#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid "Fires can spread easily, especially with abundance of fuel."
msgstr "火は簡単に燃え広がります。特に、燃料が豊富な場所では。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid "Even without electricity, ovens can be useful fire containers."
msgstr "停電中でも、オーブンは火を起こす場所として有用です。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid "Light itself doesn't draw zombies, it's sight, noise, or smell."
msgstr "光源自体はゾンビを引き寄せません。視界や音、臭いに気を付けましょう。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid "Moose may not be your friend."
msgstr "ヘラジカはあなたの友達ではありません。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid "Turnout gear protects from fire but not from overheating."
msgstr "消防士の装備は火災から身を守りますが、熱によるダメージは防げません。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid ""
"Peek around corners, when crouching, or up/down stairs to check for enemies."
msgstr "中腰時や階段を昇降する時は、「死角を覗く」で敵がいないか確認しましょう。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid "Cold food lasts longer.  Find a cool basement or make a root cellar."
msgstr "食べ物を冷やすと長持ちします。温度の低い地下室や自作の貯蔵穴を利用しましょう。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid "Dying is part of the experience.  Try again with what you've learned."
msgstr "死もまた経験です。学んだことを生かしてもう一度挑戦しましょう。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid "Frozen food?  Put it by a fire or heat it up in a pan."
msgstr "食べ物が凍っている？火の傍に置くか鍋で温めてみましょう。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid "Underground spaces like basements or caves stay cool year-round."
msgstr "地下洞窟や地下室は年中涼しく過ごせます。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid ""
"Afraid of wildlife?  Yell until it goes away.  But beware of what comes "
"instead."
msgstr "野生動物が怖い？叫んで追い払いましょう。代わりに別の何かを呼び寄せるかもしれませんが。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid "Animals and zombies are not friends.  You can take advantage of that."
msgstr "動物とゾンビは友達同士ではありません。上手く利用しましょう。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid "A door is not the only way in or out of most places."
msgstr "ドアだけが出入口ではありません。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid "Don't fight against the odds.  There's no shame in running to survive."
msgstr "勝ち目のない戦いは避けましょう。生き延びるための逃走は恥ではありません。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid "You don't have to sit right next to fire to use it."
msgstr "燃えている火は隣接しなくても利用できます。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid "Many items have special actions.  Try to find out what they do."
msgstr "特殊な用途をもつアイテムはたくさんあります。何ができるか試してみましょう。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid "Just because a place is dangerous doesn't mean it's worth looting."
msgstr "危険な場所だからと言って、素敵な戦利品があるとは限りません。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid "If you're breaking in, be sure you also know how to get back out."
msgstr "侵入する前に脱出経路を確認しておきましょう。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid ""
"There's usually more than one way to do things.  Think outside the box."
msgstr "目標を達成する方法は様々です。既成概念にとらわれず考えましょう。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid "Survival order: shelter, water, food, then everything else."
msgstr "生き延びるためにまず優先すべきは安全な場所、水、食料。その他は後回しです。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid ""
"Balance armor versus encumbrance.  Even dropping a backpack can help in "
"melee."
msgstr "防御力と動作制限のバランスを考えましょう。バックパックを脱ぎ捨てるだけで、近接戦闘が楽になります。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid ""
"Scared of melee?  Throw some things at enemies and use reach weapons like "
"spears."
msgstr "近接戦闘が怖い？敵に物を投擲する、スピアなどの遠隔武器を使う、といった方法があります。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid ""
"Makeshift weapons can break easily, but they are weapons, and can be made "
"again."
msgstr "簡易武器は簡単に破損しますが、簡単に作り直せるのが最大の利点です。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid "Not much survives a car at 120mph.  Can you?"
msgstr "時速200kmで走る車に勝てる敵は滅多にいません。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid ""
"Drugs are great for quick morale boosts and more, but be aware of addiction "
"and overdose."
msgstr "意欲などを今すぐ上げたいなら薬物が便利ですが、依存症や過剰摂取に注意しましょう。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid ""
"Use your map wisely.  Prioritize looting places that will get you what you "
"need."
msgstr "マップを上手に使いましょう。必要なものがありそうな場所を優先して狙いましょう。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid "Wounds heal over time.  Bandages and antiseptic speeds that up."
msgstr "傷は時間経過とともに治癒します。包帯や消毒薬を使えば治りが早まります。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid "Don't get grabbed by zombies.  Their bites can be infectious."
msgstr "ゾンビに掴まれないよう気を付けましょう。ゾンビの咬傷は感染症を引き起こす危険性があります。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid ""
"Feeling odd after waking up?  Try eating healthier and your health may "
"improve."
msgstr "起床したとき調子が悪い？もっと健康的な食事を心がけましょう。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid ""
"Eat well or your health might suffer.  Fast food is only good in a pinch."
msgstr "健康的な食事をしないと体調は悪化します。ファーストフードを食べるのは最後の手段です。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/core/tips.json data/json/npcs/godco/members/NPC_Kostas_Walsman.json
msgid "Nature can provide.  You can live off the land if you learn how."
msgstr "自然は多くのものを与えてくれる。方法さえ学べば野外で暮らすこともできる。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid "Raw food and water from unsafe sources can't be healthy.  Right?"
msgstr "生の肉や危険な水源から汲んだ水が健康にいい筈がありませんね？"

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid "Why walk when you can use a car?  Or a bike?  Or rollerblades?"
msgstr "徒歩ではなく車で移動してみては？それとも自転車？ローラーブレードはどうでしょう？"

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid "Food from before the Cataclysm won't last forever.  Keep that in mind."
msgstr "大変動以前からあった食料はいつか必ず枯渇します。心に留めておきましょう。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid ""
"You can make unusual things from usual stuff.  Go full MacGyver style if "
"needed."
msgstr "ありふれたアイテムからでも貴重な物を作れます。冒険野郎マクガイバーになりきりましょう。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid ""
"There are fungi you want to eat, and those you want to burn.  You'll know "
"the difference."
msgstr "食べられるキノコと燃やすべきキノコがあります。違いを知りましょう。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid "Having a backup weapon is wise.  So is having a backup plan."
msgstr "賢人は予備の武器を用意するものです。予備の計画も立てておきましょう。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid "Wet and angry?  A dry towel will bring your smile back."
msgstr "身体が濡れて不愉快？乾いたタオルで笑顔を取り戻しましょう。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid "Like to gamble?  Use mutagen!  Be a winner today!"
msgstr "ギャンブルが好き？変異原を使いましょう！今日こそ勝ってやる！"

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid "Smoking and napping is asking for more than a hole in your shirt."
msgstr "寝タバコをすると、シャツに空いた穴以上の代償を払うことになります。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid "You're on fire?  Stop and wait to put it out."
msgstr "身体が燃えてる？立ち止まって、鎮火を待ちましょう。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid "Routine kills.  Stay alert!  Don't let your guard down."
msgstr "そろそろ殺しに慣れてきた、そんな時こそ気を付けて！警戒を緩めてはいけません。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid ""
"Most medicine doesn't work instantly, so don't swallow a whole bottle of "
"pills."
msgstr "大抵の薬品は飲んでもすぐには効きません。一気飲みは止めましょう。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid ""
"Famous last words:  Let's poke this electric zombie with a metal stick."
msgstr "有名な最期の言葉: この放電ゾンビを金属棒で突き刺してみようかな。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid ""
"A full stomach will not solve your starvation.  Give it time and eat "
"regularly."
msgstr "今は満腹でもいつか飢餓は訪れます。定期的に食事を摂りましょう。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid ""
"Be mindful of the environmental protection of your gear.  It can take you "
"places."
msgstr "着用アイテムの環境防護をチェックしましょう。重要な数値です。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid ""
"Don't overlook protective gear, like gas masks or turnout gear.  You never "
"know."
msgstr "ガスマスクや消防士用の防具を見逃してはいけません。きっと必要になる時が来ます。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid ""
"Out of resources?  Breaking or disassembling stuff can yield interesting "
"components."
msgstr "資源が足りない？物を破壊、分解すると様々な素材が得られます。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid "Temperature affects the shelf life of foods.  The colder, the better."
msgstr "気温は食べ物の腐敗速度に影響します。寒ければ寒いほど長持ちします。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid "Frozen food doesn't rot, but may be inedible if not defrosted."
msgstr "冷凍した食べ物は腐敗しませんが、解凍しないと食べられないアイテムもあります。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid ""
"Some dry foods can be eaten frozen.  Some foods become mushy after "
"defrosting."
msgstr "乾燥している食べ物には凍ったまま食べられる物もあります。解凍すると不味くなる食べ物もあります。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid "Thirsty on a long winter journey?  Take a thermos with you."
msgstr "冬の長旅で喉が渇いた？魔法瓶を持っていきましょう。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid ""
"'Tis but a scratch?'  Bandage and disinfect it anyway to speed up healing."
msgstr "「かすり傷だ」？包帯や消毒をすれば早く治りますよ。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid ""
"Broken limb?  Improvised splints are ok, but hospitals might have better "
"tech for it."
msgstr "手足を骨折した？即席の添え木を使うのもいいですが、病院ではもっと高度な治療を受けられるかもしれません。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid ""
"Don't be afraid to make the game easier on yourself.  Worlds can be made to "
"spawn with more resources."
msgstr "難易度を易しくすることを恐れてはいけません。設定でよりアイテム生成量の多い世界も作れます。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid "Terrain that slows you down will also slow down your enemies."
msgstr "通り抜け辛い地形では、敵の移動速度も遅くなります。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#. ~ Snippet in category "hint"
#: data/core/tips.json data/json/npcs/hints.json
msgid ""
"When the whole town is one big supermarket, a shopping cart becomes your "
"best friend."
msgstr "街全体が大きなスーパーマーケットだと考えれば、ショッピングカートは大いに活躍します。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid ""
"Different characters, professions, hobbies, and scenarios can spice up your "
"game.  Roleplay!"
msgstr "様々なキャラクター、職業、趣味、シナリオでプレイすればゲームが更に楽しくなります。ロールプレイしましょう！"

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid "A survivor saved is a friend earned.  Most of the time…"
msgstr "生存者を助けてあげると友情が芽生えます。そうならないことも稀にありますが..."

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid ""
"Learning how to play?  Visit the keybindings menu and learn your ropes."
msgstr "操作方法を学びたい？キー割当メニューを開いて操作を身に付けましょう。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid "Expect the unexpected, even if it's the Spanish Inquisition."
msgstr "スペイン宗教裁判ではありませんが、まさかの時を予測しておきましょう。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid ""
"You can throw things while peeking around corners.  Perfect for taking down "
"gun turrets."
msgstr "死角を覗きながら物を投擲できます。この方法はタレットを破壊するのに最適です。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid ""
"Nobody told the vending machines that the world ended.  Save those cash "
"cards!"
msgstr "自動販売機は世界が崩壊したことに気付いていないようです。キャッシュカードは残しておきましょう！"

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid ""
"There's got to be some cool stuff in those top-secret underground labs, "
"right?"
msgstr "最高機密の地下研究所で素晴らしい物が見つかる気がしませんか？"

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid "Put a funnel over a jug or barrel to collect rainwater over time."
msgstr "瓶や樽などを置いた地形に漏斗を設置すれば、時間経過と共に雨水が溜まります。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid ""
"The number of zombies in a city is large but finite.  You can (eventually) "
"kill them all."
msgstr "都市部に大量発生したゾンビも、数は有限です。(時間はかかりますが)皆殺しも可能です。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid ""
"Did you *only* take everything not nailed down?  Go back for the nails!"
msgstr "本当に*あらゆる*物資を拾いましたか？釘も大事な資源です！"

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid "You can make your own safe mode rules in the pause menu."
msgstr "Escキーのメニューから独自のセーフモード規則を設定できます。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid "The best gun in the world is useless without ammo."
msgstr "最強の銃も弾薬が無ければ役に立ちません。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid ""
"Most zombies go through cars, not around them.  Remember that when running "
"away."
msgstr "大抵のゾンビは停車中の車両を避けようとしません。逃げるときは有効活用しましょう。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid ""
"If you're stuck inside with a broken leg, read some books to pass the time."
msgstr "足が骨折して家に籠っている時は、本でも読んで時間をつぶしましょう。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid "Don't be too greedy.  Loot doesn't matter if you're dead."
msgstr "欲張り過ぎは止めましょう。死んでしまっては戦利品も役に立ちません。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid "The floor is too hard to sleep on?  Try gathering a pile of leaves."
msgstr "床で眠るのが辛い？枯れた植物を集めてみましょう。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid ""
"Too cold to sleep well at night?  A pile of clothes will make it better."
msgstr "夜は寒くてよく眠れない？寝る場所に服を山ほど置けば安心です。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid ""
"Major blood loss?  Drink plenty, supplement iron, and rest to regenerate "
"your red blood cells."
msgstr "大出血した？水分をたっぷり取って、鉄分を補給して、休養して、赤血球を増やしましょう。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid ""
"Arterial bleeding from a gunshot?  A tourniquet can save you from death."
msgstr "銃で撃たれて血が止まらない？止血帯があれば死なずに済みます。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid ""
"No bandages nearby?  Empty your hands and let the time pass to apply "
"pressure to the wound."
msgstr "包帯を持っていない？何も装備していない状態で、傷口を押さえることができます。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid ""
"Tis but a scratch?  Minor bleeding does not require any dressing.  A Bandaid"
" is sufficient enough."
msgstr "かすり傷を負った？軽度の出血であれば包帯は要りません。絆創膏で十分です。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid "Zone activity manager can make your life easier.  Do more in one go."
msgstr "区域管理システムを使って一度にたくさんの作業をこなせば、生活がもっと快適になります。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid "Want less micro-management?  Zone manager can change your game."
msgstr "細々した作業はうんざり？区域管理システムを使えばゲームが快適になります。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid "Every sensei was once a student.  NPCs can teach you and vice versa."
msgstr "偉大な先生もかつては生徒でした。NPCから教わることもあれば、その逆もあり得ます。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid ""
"Length matters… at least when it comes to shoving a shovel in your backpack."
msgstr "長さは重要な問題です...少なくとも、シャベルをバックパックに詰めこみたい時は。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid ""
"Where did my lighter go again?  Manage your containers to store specific "
"items in them."
msgstr "ライターをどこに入れたか忘れた？特定のポケットにアイテムを収納するよう設定できます。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid ""
"Keep essentials in your clothing pockets in case you have to ditch your "
"backpack."
msgstr "衣類のポケットに必需品を収納すれば、万が一バックパックを捨てることになっても安心です。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid ""
"Exercising and being active increases your cardio and therefore your stamina"
" pool."
msgstr "頻繁に有酸素運動をし続けることで、スタミナ上限が上昇します。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid ""
"Long trip ahead?  Auto travel and auto drive to your desired destination."
msgstr "長旅を始めますか？自動移動、自動運転モードで目的地を目指しましょう。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid ""
"You can automate repetitive tasks such as foraging, mining, or mopping for "
"your convenience."
msgstr "採取、採掘、モップ掛けなどの反復作業は、自動化して楽にこなしましょう。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid ""
"You can crouch or go prone to hide behind objects and reduce the sound you "
"make when you move."
msgstr "屈んだり伏せて物陰に隠れたりすれば、移動時に発生する音を軽減できます。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid ""
"When you are prone, you use the bipod of your rifle for better accuracy."
msgstr "伏せてライフルを撃つなら、二脚で命中精度を高めましょう。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid ""
"Dissecting bodies will help in gaining knowledge about the weaknesses of the"
" opponents."
msgstr "敵の死体を解剖すれば、急所に関する知識を得られます。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid ""
"An armored enemy?  Don't give up, maybe it has some weaknesses that can be "
"exploited."
msgstr "装甲の厚い敵が現れた？諦めずに攻撃すれば、急所に命中するかもしれません。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid ""
"Need experience with crafting and such?  Use the training recipes to master "
"the ins and outs."
msgstr "製作などの経験を積みたい？訓練用の製作レシピを使って、コツを掴みましょう。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid ""
"Remember that the sidebar is customizable and widgets can be added and "
"removed from it."
msgstr "サイドバーは、項目の追加や削除などカスタマイズが可能です。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid "Power move.  You can take control and play as your NPC follower."
msgstr "これがプレイヤーの力です。操作キャラクターを仲間NPCに切り替えて、自由に動かすことができます。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid ""
"Your skills can rust, but you'll learn them faster when you pick them up "
"again."
msgstr "一度衰えたスキルも、磨き直せば通常より早く身につきます。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid ""
"Save time.  Instead of using a recipe, place water in a container on a fire "
"to boil it."
msgstr "時間を節約しましょう。製作レシピを使わなくても、容器に入れた水を火にかけるだけで煮沸できます。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid ""
"Knowledge can't replace practical skill and experience, but it will help you"
" get them faster."
msgstr "知識は実践的なスキルや経験の代わりにはなりませんが、それらをより早くものにする足掛かりになります。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid ""
"Books carry knowledge and often recipes.  You need practical skills to "
"utilize them.  Practice."
msgstr "本に有用な知識やレシピが載っていることもありますが、それらを活用するには実践的なスキルが必要です。実践あるのみ。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid ""
"Being skilled does not mean being proficient.  Gain proficiency to become a "
"master in specific areas."
msgstr "スキルがある＝熟練している、ではありません。特定の分野の達人を目指すなら、熟練が必要です。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid ""
"Prolonged physical exhaustion results in weariness.  Overworking causes loss"
" of productivity."
msgstr "長時間の肉体的疲労は倦怠感を招きます。過労は生産性の低下を招きます。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid ""
"Mark the items you carry as favorites so you can easily identify new items "
"and drop them in bulk."
msgstr "普段持ち歩くアイテムをお気に入りに設定しておくと、新たに拾った物資の確認や、アイテムをまとめて置く際に便利です。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid ""
"Verticality is a thing.  If you can get to a roof somehow, it may save your "
"life."
msgstr "垂直方向に目を向けましょう。何とかして屋根の上に昇れば、命拾いすることもあります。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid ""
"Your enemy is often slower than you.  Walk to conserve stamina and run only "
"when you must."
msgstr "大抵の敵は自分より鈍いです。必要なときだけ走り、普段は歩いてスタミナを温存しましょう。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid ""
"Fight on your conditions whenever you can.  Use terrain, traps, and fire to "
"your advantage."
msgstr "周囲の環境を利用して戦いましょう。地形や罠、射撃などを駆使し、有利に立ち回りましょう。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid ""
"Pick your fights and don't let them pick you.  Don't bite what you can't "
"chew."
msgstr "喧嘩の相手は選びましょう。歯が立たない相手には目を付けられないように動きましょう。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid ""
"Learn to use zone sorting to sort your loot in one go.  Y to set up zones, O"
" to sort items."
msgstr "アイテムを一度に整理する区域管理のやり方は覚えておきましょう。Yで区域を設定し、Oで自動分類を開始します。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid ""
"Want to loot everything not nailed down in one go?  Use zone manager to fill"
" your hoard."
msgstr "落ちているアイテムを一気に整頓したい？区域管理システムを使って貯蔵庫を満たしましょう。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid ""
"You can view local keybindings in most sub-menus by pressing the question "
"mark (?) key."
msgstr "?キーを押すと、その画面で使えるキー割り当てが表示されます。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid ""
"There are some unbound keybindings that might prove useful for your needs.  "
"Check them out."
msgstr "初期状態でキーが割り当てられていない便利機能もあります。一度チェックしてみましょう。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid ""
"Check what you can craft from time to time, even if you don't have "
"components right now."
msgstr "今は材料が足りなくても、製作レシピはこまめにチェックしておきましょう。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid ""
"Where applicable, use blacklists, whitelists, and filters for a better "
"quality of life."
msgstr "必要に応じてブラックリストやホワイトリスト、フィルターを使い、質の高い暮らしを目指しましょう。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid ""
"Many items have contextual uses.  Use the item action menu to find out what "
"you can do with them."
msgstr "大抵のアイテムは、状況に応じた使い道があります。使用メニューを開き、各アイテムで何ができるか見ておきましょう。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid ""
"The action menu can help you determine what you can do.  There are also some"
" rare actions there."
msgstr "使用メニューを見れば、アイテムの使用法が分かります。今まで知らなかった使い方が判明することもありますよ。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid ""
"Auto-pickup settings can save you time when you need it.  It's fully "
"customizable too."
msgstr "自動拾得を設定すれば、時間の節約になります。設定は細かくカスタマイズできます。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid ""
"Feeling unwell?  Allow yourself to rest, even for a few days as needed.  "
"Heal now, explore later."
msgstr "体調が悪い？必要に応じて、数時間でも数日でも休みましょう。冒険は一休み、ひとまず治療に専念です。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid ""
"Overconfidence is a treacherous killer.  Leave yourself some leeway for "
"unforeseen circumstances."
msgstr "自信過剰は危険な罠です。不測の事態に備え、ある程度の余裕をもって行動しましょう。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid ""
"Be mindful of what, when, and how much you eat.  A balanced diet is crucial "
"in the long run."
msgstr "何を、いつ、どれだけ食べるかに気を付けましょう。長期的に見れば、バランスのとれた食生活はとても重要です。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid ""
"Skillful management of your stamina is crucial for your survival.  Conserve "
"it when you can."
msgstr "生き残るには、上手なスタミナ管理が大切です。使わずに済むなら温存しましょう。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid ""
"For free in the construction menu: a crafting spot, a firewood source, and a"
" practice target."
msgstr "製作場所、焚物置き場、練習標的は、道具や材料なしで建設メニューから設置できます。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid ""
"When looking around, use T to move to a destination or item automatically."
msgstr "周囲確認中にTキーを押すと、指定した地点やアイテムのある位置に自動で移動します。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid "You can use your mouse to move to a destination by double-clicking it."
msgstr "行きたいタイルをマウスでダブルクリックすれば、その地点まで移動できます。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid "You can use your mouse in your inventory and few other menus."
msgstr "所持アイテムメニューなど一部の画面では、マウス操作が可能です。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid ""
"Crafting is faster if you have an actual place for it, preferably a workshop"
" bench."
msgstr "製作は作業しやすい場所、できれば作業台などの付近で実行すれば、早く完了できます。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid ""
"Hope for the best but prepare for the worst.  A backup stash of necessities "
"can save the day."
msgstr "最善を尽くし、最悪に備えましょう。必需品の予備を用意しておくことで、危機を脱することもあります。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid ""
"Pain can drastically slow you down and reduces your stats.  Check your speed"
" in the character menu."
msgstr "苦痛は動きを鈍らせ、能力値を低下させます。キャラクターメニューで速度を確認しましょう。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid ""
"Winners don't do drugs.  They're too valuable.  Winners trade drugs for more"
" bullets."
msgstr "勝者は注意深く慎重であり、ドラッグに手を出しません。勝者はドラッグを売って弾薬をたっぷり手に入れます。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid ""
"If you don't have a certain proficiency, having a related book is a good "
"idea.  More books make you less likely to fail, but not as good as knowing "
"the subject for yourself."
msgstr "得意でないスキルに関する本を集めておきましょう。経験には劣りますが、本を読めば読むほど失敗も減ります。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid ""
"You can set priority levels for pockets in your inventory, letting you "
"decide where your loot goes."
msgstr "所持アイテムのポケットの優先順位を設定すれば、拾ったものをどこに入れるか決められます。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid ""
"Face masks can help protect from smoke and disease, but make it harder to "
"breathe, affecting stamina."
msgstr "マスクは煙や病原体から身を守りますが、呼吸がし辛くなるため、スタミナに影響します。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid ""
"The burglar alarm for a store won't go off if you break through the wall."
msgstr "店舗の防犯ブザーは、壁に穴を開けても鳴りません。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid ""
"You can keep a diary if you set the keybinding.  Use it to roleplay, take "
"notes, and keep score."
msgstr "キー割当メニューで設定すれば、日記をつけられます。ロールプレイやメモ、スコア集計に使いましょう。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid ""
"Some weapons have techniques that let you do things like hit faster, block "
"attacks, or stun opponents."
msgstr "より素早く攻撃する、攻撃を防ぐ、相手を気絶させるなど、特別な技を繰り出せる武器もあります。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid "If brute force isn't working, you're not using enough of it."
msgstr "力任せが通用しないのは、力が足りないということです。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid ""
"Sweat is simulated in Cataclysm.  Excessive sweating will dehydrate you "
"quickly but keep you cool."
msgstr "ゲーム内では発汗もシミュレートされます。過度であれば脱水症状を起こしますが、適度な発汗は肉体を冷やします。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid ""
"Feral humans are smarter than zombies.  They throw rocks and can even open "
"doors.  Watch out!"
msgstr "狂った人間はゾンビより狡猾です。投石したり、ドアを開けたりもします。気をつけて！"

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid ""
"If you want something to stop existing, setting it on fire is a tried and "
"true method."
msgstr "もし存在を消したいものがあるなら、火をつけるのが一番確実です。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid "The higher up you are, the farther you can see on the overmap."
msgstr "高い位置にいるほど、全体マップで遠くを見渡せます。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid ""
"Nobody wants to buy filthy underwear.  Wash your clothes to get a better "
"price for them."
msgstr "不潔な服なんて誰も欲しがりません。洗濯して、高値で買い取ってもらいましょう。"

#. ~ Name of a trap
#: data/core/traps.json data/json/traps.json
msgid "ledge"
msgstr "地形端"

#. ~ Memorial message of trap "ledge"
#: data/core/traps.json
msgctxt "memorial_male"
msgid "Fell down a ledge."
msgstr "地形端から落下しました。"

#. ~ Memorial message of trap "ledge"
#: data/core/traps.json
msgctxt "memorial_female"
msgid "Fell down a ledge."
msgstr "地形端から落下しました。"

#. ~ Message when player triggers trap "ledge"
#: data/core/traps.json
msgid "You fell down a ledge!"
msgstr "地形端から落下しました！"

#. ~ Message when NPC triggers trap "ledge"
#: data/core/traps.json
msgid "<npcname> fell down a ledge!"
msgstr "<npcname>は地形端から落下しました！"

#. ~ Weather type name
#: data/core/weather.json
msgid "Clear"
msgstr "晴れ"

#. ~ Weather type name
#: data/core/weather.json
msgid "NULL Weather - BUG"
msgstr "天候なし - バグ"

#. ~ Name of an option slider
#: data/core/world_option_sliders.json
msgid "Cities"
msgstr "街のサイズ"

#. ~ Name of a slider position in the "Cities" option slider
#: data/core/world_option_sliders.json
msgid "Remote"
msgstr "僻地"

#. ~ Description of a slider position in the "Cities" option slider
#: data/core/world_option_sliders.json
msgid ""
"Cities are basically non-existent.  Expect rural-only areas with rare tiny "
"villages."
msgstr "都市は基本的に存在せず、まれに小さな村が生成されます。"

#. ~ Name of a slider position in the "Cities" option slider
#: data/core/world_option_sliders.json
msgid "Rural"
msgstr "田舎"

#. ~ Description of a slider position in the "Cities" option slider
#: data/core/world_option_sliders.json
msgid "Cities are half as large and twice as far apart."
msgstr "都市のサイズが通常の1/2になり、都市間の距離が通常の2倍離れています。"

#. ~ Name of a slider position in the "Cities" option slider
#: data/core/world_option_sliders.json
msgid "Semirural"
msgstr "郊外"

#. ~ Description of a slider position in the "Cities" option slider
#: data/core/world_option_sliders.json
#, c-format
msgid "Cities are 25% smaller and 50% farther apart."
msgstr "都市のサイズが通常の1/4になり、都市間の距離が通常の1.5倍離れています。"

#. ~ Name of a slider position in the "Cities" option slider
#: data/core/world_option_sliders.json
msgid "Suburbia"
msgstr "近郊"

#. ~ Description of a slider position in the "Cities" option slider
#: data/core/world_option_sliders.json
msgid ""
"Cities use default size and distances, with small to large cities separated "
"by large rural areas."
msgstr "既定の都市サイズと都市間距離です。村や都市が広大な土地に点々と現れます。"

#. ~ Name of a slider position in the "Cities" option slider
#: data/core/world_option_sliders.json
msgid "Townscape"
msgstr "市街地"

#. ~ Description of a slider position in the "Cities" option slider
#: data/core/world_option_sliders.json
#, c-format
msgid "Cities are 50% larger."
msgstr "都市のサイズが通常の1.5倍になります。"

#. ~ Name of a slider position in the "Cities" option slider
#: data/core/world_option_sliders.json
msgid "Cityscape"
msgstr "都市部"

#. ~ Description of a slider position in the "Cities" option slider
#: data/core/world_option_sliders.json
#, c-format
msgid "Cities are twice as large and 25% closer to each other."
msgstr "都市のサイズが通常の2倍になり、都市間の距離は通常の1/4しか離れていません。"

#. ~ Name of a slider position in the "Cities" option slider
#: data/core/world_option_sliders.json
msgid "Megacity"
msgstr "大都会"

#. ~ Description of a slider position in the "Cities" option slider
#: data/core/world_option_sliders.json
msgid "Cities are nearly continuous, with minimal distance between them."
msgstr "都市同士がほぼ連続しており、都市間の距離もほとんどありません。"

#. ~ Name of an option slider
#: data/core/world_option_sliders.json
msgid "Difficulty"
msgstr "難易度"

#. ~ Name of a slider position in the "Difficulty" option slider
#: data/core/world_option_sliders.json
msgid "Cakewalk?"
msgstr "とても簡単"

#. ~ Description of a slider position in the "Difficulty" option slider
#: data/core/world_option_sliders.json
msgid ""
"Monsters are much easier to deal with, and plenty of items can be found."
msgstr "モンスターの対処が楽になり、アイテムもたくさん見つけられます。"

#. ~ Name of a slider position in the "Difficulty" option slider
#: data/core/world_option_sliders.json
msgid "Be really nice to me"
msgstr "簡単"

#. ~ Description of a slider position in the "Difficulty" option slider
#: data/core/world_option_sliders.json
msgid ""
"Monsters are less tough; move, evolve and spawn slower; and items are a bit "
"easier to come by."
msgstr "モンスターの頑丈さは少し弱く、進化速度は遅く、生成量は少なくなり、アイテムは多少見つけやすくなります。"

#. ~ Name of a slider position in the "Difficulty" option slider
#: data/core/world_option_sliders.json
