msgstr "急変(ウシ)"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Cattle Mutation"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "You consumed cattle primer."
msgstr "ウシの変異源プライマーを摂取しました。"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Cattle Transformation"
#: data/json/effects.json
