msgstr "急変(トカゲ)"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Lizard Mutation"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "You consumed lizard primer."
msgstr "トカゲの変異原プライマーを摂取しました。"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Lizard Transformation"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "Your skin feels dry and too small.  You'll have to molt soon."
msgstr "この肌はカサついており、窮屈すぎます。そろそろ脱皮する頃合いでしょうか。"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Lizard Metamorphosis"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "Your limbs slump, almost ready to tear right out of their sockets."
msgstr "四肢が力を失い、今にももげてしまいそうに感じます。"

#. ~ Name of effect type id "mutagen_lupine"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "Lupine Mutation"
msgstr "変化(オオカミ)"

#. ~ Name of effect type id "mutagen_lupine"
#: data/json/effects.json
