msgstr "急変(医療)"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Medical Mutation"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "You consumed medical primer."
msgstr "医療変異原プライマーを摂取しました。"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Medical Transformation"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "You consumed medical primer.  You should do that again."
msgstr "医療変異原プライマーを摂取しました。もっと摂取しなければ。"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Medical Metamorphosis"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid ""
"You're tearing yourself apart.  Need to get fixed back up.  Should put some "
"stitches in you."
msgstr "肉体を自ら引き裂いています。元通りに治さないと。何針か縫えば大丈夫でしょうか。"

#. ~ Name of effect type id "mutagen_mouse"
#: data/json/effects.json
