msgstr "アドレナリンの爆発が収まりました。酷い気分だ！"

#. ~ Name of effect type id "stimpack"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "RX11 Stimulant Comedown"
msgstr "精神消沈(RX11)"

#. ~ Name of effect type id "stimpack"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "RX11 Stimulant Rush"
msgstr "急速興奮(RX11)"

#. ~ Description of effect type "RX11 Stimulant Comedown"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "You feel sluggish and slow."
msgstr "身体の動きが緩慢になったようだ。"

#. ~ Description of effect type "RX11 Stimulant Rush"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "An intense surge of stimulants pulses through your body."
msgstr "薬物由来の強烈なうねりが身体を包んでいます。"

#. ~ Apply message of effect type "RX11 Stimulant Comedown, RX11 Stimulant
#. Rush"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "You feel an intense surge of stimulants pulse through your body!"
msgstr "薬物由来の強烈なうねりが身体を包みました！"

#. ~ Decay message of effect type "RX11 Stimulant Comedown, RX11 Stimulant
#. Rush"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "The stimulant combo is wearing off.  You feel sluggish."
msgstr "薬物の効果は落ち着いたようです。だるさを感じます。"

#. ~ Name of effect type id "adrenaline"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "Adrenaline Comedown"
msgstr "アドレナリン低下"

#. ~ Name of effect type id "adrenaline"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "Adrenaline Rush"
msgstr "アドレナリン上昇"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Adrenaline Rush"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "You feel the rush of adrenaline in your body!"
msgstr "アドレナリンが体内を駆け巡っています！"

#. ~ Apply message of effect type "Adrenaline Comedown, Adrenaline Rush"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "You feel a surge of adrenaline!"
msgstr "アドレナリンの爆発を感じました！"

#. ~ Miss message of effect type "Adrenaline Comedown, Adrenaline Rush"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "Your comedown throws you off."
msgstr "薬の効果が切れて、気分が落ち込んでいます。"

#. ~ Decay message of effect type "Adrenaline Comedown, Adrenaline Rush"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "Your adrenaline rush wears off.  You feel AWFUL!"
msgstr "アドレナリンの爆発が収まりました。酷い気分です！"

#. ~ Name of effect type id "adrenaline_mycus"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "Mycus Respite"
msgstr "ミカズ(小康)"

#. ~ Name of effect type id "adrenaline_mycus"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "Mycus Wrath"
msgstr "ミカズ(憤怒)"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Mycus Respite"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid ""
"Our fibers are stretched near breaking.  Local power diverted to regenerate."
msgstr "我々の繊維が破断を治療する。局所出力を再生に充てる。"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Mycus Wrath"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "Our enemies are near, and violent action is imminent.  We are turgid."
msgstr "我々の仇敵が近づき、暴力的な衝動が沸き起こる。我々は膨張を始める。"

#. ~ Apply message of effect type "Mycus Respite, Mycus Wrath"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "Mycal wrath fills our fibers, and we grow turgid."
msgstr "ミカズの憤怒が我々の繊維を満たし、我々は膨張を始める。"

#. ~ Decay message of effect type "Mycus Respite, Mycus Wrath"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "We require repose; our fibers are nearly spent…"
msgstr "我々には安息が必要だ。我々の繊維は不足している..."

#. ~ Name of effect type id "meth"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "Meth comedown"
msgstr "精神消沈"

#. ~ Name of effect type id "meth"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "High on Meth"
msgstr "高揚(薬物)"

#. ~ Name of effect type id "cig"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "Nicotine"
msgstr "ニコチン"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Nicotine"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "You had a puff or two."
msgstr "結構な量のタバコをふかしました。"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Nicotine"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "You smoked too much."
msgstr "タバコの吸い過ぎです。"

#. ~ Name of effect type id "high"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "High"
msgstr "High"

#. ~ Description of effect type "High"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "You are high as a kite."
msgstr "凧みたいにハイな気分です。"

#. ~ Apply message of effect type "High"
#. ~ Apply message of effect type "weed_high"
#. ~ Apply message of effect type "Tipsy, Drunk, Trashed, Wasted, Dead Drunk"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "You feel lightheaded."
msgstr "目眩がしました。"

#. ~ Miss message of effect type "weed_high"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid ""
"That critter's jumping around like a jitterbug!  It needs to mellow out."
msgstr "周囲で小動物が飛び跳ねながらジルバを踊っています！休息が必要ですね。"

#. ~ Name of effect type id "contacts"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "Contact Lenses"
msgstr "コンタクトレンズ"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Contact Lenses"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "You are wearing contact lenses."
msgstr "コンタクトレンズを付けました。"

#. ~ Apply message of effect type "Contact Lenses"
#. ~ Apply message of effect type "Transition Contact Lenses"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "You can see more clearly."
msgstr "視界が明瞭です。"

#. ~ Remove message of effect type "Contact Lenses"
#. ~ Remove message of effect type "Transition Contact Lenses"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "Your vision starts to blur."
msgstr "視界がぼやけ始めました。"

#. ~ Name of effect type id "transition_contacts"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "Transition Contact Lenses"
msgstr "調光コンタクトレンズ"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Transition Contact Lenses"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid ""
"You are wearing photochromic contact lenses that additionally protect you "
"from the sunlight."
msgstr "太陽光から目を守る調光コンタクトレンズを着用しています。"

#. ~ Name of effect type id "transition_contacts_plano"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "Transition Contact Lenses (Plano)"
msgstr "調光コンタクトレンズ(度なし)"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Transition Contact Lenses (Plano)"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid ""
"You are wearing non-prescription photochromic contact lenses that protect "
"you from the sunlight, but don't help with any sight issues."
msgstr "太陽光から目を守る度なし調光コンタクトレンズを着用しています。視力は補正されていません。"

#. ~ Apply message of effect type "Transition Contact Lenses (Plano)"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "You apply photochromic contact lenses."
msgstr "調光コンタクトレンズを付けました。"

#. ~ Remove message of effect type "Transition Contact Lenses (Plano)"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "you pull off your photochromic contact lenses."
msgstr "調光コンタクトレンズを外しました。"

#. ~ Name of effect type id "drunk"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "Tipsy"
msgstr "飲酒(爽快期)"

#. ~ Name of effect type id "drunk"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "Drunk"
msgstr "飲酒(ほろ酔い期)"

#. ~ Name of effect type id "drunk"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "Trashed"
msgstr "飲酒(酩酊期)"

#. ~ Name of effect type id "drunk"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "Wasted"
msgstr "飲酒(泥酔期)"

#. ~ Name of effect type id "drunk"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "Dead Drunk"
msgstr "飲酒(昏睡期)"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Tipsy"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "You drank some alcohol.  You feel warm inside."
msgstr "酒を飲みました。体内が暖かく感じます。"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Drunk"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "You drank alcohol.  Party on!"
msgstr "酒に酔っています。楽しくいこう！"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Trashed"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "You drank lots of alcohol.  Are those white mice?"
msgstr "酒の飲み過ぎです。"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Wasted"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid ""
"You drank unholy amounts of alcohol.  It's the end of the world, what do you"
" care?"
msgstr "アルコールを大量摂取しました。この世の終わりなんだから、何も気にすることはないでしょう？"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Dead Drunk"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid ""
"You embalmed yourself alive with so much alcohol, that even zombies will "
"leave your dead body alone."
msgstr "非常に多量のアルコールを摂取して自分自身に防腐処置を施しました。この死体はゾンビすら見向きもしません。"

#. ~ Miss message of effect type "Tipsy, Drunk, Trashed, Wasted, Dead Drunk"
#. ~ Miss message of effect type "Depressants"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "You feel woozy."
msgstr "眩暈がしました。"

#. ~ Apply message of effect type "amigara"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "You can't look away from the faultline…"
msgstr "断層線から目を逸らせません..."

#. ~ Name of effect type id "fearparalyze"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "Feared"
msgstr "戦慄"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Feared"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "You have been paralyzed by the fear."
msgstr "恐怖で体が麻痺しました。"

#. ~ Name of effect type id "asthma"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "Asthma"
msgstr "喘息(軽)"

#. ~ Name of effect type id "asthma"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "Heavy Asthma"
msgstr "喘息(重)"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Asthma, Heavy Asthma"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid ""
"You suffer from a respiratory disorder that makes breathing difficult.\n"
"An asthma attack can occur from time to time, so have your inhaler nearby."
msgstr ""
"呼吸器系疾患の症状に苦しんでいます。\n"
"時々喘息の発作が起きるので、手元に吸入器を用意しておきましょう。"

#. ~ Apply message of effect type "Asthma, Heavy Asthma"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "You can't breathe… asthma attack!"
msgstr "呼吸ができません...喘息の発作です！"

#. ~ Miss message of effect type "Asthma, Heavy Asthma"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "You're winded."
msgstr "息切れしています。"

#. ~ Apply message of effect type "crushed"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "The ceiling collapses on you!"
msgstr "天井が崩れてきました！"

#. ~ Name of effect type id "took_anticonvulsant_visible"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "Took Anticonvulsant Drugs"
msgstr "抗けいれん薬摂取"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Took Anticonvulsant Drugs"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid ""
"You took anticonvulsant drugs some time ago and you might still be under its influence.\n"
"Prescription note says its effect duration may vary, so your estimate may be inaccurate."
msgstr ""
"プロザックを摂取した影響を受けているようです。\n"
"処方箋によると効果の持続時間は変動するため、数値は不正確かもしれません。"

#. ~ Name of effect type id "relax_gas"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "Relaxation Gas"
msgstr "鎮静ガス"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Relaxation Gas"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid ""
"You are thoroughly relaxed and don't feel like moving.  Fighting?  Too much "
"effort."
msgstr "完全にリラックスしており、動く気力が沸きません。戦闘ですか？多大な努力が必要ですね。"

#. ~ Apply message of effect type "Relaxation Gas"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "You inhale sweetish gas."
msgstr "仄かに甘いガスを吸い込みました。"

#. ~ Remove message of effect type "Relaxation Gas"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "The slackness leaves your muscles."
msgstr "筋肉の弛みは無くなりました。"

#. ~ Name of effect type id "tapeworm"
#. ~ Name of effect type id "bloodworms"
#. ~ Name of effect type id "brainworms"
#. ~ Name of effect type id "paincysts"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "Unidentified Illness"
msgstr "正体不明の病"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Unidentified Illness"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "You aren't sure what's wrong with you but you don't feel well."
msgstr "何が原因かよく分かりませんが、気分が悪いと感じています。"

#. ~ Name of effect type id "tetanus"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "Muscle Cramps"
msgstr "筋肉痙攣"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Muscle Cramps"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "Your muscles are binding up, you should probably find a sedative."
msgstr "筋肉が自由に動きません。鎮静剤を摂取しましょう。"

#. ~ Apply message of effect type "Muscle Cramps"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "Your muscles start convulsing!"
msgstr "筋肉が痙攣しています！"

#. ~ Name of effect type id "rat_bite_fever"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "Puckered Scratches"
msgstr "ミミズ腫れ"

#. ~ Apply message of effect type "Puckered Scratches"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid ""
"Your skin starts burning around some of your scratches.  Some aspirin might "
"relieve the effects."
msgstr "傷の周りがヒリヒリと傷みます。アスピリンで症状を緩和できます。"

#. ~ Remove message of effect type "Puckered Scratches"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "The fever breaks."
msgstr "熱をもった腫れが治まりました。"

#. ~ Name of effect type id "datura"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "Experiencing Datura"
msgstr "ダツラの技法"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Experiencing Datura"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "Buy the ticket, take the ride.  The datura has you now."
msgstr "チケットを買って飛び乗る。ただそれだけです。もはやダチュラの虜。"

#. ~ Name of effect type id "grabbed"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "Grabbed"
msgstr "被拘束"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Grabbed"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid ""
"You have been grabbed and held in place by an attack.  You're not able to move until breaking the grab, and depending on the strength of your opponent using this limb is difficult to impossible.\n"
"Wait in place or attempt to move without attacking to try and remove this effect."
msgstr ""
"攻撃によって拘束され、その場に固定された状態です。被拘束状態を解除するまで動くことができず、拘束の強さによって、四肢を使うことが困難もしくは不可能になります。解除するにはその場で待つか、攻撃せずに移動を試みましょう。"

#. ~ Name of effect type id "grabbing"
#. ~ Name of effect type id "grabbing_2"
#. ~ Name of effect type id "grabbing_3"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "Grabbing"
msgstr "拘束"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Grabbing"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "Grabbing another creature and holding them in place."
msgstr "相手を掴み、所定の位置に固定しています。"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Grabbing"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid ""
"Grabbing another creature and holding them in place with a second appendage."
msgstr "触手で相手を掴み、追加部位で所定の位置に固定しています。"

#. ~ Name of effect type id "lack_sleep"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "Lacking Sleep"
msgstr "寝不足"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Lacking Sleep"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "You haven't slept in a while, and it shows."
msgstr "しばらく眠っていないので、疲れが見えます。"

#. ~ Apply message of effect type "Lacking Sleep"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "You are too physically tired to function well."
msgstr "疲れ過ぎて身体が上手く動きません。"

#. ~ Miss message of effect type "Lacking Sleep"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "You don't have energy to fight."
msgstr "戦う気力が湧きません。"

#. ~ Apply message of effect type "lying_down"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "You lie down to go to sleep…"
msgstr "横になりました..."

#. ~ Apply message of effect type "sleep"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "You fall asleep."
msgstr "眠りに落ちました。"

#. ~ Remove message of effect type "sleep"
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_LUCID_DREAM_END"
#: data/json/effects.json data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/spells/spell_eocs.json
msgid "You wake up."
msgstr "目が覚めました。"

#. ~ Name of effect type id "under_operation"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "Under Operation"
msgstr "手術中"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Under Operation"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "You are being operated on.  Try to stay still."
msgstr "手術を受けています。じっとしていましょう。"

#. ~ Name of effect type id "playing_instrument"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "Playing an Instrument"
msgstr "楽器演奏"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Playing an Instrument"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid ""
"You're playing an instrument.\n"
"Focusing on playing music distracts you, slowing you down."
msgstr ""
"楽器を演奏しています。\n"
"楽器の演奏に集中している間は、他の事に気が回らず、行動も緩慢になります。"

#. ~ Name of effect type id "corroding"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "Corroding"
msgstr "腐食"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Corroding"
#. ~ Apply message of effect type "Corroding"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "You're covered in acid!"
msgstr "酸まみれになっています！"

#. ~ Name of effect type id "zapped"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "Zapped"
msgstr "電撃"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Zapped"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "You've been zapped with electricity and are barely able to move!"
msgstr "電撃を浴びました。移動が困難になります！"

#. ~ Apply message of effect type "Zapped"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "You're zapped!"
msgstr "電撃を浴びました！"

#. ~ Name of effect type id "electrocuted"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "Electrocuted"
msgstr "感電"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Electrocuted"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "You're being shocked with electricity to the point of serious harm!"
msgstr "重傷に至る程の電気ショックを受けています。"

#. ~ Apply message of effect type "Electrocuted"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "You're being electrocuted!"
msgstr "感電しています！"

#. ~ Name of effect type id "anemia"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "Early Iron Deficiency"
msgstr "軽度鉄分不足"

#. ~ Name of effect type id "anemia"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "Iron Deficiency"
msgstr "鉄分不足"

#. ~ Name of effect type id "anemia"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "Acute Iron Deficiency"
msgstr "鉄欠乏症"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Early Iron Deficiency"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid ""
"A lack of iron in your diet has hampered the efficiency and regeneration of "
"your red blood cells."
msgstr "食事中の鉄分が不足していると、赤血球の輸送効率と再生力が低下します。"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Iron Deficiency"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid ""
"Prolonged lack of iron in your diet has compromised the efficiency and "
"regeneration of your red blood cells."
msgstr "食事中の鉄分が不足していると、赤血球の輸送効率と再生力が著しく低下します。"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Acute Iron Deficiency"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid ""
"Severe lack of iron in your diet results in your red blood cells dying "
"faster then they are regenerating."
msgstr "深刻なレベルで食事中の鉄分が欠乏しており、再生するよりも早く赤血球が死んでしまいます。"

#. ~ Apply message of effect type "Early Iron Deficiency, Iron Deficiency,
#. Acute Iron Deficiency"
#. ~ Apply message of effect type "Early Anemia, Anemia, Acute Anemia"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "You begin feeling increasingly tired and listless."
msgstr "疲れがたまって辛い気分です。"

#. ~ Remove message of effect type "Early Iron Deficiency, Iron Deficiency,
#. Acute Iron Deficiency"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "You are no longer in risk of becoming anemic."
msgstr "貧血にならない体調まで回復しました。"

#. ~ Decay message of effect type "Early Iron Deficiency, Iron Deficiency,
#. Acute Iron Deficiency"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "Your iron deficiency is nearly resolved."
msgstr "鉄分不足はほぼ解消されました。"

#. ~ Decay message of effect type "Early Iron Deficiency, Iron Deficiency,
#. Acute Iron Deficiency"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "Your feel stronger as your iron deficiency starts to improve."
msgstr "鉄欠乏症が改善し始め、元気になった気がします。"

#. ~ Name of effect type id "redcells_anemia"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "Early Anemia"
msgstr "軽度貧血"

#. ~ Name of effect type id "redcells_anemia"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "Anemia"
msgstr "貧血"

#. ~ Name of effect type id "redcells_anemia"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "Acute Anemia"
msgstr "重度貧血"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Early Anemia, Anemia, Acute Anemia"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "Loss of red blood cells results in progressively worsening anemia."
msgstr "赤血球が少なくなり、貧血が次第に悪化します。"

#. ~ Remove message of effect type "Early Anemia, Anemia, Acute Anemia"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "You no longer feel anemic."
msgstr "貧血が治りました。"

#. ~ Decay message of effect type "Early Anemia, Anemia, Acute Anemia"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "Your anemia is nearly resolved."
msgstr "貧血がほぼ発生しなくなりました。"

#. ~ Decay message of effect type "Early Anemia, Anemia, Acute Anemia"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "Your feel stronger as your anemia starts to improve."
msgstr "貧血が改善し、前より強くなった気がします。"

#. ~ Name of effect type id "scurvy"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "Early Scurvy"
msgstr "軽度壊血病"

#. ~ Name of effect type id "scurvy"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "Scurvy"
msgstr "壊血病"

#. ~ Name of effect type id "scurvy"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "Bad Scurvy"
msgstr "重度壊血病"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Early Scurvy, Scurvy, Bad Scurvy"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid ""
"A lack of vitamin C in your diet will result in progressively worse symptoms"
" of scurvy."
msgstr "食事内のビタミンCが不足すると、壊血病が次第に悪化します。"

#. ~ Apply message of effect type "Early Scurvy, Scurvy, Bad Scurvy"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "You start to develop symptoms of scurvy."
msgstr "壊血病の症状が現れはじめました。"

#. ~ Remove message of effect type "Early Scurvy, Scurvy, Bad Scurvy"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "Your scurvy has resolved."
msgstr "壊血病が治りました。"

#. ~ Decay message of effect type "Early Scurvy, Scurvy, Bad Scurvy"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "Your vitamin C deficiency is starting to resolve."
msgstr "ビタミンC不足はほぼ解消されました。"

#. ~ Decay message of effect type "Early Scurvy, Scurvy, Bad Scurvy"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "Your scurvy lessens as your Vitamin C deficiency improves."
msgstr "ビタミンC不足が改善され、壊血病の症状は軽くなりました。"

#. ~ Name of effect type id "betablock"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "Beta blocker"
msgstr "ベータ遮断薬"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Beta blocker"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid ""
"You are under the influence of a beta blocker.  This controls your heart "
"rate, decreasing the influence of stressful events such as pain on it.  "
"However, it also lowers blood pressure and induces sleepiness."
msgstr ""
"ベータ遮断薬の影響を受けており、心拍数が抑制されています。苦痛などのストレスが心拍数に与える影響を軽減しますが、血圧が低下し眠気を引き起こします。"

#. ~ Name of effect type id "hypervitaminosis"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "Hypervitaminosis"
msgstr "栄養過剰症"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Hypervitaminosis"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "An excess of vitamins has badly affected your metabolism."
msgstr "過剰な栄養摂取によって代謝に悪影響が出ています。"

#. ~ Apply message of effect type "Hypervitaminosis"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "Your metabolism becomes unstable."
msgstr "代謝が不安定になりました。"

#. ~ Remove message of effect type "Hypervitaminosis"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "Your metabolism becomes more stable."
msgstr "代謝が安定しました。"

#. ~ Name of effect type id "toxin_buildup"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "Concerning symptoms"
msgstr "毒素症状"

#. ~ Name of effect type id "toxin_buildup"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "Unnerving symptoms"
msgstr "毒素障害"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Concerning symptoms"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "Your muscles keep twitching strangely."
msgstr "筋肉の痙攣がなかなか治まりません。"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Unnerving symptoms"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid ""
"Your nervous system is malfunctioning, almost like it's being torn apart "
"from the inside."
msgstr "体内に異常があるのか、神経系が誤作動を起こしています。"

#. ~ Name of effect type id "bad_food_ennui"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "Gross Food"
msgstr "不味い食事"

#. ~ Name of effect type id "bad_food_ennui"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "Demoralizing Food"
msgstr "酷い食事"

#. ~ Name of effect type id "bad_food_ennui"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "Depressing Food"
msgstr "おぞましい食事"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Gross Food"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "The food you eat is disgusting."
msgstr "あまり食べたくない物を食べています。"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Demoralizing Food"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "Eating nothing but disgusting rations is starting to get you down."
msgstr "食べたくない物ばかり食べていると、気分が滅入ってしまいます。"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Depressing Food"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid ""
"Sure, you survived, but what kind of survival is this, eating these "
"disgusting rations day in and day out?"
msgstr "確かに、生きてはいます。しかし、こんなモノを食べ続けてまで生き続ける意味があるのでしょうか？"

#. ~ Name of effect type id "hypovolemia"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "Mild Hypovolemic Shock"
msgstr "出血性ショック(軽)"

#. ~ Name of effect type id "hypovolemia"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "Moderate Hypovolemic Shock"
msgstr "出血性ショック(中)"

#. ~ Name of effect type id "hypovolemia"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "Advanced Hypovolemic Shock"
msgstr "出血性ショック(重)"

#. ~ Name of effect type id "hypovolemia"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "Severe Hypovolemic Shock"
msgstr "出血性ショック(重篤)"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Mild Hypovolemic Shock"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "You've lost some blood and look somewhat pale."
msgstr "血液を失い、顔が少し青ざめています。"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Moderate Hypovolemic Shock"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "You've lost a large amount of blood, and you're not feeling well."
msgstr "大量の血液を失い、気分が悪くなっています。"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Advanced Hypovolemic Shock"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid ""
"You've lost an awful lot of blood, and your condition is severe.  Seek "
"medical attention."
msgstr "非常に大量の血液を失い、容体は深刻です。医師の診察を受けた方がよさそうです。"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Severe Hypovolemic Shock"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid ""
"You've lost tremendous amount of blood, and you're standing on death's door."
"  Transfusion might save you."
msgstr "途方もない量の血液を失い、死にかけています。輸血できれば助かるかもしれません。"

#. ~ Apply message of effect type "Mild Hypovolemic Shock, Moderate
#. Hypovolemic Shock, Advanced Hypovolemic Shock, Severe Hypovolemic Shock"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "You have lost a lot of blood, and your condition worsens."
msgstr "大量の血液を失い、容体が悪化しています。"

#. ~ Remove message of effect type "Mild Hypovolemic Shock, Moderate
#. Hypovolemic Shock, Advanced Hypovolemic Shock, Severe Hypovolemic Shock"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "You are no longer in shock."
msgstr "出血性ショックから回復しました。"

#. ~ Decay message of effect type "Mild Hypovolemic Shock, Moderate
#. Hypovolemic Shock, Advanced Hypovolemic Shock, Severe Hypovolemic Shock"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid ""
"Your blood volume increases, and you feel better; but still, you look pale."
msgstr "血液量が回復して気分は良くなりましたが、まだ顔色は悪いままです。"

#. ~ Decay message of effect type "Mild Hypovolemic Shock, Moderate
#. Hypovolemic Shock, Advanced Hypovolemic Shock, Severe Hypovolemic Shock"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "You feel stronger as your blood volume starts to improve."
msgstr "血液量が回復し始め、元気になってきた気がします。"

#. ~ Decay message of effect type "Mild Hypovolemic Shock, Moderate
#. Hypovolemic Shock, Advanced Hypovolemic Shock, Severe Hypovolemic Shock"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid ""
"You're not dying from lack of blood, but you're not out of the woods yet."
msgstr "出血多量による死は回避しましたが、まだ峠は越えていません。"

#. ~ Name of effect type id "haslight"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "Lit Up"
msgstr "照明"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Lit Up"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "You are carrying a light and can't hide well."
msgstr "照明器具を所持しているため上手く隠れられません。"

#. ~ Name of effect type id "mending"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "Started Recovery"
msgstr "治療開始"

#. ~ Name of effect type id "mending"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "Recovering"
msgstr "回復中"

#. ~ Name of effect type id "mending"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "Mostly Recovered"
msgstr "完治目前"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Started Recovery, Recovering, Mostly
#. Recovered"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "This damaged limb is slowly regaining its functions."
msgstr "障害を負った部位はゆっくりと機能を回復しています。"

#. ~ Name of effect type id "disabled"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgctxt "physically"
msgid "Disabled"
msgstr "身体障害"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Disabled"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "This limb is damaged beyond use and may require a splint to recover."
msgstr "この部位は全く動かせないほどのダメージを受けており、回復するためには添え木を着用する必要がありそうです。"

#. ~ Apply message of effect type "Disabled"
#. ~ Snippet in category "broken_limb"
#: data/json/effects.json data/json/snippets/schizophrenia.json
msgid "Your limb breaks!"
msgstr "骨折しました！"

#. ~ Remove message of effect type "Disabled"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "The broken limb has mended."
msgstr "骨折した部位が完治しました。"

#. ~ Name of effect type id "milked"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "Milked"
msgstr "搾乳済"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Milked"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "The creature has been partially or fully milked."
msgstr "この生物は乳の一部もしくは全部を搾乳されています。"

#. ~ Name of effect type id "sheared"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "Sheared"
msgstr "毛刈り"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Sheared"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "The creature has been fully sheared."
msgstr "この動物は毛が完全に刈られています。"

#. ~ Name of effect type id "pkill"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "Painkillers"
msgstr "鎮痛"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Painkillers"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid ""
"You are under the influence of analgesic substances to relieve pain, but "
"they may numb you a bit."
msgstr "痛みを和らげる鎮痛物質の影響を受け、身体が少々痺れているようです。"

#. ~ Name of effect type id "happy"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "Happy"
msgstr "満足"

#. ~ Name of effect type id "happy"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "Joyful"
msgstr "楽しい"

#. ~ Name of effect type id "happy"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "Elated"
msgstr "意気揚々"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Happy, Joyful, Elated"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "Life is good."
msgstr "人生は素晴らしい。"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Happy, Joyful, Elated"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "Oh what a day!  What a lovely day!"
msgstr "ああ、良い日だ！なんて素晴らしい日だろう！"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Happy, Joyful, Elated"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "I'm on top of the world, baby!"
msgstr "最高の気分だよ、ベイビー！"

#. ~ Name of effect type id "sad"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "Unhappy"
msgstr "不満"

#. ~ Name of effect type id "sad"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "Sad"
msgstr "悲しい"

#. ~ Name of effect type id "sad"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "Depressed"
msgstr "気分消沈"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Unhappy, Sad, Depressed"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "You are not content with your life."
msgstr "現状に不満を感じています。"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Unhappy, Sad, Depressed"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "This is not what you planned for your life."
msgstr "こんなハズじゃなかったと感じています。"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Unhappy, Sad, Depressed"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "When will all your suffering end?"
msgstr "この苦しみはいつ終わるんだろう？"

#. ~ Miss message of effect type "Unhappy, Sad, Depressed"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "What's the point of fighting?"
msgstr "戦うことに何の意味がある？"

#. ~ Name of effect type id "irradiated"
#. ~ Name of effect type id "effect_weakening"
#: data/json/effects.json data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/effects.json
msgid "Weakness"
msgstr "衰弱"

#. ~ Name of effect type id "stim"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "Stimulants"
msgstr "興奮"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Stimulants"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "You're very jittery and pumped up, probably from some stimulants."
msgstr "何らかの興奮物質の影響で神経が昂り、過敏になっています。"

#. ~ Name of effect type id "depressants"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "Depressants"
msgstr "鎮静"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Depressants"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "You are under the influence of depressants, and in a bit of a daze."
msgstr "鎮静物質の影響を受け、放心しているようです。"

#. ~ Name of effect type id "stim_overdose"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "Stimulant Overdose"
msgstr "過剰興奮"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Stimulant Overdose"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid ""
"You can't sit still as you feel your heart pounding out of your chest.  You "
"probably overdosed on those stims."
msgstr "心臓が飛び出しそうで座っていられません。興奮物質を過剰摂取してしまったようです。"

#. ~ Miss message of effect type "Stimulant Overdose"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "You shake with the excess stimulation."
msgstr "過剰興奮で体が震えています。"

#. ~ Name of effect type id "weak_antibiotic_visible"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "Took Weak Antibiotic"
msgstr "弱い抗生物質摂取"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Took Weak Antibiotic"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid ""
"You consumed mild antibiotic some time ago to fight off infection.\n"
"If you don't recover you may want to take another dose, but beware overdosage."
msgstr ""
"感染症を克服するために効果の弱い抗生物質を摂取しました。\n"
"回復が遅い場合は更に摂取することも可能ですが、過剰摂取に気を付けましょう。"

#. ~ Name of effect type id "antibiotic_visible"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "Took Antibiotic"
msgstr "抗生物質摂取"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Took Antibiotic"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid ""
"You consumed antibiotic some time ago to fight off infection.\n"
"If you don't recover you may want to take another dose, but beware overdosage."
msgstr ""
"感染症を克服するために抗生物質を摂取しました。\n"
"回復が遅い場合は更に摂取することも可能ですが、過剰摂取に気を付けましょう。"

#. ~ Name of effect type id "strong_antibiotic_visible"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "Took Strong Antibiotic"
msgstr "強い抗生物質摂取"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Took Strong Antibiotic"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid ""
"You consumed prescription-grade antibiotic some time ago to fight off infection.\n"
"If you don't recover you may want to take another dose, but beware overdosage."
msgstr ""
"感染症を克服するために医療機関で処方される抗生物質を摂取しました。\n"
"回復が遅い場合は更に摂取することも可能ですが、過剰摂取に気を付けましょう。"

#. ~ Name of effect type id "panacea"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "Panacea"
msgstr "万能薬"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Panacea"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "You feel incredible!  You could take on the world!"
msgstr "素晴らしい気分です！今なら何でもできそうです！"

#. ~ Name of effect type id "tummy_tablet"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "Soothed Stomach"
msgstr "胃薬"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Soothed Stomach"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "You are under the effects of a stomach soother."
msgstr "胃薬が作用しています。"

#. ~ Name of effect type id "antifungal"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "Antifungals"
msgstr "抗真菌薬"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Antifungals"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "You are under the effects of an antifungal medicine or chemicals."
msgstr "抗真菌作用をもつ科学物質の影響を受けています。"

#. ~ Name of effect type id "emp"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "Discharge"
msgstr "放電"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Discharge"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "You've been recently affected by an electromagnetic pulse."
msgstr "EMPの影響を受けています。"

#. ~ Name of effect type id "supercharged"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "Supercharged"
msgstr "過充電"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Supercharged"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "You've been struck by lightning, and feel… different."
msgstr "電撃に打たれ、何か...今までと違う気分になっています。"

#. ~ Name of effect type id "pd_str_bad"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "Muscle Vanishment"
msgstr "筋力障害"

#. ~ Name of effect type id "pd_str_bad"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "Muscle Disappearance"
msgstr "筋力不全"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Muscle Vanishment"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "You feel as if your muscles are not quite there."
msgstr "筋肉が全て失われたような感覚に襲われています。"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Muscle Disappearance"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "You feel as if your muscles are not in your body."
msgstr "筋肉が失われたような感覚に襲われています。"

#. ~ Miss message of effect type "Muscle Vanishment, Muscle Disappearance"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "Your lack of strength stops you!"
msgstr "身体に力が入らず動けません！"

#. ~ Name of effect type id "pd_dex_bad"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "Weak Grasp"
msgstr "触覚障害"

#. ~ Name of effect type id "pd_dex_bad"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "Inexistent Grasp"
msgstr "触覚不全"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Weak Grasp"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "You seem to have problems touching things."
msgstr "触覚が鈍っているように感じます。"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Inexistent Grasp"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "You feel as if your hands just pass through matter."
msgstr "触覚が機能せず、触ったものが肉体をすり抜けてしまうように感じます。"

#. ~ Miss message of effect type "Weak Grasp, Inexistent Grasp"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "Your attacks don't seem to touch your enemies!"
msgstr "攻撃が敵に効いていないようです！"

#. ~ Name of effect type id "pd_per_bad"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "Distorted Vision"
msgstr "視界の歪み"

#. ~ Name of effect type id "pd_per_bad"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "Otherworldly Vision"
msgstr "視覚異常"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Distorted Vision"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "You have problems distinguishing shapes and colors."
msgstr "ものの形や色を識別できない状態です。"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Otherworldly Vision"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "You seem to see slightly different realities every time you blink."
msgstr "瞬きをする度に、周囲の光景が少しずつ変わって見えます。"

#. ~ Miss message of effect type "Distorted Vision, Otherworldly Vision"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "You can't distinguish up from down!"
msgstr "どちらが上でどちらが下かも判別できません！"

#. ~ Name of effect type id "pd_int_bad"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "Wandering Mind"
msgstr "精神の歪み"

#. ~ Name of effect type id "pd_int_bad"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "Foreign Mind"
msgstr "精神異常"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Wandering Mind"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "Your thoughts seem to wander around on their own."
msgstr "思考が迷走し、考えがまとまりません。"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Foreign Mind"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "Foreign thoughts seem to invade your mind."
msgstr "妙な考えが頭の中に浮かび、落ち着きません。"

#. ~ Miss message of effect type "Wandering Mind, Foreign Mind"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "You suddenly think you shouldn't do that!"
msgstr "突然、こんなことをしてはいけないという考えが頭に浮かびました！"

#. ~ Name of effect type id "pd_rejection"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "World Rejection"
msgstr "空間拒絶"

#. ~ Name of effect type id "pd_rejection"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "Dimensional Rejection"
msgstr "次元拒絶"

#. ~ Description of effect type "World Rejection"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid ""
"Faint sparks surround your every move, your body aches more with every "
"passing second."
msgstr "少し動くだけでも微弱な火花が発生し、肉体が苦痛を感じています。"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Dimensional Rejection"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid ""
"Sparks swarm around you, your body hurts and even the air seems to reject "
"your existence."
msgstr "周囲に火花が飛び散り、身体が痛み、空気までもが自分の存在を拒絶しているかのように感じます。"

#. ~ Remove message of effect type "World Rejection, Dimensional Rejection"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid ""
"The world is no longer trying to eject you from this plane of existence, for"
" now."
msgstr "今のところは、世界から拒絶されなくなりました。"

#. ~ Decay message of effect type "World Rejection, Dimensional Rejection"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid ""
"The rejection you feel from all around you has become a little easier to "
"bear."
msgstr "世界からの拒絶に少し耐えられるようになってきました。"

#. ~ Name of effect type id "pd_strengthened_reality"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "World's Acceptance"
msgstr "世界の受容*"

#. ~ Name of effect type id "pd_strengthened_reality"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "World's Embracement"
msgstr "世界の抱擁**"

#. ~ Name of effect type id "pd_strengthened_reality"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "Dimensional Foothold"
msgstr "次元支持***"

#. ~ Name of effect type id "pd_strengthened_reality"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "Dimensional Assimilation"
msgstr "次元同化****"

#. ~ Description of effect type "World's Acceptance"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "The world around you seems calmer with your presence and actions."
msgstr "自分自身の存在と行動によって、周囲の世界がより穏やかになっていると感じます。"

#. ~ Description of effect type "World's Embracement"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid ""
"The world around you seems to regard you as one of their own, your body is a"
" little easier to move now."
msgstr "周囲の世界に仲間として認められ、肉体が少し動きやすくなったように感じます。"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Dimensional Foothold"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid ""
"You can more easily exert your will around you, this dimension is, if not "
"welcoming you, obeying you a little.  You have managed to secure a foothold "
"in this reality."
msgstr ""
"この世界で自分の意志をより発揮しやすくなりました。次元から歓迎されていないにしても、多少は言うことを聞いてもらえそうです。ひとまずは現実世界に足場を確保できました。"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Dimensional Assimilation"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid ""
"The very fabric of reality is blending in with your body, your will is "
"greatly easier to exert around you and your body is trying to permanently "
"assimilate with this world, it just needs a little push…"
msgstr "現実の構造が肉体に溶け込み、意志が世界に伝わりやすくなっています。あとほんの少しのきっかけがあれば、この世界と永久に同化しそうです..."

#. ~ Apply message of effect type "World's Acceptance, World's Embracement,
#. Dimensional Foothold, Dimensional Assimilation"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "Your eyes open to a whole new world!"
msgstr "まったく新しい世界を見据えました！"

#. ~ Remove message of effect type "World's Acceptance, World's Embracement,
#. Dimensional Foothold, Dimensional Assimilation"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "You start to feel rejected by the world again."
msgstr "世界からの拒絶を再び感じ始めました。"

#. ~ Miss message of effect type "World's Acceptance, World's Embracement,
#. Dimensional Foothold, Dimensional Assimilation"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "Did the world just oppose you?"
msgstr "この世界に嫌われているのでしょうか？"

#. ~ Miss message of effect type "World's Acceptance, World's Embracement,
#. Dimensional Foothold, Dimensional Assimilation"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "For a moment you felt a great hostility all around you."
msgstr "一瞬、周囲の世界から強い敵意を感じました。"

#. ~ Miss message of effect type "World's Acceptance, World's Embracement,
#. Dimensional Foothold, Dimensional Assimilation"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "Did your enemy just vanish for a moment?"
msgstr "敵の姿が一瞬だけ消えました。何だったのでしょうか？"

#. ~ Miss message of effect type "World's Acceptance, World's Embracement,
#. Dimensional Foothold, Dimensional Assimilation"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "You felt weird for a moment."
msgstr "一瞬だけ、奇妙な感覚に襲われました。"

#. ~ Miss message of effect type "World's Acceptance, World's Embracement,
#. Dimensional Foothold, Dimensional Assimilation"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "Was that a spark?"
msgstr "奇妙な感覚に襲われましたが、何かの兆候だったのでしょうか？"

#. ~ Miss message of effect type "World's Acceptance, World's Embracement,
#. Dimensional Foothold, Dimensional Assimilation"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "Your grip suddenly failed you."
msgstr "一瞬、何も分からなくなりました。"

#. ~ Miss message of effect type "World's Acceptance, World's Embracement,
#. Dimensional Foothold, Dimensional Assimilation"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "Something just flashed in front of your eyes."
msgstr "目の前で何かが閃きました。"

#. ~ Miss message of effect type "World's Acceptance, World's Embracement,
#. Dimensional Foothold, Dimensional Assimilation"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "Why did the hit go that way?"
msgstr "衝撃を感じましたが、何だったのでしょうか？"

#. ~ Miss message of effect type "World's Acceptance, World's Embracement,
#. Dimensional Foothold, Dimensional Assimilation"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "You could swear that you hit it!"
msgstr "間違いなく、何らかの衝撃を感じました！"

#. ~ Decay message of effect type "World's Acceptance, World's Embracement,
#. Dimensional Foothold, Dimensional Assimilation"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid ""
"The world no longer embraces you as its child.  At least it still tolerates "
"your presence."
msgstr "世界は赤子を抱擁する親ではありません。少なくとも、存在することは許されているようです。"

#. ~ Decay message of effect type "World's Acceptance, World's Embracement,
#. Dimensional Foothold, Dimensional Assimilation"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid ""
"You have lost your foothold and can no longer command the world around you, "
"the world sees you now as only an unruly child."
msgstr "足元がおぼつかず、周囲の世界を把握できなくなりました。世界から、手に負えない子供だと思われているように感じます。"

#. ~ Decay message of effect type "World's Acceptance, World's Embracement,
#. Dimensional Foothold, Dimensional Assimilation"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid ""
"You can no longer bend the world to your will.  You have failed in blending "
"in with this reality and have now only a foothold left."
msgstr "もう世界を意のままに操ることはできません。現実からはじき出され、心もとない足場に留まるほかありません。"

#. ~ Name of effect type id "grown_of_fuse"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "Grown of Fusion"
msgstr "融合成長"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Grown of Fusion"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid ""
"AI effect to increase stats after fusing with another critter.  1 stack "
"means one absorbed max_hp."
msgstr "別の生物と融合した際の能力値が増加するAI効果です。1スタックはmax_hpを1吸収されることを意味します。"

#. ~ Name of effect type id "migo_atmosphere"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "Stinking Air"
msgstr "かすかな悪臭"

#. ~ Name of effect type id "migo_atmosphere"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "Disorienting Air"
msgstr "悪臭"

#. ~ Name of effect type id "migo_atmosphere"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "Smothering Air"
msgstr "酷い悪臭"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Stinking Air"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "The air in here smells like vinegar and mold."
msgstr "酢とカビが混じったような臭いが漂っています。"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Disorienting Air"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid ""
"The air in here smells like vinegar and mold.  It makes you feel soft-headed"
" and confused."
msgstr "酢とカビが混じったような臭いが漂っています。あまりの悪臭に思考力が弱っている気がします。"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Smothering Air"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid ""
"The air in here smells like vinegar and mold.  It is closing in and "
"smothering you, making it impossible to think clearly."
msgstr "酢とカビが混じったような臭いが漂っています。あまりの悪臭に息もできず、頭が正常に働きません。"

#. ~ Apply message of effect type "Stinking Air, Disorienting Air, Smothering
#. Air"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid ""
"The air in here smells like vinegar and mold, and hurts your lungs a bit."
msgstr "酢とカビが混じったような臭いが漂っています。肺に悪影響がありそうです。"

#. ~ Miss message of effect type "Stinking Air, Disorienting Air, Smothering
#. Air"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "You feel groggy in this sweltering, foul air."
msgstr "息苦しいほどの悪臭に、気分が悪くなっています。"

#. ~ Name of effect type id "fetid_goop"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "Covered in Fetid Goop"
msgstr "臭い粘液まみれ"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Covered in Fetid Goop"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid ""
"The feeling of the goop slowly sliding on your skin revulses you and the "
"smell makes you gag."
msgstr "ヘドロが肌をゆっくりと伝う感覚は不快で、悪臭で息が詰まりそうです。"

#. ~ Apply message of effect type "Covered in Fetid Goop"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "You're disgusted by the goop."
msgstr "ヘドロにまみれて不快な気分です。"

#. ~ Name of effect type id "incorporeal"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "Incorporeal"
msgstr "霊体"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Incorporeal"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "You lack substance, as if you aren't quite fully here."
msgstr "自分の存在が消えてしまったような気分になりました。"

#. ~ Name of effect type id "weary_1"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "Lightly Weary"
msgstr "若干の疲労"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Lightly Weary"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid ""
"You've been pretty active for a while; operating at the highest levels of activity will be impaired.\n"
"The following move penalties are applied for the following activity levels:\n"
"Extreme: 1.25x"
msgstr ""
"活発な運動が少し続きました。最高の調子では動けません。\n"
"以下の運動レベルの行動コストにペナルティを受けます。\n"
"最高: x1.25"

#. ~ Name of effect type id "weary_2"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "Moderately Weary"
msgstr "軽い疲労"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Moderately Weary"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid ""
"You've been quite active for a while; operating at higher levels of activity will be impaired.\n"
"The following move penalties are applied for the following activity levels:\n"
"Extreme: 1.67x, Active: 1.33x"
msgstr ""
"活発な運動がしばらく続きました。あまり調子良くは動けません。\n"
"以下の運動レベルの行動コストにペナルティを受けます。\n"
"最高: x1.67、高: x1.33"

#. ~ Name of effect type id "weary_3"
#. ~ Label of UI widget "ln_weariness_desc"
#. ~ Label of UI widget "zenfs_weariness_num"
#: data/json/effects.json data/json/ui/sidebar-legacy-labels-narrow.json
#: data/json/ui/zenfs/health.json
msgid "Weary"
msgstr "疲労"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Weary"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid ""
"You've been very active for a while, and need to slow down for a bit.\n"
"The following move penalties are applied for the following activity levels:\n"
"Extreme: 2.5x, Active: 2x, Brisk: 1.5x"
msgstr ""
"活発な運動がかなりの間続きました。少し身体を休ませる必要があります。\n"
"以下の運動レベルの行動コストにペナルティを受けます。\n"
"最高: x2.5、高: x2、中: x1.5"

#. ~ Name of effect type id "weary_4"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "Very Weary"
msgstr "強い疲労"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Very Weary"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid ""
"You've been extremely active for a while, and need to slow down.\n"
"The following move penalties are applied for the following activity levels:\n"
"Extreme: 5x, Active: 4x, Brisk: 3x, Moderate: 2x"
msgstr ""
"活発な運動が長く続きました。しばらくは身体を休ませる必要があります。\n"
"以下の運動レベルの行動コストにペナルティを受けます。\n"
"最高: x5、高: x4、中: x3、低: x2"

#. ~ Name of effect type id "weary_5"
#. ~ Name of effect type id "weary_6"
#. ~ Name of effect type id "weary_7"
#. ~ Name of effect type id "weary_8"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "Extremely Weary"
msgstr "酷い疲労"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Extremely Weary"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid ""
"You've been extremely active for a while, and can't take much more activity.\n"
"The following move penalties are applied for the following activity levels:\n"
"Extreme: 10x, Active: 8x, Brisk: 6x, Moderate: 4x, Light: 2x"
msgstr ""
"非常に活発な運動をずっと続けています。これ以上の活動は難しそうです。\n"
"以下の運動レベルの行動コストにペナルティを受けます。\n"
"最高: x10、高: x8、中: x6、低: x4、軽微: x2"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Extremely Weary"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid ""
"You've been extremely active for a while, and really need to get some rest.\n"
"The following move penalties are applied for the following activity levels:\n"
"Extreme: 10x, Active: 8x, Brisk: 6x, Moderate: 4x, Light: 2x"
msgstr ""
"非常に活発な運動をずっと続けています。休憩を真剣に検討するべきです。\n"
"以下の運動レベルの行動コストにペナルティを受けます。\n"
"最高: x10、高: x8、中: x6、低: x4、軽微: x2"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Extremely Weary"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid ""
"You've been extremely active for a while; it's time to stop.\n"
"The following move penalties are applied for the following activity levels:\n"
"Extreme: 10x, Active: 8x, Brisk: 6x, Moderate: 4x, Light: 2x"
msgstr ""
"非常に活発な運動が長期間続きました。もう止めましょう。\n"
"以下の運動レベルの行動コストにペナルティを受けます。\n"
"最高: x10、高: x8、中: x6、低: x4、軽微: x2"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Extremely Weary"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid ""
"You've been extremely active for a while, and can no longer keep pushing.\n"
"The following move penalties are applied for the following activity levels:\n"
"Extreme: 10x, Active: 8x, Brisk: 6x, Moderate: 4x, Light: 2x"
msgstr ""
"非常に活発な運動が長期間続きました。既に限界を超えています。\n"
"以下の運動レベルの行動コストにペナルティを受けます。\n"
"最高: x10、高: x8、中: x6、低: x4、軽微: x2"

#. ~ Name of effect type id "hunger_full"
#. ~ Name of effect type id "beggar_has_eaten"
#. ~ Clause text "full" of UI widget "hunger_desc_label"
#: data/json/effects.json
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/beggars/BEGGAR_1_Reena_Sandhu.json
#: data/json/ui/hunger.json
msgid "Full"
msgstr "満腹 *"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Full"
#. ~ Apply message of effect type "Full"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "You feel quite full, and a bit sluggish."
msgstr "空腹が満たされ、少しだるさを感じます。"

#. ~ Name of effect type id "hunger_engorged"
#. ~ Clause text "engorged" of UI widget "hunger_desc_label"
#. ~ Clause text "engorged" of UI widget "zenfs_blood_level"
#. ~ Name of effect type id "blood_quenched"
#. ~ Clause text "engorged" of UI widget "vampire_blood_levels"
#: data/json/effects.json data/json/ui/hunger.json
#: data/json/ui/zenfs/mod_XE.json data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/effects.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/ui/vamp_blood_levels.json
msgid "Engorged"
msgstr "膨満"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Engorged"
#. ~ Apply message of effect type "Engorged"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "Your stomach is full to bursting.  This was a mistake."
msgstr "胃が張り裂けそうです。食べ過ぎましたね。"

#. ~ Name of effect type id "weakened_inertia"
#. ~ Name of effect type id "strengthened_inertia"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "Weakened Inertia"
msgstr "慣性減少"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Weakened Inertia"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "Your body moves strangely easily, as if it weighted less."
msgstr "身体が妙に軽くなり、楽に動くような気がします。"

#. ~ Apply message of effect type "Weakened Inertia"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid ""
"Your inertia itself is damaged, but the outcome seems suspiciously "
"beneficial."
msgstr "慣性に欠落が生じており、妙に身体が軽くなったような気がします。"

#. ~ Remove message of effect type "Weakened Inertia"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "Reality reasserts itself and your inertia returns to normal."
msgstr "現実世界が元に戻り、慣性も正常になりました。"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Weakened Inertia"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "Your body is strangely difficult to move, as if it weighted more."
msgstr "身体が重くなったような、妙な動きにくさを感じます。"

#. ~ Apply message of effect type "Weakened Inertia"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "Your inertia itself is damaged, but hopefully it's not permanent yet."
msgstr "慣性に欠落が生じていますが、きっとそのうち元に戻るでしょう。"

#. ~ Name of effect type id "warped_viewpoint"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "Warped Viewpoint"
msgstr "視界歪曲"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Warped Viewpoint"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid ""
"Space is warped around you such that you can see a wider arc and as if "
"everything was closer."
msgstr "周囲の空間が弧を描くように歪んで見え、あらゆる物体が近くにあるように感じます。"

#. ~ Apply message of effect type "Warped Viewpoint"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid ""
"Space around you is damaged but in the process your can see more and more "
"easily than before."
msgstr "周囲の空間が歪んで見えますが、以前よりも視界が広がったような気もします。"

#. ~ Remove message of effect type "Warped Viewpoint"
#. ~ Remove message of effect type "Narrowed Viewpoint"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "Reality reasserts itself and your perspective returns to normal."
msgstr "現実世界が元に戻り、視界も正常になりました。"

#. ~ Name of effect type id "narrow_viewpoint"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "Narrowed Viewpoint"
msgstr "視界狭窄"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Narrowed Viewpoint"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid ""
"Space is warped around you such that you can see less and as if everything "
"was farther away."
msgstr "周囲の空間が縮まって見え、あらゆる物体が遠くにあるように感じます。"

#. ~ Apply message of effect type "Narrowed Viewpoint"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "Space around you is damaged narrowing your perspective."
msgstr "周囲の空間が歪み、視界が狭くなったように感じます。"

#. ~ Name of effect type id "weakened_gravity"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "Weakened Gravity"
msgstr "重力減少"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Weakened Gravity"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid ""
"Something is wrong with local spacetime and everything near you seems to "
"weigh less."
msgstr "周囲の時空が異常をきたし、物体が軽くなったように感じます。"

#. ~ Apply message of effect type "Weakened Gravity"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid ""
"Space around you is damaged and everything near you seems to weigh less."
msgstr "周囲の時空が歪み、物体が軽くなったように感じます。"

#. ~ Remove message of effect type "Weakened Gravity"
#. ~ Remove message of effect type "Strengthened Gravity"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "Reality reasserts itself and your gravity returns to normal."
msgstr "現実世界が元に戻り、重力も正常になりました。"

#. ~ Name of effect type id "strengthened_gravity"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "Strengthened Gravity"
msgstr "重力増大"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Strengthened Gravity"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid ""
"Something is wrong with local spacetime and everything near you seems to "
"weigh more."
msgstr "周囲の時空が異常をきたし、物体が重くなったように感じます。"

#. ~ Apply message of effect type "Strengthened Gravity"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid ""
"Space around you is damaged and everything near you seems to weigh more."
msgstr "周囲の時空が歪み、物体が重くなったように感じます。"

#. ~ Name of effect type id "slowed_time"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "Slowed Time"
msgstr "時間遅滞"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Slowed Time"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid ""
"Something is wrong with local spacetime and everything around seems to move "
"faster than you."
msgstr "周囲の時空が異常をきたし、自分以外の全てが速く動いているように感じます。"

#. ~ Apply message of effect type "Slowed Time"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid ""
"Time around you is damaged and everything near you seems to move faster."
msgstr "周囲の時間が歪み、自分以外の全てが速く動いているように感じます。"

#. ~ Remove message of effect type "Slowed Time"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "Reality reasserts itself and your time returns to normal."
msgstr "現実世界が元に戻り、時間の流れも正常になりました。"

#. ~ Name of effect type id "nvg_green"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "Night Vision Goggles (Green)"
msgstr "暗視ゴーグル(緑色)"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Night Vision Goggles (Green)"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "Your night vision goggles give a green tint to the world."
msgstr "暗視ゴーグルによって視界が緑色に染まっています。"

#. ~ Name of effect type id "glowing_gas"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgctxt "inhaled"
msgid "Glowing Gas"
msgstr "発光粒子"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Glowing Gas"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid ""
"You've inhaled a lungful of glowing nether parasite spores.  Thankfully, "
"they don't seem adapted to the human physiology."
msgstr "光り輝く異界の寄生生物の胞子を肺一杯に吸い込みました。ありがたいことに、人間に寄生する特性はないようです。"

#. ~ Apply message of effect type "Glowing Gas"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid ""
"You inhale a lungful of the glowing gas, and you have an urge to violently "
"cough."
msgstr "光り輝く粒子を肺一杯に吸い込んでしまい、咳き込みそうになりました。"

#. ~ Miss message of effect type "Glowing Gas"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "Your lungs burn from the glowing gas."
msgstr "発光する粒子を吸い込み、肺がヒリヒリと痛みます。"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Glowing"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "You are covered in glowing nether spores!"
msgstr "発光する異界の胞子に覆われています！"

#. ~ Apply message of effect type "Glowing"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "The glowing spores settle on you!"
msgstr "発光する胞子が付着しています！"

#. ~ Name of effect type id "lightsnare"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "Snared"
msgstr "くくり罠拘束"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Snared"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "For such a tiny creature, you're in a very big pickle."
msgstr "小動物にとってこの状況は一大事です。"

#. ~ Name of effect type id "Shadow_Reveal"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "Revealed"
msgstr "擬装消失"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Revealed"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "The shadows no longer hide you!"
msgstr "影が消え、再び姿が現れました！"

#. ~ Name of effect type id "photophobia"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "photophobia"
msgstr "嫌光性"

#. ~ Description of effect type "photophobia"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid ""
"It burns!  Thankfully, this can't ever happen to you.  This is a bug if you "
"have it."
msgstr "燃えています！ありがたいことに、通常は操作キャラクターには表示されません。"

#. ~ Name of effect type id "nemesis_buff"
#: data/json/effects.json
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effects/effects_monster.json
msgid "SWOLE"
msgstr "筋肥大"

#. ~ Description of effect type "SWOLE"
#: data/json/effects.json
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effects/effects_monster.json
msgid "If you see this description it is a bug."
msgstr "この説明は通常は表示されません。"

#. ~ Name of effect type id "molting"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "Molting"
msgstr "脱皮"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Molting"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "You feel a strong urge to hide somewhere safe."
msgstr "どこか安全な場所に隠れたいという強い衝動を感じます。"

#. ~ Apply message of effect type "Molting"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "Your chitin plating itches against your body."
msgstr "キチン質の装甲と肉体が擦れて痒みを感じます。"

#. ~ Name of effect type id "molting_imminent"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "Imminent Molting"
msgstr "脱皮直前"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Imminent Molting"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "Seek shelter, you will be helpless when it begins."
msgstr "安全な場所を探しましょう。脱皮が始まれば肉体は脆弱になります。"

#. ~ Apply message of effect type "Imminent Molting"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid ""
"You can hardly move in your tightening exoskeleton, and you feel a strong "
"impulse to hunker down somewhere safe."
msgstr "外骨格に肉体を締め付けられており、ほとんど動けません。どこか安全な場所に身を隠したいという衝動に駆られています。"

#. ~ Name of effect type id "VITRIFYING"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "Among Glass"
msgstr "ガラスの中"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Among Glass"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "It is very peaceful here."
msgstr "ここはとても平和です。"

#. ~ Name of effect type id "hay_fever"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "Hay Fever"
msgstr "花粉症"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Hay Fever"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "Your eyes are itchy and you've got a runny nose."
msgstr "目が痒く、鼻水が出ています。"

#. ~ Name of effect type id "star_vampire_blood_drank"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "Drank blood"
msgstr "血液摂取"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Drank blood"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "The star vampire has drunk blood and is now visible."
msgstr "星の精が血液を啜り、可視状態になっています。"

#. ~ Name of effect type id "star_vampire_blood_drink"
#. ~ Name of effect type id "star_vampire_blood_drink_feral"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "Exsanguination"
msgstr "被飲血"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Exsanguination"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "The monster is greedily drinking your blood!"
msgstr "モンスターに大量の血液を飲まれています！"

#. ~ Name of effect type id "star_vampire_blood_drink"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "Hemorrhage"
msgstr "被吸血(軽)"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Hemorrhage"
#. ~ Description of effect type "Bloodsucking"
#: data/json/effects.json data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/vampire_askblood.json
msgid "The monster is sucking up your blood!"
msgstr "モンスターに血液を吸われています！"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Exsanguination"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "The monster is drinking your blood, you vile feral!"
msgstr "怪物に血を啜られています。なんとおぞましい所業でしょうか！"

#. ~ Name of effect type id "ink_gland_ink"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "Depleted ink"
msgstr "空の墨袋"

#. ~ Name of effect type id "ink_gland_ink"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "Deflated ink glands"
msgstr "収縮した墨袋"

#. ~ Name of effect type id "ink_gland_ink"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "Inky glands"
msgstr "墨袋"

#. ~ Name of effect type id "ink_gland_ink"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "Bulged ink glands"
msgstr "充満した墨袋"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Depleted ink"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid ""
"Your ink glands are empty.  Given some time and hydration they will "
"recharge."
msgstr "墨袋がほとんど空になっています。水分を補給して少し待てば墨が生成されます。"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Deflated ink glands"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid ""
"Your ink glands are almost empty.  Given some time and hydration they will "
"recharge."
msgstr "墨袋がほとんど空になっています。水分を補給して少し待てば墨が生成されます。"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Inky glands"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid ""
"Your ink glands have some ink inside.  Given some time and hydration, more "
"ink will be generated."
msgstr "墨袋の中に墨が入っています。水分を補給して少し待てば墨が更に生成されます。"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Bulged ink glands"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "Your ink glands are bulged and full.  No more ink is being created."
msgstr "墨袋がパンパンに膨らんでいます。墨はこれ以上生成されません。"

#. ~ Name of effect type id "cramped_space"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "Cramped Space"
msgstr "狭い空間"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Cramped Space"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "You are painfully crammed into a space too small for your body."
msgstr "狭すぎる空間に詰め込まれ、苦痛を感じています。"

#. ~ Apply message of effect type "Cramped Space"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "You are squeezed uncomfortably into the cramped space."
msgstr "狭い空間に無理やり押し込められています。"

#. ~ Remove message of effect type "Cramped Space"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "It feels good having room to move again."
msgstr "快適に動けるようになりました。"

#. ~ Miss message of effect type "Cramped Space"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "You don't have any room to move!"
msgstr "身動きが取れません！"

#. ~ Name of effect type id "gliding"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "Gliding"
msgstr "滑空"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Gliding"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "You are gliding through the air."
msgstr "空中を滑空しています。"

#. ~ Name of effect type id "slow_descent"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "Slow Descent"
msgstr "低速下降"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Slow Descent"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "You are descending at a safe speed."
msgstr "安全な速度で下降しています。"

#. ~ Name of effect type id "mute"
#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/json/effects.json data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Mute"
msgstr "発話不可"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Mute"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "You can't talk."
msgstr "会話できません。"

#. ~ Name of effect type id "social_satisfied"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "Good Company"
msgstr "素敵な仲間"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Good Company"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "It feels good to spend time around others."
msgstr "誰かと共に過ごすのは楽しいものです。"

#. ~ Name of effect type id "social_dissatisfied"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "Very Lonely"
msgstr "強い孤独"

#. ~ Name of effect type id "social_dissatisfied"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "All Alone"
msgstr "絶望的孤独"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Lonely"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "You feel a little lonely."
msgstr "少し寂しさを感じます。"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Very Lonely"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "You could really use a friend right now."
msgstr "今すぐ仲間に会いたいと感じています。"

#. ~ Description of effect type "All Alone"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "What's the point of surviving if you're all alone?"
msgstr "これからずっと一人で過ごすなら、生き残る意味などあるのでしょうか？"

#. ~ Name of effect type id "asocial_satisfied"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "Alone"
msgstr "孤高"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Alone"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "Being on your own makes you feel good."
msgstr "一人で過ごすのは気分のいいものです。"

#. ~ Name of effect type id "asocial_dissatisfied"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "Irritable"
msgstr "面倒"

#. ~ Name of effect type id "asocial_dissatisfied"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "Annoyed"
msgstr "苛立ち"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Irritable"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "Being around others has left you feeling drained."
msgstr "仲間と一緒に過ごすと気疲れします。"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Annoyed"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "OK, that's enough social time.  You'd really rather be alone now."
msgstr "他者との交流はもう十分です。一人で過ごしたいと感じています。"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Crowded"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid ""
"Your nerves are frayed from all this socializing.  You need some alone time "
"to recharge."
msgstr "他者との交流のせいで神経がすり減っています。元気を取り戻すには一人の時間が必要です。"

#. ~ Name of effect type id "natural_stance"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "Natural Stance"
msgstr "四足立ち"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Natural Stance"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid ""
"You are positioned to take advantage of your mutated anatomy, and will "
"receive no penalties for crouching in melee combat.  Wielding a weapon will "
"cause you to lose this effect."
msgstr ""
"変異した体構造に適した姿勢を取っているため、中腰状態で近接攻撃を行ってもペナルティを受けません。アイテムを装備している場合は、この効果は失われます。"

#. ~ Name of effect type id "subaquatic_sonar"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "Subaquatic SONAR"
msgstr "水中ソナー"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Subaquatic SONAR"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid ""
"Every few seconds, an ultrasonic pulse is broadcast from your location.  If "
"you're underwater and your hearing is good enough, you may be able to "
"navigate by the pings that come back."
msgstr "数秒ごとに、現在位置から超音波パルスが放出されます。聴覚が正常な状態で水中にいると、音波の反射を頼りに周囲を探査できます。"

#. ~ Name of effect type id "fragile_frog"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "Fragile Frog"
msgstr "カエル脆弱化"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Fragile Frog"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid ""
"Applied by leap special attack of burned frog zombies, conditional for "
"related spell."
msgstr "関連呪文の条件次第で、焼焦ゾンビガエルの特殊攻撃によって付与されます。"

#. ~ Name of effect type id "a_winner_is_u"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "Winning!"
msgstr "勝利！"

#. ~ Name of a enchantment
#: data/json/enchantments.json
msgid "Night Vision Goggles"
msgstr "暗視ゴーグル"

#. ~ Description of enchantment "Night Vision Goggles"
#: data/json/enchantments.json
msgid ""
"You are wearing night vision goggles which allow you to see really well in "
"the dark."
msgstr "暗視ゴーグルを着用しているため、暗闇でも非常にはっきりと視認できます。"

#. ~ Description of enchantment "Night Vision Goggles"
#: data/json/enchantments.json
msgid ""
"You are wearing night vision goggles which allow you to see quite well in "
"the dark."
msgstr "暗視ゴーグルを着用しているため、暗闇でもはっきりと視認できます。"

#. ~ Description of enchantment "Night Vision Goggles"
#: data/json/enchantments.json
msgid ""
"You are wearing night vision goggles which allow you to see in the dark."
msgstr "暗視ゴーグルを着用しているため、暗闇でも視認できます。"

#. ~ Description of enchantment "Night Vision Goggles"
#: data/json/enchantments.json
msgid ""
"You are wearing night vision goggles which allow you to poorly see in the "
"dark."
msgstr "暗視ゴーグルを着用しているため、暗闇でもかろうじて視認できます。"

#. ~ Name of a enchantment
#: data/json/enchantments.json data/mods/Aftershock/items/item_enchants.json
msgid "Cold Climate Control"
msgstr "低温適応"

#. ~ Description of enchantment "Cold Climate Control"
#. ~ Description of enchantment "Complete Climate Control"
#: data/json/enchantments.json data/mods/Aftershock/items/item_enchants.json
msgid "You are wearing equipment that helps handle harsh climates."
msgstr "過酷な温度に適応するアイテムを着用しています。"

#. ~ Name of a enchantment
#: data/json/enchantments.json
msgid "Complete Climate Control"
msgstr "温度適応"

#. ~ Name of a enchantment
#: data/json/enchantments.json
msgid "EXO Frame Strength"
msgstr "筋力増強外骨格"

#. ~ Description of enchantment "EXO Frame Strength"
#: data/json/enchantments.json
msgid "You are wearing equipment that gives 10 strength."
msgstr "筋力が10増加するアイテムを着用しています。"

#. ~ Name of a enchantment
#: data/json/enchantments.json
msgid "Hyperdense"
msgstr "超重装甲"

#. ~ Description of enchantment "Hyperdense"
#: data/json/enchantments.json
msgid ""
"Your armor's massive weight makes it nearly impossible to be knocked over or"
" pushed back."
msgstr "防具が非常に重いため、転倒したり押し出されたりすることはほぼありません。"

#. ~ Name of a enchantment
#: data/json/enchantments.json
msgid "Detect Evil"
msgstr "異界生物感知"

#. ~ Description of enchantment "Detect Evil"
#: data/json/enchantments.json
msgid "Your armor lets you detect otherworldly presence with ease."
msgstr "防具着用中は異界生物を感知できます。"

#. ~ Name of a enchantment
#: data/json/enchantments.json
msgid "Dampened Steps"
msgstr "足音減衰"

#. ~ Description of enchantment "Dampened Steps"
#: data/json/enchantments.json
msgid "You are wearing equipment that muffles your footsteps."
msgstr "足音を消すアイテムを着用しています。"

#. ~ Name of a enchantment
#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/json/enchantments.json data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Insect Wings (Buzzing)"
msgstr "虫の翅(羽ばたき)"

#. ~ Description of enchantment "Insect Wings (Buzzing)"
#: data/json/enchantments.json
msgid "Your rapidly buzzing wings propel you with extra speed."
msgstr "音を立てて素早く翅を動かすと、速度が上昇します。"

#. ~ Name of a enchantment
#: data/json/enchantments.json
msgid "Inactive exoskeleton"
msgstr "外骨格(停止)"

#. ~ Description of enchantment "Inactive exoskeleton"
#: data/json/enchantments.json
msgid ""
"The exoskeleton is inactive and makes moving in it difficult and exhausting."
msgstr "外骨格は起動しておらず、着用して移動するのは困難であり、疲労を伴います。"

#. ~ Name of a enchantment
#: data/json/enchantments.json
msgid "Active combat exoskeleton mk.1"
msgstr "戦闘用外骨格mk.1(起動)"

#. ~ Description of enchantment "Active combat exoskeleton mk.1"
#: data/json/enchantments.json
msgid ""
"Now powered, the exoskeleton provides <color_white>significant</color> "
"improvements to your carry weight and movement exertion while the life "
"support system shields you against harmful gas, cools you down, and dampens "
"harmful sounds."
msgstr ""
"電力が供給されると、外骨格の力で所持重量限界と移動速度が<color_white>大幅に上昇</color>し、生命維持システムの効果で有毒ガスの影響を受けなくなり、肉体を適温に冷やし、有害な大音量を遮断します。"

#. ~ Name of a enchantment
#: data/json/enchantments.json
msgid "Active combat exoskeleton mk.2"
msgstr "戦闘用外骨格mk.2(起動)"

#. ~ Description of enchantment "Active combat exoskeleton mk.2"
#: data/json/enchantments.json
msgid ""
"Now powered, the exoskeleton provides <color_white>moderate</color> "
"improvements to your carry weight and movement exertion while the life "
"support system shields you against harmful gas, cools you down, and dampens "
"harmful sounds."
msgstr ""
"電力が供給されると、外骨格の力で所持重量限界と移動速度が<color_white>上昇</color>し、生命維持システムの効果で有毒ガスの影響を受けなくなり、肉体を適温に冷やし、有害な大音量を遮断します。"

#. ~ Name of a enchantment
#: data/json/enchantments.json
msgid "Active combat exoskeleton mk.3"
msgstr "戦闘用外骨格mk.3(起動)"

#. ~ Description of enchantment "Active combat exoskeleton mk.3"
#: data/json/enchantments.json
msgid ""
"Now powered, the exoskeleton provides <color_white>slight</color> "
"improvements to your carry weight and movement exertion while the life "
"support system shields you against harmful gas, cools you down, and dampens "
"harmful sounds."
msgstr ""
"電力が供給されると、外骨格の力で所持重量限界と移動速度が<color_white>少し上昇</color>し、生命維持システムの効果で有毒ガスの影響を受けなくなり、肉体を適温に冷やし、有害な大音量を遮断します。"

