#. ~ Profession name for male
#: data/json/hobbies.json
msgctxt "profession_male"
msgid "Caffeine Fiend"
msgstr "カフェイン狂い"

#. ~ Description of profession "Caffeine Fiend" for male
#: data/json/hobbies.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"Caffeine gave you life and without it you are nothing.  Your dependence upon"
" it was so extreme that you can barely function in its absence and you've "
"done lasting psychological harm to yourself.  You'd better find a steady "
"supply, and fast."
msgstr ""
"カフェインによって命を繋いでおり、カフェインがない人生は無そのものです。カフェインに強く依存するあまり、カフェインを摂取しない状態の肉体は役に立たず、精神も衰弱してしまいます。安定した供給源を早く見つけた方がよさそうです。"

#. ~ Profession name for female
#: data/json/hobbies.json
