#. ~ Profession name for male
#: data/json/hobbies.json
msgctxt "profession_male"
msgid "Parkour"
msgstr "パルクール"

#. ~ Description of profession "Parkour" for male
#: data/json/hobbies.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You've practiced parkour for many years, and made the world your playground."
"  It wouldn't be a lie to say that running is your life.  Which is good, "
"because now that the end has come, you're running for your life."
msgstr ""
"多くの年月をかけてパルクールの修練を重ね、世界の全てを遊び場にできるようになりました。こういった走り回っていないと死んでしまう体質の人間にうってつけの、走り回っていないと死んでしまう世界が、目の前に広がっています。"

#. ~ Profession name for female
#: data/json/hobbies.json
msgctxt "profession_female"
msgid "Parkour"
msgstr "パルクール"

