#. ~ Profession name for male
#: data/json/hobbies.json
msgctxt "profession_male"
msgid "Camping"
msgstr "キャンプ"

#. ~ Description of profession "Camping" for male
#: data/json/hobbies.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You enjoyed camping in the vast wilderness as a means of escaping the pace "
"of modern life.  The wilderness isn't filled with people, so it must be "
"safe.  Right?  It must be."
msgstr ""
"忙しい現代生活を忘れる手段として、広大な土地でキャンプを楽しんでいました。森の中には人がいないから、今もきっと安全です。本当に？どうでしょうね。"

#. ~ Profession name for female
#: data/json/hobbies.json
