msgctxt "profession_male"
msgid "Home canning"
msgstr "保存食自作"

#. ~ Description of profession "Home canning" for male
#: data/json/hobbies.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"Whether it was something practiced in your family or something you took it "
"up to extend the shelf life of your groceries, you know how to preserve "
"produce and meat in cans or mason jars.  With the electricity down and "
"refrigerators dead, saying your skills could come in handy is an "
"understatement."
msgstr ""
"家族に習ったのか、それとも食料品を長持ちさせたいと思い立ったのか、野菜や肉を缶や瓶に詰めて保存する方法を身につけました。停電して冷蔵庫も使えない今、この技術は間違いなくやうに建つでしょう。"

