msgctxt "profession_male"
msgid "Sewing (Expert)"
msgstr "裁縫(上級)"

#. ~ Description of profession "Sewing (Expert)" for male
#: data/json/hobbies.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"Despite modern technology making career tailors obsolete you've spent much "
"of your life hand-making clothing of all sorts, whether for historical "
"purposes or to sell as artisanal goods.  Too bad you can't stitch the holes "
"in reality closed."
msgstr ""
"科学技術が仕立て職人を時代遅れにした現代で、史学的な目的にしろ販売するためにしろ、多くの時間を費やしてあらゆる種類の衣類を手作りしてきました。 "
"残念ながら、現実に開いた穴を縫い合わせて閉じることはできません。"

#. ~ Profession name for female
#: data/json/hobbies.json
msgctxt "profession_female"
msgid "Sewing (Expert)"
msgstr "裁縫(上級)"

