msgctxt "profession_male"
msgid "Fencing (Intermediate)"
msgstr "フェンシング(中級)"

#. ~ Description of profession "Fencing (Intermediate)" for male
#: data/json/hobbies.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You were in a fencing club, and you weren't too shabby with a saber.  If you"
" can get your hands on a real sword, you'll be a formidable fighter."
msgstr "フェンシングクラブに所属し、サーブルを使いこなしていました。本物の剣が手に入れば、恐るべき戦闘能力を発揮できそうです。"

