#. ~ Profession name for male
#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "profession_male"
msgid "Shower Victim"
msgstr "入浴中に被害にあった人"

#. ~ Description of profession "Shower Victim" for male
#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You just stepped out of a nice, hot shower to find the world had ended.  "
"You've got some soap, along with the most massively useful thing ever… a "
"towel."
msgstr "熱いシャワーを浴びているまさにその時、大変動が起きました。石鹸とその場にあった最も役立ちそうな物...タオルをとっさに持ち出しました。"

