msgstr "残骸やゾンビ、名状しがたい怪物に占拠される前の道路を支配していました。崩壊した世界には速度制限なんてありません！"

#. ~ Profession name for male
#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "profession_male"
msgid "Hazmat Unit"
msgstr "危険物処理班員"

#. ~ Description of profession "Hazmat Unit" for male
#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You were deployed to autopsy one of the rioters showing feral behavior "
"before being put down.  When they got back up, you knew this was out of your"
" pay grade."
msgstr "暴れ回って鎮圧された暴徒の死体を解剖するために派遣されました。動く死体の解剖なんて、今の給与水準に見合う仕事だとは思えません。"

#. ~ Profession name for female
#: data/json/professions.json
