msgid "Challenge - Overrun"
msgstr "挑戦 - 制圧"

#. ~ Description of scenario "Challenge - Overrun" for male
#: data/json/scenarios.json
msgctxt "scen_desc_male"
msgid ""
"Despite all the soldiers, guns, and minefields, the military base you were "
"in was overrun by the dead.  Everyone was ordered to fall back to the "
"armory, but during all the chaos you got lost and you are now stuck in the "
"warehouse by yourself.  You are not sure if anyone made it to the armory, or"
" if you are the last one alive."
msgstr ""
"あらん限りの兵士、銃、地雷を投入したにもかかわらず、基地は死者に制圧されました。武器庫への退却という最後の命令が下されましたが、混乱の中で部隊からはぐれ、今は一人で倉庫に閉じ込められています。武器庫にたどり着けた者はいるのか、自分が最後の生存者なのか、何一つ分かりません。"

#. ~ Description of scenario "Challenge - Overrun" for female
#: data/json/scenarios.json
msgctxt "scen_desc_female"
msgid ""
"Despite all the soldiers, guns, and minefields, the military base you were "
"in was overrun by the dead.  Everyone was ordered to fall back to the "
"armory, but during all the chaos you got lost and you are now stuck in the "
"warehouse by yourself.  You are not sure if anyone made it to the armory, or"
" if you are the last one alive."
msgstr ""
"あらん限りの兵士、銃、地雷を投入したにもかかわらず、基地は死者に制圧されました。武器庫への退却という最後の命令が下されましたが、混乱の中で部隊からはぐれ、今は一人で倉庫に閉じ込められています。武器庫にたどり着けた者はいるのか、自分が最後の生存者なのか、何一つ分かりません。"

#. ~ Starting location of scenario "Challenge - Overrun"
#: data/json/scenarios.json
msgctxt "start_name"
msgid "Military Base Warehouse"
msgstr "軍事基地内倉庫"

#. ~ Scenario name for male
#: data/json/scenarios.json
msgctxt "scenario_male"
msgid "Crazy Party"
msgstr "イカれたパーティー"

#. ~ Scenario name for female
#: data/json/scenarios.json
msgctxt "scenario_female"
msgid "Crazy Party"
msgstr "イカれたパーティー"

#. ~ Description of scenario "Crazy Party" for male
#: data/json/scenarios.json
msgctxt "scen_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You'd been unsurprised when your vacation — a hastily arranged holiday to a "
"remote resort to maintain distance from the riots — had been put out of its "
"misery when state-wide evacuation was ordered after weeks of worsening "
"violence, and the complex had been placed on a shortlist for civilian "
"gathering sites.  After days of waiting for a non-existent rescue and "
"refugees bringing tales of monsters and the dead, the remaining staff had "
"taken steps to keep spirits up, and last evening, they did that in the best "
"way they knew — hosting a party.  Considering that it lured scores of "
"zombies, you could probably classify that decision as a 'road to literal "
"hell paved with good intentions.'"
msgstr ""
"暴動から逃れるために急遽休暇を取り、人里離れたリゾート地に向かいました。数週間にわたる治安の悪化を受けて州全体に避難勧告が出された段階でもリゾート地は平和そのもので、この複合施設が民間人の避難所に指定されたことを聞いても、何の驚きもありませんでした。何日待っても救助隊はやって来ません。避難者たちは怪物や蘇った死者の噂をしています。昨夜は、滞在者の気分が少しでも明るくなるように、従業員たちが考えうる中で最善のイベント...すなわちパーティーを開いてくれました。結果として多数のゾンビを引き寄せてしまったことを考えると、これはまさに「善意で舗装された地獄への道」の典型例と言えます。"

