msgid "Challenge - Between a Rock and a Hard Place"
msgstr "挑戦 - 挟み撃ち"

#. ~ Description of scenario "Challenge - Between a Rock and a Hard Place" for
#. male
#: data/json/scenarios.json
msgctxt "scen_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You were trying to scavenge for supplies, and now some rough group of "
"bandits has dragged monsters in with them where you were hiding!"
msgstr "物資を調達していると、危険な盗賊団がモンスターを引き連れて、隠れ場所に乗り込んできました！"

#. ~ Description of scenario "Challenge - Between a Rock and a Hard Place" for
#. female
#: data/json/scenarios.json
msgctxt "scen_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You were trying to scavenge for supplies, and now some rough group of "
"bandits has dragged monsters in with them where you were hiding!"
msgstr "物資を調達していると、危険な盗賊団がモンスターを引き連れて、隠れ場所に乗り込んできました！"

#. ~ Scenario name for male
#: data/json/scenarios.json
msgctxt "scenario_male"
msgid "Challenge - Shattered Sky"
msgstr "挑戦 - 砕かれた空"

#. ~ Scenario name for female
#: data/json/scenarios.json
msgctxt "scenario_female"
msgid "Challenge - Shattered Sky"
msgstr "挑戦 - 砕かれた空"

#. ~ Description of scenario "Challenge - Shattered Sky" for male
#: data/json/scenarios.json
msgctxt "scen_desc_male"
msgid ""
"From up here, you watched it all fall apart.  The sky cracked and "
"indescribable alien shapes writhed in the clouds.  The horizon has returned "
"to normal, but you still see shadows moving in the corner of your eye and "
"feel them calling you."
msgstr ""
"この場所から、あらゆるものが崩れ去る瞬間を目撃しました。空は割れ、雲の中に名状しがたい異様な影が蠢きました。水平線は元に戻りましたが、視界の端で何かがちらついています。誰かに呼ばれているような気がします。"

#. ~ Description of scenario "Challenge - Shattered Sky" for female
#: data/json/scenarios.json
msgctxt "scen_desc_female"
msgid ""
"From up here, you watched it all fall apart.  The sky cracked and "
"indescribable alien shapes writhed in the clouds.  The horizon has returned "
"to normal, but you still see shadows moving in the corner of your eye and "
"feel them calling you."
msgstr ""
"この場所から、あらゆるものが崩れ去る瞬間を目撃しました。空は割れ、雲の中に名状しがたい異様な影が蠢きました。水平線は元に戻りましたが、視界の端で何かがちらついています。誰かに呼ばれているような気がします。"

#. ~ Starting location of scenario "Challenge - Shattered Sky"
#: data/json/scenarios.json
msgctxt "start_name"
msgid "Up Above"
msgstr "上層"

#. ~ Scenario name for male
#: data/json/scenarios.json
msgctxt "scenario_male"
msgid "Low Profile"
msgstr "貧乏生活"

#. ~ Scenario name for female
#: data/json/scenarios.json
msgctxt "scenario_female"
msgid "Low Profile"
msgstr "貧乏生活"

#. ~ Description of scenario "Low Profile" for male
#: data/json/scenarios.json
msgctxt "scen_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You heard the global, worsening news and saw the nightmare in the cities "
"firsthand — a situation that prompted you to jump from low-rent motel to "
"cheap trailer, trying to outrun the madness.  While only you know where "
"you'd planned to go, when you heard the government's last broadcast and "
"realized 'no help was coming,' you resolved to raise a dejected toast and "
"sink to the bottom of a bottle for as long as you could.  What happened in "
"the following days of drunken stupor is an enigma.  What you do know, is "
"that it's time to see how much of the world there's left to return to."
msgstr ""
"世界的な情勢悪化のニュースを聞き、都市部の悪夢を目の当たりにしました。狂った世界から逃げるために安モーテルを抜け出し、安トレーラーに飛び乗りました。その後どこへ逃げる気だったのかはもう覚えていませんが、政府からの最後の放送を聞いた頃には「助けは来ない」と悟り、後は失意のどん底で乾杯し、できる限り長く酔って気を紛らわせること以外何も考えられませんでした。酒に溺れていたその後の数日間、何が起きていたのかは覚えていません。今分かるのは、残っているかどうかも怪しい現実世界と対峙するときが来たということだけです。"

#. ~ Description of scenario "Low Profile" for female
#: data/json/scenarios.json
msgctxt "scen_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You heard the global, worsening news and saw the nightmare in the cities "
"firsthand — a situation that prompted you to jump from low-rent motel to "
"cheap trailer, trying to outrun the madness.  While only you know where "
"you'd planned to go, when you heard the government's last broadcast and "
"realized 'no help was coming,' you resolved to raise a dejected toast and "
"sink to the bottom of a bottle for as long as you could.  What happened in "
"the following days of drunken stupor is an enigma.  What you do know, is "
"that it's time to see how much of the world there's left to return to."
msgstr ""
"世界的な情勢悪化のニュースを聞き、都市部の悪夢を目の当たりにしました。狂った世界から逃げるために安モーテルを抜け出し、安トレーラーに飛び乗りました。その後どこへ逃げる気だったのかはもう覚えていませんが、政府からの最後の放送を聞いた頃には「助けは来ない」と悟り、後は失意のどん底で乾杯し、できる限り長く酔って気を紛らわせること以外何も考えられませんでした。酒に溺れていたその後の数日間、何が起きていたのかは覚えていません。今分かるのは、残っているかどうかも怪しい現実世界と対峙するときが来たということだけです。"

#. ~ Scenario name for male
#: data/json/scenarios.json
msgctxt "scenario_male"
msgid "Mass Quarantine"
msgstr "集団検疫"

#. ~ Scenario name for female
#: data/json/scenarios.json
msgctxt "scenario_female"
msgid "Mass Quarantine"
msgstr "集団検疫"

#. ~ Description of scenario "Mass Quarantine" for male
#: data/json/scenarios.json
msgctxt "scen_desc_male"
msgid ""
"When FEMA camps ran out of space the authorities used what was left of their"
" manpower to round up people at gunpoint.  The stadiums they forced everyone"
" into did nothing to slow down the madness and it spread like wildfire.  You"
" managed to slip away from the worst violence but you are now surrounded and"
" need to escape quickly!"
msgstr ""
"FEMAキャンプに空きがなくなると、政府当局は残された職員を動員し、銃口を突きつけて市民を一箇所に集めました。市民が収容されたスタジアムでは狂気が野火のように広がり、溢れだしました。最悪の事態からは逃れましたが、包囲網からは抜け出せていません。迅速に脱出しましょう！"

#. ~ Description of scenario "Mass Quarantine" for female
#: data/json/scenarios.json
msgctxt "scen_desc_female"
msgid ""
"When FEMA camps ran out of space the authorities used what was left of their"
" manpower to round up people at gunpoint.  The stadiums they forced everyone"
" into did nothing to slow down the madness and it spread like wildfire.  You"
" managed to slip away from the worst violence but you are now surrounded and"
" need to escape quickly!"
msgstr ""
"FEMAキャンプに空きがなくなると、政府当局は残された職員を動員し、銃口を突きつけて市民を一箇所に集めました。市民が収容されたスタジアムでは狂気が野火のように広がり、溢れだしました。最悪の事態からは逃れましたが、包囲網からは抜け出せていません。迅速に脱出しましょう！"

