#. ~ Mission name
#: data/json/starting_missions.json
msgid "Finish your mission"
msgstr "任務を遂行する"

#. ~ Description of mission "Finish your mission"
#: data/json/starting_missions.json
msgid ""
"Your mission required you to eliminate a certain high-ranking individual in "
"hiding.  Your mark seems to have turned feral while escaping and the world "
"appears to be ending, but not even that can stop you from finishing your "
"mission."
msgstr ""
"潜伏しているある高名な人物を殺す任務を与えられていました。ターゲットは逃走中に凶暴化し、更に世界も崩壊してしまったようですが、それでも任務は遂行しなければなりません。"

#. ~ Name of the monster "mon_feral_scientist_scalpel" placed on map update on
#. start of mission "Finish your mission"
#. ~ Name of the monster "mon_zombie_prisoner_brute" placed on map update on
#. start of mission "Kill your mark"
#: data/json/starting_missions.json
msgid "The Target"
msgstr "標的"

#. ~ Name of the monster "mon_feral_labsecurity_9mm" placed on map update on
#. start of mission "Finish your mission"
#. ~ Name of the monster "afs_mon_reaver" placed on map update on start of
#. mission "The bounty is on Salus IV"
#: data/json/starting_missions.json
#: data/mods/Aftershock/missions/bounty_hunter_missions.json
msgid "The Guard"
msgstr "護衛"

#. ~ Name of the monster "mon_feral_soldier" placed on map update on start of
#. mission "Finish your mission"
#: data/json/starting_missions.json
msgid "The Collaborator"
msgstr "協力者"

#. ~ Name of the monster "mon_feral_fancy_rapier" placed on map update on
#. start of mission "Finish your mission"
#. ~ Name of the monster "afs_mon_reaver" placed on map update on start of
#. mission "The bounty is on Salus IV"
#: data/json/starting_missions.json
#: data/mods/Aftershock/missions/bounty_hunter_missions.json
msgid "The Aristocrat"
msgstr "貴人"

#. ~ Name of the monster "mon_feral_maid_broom" placed on map update on start
#. of mission "Finish your mission"
#: data/json/starting_missions.json
msgid "The Servant"
msgstr "使用人"

#. ~ Mission name
#: data/json/starting_missions.json
msgid "Kill your mark"
msgstr "標的を殺す"

#. ~ Description of mission "Kill your mark"
#: data/json/starting_missions.json
msgid ""
"Your employer could be no longer responding but you have decided to finish "
"your mission.  Hunt down and kill your mark."
msgstr "雇用主からの返事はもうないかもしれませんが、ともかく任務を完了することにしました。標的を追い詰め、殺しましょう。"

#. ~ Mission name
#: data/json/starting_missions.json
msgid "Life vow"
msgstr "命の約束"

#. ~ Description of mission "Life vow"
#: data/json/starting_missions.json
msgid ""
"Live your life to the fullest, prove to yourself that you can survive this "
"new obstacle in the same way that you have survived the last."
msgstr "精一杯生きて、この新たな困難も今までと同じように乗り越えられることを自ら証明しましょう。"

#. ~ Mission name
#: data/json/starting_missions.json
msgid "Prepare for your next show"
msgstr "次のショーに備える"

#. ~ Description of mission "Prepare for your next show"
#: data/json/starting_missions.json
msgid ""
"Become the best clown, make sure that your next show will make everyone "
"laugh by training your social skills to perfection."
msgstr "次のショーで皆を笑わせるために、社交スキルをできる限り高めて最高のクラウンを目指しましょう。"

#. ~ Mission name
#: data/json/starting_missions.json
msgid "Find a memory of your master"
msgstr "ご主人様との思い出を探す"

#. ~ Description of mission "Find a memory of your master"
#: data/json/starting_missions.json
msgid "Find and wield a whip to remember your master even when separated."
msgstr "離れていてもご主人様のことをいつでも思い出せるように、鞭を手に入れましょう。"

#. ~ Mission name
#: data/json/starting_missions.json
msgid "Obtain your black belt"
msgstr "黒帯を手に入れる"

#. ~ Description of mission "Obtain your black belt"
#: data/json/starting_missions.json
msgid ""
"You could have become a master in martial arts if you had the chance, so "
"train until you achieve the level of a master in the old world, and find "
"yourself a nice black belt to commemorate the occasion."
msgstr ""
"チャンスがあれば武道の達人になれていたかもしれません。修行して崩壊前の世界でも達人と言われるであろうレベルまで鍛え、その記念に立派な黒帯を自力で手に入れましょう。"

#. ~ Mission name
#: data/json/starting_missions.json
msgid "Find a real katana"
msgstr "本物の刀を探す"

#. ~ Description of mission "Find a real katana"
#: data/json/starting_missions.json
msgid ""
"The world has ended, but as an authentic samurai you lack a katana, you must"
" find one, quickly."
msgstr "世界は崩壊し、本物の侍にふさわしい刀も手元にありません。早急に見つけ出しましょう。"

#. ~ Mission name
#: data/json/starting_missions.json
msgid "Find a new rifle"
msgstr "新しいライフルを探す"

#. ~ Description of mission "Find a new rifle"
#: data/json/starting_missions.json
msgid ""
"When you were escaping an evacuation point that was overrun, you had to "
"leave your rifle behind.  Shame on you, what's a hunter without their "
"hunting rifle?  You have to find one immediately."
msgstr ""
"避難所が襲われ、ライフルを置いたまま逃げ出してしまいました。まったく残念です。狩猟用ライフルを持たない狩人なんてものがいるのでしょうか？すぐに代わりを探し出すべきです。"

#. ~ Mission name
#: data/json/starting_missions.json
msgid "Protect your canine friends"
msgstr "愛犬を守る"

#. ~ Description of mission "Protect your canine friends"
#: data/json/starting_missions.json
msgid ""
"You have saved your dogs from the fall of the world, but they could still "
"suffer from danger everywhere.  Police dogs used some Kevlar harnesses for "
"protection…  Maybe your friends could use some too?"
msgstr ""
"愛犬が世界の崩壊に巻き込まれることは防ぎましたが、今後も危険な目に遭うことが予想されます。警察犬も装着しているケブラーハーネスがあれば、愛犬たちを守れるでしょうか？"

#. ~ Mission name
#: data/json/starting_missions.json
msgid "Hunt big game"
msgstr "大物狩り"

#. ~ Description of mission "Hunt big game"
#: data/json/starting_missions.json
msgid ""
"The end of the world could have arrived, but you still crave for that one "
"big hunt.  Search and kill a black bear to remember the old days."
msgstr "世界が終わりを迎えたとしても、一獲千金を望む気持ちは変わりません。かつての栄光を再現するためにも、クマを探し出して仕留めましょう。"

#. ~ Mission name
#: data/json/starting_missions.json
msgid "Become the protagonist"
msgstr "主人公になる"

#. ~ Description of mission "Become the protagonist"
#: data/json/starting_missions.json
msgid ""
"The world has become like an anime!  Zombies, mutants, the end of "
"civilization as we know it…  You must become the protagonist if you want to "
"survive, the plot armor will help you.  Go and kill 50 zombies to show your "
"protagonist potential."
msgstr ""
"この世界はまるでアニメです！ゾンビ、ミュータント、文明の終焉...生き残るためには主人公になって、ご都合主義に助けてもらうしかありません。秘められた真の力を解放するために、ゾンビを50体倒しましょう。"

#. ~ Mission name
#: data/json/starting_missions.json
msgid "Make the cops pay"
msgstr "警察に復讐する"

#. ~ Description of mission "Make the cops pay"
#: data/json/starting_missions.json
msgid ""
"They wanted to put you behind bars, but are now dead, make them pay with "
"blood, unliving blood."
msgstr "厄介な警官も皆、死んでしまいました。しかし、たとえ死人であろうと、血であがなわせる必要があります。"

#. ~ Mission name
#: data/json/starting_missions.json
msgid "Continue with your evolution"
msgstr "進化を続ける"

#. ~ Description of mission "Continue with your evolution"
#: data/json/starting_missions.json
msgid ""
"Your evolution to a more perfect form was interrupted by the Cataclysm.  "
"Restart your transformation process whatever it costs."
msgstr "完璧を目指す進化の歩みは、大変動によって中断されてしまいました。どんな犠牲を支払ってでも、再び歩み始めなければなりません。"

#. ~ Mission name
#: data/json/starting_missions.json
msgid "Recover a part of yourself"
msgstr "自己を取り戻す"

#. ~ Description of mission "Recover a part of yourself"
#: data/json/starting_missions.json
msgid ""
"They took away something from you, something important.  You feel a "
"connection with this weather, maybe you can recover some portion of what you"
" lost in one of these storms."
msgstr ""
"何か、大事なものが奪われてしまったという感覚が消えません。この妙な天候が関係しているのでしょうか。嵐の中から、失ったものの一部を取り戻しましょう。"

#. ~ Mission name
#: data/json/starting_missions.json
msgid "Social butterfly"
msgstr "社交家"

#. ~ Description of mission "Social butterfly"
#: data/json/starting_missions.json
msgid ""
"You have always had good social abilities.  Go and recruit 2 followers and "
"establish your leadership among them.  Don't forget to order them to build a"
" base of operations for you in the form of a survivor camp."
msgstr "以前から社交的な人間でした。仲間を2人集めてリーダーシップを発揮し、生存者の拠点を作り上げましょう。"

#. ~ Mission name
#: data/json/starting_missions.json
msgid "Kill your rivals"
msgstr "好敵手たちを殺す"

#. ~ Description of mission "Kill your rivals"
#: data/json/starting_missions.json
msgid ""
"As a real ninja, you can't allow competitors for the night.  Kill 10 shady "
"zombies and demonstrate who is the real ninja here."
msgstr "真の忍者として、同業者は一日たりとも生かしておけません。冥暗ゾンビを10体倒し、誰が真の忍者なのかを証明しましょう。"

#. ~ Mission name
#: data/json/starting_missions.json
msgid "Find some cosplay suits"
msgstr "コスプレ衣装を探す"

#. ~ Description of mission "Find some cosplay suits"
#: data/json/starting_missions.json
msgid ""
"The world could have ended, but there are still some fantastic costumes out "
"there, just waiting for you to wear them.  Search them until you find them."
msgstr "世界は崩壊しても、晴れの舞台を待ちわびる素敵な衣装たちは残っています。探し出し、手に入れましょう。"

#. ~ Mission name
#: data/json/starting_missions.json
msgid "Find some skates"
msgstr "スケートシューズを探す"

#. ~ Description of mission "Find some skates"
#: data/json/starting_missions.json
msgid ""
"You are a skater at heart, and as such you need some skates to drive by, any"
" kind will suffice."
msgstr "かっ飛ばせるシューズが無ければスケーターとは言えません。どんな種類でもいいので、手に入れましょう。"

#. ~ Mission name
#: data/json/starting_missions.json
msgid "Dress with style"
msgstr "スタイリッシュに着こなす"

#. ~ Description of mission "Dress with style"
#: data/json/starting_missions.json
msgid ""
"You need to always dress in style and fashion.  Find a gown or tuxedo for "
"your personal use."
msgstr "モデルたるもの、常にスタイリッシュでファッショナブルでなければいけません。好みのガウンかタキシードを探しましょう。"

#. ~ Mission name
#: data/json/starting_missions.json
msgid "Find a tabletop game"
msgstr "卓上ゲームを楽しむ"

#. ~ Description of mission "Find a tabletop game"
#: data/json/starting_missions.json
msgid ""
"As a Game Master, it's just unacceptable that you now lack your means to "
"play.  Find any tabletop game to play with any survivors you could find, "
"even a cards game will suffice."
msgstr ""
"卓上ゲームをプレイできない今の状況は、ゲームマスターとして看過できません。どんな卓上ゲームでもいいので、仲間と共にプレイしましょう。トランプカードでも十分です。"

#. ~ Mission name
#: data/json/starting_missions.json
msgid "Ready or Not"
msgstr "レディ・オア・ノット"

#. ~ Description of mission "Ready or Not"
#: data/json/starting_missions.json
msgid "Survive all day from the crazy inhabitants of the mansion."
msgstr "大邸宅に住む狂人に殺されることなく一日を生き延びましょう。"

#. ~ Mission name
#: data/json/starting_missions.json
msgid "Find Antibiotics Before You Die!"
msgstr "死ぬ前に抗生物質を見つける！"

#. ~ Mission name
#: data/json/starting_missions.json
msgid "Refuel your helicopter."
msgstr "ヘリコプターに燃料を補給する"

#. ~ Description of mission "Refuel your helicopter."
#: data/json/starting_missions.json
msgid ""
"You were flying towards a nearby private airport before your forced landing."
"  You could still reach it by ground, and scavenge it for fuel."
msgstr "付近の私設空港に向かって飛行中に不時着してしまいました。未だ地面から離れられないヘリコプターを何とかするために、燃料を集めましょう。"

#. ~ Mission name
#: data/json/starting_missions.json
msgid "Return to base"
msgstr "基地に帰還する"

#. ~ Description of mission "Return to base"
#: data/json/starting_missions.json
msgid ""
"Your helicopter was crashed to the ground, communications were lost with "
"ground base, and the rest of your team died while landing, at least you "
"still know the way back to the base."
msgstr "ヘリコプターは墜落し、基地との通信は途絶え、生き残っていた隊員も全滅しました。しかし、少なくとも基地へ戻る経路は分かっている筈です。"

#. ~ Mission name
#: data/json/starting_missions.json
msgid "Go to the refueling stop"
msgstr "給油拠点に向かう"

#. ~ Description of mission "Go to the refueling stop"
#: data/json/starting_missions.json
msgid ""
"Your bird is now on the ground, never again able to fly, you could search "
"for a new one in the closest refueling stop requisitioned by the military."
msgstr "乗っていたヘリコプターが墜落し、二度と飛べなくなってしまいました。近くの給油拠点で新たなヘリを探しましょう。"

#. ~ Mission name
#: data/json/starting_missions.json
msgid "Deliver Your Cargo"
msgstr "商品を配達する"

#. ~ Description of mission "Deliver Your Cargo"
#: data/json/starting_missions.json
msgid ""
"You're not sure who orders takeout when the world's ending, but that doesn't"
" matter.  Evacuation doesn't matter.  Nothing, indeed, matters, save for "
"safely delivering your precious cargo to its destination: a remote mansion."
msgstr ""
"崩壊した世界でもテイクアウトの注文が入るかもしれませんが、そんな業務は二の次です。自分の避難などまったく考えていません。大切な商品を配達先である人里離れた大邸宅に安全に届けること、それ以外に重要な仕事などこの世にはありません。"

#. ~ Mission name
#: data/json/starting_missions.json
msgid "Kill your pursuer"
msgstr "追跡者を殺す"

#. ~ Description of mission "Kill your pursuer"
#: data/json/starting_missions.json
msgid ""
"Since the start of the Cataclysm, something has been hunting you "
"relentlessly.  You can outrun it but never truly escape it.  It won't end "
"until one of you dies."
msgstr ""
"大変動が始まって以来、何者かが執拗に追いかけてきます。逃げ切ったとしても、真に逃げ延びたとは言えません。この追跡は、どちらかが死ぬまで終わらないのです。"

#. ~ Mission name
#: data/json/starting_missions.json
msgid "Survive your pursuer"
msgstr "追跡者から生き延びる"

#. ~ Description of mission "Survive your pursuer"
#: data/json/starting_missions.json
msgid ""
"Since the start of the Cataclysm, something has been hunting you "
"relentlessly.  You can fight it but never truly kill it.  It won't end until"
" you die."
msgstr ""
"大変動が始まって以来、何者かが執拗に追いかけてきます。戦うことも可能ですが、とどめを刺すことはできません。死以外に、この追跡を終わらせる方法はありません。"

