#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/artifact/artifact_item_types.json
msgid "royal robe"
msgid_plural "royal robes"
msgstr[0] "王家のローブ"

#. ~ Description of "royal robe"
#: data/json/artifact/artifact_item_types.json
msgid ""
"An ornately decorated robe with an unfamiliar royal symbol on it.  The humanoid figure on the seal has two pairs of eyes.  It is the only one of its kind.\n"
"It may have unknown powers; try activating them."
msgstr ""
"見慣れない王家の紋章が描かれた、装飾付きのローブです。紋章に描かれた人間には目が4つあります。唯一無二の存在です。\n"
"未知の力を秘めており、使用すると効果を発揮します。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/artifact/artifact_item_types.json
msgid "ancient burial shroud"
msgid_plural "ancient burial shrouds"
msgstr[0] "古代の埋葬布"

#. ~ Description of "ancient burial shroud"
#: data/json/artifact/artifact_item_types.json
msgid ""
"A cloak of thin, faded cloth.  The faint silhouette of a long-dead humanoid is barely visible on it.  It is the only one of its kind.\n"
"It may have unknown powers; try activating them."
msgstr ""
"色褪せた薄い布です。表面に、はるか昔から包まれていた死体の痕跡が薄く残っています。唯一無二の存在です。\n"
"未知の力を秘めており、使用すると効果を発揮します。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/artifact/artifact_item_types.json
msgid "ornate fur coat"
msgid_plural "ornate fur coats"
msgstr[0] "華麗なファーコート"

#. ~ Description of "ornate fur coat"
#: data/json/artifact/artifact_item_types.json
msgid ""
"A heavy, finely crafted coat made of the fur of an unidentifiable creature.  It is the only one of its kind.\n"
"It may have unknown powers; try activating them."
msgstr ""
"正体不明の生物の毛皮でできた、緻密な装飾で飾られた重厚なコートです。唯一無二の存在です。\n"
"未知の力を秘めており、使用すると効果を発揮します。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/artifact/artifact_item_types.json
msgid "ancient stone mask"
msgid_plural "ancient stone masks"
msgstr[0] "古代の石仮面"

#. ~ Description of "ancient stone mask"
#: data/json/artifact/artifact_item_types.json
msgid ""
"A sinister mask made of a smooth green stone.  It is the only one of its kind.\n"
"It may have unknown powers; try activating them."
msgstr ""
"滑らかな緑色の石で作られた、不吉な仮面です。唯一無二の存在です。\n"
"未知の力を秘めており、使用すると効果を発揮します。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/artifact/artifact_item_types.json
msgid "ancient bronze helmet"
msgid_plural "ancient bronze helmets"
msgstr[0] "古代の青銅兜"

#. ~ Description of "ancient bronze helmet"
#: data/json/artifact/artifact_item_types.json
msgid ""
"A helmet with an imposing face plate.  Though the corrosion has completely defaced the symbols written on the sides, it seems sturdy.  It is the only one of its kind.\n"
"It may have unknown powers; try activating them."
msgstr ""
"立派なフェイスプレートが付いた兜です。側面に何かの記号が彫られていたようですが、腐食によって消えてしまっています。唯一無二の存在です。\n"
"未知の力を秘めており、使用すると効果を発揮します。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/artifact/artifact_item_types.json
msgid "pair of ornate leather gloves"
msgid_plural "pairs of ornate leather gloves"
msgstr[0] "華麗なレザーグローブ"

#. ~ Description of "pair of ornate leather gloves"
#: data/json/artifact/artifact_item_types.json
msgid ""
"A set of worn leather gloves embossed with gold.  The unidentifiable leather it is made from is oddly soft.  It is the only one of its kind.\n"
"It may have unknown powers; try activating them."
msgstr ""
"金色のエンボス加工が施された、使い込まれたレザーグローブです。素材に使われている革は、何の動物のものかは不明ですが、非常に柔軟性があります。唯一無二の存在です。\n"
"未知の力を秘めており、使用すると効果を発揮します。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/artifact/artifact_item_types.json
msgid "pair of ancient leather boots"
msgid_plural "pairs of ancient leather boots"
msgstr[0] "古代のレザーブーツ"

#. ~ Description of "pair of ancient leather boots"
#: data/json/artifact/artifact_item_types.json
msgid ""
"A pair of ancient leather boots.  Though the flaps of leather are crudely sewn together, the red hue it is dyed with is striking.  It is the only one of its kind.\n"
"It may have unknown powers; try activating them."
msgstr ""
"古びたレザーブーツです。履き口部分の縫い方は粗いですが、染め抜かれた赤い色合いが印象的です。唯一無二の存在です。\n"
"未知の力を秘めており、使用すると効果を発揮します。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/artifact/artifact_item_types.json
msgid "amber ring"
msgid_plural "amber rings"
msgstr[0] "琥珀の指輪"

#. ~ Description of "amber ring"
#: data/json/artifact/artifact_item_types.json
msgid ""
"A band of gold with a smooth piece of amber set into it.  A strange worm is encased in the amber, making a perfect spiral with its sealed body.  It is the only one of its kind.\n"
"It may have unknown powers; try activating them."
msgstr ""
"金の指輪に、小さく滑らかな琥珀が嵌め込まれています。琥珀の中には螺旋形で固定されている奇妙なワームが入っています。唯一無二の存在です。\n"
"未知の力を秘めており、使用すると効果を発揮します。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/artifact/artifact_item_types.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/weapon_copy_extensions.json
msgid "ancient staff"
msgid_plural "ancient staffs"
msgstr[0] "古代の杖"

#. ~ Description of "ancient staff"
#: data/json/artifact/artifact_item_types.json
msgid ""
"A well-balanced stick of treated wood with metal caps.  A red stone is embedded in the handle.  It is the only one of its kind.\n"
"It may have unknown powers; try activating them."
msgstr ""
"磨かれた木の棒の先端に金属製のキャップが付いた、バランスのいい杖です。持ち手の部分に赤い意志が埋め込まれています。唯一無二の存在です。\n"
"未知の力を秘めており、使用すると効果を発揮します。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/artifact/artifact_item_types.json
msgid "ancient sword"
msgid_plural "ancient swords"
msgstr[0] "古代の剣"

#. ~ Description of "ancient sword"
#: data/json/artifact/artifact_item_types.json
msgid ""
"A sword made out of a striking black metal.  It is the only one of its kind.\n"
"It may have unknown powers; try activating them."
msgstr ""
"印象的な黒い金属で作られた剣です。唯一無二の存在です。\n"
"未知の力を秘めており、使用すると効果を発揮します。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/artifact/artifact_item_types.json
msgid "ancient harp"
msgid_plural "ancient harps"
msgstr[0] "古代の竪琴"

#. ~ Description of "ancient harp"
#: data/json/artifact/artifact_item_types.json
msgid ""
"A harp made of black wood.  Faint hypnotic notes ring in the air each time you touch it.  It is the only one of its kind.\n"
"It may have unknown powers; try activating them."
msgstr ""
"黒い木材で作られた剣です。触れると、眠気を誘う小さな音が鳴ります。唯一無二の存在です。\n"
"未知の力を秘めており、使用すると効果を発揮します。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/artifact/artifact_item_types.json
msgid "ancient athame"
msgid_plural "ancient athames"
msgstr[0] "古代のアサメ"

#. ~ Description of "ancient athame"
#: data/json/artifact/artifact_item_types.json
msgid ""
"A ritual knife used by some ancient civilization.  Unreadable runes are carved into the handle.  It is the only one of its kind.\n"
"It may have unknown powers; try activating them."
msgstr ""
"古代文明で使われていた儀式用の短剣です。柄の部分には何かの記号が刻まれています。唯一無二の存在です。\n"
"未知の力を秘めており、使用すると効果を発揮します。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/artifact/artifact_item_types.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/weapon_copy_extensions.json
msgid "ancient spear"
msgid_plural "ancient spears"
msgstr[0] "古代の槍"

#. ~ Description of "ancient spear"
#: data/json/artifact/artifact_item_types.json
msgid ""
"A sturdy wooden pole with a sharp metal spike on the end.  The handle has the symbol of a blue sun on it.  It is the only one of its kind.\n"
"It may have unknown powers; try activating them."
msgstr ""
"丈夫な木製のポールの先端に、金属製の鋭いスパイクが付いています。柄の部分には青い太陽のマークが描かれています。唯一無二の存在です。\n"
"未知の力を秘めており、使用すると効果を発揮します。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/artifact/artifact_item_types.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/weapon_copy_extensions.json
msgid "ancient club"
msgid_plural "ancient clubs"
msgstr[0] "古代の棍棒"

#. ~ Description of "ancient club"
#: data/json/artifact/artifact_item_types.json
msgid ""
"A misshapen rod of gnarled, knotted wood.  The knots in the wood exhibit a strange fractal pattern.  It is the only one of its kind.\n"
"It may have unknown powers; try activating them."
msgstr ""
"凸凹とした節がある、不格好な棒状の木材です。節は奇妙なフラクタル模様を形作っています。唯一無二の存在です。\n"
"未知の力を秘めており、使用すると効果を発揮します。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/artifact/artifact_item_types.json
msgid "set of oddly interlocked rings"
msgid_plural "sets of oddly interlocked rings"
msgstr[0] "絡み合った奇妙な輪"

#. ~ Description of "set of oddly interlocked rings"
#: data/json/artifact/artifact_item_types.json
msgid ""
"A set of three rings linked together.  There's something about the way the rings connect to each other that gives you a headache.  It is the only one of its kind.\n"
"It may have unknown powers; try activating them."
msgstr ""
"連なった3つの輪です。それぞれの連結部分をじっくり見ていると脳が混乱してきます。唯一無二の存在です。\n"
"未知の力を秘めており、使用すると効果を発揮します。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/artifact/artifact_item_types.json
msgid "strange triangle"
msgid_plural "strange triangles"
msgstr[0] "不思議な三角形"

#. ~ Description of "strange triangle"
#: data/json/artifact/artifact_item_types.json
msgid ""
"A large triangle made out of three thick rectangles that connect to each other in an angle.  No matter how much you turn it around, you can't seem to comprehend how it links together.  It is the only one of its kind.\n"
"It may have unknown powers; try activating them."
msgstr ""
"3本の太い直方体が角度をつけて繋がり、大きな三角形を形作っています。どの方向から見ても、直方体がどのように繋がっているのか理解できません。唯一無二の存在です。\n"
"未知の力を秘めており、使用すると効果を発揮します。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/artifact/artifact_item_types.json
msgid "impossible trident"
msgid_plural "impossible tridents"
msgstr[0] "不可能な三叉槍"

#. ~ Description of "impossible trident"
#: data/json/artifact/artifact_item_types.json
msgid ""
"A large trident made entirely out of an indiscernible material.  The prong in the middle seems to fade away into nothingness when looked at from the top, but you can clearly see the shaft connecting the tip of the weapon from the bottom.  It's giving you a headache.  It is the only one of its kind.\n"
"It may have unknown powers; try activating them."
msgstr ""
"全体が正体不明の素材で作られた大きな三叉槍です。根元から見ると柄から真っすぐ伸びる中央の槍が見えますが、頂点の方向から見ると二叉槍にしか見えず、頭が混乱してきます。唯一無二の存在です。\n"
"未知の力を秘めており、使用すると効果を発揮します。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/artifact/artifact_item_types.json
msgid "self-crossing flask"
msgid_plural "self-crossing flasks"
msgstr[0] "自己交差フラスコ"

#. ~ Description of "self-crossing flask"
#: data/json/artifact/artifact_item_types.json
msgid ""
"A transparent flask with a neck that connects directly to its bottom without overlapping itself, even though it clearly does.  You can put things in it, but attempting to follow their path through the neck is impossible.  It is the only one of its kind.\n"
"It may have unknown powers; try activating them."
msgstr ""
"口と底が直接繋がっている透明なフラスコです。明らかに重なっているようですが、実際には干渉していません。中にものを入れることはできますが、入っていく経路を辿ることは不可能です。唯一無二の存在です。\n"
"未知の力を秘めており、使用すると効果を発揮します。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/artifact/artifact_item_types.json
msgid "four-dimensional cube"
msgid_plural "four-dimensional cubes"
msgstr[0] "四次元立方体"

#. ~ Description of "four-dimensional cube"
#: data/json/artifact/artifact_item_types.json
msgid ""
"It's a cube that constantly shrinks and grows in size.  It's two cubes linked by the vertices, with ever-shifting sides folding onto each other, over and over.  It's four cubes in the exact same position.  It's a cube fading to ash then reverting to pristine form repeatedly.  It's all of these at once, and none of them at all.  It is the only one of its kind.\n"
"It may have unknown powers; try activating them."
msgstr ""
"常にサイズが変わり続ける立方体。頂点同士が繋がって絶えず変形し、各面が互いに何重にも折り重なっている2つの立方体。まったく同じ位置にある4つの立方体。灰になって消え、再び元の形状に戻る立方体。これらの形が全て同時に存在しており、あるいは存在していません。唯一無二の存在です。\n"
"未知の力を秘めており、使用すると効果を発揮します。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/artifact/artifact_item_types.json
msgid "irrational cube"
msgid_plural "irrational cubes"
msgstr[0] "不合理な立方体"

#. ~ Description of "irrational cube"
#: data/json/artifact/artifact_item_types.json
msgid ""
"A large wire-frame cube.  The interior wires somehow appear to be over the exterior wires, no matter which angle you look at the cube from.  Trying to trace the lines with your finger is probably not a good idea.  It is the only one of its kind.\n"
"It may have unknown powers; try activating them."
msgstr ""
"ワイヤーフレームによって形作られた立方体です。どの角度から見ても、内側の辺が外側の辺より上にあるように見えますが、指で辺をなぞろうとするのは止めておいたほうがいいでしょう。唯一無二の存在です。\n"
"未知の力を秘めており、使用すると効果を発揮します。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/artifact/artifact_item_types.json
msgid "wobbly ring"
msgid_plural "wobbly rings"
msgstr[0] "うねる指輪"

#. ~ Description of "wobbly ring"
#: data/json/artifact/artifact_item_types.json
msgid ""
"A chunky ring that folds onto itself continuously, preventing its use as an esoteric piece of jewelry.  It is the only one of its kind.\n"
"It may have unknown powers; try activating them."
msgstr ""
"幾重にも折り重なった分厚い指輪です。あまりに複雑な形状のため、宝飾品としては使えません。唯一無二の存在です。\n"
"未知の力を秘めており、使用すると効果を発揮します。"

#. ~ Spell name
#: data/json/artifact/legacy_artifact_active.json
msgid "Artifact Adrenaline"
msgstr "アドレナリン増加(アーティファクト)"

#. ~ Description of spell "Artifact Adrenaline"
#: data/json/artifact/legacy_artifact_active.json
msgid "Causes a surge of adrenaline to flow throughout your body."
msgstr "アドレナリンが急増し全身に行き渡ります。"

#. ~ Message of spell "Artifact Adrenaline"
#: data/json/artifact/legacy_artifact_active.json
msgid "You're filled with a roaring energy!"
msgstr "猛々しいエネルギーが体に漲りました！"

#. ~ Spell name
#: data/json/artifact/legacy_artifact_active.json
msgid "Artifact Blood"
msgstr "血液噴出(アーティファクト)"

#. ~ Description of spell "Artifact Blood"
#: data/json/artifact/legacy_artifact_active.json
msgid "Causes blood to leak from nearby terrain."
msgstr "付近の地形から血液が漏れ出します。"

#. ~ Message of spell "Artifact Blood"
#: data/json/artifact/legacy_artifact_active.json
msgid "Blood soaks out of the ground and walls."
msgstr "血が地面や壁をべっとりと濡らしました。"

#. ~ Spell name
#: data/json/artifact/legacy_artifact_active.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/spells/XAEA.json
msgid "Artifact Heal"
msgstr "治癒(アーティファクト)"

#. ~ Description of spell "Artifact Heal"
#: data/json/artifact/legacy_artifact_active.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/spells/XAEA.json
msgid "Will heal injuries all over your body."
msgstr "全身の傷を治癒します。"

#. ~ Message of spell "Artifact Heal"
#: data/json/artifact/legacy_artifact_active.json
msgid "You feel healed."
msgstr "治療されたようです。"

#. ~ Spell name
#: data/json/artifact/legacy_artifact_active.json
msgid "Artifact Confused"
msgstr "混乱(アーティファクト)"

#. ~ Description of spell "Artifact Confused"
#: data/json/artifact/legacy_artifact_active.json
msgid "Causes nearby enemies to become confused."
msgstr "付近の敵を混乱させます。"

#. ~ Spell name
#: data/json/artifact/legacy_artifact_active.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/spells/XAEA.json
msgid "Artifact Pain"
msgstr "苦痛(アーティファクト)"

#. ~ Description of spell "Artifact Pain"
#: data/json/artifact/legacy_artifact_active.json
msgid "Owchie, that hurts."
msgstr "痛っ。"

#. ~ Message of spell "Artifact Pain"
#: data/json/artifact/legacy_artifact_active.json
msgid "You're wracked with pain!"
msgstr "苦痛に呻きました！"

#. ~ Spell name
#: data/json/artifact/legacy_artifact_active.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/spells/XAEA.json
msgid "Artifact Teleport"
msgstr "転移(アーティファクト)"

#. ~ Description of spell "Artifact Teleport"
#: data/json/artifact/legacy_artifact_active.json
msgid "Randomly teleports you a short distance."
msgstr "ランダムな近い位置にテレポートします。"

#. ~ Message of spell "Artifact Teleport"
#: data/json/artifact/legacy_artifact_active.json
msgid "You teleport!"
msgstr "テレポートしました！"

#. ~ Spell name
#: data/json/artifact/legacy_artifact_active.json
msgid "Artifact Attention"
msgstr "注目(アーティファクト)"

#. ~ Description of spell "Artifact Attention"
#: data/json/artifact/legacy_artifact_active.json
msgid ""
"You're not quite sure what you did, but something is watching you for it."
msgstr "何が悪かったのかよく分かりませんが、何者かに見られています。"

#. ~ Message of spell "Artifact Attention"
#: data/json/artifact/legacy_artifact_active.json
msgid "You feel like your action has attracted attention."
msgstr "自分の行動が周囲の注目を集めているように感じます。"

#. ~ Spell name
#: data/json/artifact/legacy_artifact_active.json
msgid "Artifact Teleglow"
msgstr "テレポート病(アーティファクト)"

#. ~ Description of spell "Artifact Teleglow"
#: data/json/artifact/legacy_artifact_active.json
msgid "DO YOU HEAR THE VOICES TOO?"
msgstr "あなたにもこの声が聞こえるでしょう？"

#. ~ Message of spell "Artifact Teleglow"
#: data/json/artifact/legacy_artifact_active.json
msgid "You feel unhinged."
msgstr "錯乱しました。"

#. ~ Spell name
#: data/json/artifact/legacy_artifact_active.json
msgid "Artifact Vomit"
msgstr "嘔吐(アーティファクト)"

#. ~ Description of spell "Artifact Vomit"
#: data/json/artifact/legacy_artifact_active.json
msgid "Causes the caster to vomit."
msgstr "詠唱者を嘔吐させます。"

#. ~ Message of spell "Artifact Vomit"
#: data/json/artifact/legacy_artifact_active.json
msgid "A wave of nausea passes through you!"
msgstr "吐き気の波が全身を突き抜けました！"

#. ~ Spell name
#: data/json/artifact/legacy_artifact_active.json
msgid "Artifact Shadows"
msgstr "シャドウ召喚(アーティファクト)"

#. ~ Description of spell "Artifact Shadows"
#: data/json/artifact/legacy_artifact_active.json
msgid "Summons shadows."
msgstr "複数のシャドウを召喚します。"

#. ~ Message of spell "Artifact Shadows"
#: data/json/artifact/legacy_artifact_active.json
msgid "Shadows form around you."
msgstr "周囲にシャドウが出現しました。"

#. ~ Spell name
#: data/json/artifact/legacy_artifact_active.json
msgid "Artifact Stamina Empty"
msgstr "スタミナ減少(アーティファクト)"

#. ~ Description of spell "Artifact Stamina Empty"
#: data/json/artifact/legacy_artifact_active.json
msgid "Does a variable amount of stamina damage."
msgstr "スタミナがランダムに減少します。"

#. ~ Message of spell "Artifact Stamina Empty"
#: data/json/artifact/legacy_artifact_active.json
msgid "Your body feels like jelly."
msgstr "身体がゼリー状になっている気がします。"

#. ~ Spell name
#: data/json/artifact/legacy_artifact_active.json
msgid "Artifact Radiation"
msgstr "放射能汚染(アーティファクト)"

#. ~ Description of spell "Artifact Radiation"
#: data/json/artifact/legacy_artifact_active.json
msgid "Causes radiation."
msgstr "放射能汚染を引き起こします。"

#. ~ Message of spell "Artifact Radiation"
#: data/json/artifact/legacy_artifact_active.json
msgid "Horrible gases are emitted!"
msgstr "恐ろしいガスが放出されました！"

#. ~ Description of spell "Artifact Hurtall"
#: data/json/artifact/legacy_artifact_active.json
msgid "Hurts all monsters within your view distance."
msgstr "視界内の全モンスターにダメージを与えます。"

#. ~ Spell name
#: data/json/artifact/legacy_artifact_active.json
msgid "Artifact Acidball"
msgstr "酸噴出(アーティファクト)"

#. ~ Description of spell "Artifact Acidball"
#: data/json/artifact/legacy_artifact_active.json
msgid "Fires an acidball."
msgstr "周囲に酸を噴出します。"

#. ~ Description of spell "Pet"
#: data/json/artifact/legacy_artifact_active.json
msgid "Makes the target a pet."
msgstr "標的をペット化します。"

#. ~ Spell name
#: data/json/artifact/legacy_artifact_active.json
msgid "Artifact Flies Buzz"
msgstr "羽音(アーティファクト)"

#. ~ Description of spell "Artifact Flies Buzz"
#. ~ Message of spell "Artifact Flies Buzz"
#: data/json/artifact/legacy_artifact_active.json
msgid "Flies buzz around you."
msgstr "ハエが周囲で騒音を発しています。"

#. ~ Spell name
#: data/json/artifact/legacy_artifact_active.json
msgid "Artifact Summon Flies"
msgstr "ハエ召喚(アーティファクト)"

#. ~ Description of spell "Artifact Summon Flies"
#: data/json/artifact/legacy_artifact_active.json
msgid "Summons some flies."
msgstr "複数のハエを召喚します。"

#. ~ Message of spell "Artifact Summon Flies"
#: data/json/artifact/legacy_artifact_active.json
msgid "Giant flies appear!"
msgstr "巨大ハエが現れました！"

#. ~ Spell name
#: data/json/artifact/legacy_artifact_active.json
msgid "Artifact Summon Bees"
msgstr "ハチ召喚(アーティファクト)"

#. ~ Description of spell "Artifact Summon Bees"
#. ~ Message of spell "Artifact Summon Bees"
#: data/json/artifact/legacy_artifact_active.json
msgid "Giant bees appear!"
msgstr "巨大ハチが現れました！"

#. ~ Spell name
#: data/json/artifact/legacy_artifact_active.json
msgid "Artifact Summon Wasps"
msgstr "スズメバチ召喚(アーティファクト)"

#. ~ Description of spell "Artifact Summon Wasps"
#: data/json/artifact/legacy_artifact_active.json
msgid "Summons some wasps."
msgstr "複数のスズメバチを召喚します。"

#. ~ Message of spell "Artifact Summon Wasps"
#: data/json/artifact/legacy_artifact_active.json
msgid "Giant wasps appear!"
msgstr "巨大スズメバチが現れました！"

#. ~ Spell name
#: data/json/artifact/legacy_artifact_active.json
msgid "Artifact Bugs"
msgstr "虫召喚(アーティファクト)"

#. ~ Description of spell "Artifact Bugs"
#: data/json/artifact/legacy_artifact_active.json
msgid "Summons some bugs."
msgstr "複数の虫を召喚します。"

#. ~ Spell name
#: data/json/artifact/legacy_artifact_active.json
msgid "Artifact Noise"
msgstr "騒音(アーティファクト)"

#. ~ Description of spell "Artifact Noise"
#: data/json/artifact/legacy_artifact_active.json
msgid "Makes a noise at your location."
msgstr "騒音を発生させます。"

#. ~ Sound description of spell "Artifact Noise"
#: data/json/artifact/legacy_artifact_active.json
msgid "a deafening boom"
msgstr "[耳障りな騒音]"

#. ~ Message of spell "Artifact Noise"
#: data/json/artifact/legacy_artifact_active.json
msgid "You hear a deafening boom from your location!"
msgstr "耳障りな騒音が聞こえます！"

#. ~ Spell name
#: data/json/artifact/legacy_artifact_active.json
msgid "Artifact Light"
msgstr "光源(アーティファクト)"

#. ~ Description of spell "Artifact Light"
#: data/json/artifact/legacy_artifact_active.json
msgid "Makes some light."
msgstr "光源を生成します。"

#. ~ Message of spell "Artifact Light"
#: data/json/artifact/legacy_artifact_active.json
msgid "You glow brightly!"
msgstr "身体が光り輝きました！"

#. ~ Spell name
#: data/json/artifact/legacy_artifact_active.json
msgid "Artifact Dim"
msgstr "宵闇(アーティファクト)"

#. ~ Description of spell "Artifact Dim"
#: data/json/artifact/legacy_artifact_active.json
msgid "Darkens the sky."
msgstr "空が暗くなります。"

#. ~ Message of spell "Artifact Dim"
#: data/json/artifact/legacy_artifact_active.json
msgid "The sky starts to dim."
msgstr "空が暗くなり始めました。"

#. ~ Spell name
#: data/json/artifact/legacy_artifact_active.json
msgid "Artifact Dimensional Fatigue"
msgstr "時空の歪み(アーティファクト)"

#. ~ Description of spell "Artifact Dimensional Fatigue"
#: data/json/artifact/legacy_artifact_active.json
msgid "Creates some dimensional fatigue at a random point within range."
msgstr "範囲内のランダムな地点に時空の歪みを生成します。"

#. ~ Spell name
#: data/json/artifact/legacy_artifact_active.json
msgid "Artifact Fireball"
msgstr "ファイアボール(アーティファクト)"

#. ~ Description of spell "Artifact Fireball"
#: data/json/artifact/legacy_artifact_active.json
msgid "Causes an explosion at the target."
msgstr "標的のいる地点に爆発を発生させます。"

#. ~ Spell name
#: data/json/artifact/legacy_artifact_active.json
msgid "Artifact Flash"
msgstr "閃光(アーティファクト)"

#. ~ Description of spell "Artifact Flash"
#: data/json/artifact/legacy_artifact_active.json
msgid "Causes a flashbang at the target."
msgstr "標的のいる地点に閃光を発生させます。"

#. ~ Spell name
#: data/json/artifact/legacy_artifact_active.json
msgid "Artifact Paralyze"
msgstr "麻痺(アーティファクト)"

#. ~ Description of spell "Artifact Paralyze"
#: data/json/artifact/legacy_artifact_active.json
msgid "Paralyzes you for a second or two."
