#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/artifact/premade_artifacts.json
msgid "The Architect's Cube"
msgid_plural "The Architect's Cubes"
msgstr[0] "創造者の立方体"

#. ~ Description of "The Architect's Cube"
#: data/json/artifact/premade_artifacts.json
msgid ""
"This is a solid cube that is much heavier than its size suggests.  When you "
"look at it, it pulls your gaze inward until you fall through the sky, "
"showing you a top-down view of your position with the surroundings revealed."
msgstr ""
"そのサイズからは想像できないほど重い立方体です。見つめると視線が立方体の内側へ吸い寄せられ、所持している限り常に自分の現在地と周囲を俯瞰的に知覚できます。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/artifact/premade_artifacts.json
msgid "stone of stabbing"
msgid_plural "stones of stabbing"
msgstr[0] "刺突石"

#. ~ Description of "stone of stabbing"
#: data/json/artifact/premade_artifacts.json
msgid "A debug item to make sure that skills can be modified by enchantments."
msgstr "使用スキルに変更を加えられることを確認するためのデバッグアイテムです。"

#. ~ Prerequisite of terrain constrution
#: data/json/construction/doors.json
#: data/json/construction/furniture_barriers.json
#: data/json/construction/furniture_fireplaces.json
#: data/json/construction/furniture_recreation.json
#: data/json/construction/furniture_sleep.json
#: data/json/construction/furniture_surfaces.json
#: data/json/construction/furniture_tools.json
#: data/json/construction/manufactured.json
#: data/mods/innawood/mining/construction.json
msgid "Can be deconstructed without tools."
msgstr "工具なしで分解できます。"

#. ~ Prerequisite of terrain constrution
#: data/json/construction/doors.json
#: data/json/construction/floors_indoors.json
#: data/json/construction/floors_outdoors.json
#: data/json/construction/furniture_tools.json
#: data/json/construction/walls.json
msgid "Must be supported on at least two sides."
msgstr "最低でも2面の支えられる地形と接している必要があります。"

#. ~ Prerequisite of terrain constrution
#: data/json/construction/doors.json
msgid ""
"Must be between ordinary, concrete, brick, or rock walls to function, and at"
" least one wall must have an adjacent mechanical winch."
msgstr ""
"門を開閉するには、壁(ｺﾝｸﾘｰﾄ)か壁(レンガ)か壁(石)と隣接して設置し、なおかつ少なくとも1か所の壁と手巻きウインチが隣接している必要があります。"

#. ~ Prerequisite of terrain constrution
#: data/json/construction/fences_gates.json
msgid "Needs to be supported on both sides by fencing, walls, etc."
msgstr "フェンスや壁などで両側が支えられている必要があります。"

#. ~ Prerequisite of terrain constrution
#: data/json/construction/fences_gates.json
msgid ""
"Must be between palisade walls to function, and at least one wall must have "
"an adjacent rope & pulley system."
msgstr "門(矢来)が機能するには、壁(矢来)に挟まれた位置にあり、少なくとも１か所の壁(矢来)と滑車装置が隣接している必要があります。"

#. ~ Prerequisite of terrain constrution
#: data/json/construction/floors_indoors.json
msgid ""
"Your power tool is effective at cutting through the resin cage, but it's "
"still a hard process.  Mi-go structures are dangerously hot -- you'll likely"
" need to take breaks outside."
msgstr ""
"電動工具は樹脂の檻を切断するのに効果的ですが、それでも作業は困難です。ミ＝ゴの構造物は極端な高温環境であり、作業の合間に外で休憩する必要がありそうです。"

#. ~ Prerequisite of terrain constrution
#: data/json/construction/floors_indoors.json
msgid ""
"This is a slow, hard process that could be accelerated with power tools.  "
"Mi-go structures are dangerously hot -- you'll likely need to take breaks "
"outside."
msgstr ""
"時間が掛かる困難な作業ですが、電動工具があれば早く完了します。ミ＝ゴの構造物は極端な高温環境であり、作業の合間に外で休憩する必要がありそうです。"

#. ~ Prerequisite of terrain constrution
#: data/json/construction/furniture_domestic_plants.json
msgid ""
"Mark a spot to stack cut grain for drying outdoors.  Once placed, put "
"unrotten undried grain stalks on the stooking spot and examine it to get "
"started."
msgstr "収穫した穀物を束ねて乾燥させる屋外の地点に印を付けます。腐敗していない未乾燥の穀物の穂が置かれ、調べることで乾燥を開始します。"

#. ~ Prerequisite of terrain constrution
#: data/json/construction/furniture_recreation.json
#: data/json/construction/furniture_tools.json
msgid "Must be built indoors."
msgstr "屋内に建設する必要があります。"

#. ~ Prerequisite of terrain constrution
#: data/json/construction/furniture_sleep.json
msgid ""
"Can be deconstructed without tools.  Must be supported on at least two "
"sides."
msgstr "工具なしで分解できます。最低でも2面の支えられる地形と接している必要があります。"

#. ~ Prerequisite of terrain constrution
#: data/json/construction/furniture_tools.json
msgid "Built in a tree."
msgstr "樹木がある位置に建設する必要があります。"

#. ~ Prerequisite of terrain constrution
#: data/json/construction/manufactured.json
msgid "Carve a thick wooden door for the brick oven."
msgstr "石窯に取り付ける厚い木製の扉を作ります。"

#. ~ Prerequisite of terrain constrution
#: data/json/construction/manufactured.json
msgid "Weld together a metal door for the brick oven."
msgstr "石窯に金属製の扉を溶接します。"

#. ~ Prerequisite of terrain constrution
#: data/json/construction/manufactured.json
msgid "You need a deep pit to construct a root cellar."
msgstr "貯蔵穴の設置には深い穴が必要です。"

#. ~ Prerequisite of terrain constrution
#: data/json/construction/mechanisms.json
msgid ""
"Must be adjacent to ordinary, concrete, brick, or rock wall that is itself "
"adjacent to a metal gate in order to open said gate."
msgstr "門(金属)を開閉するには、壁(ｺﾝｸﾘｰﾄ)か壁(レンガ)か壁(石)と隣接して設置する必要があります。"

#. ~ Prerequisite of terrain constrution
#: data/json/construction/mechanisms.json
msgid ""
"Can be deconstructed without tools.  Must be adjacent to a palisade wall "
"that is itself adjacent to a palisade gate in order to open said gate."
msgstr "工具なしで分解できます。滑車装置で門(矢来)を開くには、門(矢来)と壁(矢来)、滑車装置と壁(矢来)がそれぞれ隣接している必要があります。"

#. ~ Prerequisite of terrain constrution
#: data/json/construction/misc.json
msgid "Certain terrain and furniture can be deconstructed without any tools."
msgstr "特定の地形や設置物は工具なしで分解できます。"

#. ~ Prerequisite of terrain constrution
#: data/json/construction/misc.json
msgid ""
"Mark a spot for crafting.  Crafting tasks next to this tile will "
"automatically use this location instead of attempting to craft in your "
"hands, with the usual crafting speed penalty for working on the ground.  "
"Does not prevent using a proper workbench, if available.  Deconstruct or "
"smash to remove."
msgstr ""
"製作を実行する地点に印を付けます。この印に隣接した地点で製作を実行する場合、装備を外して手を空ける必要がありません。指定した地点が地面であれば通常通り製作時間にペナルティが課されますが、適切な作業台が設置されている場合はその効果が自動的に適用されます。分解するか叩くことで取り除きます。"

#. ~ Prerequisite of terrain constrution
#: data/json/construction/misc.json
msgid ""
"Firewood or other flammable materials on a nearby tile marked in this way "
"may be used to automatically refuel fires.  This will be done to maintain "
"light during long-running tasks that require it such as crafting or reading,"
" but not (for example) if you are simply waiting nearby."
msgstr ""
"印を付けたタイルに置かれている焚木やその他の可燃物は、火の中へ自動的に補給されます。製作や読書などの長時間の作業時には、火を絶やさないよう自動補給機能が働きますが、火の傍でただ立っているだけの時などは、自動補給は行われません。"

#. ~ Prerequisite of terrain constrution
#: data/json/construction/misc.json
msgid ""
"Mark a spot for target practice.  Firing will automatically target the first"
" practice target location found in gun range, if no enemies are around."
msgstr "練習標的となる地点に印を付けます。周囲に敵がいない時に射撃を行う際は、練習標的の地点を自動的に狙います。"

#. ~ Prerequisite of terrain constrution
#: data/json/construction/roofs.json
msgid ""
"Must be supported directly from below or on at least two sides.  May need a "
"'room' supporting a roof directly below."
msgstr "直接支えるか、あるいは最低2面の支えられる地形と接している必要があります。屋根の下層を支える「部屋」が必要になる場合があります。"

#. ~ Prerequisite of terrain constrution
#: data/json/construction/zlvels_transition.json
msgid ""
"Build a concrete ramp leading to the next z-level above, and the "
"corresponding ramp down leading from the z-level above to this level.  It "
"must be built next to a low end of a ramp to allow moving between z-levels "
"in both directions."
msgstr ""
"一つ上の層へ通じるコンクリート製の傾斜路を現在の層に設置し、この層へ通じる傾斜路を一つ上の層に設置します。異なる層への移動を可能にするためには、隣接する地点に上り傾斜路下端を設置してください。"

#. ~ Prerequisite of terrain constrution
#: data/json/construction/zlvels_transition.json
msgid ""
"Build a concrete ramp leading to the next z-level above, and the "
"corresponding ramp down leading from the z-level above to this level.  The "
"high end of a ramp must be built adjacent to allow moving between z-levels "
"in both directions."
msgstr ""
"一つ上の層へ通じるコンクリート製の傾斜路を現在の層に設置し、この層へ通じる傾斜路を一つ上の層に設置します。異なる層への移動を可能にするためには、隣接する地点に上り傾斜路上端を設置してください。"

#. ~ Prerequisite of terrain constrution
#: data/json/construction/zlvels_transition.json
msgid ""
"Build an earth ramp leading to the next z-level above, and the corresponding"
" ramp down leading from the z-level above to this level.  It must be built "
"next to a low end of a ramp to allow moving between z-levels in both "
"directions."
msgstr ""
"一つ上の層へ通じる傾斜路を現在の層に設置し、この層へ通じる傾斜路を一つ上の層に設置します。異なる層への移動を可能にするためには、隣接する地点に上り傾斜路下端を設置してください。"

#. ~ Prerequisite of terrain constrution
#: data/json/construction/zlvels_transition.json
msgid ""
"Build an earth ramp leading to the next z-level above, and the corresponding"
" ramp down leading from the z-level above to this level.  The high end of a "
"ramp must be built adjacent to allow moving between z-levels in both "
"directions."
msgstr ""
"一つ上の層へ通じる傾斜路を現在の層に設置し、この層へ通じる傾斜路を一つ上の層に設置します。異なる層への移動を可能にするためには、隣接する地点に上り傾斜路上端を設置してください。"

#. ~ Prerequisite of terrain constrution
#: data/json/construction/zlvels_transition.json
msgid "Builds another scaffolding level."
msgstr "指定したタイルの上層に足場の上端を建設します。"

#. ~ Prerequisite of terrain constrution
#: data/json/construction/zlvels_transition.json
msgid ""
"Constructs scaffolding on the tile and provides a platform on the Z level "
"above."
msgstr "指定したタイルに、上層に繋げるための足場を建設します。"

#. ~ Prerequisite of terrain constrution
#: data/json/construction/zlvels_transition.json
msgid "Removes down scaffolding from directly above the construction tile."
msgstr "指定したタイルの上層にある足場を取り除きます。"

#. ~ Prerequisite of terrain constrution
#: data/json/construction/zlvels_transition.json
msgid "Removes scaffolding."
msgstr "足場を取り除きます。"

#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_CAFFEINE_ADDICTION"
#: data/json/effects_on_condition/addictions_eocs.json
msgid "You want some caffeine."
msgstr "カフェインを欲しています。"

#. ~ Player message in nested effect in then statement in effect in EoC
#. "EOC_CAFFEINE_ADDICTION"
#: data/json/effects_on_condition/addictions_eocs.json
msgid "Your hands start shaking… you need it bad!"
msgstr "手が震え始めました...カフェインを欲しています！"

#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_MARLOSS_R_ADDICTION"
#: data/json/effects_on_condition/addictions_eocs.json
msgid "You daydream about luscious pink berries as big as your fist."
msgstr "握り拳ほどの大きさの、甘美で芳しい桃色のベリーを空想しています。"

#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_MARLOSS_B_ADDICTION"
#: data/json/effects_on_condition/addictions_eocs.json
msgid "You daydream about nutty cyan seeds as big as your hand."
msgstr "手の平に乗る大きさの、木の実の味がする青緑色の種を空想しています。"

#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_MARLOSS_Y_ADDICTION"
#: data/json/effects_on_condition/addictions_eocs.json
msgid "You daydream about succulent, pale golden gel, sweet but light."
msgstr "汁気たっぷりの、甘いのにしつこくない、淡い黄金色のジェルを空想しています。"

#. ~ Player message in nested effect in then statement in nested effect in
#. then statement in effect in EoC "EOC_MUTAGEN_ADDICTION"
#: data/json/effects_on_condition/addictions_eocs.json
msgid "You so miss the exquisite rainbow of post-humanity."
msgstr "新人類へと至るキラキラしあわせ気分が恋しくなってきました。"

#. ~ Player message in nested effect in else statement in nested effect in
#. then statement in effect in EoC "EOC_MUTAGEN_ADDICTION"
#: data/json/effects_on_condition/addictions_eocs.json
msgid "Your body is SOO booorrrring.  Just a little sip to liven things up?"
msgstr "身体が物凄く退屈しているのを感じます。ほんの少しでも、楽しくなるものが欲しいですね？"

#. ~ Player message in nested effect in then statement in effect in EoC
#. "EOC_MUTAGEN_ADDICTION"
#: data/json/effects_on_condition/addictions_eocs.json
msgid ""
"You daydream what it'd be like if you were *different*.  Different is good."
msgstr "もっと*違って*いたらいいのになあと空想しています。違っていることは良いことですよね。"

#. ~ Player message in nested effect in then statement in nested effect in
#. then statement in false effect in EoC "EOC_MUTAGEN_ADDICTION"
#: data/json/effects_on_condition/addictions_eocs.json
msgid "You haven't had any mutagen lately."
msgstr "最近は変異していませんね。"

#. ~ Player message in nested effect in else statement in nested effect in
#. then statement in false effect in EoC "EOC_MUTAGEN_ADDICTION"
#: data/json/effects_on_condition/addictions_eocs.json
msgid "You could use some new parts…"
msgstr "新しい部位を増やしたくなってきました..."

#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_bio_adrenaline"
#: data/json/effects_on_condition/bionic_active_eocs.json
msgid "Safeguards kicks in, and the bionic refuses to activate!"
msgstr "安全装置が作動したため、生体部品を起動できませんでした！"

#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_time_freeze"
#: data/json/effects_on_condition/bionic_active_eocs.json
msgid "You cannot activate Time Dilation while mounted."
msgstr "騎乗中は時間拡張システムを起動できません。"

#. ~ Player message in false effect in EoC "EOC_time_freeze"
#: data/json/effects_on_condition/bionic_active_eocs.json
msgid "You activate your Time Dilation."
msgstr "時間拡張システムを起動しました。"

#. ~ Player message in false effect in EoC "EOC_time_freeze"
#: data/json/effects_on_condition/bionic_active_eocs.json
msgid "Your speed suddenly increases!"
msgstr "急に素早く動けるようになりました！"

#. ~ Player message in nested effect in then statement in false effect in EoC
#. "EOC_time_freeze"
#: data/json/effects_on_condition/bionic_active_eocs.json
msgid "Your muscles tear with the strain!"
msgstr "張り詰めた筋肉が断裂しました！"

#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_bio_hydraulics"
#: data/json/effects_on_condition/bionic_active_eocs.json
msgid "Your muscles hiss as hydraulic strength fills them!"
msgstr "油圧機構の力に満たされた全身の筋肉が甲高い唸りをあげています！"

#. ~ Player makes sound in effect in EoC "EOC_bio_hydraulics"
#. ~ Player makes sound in effect in EoC "EOC_bio_hydraulics_act"
#: data/json/effects_on_condition/bionic_active_eocs.json
msgid "HISISSS!"
msgstr "シューシュー！"

#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "bio_drain"
#: data/json/effects_on_condition/bionic_eocs.json
msgid "Your batteries discharge slightly."
msgstr "電池がわずかに放電しました。"

#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "bio_trip"
#: data/json/effects_on_condition/bionic_eocs.json
msgid "Your vision pixelates!"
msgstr "視界にモザイクがかかりました！"

#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "bio_spasm"
#: data/json/effects_on_condition/bionic_eocs.json
msgid "Your malfunctioning bionic causes you to spasm and fall to the floor!"
msgstr "生体部品の機能不全によって発作を起こし、地面に倒れ込みました！"

#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "bio_shakes"
#: data/json/effects_on_condition/bionic_eocs.json
msgid "Your bionics short-circuit, causing you to tremble and shiver."
msgstr "生体部品が漏電を起こしています。全身の痙攣が止まりません。"

#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "bio_glowy"
#: data/json/effects_on_condition/bionic_eocs.json
msgid "Your malfunctioning bionic starts to glow!"
msgstr "誤作動を起こした生体部品が光り輝きました！"

