#. ~ Description of "plastic jack o'lantern"
#: data/json/items/items_holiday.json
msgid ""
"A plastic lantern that is painted to look like a pumpkin with a face.  It "
"has a tiny LED light inside, which is currently off.  It's mostly for "
"seasonal decoration and doesn't provide very much light."
msgstr ""
"顔が描かれたカボチャのようなデザインの、プラスチック製ランタンです。中に小さなLEDライトが入っており、現在は消灯しています。主に季節のイベントの装飾で使う照明なので、あまり明るくありません。"

