msgid ""
"A large, lovable and huggable humpback whale plushie with soft, gray and "
"white fur and big, friendly eyes."
msgstr "柔らかい灰色と白色の表皮と人懐こそうなつぶらな瞳が特徴的な、思わず抱きしめたくなるほど可愛らしい大きなザトウクジラのぬいぐるみです。"

#. ~ Variant name of item "plush toy"
#: data/json/items/toy.json
msgid "camel plushie"
msgid_plural "camel plushies"
msgstr[0] "ぬいぐるみ(ﾌﾀｺﾌﾞﾗｸﾀﾞ)"

#. ~ Description of variant "camel plushie" of item "plush toy"
#: data/json/items/toy.json
msgid ""
"A cuddly and sweet camel plushie with two soft humps, tan fur and big, "
"soulful eyes."
msgstr "二つの柔らかいこぶ、黄褐色の毛皮、つぶらで悲しそうな瞳が特徴的な、可愛らしいフタコブラクダのぬいぐるみです。"

#. ~ Variant name of item "plush toy"
#: data/json/items/toy.json
msgid "dromedary plushie"
msgid_plural "dromedary plushies"
msgstr[0] "ぬいぐるみ(ﾋﾄｺﾌﾞﾗｸﾀﾞ)"

#. ~ Description of variant "dromedary plushie" of item "plush toy"
