msgstr "柔らかい茶色の毛皮、大きな一つのコブ、優しい目が特徴的な、抱きしめたくなるほど可愛らしいヒトコブラクダのぬいぐるみです。"

#. ~ Variant name of item "plush toy"
#: data/json/items/toy.json
msgid "llama plushie"
msgid_plural "llama plushies"
msgstr[0] "ぬいぐるみ(ﾗﾏ)"

#. ~ Description of variant "llama plushie" of item "plush toy"
#: data/json/items/toy.json
msgid ""
"A precious llama plushie with soft, fluffy fur in grayish white.  It has "
"expressive eyes, a tuft of fur on its head, long, delicate legs, and has a "
"selection of detachable accessories, such as a saddle, a blanket, and even a"
" hat!"
msgstr ""
"灰白色のフワフワした毛皮をもつ、可愛らしいラマのぬいぐるみです。表情豊かな目、発達した頭部の毛、長細い足が特徴的で、鞍やブランケット、帽子などの取り外せる付属品も豊富に揃っています。"

#. ~ Variant name of item "plush toy"
#: data/json/items/toy.json
