msgid_plural "alpaca plushies"
msgstr[0] "ぬいぐるみ(ｱﾙﾊﾟｶ)"

#. ~ Description of variant "alpaca plushie" of item "plush toy"
#: data/json/items/toy.json
msgid ""
"A cute and loving alpaca plushie featuring soft, curly fur in shades of "
"white and brown, shiny black eyes, and slightly short legs."
msgstr "白色と茶色の柔らかい巻き毛、光沢のある黒い目、少し短い足が特徴的な、愛らしいアルパカのぬいぐるみです。"

#. ~ Variant name of item "plush toy"
#: data/json/items/toy.json
msgid "cow plushie"
msgid_plural "cow plushies"
msgstr[0] "ぬいぐるみ(ｳｼ)"

#. ~ Description of variant "cow plushie" of item "plush toy"
#: data/json/items/toy.json
