msgid_plural ".32 ACP FMJ"
msgstr[0] "弾薬(.32口径/FMJ)"

#. ~ Description of ".32 ACP FMJ"
#: data/json/items/ammo/32.json
msgid ""
"A jacketed .32 ACP cartridge loaded with a 71 grain bullet.  .32 ACP was "
"once a popular handgun cartridge in the 20th century.  It lacks power "
"compared to .380 Auto and 9x19mm."
msgstr ""
"弾頭重量約4.5gの.32口径ACPフルメタルジャケット弾です。20世紀に流行したハンドガン弾ですが、.380口径オート弾や9x19mm弾と比べると威力不足です。"

