msgstr[0] "弾薬(.357口径ﾏｸﾞﾅﾑ/FMJ/手詰め)"

#. ~ Description of ".357 Magnum FMJ, reloaded"
#: data/json/items/ammo/357mag.json
msgid ""
"Jacketed .357 Magnum ammunition.  This one has been hand-reloaded by a "
"survivor or perhaps a pre-Cataclysm hobbyist, leading to slightly inferior "
"performance compared to factory-produced ammo."
msgstr ""
".357口径マグナム・ジャケッテッド弾です。大変動の生存者、あるいは単なる趣味人が手詰めしたものであり、性能は工場生産された弾薬に比べてやや劣ります。"

