msgid ".45 FMJ, reloaded"
msgid_plural ".45 FMJ, reloaded"
msgstr[0] "弾薬(.45口径ACP/FMJ/手詰め)"

#. ~ Description of ".45 FMJ, reloaded"
#: data/json/items/ammo/45.json
msgid ""
".45 ACP ammunition with a 230gr FMJ bullet.  Due to a reputation for "
"effectiveness, the .45 ACP round has been common for over a century.  This "
"one has been hand-reloaded by a survivor or perhaps a pre-Cataclysm "
"hobbyist, leading to slightly inferior performance compared to factory-"
"produced ammo."
msgstr ""
"弾頭重量約15gの.45口径ACPフルメタルジャケット弾です。.45口径ACP弾はその有効性に定評があり、一世紀以上にわたって広く使われています。大変動の生存者、あるいは単なる趣味人が手詰めしたものであり、性能は工場生産された弾薬に比べてやや劣ります。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/ammo/45.json
msgid ".45 ACP JHP, reloaded"
msgid_plural ".45 ACP JHP, reloaded"
msgstr[0] "弾薬(.45口径ACP/JHP/手詰め)"

