" of a number of such high-caliber rounds and is compatible with "
"appropriately converted AR-15-platform rifles.  This particular cartridge is"
" loaded with a solid-copper projectile: excellent at punching through thick "
"barriers and delivering massive amounts of energy to anything unfortunate "
"enough to be hit."
msgstr ""
