#. ~ Description of ".50 BMG AP, reloaded"
#: data/json/items/ammo/50.json
msgid ""
"A variant of the .50 BMG round that uses a core of hardened steel.  "
"Penetration is increased, but damage is reduced.  This one has been hand-"
"reloaded.  by a survivor or perhaps a pre-Cataclysm hobbyist, leading to "
"slightly inferior performance compared to factory-produced ammo."
msgstr ""
"鍛錬した高密度鋼を芯に用いた、改良型.50口径BMG弾です。貫通力は増加しましたが、威力が低下しています。大変動の生存者、あるいは単なる趣味人が手詰めしたものであり、性能は工場生産された弾薬に比べてやや劣ります。"

#. ~ Item name
