#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/ammo/84x246mm.json
msgid "84x245mm HE"
msgid_plural "84x245mm HE"
msgstr[0] "弾薬(84mm/HE)"

#. ~ Description of "84x245mm HE"
#: data/json/items/ammo/84x246mm.json
msgid ""
"An 84x245mm High Explosive anti-personnel cartridge for the Carl Gustaf M3 "
"and other 84mm recoilless rifles.  Designed to be highly effective against "
"personnel."
msgstr "カールグスタフM3などの84mm無反動砲に対応する84x245mm対人榴弾です。人体に対して高い効果をもつように設計されています。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/ammo/84x246mm.json
msgid "84x245mm HEDP"
msgid_plural "84x245mm HEDP"
msgstr[0] "弾薬(84mm/HEDP)"

#. ~ Description of "84x245mm HEDP"
#: data/json/items/ammo/84x246mm.json
msgid ""
"An 84x245mm High Explosive Dual Purpose anti-materiel cartridge for the Carl"
" Gustaf M3 and other 84mm recoilless rifles.  Designed to be highly "
"effective against vehicles and structures."
msgstr ""
"カールグスタフM3などの84mm無反動砲に対応する84x245mm多目的榴弾です。車両や構造物に対して高い効果をもつように設計されています。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/ammo/84x246mm.json
msgid "84x245mm smoke"
msgid_plural "84x245mm smoke"
msgstr[0] "弾薬(84mm/煙幕)"

#. ~ Description of "84x245mm smoke"
#: data/json/items/ammo/84x246mm.json
msgid ""
"An 84x245mm smoke marker cartridge for the Carl Gustaf M3 and other 84mm "
"recoilless rifles.  Commonly used for signaling, target designation, and for"
" screening troop movements."
msgstr ""
"カールグスタフM3などの84mm無反動砲に対応する84x245mm84x246mm煙幕弾です。一般的には合図や標的の指示、部隊移動の支援に使います。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/ammo/8x40mm.json
msgid "bootleg 8x40mm FMJ"
msgid_plural "bootleg 8x40mm FMJ"
msgstr[0] "弾薬(8mm/FMJ/非正規)"

#. ~ Description of "bootleg 8x40mm FMJ"
#: data/json/items/ammo/8x40mm.json
msgid "A bootleg duplicate of the Rivtech 8x40mm caseless round."
msgstr "Rivtech社製8x40mmケースレス弾を非公式に複製したものです。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/ammo/8x40mm.json
msgid "8x40mm FMJ"
msgid_plural "8x40mm FMJ"
msgstr[0] "弾薬(8mm/FMJ)"

#. ~ Description of "8x40mm FMJ"
#: data/json/items/ammo/8x40mm.json
msgid ""
"An 8x40mm caseless cartridge with a rectangular shape, consisting of a "
"jacketed 127gr bullet housed inside of an advanced propellant body.  Upon "
"firing, the body will be consumed, leaving nothing behind in the chamber.  "
"Proprietary ammunition for Rivtech 8x40 caseless guns."
msgstr ""
"先進的な燃焼薬が長方形の本体内部に充填されている、弾頭重量約8.2gの8x40mmケースレス・フルメタルジャケット弾です。発砲すると本体が燃焼し、薬室に薬莢が残りません。Rivtech社製の銃用の独自の弾薬です。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/ammo/8x40mm.json
msgid "8x40mm SCX"
msgid_plural "8x40mm SCX"
msgstr[0] "弾薬(8mm/SCX)"

#. ~ Description of "8x40mm SCX"
#: data/json/items/ammo/8x40mm.json
msgid ""
"An 8x40mm caseless cartridge with a rectangular shape, consisting of a "
"licensed 127gr solid copper expanding bullet housed inside of an advanced "
"propellant body.  Upon firing, the body will be consumed, leaving nothing "
"behind in the chamber.  The monometal construction of the bullet lends "
"itself to greater manufacturing precision, while also offering excellent "
"expansion and penetration.  Proprietary ammunition for Rivtech 8x40 caseless"
" guns."
msgstr ""
"先進的な燃焼薬が長方形の本体内部に充填されている、重量約8.2gの純銅製拡張弾頭を備えた8x40mmケースレス弾です。発砲すると本体が燃焼し、薬室に薬莢が残りません。モノメタル構造のため品質が安定しており、膨張性と貫通力にも優れています。Rivtech社製の銃用の独自の弾薬です。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/ammo/9mm.json
msgid "9x19mm JHP"
msgid_plural "9x19mm JHP"
msgstr[0] "弾薬(9x19mm/JHP)"

#. ~ Description of "9x19mm JHP"
#: data/json/items/ammo/9mm.json
msgid ""
"9x19mm ammunition with a 116gr jacketed hollow point bullet.  JHP rounds "
"have inferior penetration to FMJ rounds, but their expansion slightly "
"increases stopping power against unarmored targets and reduces "
"overpenetration."
msgstr ""
"弾頭重量約7.52gの9x19mmジャケッテッドホローポイント弾です。フルメタルジャケット弾より貫通力が低下しますが、体内で拡散するため、装甲を持たない標的に対するストッピングパワーが多少増加しています。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/ammo/9mm.json
msgid "9x19mm FMJ"
msgid_plural "9x19mm FMJ"
msgstr[0] "弾薬(9x19mm/FMJ)"

#. ~ Description of "9x19mm FMJ"
#: data/json/items/ammo/9mm.json
msgid ""
"9x19mm ammunition with a brass jacketed 115gr bullet.  It has been a popular"
" round for military, law enforcement, and civilian use for over a century."
msgstr "弾頭重量約7.45gの9x19mmブラスジャケッテッド弾です。100年以上前から軍や法執行機関、民間で高い人気を誇っています。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/ammo/9mm.json
msgid "9x19mm +P"
msgid_plural "9x19mm +P"
msgstr[0] "弾薬(9x19mm/+P)"

#. ~ Description of "9x19mm +P"
#: data/json/items/ammo/9mm.json
msgid ""
"Overpressure 9x19mm ammunition.  The round's increased velocity results in "
"superior accuracy and stopping power at the cost of higher recoil."
msgstr "9x19mm強装弾です。通常より反動は強いですが、強化された弾速によって優れた精度とストッピングパワーを実現しています。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/ammo/9mm.json
msgid "9x19mm +P+"
msgid_plural "9x19mm +P+"
msgstr[0] "弾薬(9x19mm/+P+)"

#. ~ Description of "9x19mm +P+"
#: data/json/items/ammo/9mm.json
msgid ""
"A step beyond the high-pressure 9x19mm +P round, the +P+ has even higher "
"internal pressure offering superior damage, accuracy, and penetration."
msgstr "9x19mm/+P弾の一歩先をゆく+P+弾です。通常より装薬量を増加してより優れたダメージ、精度、貫通力を実現しています。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/ammo/9mm.json
msgid "9x19mm JHP, black powder"
msgid_plural "9x19mm JHP, black powder"
msgstr[0] "弾薬(9x19mm/JHP/黒色火薬)"

#. ~ Description of "9x19mm JHP, black powder"
#: data/json/items/ammo/9mm.json
msgid ""
"9x19mm ammunition with a 116gr jacketed hollow point bullet.  JHP rounds "
"have inferior penetration to FMJ rounds, but their expansion slightly "
"increases stopping power against unarmored targets and reduces "
"overpenetration.  Someone was down on their luck when they hand-reloaded "
"this one - it's filled with black powder instead of smokeless powder.  "
"Expect lower velocity, muzzle smoke, and a dirtier barrel if you shoot it."
msgstr ""
"弾頭重量約7.52gの9x19mmジャケッテッドホローポイント弾です。フルメタルジャケット弾より貫通力が低下しますが、体内で拡散するため、装甲を持たない標的に対するストッピングパワーが多少増加しています。この弾薬の製作者に運がなかったのか、無煙火薬ではなく黒色火薬が充填されています。黒色火薬を使っている弾薬は弾速が遅く、銃口から煙が排出されたり、銃身内部が汚れたりする欠点があります。"

#. ~ Item name
