msgstr "化学物質噴霧器に装填して使う、強力な殺虫剤です。使用の際はマスクなどで口を防護しましょう"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/ammo/exodii.json
msgid "12.3ln round"
msgid_plural "12.3ln rounds"
msgstr[0] "弾薬(12.3ln)"

#. ~ Description of "12.3ln round"
#: data/json/items/ammo/exodii.json
msgid ""
"In some alternate universe, the 12.3ln cartridge was introduced in Romania "
"in the wake of the second Carpathian conflict.  The PA md. 71 rifle using "
"this ammunition rapidly gained popularity in the Eastern Union, and from "
"there, the world.  Due to this, the 12.3ln rapidly became the standard "
"combat round in the Eurasian sphere, making it easy for the Exodii to "
"stockpile it in large quantities when they visited that version of Earth.  "
"It looks vaguely like a rimless, .303 British cartridge loaded with a "
"larger, non-spitzer bullet."
msgstr ""
"ある平行宇宙において、12.3ln弾は第二次カルパチア紛争をきっかけにルーマニアで導入されました。この弾薬を使うPA "
"md.71ライフルが東側諸国で急速に人気を博し、その後世界に広まったという経緯から、12.3ln弾はユーラシア圏の標準的な軍用弾薬になりました。そのため、エクゾディはこの弾薬を容易に収集、備蓄できました。見た目は少し大きめの.303口径ブリティッシュ弾のようですが、リムがなく先端も尖っていません。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/ammo/exodii.json
msgid "12.3ln, reloaded"
msgid_plural "12.3ln, reloaded"
msgstr[0] "弾薬(12.3ln/手詰め)"

#. ~ Description of "12.3ln, reloaded"
#: data/json/items/ammo/exodii.json
msgid ""
"In some alternate universe, the 12.3ln cartridge was introduced in Romania "
"in the wake of the second Carpathian conflict.  This one has been hand-"
"reloaded by a survivor, leading to slightly inferior performance compared to"
" factory-produced ammo."
msgstr ""
"ある平行宇宙において、12.3ln弾は第二次カルパチア紛争をきっかけにルーマニアで導入されました。大変動の生存者、あるいは単なる趣味人が手詰めしたものであり、性能は工場生産された弾薬に比べてやや劣ります。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/ammo/exodii.json
msgid "12.3ln, black powder"
msgid_plural "12.3ln, black powder"
msgstr[0] "弾薬(12.3In/黒色火薬)"

#. ~ Description of "12.3ln, black powder"
#: data/json/items/ammo/exodii.json
msgid ""
"In some alternate universe, the 12.3ln cartridge was introduced in Romania "
"in the wake of the second Carpathian conflict.  Someone was down on their "
"luck when they hand-reloaded this one - it's filled with black powder "
"instead of smokeless powder.  Expect lower velocity, muzzle smoke, and a "
"dirtier barrel if you shoot it."
msgstr ""
"ある平行宇宙において、12.3ln弾は第二次カルパチア紛争をきっかけにルーマニアで導入されました。この弾薬の製作者に運がなかったのか、無煙火薬ではなく黒色火薬が充填されています。黒色火薬を使っている弾薬は弾速が遅く、銃口から煙が排出されたり、銃身内部が汚れたりする欠点があります。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/ammo/exodii.json
msgid "base Exodii shotshell"
msgid_plural "base Exodii shotshells"
msgstr[0] "弾薬(ｴｸｿﾞﾃﾞｨ/ﾍﾞｰｽ)"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/ammo/exodii.json
msgid "27.3x110 Diyua light slug"
msgid_plural "27.3x110 Diyua light slugs"
msgstr[0] "弾薬(27.3x110Diyua/軽ｽﾗｯｸﾞ)"

#. ~ Description of "27.3x110 Diyua light slug"
#: data/json/items/ammo/exodii.json
msgid ""
"27.3x110 Diyua light slug loads were employed by colonists on some alternate"
" earth to take dangerous game, and later, fend off commonwealth forces from "
"atop palisade walls."
msgstr ""
"27.3x110Diyua軽スラッグ弾は、別世界の地球の入植者が危険な狩りへ赴く際に用い、その後も壁上の柵越しにコモンウェルスを撃退する際に使われました。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/ammo/exodii.json
msgid "27.3x110 Diyua medium slug"
msgid_plural "27.3x110 Diyua medium slugs"
msgstr[0] "弾薬(27.3x110Diyua/中ｽﾗｯｸﾞ)"

#. ~ Description of "27.3x110 Diyua medium slug"
#: data/json/items/ammo/exodii.json
msgid ""
"27.3x110 Diyua medium slug loads were employed by colonists on some "
"alternate earth to take extremely dangerous game, and later, fend off "
"commonwealth forces from atop palisade walls.  Most users of the Brogyaga "
"guns considered these shells too punishing to withstand."
msgstr ""
"27.3x110Diyua中スラッグ弾は、別世界の地球の入植者が非常に危険な狩りへ赴く際に用い、その後も壁上の柵越しにコモンウェルスを撃退する際に使われました。ブロギャガの使用者のほとんどは、この弾薬の威力が高すぎると考えていました。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/ammo/exodii.json
msgid "27.3x110 Diyua heavy slug"
msgid_plural "27.3x110 Diyua heavy slugs"
msgstr[0] "弾薬(27.3x110Diyua/重ｽﾗｯｸﾞ)"

#. ~ Description of "27.3x110 Diyua heavy slug"
#: data/json/items/ammo/exodii.json
msgid ""
"27.3x110 Diyua slug loads similar to these were employed by colonists on "
"some alternate earth to take extremely dangerous game.  This heavy slug load"
" however, was used almost entirely by recoil enthusiasts and braggarts, "
"until the Exodii came upon them."
msgstr ""
"27.3x110Diyua銃スラッグ弾は、別世界の地球の入植者が非常に危険な狩りへ赴く際に用いていました。エクゾディが出現するまでは、重スラッグ弾を使うのは余程の反動中毒者か派手好きくらいのものでした。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/ammo/exodii.json
msgid "27.3x110 Diyua flockshot"
msgid_plural "27.3x110 Diyua flockshot"
msgstr[0] "弾薬(27.3x110Diyua/ﾌﾛｯｸｼｮｯﾄ)"

#. ~ Description of "27.3x110 Diyua flockshot"
#: data/json/items/ammo/exodii.json
msgid ""
"On some alien earth, scores of flocks were decimated by loads such as this "
"27.3x110 Diyua shell, loaded with a ludicrous number of tiny pellets.  "
"Though it would still be devastating against more humanoid targets, "
"flockshot like this is more typically employed by the Exodii by the "
"occasional hunting party."
msgstr ""
"こことは異なるどこかの世界では、この27.3x110Diyua弾のような途方もない数の小ペレットを備えた弾薬によって、多数の敵の群れが倒されました。人型の標的に対して致命的な威力を発揮しますが、エクゾディが時折結成している狩猟部隊では標準的な弾薬として運用されています。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/ammo/exodii.json
msgid "27.3x110 Diyua canister"
msgid_plural "27.3x110 Diyua canisters"
msgstr[0] "弾薬(27.3x110Diyua/ｷｬﾆｽﾀｰ)"

#. ~ Description of "27.3x110 Diyua canister"
#: data/json/items/ammo/exodii.json
msgid ""
"On some alien earth, these mini-canister loads mimicked much larger "
"artillery shot, and were employed for anti-personnel usage against advancing"
" waves from atop a palisade.  The Exodii would load these in their Brogyeki "
"sidearms for backup usage."
msgstr ""
"こことは異なるどこかの世界では、これらの小型矢弾が遥かに威力の高い砲撃と同じように、柵の向こう側から押し寄せる人型の敵に対して用いられました。エクゾディはこれらをサイドアームであるBrogyekiに装填し、予備の武装として使います。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/ammo/exodii.json
msgid "base Exodii grenade"
msgid_plural "base Exodii grenades"
msgstr[0] "弾薬(ｴｸｿﾞﾃﾞｨ擲弾/ﾍﾞｰｽ)"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/ammo/exodii.json
msgid "27.3x44 Diyua star"
msgid_plural "27.3x44 Diyua star"
msgstr[0] "弾薬(27.3x44Diyua/ｽﾀｰ)"

#. ~ Description of "27.3x44 Diyua star"
#: data/json/items/ammo/exodii.json
msgid ""
"These flare cartridges are for use in 27.3x44 Diyua guns, or perhaps in "
"27.3x110 Diyua guns.  They are employed by Exodii for emergency signaling "
"when their usual communications systems are suffering interference, "
"breakdown, or are being jammed."
msgstr ""
"27.3x44Diyua銃、もしくは27.3x110Diyua銃などで使われる信号弾です。エクゾディの部隊は、通常の通信システムが干渉、故障、妨害などによって使いない場合に、この弾薬を緊急信号の送信手段として用います。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/ammo/exodii.json
msgid "27.3x44 Diyua practice"
msgid_plural "27.3x44 Diyua practice"
msgstr[0] "弾薬(27.3x44Diyua/訓練用)"

#. ~ Description of "27.3x44 Diyua practice"
#: data/json/items/ammo/exodii.json
msgid ""
"A 27.3x44 Diyua cartridge loaded with a large hollow aluminum projectile, "
"painted blue at the tip, for practicing shooting.  If interdimensional total"
" replacement cyborgs have to practice, maybe you should too."
msgstr ""
"中空アルミニウム弾頭を備えている、先端部が青く塗られた射撃練習用の27.3x44Diyua弾です。次元間旅行が可能な全身サイボーグですら訓練が必要なのですから、普通の人間は当然訓練を積むべきです。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/ammo/exodii.json
msgid "27.3x44 Diyua thermobaric"
msgid_plural "27.3x44 Diyua thermobaric"
msgstr[0] "弾薬(27.3x44Diyua/ｻｰﾓﾊﾞﾘｯｸ)"

#. ~ Description of "27.3x44 Diyua thermobaric"
#: data/json/items/ammo/exodii.json
msgid ""
"A 27.3x44 Diyua cartridge with a minute amount of liquid fuel encasing a "
"fuel dispersing explosive charge, and a secondary ignition charge.  On "
"impact the fuel is dispersed, creating a fuel air mixture which is ignited a"
" few milliseconds later.  In a cartridge like 27.3x44 Diyua, the pressure "
"wave produced is rather diminutive, yet it makes the most of what little "
"payload is available."
msgstr ""
"燃料散布用の爆薬と二次点火用爆薬、微量の液体燃料が入った27.3x44Diyua弾です。命中すると燃料が散布されて周囲の空気に混じり、数ミリ秒後に点火されます。27.3x44Diyua弾によって生成される圧力波はかなり小規模ですが、利用できるわずかな燃料を最大限に活かした攻撃が可能です。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/ammo/exodii.json
msgid "27.3x44 Diyua high explosive"
msgid_plural "27.3x44 Diyua high explosive"
msgstr[0] "弾薬(27.3x44Diyua/榴弾)"

#. ~ Description of "27.3x44 Diyua high explosive"
#: data/json/items/ammo/exodii.json
msgid ""
"A 27.3x44 Diyua cartridge loaded with a high explosive charge and a point-"
"detonating fuze.  Primarily useful for assaulting soft targets, and, in "
"their universe of origin, dispersing crowds."
msgstr ""
"高性能爆薬と起爆用信管を内包した27.3x44Diyua弾です。不特定多数を攻撃する際に特に効果を発揮し、この弾薬が生まれた世界では敵の群れを分散させるのに役立っていました。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/ammo/exodii.json
msgid "66/27.3x278 Diyua multipurpose"
msgid_plural "66/27.3x278 Diyua multipurpose"
msgstr[0] "弾薬(27.3x44Diyua/多目的)"

#. ~ Description of "66/27.3x278 Diyua multipurpose"
#: data/json/items/ammo/exodii.json
msgid ""
"A long 27.3 Diyua cartridge loaded with a propelling charge, attached to a "
"large high explosive shaped charge grenade several times larger in diameter."
"  It was designed to be muzzle loaded into 27.3x44 Diyua guns.  Though the "
"grenade's penetration and fragmentation were ultimately deemed insufficient,"
" this was of no matter to the Exodii who saw value in the explosive "
"potential the grenade added to the Brogyeki '23."
msgstr ""
"推進薬を内包した長い27.3Diyua弾です。直径が更に数倍長い擲弾と一体化しており、27.3x44Diyua銃の先端側から装填する作りになっています。最終的に貫通力と破片の威力が不足していると結論付けられましたが、Brogyeki"
" '23と呼ばれる銃に装填した際の爆発力に価値を見出していたエクゾディにとっては問題ではありませんでした。"

#. ~ Description of "paper cartridge"
#: data/json/items/ammo/flintlock.json
msgid ""
"A paper cartridge containing black powder and a metallic projectile.  "
"Historically used to reload muzzleloaders in a more reasonable time."
msgstr "黒色火薬と金属製の発射体を内包した紙製薬莢です。歴史的には、前装式銃の装填の時間を効率化する目的で使われていました。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/ammo/flintlock.json
#: data/mods/Generic_Guns/ammo/black_powder.json
msgid "paper shot cartridge"
msgid_plural "paper shot cartridges"
msgstr[0] "紙製薬莢(散弾)"

#. ~ Description of "paper shot cartridge"
#: data/json/items/ammo/flintlock.json
#: data/mods/Generic_Guns/ammo/black_powder.json
msgid ""
"A paper cartridge containing black powder and metallic shot.  Historically "
"used to reload muzzleloaders in a more reasonable time."
msgstr "黒色火薬と金属製の散弾を内包した紙製薬莢です。歴史的には、前装式銃の装填の時間を効率化する目的で使われていました。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/ammo/nail.json
msgid "flechette"
msgid_plural "flechettes"
msgstr[0] "矢弾"

#. ~ Description of "flechette"
#: data/json/items/ammo/nail.json
msgid ""
"A tiny steel dart.  Can be fired from a nail gun or similar weapon, or used "
"for crafting ammunition."
msgstr "鋼鉄製の小さなダーツです。ネイルガンなどの武器から発射する他に、弾薬の製作材料としても使えます。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/ammo/nail.json
msgid "bronze nail"
msgid_plural "bronze nails"
msgstr[0] "釘(青銅)"

#. ~ Description of "bronze nail"
#: data/json/items/ammo/nail.json
msgid ""
"A pin-shaped piece of bronze.  It can be used to construct various things "
"with a hammer."
msgstr "針状に尖った青銅製の部品です。これとハンマーを使えば様々なものが作れます。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/ammo/nail.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/spell_learning_items/spell_learning_items_dreamer.json
msgid "nail"
msgid_plural "nails"
msgstr[0] "釘"

#. ~ Description of "nail"
#: data/json/items/ammo/nail.json
msgid ""
"A pin-shaped piece of steel.  It can be used to construct various things "
"with a hammer."
msgstr "針状に尖った鋼鉄製の部品です。これとハンマーを使えば様々なものが作れます。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/ammo/nail.json
msgid "nut and bolt"
msgid_plural "nuts and bolts"
msgstr[0] "ボルトナット"

#. ~ Description of "nut and bolt"
#: data/json/items/ammo/nail.json
msgid "A matching nut and bolt.  Useful for securing objects together."
msgstr "同サイズのボルトとナットです。何かを固定する際に役立ちます。"

#. ~ Description of "paintball"
#: data/json/items/ammo/paintball.json
msgid ""
"A small paintball for recreational shooting.  Getting shot with one stings a"
" little, but you'd be hard-pressed to kill anything with it."
msgstr "レクリエーション用の小型ペイントボールです。当たると少し痛いですが、殺傷力はほぼありません。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/ammo/shot.json
msgid "birdshot, reloaded"
msgid_plural "birdshot, reloaded"
msgstr[0] "弾薬(12ga/小ﾍﾟﾚｯﾄ弾/手詰め)"

#. ~ Description of "birdshot, reloaded"
#: data/json/items/ammo/shot.json
msgid ""
"Weak shotgun ammunition.  Designed for hunting birds and other small game, "
"its applications in combat are very limited.  This one has been hand-"
"reloaded by a survivor or perhaps a pre-Cataclysm hobbyist, leading to "
"slightly inferior performance compared to factory-produced ammo."
msgstr ""
"ショットガン用の威力の低い弾薬です。鳥獣の狩猟や小さな標的向きで、戦闘における用途は非常に限られています。大変動の生存者、あるいは単なる趣味人が手詰めしたものであり、性能は工場生産された弾薬に比べてやや劣ります。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/ammo/shot.json
msgid "dragon's breath shell, reloaded"
msgid_plural "dragon's breath shells, reloaded"
msgstr[0] "弾薬(12ga/ﾄﾞﾗｺﾞﾝﾌﾞﾚｽ弾/手詰め)"

#. ~ Description of "dragon's breath shell, reloaded"
#: data/json/items/ammo/shot.json
msgid ""
"A shotgun shell filled with magnesium pellets or shards, used mostly as a "
"distress flare or pyrotechnics tool.  When the round is fired, high-"
"temperature sparks and flames shoot out of the barrel, igniting everything "
"in their path.  This one was made in somebody's garage.  Are you sure you "
"want to shoot this?"
msgstr ""
"主に遭難時の信号弾や娯楽用に使われる、マグネシウムのペレットや破片が詰まったショットガン用の弾薬です。発射と共に砲身から高温の火花と炎が飛び出し、弾道に沿って炎が発生します。誰かが手作りしたもののようですが、本当に発射しても大丈夫なのでしょうか？"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/ammo/shot.json
msgid "00 shot, reloaded"
msgid_plural "00 shot, reloaded"
msgstr[0] "弾薬(12ga/散弾/手詰め)"

#. ~ Description of "00 shot, reloaded"
#: data/json/items/ammo/shot.json
msgid ""
"A shell filled with metal pellets.  Extremely damaging, plus the spread "
"makes it very accurate at short range.  SWAT forces wouldn't use this "
"homebrew shell, but a sovereign citizen looking to fend off SWAT probably "
"would."
msgstr ""
"金属製の小球が詰まった弾薬です。殺傷能力が高く、広範囲に拡散するため近距離で命中しやすい特徴があります。SWATは手詰め弾を使いませんが、SWATを撃退したい民間人は使うかもしれません。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/ammo/shot.json
msgid "flechette shell, reloaded"
msgid_plural "flechette shells, reloaded"
msgstr[0] "弾薬(12ga/矢弾/手詰め)"

#. ~ Description of "flechette shell, reloaded"
#: data/json/items/ammo/shot.json
msgid ""
"A shotgun shell filled with tiny steel darts.  The spread makes it very "
"accurate at short range.  This one has been hand-reloaded by a survivor or "
"perhaps a pre-Cataclysm hobbyist, leading to slightly inferior performance "
"compared to factory-produced ammo."
msgstr ""
"鋼鉄製の小さなダーツが詰まったショットガン用の弾薬です。発射後に拡散するため、近距離での命中精度が非常に高くなります。大変動の生存者、あるいは単なる趣味人が手詰めしたものであり、性能は工場生産された弾薬に比べてやや劣ります。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/ammo/shot.json
msgid "shotgun slug, reloaded"
msgid_plural "shotgun slugs, reloaded"
msgstr[0] "弾薬(12ga/単発弾/手詰め)"

#. ~ Description of "shotgun slug, reloaded"
#: data/json/items/ammo/shot.json
msgid ""
"A heavy metal slug used to give a shotgun the range capabilities of a rifle."
"  Extremely damaging but rather inaccurate.  This one has been hand-reloaded"
" by a survivor or perhaps a pre-Cataclysm hobbyist, leading to slightly "
"inferior performance compared to factory-produced ammo."
msgstr ""
"ライフルの射程距離をショットガンで実現するための、重金属スラッグ弾です。威力は絶大ですが、精度はかなり不正確です。大変動の生存者、あるいは単なる趣味人が手詰めしたものであり、性能は工場生産された弾薬に比べてやや劣ります。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/ammo/shot.json
msgid "birdshot, black powder"
msgid_plural "birdshot, black powder"
msgstr[0] "弾薬(12ga/小ﾍﾟﾚｯﾄ弾/黒色火薬)"

#. ~ Description of "birdshot, black powder"
#: data/json/items/ammo/shot.json
msgid ""
"Weak shotgun ammunition.  Designed for hunting birds and other small game, "
"its applications in combat are very limited.  Someone was down on their luck"
" when they hand-reloaded this one - it's filled with black powder instead of"
" smokeless powder.  Expect lower velocity, muzzle smoke, and a dirtier "
"barrel if you shoot it."
msgstr ""
"ショットガン用の威力の低い弾薬です。鳥獣の狩猟や小さな標的向きで、戦闘における用途は非常に限られています。この弾薬の製作者に運がなかったのか、無煙火薬ではなく黒色火薬が充填されています。黒色火薬を使っている弾薬は弾速が遅く、銃口から煙が排出されたり、銃身内部が汚れたりする欠点があります。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/ammo/shot.json
msgid "dragon's breath shell, black powder"
msgid_plural "dragon's breath shells, black powder"
msgstr[0] "弾薬(12ga/ﾄﾞﾗｺﾞﾝﾌﾞﾚｽ弾/黒色火薬)"

#. ~ Description of "dragon's breath shell, black powder"
#: data/json/items/ammo/shot.json
msgid ""
"A shotgun shell filled with magnesium pellets or shards, used mostly as a "
"distress flare or pyrotechnics tool.  When the round is fired, high-"
"temperature sparks and flames shoot out of the barrel, igniting everything "
"in their path.  This one was made in somebody's garage, and with black "
"gunpowder to boot.  Are you sure you want to shoot this?"
msgstr ""
"主に遭難時の信号弾や娯楽用に使われる、マグネシウムのペレットや破片が詰まったショットガン用の弾薬です。発射と共に砲身から高温の火花と炎が飛び出し、弾道に沿って炎が発生します。誰かが手作りしたもののようで、しかも黒色火薬を使っていますが、本当に発射しても大丈夫なのでしょうか？"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/ammo/shot.json
msgid "00 shot, black powder"
msgid_plural "00 shot, black powder"
msgstr[0] "弾薬(12ga/散弾/黒色火薬)"

#. ~ Description of "00 shot, black powder"
#: data/json/items/ammo/shot.json
msgid ""
"A shell filled with metal pellets.  Extremely damaging, plus the spread "
"makes it very accurate at short range.  SWAT forces probably wouldn't use "
"this one - it's filled with black powder instead of smokeless powder.  "
"Expect lower velocity, muzzle smoke, and a dirtier barrel if you shoot it."
msgstr ""
"金属製の小球が詰まった弾薬です。殺傷能力が高く、広範囲に拡散するため近距離で命中しやすい特徴があります。無煙火薬ではなく黒色火薬が充填されているため、SWATの愛用品ではなさそうです。黒色火薬を使っている弾薬は弾速が遅く、銃口から煙が排出されたり、銃身内部が汚れたりする欠点があります。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/ammo/shot.json
msgid "flechette shell, black powder"
msgid_plural "flechette shells, black powder"
msgstr[0] "弾薬(12ga/矢弾/黒色火薬)"

#. ~ Description of "flechette shell, black powder"
#: data/json/items/ammo/shot.json
msgid ""
"A shotgun shell filled with tiny steel darts.  The spread makes it very "
"accurate at short range.  Someone was down on their luck when they hand-"
"reloaded this one - it's filled with black powder instead of smokeless "
"powder.  Expect lower velocity, muzzle smoke, and a dirtier barrel if you "
"shoot it."
msgstr ""
"鋼製の小さなダーツが詰まったショットガン用の弾薬です。発射後に拡散するため、近距離での命中精度が非常に高くなります。この弾薬の製作者に運がなかったのか、無煙火薬ではなく黒色火薬が充填されています。黒色火薬を使っている弾薬は弾速が遅く、銃口から煙が排出されたり、銃身内部が汚れたりする欠点があります。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/ammo/shot.json
msgid "shotgun slug, black powder"
msgid_plural "shotgun slugs, black powder"
msgstr[0] "弾薬(12ga/単発弾/黒色火薬)"

#. ~ Description of "shotgun slug, black powder"
#: data/json/items/ammo/shot.json
msgid ""
"A heavy metal slug used to give a shotgun the range capabilities of a rifle."
"  Extremely damaging but rather inaccurate.  Someone was down on their luck "
"when they hand-reloaded this one - it's filled with black powder instead of "
"smokeless powder.  Expect lower velocity, muzzle smoke, and a dirtier barrel"
" if you shoot it."
msgstr ""
"ライフルの射程距離をショットガンで実現するための、重金属スラッグ弾です。威力は絶大ですが、精度はかなり不正確です。この弾薬の製作者に運がなかったのか、無煙火薬ではなく黒色火薬が充填されています。黒色火薬を使っている弾薬は弾速が遅く、銃口から煙が排出されたり、銃身内部が汚れたりする欠点があります。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/ammo/shot.json
msgid "base shotshell"
msgid_plural "base shotshells"
msgstr[0] "弾薬(12ga/ﾍﾞｰｽ)"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/ammo/shot.json
msgid "00 shot"
msgid_plural "00 shot"
msgstr[0] "弾薬(12ga/散弾)"

#. ~ Description of "00 shot"
#: data/json/items/ammo/shot.json
msgid ""
"A shell filled with metal pellets.  Extremely damaging, plus the spread "
"makes it very accurate at short range.  Favored by SWAT forces."
msgstr "金属製の小球が詰まった弾薬です。殺傷能力が高く、広範囲に拡散するため近距離で命中しやすい特徴があります。SWATが愛用しています。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/ammo/shot.json
msgid "shotgun beanbag"
msgid_plural "shotgun beanbags"
msgstr[0] "弾薬(12ga/ﾋﾞｰﾝﾊﾞｯｸﾞ)"

#. ~ Description of "shotgun beanbag"
#: data/json/items/ammo/shot.json
msgid ""
"A beanbag round for shotguns.  Designated 'less-lethal' and intended to "
"disable, but remember that 'less-lethal' does not mean 'non-lethal'."
msgstr ""
"ショットガン用のビーンバッグ弾です。標的の無力化を目的とした「低致死性」弾薬ですが、決して「非致死性」ではないことに留意する必要があります。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/ammo/shot.json
msgid "birdshot"
msgid_plural "birdshot"
msgstr[0] "弾薬(12ga/小ﾍﾟﾚｯﾄ弾)"

#. ~ Description of "birdshot"
#: data/json/items/ammo/shot.json
msgid ""
"Weak shotgun ammunition.  Designed for hunting birds and other small game, "
"its applications in combat are very limited."
msgstr "ショットガン用の威力の低い弾薬です。鳥獣の狩猟や小さな標的向きで、戦闘における用途は非常に限られています。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/ammo/shot.json
msgid "dragon's breath shell"
msgid_plural "dragon's breath shells"
msgstr[0] "弾薬(12ga/ﾄﾞﾗｺﾞﾝﾌﾞﾚｽ弾)"

#. ~ Description of "dragon's breath shell"
#: data/json/items/ammo/shot.json
msgid ""
"A shotgun shell filled with magnesium pellets or shards, used mostly as a "
"distress flare or pyrotechnics tool.  When the round is fired, high-"
"temperature sparks and flames shoot out of the barrel, igniting everything "
"in their path."
msgstr ""
"主に遭難時の信号弾や娯楽用に使われる、マグネシウムのペレットや破片が詰まったショットガン用の弾薬です。発射と共に砲身から高温の火花と炎が飛び出し、弾道に沿って炎が発生します。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/ammo/shot.json
msgid "flechette shell"
msgid_plural "flechette shells"
msgstr[0] "弾薬(12ga/矢弾)"

#. ~ Description of "flechette shell"
#: data/json/items/ammo/shot.json
msgid ""
"A shotgun shell filled with tiny steel darts.  The spread makes it very "
"accurate at short range."
msgstr "鋼鉄製の小さな矢が詰まっている、ショットガン用の弾薬です。発射後に拡散するため、近距離での命中精度が非常に高くなっています。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/ammo/shot.json
msgid "explosive slug"
msgid_plural "explosive slugs"
msgstr[0] "弾薬(12ga/単発弾/炸裂)"

#. ~ Description of "explosive slug"
#: data/json/items/ammo/shot.json
msgid ""
"A shotgun shell shooting a small explosive.  Banned in several states.  "
"While an explosive from a shotgun sounds impressive, its practical "
"applications are limited at best.  The loss in mass in order to accommodate "
"an explosive give it much less impact force compared to traditional "
"ammunition.  The relatively small size of the slug can only accommodate a "
"limited amount of explosives, resulting in a fairly underwhelming explosion."
"  These traits make it a utility tool for damaging barriers and disrupting "
"other explosive devices, rather than something for anti-personnel use."
msgstr ""
"小規模の爆発を引き起こす、ショットガン用の弾薬です。特定の州では使用が禁止されています。ショットガンで爆弾を発射できると聞くと魅力的に思えますが、実用性はそれほどでもありません。爆薬の搭載によって全体の質量が減ったことで従来の弾薬より威力が大幅に低下しており、更に、通常より小さい単発弾には少量の爆薬しか入らないため、結果的に爆発力もあまり期待できません。これらの特徴から、対人戦よりも障壁の破壊や他の爆発物への引火を目的として使う方が実用的です。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/ammo/shot.json
msgid "00 shot, scrap loaded"
msgid_plural "00 shot, scrap loaded"
msgstr[0] "弾薬(12ga/金属片)"

#. ~ Description of "00 shot, scrap loaded"
#: data/json/items/ammo/shot.json
msgid ""
"A shotgun shell filled with whatever scrap metal was lying around.  More "
"damaging than birdshot, but fairly inaccurate."
msgstr "どこにでもある金属片を詰めただけの12ga弾です。小ペレット弾よりは威力がありますが、精度はかなり劣ります。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/ammo/shot.json
msgid "00 shot, black powder, scrap loaded"
msgid_plural "00 shot, black powder, scrap loaded"
msgstr[0] "弾薬(12ga/金属片/黒色火薬)"

#. ~ Description of "00 shot, black powder, scrap loaded"
#: data/json/items/ammo/shot.json
msgid ""
"A shotgun shell filled with black gunpowder and whatever scrap metal was "
"lying around.  The logical conclusion of ammunition bootlegging.  It'll kill"
" zombies just fine, but your gun will suffer for it."
msgstr ""
"どこにでもある金属片と黒色火薬を詰め込んだ、弾薬自作の論理性を突き詰めた12ga弾です。ゾンビを殺すならこれで十分ですが、銃への負荷も大きくなります。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/ammo/shot.json
msgid "shotgun slug"
msgid_plural "shotgun slugs"
msgstr[0] "弾薬(12ga/単発弾)"

#. ~ Description of "shotgun slug"
#: data/json/items/ammo/shot.json
msgid ""
"A heavy metal slug used to give a shotgun the range capabilities of a rifle."
"  Extremely damaging but rather inaccurate."
msgstr "ライフルの射程距離をショットガンで実現するための、重金属スラッグ弾です。威力は絶大ですが、精度はかなり不正確です。"

#. ~ Description of "signal flare"
#: data/json/items/ammo/signal_flare.json
msgid ""
"A heavy plastic cartridge made for use in flare guns.  It appears to be a "
"modified 12 gauge shotgun shell."
msgstr "信号銃用に作られた重い合成樹脂製のカートリッジです。これは12ゲージの散弾を改造した弾薬のようです。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/ammo/sling-ready_grenade.json
msgid "sling-ready Molotov cocktail"
msgid_plural "sling-ready Molotov cocktails"
msgstr[0] "投石杖用火炎瓶"

#. ~ Description of "sling-ready Molotov cocktail"
#: data/json/items/ammo/sling-ready_grenade.json
msgid ""
"A bottle of flammable liquid with a long fuse inserted, ready to be used in "
"a staff sling with a modified cradle.  To throw this item without a sling, "
"use it light the fuse.  You will, of course, need a lighter or matches in "
"your inventory to do this.  After lighting it, throw it to cause fires."
msgstr ""
"ホルダーを改造した投石杖を使って飛ばせる、長い導火線が付いた可燃性液体入りの瓶です。投石杖がなくても導火線に点火して投擲することはできますが、当然ライターやマッチなどの点火装置は必要です。点火した状態で投げると着弾点に火が発生します。"

#. ~ "menu_text" action message of item "sling-ready Molotov cocktail"
#. ~ "menu_text" action message of item "Molotov cocktail"
#: data/json/items/ammo/sling-ready_grenade.json
#: data/json/items/tool/explosives.json
msgid "Light rag"
msgstr "点火する"

#. ~ "msg" action message of item "sling-ready Molotov cocktail"
#. ~ "msg" action message of item "Molotov cocktail"
#: data/json/items/ammo/sling-ready_grenade.json
#: data/json/items/tool/explosives.json
msgid "You light the Molotov cocktail!"
msgstr "火炎瓶に火をつけました！"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/ammo/sling-ready_grenade.json
msgid "sling-ready grenade"
msgid_plural "sling-ready grenades"
msgstr[0] "投石杖用手榴弾"

#. ~ Description of "sling-ready grenade"
#: data/json/items/ammo/sling-ready_grenade.json
msgid ""
"A military-grade fragmentary hand grenade, modified with a retaining fuse "
"for use in a staff sling with a modified cradle.  To throw this item without"
" a sling, use it to snap the fuse and activate the grenade.  You will then "
"have five seconds before it explodes; throwing it would be a good idea."
msgstr ""
"ホルダーを改造した投石杖を使って飛ばせる、時限信管に改良を加えた軍用の破片手榴弾です。投石杖がなくても信管を起動することはできますが、その場合5秒後に爆発します。爆発する前に投げた方がよさそうです。"

#. ~ "menu_text" action message of item "sling-ready grenade"
#: data/json/items/ammo/sling-ready_grenade.json
msgid "Activate grenade"
msgstr "起動する"

#. ~ "msg" action message of item "sling-ready grenade"
#: data/json/items/ammo/sling-ready_grenade.json
msgid "You snap the retaining fuse on the grenade."
msgstr "手榴弾の時限信管を起動しました。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/ammo/sling-ready_grenade.json
msgid "sling-ready small homemade grenade"
msgid_plural "sling-ready small homemade grenades"
msgstr[0] "投石杖用自作小型手榴弾"

#. ~ Description of "sling-ready small homemade grenade"
#: data/json/items/ammo/sling-ready_grenade.json
msgid ""
"An improvised explosive device cobbled together from spare parts, modified "
"with a retaining fuse for use in a staff sling.  To throw this item without "
"a sling, use it to snap the fuse and activate the grenade.  You will then "
"have 5 seconds before it explodes; throwing it would be a good idea."
msgstr ""
"投石杖を使って飛ばせる、余った部品を組み合わせて作った即席の爆発物です。投石杖がなくても信管を起動することはできますが、その場合5秒後に爆発します。爆発する前に投げた方がよさそうです。"

#. ~ "menu_text" action message of item "sling-ready small homemade grenade"
#. ~ "menu_text" action message of item "sling-ready homemade grenade"
#. ~ "menu_text" action message of item "sling-ready military explosive small
#. homemade grenade"
#. ~ "menu_text" action message of item "sling-ready military explosive
#. homemade grenade"
#. ~ "menu_text" action message of item "dynamite"
#. ~ "menu_text" action message of item "dynamite bomb"
#. ~ "menu_text" action message of item "military explosive small homemade
#. grenade"
#. ~ "menu_text" action message of item "military explosive homemade grenade"
#. ~ "menu_text" action message of item "small homemade grenade"
#. ~ "menu_text" action message of item "homemade grenade"
#. ~ "menu_text" action message of item "pipebomb"
#. ~ "menu_text" action message of item "homemade bomb"
#. ~ "menu_text" action message of item "homemade demolition charge"
#: data/json/items/ammo/sling-ready_grenade.json
#: data/json/items/tool/explosives.json
msgid "Light fuse"
msgstr "点火する"

#. ~ "msg" action message of item "sling-ready small homemade grenade"
#. ~ "msg" action message of item "sling-ready homemade grenade"
#. ~ "msg" action message of item "sling-ready military explosive small
#. homemade grenade"
#. ~ "msg" action message of item "sling-ready military explosive homemade
#. grenade"
#: data/json/items/ammo/sling-ready_grenade.json
msgid ""
"You light the retaining fuse on the improvised grenade.  Throw it before it "
"blows in your face!"
msgstr "自作手榴弾に火をつけました。吹っ飛ばされる前に投げましょう！"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/ammo/sling-ready_grenade.json
msgid "sling-ready homemade grenade"
msgid_plural "sling-ready homemade grenades"
msgstr[0] "投石杖用自作手榴弾"

#. ~ Description of "sling-ready homemade grenade"
#: data/json/items/ammo/sling-ready_grenade.json
msgid ""
"An improvised explosive device cobbled together from spare parts, modified "
"with a retaining fuse for use in a staff sling with a modified cradle.  To "
"throw this item without a sling, use it to snap the fuse and activate the "
"grenade.  You will then have 5 seconds before it explodes; throwing it would"
" be a good idea."
msgstr ""
"ホルダーを改造した投石杖を使って飛ばせる、余った部品を組み合わせて作った即席の爆発物です。投石杖がなくても信管を起動することはできますが、その場合5秒後に爆発します。爆発する前に投げた方がよさそうです。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/ammo/sling-ready_grenade.json
msgid "sling-ready military explosive small homemade grenade"
msgid_plural "sling-ready military explosive small homemade grenades"
msgstr[0] "投石杖用改造小型手榴弾"

#. ~ Description of "sling-ready military explosive small homemade grenade"
#: data/json/items/ammo/sling-ready_grenade.json
msgid ""
"An improvised explosive device cobbled together from parts, modified with a "
"retaining fuse for use in a staff sling.  To throw this item without a "
"sling, use it to snap the fuse and activate the grenade.  You will then have"
" some amount of time before it explodes; throwing it would be a good idea."
msgstr ""
"投石杖を使って飛ばせる、部品を組み合わせて作った即席の爆発物です。投石杖がなくても信管を起動することはできますが、数秒後には爆発します。爆発する前に投げた方がよさそうです。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/ammo/sling-ready_grenade.json
msgid "sling-ready military explosive homemade grenade"
msgid_plural "sling-ready military explosive homemade grenades"
msgstr[0] "投石杖用改造手榴弾"

#. ~ Description of "sling-ready military explosive homemade grenade"
#: data/json/items/ammo/sling-ready_grenade.json
msgid ""
"An improvised explosive device cobbled together from parts, modified with a "
"retaining fuse for use in a staff sling with a modified cradle.  To throw "
"this item without a sling, use it to snap the fuse and activate the grenade."
"  You will then have some amount of time before it explodes; throwing it "
"would be a good idea."
msgstr ""
"ホルダーを改造した投石杖を使って飛ばせる、部品を組み合わせて作った即席の爆発物です。投石杖がなくても信管を起動することはできますが、数秒後には爆発します。爆発する前に投げた方がよさそうです。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/ammo/weldgas.json
msgid "oxyacetylene"
msgid_plural "oxyacetylene"
msgstr[0] "オキシアセチレン"

#. ~ Description of "oxyacetylene"
#: data/json/items/ammo/weldgas.json
msgid ""
"Pressurized, dangerous acetylene gas.  Can be used for welding or cutting "
"with a torch."
msgstr "加圧された危険なアセチレンガスです。バーナーがあれば溶接や切断に使えます。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/ammo/weldgas.json
msgid "welding rod"
msgid_plural "welding rods"
msgstr[0] "溶接棒"

#. ~ Description of "welding rod"
#: data/json/items/ammo/weldgas.json
msgid ""
"A length of coated welding electrode - a 3 mm thick steel rod coated in a "
"special flux.  During the welding process, the hot metal of the electrode "
"fills the seam, jointing parts together while the flux protects the surface "
"of the seam from atmospheric gases and rapid cooling.  Required for arc "
"welding."
msgstr ""
"被覆アーク溶接棒、簡単に言えば特殊な被覆剤でコーティングされた直径3mmの鋼鉄製の棒です。溶接過程で熱された溶接棒が溶け出して溶接部と一体化し、空気や急冷による劣化から溶接部を保護します。アーク溶接作業に必要な工具です。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/ammo/weldgas.json
msgid "aluminum welding rod"
msgid_plural "aluminum welding rods"
msgstr[0] "アルミニウム溶接棒"

#. ~ Description of "aluminum welding rod"
#: data/json/items/ammo/weldgas.json
msgid ""
"A length of coated welding electrode - a 3.2 mm thick aluminum rod coated in"
" a special protective flux.  Required for arc welding aluminum alloys."
msgstr ""
"被覆アーク溶接棒、簡単に言えば特殊な被覆材でコーティングされた直径3.2mmのアルミニウム製の棒です。アルミニウム合金のアーク溶接作業に必要な工具です。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/ammo/weldgas.json
msgid "welding wire"
msgid_plural "welding wires"
msgstr[0] "溶接ワイヤー"

#. ~ Description of "welding wire"
#: data/json/items/ammo/weldgas.json
msgid "A length of 0.8 mm steel wire for MAG welding."
msgstr "MAG溶接で用いる直径0.8mmの鋼鉄製のワイヤーです。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/ammo/weldgas.json
msgid "aluminum welding wire"
msgid_plural "aluminum welding wires"
msgstr[0] "アルミニウム溶接ワイヤー"

#. ~ Description of "aluminum welding wire"
#: data/json/items/ammo/weldgas.json
msgid "A length of 0.9 mm aluminum wire for MIG welding."
msgstr "MIG溶接で用いる直径0.9mmのアルミニウム製のワイヤーです。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/ammo/weldgas.json
msgid "brazing rod"
msgid_plural "brazing rods"
msgstr[0] "ろう付け棒"

#. ~ Description of "brazing rod"
#: data/json/items/ammo/weldgas.json
msgid "A length of 3.2 mm flux-coated bronze rod, for brazing steel."
msgstr "鋼鉄のろう付けに用いる、融剤でコーティングされた直径3.2mmの青銅製の棒です。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/ammo/weldgas.json
msgid "aluminum brazing rod"
msgid_plural "aluminum brazing rods"
msgstr[0] "アルミニウムろう付け棒"

#. ~ Description of "aluminum brazing rod"
#: data/json/items/ammo/weldgas.json
msgid ""
"A length of 3.2 mm aluminum rod, for brazing aluminum alloys.  Also suitable"
" for TIG welding."
msgstr "アルミニウム合金のろう付けに用いる、直径3.2mmのアルミニウム製の棒です。 TIG溶接にも適しています。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/appliances/appliances_refrigeration.json
msgid "household fridge"
msgid_plural "household fridges"
msgstr[0] "家庭用冷蔵庫"

#. ~ Description of "household fridge"
#: data/json/items/appliances/appliances_refrigeration.json
msgid ""
"A disconnected household refrigerator.  General choice to store some "
"perishables for an average family.  Activate to deploy and connect to your "
"electric grid."
msgstr "設置していない状態の家庭用冷蔵庫です。生鮮食品を保管するための、一般家庭向けの家電製品です。使用すると設置して電気配線に接続します。"

#. ~ Description of "minifridge"
#: data/json/items/appliances/appliances_refrigeration.json
msgid ""
"A disconnected minifridge, similar to ones in some luxury limousines.  "
"Activate to deploy and connect to your electric grid."
msgstr "高級リムジンに搭載されているようなタイプの、接続されていない小型冷蔵庫です。使用すると設置して電気配線に接続します。"

#. ~ Description of "food truck fridge"
#: data/json/items/appliances/appliances_refrigeration.json
msgid ""
"A heavy and bulky fridge with little wheels for easier transportation.  Has "
"a bunch of sections and separators, which allow it to be installed in a "
"vehicle with relative assurance that any items inside will stay put.  "
"Activate to deploy and connect to your electric grid."
msgstr ""
"移動用に小さな車輪が付いている、重く大きな冷蔵庫です。内部は多数の仕切りで区分けされており、車に設置して運んでも中身を比較的しっかりと固定できます。使用すると設置して電気配線に接続します。"

#. ~ Description of "single glass door fridge"
#: data/json/items/appliances/appliances_refrigeration.json
msgid ""
"A disconnected commercial refrigerator with a transparent glass door, "
"designed to show off any cold drinks and similar goods in a grocery store "
"while still keeping them cool.  Activate to deploy and connect to your "
"electric grid."
msgstr ""
"透明なガラスドアが付いた、接続されていない状態の業務用冷蔵庫です。食料品店で飲み物などを冷やした状態で陳列できます。使用すると設置して電気配線に接続します。"

#. ~ Description of "double glass door fridge"
#: data/json/items/appliances/appliances_refrigeration.json
msgid ""
"A disconnected commercial refrigerator with two transparent glass doors, "
"designed to show off any cold drinks and similar goods in a grocery store "
"while still keeping them cool.  Activate to deploy and connect to your "
"electric grid."
msgstr ""
"2枚の透明なガラスドアが付いた、接続されていない状態の業務用冷蔵庫です。食料品店で飲み物などを冷やした状態で陳列できます。使用すると設置して電気配線に接続します。"

#. ~ Description of "heavy-duty fridge"
#: data/json/items/appliances/appliances_refrigeration.json
msgid ""
"A disconnected commercial refrigerator, used in many professional kitchens."
"  Activate to deploy and connect to your electric grid."
msgstr "店舗の厨房でよく使われている、接続されていない状態の業務用冷蔵庫です。使用すると設置して電気配線に接続します。"

#. ~ Description of "display fridge"
#: data/json/items/appliances/appliances_refrigeration.json
msgid ""
"A big glass chamber, designed to display different food in a multiple rows, "
"while cooling it at the same time.  While you might not need to actually "
"display any of your food, it cools the food as good as any another fridge.  "
"Activate to deploy and connect to your electric grid."
msgstr ""
"ガラスドアが付いた大型の冷蔵ショーケースです。様々な食品を冷やした状態で複数の列に陳列することができます。実際に食品を綺麗に並べる機会はなさそうですが、一般的な冷蔵庫と同じように機能します。使用すると設置して電気配線に接続します。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/appliances/appliances_refrigeration.json
msgid "household freezer"
msgid_plural "household freezers"
msgstr[0] "家庭用冷凍庫"

#. ~ Description of "household freezer"
#: data/json/items/appliances/appliances_refrigeration.json
msgid ""
"A disconnected household freezer.  Great choice if you need to freeze some "
"discount meat.  Activate to deploy and connect to your electric grid."
msgstr "接続されていない状態の家庭用冷凍庫です。お値打ち価格の肉を保存したいときに活躍します。使用すると設置して電気配線に接続します。"

#. ~ Description of "minifreezer"
#: data/json/items/appliances/appliances_refrigeration.json
msgid ""
"A compact version of an upright freezer, designed as a mobile solution for "
"freezing food.  Activate to deploy and connect to your electric grid."
msgstr "持ち運び可能な食品冷凍手段として使われる、小型の冷凍庫です。調べると電気配線に接続します。"

#. ~ Description of "chest minifreezer"
#: data/json/items/appliances/appliances_refrigeration.json
msgid ""
"A compact version of a chest freezer, designed as a mobile solution for "
"freezing food, but it's pretty tricky to pull anything out from the bottom."
"  Perfect choice to put in your closet and forget for a year.  Activate to "
"deploy and connect to your electric grid."
msgstr ""
"小型の冷凍ストッカーです。車両内で食品を冷凍保存する手段ではありますが、底から目当ての品を掘り出すのはかなり大変なので、入れっぱなしで一年ほど忘れておくのがいいでしょう。使用すると設置して電気配線に接続します。"

#. ~ Description of "food truck freezer"
#: data/json/items/appliances/appliances_refrigeration.json
msgid ""
"A heavy and bulky freezer with little wheels for easier transportation.  Has"
" a bunch of sections and separators, which allow it to be installed in a "
"vehicle with relative assurance that any items inside will stay put.  "
"Activate to deploy and connect to your electric grid."
msgstr ""
"移動用に小さな車輪が付いている、重く大きな冷凍庫です。内部は多数の仕切りで区分けされており、車に設置して運んでも中身を比較的しっかりと固定できます。使用すると設置して電気配線に接続します。"

#. ~ Description of "chest freezer"
#: data/json/items/appliances/appliances_refrigeration.json
msgid ""
"A hefty chest freezer, designed to store plenty of perishables for a "
"minuscule amount of power.  Activate to deploy and connect to your electric "
"grid."
msgstr "わずかな電力で生鮮食品をたっぷり保存できる大型冷凍ストッカーです。使用すると設置して電気配線に接続します。"

#. ~ Description of "heavy-duty freezer"
#: data/json/items/appliances/appliances_refrigeration.json
msgid ""
"A heavy-duty upright freezer.  Big as a closet, heavy as a tank, can "
"probably fit enough meat to feed a little colony for a week, but consumes "
"power like no other.  Activate to deploy and connect to your electric grid."
msgstr ""
"縦長の業務用冷凍庫です。クローゼット並みに大きく、戦車並みに重く、小集団であれば一週間は養える量の肉を保存できますが、消費電力は並の冷凍庫の比ではありません。使用すると設置して電気配線に接続します。"

#. ~ Description of "glass door freezer"
#: data/json/items/appliances/appliances_refrigeration.json
msgid ""
"A disconnected commercial freezer with a glass door, used to present "
"different frozen goods.  Activate to deploy and connect to your electric "
"grid."
msgstr "様々な冷凍食品の陳列に使われる、ガラスドアが付いた設置されていない業務用冷凍庫です。使用すると設置して電気配線に接続します。"

#. ~ Description of "display freezer"
#: data/json/items/appliances/appliances_refrigeration.json
msgid ""
"A disconnected commercial chest freezer with a glass lid.  Activate to "
"deploy and connect to your electric grid."
msgstr "ガラス蓋が付いた、設置していない状態の業務用冷凍ショーケースです。使用すると設置して電気配線に接続します。"

#. ~ Name of effect type id "artifact_teleportitis_aura"
#: data/json/items/armor/altered_object_auras.json
msgid "Strange Pressure"
msgstr "奇妙な圧迫感"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Strange Pressure"
#: data/json/items/armor/altered_object_auras.json
msgid "You feel a strange force pressing you inwards and inside-out"
msgstr "肉体の内と外が反転してしまいそうな、奇妙な圧力を感じます。"

#. ~ Name of effect type id "artifact_slow_aura"
#: data/json/items/armor/altered_object_auras.json
msgid "Temporal Distortion"
msgstr "時空の歪み"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Temporal Distortion"
#: data/json/items/armor/altered_object_auras.json
msgid "A slight temporal distortion appears to be centered around you"
msgstr "わずかな歪みが一時的に周囲に集まっているような気がします。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/ammo_pouch.json
#: data/mods/Generic_Guns/bandoliers/bandolier.json
msgid "ammo pouch"
msgid_plural "ammo pouches"
msgstr[0] "弾倉ポーチ"

#. ~ Description of "ammo pouch"
#: data/json/items/armor/ammo_pouch.json
msgid ""
"A small pouch that can be used to store most types of small ammunition; "
"rockets, however, will not fit.  Use insert to store ammunition."
msgstr "ほぼあらゆるの種類の小型弾薬を収納できる小さなポーチです。ただし、ロケット弾は入りません。使用すると弾薬を収納します。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/ammo_pouch.json
msgid "ammo satchel"
msgid_plural "ammo satchels"
msgstr[0] "弾倉鞄"

#. ~ Description of "ammo satchel"
#: data/json/items/armor/ammo_pouch.json
msgid ""
"A fabric ammo bag worn at the waist.  It is capable of holding a single "
"large magazine close at hand."
msgstr "腰に取り付ける布製の弾倉鞄です。取り出しやすい位置に大型の弾倉を1個収納しておけます。"

#. ~ "holster_msg" action message of item "ammo satchel"
#. ~ "holster_msg" action message of item "chest ammo pouch"
#. ~ "holster_msg" action message of item "chest rig"
#. ~ "holster_msg" action message of item "javelin bag"
#. ~ "holster_msg" action message of item "ankle ammo pouch"
#. ~ "holster_msg" action message of item "leg ammo pouch"
#. ~ "holster_msg" action message of item "tac vest"
#. ~ "holster_msg" action message of item "leather ammo satchel"
#. ~ "holster_msg" action message of item "leather chest ammo pouch"
#. ~ "holster_msg" action message of item "large grenade pouch"
#. ~ "holster_msg" action message of item "combat wetsuit"
#. ~ "holster_msg" action message of item "HERC rig"
#. ~ "holster_msg" action message of item "U7s ammo satchel"
