msgid ""
"The original owner has decorated this thing with an excessive number of "
"patches; inane slogans, political punch lines, and cartoon characters making"
" bedroom eyes are plastered all over the front."
msgstr "寝ぼけた目をした漫画のキャラクターや意味不明なスローガン、政治風刺など、以前の持ち主が貼り付けたらしき大量のワッペンが前面を覆っています。"

#. ~ Description of a pocket in item "light ballistic vest (mag pouches)"
#: data/json/items/armor/ballistic_armor.json
