msgid_plural "light ballistic vests (storage pouch)"
msgstr[0] "ポーチ付き軽装防弾ベスト"

#. ~ Description of "light ballistic vest (storage pouch)"
#: data/json/items/armor/ballistic_armor.json
msgid ""
"A simple plate carrier covering the thorax, with front and back pockets for "
"armor plates.  Designed to keep your organs from being perforated by small-"
"arms fire.  This version has a small pouch on the front to store stuff."
msgstr ""
"胸部のみを覆うシンプルな防弾ベストです。前後にプレートを収納するポケットが付いており、小口径の銃撃から臓器を守るように設計されています。前面に道具を収納できる小さなポーチが付属しています。"

#. ~ Variant name of item "light ballistic vest (storage pouch)"
