msgid "Low-profile zipper storage pouch."
msgstr "ファスナーが付いた小型ポーチです。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/ballistic_armor.json
msgid "light ballistic vest (shoulder pouch)"
msgid_plural "light ballistic vests (shoulder pouch)"
msgstr[0] "肩ポーチ付き軽装防弾ベスト"

#. ~ Description of "light ballistic vest (shoulder pouch)"
#: data/json/items/armor/ballistic_armor.json
msgid ""
"A simple plate carrier covering the thorax, with front and back pockets for "
"armor plates.  Designed to keep your organs from being perforated by small-"
"arms fire.  This version has a shoulder-mounted pouch for a radio and a hook"
" on the front for a glowstick."
msgstr ""
"胸部のみを覆うシンプルな防弾ベストです。前後にプレートを収納するポケットが付いており、小口径の銃撃から臓器を守るように設計されています。肩に無線機用ポーチが付属しており、前面のフックにはケミカルライトを収納できます。"

#. ~ Variant name of item "light ballistic vest (shoulder pouch)"
#: data/json/items/armor/ballistic_armor.json
