msgstr "ケミカルライトを留めるフックです。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/ballistic_armor.json
msgid "stab vest"
msgid_plural "stab vests"
msgstr[0] "防刃ベスト"

#. ~ Description of "stab vest"
#: data/json/items/armor/ballistic_armor.json
msgid "A simple Level II protection vest."
msgstr "NIJの防刃規格レベルIIに分類される、シンプルなベストです。"

#. ~ Variant name of item "stab vest"
#: data/json/items/armor/ballistic_armor.json
msgid "security stab vest"
msgid_plural "security stab vests"
msgstr[0] "防刃ベスト(警備員)"

#. ~ Description of variant "security stab vest" of item "stab vest"
#: data/json/items/armor/ballistic_armor.json
msgid ""
"A slim security vest used by mall cops.  Its protection is mostly meant to "
"extend to knives and not actual bullets, but at least it kept insurance "
"costs down.  It has \"SECURITY\" written on the front lapel and across the "
"back, and features a pocket for a notebook and pen."
msgstr ""
"ショッピングモールの警備員が使っている、薄手の防刃ベストです。ナイフはともかく実弾を防ぐほど強靭ではありませんが、少なくとも医療費を安く抑えられる程度の保護性能はあります。正面と背面に「SECURITY」と表記してあり、手帳やペンが入るポケットも付いています。"

#. ~ Variant name of item "stab vest"
#: data/json/items/armor/ballistic_armor.json
msgid "airsoft vest"
msgid_plural "airsoft vests"
msgstr[0] "防刃ベスト(ｻﾊﾞｲﾊﾞﾙｹﾞｰﾑ)"

#. ~ Description of variant "airsoft vest" of item "stab vest"
#: data/json/items/armor/ballistic_armor.json
msgid ""
"A low-cost tactical vest styled in black camouflage, used in cosplay and "
"airsoft.  It'll let you shrug off airsoft pellets like a badass, but its "
"protection is mediocre against anything that's actually dangerous.  It "
"sports several small pouches, and includes touch fasteners to attach "
"identifying patches."
msgstr ""
"コスプレやサバイバルゲームで活躍する、暗い迷彩柄の安価な防刃ベストです。BB弾程度なら防げますが、本当に危険な攻撃に対してはあまり信用できません。複数の小さなポーチと、チームワッペンを貼り付けられる面ファスナーが付属しています。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/ballistic_armor.json
msgid "soft armor vest"
msgid_plural "soft armor vests"
msgstr[0] "軟質防弾ベスト"

#. ~ Description of "soft armor vest"
#: data/json/items/armor/ballistic_armor.json
msgid "A simple soft armor ballistic vest."
msgstr "シンプルな軟質防弾ベストです。"

#. ~ Variant name of item "soft armor vest"
#: data/json/items/armor/ballistic_armor.json
msgid "security ballistic vest"
msgid_plural "security ballistic vests"
msgstr[0] "軟質防弾ベスト(警備員)"

#. ~ Description of variant "security ballistic vest" of item "soft armor
#. vest"
#: data/json/items/armor/ballistic_armor.json
msgid ""
"A lightweight black vest used by private security, covering the chest and "
"most of the abdomen.  Soft armor plates sealed inside the fabric provide "
"solid defense against shrapnel and small-caliber rounds.  \"SECURITY\" is "
"emblazoned on the front lapel and across the back, and it features a pocket "
"for a notebook and pen."
msgstr ""
"民間警備会社で支給される、胸部と腹部の大部分を覆う黒色の軽量ベストです。生地の内側に軟質プレートが入っており、榴散弾や小口径弾に対して強固な防御力を発揮します。正面と背面に「SECURITY」と表記してあり、手帳やペンが入るポケットも付いています。"

#. ~ Variant name of item "soft armor vest"
#: data/json/items/armor/ballistic_armor.json
msgid "press ballistic vest"
msgid_plural "press ballistic vests"
msgstr[0] "軟質防弾ベスト(記者)"

#. ~ Description of variant "press ballistic vest" of item "soft armor vest"
#: data/json/items/armor/ballistic_armor.json
msgid ""
"Colored a distinctive navy blue and with a flared collar extending up to the"
" chin, this soft body armor was once used by news crews reporting from "
"combat zones.  It provides good protection from shrapnel, and to a lesser "
"degree, low-caliber bullets.  \"PRESS\" is emblazoned prominently on the "
"front lapel and across the back, and it features a pocket for a notebook and"
" pen."
msgstr ""
"独特のネイビーブルーのデザインと顎まで覆う長い襟が特徴的な、戦闘地域で報道関係者が着用する軟質ボディアーマーです。榴散弾や小口径の銃弾程度は防ぎきる性能があります。正面と背面に大きく「PRESS」と表記してあり、手帳やペンが入るポケットも付いています。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/ballistic_armor.json
msgid "hard armor vest"
msgid_plural "hard armor vests"
msgstr[0] "硬質防弾ベスト"

#. ~ Description of "hard armor vest"
#: data/json/items/armor/ballistic_armor.json
msgid ""
"Armored panels give this vest solid defense against small caliber firearms, "
"and front and back pockets for hard armor panels give protection from higher"
" calibers."
msgstr ""
"本体の装甲は小口径の銃器に対して強い防御力を発揮します。前後のポケットに硬質アーマープレートを収納しておけば、より大口径の銃器に対しても有効です。"

#. ~ Variant name of item "hard armor vest"
#: data/json/items/armor/ballistic_armor.json
msgid "humanitarian ballistic vest"
msgid_plural "humanitarian ballistic vests"
msgstr[0] "硬質防弾ベスト(人道支援)"

#. ~ Description of variant "humanitarian ballistic vest" of item "hard armor
#. vest"
#: data/json/items/armor/ballistic_armor.json
msgid ""
"Bright blue in color, this slim armor vest was used by volunteers and "
"officials from humanitarian groups during the first days of the Cataclysm "
"before order broke down completely.  \"FEMA\" is written on the front lapel "
"and across the back."
msgstr ""
"大変動の最初の数日間、秩序が完全に崩壊するまでボランティア団体や人道支援団体が使っていた、鮮やかな青色をした薄手の防弾ベストです。正面と背面に「FEMA」と表記してあります。"

#. ~ Variant name of item "hard armor vest"
#: data/json/items/armor/ballistic_armor.json
msgid "police ballistic vest"
msgid_plural "police ballistic vests"
msgstr[0] "硬質防弾ベスト(警察)"

#. ~ Description of variant "police ballistic vest" of item "hard armor vest"
#: data/json/items/armor/ballistic_armor.json
msgid ""
"This charcoal-colored body armor was once a common sight on police officers,"
" and it provides adequate protection against small-caliber firearms in "
"addition to featuring pouches to hold armor inserts.  \"POLICE\" is written "
"on the front lapel and across the back."
msgstr ""
"警察官がよく着用していた、チャコールグレーの防弾ベストです。小口径の銃弾に対する十分な防御力がありますが、付属のポケットにプレートを収納することが可能です。正面と背面に「POLICE」と表記してあります。"

#. ~ Variant name of item "hard armor vest"
#: data/json/items/armor/ballistic_armor.json
msgid "National Guard ballistic vest"
msgid_plural "National Guard ballistic vests"
msgstr[0] "硬質防弾ベスト(州兵)"

#. ~ Description of variant "National Guard ballistic vest" of item "hard
#. armor vest"
#: data/json/items/armor/ballistic_armor.json
msgid ""
"Styled in urban camo, this ballistic vest was issued to soldiers, and as "
"things got worse, to volunteers as well.  It was designed to stand out after"
" the chaos of the riots; \"US ARMY\" is emblazoned on the front lapel next "
"to a patch of the United States flag, and \"NATIONAL GUARD\" is written "
"across the back."
msgstr ""
"兵士に加えて、事態が悪化した頃には志願兵にも支給された、都市迷彩柄の防弾ベストです。正面には星条旗と「US ARMY」の文字、背面には「NATIONAL"
" GUARD」の文字が表記されており、暴動の混乱の中でも目立つデザインになっています。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/ballistic_armor.json
msgid "dragon skin vest"
msgid_plural "dragon skin vests"
msgstr[0] "ドラゴンスキンベスト"

#. ~ Description of "dragon skin vest"
#: data/json/items/armor/ballistic_armor.json
msgid ""
"This type of ballistic vest once promised to be the future of body armor, claiming to allow a greater range of movement than conventional ballistic vests as well as better protection.  Created by the now-defunct company Meridian Ballistics, it features a unique design consisting of overlapping ceramic disks, and was once famously demonstrated on TV absorbing high-energy rifle rounds at point blank.\n"
"\n"
"The US Army quickly snapped up several hundred units of the armor, but testing soon revealed that they were extremely heavy, weighing almost fifty pounds, and that the design failed spectacularly in environmental tests.  After a series of investigations, claims of fraud, and court hearings, Meridian went bankrupt, and the Department of Justice subsequently dropped this design from its certifications.\n"
"\n"
"There were no known users of these vests by the time that the world ended; this one was either an original production in the hands of a collector, or a similar design from a different company.  Whatever the case may be, you have one now, in all its unwieldy glory."
msgstr ""
"従来の防弾ベストよりも可動域が広く防御力も高いことから、次世代の防弾装備として期待されていた防具です。今は亡きMeridian Ballistics社が開発したこのベストは、セラミック製のディスクを重ねた独自のデザインが特徴であり、至近距離から発射された高威力のライフル弾を無効化する様子がテレビで放映されたこともありました。\n"
"\n"
"アメリカ陸軍はこの防具をすぐに数百単位購入しましたが、間もなくして重量が20kg以上あることが判明し、実地試験でも防具が役に立つことはありませんでした。その後、監査や不正の告発、裁判などが相次いだことでMeridian Ballistics社は倒産し、司法省はこの防具をNIJ規格から外しました。\n"
"\n"
"このベストはコレクターの手に渡ったオリジナル製品か、もしくは他社製の類似品でしょう。いずれにせよ、このベストはその扱い辛さ故にここまでたどり着いたのです。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/ballistic_armor.json
msgid "ballistic vest"
msgid_plural "ballistic vests"
msgstr[0] "防弾ベスト"

#. ~ Description of "ballistic vest"
#: data/json/items/armor/ballistic_armor.json
msgid ""
"An enormous handmade ballistic vest built with of lots of salvaged ballistic"
" Kevlar panels.  It's bulkier than a factory made US Army vest, but it is "
"customized for the benefit of an abnormally large mutant who couldn't wear "
"such armors otherwise.  Coated in MOLLE webbing to support modular loadouts "
"for the tacticool mutant.  It could be outfitted with steel plates for "
"further protection."
msgstr ""
"ケブラー製防弾パネルを大量に集めて作った巨大な防弾ベストです。大量生産されたアメリカ軍のベストよりも嵩張りますが、この種の防具を着用できない異常に大きな変異体でも利用できるようにカスタマイズされています。MOLLEウェビングがあちこちに付いており、ミリタリー趣味の変異体が装備品を持ち歩くのに役立ちます。鋼鉄製防弾プレートを組み込めば、防御力は更に向上します。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/ballistic_armor.json
msgid "ballistic vest (mild steel plates)"
msgid_plural "ballistic vests (mild steel plates)"
msgstr[0] "防弾ベスト(低炭素鋼)"

#. ~ Description of "ballistic vest (mild steel plates)"
#: data/json/items/armor/ballistic_armor.json
msgid ""
"An enormous handmade ballistic vest built with lots of salvaged ballistic "
"Kevlar panels and homemade \"ballistic inserts\" made of mild steel.  The "
"thin metal isn't the most protective, but it's probably better than just "
"plain Kevlar."
msgstr ""
"ケブラー製防弾パネルを大量に集め、低炭素鋼製の自作「防弾プレート」と組み合わせて作った、巨大な防弾ベストです。プレートは薄く最高の防御力は望めませんが、ケブラー生地単体よりはマシになっている筈です。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/ballistic_armor.json
msgid "ballistic vest (tempered steel plates)"
msgid_plural "ballistic vests (tempered steel plates)"
msgstr[0] "防弾ベスト(焼戻炭素鋼)"

#. ~ Description of "ballistic vest (tempered steel plates)"
#: data/json/items/armor/ballistic_armor.json
msgid ""
"An enormous handmade ballistic vest made of lots of salvaged ballistic "
"Kevlar panels and ten NIJ IIIA plates inserted into custom-made pockets - "
"four each for your front and back and one each for your sides.  Monstrously "
"heavy but extremely protective."
msgstr ""
"ケブラー製防弾パネルを大量に集め、10枚のNIJ "
"IIIAレベルのプレートをベストの前後に4枚ずつ、側面に1枚ずつ専用ポケットに組み込んで作った、巨大な防弾ベストです。とんでもない重量ですが、非常に防御力が高いです。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/ballistic_armor.json
msgid "pair of ballistic shoulder protectors"
msgid_plural "pairs of ballistic shoulder protectors"
msgstr[0] "肩用防弾プロテクター"

#. ~ Description of "pair of ballistic shoulder protectors"
#: data/json/items/armor/ballistic_armor.json
msgid ""
"Nylon armor with soft armor inserts protecting the deltoid and upper arm.  "
"Designed to be attached to heavy military body armor."
msgstr "肩と上腕部を柔らかい素材で覆って守る、ナイロン製の防具です。軍用重装ボディアーマーと併せて着用できる作りになっています。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/ballistic_armor.json
msgid "ballistic groin protector"
msgid_plural "ballistic groin protectors"
msgstr[0] "腰用防弾プロテクター"

#. ~ Description of "ballistic groin protector"
#: data/json/items/armor/ballistic_armor.json
msgid ""
"Front and back nylon armor with soft armor inserts for groin and butt "
"protection.  Designed to be attached to heavy military body armor."
msgstr "腰全体を保護する軟性アーマープレートを収納できる、ナイロン製の防具です。軍用重装ボディアーマーと併せて着用できる作りになっています。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/ballistic_armor.json
msgid "ballistic collar"
msgid_plural "ballistic collars"
msgstr[0] "首用防弾プロテクター"

#. ~ Description of "ballistic collar"
#: data/json/items/armor/ballistic_armor.json
msgid ""
"Front and back nylon collar assemblies with soft armor inserts for neck "
"protection.  Designed to be attached to heavy military body armor."
msgstr "首を保護する軟性アーマープレートを収納できる、ナイロン製の防具です。軍用重装ボディアーマーと併せて着用できる作りになっています。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/bandolier.json
#: data/mods/Generic_Guns/bandoliers/bandolier.json
msgid "pistol bandolier"
msgid_plural "pistol bandoliers"
msgstr[0] "拳銃弾ベルト"

#. ~ Description of "pistol bandolier"
#: data/json/items/armor/bandolier.json
msgid ""
"An embroidered leather bandolier for keeping pistol cartridges close to "
"hand.  If this doesn't make you feel like a cowboy, nothing will."
msgstr "取り出しやすい位置に拳銃の弾薬を常備できる革製のベルトです。空のまま着けていてもカウボーイにはなれません。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/bandolier.json
#: data/mods/Generic_Guns/bandoliers/bandolier.json
msgid "rifle bandolier"
msgid_plural "rifle bandoliers"
msgstr[0] "ライフル弾ベルト"

#. ~ Description of "rifle bandolier"
#: data/json/items/armor/bandolier.json
msgid "A leather bandolier for keeping rifle cartridges close to hand."
msgstr "取り出しやすい位置にライフルの弾薬を常備できる革製のベルトです。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/bandolier.json
#: data/mods/Generic_Guns/bandoliers/bandolier.json
msgid "waist shotgun bandolier"
msgid_plural "waist shotgun bandoliers"
msgstr[0] "ショットガン弾ベルト"

#. ~ Description of "waist shotgun bandolier"
#: data/json/items/armor/bandolier.json
msgid ""
"A leather bandolier worn around the waist for keeping shotgun shells close "
"to hand."
