msgstr "赤色、白色、青色で横に三分されている旗です。"

#. ~ Variant name of item "national flag"
#: data/json/items/armor/cloaks.json
msgid "New Zealand flag"
msgid_plural "New Zealand flags"
msgstr[0] "国旗(ﾆｭｰｼﾞｰﾗﾝﾄﾞ)"

#. ~ Description of variant "New Zealand flag" of item "national flag"
#: data/json/items/armor/cloaks.json
msgid ""
"A flag that features a blue ensign with a Union Jack in the first quarter "
"and four five-pointed red stars with white borders on the fly."
msgstr "青色の旗の左上にユニオンジャック、右側に白色で縁取られた4つの赤色の星が描かれています。"

#. ~ Variant name of item "national flag"
#: data/json/items/armor/cloaks.json
