" vertical white stripe at the hoist."
msgstr "濃い緑色の旗に白色で星と三日月が描かれており、左側に白色の縦帯が入っています。"

#. ~ Variant name of item "national flag"
#: data/json/items/armor/cloaks.json
msgid "Palauan flag"
msgid_plural "Palauan flags"
msgstr[0] "国旗(ﾊﾟﾗｵ)"

#. ~ Description of variant "Palauan flag" of item "national flag"
#: data/json/items/armor/cloaks.json
