msgid_plural "Panamanian flags"
msgstr[0] "国旗(ﾊﾟﾅﾏ)"

#. ~ Description of variant "Panamanian flag" of item "national flag"
#: data/json/items/armor/cloaks.json
msgid ""
"A flag divided into four rectangles, going clockwise from the top left it "
"features a blue star, a red rectangle, a red star, and a blue rectangle."
msgstr "旗が十字に区切られ、左下は青色、右上は赤色で塗られ、左上には青色の星、右下には赤色の星が描かれています。"

#. ~ Variant name of item "national flag"
#: data/json/items/armor/cloaks.json
msgid "Papuan flag"
msgid_plural "Papuan flags"
msgstr[0] "国旗(ﾊﾟﾌﾟｱﾆｭｰｷﾞﾆｱ)"

#. ~ Description of variant "Papuan flag" of item "national flag"
#: data/json/items/armor/cloaks.json
msgid ""
"A flag divided diagonally from the upper hoist side corner to the lower fly "
"side corner, the upper triangle is red with the soaring raggiana bird and "
"the lower triangle is black with the Southern Cross of four white larger "
"five pointed stars and the smaller star."
msgstr ""
"旗が斜めに区切られており、右上側は赤色、左下側は黒色で塗られています。右上には舞い上がるアカカザリフウチョウ、左下には白色で大きな一つ星と小さな四つ星からなる南十字星が描かれています。"

#. ~ Variant name of item "national flag"
#: data/json/items/armor/cloaks.json
