msgstr "青色、黄色、赤色で横に三分されているシンプルな旗です。"

#. ~ Variant name of item "national flag"
#: data/json/items/armor/cloaks.json
msgid "Rwandan flag"
msgid_plural "Rwandan flags"
msgstr[0] "国旗(ﾙﾜﾝﾀﾞ)"

#. ~ Description of variant "Rwandan flag" of item "national flag"
