"A flag that features a pale triband of blue, gold, and green, with three "
"green diamonds in the center arranged to form a v shape."
msgstr "青色、金色、淡緑色で縦に三分された旗の中央に、3つの緑色のダイヤモンドがV字型に並んでいます。"

#. ~ Variant name of item "national flag"
#: data/json/items/armor/cloaks.json
msgid "Samoan flag"
msgid_plural "Samoan flags"
msgstr[0] "国旗(ｻﾓｱ)"

#. ~ Description of variant "Samoan flag" of item "national flag"
#: data/json/items/armor/cloaks.json
msgid ""
"A flag with a red field and a blue rectangle on the upper hoist side "
"quadrant bearing the Southern Cross of four white larger five pointed stars "
"and the smaller star in the center."
msgstr "赤色の旗の左上が青色で四角形に区切られ、その中に4つの大きな星と1つの小さな星からなる白色の南十字星が描かれています。"

#. ~ Variant name of item "national flag"
#: data/json/items/armor/cloaks.json
msgid "Sammarinese flag"
msgid_plural "Sammarinese flags"
msgstr[0] "国旗(ｻﾝﾏﾘﾉ)"

#. ~ Description of variant "Sammarinese flag" of item "national flag"
#: data/json/items/armor/cloaks.json
msgid ""
"A flag that features a horizontal bicolor of white and light blue; charged "
"with the national coat of arms in the center."
msgstr "白色と水色で横に二分された旗の中央に国の紋章が描かれています。"

#. ~ Variant name of item "national flag"
#: data/json/items/armor/cloaks.json
msgid "Sao Tomean flag"
msgid_plural "Sao Tomean flags"
msgstr[0] "国旗(ｻﾝﾄﾒ･ﾌﾟﾘﾝｼﾍﾟ)"

#. ~ Description of variant "Sao Tomean flag" of item "national flag"
#: data/json/items/armor/cloaks.json
msgid ""
"A horizontal tricolor flag of green, yellow and green with a red triangle "
"based at the hoist and two five pointed black stars of in the yellow stripe."
msgstr "緑色、黄色、緑色で横に三分された旗の左側が赤色で三角形に区切られ、黄色の横帯の中に2つの黒色の星が描かれています。"

#. ~ Variant name of item "national flag"
#: data/json/items/armor/cloaks.json
msgid "Saudi Arabian flag"
msgid_plural "Saudi Arabian flags"
msgstr[0] "国旗(ｻｳｼﾞｱﾗﾋﾞｱ)"

#. ~ Description of variant "Saudi Arabian flag" of item "national flag"
#: data/json/items/armor/cloaks.json
msgid ""
"A flag that features a green field with the shahada or Muslim creed written "
"in the Thuluth script in white above a horizontal sword, having its tip "
"pointed to the left."
msgstr "緑色の旗の中央に先端を左に向けた剣が描かれ、その上にシャハーダと呼ばれるイスラム教の信条を表わす言葉がスルス体で描かれています。"

#. ~ Variant name of item "national flag"
#: data/json/items/armor/cloaks.json
msgid "Senegalese flag"
msgid_plural "Senegalese flags"
msgstr[0] "国旗(ｾﾈｶﾞﾙ)"

#. ~ Description of variant "Senegalese flag" of item "national flag"
#: data/json/items/armor/cloaks.json
msgid ""
"A flag that features a vertical tricolor of green, yellow and red; charged "
"with a green five pointed star at the center."
msgstr "緑色、黄色、赤色で縦に三分された旗の中央に緑色の星が描かれています。"

#. ~ Variant name of item "national flag"
#: data/json/items/armor/cloaks.json
msgid "Serbian flag"
msgid_plural "Serbian flags"
msgstr[0] "国旗(ｾﾙﾋﾞｱ)"

#. ~ Description of variant "Serbian flag" of item "national flag"
#: data/json/items/armor/cloaks.json
msgid ""
"A flag that features a horizontal tricolor of red, blue, and white charged "
"with the lesser coat of arms left of center."
msgstr "赤色、青色、白色で横に三分された旗の中央左側に、国の紋章の一部分が描かれています。"

#. ~ Variant name of item "national flag"
#: data/json/items/armor/cloaks.json
msgid "Seychellois flag"
msgid_plural "Seychellois flags"
msgstr[0] "国旗(ｾｰｼｪﾙ)"

#. ~ Description of variant "Seychellois flag" of item "national flag"
#: data/json/items/armor/cloaks.json
msgid ""
"A flag that features five oblique bands of blue, yellow, red, white, and "
"green radiating from the bottom of the hoist side."
msgstr "旗の左下から青色、黄色、赤色、白色、緑色の帯が放射状に伸びています。"

#. ~ Variant name of item "national flag"
#: data/json/items/armor/cloaks.json
msgid "Sierra Leonean flag"
msgid_plural "Sierra Leonean flags"
msgstr[0] "国旗(ｼｴﾗﾚｵﾈ)"

#. ~ Description of variant "Sierra Leonean flag" of item "national flag"
#: data/json/items/armor/cloaks.json
msgid ""
"A flag that features a horizontal tricolor of light green, white and light "
"blue."
msgstr "薄緑色、白色、水色で横に三分されている旗です。"

#. ~ Variant name of item "national flag"
#: data/json/items/armor/cloaks.json
msgid "Singaporean flag"
msgid_plural "Singaporean flags"
msgstr[0] "国旗(ｼﾝｶﾞﾎﾟｰﾙ)"

#. ~ Description of variant "Singaporean flag" of item "national flag"
#: data/json/items/armor/cloaks.json
msgid ""
"A flag that features a horizontal bicolor of red and white, in the canton is"
" a crescent facing the fly and a pentagon of five stars."
msgstr "赤色と白色で横に二分された旗の左上に、三日月と5つの星が描かれています。"

#. ~ Variant name of item "national flag"
#: data/json/items/armor/cloaks.json
msgid "Slovakian flag"
msgid_plural "Slovakian flags"
msgstr[0] "国旗(ｽﾛﾊﾞｷｱ)"

#. ~ Description of variant "Slovakian flag" of item "national flag"
#: data/json/items/armor/cloaks.json
msgid ""
"A flag that features a horizontal tricolor flag of white, blue, and red; "
"charged with coat of arms at the hoist side."
msgstr "白色、青色、赤色で横に三分された旗の左側に国の紋章が描かれています。"

#. ~ Variant name of item "national flag"
#: data/json/items/armor/cloaks.json
msgid "Slovenian flag"
msgid_plural "Slovenian flags"
msgstr[0] "国旗(ｽﾛﾍﾞﾆｱ)"

#. ~ Description of variant "Slovenian flag" of item "national flag"
#: data/json/items/armor/cloaks.json
msgid ""
"A flag that features a horizontal tricolor flag of white, blue, and red "
"charged with a small coat of arms at the hoist side."
msgstr "白色、青色、赤色で横に三分された旗の左側に国の紋章が小さく描かれています。"

#. ~ Variant name of item "national flag"
#: data/json/items/armor/cloaks.json
msgid "Solomon Islands flag"
msgid_plural "Solomon Islands flags"
msgstr[0] "国旗(ｿﾛﾓﾝ諸島)"

#. ~ Description of variant "Solomon Islands flag" of item "national flag"
#: data/json/items/armor/cloaks.json
msgid ""
"A flag that has a thin, yellow stripe dividing diagonally from the lower "
"hoist side corner to the upper fly side corner, the upper triangle is blue "
"with five white five pointed stars arranged in an x pattern and the lower "
"triangle is green."
msgstr "旗の左下から右上にかけて細い黄色の線が引かれ、左上は青色、右下は緑色で塗られています。左上には5つの白色の星がX字型に並んでいます。"

#. ~ Variant name of item "national flag"
#: data/json/items/armor/cloaks.json
msgid "Somali flag"
msgid_plural "Somali flags"
msgstr[0] "国旗(ｿﾏﾘｱ)"

#. ~ Description of variant "Somali flag" of item "national flag"
#: data/json/items/armor/cloaks.json
msgid ""
"A flag that has a single white five pointed star centered on a cyan field."
msgstr "水色の旗の中央に白色の星が描かれています。"

#. ~ Variant name of item "national flag"
#: data/json/items/armor/cloaks.json
msgid "South African flag"
msgid_plural "South African flags"
msgstr[0] "国旗(南ｱﾌﾘｶ共和国)"

#. ~ Description of variant "South African flag" of item "national flag"
#: data/json/items/armor/cloaks.json
msgid ""
"A horizontal bicolor flag of red and blue with a black isosceles triangle "
"based on the hoist side and a green pall, a central green band that splits "
"into a horizontal Y, centered over the partition lines and was edged in both"
" white against the red and the blue bands and yellow against the triangle, "
"in which the arms of the Y ends at the corners of the hoist and embraces the"
" triangle on the hoist side."
msgstr ""
"赤色と青色で横に二分された旗の左側が、黒色で二等辺三角形に区切られており、各色を分ける横向きのYのような形で緑色の帯が伸びています。三角形は黄色、赤色と青色部分は白色の細い線でそれぞれ縁取られています。"

#. ~ Variant name of item "national flag"
#: data/json/items/armor/cloaks.json
msgid "South Korean flag"
msgid_plural "South Korean flags"
msgstr[0] "国旗(韓国)"

#. ~ Description of variant "South Korean flag" of item "national flag"
#: data/json/items/armor/cloaks.json
msgid ""
"A flag of a white field with a centered red and blue taegeuk surrounded by "
"four trigrams."
msgstr "白色の旗の中央に赤色と青色の太極図が描かれ、それを4つの卦が囲んでいます。"

#. ~ Variant name of item "national flag"
#: data/json/items/armor/cloaks.json
msgid "South Sudan flag"
msgid_plural "South Sudan flags"
msgstr[0] "国旗(南ｽｰﾀﾞﾝ)"

#. ~ Description of variant "South Sudan flag" of item "national flag"
#: data/json/items/armor/cloaks.json
msgid ""
"A horizontal tricolor flag of black, red, and green, fimbriated with white "
"stripes with a blue equilateral triangle based on the hoist side bearing a "
"gold star."
msgstr "黒色、赤色、緑色で横に三分された旗の左側が青色で正三角形に区切られ、横帯の境界は白色の細い線で縁取られています。"

#. ~ Variant name of item "national flag"
#: data/json/items/armor/cloaks.json
msgid "Spanish flag"
msgid_plural "Spanish flags"
msgstr[0] "国旗(ｽﾍﾟｲﾝ)"

#. ~ Description of variant "Spanish flag" of item "national flag"
#: data/json/items/armor/cloaks.json
msgid ""
"A flag that has a horizontal triband flag of red, yellow and red charged "
"with the Spanish coat of arms off centered toward the hoist."
msgstr "赤色、黄色、赤色で横に三分された旗の左側にスペインの紋章が描かれています。"

#. ~ Variant name of item "national flag"
#: data/json/items/armor/cloaks.json
msgid "Sri Lankan flag"
msgid_plural "Sri Lankan flags"
msgstr[0] "国旗(ｽﾘﾗﾝｶ)"

#. ~ Description of variant "Sri Lankan flag" of item "national flag"
#: data/json/items/armor/cloaks.json
msgid ""
"A flag of a golden field with two panels the smaller hoist side panel has "
"only two vertical bands of teal and orange and the larger fly side panel is "
"the maroon field depicting the golden lion holding the kastane sword."
msgstr ""
"金色の旗の左側に青緑色とオレンジ色の長方形が並んでいます。右側はマルーン色に塗られ、その中にカスターネと呼ばれる剣をもつ金色のライオンが描かれています。"

#. ~ Variant name of item "national flag"
#: data/json/items/armor/cloaks.json
msgid "Sudanese flag"
msgid_plural "Sudanese flags"
msgstr[0] "国旗(ｽｰﾀﾞﾝ)"

#. ~ Description of variant "Sudanese flag" of item "national flag"
#: data/json/items/armor/cloaks.json
msgid ""
"A flag that has a horizontal tricolor of red, white, and black with a green "
"triangle based at the hoist."
msgstr "赤色、白色、黒色で横に三分された旗の左側が、緑色で三角形に区切られています。"

#. ~ Variant name of item "national flag"
#: data/json/items/armor/cloaks.json
msgid "Surinamese flag"
msgid_plural "Surinamese flags"
msgstr[0] "国旗(ｽﾘﾅﾑ)"

#. ~ Description of variant "Surinamese flag" of item "national flag"
#: data/json/items/armor/cloaks.json
msgid ""
"A flag that features a horizontal triband of green and red with large white "
"border with the large yellow five pointed star centered on the red band."
msgstr "緑色と赤色で横に三分され、境界を白色で縁取られた旗の中央に、黄色の大きな星が描かれています。"

#. ~ Variant name of item "national flag"
#: data/json/items/armor/cloaks.json
msgid "Swedish flag"
msgid_plural "Swedish flags"
msgstr[0] "国旗(ｽｳｪｰﾃﾞﾝ)"

#. ~ Description of variant "Swedish flag" of item "national flag"
#: data/json/items/armor/cloaks.json
msgid ""
"A flag that features a blue field charged with a yellow Nordic cross that "
"extends to the edges, the vertical part of the cross is shifted to the hoist"
" side."
msgstr "青色の旗に黄色のスカンディナヴィア十字が描かれています。十字の交差地点は少し左側に寄っています。"

#. ~ Variant name of item "national flag"
#: data/json/items/armor/cloaks.json
msgid "Swiss flag"
msgid_plural "Swiss flags"
msgstr[0] "国旗(ｽｲｽ)"

#. ~ Description of variant "Swiss flag" of item "national flag"
#: data/json/items/armor/cloaks.json
msgid "A red square flag with a white cross in the center."
msgstr "赤色の旗の中央に白色の十字が描かれています。"

#. ~ Variant name of item "national flag"
#: data/json/items/armor/cloaks.json
msgid "Syrian flag"
msgid_plural "Syrian flags"
msgstr[0] "国旗(ｼﾘｱ)"

#. ~ Description of variant "Syrian flag" of item "national flag"
#: data/json/items/armor/cloaks.json
msgid ""
"A flag that features a horizontal tricolor of red, white, and black charged "
"with two green stars at the center."
msgstr "赤色、白色、黒色で横に三分された旗の中央に2つの緑色の星が描かれています。"

#. ~ Variant name of item "national flag"
#: data/json/items/armor/cloaks.json
msgid "Taiwanese flag"
msgid_plural "Taiwanese flags"
msgstr[0] "国旗(中華民国)"

#. ~ Description of variant "Taiwanese flag" of item "national flag"
#: data/json/items/armor/cloaks.json
msgid ""
"A flag with a red field and blue canton with a white sun in the canton."
msgstr "赤い旗の左上が青色で四角形に区切られ、その中に白色の太陽が描かれています。"

#. ~ Variant name of item "national flag"
#: data/json/items/armor/cloaks.json
msgid "Tajikistani flag"
msgid_plural "Tajikistani flags"
msgstr[0] "国旗(ﾀｼﾞｷｽﾀﾝ)"

#. ~ Description of variant "Tajikistani flag" of item "national flag"
#: data/json/items/armor/cloaks.json
msgid ""
"A horizontal tricolor flag of red, white, and green, with a yellow crown "
"surmounted by an arc of seven stars at the center."
msgstr "赤色、白色、緑色で横に三分された旗の中央に黄色の冠が描かれ、その上に7つの星が弧状に並んでいます。"

#. ~ Variant name of item "national flag"
#: data/json/items/armor/cloaks.json
msgid "Tanzanian flag"
msgid_plural "Tanzanian flags"
msgstr[0] "国旗(ﾀﾝｻﾞﾆｱ)"

#. ~ Description of variant "Tanzanian flag" of item "national flag"
#: data/json/items/armor/cloaks.json
msgid ""
"A flag that features a yellow edged black diagonal band divided diagonally "
"from the lower hoist side corner, the upper triangle is green and the lower "
"triangle is light blue."
msgstr "旗の左下から右上にかけて、黄色で縁取られた黒色の帯が入っており、左上は緑色、右下は緑色で塗られています。"

#. ~ Variant name of item "national flag"
#: data/json/items/armor/cloaks.json
msgid "Thai flag"
msgid_plural "Thai flags"
msgstr[0] "国旗(ﾀｲ)"

#. ~ Description of variant "Thai flag" of item "national flag"
#: data/json/items/armor/cloaks.json
msgid ""
"A flag of five horizontal stripes of red, white, purple, white and red, the "
"middle stripe being twice as wide as the others."
msgstr "赤色、白色、紫色、白色、赤色で横に五分された旗で、紫色の帯は他の色の2倍の太さになっています。"

#. ~ Variant name of item "national flag"
#: data/json/items/armor/cloaks.json
msgid "Timorese flag"
msgid_plural "Timorese flags"
msgstr[0] "国旗(東ﾃｨﾓｰﾙ)"

#. ~ Description of variant "Timorese flag" of item "national flag"
#: data/json/items/armor/cloaks.json
msgid ""
"A flag of a red field with the black isosceles triangle based on the hoist "
"side bearing a white five pointed star in the center superimposed on the "
"larger yellow triangle, also based on the hoist-side, that extends to the "
"center of the flag."
msgstr ""
"赤色の旗の左側が黒色で二等辺三角形に区切られており、その中に白色の星が描かれており、より長い黄色の二等辺三角形が、黒色の三角形を縁取るように伸びています。"

#. ~ Variant name of item "national flag"
#: data/json/items/armor/cloaks.json
msgid "Togolese flag"
msgid_plural "Togolese flags"
msgstr[0] "国旗(ﾄｰｺﾞ)"

#. ~ Description of variant "Togolese flag" of item "national flag"
#: data/json/items/armor/cloaks.json
msgid ""
"A flag that features five equal horizontal bands of green alternating with "
"yellow with a red canton bearing a white five pointed star."
msgstr "緑色と黄色の5つの帯がが交互に水平に並んだ旗の左上が赤色で四角形に塗られ、その中に白色の星が描かれています。"

#. ~ Variant name of item "national flag"
#: data/json/items/armor/cloaks.json
msgid "Tongan flag"
msgid_plural "Tongan flags"
msgstr[0] "国旗(ﾄﾝｶﾞ)"

#. ~ Description of variant "Tongan flag" of item "national flag"
#: data/json/items/armor/cloaks.json
msgid ""
"A flag of a red field with the white rectangle on the upper hoist side "
"corner bearing the red Greek Cross in the center."
msgstr "赤色の旗の左上が白色で長方形に区切られ、その中に赤色のギリシャ十字が描かれています。"

#. ~ Variant name of item "national flag"
#: data/json/items/armor/cloaks.json
msgid "Trinidad and Tobago flag"
msgid_plural "Trinidad and Tobago flags"
msgstr[0] "国旗(ﾄﾘﾆﾀﾞｰﾄﾞ･ﾄﾊﾞｺﾞ)"

#. ~ Description of variant "Trinidad and Tobago flag" of item "national flag"
#: data/json/items/armor/cloaks.json
msgid ""
"A flag of a red field with a white fimbriated black diagonal band from the "
"upper hoist side to the lower fly side."
msgstr "赤色の旗の左上から右下にかけて、白色の細い線で縁取られた黒色の帯が伸びています。"

#. ~ Variant name of item "national flag"
#: data/json/items/armor/cloaks.json
msgid "Tunisian flag"
msgid_plural "Tunisian flags"
msgstr[0] "国旗(ﾁｭﾆｼﾞｱ)"

#. ~ Description of variant "Tunisian flag" of item "national flag"
#: data/json/items/armor/cloaks.json
msgid ""
"A flag of a red field with a centered white sun disc containing a red five "
"pointed star surrounded by a red crescent."
msgstr "赤色の旗の中央に太陽を表わす白色の円があり、その中に赤色の三日月と星が描かれています。"

#. ~ Variant name of item "national flag"
#: data/json/items/armor/cloaks.json
msgid "Turkish flag"
msgid_plural "Turkish flags"
msgstr[0] "国旗(ﾄﾙｺ)"

#. ~ Description of variant "Turkish flag" of item "national flag"
#: data/json/items/armor/cloaks.json
msgid ""
"A flag of a red field with a white star and crescent slightly left of "
"center."
msgstr "赤色の旗のやや左側に白色の星と三日月が描かれています。"

#. ~ Variant name of item "national flag"
#: data/json/items/armor/cloaks.json
msgid "Turkmen flag"
msgid_plural "Turkmen flags"
msgstr[0] "国旗(ﾄﾙｸﾒﾆｽﾀﾝ)"

#. ~ Description of variant "Turkmen flag" of item "national flag"
#: data/json/items/armor/cloaks.json
msgid ""
"A flag of a green field with a vertical red stripe near the hoist side, "
"containing five carpet guls stacked above two crossed olive branches; a "
"white waxing crescent moon and five white five pointed stars appear in the "
"upper field, to the fly side of the red stripe."
msgstr ""
"緑色の旗のやや左側に赤色の縦帯が入っており、その中に5つの部族を象徴する絨毯模様と2本のオリーブの枝が並んでいます。赤色の帯の右隣上部には白色の上弦の月と5つの星が描かれています。"

#. ~ Variant name of item "national flag"
#: data/json/items/armor/cloaks.json
msgid "Tuvaluan flag"
msgid_plural "Tuvaluan flags"
msgstr[0] "国旗(ﾂﾊﾞﾙ)"

#. ~ Description of variant "Tuvaluan flag" of item "national flag"
#: data/json/items/armor/cloaks.json
msgid ""
"A flag of a light blue field with a union jack in the canton and nine yellow"
" stars on the fly half of the flag."
msgstr "水色の旗の左上にユニオンジャックがあり、右側に9つの黄色い星が描かれています。"

#. ~ Variant name of item "national flag"
#: data/json/items/armor/cloaks.json
msgid "Ugandan flag"
msgid_plural "Ugandan flags"
msgstr[0] "国旗(ｳｶﾞﾝﾀﾞ)"

#. ~ Description of variant "Ugandan flag" of item "national flag"
#: data/json/items/armor/cloaks.json
msgid ""
"A flag that features six equal horizontal bands of black, yellow, red, "
"black, yellow, and red, a white disc is superimposed at the center with a "
"grey crowned crane, facing the hoist side."
msgstr "黒色、黄色、赤色、黒色、黄色、赤色で横に六分された旗の中央に白色の円があり、その中に左側を向いたホオジロカンムリヅルが描かれています。"

#. ~ Variant name of item "national flag"
#: data/json/items/armor/cloaks.json
msgid "Ukrainian flag"
msgid_plural "Ukrainian flags"
msgstr[0] "国旗(ｳｸﾗｲﾅ)"

#. ~ Description of variant "Ukrainian flag" of item "national flag"
#: data/json/items/armor/cloaks.json
msgid "A horizontal bicolor flag of blue and yellow."
msgstr "青色と黄色で横に二分されている旗です。"

#. ~ Variant name of item "national flag"
#: data/json/items/armor/cloaks.json
msgid "Emirati flag"
msgid_plural "Emirati flags"
msgstr[0] "国旗(ｱﾗﾌﾞ首長国連邦)"

#. ~ Description of variant "Emirati flag" of item "national flag"
#: data/json/items/armor/cloaks.json
msgid ""
"A horizontal tricolor flag of green, white and black with a vertical red bar"
" at the hoist."
msgstr "緑色、白色、黒色で横に三分された旗の左側に赤色の縦帯が入っています。"

#. ~ Variant name of item "national flag"
#: data/json/items/armor/cloaks.json
msgid "United Kingdom flag"
msgid_plural "United Kingdom flags"
msgstr[0] "国旗(ｲｷﾞﾘｽ)"

#. ~ Description of variant "United Kingdom flag" of item "national flag"
#: data/json/items/armor/cloaks.json
msgid ""
"A flag with white fimbriated asymmetric red cross on a blue field with a "
"white fimbriated counterchanged saltire of red and white.  Also known as the"
" Union Jack."
msgstr ""
"青色の旗に白色で縁取られた赤色の十字が描かれ、全体をX字に区切る形で赤色と白色の斜めの帯が入っています。ユニオンジャックという名称でも知られています。"

#. ~ Variant name of item "national flag"
#: data/json/items/armor/cloaks.json
msgid "Uruguayan flag"
msgid_plural "Uruguayan flags"
msgstr[0] "国旗(ｳﾙｸﾞｱｲ)"

#. ~ Description of variant "Uruguayan flag" of item "national flag"
#: data/json/items/armor/cloaks.json
msgid ""
"A flag of four horizontal stripes of blue with the upper hoist side corner "
"bearing the sun of may in the center over a white field."
msgstr "4本の青色の横縞が入った白色の旗の左上にが白色で四角く区切られ、その中に五月の太陽と呼ばれる紋章が描かれています。"

#. ~ Variant name of item "national flag"
#: data/json/items/armor/cloaks.json
msgid "Uzbek flag"
msgid_plural "Uzbek flags"
msgstr[0] "国旗(ｳｽﾞﾍﾞｷｽﾀﾝ)"

#. ~ Description of variant "Uzbek flag" of item "national flag"
#: data/json/items/armor/cloaks.json
msgid ""
"A horizontal triband flag of azure, white and green, separated by two narrow"
" red stripes.  A white crescent and three rows of twelve white five pointed "
"stars are situated on the left side of the upper azure stripe."
msgstr "青緑色、白色、緑色で横に三分され、境界が赤色の細い線で区切られた旗です。左上に白色の三日月と3列に並んだ12個の星が描かれています。"

#. ~ Variant name of item "national flag"
#: data/json/items/armor/cloaks.json
msgid "Vanuatuan flag"
msgid_plural "Vanuatuan flags"
msgstr[0] "国旗(ﾊﾞﾇｱﾂ)"

#. ~ Description of variant "Vanuatuan flag" of item "national flag"
#: data/json/items/armor/cloaks.json
msgid ""
"A horizontal bicolor flag of red and green with a golden pall, fimbriated in"
" black, with a black chevron filling the left hand space and two gold "
"crossed namele cycad fronds encircled in a gold boar tusk centered on the "
"chevron."
msgstr ""
"赤色と緑色で横に二分され、黒色で縁取られた旗の左側が黒色で三角形に区切られています。黒色の部分には横向きのYののような形で金色の細い線が入っています。三角形の中には金色のイノシシの牙、更にその中に交差したナメーレと呼ばれる植物が描かれています。"

#. ~ Variant name of item "national flag"
#: data/json/items/armor/cloaks.json
msgid "Venezuelan flag"
msgid_plural "Venezuelan flags"
msgstr[0] "国旗(ﾍﾞﾈｽﾞｴﾗ)"

#. ~ Description of variant "Venezuelan flag" of item "national flag"
#: data/json/items/armor/cloaks.json
msgid ""
"A horizontal tricolor flag of yellow, blue and red with an arc of eight "
"white five pointed stars centered on the blue band."
msgstr "黄色、青色、赤色で横に三分された旗の中央に、8つの白色の星が弧を描いて並んでいます。"

#. ~ Variant name of item "national flag"
#: data/json/items/armor/cloaks.json
msgid "Vietnamese flag"
msgid_plural "Vietnamese flags"
msgstr[0] "国旗(ﾍﾞﾄﾅﾑ)"

#. ~ Description of variant "Vietnamese flag" of item "national flag"
#: data/json/items/armor/cloaks.json
msgid "A flag with a red field and large yellow star in the center."
msgstr "赤色の旗の中央に大きな黄色の星が描かれています。"

#. ~ Variant name of item "national flag"
#: data/json/items/armor/cloaks.json
msgid "Yemenis flag"
msgid_plural "Yemenis flags"
msgstr[0] "国旗(ｲｴﾒﾝ)"

#. ~ Description of variant "Yemenis flag" of item "national flag"
#: data/json/items/armor/cloaks.json
msgid "A horizontal tricolor flag of red, white and black."
msgstr "赤色、白色、黒色で横に三分されている旗です。"

#. ~ Variant name of item "national flag"
#: data/json/items/armor/cloaks.json
msgid "Zambian flag"
msgid_plural "Zambian flags"
msgstr[0] "国旗(ｻﾞﾝﾋﾞｱ)"

#. ~ Description of variant "Zambian flag" of item "national flag"
#: data/json/items/armor/cloaks.json
msgid ""
"A flag featuring green field with an orange fish eagle in flight over a "
"rectangular block of three vertical stripes colored from left to right in "
"red, black and orange."
msgstr "緑色の旗の右側に翼を広げるフィッシュ・イーグルが描かれており、その下に赤色、黒色、オレンジ色の縦縞が入っています。"

#. ~ Variant name of item "national flag"
#: data/json/items/armor/cloaks.json
msgid "Zimbabwean flag"
msgid_plural "Zimbabwean flags"
msgstr[0] "国旗(ｼﾞﾝﾊﾞﾌﾞｴ)"

#. ~ Description of variant "Zimbabwean flag" of item "national flag"
#: data/json/items/armor/cloaks.json
msgid ""
"A flag of seven horizontal stripes of green, yellow, red, black, red, yellow"
" and green with a black edged white isosceles triangle base on the hoist "
"side bearing a Zimbabwe bird superimposed on a red five pointed star."
msgstr ""
"緑色、黄色、赤色、黒色、赤色、黄色、緑色で横に七分された旗の左側が黒色で縁取られた白色の二等辺三角形に区切られており、その中に赤色の星、それに重なるように大ジンバブエ鳥が描かれています。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/cloaks.json
msgid "state flag"
msgid_plural "state flags"
msgstr[0] "州旗"

#. ~ Description of "state flag"
#. ~ Description of variant "Massachusetts flag" of item "state flag"
#: data/json/items/armor/cloaks.json
msgid ""
"A large white flag with a shield featuring an American Native and a star "
"which represents the state of Massachusetts."
msgstr "白色の大きな旗です。ネイティブアメリカンの姿とマサチューセッツ州を表す星が盾に描かれています。"

#. ~ Variant name of item "state flag"
#: data/json/items/armor/cloaks.json
msgid "Massachusetts flag"
msgid_plural "Massachusetts flags"
msgstr[0] "州旗(マサチューセッツ州)"

#. ~ Variant name of item "state flag"
#: data/json/items/armor/cloaks.json
msgid "Maine flag"
msgid_plural "Maine flags"
msgstr[0] "州旗(メイン州)"

#. ~ Description of variant "Maine flag" of item "state flag"
#: data/json/items/armor/cloaks.json
msgid ""
"A large blue flag featuring a moose and pine tree emblem on a shield "
"supported by a farmer and a sailor, above is the north star and the Latin "
"motto \"Dirigo\" (\"I direct\"), below the shield reads out the state of "
"\"Maine\"."
msgstr ""
"青色の大きな旗です。ヘラジカと松が描かれた盾形の紋章を農夫と船乗りが支えており、上部には北極星とラテン語の標語「Dirigo(先頭に立つ者)」が載っており、下部には「MAINE」と書いてあります。"

#. ~ Variant name of item "state flag"
#: data/json/items/armor/cloaks.json
msgid "New Hampshire flag"
msgid_plural "New Hampshire flags"
msgstr[0] "州旗(ニューハンプシャー州)"

#. ~ Description of variant "New Hampshire flag" of item "state flag"
#: data/json/items/armor/cloaks.json
msgid ""
"A large blue flag with New Hampshire's state seal of the frigate Raleigh "
"surrounded by laurel leaves and nine stars against a field of blue."
msgstr "青色の大きな旗です。月桂樹の葉と9つの星に囲まれたフリゲート艦「ローリー」が描かれています。"

#. ~ Variant name of item "state flag"
#: data/json/items/armor/cloaks.json
msgid "Vermont flag"
msgid_plural "Vermont flags"
msgstr[0] "州旗(バーモント州)"

#. ~ Description of variant "Vermont flag" of item "state flag"
#: data/json/items/armor/cloaks.json
msgid ""
"A large blue flag featuring a shield with wreaths on both sides, a pine tree"
" in a green field along with a cow and bales of wheat reside within the "
"shield representing Vermont."
msgstr "青色の大きな旗です。左右を植物で彩られた盾の中に、草原と松の木、ウシ、麦束が描かれています。"

#. ~ Variant name of item "state flag"
#: data/json/items/armor/cloaks.json
msgid "Connecticut flag"
msgid_plural "Connecticut flags"
msgstr[0] "州旗(コネチカット州)"

#. ~ Description of variant "Connecticut flag" of item "state flag"
#: data/json/items/armor/cloaks.json
msgid ""
"A large blue flag featuring a white baroque shield with three grapevines, "
"each bearing three bunches of purple grapes on a field of royal blue, below "
"the shield reads \"Qui Transtulit Sustinet\", which is Latin for \"He who "
"transplanted sustains\" which represents the state of Connecticut."
msgstr ""
"青色の大きな旗です。ロイヤルブルーの背景に白いバロック風の盾が配され、その中に紫色の果実を3房ずつ実らせたブドウの木が描かれています。下部にはラテン語「Qui"
" Transtulit Sustinet(移住した者が維持する)」という標語が書かれています。"

#. ~ Variant name of item "state flag"
#: data/json/items/armor/cloaks.json
msgid "Rhode Island flag"
msgid_plural "Rhode Island flags"
msgstr[0] "州旗(ロードアイランド州)"

#. ~ Description of variant "Rhode Island flag" of item "state flag"
#: data/json/items/armor/cloaks.json
msgid ""
"A large white flag of Rhode Island that features a golden anchor in the "
"middle of it surrounded by thirteen gold stars, below the anchor is a blue "
"banner that reads \"hope\"."
msgstr ""
"白色の大きな旗です。中央に金色の錨、その周囲に13個の金色の星が描かれています。錨の下には「HOPE」と書かれた青色のリボンが配されています。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/cloaks.json
msgid "Foodperson's cape"
msgid_plural "Foodperson's capes"
msgstr[0] "フードパーソンマント"

#. ~ Description of "Foodperson's cape"
#: data/json/items/armor/cloaks.json
msgid "A brightly-colored cape emblazoned with the \"Fp\" symbol."
msgstr "「Fp」のシンボルが描かれた色鮮やかなマントです。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/cloaks.json
msgid "heraldic cape"
msgid_plural "heraldic capes"
msgstr[0] "紋章のマント"

#. ~ Description of "heraldic cape"
#: data/json/items/armor/cloaks.json
msgid ""
"Sable and argent fields retreat diagonally from a full-moon sigil.  Its "
"metallic fibers reveal holographic motifs in accordance with ambient light."
msgstr ""
"斜めに区切られた黒色と銀色の背景に満月の紋章が描かれたマントです。金属のような光沢がある繊維でできており、周囲の光を反射して紋章がぼんやりと浮かび上がります。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/cloaks.json
msgid "ferraiolo"
msgid_plural "ferraiolos"
msgstr[0] "フェッライオーロ"

#. ~ Description of "ferraiolo"
#: data/json/items/armor/cloaks.json
msgid ""
"A long, crimson cape that reaches the ankles.  Worn by Catholic priests for "
"ceremonious occasions."
msgstr "足首まで届く丈の長い深紅のマントです。カトリックの司祭が儀式の際に着用します。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/cloaks.json
msgid "grass cloak"
msgid_plural "grass cloaks"
msgstr[0] "草編みクローク"

#. ~ Description of "grass cloak"
#: data/json/items/armor/cloaks.json
msgid "A primitive cloak.  Ötzi wore one, too."
msgstr "原始的な外套です。氷河から見つかったミイラもこれに似た服を着ていました。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/cloaks.json
msgid "cloak"
msgid_plural "cloaks"
msgstr[0] "クローク"

#. ~ Description of "cloak"
#: data/json/items/armor/cloaks.json
msgid "A heavy cloak meant to be thrown over your body."
msgstr "身体を覆い隠す分厚い外套です。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/cloaks.json
msgid "denim cloak"
msgid_plural "denim cloaks"
msgstr[0] "デニムクローク"

#. ~ Description of "denim cloak"
#: data/json/items/armor/cloaks.json
msgid ""
"A heavy denim cloak worn over your body.  Warmer, sturdier and heavier than "
"a cotton cloak."
msgstr "羽織って着る厚手のデニム製マントです。綿製のものよりも暖かく、丈夫で重厚です。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/cloaks.json
msgid "sinister cloak (black)"
msgid_plural "sinister cloaks (black)"
msgstr[0] "邪悪なクローク(黒)"

#. ~ Description of "sinister cloak (black)"
#: data/json/items/armor/cloaks.json
msgid ""
"A sinister-looking hooded cloak meant to be thrown over your body.  The "
"black side is currently facing outwards.  Use it to reverse it and show the "
"red side."
msgstr "羽織って身に着ける、不吉な雰囲気が漂うフード付き外套です。外側は黒色、内側は赤色の布地です。使用すると布地を裏返します。"

#. ~ "menu_text" action message of item "sinister cloak (black)"
#. ~ "menu_text" action message of item "sinister cloak (red)"
#: data/json/items/armor/cloaks.json
msgid "Reverse the colors"
msgstr "裏返す"

#. ~ "msg" action message of item "sinister cloak (black)"
#: data/json/items/armor/cloaks.json
msgid "Your cloak is now bathed in blood."
msgstr "クロークが鮮血の色に染まりました。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/cloaks.json
msgid "sinister cloak (red)"
msgid_plural "sinister cloaks (red)"
msgstr[0] "邪悪なクローク(赤)"

#. ~ Description of "sinister cloak (red)"
#: data/json/items/armor/cloaks.json
msgid ""
"A sinister-looking hooded cloak meant to be thrown over your body.  The red "
"side is currently facing outwards.  Use it to reverse it and show the black "
"side."
msgstr "羽織って身に着ける、不吉な雰囲気が漂うフード付き外套です。外側は赤色、内側は黒色の布地です。使用すると布地を裏返します。"

#. ~ "msg" action message of item "sinister cloak (red)"
#: data/json/items/armor/cloaks.json
msgid "Your cloak is now one with the night."
msgstr "クロークが宵闇の色に染まりました。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/cloaks.json
msgid "dark cloak"
msgid_plural "dark cloaks"
msgstr[0] "闇のクローク"

#. ~ Description of "dark cloak"
#: data/json/items/armor/cloaks.json
msgid ""
"A black cloak meant to be thrown over your body.  Commonly used by witches "
"and other creatures of the night."
msgstr "魔女などの夜の住人が羽織って身に着ける黒い外套です。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/cloaks.json
msgid "fur cloak"
msgid_plural "fur cloaks"
msgstr[0] "ファークローク"

#. ~ Description of "fur cloak"
#: data/json/items/armor/cloaks.json
msgid "A heavy fur cloak meant to be thrown over your body."
msgstr "身体を覆い隠す毛皮製の分厚い外套です。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/cloaks.json
msgid "leather cloak"
msgid_plural "leather cloaks"
msgstr[0] "レザークローク"

#. ~ Description of "leather cloak"
#: data/json/items/armor/cloaks.json
msgid "A heavy leather cloak meant to be thrown over your body."
msgstr "身体を覆い隠す革製の分厚い外套です。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/cloaks.json
msgid "wool cloak"
msgid_plural "wool cloaks"
msgstr[0] "ウールクローク"

#. ~ Description of "wool cloak"
#: data/json/items/armor/cloaks.json
msgid "A heavy woolen cloak meant to be thrown over your body."
msgstr "身体を覆い隠すウールの分厚い外套です。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/cloaks.json
msgid "Jedi cloak"
msgid_plural "Jedi cloaks"
msgstr[0] "ジェダイのクローク"

#. ~ Description of "Jedi cloak"
#: data/json/items/armor/cloaks.json
msgid ""
"A long, flowing robe.  Be sure to tear it off dramatically before fighting "
"any foes!"
msgstr "ゆったりと垂れた長いローブです。敵と戦う前に、必ずドラマチックに脱ぎ捨てましょう！"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/cloaks.json
msgid "FB51 optical cloak"
msgid_plural "FB51 optical cloaks"
msgstr[0] "FB51光学迷彩クローク"

#. ~ Description of "FB51 optical cloak"
#: data/json/items/armor/cloaks.json
msgid ""
"A plastic cloak embedded with cameras and LEDs that will render you fully "
"invisible to normal vision when powered and worn.  You must be carrying a "
"unified power supply, or UPS, to use it.  Activate to toggle visibility."
msgstr ""
"カメラとLEDが埋め込まれたプラスチック製の外套です。充電された状態で着用し、起動することで通常の視界から完全に姿を消します。使用するにはUPSまたはUPS互換の統合電源が必要です。使用することで起動します。"

#. ~ "msg" action message of item "FB51 optical cloak"
#: data/json/items/armor/cloaks.json
msgid "Your optical cloak flickers as it becomes transparent."
msgstr "光学迷彩クロークが明滅し、姿が見えなくなりました。"

#. ~ "need_charges_msg" action message of item "FB51 optical cloak"
#: data/json/items/armor/cloaks.json
#, c-format
msgid "You don't have enough UPS charges to turn on the %s"
msgstr "%sの電源を入れるのに十分なUPSの電力がありません。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/cloaks.json
msgid "FB51 optical cloak (on)"
msgid_plural "FB51 optical cloaks (on)"
msgstr[0] "FB51光学迷彩クローク(オン)"

#. ~ Description of "FB51 optical cloak (on)"
#: data/json/items/armor/cloaks.json
msgid ""
"A plastic cloak embedded with cameras and LEDs that will render you fully "
"invisible to normal vision when powered and worn.  It is turned on, and "
"continually draining power from a UPS.  Use it to turn it off."
msgstr ""
"カメラとLEDが埋め込まれたプラスチック製の外套です。電源が入っており、通常の視界から完全に姿を消しています。UPSの電力を消費し続けており、使用すると電源を切ります。"

#. ~ "msg" action message of item "FB51 optical cloak (on)"
#: data/json/items/armor/cloaks.json
#, c-format
msgid "The %s flickers for a moment as it becomes opaque."
msgstr "%sが明滅して姿を現しました。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/cloaks.json
msgid "wool poncho"
msgid_plural "wool ponchos"
msgstr[0] "ポンチョ(羊毛)"

#. ~ Description of "wool poncho"
#: data/json/items/armor/cloaks.json
msgid "A simple wool garment worn over the torso and upper arms."
msgstr "胴と上腕を覆うシンプルなウールの衣服です。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/cloaks.json
msgid "makeshift poncho"
msgid_plural "makeshift ponchos"
msgstr[0] "簡易ポンチョ"

#. ~ Description of "makeshift poncho"
#: data/json/items/armor/cloaks.json
msgid "A large plastic trash bag with holes cut out for the head and arms."
msgstr "頭と腕を入れる穴が開いた、大きなビニール袋です。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/cloaks.json
msgid "rain poncho"
msgid_plural "rain ponchos"
msgstr[0] "レインポンチョ"

#. ~ Description of "rain poncho"
#: data/json/items/armor/cloaks.json
msgid ""
"A lightweight plastic rain poncho with a hood.  It folds into a very compact"
" form when not in use."
msgstr "軽量プラスチック製のフード付き雨除けポンチョです。使わないときは小さく折り畳んでおけます。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/cloaks.json
msgid "straw cape"
msgid_plural "straw capes"
msgstr[0] "蓑"

#. ~ Description of "straw cape"
#: data/json/items/armor/cloaks.json
msgid ""
"A bulky traditional Japanese raincoat made from straw, which covers the "
"entire body.  Also known as mino."
msgstr "藁で作られた、分厚いレインコートです。日本の伝統的な雨具であり、全身を覆います。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/cloaks.json
msgid "snuggie"
msgid_plural "snuggies"
msgstr[0] "袖付きブランケット"

#. ~ Description of "snuggie"
#: data/json/items/armor/cloaks.json
msgid "Perfect for reading all those books you scavenged."
msgstr "拾ってきた本を読み耽るのに最適な衣服です。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
msgid "turnout coat"
msgid_plural "turnout coats"
msgstr[0] "消防士コート"

#. ~ Description of "turnout coat"
#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
msgid ""
"A heavy protective coat worn by firefighters, highly resistant to heat and "
"flame."
msgstr "熱や炎に対する耐性が高い、消防士が着用する重厚な防護服です。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
msgid "cassock"
msgid_plural "cassocks"
msgstr[0] "カソック"

#. ~ Description of "cassock"
#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
msgid "A piece of clerical clothing, usually worn by Christian priests."
msgstr "キリスト教の神父がよく着用している聖職服です。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
msgid "fur coat"
msgid_plural "fur coats"
msgstr[0] "ファーコート"

#. ~ Description of "fur coat"
#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
msgid "A fur coat with a couple small pockets.  Extremely warm."
msgstr "2つの小さなポケットが付いた毛皮製のコートです。着用すると極めて暖かいです。"

#. ~ Variant name of item "fur coat"
#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
msgid "mink coat"
msgid_plural "mink coats"
msgstr[0] "ファーコート(ﾐﾝｸ)"

#. ~ Description of variant "mink coat" of item "fur coat"
#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
msgid ""
"A classic status symbol for the rich and famous, this is a heavy and "
"expensive coat made from luxuriously thick, soft, and rather short fur, with"
" a color palette consisting of rich, deep brown.  One of the most popular "
"types of fur coats produced and traded, this jacket is incredibly warm and "
"comes with two modest pockets."
msgstr ""
"古くから富裕層や有名人のステータスシンボルとされてきた、厚く柔らかなやや短い毛皮で作られた、豊かで深いブラウンカラーの重厚で豪華なコートです。生産、販売されるファーコートの中でも特に人気があり、信じられないほど暖かく、2つの小さなポケットが付いています。"

#. ~ Variant name of item "fur coat"
#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
msgid "arctic fox jacket"
msgid_plural "arctic fox jackets"
msgstr[0] "ファーコート(ﾎｯｷｮｸｷﾞﾂﾈ)"

#. ~ Description of variant "arctic fox jacket" of item "fur coat"
#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
msgid ""
"Fluffy and insulating, this expensive fur coat is composed of a small "
"battalion's worth of snowy-white arctic fox pelts with silver tips.  A "
"straight section forms the back and lower sweep, while triangularly cut furs"
" are sown in an inverse pattern to form the rest of the jacket."
msgstr ""
"雪のように白く先端だけが銀色に染まっている、驚くほど暖かい大量のホッキョクギツネの毛皮で作られた、柔らかく断熱性に優れる豪華なファーコートです。背中側と下部には毛皮の広い面が使われ、その他の部分には三角形にカットされた残りの毛皮が逆向きに使われています。"

#. ~ Variant name of item "fur coat"
#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
msgid "frost fox overcoat"
msgid_plural "frost fox overcoats"
msgstr[0] "ファーコート(ﾌﾛｽﾄﾌｫｯｸｽ)"

#. ~ Description of variant "frost fox overcoat" of item "fur coat"
#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
msgid ""
"A straight-cut, classically stylish jacket crafted from soft and voluminous "
"gray fox fur with a blue undercoat, this article of winter apparel comes "
"kitted out with a tall collar and two modest pockets."
msgstr ""
"柔らかくボリューム感のある灰色のキツネの毛皮と青みがかった下毛で作られた、直線的なシルエットの古風でお洒落なコートです。襟が高く、2つの小さなポケットが付いています。"

#. ~ Variant name of item "fur coat"
#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
msgid "fox fur bomber jacket"
msgid_plural "fox fur bomber jackets"
msgstr[0] "ファーコート(ﾌｫｯｸｽﾎﾞﾏｰｼﾞｬｹｯﾄ)"

#. ~ Description of variant "fox fur bomber jacket" of item "fur coat"
#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
msgid ""
"What was once a rugged piece of military clothing has metamorphosed into a "
"fashion icon within this slim-cut and insulated jacket, with wide, cinchable"
" sleeves and a broad collar.  Composed of sewn-together fox pelts and "
"fastened with a zipper at the front, the inside of this jacket is lined with"
" plush, reddish orange fur."
msgstr ""
"かつての丈夫な戦闘服のデザインがファッションアイコンとして蘇った、幅が広く手首が狭い袖と幅広の襟を備えた、前面をジッパーで開閉できるスリムなシルエットの暖かいコートです。キツネの毛皮を縫い合わせて作ってあり、裏地には赤みがかったオレンジ色の派手な毛皮が使われています。"

#. ~ Variant name of item "fur coat"
#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
msgid "chinchilla jacket"
msgid_plural "chinchilla jackets"
msgstr[0] "ファーコート(ﾁﾝﾁﾗ)"

#. ~ Description of variant "chinchilla jacket" of item "fur coat"
#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
msgid ""
"Luxuriously velvety and ridiculously extra, this warm, gray-hued coat is "
"ribbed with patterns of black and white highlights.  Composed of a small "
"army's worth of dead chinchilla pelts and naturally hypoallergenic, the "
"world might be going to hell, but at least you'll look like a celebrity "
"while enveloped within this dreamily soft, timelessly stylish coat."
msgstr ""
"低アレルゲン素材とされる黒色と白色のチンチラの毛皮を大量に揃え、リブ編みして作り上げた、贅沢なベルベットにも劣らない、非常に暖かい極上の灰色のコートです。世界は地獄も同然になっていまいましたが、少なくともこの夢のように柔らかく時代を超越した魅力をもつコートに包まれている間は、セレブ気分を味わえます。"

#. ~ Variant name of item "fur coat"
#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
msgid "rabbit overcoat"
msgid_plural "rabbit overcoats"
msgstr[0] "ファーコート(ｷﾂﾈ&ｳｻｷﾞ)"

#. ~ Description of variant "rabbit overcoat" of item "fur coat"
#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
msgid ""
"Prey and predator are brought together within this luxurious fir coat, sewn "
"from panels of velvety, snowy-white rabbit pelts and accentuated by a beige "
"layer of fox fur trimming the collar and cuffs.  With a tapered waist and "
"two side pockets, the jacket is both comfortable to wear and stylish."
msgstr ""
"捕食者と被捕食者をまとめて縫い合わせた豪華なコートです。ベルベットのように滑らかな純白のウサギのファーコートの襟と袖口には、ベージュ色のキツネの毛皮が使われています。2つのサイドポケットを備えたウエストの細いこのコートは、快適な着用感とスタイリッシュな着こなしを両立できます。"

#. ~ Variant name of item "fur coat"
#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
msgid "beaver skin bomber jacket"
msgid_plural "beaver skin bomber jackets"
msgstr[0] "ファーコート(ﾋﾞｰﾊﾞｰﾎﾞﾏｰｼﾞｬｹｯﾄ)"

#. ~ Description of variant "beaver skin bomber jacket" of item "fur coat"
#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
msgid ""
"The skins of what used to be several beavers have taken to the skies within "
"the composition of this sleek-fitting flight jacket, or, rather, they would "
"if the coat were in any way designed to be a practical piece of kit.  With a"
" soft spread of brown fur lining the inside of this wide-necked overcoat and"
" its exterior finished in a bold, glossy black color, it's safe to say that "
"this garment belongs more within a ski chalet than the cockpit of a fighter "
"craft."
msgstr ""
"数頭のビーバーが毛皮だけになり、フィット感の高い洗練されたフライトジャケットとして空へ飛び立つことになりました。実用目的でデザインされていたならそんな話も夢ではなかったかもしれませんが、このコートは戦闘機のコックピットよりも、スキー場の山小屋が似合っているように感じます。襟の広いオーバーコートの内側には柔らかい茶色の毛皮が使われており、外側は光沢のある漆黒に仕上がっています。"

#. ~ Variant name of item "fur coat"
#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
msgid "albino mink coat"
msgid_plural "albino mink coats"
msgstr[0] "ファーコート(ｱﾙﾋﾞﾉﾐﾝｸ)"

#. ~ Description of variant "albino mink coat" of item "fur coat"
#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
msgid ""
"Even more prized than regular mink jackets, this coat is exclusively "
"composed of plush white fur with no markings or color in its undercoat.  "
"Extremely warm and equipped with dual pockets, this expensive fashion "
"statement would certainly turn some heads if anyone left alive could still "
"care about aesthetics."
msgstr ""
"通常のミンクコートより更に珍重されている、下毛に模様や色のない純白の毛皮だけで作られた、非常に暖かく、2つのポケットが付いている豪華なコートです。もし今の状況で生存よりも美学を優先できる人が残っていたら、この極上のファッションアイテムは間違いなく注目を集めるでしょう。"

#. ~ Variant name of item "fur coat"
#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
msgid "lynx coat"
msgid_plural "lynx coats"
msgstr[0] "ファーコート(ｵｵﾔﾏﾈｺ)"

#. ~ Description of variant "lynx coat" of item "fur coat"
#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
msgid ""
"Possessing bell-bottom sleeves, a tapered waist, and a snowy-white fox fur "
"trim around the collar, hem, and cuffs, this pure white fur coat dappled "
"with striking spots would make any self-respecting aristocrat's heart swell "
"in admiration.  Sown from sections of long and silky abdominal lynx fur and "
"featuring two side pockets, the coat is extremely warm, elegant, and, thanks"
" to the Cataclysm, completely free."
msgstr ""
"襟と裾、ベルボトムの袖口が純白のキツネの毛皮で装飾されている、白色地に派手な斑点模様が入ったウエストの細いファーコートです。長く絹のように滑らかなオオヤマネコの毛皮が使われており、プライドの高い貴族も満足すること間違いなしのデザインです。2つのサイドポケットが付いており、非常に暖かくエレガントで、しかも大変動のお陰で完全にタダです。"

#. ~ Variant name of item "fur coat"
#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
msgid "sable coat"
msgid_plural "sable coats"
msgstr[0] "ファーコート(ｸﾛﾃﾝ)"

#. ~ Description of variant "sable coat" of item "fur coat"
#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
msgid ""
"The favorite coat of old European royalty, this extravagant jacket of "
"Russian sable is composed of stitched panels of cinnamon brown fur with a "
"pale yellow undercoat and silver tips.  Possessing a tall collar and flaring"
" hips that just might require you to walk sideways through narrower door "
"frames, the coat is impractical, swelteringly warm, and incredibly stylish."
msgstr ""
"淡い黄色の下毛の毛皮と毛先が銀色に染まった茶色の毛皮が縫い合わされている、かつてヨーロッパの王族に珍重されたロシアンセーブルの豪華なコートです。襟が高く、腰の位置で広がっているデザインのため、狭い扉を横歩きで通る必要があるかもしれませんが、そもそも実用性は考えられていません。うだるほど暖かく、信じられないほどスタイリッシュです。"

#. ~ Variant name of item "fur coat"
#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
msgid "coyote jacket"
msgid_plural "coyote jackets"
msgstr[0] "ファーコート(ｺﾖｰﾃ)"

#. ~ Description of variant "coyote jacket" of item "fur coat"
#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
msgid ""
"Before the Cataclysm, this fur coat would have likely been termed \"ruggedly"
" handsome,\" a nice way of saying that, while it's not as nice or as "
"luxurious as other fur garments, its price was the same.  Regardless, the "
"jacket's cinnamon brown fur and rust-red undercoat give it a pleasing "
"aesthetic, while its long hairs are also both dense and durable."
msgstr ""
"大変動以前であれば「逞しくハンサム」と評されていたであろうファーコートです。他の毛皮製品ほど上品でも豪華でもないのに価格は同じであることを上手く表した言い方ですね。評価はどうあれ、シナモンブラウンの毛皮と赤錆色の下毛は美しさと心地よさを兼ね備えており、長い毛は密度が高く耐久性も申し分ありません。"

#. ~ Variant name of item "fur coat"
#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
msgid "tiger-skin overcoat"
msgid_plural "tiger-skin overcoats"
msgstr[0] "ファーコート(ﾄﾗ)"

#. ~ Description of variant "tiger-skin overcoat" of item "fur coat"
#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
msgid ""
"This is a vintage tiger skin jacket smelling distinctly of mothballs, "
"possessing an alternating blend of orange, white, and black striations "
"ribbing its shaggy exterior, broadly flaring hips, and an interior lining of"
" velvety chinchilla fur.  Illegal, before the Cataclysm, to either produce "
"or sell, this coat is almost certainly one of the last of its kind and would"
" make for a killer fashion statement, if you don't mind wearing the skin of "
"a murdered, endangered animal, that is."
msgstr ""
"防虫剤の匂いが染み付いている、トラの毛皮を使ったビンテージものと思われるコートです。オレンジ色、白色、黒色が縞模様に並んだ長い毛皮が外側に使われており、裏地にはベルベットのように滑らかなチンチラの毛皮が使われています。大変動以前は製造も販売も違法とされており、これはほぼ間違いなく残った最後の数点の一つです。絶滅危惧種の動物を殺してその皮をまとうことを気にしないのであれば、ファッション業界の話題を席巻すること間違いなしです。"

#. ~ Description of a pocket in item "fur coat"
#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
msgid "side pocket."
msgstr "側面のポケットです。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
msgid "faux fur coat"
msgid_plural "faux fur coats"
msgstr[0] "フェイクファーコート"

#. ~ Description of "faux fur coat"
#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
msgid ""
"A garishly-colored faux fur coat with a couple small pockets.  Although not "
"as warm as natural fur, it gives you some of that unique flair."
msgstr "小さなポケットが複数ある、派手な色のフェイクファーコートです。天然の毛皮ほどは暖かくありませんが、個性的なおしゃれを楽しめます。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
msgid "lab coat"
msgid_plural "lab coats"
msgstr[0] "白衣"

#. ~ Description of "lab coat"
#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
msgid ""
"A long white coat with several large pockets.  Comes with a very nice pocket"
" protector."
msgstr "複数の大きなポケットが付いた白いロングコートです。とても素敵な胸ポケット用カバーが付属しています"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
msgid "rain coat"
msgid_plural "rain coats"
msgstr[0] "レインコート"

#. ~ Description of "rain coat"
#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
msgid ""
"A vinyl coat with a hood and two very large pockets, meant to provide "
"protection from rain."
msgstr "フードと2つの大きなポケットが付いた、身体を雨から保護するビニール製のコートです。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
msgid "gutskin parka"
msgid_plural "gutskin parkas"
msgstr[0] "腸製衣"

#. ~ Description of "gutskin parka"
#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
msgid ""
"An intricately sewn coat of treated and split intestines, prized for its "
"light weight and waterproof qualities among the indigenous peoples of the "
"arctic."
msgstr "北極圏の先住民族が着用する、洗浄した動物の腸を縫い合わせて作ったコートです。軽量性と防水性に優れています。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
msgid "winter coat"
msgid_plural "winter coats"
msgstr[0] "防寒コート"

#. ~ Description of "winter coat"
#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
msgid "A padded coat with deep pockets and a hood.  Very warm."
msgstr "深いポケットとフードが付いたパッド入りのコートです。着用すると非常に暖かいです。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
msgid "duster"
msgid_plural "dusters"
msgstr[0] "ダスターコート"

#. ~ Description of "duster"
#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
msgid "A rugged full-length duster coat.  Has many pockets for storage."
msgstr "全身を覆う丈夫なダスターコートです。収納用にたくさんのポケットが付いています。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
msgid "fur duster"
msgid_plural "fur dusters"
msgstr[0] "ダスターコート(毛皮)"

#. ~ Description of "fur duster"
#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
msgid "A thick fur full-length duster.  Has many pockets for storage."
msgstr "厚手の毛皮で作った、全身を覆うダスターコートです。収納用にたくさんのポケットが付いています。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
msgid "faux fur duster"
msgid_plural "faux fur dusters"
msgstr[0] "ダスターコート(ﾌｪｲｸﾌｧｰ)"

#. ~ Description of "faux fur duster"
#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
msgid ""
"A thick faux fur duster, falling below your knees.  Has many pockets for "
"storing things."
msgstr "厚手のフェイクファーで作った、全身を覆うダスターコートです。収納用に複数のポケットが付いています。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
msgid "leather duster"
msgid_plural "leather dusters"
msgstr[0] "ダスターコート(革)"

#. ~ Description of "leather duster"
#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
msgid "A thick leather full-length duster.  Has many pockets for storage."
msgstr "厚手の革で作った、全身を覆うダスターコートです。収納用にたくさんのポケットが付いています。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
msgid "greatcoat"
msgid_plural "greatcoats"
msgstr[0] "グレートコート"

#. ~ Description of "greatcoat"
#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
msgid ""
"A heavy, full-length wool coat.  Cumbersome, but warm and with deep pockets."
msgstr "深いポケットが付いた、ウールの重い全身コートです。嵩張りますが、寒さをしのげます。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
msgid "hakama"
msgid_plural "hakama"
msgstr[0] "袴"

#. ~ Description of "hakama"
#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
msgid "Plain black hakama for use in kendo and other martial arts."
msgstr "剣道や武道などに使用される無地の黒い袴です。"

#. ~ Description of "hakama"
#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
msgid "A flowing, pleated garment which can be worn over a kimono."
msgstr "着物と併せて着用する、折りひだのあるゆったりとした衣服です。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
msgid "bathrobe"
msgid_plural "bathrobes"
msgstr[0] "バスローブ"

#. ~ Description of "bathrobe"
#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
msgid ""
"An outer garment of absorbent, towel-like material traditionally worn to "
"cover one's nakedness to and from the bath.  It makes you wish you had "
"running water to bathe with."
msgstr ""
"風呂場へ出入りする際裸を見せないように古くから着用されてきた、吸水性の高いタオルのような素材で作られた衣服です。入浴できるだけの綺麗な水があれば良かったのですが。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
msgid "army jacket"
msgid_plural "army jackets"
msgstr[0] "軍用ジャケット"

#. ~ Description of "army jacket"
#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
msgid ""
"A vintage article of military surplus with an adjustable waist drawstring, "
"or at least a civilian reproduction of one — it's resplendent with a cotton "
"liner, an integral hood tucked away in a zip-up pouch in the collar, and "
"epaulettes upon the shoulders."
msgstr ""
"ウエストにサイズを調節できる引き紐が付いた、ヴィンテージ物の軍用ジャケット、あるいはそのコピー品です。裏地に綿が使われ、襟のジッパー内にはフードが収納されており、肩には鮮やかな房飾りが付いています。"

#. ~ Variant name of item "army jacket"
#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
msgid "woodland-camo combat jacket"
msgid_plural "woodland-camo combat jackets"
msgstr[0] "軍用ジャケット(森林迷彩)"

#. ~ Description of variant "woodland-camo combat jacket" of item "army
#. jacket"
#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
msgid ""
"Tried and true, the US military's antiquated 4-tone woodland camouflage "
"pattern covers this particular jacket: large, high-contrast patches of "
"green, black, brown, and sand hues, all rather faded from years and ware."
msgstr ""
"アメリカ軍で使用され効果が実証された4色森林迷彩パターンで覆われている、年季の入ったジャケットです。明暗の差が強い緑色、黒色、茶色、砂色の大きな迷彩模様は、長年の使用と摩耗によってかなり色褪せています。"

#. ~ Variant name of item "army jacket"
#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
msgid "desert-camo combat jacket"
msgid_plural "desert-camo combat jackets"
msgstr[0] "軍用ジャケット(砂漠迷彩)"

#. ~ Description of variant "desert-camo combat jacket" of item "army jacket"
#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
msgid ""
"This jacket's brass zipper runs from collar to hem, a river of metallic "
"brown knitting together the coat's arid-hued lapels, printed with a 3-tone "
"mix of pale green, dark brown, and beige.  Looking at it, you wonder how "
"many zombies are wandering about the gulf right now."
msgstr ""
"ペールグリーン、ダークブラウン、ベージュの3色が混ざった迷彩パターンのジャケットです。襟から裾にかけて真鍮のジッパーが伸びており、さながら乾いた色の大地に流れるメタリックブラウンの一筋の川のようです。これを見ていると、ペルシア湾を徘徊しているゾンビの規模について思いを馳せたくなります。"

#. ~ Variant name of item "army jacket"
#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
msgid "olive-drab combat jacket"
msgid_plural "olive-drab combat jackets"
msgstr[0] "軍用ジャケット(ｵﾘｰﾌﾞﾄﾞﾗﾌﾞ)"

#. ~ Description of variant "olive-drab combat jacket" of item "army jacket"
#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
msgid ""
"Lacking much frills and fanfare, this simple, traditional jacket is dyed a "
"solid shade of olive green with a brass zipper and buttons."
msgstr "装飾や派手さがあまりない、真鍮製のジッパーとボタンが付いた、オリーブグリーン一色のシンプルで伝統的なジャケットです。"

#. ~ Variant name of item "army jacket"
#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
msgid "mottled-camo combat jacket"
msgid_plural "mottled-camo combat jackets"
msgstr[0] "軍用ジャケット(まだら迷彩)"

#. ~ Description of variant "mottled-camo combat jacket" of item "army jacket"
#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
msgid ""
"This particular garment has a base hue of dark tan, coated by myriad spots, "
"blobs, and splotches of green, reddish brown, black, and greyish green to "
"form a mottled, disruptive camouflage pattern."
msgstr "濃い黄褐色の基本色に、緑色、赤褐色、黒色、灰緑色の大小様々な斑を無数に散りばめた、目が眩みそうなまだら模様の迷彩ジャケットです。"

#. ~ Variant name of item "army jacket"
#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
msgid "ocean-camouflage combat jacket"
msgid_plural "ocean-camouflage combat jackets"
msgstr[0] "軍用ジャケット(海洋迷彩)"

#. ~ Description of variant "ocean-camouflage combat jacket" of item "army
#. jacket"
#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
msgid ""
"This jacket's exterior shell is dyed a mix of blue and grey hues, with extra"
" patches and disruptive striations, flipping between black and dark grey, "
"covering the garment from collar to hem.  Chrome buttons, zips, and other "
"fixtures glint from their home upon the coat."
msgstr ""
"青色と灰色を組み合わせた色彩にまだら模様が散りばめられ、更に明暗の差が強く目が眩みそうな黒色とダークグレーのストライプが襟から袖までを覆い、クロームメッキのボタンやジッパーが布地の上で輝いています。"

#. ~ Variant name of item "army jacket"
#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
msgid "digital-camo combat jacket"
msgid_plural "digital-camo combat jackets"
msgstr[0] "軍用ジャケット(ﾃﾞｼﾞﾀﾙ迷彩)"

#. ~ Description of variant "digital-camo combat jacket" of item "army jacket"
#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
msgid ""
"The fabric of this particular jacket is coated in the pixelized camouflage "
"pattern of the United States Army's former combat uniform, combining a sand-"
"brown base with disruptive patterns of urban grey and sage green, as well as"
" plastic zips and buttons."
msgstr ""
"アメリカ陸軍の戦闘服としてかつて使われていた、ピクセル状の迷彩パターンで覆われた特徴的なジャケットです。サンドブラウンの基本色にアーバングレーとセージグリーンの目が眩みそうな模様が散りばめられ、プラスチック製のジッパーとボタンが取り付けられています。"

#. ~ Variant name of item "army jacket"
#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
msgid "urban black combat jacket"
msgid_plural "urban black combat jackets"
msgstr[0] "軍用ジャケット(ｱｰﾊﾞﾝﾌﾞﾗｯｸ)"

#. ~ Description of variant "urban black combat jacket" of item "army jacket"
#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
msgid ""
"Fitted with a brass main zip and corresponding buttons, this entire jacket "
"forgoes frivolities and is, instead, dyed a solid shade of midnight black."
msgstr "真鍮のジッパーとボタンが取り付けられたこのジャケットは、華美な要素を排したミッドナイトブラックの深い色合いで染め上げられています。"

#. ~ Variant name of item "army jacket"
#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
msgid "splinter-camo combat jacket"
msgid_plural "splinter-camo combat jackets"
msgstr[0] "軍用ジャケット(ｽﾌﾟﾘﾝﾀｰ迷彩)"

#. ~ Description of variant "splinter-camo combat jacket" of item "army
#. jacket"
#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
msgid ""
"This particular jacket is sown from fabric dyed a base color of stoney grey "
"with notes of brown, sprinkled through with large, splinter-like geometric "
"shapes of green, grey, and hues of deep naval blue."
msgstr ""
"ブラウンに近いストーニーグレーで染色された生地に、緑色、灰色、濃いネイビーブルーの大きな幾何学模様が散りばめられている、特徴的な迷彩模様のジャケットです。"

#. ~ Variant name of item "army jacket"
#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
msgid "coyote combat jacket"
msgid_plural "coyote combat jackets"
msgstr[0] "軍用ジャケット(ｺﾖｰﾃﾌﾞﾗｳﾝ)"

#. ~ Description of variant "coyote combat jacket" of item "army jacket"
#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
msgid ""
"Dyed in a solid shade of rugged, earthen brown with a brass main zip and "
"press-studs, this is a relatively handsome coat, so far as reproduction "
"military equipment goes.  Obviously, the would-be soldier, prepper, and "
"general wearer would most appreciate its utility in going undercover among "
"the insurgent coyote population."
msgstr ""
"真鍮のジッパーとスナップボタンが付いた、軍服の模造品としては比較的お洒落な、濃い土色の無骨なコートです。軍事オタクやプレッパー、その他一般人がコヨーテブラウンのジャケットを着た反乱軍の内部に潜入したいときは、まさにこの服の出番です。"

#. ~ Description of variant "woodland-camo combat jacket" of item "army
#. jacket"
#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
msgid ""
"Dyed in a 4-tone blend of worn green, black, sand, and brown hues, this "
"particular overcoat had been your own issued service jacket when you'd still"
" been in the forces, with your name stitched upon the right lapel and "
"insignia pinned to the appropriate shoulder board."
msgstr ""
"軍隊に所属していたときに支給された、緑色、黒色、茶色、砂色の4色迷彩パターンで覆われている、年季の入った上着です。右の襟には名前が刺繍されており、短冊形の肩章の決められた位置に階級章がピン留めされています。"

#. ~ Description of a pocket in item "army jacket"
#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
msgid "Button-fastened hip pocket."
msgstr "ボタンで留めるフラップが付いた尻ポケットです。"

#. ~ Description of a pocket in item "army jacket"
#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
msgid "Button-fastened chest pocket."
msgstr "ボタンで留めるフラップが付いた正面ポケットです。"

#. ~ Description of a pocket in item "army jacket"
#. ~ Description of a pocket in item "tactical jacket"
#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
msgid "Velcro-fastened internal pocket."
msgstr "マジックテープで留めるフラップが付いた内ポケットです。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
msgid "combat blouse"
msgid_plural "combat blouses"
msgstr[0] "軍用トップス"

#. ~ Description of "combat blouse"
#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
msgid ""
"A sleek blouse in a camouflage pattern with angled breast pockets and lots "
"of loop velcro for affixing patches.  You might call it a jacket but it's "
"really a blouse.  It has a pocket for your pen!"
msgstr ""
"斜めに縫い付けられたポケットと、ワッペンを貼るためにあちこちに付いたマジックテープ素材が特徴的な、迷彩柄のなめらかなトップスです。ジャケットという呼び方もありますが、正式名称はブラウスです。ペンを入れるポケットも付いていますよ！"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
msgid "chef's jacket"
msgid_plural "chef's jackets"
msgstr[0] "シェフコート"

#. ~ Description of "chef's jacket"
#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
msgid "A double-breasted uniform to protect against the heat of the kitchen."
msgstr "調理場の熱から肉体を保護する、ダブル仕立ての制服です。"

#. ~ Variant name of item "chef's jacket"
#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
msgid "white chef's jacket"
msgid_plural "white chef's jackets"
msgstr[0] "シェフコート(白)"

#. ~ Description of variant "white chef's jacket" of item "chef's jacket"
#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
msgid "It's colored white, the most common color for chef's jackets."
msgstr "シェフコートとして代表的な白色のデザインです。"

#. ~ Variant name of item "chef's jacket"
#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
msgid "black chef's jacket"
msgid_plural "black chef's jackets"
msgstr[0] "シェフコート(黒)"

#. ~ Description of variant "black chef's jacket" of item "chef's jacket"
#. ~ Description of variant "black long waist apron" of item "long waist
#. apron"
#. ~ Description of variant "black short waist apron" of item "short waist
#. apron"
#. ~ Description of variant "black cotton apron" of item "cotton apron"
#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json data/json/items/armor/torso_clothes.json
msgid ""
"It's colored black, commonly used by chefs working in the night or who just "
"want to look cool."
msgstr "夜勤の料理人や格好つけたい人がよく着用している、黒色のデザインです。"

#. ~ Variant name of item "chef's jacket"
#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
msgid "blue chef's jacket"
msgid_plural "blue chef's jackets"
msgstr[0] "シェフコート(青)"

#. ~ Description of variant "blue chef's jacket" of item "chef's jacket"
#. ~ Description of variant "blue toque" of item "toque"
#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json data/json/items/armor/hats.json
msgid "It's a royal blue color."
msgstr "このコートはロイヤルブルーのデザインです。"

#. ~ Variant name of item "chef's jacket"
#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
msgid "red chef's jacket"
msgid_plural "red chef's jackets"
msgstr[0] "シェフコート(赤)"

#. ~ Description of variant "red chef's jacket" of item "chef's jacket"
#. ~ Description of variant "red toque" of item "toque"
