#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/holster.json
msgid "back holster"
msgid_plural "back holsters"
msgstr[0] "バックホルスター"

#. ~ Description of "back holster"
#: data/json/items/armor/holster.json
msgid ""
"A leather holster, big enough for a rifle or other large gun.  Designed to "
"be strapped to the back.  Activate to holster/draw a gun."
msgstr "ライフルなどの大型の銃も十分収められる革製のホルスターです。背中に括り付けて使用します。使用すると銃を収納/装備します。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/holster.json
msgid "baldric holster"
msgid_plural "baldric holsters"
msgstr[0] "バルドリックホルスター"

#. ~ Description of "baldric holster"
#: data/json/items/armor/holster.json
msgid ""
"A leather harness which can hold up to six pistol-sized guns in total, "
"available for quick drawing.  Historically, similar harnesses were used by "
"pirates to carry multiple loaded flintlock pistols at once, as reloading "
"them is a lengthy process.  Activate to holster/draw a gun."
msgstr ""
"ハンドガンサイズの銃を合計6丁まで収納して素早く抜き放てる、革製のハーネスです。かつて海賊はこれと似たようなものを使い、装填に時間がかかるフリントロック式ピストルをすぐに撃てる状態にして一度にたくさん持ち歩いていました。使用すると銃を収納/装備します。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/holster.json
msgid "ankle holster"
msgid_plural "ankle holsters"
msgstr[0] "アンクルホルスター"

#. ~ Description of "ankle holster"
#: data/json/items/armor/holster.json
msgid ""
"A small concealed holster worn on the ankle.  It is awkward to use without "
"practice.  Activate to holster/draw a small pistol."
msgstr "足首に着ける小さな隠しホルスターです。練習なしでは使いこなせません。使用すると小型のピストルを収納/装備します。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/holster.json
msgid "bow sling"
msgid_plural "bow slings"
msgstr[0] "ボウスリンガー"

#. ~ Description of "bow sling"
#: data/json/items/armor/holster.json
msgid ""
"A somewhat complicated set of straps and fabric to keep your bow close to "
"hand and (mostly) out of harm's way.  Activate to holster/draw your bow."
msgstr "ストラップと布を組み合わせて作った、(通常よりは)邪魔にならないように弓を持ち運ぶための道具です。使用すると弓を収納/装備します。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/holster.json
msgid "single point sling"
msgid_plural "single point slings"
msgstr[0] "1点式負い紐"

#. ~ Description of "single point sling"
#: data/json/items/armor/holster.json
msgid ""
"A harness going over your shoulder and across your chest.  Designed to "
"connect to a rifle at a single point with the rifle hanging off your front."
"  Great for fighting, not great for travel.  Activate to holster/draw your "
"weapon."
msgstr ""
"たすき掛けに着用する負い紐です。ライフルを一か所で接続し、身体の正面にぶら下げられるようになっています。戦闘には便利ですが、着用したままの長距離の移動には適しません。使用すると銃を収納/装備します。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/holster.json
msgid "holster"
msgid_plural "holsters"
msgstr[0] "ホルスター"

#. ~ Description of "holster"
#: data/json/items/armor/holster.json
msgid ""
"A leather strap worn on the hip for holding pistol-sized guns.  Activate to "
"holster/draw a gun."
msgstr "拳銃サイズの銃を収納できる、腰回りにつける革製のストラップです。使用すると銃を収納/装備します。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/holster.json
msgid "nylon holster"
msgid_plural "nylon holsters"
msgstr[0] "ナイロンホルスター"

#. ~ Description of "nylon holster"
#: data/json/items/armor/holster.json
msgid ""
"Holster made from nylon, rather than leather.  A bit stronger and lighter, "
"but not as fashionable.  Activate to draw/holster a gun."
msgstr "革ではなくナイロン製のホルスターです。多少丈夫で軽いですが、あまりお洒落ではありません。使用すると銃を収納/装備します。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/holster.json
msgid "western gun belt"
msgid_plural "western gun belts"
msgstr[0] "ウェスタンガンベルト"

#. ~ Description of "western gun belt"
#: data/json/items/armor/holster.json
msgid ""
"A Western-style gun belt as worn by cowboys and gunfighters in the movies "
"and on TV. Has loops across the back to hold spare ammo.  Activate to "
"holster/draw a gun."
msgstr ""
"映画やテレビ番組でカウボーイやガンマンが使っている西部劇風ガンベルトです。背面に予備の弾薬を収納できるポケットが付いています。使用すると銃を収納/装備します。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/holster.json
msgid "fast draw holster"
msgid_plural "fast draw holsters"
msgstr[0] "早撃ちホルスター"

#. ~ Description of "fast draw holster"
#: data/json/items/armor/holster.json
msgid ""
"A comfortable quick-draw holster for small guns.  Activate to holster/draw a"
" gun."
msgstr "小型の銃を素早く引き抜ける、着け心地のいいホルスターです。使用すると銃を収納/装備します。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/holster.json
msgid "shoulder holster"
msgid_plural "shoulder holsters"
msgstr[0] "ショルダーホルスター"

#. ~ Description of "shoulder holster"
#: data/json/items/armor/holster.json
msgid ""
"A comfortable quick-draw holster for larger pistols.  One side holsters a "
"gun, and the other side holds two magazines.  Activate to holster/draw a "
"gun."
msgstr ""
"大型のピストルを素早く引き抜ける、着け心地のいいホルスターです。片側に銃を1丁、もう片側に弾倉を2個収納できます。使用すると銃を収納/装備します。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/holster.json
msgid "deep concealment holster"
msgid_plural "deep concealment holsters"
msgstr[0] "コンシールメントホルスター"

#. ~ Description of "deep concealment holster"
#: data/json/items/armor/holster.json
msgid ""
"An elastic band with numerous provisions for concealing a very small pistol "
"close to the body.  It is awkward to use without practice.  Activate to "
"holster/draw a gun."
msgstr "非常に小さな拳銃を身体に密着させて隠し持つためのゴムバンドです。練習なしでは使いこなせません。使用すると銃を収納/装備します。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/holster.json
msgid "belly band holster"
msgid_plural "belly band holsters"
msgstr[0] "腰巻きホルスター"

#. ~ Description of "belly band holster"
#: data/json/items/armor/holster.json
msgid ""
"A wide elastic belly belt with a built-in holster for a pistol and a spare "
"magazine.  It is very awkward to use without practice.  Activate to "
"holster/draw a gun."
msgstr "ハンドガンと弾倉用のポケットを内蔵した、腰に巻き付ける幅広のベルトです。練習なしでは使いこなせません。使用すると銃を収納/装備します。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/holster.json
msgid "side-by-side double holster"
msgid_plural "side-by-side double holsters"
msgstr[0] "サイドダブルホルスター"

#. ~ Description of "side-by-side double holster"
#: data/json/items/armor/holster.json
msgid ""
"Two holsters attached together by a strap, right next to each other.  The "
"placement means that drawing guns out of either one is slower than a regular"
" holster.  Activate to holster/draw a gun."
msgstr ""
"2つのホルスターをストラップで繋げて両サイドに配置したものです。左右どちらの手でも銃を引き抜けますが、通常のホルスターより速度は遅くなります。使用すると銃を収納/装備します。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/holster.json
msgid "front-to-back double holster"
msgid_plural "front-to-back double holsters"
msgstr[0] "ダブルホルスター"

#. ~ Description of "front-to-back double holster"
#: data/json/items/armor/holster.json
msgid ""
"Two holsters attached together by a strap, one in front of the other.  The "
"placement means that drawing a gun out of the front holster is slower than "
"the other holster.  Activate to holster/draw a gun."
msgstr ""
"2つのホルスターをストラップで前後に並べて繋げたものです。前方のホルスターから銃を引き抜く場合、通常のホルスターより速度は遅くなります。使用すると銃を収納/装備します。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/holster.json
msgid "nylon side-by-side double holster"
msgid_plural "nylon side-by-side double holsters"
msgstr[0] "サイドダブルナイロンホルスター"

#. ~ Description of "nylon side-by-side double holster"
#: data/json/items/armor/holster.json
msgid ""
"Two nylon holsters attached together by a strap, right next to each other.  "
"The placement means that drawing guns out of either one is slower than a "
"regular holster.  Activate to holster/draw a gun."
msgstr ""
"2つのナイロン製ホルスターをストラップで繋げて両サイドに配置したものです。左右どちらの手でも銃を引き抜けますが、通常のホルスターより速度は遅くなります。使用すると銃を収納/装備します。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/holster.json
msgid "nylon front-to-back double holster"
msgid_plural "nylon front-to-back double holsters"
msgstr[0] "ダブルナイロンホルスター"

#. ~ Description of "nylon front-to-back double holster"
#: data/json/items/armor/holster.json
msgid ""
"Two nylon holsters attached together by a strap, one in front of the other."
"  The placement means that drawing a gun out of the front holster is slower "
"than the other holster.  Activate to holster/draw a gun."
msgstr ""
"2つのナイロン製ホルスターをストラップで前後に並べて繋げたものです。前方のホルスターから銃を引き抜く場合、通常のホルスターより速度は遅くなります。使用すると銃を収納/装備します。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/holster.json
msgid "large holster"
msgid_plural "large holsters"
msgstr[0] "大型ホルスター"

#. ~ Description of "large holster"
#: data/json/items/armor/holster.json
msgid ""
"A belt holster consisting of a loop and strap intended for use with larger "
"firearms.  Slightly more cumbersome than a standard holster due to the "
"straps that hold it flat against your leg.  Activate to holster/draw a gun."
msgstr ""
"大型銃器を収納できる、ループとストラップで固定するベルトホルスターです。普通のホルスターよりも扱いが厄介で、左右どちらかの脚に干渉します。使用すると銃を収納/装備します。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/holster.json
msgid "large nylon holster"
msgid_plural "large nylon holsters"
msgstr[0] "大型ナイロンホルスター"

#. ~ Description of "large nylon holster"
#: data/json/items/armor/holster.json
msgid ""
"A belt holster consisting of a loop and strap intended for use with larger "
"firearms, but made with nylon instead of leather.  Activate to holster/draw "
"a gun"
msgstr "大型銃器を収納できる、ループとストラップで固定する、革ではなくナイロン製のベルトホルスターです。使用すると銃を収納/装備します。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/hoods.json
msgid "beekeeping hood"
msgid_plural "beekeeping hoods"
msgstr[0] "蜂防護フード"

#. ~ Description of "beekeeping hood"
#: data/json/items/armor/hoods.json
msgid "A beekeeping hood.  Keeps the bees out, but lets fresh air in."
msgstr "養蜂用のフードです。蜂を防ぎつつも新鮮な空気を取り込めます。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/hoods.json
msgid "chainmail coif"
msgid_plural "chainmail coifs"
msgstr[0] "チェーンメイルコイフ"

#. ~ Description of "chainmail coif"
#. ~ Description of "mild steel chainmail coif"
#: data/json/items/armor/hoods.json
msgid "A customized chainmail hood.  Can be worn comfortably under helmets."
msgstr "チェーンメイルで作られた、特別仕立てのフードです。ヘルメットの下に快適に着用できます。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/hoods.json
msgid "mild steel chainmail coif"
msgid_plural "mild steel chainmail coifs"
msgstr[0] "チェーンメイルコイフ(低炭素鋼)"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/hoods.json
msgid "medium steel chainmail coif"
msgid_plural "medium steel chainmail coifs"
msgstr[0] "チェーンメイルコイフ(中炭素鋼)"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/hoods.json
msgid "high steel chainmail coif"
msgid_plural "high steel chainmail coifs"
msgstr[0] "チェーンメイルコイフ(高炭素鋼)"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/hoods.json
msgid "hardened steel chainmail coif"
msgid_plural "hardened steel chainmail coifs"
msgstr[0] "チェーンメイルコイフ(焼入炭素鋼)"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/hoods.json
msgid "tempered steel chainmail coif"
msgid_plural "tempered steel chainmail coifs"
msgstr[0] "チェーンメイルコイフ(焼戻炭素鋼)"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/hoods.json
msgid "rain hood"
msgid_plural "rain hoods"
msgstr[0] "レインフード"

#. ~ Description of "rain hood"
#: data/json/items/armor/hoods.json
msgid "A waterproof hood made to be worn in bad weather."
msgstr "悪天候時の着用を想定して作られた、防水素材のフードです。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/hoods.json
msgid "flame-resistant hood"
msgid_plural "flame-resistant hoods"
msgstr[0] "耐火フード"

#. ~ Description of "flame-resistant hood"
#: data/json/items/armor/hoods.json
msgid ""
"A snug fitting garment that protects your head and neck, made from "
"lightweight Nomex fire-resistant fabric.  Tough yet breathable, it is light "
"and comfortable to wear under clothing."
msgstr "軽量なノーメックス製の、頭と首を守るピッチリした耐火服です。頑丈な上に通気性もあり、軽くて肌触りも良好です。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/hoods.json
msgid "gutskin hood"
msgid_plural "gutskin hoods"
msgstr[0] "腸製フード"

#. ~ Description of "gutskin hood"
#: data/json/items/armor/hoods.json
msgid ""
"A hood sewn from treated and split intestines, the perfect companion for a "
"gutskin parka."
msgstr "洗浄した腸を縫い合わせて作ったフードです。腸製衣によく似合います。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/hoods.json
msgid "ninja hood"
msgid_plural "ninja hoods"
msgstr[0] "ニンジャフード"

#. ~ Description of "ninja hood"
#: data/json/items/armor/hoods.json
msgid "A black hood commonly used by ninja."
msgstr "ニンジャがよく被っている黒いフードです。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/integrated.json
msgid "phelloderm"
msgid_plural "phelloderms"
msgstr[0] "コルク皮膚"

#. ~ Description of "phelloderm"
#: data/json/items/armor/integrated.json
msgid "A pliable but hefty layer of living plant matter."
msgstr "しなやかで重厚感もある、生きた植物の表皮に覆われています。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/integrated.json
msgid "protective bark"
msgid_plural "protective bark"
msgstr[0] "装甲樹皮"

#. ~ Description of "protective bark"
#: data/json/items/armor/integrated.json
msgid "A powerful layer of bark, thicker in parts."
msgstr "部分的に厚みを増した、頑丈な樹皮の層です。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/integrated.json
msgid "distributed bark"
msgid_plural "distributed bark"
msgstr[0] "分散樹皮装甲"

#. ~ Description of "distributed bark"
#: data/json/items/armor/integrated.json
msgid "Your bark is spread evenly across your body."
msgstr "均等な厚さの樹皮が全身を覆っています。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/integrated.json
msgid "consolidated bark"
msgid_plural "consolidated bark"
msgstr[0] "胴体樹皮装甲"

#. ~ Description of "consolidated bark"
#: data/json/items/armor/integrated.json
msgid "Your bark is pulled together to protect your torso."
msgstr "樹皮が胴を厚く覆っています。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/integrated.json
msgid "latticed bark"
msgid_plural "latticed bark"
msgstr[0] "格子状樹皮装甲"

#. ~ Description of "latticed bark"
#: data/json/items/armor/integrated.json
msgid "Your bark is latticed into a larger frame."
msgstr "樹皮が格子状に身体を覆っています。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/integrated.json
#: data/mods/Limb_WIP/armor/limb_armor.json
msgid "feathers"
msgid_plural "feathers"
msgstr[0] "羽毛"

#. ~ Description of "feathers"
#: data/json/items/armor/integrated.json
msgid ""
"Iridescent feathers covering your entire body.  Provides some warmth and "
"protection from the elements, but could be thicker."
msgstr "虹色の羽毛が全身を覆っています。ある程度の寒さを防ぎ、風雨から肉体を保護しますが、動き辛いかもしれません。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/integrated.json
msgid "light fur"
msgid_plural "light fur"
msgstr[0] "薄い毛皮"

#. ~ Description of "light fur"
#: data/json/items/armor/integrated.json
msgid "Thin, patchy fur that clearly needs to grow more."
msgstr "皮膚に毛が薄くまだらに生えています。毛皮というにはまだ薄すぎます。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/integrated.json
msgid "fur"
msgid_plural "fur"
msgstr[0] "毛皮"

#. ~ Description of "fur"
#: data/json/items/armor/integrated.json
msgid "Though it's quite warm, your fur is also quite protective."
msgstr "毛皮はかなり暖かく、更に防御力も備わっています。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/integrated.json
msgid "shaggy fur"
msgid_plural "shaggy furs"
msgstr[0] "長い毛皮"

#. ~ Description of "shaggy fur"
#: data/json/items/armor/integrated.json
msgid ""
"A heavy shag carpet of fur, somewhere between a ballistic vest and attic "
"insulation."
msgstr "防弾チョッキよりは厚く屋根裏の断熱材よりは薄い、重厚な毛皮が生えています。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/integrated.json
msgid "scruffy fur"
msgid_plural "scruffy furs"
msgstr[0] "換毛"

#. ~ Description of "scruffy fur"
#: data/json/items/armor/integrated.json
msgid ""
"While still formidable, this furry hide has lost a lot of its bulk to better"
" endure the summer months."
msgstr "密集していることには変わりありませんが、夏の暑さに負けないよう毛がかなり抜け落ちました。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/integrated.json
msgid "gray fur"
msgid_plural "gray furs"
msgstr[0] "灰色の毛皮"

#. ~ Description of "gray fur"
#: data/json/items/armor/integrated.json
msgid "The fur of a strong, wild creature."
msgstr "野性的な生物の丈夫な毛皮です。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/integrated.json
msgid "summer coat"
msgid_plural "summer coats"
msgstr[0] "夏毛皮"

#. ~ Description of "summer coat"
#: data/json/items/armor/integrated.json
msgid "A covering of fur that has thinned out for the summer."
msgstr "夏に向けて薄くなった毛皮です。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/integrated.json
msgid "sleek fur"
msgid_plural "sleek furs"
msgstr[0] "滑らかな毛皮"

#. ~ Description of "sleek fur"
#: data/json/items/armor/integrated.json
msgid "The fur of a proud, wise creature."
msgstr "賢い生物の立派な毛皮です。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/integrated.json
msgid "lynx fur"
msgid_plural "lynx furs"
msgstr[0] "ヤマネコの毛皮"

#. ~ Description of "lynx fur"
#: data/json/items/armor/integrated.json
msgid ""
"A pile of fur around the neck, protecting from foes that go for the throat."
msgstr "喉を狙う敵から身を守るため、首の周りの毛皮が特に厚くなっています。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/integrated.json
msgid "jumbled skin"
msgid_plural "jumbled skins"
msgstr[0] "不揃いの皮膚"

#. ~ Description of "jumbled skin"
#: data/json/items/armor/integrated.json
msgid ""
"Skin like a spilled tub of paints, splattered in abstract shapes of chitin, "
"fur, and hide."
msgstr "絵の具がこぼれたように色鮮やかな皮膚や甲殻、毛皮が入り混じって生えています。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/integrated.json
msgid "patchwork skin"
msgid_plural "patchwork skins"
msgstr[0] "まだら皮膚"

#. ~ Description of "patchwork skin"
#: data/json/items/armor/integrated.json
msgid ""
"Beauty is only skin deep, but with this skin, a knife might find itself "
"broken in the beauty layer."
msgstr "一見するとただ美しいだけのように見えますが、この皮膚はナイフを跳ね返すほど強靭です。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/integrated.json
msgid "patchwork armor"
msgid_plural "patchwork armor"
msgstr[0] "まだら装甲皮膚"

#. ~ Description of "patchwork armor"
#: data/json/items/armor/integrated.json
msgid ""
"Folks that can't catch bullets with their skin insist that it's what's on "
"the inside that counts.  Those folks don't know anything."
msgstr "皮膚で弾丸すら受け止められない奴らは、中身が大事などと主張します。連中は何も分かっていません。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/integrated.json
msgid "mandibles"
msgid_plural "mandibles"
msgstr[0] "虫顎"

#. ~ Description of "mandibles"
#: data/json/items/armor/integrated.json
msgid "These are much better than puny human mouthparts."
msgstr "人間のちっぽけな口よりずっと便利です。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/integrated.json
msgid "folding fangs"
msgid_plural "folding fangs"
msgstr[0] "伸縮自在の牙"

#. ~ Description of "folding fangs"
#: data/json/items/armor/integrated.json
msgid "Your fangs have properly developed, and are prepared for the kill."
msgstr "牙が大きく発達しており、殺傷能力もあります。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/integrated.json
msgid "epicuticle"
msgid_plural "epicuticles"
msgstr[0] "外表皮"

#. ~ Description of "epicuticle"
#: data/json/items/armor/integrated.json
msgid ""
"Your chitinous skin doesn't sweat so well and it's a bit stiffer than "
"before, but it's far more durable than your old human skin."
msgstr "キチン質の肌は汗をかきにくく、以前より少し柔軟性が失われましたが、人間の肌に比べれば遥かに丈夫です。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/integrated.json
msgid "chitin carapace"
msgid_plural "chitin carapaces"
msgstr[0] "キチン外殻"

#. ~ Description of "chitin carapace"
#: data/json/items/armor/integrated.json
msgid "The skin hardens, develops.  Good, it will be needed."
msgstr "まさに求めていた通り、皮膚が発達して硬くなりました。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/integrated.json
msgid "fresh chitin carapace"
msgid_plural "fresh chitin carapaces"
msgstr[0] "柔らかいキチン外殻"

#. ~ Description of "fresh chitin carapace"
#: data/json/items/armor/integrated.json
msgid ""
"The exoskeleton is soft and vulnerable.  It would be best to hide until it "
"hardens."
msgstr "柔らかく傷つきやすい外骨格です。硬くなるまで隠れていた方がいいかもしれません。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/integrated.json
msgid "sclerotin plate"
msgid_plural "sclerotin plate"
msgstr[0] "スクレロチン装甲"

#. ~ Description of "sclerotin plate"
#: data/json/items/armor/integrated.json
msgid ""
"When the time comes to prey, this platemail will be ready for any "
"resistance."
msgstr "もし捕食されそうになっても、この天然のプレートメイルがあればきっと対抗できます。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/integrated.json
msgid "fresh sclerotin plate"
msgid_plural "fresh sclerotin plate"
msgstr[0] "柔らかいスクレロチン装甲"

#. ~ Description of "fresh sclerotin plate"
#: data/json/items/armor/integrated.json
msgid "The exoskeleton is weak, it will require more time to harden."
msgstr "この外骨格は傷つきやすく、硬くなるまで時間がかかります。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/integrated.json
msgid "sclerotin claws"
msgid_plural "sclerotin claws"
msgstr[0] "スクレロチンの爪"

#. ~ Description of "sclerotin claws"
#: data/json/items/armor/integrated.json
msgid "Useful for the hunt, suitable for maximum efficiency."
msgstr "極限まで効率化された、狩りに役立つ爪です。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/integrated.json
msgid "sclerotin carapace"
msgid_plural "sclerotin carapace"
msgstr[0] "スクレロチン外殻"

#. ~ Description of "sclerotin carapace"
#: data/json/items/armor/integrated.json
msgid ""
"When the time comes to prey, this unwavering carapace will keep you safe "
"from everything that could harm you."
msgstr "獲物を捕らえる際に、この頑丈な甲羅が反撃から肉体を守ってくれます。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/integrated.json
msgid "fresh sclerotin carapace"
msgid_plural "fresh sclerotin carapace"
msgstr[0] "柔らかいスクレロチン外殻"

#. ~ Description of "fresh sclerotin carapace"
#: data/json/items/armor/integrated.json
msgid ""
"This recently-molted carapace is still soft, and will need time to harden "
"before it provides proper protection."
msgstr "脱皮したばかりの外殻はまだ柔らかく、装甲として機能するまでには時間がかかります。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/integrated.json
msgid "sclerotin right pincer"
msgid_plural "sclerotin right pincer"
msgstr[0] "発達した右はさみ"

#. ~ Description of "sclerotin right pincer"
#: data/json/items/armor/integrated.json
msgid "A powerful tool for snatching fish or breaking open shells."
msgstr "魚を掴んだり、貝殻を割ったりするのに使える強力な道具です。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/integrated.json
msgid "shell"
msgid_plural "shell"
msgstr[0] "殻"

#. ~ Description of "shell"
#: data/json/items/armor/integrated.json
msgid ""
"You have a large, protective shell on your back, but unfortunately, it "
"doesn't have enough space to fit inside or store anything, makes wearing "
"anything on your torso impossible, and makes backpacks encumbering."
msgstr ""
"背中に大きな殻がありますが、残念ながら中に入ったり荷物を収納したりはできません。胴に衣服や防具を着用できず、バックパックなども嵩張って邪魔になります。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/integrated.json
msgid "roomy shell"
msgid_plural "roomy shell"
msgstr[0] "大きな殻"

#. ~ Description of "roomy shell"
#: data/json/items/armor/integrated.json
msgid ""
"Your shell has grown larger and thicker.  You can hide yourself in it, as "
"well as use it as a backpack, but torso armor is still off limits."
msgstr "甲羅が大きく厚く発達しました。中に身を隠したり、バックパックのように荷物を入れることもできますが、やはり胴に衣服や防具を着用できません。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/integrated.json
msgid "nacreous shell"
msgid_plural "nacreous shell"
msgstr[0] "真珠層の殻"

#. ~ Description of "nacreous shell"
#: data/json/items/armor/integrated.json
msgid ""
"Your shell has grown larger and even thicker, and has a pearly sheen to it."
"  You can hide yourself in it, as well as use it as a backpack, but torso "
"armor is still off limits."
msgstr ""
"甲羅が大きく厚く発達し、更に真珠のような光沢が生じています。中に身を隠したり、バックパックのように荷物を入れることもできますが、やはり胴に衣服や防具を着用できません。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/integrated.json
#: data/mods/Aftershock/mutations/integrated.json
msgid "sparse scales"
msgid_plural "sparse scales"
msgstr[0] "まばらな鱗"

#. ~ Description of "sparse scales"
#: data/json/items/armor/integrated.json
msgid "Your dermis has toughened and started to grow scales in places."
msgstr "真皮が硬質化し、鱗がまばらに生えています。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/integrated.json
msgid "scales"
msgid_plural "scales"
msgstr[0] "鱗"

#. ~ Description of "scales"
#: data/json/items/armor/integrated.json
msgid ""
"Your scales have grown thicker and cover most of your body, providing solid "
"armor."
msgstr "鱗が肉体の大部分を厚く覆い、強固な鎧を形成しています。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/integrated.json
msgid "sleek scales"
msgid_plural "sleek scales"
msgstr[0] "滑らかな鱗"

#. ~ Description of "sleek scales"
#: data/json/items/armor/integrated.json
msgid "Your skin has become a smooth and elegant mesh of interlocking scales."
msgstr "肌を滑らかな鱗が覆い、美しい網目模様を形作っています。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/integrated.json
#: data/mods/Aftershock/mutations/integrated.json
msgid "thick scales"
msgid_plural "thick scales"
msgstr[0] "厚い鱗"

#. ~ Description of "thick scales"
#: data/json/items/armor/integrated.json
#: data/mods/Aftershock/mutations/integrated.json
msgid ""
"Leathery and heavily armored, your lamellar skin has toughened for the "
"fiercest battles ahead."
msgstr "激しい戦いにも耐える、層状になった革鎧のような肌です。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/integrated.json
msgid "protective lenses"
msgid_plural "protective lenses"
msgstr[0] "保護レンズ"

#. ~ Description of "protective lenses"
#: data/json/items/armor/integrated.json
msgid ""
"Highly protective lenses which seal off your eyes from danger, routing your "
"tear ducts to your mouth."
msgstr "非常に保護性能の高いレンズです。目へのダメージを防ぎ、涙管は口内と繋がっています。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/integrated.json
msgid "claws"
msgid_plural "claws"
msgstr[0] "鉤爪"

#. ~ Description of "claws"
#: data/json/items/armor/integrated.json
msgid "You have long, sharp claws at the tips of your fingers."
msgstr "指先から長く鋭い爪が生えています。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/integrated.json
msgid "gnarled claws"
msgid_plural "gnarled claws"
msgstr[0] "捻じれた鉤爪"

#. ~ Description of "gnarled claws"
#: data/json/items/armor/integrated.json
msgid "Your fingernails have become gnarled, twisted claws."
msgstr "指先から捻じれて歪んだ長い爪が生えています。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/integrated.json
msgid "stainless claws"
msgid_plural "stainless claws"
msgstr[0] "ステンレスの爪"

#. ~ Description of "stainless claws"
#: data/json/items/armor/integrated.json
msgid ""
"Your claws have toughened to become something akin to miniature butcher "
"knives."
msgstr "まるで小さな肉切り包丁のような硬い爪が生えています。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/integrated.json data/mods/Magiclysm/items/armor.json
msgid "talons"
msgid_plural "talons"
msgstr[0] "猛禽の鉤爪"

#. ~ Description of "talons"
#: data/json/items/armor/integrated.json data/mods/Magiclysm/items/armor.json
msgid ""
"Your index fingers have become talons.  They make for wicked natural "
"daggers.  Unfortunately, they get in the way of everything including gloves."
msgstr "人差し指の先から、短剣のような凶悪な鉤爪が生えています。残念ながら、手袋などのアイテムを手に着用できません。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/integrated.json
msgid "fangs"
msgid_plural "fangs"
msgstr[0] "牙"

#. ~ Description of "fangs"
#: data/json/items/armor/integrated.json
msgid "A pair of fangs sharp and sturdy enough to use in combat."
msgstr "戦闘に活用できるほど鋭く頑丈な一対の牙です。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/integrated.json data/json/items/armor/misc.json
msgid "vampire fangs"
msgid_plural "vampire fangs"
msgstr[0] "吸血鬼の牙"

#. ~ Description of "vampire fangs"
#: data/json/items/armor/integrated.json
msgid "A wicked pair of fangs, pointed and surgically sharp."
msgstr "肉に深く突き刺さりそうな、鋭く尖った一対の牙です。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/jewelry.json
msgid "beaded bracelet"
msgid_plural "beaded bracelets"
msgstr[0] "ブレスレット(ビーズ)"

#. ~ Description of "beaded bracelet"
#: data/json/items/armor/jewelry.json
msgid ""
"A simple bracelet of string and wooden beads.  Also doubles as a set of "
"prayer beads, if you're so inclined."
msgstr "紐と木製ビーズで作られたシンプルなブレスレットです。もし何かを祈りたくなったら、数珠の代わりとして使えそうです。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/jewelry.json
msgid "pair of beaded earrings"
msgid_plural "pairs of beaded earrings"
msgstr[0] "イヤリング(ビーズ)"

#. ~ Description of "pair of beaded earrings"
#: data/json/items/armor/jewelry.json
msgid "A simple pair of earrings made of string and wooden beads."
msgstr "紐と木製ビーズで作られたシンプルなイヤリングです。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/jewelry.json
msgid "beaded necklace"
msgid_plural "beaded necklaces"
msgstr[0] "ネックレス(ビーズ)"

#. ~ Description of "beaded necklace"
#: data/json/items/armor/jewelry.json
msgid ""
"A simple necklace made of string and wooden beads.  Also doubles as a set of"
" prayer beads, if you're so inclined."
msgstr "紐と木製ビーズで作られたシンプルなネックレスです。もし何かを祈りたくなったら、数珠の代わりとして使えそうです。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/jewelry.json
msgid "friendship bracelet"
msgid_plural "friendship bracelets"
msgstr[0] "友情のブレスレット"

#. ~ Description of "friendship bracelet"
#: data/json/items/armor/jewelry.json
msgid ""
"A homemade bracelet crafted from colorful knickknacks.  It's not very "
"expensive, but it's the effort that makes it special."
msgstr ""
"色とりどりの小間物でできた手作りのブレスレットです。決して高価ではありませんが、これを作るために払われた努力がこのブレスレットを特別なものにしています。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/jewelry.json
msgid "bronze medal"
msgid_plural "bronze medals"
msgstr[0] "銅メダル"

#. ~ Description of "bronze medal"
#: data/json/items/armor/jewelry.json
msgid ""
"A medal awarded for achieving third place in some event.  It might be worth "
"something if it was made of bronze; this one is made from brass."
msgstr ""
"何かのイベントで3位を勝ち取ったことを称えるメダルです。もし本当に青銅でできていたのならいくらかの価値はあったでしょうが...これは真鍮製です。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/jewelry.json
msgid "cowrie bracelet"
msgid_plural "cowrie bracelets"
msgstr[0] "ブレスレット(貝)"

#. ~ Description of "cowrie bracelet"
#: data/json/items/armor/jewelry.json
msgid ""
"A bracelet made of cowrie shells, valued in many African cultures such as "
"the Yoruba.  If you want, you could meditate with this."
msgstr "ヨルバ族など多くのアフリカ文化で珍重されている、コヤスガイの貝殻で作ったブレスレットです。霊感が強ければ、瞑想に使うことができます。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/jewelry.json
msgid "cowrie hair beads"
msgid_plural "sets of cowrie hair beads"
msgstr[0] "ヘアビーズ(貝)"

#. ~ Description of "cowrie hair beads"
#: data/json/items/armor/jewelry.json
msgid "An assortment of cowrie shells used to decorate locs or braids."
msgstr "ドレッドヘアやブレイズヘアの髪飾りとして使う、コヤスガイのヘアビーズです。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/jewelry.json
msgid "cowrie necklace"
msgid_plural "cowrie necklaces"
msgstr[0] "ネックレス(貝)"

#. ~ Description of "cowrie necklace"
#: data/json/items/armor/jewelry.json
msgid ""
"A necklace made of cowrie shells, valued in many African cultures such as "
"the Yoruba.  If you want, you could meditate with this."
msgstr "ヨルバ族など多くのアフリカ文化で珍重されている、コヤスガイの貝殻で作ったネックレスです。霊感が強ければ、瞑想に使うことができます。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/jewelry.json
msgid "diamond dental grill"
msgid_plural "diamond dental grills"
msgstr[0] "デンタルグリル(ﾀﾞｲﾔﾓﾝﾄﾞ)"

#. ~ Description of "diamond dental grill"
#: data/json/items/armor/jewelry.json
msgid ""
"Fake teeth inlaid with diamonds, worn over the teeth.  Fits horribly, but "
"looks very shiny.  For that high-class gangsta rap look."
msgstr ""
"歯の表面に被せる、ダイヤモンドがちりばめられた偽の歯です。口元にピッタリ嵌り、ギラギラとした輝きを放ちます。一流のギャングスタラッパーにお勧めです。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/jewelry.json
msgid "garnet dental grill"
msgid_plural "garnet dental grills"
msgstr[0] "デンタルグリル(ｶﾞｰﾈｯﾄ)"

#. ~ Description of "garnet dental grill"
#: data/json/items/armor/jewelry.json
msgid ""
"Fake teeth inlaid with garnets, worn over the teeth.  It looks very shiny."
msgstr "ガーネットが嵌め込まれた、歯の表面に被せる偽の歯です。ギラギラとした輝きを放っています。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/jewelry.json
msgid "amethyst dental grill"
msgid_plural "amethyst dental grills"
msgstr[0] "デンタルグリル(ｱﾒｼｽﾄ)"

#. ~ Description of "amethyst dental grill"
#: data/json/items/armor/jewelry.json
msgid ""
"Fake teeth inlaid with amethysts, worn over the teeth.  It looks very shiny."
msgstr "アメシストが嵌め込まれた、歯の表面に被せる偽の歯です。ギラギラとした輝きを放っています。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/jewelry.json
msgid "aquamarine dental grill"
msgid_plural "aquamarine dental grills"
msgstr[0] "デンタルグリル(ｱｸｱﾏﾘﾝ)"

#. ~ Description of "aquamarine dental grill"
#: data/json/items/armor/jewelry.json
msgid ""
"Fake teeth inlaid with aquamarines, worn over the teeth.  It looks very "
"shiny."
msgstr "アクアマリンが嵌め込まれた、歯の表面に被せる偽の歯です。ギラギラとした輝きを放っています。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/jewelry.json
msgid "emerald dental grill"
msgid_plural "emerald dental grills"
msgstr[0] "デンタルグリル(ｴﾒﾗﾙﾄﾞ)"

#. ~ Description of "emerald dental grill"
