#. ~ Description of "handgun-cartridge necklace"
#: data/json/items/armor/jewelry.json
msgid ""
"A simple, if rather crude, piece of post-Cataclysm jewelry: a solitary "
"bullet casing from a handgun cartridge or other such form of ammunition "
"strung upon a length of string, cord, or twine to form a makeshift pendant."
