#. ~ Snippet of item "ordnance-cartridge necklace"
#: data/json/items/armor/jewelry.json
msgid ""
"An expedient means of flaunting one's gunnery prowess, or a crude attempt at"
" overcompensating for matters best left undescribed, this article of craft-"
"produced jewelry is, essentially, one part cordage and three parts mammoth "
"bullet casing: the giant cartridge, either from a grenade round or some "
"other form of heavy munitions, strung to hang upon the chest as a pendent.  "
"The shell's neck has been carefully tapped, leaving a hole on either side of"
" the casing's throat through which the makeshift neck chain has been fed and"
" tied off."
msgstr ""
"砲術の腕前を自慢したいとき、もしくは言葉に出さずに意向を伝えたい場合の過剰で野蛮な手段として打ってつけの、手製のアクセサリーです。簡単に説明すると、一本の紐に3つの巨大な砲弾の薬莢を吊るしたものです。まるでペンダントのように、筒状、あるいはその他の形状の重い薬莢で胸元を飾れます。それぞれの薬莢の根元にはドリルで慎重に2つの穴が開けられており、両端を結んだ単なる紐が通してあります。"

#. ~ Snippet of item "ordnance-cartridge necklace"
#: data/json/items/armor/jewelry.json
msgid ""
"An expedient means of flaunting one's gunnery prowess, or a crude attempt at"
" overcompensating for matters best left undescribed, this article of craft-"
"produced jewelry is, essentially, one part cordage and three parts mammoth "
"bullet casing: the giant cartridge, either from a grenade round or some "
"other form of heavy munitions, strung to hang upon the chest as a pendent.  "
"The center of the shell's struck primer has been punched out, and a second "
"hole has been drilled shy of the rim, with a section of tied-off cordage "
"stringing through both entry points to form a makeshift neck chain."
msgstr ""
"砲術の腕前を自慢したいとき、もしくは言葉に出さずに意向を伝えたい場合の過剰で野蛮な手段として打ってつけの、手製のアクセサリーです。簡単に説明すると、一本の紐に3つの巨大な砲弾の薬莢を吊るしたものです。まるでペンダントのように、筒状、あるいはその他の形状の重い薬莢で胸元を飾れます。それぞれの雷管の凹んだ部分と薬莢の底部に近い側面にそれぞれ穴が開いており、そこに間に合わせのネックレスチェーンとして紐が通してあります。"

#. ~ Snippet of item "ordnance-cartridge necklace"
#: data/json/items/armor/jewelry.json
msgid ""
"An expedient means of flaunting one's gunnery prowess, or a crude attempt at"
" overcompensating for matters best left undescribed, this article of craft-"
"produced jewelry is, essentially, one part cordage and three parts mammoth "
"bullet casing: the giant cartridge, either from a grenade round or some "
"other form of heavy munitions, strung to hang upon the chest as a pendent.  "
"The jaws of a set of pliers have been laid to work, with the shell's neck "
"twisted closed in a tapered spiral, while a hole has been bored through "
"opposite sides of the cartridge's base, through which a loop of cord has "
"been tugged.  The string's loose ends have been wrapped around the casing in"
