#. ~ Snippet of item "refined ordnance-cartridge necklace"
#: data/json/items/armor/jewelry.json
msgid ""
"An article of hand-produced apparel that George Washington himself could "
"look down upon with an approving smile, the daintiness of this necklace's "
"precious metal chain looks rather comical when compared against the "
"gargantuan pendant that hangs from it: an expended casing from a grenade "
"round, shotgun cartridge, or some other form of sizable munition.  With its "
"brass polished to a mirror-like sheen and its rim cleanly extricated by the "
"saw, a well-sized gemstone peers at the world from out of this shell's "
"throat.  The jewel's wrapped within a length of fine-gauge wire, whose "
"remaining length has been tugged through the cartridge's body, fed out the "
"base, and entwined with a link in the chain."
msgstr ""
"もしジョージ・ワシントンに掛けてあげればきっとにっこり微笑むに違いない、手製のネックレスです。可憐な貴金属性のチェーンと、ショットガン弾などの大型薬莢でできた巨大なペンダントの対比はかなりコミカルです。薬莢の金属素材は鏡のように磨かれ、雷管とその縁はきれいに取り外され、空いた穴からかなりの大きさの宝石が覗いています。宝石は細いワイヤーで巻かれ、ワイヤーの余りは薬莢の内部を通って外に引き出され、チェーンと繋がっています。"

#. ~ Snippet of item "refined ordnance-cartridge necklace"
#: data/json/items/armor/jewelry.json
msgid ""
"An article of hand-produced apparel that George Washington himself could "
"look down upon with an approving smile, the daintiness of this necklace's "
"precious metal chain looks rather comical when compared against the "
"gargantuan pendant that hangs from it: an expended casing from a grenade "
"round, shotgun cartridge, or some other form of sizable munition.  The shell"
" has, essentially, been rendered into a tiny brass pipe: its base and primer"
" are neatly sawed off, and its head is capped by a large, glittering "
"gemstone that regards the Cataclysm from its seat within the throat.  A "
"length of wire is tightly wrapped around both the cartridge and jewel, with "
"the cord's loose ends trailing through a small drill hole at the shell's "
"base and linked to the neck chain."
msgstr ""
"もしジョージ・ワシントンに掛けてあげればきっとにっこり微笑むに違いない、手製のネックレスです。可憐な貴金属性のチェーンと、ショットガン弾などの大型薬莢でできた巨大なペンダントの対比はかなりコミカルです。基部と雷管がきれいに切り取られた薬莢は小さな筒状になっており、穴に嵌った大きな宝石が大変動の世界を照らしています。薬莢と宝石を固定するように細いワイヤーがしっかりと巻き付けてあり、ワイヤーの端は薬莢の基部にドリルで開けられた小さな穴を通ってチェーンと繋がっています。"

