#: data/json/items/armor/legs_clothes.json
msgid "A pair of old baggy jeans.  The heels are all ripped up."
msgstr "古びたダブダブのジーンズです。踵の部分が引き裂かれてズタズタになっています。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/legs_clothes.json
msgid "ripped jeans"
msgid_plural "pairs of ripped jeans"
msgstr[0] "ダメージジーンズ"

#. ~ Description of "ripped jeans"
#: data/json/items/armor/legs_clothes.json
msgid ""
"A pair of jeans that has been ripped over the knees.  It may have been "
"fashionable before Cataclysm, but it's just a pair of sub-par jeans now."
msgstr "膝上の部分が破れているジーンズです。大変動以前なら流行のファッションだったかもしれませんが、今では低品質なジーンズに過ぎません。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/legs_clothes.json
msgid "vintage jeans"
msgid_plural "vintage jeans"
msgstr[0] "ヴィンテージジーンズ"

#. ~ Description of "vintage jeans"
#: data/json/items/armor/legs_clothes.json
msgid ""
"A pair of vintage jeans that has started to lose its color.  It appears to "
"be slightly heavier and thicker; but hey, don't let that stop you from "
"wearing the fashion of the olden days!"
msgstr ""
"わずかに色落ちしたヴィンテージジーンズです。通常のジーンズより重く、分厚いような気がしますが、それが嫌だからと古着ファッションを敬遠するべきではありません！"

#. ~ Snippet of item "vintage jeans"
#: data/json/items/armor/legs_clothes.json
msgid ""
"A pair of vintage jeans that has been around for so long that very little "
"remains of its once vibrant blue color.  Otherwise it's surprisingly well "
"preserved though."
msgstr "あまりにも長い時を経て、かつての鮮やかな青色の面影がほとんど消えたヴィンテージジーンズです。色以外の保存状態は驚くほど良好です。"

#. ~ Snippet of item "vintage jeans"
#: data/json/items/armor/legs_clothes.json
msgid ""
"A very old pair of black vintage jeans.  From paint marks here and there you"
" assume this belonged to a painter."
msgstr "年季の入った黒色のヴィンテージジーンズです。所々に塗料の跡が残っています。前の持ち主はペンキ屋だったのでしょう。"

#. ~ Snippet of item "vintage jeans"
#: data/json/items/armor/legs_clothes.json
msgid ""
"A groovy pair of stone washed denim jeans from the 80s.  It gets baggy "
"around the ankles.  Perfect for pretending as if Cataclysm never happened "
"and you are on your way to dance floor."
msgstr ""
"ストーンウォッシュ加工が施された、80年代のクールなデニムジーンズです。足首辺りの裾が広くなっており、大変動のない世界であればダンスフロアで踊るのに最適な服装だったかもしれません。"

#. ~ Snippet of item "vintage jeans"
#: data/json/items/armor/legs_clothes.json
msgid ""
"A pair of vintage blue jeans that has been preserved perfectly.  You can see"
" the leather brand on its behind of company that hasn't been around for a "
"long while, even before the Cataclysm.  This would have made a fortune if; "
"well, you know, it wasn't apocalypse."
msgstr ""
"保存状態が完璧な青色のヴィンテージジーンズです。革パッチに刻まれた社名とブランドロゴは、大変動以前の世界でも滅多に見かけないものであり、売れば大金持ちになれたことでしょう。しかし、知っての通り、崩壊した世界ではそうも行きません。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/legs_clothes.json
msgid "skinny jeans"
msgid_plural "skinny jeans"
msgstr[0] "スキニージーンズ"

#. ~ Description of "skinny jeans"
#: data/json/items/armor/legs_clothes.json
msgid "A pair of skinny jeans with two pockets."
msgstr "2つのポケットが付いたスキニージーンズです。"

#. ~ Snippet of item "skinny jeans"
#: data/json/items/armor/legs_clothes.json
msgid "A pair of blue skinny jeans with two pockets."
msgstr "2つのポケットが付いた青色のスキニージーンズです。"

#. ~ Snippet of item "skinny jeans"
#: data/json/items/armor/legs_clothes.json
msgid "A pair of black skinny jeans with two pockets."
msgstr "2つのポケットが付いた黒色のスキニージーンズです。"

#. ~ Snippet of item "skinny jeans"
#: data/json/items/armor/legs_clothes.json
msgid "A pair of red skinny jeans with two pockets."
msgstr "2つのポケットが付いた赤色のスキニージーンズです。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/legs_clothes.json
msgid "red jeans"
msgid_plural "red jeans"
msgstr[0] "ジーンズ(赤)"

#. ~ Description of "red jeans"
#: data/json/items/armor/legs_clothes.json
msgid "A pair of tight-fitting candy-apple-red jeans with two deep pockets."
msgstr "2つの深いポケットが付いた、キャンディアップルレッドのタイトなジーンズです。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/legs_clothes.json
msgid "kilt"
msgid_plural "kilts"
msgstr[0] "キルト"

#. ~ Description of "kilt"
#: data/json/items/armor/legs_clothes.json
msgid ""
"No true Scotsman would leave home without his kilt.  Kilts lack pockets and "
"thus a belt and sporran are necessary accessories."
msgstr "真のスコットランド人はキルトなしで家を出ることは決してしません。キルトにはポケットがないため、ベルトとスポーランは欠かせません。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/legs_clothes.json
msgid "utility kilt"
msgid_plural "utility kilts"
msgstr[0] "ユーティリティキルト"

#. ~ Description of "utility kilt"
#: data/json/items/armor/legs_clothes.json
msgid ""
"Common in America, the utility kilt takes the traditional woolen kilt and "
"constructs it out of cotton canvas and then adds a pocket that would never "
"be on a traditional kilt."
msgstr "アメリカで一般的なユーティリティキルトは、伝統的なウールではなくコットンキャンバス生地でできており、ポケットも追加されています。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/legs_clothes.json
msgid "leather kilt"
msgid_plural "leather kilts"
msgstr[0] "キルト(革)"

#. ~ Description of "leather kilt"
#: data/json/items/armor/legs_clothes.json
msgid "No true Scotsman would leave home without his kilt."
msgstr "真のスコットランド人はキルトを纏わずに外出しないものです。"

