#. ~ Description of "pants"
#. ~ Description of variant "khaki pants" of item "pants"
#: data/json/items/armor/legs_clothes.json
msgid "A pair of khaki pants.  Slightly warmer than jeans."
msgstr "ジーンズよりも少しだけ暖かいカーキ色のズボンです。"

#. ~ Variant name of item "pants"
#: data/json/items/armor/legs_clothes.json
msgid "khaki pants"
msgid_plural "pairs of khaki pants"
msgstr[0] "コットンパンツ(ｶｰｷ)"

#. ~ Variant name of item "pants"
#: data/json/items/armor/legs_clothes.json
msgid "navy-blue pants"
msgid_plural "pairs of navy-blue pants"
msgstr[0] "コットンパンツ(ﾈｲﾋﾞｰﾌﾞﾙｰ)"

#. ~ Description of variant "navy-blue pants" of item "pants"
#: data/json/items/armor/legs_clothes.json
msgid ""
"A comfortable set of navy blue pants with large pockets, slightly thicker "
"and warmer than regular jeans."
msgstr "ジーンズよりも少しだけ厚く暖かい、大きなポケットの付いた快適なネイビーブルーのズボンです。"

#. ~ Variant name of item "pants"
#: data/json/items/armor/legs_clothes.json
msgid "black pants"
msgid_plural "pairs of black pants"
msgstr[0] "コットンパンツ(黒)"

#. ~ Description of variant "black pants" of item "pants"
#: data/json/items/armor/legs_clothes.json
msgid ""
"A snappy set of black, neatly pressed trousers, perfect for formal events or"
" looking professional."
msgstr "フォーマルなイベントやプロっぽい印象を与えたいときに最適な、きちんとアイロンがけされた黒色のスマートなズボンです。"

#. ~ Variant name of item "pants"
#: data/json/items/armor/legs_clothes.json
msgid "grey pants"
msgid_plural "pairs of grey pants"
msgstr[0] "コットンパンツ(灰)"

#. ~ Description of variant "grey pants" of item "pants"
#: data/json/items/armor/legs_clothes.json
msgid ""
"A set of storm gray pants speckled with dark stains so deeply assimilated "
"into the fabric that they're nigh-irremovable.  You vehemently hope that "
"they're just the mortal remains of some spilled beverage."
msgstr "生地に黒い染みが点々とこびりついている、ストームグレーのズボンです。ただの飲み物をこぼした痕であることを願いましょう。"

#. ~ Variant name of item "pants"
#: data/json/items/armor/legs_clothes.json
msgid "burgundy pants"
msgid_plural "pairs of burgundy pants"
msgstr[0] "コットンパンツ(ﾊﾞｰｶﾞﾝﾃﾞｨ)"

#. ~ Description of variant "burgundy pants" of item "pants"
#: data/json/items/armor/legs_clothes.json
msgid ""
"A pair of soft, comfortable burgundy trousers with a button-up fly and "
"spacious pockets."
msgstr "ボタンフライと広いポケットが付いた、ソフトで履き心地のいいバーガンディ色のズボンです。"

#. ~ Variant name of item "pants"
#: data/json/items/armor/legs_clothes.json
msgid "purple trackpants"
msgid_plural "pairs of purple trackpants"
msgstr[0] "コットンパンツ(紫)"

#. ~ Description of variant "purple trackpants" of item "pants"
#: data/json/items/armor/legs_clothes.json
msgid ""
"A set of rugged and comfortable trousers dyed a soft shade of violet, these "
"pants come equipped with an adjustable waistband."
msgstr "調節できるウエストバンドが付いた、丈夫で履き心地のいい淡い紫色のズボンです。"

#. ~ Variant name of item "pants"
#: data/json/items/armor/legs_clothes.json
msgid "brown pants"
msgid_plural "pairs of brown pants"
msgstr[0] "コットンパンツ(茶)"

#. ~ Description of variant "brown pants" of item "pants"
#: data/json/items/armor/legs_clothes.json
msgid ""
"Boredom personified, this pair of corduroy pants is a dull hue of brown."
msgstr "平凡を体現しているかのような、くすんだ茶色のコーデュロイパンツです。"

#. ~ Variant name of item "pants"
#: data/json/items/armor/legs_clothes.json
msgid "cream pants"
msgid_plural "pairs of cream pants"
msgstr[0] "コットンパンツ(ｸﾘｰﾑ)"

#. ~ Description of variant "cream pants" of item "pants"
#: data/json/items/armor/legs_clothes.json
msgid ""
"A pair of milky, off-white pants dyed a shade of soft cream.  They're "
"slightly warmer than jeans."
msgstr "ジーンズよりも少しだけ暖かい、ソフトクリームのような乳白色のズボンです。"

#. ~ Variant name of item "pants"
#: data/json/items/armor/legs_clothes.json
msgid "stone-gray pants"
msgid_plural "pairs of stone-gray pants"
msgstr[0] "コットンパンツ(ｽﾄｰﾝｸﾞﾚｰ)"

#. ~ Description of variant "stone-gray pants" of item "pants"
#: data/json/items/armor/legs_clothes.json
msgid ""
"A business-like set of stone-gray trousers for business-like people, these "
"pants are the same hue as concrete and are relatively warm."
msgstr "事務的な人のための事務的なストーングレーのズボンです。コンクリートに似た色合いをしており、比較的暖かな着心地です。"

#. ~ Variant name of item "pants"
#: data/json/items/armor/legs_clothes.json
msgid "beige pants"
msgid_plural "pairs of beige pants"
msgstr[0] "コットンパンツ(ﾍﾞｰｼﾞｭ)"

#. ~ Description of variant "beige pants" of item "pants"
#: data/json/items/armor/legs_clothes.json
msgid ""
"A pair of modest, beige-colored pants with a dirty white undertone.  These "
"trousers are somewhat warmer than jeans."
msgstr "濁った白色を基調とした淡いベージュ色の、ジーンズより多少暖かいズボンです。"

#. ~ Variant name of item "pants"
#: data/json/items/armor/legs_clothes.json
msgid "British-khaki pants"
msgid_plural "pairs of British-khaki pants"
msgstr[0] "コットンパンツ(ﾌﾞﾘﾃｨｯｼｭｶｰｷ)"

#. ~ Description of variant "British-khaki pants" of item "pants"
#: data/json/items/armor/legs_clothes.json
msgid ""
"While these pants might not be English, their color certainly is.  More "
"specifically, these comfortable trousers are a shade of British-khaki, a "
"type of brownish-yellow hue developed by the empire's military for use in "
"service uniforms."
msgstr ""
"イギリス製ではないかもしれませんが、色は間違いなくイギリス生まれの快適なズボンです。ブリティッシュカーキとは、大英帝国が軍服に採用するために開発した、茶色がかった黄色のことを指します。"

#. ~ Variant name of item "pants"
#: data/json/items/armor/legs_clothes.json
msgid "tan-khaki pants"
msgid_plural "pairs of tan-khaki pants"
msgstr[0] "コットンパンツ(ﾀﾝｶｰｷ)"

#. ~ Description of variant "tan-khaki pants" of item "pants"
#: data/json/items/armor/legs_clothes.json
msgid ""
"A pair of casual, tan-hued pants with a slight yellowish overtone, intended "
"to contrast with one's skin color."
msgstr "皮膚の色との調和を意識した、黄色みの強い黄褐色のカジュアルなズボンです。"

#. ~ Variant name of item "pants"
#: data/json/items/armor/legs_clothes.json
msgid "hot-pink sweatpants"
msgid_plural "pairs of hot-pink sweatpants"
msgstr[0] "コットンパンツ(ﾎｯﾄﾋﾟﾝｸ)"

#. ~ Description of variant "hot-pink sweatpants" of item "pants"
#: data/json/items/armor/legs_clothes.json
msgid ""
"Flaunting an almost aggressively vibrant shade of bright pink, this pair of "
"soft, plush pants is slightly warmer than far duller jeans and makes a bold "
"statement to any onlookers: human, zombie, or otherwise.  Though, perhaps "
"dressing up like an anthropomorphic Easter egg isn't, in retrospect, the "
"wisest way to prolong your time on this earth."
msgstr ""
"鮮やかな明るいピンク色を積極的に見せつける、ソフトで豪華なズボンです。ジーンズよりも多少暖かく、遥かに冴えているこのデザインは、人にもゾンビにも強烈な印象を与えるでしょう。しかしよく考えてみると、イースターエッグの擬人化のような格好をすることは、今の状況で長生きしたい人にはあまり向かない行為かもしれませんね。"

#. ~ Variant name of item "pants"
#: data/json/items/armor/legs_clothes.json
msgid "pebble-khaki pants"
msgid_plural "pairs of pebble-khaki pants"
msgstr[0] "コットンパンツ(ﾍﾟﾌﾞﾙｶｰｷ)"

#. ~ Description of variant "pebble-khaki pants" of item "pants"
#: data/json/items/armor/legs_clothes.json
msgid ""
"A pair of comfortable pants dyed pebble-khaki, a type of hue consisting of "
"muted greys and browns."
msgstr "ペブルカーキと呼ばれる落ち着いたグレーブラウンの色合いをした、快適なズボンです。"

#. ~ Variant name of item "pants"
#: data/json/items/armor/legs_clothes.json
msgid "ivory pants"
msgid_plural "pairs of ivory pants"
msgstr[0] "コットンパンツ(ｱｲﾎﾞﾘｰ)"

#. ~ Description of variant "ivory pants" of item "pants"
#: data/json/items/armor/legs_clothes.json
msgid ""
"A pair of clear, creamy-hued ivory-colored pants, from which the inevitable "
"splashes of zombie gore will be nigh-impossible to wash off.  The trousers "
"are slightly warmer than jeans and provide a fashionable touch to your "
"ventures in the ruins of New England."
msgstr ""
"透明感のある白っぽいアイボリー色のズボンです。ゾンビの肉片でもかぶろうものなら、シミを洗い落とすことはまず不可能です。ジーンズよりも少し暖かく、荒廃したニューイングランドでの冒険に多少のファッショナブルな印象を与えます。"

#. ~ Variant name of item "pants"
#: data/json/items/armor/legs_clothes.json
msgid "maroon sweatpants"
msgid_plural "pairs of maroon sweatpants"
msgstr[0] "コットンパンツ(ﾏﾙｰﾝ)"

#. ~ Description of variant "maroon sweatpants" of item "pants"
#: data/json/items/armor/legs_clothes.json
msgid ""
"A visually appealing and subtle blend of browns and deep reds characterizes "
"this pair of pants, which come equipped with a drawstring at the waist, "
"elastic cuffs, and zip-up pockets.  An energetic and sporting set of pants "
"for high-energy situations."
msgstr ""
"ブラウンとディープレッドに近い色合いの、絶妙に魅力的なズボンです。ウエストと裾には調整用の紐が通してあり、ジッパーで閉められるポケットも付いています。活動的な人に適した、エネルギッシュでスポーティーなデザインです。"

#. ~ Variant name of item "pants"
#: data/json/items/armor/legs_clothes.json
msgid "olive-khaki pants"
msgid_plural "pairs of olive-khaki pants"
msgstr[0] "コットンパンツ(ｵﾘｰﾌﾞｶｰｷ)"

#. ~ Description of variant "olive-khaki pants" of item "pants"
#: data/json/items/armor/legs_clothes.json
msgid ""
"A rustic blend of greenish browns characterizes this set of casual pants, "
"along with a pair of deep pockets and a padded construction that makes them "
"warmer than regular jeans."
msgstr "緑がかった茶色の素朴なカジュアルパンツです。深いポケットとしっかりした裏地が付いており、通常のジーンズよりも暖かな履き心地です。"

#. ~ Variant name of item "pants"
#: data/json/items/armor/legs_clothes.json
msgid "olive-drab pants"
msgid_plural "pairs of olive-drab pants"
msgstr[0] "コットンパンツ(ｵﾘｰﾌﾞﾄﾞﾗﾌﾞ)"

#. ~ Description of variant "olive-drab pants" of item "pants"
#: data/json/items/armor/legs_clothes.json
msgid ""
"While these aren't US-issued military trousers or even civilian tactical "
"pants, this article of clothing possesses a blend of dark greens, browns, "
"and blacks identical to the camouflage pattern of Vietnam-era army uniforms."
"  Slightly warmer than regular jeans, it's a decent piece of faux-military "
"kit for those unwilling to shill out on a pair of actual BDU pants."
msgstr ""
"アメリカ軍で支給される軍用パンツでも市販のミリタリーパンツでもありませんが、ベトナム戦争時代の迷彩パターンと同じ濃緑色、茶色、黒色が混じった色合いをしています。通常のジーンズより多少暖かく、大枚をはたいてまで本物のBDUパンツを履きたくない人にぴったりの、手軽な似非ミリタリーファッションです。"

#. ~ Variant name of item "pants"
#: data/json/items/armor/legs_clothes.json
msgid "turquoise pants"
msgid_plural "pairs of turquoise pants"
msgstr[0] "コットンパンツ(ﾀｰｺｲｽﾞ)"

#. ~ Description of variant "turquoise pants" of item "pants"
#: data/json/items/armor/legs_clothes.json
msgid ""
"A pair of casual, greenish-blue trousers with deep pockets.  With the "
"potential to be commendably fashionable and elegant given the right "
"accompanying accents, the pants are a shade warmer than regular jeans."
msgstr ""
"深いポケットが付いた、緑がかった青色のカジュアルパンツです。通常のジーンズより多少暖かく、適切なアクセントを加えれば驚くほどファッショナブルでエレガントに着こなせそうな気がします。"

#. ~ Variant name of item "pants"
#: data/json/items/armor/legs_clothes.json
msgid "ecru pants"
msgid_plural "pairs of ecru pants"
msgstr[0] "コットンパンツ(ｴｸﾘｭ)"

#. ~ Description of variant "ecru pants" of item "pants"
#: data/json/items/armor/legs_clothes.json
msgid ""
"A pair of moderately warm and comfortable ecru pants dyed a pale, greyish "
"yellow color."
msgstr "灰色がかった淡い黄色に染まった、程よく暖かく履き心地のいい生成り色のズボンです。"

#. ~ Variant name of item "pants"
#: data/json/items/armor/legs_clothes.json
msgid "fawn-khaki pants"
msgid_plural "pairs of fawn-khaki pants"
msgstr[0] "コットンパンツ(ﾌｫｰﾝｶｰｷ)"

#. ~ Description of variant "fawn-khaki pants" of item "pants"
#: data/json/items/armor/legs_clothes.json
msgid ""
"A pair of comfortable, light, delicate brown trousers dyed the same warm hue"
" as young deer fawns."
msgstr "若いシカの毛皮のような温かみのある色合いの、快適で軽快かつ上品な茶色のズボンです。"

#. ~ Variant name of item "pants"
#: data/json/items/armor/legs_clothes.json
msgid "camel-khaki pants"
msgid_plural "pairs of camel-khaki pants"
msgstr[0] "コットンパンツ(ｷｬﾒﾙ)"

#. ~ Description of variant "camel-khaki pants" of item "pants"
#: data/json/items/armor/legs_clothes.json
msgid ""
"Classy and stylish, this pair of warm, business-like trousers is dyed a "
"neutral shade of camel.  A sophisticated pair of pants for only the most "
"sophisticated of folks."
msgstr ""
"温かみがあり上品かつスタイリッシュな、くすんだキャメル色のビジネスライクなズボンです。洗練された者にしか履きこなせない、洗練されたデザインです。"

#. ~ Variant name of item "pants"
#: data/json/items/armor/legs_clothes.json
msgid "coffee-brown pants"
msgid_plural "pairs of coffee-brown pants"
msgstr[0] "コットンパンツ(ｺｰﾋｰﾌﾞﾗｳﾝ)"

#. ~ Description of variant "coffee-brown pants" of item "pants"
#: data/json/items/armor/legs_clothes.json
msgid ""
"Dyed a rich shade of deep brown reminiscent of a piping-hot coffee, this "
"pair of comfortable pants is excellent at concealing stains, whether from "
"dropped food, spilled beverages, or, nowadays, dried blood."
msgstr ""
"熱々のコーヒーを思わせる深い茶色に染められた、履き心地のいいズボンです。飲食物をこぼした汚れや、近頃よく悩まされている乾いた血液などのシミも、上手く隠すことができます。"

#. ~ Variant name of item "pants"
#: data/json/items/armor/legs_clothes.json
msgid "moss-green trackpants"
msgid_plural "pairs of moss-green trackpants"
msgstr[0] "コットンパンツ(ﾓｽｸﾞﾘｰﾝ)"

#. ~ Description of variant "moss-green trackpants" of item "pants"
#: data/json/items/armor/legs_clothes.json
msgid ""
"A comfortable, earthy pair of soft green pants with a muted hue, they're "
"slightly warmer than regular jeans and would blend in well against a "
"backdrop of woodland moss."
msgstr "落ち着いたソフトグリーンの色合いをした、快適で素朴なズボンです。通常のジーンズより多少暖かく、苔むした森での活動によく似合います。"

#. ~ Variant name of item "pants"
#: data/json/items/armor/legs_clothes.json
msgid "paprika-red pants"
msgid_plural "pairs of paprika-red pants"
msgstr[0] "コットンパンツ(ﾊﾟﾌﾟﾘｶﾚｯﾄﾞ)"

#. ~ Description of variant "paprika-red pants" of item "pants"
#: data/json/items/armor/legs_clothes.json
msgid ""
"Vibrant and bold, this pair of comfortable and statement-making trousers is "
"dyed an energetic, spicy red color.  Somewhat warmer than regular jeans, you"
" hope that wearing them won't increase your visual resemblance to a stuffed "
"chili pepper."
msgstr ""
"エネルギッシュで刺激的な赤色に染まった、活気に溢れる大胆で派手なズボンです。履き心地がよく、通常のジーンズより多少暖かいです。遠目からだとチリソースの瓶に見間違えられてしまいそうです。"

#. ~ Variant name of item "pants"
#: data/json/items/armor/legs_clothes.json
msgid "woodland-camo pants"
msgid_plural "pairs of woodland-camo pants"
msgstr[0] "コットンパンツ(森林迷彩)"

#. ~ Description of variant "woodland-camo pants" of item "pants"
#: data/json/items/armor/legs_clothes.json
msgid ""
"Not too dissimilar from the pattern adopted by older US Marine uniforms, "
"this pair of otherwise conventional civilian pants is printed with a green, "
"brown, and black woodland camouflage pattern."
msgstr ""
"かつてのアメリカ海兵隊の軍服に採用されていたデザインとさほど変わらない緑色、茶色、黒色の森林迷彩パターンがプリントされた、ごく普通の市販のズボンです。"

#. ~ Variant name of item "pants"
#: data/json/items/armor/legs_clothes.json
msgid "jungle-camo pants"
msgid_plural "pairs of jungle-camo pants"
msgstr[0] "コットンパンツ(密林迷彩)"

#. ~ Description of variant "jungle-camo pants" of item "pants"
#: data/json/items/armor/legs_clothes.json
msgid ""
"Similar in color to the old frog skin uniforms issued to Marine Raiders "
"during the Second World War, this pair of warm, comfortable trousers is dyed"
" a greenish gray hue.  Completely conventional in every other respect, the "
"patterning would be incredibly helpful if you were planning to take a trip "
"down to the Amazon any time soon."
msgstr ""
"第二次世界大戦中に海兵隊に支給されていたフロッグスキン迷彩にそっくりな緑がかった灰色の、暖かく履き心地のいいズボンです。完全に同じ迷彩柄を流用しているため、近いうちにアマゾンへ旅行に行く予定があるなら、非常に役立ちそうです。"

#. ~ Variant name of item "pants"
#: data/json/items/armor/legs_clothes.json
msgid "grassland-camo pants"
msgid_plural "pairs of grassland-camo pants"
msgstr[0] "コットンパンツ(草原迷彩)"

#. ~ Description of variant "grassland-camo pants" of item "pants"
#: data/json/items/armor/legs_clothes.json
msgid ""
"Possessing reinforced knees and a hardy construction, this set of trousers "
"is resplendent in a camouflage pattern of mixed light greens, browns, and "
"beige tones.  With a set of deep pockets and an insulated design, it's an "
"ideal piece of legwear for outdoor ventures."
msgstr ""
"ライトグリーン、ブラウン、ベージュの色調を組み合わせた迷彩柄が使われている、膝を当て布で補強された丈夫なズボンです。深いポケットが付いており、保温性もあるため、野外活動に最適です。"

#. ~ Variant name of item "pants"
#: data/json/items/armor/legs_clothes.json
msgid "marshland-camo pants"
msgid_plural "pairs of marshland-camo pants"
msgstr[0] "コットンパンツ(湿地迷彩)"

#. ~ Description of variant "marshland-camo pants" of item "pants"
#: data/json/items/armor/legs_clothes.json
msgid ""
"The faithful friend of waterfowl hunters, this pair of pants is printed with"
" a brown, gray, tan, and green camouflage pattern designed to blend in with "
"the vegetation and reeds present in swamps and marshlands."
msgstr "水鳥ハンターの忠実な友であるこのズボンには、沼地や湿地の植生に溶け込むような茶、灰、黄土色、緑を使った迷彩が施されています。"

#. ~ Variant name of item "pants"
#: data/json/items/armor/legs_clothes.json
msgid "desert-camo pants"
msgid_plural "pairs of desert-camo pants"
msgstr[0] "コットンパンツ(砂漠迷彩)"

#. ~ Description of variant "desert-camo pants" of item "pants"
#: data/json/items/armor/legs_clothes.json
msgid ""
"Dyed a mix of brown, tan, and yellowish beige hues, this pair of hardy "
"trousers is designed to seamlessly blend into arid environments.  That being"
" said, the fact that New England is famously devoid of deserts means that "
"the pattern's only utility is in looking cool."
msgstr ""
"ブラウン、タン、イエローベージュの色彩を組み合わせた迷彩柄の、砂漠の環境に上手く溶け込むようにデザインされた丈夫なズボンです。ところで、ニューイングランドに砂漠がないことは周知の事実であり、このデザインは見た目がクールであること以外何の役にも立ちません。"

#. ~ Variant name of item "pants"
#: data/json/items/armor/legs_clothes.json
msgid "alpine-camo pants"
msgid_plural "pairs of alpine-camo pants"
msgstr[0] "コットンパンツ(山岳迷彩)"

#. ~ Description of variant "alpine-camo pants" of item "pants"
#: data/json/items/armor/legs_clothes.json
msgid ""
"The companion of aspiring mountaineers and alpine hunters, these brown, "
"gray, and white dyed pants possess a network of jagged shapes and mottled "
"lines, designed to break up the wearer's profile and better conceal them "
"against the background landscape of mountains."
msgstr ""
"高みを目指す登山家や、高山で活動するハンターの相棒として活躍する、茶色、灰色、白色のギザギザ模様とランダムな線が網の目のように組み合わさった迷彩柄のズボンです。着用者のシルエットが背景の山々に上手く溶け込むようにデザインされています。"

#. ~ Variant name of item "pants"
#: data/json/items/armor/legs_clothes.json
msgid "urban-camo pants"
msgid_plural "pairs of urban-camo pants"
msgstr[0] "コットンパンツ(都市迷彩)"

#. ~ Description of variant "urban-camo pants" of item "pants"
#: data/json/items/armor/legs_clothes.json
msgid ""
"A set of rugged yet comfortable pants dyed in various scales of gray, black,"
" and dirty white, possessing a set of sizable pockets, and printed with "
"squares and irregular polygons to disrupt a wearer's silhouette within man-"
"made environments.  You would honestly not be surprised if you learned that "
"this singular pair of trousers contains 50 shades of gray."
msgstr ""
"大きなポケットが付いた頑丈で履き心地のいいズボンです。着用者のシルエットが人工環境に上手く溶け込むように、灰色、黒色、濁った白色の大小さまざまな正方形や多角形が不規則にプリントされています。この特異なズボンに50種類もの灰色が使われていることを知ったとしても、驚きはありません。"

#. ~ Variant name of item "pants"
#: data/json/items/armor/legs_clothes.json
msgid "ocean-camo pants"
msgid_plural "pairs of ocean-camo pants"
msgstr[0] "コットンパンツ(海洋迷彩)"

#. ~ Description of variant "ocean-camo pants" of item "pants"
#: data/json/items/armor/legs_clothes.json
msgid ""
"Printed with a camouflage pattern most commonly associated with naval "
"vessels or aircraft, this pair of pants is festooned with a wide array of "
"blue hues and disruptive lines, with a touch of light gray also making its "
"presence known.  Warmer than jeans and possessing a number of deep pockets, "
"this comfortable pair of trousers would do an admirable job of concealing "
"you in maritime environments.  You have yet to come up with a reason why "
"you'd ever be in a maritime environment."
msgstr ""
"海軍の艦船や航空機でよく見られる迷彩を施したコットンパンツです。さまざまな青色と分裂的なラインで飾られ、少し使われているライトグレーも効果を高めています。複数の深いポケットが付いておりジーンズよりも暖かく快適なこのズボンは、海で身を隠すのにとても役立ちますが、海に身を置く理由はまだ思い浮かびません。"

#. ~ Variant name of item "pants"
#: data/json/items/armor/legs_clothes.json
msgid "river-camo pants"
msgid_plural "pairs of river-camo pants"
msgstr[0] "コットンパンツ(河川迷彩)"

#. ~ Description of variant "river-camo pants" of item "pants"
#: data/json/items/armor/legs_clothes.json
msgid ""
"Employed by anglers and river-side hunters for camouflage in freshwater "
"habitats, this pair of bootcut trousers incorporates shades of green, brown,"
" blue, and gray, along with sizable pockets and a construction favoring heat"
" retention."
msgstr ""
"釣り人やハンターが淡水域でのカモフラージュのために着用する、緑色、茶色、青色、灰色の迷彩模様がプリントされたブーツカットパンツです。大きなポケットが付いており、保温性を高めるデザインになっています。"

#. ~ Variant name of item "pants"
#: data/json/items/armor/legs_clothes.json
msgid "arctic-camo pants"
msgid_plural "pairs of arctic-camo pants"
msgstr[0] "コットンパンツ(極地迷彩)"

#. ~ Description of variant "arctic-camo pants" of item "pants"
#: data/json/items/armor/legs_clothes.json
msgid ""
"Featuring a camouflage pattern consisting of white, shades of gray, and a "
"slight tinge of brown, this pair of rugged pants is fit for snowy tundra and"
" polar regions—or it would be, had the garment not been only moderately "
"warmer than jeans.  You have yet to grasp their point for existing."
msgstr ""
"白色、灰色、薄茶色が混じった迷彩柄の、頑丈なズボンです。雪の多いツンドラや極地に適したデザインですが、ジーンズより多少暖かい程度の保温性ではそのような環境に耐えられません。存在意義がよく分からないズボンです。"

#. ~ Variant name of item "pants"
#: data/json/items/armor/legs_clothes.json
msgid "black-camo pants"
msgid_plural "pairs of black-camo pants"
msgstr[0] "コットンパンツ(黒色迷彩)"

#. ~ Description of variant "black-camo pants" of item "pants"
#: data/json/items/armor/legs_clothes.json
msgid ""
"Dyed a deep hue of urban black, this pair of hardwearing pants is designed "
"to assist a wearer in concealing themselves within nighttime environments "
"and low-light conditions.  While they're simple civilian trousers given a "
"stealth-black paint job and don't hold a candle to their more marshal "
"brothers, they still look cool and are great at making you feel like you're "
"Spetsnaz."
msgstr ""
"着用者が夜間や薄暗い環境で身を隠せるようにデザインされた、暗い色合いの迷彩柄の都会的で丈夫なズボンです。単に黒っぽい迷彩がプリントされただけの市販品であり、実際の軍用品に匹敵する性能はもちろんありませんが、クールなことに変わりはなく、スペツナズに入隊したような気分にさせてくれます。"

#. ~ Variant name of item "pants"
#: data/json/items/armor/legs_clothes.json
msgid "white pants"
msgid_plural "pairs of white pants"
msgstr[0] "コットンパンツ(白)"

#. ~ Description of variant "white pants" of item "pants"
#: data/json/items/armor/legs_clothes.json
msgid ""
"Notorious for either looking fabulous or disastrous with little in between, "
"this stylish pair of boot-cut white trousers will almost certainly gain a "
"plethora of irremovable stains as soon as you set foot beyond the threshold "
"of your abode."
msgstr ""
"バッチリ着こなせるか、醜態を晒すかの両極端になりがちなことで有名な、スタイリッシュなブーツカットの白いズボンです。自宅から足を一歩踏み出しただけで、取れないシミが大量につくことになるのは間違いありません。"

#. ~ Variant name of item "pants"
#: data/json/items/armor/legs_clothes.json
msgid "plum-purple trackpants"
msgid_plural "pairs of plum-purple trackpants"
msgstr[0] "コットンパンツ(ﾌﾟﾗﾑﾊﾟｰﾌﾟﾙ)"

#. ~ Description of variant "plum-purple trackpants" of item "pants"
#: data/json/items/armor/legs_clothes.json
msgid ""
"With its fabric dyed a relatively pretty shade of deep reddish purple, this "
"pair of pants not only looks good but also provides a level of practicality "
"only befitting its role as sports wear, coming equipped with an elastic "
"waistband and zip-up pockets."
msgstr ""
"中々に美しいデザインの、濃い赤紫色のズボンです。見た目だけでなく、伸縮性のあるウエストバンドやジッパー付きポケットなどの実用性も兼ね備えています。"

#. ~ Variant name of item "pants"
#: data/json/items/armor/legs_clothes.json
msgid "nude trackpants"
msgid_plural "pairs of nude trackpants"
msgstr[0] "コットンパンツ(ﾍﾟｰﾙｵﾚﾝｼﾞ)"

#. ~ Description of variant "nude trackpants" of item "pants"
#: data/json/items/armor/legs_clothes.json
msgid ""
"While this plush pair of pink, flesh-colored trousers doesn't, thankfully, "
"possess any unmentionables in and of itself, it will almost certainly make "
"you look like you're striding about with your legs, caboose, and immodesty "
"on display if it's too tight.  Who knows, perhaps it would be enough to "
"blind some poor, unfortunate zombies."
msgstr ""
"光沢のある布地で作られたペールオレンジのズボンです。それ自体に特筆すべき点はありませんが、体格の大きな者が着用すれば、ほぼ間違いなく、脚、腰、そして大事なところを丸出しにして闊歩しているように勘違いされます。哀れで不幸なゾンビの目すら潰れてしまうかもしれません。"

#. ~ Variant name of item "pants"
#: data/json/items/armor/legs_clothes.json
msgid "dusty-pink pants"
msgid_plural "pairs of dusty-pink pants"
msgstr[0] "コットンパンツ(ﾀﾞｽﾃｨﾋﾟﾝｸ)"

#. ~ Description of variant "dusty-pink pants" of item "pants"
#: data/json/items/armor/legs_clothes.json
msgid ""
"A pair of delicately colored and fashionable pants dyed a pale, soft pink "
"hue, much like cherry blossoms."
msgstr "桜のような淡く優しいピンク色の、繊細でファッショナブルなズボンです。"

#. ~ Variant name of item "pants"
#: data/json/items/armor/legs_clothes.json
msgid "periwinkle-blue pants"
msgid_plural "pairs of periwinkle-blue pants"
msgstr[0] "コットンパンツ(ﾍﾟﾘｳｨﾝｸﾙﾌﾞﾙｰ)"

#. ~ Description of variant "periwinkle-blue pants" of item "pants"
#: data/json/items/armor/legs_clothes.json
msgid ""
"Dyed a light shade of almost sky-blue, this soft pair of trousers is both "
"comfortable and warmer than regular jeans."
msgstr "空色に近い明るい青色の、通常のジーンズより多少暖かく柔らかいズボンです。"

#. ~ Variant name of item "pants"
#: data/json/items/armor/legs_clothes.json
msgid "grape-purple pants"
msgid_plural "pairs of grape-purple pants"
msgstr[0] "コットンパンツ(ｸﾞﾚｰﾌﾟﾊﾟｰﾌﾟﾙ)"

#. ~ Description of variant "grape-purple pants" of item "pants"
#: data/json/items/armor/legs_clothes.json
msgid ""
"Stylish and refined-looking, this pair of elegant trousers is dyed a rich "
"purple hue, like fresh, glistening grapes.  You wonder if that makes you "
"look more or less appetizing to the zombies."
msgstr ""
"採れたてのブドウのような豊かな紫色の、スタイリッシュで洗練されたデザインの上品なズボンです。もしかすると、ゾンビから見ても美味しそうだと思われてしまうかもしれません。"

#. ~ Variant name of item "pants"
#: data/json/items/armor/legs_clothes.json
msgid "ice-blue sweatpants"
msgid_plural "pairs of ice-blue sweatpants"
msgstr[0] "コットンパンツ(ｱｲｽﾌﾞﾙｰ)"

#. ~ Description of variant "ice-blue sweatpants" of item "pants"
#: data/json/items/armor/legs_clothes.json
msgid ""
"Soft, cool, and subtle, this pair of comfortable trousers sports a serene "
"blue hue—a shade of azure as cold as the flesh of mankind's corpses."
msgstr "死んだ人間と同じくらい冷ややかで穏やかな青色の、クールで柔らかく履き心地のいいズボンです。"

#. ~ Variant name of item "pants"
#: data/json/items/armor/legs_clothes.json
msgid "baby-blue pants"
msgid_plural "pairs of baby-blue pants"
msgstr[0] "コットンパンツ(ﾍﾞｲﾋﾞｰﾌﾞﾙｰ)"

#. ~ Description of variant "baby-blue pants" of item "pants"
#: data/json/items/armor/legs_clothes.json
msgid ""
"Dyed the characteristic color of youth and whimsy, the gentle hue of this "
"set of ethereal-blue pants offers recollections of dreamy, playful youth—a "
"dream that no one upon this forsaken earth will ever know again."
msgstr ""
"若さと斬新さを兼ね備えた、幻想的で優しげな青色のズボンです。楽しみに溢れていたあの頃の想い出が心に浮かんできます。それはこの見捨てられた地球上で、二度と知ることができない想い出です。"

#. ~ Variant name of item "pants"
#: data/json/items/armor/legs_clothes.json
msgid "emerald-green pants"
msgid_plural "pairs of emerald-green pants"
msgstr[0] "コットンパンツ(ｴﾒﾗﾙﾄﾞｸﾞﾘｰﾝ)"

#. ~ Description of variant "emerald-green pants" of item "pants"
#: data/json/items/armor/legs_clothes.json
msgid ""
"There isn't such a thing as too shiny, or at least there wasn't for the "
"maker of this particular pair of vibrant green pants.  Composed from glossy "
"cotton dyed with a subtle blue cast and equipped with a pair of sizable "
"pockets, it would be fashionable were it not for the fact that dawning them "
"makes the wearer look like a post-apocalyptic leprechaun."
msgstr ""
"派手すぎるという程ではありません。少なくとも、この鮮やかな緑色のズボンのメーカーは派手ではないと考えていたようです。2つの大きなポケットが付いた、ほのかに青みがかった緑色のコットンパンツです。明るいところで見ると、まるで崩壊世界に現れたレプラコーンのようになってしまうことを除けば、ファッショナブルな装いかもしれません。"

#. ~ Variant name of item "pants"
#: data/json/items/armor/legs_clothes.json
msgid "royal-blue pants"
msgid_plural "pairs of royal-blue pants"
msgstr[0] "コットンパンツ(ﾛｲﾔﾙﾌﾞﾙｰ)"

#. ~ Description of variant "royal-blue pants" of item "pants"
#: data/json/items/armor/legs_clothes.json
msgid ""
"A centuries-old gift from the United Kingdom, this pair of comfortable "
"trousers is dyed a classic shade of deep, vivid blue."
msgstr "旧世紀のイギリスからの賜りものである、深く鮮やかな青色の古風で快適なズボンです。"

#. ~ Variant name of item "pants"
#: data/json/items/armor/legs_clothes.json
msgid "teal pants"
msgid_plural "pairs of teal pants"
msgstr[0] "コットンパンツ(ﾃｨｰﾙﾌﾞﾙｰ)"

#. ~ Description of variant "teal pants" of item "pants"
#: data/json/items/armor/legs_clothes.json
msgid ""
"Dyed a predominantly greenish hue of deep cyan, this pair of pants is both "
"comfortable and warmer than regular jeans."
msgstr "緑がかった濃いシアン色の、通常のジーンズより多少暖かく履き心地のいいズボンです。"

#. ~ Variant name of item "pants"
#: data/json/items/armor/legs_clothes.json
msgid "ash-gray pants"
msgid_plural "pairs of ash-gray pants"
msgstr[0] "コットンパンツ(ｱｯｼｭｸﾞﾚｰ)"

#. ~ Description of variant "ash-gray pants" of item "pants"
#: data/json/items/armor/legs_clothes.json
msgid ""
"A set of comfortable and smart-looking pants dyed a similar shade to "
"volcanic ash: a pale, low-saturation grayish green color."
msgstr "火山灰に似た色、つまり彩度の低い淡い灰緑色の、履き心地のいいスマートなズボンです。"

#. ~ Variant name of item "pants"
#: data/json/items/armor/legs_clothes.json
msgid "fuchsia pants"
msgid_plural "pairs of fuchsia pants"
msgstr[0] "コットンパンツ(ﾌｸｼｬ)"

#. ~ Description of variant "fuchsia pants" of item "pants"
#: data/json/items/armor/legs_clothes.json
msgid ""
"A bright, fashionable, and charming-looking pair of reddish purple trousers,"
" with two deep pockets and a construction that favors heat retention more "
"than regular jeans."
msgstr "明るくファッショナブルで魅力的な赤紫色のズボンです。2つの深いポケットが付いており、通常のジーンズより多少暖かい作りになっています。"

#. ~ Variant name of item "pants"
#: data/json/items/armor/legs_clothes.json
msgid "coral-pink pants"
msgid_plural "pairs of coral-pink pants"
msgstr[0] "コットンパンツ(ｺｰﾗﾙﾋﾟﾝｸ)"

#. ~ Description of variant "coral-pink pants" of item "pants"
#: data/json/items/armor/legs_clothes.json
msgid ""
"Dyed a soft shade of pink strongly verging upon an orange hue, this pair of "
"trousers would look right at home against a backdrop of vibrant sea coral."
msgstr "オレンジ色に近い柔らかなピンク色のズボンです。鮮やかなサンゴ礁の海によく似合います。"

#. ~ Variant name of item "pants"
#: data/json/items/armor/legs_clothes.json
msgid "chartreuse-green pants"
msgid_plural "pairs of chartreuse-green pants"
msgstr[0] "コットンパンツ(ｼｬﾙﾄﾙｰｽﾞｸﾞﾘｰﾝ)"

#. ~ Description of variant "chartreuse-green pants" of item "pants"
#: data/json/items/armor/legs_clothes.json
msgid ""
"An almost fluorescent set of yellowish-green pants with two deep pockets.  "
"Considering that chartreuse has better night-visibility than most other "
"colors, these pants, apart from being a nightmare to match with other hues, "
"would probably be an ill-advised choice to don if you wish to keep your legs"
" attached to your body."
msgstr ""
"深いポケットが2つ付いている、蛍光色に近い黄緑色のズボンです。他の色の服と調和させるのが非常に困難なシャルトルーズグリーンは、あらゆる色の中で最も夜間の視認性が高く、胴と脚が離れ離れになるのが嫌なら、このズボンは賢明な選択肢ではありません。"

#. ~ Variant name of item "pants"
#: data/json/items/armor/legs_clothes.json
msgid "orange trackpants"
msgid_plural "pairs of orange trackpants"
msgstr[0] "コットンパンツ(橙)"

#. ~ Description of variant "orange trackpants" of item "pants"
#: data/json/items/armor/legs_clothes.json
msgid ""
"Reminiscent of the color of flames, this pair of cotton trackpants is, "
"perhaps optimistically, dyed a muted shade of burned orange."
msgstr "炎の色のような安心感を与える落ち着いたオレンジ色の、運動用のコットンパンツです。"

#. ~ Variant name of item "pants"
#: data/json/items/armor/legs_clothes.json
msgid "regimental-blue pants"
msgid_plural "pairs of regimental-blue pants"
msgstr[0] "コットンパンツ(ﾚｼﾞﾒﾝﾀﾙﾌﾞﾙｰ)"

#. ~ Description of variant "regimental-blue pants" of item "pants"
#: data/json/items/armor/legs_clothes.json
msgid ""
"A pair of spiffy, bluish-purple trousers with deep pockets.  You feel smart "
"and well-put-together just looking at it."
msgstr "深いポケットが付いた、刺激的な青紫色のズボンです。見ているだけで、自分がお洒落でセンスが良くなったような気分に浸れます。"

#. ~ Variant name of item "pants"
#: data/json/items/armor/legs_clothes.json
msgid "corvette-red pants"
msgid_plural "pairs of corvette-red pants"
msgstr[0] "コットンパンツ(ｺﾙﾍﾞｯﾄﾚｯﾄﾞ)"

#. ~ Description of variant "corvette-red pants" of item "pants"
#: data/json/items/armor/legs_clothes.json
msgid ""
"The classic color of vintage Corvette muscle cars, this pair of vibrant "
"trousers is dyed an eye-bleedingly bright shade of crimson, a color in which"
" they will shortly be bathed should any resident of the Cataclysm mangle you"
" after spotting you by virtue of the cartoonishly energetic shade that these"
" pants flaunt."
msgstr ""
"古いマッスルカーであるコルベットに用いられた目から血が出るほど明るい深紅色をした、鮮やかで古風なズボンです。このズボンが持っている漫画の登場人物のようにエネルギッシュな色にゾンビが引き寄せられたとすれば、間違いなく全身を同じ色に染め上げられることになるでしょう。"

#. ~ Variant name of item "pants"
#: data/json/items/armor/legs_clothes.json
msgid "poppy-red pants"
msgid_plural "pairs of poppy-red pants"
msgstr[0] "コットンパンツ(ﾎﾟﾋﾟｰﾚｯﾄﾞ)"

#. ~ Description of variant "poppy-red pants" of item "pants"
#: data/json/items/armor/legs_clothes.json
msgid ""
"A fine choice to have donned during Veterans Day, this pair of warm, "
"insulated trousers are dyed a pinkish red hue.  Perhaps it would be fitting "
"to wear them again, for while in this war there aren't any poppies blowing "
"between crosses, the heaps of dead are certainly high."
msgstr ""
"復員軍人の日に着用するのに最適な、保温性のあるピンクがかった赤色のズボンです。この戦いで死者にポピーを供える者はもう居ませんが、死体の山の多さを考えると、今こそこのズボンを履くべき時なのかもしれません。"

#. ~ Variant name of item "pants"
#: data/json/items/armor/legs_clothes.json
msgid "mauve sweatpants"
msgid_plural "pairs of mauve sweatpants"
msgstr[0] "コットンパンツ(ﾓｰﾌﾞ)"

#. ~ Description of variant "mauve sweatpants" of item "pants"
#: data/json/items/armor/legs_clothes.json
msgid ""
"A pale mix of purple and pink, this pair of cotton sweatpants is not only "
"comfortable and practical, with a set of spacious pockets, a drawstring "
"waistband, and elastic cuffs, but also a smidge warmer than jeans."
msgstr ""
"紫色とピンク色を混ぜ合わせたような淡い色のコットンスウェットパンツです。広いポケット、調整可能なウエストバンド、伸縮性のある裾を備えており、履き心地が良く実用的であるだけでなく、ジーンズより多少暖かく過ごせます。"

#. ~ Variant name of item "pants"
#: data/json/items/armor/legs_clothes.json
msgid "lemon-yellow pants"
msgid_plural "pairs of lemon-yellow pants"
msgstr[0] "コットンパンツ(ﾚﾓﾝｲｴﾛｰ)"

#. ~ Description of variant "lemon-yellow pants" of item "pants"
#: data/json/items/armor/legs_clothes.json
msgid ""
"A set of bewilderingly bright pants dyed a cheery shade of creamy yellow and"
" sown with a set of deep pockets.  You are confused both as to which pre-"
"Cataclysm fashion trend spawned this abomination and why its hue doesn't "
"look like the actual fruit."
msgstr ""
"陽気なクリームイエローの、深いポケットが付いた目が眩むほど明るいズボンです。大変動以前のどんなファッショントレンドがこのような忌み子を生み出したのか、そして何故レモンイエローと実際のレモンの色が全く異なるのか、いくら考えても分かりません。"

#. ~ Variant name of item "pants"
#: data/json/items/armor/legs_clothes.json
msgid "mustard-yellow pants"
msgid_plural "pairs of mustard-yellow pants"
msgstr[0] "コットンパンツ(ﾏｽﾀｰﾄﾞｲｴﾛｰ)"

#. ~ Description of variant "mustard-yellow pants" of item "pants"
#: data/json/items/armor/legs_clothes.json
msgid ""
"The world's a butchered hamburger of dead flesh, and you're the condiment.  "
"At least, that's what you'll look like if you choose to stride about in this"
" set of comfortable, insulated trousers, their fabric dyed a deep yellow and"
" touched up by rich brown undertones."
msgstr ""
"世界が死肉で作ったハンバーガーだとするなら、このズボンの着用者はその調味料です。少なくとも、黄色がかった深い茶色に染まった履き心地がよく暖かいズボンを履いて闊歩していれば、そのように見えるかもしれません。"

#. ~ Variant name of item "pants"
#: data/json/items/armor/legs_clothes.json
msgid "canary-yellow pants"
msgid_plural "pairs of canary-yellow pants"
msgstr[0] "コットンパンツ(ｶﾅﾘｱｲｴﾛｰ)"

#. ~ Description of variant "canary-yellow pants" of item "pants"
#: data/json/items/armor/legs_clothes.json
msgid ""
"Much like the bird from which the hue of this pair of pants derives its "
"name, this set of trousers is dyed a warm and extremely vibrant hue of "
"yellow.  Equipped with deep pockets and warmer than regular jeans, you feel "
"relatively sure that wearing this would let you be seen by any survivors, "
"zombies, or even the ISS, if it's still in orbit."
msgstr ""
"この色の名前の由来になっている鳥のように、非常に鮮やかな黄色に染まった暖かいズボンです。深いポケットが付いており、通常のジーンズより暖かいです。ここまで派手な服を着ていれば、生存者やゾンビ、更には軌道上のISSからも発見されやすくなるような気がしてきます。"

#. ~ Variant name of item "pants"
#: data/json/items/armor/legs_clothes.json
msgid "liberty's pants"
msgid_plural "pairs of liberty's pants"
msgstr[0] "コットンパンツ(星条旗)"

#. ~ Description of variant "liberty's pants" of item "pants"
#: data/json/items/armor/legs_clothes.json
msgid ""
"These pair of sky blue pants are resplendent with a pair of stitched "
"American flags, their flag poles running down each leg, and a standard "
"flanking the trousers' front and rear.  \"Freedom\" is boldly stitched "
"across the fly and enclosed by a ring of golden stars, while the back bears "
"the legend, \"Liberbooty!\""
msgstr ""
"アメリカの国旗が前後に2枚ずつ縫い付けられた、スカイブルーのズボンです。旗竿は両足に沿って伸びており、チャックの部分には金色の星に囲まれた「Freedom」という文字が大胆に刺繍されています。背面も、「Liberbooty!」という鮮烈な文字が刻まれています。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/legs_clothes.json
msgid "army pants"
msgid_plural "army pants"
msgstr[0] "軍用パンツ"

#. ~ Description of "army pants"
#: data/json/items/armor/legs_clothes.json
msgid "A tough pair of pants lined with pockets.  Favored by the military."
msgstr "軍隊で愛用されている、複数のポケットが付いた丈夫なズボンです。"

#. ~ Snippet of item "army pants"
#: data/json/items/armor/legs_clothes.json
msgid ""
"A tough pair of pants.  Favored by the military.  This pair sports the US "
"Army's gray, green and tan Universal Camouflage Pattern.  The pattern is "
"notable for its lack of black."
msgstr "アメリカ陸軍で愛用されている丈夫なズボンです。UCPと呼ばれる灰色、緑色、黄褐色の迷彩柄であり、黒色を使っていない点が特徴です。"

#. ~ Snippet of item "army pants"
#: data/json/items/armor/legs_clothes.json
msgid ""
"A tough pair of military pants patterned in desert camouflage.  They are "
"lined with deep pockets."
msgstr "砂漠用迷彩をモチーフにした丈夫なミリタリーパンツです。深いポケットが付いています。"

#. ~ Snippet of item "army pants"
#: data/json/items/armor/legs_clothes.json
msgid ""
"A tough pair of military pants with a black, green and tan pixel camouflage "
"pattern.  Commonly seen worn by US Marines."
msgstr "黒色、緑色、黄褐色からなるデジタル迷彩柄の、丈夫なミリタリーパンツです。アメリカ軍の海兵隊がよく着用しています。"

#. ~ Snippet of item "army pants"
#: data/json/items/armor/legs_clothes.json
msgid ""
"A tough pair of military pants with the black, brown, green and tan Battle "
"Dress camouflage pattern.  They look old."
msgstr "BDUと呼ばれる黒色、茶色、緑色、黄褐色の迷彩柄の、丈夫なミリタリーパンツです。履き古されているようです。"

#. ~ Snippet of item "army pants"
#: data/json/items/armor/legs_clothes.json
msgid ""
"A tough and breathable pair of military pants in Operational Camouflage "
"Pattern."
msgstr "OCPと呼ばれる迷彩柄の、上部で通気性に優れたミリタリーパンツです。"

#. ~ Snippet of item "army pants"
#: data/json/items/armor/legs_clothes.json
msgid ""
"A tough pair of military pants with a predominantly dark blue camouflage.  "
"Favored by the US Navy."
msgstr "アメリカ海軍に愛用されている濃青色を主体とした迷彩柄の、丈夫なミリタリーパンツです。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/legs_clothes.json
msgid "cargo pants"
msgid_plural "cargo pants"
msgstr[0] "カーゴパンツ"

#. ~ Description of "cargo pants"
#: data/json/items/armor/legs_clothes.json
msgid "A pair of pants lined with pockets, offering lots of storage."
msgstr "複数のポケットで十分な収納容積を確保したズボンです。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/legs_clothes.json
msgid "checkered pants"
msgid_plural "checkered pants"
msgstr[0] "チェックパンツ"

#. ~ Description of "checkered pants"
#: data/json/items/armor/legs_clothes.json
msgid "In a pinch, these pants can be used for an impromptu game of checkers."
msgstr "いざという時には、このズボンはチェッカーのゲーム盤に利用できます。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/legs_clothes.json
msgid "fur pants"
msgid_plural "fur pants"
msgstr[0] "ファーパンツ"

#. ~ Description of "fur pants"
#: data/json/items/armor/legs_clothes.json
msgid "A hefty pair of fur-lined pants."
msgstr "裏地に毛皮を用いた丈夫なズボンです。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/legs_clothes.json
msgid "faux fur pants"
msgid_plural "faux fur pants"
msgstr[0] "フェイクファーパンツ"

#. ~ Description of "faux fur pants"
#: data/json/items/armor/legs_clothes.json
msgid "A pair of long cotton pants lined with warm imitation fur."
msgstr "裏地に毛皮の模造品が使われている布製の長ズボンです。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/legs_clothes.json
msgid "ninja trousers"
msgid_plural "ninja trousers"
msgstr[0] "ニンジャカーゴパンツ"

#. ~ Description of "ninja trousers"
#: data/json/items/armor/legs_clothes.json
msgid ""
"A pair of black trousers with calf and waistband ties.  Comfortable to use "
"but lacks pockets."
msgstr "ふくらはぎと腰に紐が付いた黒いカーゴパンツです。着心地は良好ですが、ポケットがありません。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/legs_clothes.json
msgid "leather pants"
msgid_plural "leather pants"
msgstr[0] "レザーパンツ"

#. ~ Description of "leather pants"
#: data/json/items/armor/legs_clothes.json
msgid ""
"A pair of black leather pants.  Very tough, but cumbersome and without much "
"storage."
msgstr "黒い革製のズボンです。丈夫ですが動き辛いのが難点です。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/legs_clothes.json
msgid "ski pants"
msgid_plural "ski pants"
msgstr[0] "スキーパンツ"

#. ~ Description of "ski pants"
#: data/json/items/armor/legs_clothes.json
msgid "A pair of pants meant for alpine skiing."
msgstr "アルペンスキー用のズボンです。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/legs_clothes.json
msgid "police breeches"
msgid_plural "police breeches"
msgstr[0] "警官用ブリーチェス"

#. ~ Description of "police breeches"
#: data/json/items/armor/legs_clothes.json
msgid ""
"A pair of tight-fitting police breeches.  Offers lots of mobility for "
"motorized officers."
msgstr "肌に密着する警官用ブリーチェスです。バイク警官のために、動きやすさを追求した作りになっています。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/legs_clothes.json
msgid "mail carrier shorts"
msgid_plural "mail carrier shorts"
msgstr[0] "郵便配達員ハーフパンツ"

#. ~ Description of "mail carrier shorts"
#: data/json/items/armor/legs_clothes.json
msgid "A pair of dark blue shorts, the kind used by postal service workers."
msgstr "郵便局員が着用するダークブルーのハーフパンツです。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/legs_clothes.json
msgid "Santa shorts"
msgid_plural "Santa shorts"
msgstr[0] "サンタハーフパンツ"

#. ~ Description of "Santa shorts"
