#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/robofac_armor.json
msgid "Hub 01 modular defense system"
msgid_plural "Hub 01 modular defense systems"
msgstr[0] "ハブ01モジュラーディフェンスシステム"

#. ~ Description of "Hub 01 modular defense system"
#: data/json/items/armor/robofac_armor.json
msgid ""
"A custom-designed poncho for the true frontier explorer, made with aramid "
"fibers and robust ripstop nylon.  Striped in brown and blue, the white seal "
"of Hub 01 is emblazoned proudly on the front.  It features several quick "
"access pouches attached to a waist drawstring, and two waterproof dry bags "
"for carrying liquids.  It also features several tight clamps and velcro "
"strips around the waist and shoulders; perhaps something attaches to them."
msgstr ""
"未開拓地域の探査のために特別に作られた、強靭なリップストップ生地とアラミド繊維製のポンチョです。茶色と青色の縞模様のデザインで、正面には白いハブ01という文字が誇らしげに表記されています。巾着状に引き絞れる収納に便利な腰のポーチ複数と防水タンク2つが付属しています。腰の下部と肩の辺りにクリップとマジックテープが付いており、何かを取り付けられそうです。"

#. ~ Description of a pocket in item "Hub 01 modular defense system"
#. ~ Description of a pocket in item "Hub 01 modular defense anchor"
#: data/json/items/armor/robofac_armor.json
msgid "Watertight internal reservoir."
msgstr "水密性の高い内部タンクです。"

#. ~ Description of a pocket in item "Hub 01 modular defense system"
#. ~ Description of a pocket in item "Hub 01 modular defense anchor"
#. ~ Description of a pocket in item "drone-tech harness"
#: data/json/items/armor/robofac_armor.json
msgid "Quick access pouches."
msgstr "取り出しやすいポーチです。"

#. ~ Description of a pocket in item "Hub 01 modular defense system"
#. ~ Description of a pocket in item "Hub 01 modular defense anchor"
#: data/json/items/armor/robofac_armor.json
msgid "Hooks for an armored mantle."
msgstr "防護外套をフックで固定します。"

#. ~ Description of a pocket in item "Hub 01 modular defense system"
#. ~ Description of a pocket in item "Hub 01 modular defense anchor"
#: data/json/items/armor/robofac_armor.json
msgid "Hooks for an armored skirt."
msgstr "腰部装甲をフックで固定します。"

#. ~ Description of a pocket in item "Hub 01 modular defense system"
#. ~ Description of a pocket in item "Hub 01 modular defense anchor"
#: data/json/items/armor/robofac_armor.json
msgid "Strap for a gun barrel."
msgstr "銃器をストラップに固定します。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/robofac_armor.json
msgid "Hub 01 modular defense anchor"
msgid_plural "Hub 01 modular defense anchors"
msgstr[0] "ハブ01モジュラーディフェンスアンカー"

#. ~ Description of "Hub 01 modular defense anchor"
#: data/json/items/armor/robofac_armor.json
msgid ""
"A custom-designed poncho for the true frontier explorer, made with aramid "
"fibers and robust ripstop nylon.  This one features a hardened skeleton of "
"ceramic plates running up and over the shoulders, and a portion of the front"
" has been raised upwards from the rest.  Lifting the fabric reveals a large "
"disc-shaped device installed into the garment, featureless except for a "
"prominent switch and Hub 01's logo in LED.  In addition to the poncho's "
"usual complement of storage, a battery compartment has been added that wires"
" into this device, featuring very specialized connectors and, perhaps a "
"little disconcertingly, radiation shielding."
msgstr ""
"辺境地の探査のために特別に作られた、強靭なリップストップ生地とアラミド繊維製のポンチョです。茶色と青色の縞模様のデザインで、肩はセラミックプレートで覆われています。正面の一部分は蓋のようになっており、引き上げると、内部には大きな円盤状の装置が入っています。その他に目を引くものは、鮮やかな色のスイッチとLEDで描かれたハブ01という文字以外何もありません。一般的なポンチョにあるポケット類に加え、内部の装置に接続されたバッテリーが付属しています。装置のコネクターの形状が非常に特殊であることと、放射線遮蔽材が使われていることが少し気がかりです。"

#. ~ "menu_text" action message of item "Hub 01 modular defense anchor"
#: data/json/items/armor/robofac_armor.json
msgid "Turn on anchor"
msgstr "アンカーを起動する"

#. ~ "msg" action message of item "Hub 01 modular defense anchor"
#: data/json/items/armor/robofac_armor.json
msgid ""
"You activate the anchor, and the Hub 01 logo on your front begins to glow "
"white."
msgstr "アンカーを起動すると、正面にあるハブ01のロゴが白く光り始めました。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/robofac_armor.json
msgid "Hub 01 modular defense anchor (on)"
msgid_plural "Hub 01 modular defense anchors (on)"
msgstr[0] "ハブ01モジュラーディフェンスアンカー(オン)"

#. ~ Description of "Hub 01 modular defense anchor (on)"
#: data/json/items/armor/robofac_armor.json
msgid ""
"A custom-designed poncho for the true frontier explorer, made with aramid "
"fibers and robust ripstop nylon.  The logo of Hub 01 emblazoned on the chest"
" is glowing white."
msgstr ""
"辺境地の探査のために特別に作られた、強靭なリップストップ生地とアラミド繊維製のポンチョです。胸元に記されたハブ01のロゴが白く光っています。"

#. ~ "menu_text" action message of item "Hub 01 modular defense anchor (on)"
#: data/json/items/armor/robofac_armor.json
msgid "Turn off anchor"
msgstr "アンカーを停止する"

#. ~ "msg" action message of item "Hub 01 modular defense anchor (on)"
#: data/json/items/armor/robofac_armor.json
msgid "The Hub logo on your front stops glowing."
msgstr "ハブ01のロゴが消灯しました。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/robofac_armor.json
msgid "Hub 01 modular recon headgear"
msgid_plural "Hub 01 modular recon headgears"
msgstr[0] "ハブ01偵察ヘッドギア"

#. ~ Description of "Hub 01 modular recon headgear"
#: data/json/items/armor/robofac_armor.json
msgid ""
"Heavy duty hooded headwear for the true frontier explorer, made with robust "
"Nylon sheeting reinforced with Kevlar fibers.  The top consists of a series "
"of plastic plates with hooks and velcro strips, perhaps for attaching "
"additional parts.  On the forehead of the assembly is a bulky box visor on a"
" mechanism to quickly pull it down over your eyes, with a cover on the side "
"to insert standard batteries.  Activate to lower the visor and use the light"
" amplification functions."
msgstr ""
"辺境地の探査のために特別に作られた、丈夫なナイロン生地をケブラー繊維で補強した、重装甲のフード型ヘッドギアです。頭頂部には、追加パーツを取り付けられそうなフックとマジックテープ付きプラスチックプレートが付属しています。額には大きな箱型バイザーがあり、ワンタッチで目元に引き下げられる機構になっています。側面には標準的な電池の挿入口とカバーが付いています。起動すると、バイザーを引き下げて光量増幅モードを有効化します。"

#. ~ "menu_text" action message of item "Hub 01 modular recon headgear"
#: data/json/items/armor/robofac_armor.json
msgid "activate light-amp mode"
msgstr "光量増幅"

#. ~ "msg" action message of item "Hub 01 modular recon headgear"
#: data/json/items/armor/robofac_armor.json
msgid ""
"You lower the visor and flick the control dial to light amplification mode."
msgstr "バイザーを引き下げて操作ダイヤルをフリックし、光量増幅モードを起動しました。"

#. ~ "need_charges_msg" action message of item "Hub 01 modular recon headgear"
#. ~ "need_charges_msg" action message of item "Hub 01 modular recon headgear
#. (NV)"
#: data/json/items/armor/robofac_armor.json
msgid "The visor's batteries are dead."
msgstr "ヘッドギアの電池が切れました。"

#. ~ Description of a pocket in item "Hub 01 modular recon headgear"
#: data/json/items/armor/robofac_armor.json
msgid "Hooks for an armored helm plate."
msgstr "ヘルメットをフックで固定します。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/robofac_armor.json
msgid "Hub 01 modular recon headgear (NV)"
msgid_plural "Hub 01 modular recon headgear (NV)"
msgstr[0] "ハブ01偵察ヘッドギア(光量増幅)"

#. ~ Description of "Hub 01 modular recon headgear (NV)"
#: data/json/items/armor/robofac_armor.json
msgid ""
"Heavy duty hooded headwear for the true frontier explorer.  The visor has "
"been lowered over the eyes, and is drawing low power to provide light "
"amplification by way of an infrared illuminator and detector.  Activate to "
"switch to full IR scanning."
msgstr ""
"辺境地の探査のために特別に作られた、重装甲のフード型ヘッドギアです。バイザーが目元に引き下げられており、わずかに電力を消費しながら赤外線照明と探知器による光量増幅モードを起動しています。起動すると、赤外線視モードに切り替わります。"

#. ~ "menu_text" action message of item "Hub 01 modular recon headgear (NV)"
#: data/json/items/armor/robofac_armor.json
msgid "activate IR mode"
msgstr "赤外線視"

#. ~ "msg" action message of item "Hub 01 modular recon headgear (NV)"
#: data/json/items/armor/robofac_armor.json
msgid "You flick the control dial to infra-red scanning mode."
msgstr "操作ダイヤルをフリックし、赤外線視モードを起動しました。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/robofac_armor.json
msgid "Hub 01 modular recon headgear (IR)"
msgid_plural "Hub 01 modular recon headgear (IR)"
msgstr[0] "ハブ01偵察ヘッドギア(赤外線視)"

#. ~ Description of "Hub 01 modular recon headgear (IR)"
#: data/json/items/armor/robofac_armor.json
msgid ""
"Heavy duty hooded headwear for the true frontier explorer.  The visor has "
"been lowered over the eyes, and is drawing moderate power to provide full "
"infra-red scanning, allowing you to see warm blooded creatures in the dark."
"  Activate to turn the visor off again."
msgstr ""
"辺境地の探査のために特別に作られた、重装甲のフード型ヘッドギアです。バイザーが目元に引き下げられており、電力を消費しながら赤外線視モードを起動しています。このモード中は、暗闇の中でも温血動物の位置を把握できます。起動すると、バイザーの機能を停止します。"

#. ~ "msg" action message of item "Hub 01 modular recon headgear (IR)"
#: data/json/items/armor/robofac_armor.json
msgid "You flick the visor off, and push it off your face."
msgstr "バイザーを目元から離し、引き上げました。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/robofac_armor.json
msgid "drone-tech harness"
msgid_plural "drone-tech harness"
msgstr[0] "ドローンハーネス"

#. ~ Description of "drone-tech harness"
#: data/json/items/armor/robofac_armor.json
msgid ""
"A modified army harness, repurposed to carry several small and a single "
"medium sized drone alongside the tools to maintain them."
msgstr "軍用ハーネスを改造し、小型ドローン数機と中型ドローン1機、整備用ツールを運搬できるようにしたものです。"

#. ~ Description of a pocket in item "drone-tech harness"
#: data/json/items/armor/robofac_armor.json
msgid ""
"A series of connectors meant to hold a medium sized drone on your back."
msgstr "中型ドローンを背中に固定するコネクタです。"

#. ~ Brief name of a pocket in item "drone-tech harness"
#: data/json/items/armor/robofac_armor.json
msgid "Medium drone strap"
msgstr "中型ドローンストラップ"

#. ~ Description of a pocket in item "drone-tech harness"
#: data/json/items/armor/robofac_armor.json
msgid "A series of connectors meant to store a small drone."
msgstr "小型ドローンを収納するコネクタ類です。"

#. ~ Brief name of a pocket in item "drone-tech harness"
#: data/json/items/armor/robofac_armor.json
msgid "Small drone holder"
msgstr "小型ドローンホルダー"

#. ~ Description of a pocket in item "drone-tech harness"
#: data/json/items/armor/robofac_armor.json
msgid "Gadget pouch"
msgstr "ガジェットポーチ"

#. ~ Description of a pocket in item "drone-tech harness"
#: data/json/items/armor/robofac_armor.json
msgid "Tool clip"
msgstr "工具クリップ"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/robofac_armor.json
msgid "abstract mantle"
msgid_plural "abstract mantles"
msgstr[0] "汎用外套"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/robofac_armor.json
msgid "abstract armored skirt"
msgid_plural "abstract armored skirts"
msgstr[0] "汎用腰部装甲"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/robofac_armor.json
msgid "pair of abstract armored vambraces"
msgid_plural "pairs of abstract armored vambraces"
msgstr[0] "汎用装甲ヴァンブレース"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/robofac_armor.json
msgid "pair of abstract armored greaves"
msgid_plural "pairs of abstract armored greaves"
msgstr[0] "汎用装甲グリーヴ"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/robofac_armor.json
msgid "abstract helmet"
msgid_plural "abstract helmets"
msgstr[0] "汎用ヘルメット"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/robofac_armor.json
msgid "Hub 01 prototype mantle"
msgid_plural "Hub 01 prototype mantles"
msgstr[0] "ハブ01試作外套"

#. ~ Description of "Hub 01 prototype mantle"
#: data/json/items/armor/robofac_armor.json
msgid ""
"3D printed armor for the upper body, made of thick and pliable polymer with "
"metallic fibers for reinforcement.  Several buckles and straps allow it to "
"be adjusted to fit you comfortably.  Despite its rough finish, it's clear "
"that a lot of thought has gone into the ergonomics and weight.  Designed to "
"clip to the chest and shoulders, its interior reads \"ATTACH TO MODULAR "
"DEFENSE SYSTEM\"."
msgstr ""
"3Dプリントされた、厚みのある上半身用防具です。ポリマー素材で作られていますが、特に力がかかる部分は金属繊維で補強されています。粗雑な見た目ですが、軽量で人間工学に基づいた作りになっているようです。バックルやストラップが各所に付いており、体形に合わせて調整できるようになっています。他の防具の胸と肩にクリップで固定して着用するようになっており、内側には「モジュラーディフェンスシステム取付部」と表記してあります。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/robofac_armor.json
msgid "Hub 01 kinetic mantle"
msgid_plural "Hub 01 kinetic mantles"
msgstr[0] "ハブ01作業用外套"

#. ~ Description of "Hub 01 kinetic mantle"
#: data/json/items/armor/robofac_armor.json
msgid ""
"3D printed armor for the upper body, made of thick and pliable polymer with "
"metallic fibers for reinforcement.  This model incorporates a rubber coating"
" that diffuses impacts and provides excellent protection from blunt trauma, "
"even if it does feel a bit like a rain coat.  Designed to clip to the chest "
"and shoulders, its interior reads \"ATTACH TO MODULAR DEFENSE SYSTEM\"."
msgstr ""
"3Dプリントされた、厚みのある上半身用防具です。ポリマー素材で作られていますが、特に力がかかる部分は金属繊維で補強されています。衝撃を拡散させるラバーコーティングが施されており、レインコートのような見た目でありながら打撃攻撃にも耐えられる優れものです。他の防具の胸と肩にクリップで固定して着用するようになっており、内側には「モジュラーディフェンスシステム取付部」と表記してあります。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/robofac_armor.json
msgid "Hub 01 turnout mantle"
msgid_plural "Hub 01 turnout mantles"
msgstr[0] "ハブ01防護外套"

#. ~ Description of "Hub 01 turnout mantle"
#: data/json/items/armor/robofac_armor.json
msgid ""
"3D printed armor for the upper body, made of thick and pliable polymer with "
"metallic fibers for reinforcement.  This model features heat-resistant "
"materials in the construction, providing protection from extreme heat "
"without sacrificing its overall performance.  Designed to clip to the chest "
"and shoulders, its interior reads \"ATTACH TO MODULAR DEFENSE SYSTEM\"."
msgstr ""
"3Dプリントされた、厚みのある上半身用防具です。ポリマー素材で作られていますが、特に力がかかる部分は金属繊維で補強されています。耐熱素材がコーティングされており、他の性能を低下させることなく、超高温からも肉体を保護できるようになっています。他の防具の胸と肩にクリップで固定して着用するようになっており、内側には「モジュラーディフェンスシステム取付部」と表記してあります。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/robofac_armor.json
msgid "Hub 01 ballistic mantle"
msgid_plural "Hub 01 ballistic mantles"
msgstr[0] "ハブ01防弾外套"

#. ~ Description of "Hub 01 ballistic mantle"
#: data/json/items/armor/robofac_armor.json
msgid ""
"3D printed armor for the upper body, made of thick and pliable polymer with "
"metallic fibers for reinforcement.  Thanks to a slim under-layer of "
"synthetic fibers, it provides fantastic defense from small-arms fire, and "
"could take the edge off of a rifle bullet, too.  Designed to clip to the "
"chest and shoulders, its interior reads \"ATTACH TO MODULAR DEFENSE "
"SYSTEM\"."
msgstr ""
"3Dプリントされた、厚みのある上半身用防具です。ポリマー素材で作られていますが、特に力がかかる部分は金属繊維で補強されています。内部を覆う薄い合成繊維によって、小口径の銃弾だけでなくライフル弾からも肉体を保護します。他の防具の胸と肩にクリップで固定して着用するようになっており、内側には「モジュラーディフェンスシステム取付部」と表記してあります。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/robofac_armor.json
msgid "Hub 01 soldier mantle"
msgid_plural "Hub 01 soldier mantles"
msgstr[0] "ハブ01戦闘用外套"

#. ~ Description of "Hub 01 soldier mantle"
#: data/json/items/armor/robofac_armor.json
msgid ""
"3D printed armor for the upper body, sporting a professional finish and "
"stellar ergonomics.  Made of extremely tough UHMW polyethylene combined with"
" treated aramid fabric, it provides military-grade defense against zombies, "
"bullets, zombies with bullets, and plenty of other things that the Cataclysm"
" can throw at you.  Designed to clip to the chest and shoulders, its "
"interior reads \"ATTACH TO MODULAR DEFENSE SYSTEM\"."
msgstr ""
"3Dプリントされた上半身用防具です。非常に丈夫な超高分子量ポリエチレンとアラミド繊維で作られており、ゾンビ、銃撃、ゾンビによる銃撃など、大変動の状況下で起こりうるあらゆる攻撃に対して軍用レベルの防御力を発揮します。他の防具の胸と肩にクリップで固定して着用するようになっており、内側には「モジュラーディフェンスシステム取付部」と表記してあります。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/robofac_armor.json
msgid "Hub 01 prototype skirt"
msgid_plural "Hub 01 prototype skirts"
msgstr[0] "ハブ01試作腰部装甲"

#. ~ Description of "Hub 01 prototype skirt"
#: data/json/items/armor/robofac_armor.json
msgid ""
"3D printed armor for the thighs and knees, consisting of a skirt made of "
"segmented armor plates.  It features a simple integrated belt to let it fit "
"any waist size.  Despite its rough finish, it's clear that a lot of thought "
"has gone into the ergonomics and weight.  Designed to clip to the waist, its"
" interior reads \"ATTACH TO MODULAR DEFENSE SYSTEM\"."
msgstr ""
"3Dプリントされた、太股から膝までを覆う、セグメント化されたスカート型装甲です。シンプルなベルトが内蔵されており、体形に合わせて調整できるようになっています。粗雑な見た目ですが、軽量で人間工学に基づいた作りになっているようです。他の防具の腰にクリップで固定して着用するようになっており、内側には「モジュラーディフェンスシステム取付部」と表記してあります。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/robofac_armor.json
msgid "Hub 01 kinetic skirt"
msgid_plural "Hub 01 kinetic skirts"
msgstr[0] "ハブ01作業用腰部装甲"

#. ~ Description of "Hub 01 kinetic skirt"
#: data/json/items/armor/robofac_armor.json
msgid ""
"3D printed armor for the thighs and knees, consisting of a skirt made of "
"segmented armor plates.  This model resembles scale armor, and provides "
"excellent protection from blunt trauma.  Designed to clip to the waist, its "
"interior reads \"ATTACH TO MODULAR DEFENSE SYSTEM\"."
msgstr ""
"3Dプリントされた、太股から膝までを覆う、セグメント化されたスカート型装甲です。このモデルはスケイルアーマーを模したデザインになっており、打撃耐性に優れています。他の防具の腰にクリップで固定して着用するようになっており、内側には「モジュラーディフェンスシステム取付部」と表記してあります。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/robofac_armor.json
msgid "Hub 01 turnout skirt"
msgid_plural "Hub 01 turnout skirts"
msgstr[0] "ハブ01防護腰部装甲"

#. ~ Description of "Hub 01 turnout skirt"
#: data/json/items/armor/robofac_armor.json
msgid ""
"3D printed armor for the thighs and knees, consisting of a skirt made of "
"segmented armor plates.  This version incorporates tight-fitting leggings "
"that provide some protection from extreme heat.  Designed to clip to the "
"waist, its interior reads \"ATTACH TO MODULAR DEFENSE SYSTEM\"."
msgstr ""
"3Dプリントされた、太股から膝までを覆う、セグメント化されたスカート型装甲です。このモデルは、超高温にも耐えるレギンス素材が肌に密着するようになっています。他の防具の腰にクリップで固定して着用するようになっており、内側には「モジュラーディフェンスシステム取付部」と表記してあります。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/robofac_armor.json
msgid "Hub 01 ballistic skirt"
msgid_plural "Hub 01 ballistic skirts"
msgstr[0] "ハブ01防弾腰部装甲"

#. ~ Description of "Hub 01 ballistic skirt"
#: data/json/items/armor/robofac_armor.json
msgid ""
"3D printed armor for the thighs and knees, consisting of a skirt made of "
"segmented armor plates.  It includes a reinforcing layer of aramid fabric in"
" addition to leg sleeves made of high-strength material, protecting your "
"sensitive bits from small-arms fire.  Designed to clip to the waist, its "
"interior reads \"ATTACH TO MODULAR DEFENSE SYSTEM\"."
msgstr ""
"3Dプリントされた、太股から膝までを覆う、セグメント化されたスカート型装甲です。このモデルは非常に強靭なレッグスリーブがアラミド繊維で更に補強されており、小口径の銃撃から急所を保護します。他の防具の腰にクリップで固定して着用するようになっており、内側には「モジュラーディフェンスシステム取付部」と表記してあります。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/robofac_armor.json
msgid "Hub 01 soldier skirt"
msgid_plural "Hub 01 soldier skirts"
msgstr[0] "ハブ01戦闘用腰部装甲"

#. ~ Description of "Hub 01 soldier skirt"
#: data/json/items/armor/robofac_armor.json
msgid ""
"3D printed armor for the thighs and knees, sporting a professional finish "
"and stellar ergonomics.  Composed of segmented polyethylene armor plates "
"featuring a dense metal core sandwiched between layers of composite-grade "
"aramid fabric, it provides excellent protection for the upper legs to ensure"
" that you'll stay on your feet when it really matters.  Designed to clip to "
"the waist, its interior reads \"ATTACH TO MODULAR DEFENSE SYSTEM\"."
msgstr ""
"3Dプリントされた、太股から膝までを覆う、セグメント化されたスカート型装甲です。人間工学に基づいた、非常に洗練されたデザインが特徴的です。セグメントには、高密度の金属コアを高品質のアラミド繊維で覆ったプレートを用いており、上肢を強力に保護します。他の防具の腰にクリップで固定して着用するようになっており、内側には「モジュラーディフェンスシステム取付部」と表記してあります。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/robofac_armor.json
msgid "pair of Hub 01 prototype vambraces"
msgid_plural "pairs of Hub 01 prototype vambraces"
msgstr[0] "ハブ01試作ヴァンブレース"

#. ~ Description of "pair of Hub 01 prototype vambraces"
#: data/json/items/armor/robofac_armor.json
msgid ""
"3D printed arm guards, made of large and flexible polymer sheets wrapped "
"around the forearm.  The end of each sheet features a clip and drawstring, "
"to fit the armor to any size.  Despite the rough finish, it fits securely, "
"and feels quite comfortable."
msgstr ""
"柔軟でゆったりしたポリマー素材で前腕を覆う、3Dプリントされたアームガードです。各部に付いたクリップとストラップを体形に合わせて調整できるようになっています。粗雑な見た目ですが、着用感は快適です。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/robofac_armor.json
msgid "pair of Hub 01 kinetic vambraces"
msgid_plural "pairs of Hub 01 kinetic vambraces"
msgstr[0] "ハブ01作業用ヴァンブレース"

#. ~ Description of "pair of Hub 01 kinetic vambraces"
#: data/json/items/armor/robofac_armor.json
msgid ""
"3D printed arm guards, made of large and flexible polymer sheets wrapped "
"around the forearm.  These ones are built in an overlapping pattern that "
"diffuses impacts and provides excellent protection from blunt trauma."
msgstr ""
"柔軟でゆったりしたポリマー素材で前腕を覆う、3Dプリントされたアームガードです。同一の小さな部品を重ね合わせた作りによって衝撃を拡散し、打撃攻撃から肉体を強固に守ります。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/robofac_armor.json
msgid "pair of Hub 01 turnout vambraces"
msgid_plural "pairs of Hub 01 turnout vambraces"
msgstr[0] "ハブ01防護ヴァンブレース"

#. ~ Description of "pair of Hub 01 turnout vambraces"
#: data/json/items/armor/robofac_armor.json
msgid ""
"3D printed arm guards, made of large and flexible polymer sheets wrapped "
"around the forearm.  These ones include Nomex sleeves to protect your arms "
"from extreme heat."
msgstr ""
"柔軟でゆったりしたポリマー素材で前腕を覆う、3Dプリントされたアームガードです。袖はノーメックス素材になっており、超高温から腕を保護します。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/robofac_armor.json
msgid "pair of Hub 01 ballistic vambraces"
msgid_plural "pairs of Hub 01 ballistic vambraces"
msgstr[0] "ハブ01防弾ヴァンブレース"

#. ~ Description of "pair of Hub 01 ballistic vambraces"
#: data/json/items/armor/robofac_armor.json
msgid ""
"3D printed arm guards, made of large and flexible polymer sheets wrapped "
"around the forearm.  These ones include aramid arm sleeves that do a great "
"job of slowing down bullets and preventing them from shredding your arms."
msgstr ""
"柔軟でゆったりしたポリマー素材で前腕を覆う、3Dプリントされたアームガードです。アラミド繊維が弾丸の威力を減衰させ、腕がちぎれ飛ぶ事態を防ぎます。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/robofac_armor.json
msgid "pair of Hub 01 soldier vambraces"
msgid_plural "pairs of Hub 01 soldier vambraces"
msgstr[0] "ハブ01戦闘用ヴァンブレース"

#. ~ Description of "pair of Hub 01 soldier vambraces"
#: data/json/items/armor/robofac_armor.json
msgid ""
"3D printed arm guards, sporting a professional finish and stellar "
"ergonomics.  With thick bullet-resistant arm sleeves, flexible but extremely"
" tough thermoplastic plates, and special attention given to areas "
"reflexively used to protect the face from attacks, it provides first-rate "
"protection against all the horrors that the apocalypse has brought to bear."
msgstr ""
"3Dプリントされたアームガードです。銃弾に耐える厚い装甲、柔軟で非常に強靭な熱可塑性プレートを備えており、反射的に顔を守る位置は特に頑丈に作られています。大変動がもたらすあらゆる脅威から肉体を守り抜きます。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/robofac_armor.json
msgid "pair of Hub 01 prototype greaves"
msgid_plural "pairs of Hub 01 prototype greaves"
msgstr[0] "ハブ01試作グリーヴ"

#. ~ Description of "pair of Hub 01 prototype greaves"
#: data/json/items/armor/robofac_armor.json
msgid ""
"3D printed leg guards, consisting of thick knee pads and a pair of large, "
"flexible polymer plates for securing around the calves to protect the tibias"
" of each leg.  Two straps on each plate can be tightened or loosened to fit "
"different leg sizes.  Despite the rough finish, it doesn't impede your "
"movement, and fits comfortably against your body."
msgstr ""
"厚い装甲で膝を覆い、柔軟でゆったりしたポリマー素材でふくらはぎを覆う、3Dプリントされたレッグガードです。各部に2本ずつ付いたストラップを体形に合わせて調整できるようになっています。簡素な見た目ですが、着用感は快適で動きを妨げません。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/robofac_armor.json
msgid "pair of Hub 01 kinetic greaves"
msgid_plural "pairs of Hub 01 kinetic greaves"
msgstr[0] "ハブ01作業用グリーヴ"

#. ~ Description of "pair of Hub 01 kinetic greaves"
#: data/json/items/armor/robofac_armor.json
msgid ""
"3D printed leg guards, consisting of thick knee pads and a pair of large, "
"flexible polymer plates for securing around the calves to protect the tibias"
" of each leg.  Thick padding and rubber lining provide excellent protection "
"from blunt trauma."
msgstr ""
"厚い装甲で膝を覆い、柔軟でゆったりしたポリマー素材でふくらはぎを覆う、3Dプリントされたレッグガードです。厚みのあるパッドとラバー構造によって、打撃から肉体を強固に守ります。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/robofac_armor.json
msgid "pair of Hub 01 turnout greaves"
msgid_plural "pairs of Hub 01 turnout greaves"
msgstr[0] "ハブ01防護グリーヴ"

#. ~ Description of "pair of Hub 01 turnout greaves"
#: data/json/items/armor/robofac_armor.json
msgid ""
"3D printed leg guards, consisting of thick knee pads and a pair of large, "
"flexible polymer plates for securing around the calves to protect the tibias"
" of each leg.  Heat-resistant leg sleeves and a breathable design provide "
"adequate protection from extreme heat without sacrificing your mobility or "
"core protection."
msgstr ""
"厚い装甲で膝を覆い、柔軟でゆったりしたポリマー素材でふくらはぎを覆う、3Dプリントされたレッグガードです。耐熱性の高いスリーブと通気性を確保したデザインによって、運動性やバランスはそのままに、超高温から肉体を保護します。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/robofac_armor.json
msgid "pair of Hub 01 ballistic greaves"
msgid_plural "pairs of Hub 01 ballistic greaves"
msgstr[0] "ハブ01防弾グリーヴ"

#. ~ Description of "pair of Hub 01 ballistic greaves"
#: data/json/items/armor/robofac_armor.json
msgid ""
"3D printed leg guards, consisting of thick knee pads and a pair of large, "
"flexible polymer plates for securing around the calves to protect the tibias"
" of each leg.  This model features leggings made of durable aramid and a "
"reinforced plate design; combined, they do a good job of mitigating damage "
"from small-arms fire."
msgstr ""
"厚い装甲で膝を覆い、柔軟でゆったりしたポリマー素材でふくらはぎを覆う、3Dプリントされたレッグガードです。耐久性の高いアラミド繊維のレギンスと強化プレートによって、小口径の銃弾によるダメージを軽減します。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/robofac_armor.json
msgid "pair of Hub 01 soldier greaves"
msgid_plural "pairs of Hub 01 soldier greaves"
msgstr[0] "ハブ01戦闘用グリーヴ"

#. ~ Description of "pair of Hub 01 soldier greaves"
#: data/json/items/armor/robofac_armor.json
msgid ""
"3D printed leg guards, sporting a professional finish and stellar "
"ergonomics.  Layered UHMW thermoplastic plates and bullet-resistant aramid "
"padding combine to keep your lower leg bones protected and unbroken, even "
"when knee-deep in the dead."
msgstr ""
"3Dプリントされたレッグガードです。熱可塑性超高分子量ポリエチレンの層と防弾性能の高いアラミド繊維パッドを組み合わせることで、たとえ死体の海の中でも下腿の骨を完璧に保護します。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/robofac_armor.json
msgid "Hub 01 prototype helmet"
msgid_plural "Hub 01 prototype helmets"
msgstr[0] "ハブ01試作ヘルメット"

#. ~ Description of "Hub 01 prototype helmet"
#: data/json/items/armor/robofac_armor.json
msgid ""
"3D printed armor for the head, made of thick polymer plates woven with "
"metallic fibers.  Despite its rough finish, it's clear that a lot of thought"
" has gone into the ergonomics and weight.  Designed to clip to some kind of "
"attachment point, its interior reads \"ATTACH TO MODULAR HEADGEAR\"."
msgstr ""
"3Dプリントで作られた、金属繊維を編みこんだ分厚いポリマープレート製の頭部装甲です。粗雑な見た目ですが、軽量で人間工学に基づいた作りになっているようです。内側には「モジュラーディフェンスシステム取付部」と表記してあり、何かと接続できそうな構造になっています。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/robofac_armor.json
msgid "Hub 01 kinetic helmet"
msgid_plural "Hub 01 kinetic helmets"
msgstr[0] "ハブ01作業用ヘルメット"

#. ~ Description of "Hub 01 kinetic helmet"
#: data/json/items/armor/robofac_armor.json
msgid ""
"3D printed armor for the head, made of thick polymer plates woven with "
"metallic fibers.  This model is covered in countless rubber hexagons, and "
"offers superior protection against blunt trauma.  Designed to clip to some "
"kind of attachment point, its interior reads \"ATTACH TO MODULAR HEADGEAR\"."
msgstr ""
"3Dプリントで作られた、金属繊維を編みこんだ分厚いポリマープレート製の頭部装甲です。六角形のゴム素材で覆われており、打撃に対する保護性能に優れています。内側には「モジュラーディフェンスシステム取付部」と表記してあり、何かと接続できそうな構造になっています。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/robofac_armor.json
msgid "Hub 01 turnout helmet"
msgid_plural "Hub 01 turnout helmets"
msgstr[0] "ハブ01防護ヘルメット"

#. ~ Description of "Hub 01 turnout helmet"
#: data/json/items/armor/robofac_armor.json
msgid ""
"3D printed armor for the head, made of thick polymer plates woven with "
"metallic fibers.  This version incorporates a tight fitting Nomex layer for "
"some protection against heat.  Designed to clip to some kind of attachment "
"point, its interior reads \"ATTACH TO MODULAR HEADGEAR\"."
msgstr ""
"3Dプリントで作られた、金属繊維を編みこんだ分厚いポリマープレート製の頭部装甲です。高温から頭部を守るため、密着性の高いノーメックス生地が貼り付けてあります。内側には「モジュラーディフェンスシステム取付部」と表記してあり、何かと接続できそうな構造になっています。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/robofac_armor.json
msgid "Hub 01 ballistic helmet"
msgid_plural "Hub 01 ballistic helmets"
msgstr[0] "ハブ01防弾ヘルメット"

#. ~ Description of "Hub 01 ballistic helmet"
#: data/json/items/armor/robofac_armor.json
msgid ""
"3D printed armor for the head, made of thick polymer plates woven with "
"metallic fibers.  This one has extra Kevlar and steel layering, to provide "
"superior protection against small arms.  Designed to clip to some kind of "
"attachment point, its interior reads \"ATTACH TO MODULAR HEADGEAR\"."
msgstr ""
"3Dプリントで作られた、金属繊維を編みこんだ分厚いポリマープレート製の頭部装甲です。分厚いケブラーやスチールの層が追加されており、小火器に対して優れた防御力を発揮します。内側には「モジュラーディフェンスシステム取付部」と表記してあり、何かと接続できそうな構造になっています。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/robofac_armor.json
msgid "Hub 01 soldier helmet"
msgid_plural "Hub 01 soldier helmets"
msgstr[0] "ハブ01戦闘用ヘルメット"

#. ~ Description of "Hub 01 soldier helmet"
#: data/json/items/armor/robofac_armor.json
msgid ""
"3D printed armor for the head, sporting a professional finish and stellar "
"ergonomics.  Composed of a dense metal shell sandwiched between layers of "
"composite-grade aramid fabric, it provides excellent protection, ensuring "
"you'll keep your head against whatever the cataclysm throws at you.  "
"Designed to clip to some kind of attachment point, its interior reads "
"\"ATTACH TO MODULAR HEADGEAR\"."
msgstr ""
"3Dプリントされたヘルメットです。人間工学に基づいた、非常に洗練されたデザインが特徴的です。高密度の金属コアを高品質のアラミド繊維で覆ったプレートを用いており、どんな危険な状況下でも頭部を強力に保護します。内側には「モジュラーディフェンスシステム取付部」と表記してあり、何かと接続できそうな構造になっています。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/scarfs.json
msgid "knit cowl"
msgid_plural "knit cowls"
msgstr[0] "ニット頭巾"

#. ~ Description of "knit cowl"
#: data/json/items/armor/scarfs.json
msgid ""
"A snuggly woolen cowl.  It's one of those stylish and bulky cowls you see in"
" fashion magazines."
msgstr "快適な羊毛の頭巾です。この分厚い頭巾はファッション雑誌にも載っていたもののようです。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/scarfs.json
msgid "headscarf"
msgid_plural "headscarfs"
msgstr[0] "ヘッドスカーフ"

#. ~ Description of "headscarf"
#: data/json/items/armor/scarfs.json
msgid "A loose cloth worn over the head and around the neck."
msgstr "頭や首周りにゆったりと巻いて着用する布です。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/scarfs.json
msgid "keffiyeh"
msgid_plural "keffiyehs"
msgstr[0] "クーフィーヤ"

#. ~ Description of "keffiyeh"
#: data/json/items/armor/scarfs.json
msgid ""
"A type of headdress traditionally used in the Middle East.  It can be used "
"in different ways to protect the head and mouth from the elements."
msgstr "中東で着用される伝統的な頭部衣装の一種です。頭部や口を外部から守るための色々な付け方があります。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/scarfs.json
msgid "simple patchwork scarf"
msgid_plural "simple patchwork scarves"
msgstr[0] "パッチワークマフラー"

#. ~ Description of "simple patchwork scarf"
#: data/json/items/armor/scarfs.json
msgid ""
"A simple and light cloth scarf, worn over the mouth for warmth.  Use it to "
"loosen it if you get too warm."
msgstr "口元を覆って保温する、シンプルで軽い布のマフラーです。暑すぎると感じたら、使用して緩めましょう。"

