#. ~ Description of "grass keffiyeh"
#: data/json/items/armor/scarfs.json
msgid ""
"A grass sheet with cords to wear it like a Middle Eastern headdress.  It's a"
" bit itchy, but can keep your head and mouth a bit warmer if there's nothing"
" in the way."
msgstr ""
"中東の頭部衣装のように着用できる、草で編んだ生地に紐を付けた装束です。少々痒みはありますが、他に何もないのなら頭や口元の寒さを多少防げます。"

