msgid_plural "light survivor cargo pants"
msgstr[0] "ライトサバイバーカーゴパンツ"

#. ~ Description of "light survivor cargo pants"
#: data/json/items/armor/bespoke_armor/custom_legs.json
msgid ""
"Lightweight, Kevlar armored cargo pants designed to hold as much as "
"possible.  Strong and mostly waterproof."
msgstr "できるだけたくさん収納できるように作られた、ケブラー装甲の頑丈な軽量カーゴパンツです。ほぼ完全防水です。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/bespoke_armor/custom_legs.json
msgid "survivor cargo pants"
msgid_plural "survivor cargo pants"
msgstr[0] "サバイバーカーゴパンツ"

#. ~ Description of "survivor cargo pants"
#: data/json/items/armor/bespoke_armor/custom_legs.json
msgid ""
"A pair of Kevlar armored pants covered with pouches and pockets.  Custom-"
"built to be durable, comfortable, and easy to wear."
msgstr "ケブラー装甲を施し小物袋やポケットを取り付けた特製のズボンです。頑丈で着心地が良く、着るのも簡単です。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/bespoke_armor/custom_legs.json
msgid "mercenary pants"
msgid_plural "mercenary pants"
msgstr[0] "マーセナリーパンツ"

#. ~ Description of "mercenary pants"
#: data/json/items/armor/bespoke_armor/custom_legs.json
msgid ""
"A sturdy pair of pants fit for a soldier of fortune.  Made from work pants "
"padded with Kevlar panels.  It gives good protection and decent storage, but"
" the added thickness makes it uncomfortable to wear any armor over it."
msgstr ""
"作業用パンツをケブラー板で補強した、傭兵にふさわしい丈夫なパンツです。防御力が高く収納スペースも十分ありますが、生地が厚いため、防具を重ね着すると非常に窮屈に感じます。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/bespoke_armor/custom_overcoats.json
