#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/book/cooking.json
msgid "family cookbook"
msgid_plural "family cookbooks"
msgstr[0] "本(学習/家庭のレシピ)"

#. ~ Description of "family cookbook"
#: data/json/items/book/cooking.json
msgid ""
"A big binder full of somebody's family recipes.  The well-turned pages and "
"creased corners speak volumes of the culinary knowledge contained within.  "
"You could probably learn a lot about cooking from studying this domestic "
"artifact."
msgstr ""
"どこかの家の自家製レシピを満載した大きなバインダーです。その何度も捲られたページや皺のよった角が、込められた料理知識の厚みを物語っています。この家庭的な一大著作からは料理に関する多くの知識を得られるでしょう。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/book/cooking.json
msgid "Bon Appetit"
msgid_plural "issues of Bon Appetit"
msgstr[0] "本(学習/ボナペティ)"

#. ~ Description of "Bon Appetit"
#: data/json/items/book/cooking.json
msgid ""
"Exciting recipes and restaurant reviews.  Full of handy tips about cooking."
msgstr "美味しそうなレシピやレストランのレビューが書かれた本です。料理の有益なヒントがたくさん載っています。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/book/cooking.json
msgid "Glamopolitan"
msgid_plural "issues of Glamopolitan"
msgstr[0] "本(学習/グラモポリタン)"

#. ~ Description of "Glamopolitan"
#: data/json/items/book/cooking.json
msgid ""
"A full-size glossy women's magazine.  There are a few unoriginal recipes and"
" some simple cooking tips somewhere in between the fashion photos and the "
"sex advice columns."
msgstr "規格判のお洒落な女性誌です。ファッション写真やセックス講座の記事に紛れて、独創性に欠ける料理のレシピやちょっとしたコツが載っています。"

#. ~ Item name
#. ~ That would translate out to The Scottish Book of Cookery, or The Scottish
#. Cookbook.
#: data/json/items/book/cooking.json
msgid "Ye Scots Beuk o Cuikery"
msgid_plural "copies of Ye Scots Beuk o Cuikery"
msgstr[0] "本(学習/スコットランドの郷土料理)"

#. ~ Description of "Ye Scots Beuk o Cuikery"
#: data/json/items/book/cooking.json
msgid ""
"A semi-translated Gaelic cookbook from sixteenth century Scotland.  While a "
"bit difficult to read, as there are a disquieting number of illustrations of"
" people stabbing each other mixed with rants about 'True Scotsmen', it "
"provides insights into medieval Scottish cuisine and culture."
msgstr ""
"16世紀にゲール語で書かれたスコットランドの料理書の一部を翻訳したものです。血みどろの殺し合いをする「真のスコットランド人」のイラストがレシピと共に掲載されているため少々読み辛いですが、中世スコットランドの料理と文化について考察できそうです。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/book/cooking.json
msgid "The Vinegar Maker's Handbook"
msgid_plural "copies of Vinegar Maker's Handbook"
msgstr[0] "本(学習/自家製酢の手引き)"

#. ~ Description of "The Vinegar Maker's Handbook"
#: data/json/items/book/cooking.json
msgid ""
"This book describes in detail all the ways that one can make vinegar.  You "
"would have thought that there wasn't much to making vinegar, but the girth "
"of this book tells you otherwise."
msgstr "酢の作り方が詳しく書かれた本です。本の帯には、酢を自作する機会はまず無いと思うかもしれないがそんな事はない、と言った文章が書かれています。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/book/cooking.json
msgid "Drink the Harvest"
msgid_plural "copies of Drink the Harvest"
msgstr[0] "本(学習/自然の恵みを飲もう)"

#. ~ Description of "Drink the Harvest"
#: data/json/items/book/cooking.json
msgid ""
"Canning foods doesn't have to stop with jam and pickles.  This book provides"
" a plethora of juices that can be preserved."
msgstr "保存食はジャムや酢漬けだけではありません。この本には、保存がきくジュースのレシピがたくさん載っています。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/book/cooking.json
msgid "Offal Holiday Cooking"
msgid_plural "copies of Offal Holiday Cooking"
msgstr[0] "本(学習/特別な日の内臓料理)"

#. ~ Description of "Offal Holiday Cooking"
#: data/json/items/book/cooking.json
msgid ""
"Offal Holiday Cooking, by Evelyn Turncoat, is a book of holiday recipes that"
" utilize organ meats from various animals.  For the true nose-to-tail cook."
msgstr ""
"イブリン・ターンコートが著した、様々な動物の内臓を使った特別な日に食べる料理のレシピ集です。真の意味で鼻先から尻尾まで食べ尽くしたい人向けの本です。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/book/cooking.json
msgid "Things to Do with Milk"
msgid_plural "copies of Things to Do with Milk"
msgstr[0] "本(学習/牛乳の活用法)"

#. ~ Description of "Things to Do with Milk"
#: data/json/items/book/cooking.json
msgid ""
"Whatever you want to do with milk, you will probably find it in this book."
msgstr "牛乳を使ってできることは、大抵がこの本に書かれています。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/book/cooking.json
msgid "Liver-Licious Recipes Your Kids Will Love"
msgid_plural "copies of Liver-Licious Recipes"
msgstr[0] "本(学習/子供が喜ぶ肝臓料理)"

#. ~ Description of "Liver-Licious Recipes Your Kids Will Love"
#: data/json/items/book/cooking.json
msgid ""
"This cookbook is written by liver enthusiast Tamsyn Beckerleg.  Inside "
"you'll find a great deal of anecdotes about the near-certain ruination of "
"children who refuse to eat their liver."
msgstr ""
"肝臓料理愛好家、タムシン・ベッケルレグの料理本です。肝臓を食べることを拒否した子供はほぼ確実に破滅する、という内容の逸話が大量に記されています。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/book/cooking.json
msgid "Blood for the Greater Good"
msgid_plural "copies of Blood for the Greater Good"
msgstr[0] "本(学習/健康にいい血液料理)"

#. ~ Description of "Blood for the Greater Good"
#: data/json/items/book/cooking.json
msgid ""
"A recipe book compiled by blood-as-food advocate Alžbeta Bátoriová.  The "
"consumption of blood is a taboo among members of many Abrahamic religions, "
"but they aren't going to stop you now.  This book has bonus material for "
"those with particular tastes."
msgstr ""
"血を食す健康法を提唱しているアルズベタ・バトリオヴァ女史が編纂したレシピ集です。血液を食用とすることは多くのアブラハム系宗教においてタブーとされていますが、それを指摘する者はもう誰も残っていません。食材にこだわりたい人にとっては嬉しい読み物です。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/book/cooking.json
msgid "Dainty Dishes Fit for a King"
msgid_plural "copies of Dainty Dishes"
msgstr[0] "本(学習/王侯のための贅沢料理)"

#. ~ Description of "Dainty Dishes Fit for a King"
#: data/json/items/book/cooking.json
msgid ""
"This cookbook contains many fanciful recipes.  Some of them are even worth "
"the trouble to actually prepare.  Lovely pen and ink illustrations of "
"overweight knights and gluttonous monks line the pages."
msgstr ""
"風変わりなレシピがたくさん載っている料理本ですが、準備の大変さに見合った価値がある料理もあります。いくつかのページには、太っちょの騎士と食いしん坊の修道士のイラストがインクで描かれています。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/book/cooking.json
msgid "Eat Your Way to a Fit Physique"
msgid_plural "copies of Eat Your Way"
msgstr[0] "本(学習/食べて痩せよう)"

#. ~ Description of "Eat Your Way to a Fit Physique"
#: data/json/items/book/cooking.json
msgid ""
"This self-help book, by \"acclaimed nutrition and health guru Amar de "
"Freitas,\" is as dubious as its title.  Worse, it is boring.  It does, "
"however, contain a few basic cooking instructions."
msgstr ""
"「栄養と健康の第一人者として評価の高いアマル・デ・フレイタス」なる人物が著した、タイトルと同じくらい効果が疑わしい自己啓発本です。更に悪いことに、内容が退屈です。基本的な調理の手順に関する一部の記述は役に立つかもしれません。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/book/cooking.json
msgid "Food Fashions for Young Moderns"
msgid_plural "copies of Food Fashions"
msgstr[0] "本(学習/流行の若者向け料理)"

#. ~ Description of "Food Fashions for Young Moderns"
#: data/json/items/book/cooking.json
msgid ""
"A cookbook professing itself to be for those seeking \"daring and "
"sophisticated flavors.\"  The book exhorts the reader to defy convention and"
" break the rules, and then presents a number of useful rules and conventions"
" for preparing food."
msgstr ""
"「洗練された大胆な味」を求めている人向けの料理本です。既存の慣習に逆らいルールを破るよう読者に勧めていますが、下ごしらえのための有用な決まり事や手順がたくさん載っています。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/book/cooking.json
msgid "Winemaking for Beginners"
msgid_plural "copies of Winemaking for Beginners"
msgstr[0] "本(学習/ワイン醸造入門)"

#. ~ Description of "Winemaking for Beginners"
#: data/json/items/book/cooking.json
msgid ""
"Winemaking is an art form.  This book teaches you how to crayon within the "
"lines."
msgstr "ワイン造りは芸術です。この本には典型的なワイン醸造の手順が書かれています。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/book/cooking.json
msgid "You Can Can at Home"
msgid_plural "copies of You Can Can at Home"
msgstr[0] "本(学習/自宅で作れる保存食)"

#. ~ Description of "You Can Can at Home"
#: data/json/items/book/cooking.json
msgid ""
"This entry-level guide to home canning talks about the importance of acidity"
" and food contents in preservation, and how to avoid contaminants in your "
"canning batches."
msgstr ""
"自宅で保存食を作る手順が書かれた入門ガイドです。保存液の酸性度と食品の重要な関係、大量保存する際に汚染物質混入を防ぐ方法などが解説されています。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/book/cooking.json
msgid "Can Sealer Instructions"
msgid_plural "copies of Can Sealer Instructions"
msgstr[0] "本(学習/封缶機取扱説明書)"

#. ~ Description of "Can Sealer Instructions"
#: data/json/items/book/cooking.json
msgid ""
"This dry guide to a home-use tin can sealer goes into clear detail on "
"everything you can seal with the device and how to do it safely, and "
"includes some basic recipes."
msgstr ""
"家庭用ブリキ缶封缶機について書かれた、情味に乏しい取扱説明書です。封缶機で密閉できるもの、安全な密閉の手順などが詳しく書かれており、基本的な料理のレシピもいくつか載っています。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/book/cooking.json
msgid "Vacuum Sealer Instructions"
msgid_plural "copies of Vacuum Sealer Instructions"
msgstr[0] "本(学習/真空包装機取扱説明書)"

#. ~ Description of "Vacuum Sealer Instructions"
#: data/json/items/book/cooking.json
msgid ""
"This dry guide to a home-use vacuum sealer goes into clear detail on "
"everything you can seal with the device and how to do it safely, and "
"includes some basic recipes."
msgstr ""
"家庭用真空包装機について書かれた面白くもない説明書です。真空包装機を使ってできること、安全な取り扱い方、基本的なレシピなどが分かりやすく説明されています。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/book/cooking.json
msgid "The Baker's Companion"
msgid_plural "copies of The Baker's Companion"
msgstr[0] "本(学習/パン職人の手引き書)"

#. ~ Description of "The Baker's Companion"
#: data/json/items/book/cooking.json
msgid ""
"This book promises to teach you the ways of baking, from cakes to souffles."
msgstr "ケーキからスフレまで、様々なベーキングの手法をお教えしましょう。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/book/cooking.json
msgid "Fermenting Culture"
msgid_plural "copies of Fermenting Culture"
msgstr[0] "本(学習/発酵の文化)"

#. ~ Description of "Fermenting Culture"
#: data/json/items/book/cooking.json
msgid ""
"Fermenting as a cooking practice only recently came back into vogue before "
"the Cataclysm.  Here is a book with dozens of recipes, many of which you are"
" unlikely to ever see the ingredients for again."
msgstr ""
"料理の手法としての発酵は、大変動以前に再び流行し始めていました。この本には何十種類ものレシピが掲載されており、その中にはもう二度とお目にかかれそうにない食材もたくさんあります。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/book/cooking.json
msgid "Out of the Holler and into the Home: A guide to home distillation"
msgid_plural "copies of Out of the Holler"
msgstr[0] "本(学習/渓から家へ: 家庭蒸留ガイド)"

#. ~ Description of "Out of the Holler and into the Home: A guide to home
#. distillation"
#: data/json/items/book/cooking.json
msgid ""
"A book describing the history of at-home distillation.  Each chapter is "
"named after a different type of liquor, and contains a complete recipe for "
"its namesake."
msgstr "自家醸造の歴史を記した本です。一章ごとに特定の種類の酒について解説しており、詳細な作り方も掲載されています。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/book/cooking.json
msgid "Sweets for your Sweet Child"
msgid_plural "copies of Sweets for Sweet"
msgstr[0] "本(学習/よい子のためのよいお菓子)"

#. ~ Description of "Sweets for your Sweet Child"
#: data/json/items/book/cooking.json
msgid ""
"Sweets for your Sweet Child is a best-selling cookbook marketed to the "
"parents of young children.  Every recipe uses oversized text, easy words and"
" diagram instructions for children learning to cook with their parents."
msgstr ""
"『よい子のためのよいお菓子』は、小さな子を持つ保護者に大人気の料理本です。どのレシピも、親子で一緒に調理法を学べるように、非常に大きな文字と平易な言葉、図による説明を活用しています。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/book/cooking.json
msgid "Tasting India"
msgid_plural "copies of Tasting India"
msgstr[0] "本(学習/インドを食す)"

#. ~ Description of "Tasting India"
#: data/json/items/book/cooking.json
msgid ""
"A thick hardcover book as much about Indian culture as it is a cookbook, "
"clearly written with adoration."
msgstr ""
"インド料理のレシピを記したハードカバー本です。インドの文化についての解説にもレシピと同程度のページ数が割かれており、著者のインドに対する憧れが見て取れます。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/book/cooking.json
msgid "The Sioux Chef"
msgid_plural "copies of The Sioux Chef"
msgstr[0] "本(学習/スー族のシェフ)"

#. ~ Description of "The Sioux Chef"
#: data/json/items/book/cooking.json
msgid ""
"A thick hardcover book about the history and future of Native American "
"cuisine.  As much recipe collection as manifesto."
msgstr "ネイティブアメリカン料理の歴史と未来について書かれた、レシピ集でありながら宣言書としての側面ももつ分厚いハードカバー本です。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/book/cooking.json
msgid "The Turkish Cookbook"
msgid_plural "copies of The Turkish Cookbook"
msgstr[0] "本(学習/トルコ料理レシピ集)"

#. ~ Description of "The Turkish Cookbook"
#: data/json/items/book/cooking.json
msgid "The definitive cookbook of hearty, healthy Turkish cuisine."
msgstr "ボリュームたっぷりでヘルシーなトルコ料理のレシピを記した決定版です。"

#. ~ Item name
#. ~ Variant name of item "All About Swords"
#: data/json/items/book/cutting.json
msgid "All About Swords"
msgid_plural "issues of All About Swords"
msgstr[0] "本(学習/剣の全て)"

#. ~ Description of "All About Swords"
#. ~ Description of variant "All About Swords" of item "All About Swords"
#: data/json/items/book/cutting.json
msgid ""
"An interesting magazine that contains information about swords and sword "
"fighting techniques from all across the world."
msgstr "剣を使った戦闘技術に関する情報を世界中から集めた、興味深い雑誌です。"

#. ~ Variant name of item "All About Swords"
#: data/json/items/book/cutting.json
msgid "Swordfighting, for Writers, Game Designers, and Martial Artists"
msgid_plural ""
"copies of Swordfighting, for Writers, Game Designers, and Martial Artists"
msgstr[0] "本(学習/作家、ゲームデザイナー、武術家のための剣術)"

#. ~ Description of variant "Swordfighting, for Writers, Game Designers, and
#. Martial Artists" of item "All About Swords"
#: data/json/items/book/cutting.json
msgid ""
"Answers for questions you may have if you've never held a sword in your "
"hands."
msgstr "今まで剣を手にしたことのない人が抱く疑問に答えてくれる書物です。"

#. ~ Variant name of item "All About Swords"
#: data/json/items/book/cutting.json
msgid "The Beginner's Guide to the Long Sword"
msgid_plural "copies of The Beginner's Guide to the Long Sword"
msgstr[0] "本(学習/ロングソード入門)"

#. ~ Description of variant "The Beginner's Guide to the Long Sword" of item
#. "All About Swords"
#: data/json/items/book/cutting.json
msgid ""
"Based on different Europeans' martial arts, this book describes the main "
"principles of swordsmanship."
msgstr "ヨーロッパの様々な戦闘スタイルに基づいて、剣術の大原則について解説しています。"

#. ~ Variant name of item "All About Swords"
#: data/json/items/book/cutting.json
msgid "Basics Of Stage Combat"
msgid_plural "copies of Basics Of Stage Combat"
msgstr[0] "本(学習/殺陣の基本)"

#. ~ Description of variant "Basics Of Stage Combat" of item "All About
#. Swords"
#: data/json/items/book/cutting.json
msgid ""
"Foundation of using single handed sword on stage and on screen, with "
"different tricks how to make a good show of it."
msgstr "舞台や映画で片手剣を使う際の基礎知識や、様々なトリック撮影の方法を紹介している書籍です。"

#. ~ Variant name of item "All About Swords"
#: data/json/items/book/cutting.json
msgid "Medieval Combat in Colour"
msgid_plural "copies of Medieval Combat in Colour"
msgstr[0] "本(学習/カラーで見る中世剣術)"

#. ~ Description of variant "Medieval Combat in Colour" of item "All About
#. Swords"
#: data/json/items/book/cutting.json
msgid ""
"An ancient fencing manual with updated illustrations of techniques.  "
"Sometimes it just looks silly, describing how to fight if you have sword in "
"one hand and a spear in another."
msgstr ""
"現代的なイラストで技の数々を解説している、古風なフェンシングについての教本です。片手に剣、片手に槍を装備しているときの戦い方など、冗談のような剣術も載っています"

#. ~ Item name
#. ~ Variant name of item "knife fighter's notes"
#: data/json/items/book/cutting.json
msgid "knife fighter's notes"
msgid_plural "collections of knife fighter's notes"
msgstr[0] "本(学習/短剣使いの覚書)"

#. ~ Description of "knife fighter's notes"
#. ~ Description of variant "knife fighter's notes" of item "knife fighter's
#. notes"
#: data/json/items/book/cutting.json
msgid ""
"It seems to be a guide to edged weapon combat, poorly photocopied and "
"released on spiral-bound paper.  Still, there are lots of useful tips for "
"beginners."
msgstr "斬撃武器での戦闘に関するガイドブックです。粗悪なコピー用紙をリングで綴じただけの代物ですが、初心者に役立つヒントがたくさん載っています。"

#. ~ Variant name of item "knife fighter's notes"
#: data/json/items/book/cutting.json
msgid "The Medieval Dagger"
msgid_plural "copies of The Medieval Dagger"
msgstr[0] "本(学習/中世の短剣)"

#. ~ Description of variant "The Medieval Dagger" of item "knife fighter's
#. notes"
#: data/json/items/book/cutting.json
msgid ""
"Principles and guides to Italian dagger combat, with useful drills and "
"advice for novices."
msgstr "イタリアの短剣術の原則と指針、初心者に役立つ訓練法やコツなどが載っています。"

#. ~ Variant name of item "knife fighter's notes"
#: data/json/items/book/cutting.json
msgid "Knife Fighting Techniques for the Street"
msgid_plural "copies of Knife Fighting Techniques for the Street"
msgstr[0] "本(学習/ストリートで使えるナイフ戦闘術)"

#. ~ Description of variant "Knife Fighting Techniques for the Street" of item
#. "knife fighter's notes"
#: data/json/items/book/cutting.json
msgid ""
"A small book that contain pretty simple and easy to follow movements to use "
"against your enemy or enemies."
msgstr "単純かつ簡単な動作だけで一人、もしくは複数人の敵に対抗する方法を記した短い本です。"

#. ~ Variant name of item "knife fighter's notes"
#: data/json/items/book/cutting.json
msgid "Knife Offense"
msgid_plural "copies of Knife Offense"
msgstr[0] "本(学習/ナイフ戦闘術)"

#. ~ Description of variant "Knife Offense" of item "knife fighter's notes"
#: data/json/items/book/cutting.json
msgid ""
"Complete methodology for using knives in a real fight, with tips and tricks."
msgstr "実戦でナイフを扱うための方法論を、細かいコツや秘訣なども含め網羅している書籍です。"

#. ~ Variant name of item "knife fighter's notes"
#: data/json/items/book/cutting.json
msgid "Blade Combatives"
msgid_plural "copies of Blade Combatives"
msgstr[0] "本(学習/ブレードコンバット)"

#. ~ Description of variant "Blade Combatives" of item "knife fighter's notes"
#: data/json/items/book/cutting.json
msgid ""
"This book combines some different blade methodologies from European, Asian, "
"and American martial arts into a unique style."
msgstr "ヨーロッパ、アジア、アメリカの様々なナイフ術を組み合わせた、独自の戦闘スタイルについて解説しています。"

#. ~ Variant name of item "knife fighter's notes"
#: data/json/items/book/cutting.json
msgid "Knife Anatomy"
msgid_plural "copies of Knife Anatomy"
msgstr[0] "本(学習/大解剖ナイフ術)"

#. ~ Description of variant "Knife Anatomy" of item "knife fighter's notes"
#: data/json/items/book/cutting.json
msgid ""
"Lots of knife training methods and techniques for experienced martial "
"artists."
msgstr "経験豊富な武道家向けの、ナイフを使った様々な戦闘訓練や技を解説している書籍です。"

#. ~ Item name
#. ~ Variant name of item "USMC Sword Manual Procedure"
#: data/json/items/book/cutting.json
msgid "USMC Sword Manual Procedure"
msgid_plural "copies of USMC Sword Manual Procedure"
msgstr[0] "本(学習/海兵隊下士官刀マニュアル)"

#. ~ Description of "USMC Sword Manual Procedure"
#: data/json/items/book/cutting.json
msgid "A text on stationary sword drills in US Marine Corps."
msgstr "アメリカ軍海兵隊が採用している軍刀の訓練マニュアルです。"

#. ~ Description of variant "USMC Sword Manual Procedure" of item "USMC Sword
#. Manual Procedure"
#: data/json/items/book/cutting.json
msgid ""
"A text on stationary sword drills in US Marine Corps.  Contains lots of "
"information about how to draw and pose with a sword, but nothing about using"
" it."
msgstr ""
"アメリカ軍海兵隊の儀礼用軍刀の訓練マニュアルです。剣の抜き方、構え方などの情報が大量に載っていますが、剣を使った戦い方については何も書いてありません。"

#. ~ Variant name of item "USMC Sword Manual Procedure"
#: data/json/items/book/cutting.json
msgid "Five Rings Illustrated"
msgid_plural "copies of Five Rings Illustrated"
msgstr[0] "本(学習/図解五輪書)"

#. ~ Description of variant "Five Rings Illustrated" of item "USMC Sword
#. Manual Procedure"
#: data/json/items/book/cutting.json
msgid ""
"An old Japanese treatise about swordsmanship, translated and polished, with "
"additional illustrations and detailed explanations."
msgstr "日本の剣術に関する古い書物を翻訳、改削し、更に図と詳細な解説を加えた書籍です。"

#. ~ Variant name of item "USMC Sword Manual Procedure"
#: data/json/items/book/cutting.json
msgid "Records of the Medieval Sword"
msgid_plural "copies of Records of the Medieval Sword"
msgstr[0] "本(学習/中世剣術録)"

#. ~ Description of variant "Records of the Medieval Sword" of item "USMC
#. Sword Manual Procedure"
#: data/json/items/book/cutting.json
msgid ""
"Original research about straight two-edged knightly swords of the European "
"middle ages."
msgstr "中世ヨーロッパで騎士が扱っていた両刃直剣に関する独自研究をまとめた書籍です。"

#. ~ Variant name of item "USMC Sword Manual Procedure"
#: data/json/items/book/cutting.json
msgid "The Unfettered Mind"
msgid_plural "copies of The Unfettered Mind"
msgstr[0] "本(学習/不動智神妙録)"

#. ~ Description of variant "The Unfettered Mind" of item "USMC Sword Manual
#. Procedure"
#: data/json/items/book/cutting.json
msgid ""
"An ancient Japanese book of advice about building the proper skills and mind"
" for sword fighting.  Talks too much about Zen, but the sword techniques are"
" worth noting."
msgstr "剣術に必要な技能や心構えを説いた日本古来の書物です。禅についての話が大半を占めていますが、紹介されている剣技は注目に値します。"

#. ~ Variant name of item "USMC Sword Manual Procedure"
#: data/json/items/book/cutting.json
msgid "The Art of Longsword Fighting"
msgid_plural "copies of The Art of Longsword Fighting"
msgstr[0] "本(学習/ロングソード戦闘術)"

#. ~ Description of variant "The Art of Longsword Fighting" of item "USMC
#. Sword Manual Procedure"
#: data/json/items/book/cutting.json
msgid ""
"A grounded work about the history of swordsmanship, ways to teach it, and "
"how to enhance students' experience."
msgstr "剣術の歴史、指導法、生徒に経験を積ませる方法について解説している、地に足のついた書籍です。"

#. ~ Variant name of item "USMC Sword Manual Procedure"
#: data/json/items/book/cutting.json
msgid "Art of Sword Combat"
msgid_plural "copies of Art of Sword Combat"
msgstr[0] "本(学習/剣の戦闘技術)"

#. ~ Description of variant "Art of Sword Combat" of item "USMC Sword Manual
#. Procedure"
#: data/json/items/book/cutting.json
msgid ""
"Translation of an old German treatise about using a few different cutting "
"weapons in a real fight, with modern comments and clarification."
msgstr "実戦で数種類の斬撃武器を使い分けるというドイツの古い論説を翻訳し、意見や解説を加えた書籍です。"

#. ~ Item name
#. ~ Variant name of item "Dance Dance Dance!"
#: data/json/items/book/dodge.json
msgid "Dance Dance Dance!"
msgid_plural "issues of Dance Dance Dance!"
msgstr[0] "本(学習/ダンスダンスダンス！)"

#. ~ Description of "Dance Dance Dance!"
#. ~ Description of variant "Dance Dance Dance!" of item "Dance Dance Dance!"
#: data/json/items/book/dodge.json
msgid "Learn the moves of the trendiest dances right now."
msgstr "流行しているダンスの踊り方を今すぐに学べる本です。"

#. ~ Variant name of item "Dance Dance Dance!"
#: data/json/items/book/dodge.json
msgid "How Animals Move"
msgid_plural "copies of How Animals Move"
msgstr[0] "本(学習/動物の動き)"

#. ~ Description of variant "How Animals Move" of item "Dance Dance Dance!"
#: data/json/items/book/dodge.json
msgid ""
"In this book, zoologist Sir James Gray explores the development of different"
" kinds of animal movement, from swimming to crawling to jumping, and then "
"examines the mechanics of the variety of possible movements made by "
"different creatures, illustrated with both sketches and photographs."
msgstr ""
"動物学者のジェームズ・グレイ卿が動物の動作のメカニズムをスケッチと写真から考察し、泳ぐ、這う、跳ぶなど動物に固有の様々な動作の発達について探究する書籍です。"

#. ~ Variant name of item "Dance Dance Dance!"
#: data/json/items/book/dodge.json
msgid "The Art of Movement"
msgid_plural "copies of The Art of Movement"
msgstr[0] "本(学習/運動芸術)"

#. ~ Description of variant "The Art of Movement" of item "Dance Dance Dance!"
#: data/json/items/book/dodge.json
msgid ""
"A collection of photos of different dance movements of the world.  The "
"images are inspiring, and the movements of the dancers are deep."
msgstr "世界の様々なダンスの動きを集めた写真集です。ダンサーの動きはどれも奥が深く、見ていると感動を覚えます。"

#. ~ Variant name of item "Dance Dance Dance!"
#: data/json/items/book/dodge.json
msgid "Self-Defense for Gentlemen and Ladies"
msgid_plural "copies of Self-Defense for Gentlemen and Ladies"
msgstr[0] "本(学習/紳士淑女の護身術)"

#. ~ Description of variant "Self-Defense for Gentlemen and Ladies" of item
#. "Dance Dance Dance!"
#: data/json/items/book/dodge.json
msgid "An old treatise about self defense, with style."
msgstr "洗練された護身術について論じた古い専門書です。"

#. ~ Variant name of item "Dance Dance Dance!"
#: data/json/items/book/dodge.json
msgid "Self-Defence for Non-Experts: A Book for People Who Can't Fight"
msgid_plural ""
"copies of Self-Defence for Non-Experts: A Book for People Who Can't Fight"
msgstr[0] "本(学習/アマチュア向け護身術: 戦えない人々のために)"

#. ~ Description of variant "Self-Defence for Non-Experts: A Book for People
#. Who Can't Fight" of item "Dance Dance Dance!"
#: data/json/items/book/dodge.json
msgid ""
"A small guide on self defense for an untrained person - mostly simple tricks"
" and advice like having a knife and how to threaten an enemy into backing "
"down, but contains some more advanced and detailed descriptions of movement "
"techniques."
msgstr ""
"専門の訓練を受けていない人向けの、護身術に関する短いガイドブックです。ナイフの構え方や敵を脅して退散させる方法など、簡単なコツやアドバイスが大半ですが、戦闘時の動作についてのより高度で詳細な解説も載っています。"

#. ~ Item name
#. ~ Variant name of item "The Book of Dances"
#: data/json/items/book/dodge.json
msgid "The Book of Dances"
msgid_plural "copies of The Book of Dances"
msgstr[0] "本(学習/ダンス教本)"

#. ~ Description of "The Book of Dances"
#. ~ Description of variant "The Book of Dances" of item "The Book of Dances"
#: data/json/items/book/dodge.json
msgid ""
"This massive antique book documents dances from all around the world in "
"great detail.  A perceptive reader could learn a lot about defensive "
"footwork from some of the war dances."
msgstr "この分厚い年代物の本は世界中のダンスについて詳細に解説しています。聡明な読者なら、いくさ踊りから様々な防御態勢を学び取れるでしょう。"

#. ~ Variant name of item "The Book of Dances"
#: data/json/items/book/dodge.json
msgid "The Complete Book about Dodgeball"
msgid_plural "copies of The Complete Book about Dodgeball"
msgstr[0] "本(学習/ドッジボール全書)"

#. ~ Description of variant "The Complete Book about Dodgeball" of item "The
#. Book of Dances"
#: data/json/items/book/dodge.json
msgid ""
"A small book from a Physical Education and Health teacher about the simple "
"game of dodgeball, its rules and variations, tricks, and what it can teach "
"students.  Sadly, the book contains surprisingly poor grammar, and the "
"informal conversational tone makes it difficult to follow at times."
msgstr ""
"ドッジボールというシンプルな競技のルールとバリエーション、コツ、生徒への指導の指針について保健体育教師が記した、短い書籍です。嘆かわしいことに、驚くほど稚拙な文章やくだけた会話調の解説が紛れ込んでいるため、途中で読むのを止めたくなるかもしれません。"

#. ~ Variant name of item "The Book of Dances"
#: data/json/items/book/dodge.json
msgid "When Seconds Count"
msgid_plural "copies of When Seconds Count"
msgstr[0] "本(学習/一刻を争う)"

#. ~ Description of variant "When Seconds Count" of item "The Book of Dances"
#: data/json/items/book/dodge.json
msgid ""
"A comprehensive guide on what to do in dangerous situations on the street "
"and beyond - ways to improve your awareness skills, de-escalate the "
"situation or, if it is not possible, defend yourself and your family in "
"every possible manner, violent or not."
msgstr ""
"街中などで危険な状況に陥ったときに取るべき行動、危機察知能力を高める方法、状況を打開する方法、それらが不可能な状況で暴力を含めたあらゆる手段を使って自分や家族を守る方法について、包括的に解説している書籍です。"

#. ~ Variant name of item "The Book of Dances"
#: data/json/items/book/dodge.json
msgid "Born to Walk"
msgid_plural "copies of Born to Walk"
msgstr[0] "本(学習/天性の歩行者)"

#. ~ Description of variant "Born to Walk" of item "The Book of Dances"
#: data/json/items/book/dodge.json
msgid ""
"This book explores the mechanics, mysteries, and methods of upright walking "
"- why, how, and when.  Includes a big chapter on how different martial arts "
"exploit this mode of movement."
msgstr ""
"直立歩行の仕組みや謎、方法を、何故、どうやって、いつから、といった観点で探究する書籍です。様々な武術が直立歩行をどのように活用しているかというテーマで詳しく考察している章もあります。"

#. ~ Item name
#. ~ Variant name of item "Break a Leg!"
#: data/json/items/book/dodge.json
msgid "Break a Leg!"
msgid_plural "copies of Break a Leg!"
msgstr[0] "本(学習/晴れ舞台！)"

#. ~ Description of "Break a Leg!"
#: data/json/items/book/dodge.json
msgid "The Kids' Guide to Acting and Stagecraft."
msgstr "演技と作劇法に関する子供向けの入門書です。"

#. ~ Description of variant "Break a Leg!" of item "Break a Leg!"
#: data/json/items/book/dodge.json
msgid ""
"\"The Kids' Guide to Acting and Stagecraft\".  This book is packed with "
"engaging outdoor games, complete with rules, strategies, and tips for "
"mastering each activity, along with some simple drills to train skills in an"
" easy way."
msgstr ""
"「子どものための演技と演出」と銘打っている本書には、魅力的な野外レクリエーションが豊富に掲載されており、各ゲームのルール、戦略、上達のコツと練習用の簡単なトレーニング方法などが紹介されています。"

#. ~ Variant name of item "Break a Leg!"
#: data/json/items/book/dodge.json
msgid "Self-defense for Your Child"
msgid_plural "copies of Self-defense for Your Child"
msgstr[0] "本(学習/子供のための護身術)"

#. ~ Description of variant "Self-defense for Your Child" of item "Break a
#. Leg!"
#: data/json/items/book/dodge.json
msgid ""
"A fully-illustrated practical course of simple techniques to defend your "
"child from bullies or predators.  You doubt it will help much for a real "
"child, but you found some interesting info here."
msgstr ""
"いじめっ子や悪人から身を守るための簡単なテクニックを完全図解で解説している実践的な書籍です。実際に子供が学ぶには難しすぎる気はしますが、興味深い情報を得られそうです。"

#. ~ Variant name of item "Break a Leg!"
#: data/json/items/book/dodge.json
msgid "Protective Measures: A Graphic Novel"
msgid_plural "copies of Protective Measures: A Graphic Novel"
msgstr[0] "本(学習/プロテクティブメジャー: グラフィックノベル)"

#. ~ Description of variant "Protective Measures: A Graphic Novel" of item
#. "Break a Leg!"
#: data/json/items/book/dodge.json
msgid ""
"Modern comics about an unnamed Hero that protects people without any "
"superpowers, using only his body and different martial arts.  The artwork is"
" well-illustrated and shows the movement and strategy of each character, but"
" the plot is fairly simple."
msgstr ""
"超能力を持たず、肉体と様々な武術だけで人々を守る無名のヒーローを描いた、現代的なコミックです。絵は非常に上手く、各キャラクターの動きや戦略がよく理解できますが、話の筋はかなりありきたりです。"

#. ~ Item name
#. ~ Variant name of item "Treasury of Legends about Western Dancing"
#: data/json/items/book/dodge.json
msgid "Treasury of Legends about Western Dancing"
msgid_plural "copies of Treasury of Legends about Western Dancing"
msgstr[0] "本(学習/西部の舞踏伝説)"

#. ~ Description of "Treasury of Legends about Western Dancing"
#. ~ Description of variant "Treasury of Legends about Western Dancing" of
#. item "Treasury of Legends about Western Dancing"
#: data/json/items/book/dodge.json
msgid ""
"Written by Emanuel Nogueira, a constabulario and historian of Nuevo Laredo, "
"this massive book details the movements and cultural legacies of a variety "
"of North American folk dances."
msgstr ""
"メキシコはヌエボ・ラレドの警察官であり歴史家でもあるエマヌエル・ノゲイラが著したこの分厚い本は、北アメリカの様々なフォークダンスの動きと文化的価値について詳細に解説しています。"

#. ~ Variant name of item "Treasury of Legends about Western Dancing"
#: data/json/items/book/dodge.json
msgid "A Guide To Making Yourself A Hard Target"
msgid_plural "copies of A Guide To Making Yourself A Hard Target"
msgstr[0] "本(学習/ハードターゲットになるためのガイド)"

#. ~ Description of variant "A Guide To Making Yourself A Hard Target" of item
#. "Treasury of Legends about Western Dancing"
#: data/json/items/book/dodge.json
msgid ""
"Written by self-defense instructor Neal Martin, this book describe "
"techniques and movesets you need to train to avoid being a victim, as well "
"as avoid trouble with the law in the aftermath."
msgstr ""
"護身術のインストラクターであるニール・マーティンが著した書籍です。被害を受けないために必要なテクニックや、その後に起こりうる法的トラブルの回避方法などが解説されています。"

#. ~ Variant name of item "Treasury of Legends about Western Dancing"
#: data/json/items/book/dodge.json
msgid "The Ultimate Guide to Unarmed Self Defense"
msgid_plural "copies of The Ultimate Guide to Unarmed Self Defense"
msgstr[0] "本(学習/非武装護身術究極ガイド)"

#. ~ Description of variant "The Ultimate Guide to Unarmed Self Defense" of
#. item "Treasury of Legends about Western Dancing"
#: data/json/items/book/dodge.json
msgid ""
"This book contains a lot of info about awareness, prevention, and defense in"
" unarmed fights."
msgstr "武器を持たず戦うときの意識、避けるべき行動、防御法に関する情報が多く載っている書籍です。"

#. ~ Variant name of item "Treasury of Legends about Western Dancing"
#: data/json/items/book/dodge.json
msgid "Knife Self-Defense for Combat"
msgid_plural "copies of Knife Self-Defense for Combat"
msgstr[0] "本(学習/実戦で使えるナイフ護身術)"

#. ~ Description of variant "Knife Self-Defense for Combat" of item "Treasury
#. of Legends about Western Dancing"
#: data/json/items/book/dodge.json
msgid ""
"A small manual about skills you need to defend yourself in armed street "
"fights."
msgstr "ストリートファイトで武装した相手から身を守るために必要なスキルを解説した、小さなマニュアル本です。"

#. ~ Variant name of item "Treasury of Legends about Western Dancing"
#: data/json/items/book/dodge.json
msgid "Invincible"
msgid_plural "copies of Invincible"
msgstr[0] "本(学習/インビンシブル)"

#. ~ Description of variant "Invincible" of item "Treasury of Legends about
#. Western Dancing"
#: data/json/items/book/dodge.json
msgid ""
"A dark book with a barbarian on the cover, this guide talks about how to "
"obtain skills for the streets, battlefields and… playing fields?"
msgstr "黒っぽい表紙に蛮族が描かれている、街中や戦場、そして...なんと競技場での戦闘技術の磨き方が書かれたガイドブックです。"

#. ~ Variant name of item "Treasury of Legends about Western Dancing"
#: data/json/items/book/dodge.json
msgid "War Machine"
msgid_plural "copies of War Machine"
msgstr[0] "本(学習/ウォーマシン)"

#. ~ Description of variant "War Machine" of item "Treasury of Legends about
#. Western Dancing"
#: data/json/items/book/dodge.json
msgid ""
"\"How to Transform Yourself Into A Vicious And Deadly Street Fighter\".  "
"This book, despite having a gladiator on the cover, describes pretty "
"practical ways to obtain the psychology, physiology, and combat potential of"
" a real warrior, ancient or modern."
msgstr ""
"「凶悪なストリートファイターに変身する方法」と銘打たれたこの書籍は、表紙には剣闘士が描かれていますが、古今東西の真の戦士の心理、身体、戦闘能力を手に入れるためのかなり実用的な手法が解説されています。"

#. ~ Variant name of item "Treasury of Legends about Western Dancing"
#: data/json/items/book/dodge.json
msgid "Understanding the Human Foot"
msgid_plural "copies of Understanding the Human Foot"
msgstr[0] "本(学習/人間の足を深く知る)"

#. ~ Description of variant "Understanding the Human Foot" of item "Treasury
#. of Legends about Western Dancing"
#: data/json/items/book/dodge.json
msgid ""
"A full color, updated overview of the structure of the feet, with essential "
"info about its functions, demonstrating how the foot relates to and "
"interacts with the rest of the body during movement."
msgstr ""
"足の構造や機能に関する重要な最新情報を、フルカラー写真と共に紹介しています。運動中に足が身体の他の部位とどのように連携し、相互に影響しているかがよく分かります。"

#. ~ Item name
#. ~ Variant name of item "AAA Guide"
#: data/json/items/book/driving.json
msgid "AAA Guide"
msgid_plural "copies of AAA Guide"
msgstr[0] "本(学習/AAA旅行ガイド)"

#. ~ Description of "AAA Guide"
#. ~ Description of variant "AAA Guide" of item "AAA Guide"
#: data/json/items/book/driving.json
msgid ""
"A tourist-centric guide to points of interest throughout the country.  "
"Though it focuses on the north-central US, the driving sections contain some"
" practical tips on proper driving techniques."
msgstr ""
"地域の名所を記した観光ガイドです。主にアメリカの中北部に焦点を当てて紹介されていますが、ドライブについての記事には、運転技術における実用的なヒントがいくつか記されています。"

#. ~ Variant name of item "AAA Guide"
#: data/json/items/book/driving.json
msgid "Driving Around"
msgid_plural "copies of Driving Around"
msgstr[0] "本(学習/ドライブしようよ)"

#. ~ Description of variant "Driving Around" of item "AAA Guide"
#: data/json/items/book/driving.json
msgid "A travelogue about a group of teenagers in the late nineties."
msgstr "90年代後半のティーンエイジャーたちを描いた旅行記です。"

#. ~ Variant name of item "AAA Guide"
#: data/json/items/book/driving.json
msgid "Off The Road"
msgid_plural "copies of Off The Road"
msgstr[0] "本(学習/オフ・ザ・ロード)"

#. ~ Description of variant "Off The Road" of item "AAA Guide"
#: data/json/items/book/driving.json
msgid ""
"A notebook about living off-the-grid, with a wide collection of stories, "
"examples, tips, and advice."
msgstr "道なき道を行く生活を綴った手記です。物語や実際にあった出来事、ヒントやアドバイスなどが幅広く掲載されています。"

#. ~ Variant name of item "AAA Guide"
#: data/json/items/book/driving.json
msgid "Traffic: Why We Drive the Way We Do"
msgid_plural "copies of Traffic: Why We Drive the Way We Do"
msgstr[0] "本(学習/トラフィック: 我々は何故車を運転するのか)"

#. ~ Description of variant "Traffic: Why We Drive the Way We Do" of item "AAA
#. Guide"
#: data/json/items/book/driving.json
msgid ""
"A big research book that talks about how roads are built, why they're built "
"in such a manner, and what we can do to improve it."
msgstr "道路はどのように作られるのか、何故作られるのか、道路を改善する方法はあるのか、といった内容を論じる大著です。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/book/driving.json
msgid "Top Gear magazine"
msgid_plural "Top Gear magazines"
msgstr[0] "本(学習/トップギアマガジン)"

#. ~ Description of "Top Gear magazine"
#. ~ Description of variant "Top Gear" of item "Top Gear magazine"
#: data/json/items/book/driving.json
msgid "Lots of articles about cars and driving techniques."
msgstr "車や運転技術に関する記事が大量に載っています。"

#. ~ Variant name of item "Top Gear magazine"
#: data/json/items/book/driving.json
msgid "Top Gear"
msgid_plural "issues of Top Gear"
msgstr[0] "本(学習/トップ・ギア)"

#. ~ Variant name of item "Top Gear magazine"
#: data/json/items/book/driving.json
msgid "Automobile"
msgid_plural "issues of Automobile"
msgstr[0] "本(学習/オートモービル)"

#. ~ Description of variant "Automobile" of item "Top Gear magazine"
#: data/json/items/book/driving.json
msgid ""
"A nice-looking magazine about the automobile industry, with shiny images and"
" long articles.  Dated 2019."
msgstr "派手な写真と長文で自動車業界の情報を紹介するお洒落な雑誌です。"

#. ~ Variant name of item "Top Gear magazine"
#: data/json/items/book/driving.json
msgid "Automotive Industries"
msgid_plural "issues of Automotive Industries"
msgstr[0] "本(学習/自動車産業)"

#. ~ Description of variant "Automotive Industries" of item "Top Gear
#. magazine"
#: data/json/items/book/driving.json
msgid "A monthly report about recent changes in the transport industry."
msgstr "最近の運輸業界の変化を記した月刊誌です。"

#. ~ Variant name of item "Top Gear magazine"
#: data/json/items/book/driving.json
msgid "Autoweek"
msgid_plural "issues of Autoweek"
msgstr[0] "本(学習/オートウィーク)"

#. ~ Description of variant "Autoweek" of item "Top Gear magazine"
#: data/json/items/book/driving.json
msgid ""
"A shabby magazine about new and old cars, automobile reviews, general "
"motorsports, and DIY."
msgstr "新車、旧車、自動車評論、モータースポーツ全般、部品のDIYなどに関するヨレヨレの雑誌です。"

#. ~ Variant name of item "Top Gear magazine"
#: data/json/items/book/driving.json
msgid "Car and Driver"
msgid_plural "issues of Car and Driver"
msgstr[0] "本(学習/カー&ドライバー)"

#. ~ Description of variant "Car and Driver" of item "Top Gear magazine"
#: data/json/items/book/driving.json
msgid "An absolutely generic monthly magazine about the automotive industry."
msgstr "自動車業界に関するごく一般的な月刊誌です。"

#. ~ Variant name of item "Top Gear magazine"
#: data/json/items/book/driving.json
msgid "Car Craft"
msgid_plural "issues of Car Craft"
msgstr[0] "本(学習/カー・クラフト)"

#. ~ Description of variant "Car Craft" of item "Top Gear magazine"
#: data/json/items/book/driving.json
msgid "Flashy journal about cars, racing, and mechanics."
msgstr "自動車、レース、メカニックに関する派手な雑誌です。"

#. ~ Variant name of item "Top Gear magazine"
#: data/json/items/book/driving.json
msgid "Diesel Power"
msgid_plural "issues of Diesel Power"
msgstr[0] "本(学習/ディーゼル・パワー)"

#. ~ Description of variant "Diesel Power" of item "Top Gear magazine"
#: data/json/items/book/driving.json
msgid ""
"An automotive magazine, focused on heavily modifying trucks, SUVs, and cars "
"powered by diesel."
msgstr "トラックやSUVなど、ディーゼル車の改造に特化した雑誌です。"

#. ~ Variant name of item "Top Gear magazine"
#: data/json/items/book/driving.json
msgid "Cruisin' Style Magazine"
msgid_plural "issues of Cruisin' Style Magazine"
msgstr[0] "本(学習/クルージン・スタイル)"

#. ~ Description of variant "Cruisin' Style Magazine" of item "Top Gear
#. magazine"
#: data/json/items/book/driving.json
msgid "A really old issue about classic car maintenance and restoration."
msgstr "クラシックカーの整備とレストアに関する非常に古い雑誌です。"

#. ~ Variant name of item "Top Gear magazine"
#: data/json/items/book/driving.json
msgid "Hot Rod"
msgid_plural "issues of Hot Rod"
msgstr[0] "本(学習/ホット・ロッド)"

#. ~ Description of variant "Hot Rod" of item "Top Gear magazine"
#: data/json/items/book/driving.json
msgid "Monthly magazine about hot rodding, drag racing, and muscle cars."
msgstr "ホットロッド、ドラッグレース、マッスルカーに関する月刊誌です。"

#. ~ Variant name of item "Top Gear magazine"
#: data/json/items/book/driving.json
msgid "Motor Trend"
msgid_plural "issues of Motor Trend"
msgstr[0] "本(学習/モーター・トレンド)"

#. ~ Description of variant "Motor Trend" of item "Top Gear magazine"
#: data/json/items/book/driving.json
msgid "Boring automobile magazine with a big shiny label."
msgstr "雑誌名がやたら大きく派手に書かれた、つまらない自動車情報誌です。"

#. ~ Variant name of item "Top Gear magazine"
#: data/json/items/book/driving.json
msgid "Quatro Rodas"
msgid_plural "issues of Quatro Rodas"
msgstr[0] "本(学習/クアトロ・ロダス)"

#. ~ Description of variant "Quatro Rodas" of item "Top Gear magazine"
#: data/json/items/book/driving.json
msgid ""
"It seems to be a car magazine, but you can only understand the images, as "
"the text is written in another language."
msgstr "自動車雑誌のようですが、外国の言語で書かれているため写真以外は理解できません。"

#. ~ Item name
#. ~ Variant name of item "The Rules of the Road"
#: data/json/items/book/driving.json
msgid "The Rules of the Road"
msgid_plural "copies of The Rules of the Road"
msgstr[0] "本(学習/道路交通法)"

#. ~ Description of "The Rules of the Road"
#. ~ Description of variant "The Rules of the Road" of item "The Rules of the
#. Road"
#: data/json/items/book/driving.json
msgid ""
"A thick textbook for beginning drivers.  It contains chapters on laws, safe "
"vehicle operation, and defensive driving concepts."
msgstr "運転免許の取得に際して用いられる教科書です。法律や安全な運転技術、駆動概念など章ごとに学ぶべき項目が分かれています。"

#. ~ Variant name of item "The Rules of the Road"
#: data/json/items/book/driving.json
msgid "Guide to Passing the Driving Test"
msgid_plural "copies of Guide to Passing the Driving Test"
msgstr[0] "本(学習/運転免許試験合格ガイド)"

#. ~ Description of variant "Guide to Passing the Driving Test" of item "The
#. Rules of the Road"
#: data/json/items/book/driving.json
msgid ""
"A thick, heavy book about every thing you may be asked in your driving exam."
"  The biggest part of the book contains a 'theory test' with detailed "
"answers, and many how-to's related to driving overall."
msgstr ""
"運転免許試験で出題される可能性があるあらゆる問題が掲載されている、分厚く重い書籍です。詳しい解答が書かれた「理論試験」に一番多くのページが割かれていますが、他にも運転技術全般に関わる実用的な情報が多く載っています。"

#. ~ Variant name of item "The Rules of the Road"
#: data/json/items/book/driving.json
msgid "The official DVSA guide to driving"
msgid_plural "copies of The official DVSA guide to driving"
msgstr[0] "本(学習/DVSA公式ドライビングガイド)"

#. ~ Description of variant "The official DVSA guide to driving" of item "The
#. Rules of the Road"
#: data/json/items/book/driving.json
msgid ""
"This book is packed with comprehensive information about driving, how to do "
"it properly, and take joy in it.  You wonder how this manual made it here, "
"as DVSA is a British organization, and the book contains information about "
"specific British driving rules."
msgstr ""
"運転に関する総合的な情報や正確な知識、運転の楽しみ方を網羅した書籍です。DVSAはイギリスの組織であり、本書にはイギリス独自の運転規則に関する情報も書かれています。どうしてこのガイド本がここにあるのでしょうか。"

#. ~ Variant name of item "The Rules of the Road"
#: data/json/items/book/driving.json
msgid "Automated Driving and Driver Assistance Systems"
msgid_plural "copies of Automated Driving and Driver Assistance Systems"
msgstr[0] "本(学習/自動運転と運転支援システム)"

#. ~ Description of variant "Automated Driving and Driver Assistance Systems"
#. of item "The Rules of the Road"
#: data/json/items/book/driving.json
msgid ""
"This book explains the technologies and approaches of advanced driving "
"systems, how they are designed, and why it is hard to get a good result.  It"
" is difficult to understand sometimes, but it shows driving from a "
"perspective an average driver wouldn't think about."
msgstr ""
"先進運転システムの技術や取り組み、設計方法、困難な課題とその要因などを解説した書籍です。難解な文章も多いですが、一般的なドライバーが考えもしないような視点から運転について論じています。"

#. ~ Variant name of item "The Rules of the Road"
#: data/json/items/book/driving.json
msgid "The Driving Instructor's Handbook"
msgid_plural "copies of The Driving Instructor's Handbook"
msgstr[0] "本(学習/運転教習指導員ハンドブック)"

#. ~ Description of variant "The Driving Instructor's Handbook" of item "The
#. Rules of the Road"
#: data/json/items/book/driving.json
msgid ""
"Detailed textbook about how to provide driving lessons, what may be "
"discussed, and how to prevent dangerous situations and collisions."
msgstr "自動車教習の手法、教習内容、危険な状況や事故の防止法などを詳しく解説したテキストです。"

#. ~ Description of "AAA Guide"
#. ~ Description of variant "AAA Guide" of item "AAA Guide"
#: data/json/items/book/driving.json
msgid ""
"A tourist-centric guide to points of interest throughout the country.  This "
"particular copy is apparently the Anonymous Anarchist's Annual: the cover "
"conceals a wealth of ways to help stick it to The Man, along with plenty of "
"advice for avoiding police."
msgstr ""
"地域の名所を記した観光ガイド...に偽装した書物です。アノニマス・アナーキスト・アニュアルと書かれた表紙をめくると、警察沙汰を避けるためのアドバイスや権力者に歯向かう様々な方法が大量に記されています。"

#. ~ Variant name of item "AAA Guide"
#: data/json/items/book/driving.json
msgid "The Anarchist Cookbook"
msgid_plural "copies of The Anarchist Cookbook"
msgstr[0] "本(学習/アナーキスト・クックブック)"

#. ~ Description of variant "The Anarchist Cookbook" of item "AAA Guide"
#: data/json/items/book/driving.json
msgid ""
"Classic illegal manual about making weapons and explosives.  The first page "
"contains a quote from its author William Powell, that describes it as \"a "
"youthful indiscretion or mistake that can haunt someone during their early "
"years or even longer\"."
msgstr ""
"武器や爆薬の製造に関する古典的な違法行為マニュアルです。最初のページには、著者ウィリアム・パウエルの言葉が掲載されています。「若気の至りや過ちとは、青年時代、あるいはもっと長い間、その者の心を悩ませ続けるものである。」"

#. ~ Variant name of item "AAA Guide"
#: data/json/items/book/driving.json
msgid "Science of Revolutionary Warfare"
msgid_plural "copies of Science of Revolutionary Warfare"
msgstr[0] "本(学習/革命戦争の科学)"

#. ~ Description of variant "Science of Revolutionary Warfare" of item "AAA
#. Guide"
#: data/json/items/book/driving.json
msgid ""
"A small, shabby book about making explosives, poisons, and weapons with "
"resources you may find in your backyard."
msgstr "裏庭にあるような材料で爆発物や毒物、武器を作るための、古びた短い本です。"

#. ~ Variant name of item "AAA Guide"
#: data/json/items/book/driving.json
msgid "The Poor Man's James Bond"
msgid_plural "copies of The Poor Man's James Bond"
msgstr[0] "本(学習/プアマンズ・ジェームズボンド)"

#. ~ Description of variant "The Poor Man's James Bond" of item "AAA Guide"
#: data/json/items/book/driving.json
msgid ""
"A collection of American paramilitary knowledge throughout history, "
"containing a lot of information about how to make dangerous weapons and "
"explosives in pretty dry language."
msgstr "アメリカの歴史の中から自警に関する知識を集めた書籍です。淡々とした言葉で、危険な武器や爆薬などの作り方が解説されています。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/book/electronics.json
msgid "Advanced Electronics"
msgid_plural "copies of Advanced Electronics"
msgstr[0] "本(学習/上級電子工学)"

#. ~ Description of "Advanced Electronics"
#: data/json/items/book/electronics.json
msgid "A college textbook on circuit design."
msgstr "大学で扱う回路の設計についての教科書です。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/book/electronics.json
msgid "Arduino Experiments"
msgid_plural "copies of Arduino Experiments"
msgstr[0] "本(学習/実践Arduino)"

#. ~ Description of "Arduino Experiments"
#: data/json/items/book/electronics.json
msgid "A textbook-sized book of electronics and robotics experiments."
msgstr "電子工学とロボット工学に関する実践アイデアをまとめた、教科書サイズの書籍です。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/book/electronics.json
msgid "Ham Radio Illustrated"
msgid_plural "issues of Ham Radio Illustrated"
msgstr[0] "本(学習/図解アマチュア無線)"

#. ~ Description of "Ham Radio Illustrated"
#: data/json/items/book/electronics.json
msgid ""
"An amusing magazine about ham radio, with lots of diagrams and illustrations"
" for making your own electronic devices."
msgstr "自力で電子機器を作れるように図解やイラストをふんだんに使用した、アマチュア無線に関する興味深い雑誌です。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/book/electronics.json
msgid "What's a Transistor?"
msgid_plural "copies of What's a Transistor?"
msgstr[0] "本(学習/トランジスタとは？)"

#. ~ Description of "What's a Transistor?"
#: data/json/items/book/electronics.json
msgid "A basic manual of electronics and circuit design."
msgstr "電子工学と電気回路に関する基本的なマニュアルです。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/book/electronics.json
msgid "101 Important Integrated Circuits"
msgid_plural "copies of 101 Important Integrated Circuits"
msgstr[0] "本(学習/主要集積回路101)"

#. ~ Description of "101 Important Integrated Circuits"
#: data/json/items/book/electronics.json
msgid ""
"This reference manual contains datasheets and pinout diagrams for 101 of the"
" most popular IC chips, including the 555 timer, LM358 op-amp, and LM317 "
"voltage regulator, along with logic chips from the 74xx family, and even the"
" 6502 8-bit processor.  If you want to do anything useful with integrated "
"circuits, a reference like this would be indispensable."
msgstr ""
"この技術便覧には、555タイマー、LM358オペアンプ、LM317電圧レギュレーター、74xxシリーズのロジックIC、6502 "
"8ビットプロセッサーなど、代表的なICチップのデータシートとピン配置図が掲載されています。集積回路を使って何かしようと思ったら、この書籍は欠かせません。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/book/electronics.json
msgid "Amateur Home Radio for Enthusiasts"
msgid_plural "copies of Amateur Home Radio for Enthusiasts"
msgstr[0] "本(学習/アマチュア無線ファン)"

#. ~ Description of "Amateur Home Radio for Enthusiasts"
#: data/json/items/book/electronics.json
msgid ""
"A book about ham radio and citizen's band radio.  It contains numerous "
"diagrams and illustrations explaining the science behind the electronics."
msgstr "アマチュア無線や市民ラジオについて書かれた本です。電子機器の科学的な仕組みについて、多くの図やイラストを交えて解説しています。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/book/electronics.json
msgid "computer printout"
msgid_plural "computer printouts"
msgstr[0] "本(学習/コンピュータ印刷用紙)"

#. ~ Description of "computer printout"
#: data/json/items/book/electronics.json
msgid ""
"One side of this sheet is printed with a meaningless jumble of characters, "
"but the other side shows a complicated, hand-drawn circuit diagram."
msgstr "この用紙の片面には、意味不明な文字の羅列が印刷されており、反対側には手書きの複雑な回路図が描かれています。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/book/electronics.json
msgid "The Role of Robotics in Modern Day Manufacturing"
msgid_plural "copies of The Role of Robotics in Modern Day Manufacturing"
msgstr[0] "本(学習/現代製造業におけるロボット工学の役割)"

#. ~ Description of "The Role of Robotics in Modern Day Manufacturing"
#: data/json/items/book/electronics.json
msgid ""
"A hefty book containing a whole bunch of technical info on industrial "
"robotics.  While constructing these robots are no doubt outside any realm of"
" feasibility, the information provided still has a fair bit to teach about "
"complex electronics."
msgstr ""
"産業用ロボットに関する技術情報が大量に掲載された分厚い書籍です。読むだけでロボットを組み立てるのはまず不可能ですが、複雑な電子工学に関してのためになる知識をかなり学べそうです。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/book/electronics.json
msgid "lab journal-Herrera"
msgid_plural "lab journals-Herrera"
msgstr[0] "本(学習/研究日誌-エレーラ)"

#. ~ Description of "lab journal-Herrera"
#: data/json/items/book/electronics.json
msgid ""
"This hefty binder contains a multitude of diagrams and technical "
"specifications for various electronic materials.  Some of the diagrams use "
"symbols you've not seen before…"
msgstr ""
"この分厚いバインダーには、いくつかの各種電子材料の図面と技術仕様が記載されています。今までに見たこともないような記号が使用されている図面もあるようです..."

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/book/electronics.json
msgid "2XI design binder-CLASSIFIED"
msgid_plural "2XI design binders-CLASSIFIED"
msgstr[0] "本(学習/2XI設計書:機密)"

#. ~ Description of "2XI design binder-CLASSIFIED"
#: data/json/items/book/electronics.json
msgid ""
"This DoubleTech Industries binder has several intimidating security warnings"
" on the cover.  Probably because it contains complete design specs, "
"technical drawings, and test results for their military-grade bionic "
"implants."
msgstr ""
"表紙に威圧的なセキュリティ警告文が書かれたDoubleTech社のバインダーです。おそらく、軍用生体部品の完全な設計仕様や技術的な図面、および試験結果が記載されているものと思われます。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/book/electronics.json
msgid "plans for a radio repeater mod"
msgid_plural "plans for a radio repeater mod"
msgstr[0] "本(学習/無線中継モジュール図面)"

#. ~ Description of "plans for a radio repeater mod"
#: data/json/items/book/electronics.json
msgid ""
"Instructions on how to create a mod for a radio station terminal which "
"converts the entire system into a repeater."
msgstr "ラジオ放送端末用の中継モジュールの製作方法が書かれた図面です。無線中継モジュールはシステム全体を中継器に変換します。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/book/electronics.json
msgid "Electronic Circuit Theory"
msgid_plural "copies of Electronic Circuit Theory"
msgstr[0] "本(学習/電子回路理論)"

#. ~ Description of "Electronic Circuit Theory"
#: data/json/items/book/electronics.json
msgid ""
"An advanced college textbook on circuit theory, design, and organization."
msgstr "電子回路の理論や設計、組み立てについて記された大学用の教科書です。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/book/electronics.json
msgid "Robots for Fun & Profit"
msgid_plural "copies of Robots for Fun & Profit"
msgstr[0] "本(学習/趣味と実益のロボット)"

#. ~ Description of "Robots for Fun & Profit"
#: data/json/items/book/electronics.json
msgid ""
"A rare book on the design of robots, with lots of helpful step-by-step "
"guides."
msgstr "ロボットの設計に関する希少な本です。様々な役立つ項目が段階的に解説されています。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/book/electronics.json
msgid "trifacet handling procedures"
msgid_plural "trifacet handling procedures"
msgstr[0] "本(学習/トリファセット取扱手順書)"

#. ~ Description of "trifacet handling procedures"
#: data/json/items/book/electronics.json
msgid ""
"A heavy and disparate binder detailing the deactivation, storage and "
"transport procedures for a so called \"Trifacet\" UGV.  The pages and "
"schematics within have been compiled from the internal reports of a vast "
"array of governmental agencies, many of which you had never heard of before."
msgstr ""
"「トリファセット」と呼ばれる無人機の停止、保管、輸送手順が詳しく書かれた、様々な種類の用紙が混じったバインダーです。概略図や、政府機関による膨大な内部文書がまとまっていますが、その多くはこれまで聞いたことのない内容です。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/book/electronics.json
msgid "CBM interface wiring reference"
msgid_plural "CBM interface wiring reference"
msgstr[0] "本(学習/CBM配線参考文献)"

#. ~ Description of "CBM interface wiring reference"
#: data/json/items/book/electronics.json
msgid ""
"A printed technical reference for the Exodii's CBM interface wire kit using "
"numerous alien symbols along with Anglic terminology.  Thankfully someone's "
"hand-written a legend for those symbols and terms along the margins, but "
"it'll still take significant electronics knowledge to decipher this "
"document."
msgstr ""
"エクゾディのCBMインターフェース配線キットに関する技術資料です。余白に手書きで記号や用語の説明が書き足されているのはありがたいですが、それでも解読するにはかなり高度な電子工学の知識が必要になりそうです。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/book/electronics.json
msgid "schematics"
msgid_plural "schematics"
msgstr[0] "開発概要"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/book/electronics.json
msgid "nurse bot schematics"
msgid_plural "nurse bot schematics"
msgstr[0] "本(学習/看護ロボット開発概要)"

#. ~ Description of "nurse bot schematics"
#: data/json/items/book/electronics.json
msgid ""
"Bearing the logo of Uncanny, these are assembly plans, design specs, and "
"technical drawings for the nurse bot.  Most of this is useless to you, but "
"you could use the assembly plans to re-assemble the robot from salvaged "
"parts."
msgstr ""
"Uncanny社のロゴが入った書類です。看護ロボットの組み立て計画や設計仕様、図面などが書かれています。内容のほとんどは役に立ちませんが、組み立て方法を理解すれば回収した部品からロボットを組み立て直せそうです。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/book/electronics.json
msgid "grocery bot schematics"
msgid_plural "grocery bot schematics"
msgstr[0] "本(学習/配送ロボット開発概要)"

#. ~ Description of "grocery bot schematics"
#: data/json/items/book/electronics.json
msgid ""
"Bearing the logo of Uncanny, these are assembly plans, design specs, and "
"technical drawings for the grocery bot.  Most of this is useless to you, but"
" you could use the assembly plans to re-assemble the robot from salvaged "
"parts."
msgstr ""
"Uncanny社のロゴが入った書類です。配送ロボットの組み立て計画や設計仕様、図面などが書かれています。内容のほとんどは役に立ちませんが、組み立て方法を理解すれば回収した部品からロボットを組み立て直せそうです。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/book/electronics.json
msgid "security bot schematics"
msgid_plural "security bot schematics"
msgstr[0] "本(学習/警備ロボット開発概要)"

#. ~ Description of "security bot schematics"
#: data/json/items/book/electronics.json
msgid ""
"Assembly plans, design specs, and technical drawings for the security bot.  "
"Most of this is useless to you, but you could use the assembly plans to re-"
"assemble the robot from salvaged parts."
msgstr ""
"警備ロボットの組み立て計画や設計仕様、図面などが書かれています。内容のほとんどは役に立ちませんが、組み立て方法を理解すれば回収した部品からロボットを組み立て直せそうです。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/book/electronics.json
msgid "skitterbot schematics"
msgid_plural "skitterbot schematics"
msgstr[0] "本(学習/高速ロボット開発概要)"

#. ~ Description of "skitterbot schematics"
#: data/json/items/book/electronics.json
msgid ""
"Assembly plans, design specs, and technical drawings for the skitterbot.  "
"Most of this is useless to you, but you could use the assembly plans to re-"
"assemble the robot from salvaged parts."
msgstr ""
"高速ロボットの組み立て計画や設計仕様、図面などが書かれています。内容のほとんどは役に立ちませんが、組み立て方法を理解すれば回収した部品からロボットを組み立て直せそうです。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/book/electronics.json
msgid "cleaner bot schematics"
msgid_plural "cleaner bot schematics"
msgstr[0] "本(学習/掃除ロボット開発概要)"

#. ~ Description of "cleaner bot schematics"
#: data/json/items/book/electronics.json
msgid ""
"Assembly plans, design specs, and technical drawings for the cleaner bot.  "
"Most of this is useless to you, but you could use the assembly plans to re-"
"assemble the robot from salvaged parts."
msgstr ""
