#: data/json/items/book/melee.json
msgid ""
"A barbaric guide detailing how to win a fight in the worst possible "
"scenarios - mostly about how to retreat from such a fight, but it still has "
"some information in case you have no another way."
msgstr ""
"最悪の状況で戦いに勝つ方法を詳しく解説している、残忍なガイドブックです。主な内容は戦いから逃げる方法ですが、避けようがない戦いに役立つ情報も載っています。"

#. ~ Variant name of item "CQB Monthly"
#: data/json/items/book/melee.json
msgid "Maximum Damage"
msgid_plural "copies of Maximum Damage"
msgstr[0] "本(学習/最強の一撃)"

