msgstr[0] "本(学習/ザ・MACマン)"

#. ~ Description of variant "The Mac Man" of item "The Submachine Gun
#. Handbook"
#: data/json/items/book/smg.json
msgid ""
"The full story of Gordon Ingram and his revolutionary machine gun designs: "
"the Model 6, MAC-10, MAC-11, and SWD."
msgstr "ゴードン・イングラムの人物像と、彼が設計した革命的なマシンガン、モデル6、MAC-10、MAC-11、SWDの全貌を紹介する書籍です。"

#. ~ Variant name of item "The Submachine Gun Handbook"
#: data/json/items/book/smg.json
msgid ""
"The Development of Sub-Machine Guns and their Ammunition from World War 1 to"
" the Present Day"
msgid_plural ""
"copies of The Development of Sub-Machine Guns and their Ammunition from "
"World War 1 to the Present Day"
msgstr[0] "本(学習/サブマシンガンとその弾薬の開発について: 第一次世界大戦から現代まで)"

#. ~ Description of variant "The Development of Sub-Machine Guns and their
#. Ammunition from World War 1 to the Present Day" of item "The Submachine Gun
#. Handbook"
#: data/json/items/book/smg.json
msgid ""
"A comprehensive study of the development and use of the sub-machine gun "
"since World War I, including a country-by-country survey of equipment used, "
"with lots of illustrations and precise information."
msgstr ""
"第一次世界大戦以降のサブマシンガンの開発と運用について、国別の導入装備の調査などと共に、豊富な図版と性格な情報を列挙し総合的に考察する書籍です。"

#. ~ Variant name of item "The Submachine Gun Handbook"
#: data/json/items/book/smg.json
msgid "American Submachine Guns 1919–1950"
msgid_plural "copies of American Submachine Guns 1919–1950"
msgstr[0] "本(学習/アメリカのサブマシンガン1919–1950)"

#. ~ Description of variant "American Submachine Guns 1919–1950" of item "The
#. Submachine Gun Handbook"
#: data/json/items/book/smg.json
msgid ""
"A fully illustrated book about famous submachine guns, their design, "
"construction, and testing, as well as their accessories such as magazines, "
"ammunition, webbing, and cleaning kits."
msgstr "有名なサブマシンガンの設計、構造、試射、弾倉、そしてウェビングや弾薬、整備キットなどの付属品について、完全図解で紹介している書籍です。"

#. ~ Variant name of item "The Submachine Gun Handbook"
#: data/json/items/book/smg.json
msgid "Firearm Anatomy"
msgid_plural "copies of Firearm Anatomy"
msgstr[0] "本(学習/銃器大解剖)"

#. ~ Description of variant "Firearm Anatomy" of item "The Submachine Gun
#. Handbook"
#: data/json/items/book/smg.json
msgid ""
"Part of a big series about weapons and their complexity, this issue "
"describes the long history of the M1A1 Thompson Submachine gun - when it was"
" created, why, and why it is iconic now."
msgstr ""
"銃器とその詳細な仕組みについて解説する長期シリーズの一冊です。この巻では、M1A1トンプソンサブマシンガンの長い歴史、いつ頃どんな理由で開発されたのか、なぜ今も象徴的な銃とされているかについて解説しています。"

#. ~ Variant name of item "The Submachine Gun Handbook"
#: data/json/items/book/smg.json
msgid "An Amateur's Guide for the Colt's Thompson Submachine Gun"
msgid_plural ""
"copies of An Amateur's Guide for the Colt's Thompson Submachine Gun"
msgstr[0] "本(学習/コルト社製トンプソンサブマシンガン入門ガイド)"

#. ~ Description of variant "An Amateur's Guide for the Colt's Thompson
#. Submachine Gun" of item "The Submachine Gun Handbook"
#: data/json/items/book/smg.json
msgid ""
"A 200-page collector's manual advising how to buy a real, old Tommy Gun, "
"with detailed info on each model, info about maintenance and shooting, and "
"stories about its usage in the St. Louis Police Department."
msgstr ""
"本物の古いトミーガンの購入法を指南する200ページのコレクターズマニュアルです。各モデルの詳細情報、メンテナンスと射撃に関するデータ、セントルイス警察署で運用されていたエピソードなどが掲載されています。"

#. ~ Variant name of item "The Submachine Gun Handbook"
#: data/json/items/book/smg.json
msgid "Submachine Guns Caliber .45"
msgid_plural "copies of Submachine Guns Caliber .45"
msgstr[0] "本(学習/.45口径サブマシンガン)"

#. ~ Description of variant "Submachine Guns Caliber .45" of item "The
#. Submachine Gun Handbook"
#: data/json/items/book/smg.json
msgid ""
"Part of an old army field manual, this book explains the usage and "
"maintenance of the M3 and M3A1, and how it was adopted into U.S. Army "
"service in 1942."
msgstr ""
"アメリカ陸軍の古いマニュアルの一部を抜粋したものです。M3やM3A1の使い方やメンテナンス方法、1942年にアメリカ陸軍に採用された経緯などを解説しています。"

#. ~ Variant name of item "The Submachine Gun Handbook"
#: data/json/items/book/smg.json
msgid "Maintenance on the MP40, PPSH41, M3A1, and Sten MKII Submachine Guns"
