#. ~ Description of "cooked sausage"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/meat_dishes.json
msgid "A hefty cooked sausage.  Better eat it hot and fresh."
msgstr "調理したボリュームたっぷりのソーセージです。熱いうちに召し上がれ。"

