"Reconstituted meat flakes, which are much more enjoyable to eat now that "
"they have been rehydrated."
msgstr "水で戻した乾燥肉です。乾燥したまま食べるよりずっと美味しいです。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/comestibles/meat_dishes.json
msgid "haggis"
msgid_plural "haggises"
msgstr[0] "ハギス"

#. ~ Description of "haggis"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/meat_dishes.json
msgid ""
"This traditional Scottish savory pudding is made of meat and offal mixed "
"with oatmeal, sewn into an animal's stomach and boiled.  Surprisingly tasty "
"and quite filling, it is best served with boiled root vegetables and strong "
"whisky."
msgstr ""
"肉、内臓、オートミール等を混ぜて動物の胃袋に詰め込み、口を縫い合わせて丸ごと茹でれば、塩味の効いたスコットランドの伝統的プディングが出来上がります。後は茹でた根菜と強いウイスキーがあれば、もう言うことはありません。"

#. ~ Conditional name for "haggis" when VITAMIN matches human_flesh_vitamin
