#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/comestibles/meat_dishes.json
msgid "meatball"
msgid_plural "meatballs"
msgstr[0] "ミートボール(調理済)"

#. ~ Description of "meatball"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/meat_dishes.json
msgid "A seasoned and fried round lump of meat.  Just like mom used to make!"
msgstr "肉団子に味をつけて揚げた料理です。お母さんが作ってくれた味！"

#. ~ Conditional name for "meatball" when VITAMIN matches human_flesh_vitamin
#: data/json/items/comestibles/meat_dishes.json
msgid "manball"
msgid_plural "manballs"
msgstr[0] "人肉ボール(調理済)"

#. ~ Conditional name for "meatball" when FLAG matches STRICT_HUMANITARIANISM
#: data/json/items/comestibles/meat_dishes.json
msgid "murderball"
msgid_plural "murderballs"
msgstr[0] "変異肉ボール(調理済)"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/comestibles/meat_dishes.json
msgid "Valencian paella"
msgid_plural "Valencian paella"
msgstr[0] "バレンシア風パエリア"

#. ~ Description of "Valencian paella"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/meat_dishes.json
msgid ""
"A traditional dish originating from Spain, more specifically from the region"
" of Valencia.  A very tasty and filling dish made traditionally of rabbit, "
"beans, rice, chicken, spices and sometimes snails."
msgstr ""
"スペインはバレンシア地方の郷土料理です。ウサギ肉、豆、米、鶏肉、スパイス、更にはエスカルゴなども入っている伝統的な料理で、非常に美味しく食べ応えがあります。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/comestibles/meat_dishes.json
msgid "escargot"
msgid_plural "escargot"
msgstr[0] "エスカルゴ"

#. ~ Description of "escargot"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/meat_dishes.json
msgid ""
"A traditional dish originating from France, more specifically from the "
"region of Bourgogne.  It consists of prepared snails that have then been "
"cooked in butter and parsley inside their own shells, very low on fat but "
"high on protein."
msgstr "フランスはブルゴーニュ地方の郷土料理です。カタツムリの殻の中にバターとパセリを詰めて調理した、低脂肪かつ高タンパクな点が魅力です。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/comestibles/meat_dishes.json
msgid "kiymali pide"
msgid_plural "kiymali pide"
msgstr[0] "クイマル・ピデ"

#. ~ Description of "kiymali pide"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/meat_dishes.json
msgid ""
"Turkish flatbread topped with ground lamb or beef mixed with peppers, "
"onions, and tomatoes."
msgstr "トルコ風のフラットブレッドに、ピーマン、タマネギ、トマト、羊や牛の挽肉を混ぜた具を盛りつけて作る料理です。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/comestibles/meat_dishes.json
msgid "lahmacun"
msgid_plural "lahmacuns"
msgstr[0] "ラフマジュン"

#. ~ Description of "lahmacun"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/meat_dishes.json
msgid ""
"Turkish flatbread topped with minced meat, minced vegetables, and herbs "
"including onions, garlic, tomatoes, red peppers, and parsley, flavored with "
"spices such as chili pepper and paprika, then baked."
msgstr ""
"トルコ風のフラットブレッドに挽肉、タマネギやニンニク、トマト、トウガラシ、パセリなどの細かく刻んだ野菜を盛りつけ、チリパウダーやパプリカなどの香辛料で味をつけて焼いた料理です。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/comestibles/meat_dishes.json
msgid "iskender kebab"
msgid_plural "iskender kebab"
msgstr[0] "イスケンデル・ケバブ"

#. ~ Description of "iskender kebab"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/meat_dishes.json
msgid ""
"A Turkish dish that consists of sliced döner kebab meat topped with hot "
"tomato sauce over pieces of pita bread and generously slathered with melted "
"special sheep's milk butter and yogurt."
msgstr ""
"薄くスライスしたドネルケバブに熱々のトマトソースをまぶしてピタパンに詰め、羊乳で作った特製バターとヨーグルトをたっぷりかけたトルコ料理です。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/comestibles/meat_dishes.json
msgid "manti"
msgid_plural "manti"
msgstr[0] "マンティ"

#. ~ Description of "manti"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/meat_dishes.json
msgid ""
"Dumplings that typically consist of a spiced meat mixture, usually lamb or "
"ground beef, wrapped in a thin dough sheet which is then boiled or steamed."
msgstr "香辛料で味付けした羊や牛の挽肉を丸めて薄い生地で包み、茹でる、もしくは蒸して作った料理です。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/comestibles/meat_dishes.json
msgid "sarma"
msgid_plural "sarma"
msgstr[0] "サルマ"

#. ~ Description of "sarma"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/meat_dishes.json
msgid ""
"A traditional Turkish dish prepared by rolling rice and minced meat in grape"
" leaves."
msgstr "米と挽肉をブドウの葉で巻いて作る、トルコの伝統料理です。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/comestibles/meat_dishes.json
msgid "fried chicken"
msgid_plural "fried chicken"
msgstr[0] "フライドチキン"

#. ~ Description of "fried chicken"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/meat_dishes.json
msgid "A delicious golden-brown serving of crispy fried chicken."
msgstr "カリカリに揚がった、黄金色の美味しい鳥肉です。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/comestibles/meat_dishes.json
msgid "buttermilk fried chicken"
msgid_plural "buttermilk fried chicken"
msgstr[0] "バターミルクフライドチキン"

#. ~ Description of "buttermilk fried chicken"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/meat_dishes.json
msgid ""
"Brined in buttermilk, seasoned and breaded to perfection, and fried until "
"crispy and golden.  This fried chicken is so good you can almost forget "
"about the end of the world.  Vinegar leg is on the right!"
msgstr ""
"バターミルクに浸し、味付けし、衣をまぶして完璧に仕上がった鳥肉を、黄金色になるまでカリカリに揚げた料理です。非常に美味しく、世界が崩壊したことを忘れてしまいそうになります。忘れないで、酢漬けモモ肉は右側！"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/comestibles/meat_dishes.json
msgid "tandoori chicken"
msgid_plural "tandoori chickens"
msgstr[0] "タンドリーチキン"

#. ~ Description of "tandoori chicken"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/meat_dishes.json
msgid ""
"Originating from Punjabi cuisine, this deep-red and spicy baked chicken is "
"marinated with a yogurt-based sauce and is traditionally baked directly on "
"the walls of a wood-fired clay oven."
msgstr ""
"パンジャーブ料理発祥の、スパイシーな深紅色の鳥料理です。ヨーグルトベースのソースに鳥肉を浸し、伝統的には土窯の壁に貼り付けて薪で熱して調理します。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/comestibles/meat_dishes.json
msgid "Hinanese chicken rice"
msgid_plural "Hinanese chicken rice"
msgstr[0] "海南鶏飯"

#. ~ Description of "Hinanese chicken rice"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/meat_dishes.json
msgid ""
"This delicious serving of poached chicken with rice is one of the national "
"dishes of Singapore."
msgstr "シンガポールの国民食の一つとされる、茹でた鳥肉と米飯を盛り合わせた美味しい料理です。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/comestibles/meat_dishes.json
msgid "chicken parmesan"
msgid_plural "chicken parmesan"
msgstr[0] "チキンパルメザン"

#. ~ Description of "chicken parmesan"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/meat_dishes.json
msgid ""
"A classic Italian-American dish of breaded and fried chicken atop a bed of "
"pasta, enrobed with tomato sauce and cheese."
msgstr "衣をまぶして揚げた鳥肉をパスタの上に乗せてトマトソースとチーズを絡めた、古典的なイタリア移民のアメリカ料理です。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/comestibles/meat_dishes.json
msgid "scrapple"
msgid_plural "scrapple"
msgstr[0] "スクラップル"

#. ~ Description of "scrapple"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/meat_dishes.json
msgid ""
"A dry mush of meat scraps and grain, sliced and pan-fried; better than it "
"sounds and looks.  A staple food of the Mid-Atlantic United States."
msgstr "ペースト状に潰して固めた屑肉と穀物を薄く切って炒めた料理です。見た目や名前とは裏腹に美味しく食べられる、アメリカ中部大西洋岸の主食です。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
msgid "melatonin tablet"
msgid_plural "melatonin tablets"
msgstr[0] "メラトニン剤"

#. ~ Description of "melatonin tablet"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
msgid ""
"An over-the-counter melatonin supplement, commonly prescribed to treat sleep"
" deprivation and to mitigate its effects.  One tablet a day combined with a "
"good night's sleep will help you recover faster."
msgstr ""
"睡眠不足の解消や症状軽減のためによく処方される、市販のメラトニンサプリメントです。1日1錠摂取して質の高い睡眠を心がければ、睡眠不足がより早く解消されます。"

#. ~ "activation_message" action message of item "melatonin tablet"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
msgid "You pop a melatonin tablet."
msgstr "メラトニン剤を摂取しました。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
msgid "prescription stimulant"
msgid_plural "prescription stimulant"
msgstr[0] "医療用覚醒剤"

#. ~ Description of "prescription stimulant"
#. ~ Description of variant "Adderall" of item "prescription stimulant"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
msgid ""
"Medical-grade amphetamine salts mixed with dextroamphetamine salts, commonly"
" prescribed to treat hyperactive attention deficits.  It suppresses the "
"appetite, and is quite addictive."
msgstr ""
"ADHDの治療薬としてよく処方される、デキストロアンフェタミン塩と医療用アンフェタミン塩を混合した薬物です。非常に高い依存性があり、食欲が抑制されます。"

#. ~ "activation_message" action message of item "prescription stimulant"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
#, c-format
msgid "You take some %s."
msgstr "%sを摂取しました。"

#. ~ Variant name of item "prescription stimulant"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
msgid "Adderall"
msgid_plural "Adderall"
msgstr[0] "アデロール"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
msgid "epinephrine autoinjector"
msgid_plural "epinephrine autoinjectors"
msgstr[0] "エピネフリン自己注射器"

#. ~ Description of "epinephrine autoinjector"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
msgid ""
"A syringe filled with a shot of epinephrine, also called adrenalin.  It "
"serves as a powerful stimulant when you inject yourself with it.  Asthmatics"
" can use it in an emergency to clear an asthma attack."
msgstr ""
"エピネフリン、別名アドレナリンを充填した注射器です。自身に注射すると強力な興奮剤として作用します。喘息患者が緊急時に発作を抑えるためにも使用します。"

#. ~ "activation_message" action message of item "epinephrine autoinjector"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
msgid "You inject yourself with the injector."
msgstr "注射器を使って自分自身に薬品を投与しました。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
msgid "antibiotics"
msgid_plural "antibiotics"
msgstr[0] "抗生物質"

#. ~ Description of "antibiotics"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
msgid ""
"Antibacterial medication designed to prevent or stop the spread of "
"infection.  It's the safest way to cure any infections you might have.  One "
"dose lasts twelve hours."
msgstr "感染症の悪化を抑制、阻害する効果をもつ抗生物質です。感染症治療法の中では最も安全な手段です。1回の服用で効果が12時間継続します。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
msgid "antifungal drug"
msgid_plural "antifungal drug"
msgstr[0] "抗真菌薬"

#. ~ Description of "antifungal drug"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
msgid ""
"A powerful chemical tablet designed to eliminate fungal infections in living"
" creatures.  One dose lasts four hours."
msgstr "生物の真菌感染症を治療する効果をもつ、強力な錠剤です。1回の服用で効果が4時間継続します。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
msgid "antiparasitic drug"
msgid_plural "antiparasitic drug"
msgstr[0] "抗寄生虫薬"

#. ~ Description of "antiparasitic drug"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
msgid ""
"A broad-spectrum chemical tablet designed to eliminate parasitic "
"infestations in living creatures.  Though designed for use on pets and "
"livestock, it will likely work on humans as well."
msgstr "生物の体内にいる寄生虫を駆除する効果をもつ、広域駆虫剤です。ペットや家畜用に開発された薬剤ですが、人間が服用しても効果を期待できます。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
msgid "aspirin"
msgid_plural "aspirins"
msgstr[0] "アスピリン"

#. ~ Description of "aspirin"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
msgid ""
"Acetylsalicylic acid, a mild anti-inflammatory and blood thinner.  Take to "
"relieve pain and swelling.  Careful - it can increase bleeding."
msgstr ""
"アセチルサリチル酸と弱い抗炎症、抗凝血作用をもつ成分が入っており、服用すると痛みや腫れを和らげます。出血が増える可能性があるため、注意が必要です。"

#. ~ "activation_message" action message of item "aspirin"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
msgid "You take some aspirin."
msgstr "アスピリンを服用しました。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
msgid "ibuprofen"
msgid_plural "ibuprofen"
msgstr[0] "イブプロフェン"

#. ~ Description of "ibuprofen"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
msgid ""
"Ibuprofen, a mild NSAID-based painkiller.  Take to relieve pain and "
"swelling."
msgstr "弱い鎮痛作用をもつ非ステロイド性抗炎症薬です。服用すると痛みや腫れを和らげます。"

#. ~ "activation_message" action message of item "ibuprofen"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
msgid "You take some ibuprofen."
msgstr "イブプロフェンを服用しました。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
msgid "naproxen"
msgid_plural "naproxen"
msgstr[0] "ナプロキセン"

#. ~ Description of "naproxen"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
msgid ""
"Naproxen, a mild long-lasting NSAID-based painkiller.  Take to relieve pain "
"and swelling."
msgstr "弱く持続性が高い鎮痛作用をもつ非ステロイド性抗炎症薬です。服用すると痛みや腫れを和らげます。"

#. ~ "activation_message" action message of item "naproxen"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
msgid "You take some naproxen."
msgstr "ナプロキセンを服用しました。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
msgid "acetaminophen"
msgid_plural "acetaminophen"
msgstr[0] "アセトアミノフェン"

#. ~ Description of "acetaminophen"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
msgid ""
"Acetaminophen, a mild painkiller that works well in conjunction with NSAID-"
"based painkillers like aspirin.  Take to relieve pain and swelling."
msgstr "弱い鎮痛作用があり、アスピリンなどの非ステロイド性抗炎症薬と併用することで効果が高まります。服用すると痛みや腫れを和らげます。"

#. ~ "activation_message" action message of item "acetaminophen"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
msgid "You take some acetaminophen."
msgstr "アセトアミノフェンを服用しました。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
msgid "metaprolol"
msgid_plural "metaprolol"
msgstr[0] "メトプロロール"

#. ~ Description of "metaprolol"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
msgid ""
"Metaprolol, a classic beta blocker.  It lowers blood pressure and decouples "
"heart rate from stressful events such as anxiety or pain."
msgstr "典型的なベータ遮断薬です。血圧を下げ、不安や苦痛などのストレスが心拍数に与える影響を軽減します。"

#. ~ "activation_message" action message of item "metaprolol"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
msgid "You take some metaprolol."
msgstr "メトプロロールを服用しました。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
msgid "antiseptic powder"
msgid_plural "antiseptic powder"
msgstr[0] "粉末消毒薬"

#. ~ Description of "antiseptic powder"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
msgid ""
"A powdered form of chemical antiseptic, this bismuth formic iodide cleans "
"wounds quickly and painlessly."
msgstr "ヨウ化ギ酸ビスマスを主成分とする粉末状の化学消毒剤です。傷口に刺激を与えず速やかに消毒します。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
#: data/mods/My_Sweet_Cataclysm/sweet_comestibles.json
msgid "caffeinated chewing gum"
msgid_plural "caffeinated chewing gums"
msgstr[0] "カフェインガム"

#. ~ Description of "caffeinated chewing gum"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
msgid ""
"Sugar-free chewing gum with added caffeine.  It's a nice pick-me-up, one "
"stick is equivalent to a strong cup of tea."
msgstr "カフェインが入っている、砂糖不使用のチューインガムです。一枚に濃い目の紅茶一杯分のカフェインが含まれています。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
msgid "caffeine pill"
msgid_plural "caffeine pills"
msgstr[0] "カフェイン剤"

#. ~ Description of "caffeine pill"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
msgid ""
"A No-doz brand caffeine pill, maximum strength.  Useful in pulling an all-"
"nighter, one pill is equivalent to a strong cup of coffee."
msgstr "ノードーズブランドの中で最も強いカフェイン錠剤です。1錠で濃いコーヒー1杯分の効果があり、徹夜したいときに便利です。"

#. ~ "activation_message" action message of item "caffeine pill"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
msgid "You take a caffeine pill."
msgstr "カフェイン剤を摂取しました。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
msgid "chewing tobacco"
msgid_plural "chewing tobacco"
msgstr[0] "噛みタバコ"

#. ~ Description of "chewing tobacco"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
msgid ""
"Mint-flavored chewing tobacco.  While absolutely terrible for your health, "
"it was once a favorite amongst baseball players, cowboys, and other macho "
"types."
msgstr "ミント風味の噛みタバコです。健康にとても悪い代物ですが、かつては野球選手やカウボーイなどのマッチョ野郎たちに人気がありました。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
msgid "hydrogen peroxide"
msgid_plural "hydrogen peroxide"
msgstr[0] "過酸化水素水"

#. ~ Description of "hydrogen peroxide"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
msgid ""
"Dilute hydrogen peroxide, for use as an antiseptic and for bleaching hair or"
" textiles.  Foams a little when in contact with organic matter, but "
"otherwise harmless."
msgstr "消毒、髪や織物の脱色に使える程度の濃度に調整された、過酸化水素の水溶液です。有機物に触れるとわずかに発泡しますが、危険はありません。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
msgid "skunk spray neutralizing solution"
msgid_plural "skunk spray neutralizing solution"
msgstr[0] "スカンク臭中和剤"

#. ~ Description of "skunk spray neutralizing solution"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
msgid ""
"A combination of hydrogen peroxide, baking soda, and dish soap that works "
"together to transform skunk spray thiocetates into odorless acids."
msgstr "過酸化水素水、重曹、食器用洗剤を混ぜ合わせた液体です。スカンクが放つ液体に含まれるチオアセテートを中和して無臭の酸に変える作用があります。"

#. ~ "activation_message" action message of item "skunk spray neutralizing
#. solution"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
msgid ""
"You cover yourself in the solution everywhere the spray touched your body."
msgstr "悪臭が付いた箇所に中和剤を塗りました。"

#. ~ Description of "cigarette"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
msgid ""
"A mixture of dried tobacco leaf, pesticides, and chemical additives, rolled "
"into a filtered paper tube.  Stimulates mental acuity and reduces appetite."
"  Highly addictive and hazardous to health, but lung cancer is kind of the "
"least of your concerns at this point."
msgstr ""
"乾燥させたタバコの葉と農薬、化学添加物などを混ぜ合わせ、フィルター付きの紙管で巻いたものです。精神を興奮させ、食欲を減退させる効果があります。依存性が高く、健康を害しますが、こんな状況で肺がんを気にする必要性があるのでしょうか。"

#. ~ Description of "cigar"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
msgid "Rolled, cured tobacco leaf, addictive and hazardous to health."
msgstr "乾燥させて筒状に巻いたタバコの葉です。依存性があり、健康に有害です。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
msgid "debug chloroform soaked rag"
msgid_plural "debug chloroform soaked rags"
msgstr[0] "クロロホルム布(デバッグ)"

#. ~ Description of "debug chloroform soaked rag"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
msgid "A debug item that lets you put NPCs (or yourself) to sleep."
msgstr "デバッグ専用アイテムです。NPC(もしくは自分自身)に押し当てて眠らせます。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
msgid "codeine"
msgid_plural "codeine"
msgstr[0] "コデイン"

#. ~ Description of "codeine"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
msgid ""
"A mild opiate used in the suppression of pain, cough, and other ailments.  "
"While relatively weak for a narcotic, it is still addictive, with a "
"potential for overdose."
msgstr "弱めのアヘン系麻酔剤です。痛み、咳、慢性的な疾患を和らげます。麻薬には及びませんが依存性があります。"

#. ~ "activation_message" action message of item "codeine"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
msgid "You take some codeine."
msgstr "コデインを服用しました。"

#. ~ Description of "cocaine"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
msgid ""
"Crystalline extract of the coca leaf, or at least, a white powder with some "
"of that in it.  A topical analgesic, it is more commonly used for its "
"stimulatory properties.  Highly addictive."
msgstr ""
"コカの葉から抽出される透明な結晶成分、及びそれを砕いて白い粉にしたものがコカインです。本来なら緊急時の一時的な鎮痛に使われるべき薬品ですが、刺激的な効能を目当てに使われる場合がほとんどです。強い依存性があります。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
msgid "methacola"
msgid_plural "methacola"
msgstr[0] "メスコーラ"

#. ~ Description of "methacola"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
msgid ""
"A potent cocktail of amphetamines, caffeine and corn syrup, this stuff puts "
"a spring in your step, a fire in your eye, and a bad case of tachycardia "
"tremors in your somersaulting heart."
msgstr ""
"アンフェタミン、カフェイン、コーンシロップからなる、良く効くカクテルです。踵にバネを、瞳に炎を宿らせますが、悪いケースでは頻脈や痙攣や心臓のでんぐり返しが起こります。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
msgid "myopia contact lenses (weekly)"
msgid_plural "myopia contact lenses (weekly)"
msgstr[0] "近視用1ウィークコンタクトレンズ"

#. ~ Description of "myopia contact lenses (weekly)"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
msgid ""
"Small plastic case with two extended-wear soft contact lenses, buffered in "
"saline solution.  They are a great replacement for wearing glasses and sit "
"comfortably on the surface of the eye.  The lenses are designed to help "
"anyone with <color_light_blue>nearsightedness</color>, and should be "
"discarded after <color_light_blue>a week</color> of use."
msgstr ""
"小さなプラスチック製容器内に、2枚の1週間連続装用コンタクトレンズが生理食塩水に浸かって入っています。目の表面に快適にフィットし、メガネの代わりに使えます。このレンズは<color_light_blue>近視</color>用で、<color_light_blue>1週間</color>使用したら廃棄する必要があります。"

