msgstr "殻に入ったままの一つかみ分のどんぐりです。リスの好物ですが、胃が荒れそうな非常に苦い味がします。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/comestibles/nuts.json
msgid "cooked acorns"
msgid_plural "cooked acorns"
msgstr[0] "ドングリ(調理済)"

#. ~ Description of "cooked acorns"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/nuts.json
msgid ""
"A serving of acorns that have been hulled, chopped, and boiled in water "
"before being thoroughly toasted until dry.  Filling and nutritious."
msgstr "調理したドングリです。殻を剥き、割って、一度茹でてから乾かしてこんがりと焼いてあります。腹持ちがよく栄養豊富です。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/comestibles/nuts.json
msgid "roasted acorns"
msgid_plural "roasted acorns"
msgstr[0] "ドングリ(乾煎)"

#. ~ Description of "roasted acorns"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/nuts.json
msgid "A handful of roasted nuts from an oak tree."
msgstr "オークの木から採取したドングリを炙ったものです。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/comestibles/nuts.json
msgid "blanched acorns"
msgid_plural "blanched acorns"
msgstr[0] "ドングリ(水漬)"

#. ~ Description of "blanched acorns"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/nuts.json
msgid ""
"A handful of mushy blanched acorns.  No longer bitter, but not pleasant to "
"eat in this state."
msgstr "水にさらしてふやけたドングリです。苦味は消えましたが、そのまま食べても美味しくありません。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/comestibles/nuts.json
msgid "blanching acorns"
msgid_plural "blanching acorns"
msgstr[0] "ドングリ(浸漬中)"

#. ~ Description of "blanching acorns"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/nuts.json
msgid ""
"A mix of water and hulled acorns, slowly leaching the tannins.  It'll take "
"about a week before they're palatable."
msgstr "ドングリを殻ごと水に浸し、タンニンをゆっくりと抜いています。食べられる状態になるまで約1週間かかります。"

#. ~ "msg" action message of item "blanching acorns"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/nuts.json
msgid ""
"After a week of changing water and taste-testing, the acorns are no longer "
"bitter and ready to decant."
msgstr "定期的に水を変えながら1週間ほど水に浸けていると、ドングリの苦みが消えました。"

#. ~ "not_ready_msg" action message of item "blanching acorns"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/nuts.json
msgid "The acorns are still bitter."
msgstr "ドングリはまだ苦そうです。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/comestibles/offal_dishes.json
msgid "faux gras"
msgid_plural "faux gras"
msgstr[0] "フォアグラ"

#. ~ Description of "faux gras"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/offal_dishes.json
msgid ""
"Though this meal is technically not foie gras, you have a feeling neither "
"the French nor animal rights groups are likely to criticize it now."
msgstr "厳密に言えばフォアグラではありませんが、この状況ではフランス人や動物愛護団体から文句を言われることもありません。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/comestibles/offal_dishes.json
msgid "liver & onions"
msgid_plural "liver & onions"
msgstr[0] "レバー&オニオン"

#. ~ Description of "liver & onions"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/offal_dishes.json
msgid "A classic way to serve liver."
msgstr "肝臓を使った古典的な料理です。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/comestibles/offal_dishes.json
msgid "fried liver"
msgid_plural "fried liver"
msgstr[0] "フライドレバー"

#. ~ Description of "fried liver"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/offal_dishes.json
msgid "Tasty deep-fried liver, a Southern delicacy."
msgstr "南部名物、美味しく揚げたレバーです。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/comestibles/offal_dishes.json
msgid "humble pie"
msgid_plural "humble pies"
msgstr[0] "粗製パイ"

#. ~ Description of "humble pie"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/offal_dishes.json
msgid ""
"Also known as 'Umble' pie, made with chopped organ meats.  Not half bad, and"
" full of vitamins!"
msgstr "内臓を刻んで作るので「内臓パイ」とも呼ばれています。結構美味しく、栄養素も豊富です！"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/comestibles/offal_dishes.json
msgid "stewed tripe"
msgid_plural "stewed tripe"
msgstr[0] "トライプシチュー"

#. ~ Description of "stewed tripe"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/offal_dishes.json
msgid ""
"Stomach lining, cut up and stewed for an hour in broth.  Better than it "
"sounds."
msgstr "胃袋を切り刻み、スープに入れてじっくり煮込んだ、想像以上に美味しい料理です。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/comestibles/offal_dishes.json
msgid "deep-fried tripe"
msgid_plural "deep-fried tripe"
msgstr[0] "フライドトライプ"

#. ~ Description of "deep-fried tripe"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/offal_dishes.json
msgid ""
"Some people don't enjoy the taste or texture of organ meat, so deep-frying "
"is a great way to disguise both."
msgstr "内臓の味や食感が苦手な人はそこそこいますが、揚げることで味も食感も誤魔化せます。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/comestibles/offal_dishes.json
msgid "leverpostej"
msgid_plural "leverpostej"
msgstr[0] "レバーパテ"

#. ~ Description of "leverpostej"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/offal_dishes.json
msgid ""
"A traditional Danish pate.  Probably better if you spread it on some bread."
msgstr "デンマークの伝統食材です。パンに塗って食べると良さそうです。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/comestibles/offal_dishes.json
msgid "fried brain"
msgid_plural "fried brain"
msgstr[0] "フライドブレイン"

#. ~ Description of "fried brain"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/offal_dishes.json
msgid ""
"I don't know what you were expecting.  It's brain.  It's deep-fried.  Enjoy!"
msgstr "どんな料理を期待していたのか知りませんが、これは単なる揚げた脳みそです。召し上がれ！"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/comestibles/offal_dishes.json
msgid "deviled kidney"
msgid_plural "deviled kidney"
msgstr[0] "デビルドキドニー"

#. ~ Description of "deviled kidney"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/offal_dishes.json
msgid ""
"A delicious way to prepare kidneys, originating from Victorian England.  You"
" had to make some substitutions in the devilling sauce, but it still came "
"out damn good."
msgstr ""
"ヴィクトリア朝時代のイギリスで生まれた、腎臓を美味しく食べるための料理です。ソースの材料は代用品で済ませましたが、それでもかなりの美味しさです。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/comestibles/offal_dishes.json
msgid "grilled sweetbread"
msgid_plural "grilled sweetbread"
msgstr[0] "膵臓焼き"

#. ~ Description of "grilled sweetbread"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/offal_dishes.json
msgid "Not sweet like the name would suggest, but delicious all the same!"
msgstr "\"sweetbread\"という名前の割に甘くありませんが、美味しいことは確かです！"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/comestibles/offal_dishes.json
msgid "canned liver"
msgid_plural "canned liver"
msgstr[0] "肝臓(保存食)"

#. ~ Description of "canned liver"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/offal_dishes.json
msgid "Livers preserved in a can.  Chock-full of B vitamins!"
msgstr "缶詰に保存した肝臓です。ビタミンBがぎっしり詰まっています！"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/comestibles/offal_dishes.json
msgid "lung provence"
msgid_plural "lung provence"
msgstr[0] "肺のプロヴァンス風"

#. ~ Description of "lung provence"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/offal_dishes.json
msgid ""
"A French lung dish, made by poaching the lungs before pan-frying them with "
"onion, tomato, seasonings, and a generous amount of wine."
msgstr "茹でた肺をタマネギ、トマト、調味料、たっぷりのワインと共に炒めたフランス料理です。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/comestibles/offal_dishes.json
msgid "töttchen"
msgid_plural "töttchen"
msgstr[0] "トットヒェン"

#. ~ Description of "töttchen"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/offal_dishes.json
msgid ""
"A German peasant dish that converts many less-desirable meat cuts and organs"
" into a palatable meal with the liberal application of butter, sugar, and "
"wine."
msgstr "それほど美味しくない肉や内臓を大量のバター、砂糖、ワインで調理して食べやすくした、ドイツの農民料理です。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/comestibles/offal_dishes.json
msgid "scrambled eggs and brain"
msgid_plural "scrambled eggs and brain"
msgstr[0] "脳入りスクランブルエッグ"

#. ~ Description of "scrambled eggs and brain"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/offal_dishes.json
msgid "Brain and eggs, why didn't you ever think to put these together?"
msgstr "脳と卵、この二つを混ぜようという発想がどうして今まで浮かばなかったのでしょう？"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/comestibles/offal_dishes.json
msgid "sausage casing"
msgid_plural "sausage casings"
msgstr[0] "ケーシング"

#. ~ Description of "sausage casing"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/offal_dishes.json
msgid ""
"Sausage casings made from animal intestines.  Ready to be used for forming "
"meat products."
msgstr "動物の腸から作られた、ソーセージ用のケーシングです。すぐに食肉加工品を作れる状態になっています。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/comestibles/offal_dishes.json
msgid "artificial sausage casing"
msgid_plural "artificial sausage casings"
msgstr[0] "人工ケーシング"

#. ~ Description of "artificial sausage casing"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/offal_dishes.json
msgid ""
"Sausage casings made from plastic bags.  Ready to be used for forming meat "
"products."
msgstr "ビニール製のソーセージ用ケーシングです。すぐに食肉加工品を作れる状態になっています。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/comestibles/offal_dishes.json
msgid "homemade hot dog"
msgid_plural "homemade hot dogs"
msgstr[0] "自家製フランクフルト(未調理)"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/comestibles/other.json
msgid "dried bottle gourd"
msgid_plural "dried bottle gourds"
msgstr[0] "ヒョウタン(乾燥)"

#. ~ Description of "dried bottle gourd"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/other.json
msgid ""
"A vegetable from the gourd family, bottle gourds were brought to the "
"Americas by the first Native American settlers crossing the Bering strait.  "
"This one has been dried for processing into a watertight container."
msgstr ""
"ベーリング海峡を渡った最初のネイティブアメリカンによってアメリカ大陸に持ち込まれた、ウリ科の植物の実です。乾燥しており、密閉容器に加工できます。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/comestibles/other.json
#: data/mods/My_Sweet_Cataclysm/sweet_comestibles.json
msgid "chewing gum"
msgid_plural "chewing gums"
msgstr[0] "ガム"

#. ~ Description of "chewing gum"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/other.json
msgid "Sugar-free chewing gum."
msgstr "砂糖不使用のチューインガムです。"

#. ~ Variant name of item "chewing gum"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/other.json
msgid "chewing gum, peppermint flavored"
msgid_plural "chewing gum, peppermint flavored"
msgstr[0] "ガム(ﾍﾟﾊﾟｰﾐﾝﾄ)"

#. ~ Description of variant "chewing gum, peppermint flavored" of item
#. "chewing gum"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/other.json
msgid ""
"The classic of classics, a flavor that provides a fresh and invigorating "
"sensation in the mouth, as well as freshening breath."
msgstr "基本中の基本、口の中を新鮮で心地よい風味で満たし息を爽やかにするフレーバーのチューインガムです。"

#. ~ Variant name of item "chewing gum"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/other.json
msgid "chewing gum, spearmint flavored"
msgid_plural "chewing gum, spearmint flavored"
msgstr[0] "ガム(ｽﾍﾟｱﾐﾝﾄ)"

#. ~ Description of variant "chewing gum, spearmint flavored" of item "chewing
#. gum"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/other.json
msgid ""
"Spearmint is a slightly sweeter and milder version of peppermint, providing "
"a fresher taste and is also good for freshening breath."
msgstr "ペパーミントより少し甘くマイルドなスペアミントフレーバーのチューインガムです。口の中と息がより爽やかになります。"

#. ~ Variant name of item "chewing gum"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/other.json
msgid "chewing gum, wintergreen flavored"
msgid_plural "chewing gum, wintergreen flavored"
msgstr[0] "ガム(ｳｨﾝﾀｰｸﾞﾘｰﾝ)"

#. ~ Description of variant "chewing gum, wintergreen flavored" of item
#. "chewing gum"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/other.json
msgid ""
"Wintergreen has a cool and refreshing taste, similar to mint, but with a "
"slightly sweeter flavor."
msgstr "ミントに似た清涼感と爽やかな風味がありますが、ミントより少し甘いウィンターグリーンフレーバーのチューインガムです。"

#. ~ Variant name of item "chewing gum"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/other.json
msgid "chewing gum, cinnamon flavored"
msgid_plural "chewing gum, cinnamon flavored"
msgstr[0] "ガム(ｼﾅﾓﾝ)"

#. ~ Description of variant "chewing gum, cinnamon flavored" of item "chewing
#. gum"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/other.json
msgid ""
"Cinnamon is a spicy, bold flavor that's great for clearing the sinuses and "
"providing a burst of flavor."
msgstr "辛味の強いシナモンフレーバーのチューインガムです。副鼻腔をスッキリさせ、口いっぱいに風味を満たすのに最適です。"

#. ~ Variant name of item "chewing gum"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/other.json
msgid "chewing gum, bubblegum flavored"
msgid_plural "chewing gum, bubblegum flavored"
msgstr[0] "ガム(ﾊﾞﾌﾞﾙｶﾞﾑ)"

#. ~ Description of variant "chewing gum, bubblegum flavored" of item "chewing
#. gum"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/other.json
msgid ""
"Bubblegum is a nostalgic flavor that's reminiscent of the classic pink "
"bubblegum flavor that kids love.  It's basically a combination of various "
"flavors."
msgstr "子供が大好きな昔ながらのピンク色のガムを思い出させる、懐かしいフレーバーのチューインガムです。様々な風味が混ざり合った味がします。"

#. ~ Variant name of item "chewing gum"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/other.json
msgid "chewing gum, mixed-berry flavored"
msgid_plural "chewing gum, mixed-berry flavored"
msgstr[0] "ガム(ﾐｯｸｽﾍﾞﾘｰ)"

#. ~ Description of variant "chewing gum, mixed-berry flavored" of item
#. "chewing gum"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/other.json
msgid ""
"This flavor is a combination of different berries that provides a fruity, "
"sweet, and tart taste."
msgstr "様々なベリーを組み合わせたフレーバーのチューインガムです。フルーティーな甘酸っぱい風味を味わえます。"

#. ~ Variant name of item "chewing gum"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/other.json
msgid "chewing gum, strawberry flavored"
msgid_plural "chewing gum, strawberry flavored"
msgstr[0] "ガム(ｲﾁｺﾞ)"

#. ~ Description of variant "chewing gum, strawberry flavored" of item
#. "chewing gum"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/other.json
msgid ""
"This strawberry-flavored chewing gum offers a sweet and juicy taste, "
"reminiscent of fresh strawberries."
msgstr "新鮮なイチゴを思わせる、甘くてジューシーなイチゴ味のチューインガムです。"

#. ~ Variant name of item "chewing gum"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/other.json
msgid "chewing gum, cherry flavored"
msgid_plural "chewing gum, cherry flavored"
msgstr[0] "ガム(ﾁｪﾘｰ)"

#. ~ Description of variant "chewing gum, cherry flavored" of item "chewing
#. gum"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/other.json
msgid ""
"This cherry-flavored chewing gum is both sweet and tart, with a delicious "
"fruity flavor."
msgstr "フルーティーで甘酸っぱい風味が美味しいチェリー味のチューインガムです。"

#. ~ Variant name of item "chewing gum"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/other.json
msgid "chewing gum, grape flavored"
msgid_plural "chewing gum, grape flavored"
msgstr[0] "ガム(ﾌﾞﾄﾞｳ)"

#. ~ Description of variant "chewing gum, grape flavored" of item "chewing
#. gum"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/other.json
msgid ""
"This grape-flavored chewing gum is fruity and sweet, with a juicy grape "
"flavor."
msgstr "ジューシーなブドウの風味が楽しめる、フルーティーで甘いブドウ味のチューインガムです。"

#. ~ Variant name of item "chewing gum"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/other.json
msgid "chewing gum, orange flavored"
msgid_plural "chewing gum, orange flavored"
msgstr[0] "ガム(ｵﾚﾝｼﾞ)"

#. ~ Description of variant "chewing gum, orange flavored" of item "chewing
#. gum"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/other.json
msgid ""
"This orange-flavored chewing gum provides a fresh and fruity taste, like "
"biting into a juicy orange."
msgstr "瑞々しいオレンジの果肉にかぶりついたような、新鮮でフルーティーな味が楽しめるオレンジ味のチューインガムです。"

#. ~ Variant name of item "chewing gum"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/other.json
msgid "chewing gum, watermelon flavored"
msgid_plural "chewing gum, watermelon flavored"
msgstr[0] "ガム(ｽｲｶ)"

#. ~ Description of variant "chewing gum, watermelon flavored" of item
#. "chewing gum"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/other.json
msgid ""
"This watermelon-flavored chewing gum has a sweet and fruity flavor, perfect "
"for summertime."
msgstr "夏にぴったりの、甘くフルーティーなスイカ味のチューインガムです。"

#. ~ Variant name of item "chewing gum"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/other.json
msgid "chewing gum, blueberry flavored"
msgid_plural "chewing gum, blueberry flavored"
msgstr[0] "ガム(ﾌﾞﾙｰﾍﾞﾘｰ)"

#. ~ Description of variant "chewing gum, blueberry flavored" of item "chewing
#. gum"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/other.json
msgid ""
"This blueberry-flavored chewing gum has a fruity, tangy flavor with a "
"slightly sweet taste."
msgstr "フルーティーで香りが強く、ほんのり甘いブルーベリー味のチューインガムです。"

#. ~ Variant name of item "chewing gum"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/other.json
msgid "chewing gum, cranberry flavored"
msgid_plural "chewing gum, cranberry flavored"
msgstr[0] "ガム(ｸﾗﾝﾍﾞﾘｰ)"

#. ~ Description of variant "chewing gum, cranberry flavored" of item "chewing
#. gum"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/other.json
msgid ""
"This cranberry-flavored chewing gum offers a slight bitterness along with "
"its unique and tangy taste."
msgstr "ほろ苦さと独特の強い香りが特徴のクランベリー味のチューインガムです。"

#. ~ Variant name of item "chewing gum"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/other.json
msgid "chewing gum, pineapple flavored"
msgid_plural "chewing gum, pineapple flavored"
msgstr[0] "ガム(ﾊﾟｲﾅｯﾌﾟﾙ)"

#. ~ Description of variant "chewing gum, pineapple flavored" of item "chewing
#. gum"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/other.json
msgid ""
"This pineapple-flavored chewing gum has a sweet and tangy taste, perfect for"
" those looking for a tropical twist."
msgstr "甘く香りの強いパイナップル味のチューインガムは、南国の雰囲気を味わいたい人に最適です。"

#. ~ Variant name of item "chewing gum"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/other.json
msgid "chewing gum, green apple flavored"
msgid_plural "chewing gum, green apple flavored"
msgstr[0] "ガム(青ﾘﾝｺﾞ)"

#. ~ Description of variant "chewing gum, green apple flavored" of item
#. "chewing gum"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/other.json
msgid ""
"This green apple-flavored gum is crisp and refreshing, with a slightly sour "
"and sweet taste, more sour and sweet than the regular apple-flavored one."
msgstr "一般的なリンゴ味よりも酸味と甘味が強く、新鮮で爽やかな甘酸っぱさを味わえる、青リンゴフレーバーのチューインガムです。"

#. ~ Variant name of item "chewing gum"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/other.json
msgid "chewing gum, apple flavored"
msgid_plural "chewing gum, apple flavored"
msgstr[0] "ガム(ﾘﾝｺﾞ)"

#. ~ Description of variant "chewing gum, apple flavored" of item "chewing
#. gum"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/other.json
msgid ""
"This apple-flavored gum is both crisp and refreshing, with a slightly sweet "
"and sour taste."
msgstr "新鮮で爽やかな、ほんのり甘酸っぱいリンゴ味のチューインガムです。"

#. ~ Variant name of item "chewing gum"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/other.json
msgid "chewing gum, mango flavored"
msgid_plural "chewing gum, mango flavored"
msgstr[0] "ガム(ﾏﾝｺﾞｰ)"

#. ~ Description of variant "chewing gum, mango flavored" of item "chewing
#. gum"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/other.json
msgid ""
"This uncommon mango-flavored chewing gum has a sweet, tropical taste, "
"reminiscent of fresh mangos."
msgstr "新鮮なマンゴーを思わせる、甘くてトロピカルな珍しいマンゴー味のチューインガムです。"

#. ~ Variant name of item "chewing gum"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/other.json
msgid "chewing gum, mint chocolate chip flavored"
msgid_plural "chewing gum, mint chocolate chip flavored"
msgstr[0] "ガム(ﾁｮｺﾐﾝﾄ)"

#. ~ Description of variant "chewing gum, mint chocolate chip flavored" of
#. item "chewing gum"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/other.json
msgid ""
"Mint chocolate chip is a cross between a mint and chocolate flavor, offering"
" a sweet and slightly creamy taste."
msgstr "チョコミントのチップが入っているチューインガムです。チョコとミントが混ざり合った甘くてほんのりクリーミーな風味を楽しめます。"

#. ~ Variant name of item "chewing gum"
