msgid_plural "bananas"
msgstr[0] "バナナ"

#. ~ Description of "banana"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/raw_fruit.json
msgid ""
"A long, curved yellow fruit in a peel.  Some people like using them in "
"desserts.  Those people are probably dead."
msgstr ""
"長い皮で覆われた歪曲した黄色の果物です。一部の人々はデザートに使用します。しかし、デザートを作るような人々は恐らくは死に絶えているでしょうね。"

#. ~ Item name
#. ~ Plant name of seed "orange vines"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/raw_fruit.json
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/seed.json
msgid "orange"
msgid_plural "oranges"
msgstr[0] "オレンジ"

#. ~ Description of "orange"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/raw_fruit.json
msgid ""
"A sweet citrus fruit.  Also comes in juice form.  In case you were "
"wondering, the color is named after the fruit, not the other way around."
msgstr "ジュースとしてもよく飲まれている、甘い柑橘類です。ちなみに、オレンジ色という名前はこの果物の名前が由来であり、逆ではありません。"

#. ~ Item name
#. ~ Plant name of seed "lemon vines"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/raw_fruit.json
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/seed.json
msgid "lemon"
msgid_plural "lemons"
msgstr[0] "レモン"

#. ~ Description of "lemon"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/raw_fruit.json
msgid ""
"A very sour citrus fruit.  Can be eaten if you're desperate, but you should "
"probably look for some other cooking application for this."
msgstr "非常に酸っぱい柑橘類です。どうしても食べたいなら止めませんが、普通は何か他の料理の材料として使うものです。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/comestibles/raw_fruit.json
msgid "handful of blueberries"
msgid_plural "handfuls of blueberries"
msgstr[0] "ブルーベリー"

#. ~ Description of "handful of blueberries"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/raw_fruit.json
msgid ""
"A handful of tasty sweet-tart berries.  They're blue, but that doesn't mean "
"they're sad."
msgstr "一握りの甘酸っぱくて美味しいベリーです。真っ青ですが、別に悲しんでいる訳ではありません。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/comestibles/raw_fruit.json
msgid "handful of strawberries"
msgid_plural "handfuls of strawberries"
msgstr[0] "イチゴ"

#. ~ Description of "handful of strawberries"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/raw_fruit.json
msgid ""
"A handful of tasty, juicy red berries with visible seeds on the outside of "
"the skin.  Often found growing wild in fields."
msgstr "実の外側に種が付いている、一握りの美味しくてジューシーな赤いベリーです。平野によく自生しています。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/comestibles/raw_fruit.json
