msgid_plural "Mirkwood soup"
msgstr[0] "森のスープ(変異肉)"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/comestibles/soup.json
msgid "woods egg soup"
msgid_plural "woods egg soup"
msgstr[0] "森のスープ(卵)"

#. ~ Description of "woods egg soup"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/soup.json
msgid "A nutritious and delicious soup packed with eggs and vegetables."
msgstr "卵と野菜がたっぷり入った、栄養満点の美味しいスープです。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/comestibles/soup.json
msgid "hellfire stew"
msgid_plural "hellfire stew"
msgstr[0] "ヘルファイアシチュー"

#. ~ Description of "hellfire stew"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/soup.json
msgid ""
"An old recipe from the American Civil War, designed to make hardtack more "
"palatable.  The hardtack is crushed and combined with water to make it "
"soggy, then fried up with melted chunks of fat until browned, and seasoned "
"with salt and pepper.  Surprisingly edible, considering its ingredients."
msgstr ""
"南北戦争時代のアメリカで生まれた、堅パンを食べやすくするための歴史あるレシピです。まず堅パンを砕き、水を加えてドロドロにします。そこへ溶かした脂肪を混ぜて焼き色が付くまで熱し、塩とコショウで味を調えて完成です。使った材料にしては、それなりに食べられる味がします。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/comestibles/soup.json
msgid "chicken noodle soup"
msgid_plural "chicken noodle soup"
msgstr[0] "チキンヌードル"

#. ~ Description of "chicken noodle soup"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/soup.json
msgid ""
"Chicken chunks and noodles swimming in a salty broth.  Rumored to help cure "
"colds."
msgstr "塩気のある煮汁に鶏肉と麺が入っています。風邪を治す効果があるという噂がありますね。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/comestibles/soup.json
msgid "mushroom soup"
msgid_plural "mushroom soup"
msgstr[0] "キノコスープ"

#. ~ Description of "mushroom soup"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/soup.json
msgid "A mushy, gray semi-liquid soup made from mushrooms."
msgstr "キノコで作った、とろみのある灰色のスープです。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/comestibles/soup.json
msgid "blood soup"
msgid_plural "blood soup"
msgstr[0] "ブラッドスープ"

#. ~ Description of "blood soup"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/soup.json
msgid "A mushy, brown semi-liquid soup made from blood and flour."
msgstr "血液と小麦粉で作った、とろみのある茶色いスープです。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/comestibles/soup.json
msgid "tomato soup"
msgid_plural "tomato soup"
msgstr[0] "トマトスープ"

#. ~ Description of "tomato soup"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/soup.json
msgid ""
"Condensed tomato soup.  Not very filling, but it goes well with grilled "
"cheese."
msgstr "濃いトマトスープです。あまり食べ応えはありませんが、焼いたチーズによく合います。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/comestibles/soup.json
msgid "chicken and dumplings"
msgid_plural "chicken and dumplings"
msgstr[0] "チキン&ダンプリング"

#. ~ Description of "chicken and dumplings"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/soup.json
msgid "A soup with chicken chunks and balls of dough.  Not bad."
msgstr "鶏肉の団子と穀粉の団子が入ったスープです。悪くありません。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/comestibles/soup.json
msgid "Cullen skink"
msgid_plural "Cullen skink"
msgstr[0] "カレンスキンク"

#. ~ Description of "Cullen skink"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/soup.json
msgid ""
"A rich and tasty fish chowder from Scotland, made with preserved fish and "
"creamy milk."
msgstr "スコットランドの伝統料理、贅沢で美味しい魚のチャウダーです。塩漬けの魚とクリーミーな牛乳を使っています。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/comestibles/soup.json
msgid "lobster stew"
msgid_plural "lobster stew"
msgstr[0] "ロブスターシチュー"

#. ~ Description of "lobster stew"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/soup.json
msgid ""
"A rich and tasty lobster stew from New England, made with fresh lobster, "
"milk, cream, and butter."
msgstr "新鮮なロブスターと牛乳、生クリーム、バターで作る、ニューイングランド地方名物の濃厚なシチューです。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/comestibles/soup.json
msgid "instant chicken noodle soup"
msgid_plural "instant chicken noodle soup"
msgstr[0] "即席チキンヌードル(調理済)"

#. ~ Description of "instant chicken noodle soup"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/soup.json
msgid ""
"Instant chicken noodle soup made from dehydrated noodles and chicken "
"reconstituted with water.  Not the most exciting meal but better than plain "
"water."
msgstr "乾燥させた麺と鶏肉を水でもどして作った、即席品のチキンヌードルです。豪華な食事とは言えませんが、ただの水で腹を満たすよりはマシです。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/comestibles/soup.json
msgid "instant chicken noodle soup powder"
msgid_plural "instant chicken noodle soup powder"
msgstr[0] "即席チキンヌードル(未調理)"

#. ~ Description of "instant chicken noodle soup powder"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/soup.json
msgid ""
"Instant chicken noodle soup powder made from dehydrated noodles and chicken."
"  Mix with water to create a mildly improved meal."
msgstr "脱水した麺と鶏肉が入っている、即席品のチキンヌードルです。水分を加えれば、多少は食べやすくなります。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/comestibles/soup.json
msgid "instant spring vegetable soup"
msgid_plural "instant spring vegetable soup"
msgstr[0] "即席春野菜ヌードル(調理済)"

#. ~ Description of "instant spring vegetable soup"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/soup.json
msgid ""
"Instant spring vegetable soup made from dehydrated noodles and vegetables "
"reconstituted with water.  Not the most exciting meal but better than plain "
"water."
msgstr "乾燥させた麺と野菜を水でもどして作った、即席品の春野菜ヌードルです。豪華な食事とは言えませんが、ただの水で腹を満たすよりはマシです。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/comestibles/soup.json
msgid "instant spring vegetable soup powder"
msgid_plural "instant spring vegetable soup powder"
msgstr[0] "即席春野菜ヌードル(未調理)"

#. ~ Description of "instant spring vegetable soup powder"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/soup.json
msgid ""
"Instant spring vegetable soup powder made from dehydrated noodles and "
"vegetables.  Mix with water to create a mildly improved meal."
msgstr "脱水した麺と野菜が入っている、即席品の春野菜ヌードルです。水分を加えれば、多少は食べやすくなります。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/comestibles/soup.json
msgid "coq au vin"
msgid_plural "coq au vin"
msgstr[0] "鳥肉のワイン煮"

#. ~ Description of "coq au vin"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/soup.json
msgid "French chicken stew braised with red wine."
msgstr "ワインで煮込んだフランス風チキンシチューです。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/comestibles/spice.json
msgid "chili powder"
msgid_plural "chili powder"
msgstr[0] "チリパウダー"

#. ~ Description of "chili powder"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/spice.json
msgid ""
"Chili P, yo!  Not edible on its own, but it could be used to make seasoning."
msgstr "チリパウダー、ヨー！そのままでは食べられませんが、調味料として使えそうです。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/comestibles/spice.json
msgid "garlic powder"
msgid_plural "garlic powder"
msgstr[0] "ガーリックパウダー"

#. ~ Description of "garlic powder"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/spice.json
msgid ""
"Garlic that has been dehydrated and ground into a powder.  A must-have "
"seasoning in any pantry."
msgstr "脱水したニンニクを粉末にした調味料です。キッチンに一つは常備したいですね。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/comestibles/spice.json
msgid "hot sauce"
msgid_plural "hot sauce"
msgstr[0] "ホットソース"

#. ~ Description of "hot sauce"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/spice.json
msgid ""
"Flamin' hot sauce.  It'd be a bad idea to drink it on its own.  You should "
"probably wash your hands after handling it, too."
msgstr "激辛ホットソースです。そのまま飲むのは止めておきましょう。使った後は手を洗いましょう。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/comestibles/spice.json
msgid "cinnamon"
msgid_plural "cinnamon"
msgstr[0] "シナモン"

#. ~ Description of "cinnamon"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/spice.json
msgid "Ground cinnamon bark with a sweet but slightly spicy aroma."
msgstr "挽いた桂皮に甘くてちょっとだけスパイシーな香りを添えて。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/comestibles/spice.json
msgid "curry powder"
msgid_plural "curry powder"
msgstr[0] "カレー粉"

#. ~ Description of "curry powder"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/spice.json
msgid ""
"A blend of spices meant to be used in some South Asian dishes.  Can't be "
"eaten raw, why would you even try that?"
msgstr "南アジアの伝統料理に使われるブレンド香辛料です。このままでは食べられません。食べられると思ったんですか？"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/comestibles/spice.json
msgid "black pepper"
msgid_plural "black pepper"
msgstr[0] "黒胡椒"

#. ~ Description of "black pepper"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/spice.json
msgid "Ground black spice berries with a pungent aroma."
msgstr "黒い実を挽いて作る香辛料です。刺激的な香りがします。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/comestibles/spice.json
#: data/mods/BombasticPerks/perkdata/absit_invidia.json
msgid "salt"
msgid_plural "salt"
msgstr[0] "塩"

#. ~ Description of "salt"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/spice.json
msgid ""
"Yuck!  You surely wouldn't want to eat this.  It's good for preserving meat "
"and cooking, though."
msgstr "塩です。このまま食べるものではありません。肉の保存性を上げたり、料理に使ったりするための調味料です。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/comestibles/spice.json
msgid "Italian seasoning"
msgid_plural "Italian seasoning"
msgstr[0] "イタリアンスパイス"

#. ~ Description of "Italian seasoning"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/spice.json
msgid "A fragrant mix of dried oregano, basil, thyme and other spices."
msgstr "乾燥させたオレガノやバジル、タイム、その他の香辛料を混ぜた香り豊かなスパイスです。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/comestibles/spice.json
msgid "seasoned salt"
msgid_plural "seasoned salt"
msgstr[0] "調味塩"

#. ~ Description of "seasoned salt"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/spice.json
msgid "Salt mixed with a fragrant blend of secret herbs and spices."
msgstr "香辛料と秘密のハーブをブレンドした香り豊かな塩です。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/comestibles/spice.json
#: data/mods/My_Sweet_Cataclysm/sweet_items.json
msgid "sugar"
msgid_plural "sugar"
msgstr[0] "砂糖"

#. ~ Description of "sugar"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/spice.json
#: data/mods/My_Sweet_Cataclysm/sweet_items.json
msgid ""
"Sweet, sweet sugar.  Bad for your teeth and surprisingly not very tasty on "
"its own."
msgstr "とても甘い砂糖です。非常に歯に悪い上に、砂糖単体では驚くほど美味しくありません。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/comestibles/spice.json
msgid "sprinkles"
msgid_plural "sprinkles"
msgstr[0] "スプリンクル"

#. ~ Description of "sprinkles"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/spice.json
msgid ""
"Known as nonpareils, sprinkles, jimmies, sugar strands or 'hundreds-and-"
"thousands', these colorful balls, rods or flakes of sugar and starch are "
"intended for use decorating soft surfaces of sweets.  Like sugar, they are "
"bad for your teeth and surprisingly not very tasty on their own."
msgstr ""
"ノンパレル "
"、スプリンクル、ジミー、シュガーストランド、「ハンドレッド&サウザンド」などの呼び名がある色鮮やかな丸い粒、縦長の粒、砂糖やデンプンの薄片です。菓子などの柔らかい食品の表面を飾り付けるために使われます。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/comestibles/spice.json
msgid "wild herbs"
msgid_plural "wild herbs"
msgstr[0] "野草"

#. ~ Description of "wild herbs"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/spice.json
msgid ""
"A tasty collection of wild herbs including violet, sassafras, mint, clover, "
"purslane, and fireweed."
msgstr "スミレにサッサフラス、ミントにクローバー、スベリヒユにヤナギランといった食べられる野生植物を摘んだものです。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/comestibles/spice.json
msgid "soy sauce"
msgid_plural "soy sauce"
msgstr[0] "醤油"

#. ~ Description of "soy sauce"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/spice.json
msgid "Salty fermented soybean sauce."
msgstr "大豆を発酵させて作る液体調味料です。"

#. ~ Description of "thyme"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/spice.json
msgid "A stalk of thyme.  Smells delicious."
msgstr "タイムの茎です。美味しそうな芳香を放っています。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/comestibles/spice.json
msgid "mustard powder"
msgid_plural "mustard powder"
msgstr[0] "マスタードパウダー"

#. ~ Description of "mustard powder"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/spice.json
msgid "A fragrant yellow powder.  Not edible in this form."
msgstr "香りのよい黄色の粉末です。そのままでは食べられません。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/comestibles/spice.json
msgid "artificial sweetener"
msgid_plural "artificial sweetener"
msgstr[0] "人工甘味料"

#. ~ Description of "artificial sweetener"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/spice.json
msgid ""
"Sweet, sweet sugar?  No, it is bitter-sweet artificial sweetener.  No "
"calories, no worries."
msgstr "甘い甘い砂糖でしょうか？いいえ、ほろ苦い人工甘味料です。カロリーも、不安要素もありません。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/comestibles/veggy_dishes.json
msgid "cooked cattail stalk"
msgid_plural "cooked cattail stalks"
msgstr[0] "ガマの茎(調理済)"

#. ~ Description of "cooked cattail stalk"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/veggy_dishes.json
msgid ""
"A cooked stalk from a cattail plant.  Its fibrous outer leaves have been "
"stripped away, and now it is quite delicious."
msgstr "加熱調理されたガマの茎です。繊維質の外皮が剥がれ落ち、美味しく食べられる状態になりました。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/comestibles/veggy_dishes.json
msgid "cooked plant stalk"
msgid_plural "cooked plant stalks"
msgstr[0] "植物茎(調理済)"

#. ~ Description of "cooked plant stalk"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/veggy_dishes.json
msgid ""
"A cooked stalk from a plant.  Its fibrous outer leaves have been stripped "
"away, and now it is quite delicious."
msgstr "加熱調理された植物の茎です。繊維質の外皮が剥がれ落ち、美味しく食べられる状態になりました。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/comestibles/veggy_dishes.json
msgid "roasted cattail rhizome"
msgid_plural "roasted cattail rhizomes"
msgstr[0] "ガマの根茎(乾煎)"

#. ~ Description of "roasted cattail rhizome"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/veggy_dishes.json
msgid ""
"A roasted root from a cattail plant.  Its fibrous outer core is charred "
"black, so you can remove it and chew on the dry inside."
msgstr "炙ったガマの根茎です。黒焦げになった繊維質の外皮を剥がし、乾燥した軸をかじって食べましょう。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/comestibles/veggy_dishes.json
msgid "starch"
msgid_plural "starch"
msgstr[0] "デンプン"

#. ~ Description of "starch"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/veggy_dishes.json
msgid ""
"Sticky, gooey carbohydrate paste extracted from plants.  Spoils rather "
"quickly if not prepared for storage."
msgstr "植物から抽出した、べとつく炭水化物のペーストです。腐敗が速く保存には向きません。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/comestibles/veggy_dishes.json
msgid "roasted garlic"
msgid_plural "roasted garlic"
msgstr[0] "ニンニク(調理済)"

#. ~ Description of "roasted garlic"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/veggy_dishes.json
msgid ""
"Exposed cloves of garlic that have been coated in oil and then roasted.  "
"Much better than eating them raw."
msgstr "ニンニクの小鱗茎に油を塗して炒めたものです。生よりずっと美味しく食べられます。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/comestibles/veggy_dishes.json
msgid "roasted chili pepper"
msgid_plural "roasted chili peppers"
msgstr[0] "トウガラシ(乾煎)"

#. ~ Description of "roasted chili pepper"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/veggy_dishes.json
msgid ""
"A chili pepper that has been roasted on high heat, with the skin removed.  "
"This has taken out most of the spice, and it's much better than eating it "
"raw."
msgstr "強火で炒めて薄皮を剥いだトウガラシです。辛さは弱まっており、生で食べるよりはるかに美味しいです。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/comestibles/veggy_dishes.json
msgid "cooked dandelion greens"
msgid_plural "cooked dandelion greens"
msgstr[0] "タンポポの葉(調理済)"

#. ~ Description of "cooked dandelion greens"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/veggy_dishes.json
msgid "Cooked leaves from wild dandelions.  Tasty and nutritious."
msgstr "調理した野生のタンポポの葉です。美味しく栄養も豊富です。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/comestibles/veggy_dishes.json
msgid "fried dandelions"
msgid_plural "fried dandelions"
msgstr[0] "揚げタンポポ"

#. ~ Description of "fried dandelions"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/veggy_dishes.json
msgid ""
"Wild dandelion flowers that have been pan fried.  Very tasty and nutritious."
msgstr "野生のタンポポの花を揚げたものです。非常に美味しく栄養も豊富です。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/comestibles/veggy_dishes.json
msgid "cooked burdock greens"
msgid_plural "cooked burdock greens"
msgstr[0] "ゴボウの葉(調理済)"

#. ~ Description of "cooked burdock greens"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/veggy_dishes.json
msgid "Cooked burdock leaves.  Tasty and nutritious."
msgstr "調理した野生のゴボウの葉です。美味しく栄養も豊富です。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/comestibles/veggy_dishes.json
msgid "fried burdocks"
msgid_plural "fried burdocks"
msgstr[0] "揚げゴボウ"

#. ~ Description of "fried burdocks"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/veggy_dishes.json
msgid ""
"Wild burdocks that have been battered and deep-fried.  Very tasty and "
"nutritious."
msgstr "野生のゴボウに衣をつけて揚げたものです。非常に美味しく栄養も豊富です。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/comestibles/veggy_dishes.json
msgid "fried dandelions and burdocks"
msgid_plural "fried dandelions and burdocks"
msgstr[0] "タンポポとゴボウのかき揚げ"

#. ~ Description of "fried dandelions and burdocks"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/veggy_dishes.json
msgid ""
"Wild dandelions and burdocks that have been battered and deep-fried.  Very "
"tasty and nutritious."
msgstr "野生のタンポポとゴボウに衣をつけて揚げたものです。非常に美味しく栄養も豊富です。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/comestibles/veggy_dishes.json
msgid "cooked bamboo shoots"
msgid_plural "cooked bamboo shoots"
msgstr[0] "タケノコ(調理済)"

#. ~ Description of "cooked bamboo shoots"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/veggy_dishes.json
msgid "Peeled and cooked bamboo shoots.  Tasty and nutritious."
msgstr "皮を剥いて調理したタケノコです。美味しくて栄養も豊富です。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/comestibles/veggy_dishes.json
msgid "fried bamboo shoots"
msgid_plural "fried bamboo shoots"
msgstr[0] "揚げタケノコ"

#. ~ Description of "fried bamboo shoots"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/veggy_dishes.json
msgid ""
"Raw bamboo shoots that have been peeled, battered and deep-fried.  Very "
"tasty and nutritious."
msgstr "皮を剥いたタケノコに衣をつけて揚げたものです。非常に美味しく栄養満点です。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/comestibles/veggy_dishes.json
msgid "cooked plant marrow"
msgid_plural "cooked plant marrow"
msgstr[0] "植物髄(調理済)"

#. ~ Description of "cooked plant marrow"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/veggy_dishes.json
msgid "A freshly-cooked chunk of plant matter, tasty and nutritious."
msgstr "美味しくて養分も豊富な、新鮮な調理済の植物です。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/comestibles/veggy_dishes.json
msgid "cooked wild vegetables"
msgid_plural "cooked wild vegetables"
msgstr[0] "山菜(調理済)"

#. ~ Description of "cooked wild vegetables"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/veggy_dishes.json
msgid "Cooked wild edible plants.  An interesting mix of flavors."
msgstr "調理した食用植物です。色々な食材が混ざった風変わりな味がします。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/comestibles/veggy_dishes.json
msgid "vegetable aspic"
msgid_plural "vegetable aspic"
msgstr[0] "アスピック(野菜)"

#. ~ Description of "vegetable aspic"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/veggy_dishes.json
msgid ""
"A dish in which vegetables are set into a gelatin made from a plant stock."
msgstr "煮汁から作ったゼラチンで野菜を固めた料理です。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/comestibles/veggy_dishes.json
msgid "cooked buckwheat"
msgid_plural "cooked buckwheat"
msgstr[0] "蕎麦(調理済)"

#. ~ Description of "cooked buckwheat"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/veggy_dishes.json
msgid ""
"A serving of cooked buckwheat porridge.  Healthy and nutritious but bland."
msgstr "調理して軽く潰した蕎麦の実です。健康的で栄養豊富ですが、薄味です。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/comestibles/veggy_dishes.json
msgid "canned corn"
msgid_plural "canned corn"
msgstr[0] "トウモロコシ(保存食)"

#. ~ Description of "canned corn"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/veggy_dishes.json
msgid "Canned corn in water.  Eat up!"
msgstr "水に浸したコーンが容器に入っています。美味しそう！"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/comestibles/veggy_dishes.json
msgid "corn on the cob"
msgid_plural "corn on the cob"
msgstr[0] "トウモロコシ(調理済)"

#. ~ Description of "corn on the cob"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/veggy_dishes.json
msgid "An ear of corn cooked in foil."
msgstr "ホイルで包んで焼いたトウモロコシです。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/comestibles/veggy_dishes.json
msgid "pan roasted corn"
msgid_plural "pan roasted corn"
msgstr[0] "コーン(調理済)"

#. ~ Description of "pan roasted corn"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/veggy_dishes.json
msgid "Corn roasted in a frying pan with herbs and spices."
msgstr "薬草やスパイスと共に焼いたコーンです。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/comestibles/veggy_dishes.json
msgid "hominy"
msgid_plural "hominy"
msgstr[0] "ホミニー"

#. ~ Description of "hominy"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/veggy_dishes.json
msgid ""
"Popcorn kernels which have been cooked in an alkaline solution and then "
"rinsed, making them better suited for eating or cooking."
msgstr "アルカリ性の水溶液で茹でてから薄皮を取り除いたポップコーン粒です。そのままでも食べられますが、料理の材料にもなります。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/comestibles/veggy_dishes.json
msgid "cornmeal"
msgid_plural "cornmeal"
msgstr[0] "コーンミール"

#. ~ Description of "cornmeal"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/veggy_dishes.json
msgid "This yellow cornmeal is useful for baking."
msgstr "焼いて調理すると美味しく食べられます。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/comestibles/veggy_dishes.json
msgid "vegetarian baked beans"
msgid_plural "vegetarian baked beans"
msgstr[0] "ベイクドビーンズ(野菜)"

#. ~ Description of "vegetarian baked beans"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/veggy_dishes.json
msgid "Slow-cooked beans with vegetables.  Tasty and very filling."
msgstr "豆と野菜を一緒に炊いた料理です。美味しく、お腹も十分満たされます。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/comestibles/veggy_dishes.json
msgid "dried rice"
msgid_plural "dried rice"
msgstr[0] "米(乾燥)"

#. ~ Description of "dried rice"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/veggy_dishes.json
msgid ""
"Dehydrated long-grain rice.  Tasty and nutritious when cooked, virtually "
"inedible when dry."
msgstr "乾燥させた長粒種の米です。このままでは食べられませんが、調理すれば美味しく栄養価が高い食品になります。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/comestibles/veggy_dishes.json
msgid "dry wild rice"
msgid_plural "dry wild rice"
msgstr[0] "ワイルドライス(乾燥)"

#. ~ Description of "dry wild rice"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/veggy_dishes.json
msgid ""
"Raw, milled wild rice.  Tasty and nutritious when cooked, virtually inedible"
" when dry."
msgstr "精米したワイルドライスです。このままでは食べられませんが、調理すれば美味しく栄養価が高い食品になります。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/comestibles/veggy_dishes.json
msgid "cooked rice"
msgid_plural "cooked rice"
msgstr[0] "米(調理済)"

#. ~ Description of "cooked rice"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/veggy_dishes.json
msgid "A hearty serving of cooked long-grain white rice."
msgstr "ボリューム満点の炊いた長粒種の白米です。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/comestibles/veggy_dishes.json
msgid "cooked wild rice"
msgid_plural "cooked wild rice"
msgstr[0] "ワイルドライス(調理済)"

#. ~ Description of "cooked wild rice"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/veggy_dishes.json
msgid "A hearty serving of cooked wild rice."
msgstr "ボリューム満点の炊いたワイルドライスです。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/comestibles/veggy_dishes.json
msgid "fried rice"
msgid_plural "fried rice"
msgstr[0] "炒飯(野菜)"

#. ~ Description of "fried rice"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/veggy_dishes.json
msgid "Delicious fried rice with vegetables.  Tasty and very filling."
msgstr "ご飯と野菜を一緒に炒めた料理です。美味しく、お腹も十分満たされます。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/comestibles/veggy_dishes.json
msgid "beans and rice"
msgid_plural "beans and rice"
msgstr[0] "豆飯"

#. ~ Description of "beans and rice"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/veggy_dishes.json
msgid ""
"A serving of beans and rice that has been cooked together.  Delicious and "
"healthy!"
msgstr "豆と米を一緒に炊いた料理です。美味しくてヘルシーです！"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/comestibles/veggy_dishes.json
msgid "succotash"
msgid_plural "succotash"
msgstr[0] "サコタッシュ"

#. ~ Description of "succotash"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/veggy_dishes.json
msgid ""
"Coming from a word meaning \"broken corn kernels\" in the language of the "
"Narragansett, it is a popular dish during hard times and Thanksgiving in New"
" England.  Incorporating maize and beans (or a similar legume), it is cheap "
"and made from common ingredients."
msgstr ""
"「割れたトウモロコシ粒」を意味するナラガンセット族の言葉に由来する、困窮しているときや感謝祭の宴でよく食べられるニューイングランドの料理です。トウモロコシと豆(またはそれに類するマメ科植物)が入っており、特別な材料も要らず安く作れます。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/comestibles/veggy_dishes.json
msgid "succotash deluxe"
msgid_plural "succotash deluxe"
msgstr[0] "DXサコタッシュ"

#. ~ Description of "succotash deluxe"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/veggy_dishes.json
msgid ""
"Succotash, but made more modern and tasty by adding some flavorful "
"ingredients."
msgstr "風味豊かな食材を加え、より現代的で美味しく仕上げたサコタッシュです。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/comestibles/veggy_dishes.json
msgid "tofu fried rice"
msgid_plural "tofu fried rice"
msgstr[0] "炒飯(豆腐)"

#. ~ Description of "tofu fried rice"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/veggy_dishes.json
msgid "Delicious tofu fried rice with vegetables.  Tasty and very filling."
msgstr "ご飯と豆腐と野菜を一緒に炒めた料理です。美味しく、お腹も十分満たされます。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/comestibles/veggy_dishes.json
msgid "tofu stirfry"
msgid_plural "tofu stirfry"
msgstr[0] "豆腐飯"

#. ~ Description of "tofu stirfry"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/veggy_dishes.json
msgid ""
"A tofu stirfry with rice and a sweet, bold flavor sure to stay on your mind "
"through these dark days."
msgstr "炒めた豆腐をご飯と和えて濃く甘く味付けしました。先の見えない日々の心を支える料理です。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/comestibles/veggy_dishes.json
msgid "deluxe vegetarian beans and rice"
msgid_plural "deluxe vegetarian beans and rice"
msgstr[0] "DX豆飯(野菜)"

#. ~ Description of "deluxe vegetarian beans and rice"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/veggy_dishes.json
msgid ""
"Slow-cooked beans and rice with vegetables and seasonings.  Tasty and very "
"filling."
msgstr "豆と米と野菜と調味料を一緒に炊いた料理です。美味しく、お腹も十分満たされます。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/comestibles/veggy_dishes.json
msgid "baked potato"
msgid_plural "baked potatoes"
msgstr[0] "ベイクドポテト"

#. ~ Description of "baked potato"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/veggy_dishes.json
msgid "A delicious baked potato or other tuber.  Got any sour cream?"
msgstr "ジャガイモなどを丸焼きにした美味しそうな料理です。サワークリームを付けましょうか？"

