msgid_plural "One Hundred Dollars smartphone cases"
msgstr[0] "防水スマートフォンケース(100ﾄﾞﾙ)"

#. ~ Description of variant "One Hundred Dollars smartphone case" of item
#. "waterproof smartphone case"
#: data/json/items/containers/containers.json
msgid ""
"This waterproof smartphone case has numerous one-hundred dollar bills "
"printed on it."
msgstr "たくさんの100ドル札がプリントされた防水スマートフォンケースです。"

#. ~ Variant name of item "waterproof smartphone case"
#: data/json/items/containers/containers.json
msgid "Mechanical Gear smartphone case"
msgid_plural "Mechanical Gear smartphone cases"
msgstr[0] "防水スマートフォンケース(歯車)"

#. ~ Description of variant "Mechanical Gear smartphone case" of item
#. "waterproof smartphone case"
#: data/json/items/containers/containers.json
msgid ""
"This waterproof smartphone case has numerous mechanical gears of various "
"sizes and styles printed on it."
msgstr "様々なサイズや形の歯車がプリントされた防水スマートフォンケースです。"

#. ~ Variant name of item "waterproof smartphone case"
#: data/json/items/containers/containers.json
msgid "Ace of Spades smartphone case"
msgid_plural "Ace of Spades smartphone cases"
msgstr[0] "防水スマートフォンケース(ﾄﾗﾝﾌﾟ)"

#. ~ Description of variant "Ace of Spades smartphone case" of item
#. "waterproof smartphone case"
#: data/json/items/containers/containers.json
msgid ""
"This black waterproof smartphone case has the print of a large white Ace of "
"Spades in the back.  Looks good."
msgstr "背面に大きな白いスペードのエースが描かれた黒色の防水スマートフォンケースです。かっこいいですね。"

#. ~ Variant name of item "waterproof smartphone case"
#: data/json/items/containers/containers.json
msgid "Instagram Overlay smartphone case"
msgid_plural "Instagram Overlay smartphone cases"
msgstr[0] "防水スマートフォンケース(Instagram)"

#. ~ Description of variant "Instagram Overlay smartphone case" of item
#. "waterproof smartphone case"
#: data/json/items/containers/containers.json
msgid ""
"Inspired by Instagram's popular filter overlays, this waterproof smartphone "
"case features a colorful gradient background with geometric shapes layered "
"over it.  The colors of these shapes are similar to those found in "
"Instagram's color palette.  The overlay design gives the case an interesting"
" depth and texture, and the colors make it stand out."
msgstr ""
"Instagramで人気のフィルターに着想を得たデザインの防水スマートフォンケースです。カラフルなグラデーションの上に、Instagramを連想させる色をした様々な幾何学図形がプリントされています。そのデザインはケースに洒落た深みと質感を与えており、間違いなく周囲の注目を集められます。"

#. ~ Variant name of item "waterproof smartphone case"
#: data/json/items/containers/containers.json
msgid "Nightmare on Elm Street smartphone case"
msgid_plural "Nightmare on Elm Street smartphone cases"
msgstr[0] "防水スマートフォンケース(『ｴﾙﾑ街の悪夢』)"

#. ~ Description of variant "Nightmare on Elm Street smartphone case" of item
#. "waterproof smartphone case"
#: data/json/items/containers/containers.json
msgid ""
"This design is inspired by a famous, classic horror movie about a dream "
"demon who hunts teenagers in their dreams.  This case features a distorted "
"stripe pattern, creating a kind of 3D effect, combined with the graphic of a"
" glove with blades on the fingers against a dark, spooky, and cloudy sky."
msgstr ""
"夢の中で若者を襲う悪魔を描いた有名な古典ホラー映画から着想を得たスマートフォンケースです。暗く不気味な曇天の風景に歪んだ縦縞模様が重なり、指先から刃が飛び出たグローブのグラフィックと組み合わさって一種の立体画像のような効果を生み出しています。"

#. ~ Variant name of item "waterproof smartphone case"
#: data/json/items/containers/containers.json
msgid "Friday the 13th smartphone case"
msgid_plural "Friday the 13th smartphone cases"
msgstr[0] "防水スマートフォンケース(『13日の金曜日』)"

#. ~ Description of variant "Friday the 13th smartphone case" of item
#. "waterproof smartphone case"
#: data/json/items/containers/containers.json
msgid ""
"This design is inspired by the iconic hockey mask killer.  This case "
"features a hockey mask silhouette combined with the subtle texture of "
"crystal-clear water and a design of a boat and trees to represent Crystal "
"Lake."
msgstr ""
"誰もが知っているホッケーマスク姿の殺人鬼から着想得たデザインのスマートフォンケースです。ホッケーマスクのシルエットと透き通った水の質感、クリスタル・レイクを表わすボートと木々のグラフィックが特徴的です。"

#. ~ Variant name of item "waterproof smartphone case"
#: data/json/items/containers/containers.json
msgid "Scream smartphone case"
msgid_plural "Scream smartphone cases"
msgstr[0] "防水スマートフォンケース(『ｽｸﾘｰﾑ』)"

#. ~ Description of variant "Scream smartphone case" of item "waterproof
#. smartphone case"
#: data/json/items/containers/containers.json
msgid ""
"The design on this case is inspired by the scream mask worn by the killers "
"from the Scream movie series.  The case features the classic ghostly white "
"mask together with the classic knife they wield, both designed in a gradient"
" graphic with the case's background color and dark, smoky design lines to "
"add an air of mystery and suspense."
msgstr ""
"このスマートフォンケースのデザインは、映画『スクリーム』シリーズの殺人鬼が着用しているゴーストマスクから着想を得ているようです。幽霊を表現した古典的な白色のマスクとこの殺人鬼が振るうナイフが印象的ですが、どちらも背景色に溶け込むような暗く濁ったグラデーションで表現されているため、ミステリーとサスペンスの雰囲気がさらに高まります。"

#. ~ Variant name of item "waterproof smartphone case"
#: data/json/items/containers/containers.json
msgid "It the Clown smartphone case"
msgid_plural "It the Clown smartphone cases"
msgstr[0] "防水スマートフォンケース(『IT』)"

#. ~ Description of variant "It the Clown smartphone case" of item "waterproof
#. smartphone case"
#: data/json/items/containers/containers.json
msgid ""
"This design is inspired by Pennywise, the killer clown, and his iconic red "
"balloon.  This case features Pennywise's face in a black and white gradient "
"color combination, with an image of his red balloon incorporated within the "
"case's design."
msgstr ""
"殺人ピエロのペニーワイズと象徴的な赤色の風船から着想を得たスマートフォンケースです。白黒のグラデーションで表現されたペニーワイズの顔と赤色の風船がプリントされています。"

#. ~ Variant name of item "waterproof smartphone case"
#: data/json/items/containers/containers.json
msgid "Candyman smartphone case"
msgid_plural "Candyman smartphone cases"
msgstr[0] "防水スマートフォンケース(『ｷｬﾝﾃﾞｨﾏﾝ』)"

#. ~ Description of variant "Candyman smartphone case" of item "waterproof
#. smartphone case"
#: data/json/items/containers/containers.json
msgid ""
"This design is inspired by Candyman from the 'Candyman' horror movie series."
"  With his bee-themed terror, this case features a honeycomb pattern "
"background in a dark yellowish-brownish hue, complemented with bees in a "
"similar color scheme.  The Candyman's face is, alongside his hook, in black "
"and blue tones, complementing the honeycomb pattern."
msgstr ""
"ホラー映画『キャンディマン』シリーズに登場するキャンディマンから着想を得たデザインのスマートフォンです。ハチとホラーがテーマになっており、濃い黄色がかった茶色のハニカムパターンの背景に、同系色のハチが描かれています。キャンディマンの顔と鈎は黒や青に近い色調で、ハニカムパターンを引き立てています。"

#. ~ Variant name of item "waterproof smartphone case"
#: data/json/items/containers/containers.json
msgid "Saw smartphone case"
msgid_plural "Saw smartphone cases"
msgstr[0] "防水スマートフォンケース(『ｿｳ』)"

#. ~ Description of variant "Saw smartphone case" of item "waterproof
#. smartphone case"
#: data/json/items/containers/containers.json
msgid ""
"This design is inspired by the infamous 'reverse bear trap' from Saw.  This "
"case features an in-your-face graphic of the trap with a rusted metallic "
"texture.  A blood spattering effect nearby is also included, probably to add"
" extra horror detail."
msgstr ""
"映画『ソウ』に登場する悪名高い「逆トラバサミ」から着想を得たデザインのスマートフォンケースです。錆びた金属の質感が再現されたトラップが大胆に描かれており、恐怖感を高めるために、あちこちに血しぶきの模様が散りばめられています。"

#. ~ Variant name of item "waterproof smartphone case"
#: data/json/items/containers/containers.json
msgid "Phantasm smartphone case"
msgid_plural "Phantasm smartphone cases"
msgstr[0] "防水スマートフォンケース(『ﾌｧﾝﾀｽﾞﾑ』)"

#. ~ Description of variant "Phantasm smartphone case" of item "waterproof
#. smartphone case"
#: data/json/items/containers/containers.json
msgid ""
"This design is inspired by the iconic ball-shaped weapon used by the "
"Tallman, the main villain from the 'Phantasm' movie series.  This case "
"features the ball image with a chrome-like metallic surface.  Inside the "
"ball, there are graphics of the Phantasm movie scenes to further communicate"
" the theme."
msgstr ""
"映画『ファンタズム』シリーズの有名な悪役、トールマンが操るボール状の武器から着想を得たデザインのスマートフォンケースです。ボールはクロームメタルの質感で表現されており、その内側には映画のシーンが映し出されています。"

#. ~ Variant name of item "waterproof smartphone case"
#: data/json/items/containers/containers.json
msgid "Texas Chainsaw Massacre smartphone case"
msgid_plural "Texas Chainsaw Massacre smartphone cases"
msgstr[0] "防水スマートフォンケース(『悪魔のいけにえ』)"

#. ~ Description of variant "Texas Chainsaw Massacre smartphone case" of item
#. "waterproof smartphone case"
#: data/json/items/containers/containers.json
msgid ""
"This design is inspired by the iconic chainsaw used by Leatherface in the "
"'Texas Chainsaw Massacre' movie series.  This case presents an image of a "
"volume meter with a chainsaw graphic etched vertically.  The blade of the "
"chainsaw is designed with a sharp metallic accent against a bleak backdrop, "
"symbolizing the haunting atmosphere of the film."
msgstr ""
"映画『悪魔のいけにえ』でレザーフェイスが使う有名なチェーンソーから着想を得たデザインのスマートフォンケースです。チェーンソーを象った縦向きの音量メーターが描かれており、鋭い光を放つチェーンソーの刃がケースの暗い色によく映えて映画の雰囲気を上手く表現しています。"

#. ~ Variant name of item "waterproof smartphone case"
#: data/json/items/containers/containers.json
msgid "Child's Play smartphone case"
msgid_plural "Child's Play smartphone cases"
msgstr[0] "防水スマートフォンケース(『ﾁｬｲﾙﾄﾞ･ﾌﾟﾚｲ』)"

#. ~ Description of variant "Child's Play smartphone case" of item "waterproof
#. smartphone case"
#: data/json/items/containers/containers.json
msgid ""
"The design of this waterproof smartphone case is inspired by the terrifying "
"mission of the red-haired killer doll.  This case features Chucky's graphic,"
" with vibrant highlights of blood-red and white, symbolizing his hair.  The "
"background is plain black with a stitched-like design to make it look like a"
" piece of fabric."
msgstr ""
"赤毛の殺人人形による恐ろしい所業をイメージしたデザインの防水スマートフォンケースです。チャッキーの鮮やかなグラフィックはその髪の色を象徴する血のような赤色と白色で縁取られており、よく目立ちます。ケースは黒色の無地で、布地のように見えるステッチ風のデザインが施されています。"

#. ~ Variant name of item "waterproof smartphone case"
#: data/json/items/containers/containers.json
msgid "Hellraiser smartphone case"
msgid_plural "Hellraiser smartphone cases"
msgstr[0] "防水スマートフォンケース(『ﾍﾙ･ﾚｲｻﾞｰ』)"

#. ~ Description of variant "Hellraiser smartphone case" of item "waterproof
#. smartphone case"
#: data/json/items/containers/containers.json
msgid ""
"The design of this case is inspired by the gruesome Cenobite creatures from "
"the 'Hellraiser' horror movie series.  It features a graphic of the infamous"
" puzzle box with a bloody-grey, aged texture and small comic-like graphic "
"symbols that are seen in the movie scenes.  The design layout also presents "
"a reflection of the Cenobites and their leader, Pinhead, in the background, "
"giving it a truly creepy vibe."
msgstr ""
"ホラー映画『ヘル・レイザー』シリーズに登場する、セノバイトと呼ばれる恐ろしい怪物から着想を得たデザインのスマートフォンケースです。血にまみれて古びた灰色の質感と、劇中に登場する細やかな紋様が様が描かれた悪名高いパズルボックスのグラフィックが特徴です。その背後にはセノバイトたちとそのリーダーであるピンヘッドがぼんやりと映っており、非常に不気味な印象を受けます。"

#. ~ Variant name of item "waterproof smartphone case"
#: data/json/items/containers/containers.json
msgid "Maniac Cop smartphone case"
msgid_plural "Maniac Cop smartphone cases"
msgstr[0] "防水スマートフォンケース(『ﾏﾆｱｯｸ･ｺｯﾌﾟ』)"

#. ~ Description of variant "Maniac Cop smartphone case" of item "waterproof
#. smartphone case"
#: data/json/items/containers/containers.json
msgid ""
"The design of this waterproof smartphone case is inspired by the iconic "
"police uniform of the maniac cop.  The case features the police badge, "
"symbolizing authority, with the maniac's glove-clad hand over it in a steel-"
"like color against a dark blue background.  It also includes a bloody police"
" baton graphic to further emphasize the theme."
msgstr ""
"『マニアック・コップ』の象徴的な警察官の制服に着想を得たデザインの防水スマートフォンケースです。濃い青色の背景に、警察の権威を象徴する警官バッジ、その上に鋼鉄を思わせる色合いで手袋をはめた手が描かれています。テーマをさらに強調するために血まみれの警棒も描かれています。"

#. ~ Variant name of item "waterproof smartphone case"
#: data/json/items/containers/containers.json
msgid "Re-Animator smartphone case"
msgid_plural "Re-Animator smartphone cases"
msgstr[0] "防水スマートフォンケース(『ZOMBIO』)"

#. ~ Description of variant "Re-Animator smartphone case" of item "waterproof
#. smartphone case"
#: data/json/items/containers/containers.json
msgid ""
"Inspired by Dr. Herbert West's reanimation serum and the undead creatures it"
" creates from the 'Re-Animator' horror movie series, this case features a "
"medical syringe graphic with a glowing, green liquid radiating outward, "
"symbolizing the serum substance, against a plain black background.  Eh, "
"ironic."
msgstr ""
"ホラー映画『ZOMBIO/死霊のしたたり』に登場するハーバート・ウェスト博士の死体蘇生血清とゾンビから着想を得たデザインのスマートフォンケースです。黒い無地のケースには、緑色に光る血清が入った医療用注射器が描かれています。うーん、皮肉を感じますね。"

#. ~ Variant name of item "waterproof smartphone case"
#: data/json/items/containers/containers.json
msgid "Evil Dead smartphone case"
msgid_plural "Evil Dead smartphone cases"
msgstr[0] "防水スマートフォンケース(『死霊のはらわた』)"

#. ~ Description of variant "Evil Dead smartphone case" of item "waterproof
#. smartphone case"
#: data/json/items/containers/containers.json
msgid ""
"This design is inspired by the Necronomicon and the demonic beings it "
"awakens, as well as the hero from the 'Evil Dead' horror-comedy series.  The"
" case features the book's cover design in brown with raised lettering.  The "
"lettering represents the ancient text of the book; however, the iconical "
"silhouette of Ash Williams can be seen in the center, with text saying 'Hail"
" to the King, baby'."
msgstr ""
"ホラー・コメディ映画シリーズ『死霊のはらわた』の主人公や死者の書、異形の怪物から着想を得たデザインのスマートフォンケースです。ケース表面は茶色い本の表紙を模しており、浮き彫りで書かれた古代の文書の中央に、主人公アッシュ・ウィリアムズのシルエットと「王に乾杯、ベイビー」というセリフが載っています。"

#. ~ Variant name of item "waterproof smartphone case"
#: data/json/items/containers/containers.json
msgid "Pumpkinhead smartphone case"
msgid_plural "Pumpkinhead smartphone cases"
msgstr[0] "防水スマートフォンケース(『ﾊﾟﾝﾌﾟｷﾝﾍｯﾄﾞ』)"

#. ~ Description of variant "Pumpkinhead smartphone case" of item "waterproof
#. smartphone case"
#: data/json/items/containers/containers.json
msgid ""
"This design is inspired by the demonic creature that seeks vengeance.  This "
"case features the graphic of Pumpkinhead, the demon of vengeance, with a "
"fiery red and orange color combination against a black background.  "
"Distorted, slimy tentacles are near the bottom to emphasize the monster's "
"theme."
msgstr ""
"復讐を求める恐ろしい怪物をイメージしたデザインのスマートフォンケースです。黒色の背景に、復讐の悪魔パンプキンヘッドが燃えるような赤色とオレンジ色で描かれています。周囲には捻じれた触手が蠢いており、怪物の恐ろしさを強調しています。"

#. ~ Variant name of item "waterproof smartphone case"
#: data/json/items/containers/containers.json
msgid "Halloween smartphone case"
msgid_plural "Halloween smartphone cases"
msgstr[0] "防水スマートフォンケース(『ﾊﾛｳｨﾝ』)"

#. ~ Description of variant "Halloween smartphone case" of item "waterproof
#. smartphone case"
#: data/json/items/containers/containers.json
msgid ""
"This design is inspired by the iconic slasher movie.  This case features the"
" white, plain mask's silhouette against a dark, blood-red background.  It "
"has the movie's tagline from a distance, with subtle illustrations of "
"Michael Myers holding a knife to further reinforce the theme of Halloween."
msgstr ""
"伝説的なスラッシャー映画に着想を得たデザインの防水スマートフォンケースです。血染めの暗い背景に、映画のキャッチフレーズをイメージした白い無地のマスクが描かれています。ナイフを持ったマイケル・マイヤーズの巧みなイラストがテーマをさらに強調しています。"

#. ~ Variant name of item "waterproof smartphone case"
#: data/json/items/containers/containers.json
msgid "Coffin Joe smartphone case"
msgid_plural "Coffin Joe smartphone cases"
msgstr[0] "防水スマートフォンケース(『ｺﾌｨﾝ･ｼﾞｮｰ』)"

#. ~ Description of variant "Coffin Joe smartphone case" of item "waterproof
#. smartphone case"
#: data/json/items/containers/containers.json
msgid ""
"This design is inspired by the Brazilian horror icon, Coffin Joe (Zé do "
"Caixo).  It has the silhouette of him wearing his classic top hat and suit, "
"along with the symbolic scythe, against a purple backdrop in the background."
msgstr ""
"ブラジルの有名なホラー映画のキャラクターであるコフィン・ジョー(ゼー・ド・カイション)に着想を得たデザインのスマートフォンケースです。紫色の背景に、古風なシルクハットとスーツを着たジョーのシルエットと、象徴的な鎌の図案がえがかれています。"

#. ~ Variant name of item "waterproof smartphone case"
#: data/json/items/containers/containers.json
msgid "Alien smartphone case"
msgid_plural "Alien smartphone cases"
msgstr[0] "防水スマートフォンケース(『ｴｲﾘｱﾝ』)"

#. ~ Description of variant "Alien smartphone case" of item "waterproof
#. smartphone case"
#: data/json/items/containers/containers.json
msgid ""
"This design is inspired by the Xenomorphs' threat and the spaceship's doomed"
" crew.  This case features a graphic of Ripley with the Alien Queen's tail "
"coiling around the phone case, with a striking color combination of dark "
"blues and greens to create an eerie mood."
msgstr ""
"宇宙生物ゼノモーフの脅威と、不運にも同じ宇宙船に乗り合わせた乗組員から着想を得たデザインのスマートフォンケースです。主人公リプリーのを拘束するかのように、エイリアンクイーンの尻尾がケースに巻き付いています。ダークブルーと緑色の組み合わせが、不気味で印象的な雰囲気を作り出しています。"

#. ~ Variant name of item "waterproof smartphone case"
#: data/json/items/containers/containers.json
msgid "The Predator smartphone case"
msgid_plural "The Predator smartphone cases"
msgstr[0] "防水スマートフォンケース(『ﾌﾟﾚﾃﾞﾀｰ』)"

#. ~ Description of variant "The Predator smartphone case" of item "waterproof
#. smartphone case"
#: data/json/items/containers/containers.json
msgid ""
"The design of this waterproof smartphone case is inspired by the Predator's "
"advanced technology and their hunting tools presented in the action-horror "
"series in which the creatures were presented.  This case features a graphic "
"of the Predator's mask in red, silver, and black, with futuristic lines that"
" create a mechanical texture, and a background of the jungle where the first"
" movie was based."
msgstr ""
"アクションホラー映画シリーズ『プレデター』に登場する高度なテクノロジーを用いた狩猟道具に着想を得たデザインのスマートフォンケースです。第一作の舞台となったジャングルを背景に、近未来的でメカニカルな質感のラインと赤、銀、黒の三色でプレデターのマスクが鮮やかに描かれています。"

#. ~ Variant name of item "waterproof smartphone case"
#: data/json/items/containers/containers.json
msgid "Feast smartphone case"
msgid_plural "Feast smartphone cases"
msgstr[0] "防水スマートフォンケース(『ｻﾞ･ﾌｨｰｽﾄ』)"

#. ~ Description of variant "Feast smartphone case" of item "waterproof
#. smartphone case"
#: data/json/items/containers/containers.json
msgid ""
"This design is inspired by the main monster species from the comedy-horror "
"trash trilogy 'Feast', and also the filthiness of the environment.  This "
"features a graphic of the monster in a dirty-feeling yellow and gray "
"combination, with the monster's gross tongue hanging out."
msgstr ""
"B級コメディホラー映画『ザ・フィースト』三部作に登場する主要なモンスターと不潔な雰囲気に着想を得たデザインのスマートフォンケースです。舌を出した気味の悪い怪物が、濁った黄色と灰色で描かれています。"

#. ~ Variant name of item "waterproof smartphone case"
#: data/json/items/containers/containers.json
msgid "The Collector smartphone case"
msgid_plural "The Collector smartphone cases"
msgstr[0] "防水スマートフォンケース(『ﾜﾅｵﾄｺ』)"

#. ~ Description of variant "The Collector smartphone case" of item
#. "waterproof smartphone case"
#: data/json/items/containers/containers.json
msgid ""
"The design of this waterproof smartphone case is inspired by the Collector's"
" Trap's pattern and the horror-thriller feeling from the movie of the same "
"name.  This case features a graphic of the box trap with a blend of green, "
"orange, and purple colors against a plain black background, with a top-down "
"style to show the intricate layout of the trap."
msgstr ""
"同名の映画のホラースリラー感と「コレクター」のトラップから着想を得たデザインの防水スマートフォンケースです。無地の黒い背景に緑色・オレンジ・紫色を組み合わせた彩色の箱型のトラップが、その複雑なレイアウトを見せるために上から見下ろす形で描かれています。"

#. ~ Variant name of item "waterproof smartphone case"
#: data/json/items/containers/containers.json
msgid "The Nightshifter smartphone case"
msgid_plural "The Nightshifter smartphone cases"
msgstr[0] "防水スマートフォンケース(『死体語り』)"

#. ~ Description of variant "The Nightshifter smartphone case" of item
#. "waterproof smartphone case"
#: data/json/items/containers/containers.json
msgid ""
"The design of this waterproof smartphone case is inspired by the mortuary "
"where the protagonist from the Brazilian horror movie 'The Nightshifter' "
"(Morto no Fala) works and the supernatural events that happen there.  This "
"case features the image of the mortuary in a sepia hue, with an overlay of a"
" ghostly hand coming out of a coffin, and the protagonist, Stenio, appearing"
" in the background with a serious expression."
msgstr ""
"この防水スマートフォンケースは、ブラジルのホラー映画『死体語り』で主人公が働く遺体安置所とそこで起こる超常現象に着想を得たデザインです。セピア調の遺体安置所に棺から出てくる幽霊のような手が重ね合わせられ、背景に真剣な表情の主人公ステーニョが描かれています。"

#. ~ Variant name of item "waterproof smartphone case"
#: data/json/items/containers/containers.json
msgid "Wrong Turn smartphone case"
msgid_plural "Wrong Turn smartphone cases"
msgstr[0] "防水スマートフォンケース(『ｸﾗｲﾓﾘ』)"

#. ~ Description of variant "Wrong Turn smartphone case" of item "waterproof
#. smartphone case"
#: data/json/items/containers/containers.json
msgid ""
"Inspired by the deformed and cannibalistic mountain people that are the main"
" antagonists of the horror movie series 'Wrong Turn', this case features a "
"graphic of a silhouette of the monsters' faces, arranged in a circular "
"pattern with blood-red highlights, against a misty mountain landscape."
msgstr ""
"ホラー映画『クライモリ』シリーズに敵として登場する、人を襲う奇形の山岳部族に着想を得たデザインのスマートフォンケースです。霧深い山の風景をバックに、鮮やかな血の色の模様と、特徴的な人食い部族のシルエットが描かれています。"

#. ~ Variant name of item "waterproof smartphone case"
#: data/json/items/containers/containers.json
msgid "The Hills Runs Red smartphone case"
msgid_plural "The Hills Runs Red smartphone cases"
msgstr[0] "防水スマートフォンケース(『ﾋﾙｽﾞ･ﾗﾝ･ﾚｯﾄﾞ』)"

#. ~ Description of variant "The Hills Runs Red smartphone case" of item
#. "waterproof smartphone case"
#: data/json/items/containers/containers.json
msgid ""
"The design of this waterproof smartphone case is inspired by the main "
"antagonist of the horror film 'The Hills Run Red', Babyface.  This case "
"features a graphic of the mask that Babyface wears, portrayed in a scratched"
" and dirty metal-like texture, with a design of the film's title using a "
"blood-dripping font above it."
msgstr ""
"ホラー映画『ヒルズ・ラン・レッド-"
"殺人の記録-』の敵役ベビーフェイスに着想を得たデザインの防水スマートフォンケースです。傷や汚れのある金属のようなテクスチャーにベビーフェイスの着けているマスクが描かれており、その上に血の滴るフォントで映画のタイトルがデザインされています。"

#. ~ Variant name of item "waterproof smartphone case"
#: data/json/items/containers/containers.json
msgid "You're Next smartphone case"
msgid_plural "You're Next smartphone cases"
msgstr[0] "防水スマートフォンケース(『ｻﾌﾟﾗｲｽﾞ』)"

#. ~ Description of variant "You're Next smartphone case" of item "waterproof
#. smartphone case"
#: data/json/items/containers/containers.json
msgid ""
"The design of this waterproof smartphone case is inspired by the masked "
"assailants who terrorize the family in the movie 'You're Next'.  This case "
"features a graphic of an animal mask with a sharp graphic design printed "
"onto the case, with a bloody-red background to create a sense of urgency and"
" horror."
msgstr ""
"映画『サプライズ』でとある家族を恐怖に陥れる覆面の襲撃者に着想を得たデザインのスマートフォンケースです。血のような赤色の背景にシャープなグラフィックでアニマルマスクが描かれており、緊迫感と恐怖を演出しています。"

#. ~ Variant name of item "waterproof smartphone case"
#: data/json/items/containers/containers.json
msgid "The Babadook smartphone case"
msgid_plural "The Babadook smartphone cases"
msgstr[0] "防水スマートフォンケース(『ﾊﾞﾊﾞﾄﾞｯｸ』)"

#. ~ Description of variant "The Babadook smartphone case" of item "waterproof
#. smartphone case"
#: data/json/items/containers/containers.json
msgid ""
"This design is inspired by the movie's titular character, a monster from a "
"storybook.  This case features a graphic of the Babadook's silhouette in a "
"dark blue-black color against a grayish textured background with the "
"typography and illustrations as seen in the book.  The book is incorporated "
"into the design as well."
msgstr ""
"映画のタイトルにもなっている、童話に登場する怪物に着想を得たデザインのスマートフォンケースです。灰色がかったざらついた質感の背景に、黒っぽい青色でババドックのシルエットが描かれています。童話が載っている本もデザインに取り入れられており、本文と挿絵が載っています。"

#. ~ Variant name of item "waterproof smartphone case"
#: data/json/items/containers/containers.json
msgid "Leprechaun smartphone case"
msgid_plural "Leprechaun smartphone cases"
msgstr[0] "防水スマートフォンケース(『ﾚﾌﾟﾘｺｰﾝ』)"

#. ~ Description of variant "Leprechaun smartphone case" of item "waterproof
#. smartphone case"
#: data/json/items/containers/containers.json
msgid ""
"The design of this waterproof smartphone case features a vibrant green color"
" and a graphic of the Leprechaun's face with his signature top hat on the "
"back of the case.  The case also features an etched graphic of the pot of "
"gold at the end of the rainbow on the sides."
msgstr ""
"鮮やかな緑色の背景に、特徴的なシルクハットを被ったレプリコーンの顔が描かれた防水スマートフォンケースです。ケースの側面には、虹のふもとにあると言われている金貨が入ったの壺のデザインが凹凸加工で描かれています。"

#. ~ Variant name of item "waterproof smartphone case"
#: data/json/items/containers/containers.json
msgid "Smiley Face Killers smartphone case"
msgid_plural "Smiley Face Killers smartphone cases"
msgstr[0] "防水スマートフォンケース(『ｽﾏｲﾘｰﾌｪｲｽｷﾗｰｽﾞ』)"

#. ~ Description of variant "Smiley Face Killers smartphone case" of item
#. "waterproof smartphone case"
#: data/json/items/containers/containers.json
msgid ""
"This waterproof smartphone case features a graphic of Smiley's chilling grin"
" printed in black on a deep blue background.  This case also features a "
"subtle graphic of the infamous yellow smiley face with blood dripping from "
"it."
msgstr ""
"黄色の背景に、暗くおぞましい笑顔を浮かべるスマイリーの濃い青色のシルエットと、まるで血で描いたような稚拙なスマイリーフェイスの落書きがデザインされた、防水スマートフォンケースです。"

#. ~ Variant name of item "waterproof smartphone case"
#: data/json/items/containers/containers.json
msgid "The Ring smartphone case"
msgid_plural "The Ring smartphone cases"
msgstr[0] "防水スマートフォンケース(『ｻﾞ･ﾘﾝｸﾞ』)"

#. ~ Description of variant "The Ring smartphone case" of item "waterproof
#. smartphone case"
#: data/json/items/containers/containers.json
msgid ""
"The design of this waterproof smartphone case features a graphic of the Ring"
" Girl on a black background, with her hair covering her face and creating "
"eerie flowing lines.  This case also features the iconic videotape from the "
"movie with the cursed Alaskan landscape printed on the borders."
msgstr ""
"黒色の背景に、顔全体が髪で覆われた不気味な痩せた女が描かれている、防水スマートフォンケースです。アラスカの風景を映し出した呪いのビデオテープのワンシーンが、ケースを囲むようにプリントされています。"

#. ~ Variant name of item "waterproof smartphone case"
#: data/json/items/containers/containers.json
msgid "The Descent smartphone case"
msgid_plural "The Descent smartphone cases"
msgstr[0] "防水スマートフォンケース(『ﾃﾞｨｾﾝﾄ』)"

#. ~ Description of variant "The Descent smartphone case" of item "waterproof
#. smartphone case"
#: data/json/items/containers/containers.json
msgid ""
"The design of this waterproof smartphone case features the shadows of the "
"deformed humanoid creatures lurking in the cave that the characters must "
"navigate, with corresponding blood dripping from them against a black "
"background."
msgstr ""
"あちこちに血飛沫が飛び散っている黒色の背景に、洞窟に迷い込んだ登場人物たちと、洞窟に潜む異形の人型生物のシルエットがデザインされている防水スマートフォンケースです。"

#. ~ Variant name of item "waterproof smartphone case"
#: data/json/items/containers/containers.json
msgid "The Grudge smartphone case"
msgid_plural "The Grudge smartphone cases"
msgstr[0] "防水スマートフォンケース(『呪怨』)"

#. ~ Description of variant "The Grudge smartphone case" of item "waterproof
#. smartphone case"
#: data/json/items/containers/containers.json
msgid ""
"This waterproof smartphone case features the haunting Grudge ghost's white "
"face on a black background, with her multiple horror contortions through the"
" movie sparsely hinted at in a subtle way around her face."
msgstr ""
"黒色の背景に、印象深い真っ白な顔の怨霊がプリントされた防水スマートフォンケースです。怨霊の周囲には、映画に登場した多数の犠牲者たちの恐怖に歪んだ顔がうっすらと浮かび上がっています。"

#. ~ Variant name of item "waterproof smartphone case"
#: data/json/items/containers/containers.json
msgid "[R E C] smartphone case"
msgid_plural "[R E C] smartphone cases"
msgstr[0] "防水スマートフォンケース(『ﾚｯｸ』)"

#. ~ Description of variant "[R E C] smartphone case" of item "waterproof
#. smartphone case"
#: data/json/items/containers/containers.json
msgid ""
"This waterproof smartphone case features the recognizable branding of said "
"movie's original poster, which depicts a graphic of a person with a blood-"
"splattered face, looking upwards, on an orange-colored background.  It also "
"features the film's title, 'R E C' printed in bold white letters at the "
"bottom."
msgstr ""
"オレンジ色の背景に、血まみれで上を見ている人物の顔が描かれている、映画のオリジナルポスターのデザインを模した防水スマートフォンケースです。下部には映画のタイトル『R"
" E G』が白色の太字でプリントされています。"

#. ~ Variant name of item "waterproof smartphone case"
#: data/json/items/containers/containers.json
msgid "Paranormal Activity smartphone case"
msgid_plural "Paranormal Activity smartphone cases"
msgstr[0] "防水スマートフォンケース(『ﾊﾟﾗﾉｰﾏﾙ･ｱｸﾃｨﾋﾞﾃｨ』)"

#. ~ Description of variant "Paranormal Activity smartphone case" of item
#. "waterproof smartphone case"
#: data/json/items/containers/containers.json
msgid ""
"This waterproof smartphone case features a graphic of the Ouija board, with "
"the film's title at the bottom, and a spooky blue-grey color throughout, "
"symbolizing the film's eeriness and supernatural horror."
msgstr ""
"下部に映画のタイトルが記されたウィジャボードのグラフィックが特徴的な防水スマートフォンケースです。ケース全体が、映画の不気味で超自然的な恐怖を象徴する不気味なブルーグレーに彩られています。"

#. ~ Variant name of item "waterproof smartphone case"
#: data/json/items/containers/containers.json
msgid "Cloverfield Monster smartphone case"
msgid_plural "Cloverfield Monster smartphone cases"
msgstr[0] "防水スマートフォンケース(『ｸﾛｰﾊﾞｰﾌｨｰﾙﾄﾞ』)"

#. ~ Description of variant "Cloverfield Monster smartphone case" of item
#. "waterproof smartphone case"
#: data/json/items/containers/containers.json
msgid ""
"The design of this waterproof smartphone case features the Cloverfield "
"monster's claw marks on an eroded statue-like surface against a grey-green "
"background, with a scratchy film reel aesthetic found throughout the case."
msgstr ""
"濁った緑色の背景に、表面が削り取られ怪獣の爪痕が付けられた彫像がプリントされた防水スマートフォンケースです。ケース全体にボロボロのフィルムリールがデザインされており、お洒落です。"

#. ~ Variant name of item "waterproof smartphone case"
#: data/json/items/containers/containers.json
msgid "Hatchet smartphone case"
msgid_plural "Hatchet smartphone cases"
msgstr[0] "防水スマートフォンケース(『ﾊﾁｪｯﾄ』)"

#. ~ Description of variant "Hatchet smartphone case" of item "waterproof
#. smartphone case"
#: data/json/items/containers/containers.json
msgid ""
"This waterproof smartphone case features a graphic of an eerie swamp "
"environment with a silhouette resembling one of the main villains from said "
"movie series.  The case also includes a splash effect on the sides to "
"represent the swamp water and leaves."
msgstr ""
"不気味な沼地の背景に、映画シリーズの悪役の一人を模したシルエットがプリントされた防水スマートフォンケースです。ケースの側面には沼地の水飛沫と葉を表わす図案がデザインされています。"

#. ~ Variant name of item "waterproof smartphone case"
#: data/json/items/containers/containers.json
msgid "Jaws smartphone case"
msgid_plural "Jaws smartphone cases"
msgstr[0] "防水スマートフォンケース(『ｼﾞｮｰｽﾞ』)"

#. ~ Description of variant "Jaws smartphone case" of item "waterproof
#. smartphone case"
#: data/json/items/containers/containers.json
msgid ""
"This design features a graphic of a shark fin coming out of the water with "
"the text 'Stay Out of the Water' written in bold letters over it.  It also "
"uses an intense blue gradient color to represent the ocean horizon."
msgstr ""
"水面から飛び出したサメの背びれの上に、太字で「Stay Out of the "
"Water(水場に近付くな)」と書かれたデザインが特徴的な、スマートフォンケースです。水平線の表現として、背景には濃い青色のグラデーションカラーが用いられています。"

#. ~ Variant name of item "waterproof smartphone case"
#: data/json/items/containers/containers.json
msgid "Piranha smartphone case"
msgid_plural "Piranha smartphone cases"
msgstr[0] "防水スマートフォンケース(『ﾋﾟﾗﾆｱ』)"

#. ~ Description of variant "Piranha smartphone case" of item "waterproof
#. smartphone case"
#: data/json/items/containers/containers.json
msgid ""
"The design of this waterproof smartphone case features a graphic of a group "
"of red piranhas swimming with sharp white waves against a blue background.  "
"The graphic of bloody water hints at the piranhas' violent nature."
msgstr ""
"青色の背景に、白い波を立てて泳ぐ赤色のピラニアの群れをデザインした防水スマートフォンケースです。血が混じった水のグラフィックが、ピラニアの脅威を暗示しています。"

#. ~ Variant name of item "waterproof smartphone case"
#: data/json/items/containers/containers.json
msgid "Anaconda smartphone case"
msgid_plural "Anaconda smartphone cases"
msgstr[0] "防水スマートフォンケース(『ｱﾅｺﾝﾀﾞ』)"

#. ~ Description of variant "Anaconda smartphone case" of item "waterproof
#. smartphone case"
#: data/json/items/containers/containers.json
msgid ""
"The design of this waterproof smartphone case features a graphic of a "
"python's skin texture and a subtle shadow of the anaconda's head.  The "
"background emulates dense jungle foliage, and the case sides feature coiled "
"snake graphical elements."
msgstr ""
"鬱蒼と茂るジャングルの背景に、爬虫類の皮膚の質感とアナコンダの頭部のおぼろげなシルエットを表現した防水スマートフォンケースです。ケース側面にはとぐろを巻いたヘビが描かれています。"

#. ~ Variant name of item "waterproof smartphone case"
#: data/json/items/containers/containers.json
msgid "Eight-Legged Freaks smartphone case"
msgid_plural "Eight-Legged Freaks smartphone cases"
msgstr[0] "防水スマートフォンケース(『ｽﾊﾟｲﾀﾞｰﾊﾟﾆｯｸ!』)"

#. ~ Description of variant "Eight-Legged Freaks smartphone case" of item
#. "waterproof smartphone case"
#: data/json/items/containers/containers.json
msgid ""
"The design of this waterproof smartphone case features a graphic of spider "
"web outlines with intermittent sewn lines surrounding a four-eyed spider in "
"the middle.  The web's 3D-looking white strands create a striking contrast "
"with the dark background color palette."
msgstr ""
"背景にクモの巣のような模様が入ったケースの中央に、四つ目のクモが描かれています。クモの糸は3Dプリントされているように見え、暗い背景によく映えて印象的です。"

#. ~ Variant name of item "waterproof smartphone case"
#: data/json/items/containers/containers.json
msgid "Big Ass Spider smartphone case"
msgid_plural "Big Ass Spider smartphone cases"
msgstr[0] "防水スマートフォンケース(『ﾒｶﾞ･ｽﾊﾟｲﾀﾞｰ』)"

#. ~ Description of variant "Big Ass Spider smartphone case" of item
#. "waterproof smartphone case"
#: data/json/items/containers/containers.json
msgid ""
"This waterproof smartphone case features a black spider leg on a bright red "
"backdrop, with its shadow seen underneath.  The case's side texture presents"
" red web-like patterns with black spider legs."
msgstr ""
"真っ赤な背景に黒いクモの肢とその影がデザインされた防水スマートフォンケースです。ケースの側面には、クモの巣を模した赤色の模様と黒いクモの肢が描かれています。"

#. ~ Variant name of item "waterproof smartphone case"
#: data/json/items/containers/containers.json
msgid "The Creature from the Black Lagoon smartphone case"
msgid_plural "The Creature from the Black Lagoon smartphone cases"
msgstr[0] "防水スマートフォンケース(『大ｱﾏｿﾞﾝの半魚人』)"

#. ~ Description of variant "The Creature from the Black Lagoon smartphone
#. case" of item "waterproof smartphone case"
#: data/json/items/containers/containers.json
msgid ""
"The design of this waterproof smartphone case features an underwater scene "
"of the lagoon with the Creature's shadow lurking beneath the water's "
"surface.  The color scheme features blue and green tones to mimic the "
"lagoon's color palette."
msgstr "入江の水中の風景とそこに潜む怪物の影をデザインした防水スマートフォンケースです。入江の色彩をイメージした青と緑の色合いが特徴です。"

#. ~ Variant name of item "waterproof smartphone case"
#: data/json/items/containers/containers.json
msgid "Frankenstein smartphone case"
msgid_plural "Frankenstein smartphone cases"
msgstr[0] "防水スマートフォンケース(『ﾌﾗﾝｹﾝｼｭﾀｲﾝ』)"

#. ~ Description of variant "Frankenstein smartphone case" of item "waterproof
#. smartphone case"
#: data/json/items/containers/containers.json
msgid ""
"This waterproof smartphone case features multiple graphic stitches in a "
"sloppy, Frankensteinian style wrapped around the phone case in green and "
"metallic colors, symbolic of the animated monster's character."
msgstr "緑がかったメタリックカラーの背景に、有名なフランケンシュタインがアニメ風のデザインで複数描かれている防水スマートフォンケースです。"

#. ~ Variant name of item "waterproof smartphone case"
#: data/json/items/containers/containers.json
msgid "Day of the Dead smartphone case"
msgid_plural "Day of the Dead smartphone cases"
msgstr[0] "防水スマートフォンケース(『死霊のえじき』)"

#. ~ Description of variant "Day of the Dead smartphone case" of item
#. "waterproof smartphone case"
#: data/json/items/containers/containers.json
msgid ""
"This waterproof smartphone case features an underground military bunker "
"setting and a graphic of a zombie breaking through a chain-link fence, "
"alongside a recognizable smart zombie behind it.  The sides include a dark, "
"military-colored camo pattern and texture."
msgstr ""
"地下の軍事掩体壕で金網フェンスを突破するゾンビたちと、その背後に佇む知性をもつゾンビが描かれた、防水スマートフォンケースです。ケースの側面は、ミリタリー風の暗い迷彩柄が凹凸加工されています。"

#. ~ Variant name of item "waterproof smartphone case"
#: data/json/items/containers/containers.json
msgid "Dawn of the Dead smartphone case"
msgid_plural "Dawn of the Dead smartphone cases"
msgstr[0] "防水スマートフォンケース(『ｿﾞﾝﾋﾞ』)"

#. ~ Description of variant "Dawn of the Dead smartphone case" of item
#. "waterproof smartphone case"
#: data/json/items/containers/containers.json
msgid ""
"This waterproof smartphone case features a graphic of a blood-stained "
"shopping mall's facade with the letters 'D.O.T.D.' floating ominously behind"
" it.  The side grip of the case gives a nod to the mall floor with its "
"scattered products."
msgstr ""
"血にまみれたショッピングモールの外観とその背後に不気味に浮かぶ「D.O.T.D.」の文字が描かれた防水スマートフォンケースです。側面は、商品が散らばったモールの床を思い起こさせるデザインです。"

#. ~ Variant name of item "waterproof smartphone case"
#: data/json/items/containers/containers.json
msgid "Night of the Living Dead smartphone case"
msgid_plural "Night of the Living Dead smartphone cases"
msgstr[0] "防水スマートフォンケース(『ﾅｲﾄ･ｵﾌﾞ･ｻﾞ･ﾘﾋﾞﾝｸﾞﾃﾞｯﾄﾞ』)"

#. ~ Description of variant "Night of the Living Dead smartphone case" of item
#. "waterproof smartphone case"
#: data/json/items/containers/containers.json
msgid ""
"This waterproof smartphone case features a graphic of zombie silhouettes in "
"black and white with a swarm of 'dead' creeping from city buildings, giving "
"a nod to the movie's historical legacy in the genre."
msgstr ""
"街の建物の陰から忍び寄る「死者」の群れが白黒のシルエットで表現されている防水スマートフォンケースです。この作品がゾンビ映画における歴史的遺産であることを強く感じさせます。"

#. ~ Variant name of item "waterproof smartphone case"
#: data/json/items/containers/containers.json
msgid "Jeepers Creepers smartphone case"
msgid_plural "Jeepers Creepers smartphone cases"
msgstr[0] "防水スマートフォンケース(『ｼﾞｰﾊﾟｰｽﾞ･ｸﾘｰﾊﾟｰｽﾞ』)"

#. ~ Description of variant "Jeepers Creepers smartphone case" of item
#. "waterproof smartphone case"
#: data/json/items/containers/containers.json
msgid ""
"This waterproof smartphone case features a graphic of a winged creature "
"identical to the movie's villain.  The ground beneath the creature's feet is"
" cracked with dark textures, and it is looking directly at the viewer, "
"giving off an eerie vibe."
msgstr ""
"映画に登場する翼をもった怪物が描かれた防水スマートフォンケースです。怪物の足元の部分はひび割れたような加工が施されており、まっすぐにこちらを見つめる怪物の目は不気味な雰囲気を放っています。"

#. ~ Variant name of item "waterproof smartphone case"
#: data/json/items/containers/containers.json
msgid "Terrifier smartphone case"
msgid_plural "Terrifier smartphone cases"
msgstr[0] "防水スマートフォンケース(『ﾃﾘﾌｧｰ』)"

#. ~ Description of variant "Terrifier smartphone case" of item "waterproof
#. smartphone case"
#: data/json/items/containers/containers.json
msgid ""
"This waterproof smartphone case features a joker-like face painting on the "
"case's back with a graphic crimson star and stripes accent.  On the side, "
"the case features red and black vertical stripes to evoke an image of the "
"movie's main antagonist's clown costume."
msgstr ""
"背面におどけたような表情のフェイスペイントを施した人物と赤く染まった星条旗が描かれた防水スマートフォンケースです。側面には、この映画の悪役が着用しているピエロの衣装をイメージさせる赤色と黒色の縞模様が入っています。"

#. ~ Variant name of item "waterproof smartphone case"
#: data/json/items/containers/containers.json
msgid "My Bloody Valentine smartphone case"
msgid_plural "My Bloody Valentine smartphone cases"
msgstr[0] "防水スマートフォンケース(『血のﾊﾞﾚﾝﾀｲﾝ』)"

#. ~ Description of variant "My Bloody Valentine smartphone case" of item
#. "waterproof smartphone case"
#: data/json/items/containers/containers.json
msgid ""
"This waterproof smartphone case features a graphic of a black-colored "
"miner's helmet and gas mask with a blood splatter effect, alongside a bloody"
" pickaxe, giving attention to the movie's important crime scene element.  "
"The case's sides resemble cave walls with rock-like textures."
msgstr ""
"この防水スマートフォンケースには、血飛沫を背景に、映画の重要なシーンに登場するヘルメットとガスマスクを付け血塗れのつるはしを構えた鉱山労働者が暗いタッチで描かれています。ケースの側面は洞窟の壁を思わせる岩のような質感になっています。"

#. ~ Variant name of item "waterproof smartphone case"
#: data/json/items/containers/containers.json
msgid "Hostel smartphone case"
msgid_plural "Hostel smartphone cases"
msgstr[0] "防水スマートフォンケース(『ﾎｽﾃﾙ』)"

#. ~ Description of variant "Hostel smartphone case" of item "waterproof
#. smartphone case"
#: data/json/items/containers/containers.json
msgid ""
"This waterproof smartphone case features a dark design with a graphic of "
"fingers taped up and blood dripping from them.  The case's sidewalls double "
"as barbed wire or chains, adding contextual depth."
msgstr ""
"テープが巻かれた指から血が滴っている様子を暗い色で描いた防水スマートフォンケースです。ケースの側面には有刺鉄線、あるいはチェーンのようなデザインになっており、雰囲気をさらに高めています。"

#. ~ Variant name of item "waterproof smartphone case"
#: data/json/items/containers/containers.json
msgid "Giant Spider Invasion smartphone case"
msgid_plural "Giant Spider Invasion smartphone cases"
msgstr[0] "防水スマートフォンケース(『ｼﾞｬｲｱﾝﾄ･ｽﾊﾟｲﾀﾞｰ』)"

#. ~ Description of variant "Giant Spider Invasion smartphone case" of item
#. "waterproof smartphone case"
#: data/json/items/containers/containers.json
msgid ""
"This waterproof smartphone case features a graphic of a giant spider with "
"its legs extended and positioned as though wrapping around the case.  The "
"background texture mimics space, giving an extraterrestrial theme to the "
"case."
msgstr ""
"ケース全体を包み込むように巨大グモの姿がデザインされた防水スマートフォンケースです。背景には宇宙を思わせる模様が入っており、このクモが地球外生命体であることを表わしています。"

#. ~ Variant name of item "waterproof smartphone case"
#: data/json/items/containers/containers.json
msgid "Nosferatu smartphone case"
msgid_plural "Nosferatu smartphone cases"
msgstr[0] "防水スマートフォンケース(『ﾉｽﾌｪﾗﾄｩ』)"

#. ~ Description of variant "Nosferatu smartphone case" of item "waterproof
#. smartphone case"
#: data/json/items/containers/containers.json
msgid ""
"This waterproof smartphone case features subtle elements from the movie, "
"including a graphic of castle spires against a blood-red sky.  A shadowy "
"figure can be seen lurking under the castle.  The sides of the case feature "
"bats, fangs, and other gothic motifs in silver."
msgstr ""
"血のように赤い空を背景に、城の尖頭などの映画に登場する要素が描かれている防水スマートフォンケースです。城の傍には怪しげな影が潜んでおり、ケース側面にはコウモリや牙などのゴシック風の銀色のモチーフが散りばめられています。"

#. ~ Variant name of item "waterproof smartphone case"
#: data/json/items/containers/containers.json
msgid "Mars Attacks smartphone case"
msgid_plural "Mars Attacks smartphone cases"
msgstr[0] "防水スマートフォンケース(『ﾏｰｽﾞ･ｱﾀｯｸ!』)"

#. ~ Description of variant "Mars Attacks smartphone case" of item "waterproof
#. smartphone case"
#: data/json/items/containers/containers.json
msgid ""
"This waterproof smartphone case features an image of a menacing alien "
"spaceship hovering over a cityscape at night.  The case's sides have neon "
"green and magenta stripes to give a nod to the movie's color palette and a "
"small graphic of a Martian soldier from the movie."
msgstr ""
"夜の街並みに浮かぶ恐ろしい異星人の宇宙船をプリントした防水スマートフォンケースです。ケースの側面には、この映画を象徴するネオングリーンとマゼンタの縞模様を背景に、火星人の兵士が描かれています。"

#. ~ Variant name of item "waterproof smartphone case"
#: data/json/items/containers/containers.json
msgid "The Day After Tomorrow smartphone case"
msgid_plural "The Day After Tomorrow smartphone cases"
msgstr[0] "防水スマートフォンケース(『ﾃﾞｲ･ｱﾌﾀｰ･ﾄｩﾓﾛｰ』)"

#. ~ Description of variant "The Day After Tomorrow smartphone case" of item
#. "waterproof smartphone case"
#: data/json/items/containers/containers.json
msgid ""
"This waterproof smartphone case features a graphic of icebergs floating in "
"the ocean with a cracked blue texture, giving a hint to the movie's overall "
"environment.  The sidewalls include weather-related graphics, such as "
"lightning and clouds."
msgstr ""
"映画の舞台を連想させる、ひびが入ったような青いテクスチャーで海に浮かぶ氷山が描かれた防水スマートフォンケースです。側面には稲妻や雲など気象に関するデザインが描かれています。"

#. ~ Variant name of item "waterproof smartphone case"
#: data/json/items/containers/containers.json
msgid "2012 smartphone case"
msgid_plural "2012 smartphone cases"
msgstr[0] "防水スマートフォンケース(『2012』)"

#. ~ Description of variant "2012 smartphone case" of item "waterproof
#. smartphone case"
#: data/json/items/containers/containers.json
msgid ""
"This waterproof smartphone case features a graphic of modern high-rise "
"buildings sinking in floodwater with a dark and gloomy blue and green color "
"palette.  The sidewalls evoke the same colors in a pattern resembling the "
"water's flow."
msgstr ""
"水害により水没していく現代的な高層ビルを暗く陰鬱な青と緑の色使いで描いた防水スマートフォンケースです。側面も同じ色使いですが、流水に似た模様が重なっています。"

#. ~ Variant name of item "waterproof smartphone case"
#: data/json/items/containers/containers.json
msgid "The Day Earth Stood Still smartphone case"
msgid_plural "The Day Earth Stood Still smartphone cases"
msgstr[0] "防水スマートフォンケース(『地球が静止する日』)"

#. ~ Description of variant "The Day Earth Stood Still smartphone case" of
#. item "waterproof smartphone case"
#: data/json/items/containers/containers.json
msgid ""
"This waterproof smartphone case features an image of an extraterrestrial "
"spacecraft hovering over a city at night with intricate details resembling "
"the craft from the movie.  The sidewalls include graphics of the solar "
"system and other space motifs."
msgstr ""
"夜の街の上空に浮かぶ異星人の宇宙船が描かれた防水スマートフォンケースです。宇宙船は映画に登場するものに似せた非常に複雑なデザインになっており、ケースの側面には太陽系惑星などの宇宙をモチーフにした模様が並んでいます。"

#. ~ Variant name of item "waterproof smartphone case"
#: data/json/items/containers/containers.json
msgid "Galaxy of Terror smartphone case"
msgid_plural "Galaxy of Terror smartphone cases"
msgstr[0] "防水スマートフォンケース(『恐怖の惑星』)"

#. ~ Description of variant "Galaxy of Terror smartphone case" of item
#. "waterproof smartphone case"
#: data/json/items/containers/containers.json
msgid ""
"This waterproof smartphone case features a graphic of a galaxy with stars, "
"planets, and a dark looming force in its center, giving an ode to the "
"movie's intriguing cosmic horror.  The sidewalls incorporate a similar "
"starry design with abstract waves."
msgstr ""
"星々が散りばめられた防水スマートフォンケースの中心には、闇の力を秘めた銀河系が描かれており、映画に登場する不思議な宇宙的恐怖を煽っています。ケースの側面には波や星空を表わす抽象的な模様が描かれています。"

#. ~ Variant name of item "waterproof smartphone case"
#: data/json/items/containers/containers.json
msgid "The Thing smartphone case"
msgid_plural "The Thing smartphone cases"
msgstr[0] "防水スマートフォンケース(『遊星からの物体X』)"

#. ~ Description of variant "The Thing smartphone case" of item "waterproof
#. smartphone case"
#: data/json/items/containers/containers.json
msgid ""
"This waterproof smartphone case features an icy blue background with a "
"graphic of the Thing's iconic 'hooded' features in the center.  The case's "
"sides resemble the rugged and icy Antarctic terrain where the film takes "
"place."
msgstr ""
"アイスブルーの背景に、物体Xを象徴する「フードをかぶった人物」のグラフィックが描かれています。ケースの側面には、映画の舞台となる凍てついた南極の地形をイメージした模様が刻まれています。"

#. ~ Variant name of item "waterproof smartphone case"
#: data/json/items/containers/containers.json
msgid "The Blob smartphone case"
msgid_plural "The Blob smartphone cases"
msgstr[0] "防水スマートフォンケース(『ﾌﾞﾛﾌﾞ』)"

#. ~ Description of variant "The Blob smartphone case" of item "waterproof
#. smartphone case"
#: data/json/items/containers/containers.json
msgid ""
"This waterproof smartphone case features a graphic of a metallic surface "
"with red and silver colors and subtle tendrils interwoven around it, giving "
"a nod to the movie's titular villain.  The sidewalls resemble veins through "
"a similar design."
msgstr ""
"この防水スマートフォンケースは、赤色と銀色のメタリックな背景に、映画に登場する怪物の触手がうっすらと描かれています。ケースの側面も同様のデザインで、まるで血管が伸びているように見えます。"

#. ~ Variant name of item "waterproof smartphone case"
#: data/json/items/containers/containers.json
msgid "Planet Terror smartphone case"
msgid_plural "Planet Terror smartphone cases"
msgstr[0] "防水スマートフォンケース(『ﾌﾟﾗﾈｯﾄ･ﾃﾗｰ』)"

#. ~ Description of variant "Planet Terror smartphone case" of item
#. "waterproof smartphone case"
#: data/json/items/containers/containers.json
msgid ""
"This waterproof smartphone case features an image of a toxic green zombie "
"hand with a graphic resembling the weapon attached to Cherry's stump in the "
"movie.  The sidewalls are deep red, with blood-effect splatters on top of "
"them."
msgstr ""
"この防水スマートフォンケースには、映画の主人公チェリーが脚として使っていた銃器と、毒々しい緑色のゾンビの手が描かれています。側面は深紅色に塗られており、血が飛び散ったような模様が入っています。"

#. ~ Variant name of item "waterproof smartphone case"
#: data/json/items/containers/containers.json
msgid "Shaun of the Dead smartphone case"
msgid_plural "Shaun of the Dead smartphone cases"
msgstr[0] "防水スマートフォンケース(『ｼｮｰﾝ･ｵﾌﾞ･ｻﾞ･ﾃﾞｯﾄﾞ』)"

#. ~ Description of variant "Shaun of the Dead smartphone case" of item
#. "waterproof smartphone case"
#: data/json/items/containers/containers.json
msgid ""
"This waterproof smartphone case features a graphic of zombie silhouettes in "
"a comic-style format on a black background.  The sidewalls include a subtle "
"'blood effect' graphic, along with design elements of basic, mundane "
"everyday objects recently used as weapons."
msgstr ""
"黒色の背景にコミック風のデザインのゾンビのシルエットを描いた防水スマートフォンケースです。側面には、近頃武器として使われるようになったありふれた日用品のグラフィックが並んでおり、それら全てにうっすらと「血飛沫」がプリントされています。"

#. ~ Variant name of item "waterproof smartphone case"
#: data/json/items/containers/containers.json
msgid "Day of the Triffids smartphone case"
msgid_plural "Day of the Triffids smartphone cases"
msgstr[0] "防水スマートフォンケース(『人類SOS!』)"

#. ~ Description of variant "Day of the Triffids smartphone case" of item
#. "waterproof smartphone case"
#: data/json/items/containers/containers.json
msgid ""
"This waterproof smartphone case features a graphic of a giant plant with "
"monster-like tendrils wrapped in gritty textures and faded imagery in the "
"background.  The sidewalls resemble the stems of a giant plant with somewhat"
" abstract foliage."
msgstr ""
"この防水スマートフォンケースには、ざらついた質感と褪せた色合いで、蔦を伸ばす巨大な植物型モンスターが描かれています。側面には、巨大植物の葉や茎を表わす抽象的な模様がプリントされています。"

#. ~ Variant name of item "waterproof smartphone case"
#: data/json/items/containers/containers.json
msgid "Bird Box smartphone case"
msgid_plural "Bird Box smartphone cases"
msgstr[0] "防水スマートフォンケース(『ﾊﾞｰﾄﾞ･ﾎﾞｯｸｽ』)"

#. ~ Description of variant "Bird Box smartphone case" of item "waterproof
#. smartphone case"
#: data/json/items/containers/containers.json
msgid ""
"This waterproof smartphone case features a graphic of a blindfolded face on "
"a black background with subtle patterns in the wallpaper.  The sidewalls "
"have a broken, abstract hue with some light elements and waves."
msgstr ""
"黒色の背景に、目隠しされた顔のグラフィックを薄くプリントした防水スマートフォンケースです。側面には、光や波を表わしているような抽象的な模様が描かれています。"

#. ~ Variant name of item "waterproof smartphone case"
#: data/json/items/containers/containers.json
msgid "Dracula smartphone case"
msgid_plural "Dracula smartphone cases"
msgstr[0] "防水スマートフォンケース(『魔人ﾄﾞﾗｷｭﾗ』)"

#. ~ Description of variant "Dracula smartphone case" of item "waterproof
#. smartphone case"
#: data/json/items/containers/containers.json
msgid ""
"This waterproof smartphone case features an image of a classic gothic castle"
" with a sinister font in tones of blood red, deep black, and gothic "
"elements.  The sidewalls resemble the stone-walled interiors of the same "
"castle, with colors matching the dominant colors of the case."
msgstr ""
"古風なゴシック様式の城が描かれた、血のような赤色と深い黒、古めかしく不吉な字体が特徴的な防水スマートフォンケースです。側面の色も統一感があり、城の石壁が描かれています。"

#. ~ Variant name of item "waterproof smartphone case"
#: data/json/items/containers/containers.json
msgid "Darkness Falls smartphone case"
msgid_plural "Darkness Falls smartphone cases"
msgstr[0] "防水スマートフォンケース(『黒の怨』)"

#. ~ Description of variant "Darkness Falls smartphone case" of item
#. "waterproof smartphone case"
#: data/json/items/containers/containers.json
msgid ""
"This waterproof smartphone case features an image of a creepy tooth fairy "
"with sharp, acidic white accents on a dark black background.  The sidewalls "
"include personal toothbrush elements."
msgstr ""
"真っ黒な背景にくっきりと鮮やかな白をアクセントにした不気味な「歯の妖精」が描かれた防水スマートフォンケースです。側面は歯ブラシのようなデザインになっています。"

#. ~ Variant name of item "waterproof smartphone case"
#: data/json/items/containers/containers.json
msgid "The Mist smartphone case"
msgid_plural "The Mist smartphone cases"
msgstr[0] "防水スマートフォンケース(『ﾐｽﾄ』)"

#. ~ Description of variant "The Mist smartphone case" of item "waterproof
#. smartphone case"
#: data/json/items/containers/containers.json
msgid ""
"This waterproof smartphone case features a graphic of a white, ominous cloud"
" over a suburban environment at night with tree branches and lightning in "
"the background.  The sidewalls include misty abstract elements and tree "
"graphics."
msgstr ""
"この防水スマートフォンケースには、稲妻が走る空と木々を背景に、夜の郊外に広がる不気味な白い霧が描かれています。側面は霧のようにもやがかかった色をしており、木々を表わす模様が並んでいます。"

#. ~ Variant name of item "waterproof smartphone case"
#: data/json/items/containers/containers.json
msgid "Silent Hill smartphone case"
msgid_plural "Silent Hill smartphone cases"
msgstr[0] "防水スマートフォンケース(『ｻｲﾚﾝﾄﾋﾙ』)"

#. ~ Description of variant "Silent Hill smartphone case" of item "waterproof
#. smartphone case"
#: data/json/items/containers/containers.json
msgid ""
"This waterproof smartphone case features a graphic of a sinister fog with an"
" iconic pyramid-headed silhouette in a dark world.  The sidewalls evoke an "
"intermittent window pattern with the world's colors moving over it."
msgstr ""
"この防水スマートフォンケースには、暗い色の不気味な霧深い世界を背景に、ピラミッド型の頭部が特徴的な怪物が描かれています。側面の色はグラデーションになっており、たくさんの窓が並んでいます。"

#. ~ Variant name of item "waterproof smartphone case"
#: data/json/items/containers/containers.json
msgid "Slenderman smartphone case"
msgid_plural "Slenderman smartphone cases"
msgstr[0] "防水スマートフォンケース(『ｽﾚﾝﾀﾞｰﾏﾝ』)"

#. ~ Description of variant "Slenderman smartphone case" of item "waterproof
#. smartphone case"
#: data/json/items/containers/containers.json
msgid ""
"This waterproof smartphone case features a graphic of black and white mixed "
"with static running through a dark background with fog and trees.  You can "
"see the mysterious figure of the pale, faceless stalker among those trees.  "
"The sidewalls resemble trees, with the same static running through them."
msgstr ""
"この防水スマートフォンケースには、白黒のスノーノイズを背景に、霧深く暗い静かな森が描写されています。木々の間には、顔のない青白い人型生物が立っています。ケースの側面には木々を表わす模様とスノーノイズがプリントされています。"

#. ~ Variant name of item "waterproof smartphone case"
#: data/json/items/containers/containers.json
msgid "Bates Motel smartphone case"
msgid_plural "Bates Motel smartphone cases"
msgstr[0] "防水スマートフォンケース(『ﾍﾞｲﾂ･ﾓｰﾃﾙ』)"

#. ~ Description of variant "Bates Motel smartphone case" of item "waterproof
#. smartphone case"
#: data/json/items/containers/containers.json
msgid ""
"This waterproof smartphone case features a graphic of a creepy motel sign "
"that can become warm and soothing with a touch of nostalgia for the old "
"times.  The sidewalls feature floral patterns serenading the hotel's name."
msgstr ""
"不気味なモーテルの看板をプリントした、どこか懐かしさと温かみを感じる防水スマートフォンケースです。側面には花柄に囲まれたホテル名がプリントされています。"

#. ~ Variant name of item "waterproof smartphone case"
#: data/json/items/containers/containers.json
msgid "Black Universe smartphone case"
msgid_plural "Black Universe smartphone cases"
msgstr[0] "防水スマートフォンケース(黒宇宙)"

#. ~ Description of variant "Black Universe smartphone case" of item
#. "waterproof smartphone case"
#: data/json/items/containers/containers.json
msgid ""
"This black waterproof smartphone case is made with high-quality, state-of-"
"the-art materials.  The printing on the material looks exactly like the "
"background of outer space you used to see in movies."
msgstr "品質の高い最先端の素材で作られた、黒色の防水スマートフォンケースです。映画でよく見るような宇宙の景色がプリントされています。"

#. ~ Variant name of item "waterproof smartphone case"
#: data/json/items/containers/containers.json
msgid "White Universe smartphone case"
msgid_plural "White Universe smartphone cases"
msgstr[0] "防水スマートフォンケース(白宇宙)"

#. ~ Description of variant "White Universe smartphone case" of item
#. "waterproof smartphone case"
#: data/json/items/containers/containers.json
msgid ""
"This white waterproof smartphone case is made with high-quality, state-of-"
"the-art materials.  The printing on the material looks exactly like the "
"background of outer space you used to see in movies; however, instead of a "
"black background, celestial bodies, and white dots, it presents you with a "
"white background of outer space, celestial bodies, and black dots."
msgstr ""
"品質の高い最先端の素材で作られた、白色の防水スマートフォンケースです。映画でよく見るような宇宙の景色がプリントされていますが、色が逆転しており、白色の背景に黒色の天体が散りばめられています。"

#. ~ Variant name of item "waterproof smartphone case"
#: data/json/items/containers/containers.json
msgid "zombie smartphone case"
msgid_plural "zombie smartphone cases"
msgstr[0] "防水スマートフォンケース(ｿﾞﾝﾋﾞ)"

#. ~ Description of variant "zombie smartphone case" of item "waterproof
#. smartphone case"
#: data/json/items/containers/containers.json
msgid ""
"This waterproof smartphone case has a green zombie on its reverse side.  "
"Would using this be in poor taste now?"
msgstr "背面に緑色のゾンビがプリントされた防水スマートフォンケースです。今の状況でこのデザインを選ぶのは悪趣味でしょうか？"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/containers/containers.json
msgid "waterproof camera case"
msgid_plural "waterproof camera cases"
msgstr[0] "防水カメラケース"

#. ~ Description of "waterproof camera case"
#: data/json/items/containers/containers.json
msgid ""
"A waterproof case designed for a standard camera.  Will protect your camera "
"from water damage entirely."
msgstr "一般的なカメラ向けに作られた防水ケースです。カメラの水濡れによる故障を完全に防ぎます。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/containers/containers.json
msgid "small waterskin"
msgid_plural "small waterskins"
msgstr[0] "革水筒(1.5L)"

#. ~ Description of "small waterskin"
#: data/json/items/containers/containers.json
msgid ""
"A small watertight leather bag with a carrying strap, can hold 1.5 liters of"
" water."
msgstr "水が漏れないように作られた革製の小さな水筒です。1.5Lまで液体が入ります。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/containers/containers.json
msgid "waterskin"
msgid_plural "waterskins"
msgstr[0] "革水筒(3L)"

#. ~ Description of "waterskin"
#: data/json/items/containers/containers.json
