msgid_plural "small MRE bags"
msgstr[0] "小型MREパック"

#. ~ Description of "small MRE bag"
#. ~ Description of "MRE dessert bag"
#. ~ Description of "MRE spread bag"
#. ~ Description of "MRE jam bag"
#: data/json/items/containers/containers.json
msgid ""
"A small, sturdy, plastic and aluminum container of multi-layered "
"construction, with detailed nutritional information about its contents."
msgstr "中身に関する詳細な栄養情報が記載された、多重構造のビニールとアルミニウムで作られた小さく頑丈な容器です。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/containers/containers.json
msgid "MRE bag"
msgid_plural "MRE bags"
msgstr[0] "MREパック"

#. ~ Description of "MRE bag"
#: data/json/items/containers/containers.json
msgid ""
"A sturdy plastic and aluminum container of multi-layered construction, with "
"detailed nutritional information about its contents."
msgstr "中身に関する詳細な栄養情報が記載された、多重構造のビニールとアルミニウムで作られた頑丈な容器です。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/containers/containers.json
msgid "MRE package"
msgid_plural "MRE packages"
msgstr[0] "大型MREパック"

#. ~ Description of "MRE package"
#: data/json/items/containers/containers.json
msgid ""
"The Meal, Ready-to-Eat - also known as the MRE - is the individual field "
"ration of the United States Armed Forces.  It is in a lightweight yet sturdy"
" multi-layered plastic and aluminum foil container - essentially a flexible "
"can."
