msgid "marksmen's conversion kit"
msgid_plural "marksmen's conversion kits"
msgstr[0] "口径変換セット(選抜射手)"

#. ~ Description of "marksmen's conversion kit"
#: data/json/items/containers/conversions.json
msgid ""
"This is an expansive cardboard box, stamped with manufacturer markings and "
"emblazoned with the stylized image of an assembled high-caliber rifle.  "
"Containing appropriate retool components for a larger than typical given "
"weapon platform, including big-bore upper receiver assemblies, quick-swap "
"sniper barrels, and assorted extras (such as magazines), its contents could "
"be used to rechamber a compatible rifle."
msgstr ""
"メーカーのロゴと、変換キットを取り付けた大口径ライフルの簡略図がプリントされた、巨大な段ボール箱です。内部には一般的なものより大きな銃器の口径変換に用いるキットと、大口径銃用アッパーレシーバー、着脱が簡単な狙撃用銃身、その他弾倉などの付属品が入っています。変換キットを使うと、互換性のあるライフルの口径を変えることができます。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/containers/conversions.json
msgid "large rifle conversion kit"
msgid_plural "large rifle conversion kits"
msgstr[0] "口径変換セット(大型ライフル)"

#. ~ Description of "large rifle conversion kit"
#: data/json/items/containers/conversions.json
msgid ""
"This is a large cardboard box, stamped with manufacturer markings and "
"emblazoned with the stylized image of a large, assembled rifle.  Containing "
"appropriate retool components for a given weapon platform, including high-"
"caliber upper receiver assemblies, quick-swap marksman barrels, and assorted"
" extras (such as magazines), its contents could be used to rechamber a "
"compatible rifle."
msgstr ""
"メーカーのロゴと、変換キットを取り付けた大型ライフルの簡略図がプリントされた、大きな段ボール箱です。内部には特定の銃器の口径変換に用いる部品一式と、大口径銃用アッパーレシーバー、着脱が簡単な狙撃用銃身、その他弾倉などの付属品が入っています。変換キットを使うと、互換性のあるライフルの口径を変えることができます。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/containers/conversions.json
msgid "standard rifle conversion kit"
msgid_plural "standard rifle conversion kits"
msgstr[0] "口径変換セット(中型ライフル)"

#. ~ Description of "standard rifle conversion kit"
#: data/json/items/containers/conversions.json
msgid ""
"This is a sturdy cardboard box, stamped with manufacturer markings and "
"emblazoned with the stylized image of an assembled rifle.  Containing "
"appropriate retool components for an average weapon platform, including "
"upper receiver assemblies, swappable barrels, and assorted extras (such as "
"magazines), its contents could be used to rechamber a compatible rifle."
msgstr ""
"メーカーのロゴと、変換キットを取り付けたライフルの簡略図がプリントされた、頑丈な段ボール箱です。内部には一般的なサイズの銃器の口径変換に用いる部品一式と、アッパーレシーバー、着脱が簡単な銃身、その他弾倉などの付属品が入っています。変換キットを使うと、互換性のあるライフルの口径を変えることができます。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/containers/conversions.json
msgid "SBR conversion kit"
msgid_plural "SBR conversion kits"
msgstr[0] "口径変換セット(ショートバレルライフル)"

#. ~ Description of "SBR conversion kit"
#: data/json/items/containers/conversions.json
msgid ""
"This is a modestly proportioned cardboard box, stamped with manufacturer "
"markings and emblazoned with the stylized image of an assembled, short-"
"barreled rifle.  Containing appropriate retool components for a given weapon"
" platform, including compact upper receiver assemblies, short quick-swap "
"barrels, and assorted extras (such as magazines), its contents could be used"
" to rechamber a compatible rifle."
msgstr ""
"メーカーのロゴと、変換キットを取り付けたショートバレルライフルの簡略図がプリントされた、あまり大きくない段ボール箱です。内部には特定の銃器の口径変換に用いる部品一式と、小型アッパーレシーバー、着脱が簡単な小型銃身、その他弾倉などの付属品が入っています。変換キットを使うと、互換性のあるライフルの口径を変えることができます。"

#. ~ Item name
