#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/containers/generic.json
msgid "set of clothes"
msgid_plural "sets of clothes"
msgstr[0] "着替えセット"

#. ~ Description of "set of clothes"
#: data/json/items/containers/generic.json
msgid ""
"A bundle of presses, coat hangars, and other miscellaneous items needed to "
"store and keep a good change of clothes.  You can interact with it to swap "
"to the clothes it's currently containing, or disassemble it to get the "
"clothes back."
msgstr ""
"着用アイテムを保管して楽に着替えるための、アイロンやコート掛けといった様々な道具類です。調べると、保管している着用アイテムに着替えられます。分解すると、保管している着替えを取り出します。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/containers/generic.json
msgid "small paper box"
msgid_plural "small paper boxes"
msgstr[0] "紙箱"

#. ~ Description of "small paper box"
#: data/json/items/containers/generic.json
msgid "A very small paper box."
msgstr "紙製の非常に小さな箱です。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/containers/generic.json
msgid "vacuum-sealed package"
msgid_plural "vacuum-sealed packages"
msgstr[0] "真空パック"

#. ~ Description of "vacuum-sealed package"
#: data/json/items/containers/generic.json
msgid ""
"A hermetically sealed article of packaging, made from thick plastic, "
"designed to keep the contents isolated from atmospheric contact.  Shame that"
" its properties melt away after you tear it open to get at the goodies "
"within."
msgstr "厚いビニール製の密閉された包装容器です。内容物が外気に触れない作りになっていますが、一度開封するとその利点は失われてしまいます。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/containers/lab.json
msgid "secured plastic box"
msgid_plural "secured plastic boxes"
msgstr[0] "保管箱"

#. ~ Description of "secured plastic box"
#: data/json/items/containers/lab.json
msgid ""
"A small plastic box with a rugged exterior, the cover securely held by "
"several small latches."
msgstr "頑丈そうな外装に包まれた、プラスチック製の小箱です。蓋は複数の小さな掛け金でしっかり固定されています。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/containers/lab.json
msgid "30 gallon barrel"
msgid_plural "30 gallon barrels"
msgstr[0] "プラスチック樽(112.5L)"

#. ~ Description of "30 gallon barrel"
#: data/json/items/containers/lab.json
msgid ""
"A huge plastic barrel with a watertight lid.  It's surface is completely "
"covered with hazard warning labels and, most importantly, a giant red tape, "
"that reads \"IMPURE CATALYST, DO NOT USE, FAILED SAMPLE, DO NOT USE, IMPURE "
"CATALYST…\""
msgstr ""
"防水蓋が付いたプラスチック製の巨大な樽です。表面は危険を警告するラベルに覆われていますが、特に目立つのは「汚染触媒 使用禁止 不全サンプル 使用禁止 "
"汚染触媒...」と繰り返し書かれた大きな赤色のテープです。"

