#. ~ Description of "inactive broken cyborg"
#: data/json/items/corpses/inactive_bots.json
msgid ""
"A deactivated broken cyborg, the last shreds of its humanity still rotting "
"away.  Using this item involves placing it on the ground and reactivating "
"its mechanical body.  If reprogrammed and rewired successfully, the cyborg "
"will then follow you and attack enemies.  You monster."
msgstr ""
