"The broken cyborg rises to the sound of screeching metal and peers around "
"for hostiles."
msgstr "壊れたサイボーグは金属音に似た叫び声を上げ、敵対者を捜し始めました。"

#. ~ "hostile_msg" action message of item "inactive broken cyborg"
