msgid "auto"
msgstr "オート"

#. ~ Name of a gun
#: data/json/items/gun/20x66mm.json
msgid "compact caseless shotgun"
msgid_plural "compact caseless shotguns"
msgstr[0] "ショットガン(20x66mm/小型ｹｰｽﾚｽ)"

#. ~ Description of gun "compact caseless shotgun"
#: data/json/items/gun/20x66mm.json
msgid ""
"Designed by Rivtech and designated the RM228 PDW, chambering the powerful "
"20x66mm caseless shotgun cartridge, this gun was designed for the civilian "
"personal defense market with durability and ease of use as priorities.  "
"While lauded for its small size and light weight, its hefty price tag kept "
"it out of the reach of casual collectors."
msgstr ""
"Rivtech社が設計し、RM228 "
"PDWと命名したこの銃は、強力な20x66mmケースレス弾薬を装填します。自衛用として民間市場で売れるように、耐久性と扱いやすさを優先した作りになっています。小型で軽量な点は高く評価されていますが、高価なため普通のコレクターには手が届きません。"

#. ~ Variant name of gun "compact caseless shotgun"
#: data/json/items/gun/20x66mm.json
msgid "RM228 PDW"
msgid_plural "RM228 PDWs"
msgstr[0] "ハンドガン(20x66mm/RM228 PDW)"

#. ~ Description of variant "compact caseless shotgun" of gun "RM228 PDW"
#: data/json/items/gun/20x66mm.json
msgid ""
"Chambering the powerful 20x66mm caseless shotgun cartridge, the Rivtech "
"RM228 PDW was designed for the civilian personal defense market with "
"durability and ease of use as priorities.  While lauded for its small size "
"and light weight, its hefty price tag kept it out of the reach of casual "
"collectors."
msgstr ""
"ショットガン用の強力な20x66mmケースレス弾薬を装填できるRivtech社製RM228 "
"PDWは、民間人の防衛用に設計されたもので、耐久性と扱いやすさに優れています。小型で軽量な点が評価され、気楽なコレクターでは手が届かないような値段で取引されています。"

#. ~ Name of a gun
#: data/json/items/gun/22.json data/mods/BombasticPerks/perkdata/old_guns.json
msgid "small game rifle"
msgid_plural "small game rifles"
msgstr[0] "ライフル(.22口径/小動物猟銃)"

#. ~ Description of gun "small game rifle"
#: data/json/items/gun/22.json
msgid ""
"A venerable .22 caliber lever-action rifle, with a 19-round tube magazine "
"and a classic design that dates back over a century.  Generally used for the"
" hunting of small game like rabbits, the strict taxonomic classification of "
"zombies as 'small game' is debatable, but this decades-old weapon can still "
"be counted upon to help manage the undead population."
msgstr ""
"19発の弾薬を装填できるチューブ型弾倉を備えた、1世紀以上前に作られたクラシックなデザインの.22口径レバーアクションライフルです。一般的にはウサギなど小動物の狩猟に使われます。ゾンビを「小動物」に分類すべきか否かは議論の余地がありますが、この時代遅れの銃器は現代でもゾンビ駆除に役立ちます。"

#. ~ Variant name of gun "small game rifle"
#: data/json/items/gun/22.json
msgid "Marlin 39A rifle"
msgid_plural "Marlin 39A rifles"
msgstr[0] "ライフル(.22口径/ﾏｰﾘﾝ39A)"

#. ~ Description of variant "small game rifle" of gun "Marlin 39A rifle"
#: data/json/items/gun/22.json
msgid ""
"The oldest and longest-produced shoulder firearm in the world.  Though it "
"fires the weak .22 round, it is highly accurate and damaging, and has "
"essentially no recoil."
msgstr ""
"肩付けで構える火器の中で世界最古にして世界最長生産期間記録を持つライフルです。使用弾薬はまったく非力ですが、精度に優れ、ほとんど反動がありません。"

#. ~ Name of a gun
#: data/json/items/gun/22.json
msgid ".22 pipe rifle"
msgid_plural ".22 pipe rifles"
msgstr[0] "ライフル(.22口径/ﾊﾟｲﾌﾟ銃)"

#. ~ Description of gun ".22 pipe rifle"
#. ~ Description of gun "pipe rifle: .38 Special"
#. ~ Description of gun ".44 Magnum pipe rifle"
#: data/json/items/gun/22.json data/json/items/gun/38.json
#: data/json/items/gun/44.json
msgid ""
"A home-made rifle.  It is simply a pipe attached to a stock, with a hammer "
"to strike the single round it holds."
msgstr "簡素な自家製ライフルです。単発式で、パイプと銃床を組み合わせたフレームに引き金と撃鉄が付いています。"

#. ~ Name of a gun
#: data/json/items/gun/22.json
msgid "varmint rifle"
msgid_plural "varmint rifles"
msgstr[0] "ライフル(.22口径/ﾊﾞｰﾐﾝﾄ)"

#. ~ Description of gun "varmint rifle"
#: data/json/items/gun/22.json
msgid ""
"A lightweight and modular pistol caliber hunting carbine, firing the low "
"power .22 LR cartridge.  Before the Cataclysm, a mix of high "
"customizability, cheap ammunition, and low recoil made this a very popular "
"varmint rifle amongst civilian shooters."
msgstr ""
"ピストルのような低威力の.22口径LR弾を発射する、軽量で持ち運びやすいハンティングカービンです。大変動以前は、高いカスタマイズ性、安価な弾薬、低反動という要素が功を奏し、市井の射撃愛好家の間で非常に高い人気を誇っていました。"

#. ~ Variant name of gun "varmint rifle"
#: data/json/items/gun/22.json
msgid "Ruger 10/22 rifle"
msgid_plural "Ruger 10/22 rifles"
msgstr[0] "ライフル(.22口径/ﾙｶﾞｰ10／22)"

#. ~ Description of variant "varmint rifle" of gun "Ruger 10/22 rifle"
#: data/json/items/gun/22.json
msgid ""
"A combination of negligible recoil, high customization, and inexpensive "
"ammunition made the Ruger 10/22 a popular choice among enthusiasts and small"
" game hunters.  Even though it fires the weak .22 round, it's perfectly "
"capable of killing."
msgstr ""
"無きに等しい反動、高い拡張性、非常に安価な弾薬。これらの好条件によってスタームルガー社の10/22は小型動物ハンティングの定番ライフルとしての地位と、熱狂的なファンを獲得しました。貧弱な殺傷力に見合った適切な獲物を選択しましょう。"

#. ~ Name of a gun
#: data/json/items/gun/22.json
msgid "full-auto varmint rifle"
msgid_plural "full-auto varmint rifles"
msgstr[0] "ライフル(.22口径/ﾌﾙｵｰﾄﾊﾞｰﾐﾝﾄ)"

#. ~ Description of gun "full-auto varmint rifle"
#: data/json/items/gun/22.json
msgid "A handy and lightweight rifle, modified to fire semi and full auto."
msgstr "射撃モードをセミオートとフルオートで切り替えられるように改造された、軽量で便利なライフルです。"

#. ~ Variant name of gun "full-auto varmint rifle"
#: data/json/items/gun/22.json
msgid "full-auto Ruger 10/22 rifle"
msgid_plural "full-auto Ruger 10/22 rifles"
msgstr[0] "ライフル(.22口径/ﾌﾙｵｰﾄ ﾙｶﾞｰ10／22)"

#. ~ Description of variant "full-auto varmint rifle" of gun "full-auto Ruger
#. 10/22 rifle"
#: data/json/items/gun/22.json
msgid ""
"A Ruger 10/22 modified post-Cataclysm to selective fire.  While the .22 "
"round isn't very powerful, full auto makes it a lot more effective, and "
"still easily controllable in full auto."
msgstr ""
"大変動発生後に射撃モードを切り替えられるように改造されたルガー10/22です。.22口径弾はそれほど強力ではありませんが、制御が容易なフルオート射撃によって実用性は遥かに向上しています。"

#. ~ Name of a gun
#: data/json/items/gun/22.json
msgid ".22 caliber revolver"
msgid_plural ".22 caliber revolvers"
msgstr[0] "ハンドガン(.22口径/ﾘﾎﾞﾙﾊﾞｰ)"

#. ~ Description of gun ".22 caliber revolver"
#: data/json/items/gun/22.json
msgid ""
"A comparatively dainty revolver, chambered for 8 tiny rounds of .22 LR."
msgstr ".22口径LR弾を8発装填できる、比較的小さなリボルバーです。"

#. ~ Variant name of gun ".22 caliber revolver"
#: data/json/items/gun/22.json
msgid "Ruger LCR .22 revolver"
msgid_plural "Ruger LCR .22 revolvers"
msgstr[0] "ハンドガン(.22口径/ﾙｶﾞｰLRCﾘﾎﾞﾙﾊﾞｰ)"

#. ~ Description of variant ".22 caliber revolver" of gun "Ruger LCR .22
#. revolver"
#. ~ Description of gun "Ruger LCR .38"
#: data/json/items/gun/22.json data/json/items/gun/38.json
msgid ""
"A compact, double-action-only revolver designed for easy concealment, with a"
" stainless steel cylinder and aluminum frame."
msgstr "秘匿携行性能を重視した設計のコンパクトなリボルバーです。シリンダーは鋼鉄、フレームは軽量なアルミ合金で作られています。"

#. ~ Name of a gun
#: data/json/items/gun/22.json
msgid "firefly training pistol"
msgid_plural "firefly training pistols"
msgstr[0] "ハンドガン(.22口径/ﾌｧｲｱﾌﾗｲ訓練用)"

#. ~ Description of gun "firefly training pistol"
#: data/json/items/gun/22.json
msgid ""
"A medium sized, .22 caliber semi-automatic pistol, for training with a "
"pistol similar to more powerful pistols.  Built from aluminum and polymer "
"components, the weapon is lightweight and concealable, but its chambering is"
" not very powerful."
msgstr ""
"より強力なものと同じデザインの、.22口径中型訓練用セミオートハンドガンです。アルミニウムとポリマー製の部品で作られており、軽く携行しやすいサイズですが、発射できる弾薬は高威力ではありません。"

#. ~ Variant name of gun "firefly training pistol"
#: data/json/items/gun/22.json
msgid "GSG Firefly"
msgid_plural "GSG Fireflies"
msgstr[0] "ハンドガン(.22口径/GSGﾌｧｲｱﾌﾗｲ)"

#. ~ Description of variant "firefly training pistol" of gun "GSG Firefly"
#: data/json/items/gun/22.json
msgid ""
"The GSG firefly is a .22 semi-automatic handgun.  While the GSG Firefly "
"started off as the SIG Mosquito, after the Mosquito ceased production, "
"German Sport Guns picked it up and renamed it to the Firefly."
msgstr ""
"ジャーマン・スポーツ・ガンズ社のファイアフライは.22口径のセミオートハンドガンです。当初はSIG社からモスキートという名前で発売されましたが、生産中止後にGSG社がこれを引継ぎ、ファイアフライに改名しました。"

#. ~ Name of a gun
#: data/json/items/gun/22.json
msgid "Walther training pistol"
msgid_plural "Walther training pistols"
msgstr[0] "ハンドガン(.22口径/ﾜﾙｻｰ訓練用)"

#. ~ Description of gun "Walther training pistol"
#: data/json/items/gun/22.json
msgid ""
"A dainty training pistol offered by the Walther Arms company, making use of "
"the .22 LR cartridge, for training on a pistol very similar to more powerful"
" pistols."
msgstr "ワルサー社から販売された、より強力なものと非常によく似たデザインが優美な訓練用ハンドガンです。.22口径LR弾を発射します。"

#. ~ Variant name of gun "Walther training pistol"
#: data/json/items/gun/22.json
msgid "Walther P22 pistol"
msgid_plural "Walther P22 pistols"
msgstr[0] "ハンドガン(.22口径/ﾜﾙｻｰP22)"

#. ~ Description of variant "Walther training pistol" of gun "Walther P22
#. pistol"
#: data/json/items/gun/22.json
msgid ""
"The Walther P22 is a blowback operated semi-automatic pistol intended for "
"training with a platform very similar to more defensive handguns.  It is "
"about half the size of most Walthers.  It is made mostly with plastic, with "
"the slide and key components (other than the barrel) being made of die-cast "
"zinc alloy."
msgstr ""
"ワルサーP22はブローバック式のセミオートピストルです。より自己防衛に適したハンドガンとデザインが非常によく似ており、訓練用に使われます。サイズは一般的なワルサー製銃器の半分ほどしかありません。部品はほとんど合成樹脂製で、スライドと(銃身を除く)重要な部品は圧力鋳造した亜鉛合金で作られています。"

#. ~ Name of a gun
#: data/json/items/gun/22.json
msgid "high capacity handgun"
msgid_plural "high capacity handguns"
msgstr[0] "ハンドガン(.22口径/大容量)"

#. ~ Description of gun "high capacity handgun"
#: data/json/items/gun/22.json
msgid ""
"A large capacity handgun, chambered in .22 and feeding from quad stack "
"magazines.  Used both recreationally and in competition."
msgstr "複々列弾倉から弾薬を供給する.22口径大容量ハンドガンです。娯楽と競技、どちらの場面でも利用されます。"

#. ~ Variant name of gun "high capacity handgun"
#: data/json/items/gun/22.json
msgid "CP33"
msgid_plural "CP33s"
msgstr[0] "ハンドガン(.22口径/CP33)"

#. ~ Description of variant "high capacity handgun" of gun "CP33"
#: data/json/items/gun/22.json
msgid ""
"The Kel-Tec CP33, standing for Competition Pistol 33, is a .22 semi "
"automatic pistol targeted towards competition shooters and recreational "
"shooters alike, with the ability to feed from 33 round quad stack magazines,"
" or even 50 with an extension.  While in a fairly weak cartridge, the "
"capacity makes it quite a formidable weapon in the right hands."
msgstr ""
"ケルテック社の競技用ピストル(Competition "
"Pistol)であるCP33は、競技および娯楽での射撃愛好家を対象とした.22口径セミオートハンドガンです。33発複々列弾倉には大容量化パーツを取り付けることで合計50発装填できるようになります。威力はかなり弱いですが、その容量のお陰で適切に扱えば非常に強力な武器になります。"

#. ~ Name of a gun
#: data/json/items/gun/22.json
msgid "Ruger target pistol"
msgid_plural "Ruger target pistols"
msgstr[0] "ハンドガン(.22口径/ﾙｶﾞｰ競技用)"

#. ~ Description of gun "Ruger target pistol"
#: data/json/items/gun/22.json
msgid ""
"A light and handy .22 LR handgun from Ruger, this handgun is one of the most"
" popular .22 handguns ever created."
msgstr "ルガー社の軽量で便利な.22口径ハンドガンは、今まで世に出た.22口径LR弾を使うハンドガンの中でも特に人気が高いものの一つです。"

#. ~ Variant name of gun "Ruger target pistol"
#: data/json/items/gun/22.json
msgid "Ruger Mark II"
msgid_plural "Ruger Mark IIs"
msgstr[0] "ハンドガン(.22口径/ﾙｶﾞｰ ﾏｰｸII)"

#. ~ Description of variant "Ruger target pistol" of gun "Ruger Mark II"
#: data/json/items/gun/22.json
msgid ""
"The 2nd version of the Ruger Standard, which replaced production of the "
"Standard in 1982 and continued until 2005 with the main feature of having "
"adjustable sights.  Features a 5.5 inch barrel and feeds from a 10 round "
"magazine."
msgstr ""
"調整可能な照準器が特徴的なルガーのスタンダードモデルの二代目です。スタンダードモデルに代わって1982年に登場し、生産は2005年まで続きました。銃身は約14cmあり、弾倉には10発の弾薬を装填できます。"

#. ~ Variant name of gun "Ruger target pistol"
#: data/json/items/gun/22.json
msgid "Ruger Mark III"
msgid_plural "Ruger Mark IIIs"
msgstr[0] "ハンドガン(.22口径/ﾙｶﾞｰ ﾏｰｸIII)"

#. ~ Description of variant "Ruger target pistol" of gun "Ruger Mark III"
#: data/json/items/gun/22.json
msgid ""
"The 3rd version of the Ruger Standard, which replaced production of the Mark"
" II in 2005 and continued until 2016.  Features a 5.5 inch barrel and feeds "
"from a 10 round magazine."
msgstr ""
"ルガーのスタンダードモデルの三代目です。二代目に代わって2005年に登場し、生産は2016年まで続きました。銃身は約14cmあり、弾倉には10発の弾薬を装填できます。"

#. ~ Variant name of gun "Ruger target pistol"
#: data/json/items/gun/22.json
msgid "Ruger Mark IV"
msgid_plural "Ruger Mark IVs"
msgstr[0] "ハンドガン(.22口径/ﾙｶﾞｰ ﾏｰｸIV)"

#. ~ Description of variant "Ruger target pistol" of gun "Ruger Mark IV"
#: data/json/items/gun/22.json
msgid ""
"The 4th, and most modern version of the Ruger Standard.  Still in production"
" since 2016, and has a simplified disassembly feature.  Has a 5.5 inch "
"barrel and feeds from a 10 round magazine."
msgstr ""
"ルガーのスタンダードモデルの四代目にして最新の銃です。2016年から現在まで生産が続いており、分解がしやすい構造に変わっています。銃身は約14cmあり、弾倉には10発の弾薬を装填できます。"

#. ~ Name of a gun
#: data/json/items/gun/22.json
msgid "varmint pistol"
msgid_plural "varmint pistols"
msgstr[0] "ハンドガン(.22口径/ﾊﾞｰﾐﾝﾄ)"

#. ~ Description of gun "varmint pistol"
#: data/json/items/gun/22.json
msgid ""
"Essentially a varmint rifle with no stock and a shorter barrel, this gun "
"loses out on a bit of energy with its shorter barrel and is a bit more "
"uncomfortable to hold, but a fair bit lighter.  Includes a bipod."
msgstr ""
"早い話が、銃床がなく銃身が短いバーミントライフルです。短い銃身によって威力が低下しており、多少構えにくさも感じますが、かなり軽量です。二脚が付属しています。"

#. ~ Variant name of gun "varmint pistol"
#: data/json/items/gun/22.json
msgid "Ruger 22 Charger"
msgid_plural "Ruger 22 Chargers"
msgstr[0] "ハンドガン(.22口径/ﾙｶﾞｰ22ﾁｬｰｼﾞｬｰ)"

#. ~ Description of variant "varmint pistol" of gun "Ruger 22 Charger"
#: data/json/items/gun/22.json
msgid ""
"This gun is essentially a shortened 10/22, feeding from the same magazines."
"  While it does feature a shorter barrel and a lack of a stock, it is a fair"
" bit lighter, and comes included with a bipod to more steadily plink away at"
" the undead."
msgstr ""
"早い話が短くなったルガー10/22であり、弾倉も共通です。銃身が短く銃床がないのが特徴ですが、重量はかなり軽くなっており、より安定してゾンビを撃つために二脚が付属しています。"

#. ~ Name of a gun
#: data/json/items/gun/22.json
msgid "full-auto varmint pistol"
msgid_plural "full-auto varmint pistols"
msgstr[0] "ハンドガン(.22口径/ﾌﾙｵｰﾄﾊﾞｰﾐﾝﾄ)"

#. ~ Description of gun "full-auto varmint pistol"
#: data/json/items/gun/22.json
msgid ""
"A lightweight varmint pistol, modified to fire both semi, and full auto."
msgstr "射撃モードをセミオートとフルオートで切り替えられるように改造された、重量が軽いバーミントピストルです。"

#. ~ Variant name of gun "full-auto varmint pistol"
#: data/json/items/gun/22.json
msgid "full-auto Ruger 22 Charger"
msgid_plural "full-auto Ruger 22 Chargers"
msgstr[0] "ハンドガン(.22口径/ﾌﾙｵｰﾄ ﾙｶﾞｰ22ﾁｬｰｼﾞｬｰ)"

#. ~ Description of variant "full-auto varmint pistol" of gun "full-auto Ruger
#. 22 Charger"
#: data/json/items/gun/22.json
msgid ""
"A Ruger 22 Charger modified post-Cataclysm to selective fire.  While the .22"
" round isn't very powerful, full auto makes it a lot more effective, and "
"still easily controllable in full auto even with the lack of a stock."
msgstr ""
"大変動発生後に射撃モードを切り替えられるように改造されたルガー22チャージャーです。.22口径弾はそれほど強力ではありませんが、銃床なしでも制御が容易なフルオート射撃によって実用性は遥かに向上しています。"

#. ~ Name of a gun
#: data/json/items/gun/22.json data/mods/classic_zombies/items/guns.json
msgid "pump action varmint rifle"
msgid_plural "pump action varmint rifles"
msgstr[0] "ライフル(.22口径/ﾎﾟﾝﾌﾟｱｸｼｮﾝﾊﾞｰﾐﾝﾄ)"

#. ~ Description of gun "pump action varmint rifle"
#: data/json/items/gun/22.json
msgid ""
"A lightweight, wood framed pump action rifle, holding 15 rounds of .22 with "
"an 18 inch barrel.  While pump actions tend to be largely shotguns, they can"
" be made in calibers such as .22 LR."
msgstr ""
"木製フレームの軽量なポンプアクションライフルです。約46cmの銃身に.22口径弾を15発装填できます。ポンプアクションといえばショットガンですが、.22口径LR弾を装填する銃で用いられることもあります。"

#. ~ Variant name of gun "pump action varmint rifle"
#: data/json/items/gun/22.json
msgid "Rossi Gallery"
msgid_plural "Rossi Galleries"
msgstr[0] "ライフル(.22口径/ﾛｯｼ･ｷﾞｬﾗﾘｰ)"

#. ~ Description of variant "pump action varmint rifle" of gun "Rossi Gallery"
#: data/json/items/gun/22.json
msgid ""
"A modern take on the Winchester 1890, the Rossi Gallery is a .22 LR rifle, "
"notably using a pump action.  Much like a pump action shotgun, the magazine "
"tube is below it's 18 inch barrel and can hold 15 rounds.  While pump "
"actions are quite often associated with shotguns, the mechanism can be "
"applied to rifles as well, though in practice it's limited to .22 LR."
msgstr ""
"ウィンチェスター1890の現代版であるロッシ社のギャラリーは、.22口径LR弾を用いるポンプアクション式ライフルです。ポンプアクション式ショットガンと同様に、約46cmの銃身の下部にチューブ型弾倉があり、15発の弾薬を装填できます。ポンプアクションと言えばショットガンですが、この構造はライフルに取り入れることも可能です。ただし、現実的な運用は.22口径LR弾程度に限られます。"

#. ~ Name of a gun
#: data/json/items/gun/22.json
msgid ".22 six-shooter"
msgid_plural ".22 six-shooter"
msgstr[0] "ハンドガン(.22口径/6ｼｭｰﾀｰ)"

#. ~ Description of gun ".22 six-shooter"
#: data/json/items/gun/22.json
msgid "A revolver chambered in .22 LR, with 6 shots and a 6.5 inch barrel."
msgstr "銃身約17cmの、.22口径LR弾を6発装填するリボルバーです。"

#. ~ Variant name of gun ".22 six-shooter"
#: data/json/items/gun/22.json
msgid "Heritage Rough Rider 6.5\""
msgid_plural "Heritage Rough Rider 6.5\""
msgstr[0] "ハンドガン(.22口径/ﾍﾘﾃｰｼﾞ･ﾗﾌﾗｲﾀﾞｰ6.5\")"

#. ~ Description of variant ".22 six-shooter" of gun "Heritage Rough Rider
#. 6.5""
#: data/json/items/gun/22.json
msgid ""
"A cheap, single action revolver chambered in .22 LR.  While it makes for a "
"handy plinking gun, the single action mechanism, size of the firearm, "
"combined with the lack of a swing out cylinder makes for a less than ideal "
"zombie fighting handgun."
msgstr ""
".22口径LR弾を装填する、安価なシングルアクションリボルバーです。気軽な射的には丁度いいですが、シングルアクション、小型サイズ、振出式シリンダーを採用していない点などから、ゾンビと戦う銃として理想的とは言えません。"

#. ~ Name of a gun
#: data/json/items/gun/22.json
msgid "large .22 six-shooter"
msgid_plural "large .22 six-shooter"
msgstr[0] "ハンドガン(.22口径/大型6ｼｭｰﾀｰ)"

#. ~ Description of gun "large .22 six-shooter"
#: data/json/items/gun/22.json
msgid "A revolver chambered in .22 LR, with 6 shots and a 9 inch barrel."
msgstr "銃身約23cmの、.22口径LR弾を6発装填するリボルバーです。"

#. ~ Variant name of gun "large .22 six-shooter"
#: data/json/items/gun/22.json
msgid "Heritage Rough Rider 9\""
msgid_plural "Heritage Rough Rider 9\""
msgstr[0] "ハンドガン(.22口径/ﾍﾘﾃｰｼﾞ･ﾗﾌﾗｲﾀﾞｰ9\")"

#. ~ Description of variant "large .22 six-shooter" of gun "Heritage Rough
#. Rider 9""
#: data/json/items/gun/22.json
msgid ""
"A cheap, single action revolver chambered in .22 LR.  While it makes for a "
"handy plinking gun, the single action mechanism, size of the firearm, "
"combined with the lack of a swing out cylinder makes for a less than ideal "
"zombie fighting handgun, even with the slightly increased performance from "
"the longer barrel."
msgstr ""
".22口径LR弾を装填する、安価なシングルアクションリボルバーです。気軽な射的には丁度いいですが、シングルアクション、小型サイズ、振出式シリンダーを採用していない点などから、多少銃身が長かろうがゾンビと戦う銃として理想的とは言えません。"

#. ~ Name of a gun
#: data/json/items/gun/22.json
msgid ".22 1911 pistol"
msgid_plural ".22 1911 pistols"
msgstr[0] "ハンドガン(.22口径/1911)"

#. ~ Description of gun ".22 1911 pistol"
#: data/json/items/gun/22.json
msgid ""
"A 1911 in .22 LR, with a 4 1/4\" barrel, and feeding from 10 round "
"magazines."
msgstr ".22口径LR弾を発射する1911です。銃身長は約11cmで、10発弾倉から弾を装填します。"

#. ~ Variant name of gun ".22 1911 pistol"
#: data/json/items/gun/22.json
msgid "1911-22"
msgid_plural "1911-22"
msgstr[0] "ハンドガン(.22口径/1911-22)"

#. ~ Description of variant ".22 1911 pistol" of gun "1911-22"
#: data/json/items/gun/22.json
msgid ""
"A 1911 handgun with \"1911-22\" stamped on the slide.  While .22 LR 1911s "
"were first devised as a training aid for US soldiers, it found large "
"civilian use from concealed carry to plinking thanks to the readily "
"available ammunition and familiar platform."
msgstr ""
"スライドに「1911-22」と刻まれた1911ハンドガンです。.22口径LR弾を発射する1911は当初アメリカ軍での訓練用に考案されましたが、弾薬の入手が容易でデザインも扱いやすかったことから、携行から射的ゲームまで、民間にも広く普及しました。"

#. ~ Name of a gun
#: data/json/items/gun/223.json
msgid "AR-15"
msgid_plural "AR-15s"
msgstr[0] "ライフル(.223口径/AR-15)"

#. ~ Description of gun "AR-15"
#: data/json/items/gun/223.json
msgid ""
"This ubiquitous rifle is the forefather of the M16 rifle series.  It is "
"lightweight and accurate, but will malfunction if not properly maintained.  "
"This one is a semi-automatic civilian version."
msgstr ""
"世界中至る所で目にする、M16の先祖にあたるライフルです。軽量で高精度、しかし手入れがやや難しく、機構的動作不良を起こしやすいという欠点があります。これはセミオートオンリーの民間モデルのようです。"

#. ~ Valid mod location of gun
#. ~ Location of gun mod
#: data/json/items/gun/223.json data/json/items/gun/300BLK.json
#: data/json/items/gun/338lapua.json data/json/items/gun/44.json
#: data/json/items/gun/45.json data/json/items/gun/robofac_gun.json
#: data/json/items/gunmod/conversions.json data/json/items/ranged/slings.json
msgid "bore"
msgstr "口径"

#. ~ Name of a gun
#: data/json/items/gun/223.json
msgid "AR pistol"
msgid_plural "AR pistols"
msgstr[0] "ハンドガン(.223口径/ARﾋﾟｽﾄﾙ)"

#. ~ Description of gun "AR pistol"
#: data/json/items/gun/223.json
msgid ""
"The common AR-15 platform, with its stock removed and buffer tube covered by"
" a sleeve.  AR pistols lack stocks, or have arm braces due to restrictions "
"on short barreled rifles, and so without a stock, they're legally classified"
" as a pistol."
msgstr ""
"一般的なAR-15プラットフォームのピストルです。銃床がなく、バッファーチューブはスリーブに覆われています。この類の銃には銃床がないか、もしくは短銃身ライフル規制の関係でアームブレースが付いていますが、銃床がない場合は法的にはピストルに分類されます。"

#. ~ Name of a gun
#: data/json/items/gun/223.json
msgid "M27 assault rifle"
msgid_plural "M27 assault rifles"
msgstr[0] "ライフル(.223口径/M27ｱｻﾙﾄﾗｲﾌﾙ)"

#. ~ Description of gun "M27 assault rifle"
#: data/json/items/gun/223.json
msgid ""
"Designed to replace the M4 Carbine, the M27 assault rifle features most of "
"the former's strengths, while being considerably more durable.  It is "
"chambered in 5.56x45mm and accepts STANAG magazines."
msgstr ""
"M4カービンの後継銃として開発されたM27アサルトライフルは、M4カービンの長所を生かしつつ、耐久性を大幅に向上させています。弾薬は5.56x45mm弾に対応しており、STANAG弾倉を装填できます。"

#. ~ Variant name of gun "M27 assault rifle"
#: data/json/items/gun/223.json
msgid "H&K416 A5 rifle"
msgid_plural "H&K416 A5 rifles"
msgstr[0] "ライフル(.223口径/H&K416 A5)"

#. ~ Description of variant "M27 assault rifle" of gun "H&K416 A5 rifle"
#: data/json/items/gun/223.json
msgid ""
"Designed to replace the M4A1, the Heckler and Koch 416A5 features most of "
"the former's strengths, while being considerably more durable."
msgstr "M4A1の後継銃として設計されたH&K 416A5は、旧型とほぼ同じ性能を持ち、耐久性もかなり向上しています。"

#. ~ Variant name of gun "M27 assault rifle"
#: data/json/items/gun/223.json
msgid "M27 IAR carbine"
msgid_plural "M27 IAR carbines"
msgstr[0] "ライフル(.223口径/M27 IAR)"

#. ~ Description of variant "M27 assault rifle" of gun "M27 IAR carbine"
#: data/json/items/gun/223.json
msgid ""
"A H&K416 carbine outfitted with a heavier barrel to enable higher amounts of"
" suppressive fire while retaining a good degree of mobility."
msgstr "ヘビーバレル仕様のH&K416です。機動力を維持しつつ、より効率的な制圧射撃が可能になっています。"

#. ~ Variant name of gun "M27 assault rifle"
#: data/json/items/gun/223.json
msgid "M38 DMR rifle"
msgid_plural "M38 DMR rifles"
msgstr[0] "ライフル(.223口径/M38 DMR)"

#. ~ Description of variant "M27 assault rifle" of gun "M38 DMR rifle"
#: data/json/items/gun/223.json
msgid ""
"The M38 Designated Marksman Rifle is an M27 IAR, itself derived from a "
"H&K416, selected for accuracy, and outfitted with a variable power scope and"
" a QDSS suppressor."
msgstr ""
"M38マークスマンライフルはH&K416から派生したM27 "
"IARの精度を更に高めたモデルであり、可変倍率スコープとQDSSサプレッサーが搭載されています。"

#. ~ Valid mod location of gun
#: data/json/items/gun/223.json data/json/items/gun/3006.json
#: data/json/items/gun/300BLK.json data/json/items/gun/303.json
#: data/json/items/gun/30carbine.json data/json/items/gun/545x39.json
#: data/json/items/gun/762.json data/json/items/gun/762R.json
#: data/json/items/gun/77mm_jap.json data/json/items/gun/9mm.json
#: data/json/items/gun/exodii.json data/json/items/gun/flintlock.json
#: data/json/items/gun/shot.json
msgid "bayonet lug"
msgstr "銃剣固定具"

#. ~ Name of a gun
#: data/json/items/gun/223.json
msgid "FN SCAR-L"
msgid_plural "FN SCAR-Ls"
msgstr[0] "ライフル(.223口径/FN SCAR-L)"

#. ~ Description of gun "FN SCAR-L"
#: data/json/items/gun/223.json
msgid ""
"A highly accurate and modular assault rifle specially designed for the "
"United States Special Operations Command.  The 'L' in its name stands for "
"light, as it uses the lightweight .223 round."
msgstr ""
"アメリカ軍特殊部隊向けに開発された、高精度かつ高度にモジュール化された現代的アサルトライフルです。'L'はLightの意で、実際に重量が'H'より幾分軽く、また扱いやすい.223口径弾を使用します。"

#. ~ Name of a gun
#: data/json/items/gun/223.json
msgid "SL8 civilian rifle"
msgid_plural "SL8 civilian rifles"
msgstr[0] "ライフル(.223口径/SL8民間用ﾗｲﾌﾙ)"

#. ~ Description of gun "SL8 civilian rifle"
#: data/json/items/gun/223.json
msgid ""
"A semi-automatic clone of an older German assault rifle.  Due to importation"
" bans, it is semi-auto and can only feed from 10 round magazines."
msgstr ""
"古いドイツ製アサルトライフルのセミオートモデルです。輸入規制があるため射撃モードはセミオートに限られ、弾倉への装填数も10発に減っています。"

#. ~ Variant name of gun "SL8 civilian rifle"
#: data/json/items/gun/223.json
msgid "SL8-6"
msgid_plural "SL8-6s"
msgstr[0] "ライフル(.223口径/SL8-6)"

#. ~ Description of variant "SL8 civilian rifle" of gun "SL8-6"
#: data/json/items/gun/223.json
msgid ""
"The SL8 is an importation-legal gun similar to the German G36, made to be "
"semi-auto only, and to only feed from 10 round single stack magazines.  It "
"also features a distinctive thumbhole stock, a polymer handguard, and a top "
"rail for mounting optics."
msgstr ""
"ドイツのG36に似た、射撃モードはセミオートのみ、弾倉も10発装填シングルスタックに限られていますが、合法的に輸入できます。サムホール付き銃床、ポリマー製ハンドガード、光学機器用上部レールを備えています。"

#. ~ Name of a gun
#: data/json/items/gun/223.json
msgid "M249 machine gun"
msgid_plural "M249 machine guns"
msgstr[0] "ライフル(.223口径/M249ﾏｼﾝｶﾞﾝ)"

#. ~ Description of gun "M249 machine gun"
#: data/json/items/gun/223.json
msgid ""
"The M249 is a mountable machine gun used by the US military and SWAT teams."
"  Quite inaccurate and difficult to control, the M249 is designed to fire "
"many rounds very quickly."
msgstr "アメリカ軍やSWATで使われている、設置が可能なマシンガンです。精度が低く、照準の制御も困難ですが、速やかに弾幕を展開できます。"

#. ~ Firing mode of gun
