msgid_plural "FSP 10-round 40x46 magazines"
msgstr[0] "弾倉(40x46mm/FSP/10発)"

#. ~ Description of magazine "FSP 10-round 40x46 magazine"
#: data/json/items/gun/robofac_gun.json
msgid ""
"A huge 10 round box magazine for use with the Hub 01 Fire Support Platform."
"  It resembles a coffin somewhat in profile, with 4 columns of ammunition "
"tapering down to just 1.  There's no way you're going to find a mag pouch "
"for this."
msgstr ""
"ハブ01製のFSPに対応する、巨大な10発箱型弾倉です。弾薬4列分の幅がある弾倉は先へ行くほど細くなり、横から見るとまるで棺のようです。こんなものを収納できる弾倉ポーチは見つかりそうにありません。"

#. ~ Name of a gun
#: data/json/items/gun/shot.json
msgid "12 gauge pistol"
msgid_plural "12 gauge pistols"
msgstr[0] "ハンドガン(12ga)"

#. ~ Description of gun "12 gauge pistol"
#: data/json/items/gun/shot.json
msgid ""
"A single shot pistol that loads 12 gauge shotgun shells, handcrafted from "
"scrap."
msgstr "鉄くずから作られた、12ゲージ弾を使用する単発式の拳銃です。"

#. ~ Name of a gun
#: data/json/items/gun/shot.json
msgid "12-gauge Gatling gun"
msgid_plural "12-gauge Gatling guns"
msgstr[0] "ショットガン(12ga/ｶﾞﾄﾘﾝｸﾞｶﾞﾝ)"

#. ~ Description of gun "12-gauge Gatling gun"
#: data/json/items/gun/shot.json
msgid ""
"An electrically driven six barrel Gatling shotgun, fed from handmade cloth "
"belts.  Even properly mounted, this seems like an unwieldy beast, and the "
"six separate barrels make for difficult zeroing.  The externally driven "
"action means this is much less likely to jam."
msgstr ""
"手作りの布製弾帯で弾薬を供給する、6つの銃身をもつ電動ガトリングショットガンです。適切に固定してもなお獣のように扱い辛く、銃身が複数あるため照準も困難です。駆動部が外側にあるため、弾詰まりの可能性は軽減されています。"

#. ~ Name of a gun
#: data/json/items/gun/shot.json
msgid "compact bullpup shotgun"
msgid_plural "compact bullpup shotguns"
msgstr[0] "ショットガン(12ga/小型ﾌﾞﾙﾊﾟｯﾌﾟ)"

#. ~ Description of gun "compact bullpup shotgun"
#: data/json/items/gun/shot.json
msgid ""
"This pump-action shotgun uses a system of twin magazines to carry 14 total "
"rounds of 12-gauge shotgun shells.  As the weapon's trigger is situated "
"forwards of the chamber in what is termed as a 'bullpup' design, the "
"firearm's notably more compact than its peers despite having a higher "
"capacity when compared against more classically designed shotguns."
msgstr ""
"2つの異なる弾倉に12ゲージ弾を合計14発装填できるポンプアクション式ショットガンです。トリガーを薬室の前方に配置した「ブルパップ」と呼ばれる設計のため、より古典的な作りのショットガンに比べて装弾数が多く、しかも構造はコンパクトです。"

#. ~ Variant name of gun "compact bullpup shotgun"
#: data/json/items/gun/shot.json
msgid "Kel-Tec KSG shotgun"
msgid_plural "Kel-Tec KSG shotguns"
msgstr[0] "ショットガン(12ga/ｹﾙﾃｯｸKSG)"

#. ~ Description of variant "compact bullpup shotgun" of gun "Kel-Tec KSG
#. shotgun"
#: data/json/items/gun/shot.json
msgid ""
"A bullpup pump-action shotgun, the Kel-Tec KSG uses a pair of magazine tubes"
" to increase its capacity."
msgstr "ブルパップ・ポンプアクション式ショットガンであるケルテックKSGは、容量を増やすためにチューブ型弾倉が2つ備わっています。"

#. ~ Name of a gun
#: data/json/items/gun/shot.json
msgid "6-round combat shotgun"
msgid_plural "6-round combat shotguns"
msgstr[0] "ショットガン(12ga/6発ｺﾝﾊﾞｯﾄ)"

#. ~ Description of gun "6-round combat shotgun"
#: data/json/items/gun/shot.json
msgid ""
"The faithful friend of law-enforcement officers, military personnel, and "
"zombie-hunting action heroes alike, this quaint firearm with its over 20 "
"inch long barrel, 6-round magazine tube, and iconic pump-action design is as"
" simple as it is effective.  One of the most popular firearm designs in all "
"of history, this weapon can be reliably counted upon to do the job whether "
"one's simply looking to hunt, or to, with the right loads, turn the heads of"
" the living dead into a chunky zombie puree."
msgstr ""
"50cmを超えるロングバレル、6発チューブ型弾倉、ポンプアクション構造などの特徴的なデザインをもつこの銃は、警察官や軍人、そしてアクション映画でゾンビを狩る主人公の相棒です。歴史上最も人気の高いデザインとも言われるこのショットガンは、単なる狩猟だけでなく、ゾンビの頭をミンチに変えるといった仕事も、適切な弾薬さえ使えば確実にこなせる点が評価されています。"

#. ~ Variant name of gun "6-round combat shotgun"
#: data/json/items/gun/shot.json
msgid "Mossberg 500 Field shotgun"
msgid_plural "Mossberg 500 Field shotguns"
msgstr[0] "ショットガン(12ga/ﾓｽﾊﾞｰｸﾞ500ﾌｨｰﾙﾄﾞ)"

#. ~ Description of variant "6-round combat shotgun" of gun "Mossberg 500
#. Field shotgun"
#: data/json/items/gun/shot.json
msgid ""
"The Mossberg 500 is a popular series of pump-action shotguns, often acquired"
" for military use.  It is noted for its high durability and low recoil.  "
"This one is fitted with a 28 inch barrel with sight rib."
msgstr ""
"普及率が高く、軍で使われることが多いポンプアクションショットガンです。堅牢性と低反動が特長です。このモデルの銃身は約71cmで、照準を助けるリブが付いています。"

#. ~ Name of a gun
#: data/json/items/gun/shot.json
msgid "9-round combat shotgun"
msgid_plural "9-round combat shotguns"
msgstr[0] "ショットガン(12ga/9発ｺﾝﾊﾞｯﾄ)"

#. ~ Description of gun "9-round combat shotgun"
#: data/json/items/gun/shot.json
msgid ""
"A military oriented spin on the classic pump-action shotgun recipe, this "
"firearm features an extended magazine tube capable of fielding nine rounds "
"of 12 gauge shotshells.  Sporting a heavier barrel and a bayonet lug, it "
"makes for a highly intimidating weapon, as well as a satisfying answer to "
"most of the nasties you're liable to find in the post-apocalypse."
msgstr ""
"軍用に改造されたポンプアクション式ショットガンです。12ゲージの弾薬を9発装填できるようにチューブ型弾倉を延長した点が特徴です。重厚な銃身と銃剣ホルダーを備えており、威圧感のある銃として、またはポストアポカリプス世界で遭遇する多くの悪役への返答として、満足のいく仕上がりになっています。"

#. ~ Variant name of gun "9-round combat shotgun"
#: data/json/items/gun/shot.json
msgid "Mossberg 590A1 shotgun"
msgid_plural "Mossberg 590A1 shotguns"
msgstr[0] "ショットガン(12ga/ﾓｽﾊﾞｰｸﾞ590A1)"

#. ~ Description of variant "9-round combat shotgun" of gun "Mossberg 590A1
#. shotgun"
#: data/json/items/gun/shot.json
msgid ""
"The Mossberg 590A1 is a military and police oriented version of the Mossberg"
" 500.  It features a heavier barrel, a bayonet lug, and a different magazine"
" tube for easier cleaning and maintenance."
msgstr ""
"モスバーグ500の軍事および警察向けモデルです。銃身はより重くなり、銃剣を取り付ける突起と、掃除と整備が簡単にできる形状のチューブ型弾倉を備えています。"

#. ~ Variant name of gun "9-round combat shotgun"
#: data/json/items/gun/shot.json
msgid "FN SLP MK I shotgun"
msgid_plural "FN SLP MK I shotguns"
msgstr[0] "ショットガン(12ga/FN SLP MK I)"

#. ~ Description of variant "9-round combat shotgun" of gun "FN SLP MK I
#. shotgun"
#: data/json/items/gun/shot.json
msgid ""
"An eminently practical semi-automatic shotgun, Fabrique Nationale's Mk I "
"iteration of their Self-Loading Police brings together an 8-round magazine "
"tube, accessory-ready Picatinny rail, and comfortably rubber-padded grip "
"surfaces.  Per the company's claims, it can dispense 8 servings of 12-gauge-"
"diameter medicine in under a second, and, while you're not sure if that's "
"true or even a good thing, the gun's certain to serve as a good educational "
"tool for disciplining the dead."
msgstr ""
"ファブリックナショナル社が開発した非常に実用的なセミオートショットガンであるSLPの、Mk "
"Iバージョンです。8発装填のチューブ型弾倉、MODを取り付けられるピカティニーレール、そして快適なゴムパッド入りのグリップを備えています。同社の主張によれば、この銃は12ゲージ弾を1秒以内に8発撃つことができるそうです。それが本当なのか単なる宣伝文句なのかは分かりませんが、銃がゾンビを倒すための優れた道具であるということを学びたいなら、間違いなく役立ちます。"

#. ~ Name of a gun
#: data/json/items/gun/shot.json
msgid "magazine-fed pump shotgun"
msgid_plural "magazine-fed pump shotguns"
msgstr[0] "ショットガン(12ga/弾倉給弾式ﾎﾟﾝﾌﾟｱｸｼｮﾝ)"

#. ~ Description of gun "magazine-fed pump shotgun"
#: data/json/items/gun/shot.json
msgid ""
"A classic pump-action shotgun, all save for the fact that the manufacturer "
"has modified it to use detachable box magazines instead of a standard "
"shotgun tube."
msgstr "古風なポンプアクション式ショットガンです。このモデルはメーカー標準のチューブ型弾倉ではなく取り外し可能な箱型弾倉を利用できます。"

#. ~ Variant name of gun "magazine-fed pump shotgun"
#: data/json/items/gun/shot.json
msgid "Mossberg 590M shotgun"
msgid_plural "Mossberg 590M shotguns"
msgstr[0] "ショットガン(12ga/ﾓｽﾊﾞｰｸﾞ590M)"

#. ~ Description of variant "magazine-fed pump shotgun" of gun "Mossberg 590M
#. shotgun"
#: data/json/items/gun/shot.json
msgid ""
"A classic Mossberg 590 pump-action shotgun, modified by the manufacturer to "
"utilize box magazines."
msgstr "古風なモスバーグ590ポンプアクションショットガンです。これは箱型弾倉を利用できるように改良されたモデルです。"

#. ~ Name of a gun
#: data/json/items/gun/shot.json
msgid "8-round auto-loading shotgun"
msgid_plural "8-round auto-loading shotguns"
msgstr[0] "ショットガン(12ga/8発ｵｰﾄﾛｰﾄﾞ)"

#. ~ Description of gun "8-round auto-loading shotgun"
#: data/json/items/gun/shot.json
msgid ""
"A semi-automatic smooth-bore shotgun, this weapon features respectable "
"ergonomics and room for 8 shotshells within its tubular magazine.  Suitable "
"both for competition shooting and offensive combat roles, this firearm is "
"faster to shoot than a traditional pump-action model, with the caveat that "
"it's harder to maintain than its manually operated siblings as it relies on "
"an internal gas system to cycle rounds rather than the user's own physical "
"input."
msgstr ""
"人間工学に基づいたデザインの、セミオート滑腔銃身ショットガンです。チューブ型弾倉に8発の12ゲージ弾を装填できます。競技用と実戦用を兼ねるこの銃は従来のポンプアクション方式よりも高速で射撃できますが、使用者自身の操作ではなく内部のガス圧システムによって弾薬を送るため、マニュアル操作の銃よりもメンテナンスが難しいという欠点があります。"

#. ~ Variant name of gun "8-round auto-loading shotgun"
#: data/json/items/gun/shot.json
msgid "Mossberg 930 SPX shotgun"
msgid_plural "Mossberg 930 SPX shotguns"
msgstr[0] "ショットガン(12ga/ﾓｽﾊﾞｰｸﾞ930SPX)"

#. ~ Description of variant "8-round auto-loading shotgun" of gun "Mossberg
#. 930 SPX shotgun"
#: data/json/items/gun/shot.json
msgid ""
"This semi-automatic offering from Mossberg features a recoil reducing gas "
"system, rifle style sights and a factory-installed Picatinny rail.  "
"Affordable pricing and decent ergonomics make this a popular entry-level "
"3-gun shotgun."
msgstr ""
"ガスによる反動低減機構、ライフルスタイルの照準器、装着済みのピカティニーレールを備えた、モスバーグ社のセミオートショットガンです。人間工学に基づいた設計と手ごろな価格から、3ガンネイションと呼ばれる競技の入門に適した銃です。"

#. ~ Variant name of gun "8-round auto-loading shotgun"
#: data/json/items/gun/shot.json
msgid "M1014 shotgun"
msgid_plural "M1014 shotguns"
msgstr[0] "ショットガン(12ga/M1014)"

#. ~ Description of variant "8-round auto-loading shotgun" of gun "M1014
#. shotgun"
#: data/json/items/gun/shot.json
msgid ""
"Benelli's first gas-operated shotgun, featuring dual pistons for enhanced "
"reliability with various loads and a collapsible buttstock that reduces "
"length by almost 8 inches.  Adopted in 1999 as the M1014 Joint Service "
"Combat Shotgun, the Benelli M4 is one of the finest combat shotguns "
"available."
msgstr ""
"ベネリ社が最初に作ったガス圧作動方式ショットガンです。様々な弾薬を利用できる2本のピストンと、長さ約20cmに伸長する折り畳み式の銃床を備えています。1999年にM1014という名で軍用ショットガンとして採用されたベネリM4は、入手できる中で最も性能の高いショットガンの一つです。"

#. ~ Name of a gun
#: data/json/items/gun/shot.json data/mods/Generic_Guns/firearms/shot.json
msgid "double-barrel pipe shotgun"
msgid_plural "double-barrel pipe shotguns"
msgstr[0] "ショットガン(12ga/2連ﾊﾟｲﾌﾟ銃)"

#. ~ Description of gun "double-barrel pipe shotgun"
#: data/json/items/gun/shot.json
msgid ""
"A home-made double-barreled shotgun.  It is simply two pipes attached to a "
"stock, with a pair of hammers to strike the two rounds it holds."
msgstr "自家製2連ショットガンです。連結された2本のパイプに引き金と撃鉄が組み込まれたシンプルな構造です。"

#. ~ Firing mode of gun
#: data/json/items/gun/shot.json
#: data/json/obsoletion_and_migration_0.I/gun.json
#: data/mods/Generic_Guns/firearms/rifle_huge.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/inventor/gun.json
msgid "double"
msgstr "ダブル"

#. ~ Name of a gun
#: data/json/items/gun/shot.json
msgid "pipe shotgun"
msgid_plural "pipe shotguns"
msgstr[0] "ショットガン(12ga/ﾊﾟｲﾌﾟ銃)"

#. ~ Description of gun "pipe shotgun"
#: data/json/items/gun/shot.json
msgid ""
"A home-made shotgun.  It is simply a pipe attached to a stock, with a hammer"
" to strike the single round it holds."
msgstr "自家製ショットガンです。単発式で、パイプと銃床を組み合わせたフレームに引き金と撃鉄が付いています。"

#. ~ Name of a gun
#: data/json/items/gun/shot.json
msgid "5-round hunting shotgun"
msgid_plural "5-round hunting shotguns"
msgstr[0] "ショットガン(12ga/5発狩猟用)"

#. ~ Description of gun "5-round hunting shotgun"
#: data/json/items/gun/shot.json
msgid ""
"A classic shotgun in nearly every respect; big, bulky, and intimidating, "
"guns such as this one have been made for over a century in one form or "
"another, coming in both pump-action and semi-automatic models.  Serving both"
" competition-shooting, law-enforcement, and hunting roles, this firearm is "
"sporting a standard-capacity 5-round magazine tube.  Despite the firearm's "
"low magazine space, what it lacks in capacity it makes up for in sheer "
"close-range effectiveness and stopping power."
msgstr ""
"大きさ、持ち運びにくさ、威圧感、全ての面において古典的なこのショットガンは、ポンプアクションとセミオート両方のモデルが一世紀以上にわたり作られ続けてきました。射撃競技や警察、狩猟で用いられ、標準的なチューブ型弾倉には5発の12ゲージ弾を装填できます。装填数が少ないという欠点は、近距離での威力とストッピングパワーの高さで補います。"

#. ~ Variant name of gun "5-round hunting shotgun"
#: data/json/items/gun/shot.json
msgid "Remington 870 Wingmaster shotgun"
msgid_plural "Remington 870 Wingmaster shotguns"
msgstr[0] "ショットガン(12ga/ﾚﾐﾝﾄﾝ870ｳｲﾝｸﾞﾏｽﾀｰ)"

#. ~ Description of variant "5-round hunting shotgun" of gun "Remington 870
#. Wingmaster shotgun"
#: data/json/items/gun/shot.json
msgid ""
"With over 10 million made, the Remington 870 is one of the most popular "
"shotguns on the market, and finds use with hunters and law enforcement "
"agencies alike thanks to its high accuracy and muzzle velocity.  This one is"
" a 28 inch barreled model for hunting fowl and game."
msgstr ""
"1000万丁以上製造されている、市場で最も人気の高いショットガンの一つです。精度と初速に優れているため、狩猟や法執行機関での運用にも適しています。このモデルの銃身は約71cmあり、鳥などの野生動物の狩猟に適しています。"

#. ~ Variant name of gun "5-round hunting shotgun"
#: data/json/items/gun/shot.json
msgid "Remington 1100 competition shotgun"
msgid_plural "Remington 1100 competition shotguns"
msgstr[0] "ショットガン(12ga/ﾚﾐﾝﾄﾝ1100競技用)"

#. ~ Description of variant "5-round hunting shotgun" of gun "Remington 1100
#. competition shotgun"
#: data/json/items/gun/shot.json
msgid ""
"This semi-automatic shotgun features a self compensating gas system that "
"will feed a wide array of shells while also reducing recoil.  Introduced in "
"1963, it is favored by law enforcement, hunters and competition shooters, "
"and has been the best-selling autoloading shotgun in U.S. history.  This is "
"the nickel finished, teflon coated competition model, with a full length "
"magazine tube and 30 inch barrel."
msgstr ""
"様々な種類の弾薬を反動を低減しつつ発射できる、ガス圧作動方式のセミオートショットガンです。1963年に導入されて以来、法執行機関やハンター、競技選手に好まれている、米国史上最も売れているオートロードショットガンです。このモデルはニッケル仕上げのテフロンコーティングが施された競技用モデルで、約76cmの銃身に標準長のチューブ式弾倉を備えています。"

#. ~ Variant name of gun "5-round hunting shotgun"
#: data/json/items/gun/shot.json
msgid "Browning Auto 5 shotgun"
msgid_plural "Browning Auto 5 shotguns"
msgstr[0] "ショットガン(12ga/ﾌﾞﾛｰﾆﾝｸﾞｵｰﾄ5)"

#. ~ Description of variant "5-round hunting shotgun" of gun "Browning Auto 5
#. shotgun"
#: data/json/items/gun/shot.json
msgid ""
"This humble looking shotgun was the earliest successful semi-automatic "
"shotgun, and the second most successful in U.S. history, with over 2.7 "
"million made between 1902 and 1998.  The recoil tuning mechanism under the "
"handguard and long dwell time of the action make for pleasant shooting."
msgstr ""
"粗末な見た目ですが、世界で初めて好評を博したセミオートショットガンであり、米国史上2番目の売り上げを誇り、1902年から1998年の間に270万丁以上作られました。ハンドガードの下にある反動調整機構と発射間隔の長さにより、快適な射撃が可能になっています。"

#. ~ Variant name of gun "5-round hunting shotgun"
#: data/json/items/gun/shot.json
msgid "Ithaca M37 Featherlight shotgun"
msgid_plural "Ithaca M37 Featherlight shotguns"
msgstr[0] "ショットガン(12ga/ｲｻｶM37ﾌｪｻﾞｰﾗｲﾄ)"

#. ~ Description of variant "5-round hunting shotgun" of gun "Ithaca M37
#. Featherlight shotgun"
#: data/json/items/gun/shot.json
msgid ""
"A seasoned veteran of America's sporting culture, the Ithaca M37 is the "
"oldest pump-action shotgun still in active production.  The M37 has served "
"hunters and officers for over eight decades, featuring a bottom-feeding and "
"ejecting design that keeps the action sealed from the elements.  An heirloom"
" that retains its utility all the way from pre-Cataclysm hunting expeditions"
" up into the depths of alien environments, it would be wise to keep it "
"handy, for close encounters."
msgstr ""
"アメリカの射撃競技文化に古くから関わってきたイサカM37は、現役で生産されているポンプアクション式ショットガンの中では最も歴史ある銃です。機構を密閉して風雨から守るボトムフィード&イジェクトデザインが特徴であり、80年以上もの間、猟師や警官に愛用されてきました。大変動以前の狩猟遠征から、異常だらけの状況まで、様々な場面でその実用性を発揮し続ける先祖伝来の宝です。接近戦に備え、手元に一つは持っておきたいものですね。"

#. ~ Name of a gun
#: data/json/items/gun/shot.json
msgid "breaching shotgun"
msgid_plural "breaching shotguns"
msgstr[0] "ハンドガン(12ga/ﾌﾞﾘｰﾁﾝｸﾞ)"

#. ~ Description of gun "breaching shotgun"
#: data/json/items/gun/shot.json
msgid ""
"This shotgun has a short barrel and no stock, and is set up for breaching "
"doors.  It is small enough to carry as a secondary weapon, but has fairly "
"unpleasant recoil and no sights."
msgstr ""
"銃身が短くストックもない、ドアをこじ開けるためのショットガンです。予備用の銃器として持ち運べる小さなサイズですが、反動はかなり大きく、照準器も付いていません。"

#. ~ Variant name of gun "breaching shotgun"
#: data/json/items/gun/shot.json
msgid "Remington 870 MCS shotgun"
msgid_plural "Remington 870 MCS shotguns"
msgstr[0] "ショットガン(12ga/ﾚﾐﾝﾄﾝ870MCS)"

#. ~ Description of variant "breaching shotgun" of gun "Remington 870 MCS
#. shotgun"
#: data/json/items/gun/shot.json
msgid ""
"This Remington 870 Modular Combat System shotgun is currently set up for "
"breaching operations, with a 10 inch barrel and no stock.  It is small "
"enough to carry as a secondary weapon, specifically to pop open any pesky "
"doors you might come across.  The grip's design makes for controllable yet "
"unpleasant recoil, and the barrel lacks any sights."
msgstr ""
"状況に応じて装備を変更できるショットガンです。装備は現在、銃身約25cmで銃床を取り外し、突破作戦用に設定されています。予備として持ち運べるほど小さく、特に敵と遭遇する可能性が高い厄介なドアを破る際に重宝します。動きを制御できるグリップが付いてはいるものの反動は不快なほど強く、照準器は付いていません。"

#. ~ Name of a gun
#: data/json/items/gun/shot.json
msgid "7-round riot shotgun"
msgid_plural "7-round riot shotguns"
msgstr[0] "ショットガン(12ga/7発ﾗｲｵｯﾄ)"

#. ~ Description of gun "7-round riot shotgun"
#: data/json/items/gun/shot.json
msgid ""
"A brother of more typical hunting style shotguns, this particular model was "
"most often seen utilized for self-defense or law-enforcement purposes.  "
"Featuring a shortened 18.5 inch barrel and extended 7-round magazine tube, "
"it's a very versatile and reliable weapon."
msgstr ""
"一般的な狩猟用ショットガンの兄弟とも言える、護身用や警備用に使われることが多い銃器です。約47㎝と短くなった銃身、7発の弾薬を装填するチューブ型弾倉が特徴であり、汎用性と信頼性の高さには定評があります。"

#. ~ Variant name of gun "7-round riot shotgun"
#: data/json/items/gun/shot.json
msgid "Remington 870 Express shotgun"
msgid_plural "Remington 870 Express shotguns"
msgstr[0] "ショットガン(12ga/ﾚﾐﾝﾄﾝ870ｴｸｽﾌﾟﾚｽ)"

#. ~ Description of variant "7-round riot shotgun" of gun "Remington 870
#. Express shotgun"
#: data/json/items/gun/shot.json
msgid ""
"With over 10 million made, the Remington 870 is one of the most popular "
"shotguns on the market, and finds use with hunters and law enforcement "
"agencies alike thanks to its high accuracy and muzzle velocity.  This one is"
" an 18.5 inch barreled defensive model."
msgstr ""
"1000万丁以上製造されている、市場で最も人気の高いショットガンの一つです。精度と初速に優れているため、狩猟や法執行機関での運用にも適しています。このモデルの銃身は約47cmあり、護身用に適しています。"

#. ~ Name of a gun
#: data/json/items/gun/shot.json
msgid "revolving shotgun"
msgid_plural "revolving shotguns"
msgstr[0] "ショットガン(12ga/ﾘﾎﾞﾙﾊﾞｰ)"

#. ~ Description of gun "revolving shotgun"
#: data/json/items/gun/shot.json
msgid ""
"A shotgun modified to use a revolver cylinder mechanism, it can hold 6 "
"cartridges."
msgstr "6発の弾薬を装填できる回転弾倉式に改造したショットガンです。"

#. ~ Name of a gun
#: data/json/items/gun/shot.json
msgid "assault shotgun"
msgid_plural "assault shotguns"
msgstr[0] "ショットガン(12ga/ｱｻﾙﾄ)"

#. ~ Description of gun "assault shotgun"
#: data/json/items/gun/shot.json
msgid ""
"Built in the same style as the venerable AK series of rifles, this Russian "
"exported firearm feeds from detachable magazines rather than making use of a"
" standard tubular design like most commercial shotguns.  With 10 and "
"30-round magazines available, reloading is rendered a much quicker procedure"
" than can ever be accomplished with conventional bottom-feeding firearms."
msgstr ""
"市販のショットガンのようなチューブ型弾倉ではなく、ロシアの古典ライフルAKシリーズのような着脱式の弾倉で給弾する、ロシア製の銃器です。10発と30発の二種類の弾倉があり、従来のボトムフィード方式の銃では不可能だった短時間でのリロードを実現しています。"

#. ~ Variant name of gun "assault shotgun"
#: data/json/items/gun/shot.json
msgid "Saiga-12 shotgun"
msgid_plural "Saiga-12 shotguns"
msgstr[0] "ショットガン(12ga/ｻｲｶﾞ12)"

#. ~ Description of variant "assault shotgun" of gun "Saiga-12 shotgun"
#: data/json/items/gun/shot.json
msgid ""
"The Saiga-12 is a semi-automatic shotgun designed on the same Kalashnikov "
"pattern as the AK-47 rifle.  It reloads with a magazine, rather than one "
"shell at a time like most shotguns.  It is one of the last designs of "
"Mikhail Kalashnikov, and was popular in open division shotgun competitions "
"prior to its ban from import via executive order."
msgstr ""
"AK-47と同じくカラシニコフの設計思想に基いて開発されたセミオートショットガンです。給弾は弾倉式で、他の多くのショットガンと異なり一度に最大数まで装填できます。ミハイル・カラシニコフが最後に設計した銃の一つであり、行政が輸入禁止令を出すまでは無差別級のショットガン競技大会で人気の高い銃でした。"

#. ~ Name of a gun
#: data/json/items/gun/shot.json
#: data/mods/BombasticPerks/perkdata/old_guns.json
msgid "double barrel shotgun"
msgid_plural "double barrel shotguns"
msgstr[0] "ショットガン(12ga/2連)"

#. ~ Description of gun "double barrel shotgun"
#: data/json/items/gun/shot.json
msgid ""
"An old shotgun, possibly antique.  It is little more than a pair of barrels,"
" a wood stock, and a hammer to strike the cartridges."
msgstr "骨董品としての価値がありそうなほど古めかしいショットガンです。二連の銃身、木の銃床、それに簡単な撃発機構を備えています。"

#. ~ Name of a gun
#: data/json/items/gun/shot.json
msgid "triple-barrelled shotgun"
msgid_plural "triple-barrelled shotguns"
msgstr[0] "ショットガン(12ga/ﾄﾘﾌﾟﾙﾊﾞﾚﾙ)"

#. ~ Description of gun "triple-barrelled shotgun"
#: data/json/items/gun/shot.json
msgid "A pretty modern-looking shotgun that has three barrels."
msgstr "3つの銃身をもつ、かなりモダンな外見のショットガンです。"

#. ~ Variant name of gun "triple-barrelled shotgun"
#: data/json/items/gun/shot.json
msgid "Triple Honcho"
msgid_plural "Triple Honchos"
msgstr[0] "ショットガン(12ga/ﾄﾘﾌﾟﾙﾊﾝﾁｮｳ)"

#. ~ Description of variant "triple-barrelled shotgun" of gun "Triple Honcho"
#: data/json/items/gun/shot.json
msgid ""
"Made by Charles Daly, this modern three-barrel shotgun had a unique balance "
"between how much it cost and how little firepower it could release with its "
"18.5-inch barrels.  Luckily, you do not need to pay the full price for it "
"anymore."
msgstr ""
"チャールズ・デイリー社が製造したモダンな3連ショットガンです。高額な値段、そして約47cmの銃身から発射される微々たる火力という、類まれなバランスが実現されています。ありがたいことに、今は定価を支払わずとも手に入ります。"

#. ~ Name of a gun
#: data/json/items/gun/shot.json
#: data/mods/BombasticPerks/perkdata/old_guns.json
msgid "single barrel shotgun"
msgid_plural "single barrel shotguns"
msgstr[0] "ショットガン(12ga/単銃身)"

#. ~ Description of gun "single barrel shotgun"
#: data/json/items/gun/shot.json
msgid ""
"An old shotgun, possibly antique.  It is little more than a barrel, a wood "
"stock, and a hammer to strike the cartridge.  Its simple design keeps it "
"both light and accurate."
msgstr ""
"骨董品としての価値がありそうなほど古めかしいショットガンです。銃身、木の銃床、それに簡単な撃発機構を備えています。シンプルな構造が軽さに繋がり、またそれなりの精度があります。"

#. ~ Name of a gun
#: data/json/items/gun/shot.json
msgid "auto-loading bullpup shotgun"
msgid_plural "auto-loading bullpup shotguns"
msgstr[0] "ショットガン(12ga/ｵｰﾄﾛｰﾄﾞﾌﾞﾙﾊﾟｯﾌﾟ)"

#. ~ Description of gun "auto-loading bullpup shotgun"
#: data/json/items/gun/shot.json
msgid ""
"Looking more like some form of sci-fi prop gun than an actual firearm, this "
"weapon uses a system of three different magazines to field 15 12-gauge "
"shotgun shells within a comparatively compact design.  As the weapon's "
"trigger assembly is situated forwards of the chamber and magazines in what "
"is termed as a 'bullpup' design, the firearm's notably more compact than its"
" peers despite having a higher capacity when compared against more "
"classically designed shotguns."
msgstr ""
"3つの異なる弾倉に12ゲージ弾を合計15発装填できる、SF映画に登場する架空の銃器のようなデザインの比較的小さなショットガンです。トリガーを薬室と弾倉の前方に配置した「ブルパップ」と呼ばれる設計のため、より古典的な作りのショットガンに比べて装弾数が多く、しかも構造はコンパクトです。"

#. ~ Variant name of gun "auto-loading bullpup shotgun"
#: data/json/items/gun/shot.json
msgid "Tavor TS12 shotgun"
msgid_plural "Tavor TS12 shotguns"
msgstr[0] "ショットガン(12ga/ﾀﾎﾞｰﾙTS12)"

#. ~ Description of variant "auto-loading bullpup shotgun" of gun "Tavor TS12
#. shotgun"
#: data/json/items/gun/shot.json
msgid ""
"A triple tube magazine fed, gas-operated bullpup shotgun of Israeli Weapon "
"Industries make.  It is capable of loading 15 shells, all in a relatively "
"small package.  Like many other modern IWI designs, this looks more like a "
"sci-fi prop gun than a firearm.  An integral top rail is provided for "
"mounting sights."
msgstr ""
"イスラエル・ウェポン・インダストリーズ社が製造した、3本のチューブ型弾倉を備えたガス作動式ブルパップショットガンです。15発の弾薬を小さくまとめて装填できます。IWI社が開発した他の銃器同様、銃と言うよりはSF映画の小道具のような外見です。銃身上部にレールが付いており、照準器を取り付けられるようになっています。"

#. ~ Name of a gun
#: data/json/items/gun/shot.json
msgid "double-barrelled pump shotgun"
msgid_plural "double-barrelled pump shotguns"
msgstr[0] "ショットガン(12ga/2連ﾎﾟﾝﾌﾟｱｸｼｮﾝ)"

#. ~ Description of gun "double-barrelled pump shotgun"
#: data/json/items/gun/shot.json
msgid ""
"A hefty shotgun with a double-barrel configuration, though each barrel feeds"
" from its own magazine, making the weapon actually two firearms in a single "
"frame.  While each barrel has its own associated trigger, considering there "
"is a single pump to actuate both mechanisms, one can't really use it "
"precisely.  This, however, isn't to say that the weapon isn't fit for the "
"service of shooting zombies at point blank ranges."
msgstr ""
"この大型ショットガンは二つの銃身が並んでいますが、各銃身はそれぞれ異なる弾倉から弾を装填するため、実質的には一つのフレームに二つの銃を搭載したようなものです。各銃身には独立した引き金が付いていますが、両方のメカニズムを作動させるポンプが一つしかないため、正確に撃ち分けることはできません。もっとも、至近距離でゾンビを撃つために使うなら、その欠点は何の問題にもなりませんが。"

#. ~ Variant name of gun "double-barrelled pump shotgun"
#: data/json/items/gun/shot.json
msgid "DP-12"
msgid_plural "DP-12s"
msgstr[0] "ショットガン(12ga/DP-12)"

#. ~ Description of variant "double-barrelled pump shotgun" of gun "DP-12"
#: data/json/items/gun/shot.json
msgid ""
"A bullpup, 12-gauge, pump-action, double-barrelled mouthful of a shotgun.  "
"Each barrel feeds from its own magazine, making the weapon actually two "
"firearms in a single frame, and, while each barrel has its own associated "
"trigger, the presence of a single pump to actuate both mechanisms means that"
" it cannot be used precisely.  This, however, isn't to say that the weapon "
"isn't fit for the service of shooting zombies at point blank ranges."
msgstr ""
"12ゲージ弾を発射する、ブルパップ・ポンプアクション式二連ショットガンです。各銃身はそれぞれ異なる弾倉から弾を装填するため、一つのフレームに二つの銃を搭載しているとも言えます。各銃身には独立した引き金が付いていますが、両方のメカニズムを作動させるポンプが一つしかないため、正確に撃ち分けることはできません。もっとも、至近距離でゾンビを撃つために使うなら、その欠点は何の問題にもなりませんが。"

#. ~ Name of a gun
#: data/json/items/gun/shot.json
#: data/mods/BombasticPerks/perkdata/old_guns.json
msgid "bootleg lever-action shotgun"
msgid_plural "bootleg lever-action shotguns"
msgstr[0] "ハンドガン(12ga/非正規ﾚﾊﾞｰｱｸｼｮﾝ)"

#. ~ Description of gun "bootleg lever-action shotgun"
#: data/json/items/gun/shot.json
msgid ""
"A lever-action shotgun with a very short barrel and no stock, with room for "
"6 rounds of 12 gauge shotshells.  Likely a bootlegged replica of a pre-1900 "
"firearm, it would pair nicely with a motorcycle jacket and a Harley "
"Davidson, and seems ready to terminate your cataclysmic adversaries."
msgstr ""
"銃身が非常に短くストックもない、12ゲージ弾を6発装填できるレバーアクションショットガンです。1900年代以前の銃器を違法改造したものと考えられ、バイクジャケットやハーレー・ダビッドソンによく似合います。この銃なら、崩壊した世界に蔓延る敵も打ち砕けそうな気がします。"

#. ~ Variant name of gun "bootleg lever-action shotgun"
#: data/json/items/gun/shot.json
msgid "1887 bootleg shotgun"
msgid_plural "1887 bootleg shotguns"
msgstr[0] "ハンドガン(12ga/M1887非正規改造)"

#. ~ Description of variant "bootleg lever-action shotgun" of gun "1887
#. bootleg shotgun"
#: data/json/items/gun/shot.json
msgid ""
"One of the first commercially successful repeating shotguns, the Winchester "
"1887 was specifically made lever-action at Winchester's request.  Though "
"later overshadowed in success by pump designs, the 1887 remains popular "
"today.  This one has a very short barrel, no stock, and would pair nicely "
"with a motorcycle jacket and a Harley Davidson."
msgstr ""
"商業的に成功した最初のリピーティングショットガンの一つであるウィンチェスター1887は、ウィンチェスター社の意向によりレバーアクション式が採用されています。その後ポンプアクション式の台頭によって成功に影を落としましたが、今日でも人気は衰えていません。このモデルは銃身が非常に短く銃床もない、バイクジャケットとハーレー・ダビッドソンが似合う外見です。"

#. ~ Name of a gun
#: data/json/items/gun/shot.json
#: data/mods/BombasticPerks/perkdata/old_guns.json
msgid "6-round trenchgun"
msgid_plural "6-round trenchguns"
msgstr[0] "ショットガン(12ga/6発ﾄﾚﾝﾁｶﾞﾝ)"

#. ~ Description of gun "6-round trenchgun"
#: data/json/items/gun/shot.json
msgid ""
"Whether or not you ever wondered what would happen if one was to attach a "
"shotgun atop a sword, the result of such an inquiry now rests before you in "
"all its metallic glory.  Coming outfitted with a large 17 inch sword bayonet"
" and a wooden heat shield to protect the user's hands from the barrel when "
"it heats up during firing, this pump-action shotgun practically drips menace"
" and looks like it's straight out of the trenches of World War I.  There "
"aren't any more trenches to clear, so the next zombie-infested town will "
"have to suffice."
msgstr ""
"剣とショットガンを合体させたらどうなるか考えた人がいるかどうかは知りませんが、その結果はメタリックな輝きを放ちながら目の前に存在しています。長さ約43cmの大型銃剣と、発射時に発熱する銃身から手を守る木製ヒートシールドが付属している、第一次世界大戦時の塹壕からやってきた威圧感のあるポンプアクションショットガンです。もう掃討すべき塹壕はありません。次はゾンビが蔓延る街に繰り出しましょう。"

#. ~ Variant name of gun "6-round trenchgun"
#: data/json/items/gun/shot.json
msgid "M1897 Trench Gun"
msgid_plural "M1897 Trench Guns"
msgstr[0] "ショットガン(12ga/M1897ﾄﾚﾝﾁｶﾞﾝ)"

#. ~ Description of variant "6-round trenchgun" of gun "M1897 Trench Gun"
#: data/json/items/gun/shot.json
msgid ""
"The Winchester 1897 was one of the first commercially-successful pump-action"
" shotguns.  In its 'trench' configuration it has become a heavily-"
"romanticized American icon of World War I.  With its barrel shroud, bayonet "
"lug, and 17 inch bayonet, this shotgun is undeniably fearsome in appearance."
"  There aren't any more trenches to clear, so the next zombie-infested town "
"will have to suffice."
msgstr ""
"ウィンチェスター1897は、商業的に成功した最初のポンプアクションショットガンの一つです。その「トレンチ(塹壕)」向けの設計から、第一次世界大戦中はアメリカの理想を鮮やかに体現した象徴とされていました。放熱板と着剣装置、そして銃剣を備えたこの銃の外見は、間違いなく恐ろしいものです。もう掃討すべき塹壕はありません。次はゾンビが蔓延る街に繰り出しましょう。"

#. ~ Name of a gun
#: data/json/items/gun/shot.json
msgid "4-round waterfowl shotgun"
msgid_plural "4-round waterfowl shotguns"
msgstr[0] "ショットガン(12ga/4発水鳥狩猟用)"

#. ~ Description of gun "4-round waterfowl shotgun"
#: data/json/items/gun/shot.json
msgid ""
"This is a lanky, though relatively light, semi-automatic shotgun fitted with"
" a plastic, dimple buttstock and forend, a representative of many such guns "
"employed in fighting the true, greatest foe: geese.  An under-slung magazine"
" tube retains three shells in complement with a chambered cartridge, lending"
" the gun a somewhat modest capacity despite its durability and reliable "
"action."
msgstr ""
"ひょろ長い形状の割には比較的軽量な、滑り止め加工されたプラスチック製の銃床とフォアエンドを備えたセミオートショットガンです。水鳥猟における最高の獲物とされるガンとの対決には様々な銃が使われますが、その中でも代表格に位置します。銃の下側に付いたチューブ型弾倉は、薬室とは別に合計3発の弾薬を保持します。耐久性と信頼性は高いですが、装填数はやや控えめです。"

#. ~ Variant name of gun "4-round waterfowl shotgun"
#: data/json/items/gun/shot.json
msgid "Benelli M2 shotgun"
msgid_plural "Benelli M2 shotguns"
msgstr[0] "ショットガン(12ga/ﾍﾞﾈﾘM2)"

#. ~ Description of variant "4-round waterfowl shotgun" of gun "Benelli M2
#. shotgun"
#: data/json/items/gun/shot.json
msgid ""
"Workhorse, companion, and Italian hole-puncher: the M2 forms the backbone of"
" the Benelli's venerable line of Super 90 shotguns, utilizing the company's "
"signature inertia-driven system to snap out 12-gauge shells with alacrity.  "
"Though possessing a 3-round magazine tube, the shotgun's dimpled, synthetic "
"furniture, cryogenically treated barrel, and robust action capable of "
"withstanding magnum loads make it a hardy option, even for the post-"
"cataclysm survivor."
msgstr ""
"馬車馬、相棒、イタリアの穴あけ器などと呼ばれるM2はベネリの由緒あるスーペル90シリーズの源流であり、同社製品の特長である慣性利用方式によって12ゲージ弾を素早く発射します。薬室とは別に3発の弾薬を装填できるチューブ型弾倉、滑り止め加工が施されたプラスチック製プレート、極低温処理された銃身、強装弾の負荷にも耐える堅牢な作りをを備えたこの銃は、大変動後の生存者にとっても頼もしい武器になることでしょう。"

#. ~ Variant name of gun "4-round waterfowl shotgun"
#: data/json/items/gun/shot.json
msgid "Benelli SBE 3 shotgun"
msgid_plural "Benelli SBE 3 shotguns"
msgstr[0] "ショットガン(12ga/ﾍﾞﾈﾘSBE3)"

#. ~ Description of variant "4-round waterfowl shotgun" of gun "Benelli SBE 3
#. shotgun"
#: data/json/items/gun/shot.json
msgid ""
"A relatively light, semi-automatic fowling peace finished in black furniture"
" with trim lines and a slender forend, the Super Black Eagle (SBE) shotgun "
"operates off of Benelli's inertia-driven recoil system.  Synonymous with "
"versatility and reliability, it's a decades-beloved design incorporating one"
" of the earliest actions rated to chamber 3-inch magnum shotgun shells, with"
" this 2023 updated version coming fitted with a recoil pad."
msgstr ""
"スーパー・ブラック・イーグル(SBE)ショットガンは、トリムラインと細いフォアエンドをもつ黒い銃身が特徴的な、ベネリ社独自の慣性利用装填方式を採用した鳥類狩猟向けの比較的軽量なセミオートショットガンです。多用途性と信頼性の代名詞であるこのモデルは、最初期から実装されていたケース長3インチの12ゲージ強装弾を装填できるシステムを備えており、何十年にもわたって愛されてきました。これは2023年モデルであり、反動を軽減するパッドが付いています。"

#. ~ Name of a gun
#: data/json/items/gun/shot.json
msgid "6-round tactical shotgun"
msgid_plural "6-round tactical shotguns"
msgstr[0] "ショットガン(12ga/6発ﾀｸﾃｨｶﾙ)"

#. ~ Description of gun "6-round tactical shotgun"
#: data/json/items/gun/shot.json
msgid ""
"A black-finished shotgun fit for the gentlemanly pursuit of blowing very "
"large holes through the residence of the cataclysm, be it zombie, goose, or "
"tiny abomination, this semi-automatic longarm fields five shotgun shells "
"within its tubular magazine.  Aesthetically pleasing with its dimpled "
"buttstock and forend, the weapon features an underslung pistol-style grip "
"and a gel cushion on the back of the stock for recoil mitigation."
msgstr ""
"ゾンビであれ、ガチョウであれ、小さな怪物であれ、その住処を穴だらけにする大変動後の紳士的な仕事に適した、チューブ型弾倉に5発の弾薬を装填する、黒染め加工が施されたセミオートショットガンです。銃床とフォアエンドに滑り止め加工が施された美しいデザインのこの銃は、下部にピストル風のグリップが付いており、銃床の背面には反動を軽減するゲルクッションが備わっています。"

#. ~ Variant name of gun "6-round tactical shotgun"
#: data/json/items/gun/shot.json
msgid "Benelli M2 Tactical shotgun"
msgid_plural "Benelli M2 Tactical shotguns"
msgstr[0] "ショットガン(12ga/ﾍﾞﾈﾘM2ﾀｸﾃｨｶﾙ)"

#. ~ Description of variant "6-round tactical shotgun" of gun "Benelli M2
#. Tactical shotgun"
#: data/json/items/gun/shot.json
msgid ""
"Where the full-sized Benelli M2 shotgun is a hefty stallion, this mission-"
"oriented tactical iteration is a trim race horse, with an 18.5-inch barrel, "
"dimpled grip surfaces, and an underslung pistol grip.  Ghost-ring aperture-"
"sights, a recoil-padded buttstock, and a cryogenically-treated barrel all "
"join hands to ensure that you can carry out your post-cataclysm farming "
"duties: seeding lead shot into fields of zombies."
msgstr ""
"フルサイズのベネリM2ショットガンを屈強な牡馬とするなら、こちらは均整の取れた競走馬です。同じ戦術を繰り返すミッション志向型の銃であり、銃身は約47cm、グリップ表面には滑り止め加工が施され、下部にはピストルグリップも付いています。照準用のゴーストリング、反動軽減パッドが付いた銃床、極低温された銃身素材が一体となることで、ゾンビ畑に鉛玉をばら撒く大変動後の農作業を確実に完了させることができます。"

#. ~ Variant name of gun "6-round tactical shotgun"
#: data/json/items/gun/shot.json
msgid "Mossberg 500 Security shotgun"
msgid_plural "Mossberg 500 Security shotguns"
msgstr[0] "ショットガン(12ga/ﾓｽﾊﾞｰｸﾞ500ｾｷｭﾘﾃｨ)"

#. ~ Description of variant "6-round tactical shotgun" of gun "Mossberg 500
#. Security shotgun"
#: data/json/items/gun/shot.json
msgid ""
"The Mossberg 500 is a popular series of pump-action shotguns, often acquired"
" for military use.  It is noted for its high durability and low recoil.  "
"This one is fitted with an 18.5 inch barrel."
msgstr "普及率が高く、軍で使われることが多いポンプアクションショットガンです。堅牢性と低反動が特長です。このモデルの銃身は約47cmです。"

#. ~ Name of a gun
#: data/json/items/gun/shot.json data/mods/Generic_Guns/firearms/shot.json
msgid "slam-fire pipe shotgun"
msgid_plural "slam-fire pipe shotguns"
msgstr[0] "ショットガン(12ga/ｽﾗﾑﾌｧｲｱﾊﾟｲﾌﾟ銃)"

#. ~ Description of gun "slam-fire pipe shotgun"
#: data/json/items/gun/shot.json
msgid ""
"A crude shotgun, composed of two thick steel pipes, an end cap, and a nail."
"  The lack of sights make this weapon only useful at point-blank range."
msgstr "2本の太い鋼鉄製パイプ、エンドキャップ、釘を組み合わせて作った粗悪な散弾銃です。照準器がないため、近距離でしか使えません。"

#. ~ Name of a gun
#: data/json/items/gun/shot.json data/mods/Generic_Guns/firearms/shot.json
msgid "double slam-fire pipe shotgun"
msgid_plural "double slam-fire pipe shotguns"
msgstr[0] "ショットガン(12ga/2連ｽﾗﾑﾌｧｲｱﾊﾟｲﾌﾟ銃)"

#. ~ Description of gun "double slam-fire pipe shotgun"
#: data/json/items/gun/shot.json
msgid ""
"A crude shotgun, composed of four thick steel pipes, two end caps, and two "
"nails.  The lack of sights make this weapon only useful at point-blank "
"range."
msgstr "4本の太い鋼鉄製パイプ、2つのエンドキャップと釘を組み合わせて作った粗悪な散弾銃です。照準器がないため、近距離でしか使えません。"

#. ~ Name of a gun
#: data/json/items/gun/shot.json
msgid "rifle shotgun"
msgid_plural "rifle shotguns"
msgstr[0] "ショットガン(12ga/ﾗｲﾌﾙｼｮｯﾄｶﾞﾝ)"

#. ~ Description of gun "rifle shotgun"
#: data/json/items/gun/shot.json
msgid ""
"Despite looking like a military-issued rifle, this is, in fact, a shotgun.  "
"It can accept a variety of magazines."
msgstr "軍用ライフルのようなデザインですが、実はショットガンです。様々な弾倉に対応しています。"

#. ~ Variant name of gun "rifle shotgun"
#: data/json/items/gun/shot.json
msgid "Tokarev TAR 12P"
msgid_plural "Tokarev TAR 12Ps"
msgstr[0] "ショットガン(12ga/ﾄｶﾚﾌTAR12P)"

#. ~ Description of variant "rifle shotgun" of gun "Tokarev TAR 12P"
#: data/json/items/gun/shot.json
msgid ""
"Not related to the Soviet weapon designer, Tokarev, this Turkish shotgun "
"uses an AR-12 shotgun platform to make the user comfortably hold it like a "
"rifle and to utilise MKA 1919 magazines of different sizes."
msgstr ""
"ソ連の銃器開発者トカレフとは全く関係ないトルコ製のショットガンです。AR-12ショットガンのプラットフォームを採用することでライフルのように楽に扱え、様々なサイズのMKA"
" 1919弾倉に対応しています。"

#. ~ Variant name of gun "rifle shotgun"
#: data/json/items/gun/shot.json
msgid "VR 80"
msgid_plural "VR 80s"
msgstr[0] "ショットガン(12ga/VR 80)"

#. ~ Description of variant "rifle shotgun" of gun "VR 80"
#: data/json/items/gun/shot.json
msgid ""
"The work of Rock Island Armoury, this AR-12-style shotgun affords both the "
"comfort of being similar to a rifle and the ability to use MKA 1919 shotgun "
"magazines."
msgstr ""
"ロックアイランドアーモリー社製のAR-12風ショットガンです。ライフルの快適さとMKA 1919ショットガン弾倉を装填できる機能性を両立しています。"

#. ~ Variant name of gun "rifle shotgun"
#: data/json/items/gun/shot.json
msgid "BOSS 25"
msgid_plural "BOSS 25s"
msgstr[0] "ショットガン(12ga/BOSS 25)"

#. ~ Description of variant "rifle shotgun" of gun "BOSS 25"
#: data/json/items/gun/shot.json
msgid ""
"Manufactured in Turkey, this work of Farncolin Arms uses an AR-12 shotgun "
"platform to let the user comfortably hold it like a rifle and utilise MKA "
"1919 magazines of different sizes."
msgstr ""
"トルコのフランコリン・アームズ社が製造した銃です。AR-12ショットガンのプラットフォームを採用することでライフルのように楽に扱え、様々なサイズのMKA"
" 1919弾倉に対応しています。"

#. ~ Variant name of gun "rifle shotgun"
#: data/json/items/gun/shot.json
msgid "AR-12S"
msgid_plural "AR-12Ss"
msgstr[0] "ショットガン(12ga/AR-12S)"

#. ~ Description of variant "rifle shotgun" of gun "AR-12S"
#: data/json/items/gun/shot.json
msgid ""
"Created by Charles Daly, this shotgun uses AR-12 platform to make user "
"comfortably hold it like a rifle, and to utilize MKA 1919 magazines of "
"different sizes."
msgstr ""
"チャールズ・デイリー社が製造したショットガンです。AR-12ショットガンのプラットフォームを採用することでライフルのように楽に扱え、様々なサイズのMKA"
" 1919弾倉に対応しています。"

#. ~ Variant name of gun "rifle shotgun"
#: data/json/items/gun/shot.json
msgid "AR-12A"
msgid_plural "AR-12As"
msgstr[0] "ショットガン(12ga/AR-12A)"

#. ~ Description of variant "rifle shotgun" of gun "AR-12A"
#: data/json/items/gun/shot.json
msgid ""
"Made by Charles Daly, this shotgun uses AR-12 platform to make user "
"comfortably hold it like a rifle, and to utilize MKA 1919 magazines of "
"different sizes."
msgstr ""
"チャールズ・デイリー社製のショットガンです。AR-12ショットガンのプラットフォームを採用することでライフルのように楽に扱え、様々なサイズのMKA "
"1919弾倉に対応しています。"

#. ~ Variant name of gun "rifle shotgun"
#: data/json/items/gun/shot.json
msgid "GF25"
msgid_plural "GF25s"
msgstr[0] "ショットガン(12ga/GF25)"

#. ~ Description of variant "rifle shotgun" of gun "GF25"
#: data/json/items/gun/shot.json
msgid ""
"Work of GForce Arms, this shotgun uses AR-12 platform to make user "
"comfortably hold it like a rifle, and to utilize MKA 1919 magazines of "
"different sizes."
msgstr ""
"Gフォース・アームズ社製のショットガンです。AR-12ショットガンのプラットフォームを採用することでライフルのように楽に扱え、様々なサイズのMKA "
"1919弾倉に対応しています。"

#. ~ Variant name of gun "rifle shotgun"
#: data/json/items/gun/shot.json
msgid "MKA 1919"
msgid_plural "MKA 1919s"
msgstr[0] "ショットガン(12ga/MKA 1919)"

#. ~ Description of variant "rifle shotgun" of gun "MKA 1919"
#: data/json/items/gun/shot.json
msgid ""
"First of its type, this Akdal Arms MKA 1919 looks like a bulky M-4 rifle, "
"and was a parent for numerous shotguns, that soon after got a named \"AR-12 "
"platform\", inspired by Armalite design."
msgstr ""
"大きなM-4のようにも見えるMKA "
"1919は、アーマライト社の設計にヒントを得てアクダル・アームズ社が製造しました。後に「AR-12プラットフォーム」と呼ばれる銃の元祖であり、この設計は以後多数のショットガンに取り入れられました。"

#. ~ Variant name of gun "rifle shotgun"
#: data/json/items/gun/shot.json
msgid "KRX"
msgid_plural "KRXs"
msgstr[0] "ショットガン(12ga/KRX)"

#. ~ Description of variant "rifle shotgun" of gun "KRX"
#: data/json/items/gun/shot.json
msgid ""
"Created by TriStar Arms, this shotgun uses AR-12 platform to make user "
"comfortably hold it like a rifle, and to utilize MKA 1919 magazines of "
"different sizes."
msgstr ""
"トライスター・アームズ社が製造したショットガンです。AR-12ショットガンのプラットフォームを採用することでライフルのように楽に扱え、様々なサイズのMKA"
" 1919弾倉に対応しています。"

#. ~ Variant name of gun "rifle shotgun"
#: data/json/items/gun/shot.json
msgid "VR60"
msgid_plural "VR60s"
msgstr[0] "ショットガン(12ga/VR60)"

#. ~ Description of variant "rifle shotgun" of gun "VR60"
#: data/json/items/gun/shot.json
msgid ""
"Work of Rock Island Armory, this AR-12 style shotgun afford both the comfort"
" of being similar to rifle, and ability to use MKA 1919 shotgun magazines."
msgstr ""
"ロックアイランドアーモリー社製のAR-12風ショットガンです。ライフルの快適さとMKA 1919ショットガン弾倉を装填できる機能性を両立しています。"

#. ~ Name of a gun
#: data/json/items/gun/shot.json
msgid "bullpup shotgun"
msgid_plural "bullpup shotguns"
msgstr[0] "ショットガン(12ga/ﾌﾞﾙﾊﾟｯﾌﾟ)"

#. ~ Description of gun "bullpup shotgun"
#: data/json/items/gun/shot.json
msgid "A curious magazine-fed shotgun, made using bullpup scheme."
msgstr "ブルパップ方式で設計された、弾倉から給弾する珍しいショットガンです。"

#. ~ Variant name of gun "bullpup shotgun"
#: data/json/items/gun/shot.json
msgid "GFY-1"
msgid_plural "GFY-1s"
msgstr[0] "ショットガン(12ga/GFY-1)"

#. ~ Description of variant "bullpup shotgun" of gun "GFY-1"
#: data/json/items/gun/shot.json
msgid ""
"A work of GForce Arms, this curious bullpup shotgun is compact, familiar to "
"any rifleman, and can use standard MKA 1919 magazines."
msgstr ""
"Gフォース・アームズ社製の珍しいブルパップショットガンです。コンパクトでライフルマンの手にもよく馴染み、標準的なMKA 1919弾倉に対応しています。"

#. ~ Variant name of gun "bullpup shotgun"
#: data/json/items/gun/shot.json
msgid "BP-12"
msgid_plural "BP-12s"
msgstr[0] "ショットガン(12ga/BP-12)"

#. ~ Description of variant "bullpup shotgun" of gun "BP-12"
#: data/json/items/gun/shot.json
msgid ""
"Manufactured by Century Arms, it is a compact bullpup shotgun, that accept a"
" variety of MKA 1919 magazines."
msgstr "センチュリー・アームズ社が製造した、様々なMKA 1919弾倉に対応しているコンパクトなブルパップショットガンです。"

#. ~ Name of a gun
#: data/json/items/gun/shot.json
msgid "rotary-magazine shotgun"
msgid_plural "rotary-magazine shotguns"
msgstr[0] "ショットガン(12ga/回転式)"

#. ~ Description of gun "rotary-magazine shotgun"
#: data/json/items/gun/shot.json
msgid "A lengthy shotgun that accepts revolving 16-round magazines."
msgstr "回転式16発弾倉を採用した長いショットガンです。"

#. ~ Variant name of gun "rotary-magazine shotgun"
#: data/json/items/gun/shot.json
msgid "SRM Arms Model 1216"
msgid_plural "SRM Arms Model 1216s"
msgstr[0] "ショットガン(12ga/SRMｱｰﾑｽﾞ ﾓﾃﾞﾙ1216)"

#. ~ Description of variant "rotary-magazine shotgun" of gun "SRM Arms Model
#. 1216"
#: data/json/items/gun/shot.json
msgid ""
"A delayed blowback semi-automatic shotgun feeding from detachable 16-round "
"rotary magazines."
msgstr "着脱可能な16発回転式弾倉から給弾する、ディレードブローバック方式のセミオートショットガンです。"

#. ~ Name of a gun
#: data/json/items/gun/shot.json
msgid "M26-MASS standalone shotgun"
msgid_plural "M26-MASS standalone shotguns"
msgstr[0] "ショットガン(12ga/M26-MASS単体型)"

#. ~ Description of gun "M26-MASS standalone shotgun"
#: data/json/items/gun/shot.json
msgid ""
"The Modular Accessory Shotgun System is an underbarrel bolt-action shotgun "
"that was inspired by the \"Masterkey\" and which fixed most of its "
"predecessor's problems.  This one is configured for standalone usage."
msgstr ""
"「マスターキー」に影響を受けつつ、その問題点をほぼ修正したアンダーバレル・ボルトアクションショットガンです。このモデルは、単体での使用を前提とした構成になっています。"

#. ~ Name of a gun
#: data/json/items/gun/signal_flare.json
msgid "flaregun"
msgid_plural "flareguns"
msgstr[0] "ハンドガン(信号弾/信号拳銃)"

#. ~ Description of gun "flaregun"
#: data/json/items/gun/signal_flare.json
msgid "A plastic single shot pistol that can be loaded with signal flares."
msgstr "信号弾を装填できる、合成樹脂製の単発式ピストルです。"

#. ~ Name of a gun
#: data/json/items/gun/ups.json
msgid "XM34 EMP projector"
msgid_plural "XM34 EMP projectors"
msgstr[0] "ライフル(XM34 EMPﾌﾟﾛｼﾞｪｸﾀｰ)"

#. ~ Description of gun "XM34 EMP projector"
#: data/json/items/gun/ups.json
msgid ""
"A powerful electrolaser developed by the R&D outfit \"Aerial Labs\".  "
"Especially effective against electronic targets."
msgstr "独立研究開発機関\"Aerial Labs\"が作り上げた強力なエレクトロレーザーです。電子回路を持つ標的に対して特に効果を発揮します。"

#. ~ Valid mod location of gun
#. ~ Location of gun mod
#: data/json/items/gun/ups.json data/json/items/gunmod/laser_gunmods.json
#: data/json/items/ranged/energy.json
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/gun/laser.json
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/items/weapons.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/inventor/gun.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/inventor/gunmods.json
msgid "emitter"
msgstr "エミッター"

#. ~ Name of a gun
#: data/json/items/gun/ups.json
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/items/laser_overrides.json
msgid "CMES laser cannon"
msgid_plural "CMES laser cannons"
msgstr[0] "ライフル(CMESﾚｰｻﾞｰ砲)"

#. ~ Description of gun "CMES laser cannon"
#: data/json/items/gun/ups.json
msgid ""
"The integral weapon system for the CMES exoskeleton mech-suit, a rotating-"
"barrel actively-cooled rapid-fire laser system."
msgstr "CMES外骨格メックスーツに不可欠な、回転バレルと強制冷却装置を備えたレーザー速射砲システムです。"

#. ~ Firing mode of gun
#: data/json/items/gun/ups.json data/mods/Aftershock/items/gun/5x50.json
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/gun/needle.json
msgid "5 rd."
msgstr "5点バースト"

#. ~ Name of a gun
#: data/json/items/gun/ups.json
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/items/laser_overrides.json
msgid "RMES marksman system"
msgid_plural "RMES marksman systems"
msgstr[0] "ライフル(RMES遠距離射撃ｼｽﾃﾑ)"

#. ~ Description of gun "RMES marksman system"
#: data/json/items/gun/ups.json
msgid ""
"The integral weapon system for the RMES exoskeleton mech-suit, a quiet and "
"accurate marksman laser rifle."
msgstr "RMES外骨格メックスーツ用の内蔵型銃器システムである、静音性と精密性に優れた遠距離射撃用レーザーライフルです。"

#. ~ Name of a gun
#: data/json/items/gun/ups.json data/mods/Aftershock/items/gun/laser.json
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/items/laser_overrides.json
msgid "A7 laser rifle"
msgid_plural "A7 laser rifles"
msgstr[0] "ライフル(A7ﾚｰｻﾞｰﾗｲﾌﾙ)"

#. ~ Description of gun "A7 laser rifle"
#: data/json/items/gun/ups.json
msgid ""
"A state-of-the-art laser rifle developed by the R&D outfit \"Aerial Labs\"."
"  Initial performance rivaled Rivtech's finest, with rumors flying about "
"corporate skulduggery.  Though the Cataclysm put that on the ash heap of "
"history, this weapon can still do the same to your foes."
msgstr ""
"独立研究開発機関\"Aerial "
"Labs\"が開発した、最先端技術の結晶たるレーザーライフルです。初期性能はRivtech社製の最上位製品に匹敵するとも言われています。開発機関の不正行為に関する噂が飛び交っていましたが、それも今では灰燼の底に埋もれています。この銃のレーザーで焼かれる敵にはなお関係の無い話です。"

#. ~ Valid mod location of gun
#. ~ Location of gun mod
#: data/json/items/gun/ups.json data/json/items/gunmod/laser_gunmods.json
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/gun/laser.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/inventor/gun.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/inventor/gunmods.json
msgid "lens"
msgstr "レンズ"

#. ~ Name of a gun
#: data/json/items/gun/ups.json
msgid "hm12 dazzle rifle"
msgid_plural "hm12 dazzle rifles"
msgstr[0] "ライフル(hm12ﾀﾞｽﾞﾙﾗｲﾌﾙ)"

#. ~ Description of gun "hm12 dazzle rifle"
#: data/json/items/gun/ups.json
msgid ""
"This prototype 'energy weapon' was apparently manufactured by Hub 01.  It "
"somewhat resembles an oversize radar gun, mounted on a rectangular frame of "
"white sheet metal.  It will temporarily stun robots, if you manage to hit "
"their sensors with a clean shot."
msgstr ""
"明らかにハブ01が製造したと思われる、「エネルギー兵器」の試作品です。白い長方形の金属板で作ったフレームに、特大のスピードガンを取り付けたような形状です。ロボットのセンサーに上手く命中すれば、一時的に気絶させることができます。"

#. ~ Name of a gun
#: data/json/items/gun/ups.json
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/items/laser_overrides.json
msgid "V29 laser pistol"
msgid_plural "V29 laser pistols"
msgstr[0] "ハンドガン(V29ﾚｰｻﾞｰﾋﾟｽﾄﾙ)"

#. ~ Description of gun "V29 laser pistol"
#: data/json/items/gun/ups.json
msgid ""
"The V29 laser pistol was one of the first handheld laser weapons.  It is "
"larger than most traditional handguns, but has no recoil whatsoever."
msgstr "最初期の携帯型レーザー兵器の一つです。従来のハンドガンと比較してやや大型ですが、射撃時の反動がまったくありません。"

#. ~ Name of a gun
#: data/json/items/gun/ups.json
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/items/laser_overrides.json
msgid "salvaged CMES laser cannon"
msgid_plural "salvaged CMES laser cannons"
msgstr[0] "ライフル(CMESﾚｰｻﾞｰ砲単体型)"

#. ~ Description of gun "salvaged CMES laser cannon"
#: data/json/items/gun/ups.json
msgid ""
"This Gatling-laser has been stripped from its CMES mech-suit and is far too "
"heavy to use on its own.  You will need to deploy it or mount it to a "
"vehicle, but it could be devastating if you have deep battery reserves."
msgstr ""
"CMES外骨格メックスーツから取り外されたこのガトリングレーザーは、単体で扱うにはあまりにも重すぎます。設置するか車両に搭載して発射する必要がありますが、電力が大量にある限り壊滅的な打撃を与えられます。"

#. ~ Name of a gun
#: data/json/items/gun/ups.json
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/items/laser_overrides.json
msgid "salvaged RMES marksman laser"
msgid_plural "salvaged RMES marksman lasers"
msgstr[0] "ライフル(RMES遠距離射撃ﾚｰｻﾞｰ単体型)"

#. ~ Description of gun "salvaged RMES marksman laser"
#: data/json/items/gun/ups.json
msgid ""
"Formerly belonging to an RMES mech-suit, this powerful long-range laser "
"rifle was never designed for human hands.  You might be able to make it work"
" if you deployed it or mounted it to a vehicle, though, and its long range "
"and potency could be pretty handy if you can keep it powered."
msgstr ""
"元々はRMES外骨格メックスーツに搭載されていた、強力な長距離レーザーライフルです。人間が扱えるようには設計されていませんが、設置するか車両に搭載すれば、使えなくもありません。"

#. ~ Gun mod name
#. ~ Location of gun mod
#. ~ Valid mod location of gun
#: data/json/items/gunmod/accessories.json data/json/items/ranged/archery.json
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/enchanted_ranged.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/range.json
msgid "arrow rest"
msgid_plural "arrow rests"
msgstr[0] "アローレスト"

#. ~ Description of gun mod "arrow rest"
#. ~ Description of gun mod "wooden arrow rest"
#: data/json/items/gunmod/accessories.json
msgid ""
"A small extension above the grip which an arrow rests upon while being "
"aimed.  Improves accuracy with no drawbacks."
msgstr "番えた矢を載せておく土台です。撃ち出された矢の軌道が安定し、狙った場所に飛びやすくなります。"

#. ~ Target of gun mod
#: data/json/items/gunmod/accessories.json data/json/items/gunmod/grip.json
#: data/json/items/gunmod/mount.json data/json/items/gunmod/sights.json
#: data/json/items/gunmod/underbarrel.json
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/enchanted_gunmods.json
msgctxt "gun_type_type"
msgid "bow"
msgstr "弓"

#. ~ Gun mod name
#: data/json/items/gunmod/accessories.json
msgid "wooden arrow rest"
msgid_plural "wooden arrow rests"
msgstr[0] "アローレスト(木)"

#. ~ Gun mod name
#: data/json/items/gunmod/accessories.json
msgid "bow stabilizer"
msgid_plural "bow stabilizers"
msgstr[0] "ボウスタビライザー"

#. ~ Description of gun mod "bow stabilizer"
#: data/json/items/gunmod/accessories.json
msgid ""
"A counterweight placed forward of the bow's grip allows for greater "
"accuracy.  Aside from increased weight and size, there are no drawbacks."
msgstr "弓の前部に取り付けるカウンターウェイトです。ブレを抑制し、拡散率を低減させます。重量と体積は増えますが、他に欠点はありません。"

#. ~ Location of gun mod
#. ~ Valid mod location of gun
#: data/json/items/gunmod/accessories.json data/json/items/ranged/archery.json
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/weapons.json
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/archery.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/range.json
msgid "stabilizer"
msgstr "スタビライザー"

#. ~ Gun mod name
#: data/json/items/gunmod/accessories.json
msgid "bow stabilizer system"
msgid_plural "bow stabilizer systems"
msgstr[0] "ボウスタビライザーシステム"

#. ~ Description of gun mod "bow stabilizer system"
#: data/json/items/gunmod/accessories.json
msgid ""
"A set of stabilizing rods with dampeners and an adjustable mount.  This "
"system will significantly reduce shaking at full draw."
msgstr "取付位置を調整できる、振動吸収システムが付いたスタビライザーです。弓を引き絞った際の照準のブレを大幅に軽減します。"

#. ~ Gun mod name
#: data/json/items/gunmod/accessories.json
msgid "bow dampening kit"
msgid_plural "bow dampening kits"
msgstr[0] "弓用振動吸収パッド"

#. ~ Description of gun mod "bow dampening kit"
#: data/json/items/gunmod/accessories.json
msgid ""
"A set of simple pads and rubber with adhesive backing, designed to stick on "
"the limbs and string of a bow to absorb vibrations.  This substantially "
"reduces noise during firing and can help with accuracy."
msgstr ""
"弓のリムとストリングに貼り付けて弓の振動を吸収する、裏地が粘着シールになったゴム製の簡素なパッドです。取り付けると発射音が大幅に低減され、精密性も向上します。"

#. ~ Location of gun mod
#. ~ Valid mod location of gun
#: data/json/items/gunmod/accessories.json data/json/items/ranged/archery.json
#: data/json/items/ranged/crossbows.json
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/weapons.json
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/archery.json
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/enchanted_ranged.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/range.json
msgid "dampening"
msgstr "ダンパー"

#. ~ Target of gun mod
#: data/json/items/gunmod/accessories.json data/json/items/gunmod/grip.json
#: data/json/items/gunmod/mount.json data/json/items/gunmod/rail.json
#: data/json/items/gunmod/sights.json data/json/items/gunmod/sling.json
#: data/json/items/gunmod/stock.json data/json/items/gunmod/underbarrel.json
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/gunmods/sights.json
#: data/mods/Generic_Guns/gunmods/gunmods.json
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/enchanted_gunmods.json
msgctxt "gun_type_type"
msgid "crossbow"
msgstr "クロスボウ"

#. ~ Gun mod name
#: data/json/items/gunmod/accessories.json
msgid "primitive bow dampening kit"
msgid_plural "primitive bow dampening kits"
msgstr[0] "弓用簡易振動吸収パッド"

#. ~ Description of gun mod "primitive bow dampening kit"
#: data/json/items/gunmod/accessories.json
msgid ""
"A set of simple pads and strips of fur with adhesive backing, designed to "
"stick on the limbs and string of a bow to absorb vibrations.  This "
"substantially reduces noise during firing and can help with accuracy."
msgstr ""
"弓のリムとストリングに張り付けて弓の振動を吸収する、裏地が粘着シールになった毛皮製の簡素なパッドです。取り付けると発射音が大幅に低減され、精密性も向上します。"

#. ~ Description of gun mod "belt clip"
#: data/json/items/gunmod/accessories.json
msgid ""
"A belt clip that attaches to the grip or slide of a pistol to facilitate "
"'Mexican carry', the practice of carrying without a holster.  It does not "
"offer any protection for the trigger, so users are strongly advised to carry"
" with the chamber empty or select a firearm with a very heavy trigger pull."
msgstr ""
"ホルスターなしで銃を携行する「メキシカンキャリー」を簡単に実現できる、ハンドガンのグリップやスライド部分に取り付けるクリップです。引き金は剥き出しのままなので、チャンバーを空にして携行するか、引き金を強く引く必要がある銃に付けることをお勧めします。"

#. ~ Target of gun mod
#: data/json/items/gunmod/accessories.json
msgctxt "gun_type_type"
msgid "rugerlcp"
msgstr "ルガーLCP"

#. ~ Target of gun mod
#: data/json/items/gunmod/accessories.json
msgctxt "gun_type_type"
msgid "kp32"
msgstr "ケルテックP-32"

#. ~ Target of gun mod
#: data/json/items/gunmod/accessories.json
msgctxt "gun_type_type"
msgid "kp3at"
msgstr "ケルテックP3AT"

#. ~ Target of gun mod
#: data/json/items/gunmod/accessories.json
msgctxt "gun_type_type"
msgid "kpf9"
msgstr "ケルテックPF-9"

#. ~ Gun mod name
#: data/json/items/gunmod/barrel.json
msgid "ported barrel"
msgid_plural "ported barrels"
msgstr[0] "ポーテッドバレル"

#. ~ Description of gun mod "ported barrel"
#: data/json/items/gunmod/barrel.json
msgid ""
"A ported barrel redirects exhaust gases to compensate for muzzle climb, "
"improving recoil but increasing noise and reducing accuracy slightly."
msgstr ""
"銃口付近の上面にガス排出ポートが追加された銃身です。ガスの噴出によって銃口の跳ね上がりを抑える効果があります。反動を軽減しますが、発射音が増大し、わずかに精度が下がります。"

#. ~ Gun mod name
#: data/json/items/gunmod/barrel.json
msgid "shortened barrel"
msgid_plural "shortened barrels"
msgstr[0] "短銃身"

#. ~ Description of gun mod "shortened barrel"
#: data/json/items/gunmod/barrel.json
msgid ""
"A shortened barrel results in markedly reduced accuracy and a minor increase"
" in noise, but also greatly improves the ease with which the weapon can be "
"carried and wielded."
msgstr "銃身を短くする事で精度が下がり、発射音がやや大きくなりますが、体積が小さくなって持ち運びやすくなり、素速く構えられるようになります。"

#. ~ Gun mod name
#: data/json/items/gunmod/barrel.json
msgid "UPS test"
msgid_plural "UPS test"
msgstr[0] "UPS(テスト)"

#. ~ Description of gun mod "UPS test"
#: data/json/items/gunmod/barrel.json
msgid ""
"Test mod for UPS drain on mods, this should never spawn, if you see this, "
"it's a bug.  50x more UPS drain."
msgstr "UPSの電源消費を確認するためのテストMODです。通常は表示されません。UPS電力を50以上消費します。"

#. ~ Description of gun mod "brass catcher"
#: data/json/items/gunmod/brass_catcher.json
msgid ""
"A bag that hangs off the side of your gun and catches ejected casings so you"
" don't have to pick them up."
