msgid_plural "RM121 aux shotguns"
msgstr[0] "RM121補助ショットガン(20x66mm)"

#. ~ Description of variant "RM121 aux shotgun"of gun mod "caseless aux
#. shotgun"
#: data/json/items/gunmod/underbarrel.json
msgid ""
"The Rivtech RM121 auxiliary weapon system is a magazine-fed semi-automatic "
"caseless shotgun, which can be mounted under the barrel of many rifles.  "
"Accepts RMSA10 box magazines."
msgstr ""
"Rivtech社のRM121補助武装システムは、様々なライフルのアンダーバレルに装着できる弾倉式セミオートケースレスショットガンです。RMSA10箱型弾倉に対応します。"

#. ~ Gun mod name
