msgid_plural "modified RM121 aux shotguns"
msgstr[0] "改造RM121補助ショットガン(20x66mm)"

#. ~ Description of gun mod "modified RM121 aux shotgun"
#: data/json/items/gunmod/underbarrel.json
msgid ""
"The Rivtech RM121 auxiliary weapon system is a magazine-fed semi-automatic "
