"steel.  Blades are definitely sturdier than obsidian ones."
msgstr ""
"アステカ族の戦士が使っていた近接戦闘用の大型武器を、現代風に再現したものです。頑丈な木製の棍棒に鋭い刃が並んでいます。高炭素鋼製の刃は黒曜石よりもずっと頑丈です。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/melee/bludgeons.json
msgid "hardened steel bladed macuahuitl"
msgid_plural "hardened steel bladed macuahuitls"
msgstr[0] "鉄片マフアクティル(焼入炭素鋼)"

#. ~ Description of "hardened steel bladed macuahuitl"
#: data/json/items/melee/bludgeons.json
msgid ""
"A modern reimagining of the large close combat weapon affiliated with Aztec "
"warriors, made of a sturdy wooden club and sharp blades forged from hardened"
" steel.  Blades are definitely sturdier than obsidian ones."
msgstr ""
"アステカ族の戦士が使っていた近接戦闘用の大型武器を、現代風に再現したものです。頑丈な木製の棍棒に鋭い刃が並んでいます。焼入炭素鋼製の刃は黒曜石よりもずっと頑丈です。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/melee/bludgeons.json
msgid "tempered steel bladed macuahuitl"
msgid_plural "tempered steel bladed macuahuitls"
msgstr[0] "鉄片マフアクティル(焼戻炭素鋼)"

#. ~ Description of "tempered steel bladed macuahuitl"
#: data/json/items/melee/bludgeons.json
msgid ""
"A modern reimagining of the large close combat weapon affiliated with Aztec "
"warriors, made of a sturdy wooden club and sharp blades forged from tempered"
" steel.  You can single-handedly avenge the fallen nations of Mesoamerica "
"with this one."
msgstr ""
"アステカ族の戦士が使っていた近接戦闘用の大型武器を、現代風に再現したものです。頑丈な木製の棍棒に焼戻炭素鋼製の鋭い刃が並んでいます。これを振るえば、滅びたメソアメリカの国々の仇を単独で討つことすらできそうです。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/melee/bludgeons.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/weapon_copy_extensions.json
msgid "ironshod quarterstaff"
msgid_plural "ironshod quarterstaves"
msgstr[0] "鉄張りクォータースタッフ"

#. ~ Description of "ironshod quarterstaff"
#: data/json/items/melee/bludgeons.json
msgid "A long wooden staff reinforced with metal bands and caps."
msgstr "先端と持ち手に金属を巻いて補強した、木製の長い杖です。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/melee/bludgeons.json
msgid "mild steelshod quarterstaff"
msgid_plural "mild steelshod quarterstaves"
msgstr[0] "鉄張りクォータースタッフ(低炭素鋼)"

#. ~ Description of "mild steelshod quarterstaff"
#: data/json/items/melee/bludgeons.json
msgid ""
"A long wooden staff reinforced with metal bands and caps.  This one has been"
" forged with mild steel rather than the traditional iron, and so hits just "
"that little bit harder."
msgstr "先端と持ち手が金属板で補強された、長い木製の棒です。一般的な鉄ではなく低炭素鋼が使われているため、攻撃力が多少上がっています。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/melee/bludgeons.json
msgid "medium steelshod quarterstaff"
msgid_plural "medium steelshod quarterstaves"
msgstr[0] "鉄張りクォータースタッフ(中炭素鋼)"

#. ~ Description of "medium steelshod quarterstaff"
#: data/json/items/melee/bludgeons.json
msgid ""
"A long wooden staff reinforced with metal bands and caps.  This one has been"
" forged with medium steel rather than the traditional iron, and so hits just"
" that little bit harder."
msgstr "先端と持ち手が金属板で補強された、長い木製の棒です。一般的な鉄ではなく中炭素鋼が使われているため、攻撃力が多少上がっています。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/melee/bludgeons.json
msgid "high steelshod quarterstaff"
msgid_plural "high steelshod quarterstaves"
msgstr[0] "鉄張りクォータースタッフ(高炭素鋼)"

#. ~ Description of "high steelshod quarterstaff"
#: data/json/items/melee/bludgeons.json
msgid ""
"A long wooden staff reinforced with metal bands and caps.  This one has been"
" forged with high steel rather than the traditional iron, and so hits just "
"that little bit harder."
msgstr "先端と持ち手が金属板で補強された、長い木製の棒です。一般的な鉄ではなく高炭素鋼が使われているため、攻撃力が多少上がっています。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/melee/bludgeons.json
msgid "hardened steelshod quarterstaff"
msgid_plural "hardened steelshod quarterstaves"
msgstr[0] "鉄張りクォータースタッフ(焼入炭素鋼)"

#. ~ Description of "hardened steelshod quarterstaff"
#: data/json/items/melee/bludgeons.json
msgid ""
"A long wooden staff reinforced with metal bands and caps.  This one has been"
" forged with hardened steel rather than the traditional iron, and so hits "
"just that little bit harder."
msgstr "先端と持ち手が金属板で補強された、長い木製の棒です。一般的な鋼鉄ではなく焼入炭素鋼が使われているため、攻撃力が多少上がっています。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/melee/bludgeons.json
msgid "tempered steelshod quarterstaff"
msgid_plural "tempered steelshod quarterstaves"
msgstr[0] "鉄張りクォータースタッフ(焼戻炭素鋼)"

#. ~ Description of "tempered steelshod quarterstaff"
#: data/json/items/melee/bludgeons.json
msgid ""
"A long wooden staff reinforced with metal bands and caps.  This one has been"
" forged with tempered steel rather than the traditional iron, and so hits "
"just that little bit harder."
msgstr "先端と持ち手が金属板で補強された、長い木製の棒です。一般的な鋼鉄ではなく焼戻炭素鋼が使われているため、攻撃力が多少上がっています。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/melee/bludgeons.json
msgid "lucerne hammer"
msgid_plural "lucerne hammers"
msgstr[0] "ルツェルンハンマー"

#. ~ Description of "lucerne hammer"
#: data/json/items/melee/bludgeons.json
msgid ""
"A versatile polearm with a spiked hammer head, a spike, and a hook attached "
"to a beefy wooden pole."
msgstr "尖った金鎚とスパイクと鉤を頑丈な木の棒の先に取り付けた、多芸な長柄武器です。"

#. ~ Description of "lucerne hammer"
#: data/json/items/melee/bludgeons.json
msgid ""
"A cheap piece of crap imitation of a versatile polearm with a spiked hammer "
"head, probably meant to be used for LARPing."
msgstr ""
"尖った金鎚とスパイクと鉤を長い棒の先に取り付けた、多芸な長柄武器...の安価なレプリカです。恐らくライブアクションRPGに使うものでしょう。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/melee/bludgeons.json
msgid "homemade polehammer"
msgid_plural "homemade polehammers"
msgstr[0] "自作ポールハンマー"

#. ~ Description of "homemade polehammer"
#: data/json/items/melee/bludgeons.json
msgid ""
"A standard hammerhead solidly mounted at the end of a proper spear shaft.  "
"The long leverage provides surprising balance and impact force.  Simple and "
"effective."
msgstr ""
"丈夫な槍柄の先端に、一般的なハンマー状の武器がしっかり取り付けられています。柄の長さと梃子の原理によって驚くべき扱いやすさと高威力を実現する、シンプルで効果的な武器です。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/melee/bludgeons.json
msgid "makeshift homemade polehammer"
msgid_plural "makeshift homemade polehammers"
msgstr[0] "簡易ポールハンマー"

#. ~ Description of "makeshift homemade polehammer"
#: data/json/items/melee/bludgeons.json
msgid ""
"A standard hammerhead mounted at the end of a long stick.  It is far from "
"being a proper weapon, but it allows you to bash zombie heads from a safe "
"distance."
msgstr ""
"長い棒の先端に一般的なハンマー状の武器が取り付けられています。まともな武器とは言えませんが、安全な距離からゾンビの頭を叩き潰すことができます。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/melee/bludgeons.json
msgid "mace"
msgid_plural "maces"
msgstr[0] "メイス"

#. ~ Description of "mace"
#: data/json/items/melee/bludgeons.json
msgid ""
"A medieval weapon consisting of a wood handle with a heavy metal head.  It "
"is heavy and slow to swing, but its crushing damage is devastating."
msgstr "木製の柄の先に重い金属製の鈍器が付いた、中世の武器です。重量があるため攻撃速度は遅いですが、その威力は破壊的です。"

#. ~ Description of "mace"
#: data/json/items/melee/bludgeons.json
msgid ""
"A light, cheaply-made replica of a medieval weapon that would normally "
"consist of a wood handle with a heavy metal head."
msgstr "木製の柄の先に重い金属製の鈍器が付いた中世の武器...の安価で軽量なレプリカです。"

#. ~ Description of "mace"
#: data/json/items/melee/bludgeons.json
msgid ""
"A medieval weapon consisting of a wood handle with a heavy metal head.  The "
"head feels a bit loose."
msgstr "木製の柄の先に重い金属製の鈍器が付いた、中世の武器です。先端の鈍器が少しガタついています。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/melee/bludgeons.json
msgid "mild steel mace"
msgid_plural "mild steel maces"
msgstr[0] "メイス(低炭素鋼)"

#. ~ Description of "mild steel mace"
#: data/json/items/melee/bludgeons.json
msgid ""
"A medieval weapon consisting of a wood handle with a heavy metal head.  It "
"is heavy and slow to swing, but its crushing damage is devastating.  This "
"one is custom-made with mild steel, which technically still works fine but "
"tends to blunt more easily, and the grip is kind of bad."
msgstr ""
"木製の柄の先に重い金属製の鈍器が付いた、中世の武器です。重量があるため攻撃速度は遅いですが、その威力は破壊的です。低炭素鋼を使って自作されたものであり、問題なく扱うことはできますが、攻撃力が少し低く、手にもあまり馴染みません。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/melee/bludgeons.json
msgid "medium steel mace"
msgid_plural "medium steel maces"
msgstr[0] "メイス(中炭素鋼)"

#. ~ Description of "medium steel mace"
#: data/json/items/melee/bludgeons.json
msgid ""
"A medieval weapon consisting of a wood handle with a heavy metal head.  It "
"is heavy and slow to swing, but its crushing damage is devastating.  This "
"one is custom-made with medium steel which is passable, but hardly the "
"pinnacle of weapon making."
msgstr ""
"木製の柄の先に重い金属製の鈍器が付いた、中世の武器です。重量があるため攻撃速度は遅いですが、その威力は破壊的です。中炭素鋼を使って自作されたものであり、それなりの攻撃力は備えていますが、最高峰の武器とまでは言えません。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/melee/bludgeons.json
msgid "high steel mace"
msgid_plural "high steel maces"
msgstr[0] "メイス(高炭素鋼)"

#. ~ Description of "high steel mace"
#: data/json/items/melee/bludgeons.json
msgid ""
"A medieval weapon consisting of a wood handle with a heavy metal head.  It "
"is heavy and slow to swing, but its crushing damage is devastating.  This "
"one is custom-made with high steel and is a solid, dependable weapon."
msgstr ""
"木製の柄の先に重い金属製の鈍器が付いた、中世の武器です。重量があるため攻撃速度は遅いですが、その威力は破壊的です。高炭素鋼を使って自作されたものであり、頑丈で信頼性の高い武器です。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/melee/bludgeons.json
msgid "hardened steel mace"
msgid_plural "hardened steel maces"
msgstr[0] "メイス(焼入炭素鋼)"

#. ~ Description of "hardened steel mace"
#: data/json/items/melee/bludgeons.json
msgid ""
"A medieval weapon consisting of a wood handle with a heavy metal head.  It "
"is heavy and slow to swing, but its crushing damage is devastating.  This "
"one is custom-made with hardened steel and can pulverize bones."
msgstr ""
"木製の柄の先に重い金属製の鈍器が付いた、中世の武器です。重量があるため攻撃速度は遅いですが、その威力は破壊的です。焼入炭素鋼を使って自作されたものであり、その攻撃は骨まで砕きます。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/melee/bludgeons.json
msgid "tempered steel mace"
msgid_plural "tempered steel maces"
msgstr[0] "メイス(焼戻炭素鋼)"

#. ~ Description of "tempered steel mace"
#: data/json/items/melee/bludgeons.json
msgid ""
"A medieval weapon consisting of a wood handle with a heavy metal head.  It "
"is heavy and slow to swing, but its crushing damage is devastating.  This "
"one is custom-made with tempered steel and will crack skulls like "
"watermelons."
msgstr ""
"木製の柄の先に重い金属製の鈍器が付いた、中世の武器です。重量があるため攻撃速度は遅いですが、その威力は破壊的です。焼戻炭素鋼を使って自作されたものであり、頭蓋骨もスイカのように砕けます。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/melee/bludgeons.json
msgid "simple mace"
msgid_plural "simple maces"
msgstr[0] "簡易メイス"

#. ~ Description of "simple mace"
#: data/json/items/melee/bludgeons.json
msgid ""
"A stick with a circular lump of metal tied to it in a facsimile of a mace.  "
"You could probably improve it by finding a way to pin the head to the "
"handle."
msgstr "棒の先端に丸い金属塊を縛り付けた、メイスを模した武器です。柄に固定する方法を見直せば、性能を改善できるかもしれません。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/melee/bludgeons.json
msgid "trench mace"
msgid_plural "trench maces"
msgstr[0] "トレンチメイス"

#. ~ Description of "trench mace"
#: data/json/items/melee/bludgeons.json
msgid ""
"A mace made from a circular chunk of steel pinned to the end of a stick.  "
"You can feel your inner Trench Raider come alive when you wield it."
msgstr "鉄塊を棒の先に固定して作ったメイスです。装備すれば内なる塹壕強襲兵魂が震えることでしょう。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/melee/bludgeons.json
msgid "pipe mace"
msgid_plural "pipe maces"
msgstr[0] "パイプメイス"

#. ~ Description of "pipe mace"
#: data/json/items/melee/bludgeons.json
msgid ""
"A pipe with a handful of pipe fittings screwed onto the end to give it a "
"weighty head for bashing."
msgstr "先端に管継手をねじ込んで重量を増やし、殴打しやすくなるよう調整したパイプです。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/melee/bludgeons.json
msgid "great pipe mace"
msgid_plural "great pipe maces"
msgstr[0] "大型パイプメイス"

#. ~ Description of "great pipe mace"
#: data/json/items/melee/bludgeons.json
msgid ""
"Two pipes fitted end-to-end with more pipe fittings screwed onto the far "
"end.  The result is a large, but awkward bludgeon."
msgstr "2本のパイプを繋ぎ合わせ、更にその先端に管継手をねじ込んだ結果、大掛かりで不格好な鈍器が完成しました。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/melee/bludgeons.json
msgid "pipe staff"
msgid_plural "pipe staffs"
msgstr[0] "パイプスタッフ"

#. ~ Description of "pipe staff"
#: data/json/items/melee/bludgeons.json
msgid "Three pipes fitted end-to-end in a heavy facsimile of a quarterstaff."
msgstr "3本のパイプを繋ぎ合わせ、大きく重いクォータースタッフを作り上げました。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/melee/bludgeons.json
msgid "bronze mace"
msgid_plural "bronze maces"
msgstr[0] "ブロンズメイス"

#. ~ Description of "bronze mace"
#: data/json/items/melee/bludgeons.json
msgid ""
"While nothing more than a bronze sphere on a stick, it is still surprisingly"
" effective."
msgstr "青銅の球体を棒に取り付けただけで、驚くほど効果的な武器になります。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/melee/bludgeons.json
msgid "makeshift sap"
msgid_plural "makeshift saps"
msgstr[0] "簡易サップ"

#. ~ Description of "makeshift sap"
#: data/json/items/melee/bludgeons.json
msgid ""
"An improvised sap, also known as a cosh, slapjack and slapper.  A short, "
"flat bludgeoning weapon consisting of a weight embedded between two patches "
"of leather."
msgstr "コッシュ、スラップジャック、スラッパーという呼び名でも知られている、おもりを2枚の革で挟んで固定した、短く平らな棍棒状の武器です。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/melee/bludgeons.json data/mods/Magiclysm/items/melee.json
msgid "Mjölnir"
msgid_plural "Mjölnirs"
msgstr[0] "ミョルニル"

#. ~ Description of "Mjölnir"
#: data/json/items/melee/bludgeons.json
msgid ""
"A large hammer, forged from the heart of a dying star.  It bears the inscription:\n"
"\n"
"Whosoever holds this hammer,\n"
"If he be worthy,\n"
"Shall possess the power to…\n"
"CRUSH!'"
msgstr ""
"死んだ星の核から鍛造した大型のハンマーです。以下のような銘が刻まれています。\n"
"\n"
"この鎚に\n"
"相応しき者\n"
"破壊の力を\n"
"与えん"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/melee/bludgeons.json
msgid "morningstar"
msgid_plural "morningstars"
msgstr[0] "モーニングスター"

#. ~ Description of "morningstar"
#: data/json/items/melee/bludgeons.json
msgid ""
"A medieval weapon consisting of a wood handle with a heavy, spiked metal "
"ball on the end.  It deals devastating crushing damage, and the spikes "
"easily puncture soft targets."
msgstr "木製の柄の先端に棘付きの重い金属球を付けた、中世の武器です。その破壊力は凄まじく、金属の棘は柔らかい敵を簡単に穴だらけにできます。"

#. ~ Description of "morningstar"
#: data/json/items/melee/bludgeons.json
msgid ""
"A light, cheaply-made replica of a medieval weapon that would normally "
"consist of a wood handle with a heavy, spiked metal ball on the end."
msgstr "木製の柄の先端に棘付きの重い金属球を付けた中世の武器...の安価で軽量なレプリカです。"

#. ~ Description of "morningstar"
#: data/json/items/melee/bludgeons.json
msgid ""
"A medieval weapon consisting of a wood handle with a heavy, spiked metal "
"ball on the end.  The weight feels off on this one, and the spikes are "
"blunted."
msgstr "木製の柄の先端に棘付きの重い金属球を付けた、中世の武器です。あまり重さは感じられず、棘の先端も尖っていません。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/melee/bludgeons.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/weapon_copy_extensions.json
msgid "nail bat"
msgid_plural "nail bats"
msgstr[0] "釘バット"

#. ~ Description of "nail bat"
#: data/json/items/melee/bludgeons.json
msgid ""
"A baseball bat with several nails driven through it, an excellent melee "
"weapon."
msgstr "釘を無数に打ち付けたバットです。優秀な近接武器として頼れる相棒になる事でしょう。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/melee/bludgeons.json
msgid "nailboard"
msgid_plural "nailboards"
msgstr[0] "釘板"

#. ~ Description of "nailboard"
#: data/json/items/melee/bludgeons.json
msgid ""
"A plank of wood with several nails through one end; essentially a simple "
"mace.  Makes an acceptable melee weapon."
msgstr "釘を無数に打ちつけた木材です。メイスのようにシンプルな近接武器として役立ちます。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/melee/bludgeons.json
msgid "pool cue"
msgid_plural "pool cues"
msgstr[0] "ビリヤードキュー"

#. ~ Description of "pool cue"
#: data/json/items/melee/bludgeons.json
msgid ""
"A hardwood stick designed for hitting colorful balls around a felt table.  "
"Truly, the coolest of sports."
msgstr "フェルトテーブル上のカラフルなボールを突くために設計された、堅い木の棒です。これぞ最もクールなスポーツです。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/melee/bludgeons.json
msgid "PR-24 baton (extended)"
msgid_plural "PR-24 batons (extended)"
msgstr[0] "PR-24防犯警棒(伸長)"

#. ~ Description of "PR-24 baton (extended)"
#: data/json/items/melee/bludgeons.json
msgid ""
"The Monadnock PR-24 baton is a collapsible, lightweight, side-handle baton "
"used by law enforcement all over the world.  The PR designation is rumored "
"to mean Public Relations.  Activate to retract."
msgstr ""
"モナドノック社製のPR-24防犯警棒は世界中の法執行機関で使用される軽量の折り畳み式サイドハンドルバトンです。PRとは広報活動(Public "
"Relations)の略称であると噂されています。使用すると棒を短縮します。"

#. ~ "menu_text" action message of item "PR-24 baton (extended)"
#. ~ "menu_text" action message of item "telescoping fishing rod"
#: data/json/items/melee/bludgeons.json data/json/items/tool/fishing.json
msgid "Retract"
msgstr "折り畳む"

#. ~ "msg" action message of item "PR-24 baton (extended)"
#: data/json/items/melee/bludgeons.json
msgid "You collapse your PR-24 baton."
msgstr "防犯警棒を折り畳みました。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/melee/bludgeons.json
msgid "PR-24 baton (retracted)"
msgid_plural "PR-24 batons (retracted)"
msgstr[0] "PR-24防犯警棒(折畳)"

#. ~ Description of "PR-24 baton (retracted)"
#: data/json/items/melee/bludgeons.json
msgid ""
"The Monadnock PR-24 baton is a collapsible, lightweight, side-handle baton "
"used by law enforcement all over the world.  The PR designation is rumored "
"to mean Public Relations.  Activate to extend."
msgstr ""
"モナドノック社製のPR-24防犯警棒は世界中の法執行機関で使用される折り畳み式で軽量のサイドハンドルバトンです。PRとは広報活動(Public "
"Relations)の略称であると噂されています。使用すると棒を伸長します。"

#. ~ "msg" action message of item "PR-24 baton (retracted)"
#: data/json/items/melee/bludgeons.json
msgid "You snap open your PR-24 baton."
msgstr "防犯警棒を伸ばしました。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/melee/bludgeons.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/weapon_copy_extensions.json
msgid "quarterstaff"
msgid_plural "quarterstaves"
msgstr[0] "クォータースタッフ"

#. ~ Description of "quarterstaff"
#: data/json/items/melee/bludgeons.json
msgid ""
"A sturdy staff carved out of wood.  Lightweight and long, it is surprisingly"
" easy to handle."
msgstr "木製の頑丈な棒です。長く軽いため、思った以上に容易に扱えます。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/melee/bludgeons.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/weapon_copy_extensions.json
msgid "bō"
msgid_plural "bō"
msgstr[0] "六尺棒"

#. ~ Description of "bō"
#: data/json/items/melee/bludgeons.json
msgid ""
"A wooden staff weapon used in Okinawan martial arts.  Finely sanded and "
"treated with oil for integrity."
msgstr "沖縄の武術で使われる木製の武器です。表面を丁寧に研磨され、油で磨かれた完璧な仕上がりです。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/melee/bludgeons.json
msgid "rock in a sock"
msgid_plural "rocks in socks"
msgstr[0] "石入り靴下"

#. ~ Description of "rock in a sock"
#: data/json/items/melee/bludgeons.json
msgid ""
"A pair of nested socks with a stone tied inside.  A true weapon of "
"desperation."
msgstr "中に石をたっぷり詰めた、二枚重ねの靴下です。まさに絶体絶命の状況で役に立つ武器です。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/melee/bludgeons.json
msgid "plastic shank"
msgid_plural "plastic shanks"
msgstr[0] "シャンク"

#. ~ Description of "plastic shank"
#: data/json/items/melee/bludgeons.json
msgid ""
"An oblong plastic object with the far end ground down into a stabbing point."
msgstr "長方形のプラスチックの一端を尖らせて作った簡易武器です。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/melee/bludgeons.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/weapon_copy_extensions.json
msgid "shillelagh"
msgid_plural "shillelaghs"
msgstr[0] "シレイラ"

#. ~ Description of "shillelagh"
#: data/json/items/melee/bludgeons.json
msgid ""
"A stout, knotty stick with a large knob at the top that has been left to "
"cure in a chimney.  A traditional Irish weapon, the shillelagh was "
"originally used for settling disputes in a gentlemanly manner."
msgstr ""
"煙突の中で煙を浴びせて硬化させた、大きなコブがある節くれだった頑丈な木の棒です。アイルランドの伝統的な武器であり、紳士的な方法で紛争を解決するために使われていました。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/melee/bludgeons.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/weapon_copy_extensions.json
msgid "loaded stick"
msgid_plural "loaded sticks"
msgstr[0] "強化シレイラ"

#. ~ Description of "loaded stick"
#: data/json/items/melee/bludgeons.json
msgid ""
"A stout knotty stick with a large knob at the top that has been left to cure"
" in a chimney.  A traditional Irish weapon, the shillelagh was originally "
"used for settling disputes in a gentlemanly manner.  The knob has been "
"hollowed and filled with molten heavy metal to pack more of a punch."
msgstr ""
"煙突の上で煙を浴びせて硬化させた大きなコブが付いた、節くれだった頑丈な木の棒です。アイルランドの伝統的な武器であり、紳士的な方法で紛争を解決するために使われていました。コブの中には重金属が詰まっており、更に威力が増しています。"

#. ~ Description of "shillelagh"
#: data/json/items/melee/bludgeons.json
msgid ""
"A fake shillelagh massproduced as a souvenir for tourists.  This knotty "
"stick has not been cured in a chimney like a traditional shillelagh, but "
"instead has had fake black soot painted on."
msgstr ""
"観光客向けのお土産として大量生産されたシレイラです。この節くれだった木の棒は、伝統的なシレイラのように煙突の煙を浴びせて硬化させてはいないようですが、黒い煤に見立てた塗料が塗ってあります。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/melee/bludgeons.json
msgid "powered quarterstaff"
msgid_plural "powered quarterstaves"
msgstr[0] "電撃クォータースタッフ"

#. ~ Description of "powered quarterstaff"
#: data/json/items/melee/bludgeons.json
msgid ""
"An ironshod quarterstaff that has a high-voltage stun gun built into the "
"handle.  The stun gun is wired to the metal caps at either end of the staff,"
" allowing you to zap a dangerous opponent should beating them senseless with"
" it prove too hazardous."
msgstr ""
"高電圧スタンガンを内蔵したクォータースタッフです。金属で強化された杖の両端には電撃が流れるようになっており、殴り倒せそうにない危険な敵を気絶させることができます。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/melee/bludgeons.json
msgid "tactical tonfa (off)"
msgid_plural "tactical tonfas (off)"
msgstr[0] "タクティカルトンファー(オフ)"

#. ~ Description of "tactical tonfa (off)"
#: data/json/items/melee/bludgeons.json
msgid ""
"A reinforced plastic tonfa; the core is filled with capacitors and a high-"
"yield rechargeable storage battery.  When a switch on the handle is pressed,"
" a high-voltage current is transmitted to the two electrodes mounted in the "
"end of the tonfa, and by extension to anyone unfortunate enough to be in "
"contact with them.  It also has a nifty flashlight, which is off at the "
"moment."
msgstr ""
"内部にコンデンサーと高出力バッテリーが組み込まれている、強化プラスチック製の改造トンファーです。握りのスイッチを押すと先端の電極に高圧の電気が流れ、接触した不運な敵を感電させます。懐中電灯も内蔵されていますが、今は消灯しています。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/melee/bludgeons.json
msgid "tactical tonfa (on)"
msgid_plural "tactical tonfas (on)"
msgstr[0] "タクティカルトンファー(オン)"

#. ~ Description of "tactical tonfa (on)"
#: data/json/items/melee/bludgeons.json
msgid ""
"A reinforced plastic tonfa; the core is filled with capacitors and a high-"
"yield rechargeable storage battery.  When a switch on the handle is pressed,"
" a high-voltage current is transmitted to the two electrodes mounted in the "
"end of the weapon, and by extension to anyone unfortunate enough to be in "
"contact with them.  The integral flashlight is turned on, continually "
"draining power and lighting the surrounding area."
msgstr ""
"内部にコンデンサーと高出力バッテリーが組み込まれている、強化プラスチック製の改造トンファーです。握りのスイッチを押すと先端の電極に高圧の電気が流れ、接触した不運な敵を感電させます。懐中電灯も内蔵されており、電力を消費しながら周囲を照らしています。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/melee/bludgeons.json
msgid "tonfa"
msgid_plural "tonfas"
msgstr[0] "トンファー"

#. ~ Description of "tonfa"
#: data/json/items/melee/bludgeons.json
msgid ""
"A hard plastic truncheon commonly employed by police.  Originally an "
"Okinawan weapon, it consists of a stick with a perpendicular handle attached"
" a third of the way down its length."
msgstr ""
"主に警察が採用している、硬質合成樹脂製の警棒です。トンファーは沖縄発祥の武器であり、長い棒の手元から三分の一程度の位置に短い持ち手が垂直に付いている形状をしています。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/melee/bludgeons.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/weapon_copy_extensions.json
msgid "wooden tonfa"
msgid_plural "wooden tonfas"
msgstr[0] "トンファー(木)"

#. ~ Description of "wooden tonfa"
#: data/json/items/melee/bludgeons.json
msgid ""
"A stout wooden truncheon of the sort commonly employed by police.  "
"Originally an Okinawan weapon, it consists of a stick with a perpendicular "
"handle attached a third of the way down its length."
msgstr ""
"主に警察が採用している、木製の警棒です。トンファーは沖縄発祥の武器であり、長い棒の手元から三分の一程度の位置に短い持ち手が垂直に付いている形状をしています。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/melee/bludgeons.json
msgid "welded battle axe"
msgid_plural "welded battle axes"
msgstr[0] "板金溶接バトルアックス"

#. ~ Description of "welded battle axe"
#: data/json/items/melee/bludgeons.json
msgid ""
"A savage-looking battle axe made out of layered sheet metal welded into two "
"pipes held together with fittings, vaguely forming a upside-down L shape.  "
"This should be structurally stable.  Hopefully."
msgstr ""
"逆L字型になるよう継ぎ手で繋いだ二本のパイプに重ねた板金を溶接して作った、野蛮そうなバトルアックスです。恐らく構造的には安定している、筈です。きっと。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/melee/bludgeons.json
msgid "bolted battle axe"
msgid_plural "bolted battle axes"
msgstr[0] "板金バトルアックス"

#. ~ Description of "bolted battle axe"
#: data/json/items/melee/bludgeons.json
msgid ""
"A savage-looking battle axe made out of layered sheet metal bolted to two "
"pipes held together with fittings, vaguely forming a upside-down L shape.  "
"Swing it with all your might."
msgstr ""
"逆L字型になるよう継ぎ手で繋いだ二本のパイプと重ねた板金をボルトで固定して作った、野蛮そうなバトルアックスです。力いっぱい振り回しましょう。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/melee/bludgeons.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/cold_iron.json
msgid "war hammer"
msgid_plural "war hammers"
msgstr[0] "ウォーハンマー"

#. ~ Description of "war hammer"
#: data/json/items/melee/bludgeons.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/cold_iron.json
msgid ""
"A medieval hammer with a spike on one end, made for battle.  Its odd shape "
"and balance make it an excellent weapon, but an ineffective tool."
msgstr "一方の先端が尖っている、中世の戦闘用ハンマーです。奇妙な形状とバランスのお陰で優れた武器として扱えますが、工具としては役に立ちません。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/melee/fake.json
msgid "bionic claws"
msgid_plural "bionic claws"
msgstr[0] "アダマンチウム･クロー"

#. ~ Description of "bionic claws"
#: data/json/items/melee/fake.json
msgid "Short, sharp claws made from a high-tech metal."
msgstr "先端技術で生成した金属製の、短く鋭い鉤爪です。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/melee/fake.json
msgid "monomolecular blade"
msgid_plural "monomolecular blades"
msgstr[0] "単分子ブレード"

#. ~ Description of "monomolecular blade"
#: data/json/items/melee/fake.json
msgid ""
"A foot-long blade made from high-tech alloy and edged with bonded "
"nanocrystals."
msgstr "最先端の合金から作られ、刃にナノ結晶を結合させた剣です。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/melee/misc.json
msgid "bullwhip"
msgid_plural "bullwhips"
msgstr[0] "鞭"

#. ~ Description of "bullwhip"
#: data/json/items/melee/misc.json
msgid ""
"A long strip of braided leather with a handle on one end.  Originally "
"developed to settle disagreements with cattle, it's better used now for "
"flaying the rotten flesh off of walking corpses.  Great for when a problem "
"comes along."
msgstr ""
"一端に柄の付いた、堅く編み込まれた長い革の紐です。本来は家畜を操作するために用いられる道具ですが、このご時勢ですから歩く死体の腐った肉体を激しく打ち据えてやるのも一興かもしれません。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/melee/misc.json
msgid "scourge"
msgid_plural "scourges"
msgstr[0] "バラ鞭"

#. ~ Description of "scourge"
#: data/json/items/melee/misc.json
msgid ""
"The \"cat 'o nine tails\", a handle with nine short leather whips, each "
"sporting a razor-sharp metal tip.  This ancient instrument of torture causes"
" massive bleeding, but by design is inefficient as a weapon."
msgstr ""
"「九尾鞭」とも呼ばれる、持ち手の先に9本の短い革紐が伸びた鞭です。それぞれの紐の先には剃刀のように鋭い金属が付いています。大量出血を引き起こす古代の拷問器具ですが、設計上戦闘には不向きです。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/melee/misc.json
msgid "stun gun"
msgid_plural "stun guns"
msgstr[0] "スタンガン"

#. ~ Description of "stun gun"
#: data/json/items/melee/misc.json
msgid ""
"A high-powered stun gun.  Use this item to attempt to electrocute an "
"adjacent enemy, temporarily paralyzing them."
msgstr "高出力のスタンガンです。使用すると隣接する敵を感電させ、一定確率で一時的に麻痺させます。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/melee/spears_and_polearms.json
msgid "pitchfork"
msgid_plural "pitchforks"
msgstr[0] "ピッチフォーク"

#. ~ Description of "pitchfork"
#: data/json/items/melee/spears_and_polearms.json
msgid ""
"An agricultural tool with a long wooden shaft and four spikes.  Normally "
"used to lift hay."
msgstr "長い木製の柄の先端に四又の棘が付いた農具です。干し草を突き刺して運ぶのに使います。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/melee/spears_and_polearms.json
msgid "pointy stick"
msgid_plural "pointy sticks"
msgstr[0] "尖った棒"

#. ~ Description of "pointy stick"
#: data/json/items/melee/spears_and_polearms.json
msgid "A simple wooden pole with one end sharpened to a point."
msgstr "一端を尖らせただけの、長い木の棒です。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/melee/spears_and_polearms.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/weapon_copy_extensions.json
msgid "long pointy stick"
msgid_plural "long pointy sticks"
msgstr[0] "尖った長棒"

#. ~ Description of "long pointy stick"
#: data/json/items/melee/spears_and_polearms.json
msgid "A stout pole with one end sharpened to a point."
msgstr "一方の先端を尖らせた、丈夫な長い木の棒です。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/melee/spears_and_polearms.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/weapon_copy_extensions.json
msgid "fire-hardened wooden spear"
msgid_plural "fire-hardened wooden spears"
msgstr[0] "強化ウッドスピア"

#. ~ Description of "fire-hardened wooden spear"
#: data/json/items/melee/spears_and_polearms.json
msgid "A stout wooden pole with a fire-hardened point."
msgstr "長い棒の先端を削って尖らせ焼き固めた、頑丈な木の槍です。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/melee/spears_and_polearms.json
msgid "wooden spear"
msgid_plural "wooden spears"
msgstr[0] "ウッドスピア"

#. ~ Description of "wooden spear"
#: data/json/items/melee/spears_and_polearms.json
msgid "A stout wooden pole with a whittled point."
msgstr "長い棒の先端を削って尖らせた、頑丈な木の槍です。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/melee/spears_and_polearms.json
msgid "sharpened spear shaft"
msgid_plural "sharpened spear shafts"
msgstr[0] "尖った槍柄"

#. ~ Description of "sharpened spear shaft"
#: data/json/items/melee/spears_and_polearms.json
msgid ""
"You've gone through the effort of making a proper spear shaft, but instead "
"of attaching something sharp to the end you just whittled a point into the "
"wood.  The peak of pointy stick technology."
msgstr "せっかく頑丈な木製の槍柄を作ったのに、先端を尖らせただけで穂が付いていません。棒を尖らせる技術の完成形です。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/melee/spears_and_polearms.json
msgid "makeshift war scythe"
msgid_plural "makeshift war scythes"
msgstr[0] "簡易戦闘用大鎌"

#. ~ Description of "makeshift war scythe"
#: data/json/items/melee/spears_and_polearms.json
msgid ""
"This farming tool has been modified into an improvised weapon by rotating "
"its blade 90 degrees, transforming it into a deadly giant blade on the end "
"of a stick.  It's quite fragile, however."
msgstr "戦闘用に改造した鎌です。刃の角度を90度回転させることで、農具が棒に括りつけた威力の高い巨大な刃に変貌しました。壊れやすいのが難点です。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/melee/spears_and_polearms.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/weapon_copy_extensions.json
msgid "simple makeshift glaive"
msgid_plural "simple makeshift glaives"
msgstr[0] "簡易ハルバード"

#. ~ Description of "simple makeshift glaive"
#: data/json/items/melee/spears_and_polearms.json
msgid ""
"A large blade attached to a stout section of tree branch.  It could do a "
"considerable amount of damage, but the blade isn't secured very well and "
"could easily break off."
msgstr "頑丈な木の棒の先端に大型の刃が付いています。かなり強力な武器ですが、刃の固定が甘いため、簡単に壊れてしまいそうです。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/melee/spears_and_polearms.json
msgid "makeshift glaive"
msgid_plural "makeshift glaives"
msgstr[0] "強化簡易ハルバード"

#. ~ Description of "makeshift glaive"
#: data/json/items/melee/spears_and_polearms.json
msgid ""
"A stout tree branch that has been carefully split and reinforced.  At the "
"split point, a sharp blade has been bolted into place and reinforced with "
"layers of sturdy wrapped bindings."
msgstr "木の枝の先端を丁寧に割き、その隙間に鋭い刃を差し込んだ武器です。刃はボルトで固定され、その上から何重にも硬く紐を巻いてあります。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/melee/spears_and_polearms.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/weapon_copy_extensions.json
msgid "spike on a stick"
msgid_plural "spikes on sticks"
msgstr[0] "棘つき棒"

#. ~ Description of "spike on a stick"
#: data/json/items/melee/spears_and_polearms.json
msgid ""
"A flimsy pole made of wood with a basic metal spike tied to it.  It's barely"
" sharp, and crudely constructed, but it will keep the zombies out of arm's "
"reach until you can find something better."
msgstr ""
"シンプルな金属の棘が括りつけられた細い木の棒です。ただ鋭いだけで不格好なつくりですが、もっとマシなものが見つかるまではゾンビを腕の届く範囲から遠ざけることができそうです。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/melee/spears_and_polearms.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/weapon_copy_extensions.json
msgid "simple knife spear"
msgid_plural "simple knife spears"
msgstr[0] "簡易ナイフスピア"

#. ~ Description of "simple knife spear"
#: data/json/items/melee/spears_and_polearms.json
msgid ""
"A flimsy pole made of wood with a knife bound to the end.  It's long enough "
"to slice from a distance, but the knife isn't that well attached.  You could"
" take a bit more time to carefully split the shaft and attach the knife "
"blade more permanently."
msgstr ""
"ナイフが一端に括りつけられた細い棒です。離れたところから標的を切りつけるには十分な長さがありますが、ナイフはあまりしっかり取り付けられていないようです。棒を注意深く割き、ナイフの刃を取り付けてより長持ちするように作るにはもう少し時間が必要です。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/melee/spears_and_polearms.json
msgid "makeshift knife spear"
msgid_plural "makeshift knife spears"
msgstr[0] "強化簡易ナイフスピア"

#. ~ Description of "makeshift knife spear"
#: data/json/items/melee/spears_and_polearms.json
msgid ""
"A long stick that has been carefully split and reinforced.  At the split "
"point, a sharp blade has been bolted into place and reinforced with layers "
"of sturdy wrapped bindings."
msgstr "棒の先端を慎重に割き、その隙間に鋭い刃を差し込んだ武器です。刃はボルトで固定され、その上から何重にも硬く紐で巻いてあります。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/melee/spears_and_polearms.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/weapon_copy_extensions.json
msgid "knife spear"
msgid_plural "knife spears"
msgstr[0] "ナイフスピア"

#. ~ Description of "knife spear"
#: data/json/items/melee/spears_and_polearms.json
msgid ""
"A stout wooden pole with the blade of a knife bolted into place at the end."
"  The shape of a knife blade isn't ideal for a spear, but it's still very "
"sharp and effective."
msgstr "頑丈な長い棒の先端にナイフの刃を固定した武器です。刃の形状は刺突攻撃には向きませんが、切れ味は抜群で実用的です。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/melee/spears_and_polearms.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/weapon_copy_extensions.json
msgid "homemade halfpike"
msgid_plural "homemade halfpikes"
msgstr[0] "自作短槍"

#. ~ Description of "homemade halfpike"
#: data/json/items/melee/spears_and_polearms.json
msgid ""
"A short do-it-yourself spear made out of a long stick with a metal spike "
"seated and bound into place at its tip."
msgstr "棒の先端に金属製のスパイクを縛り付けた、自作の短い槍です。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/melee/spears_and_polearms.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/weapon_copy_extensions.json
msgid "crude steel spear"
msgid_plural "crude steel spears"
msgstr[0] "粗製スチールスピア"

#. ~ Description of "crude steel spear"
#: data/json/items/melee/spears_and_polearms.json
msgid ""
"A stout wooden pole with a misshapen metal spike seated into the end and "
"bolted into place."
msgstr "頑丈な長い棒の先端に不格好な金属製のスパイクを嵌め込み、固定した武器です。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/melee/spears_and_polearms.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/weapon_copy_extensions.json
msgid "forked spear"
msgid_plural "forked spears"
msgstr[0] "フォークスピア"

#. ~ Description of "forked spear"
#: data/json/items/melee/spears_and_polearms.json
msgid ""
"A wooden pole with three spikes tied to it.  It's specialized for catching "
"weapons, and not intended for extended use in combat."
msgstr "先端に3本のスパイクが付いた木製のポールです。敵を取り押さえることに特化しており、戦闘での長期使用を意図した作りではありません。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/melee/spears_and_polearms.json
msgid "copper spear"
msgid_plural "copper spears"
msgstr[0] "カッパースピア"

#. ~ Description of "copper spear"
#: data/json/items/melee/spears_and_polearms.json
msgid "A stout wooden pole with a spearhead worked from copper."
msgstr "頑丈な木製の棒に鋭く尖った銅の穂先を取り付けた武器です。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/melee/spears_and_polearms.json
msgid "steel spear"
msgid_plural "steel spears"
msgstr[0] "スチールスピア"

#. ~ Description of "steel spear"
#: data/json/items/melee/spears_and_polearms.json
msgid "A stout wooden pole with a hand-forged steel spearhead."
msgstr "頑丈な木製の棒に手鋳造された鋼鉄の穂先を取り付けた武器です。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/melee/spears_and_polearms.json
msgid "sharpened pipe"
msgid_plural "sharpened pipes"
msgstr[0] "尖ったパイプ"

#. ~ Description of "sharpened pipe"
#: data/json/items/melee/spears_and_polearms.json
msgid "A pipe with one end cut off at an angle."
msgstr "一端が斜めにカットされたパイプです。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/melee/spears_and_polearms.json
msgid "basic pipe spear"
msgid_plural "basic pipe spears"
msgstr[0] "簡易パイプスピア"

#. ~ Description of "basic pipe spear"
#: data/json/items/melee/spears_and_polearms.json
msgid "Three pipes tightly fit together with one end cut down to a point."
msgstr "束ねた3本のパイプの一端をカットしたものです。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/melee/spears_and_polearms.json
msgid "pipe spear"
msgid_plural "pipe spears"
msgstr[0] "パイプスピア"

#. ~ Description of "pipe spear"
#: data/json/items/melee/spears_and_polearms.json
msgid ""
"Three pipes tightly fit together with some wrappings for a handle around one"
" end and a sharp tip on the other."
msgstr "しっかりと束ねた3本のパイプの一端に滑り止めを巻き付け、もう一端を鋭く尖らせたものです。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/melee/spears_and_polearms.json
msgid "pointed rebar"
msgid_plural "pointed rebars"
msgstr[0] "尖った鉄筋"

#. ~ Description of "pointed rebar"
#: data/json/items/melee/spears_and_polearms.json
msgid "A rod of rebar that's been crudely hammered into a point."
msgstr "一端を粗く叩いて尖らせた長い鉄筋です。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/melee/spears_and_polearms.json
msgid "sharpened rebar"
msgid_plural "sharpened rebars"
msgstr[0] "尖った鉄筋"

#. ~ Description of "sharpened rebar"
#: data/json/items/melee/spears_and_polearms.json
msgid "A rod of rebar that's been cut and sharpened to a point."
msgstr "一端を切断して尖らせた鉄筋です。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/melee/spears_and_polearms.json
msgid "rebar spear"
msgid_plural "rebar spears"
msgstr[0] "鉄筋スピア"

#. ~ Description of "rebar spear"
#: data/json/items/melee/spears_and_polearms.json
msgid "Two rods of rebar welded together with a pointed tip."
msgstr "2本の鉄筋を溶接し、先端を尖らせたものです。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/melee/spears_and_polearms.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/weapon_copy_extensions.json
msgid "qiang"
msgid_plural "qiang"
msgstr[0] "中国槍"

#. ~ Description of "qiang"
#: data/json/items/melee/spears_and_polearms.json
msgid ""
"An ancient Chinese spear, typically with a tassel just below the spearhead "
"and larger than most European spears.  One of the four major weapons in "
"folklore, alongside the dao sabre, jian sword, and gun staff."
msgstr ""
"古代中国で使われた槍です。典型的な特徴として穂先の下に飾り房が付いており、ヨーロッパの槍よりも長大です。四大武器の一つで、あとの三つは刀(dao)、劍(jian)、棍(gun)であると言われています。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/melee/spears_and_polearms.json
msgid "halberd"
msgid_plural "halberds"
msgstr[0] "ハルバード"

#. ~ Description of "halberd"
#: data/json/items/melee/spears_and_polearms.json
msgid ""
"A versatile polearm with an axe blade, a spike, and other fun things "
"attached to a long, sturdy stick."
msgstr "頑丈な長い棒の先端に斧やスパイクなど賑やかなものを取り付けた、多芸な長柄武器です。"

#. ~ Description of "halberd"
#: data/json/items/melee/spears_and_polearms.json
msgid ""
"A dull, cheaply made replica of a polearm with an axe blade, a spike, and "
"other fun things attached to a thick pole."
msgstr "頑丈な長い棒の先端に斧やスパイクなど賑やかなものを取り付けた、多芸な長柄武器...の安価で刃が鈍いレプリカです。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/melee/spears_and_polearms.json
msgid "glaive"
msgid_plural "glaives"
msgstr[0] "グレイブ"

#. ~ Description of "glaive"
#: data/json/items/melee/spears_and_polearms.json
msgid "A sturdy polearm with a sizable single-edged blade on the end."
msgstr "先端に大きな片刃の剣が付いた、頑丈な長柄武器です。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/melee/spears_and_polearms.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/weapon_copy_extensions.json
msgid "naginata"
msgid_plural "naginata"
msgstr[0] "薙刀"

#. ~ Description of "naginata"
#: data/json/items/melee/spears_and_polearms.json
msgid ""
"A sturdy polearm with a curved blade, made in the same manner as the katana "
"and other Japanese blades.  Occasionally used by samurai in early periods, "
"or by their wives in defense of the household."
msgstr "刀をはじめとする日本の刀剣と同じ流れを汲む長柄武器です。侍によって戦場で、あるいはその妻女によって御家を守るために使われました。"

#. ~ Description of "naginata"
#: data/json/items/melee/spears_and_polearms.json
msgid ""
"A sturdy polearm with a curved blade, made in the same manner as the katana "
"and other Japanese blades.  This one has a bit of wiggle to its blade and "
"feels a bit shoddily made."
msgstr "刀をはじめとする日本の刀剣と同じ手法で作られた、湾曲した刃を持つ頑丈な長柄武器です。刃が少しガタついており、作りが雑な気がします。"

#. ~ Description of "naginata"
#: data/json/items/melee/spears_and_polearms.json
msgid ""
"A dull, slightly floppy replica of a Japanese polearm with a curved blade.  "
"With a little difficulty, you could use it administer a solid slap from a "
"distance."
msgstr "湾曲した刃を持つ日本の長柄武器...の、軟弱で安っぽいレプリカです。少し扱い辛くはありますが、ちゃんと離れた位置から攻撃を叩き込めます。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/melee/spears_and_polearms.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/weapon_copy_extensions.json
msgid "wooden javelin"
msgid_plural "wooden javelins"
msgstr[0] "ウッドジャベリン"

#. ~ Description of "wooden javelin"
#: data/json/items/melee/spears_and_polearms.json
msgid "A fire-hardened wooden spear honed to a sharper point."
msgstr "先端を削って尖らせ焼き固めた投げ槍です。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/melee/spears_and_polearms.json
msgid "iron javelin"
msgid_plural "iron javelins"
msgstr[0] "アイアンジャベリン"

#. ~ Description of "iron javelin"
#: data/json/items/melee/spears_and_polearms.json
msgid "An iron-tipped wooden throwing spear."
msgstr "先端に鉄片が付いた木製の投げ槍です。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/melee/spears_and_polearms.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/weapon_copy_extensions.json
msgctxt "weapon"
msgid "wooden pike"
msgid_plural "wooden pikes"
msgstr[0] "ウッドパイク"

#. ~ Description of "wooden pike"
#: data/json/items/melee/spears_and_polearms.json
msgid ""
"A medieval weapon consisting of a very long wooden shaft with a fire-"
"hardened point."
msgstr "非常に長い木の棒の先端を火で炙って硬くした、中世の武器です。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/melee/spears_and_polearms.json
msgctxt "weapon"
msgid "copper pike"
msgid_plural "copper pikes"
msgstr[0] "カッパーパイク"

#. ~ Description of "copper pike"
#: data/json/items/melee/spears_and_polearms.json
msgid ""
"A medieval weapon consisting of a very long wooden shaft tipped with a "
"copper spearhead."
msgstr "非常に長い木の柄の先端に銅の穂先が付いた、中世の武器です。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/melee/spears_and_polearms.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/weapon_copy_extensions.json
msgctxt "weapon"
msgid "pike"
msgid_plural "pikes"
msgstr[0] "パイク"

#. ~ Description of "pike"
#: data/json/items/melee/spears_and_polearms.json
msgid ""
"A medieval weapon consisting of a very long wooden shaft tipped with a steel"
" spearhead."
msgstr "非常に長い木の柄の先端に鋼鉄の穂先が付いた、中世の武器です。"

#. ~ Description of "pike"
#: data/json/items/melee/spears_and_polearms.json
msgid ""
"A dull, cheaply made replica of a medieval weapon consisting of a very long "
"wooden shaft tipped with an iron spearhead."
msgstr "非常に長い木の柄の先端に鉄の穂先が付いた、中世の武器...の安価で刃が鈍いレプリカです。"

#. ~ Description of "pike"
#: data/json/items/melee/spears_and_polearms.json
msgid ""
"A medieval weapon consisting of a very long wooden shaft tipped with an iron"
" spearhead.  The head seems to be pretty dull, and the whole thing feels "
"poorly made."
msgstr "非常に長い木の柄の先端に鉄の穂先が付いた、中世の武器です。全体的に作りが貧相で、穂先の切れ味もかなり悪そうです。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/melee/spears_and_polearms.json
msgid "war scythe"
msgid_plural "war scythes"
msgstr[0] "戦闘用大鎌"

#. ~ Description of "war scythe"
#: data/json/items/melee/spears_and_polearms.json
msgid ""
"A pole weapon with a curving single-edged blade.  Its blade bears some "
"superficial resemblance to that of an agricultural scythe from which it "
"likely evolved."
msgstr "湾曲した片刃をもつ武器です。外見は元々の用途であった農業用の鎌に似ています。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/melee/spears_and_polearms.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/weapon_copy_extensions.json
msgid "dory"
msgid_plural "dories"
msgstr[0] "ドリ"

#. ~ Description of "dory"
#: data/json/items/melee/spears_and_polearms.json
msgid ""
"A well-made spear with a bronze head, Greek in origin.  Despite its large "
"size, it was frequently used one-handed."
msgstr "ブロンズ製の穂先をもつ、ギリシャを起源とする立派な槍です。長大ですが、通常は片手で振るわれました。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/melee/spears_and_polearms.json
msgid "bronze spear"
msgid_plural "bronze spears"
msgstr[0] "ブロンズスピア"

#. ~ Description of "bronze spear"
#: data/json/items/melee/spears_and_polearms.json
msgid "A forged spear with a bronze head."
msgstr "青銅製の穂先をもつ鍛造された槍です。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/melee/spears_and_polearms.json
msgid "poleaxe"
msgid_plural "poleaxes"
msgstr[0] "ポールアックス"

#. ~ Description of "poleaxe"
#: data/json/items/melee/spears_and_polearms.json
msgid ""
"A polearm with an axe head, a small hammer on the back, and a short dagger-"
"like spike on top.  It's less heavy than most polearms and has a smaller "
"head, making it slightly quicker."
msgstr ""
"斧頭の後部に小さなハンマー、上部に短いナイフ状のスパイクが付いた長柄武器です。一般的な長柄武器よりは軽く先端も小さいため、多少は素早く振り回せます。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/melee/spears_and_polearms.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/weapon_copy_extensions.json
msgid "ji"
msgid_plural "ji"
msgstr[0] "戟"

#. ~ Description of "ji"
#: data/json/items/melee/spears_and_polearms.json
msgid ""
"A bronze polearm that originated in the Shang dynasty of China, if not "
"earlier.  It combines a spear head with the perpendicular blade of the "
"earlier ge or dagger-axe."
msgstr "遅くとも殷の時代には中国で使われていた、青銅製の長柄武器です。槍の穂先の下に、柄と直交する角度で戈の刃を組み合わせた形状をしています。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/melee/spears_and_polearms.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/weapon_copy_extensions.json
msgid "stone spear"
msgid_plural "stone spears"
msgstr[0] "ストーンスピア"

#. ~ Description of "stone spear"
#: data/json/items/melee/spears_and_polearms.json
msgid "A stout wooden pole with a sharp stone spearhead."
msgstr "頑丈な木製の棒に鋭い石の穂先を取り付けた武器です。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/melee/spears_and_polearms.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/weapon_copy_extensions.json
msgid "simple stone spear"
msgid_plural "simple stone spears"
msgstr[0] "簡易ストーンスピア"

#. ~ Description of "simple stone spear"
#: data/json/items/melee/spears_and_polearms.json
msgid "A long stick with a sharp stone spearhead."
msgstr "木の棒の先端に尖った石の穂先を取り付けた武器です。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/melee/spears_and_polearms.json
msgid "makeshift tepoztopili"
msgid_plural "makeshift tepoztopilis"
msgstr[0] "簡易テポストピリー"

#. ~ Description of "makeshift tepoztopili"
#: data/json/items/melee/spears_and_polearms.json
msgid ""
"This is a long polearm with an oar-like oval head covered with razors.  Its "
"shape make it suitable for both thrusting and slashing.  It resembles the "
"Mesoamerican Tepoztopili, though the shaft is not very sturdy."
msgstr ""
"オールのような楕円形の先端部にカミソリ刃が並んでいる、刺突と斬撃、どちらの攻撃もこなせる長柄武器です。メソアメリカ地域のテポストピリーという武器に似せたものですが、柄はあまり頑丈ではありません。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/melee/spears_and_polearms.json
msgid "glass bladed tepoztopili"
msgid_plural "glass bladed tepoztopilis"
msgstr[0] "ガラス片テポストピリー"

#. ~ Description of "glass bladed tepoztopili"
#: data/json/items/melee/spears_and_polearms.json
msgid ""
"This is a long polearm with an oar-like oval head covered with glass.  Its "
"shape make it suitable for both thrusting and slashing.  It resembles the "
"Mesoamerican Tepoztopili, though the shaft is not very sturdy."
msgstr ""
"オールのような楕円形の先端部にガラス片が並んでいる、刺突と斬撃、どちらの攻撃もこなせる長柄武器です。メソアメリカ地域のテポストピリーという武器に似せたものですが、柄はあまり頑丈ではありません。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/melee/spears_and_polearms.json
msgid "stone bladed tepoztopili"
msgid_plural "stone bladed tepoztopilis"
msgstr[0] "石片テポストピリー"

#. ~ Description of "stone bladed tepoztopili"
#: data/json/items/melee/spears_and_polearms.json
msgid ""
"This is a long polearm with an oar-like oval head covered with stones.  Its "
"shape make it suitable for both thrusting and slashing.  It resembles the "
"Mesoamerican Tepoztopili, though the shaft is not very sturdy."
msgstr ""
"オールのような楕円形の先端部に石の破片が並んでいる、刺突と斬撃、どちらの攻撃もこなせる長柄武器です。メソアメリカ地域のテポストピリーという武器に似せたものですが、柄はあまり頑丈ではありません。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/melee/spears_and_polearms.json
msgid "mild steel bladed tepoztopili"
msgid_plural "mild steel bladed tepoztopilis"
msgstr[0] "鉄片テポストピリー(低炭素鋼)"

#. ~ Description of "mild steel bladed tepoztopili"
#: data/json/items/melee/spears_and_polearms.json
msgid ""
"This is a redesigned version of the Mesoamerican tepoztopili.  It's an "
"elliptical piece of carved wood lined with sharp mild steel blades, firmly "
"attached to a stout spear shaft."
msgstr ""
"メソアメリカ地域の長柄武器、テポストピリーを再現したものです。頑丈な木製の槍の柄の先端部は楕円形に削られており、縁に低炭素鋼製の鋭い刃が並んでいます。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/melee/spears_and_polearms.json
msgid "medium steel bladed tepoztopili"
msgid_plural "medium steel bladed tepoztopilis"
msgstr[0] "鉄片テポストピリー(中炭素鋼)"

#. ~ Description of "medium steel bladed tepoztopili"
#: data/json/items/melee/spears_and_polearms.json
msgid ""
"This is a redesigned version of the Mesoamerican tepoztopili.  It has an "
"elliptical piece of carved wood lined with sharp medium steel blades, firmly"
" attached to a stout spear shaft."
msgstr ""
"メソアメリカ地域の長柄武器、テポストピリーを再現したものです。頑丈な木製の槍の柄の先端部は楕円形に削られており、縁に中炭素鋼製の鋭い刃が並んでいます。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/melee/spears_and_polearms.json
msgid "high steel bladed tepoztopili"
msgid_plural "high steel bladed tepoztopilis"
msgstr[0] "鉄片テポストピリー(高炭素鋼)"

#. ~ Description of "high steel bladed tepoztopili"
#: data/json/items/melee/spears_and_polearms.json
msgid ""
"This is a redesigned version of the Mesoamerican tepoztopili.  It has an "
"elliptical piece of carved wood lined with sharp high steel blades, firmly "
"attached to a stout spear shaft."
msgstr ""
"メソアメリカ地域の長柄武器、テポストピリーを再現したものです。頑丈な木製の槍の柄の先端部は楕円形に削られており、縁に高炭素鋼製の鋭い刃が並んでいます。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/melee/spears_and_polearms.json
msgid "hardened steel bladed tepoztopili"
msgid_plural "hardened steel bladed tepoztopilis"
msgstr[0] "鉄片テポストピリー(焼入炭素鋼)"

#. ~ Description of "hardened steel bladed tepoztopili"
#: data/json/items/melee/spears_and_polearms.json
msgid ""
"This is a redesigned version of the Mesoamerican tepoztopili.  It has an "
"elliptical piece of carved wood lined with sharp hardened steel blades, "
"firmly attached to a stout spear shaft."
msgstr ""
"メソアメリカ地域の長柄武器、テポストピリーを再現したものです。頑丈な木製の槍の柄の先端部は楕円形に削られており、縁に焼入炭素鋼製の鋭い刃が並んでいます。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/melee/spears_and_polearms.json
msgid "tempered steel bladed tepoztopili"
msgid_plural "tempered steel bladed tepoztopilis"
msgstr[0] "鉄片テポストピリー(焼戻炭素鋼)"

#. ~ Description of "tempered steel bladed tepoztopili"
#: data/json/items/melee/spears_and_polearms.json
msgid ""
"This is a redesigned version of the Mesoamerican tepoztopili.  It has an "
"elliptical piece of carved wood lined with sharp tempered steel blades, "
"firmly attached to a stout spear shaft.  It's a weapon worthy of being "
"wielded by Huitzilopochtli himself."
msgstr ""
"メソアメリカ地域の長柄武器、テポストピリーを再現したものです。頑丈な木製の槍の柄の先端部は楕円形に削られており、縁に焼戻炭素鋼製の鋭い刃が並んでいます。ウィツィロポチトリ自らが振るうのに相応しい強さの武器です。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/melee/swords_and_blades.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/weapon_copy_extensions.json
msgid "2-by-sword"
msgid_plural "2-by-swords"
msgstr[0] "簡易木刀"

#. ~ Description of "2-by-sword"
#: data/json/items/melee/swords_and_blades.json
msgid ""
"A plank with a handle and a whittled-down point.  Not much good for "
"slashing, but much better than your bare hands."
msgstr "柄を付けて先端を尖らせた木材です。敵を切り裂くことはできませんが、素手で叩くよりずっとマシです。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/melee/swords_and_blades.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/weapon_copy_extensions.json
msgid "zweitimber"
msgid_plural "zweitimbers"
msgstr[0] "木製ツヴァイヘンダー"

#. ~ Description of "zweitimber"
#: data/json/items/melee/swords_and_blades.json
msgid ""
"A plank with a handle and a whittled-down point, left large enough to "
"require two hands.  Still not much good for slashing, but far better than "
"the plank on its own."
msgstr "片手では扱えないサイズの、柄を付けて先端を尖らせた木材です。敵を斬ることはできませんが、単なる木材を武器として選ぶよりずっとマシです。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/melee/swords_and_blades.json
msgid "nord"
msgid_plural "nords"
msgstr[0] "ノード"

#. ~ Description of "nord"
#: data/json/items/melee/swords_and_blades.json
msgid ""
"A nail sword, or nord for short.  This wooden sword has a dozen nails "
"sticking out at jagged angles from the edge of the blade, making it much "
"better at chopping than slashing."
msgstr "Nail swORD、略してノードです。木製の剣から何本もの釘が不規則に突き出ています。切り裂くよりも切り刻む方が得意な武器です。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/melee/swords_and_blades.json
msgid "scrap sword"
msgid_plural "scrap swords"
msgstr[0] "スクラップソード"

#. ~ Description of "scrap sword"
#: data/json/items/melee/swords_and_blades.json
msgid ""
"Several bits of thin scrap metal crudely beat into the semblance of an edge "
"over a wooden sword.  The added weight is unbalanced, but the jagged edge "
"offers a good bit of slashing power."
msgstr ""
"木製の剣に数個の金属屑を取り付けて刃にした剣です。作りが粗いためバランスが悪く取り回し辛いですが、ギザギザの刃は確かな斬撃性能を生み出しています。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/melee/swords_and_blades.json
msgid "scrap greatsword"
msgid_plural "scrap greatswords"
msgstr[0] "スクラップグレートソード"

#. ~ Description of "scrap greatsword"
#: data/json/items/melee/swords_and_blades.json
msgid ""
"A large wooden sword with scrap metal hammered over it into something "
"pretending to be an edge.  The extra weight almost completely front-loads "
"the balance, and it hurts your wrists just to wield."
msgstr "大きな木製の剣に金属屑を打ち付けて刃の代わりにした武器です。重いためバランスが悪く、ちょっと振り回しただけで手首が疲れます。"

#. ~ Item name
#. ~ Variant name of item "welded sword"
#: data/json/items/melee/swords_and_blades.json
msgid "welded sword"
msgid_plural "welded swords"
msgstr[0] "板金溶接剣"

#. ~ Description of "welded sword"
#. ~ Description of variant "welded sword" of item "welded sword"
#: data/json/items/melee/swords_and_blades.json
msgid ""
"A vicious single-edged sword made out of sheet metal layered twice over "
"itself then welded together.  It's not as robust as a proper forged sword, "
"but the edge is wickedly sharp."
msgstr "二枚重ねた板金を溶接して作った、凶悪そうな片刃の剣です。鍛造した剣ほど頑丈ではありませんが、切れ味は抜群です。"

#. ~ Variant name of item "welded sword"
#: data/json/items/melee/swords_and_blades.json
msgid "bolted sword"
msgid_plural "bolted swords"
msgstr[0] "板金剣"

#. ~ Description of variant "bolted sword" of item "welded sword"
#: data/json/items/melee/swords_and_blades.json
msgid ""
"A vicious single-edged sword made out of sheet metal layered twice over "
"itself then bolted together.  It's not quite a katana made from steel folded"
" a thousand times over, but it has a certain industrial charm to it."
msgstr ""
"二枚重ねた板金をボルトで固定して作った、凶悪そうな片刃の剣です。鋼鉄を千回も折り曲げて作った刀には劣りますが、どこか工業製品的な魅力があります。"

#. ~ Item name
#. ~ Variant name of item "welded greatsword"
#: data/json/items/melee/swords_and_blades.json
msgid "welded greatsword"
msgid_plural "welded greatswords"
msgstr[0] "板金溶接大剣"

#. ~ Description of "welded greatsword"
#. ~ Description of variant "welded greatsword" of item "welded greatsword"
#: data/json/items/melee/swords_and_blades.json
msgid ""
"A long-handled single-edged sword made out of sheet metal layered thrice "
"over itself then welded together.  The extra length and weight makes it a "
"tad awkward, but gives it a lot of slashing power."
msgstr "三枚重ねた板金を溶接して作った、柄の長い片刃剣です。長く重いためやや不格好ですが、切れ味は抜群です。"

#. ~ Variant name of item "welded greatsword"
#: data/json/items/melee/swords_and_blades.json
msgid "bolted greatsword"
msgid_plural "bolted greatswords"
msgstr[0] "板金大剣"

#. ~ Description of variant "bolted greatsword" of item "welded greatsword"
#: data/json/items/melee/swords_and_blades.json
msgid ""
"A long-handled single-edged sword made out of sheet metal layered thrice "
"over itself then bolted together.  It vaguely resembles a Japanese nagamaki "
"if you squint."
msgstr "三枚重ねた板金をボルトで固定して作った、柄の長い片刃剣です。日本刀の一種である長巻に見えなくもありません。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/melee/swords_and_blades.json
msgid "metal sword"
msgid_plural "metal swords"
msgstr[0] "金属剣"

#. ~ Description of "metal sword"
#: data/json/items/melee/swords_and_blades.json
msgid ""
"An imitation of a true sword forged by someone who knows what swords look "
"like, at least.  Made from whatever scrap metal was on hand, it has the "
"general shape of a sword, and it is sharp, but it is a bit heavier than it "
"should be and the balance isn't quite right."
msgstr ""
"少なくとも剣の作りを知っている者が鍛えた、剣の模造品です。形状もまともで切れ味も抜群ですが、かき集めた金属屑を素材にしているため少し重く、全体のバランスも取れていません。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/melee/swords_and_blades.json
msgid "metal greatsword"
msgid_plural "metal greatswords"
msgstr[0] "金属大剣"

#. ~ Description of "metal greatsword"
#: data/json/items/melee/swords_and_blades.json
msgid ""
"A large, crudely-forged blade.  It's too big to be called a sword.  Too "
"massive, too thick, too heavy, and far too rough."
msgstr "鍛造された荒々しい剣です。剣と言うにはあまりにも大きすぎます。大きく、ぶ厚く、重く、そして大雑把すぎます。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/melee/swords_and_blades.json
msgid "metal fencing sword"
msgid_plural "metal fencing swords"
msgstr[0] "金属刺突剣"

#. ~ Description of "metal fencing sword"
#: data/json/items/melee/swords_and_blades.json
msgid ""
"Calling this a rapier is a stretch.  It's robust and very pointy, but more "
"akin to a long metal spike with a handguard than the elegant swords of the "
"Renaissance."
msgstr ""
"この剣をレイピアとは呼びたくありません。ルネッサンス期の優雅な剣というより金属製のスパイクにハンドガードを付けただけの代物ですが、頑丈で非常に鋭利です。"

#. ~ Item name
#. ~ Variant name of item "switchblade"
#: data/json/items/melee/swords_and_blades.json
msgid "switchblade"
msgid_plural "switchblades"
msgstr[0] "飛び出しナイフ"

#. ~ Description of "switchblade"
#. ~ Description of variant "switchblade" of item "switchblade"
#: data/json/items/melee/swords_and_blades.json
msgid ""
"A long, thin knife with a spring-loaded blade that rests inside the handle "
"while not in use."
msgstr "使わない時はグリップの中に薄く長い刃を折り畳めるナイフです。使う時はバネの力で刃を素早く引き出せます。"

#. ~ Variant name of item "switchblade"
#: data/json/items/melee/swords_and_blades.json
msgid "balisong"
msgid_plural "balisongs"
msgstr[0] "バリソン"

#. ~ Description of variant "balisong" of item "switchblade"
#: data/json/items/melee/swords_and_blades.json
msgid ""
"A flashy knife with hinged handles that completely conceal the blade while "
"folded.  Popular among movie gangbangers and people who thought fidget "
"spinners were too safe."
msgstr ""
"持ち手を蝶番で折り畳んで刃を完全に収納できる、派手なデザインのナイフです。映画に登場するギャングや、安全すぎるハンドスピナーに飽きてしまった人がよく使っています。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/melee/swords_and_blades.json
msgid "folding knife"
msgid_plural "folding knives"
msgstr[0] "折り畳みナイフ"

#. ~ Description of "folding knife"
#: data/json/items/melee/swords_and_blades.json
msgid ""
"A small folding knife with a locking blade and a pocket clip.  Not as good a"
" weapon as a solid fixed-blade knife, but better than a penknife."
msgstr ""
"刃を固定する機構とポケットに挟めるクリップが付いた、小さな折り畳みナイフです。作りのしっかりしたナイフほど良い武器ではありませんが、ポケットナイフよりはマシです。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/melee/swords_and_blades.json
msgid "utility folding knife"
msgid_plural "utility folding knives"
msgstr[0] "多機能折り畳みナイフ"

#. ~ Description of "utility folding knife"
#: data/json/items/melee/swords_and_blades.json
msgid ""
"A 'Hideman' brand folding knife, this model includes extra utility options "
"such as a screwdriver, awl, and small pry bar."
msgstr "「Hideman」ブランドの折り畳みナイフです。ドライバー、千枚通し、小型バールなどのツールが内蔵されています。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/melee/swords_and_blades.json
msgid "USMC bayonet"
msgid_plural "USMC bayonets"
msgstr[0] "海兵隊銃剣"

#. ~ Description of "USMC bayonet"
#: data/json/items/melee/swords_and_blades.json
msgid ""
"A modern bayonet in use with the US Marine Corps, adopted in an effort to "
"improve USMC hand-to-hand fighting capabilities.  The bayonet is optimized "
"to function as a fighting knife, sporting an ergonomic handle that will "
"minimize hand fatigue during combat.  The blade tip is sharper in profile "
"than other bayonets to assist in penetrating body armor, and also features a"
" small serrated section to provide for some utility."
msgstr ""
"アメリカ海兵隊の白兵戦能力を向上させるために採用された、最新式の銃剣です。戦闘用のナイフとしても機能するように最適化されており、柄の部分は戦闘中の手の疲れを最小限に抑える人間工学に基づいた作りになっています。刃の先端は他の銃剣よりも鋭く、装甲貫通力が高くなっており、一部が実用的な鋸歯状になっている点も特徴的です。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/melee/swords_and_blades.json
msgid "Bayonet"
msgid_plural "Bayonets"
msgstr[0] "銃剣"

#. ~ Description of "Bayonet"
#. ~ Description of variant "Army bayonet" of item "Bayonet"
#: data/json/items/melee/swords_and_blades.json
msgid ""
"The current issue Army bayonet, before the Cataclysm anyways.  It is thick, "
"heavy, and surprisingly sharp.  This bayonet also functions as a wire "
"cutter, and a mediocre saw for cutting through aircraft fuselage.  That the "
"handle and tang can be completely disassembled from the blade is surely a "
"fact of great comfort to the soldier, survivalist, and you."
msgstr ""
"大変動以前に陸軍で採用されていた銃剣です。分厚く重く、驚くほど切れ味が鋭く、ワイヤーカッターや、航空機のボディを切断することも不可能ではないのこぎりとしても機能します。柄とタングを刃から完全に取り外すことができる作りになっていることは、兵士にもサバイバリストにも大きな安心感を与える要素です。"

#. ~ Variant name of item "Bayonet"
#: data/json/items/melee/swords_and_blades.json
msgid "Army bayonet"
msgid_plural "Army bayonets"
msgstr[0] "軍用銃剣"

#. ~ Variant name of item "Bayonet"
#: data/json/items/melee/swords_and_blades.json
msgid "AK bayonet"
msgid_plural "AK bayonets"
msgstr[0] "AK銃剣"

#. ~ Description of variant "AK bayonet" of item "Bayonet"
#: data/json/items/melee/swords_and_blades.json
msgid ""
"A 6H4 bayonet for Kalashnikov pattern rifles, usually imported military "
"surplus from eastern bloc countries.  The blade is made of stainless steel "
"and the handle of a lightweight and durable plastic.  It features a middling"
" metal saw on the spine of the blade, and can function as a wire cutter as "
"well.  Though it is quite sturdy, it can't hold an edge very well."
msgstr ""
"6H4はカラシニコフ系ライフル用の銃剣であり、大半は東側諸国から持ち込まれたものです。刃はステンレス鋼製、柄は軽く丈夫なプラスチック製で、刃の背には中程度の長さの鋸刃が付いており、ワイヤーカッターとして使うことも可能です。かなり頑丈ですが、切れ味を維持するのは困難です。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/melee/swords_and_blades.json
msgid "National Guard bayonet"
msgid_plural "National Guard bayonets"
msgstr[0] "州兵銃剣"

#. ~ Description of "National Guard bayonet"
#: data/json/items/melee/swords_and_blades.json
msgid ""
"A Cold War era Army bayonet that has only partially been replaced by newer "
"models.  It has an apocalypse-proof full-tang, double-edged high steel blade"
" terminating in a spear point.  The no-frills design makes for both a good "
"fighting knife and bayonet, a fact that was appreciated when reserve stocks "
"of these were issued out to National Guardsmen."
msgstr ""
"冷戦時代に陸軍で使われていた銃剣ですが、一部の部品は新型モデルに置き換わっています。終末世界にも耐えられる高炭素鋼製のフルタングの両刃は、先端が槍のように尖っています。飾り気のないデザインは戦闘用ナイフとしても銃剣としても扱いやすく、予備在庫が州兵に支給された際は高く評価されました。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/melee/swords_and_blades.json
msgid "hunting knife"
msgid_plural "hunting knives"
msgstr[0] "狩猟用ナイフ"

#. ~ Description of "hunting knife"
#: data/json/items/melee/swords_and_blades.json
msgid ""
"Commonly used by hunters, this single-edged sheath knife is designed for "
"cutting and skinning game rather than combat."
msgstr "主に狩人が用いる片刃の鞘付きナイフです。戦闘用というよりも、獲物の解体や皮を剥ぐ用途で設計されています。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/melee/swords_and_blades.json
msgid "KA-BAR knife"
msgid_plural "KA-BAR knives"
msgstr[0] "ケーバーナイフ"

#. ~ Description of "KA-BAR knife"
#: data/json/items/melee/swords_and_blades.json
msgid ""
"The KA-BAR was developed by the United States Marine Corps in 1942 by "
"modifying hunting knife designs to be more soldier-proof.  The handle is "
"made of stacked leather washers, and the blade is made of easy to sharpen "
"high steel, making for a popular fighting, hunting and utility knife.  The "
"blade is marked 'USMC'."
msgstr ""
"ケイバーナイフは狩猟用ナイフの設計に改良を加え、アメリカ海兵隊の運用にも耐えうるナイフとして1942年に開発されました。柄は革を層状に重ねた作りで、刃は研ぎやすい高炭素鋼製です。戦闘用、狩猟用、そして万能ナイフとしても人気があります。このナイフには「USMC」と刻印されています。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/melee/swords_and_blades.json
msgid "survival knife"
msgid_plural "survival knives"
msgstr[0] "サバイバルナイフ"

#. ~ Description of "survival knife"
#: data/json/items/melee/swords_and_blades.json
msgid ""
"This massive knife features a hollow handle with a compass built into the "
"pommel and a row of fearsome-looking saw teeth along the back of its blade."
msgstr "大型のナイフです。柄の内部は中空で、柄頭にコンパスが内蔵されています。刃の峰は凶悪そうな鋸歯になっています。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/melee/swords_and_blades.json
msgid "mild steel survival knife"
msgid_plural "mild steel survival knives"
msgstr[0] "サバイバルナイフ(低炭素鋼)"

#. ~ Description of "mild steel survival knife"
#: data/json/items/melee/swords_and_blades.json
msgid ""
"This massive knife features a hollow handle with a compass built into the "
"pommel and a row of fearsome-looking saw teeth along the back of its blade."
"  It's custom-made of mild steel, you could probably find better in a "
"hunting store."
msgstr ""
"大型のナイフです。柄の内部は中空で、柄頭にコンパスが内蔵されています。刃の峰は凶悪そうな鋸歯になっています。低炭素鋼で自作したものですが、狩猟用品店へ行けばもっと品質の高いナイフがありそうです。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/melee/swords_and_blades.json
msgid "medium steel survival knife"
msgid_plural "medium steel survival knives"
msgstr[0] "サバイバルナイフ(中炭素鋼)"

#. ~ Description of "medium steel survival knife"
#: data/json/items/melee/swords_and_blades.json
msgid ""
"This massive knife features a hollow handle with a compass built into the "
"pommel and a row of fearsome-looking saw teeth along the back of its blade."
"  Made of medium steel, this is about as good as store bought."
msgstr ""
"大型のナイフです。柄の内部は中空で、柄頭にコンパスが内蔵されています。刃の峰は凶悪そうな鋸歯になっています。中炭素鋼で作られており、市販品と同程度の品質です。"

#. ~ Description of a pocket in item "medium steel survival knife"
#: data/json/items/melee/swords_and_blades.json
msgid "A hidden handle compartment.  Unscrew the compass to access."
msgstr "コンパスを外すと、柄の空洞にアイテムを収納できます。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/melee/swords_and_blades.json
msgid "high steel survival knife"
msgid_plural "high steel survival knives"
msgstr[0] "サバイバルナイフ(高炭素鋼)"

#. ~ Description of "high steel survival knife"
#: data/json/items/melee/swords_and_blades.json
msgid ""
"This massive knife features a hollow handle with a compass built into the "
"pommel and a row of fearsome-looking saw teeth along the back of its blade."
"  A competent weapon and tool, if not the best at any of them."
msgstr ""
"大型のナイフです。柄の内部は中空で、柄頭にコンパスが内蔵されています。刃の峰は凶悪そうな鋸歯になっています。最高とまでは言えませんが、便利な武器兼道具です。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/melee/swords_and_blades.json
msgid "hardened steel survival knife"
msgid_plural "hardened steel survival knives"
msgstr[0] "サバイバルナイフ(焼入炭素鋼)"

#. ~ Description of "hardened steel survival knife"
#: data/json/items/melee/swords_and_blades.json
msgid ""
"This massive knife features a hollow handle with a compass built into the "
"pommel and a row of fearsome-looking saw teeth along the back of its blade."
"  Now this, this is a knife."
msgstr "大型のナイフです。柄の内部は中空で、柄頭にコンパスが内蔵されています。刃の峰は凶悪そうな鋸歯になっています。これがナイフだ。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/melee/swords_and_blades.json
msgid "tempered steel survival knife"
msgid_plural "tempered steel survival knives"
msgstr[0] "サバイバルナイフ(焼戻炭素鋼)"

#. ~ Description of "tempered steel survival knife"
#: data/json/items/melee/swords_and_blades.json
msgid ""
"This massive knife features a hollow handle with a compass built into the "
"pommel and a row of fearsome-looking saw teeth along the back of its blade."
"  Time to go Rambo on this apocalypse."
msgstr ""
"大型のナイフです。柄の内部は中空で、柄頭にコンパスが内蔵されています。刃の峰は凶悪そうな鋸歯になっています。遂にこの終末世界にランボーがやって来ました。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/melee/swords_and_blades.json
msgid "F-S fighting knife"
msgid_plural "F-S fighting knives"
msgstr[0] "F-S戦闘ナイフ"

#. ~ Description of "F-S fighting knife"
#: data/json/items/melee/swords_and_blades.json
msgid ""
"Arguably the most famous combat knife in military history, this blackened "
"double-edged knife is made of drop-forged steel and knurled brass.  The "
"balance of the knife is such that it can be tossed from one hand to the "
"other instinctively, and the spear point allows for easy insertion into an "
"unsuspecting foe's heart.  While this knife is great in a fight, it's not "
"very good as a tool.  The ricasso declares this to be a 'Fairbairn-Sykes "
"knife', with a National Stocking Number of '1095-99-963-2037'."
msgstr ""
"恐らくは軍事史で最も有名な、落とし鍛造鋼でできた黒い両刃とローレット加工を施した真鍮製の柄が特徴の軍用ナイフです。何も意識せずに右手から左手へ投げ渡せるほどバランスが取れており、槍のような先端部は、油断した敵の心臓に容易く突き刺すことができます。戦闘では非常に役立ちますが、道具として扱いやすいとは言えません。刃の付け根の部分に「フェアバーン・サイクス戦闘ナイフ」の文字とナショナルストックナンバー「1095-99-963-2037」が刻印されています。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/melee/swords_and_blades.json
msgid "Swiss Army knife"
msgid_plural "Swiss Army knives"
msgstr[0] "十徳ナイフ"

#. ~ Description of "Swiss Army knife"
#: data/json/items/melee/swords_and_blades.json
msgid ""
"An iconic pocket knife imported from Europe.  Its red plastic handle "
"conceals many small tools."
msgstr "ヨーロッパから輸入された特徴的なポケットナイフです。赤いプラスチックの持ち手の中に様々な小さい道具が隠れています。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/melee/swords_and_blades.json
msgid "trench knife"
msgid_plural "trench knives"
msgstr[0] "トレンチナイフ"

#. ~ Description of "trench knife"
#: data/json/items/melee/swords_and_blades.json
msgid ""
"This stout combat knife features a steel guard to protect the user's "
"knuckles.  The guard can also be used for striking or blocking."
msgstr "手を保護する鋼鉄製のガードが付いた、頑丈な軍用ナイフです。ガードは打撃武器や敵の攻撃を防ぐ用途にも使えそうです。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/melee/swords_and_blades.json
msgid "mild steel trench knife"
msgid_plural "mild steel trench knives"
msgstr[0] "トレンチナイフ(低炭素鋼)"

#. ~ Description of "mild steel trench knife"
#: data/json/items/melee/swords_and_blades.json
msgid ""
"This stout combat knife features a steel guard to protect the user's "
"knuckles.  The guard can also be used for striking or blocking.  This one is"
" poorly made of mild steel with barely a proper grip."
msgstr ""
"頑丈な軍用ナイフです。使用者の指を保護する金属製のガードが特徴的です。ガードは防御の用途だけではなく、拳で相手を殴りつける時にも有用でしょう。低炭素鋼で作られており、あまり手に馴染みません。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/melee/swords_and_blades.json
msgid "medium steel trench knife"
msgid_plural "medium steel trench knives"
msgstr[0] "トレンチナイフ(中炭素鋼)"

#. ~ Description of "medium steel trench knife"
#: data/json/items/melee/swords_and_blades.json
msgid ""
"This stout combat knife features a steel guard to protect the user's "
"knuckles.  The guard can also be used for striking or blocking.  This one is"
" made of medium steel and is about shop quality."
msgstr ""
"頑丈な軍用ナイフです。使用者の指を保護する金属製のガードが特徴的です。ガードは防御の用途だけではなく、拳で相手を殴りつける時にも有用でしょう。中炭素鋼で作られており、市販品とほぼ同じ品質です。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/melee/swords_and_blades.json
msgid "high steel trench knife"
msgid_plural "high steel trench knives"
msgstr[0] "トレンチナイフ(高炭素鋼)"

#. ~ Description of "high steel trench knife"
#: data/json/items/melee/swords_and_blades.json
msgid ""
"This stout combat knife features a steel guard to protect the user's "
"knuckles.  The guard can also be used for striking or blocking.  This one is"
" made of high steel and is probably as good as a WWI trench knife."
msgstr ""
"頑丈な軍用ナイフです。使用者の指を保護する金属製のガードが特徴的です。ガードは防御の用途だけではなく、拳で相手を殴りつける時にも有用でしょう。高炭素鋼で作られており、第一次世界大戦時のものと同じくらい高品質です。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/melee/swords_and_blades.json
msgid "hardened steel trench knife"
msgid_plural "hardened steel trench knives"
msgstr[0] "トレンチナイフ(焼入炭素鋼)"

#. ~ Description of "hardened steel trench knife"
#: data/json/items/melee/swords_and_blades.json
msgid ""
"This stout combat knife features a steel guard to protect the user's "
"knuckles.  The guard can also be used for striking or blocking.  This one is"
" made of hardened steel, an officer's weapon if ever there was one."
msgstr ""
"頑丈な軍用ナイフです。使用者の指を保護する金属製のガードが特徴的です。ガードは防御の用途だけではなく、拳で相手を殴りつける時にも有用でしょう。焼入炭素鋼で作られており、将校が身に着けるのに相応しい品質です。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/melee/swords_and_blades.json
msgid "tempered steel trench knife"
msgid_plural "tempered steel trench knives"
msgstr[0] "トレンチナイフ(焼戻炭素鋼)"

#. ~ Description of "tempered steel trench knife"
#: data/json/items/melee/swords_and_blades.json
msgid ""
"This stout combat knife features a steel guard to protect the user's "
"knuckles.  The guard can also be used for striking or blocking.  This one is"
" made of tempered steel, and you feel you could hold a trench against an "
"army of zombies with it."
msgstr ""
"頑丈な軍用ナイフです。使用者の指を保護する金属製のガードが特徴的です。ガードは防御の用途だけではなく、拳で相手を殴りつける時にも有用でしょう。焼戻炭素鋼で作られており、これを使えばゾンビの大軍団を塹壕で食い止められるかもしれません。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/melee/swords_and_blades.json
msgid "makeshift knife"
msgid_plural "makeshift knives"
msgstr[0] "簡易ナイフ"

#. ~ Description of "makeshift knife"
#: data/json/items/melee/swords_and_blades.json
msgid ""
"A knife consisting of a long, somewhat sharpened spike and a tightly-wrapped"
" rag as a handle.  Not as good as a real knife, but it'll do in a pinch."
msgstr ""
"ある程度研いだ長いスパイクの一端に布を固く巻きつけて作った、簡易的なナイフです。本物のナイフほどではありませんが、いざというときに役立ちます。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/melee/swords_and_blades.json
msgid "bone shiv"
msgid_plural "bone shivs"
msgstr[0] "簡易ナイフ(骨)"

#. ~ Description of "bone shiv"
#: data/json/items/melee/swords_and_blades.json
msgid ""
"A femur or other bone, about 20 cm long, which has been broken at one end "
"and sharpened into a cutting tool.  Its jagged edge is wicked but fragile."
msgstr "大腿骨などの全長20cm以上の骨の一端を折って削った、切削工具です。ギザギザの刃は凶悪そうに見えますが簡単に砕けます。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/melee/swords_and_blades.json
msgid "baselard"
msgid_plural "baselards"
msgstr[0] "バーゼラルド"

#. ~ Description of "baselard"
#: data/json/items/melee/swords_and_blades.json
msgid ""
"A medieval dagger forged from rough iron.  It is not the sharpest tool in "
"the shed, but it is certainly one of the largest."
msgstr "粗鉄を鍛えて作った中世の短剣です。最も鋭い短剣とまでは言えませんが、最大級の短剣であることは確かです。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/melee/swords_and_blades.json
msgid "makeshift machete"
msgid_plural "makeshift machetes"
msgstr[0] "簡易マチェット"

#. ~ Description of "makeshift machete"
#: data/json/items/melee/swords_and_blades.json
msgid ""
"A large blade with one end wrapped in duct tape to make a crude handle, "
"making it easier to wield as a rough machete."
msgstr "大きな刃の一端にダクトテープを巻き付けて簡易的な柄を作り、鉈のように振り回せるにした簡素な武器です。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/melee/swords_and_blades.json
msgid "machete"
msgid_plural "machetes"
msgstr[0] "マチェット"

#. ~ Description of "machete"
#: data/json/items/melee/swords_and_blades.json
msgid ""
"This huge steel knife makes an excellent tool for cutting down large "
"vegetation or other 'obstacles.'"
msgstr "大きな鋼製のナイフです。背の高い植物やその他の「障害物」を薙ぎ払う為の優れた道具です。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/melee/swords_and_blades.json
msgid "combat machete"
msgid_plural "combat machetes"
msgstr[0] "軍用マチェット"

#. ~ Description of "combat machete"
#: data/json/items/melee/swords_and_blades.json
msgid ""
"This common gardening tool has been customized and rebalanced to improve its"
" performance as a weapon."
msgstr "一般的な園芸ツールを、武器としての性能が向上するように改造したものです。"

#. ~ Item name
#. ~ Variant name of item "tempered steel combat machete"
#: data/json/items/melee/swords_and_blades.json
msgid "tempered steel combat machete"
msgid_plural "tempered steel combat machetes"
msgstr[0] "軍用マチェット(焼戻炭素鋼)"

#. ~ Description of "tempered steel combat machete"
#. ~ Description of variant "tempered steel combat machete" of item "tempered
#. steel combat machete"
#: data/json/items/melee/swords_and_blades.json
msgid ""
"This common gardening tool has been customized, rebalanced and tempered to "
"dramatically improve its performance as a weapon."
msgstr "一般的な伐採道具のバランスを調整し、更に焼き戻し加工することで、武器としての性能を飛躍的に向上させました。"

#. ~ Variant name of item "tempered steel combat machete"
#: data/json/items/melee/swords_and_blades.json
msgid "hazardous environment blade"
msgid_plural "hazardous environment blades"
msgstr[0] "特殊環境ブレード"

#. ~ Description of variant "hazardous environment blade" of item "tempered
#. steel combat machete"
#: data/json/items/melee/swords_and_blades.json
msgid ""
"This black tempered steel bushcraft machete has been reinforced for use in "
"exotic environments.  \"HE Blade\" is engraved in the steel."
msgstr "屋外の特殊環境で用いる黒い強化焼戻鋼製のマチェットです。刃に「HE Blade」の文字が刻まれています。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/melee/swords_and_blades.json
msgid "machete multitool"
msgid_plural "machete multitools"
msgstr[0] "多機能マチェット"

#. ~ Description of "machete multitool"
#: data/json/items/melee/swords_and_blades.json
msgid ""
"A thin, wobbly steel blade with sawteeth on one side and a flat chisel tip "
"for digging.  More of a jackass of all trades than a jack of them."
msgstr "グラついた薄い鋼の刃の片側にはノコギリ刃が付いており、先端は掘削に適したノミのような形状です。多芸というよりは、器用貧乏です。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/melee/swords_and_blades.json
msgid "cavalry saber"
msgid_plural "cavalry sabers"
msgstr[0] "騎兵刀"

#. ~ Description of "cavalry saber"
#: data/json/items/melee/swords_and_blades.json
msgid ""
"A curved sword associated with cavalry from the Early Modern period onward."
"  Lightweight, but a deadly slashing weapon."
msgstr "近世以降に作られた、騎兵が用いる湾曲したサーベルです。軽量ながら致命的な威力で敵を切り裂きます。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/melee/swords_and_blades.json
msgid "mild steel cavalry saber"
msgid_plural "mild steel cavalry sabers"
msgstr[0] "騎兵刀(低炭素鋼)"

#. ~ Description of "mild steel cavalry saber"
#: data/json/items/melee/swords_and_blades.json
msgid ""
"A curved sword associated with cavalry from the Early Modern period onwards.  Lightweight, but a deadly slashing weapon.\n"
"\n"
"Made with mild steel and lacking a proper grip, this is better than the sticks you swung around as a kid, but you know you can do better."
msgstr ""
"近世以降に作られた、騎兵が用いる湾曲したサーベルです。軽量ながら致命的な威力で敵を切り裂きます。\n"
"\n"
"刃全体が低炭素鋼で作られており、柄は手にあまり馴染みません。子供が振り回す棒きれよりはマシですが、もっと品質のいい武器が欲しいものです。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/melee/swords_and_blades.json
msgid "medium steel cavalry saber"
msgid_plural "medium steel cavalry sabers"
msgstr[0] "騎兵刀(中炭素鋼)"

#. ~ Description of "medium steel cavalry saber"
#: data/json/items/melee/swords_and_blades.json
msgid ""
"A curved sword associated with cavalry from the Early Modern period onwards.  Lightweight, but a deadly slashing weapon.\n"
"\n"
"Made with medium steel and with a grip made of leather wrapped in steel wire, this weapon is comfortable in your hand, though the balance isn't perfect and the edge could be sharper."
msgstr ""
"近世以降に作られた、騎兵が用いる湾曲したサーベルです。軽量ながら致命的な威力で敵を切り裂きます。\n"
"\n"
"刃全体が中炭素鋼で作られています。柄には手に馴染むように革が巻かれ、ワイヤーで固定されています。武器全体のバランスには難があり、刃もそれほど鋭くありません。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/melee/swords_and_blades.json
msgid "high steel cavalry saber"
msgid_plural "high steel cavalry sabers"
msgstr[0] "騎兵刀(高炭素鋼)"

#. ~ Description of "high steel cavalry saber"
#: data/json/items/melee/swords_and_blades.json
msgid ""
"A curved sword associated with cavalry from the Early Modern period onwards.  Lightweight, but a deadly slashing weapon.\n"
"\n"
"Made with high steel and featuring a sturdy grip, this feels like a proper weapon.  The balance feels right and the blade is quite sharp."
msgstr ""
"近世以降に作られた、騎兵が用いる湾曲したサーベルです。軽量ながら致命的な威力で敵を切り裂きます。\n"
"\n"
"刃全体が高炭素鋼で作られており、柄も頑丈です。武器全体のバランスも刃の切れ味も良好で、丁寧に作ってあると感じます。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/melee/swords_and_blades.json
msgid "hardened steel cavalry saber"
msgid_plural "hardened steel cavalry sabers"
msgstr[0] "騎兵刀(焼入炭素鋼)"

#. ~ Description of "hardened steel cavalry saber"
#: data/json/items/melee/swords_and_blades.json
msgid ""
"A curved sword associated with cavalry from the Early Modern period onwards.  Lightweight, but a deadly slashing weapon.\n"
"\n"
"Made of hardened steel and with a molded grip that fits your hand perfectly, this weapon looks as good as any you might find in a museum.  The balance is perfect and the edge is as sharp as a razor."
msgstr ""
"近世以降に作られた、騎兵が用いる湾曲したサーベルです。軽量ながら致命的な威力で敵を切り裂きます。\n"
"\n"
"刃全体が焼入炭素鋼で作られており、柄の形状は手によく馴染みます。武器全体のバランスも完璧で、刃は鋭く研がれています。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/melee/swords_and_blades.json
msgid "tempered steel cavalry saber"
msgid_plural "tempered steel cavalry sabers"
msgstr[0] "騎兵刀(焼戻炭素鋼)"

#. ~ Description of "tempered steel cavalry saber"
#: data/json/items/melee/swords_and_blades.json
msgid ""
"A curved sword associated with cavalry from the Early Modern period onwards.  Lightweight, but a deadly slashing weapon.\n"
"\n"
"Made of tempered steel, this is a masterpiece.  The grip, the balance, the blade, all perfect.  This is the peak of the swordsmith's craft."
msgstr ""
"近世以降に作られた、騎兵が用いる湾曲したサーベルです。軽量ながら致命的な威力で敵を切り裂きます。\n"
"\n"
"刃全体が焼戻炭素鋼で作られており、柄のフィット感、全体のバランス、刃の切れ味、全てにおいて完璧です。これぞ匠の技の結晶です。"

#. ~ Description of "cavalry saber"
#: data/json/items/melee/swords_and_blades.json
msgid ""
"A dull, cheaply-made replica of a curved sword associated with cavalry from "
"the Early Modern period onwards."
msgstr "近世以降に作られた、騎兵が用いる湾曲したサーベル...の安価で刃が鈍いレプリカです。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/melee/swords_and_blades.json
msgid "kris"
msgid_plural "krises"
msgstr[0] "クリス"

#. ~ Description of "kris"
#: data/json/items/melee/swords_and_blades.json
msgid ""
"This wavy-bladed dagger is from Southeast Asia.  The design of the blade "
"causes it to make broad, painful wounds."
msgstr "波打つ刃をもつ、東南アジア生まれの短剣です。特徴的な形の刃は敵の傷口を広げ、より大きな苦痛を与えます。"

#. ~ Description of "kris"
#: data/json/items/melee/swords_and_blades.json
msgid "A dull, cheap replica of a wavy-bladed dagger from Southeast Asia."
msgstr "波打つ刃をもつ、東南アジア生まれの短剣...の安価で刃が鈍いレプリカです。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/melee/swords_and_blades.json
#: data/mods/MMA/exemplar_weapons.json
msgid "kukri"
msgid_plural "kukris"
msgstr[0] "ククリ"

#. ~ Description of "kukri"
#: data/json/items/melee/swords_and_blades.json
msgid ""
"This versatile implement is a modern take on a traditional weapon that "
"originated in Nepal.  Featuring a heavy blade with an inwardly-curved edge, "
"it can be used as both a tool and a weapon."
msgstr ""
"ネパール発祥の伝統ある刃物を近代的に改造した、実用性の高い武器です。重い刃の内側は湾曲しており、武器としても道具としても使うことができます。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/melee/swords_and_blades.json
msgid "mild steel kukri"
msgid_plural "mild steel kukris"
msgstr[0] "ククリ(低炭素鋼)"

#. ~ Description of "mild steel kukri"
#: data/json/items/melee/swords_and_blades.json
msgid ""
"This versatile implement is a custom-forged version of a traditional weapon "
"that originated in Nepal.  Featuring a heavy blade with an inwardly-curved "
"edge, this one is made of mild steel, and barely has a proper handle.  You'd"
" probably find a better version in a store somewhere."
msgstr ""
"ネパール発祥の伝統ある刃物を近代的に改造した、実用性の高い武器です。低炭素鋼で作られた重い刃の内側は湾曲しており、辛うじて落とさずに済む程度の粗末な柄が付いています。どこかの店を漁った方が、より高品質なものを見付けられそうです。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/melee/swords_and_blades.json
msgid "medium steel kukri"
msgid_plural "medium steel kukris"
msgstr[0] "ククリ(中炭素鋼)"

#. ~ Description of "medium steel kukri"
#: data/json/items/melee/swords_and_blades.json
msgid ""
"This versatile implement is a custom-forged version of a traditional weapon "
"that originated in Nepal.  Featuring a heavy blade with an inwardly-curved "
"edge, this one is made of medium steel, and is about what you'd expect to "
"see in a hunting shop."
msgstr ""
"ネパール発祥の伝統ある刃物を近代的に改造した、実用性の高い武器です。中炭素鋼で作られた重い刃の内側は湾曲しており、狩猟洋品店で売っているものと同程度の品質です。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/melee/swords_and_blades.json
msgid "high steel kukri"
msgid_plural "high steel kukris"
msgstr[0] "ククリ(高炭素鋼)"

#. ~ Description of "high steel kukri"
#: data/json/items/melee/swords_and_blades.json
msgid ""
"This versatile implement is a custom-forged version of a traditional weapon "
"that originated in Nepal.  Featuring a heavy blade with an inwardly-curved "
"edge, this one is made of high steel and is a well-made piece."
msgstr "ネパール発祥の伝統ある刃物を近代的に改造した、実用性の高い武器です。高炭素鋼で作られた重い刃の内側は湾曲しており、非常によく出来ています。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/melee/swords_and_blades.json
msgid "hardened steel kukri"
msgid_plural "hardened steel kukris"
msgstr[0] "ククリ(焼入炭素鋼)"

#. ~ Description of "hardened steel kukri"
#: data/json/items/melee/swords_and_blades.json
msgid ""
"This versatile implement is a custom-forged version of a traditional weapon "
"that originated in Nepal.  Featuring a heavy blade with an inwardly-curved "
"edge, this one is made of hardened steel and is a fine tool and weapon."
