msgid "jian"
msgid_plural "jian"
msgstr[0] "中国剣"

#. ~ Description of "jian"
#: data/json/items/melee/swords_and_blades.json
msgid ""
"An ancient Chinese doubled-edged straight sword, with an ornate guard and a "
"tassel attached to the pommel.  One of the four major weapons in folklore, "
"alongside the dao sabre, qiang spear, and gun staff."
msgstr ""
"古代中国で使われた両刃の直剣です。鍔には優美な装飾が施され、柄頭には飾り房が付いています。四大武器の一つで、あとの三つは刀(dao)、鎗(qiang)、棍(gun)であると言われています。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/melee/swords_and_blades.json
msgid "mild steel jian"
msgid_plural "mild steel jian"
msgstr[0] "中国剣(低炭素鋼)"

#. ~ Description of "mild steel jian"
#: data/json/items/melee/swords_and_blades.json
msgid ""
"An ancient Chinese doubled-edged straight sword, with an ornate guard and a tassel attached to the pommel.  One of the four major weapons in folklore, alongside the dao sabre, qiang spear, and gun staff.\n"
"\n"
"Made with mild steel and lacking a proper grip, this is better than the sticks you swung around as a kid, but you know you can do better."
msgstr ""
"古代中国で使われた両刃の直剣です。鍔には優美な装飾が施され、柄頭には飾り房が付いています。四大武器の一つで、あとの三つは刀(dao)、鎗(qiang)、棍(gun)であると言われています。\n"
"\n"
"刃全体が低炭素鋼で作られており、柄は手にあまり馴染みません。子供が振り回す棒きれよりはマシですが、もっと品質のいい武器が欲しいものです。"

#. ~ Item name
