#: data/json/items/melee/swords_and_blades.json
msgid ""
"A classic medieval sword, in between the lighter arming sword and later two-handed swords in size.  It's well-balanced and surprisingly easy to use due to its two-handed grip, but requires a larger baldric or scabbard, compared to smaller swords.\n"
"\n"
"Made with medium steel and with a grip made of leather wrapped in steel wire, this weapon is comfortable in your hand, though the balance isn't perfect and the edge could be sharper."
msgstr ""
"軽量アーミングソードと後期のツーハンデッドソードの中間にあたるサイズの、中世時代の古典的な剣です。バランスがよく、両手で握れるため意外と扱いやすいですが、収納するには大型の鞘が必要です。\n"
"\n"
"刃全体が中炭素鋼で作られています。柄には手に馴染むように革が巻かれ、ワイヤーで固定されています。武器全体のバランスには難があり、刃もそれほど鋭くありません。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/melee/swords_and_blades.json
msgid "high steel longsword"
msgid_plural "high steel longswords"
msgstr[0] "ロングソード(高炭素鋼)"

#. ~ Description of "high steel longsword"
#: data/json/items/melee/swords_and_blades.json
msgid ""
"A classic medieval sword, in between the lighter arming sword and later two-handed swords in size.  It's well-balanced and surprisingly easy to use due to its two-handed grip, but requires a larger baldric or scabbard, compared to smaller swords.\n"
"\n"
"Made with high steel and featuring a sturdy grip, this feels like a proper weapon.  The balance feels right and the blade is quite sharp."
msgstr ""
"軽量アーミングソードと後期のツーハンデッドソードの中間にあたるサイズの、中世時代の古典的な剣です。バランスがよく、両手で握れるため意外と扱いやすいですが、収納するには大型の鞘が必要です。\n"
"\n"
"刃全体が高炭素鋼で作られており、柄も頑丈です。武器全体のバランスも刃の切れ味も良好で、丁寧に作ってあると感じます。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/melee/swords_and_blades.json
msgid "hardened steel longsword"
msgid_plural "hardened steel longswords"
msgstr[0] "ロングソード(焼入炭素鋼)"

#. ~ Description of "hardened steel longsword"
#: data/json/items/melee/swords_and_blades.json
msgid ""
"A classic medieval sword, in between the lighter arming sword and later two-handed swords in size.  It's well-balanced and surprisingly easy to use due to its two-handed grip, but requires a larger baldric or scabbard, compared to smaller swords.\n"
"\n"
"Made of hardened steel and with a molded grip that fits your hand perfectly, this weapon looks as good as any you might find in a museum.  The balance is perfect and the edge is as sharp as a razor."
msgstr ""
"軽量アーミングソードと後期のツーハンデッドソードの中間にあたるサイズの、中世時代の古典的な剣です。バランスがよく、両手で握れるため意外と扱いやすいですが、収納するには大型の鞘が必要です。\n"
"\n"
"刃全体が焼入炭素鋼で作られており、柄の形状は手によく馴染みます。武器全体のバランスも完璧で、刃は鋭く研がれています。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/melee/swords_and_blades.json
msgid "tempered steel longsword"
msgid_plural "tempered steel longswords"
msgstr[0] "ロングソード(焼戻炭素鋼)"

#. ~ Description of "tempered steel longsword"
#: data/json/items/melee/swords_and_blades.json
msgid ""
"A classic medieval sword, in between the lighter arming sword and later two-handed swords in size.  It's well-balanced and surprisingly easy to use due to its two-handed grip, but requires a larger baldric or scabbard, compared to smaller swords.\n"
"\n"
"Made of tempered steel, this is a masterpiece.  The grip, the balance, the blade, all perfect.  This is the peak of the swordsmith's craft."
msgstr ""
"軽量アーミングソードと後期のツーハンデッドソードの中間にあたるサイズの、中世時代の古典的な剣です。バランスがよく、両手で握れるため意外と扱いやすいですが、収納するには大型の鞘が必要です。\n"
"\n"
"刃全体が焼戻炭素鋼で作られており、柄のフィット感、全体のバランス、刃の切れ味、全てにおいて完璧です。これぞ匠の技の結晶です。"

#. ~ Description of "longsword"
#: data/json/items/melee/swords_and_blades.json
msgid ""
"A classic medieval sword, in between the lighter arming sword and later two-"
"handed swords in size.  You feel like the pommel could just snap off if you "
"used it."
msgstr ""
"軽いアーミングソードと後期のツーハンデッドソードの中間にあたるサイズの、中世時代の古典的な剣です。一振りで柄がすっぽ抜けてしまいそうな、嫌な予感がします。"

#. ~ Description of "longsword"
#: data/json/items/melee/swords_and_blades.json
msgid ""
"A dull, cheaply-made replica of the classic medieval longsword.  It requires"
" a larger baldric or scabbard compared to smaller swords."
msgstr "中世時代のロングソード...の安価で刃が鈍いレプリカです。収納するには大型の鞘が必要です。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/melee/swords_and_blades.json
msgid "arming sword"
msgid_plural "arming swords"
msgstr[0] "アーミングソード"

#. ~ Description of "arming sword"
#: data/json/items/melee/swords_and_blades.json
msgid "A classic medieval sword, just the right size to use one-handed."
msgstr "片手で扱うのに丁度いいサイズの、中世の長剣です。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/melee/swords_and_blades.json
msgid "mild steel arming sword"
msgid_plural "mild steel arming swords"
msgstr[0] "アーミングソード(低炭素鋼)"

#. ~ Description of "mild steel arming sword"
#: data/json/items/melee/swords_and_blades.json
msgid ""
"A classic medieval sword, just the right size to use one-handed.\n"
"\n"
"Made with mild steel and lacking a proper grip, this is better than the sticks you swung around as a kid, but you know you can do better."
msgstr ""
"片手で扱うのに丁度良い拵えの、中世様式の長剣です。\n"
"\n"
"刃全体が低炭素鋼で作られており、柄は手にあまり馴染みません。子供が振り回す棒きれよりはマシですが、もっと品質のいい武器が欲しいものです。"

