"Made with medium steel and with a grip made of leather wrapped in steel wire, this weapon is comfortable in your hand, though the balance isn't perfect and the edge could be sharper."
msgstr ""
"強烈な一撃を叩き込む、ドイツ生まれの巨大な両手剣です。\n"
"\n"
"刃全体が中炭素鋼で作られています。柄には手に馴染むように革が巻かれ、ワイヤーで固定されています。武器全体のバランスには難があり、刃もそれほど鋭くありません。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/melee/swords_and_blades.json
msgid "high steel zweihänder"
msgid_plural "high steel zweihänders"
msgstr[0] "ツヴァイヘンダー(高炭素鋼)"

#. ~ Description of "high steel zweihänder"
#: data/json/items/melee/swords_and_blades.json
msgid ""
"A huge two-handed sword from Germany.  It packs a real wallop.\n"
"\n"
"Made with high steel and featuring a sturdy grip, this feels like a proper weapon.  The balance feels right and the blade is quite sharp."
msgstr ""
"強烈な一撃を叩き込む、ドイツ生まれの巨大な両手剣です。\n"
"\n"
"刃全体が高炭素鋼で作られており、柄も頑丈です。武器全体のバランスも刃の切れ味も良好で、丁寧に作ってあると感じます。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/melee/swords_and_blades.json
msgid "hardened steel zweihänder"
msgid_plural "hardened steel zweihänders"
msgstr[0] "ツヴァイヘンダー(焼入炭素鋼)"

#. ~ Description of "hardened steel zweihänder"
#: data/json/items/melee/swords_and_blades.json
msgid ""
"A huge two-handed sword from Germany.  It packs a real wallop.\n"
"\n"
"Made of hardened steel and with a molded grip that fits your hand perfectly, this weapon looks as good as any you might find in a museum.  The balance is perfect and the edge is as sharp as a razor."
msgstr ""
"強烈な一撃を叩き込む、ドイツ生まれの巨大な両手剣です。\n"
"\n"
"刃全体が焼入炭素鋼で作られており、柄の形状は手によく馴染みます。武器全体のバランスも完璧で、刃は鋭く研がれています。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/melee/swords_and_blades.json
msgid "tempered steel zweihänder"
msgid_plural "tempered steel zweihänders"
msgstr[0] "ツヴァイヘンダー(焼戻炭素鋼)"

#. ~ Description of "tempered steel zweihänder"
#: data/json/items/melee/swords_and_blades.json
msgid ""
"A huge two-handed sword from Germany.  It packs a real wallop.\n"
"\n"
"Made of tempered steel, this is a masterpiece.  The grip, the balance, the blade, all perfect.  This is the peak of the swordsmith's craft."
msgstr ""
"強烈な一撃を叩き込む、ドイツ生まれの巨大な両手剣です。\n"
"\n"
"刃全体が焼戻炭素鋼で作られており、柄のフィット感、全体のバランス、刃の切れ味、全てにおいて完璧です。これぞ匠の技の結晶です。"

#. ~ Description of "zweihänder"
#: data/json/items/melee/swords_and_blades.json
msgid ""
"A huge two-handed sword from Germany.  You're not quite sure it's supposed "
"to be this bendy."
msgstr "ドイツ生まれの巨大な両手剣です。想像していたよりずっと折れやすそうに見えます。"

#. ~ Description of "zweihänder"
#: data/json/items/melee/swords_and_blades.json
msgid ""
"A dull, cheaply-made replica of a huge two-handed sword from Germany.  Even "
"blunted, it still packs a wallop."
msgstr "ドイツ生まれの巨大な両手剣...の安価で刃が鈍いレプリカです。依然として強烈な一撃を叩き込めます。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/melee/swords_and_blades.json
msgid "karambit"
msgid_plural "karambits"
msgstr[0] "カランビット"

#. ~ Description of "karambit"
#: data/json/items/melee/swords_and_blades.json
msgid ""
"A traditional Indonesian small knife.  This one is sharp and could be an "
"effective weapon."
msgstr "インドネシアの伝統的な小型ナイフです。切れ味が鋭く、武器として使えそうです。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/melee/swords_and_blades.json
msgid "kirpan"
msgid_plural "kirpans"
msgstr[0] "キルパン"

#. ~ Description of "kirpan"
#: data/json/items/melee/swords_and_blades.json
msgid ""
"A ceremonial dagger carried by Sikh men.  This one is sharp and could be an "
"effective weapon."
msgstr "シーク教徒の男性が携行する儀式用の短剣です。切れ味が鋭く、武器として使えそうです。"

#. ~ Description of "kirpan"
#: data/json/items/melee/swords_and_blades.json
msgid ""
"A ceremonial dagger carried by Sikh men.  This one is not particularly well-"
"made."
msgstr "シーク教徒の男性が携行する儀式用の短剣です。あまり出来が良くないようです。"

#. ~ Item name
#. ~ name of the nested group
#: data/json/items/melee/swords_and_blades.json data/json/recipes/nested.json
msgid "nodachi"
msgid_plural "nodachi"
msgstr[0] "野太刀"

#. ~ Description of "nodachi"
#: data/json/items/melee/swords_and_blades.json
msgid ""
"A huge, curved, two-handed sword from Japan.  It is surprisingly light for "
"its size."
msgstr "大きさの割に驚くほど軽い、両手で扱う日本生まれの巨大な曲刀です。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/melee/swords_and_blades.json
msgid "mild steel nodachi"
msgid_plural "mild steel nodachi"
msgstr[0] "野太刀(低炭素鋼)"

#. ~ Description of "mild steel nodachi"
#: data/json/items/melee/swords_and_blades.json
msgid ""
"A huge, curved, two-handed sword from Japan.  It is surprisingly light for its size.\n"
"\n"
"Made with mild steel and lacking a proper grip, this is better than the sticks you swung around as a kid, but you know you can do better."
msgstr ""
"大きさの割に驚くほど軽い、両手で扱う日本生まれの巨大な曲刀です。\n"
"\n"
"刃全体が低炭素鋼で作られており、柄は手にあまり馴染みません。子供が振り回す棒きれよりはマシですが、もっと品質のいい武器が欲しいものです。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/melee/swords_and_blades.json
msgid "medium steel nodachi"
msgid_plural "medium steel nodachi"
msgstr[0] "野太刀(中炭素鋼)"

