#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/melee/swords_and_blades.json
msgid "high steel nodachi"
msgid_plural "high steel nodachi"
msgstr[0] "野太刀(高炭素鋼)"

#. ~ Description of "high steel nodachi"
#: data/json/items/melee/swords_and_blades.json
msgid ""
"A huge, curved, two-handed sword from Japan.  It is surprisingly light for its size.\n"
"\n"
"Made with high steel and featuring a sturdy grip, this feels like a proper weapon.  The balance feels right and the blade is quite sharp."
msgstr ""
"大きさの割に驚くほど軽い、両手で扱う日本生まれの巨大な曲刀です。\n"
"\n"
"刃全体が高炭素鋼で作られており、柄も頑丈です。武器全体のバランスも刃の切れ味も良好で、丁寧に作ってあると感じます。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/melee/swords_and_blades.json
msgid "hardened steel nodachi"
msgid_plural "hardened steel nodachi"
msgstr[0] "野太刀(焼入炭素鋼)"

