msgid "katana"
msgid_plural "katana"
msgstr[0] "日本刀"

#. ~ Description of "katana"
#: data/json/items/melee/swords_and_blades.json
msgid ""
"A rare sword from Japan.  Deadly against unarmored targets, and still very "
"effective against armor."
msgstr "希少価値の高い日本刀です。装甲をもたない敵には致命的な一撃を繰り出せますが、装甲の厚い相手にも効果があります。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/melee/swords_and_blades.json
msgid "mild steel katana"
msgid_plural "mild steel katana"
msgstr[0] "日本刀(低炭素鋼)"

#. ~ Description of "mild steel katana"
#: data/json/items/melee/swords_and_blades.json
msgid ""
"A rare sword from Japan.  Deadly against unarmored targets, and still very effective against armor.\n"
"\n"
"Made with mild steel and lacking a proper grip, this is better than the sticks you swung around as a kid, but you know you can do better."
msgstr ""
"希少価値の高い日本刀です。装甲の薄い敵に対して致命的なダメージを与えられますが、装甲の厚い相手にも有効です。\n"
"\n"
"刃全体が低炭素鋼で作られており、柄は手にあまり馴染みません。子供が振り回す棒きれよりはマシですが、もっと品質のいい武器が欲しいものです。"

