#. ~ Description of "kriegsmesser"
#: data/json/items/melee/swords_and_blades.json
msgid ""
"A single-edged two-handed sword of German design, with a long, curved blade."
"  It became popular across Europe due to its low cost while maintaining "
"strong cutting power in comparison to the more sophisticated longsword."
msgstr ""
"ドイツで生まれた、両手持ち用の湾曲した長い片刃剣です。ロングソードよりは洗練されていませんが、切れ味が衰えにくく安価なため、ヨーロッパ全土に普及しました。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/melee/swords_and_blades.json
msgid "mild steel kriegsmesser"
msgid_plural "mild steel kriegsmessers"
msgstr[0] "クリークスメッサー(低炭素鋼)"

#. ~ Description of "mild steel kriegsmesser"
#: data/json/items/melee/swords_and_blades.json
msgid ""
"A single-edged hand-and-a-half-sword of German design, with a long, curved blade.  It became popular across Europe due to its low cost while maintaining strong cutting power in comparison to the more sophisticated longsword.\n"
"\n"
"Made with mild steel and lacking a proper grip, this is better than the sticks you swung around as a kid, but you know you can do better."
msgstr ""
"ドイツで生まれた、片手でも両手でも扱える湾曲した長い片刃剣です。ロングソードよりは洗練されていませんが、切れ味が衰えにくく安価なため、ヨーロッパ全土に普及しました。\n"
"\n"
"刃全体が低炭素鋼で作られており、柄は手にあまり馴染みません。子供が振り回す棒きれよりはマシですが、もっと品質のいい武器が欲しいものです。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/melee/swords_and_blades.json
msgid "medium steel kriegsmesser"
msgid_plural "medium steel kriegsmessers"
msgstr[0] "クリークスメッサー(中炭素鋼)"

#. ~ Description of "medium steel kriegsmesser"
#: data/json/items/melee/swords_and_blades.json
msgid ""
"A single-edged two-handed sword of German design, with a long, curved blade.  It became popular across Europe due to its low cost while maintaining strong cutting power in comparison to the more sophisticated longsword.\n"
"\n"
"Made with medium steel and with a grip made of leather wrapped in steel wire, this weapon is comfortable in your hand, though the balance isn't perfect and the edge could be sharper."
msgstr ""
"ドイツで生まれた、両手持ち用の湾曲した長い片刃剣です。ロングソードよりは洗練されていませんが、切れ味が衰えにくく安価なため、ヨーロッパ全土に普及しました。\n"
"\n"
"刃全体が中炭素鋼で作られています。柄には手に馴染むように革が巻かれ、ワイヤーで固定されています。武器全体のバランスには難があり、刃もそれほど鋭くありません。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/melee/swords_and_blades.json
msgid "high steel kriegsmesser"
msgid_plural "high steel kriegsmessers"
msgstr[0] "クリークスメッサー(高炭素鋼)"

#. ~ Description of "high steel kriegsmesser"
#: data/json/items/melee/swords_and_blades.json
msgid ""
"A single-edged two-handed sword of German design, with a long, curved blade.  It became popular across Europe due to its low cost while maintaining strong cutting power in comparison to the more sophisticated longsword.\n"
"\n"
"Made with high steel and featuring a sturdy grip, this feels like a proper weapon.  The balance feels right and the blade is quite sharp."
msgstr ""
"ドイツで生まれた、両手持ち用の湾曲した長い片刃剣です。ロングソードよりは洗練されていませんが、切れ味が衰えにくく安価なため、ヨーロッパ全土に普及しました。\n"
"\n"
"刃全体が高炭素鋼で作られており、柄も頑丈です。武器全体のバランスも刃の切れ味も良好で、丁寧に作ってあると感じます。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/melee/swords_and_blades.json
msgid "hardened steel kriegsmesser"
msgid_plural "hardened steel kriegsmessers"
msgstr[0] "クリークスメッサー(焼入炭素鋼)"

#. ~ Description of "hardened steel kriegsmesser"
