"A heavy half-meter length of railroad track with a smooth top, liberated "
"from a now-defunct rail line.  Could be used as a makeshift anvil, "
"especially with some modifications, or as spare steel."
msgstr ""
"使われていない線路から切り出した、長さ0.5mの重厚で表面が滑らかなレールです。多少加工すれば金床として活用できますが、予備の鋼材としても使えます。"

#. ~ Item name
#. ~ name of the nested group
#: data/json/items/resources/metal.json data/json/recipes/nested.json
msgid "scrap aluminum"
msgid_plural "scrap aluminum"
msgstr[0] "アルミニウム屑"

#. ~ Description of "scrap aluminum"
#: data/json/items/resources/metal.json
msgid "A handful of small pieces of aluminum, usable for crafting or repairs."
msgstr "小さなアルミニウムの欠片です。修復やアイテム製作の材料として使います。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/resources/metal.json
msgid "scrap cast iron"
msgid_plural "scrap cast iron"
msgstr[0] "鋳鉄屑"

#. ~ Description of "scrap cast iron"
#: data/json/items/resources/metal.json
msgid ""
"A handful of small pieces of scrap cast iron, usable for crafting or "
"repairs."
msgstr "修復やアイテム製作の材料として使える、小さなアルミニウムの欠片です。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/resources/metal.json
msgid "cast iron chunk"
msgid_plural "cast iron chunk"
msgstr[0] "鋳鉄塊"

#. ~ Description of "cast iron chunk"
#: data/json/items/resources/metal.json
msgid ""
"A misshapen chunk of cast iron.  Makes a decent weapon in a pinch, and is "
"also useful for some crafting recipes."
msgstr "不格好な鋳鉄の塊です。アイテム製作の材料として使いますが、いざというときは武器にもなります。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/resources/metal.json
msgid "cast iron lump"
msgid_plural "cast iron lump"
msgstr[0] "圧縮鋳鉄塊"

#. ~ Description of "cast iron lump"
#: data/json/items/resources/metal.json
msgid "A heavy piece of cast iron.  Useful for some crafting recipes."
msgstr "非常に重い鋳鉄の塊です。アイテム製作の材料として使います。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/resources/misc.json
msgid "bee stinger"
msgid_plural "bee stingers"
msgstr[0] "針(ハチ)"

#. ~ Description of "bee stinger"
#: data/json/items/resources/misc.json
msgid "A six-inch stinger from a giant bee.  Makes a mediocre melee weapon."
msgstr "長さ約15cmの巨大なハチの針です。間に合わせながらも十分な性能を持つ近接武器になります。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/resources/misc.json
msgid "broom"
msgid_plural "brooms"
msgstr[0] "箒"

#. ~ Description of "broom"
#: data/json/items/resources/misc.json
msgid ""
"A long-handled broom.  Makes a terrible weapon unless you're chasing cats."
msgstr "柄の長い箒です。(猫を追いかけ回す用途においては)最凶の武器ですね。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/resources/misc.json
msgid "ceramic shard"
msgid_plural "ceramic shards"
msgstr[0] "セラミック片"

#. ~ Description of "ceramic shard"
#: data/json/items/resources/misc.json
msgid ""
"A broken ceramic shard.  It is relatively heavy for its size and has a "
"somewhat sharp edge, but it's too irregular to cut properly."
msgstr "セラミックの破片です。大きさの割に重く、やや尖っていますが、形状が不規則すぎるため切断道具としては使えません。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/resources/misc.json
msgid "fungal fighter stinger"
msgid_plural "fungal fighter stingers"
msgstr[0] "針(真菌殺し)"

#. ~ Description of "fungal fighter stinger"
#: data/json/items/resources/misc.json
msgid "A short dart from a fungal fighter.  Makes a poor melee weapon."
msgstr "真菌殺しが持っている短いダーツです。威力は貧弱なものの近接武器として使えます。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/resources/misc.json
msgid "incendiary"
msgid_plural "incendiary"
msgstr[0] "焼夷剤"

#. ~ Description of "incendiary"
#: data/json/items/resources/misc.json
msgid ""
"Material from an incendiary round, useful in constructing incendiary "
"ammunition."
msgstr "焼夷弾の素材であり、燃焼する弾薬を作る際に役立ちます。"

#. ~ Description of "mattress"
#: data/json/items/resources/misc.json
msgid "A single, or twin, sized mattress."
msgstr "シングル、あるいはツインサイズのマットレスです。"

#. ~ "done_message" action message of item "mattress"
#: data/json/items/resources/misc.json
msgid "You lay the mattress flat on the ground."
msgstr "マットレスを敷きました。"

#. ~ Description of "down mattress"
#: data/json/items/resources/misc.json
msgid "A single, or twin, sized down-filled mattress."
msgstr "シングル、あるいはツインサイズの、羽毛が入ったマットレスです。"

#. ~ "done_message" action message of item "down mattress"
#: data/json/items/resources/misc.json
msgid "You lay the down mattress flat on the ground."
msgstr "マットレス(羽毛)を敷きました。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/resources/misc.json
msgid "fuse"
msgid_plural "fuse"
msgstr[0] "導火線"

#. ~ Description of "fuse"
#: data/json/items/resources/misc.json
msgid ""
"A piece of fuse, long enough to give you enough time to get away from most "
"explosions."
msgstr "一本の導火線です。この程度の長さがあれば、大抵の点火済み爆発物から退避できそうです。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/resources/misc.json
msgid "sharp rock"
msgid_plural "sharp rocks"
msgstr[0] "鋭利な石"

#. ~ Description of "sharp rock"
#: data/json/items/resources/misc.json
msgid ""
"A baseball-sized rock with a somewhat sharp edge that also chips in a semi-"
"predictable way if struck.  With the right skills, you could give it a "
"better edge."
msgstr "叩けばすぐに欠けてしまいそうな、野球ボール大のやや尖った石です。適切な加工法を学べば、更に鋭く尖らせることができそうです。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/resources/misc.json
msgid "rubber sole"
msgid_plural "rubber soles"
msgstr[0] "ラバーソール"

#. ~ Description of "rubber sole"
#: data/json/items/resources/misc.json
msgid ""
"A sole made from rubber, usually found on the bottoms of boots.  Can be used"
" for making actual boots."
msgstr "一般的なブーツの底に使われるゴム製の靴底です。これがあれば実際にブーツを作れます。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/resources/misc.json
msgid "thick rubber chunk"
msgid_plural "thick rubber chunks"
msgstr[0] "ゴム塊"

#. ~ Description of "thick rubber chunk"
#: data/json/items/resources/misc.json
msgid ""
"A chunk of thick, semi-rigid rubber, similar to what tires are made from."
msgstr "タイヤなどに使われていた、弾力がある厚いゴムの塊です。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/resources/misc.json
msgid "rubber tire strip"
msgid_plural "rubber tire strips"
msgstr[0] "タイヤゴム生地"

#. ~ Description of "rubber tire strip"
#: data/json/items/resources/misc.json
msgid "A long, curled strip of thick, semi-rigid rubber cut from a tire."
msgstr "タイヤから切り取って巻き取った、弾力があり分厚く長いゴム生地です。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/resources/misc.json
msgid "grenade launcher buttstock"
msgid_plural "grenade launcher buttstocks"
msgstr[0] "グレネードランチャー用銃床"

#. ~ Description of "grenade launcher buttstock"
#: data/json/items/resources/misc.json
msgid ""
"A collapsible buttstock designed for the M320 grenade launcher.  When "
"combined with this stock, the M320 can be used as a standalone weapon."
msgstr "M320グレネードランチャー用の折り畳み式銃床です。この銃床と組み合わせることでM320を単体の武器として扱えるようになります。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/resources/misc.json
msgid "wasp stinger"
msgid_plural "wasp stingers"
msgstr[0] "針(スズメバチ)"

#. ~ Description of "wasp stinger"
#: data/json/items/resources/misc.json
msgid "A six-inch stinger from a giant wasp.  Makes a poor melee weapon."
msgstr "巨大スズメバチが持つ約15センチの針です。威力は貧弱なものの近接武器として使えます。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/resources/misc.json
msgid "cannonball"
msgid_plural "cannonballs"
msgstr[0] "砲弾"

#. ~ Description of "cannonball"
#: data/json/items/resources/misc.json
msgid ""
"A four-pound cannonball.  With some gunpowder, wadding, and a fuse, it could"
" be prepared to load into a cannon."
msgstr "4ポンド砲弾です。火薬と詰め物、起爆装置があれば大砲に装填できます。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/resources/misc.json
msgid "RC car wheel set"
msgid_plural "RC car wheel sets"
msgstr[0] "ラジコンカーホイール"

#. ~ Description of "RC car wheel set"
#: data/json/items/resources/misc.json
msgid ""
"A small set of wheels for a radio-controlled car.  Could be improvised with "
"caster wheels if given rubber treads for grip."
msgstr "ラジコンカー用の小さなホイール一式です。路面をしっかり掴めるゴム製履帯と組み合わせれば、即席のキャスター用ホイールになります。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/resources/misc.json
msgid "destroyed ryūsei kabuto"
msgid_plural "destroyed ryūsei kabuto"
msgstr[0] "破壊された流星の兜"

#. ~ Description of "destroyed ryūsei kabuto"
#: data/json/items/resources/misc.json
msgid ""
"A conical shaped massive slab of inscrutable rock now in two pieces, strange"
" metallic tubes visibly on display.  Something seems to have cracked it from"
" the inside out."
msgstr ""
"奇妙な岩で作られた巨大な装甲は真っ二つに割れており、隙間から奇妙な金属製の管が飛び出しています。どうやら内部の機構が壊れてしまったようです。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/resources/misc.json
msgid "chunk of paraffin wax"
msgid_plural "chunks of paraffin wax"
msgstr[0] "パラフィンワックスの塊"

#. ~ Description of "chunk of paraffin wax"
#: data/json/items/resources/misc.json
msgid "A large chunk of paraffin wax."
msgstr "パラフィンワックスの大きな塊です。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/resources/plastic.json
msgid "thermoplastic resin chunk"
msgid_plural "thermoplastic resin chunks"
msgstr[0] "熱可塑性樹脂片"

#. ~ Description of "thermoplastic resin chunk"
#: data/json/items/resources/plastic.json
msgid ""
"A piece of tough thermoplastic resin that could be used to craft, repair, or"
" reinforce items."
msgstr "加工、修理、補強などの材料に適した、丈夫な熱可塑性樹脂です。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/resources/plastic.json
msgid "epoxy chunk"
msgid_plural "epoxy chunks"
msgstr[0] "エポキシ片"

#. ~ Description of "epoxy chunk"
#: data/json/items/resources/plastic.json
msgid ""
"A hardy and durable piece of epoxy.  You could potentially craft items with "
"it."
msgstr "硬く丈夫なエポキシ樹脂です。アイテム製作の材料として使えそうです。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/resources/plastic.json
msgid "polycarbonate chunk"
msgid_plural "polycarbonate chunks"
msgstr[0] "ポリカーボネート片"

#. ~ Description of "polycarbonate chunk"
#: data/json/items/resources/plastic.json
msgid ""
"A hardy and durable piece of polycarbonate.  You could potentially craft "
"items with it."
msgstr "硬く丈夫なポリカーボネートです。アイテム製作の材料として使えそうです。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/resources/plastic.json
msgid "10 L plastic block"
msgid_plural "10 L plastic blocks"
msgstr[0] "プラスチック塊10L"

#. ~ Description of "10 L plastic block"
#: data/json/items/resources/plastic.json
msgid "A ten-liter block of solid plastic."
msgstr "体積10Lのプラスチック製ブロックです。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/resources/plastic.json
msgid "5 L plastic block"
msgid_plural "5 L plastic blocks"
msgstr[0] "プラスチック塊5L"

#. ~ Description of "5 L plastic block"
#: data/json/items/resources/plastic.json
msgid "A five-liter block of solid plastic."
msgstr "体積5Lのプラスチック製ブロックです。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/resources/plastic.json
msgid "plastic chunk"
msgid_plural "plastic chunks"
msgstr[0] "プラスチック片"

#. ~ Description of "plastic chunk"
#: data/json/items/resources/plastic.json
msgid ""
"A piece of plastic.  It could be used to fabricate, repair, or reinforce "
"plastic items."
msgstr "プラスチックの欠片です。プラスチック製アイテムの製作、修復や補強に使えます。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/resources/plastic.json
msgid "synthetic fabric patch"
msgid_plural "synthetic fabric patches"
msgstr[0] "端切れ(合成繊維)"

#. ~ Description of "synthetic fabric patch"
#: data/json/items/resources/plastic.json
msgid ""
"A six-inch square patch of synthetic fabric.  Unlike you and other natural "
"materials, it won't degrade much with age.  Maybe that's less of a bad thing"
" now."
msgstr "約16cm四方の、合成繊維の端切れです。人間や天然素材と異なり、年齢を経てもそれほど劣化しません。今の状況に役立つ素材と言えますね。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/resources/plastic.json
msgid "Lycra patch"
msgid_plural "Lycra patches"
msgstr[0] "端切れ(ライクラ)"

#. ~ Description of "Lycra patch"
#: data/json/items/resources/plastic.json
msgid ""
"A six-inch square patch of synthetic fabric blended with stretchy Lycra "
"fibers.  It could be used to make flexible yet strong clothing.  Stylish, "
"but bad for the environment; at least you're recycling it."
msgstr ""
"約16cm四方の、伸縮性の高いライクラ繊維を織り交ぜた合成繊維の端切れです。柔軟かつ丈夫な衣類を仕立てるのに適しています。お洒落ではあるものの自然環境に悪い素材だと言われていますが、少なくとも再利用は可能です。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/resources/plastic.json
msgid "large plastic sheet"
msgid_plural "large plastic sheets"
msgstr[0] "大型ビニールシート"

#. ~ Description of "large plastic sheet"
#: data/json/items/resources/plastic.json
msgid ""
"A large sheet of flexible plastic, the sort that might have been used for "
"commercial wrapping or for weather-sealing a home."
msgstr "商業用の包装や家の雨漏りを防ぐ用途で使われていたような、大きなビニールシートです。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/resources/plastic.json
msgid "plastic sheet"
msgid_plural "plastic sheets"
msgstr[0] "ビニールシート"

#. ~ Description of "plastic sheet"
#: data/json/items/resources/plastic.json
msgid ""
"A small sheet of flexible plastic, like a cut-up garbage bag.  It might be "
"useful for waterproofing clothes."
msgstr "ゴミ袋を切って作ったような、小さなビニールシートです。衣服の防水対策に活用できそうです。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/resources/plastic.json
msgid "polycarbonate sheet"
msgid_plural "polycarbonate sheets"
msgstr[0] "ポリカーボネートシート"

#. ~ Description of "polycarbonate sheet"
#: data/json/items/resources/plastic.json
msgid ""
"A polycarbonate sheet that can be used for, among other things, vacuum "
"molding."
msgstr "真空成形などに使われる、ポリカーボネートシートです。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/resources/plastic.json
msgid "rigid plastic sheet"
msgid_plural "rigid plastic sheets"
msgstr[0] "硬質プラスチック板"

#. ~ Description of "rigid plastic sheet"
#: data/json/items/resources/plastic.json
msgid ""
"A large, rigid sheet of transparent polycarbonate, useful for all manner of "
"things; from construction to art, or even amateur snowboarding."
msgstr "大きく硬く透明なポリカーボネートの板です。建築物から芸術品、初心者向けのスノーボードまで、様々な分野で素材として使われています。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/resources/plastic.json
msgid "panoramic lens"
msgid_plural "panoramic lenses"
msgstr[0] "一眼マスクレンズ"

#. ~ Description of "panoramic lens"
#: data/json/items/resources/plastic.json
msgid ""
"A relatively broad strip of chemical and impact-resistant polycarbonate "
"plastic, most commonly used for the construction of wide-view visors and "
"single-element eye pieces that offer maximal vision."
msgstr ""
"耐薬品性、耐衝撃性に優れた、比較的幅の広いポリカーボネート製のマスクレンズです。視界を最大限確保するマスクや目元の保護具の材料としての用途が最も一般的です。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/resources/plastic.json
msgid "inhalation valve"
msgid_plural "inhalation valves"
msgstr[0] "吸気弁"

#. ~ Description of "inhalation valve"
#: data/json/items/resources/plastic.json
msgid ""
"An essential component of any gas mask, this is a small one-way valve that "
"allows purified air to pass from a gas respirator's filter element to the "
"mask's interior, delivering safe, breathable air to one's lungs."
msgstr ""
"あらゆるガスマスクに不可欠な、一方向にのみ空気を通す小型部品です。ろ過された空気をキャニスター内のフィルターからマスク内部に通すことで、安全に呼吸できる空気が肺まで届きます。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/resources/plastic.json
msgid "40mm filter port"
msgid_plural "40mm filter ports"
msgstr[0] "40mmキャニスター差込口"

#. ~ Description of "40mm filter port"
#: data/json/items/resources/plastic.json
msgid ""
"A compact plastic and metal housing with a threaded exterior, designed to "
"retain a screwed-on 40-mm canister filter and allow the airtight passage of "
"air from the filter media to a gas mask's inhalation valve."
msgstr ""
"外側にネジ山が刻まれた、プラスチックと金属でできた小さな部品です。直径40mmのフィルターキャニスターを差し込んで固定し、フィルター部分からガスマスクの吸気弁まで空気を漏らすことなく通します。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/resources/stone.json
msgid "flaking rock"
msgid_plural "flaking rocks"
msgstr[0] "剥離石"

#. ~ Description of "flaking rock"
#: data/json/items/resources/stone.json
msgid ""
"A rock the size of a baseball which chips in a semi-predictable way if "
"struck, leaving a sharp edge.  Makes a decent melee weapon, and is also good"
" for throwing at enemies."
msgstr "野球ボールサイズの石です。強い力で叩けば、当然ですが鋭い破片状に砕けます。まともな近接武器として使えますが、投擲武器にも適しています。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/resources/stone.json
msgid "flint"
msgid_plural "flints"
msgstr[0] "火打石"

#. ~ Description of "flint"
#: data/json/items/resources/stone.json
msgid ""
"A chunk of flint, the kind of rock that can make sparks if stuck against "
"high-carbon steel.  It also chips in a semi-predictable way if struck, "
"leaving a sharp edge."
msgstr "高炭素鋼と打ち合わせると火花が散る、硬い石の塊です。叩けばすぐに欠けそうですが、鋭く尖った破片が残ります。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/resources/stone.json
msgid "large rock"
msgid_plural "large rocks"
msgstr[0] "大きな石"

#. ~ Description of "large rock"
#: data/json/items/resources/stone.json
msgid ""
"A large, heavy rock, big enough to be used as a primitive anvil or shaped "
"into larger stone items."
msgstr "重く大きな石です。十分なサイズがあるため、原始的な金床代わりにしたり、組み合わせてより大きなアイテムを製作したりできます。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/resources/stone.json
msgid "fiber insulation batt"
msgid_plural "fiber insulation batts"
msgstr[0] "断熱板"

#. ~ Description of "fiber insulation batt"
#: data/json/items/resources/stone.json
msgid ""
"A foil-wrapped batt of fibrous insulation; fire- and moisture-resistant, "
"it's used for hot appliances like dishwashers and ovens."
msgstr "繊維状の断熱材を金属箔で包んだ板です。火や湿気に強く、食器洗浄機やオーブンなどの高熱を発する設備に使われています。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/resources/stone.json
msgid "bone replica"
msgid_plural "bone replicas"
msgstr[0] "骨のレプリカ"

#. ~ Description of "bone replica"
#: data/json/items/resources/stone.json
msgid "A plaster replica of a bone."
msgstr "骨の石膏レプリカです。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/resources/stone.json
msgid "large bone replica"
msgid_plural "large bone replicas"
msgstr[0] "骨の大型レプリカ"

#. ~ Description of "large bone replica"
#: data/json/items/resources/stone.json
msgid "A plaster replica of a huge bone."
msgstr "巨大な骨の石膏レプリカです。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/resources/stone.json
msgid "bone fossil"
msgid_plural "bone fossils"
msgstr[0] "骨の化石"

#. ~ Description of "bone fossil"
#: data/json/items/resources/stone.json
msgid "A fossilized bone.  Not good to eat."
msgstr "化石になった骨です。食べられません。"

#. ~ Description of "large bone replica"
#: data/json/items/resources/stone.json
msgid "A huge fossilized bone.  Not good to eat."
msgstr "化石になった巨大な骨です。食べられません。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/resources/tailoring.json
msgid "worthless scraps"
msgid_plural "worthless scraps"
msgstr[0] "汎用低級布屑"

#. ~ Description of "worthless scraps"
#: data/json/items/resources/tailoring.json
msgid ""
"A handful of oddly-shaped worthless bits of abstract code.  Seeing this is a"
" bug."
msgstr "奇妙な形をした価値のない抽象的なコードの屑です。通常は表示されません。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/resources/tailoring.json
msgid "valuable scraps"
msgid_plural "valuable scraps"
msgstr[0] "汎用高級布屑"

#. ~ Description of "valuable scraps"
#: data/json/items/resources/tailoring.json
msgid ""
"A handful of oddly-shaped valuable bits of abstract code.  Seeing this is a "
"bug."
msgstr "奇妙な形をした貴重で抽象的なコードの屑です。通常は表示されません。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/resources/tailoring.json
msgid "grass yarn"
msgid_plural "grass yarns"
msgstr[0] "草糸"

#. ~ Description of "grass yarn"
#: data/json/items/resources/tailoring.json
msgid ""
"Primitive yarn made from coarse plant fibers like straw or grass.  Too thick"
" to sew with, but could be woven into a crude sheet of fabric."
msgstr "藁や草などの粗い植物繊維を紡いで作った原始的な糸です。衣類を縫うには太すぎますが、織れば粗い生地が作れます。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/resources/tailoring.json
msgid "cotton scraps"
msgid_plural "cotton scraps"
msgstr[0] "布屑(綿)"

#. ~ Description of "cotton scraps"
#: data/json/items/resources/tailoring.json
msgid ""
"A handful of oddly-shaped smallish bits of cotton, waste material from "
"tailoring projects.  Not useful for much and usually disposed of, but they "
"can be recycled into some thread if you really want."
msgstr "服を仕立てた際に余った、歪な形の細かい綿です。大抵は何の役にも立たず廃棄されますが、もし必要なら糸を作る材料として再利用できます。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/resources/tailoring.json
msgid "faux fur scraps"
msgid_plural "faux fur scraps"
msgstr[0] "布屑(ﾌｪｲｸﾌｧｰ)"

#. ~ Description of "faux fur scraps"
#: data/json/items/resources/tailoring.json
msgid ""
"A handful of oddly-shaped smallish bits of faux fur, waste material from "
"tailoring projects.  Not useful for much and usually disposed of."
msgstr "服を仕立てた際に余った、歪な形の細かいフェイクファーです。大抵は何の役にも立たず廃棄されます。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/resources/tailoring.json
msgid "felt scraps"
msgid_plural "felt scraps"
msgstr[0] "布屑(フェルト)"

#. ~ Description of "felt scraps"
#: data/json/items/resources/tailoring.json
msgid ""
"A handful of oddly-shaped smallish bits of felt, waste material from "
"tailoring projects.  Not useful for much and usually disposed of, but they "
"can be recycled into some wool fiber if you really want."
msgstr "服を仕立てた際に余った、歪な形の細かいフェルトです。大抵は何の役にも立たず廃棄されますが、もし必要なら織糸を作る材料として再利用できます。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/resources/tailoring.json
msgid "fur scraps"
msgid_plural "fur scraps"
msgstr[0] "布屑(毛皮)"

#. ~ Description of "fur scraps"
#: data/json/items/resources/tailoring.json
msgid ""
"A handful of oddly-shaped smallish bits of fur, waste material from "
"tailoring projects.  Not useful for much and usually disposed of."
msgstr "服を仕立てた際に余った、歪な形の細かいライクラです。大抵は何の役にも立たず廃棄されます。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/resources/tailoring.json
msgid "Kevlar scraps"
msgid_plural "Kevlar scraps"
msgstr[0] "布屑(ケブラー)"

#. ~ Description of "Kevlar scraps"
#: data/json/items/resources/tailoring.json
msgid ""
"A handful of oddly-shaped smallish bits of Kevlar fabric, waste material "
"from tailoring projects.  Normally it would be disposed of, but since Kevlar"
" is very difficult to make in a post-apocalyptic world, it might be worth "
"recycling it for Kevlar thread."
msgstr ""
"服を仕立てた際に余った、歪な形の細かいケブラー片です。大抵は何の役にも立たず廃棄されますが、終末が訪れた世界ではケブラーを生成するのは非常に難しいため、繊維として再利用する価値はありそうです。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/resources/tailoring.json
msgid "leather scraps"
msgid_plural "leather scraps"
msgstr[0] "布屑(革)"

#. ~ Description of "leather scraps"
#: data/json/items/resources/tailoring.json
msgid ""
