#: data/json/monster_weakpoints/yrax_weakpoints.json
msgid "a weak segment"
msgstr "脆い接合部"

#. ~ Name of a gun
#: data/json/monsters/LIXA_monsters.json
msgid "photonic gun"
msgid_plural "photonic guns"
msgstr[0] "フォトニックガン"

#. ~ Description of gun "photonic gun"
#: data/json/monsters/LIXA_monsters.json
msgid "Horks up a glob of congealed light."
msgstr "凝固した光を発生させます。"

#. ~ Spell name
#: data/json/monsters/LIXA_monsters.json
msgid "Spread Light"
msgstr "光散布"

#. ~ Description of spell "Spread Light"
#: data/json/monsters/LIXA_monsters.json
msgid "Splashes congealed light along the ground in a cone."
msgstr "地面へ円錐状に凝固した光をまき散らします。"

#. ~ Spell name
#: data/json/monsters/LIXA_monsters.json
msgid "Photonic Death"
msgstr "死亡時光発生"

#. ~ Description of spell "Photonic Death"
#: data/json/monsters/LIXA_monsters.json
msgid "Puddle o' light."
msgstr "凝固した光を生成します。"

#. ~ Spell name
#: data/json/monsters/LIXA_monsters.json
msgid "Summon Eigenspectre Copy"
msgstr "アイゲンスペクトル複製召喚"

#. ~ Description of spell "Summon Eigenspectre Copy"
#: data/json/monsters/LIXA_monsters.json
msgid "Ripping off the hounds of Tindalos!"
msgstr "ティンダロスの猟犬を欺きます！"

#. ~ Name of a gun
#: data/json/monsters/LIXA_monsters.json
msgid "coordinate rotation volley"
msgid_plural "coordinate rotation volleys"
msgstr[0] "座標回転照射"

#. ~ Description of gun "coordinate rotation volley"
#: data/json/monsters/LIXA_monsters.json
msgid "Fake gun that fires, uh.  Coordinate transform matrices?"
msgstr "疑似的な銃です。ええと、座標回転行列？"

#. ~ Spell name
#: data/json/monsters/LIXA_monsters.json
msgid "an arc of coordinate reassignment"
msgstr "座標再割当アーク"

#. ~ Description of spell "an arc of coordinate reassignment"
#: data/json/monsters/LIXA_monsters.json
msgid "Spawns LIXA reshuffle."
msgstr "LIXA装置の効果で位置を元に戻します。"

#. ~ Sound description of spell "an arc of coordinate reassignment"
#: data/json/monsters/LIXA_monsters.json
msgid "snapping geometry"
msgstr "[構造が断ち切れる音]"

#. ~ Spell name
#: data/json/monsters/LIXA_monsters.json
msgid "Unfold Collapse"
msgstr "展開空間正常化"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/json/monsters/LIXA_monsters.json
msgid "eigenspectre"
msgid_plural "eigenspectres"
msgstr[0] "アイゲンスペクトル"

#. ~ Description of monster "eigenspectre"
#: data/json/monsters/LIXA_monsters.json
msgid ""
"This is the opposite of a human silhouette; every facet of every detail on "
"display, with no shape to make sense of them.  You can see both sides of an "
"ID badge on a white labcoat.  You can see every muscle and nerve in eyes "
"blown wide with horror."
msgstr ""
"人間の形状を反転させたような何かです。あらゆる面が細部に至るまで表出しており、理解できる部分はまったくありません。まとった白衣には、裏と表が同時に見えるバッジが付いています。恐怖で見開かれた目元の筋肉や神経すらはっきりと視認できます。"

#. ~ Death message of monster "eigenspectre"
#. ~ Death message of monster "shifting eigenspectre"
#. ~ Death message of monster "titanic eigenspectre"
#: data/json/monsters/LIXA_monsters.json
#, c-format
msgid "The %s becomes part of the endless chamber."
msgstr "%sは無限回廊に同化しました。"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/json/monsters/LIXA_monsters.json
msgid "photonic eigenspectre"
msgid_plural "photonic eigenspectres"
msgstr[0] "発光するアイゲンスペクトル"

#. ~ Description of monster "photonic eigenspectre"
#: data/json/monsters/LIXA_monsters.json
msgid ""
"The endless details of this figure are mercifully obscured by the viscous "
"light coursing 'through' it.  It cannot contain anything, but the smears of "
"light follow the shapes of stomach and intestines, and are splattered across"
" what must be the lips and chin."
msgstr ""
"この人物の極限まで緻密に描写されているであろう姿は、その肉体を「通り抜けている」粘つく光の塊によって慈悲深く隠されています。混じり気のない光は胃や腸の形状を照らし出し、唇や顎と思しき場所から飛び散っています。"

#. ~ Death message of monster "photonic eigenspectre"
#: data/json/monsters/LIXA_monsters.json
#, c-format
msgid ""
"The %s becomes part of the endless chamber, and congealed light splashes "
"away from the spot it occupied."
msgstr "%sは無限回廊に同化し、光の塊がその場で飛び散りました。"

#. ~ Monster message of special attack of monster "photonic eigenspectre"
#: data/json/monsters/LIXA_monsters.json
#, c-format
msgid "The %s emits a torrent of congealed light!"
msgstr "%sは凝固した光を吐き出しました！"

#. ~ Description of special attack of monster "photonic eigenspectre"
#: data/json/monsters/LIXA_monsters.json
#, c-format
msgid "The %s flings a gobbet of congealed light!"
msgstr "%sは凝固した光の塊を飛び散らせました！"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/json/monsters/LIXA_monsters.json
msgid "shifting eigenspectre"
msgid_plural "shifting eigenspectres"
msgstr[0] "回転するアイゲンスペクトル"

#. ~ Description of monster "shifting eigenspectre"
#: data/json/monsters/LIXA_monsters.json
msgid ""
"This distorted figure is a kaleidoscope of borders.  Every part of a human, "
"flattened into place, warps wildly from second to second.  The word your "
"mind conjures to describe it is 'rotating', though you're not sure why."
msgstr ""
"まるで万華鏡を覗いているかのような、歪んだ形状の物体です。均一化され一か所にまとまった人間のあらゆる部位が、次から次へと激しく変化していきます。この状態を説明するとして、理由は分かりませんが、まず「回転」という言葉が頭に思い浮かびました。"

#. ~ Monster message of special attack of monster "shifting eigenspectre"
#: data/json/monsters/LIXA_monsters.json
#, c-format
msgid ""
"The %s is in two places at once, and leaves something of itself behind."
msgstr "%sはその場に何らかの痕跡を残し、二か所に同時に出現しました。"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/json/monsters/LIXA_monsters.json
msgid "titanic eigenspectre"
msgid_plural "titanic eigenspectres"
msgstr[0] "巨大アイゲンスペクトル"

#. ~ Description of monster "titanic eigenspectre"
#: data/json/monsters/LIXA_monsters.json
msgid ""
"There is somehow more of this figure than the others.  Every side of every "
"surface is on display, but each of those seems like the thin edge of a "
"larger shape.  There is an eternity here, where a scientist used to be."
msgstr ""
"この物体は、どういう訳か似たような他の物体よりも大きいサイズです。あらゆる人体部位のあらゆる面が同時に表出していますが、一つ一つがより大きく、薄く尖っているように見えます。かつて科学者が存在していた場所に、今は永遠が存在しています。"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/json/monsters/LIXA_monsters.json
msgid "unfolded impossibility"
msgid_plural "unfolded impossibilities"
msgstr[0] "展開された不可能物体"

#. ~ Description of monster "unfolded impossibility"
#: data/json/monsters/LIXA_monsters.json
msgid ""
"This is the entirety of the infinite chamber you are in, which perfectly "
"contains itself.  If you look very closely, you might see yourself looking "
"back.  You are sure that at any other time, seeing this would crack your "
"brain like an eggshell.  But you understand it just fine right now.  And you"
" can see it breathing."
msgstr ""
"これは、今立っている無限回廊の全てであり、一部でもあります。目を凝らせば、振り返ってこちらを見ている自分自身が見えるかもしれません。別の状況でこんなものと対峙したら、きっと脳が卵の殻のように砕けてしまうでしょう。しかし、今は何故か存在を理解できます。しかも、こいつは呼吸しているようです。"

#. ~ Description of special attack of monster "unfolded impossibility"
#: data/json/monsters/LIXA_monsters.json
#, c-format
msgid "The %s rapidly rearranges the coordinates of the infinite chamber."
msgstr "%sが無限回廊の座標を素早く変化させました。"

#. ~ Monster message of special attack of monster "unfolded impossibility"
#: data/json/monsters/LIXA_monsters.json
#, c-format
msgid ""
"The %s rearranges the parts of itself you occupy, dilating them around you."
msgstr "%sが無限回廊の座標を素早く変化させ、付近に出現しました。"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/json/monsters/bird.json
msgid "flying bird abstract"
msgid_plural "flying bird abstracts"
msgstr[0] "汎用飛翔鳥類"

#. ~ Description of monster "flying bird abstract"
#: data/json/monsters/bird.json
msgid ""
"This is an abstract monster for other flying birds to copy from, so that we "
"have some common foundation to work with.  If it appears in the game that's "
"a bug.  Use this when your bird can fly, but cannot swim."
msgstr ""
"飛行能力をもつ鳥類を作成する際の共通のコピー元となる汎用的なモンスターです。通常は生成されません。飛行能力があり水泳能力がない鳥に適用します。"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/json/monsters/bird.json
msgid "flightless bird abstract"
msgid_plural "flightless bird abstracts"
msgstr[0] "汎用非飛翔鳥類"

#. ~ Description of monster "flightless bird abstract"
#: data/json/monsters/bird.json
msgid ""
"This is an abstract monster for other flightless birds to copy from, so that"
" we have some common foundation to work with.  If it appears in the game "
"that's a bug.  Use this when your bird can neither fly nor swim."
msgstr ""
"飛行能力をもたない鳥類を作成する際の共通のコピー元となる汎用的なモンスターです。通常は生成されません。飛行能力か水泳能力がない鳥に適用します。"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/json/monsters/bird.json
msgid "water bird abstract"
msgid_plural "water bird abstracts"
msgstr[0] "汎用水鳥"

#. ~ Description of monster "water bird abstract"
#: data/json/monsters/bird.json
msgid ""
"This is an abstract monster for other water birds to copy from, so that we "
"have some common foundation to work with.  If it appears in the game that's "
"a bug.  Use this when your bird can both fly and swim."
msgstr "水鳥を作成する際の共通のコピー元となる汎用的なモンスターです。通常は生成されません。飛行能力も水泳能力もある鳥に適用します。"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/json/monsters/bird.json
#: data/mods/TropiCataclysm/monsters/tropical_bird.json
msgid "brown chick"
msgid_plural "brown chicks"
msgstr[0] "ひな鳥(茶色)"

#. ~ Description of monster "brown chick"
#: data/json/monsters/bird.json
msgid ""
"A tiny darkly-colored chick, it could be from a number of different species."
msgstr "暗い羽色の小さなひな鳥です。様々な種が混血している可能性があります。"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/json/monsters/bird.json
msgid "grey chick"
msgid_plural "grey chicks"
msgstr[0] "ひな鳥(灰色)"

#. ~ Description of monster "grey chick"
#: data/json/monsters/bird.json
msgid ""
"A tiny dull-colored chick, it could be from a number of different species."
msgstr "くすんだ色の小さなひな鳥です。様々な種が混血している可能性があります。"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/json/monsters/bird.json
msgid "waterfowl chick"
msgid_plural "waterfowl chicks"
msgstr[0] "ひな鳥(水鳥)"

#. ~ Description of monster "waterfowl chick"
#: data/json/monsters/bird.json
msgid ""
"A tiny yellow and brown waterfowl chick, it could be from a number of "
"different species."
msgstr "黄色と茶色が混じった模様の、小さな水鳥のひなです。様々な種が混血している可能性があります。"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/json/monsters/bird.json
msgid "chicken"
msgid_plural "chickens"
msgstr[0] "ニワトリ"

#. ~ Description of monster "chicken"
#: data/json/monsters/bird.json
msgid ""
"A domesticated descendant of junglefowl, it may still be the most numerous "
"bird in the world.  Before the Cataclysm, it was raised by humans as a "
"source of meat, eggs, and early morning wakeup calls."
msgstr ""
"家畜化したヤケイの子孫であるニワトリは、今なお世界で最も生息数が多い鳥かもしれません。大変動前は肉や卵、早朝の目覚ましの供給源として人間に飼育されていました。"

