msgid "Nevermind."
msgstr "なんでもない。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/TALK_TRUE_FOODPERSON.json
msgid "This is no place for a civilian.  You should go to the refugee center."
msgstr "ここは民間人のための施設じゃない。避難センターへ行くべきだな。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/TALK_TRUE_FOODPERSON.json
msgid "Damn!"
msgstr "畜生！"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/TALK_TRUE_FOODPERSON.json
msgid "Well… You seem like a decent sort, I might have an offer for you."
msgstr "そうだな...君はまともな奴のようだ。少し手伝ってもらおうかな。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/Kindred/NPC_Brigitte_LaCroix.json
#: data/json/npcs/TALK_TRUE_FOODPERSON.json
#: data/json/npcs/isolated_road/isolated_road_jay_dialogue.json
#: data/json/npcs/robofac/robofac_intercom/robofac_intercom.json
#: data/mods/DinoMod/NPC/NC_BO_BARONYX.json
msgid "I'm listening."
msgstr "ふむ。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/TALK_TRUE_FOODPERSON.json
msgid "Sorry but I work alone."
msgstr "悪いけど、一人で行動したいんだ。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/TALK_TRUE_FOODPERSON.json
msgid "We could really use your help!"
msgstr "手伝ってもらえると助かるんだけどなぁ！"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
#: data/json/npcs/TALK_TRUE_FOODPERSON.json
msgctxt "u:f"
msgid "What about: you prove your worth and join me as my sidekick?"
msgstr "自分の価値を証明し、私の助手になってくれるのか？"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
#: data/json/npcs/TALK_TRUE_FOODPERSON.json
msgctxt "u:m"
msgid "What about: you prove your worth and join me as my sidekick?"
msgstr "自分の価値を証明し、私の助手になってくれるのか？"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
