msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
"I don't even <swear> know anymore.  I have no <swear> idea what is going on."
"  I'm just doing what I can to stay alive.  The world ended and I bungled "
"along not dying, until I met you."
msgstr ""
"<swear>、何も分からない。<swear>、見当もつかないよ。生き延びるためにできることをやってるだけさ。世界は滅んだが、少なくとも今までは生きてこられた。"

