#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/gung_ho_1.json
msgid ""
"Okay, y'know, I'm honestly gonna stop ya there.  Who gives a rat's ass?  I "
"won't waste a second of time on thinkin' about that."
msgstr "いや、正直言って話したくないね。どうでもよくないか？そんなこと話すのは時間の無駄だ。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/gung_ho_1.json
msgid "Seriously?  You must have some idea."
msgstr "そう？興味深い話が聞けると思ったんだけど。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/gung_ho_1.json
msgid ""
"What difference does it make?  Why waste brain cells on that?  I'm a finely "
"tuned killing machine.  Point me at the zombies and I'll do my thing.  I "
"don't want to get up in it, and find something that takes the magic out of "
"it."
msgstr ""
"そんな話を聞いてどうする？どうして下らない話で脳細胞を浪費しなきゃならないんだ？私はいわば完璧に整備された殺戮兵器。ゾンビと戦うことさえできれば、それで十分だ。余計なストーリーを付け加えるなんて、夢を覚ますような真似は止めてほしいね。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/gung_ho_1.json
msgid "I see.  <done_conversation_section>"
msgstr "分かった。<done_conversation_section>"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/gung_ho_1.json
msgid "I see.  <end_talking>"
msgstr "分かった。<end_talking>"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/gung_ho_2.json
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
"Oh, you know.  Blah blah blah, had a job and a life, everyone died.  Boo "
"hoo.  I gotta be straight with you though: I honestly think I like this "
"better.  Fighting for survival every day?  I've never felt so alive.  I've "
"killed hundreds of those bastards.  Sooner or later one of them will take me"
" out, but I'll go down knowing I did something actually important."
msgstr ""
"ああ、分かりきった事だろう。皆なんやかんやあって、仕事や生活をして、最後には死ぬ。やれやれ。君には率直な意見を話しておこう。私はこれまでの世界より今の世界が好きだ。生きるために毎日戦うだろ？これほど生を実感できたことはないね。化け物どもを何百体も殺したよ。遅かれ早かれそいつらに殺されることになるだろうけど、本当に大事なものが何なのか理解して死ねるだろうな。"

