#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/gung_ho_2.json
msgid ""
"We-e-e-ell now, that's a fun one.  I haven't got a single solid idea, you "
"know?  But whatever made it start, I think the goop is behind it all."
msgstr ""
"えぇーっと、そうだな、面白いことを聞くね。これだって答えは一つも思いつかない。でも、どんなきっかけで始まったにせよ、その背後にはあのドロドロがあると思う。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/gung_ho_2.json
msgid "The goop?  What do you mean?"
msgstr "ドロドロ？どういうこと？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/gung_ho_2.json
msgid "What are your other ideas?"
msgstr "他にはどんな考えがある？"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/gung_ho_2.json
msgid ""
"Those zombies are just spitting it.  Goop, black tarry stuff coming out "
"their eyes and nose and mouth.  Whatever it is, it's what's making them walk"
" again.  Somehow doesn't seem to be too contagious, I got tons of it on me… "
"still not a zombie.  And then there are those goopy monsters around, "
"whatever they are, I think they're connected.  Maybe they're behind it, or "
"maybe they're something else caused by the same stuff.  Dunno, but mark my "
"words: it's the goop."
msgstr ""
"ゾンビが吐き出すドロドロだ。目や鼻や口から、黒い泥みたいなのが出てるだろう。正体は分からないが、あれが死体を動かしてる。あれ自体に伝染性はないらしい。大量に付着したけど...まだゾンビになってないからな。辺りにいるドロドロりのモンスターには、何らかの関連性がある。裏に親玉がいるとか、それか、皆同じ原因があるのかも。ともかく、詳しく知らないが、全部ドロドロのせいだ。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/gung_ho_2.json
msgid ""
"Is all this just based on the goop from zombies being black and slimy, like "
"the black slimes?"
msgstr "それって、ゾンビから出る粘液が黒くてドロドロしていて、スライムのモンスターみたいに見えるって根拠だけで言ってるのか？"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/gung_ho_2.json
msgid ""
"You got any better ideas?  Besides, not like there's any teacher checkin' "
"our work.  Maybe I'm wrong, don't really give a shit.  But the zombies and "
"those slime things showed up about the same time, and they both have this "
"connection to black goo, so I'm stickin' to my guns."
msgstr ""
"他にいい考えがあるか？それに、答え合わせしてくれる先生なんてどこにもいない。確かに間違ってるかもしれないけど、細かいことはいいだろ。でも、ゾンビとあのスライムは同じ時期に現れたんだ。あの黒いドロドロには何かがある。自分の直感に従って言ってるだけさ。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/gung_ho_2.json
msgid ""
"Oh, probably the same stuff everyone's thinking.  No special ideas.  Like, "
"maybe this is some kind of military superweapon gone wrong.  Or maybe the "
"world just is like this every so often, and that's what killed the "
"dinosaurs.  Who knows."
msgstr ""
"ああ、皆が思いつきそうなことならね。特別すごい考えじゃない。例えば、ある種の最新軍事兵器の運用に失敗したとか。あるいは、世界は結構な頻度で滅茶苦茶になっていて、恐竜の絶滅もこんな感じだったとか。真相は誰にも分からないよ。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/gung_ho_2.json
#: data/mods/innawood/npcs/Backgrounds/gung_ho_2.json
msgid "What were you saying about goop?"
msgstr "ドロドロについての考えをもう一度聞かせて？"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/gung_ho_3.json
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
"Well y'see, I'm not from these parts at all.  I was driving up from the "
"South to visit my son when it all happened.  I was staying at a motel when a"
" military convoy passed through and told us to evacuate to a FEMA shelter."
msgstr ""
"ええと、全部は話さないからな。事が起こった時、私は南部から車に乗って息子のもとを訪ねるところだった。モーテルで過ごしていると、通りがかった軍用車からFEMAの避難所へ向かうよう指示されたんだ。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
