#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/hospital_2.json
msgid ""
"Yeah, fat chance I'm giving up that kind of personal information to someone "
"I barely know.  What are you trying to pull?"
msgstr "おいおい、ほとんど他人のような人にそんな個人情報を渡すなんて、とんでもない。何を企んでいるんだ？"

