#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/prepper_1.json
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/Rural-Cowboy_Nihilist.json
#: data/mods/innawood/npcs/Backgrounds/prepper_1.json
msgid "What happened to you?"
msgstr "それからどうなったんだ？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/prepper_1.json
#: data/mods/innawood/npcs/Backgrounds/prepper_1.json
msgid "What about your shelter?"
msgstr "シェルターは今どうなっているんだ？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/prepper_1.json
msgid ""
"You said you could tell me more about the shelter if I wanted.  How did "
"these things get built?"
msgstr "シェルターについて詳しく教えてくれると言っていたな。どうやって作ったんだ？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/prepper_1.json
msgid ""
"What do you think happened?  You must have some interesting theories on why "
"everything went to shit."
msgstr "世界に何が起きたと思う？何故こんな酷い事態になったのか、あなたは面白そうな理論を語ってくれそうだ。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/prepper_1.json
msgid ""
"Hey, uh…  I noticed you left a computer down in your shelter.  I didn't "
"intend to pry, but you said I could go through everything.  So, I read a "
"little of what you wrote.  You wanna talk about it?"
msgstr ""
"シェルターにコンピューターがあった。詮索するつもりはなかったが、好きに使っていいって話だったから、ついファイルを読んでしまった。詳しく話を聞かせてもらえないか？"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/prepper_1.json
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
"Our conference was at a retreat by a lake.  We all got the emergency "
"broadcast on our cells, but I was the only one to read between the lines and"
" see it for what it was: large scale bio-terrorism.  I wasn't about to stay "
"and find out who of my coworkers was a sleeper agent.  Although I'd bet "
"fifty bucks it was Lee.  Anyway, I stole the coordinator's pickup and headed"
" straight for my shelter."
msgstr ""
"その時は湖畔の建物で会議をしていたんだ。参加者の携帯電話から緊急放送が流れたけれど、放送の真意を理解していたのは私だけだろうな。そう、大規模バイオテロだ。その場に留まるつもりは全くなかったし、同僚の中にスパイが紛れている事も把握していた。リーという奴だ、50ドル賭けてもいい。ともかく、私は会議の司会者が乗っていたピックアップトラックを盗んで、まっすぐシェルターへと向かったんだ。"

