msgid ""
"I knew it…  This whole time.  It was all part of the plan.  The riots, the "
"storms…  You always had control…"
msgstr "分かってはいた...ずっと。すべて計画の一部だったんだろう。暴動も、混乱も...お前が裏でコントロールしていた..."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/prepper_1.json
msgid "Prepare to meet your end, <npc_name>.  *Attack <npc_name>.*"
msgstr "<npc_name>、最期を迎える準備をしろ。*<npc_name>を攻撃する*"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/prepper_1.json
msgid ""
"Yeah, listen, just keep your questions to yourself.  I don't trust you and "
"you shouldn't trust me, either."
msgstr "ああ、そうかい、もう金輪際あんたの声は聞きたくない。あんたのことは今後まったく信用しないし、こっちのことも信用しないでくれ。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/prepper_1.json
msgid "Sorry, I won't ask again."
msgstr "悪かった、もう妙なことは言わない。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/prepper_1.json
msgid "It IS a good place to stay safe.  Just don't go prying, okay?"
msgstr "確かに、今は安全に過ごせているようだな。妙な詮索はするなよ、分かったか？"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/prepper_1.json
msgid ""
"You think that's funny?!  Some of us watched the warning signs for years.  "
"All the news, all the violence and the secret plots…  Now the dead are "
"walking, reality itself is tearing apart, and you're making jokes like "
"that?!"
msgstr ""
"何が面白いんだ！？警告のサインを何年も見てきたんだ。ニュースや暴行事件、秘密の計画...今や死者が歩き始め、現実が壊れてきているのに、そんな下らない冗談を言うのか！？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/prepper_1.json
msgid "Yeah…?  I didn't realize it bothered you so much."
msgstr "ええっと...？そんなに怒るとは思わなかった、ごめん。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/prepper_1.json
msgid ""
"I marked the spot for you.  When you get there, pry off the metal above the "
"door and you'll see the special latch I made to keep thieves out.  I trust "
"you to make the right decisions."
msgstr ""
"目的地に印を付けておいた。シェルターのドアの上の金属部を動かすと、私が防犯対策で取り付けた特殊な掛け金が見える筈だ。君が正しい判断をしてくれると信じているよ。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/prepper_1.json
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
"I'd have to be absolutely <dumb> to give up the location of my stash to "
"someone I barely know.  For all I know you'd just kill me and take it all "
"for yourself!  Better luck next time, pal."
msgstr ""
"ほぼ他人のような奴に隠れ家を教えるなんて、途方もない<dumb>じゃないか。私を殺してシェルターを独り占めする気だろう！次はもっと上手くやることだな。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
