#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/prepper_1.json
msgid ""
"I think you might be right.  The government probably does have something to "
"do with it."
msgstr "その考えには一理ある。きっとアメリカ政府も何か関係しているんだろう。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/prepper_1.json
msgid ""
"[Spiritual] I feel like this could definitely be some kind of divine "
"punishment."
msgstr "[霊感] これは間違いなく、神罰だと思う。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/prepper_1.json
msgid ""
"Maybe the explanation is more scientific.  Zombies and flesh-eating monsters"
" only come from supervillains and gods in fiction."
msgstr "もしかしたら、科学的に説明できることかもしれない。ゾンビや人を襲う怪物なんて、フィクションの悪役や超越者からしか生まれない。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/prepper_1.json
msgid ""
"[US Marshal] I actually used to be a US Marshal, and there were crazy rumors"
" coming from all over back in the day.  A buddy of mine heard that China "
"built a portal to another dimension.  Or a time machine.  Someone else "
"claimed it was America who made it, and it was actually some kind of "
"doomsday device.  There was a lot of money getting sunk into the Department "
"of Energy, DARPA, military contractors…  We all knew something was up, but "
"it was impossible to say what."
msgstr ""
"[執行官] "
"私は以前連邦の執行官をしていたが、当時はあちこちでおかしな噂が流れていた。中国が異界に繋がるポータルやらタイムマシンやらを開発した、なんて話を同僚から聞いたこともある。いや、それを開発したのはアメリカだとか、いやいや、終末を引き起こす装置だとか、色々な噂があった。エネルギー省やDARPA、軍需産業に多額の予算が投入され...誰もが何かが起きる予兆を感じていたが、具体的に何が起きるのかは誰にも分からなかった。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/prepper_1.json
msgid ""
"[Hub 01 Ancillary] I have an idea what happened.  This might sound strange, "
"but I've been doing jobs for these people in a hidden bunker who gave me "
"some high-tech armor and told me our reality… 'broke' somehow.  That's why "
"those crazy portal storms keep happening.  They also told me it's probably "
"going to get worse."
msgstr ""
"[ハブ01別動隊] "
"何が起きたのか見当は付いている。おかしな奴だと思うかもしれないが、私は秘匿されたある集団に雇われているんだ。連中は私に、ハイテクな装甲を支給してくれた。そしてこう説明した。私たちが生きている現実世界が...「壊れた」んだって。そのせいでポータルの嵐が狂ったように発生し続けている。しかも、これから状況は更に悪化するらしい。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/prepper_1.json
msgid ""
"I met this woman who was… uh… obsessed with bones?  She said that since "
"<the_cataclysm>, the bones of living things 'hum' with some kind of special "
"power and that she wants to collect lots of them to either end the world or "
"save the world.  I'm honestly still not entirely clear how or what's "
"supposed to happen…  How about that idea?  Did THAT ever cross your mind?"
msgstr ""
"以前私は...なんというか...骨を、熱狂的に信奉する女性に会ったんだ。なんでも、<the_cataclysm>以来、生物の骨には特別な力が宿るようになって、骨をたくさん集めることで、世界を救うか終わらせるか選ぼうとしているらしい。正直、何がどうなってそんな事になるのか、さっぱり分からないけれど...この考えをどう思う？何か、思い当たる情報はないか？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/prepper_1.json
msgid ""
"Honestly, it's probably aliens.  I can't really think of another reasonable "
"explanation for all of this."
msgstr "正直言って、エイリアンの仕業としか言いようがない。これ以外に合理的な説明は思いつかないよ。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/prepper_1.json
msgid ""
"I don't think there's any explanation.  Sometimes bad things just happen."
msgstr "簡単に説明できるようなことじゃない。時には、最悪の事態が発生することもあるものだ。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/prepper_1.json
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
"That's what I'm saying!  Everything that's going on wouldn't be possible "
"without massive fuck-ups by people in power.  China has fusion reactors?  "
"Well, I've never seen it!  America sinks trillions and trillions of dollars "
"into secret military budgets with no explanation.  If you gave me a trillion"
" dollars and the brain of a bureaucrat, I bet I could completely fuck up "
"reality, too."
msgstr ""
"やっぱりそう思うか！権力者の大失態なくして、こんな事態はあり得ない。中国は核融合炉を持っているのか？いいや、見たこともない！アメリカは何兆ドル、何十兆ドルも機密軍事費に予算をつぎ込んでおいて、何の説明もしない。私だって一兆ドルと官僚の脳みそがあれば、現実世界を完全にめっちゃくちゃにしてしまうと思うね。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
