#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/prepper_1.json
msgid ""
"We should keep moving…  No sense dwelling on fate.  If those people are "
"right, then this is all we've got: survival."
msgstr "前に進み続けるしかない...運命に翻弄されてはいけない。その人たちの言ったことが正しいとして、私たちにできることは一つ。生き残ることだ。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/prepper_1.json
msgid ""
"Maybe.  I guess multiple things could be possible.  You really don't think "
"that there's someone or something behind this?  Someone who flew a little "
"too close to the sun?  Poked the beast?"
msgstr ""
"かもね。複数の要因が絡み合っているんだろう。しかし、この現状の背後に誰か、あるいは何かの思惑があるとは思わないのか？誰かが太陽に近づきすぎたのか？それとも獣を突いて起こしてしまったか？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/prepper_1.json
msgid ""
"I think it's possible, but ultimately unknowable.  What matters now is "
"survival and actually fighting the monsters that are trying to kill us.  We "
"shouldn't dwell on crazy theories."
msgstr ""
"可能性はあると思うけど、考えたって結局答えは分からない。今一番大事なのは生き延びること、そして現実世界で襲いかかってくる怪物に立ち向かうことだろう。おかしな理論に囚われてばかりじゃダメだ。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/prepper_1.json
msgid ""
"A Marshal, huh?  I could tell there was something a bit square about you.  "
"Or… round, I suppose, ha!  In my experience, when people at that level start"
" talking stuff like that, there's at least some truth to it."
msgstr ""
"へぇ、連邦の執行官？四角張った性格の理由はそれか。でも...体型は意外と、丸い、かもしれないな！これは経験則だけれど、そういう現場で流れる噂話には、少なくともいくつか真実が紛れているものなんだ。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/prepper_1.json
msgid ""
"I might not have 'real' authority anymore, and we might not have a real "
"'society', but it's still not nice to make fat jokes…"
msgstr "もう「本物」の権威なんてないだろうし、「社会」も消えてしまったかもしれない。でも、デブを揶揄するジョークは勘弁してもらいたいね..."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/prepper_1.json
msgid "They were talking a LOT in that time, that's for sure."
msgstr "噂話に明け暮れていたことは間違いないね。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/prepper_1.json
msgid ""
"High-tech armor?  And there's a whole group of them down in a bunker?  "
"Probably best to keep people like that on our good side.  What they're "
"saying seems to check out.  Reality does seem pretty fucked.  Kinda makes me"
" wonder how involved THEY were if they know all that, though."
msgstr ""
"ハイテク装甲？そんな集団が隠れ住んでいるのか？私たちの味方でいてくれると心強いね。その人たちの言うことには真実味がある。確かに、現実世界はもう滅茶苦茶だ。ただ、それほど詳しい人たちが元凶にどこまで関与していたのかは、気になるところだ。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/prepper_1.json
msgid ""
"I'm not sure yet.  It's suspicious, yes, but they seem to be nearly as "
"confused as we are about some things.  Almost like they're scared by what's "
"happened."
msgstr "まだよく分からない。確かに怪しい集団だけど、私たちと同じように混乱しているようだった。現状に怯えていたと言い換えてもいい。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/prepper_1.json
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
"She said it was… energy in bones?  Listen, I've heard a lot of crazy "
"bullshit in my time and that's up there, for sure.  And I don't see how "
"something like that explains all the crazy shit I've seen either.  But "
"collecting bones to… save the world?  Fuck it, give it a shot.  Maybe that's"
" something just YOU do, though.  I'm happy believing a lie if that's the "
"truth, I'll be honest."
msgstr ""
"骨に...力が宿る？今まで散々イカれた話を聞いてきたけど、これは記録更新かもしれないな。それに、そんな考え方で、私が見てきた様々な怪現象を説明できるとも思えない。しかし、骨を集めて...世界を救うだって？アホらしい、是非とも頑張ってもらいたいね。そんなものを信じてるのは君だけだろう。その女の話が真実だっていうなら、嘘をつかれ続けた方がまだマシだ。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
