#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/prepper_1.json
msgid ""
"I didn't say it was a SOLID theory, but maybe she's onto something.  This is"
" evil on a cosmic scale; I don't know how else to explain it.  Maybe she's "
"right.  Maybe the bones really are 'singing'."
msgstr ""
"確実に正しい理論だとは思っていないけど、彼女が何かを知っている可能性もある。宇宙規模の悪が潜んでいる。他にどう説明すればいいんだ。彼女の話は真実だ。きっと骨は本当に「歌っている」んだよ。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/prepper_1.json
msgctxt "u:f"
msgid ""
"I've been trying not to think about it, but you could be right.  The more "
"that I see, the less I can explain.  I don't know why humans would want "
"this, but if you're a brain-sucking alien, this is the place to be."
msgstr ""
"考えないようにしていたけれど、本当かもしれないな。色々な経験を積むほど、説明のつかない現象が増えていく。人間がこんなことを望むとは思えない。もし脳ミソが大好物のエイリアンだったら、確かに地球は楽園だと思うだろう。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
