msgid "I'm sorry, 'officer'.  I didn't write the book of cop jokes, you know."
msgstr "失礼しました、「お巡りさん」。私の警官ジョークはちょっと滑っていたようだな。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/prepper_1.json
msgid "Let's just keep moving.  We don't have time for this nonsense…"
msgstr "とにかく動き続けるしかない。こんな下らない話をしている暇があるなんて..."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/prepper_1.json
msgid ""
"That's always how it goes: someone knows someone else, they get drunk at "
"some Virginia wine party for rich elites, and suddenly state secrets are "
"leaking out.  'Oh, my Russian contacts got this covert intelligence'…  'My "
"secret Chinese spies think this crazy thing is happening'…  Sometimes they "
"know and sometimes they don't.  It's up to us to put the truth together."
msgstr ""
"誰が誰の知り合いかなんて、分かったものじゃないからね。金持ちのエリートが集まるバージニア州のワインパーティーで、酔っ払いが国家機密を漏らすなんてよくある話さ。「そういや、ロシアの情報筋が極秘情報を手に入れたんだ」とか...「子飼いの中国人スパイから妙な事件のことを聞いた」とか...その情報が当たっていることも、外れていることもある。真実を解明できるかは、私たち次第なんだ。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/prepper_1.json
msgid ""
"I'm tired of talking.  Let's get moving and put that truth together for "
"ourselves…"
msgstr "そろそろ話を聞くのも疲れてきた。真実を探しに行くとしよう..."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/prepper_1.json
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
"Scared?  Yeah, that's fair.  I wouldn't say it's a friendly world out here."
"  Still, it's best to be friends.  Anyone that prepared for the apocalypse "
"is probably armed to the teeth anyway."
msgstr ""
"怯えるだって？まあ、無理もないか。平和で楽しい世界なんて無いからね。でも、仲間を作っておくことは重要だ。世界の崩壊を予見していた集団なら、きっと完全武装が揃っているに違いない。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
