#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/OtherSurvivorStories/Lapin_01.json
msgid "Check out that cabin in the woods"
msgstr "森の中の小屋を調べる"

#. ~ Description of mission "Check out that cabin in the woods"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Check out that cabin in the woods"
#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/OtherSurvivorStories/Lapin_01.json
msgid "Maybe still a guy in a cabin in the woods."
msgstr "森の中の小屋にまだ生存者がいるかもしれません。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
