"Language is too weak to describe it.  You are too limited to understand "
"freedom yet.  What is mortality when time is a choice?  What is weakness "
"when limits are an illusion?  What is up when there is no down, wrong when "
"there is no right?"
msgstr ""
"それを表現するには、言語はあまりにも弱すぎます。あなたは有限であり、自由を理解することはできません。時間を自由に選べるなら、死とは何でしょうか？有限が幻想であるなら、弱さとは何でしょうか？下が無い世界の上、正しさが無い世界の誤りとは何でしょうか？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/EOC_talkers/portal_storm.json
msgid "Would such a thing even be me?"
msgstr "本当に私に可能性があるのだろうか？"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/EOC_talkers/portal_storm.json
msgid "Is a seed a tree?  Are you a fetus?  Growth is change."
msgstr "種子は樹木ですか？あなたは胎児ですか？成長とは変化です。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/EOC_talkers/portal_storm.json
msgid "What do you get out of this?"
msgstr "あなたに何の得がある？"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
#: data/json/npcs/EOC_talkers/portal_storm.json
msgctxt "u:f"
msgid ""
"There is no me.  I don't exist yet, but time is a lie.  The barriers are "
"weak and your presence is potent enough to reflect.  I am the you that said "
"yes."
msgstr ""
"私は存在しません。まだ、存在しませんが、時間とはまやかしです。障壁は弱く、あなたの存在は私を映し出すほどに強力です。私は、問いかけに合意したあなたです。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
#: data/json/npcs/EOC_talkers/portal_storm.json
