msgctxt "npc:m"
msgid ""
"I should be resting right now, this is my third straight shift.  Too many "
"people sick or hurt right now."
msgstr "これで三連勤、そろそろ休みたいね。でも、病気や怪我で人手が足りていない。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
#: data/json/npcs/campus/NPC_campus_guard_generic.json
msgctxt "npc:n"
msgid ""
"I should be resting right now, this is my third straight shift.  Too many "
"people sick or hurt right now."
msgstr "これで三連勤、そろそろ休みたいね。でも、病気や怪我で人手が足りていない。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/campus/NPC_campus_guard_generic.json
msgid ""
"I live for this stuff.  I'm not really big on books, so this is probably "
"what I'm best at here."
msgstr "まさに私の天職だよ。本があまり好きじゃないから、ここでの仕事の中では警備が一番得意だ。"

#. ~ Job description of "Guard" NPC class
#: data/json/npcs/campus/generic_class_definitions.json
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_staff/generic_class_definitions.json
msgid "I'm on a guard shift."
msgstr "警備の仕事をしている。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/campus/great_library_librarian_talk.json
msgid "*whispering.  \"Welcome back to the Library.\""
msgstr "*は小声で話しました。「また会いましたね、図書館へようこそ。」"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/campus/great_library_librarian_talk.json
msgid "*whispering.  \"Hello again.  Can I help you find something?\""
msgstr "*は小声で話しました。「また会いましたね。何かお手伝いが必要ですか？」"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/campus/great_library_librarian_talk.json
msgid "*whispering.  \"Hello.\""
msgstr "*は小声で話しました。「ごきげんよう。」"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/campus/great_library_librarian_talk.json
msgid "*waves and smiles.  \"Welcome fellow reader.\""
msgstr "*は手を振り、笑いました。「読書家の集いへようこそ。」"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/campus/great_library_librarian_talk.json
msgid "Hello, who are you?  This is a library, is it?"
msgstr "どうも、あなたは誰だ？ここは図書館なのか？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/campus/great_library_librarian_talk.json
msgid "Oh sorry, I'm not interested right now."
msgstr "ああ失礼、また後にしよう。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/campus/great_library_librarian_talk.json
#: data/json/npcs/godco/members/cook.json
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_staff/Smokes/free_merchant_shopkeep_talk.json
#: data/json/npcs/robofac/NPC_Cranberry_Foster.json
msgid "I wanted to talk."
msgstr "話がしたい。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/campus/great_library_librarian_talk.json
msgid "Let me see what you have."
msgstr "商品を見せてもらおう。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/campus/great_library_librarian_talk.json
msgid "Just saying hello."
msgstr "挨拶に寄っただけだ。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/campus/great_library_librarian_talk.json
msgid "Always glad to help another reader."
msgstr "読書家を手助けできることが何よりの喜びです。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/campus/great_library_librarian_talk.json
msgid "Never stop learning."
msgstr "常に学び続けましょうね。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/campus/great_library_librarian_talk.json
msgid "I just love books."
msgstr "読書は本当にいいものですね。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/campus/great_library_librarian_talk.json
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_staff/Smokes/free_merchant_shopkeep_talk.json
msgid "About other things…"
msgstr "他のことについて..."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/campus/great_library_librarian_talk.json
msgid "When will you have new material?"
msgstr "商品はいつ頃入荷する？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/campus/great_library_librarian_talk.json
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_staff/Smokes/free_merchant_shopkeep_talk.json
msgid "That's all for now.  Take care."
msgstr "これでよし。では、お元気で。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/campus/great_library_librarian_talk.json
msgid ""
"It can be hard to predict the way things are now, but I am expecting new "
"materials around <interval>."
msgstr "この状況で予測を立てるのは難しいですが、<interval>後にはご用意できるかと。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/campus/great_library_librarian_talk.json
msgid ""
"I am expecting some new materials <interval>, hopefully some good escapism."
msgstr "<interval>後には新しく入荷できる予定ですよ。よい気晴らしになれば幸いです。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/campus/great_library_librarian_talk.json
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_staff/Smokes/free_merchant_shopkeep_talk.json
msgid "Actually, I wanted to ask…"
msgstr "実は、聞きたいことがあって..."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/campus/great_library_librarian_talk.json
msgid "Thanks, I will make sure to check back."
msgstr "ありがとう、必ずまた来よう。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/campus/great_library_librarian_talk.json
msgid ""
"Before you ask, we can't lend out books anymore.  We've had too many stolen "
"and destroyed.  If you want to read something, either do it here or I will "
"need to sell it to you for something useful, like a book.  Oh, my name is "
"Elvira Fish, I run Circulations here.  I hope you learn something."
msgstr ""
"先にお伝えしておきますが、もう本の貸し出しは行っておりません。盗まれたり、破られたり、もうこりごりです。何かお読みになりたいなら、ここでお願いしますね。役に立ちそうな書籍は、販売もしていますよ。失礼、私の名前はエルビラ・フィッシュ。ここで蔵書管理をしております。本を学びにお役立てくださいね。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/campus/great_library_librarian_talk.json
msgid "Can you answer some questions for me?"
msgstr "いくつか質問してもいいか？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/campus/great_library_librarian_talk.json
msgid "Let me look at what you have."
msgstr "商品を見てみよう。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/campus/great_library_librarian_talk.json
msgid "I just want to browse.  See you."
msgstr "ちょっと覗いてみただけだ。さようなら。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/campus/great_library_librarian_talk.json
msgid "Of course, how can I help?"
msgstr "もちろん、どういったご質問ですか？"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/campus/great_library_librarian_talk.json
msgid "I would be happy to assist."
msgstr "喜んでお答えしますよ。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/campus/great_library_librarian_talk.json
msgid "Of course, please ask."
msgstr "もちろん、どうぞお聞きください。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/campus/great_library_librarian_talk.json
msgid "What questions do you have?"
msgstr "何かご質問が？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/campus/great_library_librarian_talk.json
msgid "You can't lend out books?  What kind of library is that?"
msgstr "本当に本を借りられないのか？そんな図書館があるのか？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/campus/great_library_librarian_talk.json
msgid "You want even more books?"
msgstr "もっと本が欲しくないか？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/campus/great_library_librarian_talk.json
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_staff/Smokes/free_merchant_shopkeep_talk.json
msgid "Who's in charge here?"
msgstr "ここの責任者は誰だ？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/campus/great_library_librarian_talk.json
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_staff/Smokes/free_merchant_shopkeep_talk.json
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_visitors/NPC_arsonist.json
msgid "Is there any way I can join your group?"
msgstr "あなたの組織に参加する方法はあるか？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/campus/great_library_librarian_talk.json
#: data/json/npcs/godco/members/NPC_Arturo_Maldonado.json
#: data/json/npcs/godco/members/NPC_Aunt_Theresa.json
#: data/json/npcs/godco/members/NPC_Chloe_Taylor_King.json
#: data/json/npcs/godco/members/NPC_Darryl_Johnstone.json
#: data/json/npcs/godco/members/NPC_Father_Greenwood.json
#: data/json/npcs/godco/members/NPC_Felicity_Powell.json
#: data/json/npcs/godco/members/NPC_Gemma_Johnstone.json
#: data/json/npcs/godco/members/NPC_Helena_Misinter.json
#: data/json/npcs/godco/members/NPC_Jeremiah_Weaver.json
#: data/json/npcs/godco/members/NPC_Julian_Ray.json
#: data/json/npcs/godco/members/NPC_Katherine_Weaver.json
#: data/json/npcs/godco/members/NPC_Kostas_Walsman.json
#: data/json/npcs/godco/members/NPC_Olwen_Powell.json
#: data/json/npcs/godco/members/NPC_Tom_Powell.json
#: data/json/npcs/godco/members/cook.json
#: data/json/npcs/godco/visitors/TALK_CARAVAN_MERCHANT_PREDATORY.json
#: data/json/npcs/lumbermill_employees/TALK_lumbermill_logger.json
#: data/json/npcs/random_encounters/free_merchant_caravans.json
#: data/json/npcs/random_encounters/refugee_caravans.json
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Aleesha_Seward.json
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Alonso_Lautrec.json
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Boris_Borichenko.json
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Dana_Nunez.json
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Fatima_Al_Jadir.json
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Garry_Villeneuve.json
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Guneet_Singh.json
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_John_Clemens.json
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Mandeep_Singh.json
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Mangalpreet_Singh.json
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Pablo_Nunez.json
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Rhyzaea_Johnny.json
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Uyen_Tran.json
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Vanessa_Toby.json
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_staff/Smokes/free_merchant_shopkeep_talk.json
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_visitors/NPC_visiting_scavenger.json
#: data/json/npcs/scrap_trader/scrap_trader.json
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/prepnet_dialogue.json
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/whately_generic_dialogue.json
msgid "What's your story?"
msgstr "あなたの話を聞かせて？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/campus/great_library_librarian_talk.json
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_staff/Smokes/free_merchant_shopkeep_talk.json
msgid "Have you heard anything about the rest of the world?"
msgstr "他の地域について何か話を聞いていないか？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/campus/great_library_librarian_talk.json
msgid "Actually, I need to head out."
msgstr "さて、そろそろ行かないと。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/campus/great_library_librarian_talk.json
msgid ""
"Some, here and there.  My responsibilities keep me here but I have spoken "
"with traveling merchants.  They thought we wanted guns and were confused "
"that we wished to trade books for books.  I must assume that most of the "
"other survivors are more violent and less scholarly."
msgstr ""
"ええまあ、色々と。私は責任者ですからここに留まっていますが、旅の商人たちとお話はできます。普段は銃などを売られている方々ですから、本を取り引きしましょうと伝えたら困惑されてしまいました。大抵の生存者は暴力を好み、知識に興味はないのですね。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/campus/great_library_librarian_talk.json
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_staff/Smokes/free_merchant_shopkeep_talk.json
msgid "Are there any other settlements around?"
msgstr "この近くに生存者の集落はないのか？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/campus/great_library_librarian_talk.json
#: data/json/npcs/campus/great_library_librarian_talk_fluff.json
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_staff/Smokes/free_merchant_shopkeep_missions.json
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_staff/Smokes/free_merchant_shopkeep_talk.json
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_staff/Smokes/free_merchant_shopkeep_talk_fluff.json
msgid "That's fine for now."
msgstr "今はその情報で十分だ。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/campus/great_library_librarian_talk.json
msgid ""
"Yes we are.  We still have some of our original collection, but far too much"
" of it was stolen or destroyed, and of course it was far from complete even "
"before.  Some of us go out to try and rebuild the collection from towns "
"nearby, but mostly we rely on people passing through like you.  We "
"especially want anything rare and hard to find."
msgstr ""
"ええ、もちろん。元々の蔵書も一部は残っていますが、大部分は盗まれたり破られたりしてしまい、以前の素晴らしい図書館からは程遠い状態です。近くの街で集めてこようとしている仲間もおりますが、ここの蔵書の充実は、あなたのような通りがかった方々が頼りです。特に希少本、稀覯本は歓迎しています。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/campus/great_library_librarian_talk.json
#: data/json/npcs/other/homeless/group_camp/TALK_homeless_broker.json
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_staff/Smokes/free_merchant_shopkeep_talk.json
#: data/json/npcs/robofac/robofac_ancilla_npcs/NPC_ANCILLA_DOCTOR.json
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_crop_overseer.json
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_foreman.json
msgid "I'll keep that in mind."
msgstr "覚えておくよ。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/campus/great_library_librarian_talk_fluff.json
msgid ""
"*frowning.  \"Listen, we are doing our best here.  Most of our original "
"staff is gone and people keep stealing and breaking things for no reason.  "
"We're just trying to protect some information for the future.\""
msgstr ""
"*は顔をしかめました。「よくお聞きください、私たち職員はここで最善を尽くしています。人手もどんどん減り、誰もが理由もなく物を盗んだり壊したりし続けています。私たちは、未来のために少しでも知識を守ろうとしているだけなのですよ。」"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/campus/great_library_librarian_talk_fluff.json
msgid "Okay, I'm sorry."
msgstr "分かった、申し訳ない。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/campus/great_library_librarian_talk_fluff.json
msgid "But why bother then?"
msgstr "どうしてわざわざそんな活動を？"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/campus/great_library_librarian_talk_fluff.json
msgid "*deep breath, tired smile.  \"How else can I help you?\""
msgstr "*は深くため息をつき、何とか笑顔を作りました。「他にご質問は？」"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/campus/great_library_librarian_talk_fluff.json
msgid ""
"*frowning, grimacing.  \"I don't know.  It's.  I can't talk about this right"
" now.\""
msgstr "*は顔をしかめました。「分かりません。ええ。今はその件についてはお話しできません。」"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/campus/great_library_librarian_talk_fluff.json
msgid "Of course, I'm sorry."
msgstr "そうか。悪いことを聞いた。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/campus/great_library_librarian_talk_fluff.json
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_staff/Smokes/free_merchant_shopkeep_talk_fluff.json
msgid "I should probably go."
msgstr "そろそろ行くよ。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/campus/great_library_librarian_talk_fluff.json
msgid "Oh.  Um.  I guess I like stories.  And quiet."
msgstr "あら。ええと。私はお話は好きですね。それから、静寂も。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/campus/great_library_librarian_talk_fluff.json
msgid "How did you end up here?"
msgstr "どうやってここにたどり着いたんだ？"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/campus/great_library_librarian_talk_fluff.json
msgid ""
"Oh, well I took a job here about a year before <the_cataclysm>, and I was "
"living alone when things got bad and I thought I might be safer here with "
"work friends.  My friends Beatrice and Ross and I got some supplies ready "
"and then more people started to join us.  And then it got bad.  But I think "
"that has settled down some now."
msgstr ""
"ええと、そうですね、<the_cataclysm>の一年ほど前に、ここに就職しました。情勢が不安定になった頃は一人暮らしだったので、同僚がいるここへ集まった方が安全だと思ったんです。仲のいいベアトリスとロスと共に物資を集め、更に多くの人が輪に加わり、そして最悪の事態を迎えました。でも、今は少し安定してきた気もしますね。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/campus/great_library_librarian_talk_fluff.json
msgid ""
"Oh.  Um.  I don't.  I don't think that makes sense right now.  I have enough"
" help here, and we.  Maybe when things are more settled but not now.  But "
"you might ask others if they need help."
msgstr ""
"ええと。ううん。ありませんね。今のところは、あまり有意義とも思えません。私も、私たちも、十分やっていけます。事態がもっと落ち着けば話は変わりますが、今は、ごめんなさい。でも、他にも助けを必要としている人はいる筈ですよ。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/campus/great_library_librarian_talk_fluff.json
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_staff/Smokes/free_merchant_shopkeep_talk_fluff.json
msgid "Another time, then."
msgstr "じゃあ、またの機会にするよ。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/campus/great_library_librarian_talk_fluff.json
msgid "I'm useful!  I have skills!"
msgstr "私は役に立つ筈だ！色々なスキルもある！"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/campus/great_library_librarian_talk_fluff.json
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_staff/Smokes/free_merchant_shopkeep_talk_fluff.json
msgid "Maybe I could change your mind…?~"
msgstr "これで心変わりしてくれたりは...？~"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/campus/great_library_librarian_talk_fluff.json
msgid ""
"Um.  Right, I guess you made it this far.  But.  Really I don't have "
"something right now.  But really if you could find some books to trade us "
"that would be great.  We really should be rebuilding the collection.  "
"Really.  Um."
msgstr ""
"ええと、はい、素晴らしいと思います。うーん。本当に、今は人を募れる段階ではないんです。ですが、取り引きで本を持ってきてくださるなら、それは歓迎します。まずは、蔵書の再構築が必要です。分かっていただけますか。ええ。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/campus/great_library_librarian_talk_fluff.json
msgid ""
"Um.  Well.  You shouldn't.  I shouldn't.  Um.  I don't.  Let's talk about "
"something else."
msgstr "ええと。うーん。止めてください。結構です。ええ。本当に。他にご質問があればどうぞ。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/campus/great_library_librarian_talk_fluff.json
msgid ""
"Yes, so I hear.  One trader I talked to said they have a whole market "
"somewhere with all kinds of useful things.  Not a lot of books though, it "
"sounds like."
msgstr ""
"ああ、そういえば。商人の一人が、あらゆる便利な商品が揃った大きな市場がどこかにあると言っていましたね。とは言え、書籍はそれほど置いていないようですが。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/campus/great_library_librarian_talk_fluff.json
msgid ""
"Trying to keep the library here in good order.  She's seen some hard times "
"recently and needs a lot of love.  Past that, well…I guess it would be good "
"to get the rest of the campus cleaned up.  That's what Jack wants to do but "
"we don't have any guns and we don't want to.  I know Callista wants to get "
"classes going again as soon as possible though I imagine we have some "
"problems with the academic interests of the students still with us and the "
"teachers we have left."
msgstr ""
"この図書館の良好な環境を維持できるよう、努めています。近頃は酷いことばかり起きていましたから、もっと愛を注いであげないと。一段落したら、次は...大学の他のエリアを片付けたいですね。ジャックが早く取り掛かりたいと言っていましたが、私たちは銃を持っていませんし、持ちたくもありません。カリスタはできるだけ早く講義を再開しようとしています。しかし、残された学生や教官たちが学業に関心を持てる状態かと問われると、難しい所です。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/campus/great_library_librarian_talk_fluff.json
msgid "You're really just going to keep going like nothing happened?"
msgstr "本当に、何事もなかったかのように再開できると思っているのか？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/campus/great_library_librarian_talk_fluff.json
msgid "I hope it works out for you."
msgstr "上手くいくことを願っている。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/campus/great_library_librarian_talk_fluff.json
msgid ""
"*frowning.  \"It's not.  I'm not saying nothing happened.  We lost a lot.  I"
" lost a lot.  We just need to go forward.  We need to put things back "
"together and help people.  That's why this place is here.  What else would "
"we do?  We can't give up too."
msgstr ""
"*は眉をひそめました。「違います。何事もなかったと言っている訳ではありません。私たちは多くを失いました。私個人もそうです。でも、前を向いて進むしかない。以前の暮らしを取り戻せるよう、人々を助けないと。それが、この場所の存在意義です。他に私たちができることなど無いでしょう？ここで諦めたくはないのです。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/campus/great_library_librarian_talk_fluff.json
msgid ""
"Oh, we did have a President, Mx. Rose.  As things were starting to get bad "
"they locked themself into the administrative building with all of the senior"
" staff.  It's a good thing too because that building is full of the dead "
"now, just like the rest except the library here.  For now everyone is still "
"trying to operate under the old library structure, so I guess I'm in charge "
"now as the most senior library staff left, though we have some survivors "
"here from the other buildings from other divisions.  Callista Rupp from "
"Academics is here, she taught physics.  I think she was at MIT for a while."
"  And Jack Springer from Facilities is here too, he's probably the only "
"really practical person here, very handy!  It was his idea to board up the "
"other buildings."
msgstr ""
"ええと、以前はローズ学長が責任者だったのですがね。あの方は事態が悪化し始めて早々に、幹部の皆さんと一緒に管理棟に籠ってしまって。でも、現在ここ以外の大学の施設は死者でいっぱいですから、どうなったかはお察しください。現時点では、以前からの図書館部門の制度を変えずに運営していますので、図書館長が出て行ってしまってからは、私が責任者ということになりますね。それから、他の棟の方も、何名か生き残っています。教育部門のカリスタ・ラップは物理学の教官です。確か、しばらくMITに所属していたんだったかしら。それから、施設部門のジャック・スプリンガー。少なくともここでは、実務に関して彼の右に出る者はいませんよ！他の棟を板張りしておくアイデアは、彼の発案なんです。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/civilians/civilians.json
msgid ""
"&You see this crazed fellows eyes darting around anxiously, always "
"anticipating impending doom.  Every now and then you can even hear them "
"whimper in fear.  Although they do not seem aggressive, they definitely are "
"out of their mind."
msgstr ""
"&狂気に満ちた目が落ち着きなく周囲を見回しており、いつ破滅を迎えてもおかしくない状態に見えます。時折、恐怖のあまりすすり泣くような呻き声を漏らしています。攻撃的ではなさそうですが、間違いなく精神的に限界を迎えています。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/civilians/civilians.json
msgid "You need to get to safety!"
msgstr "早く安全な場所に逃げろ！"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/civilians/civilians.json
msgid "[Awkwardly distance yourself.]"
msgstr "[そっとしておく。]"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/civilians/civilians.json
msgid "&They shriek and stumble backwards, as if you just became a threat."
msgstr "&まるで化け物にでも出くわしたかのように、悲鳴を上げて後ずさりしました。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/civilians/civilians.json
msgid "I'm gonna kill all these <swear> things!"
msgstr "<swear>、全部殺してやる！"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/civilians/civilians.json
msgid "&They let out a bellowing warcry and wave their stick."
msgstr "&雄叫びを上げ、手にした棒を振り回しています。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/civilians/civilians.json
msgid "I'M INVINCIBLE!"
msgstr "私は無敵だ！"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/civilians/civilians.json
msgid "Are you crazy?  Get out of here!"
msgstr "気は確かか？ここから逃げろ！"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/civilians/civilians.json
msgid "[Leave them to their futile fight.]"
msgstr "[無意味な戦いを放っておく。]"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/civilians/civilians.json
msgid "Like hell I will!"
msgstr "絶対に動くもんか！"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/civilians/civilians.json
msgid "Fuck that, I'm not going out like a coward!"
msgstr "クソっ、びびって逃げ出したりはしない！"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/civilians/civilians.json
msgid "Stand aside citizen, I'll handle this!"
msgstr "一般人は退いてろ、私が何とかする！"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/civilians/civilians.json
msgid "Don't worry, I'm with the police<punc>"
msgstr "心配ない、私は警察の人間だ<punc>"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/civilians/civilians.json
msgid ""
"&The officer scans the area, looking for trouble.  They have a dangerous "
"glint in their eyes."
msgstr "&警官は辺りをじっくり見回し、異常がないか探しています。その目は爛々と輝いており、危うさを感じます。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/civilians/civilians.json
msgid "[Back away.]"
msgstr "[立ち去る。]"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/civilians/civilians.json
msgid ""
"&They are still breathing but unable to move and speak.  You are unsure if "
"they are even fully conscious and yet shudder at the thought of being "
"trapped inside your body."
msgstr ""
"&まだ呼吸していますが、動くことも話すこともできません。意識が完全に覚醒しているかどうかも分かりませんが、この状況で身動きが取れないことを思うとぞっとします。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/civilians/civilians.json
msgid "[Leave them to their ultimate fate.]"
msgstr "[できることは何もない。]"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/civilians/civilians.json
msgid "No!  I just know it, they are still alive!"
msgstr "そんなことはない！私にはわかる、あの子はまだ生きてる！"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/civilians/civilians.json
msgid "[Let them keep on searching.]"
msgstr "[捜し続けさせる。]"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/civilians/civilians.json
msgid "Have you seen my child?"
msgstr "私の子供を見なかった？"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/civilians/civilians.json
msgid "I am not leaving without my little one!"
msgstr "かわいいあの子を置いていけない！"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/civilians/civilians.json
msgid "Where is my kid?"
msgstr "私の子供はどこだ？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/civilians/civilians.json
msgid "Your child is likely dead by now and you should get to safety!"
msgstr "あなたの子供は多分もう助からない。安全な場所へ逃げたほうがいい！"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/common_chat/TALK_COMMON_ALLY.json
msgid "No, just <swear> no…"
msgstr "やめろ、おい<swear>  やめろ..."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/common_chat/TALK_COMMON_ALLY.json
msgid "Just let me sleep, <name_b>!"
msgstr "眠らせてくれないか、 <name_b>！"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/common_chat/TALK_COMMON_ALLY.json
msgid "Make it quick, I want to go back to sleep."
msgstr "まだ眠いんだ、すぐにでも寝直したいよ。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/common_chat/TALK_COMMON_ALLY.json
msgid "Just few minutes more…"
msgstr "あと5分..."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/common_chat/TALK_COMMON_ALLY.json
msgid "Anything to do before I go to sleep?"
msgstr "寝入る前にやっておくことでもあるのか？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/common_chat/TALK_COMMON_ALLY.json
msgid "Wake up!"
msgstr "起きろ！"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/common_chat/TALK_COMMON_ALLY.json
msgid "Go back to sleep."
msgstr "寝ていて構わない。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/common_chat/TALK_COMMON_ALLY.json
msgid ""
"This character was previously put into a suspension state due to an AI bug."
"  If you have reason to believe the problem was fixed, you can wake them up."
"  Do you want to do that now?"
msgstr ""
"このキャラクターは、AIのバグにより一時停止状態になっていました。問題が間違いなく修正されたと確信できる場合のみ、一時停止状態を解除してください。解除しますか？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/common_chat/TALK_COMMON_ALLY.json
msgid "Yes, wake up!"
msgstr "ああ、解除して構わない！"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/common_chat/TALK_COMMON_ALLY.json
msgid "No, go back to sleep."
msgstr "いいや、停止状態のままにしておこう。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/common_chat/TALK_COMMON_ALLY.json
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/TALK_COMMON_OVERRIDES.json
msgid " *pshhhttt* I'm reading you boss, over."
msgstr "...ザザザザ...ちゃんと聞こえているよ、どうぞ。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/common_chat/TALK_COMMON_ALLY.json
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/TALK_COMMON_OVERRIDES.json
msgid "What is it, friend?"
msgstr "何だい、友よ？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/common_chat/TALK_COMMON_ALLY.json
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_main_dialogue.json
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/luo_follower.json
msgid "[rules] Let's talk about how we'll work together."
msgstr "[行動規則] 仲間としてのルールについて話そう。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/common_chat/TALK_COMMON_ALLY.json
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_main_dialogue.json
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/luo_follower.json
msgid "I'd like to know a bit more about your abilities."
msgstr "あなたの能力についてもっと詳しく知りたい。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/common_chat/TALK_COMMON_ALLY.json
msgid "Please go to this location."
msgstr "この場所へ向かってほしい。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/common_chat/TALK_COMMON_ALLY.json
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_main_dialogue.json
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/luo_follower.json
msgid "There's something I want you to do."
msgstr "やってほしいことがある。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/common_chat/TALK_COMMON_ALLY.json
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_main_dialogue.json
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/luo_follower.json
msgid "I just wanted to talk for a bit."
msgstr "ちょっと話がしたくなった。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/common_chat/TALK_COMMON_ALLY.json
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_main_dialogue.json
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/luo_follower.json
msgid "Can you help me understand something?  (HELP/TUTORIAL)"
msgstr "色々と教えてもらえないか？(ヘルプ/チュートリアル)"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/common_chat/TALK_COMMON_ALLY.json
msgid "[DEBUG MIND CONTROL] Now listen closely… (DEBUG FUNCTIONS)"
msgstr "[態度デバッグ] よく聞いて...(態度の値を編集)"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/common_chat/TALK_COMMON_ALLY.json
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_main_dialogue.json
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/luo_follower.json
msgid "I'm going to go my own way for a while."
msgstr "これからはあなたと離れて別の道を行こうと思っている。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/common_chat/TALK_COMMON_ALLY.json
msgid ""
" *tshk* Are you serious?  This isn't a cell phone.  Can it wait until we're "
"in the same place?"
msgstr "*ザザッ* 冗談だろ？これは携帯電話じゃないんだ。直接会った時にしてくれないか？"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/common_chat/TALK_COMMON_ALLY.json
msgid "Sure, what did you want to say?"
msgstr "分かったよ、何の話だ？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/common_chat/TALK_COMMON_ALLY.json
msgid "Mind if we just chat for a bit about your history?"
msgstr "あなたの過去について話してもらえないか？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/common_chat/TALK_COMMON_ALLY.json
msgid "Let's just chitchat for a while, I could use some relaxation."
msgstr "気分転換に、少し雑談でもしようか。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/common_chat/TALK_COMMON_ALLY.json
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/luo_follower.json
msgid "I changed my mind, wanted to ask you something else."
msgstr "気が変わった、他に聞きたいことがある。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/common_chat/TALK_COMMON_ALLY.json
msgid "I'm all ears, my friend."
msgstr "友よ、ちゃんと聞いてる。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/common_chat/TALK_COMMON_ALLY.json
msgid "You gonna give me orders?"
msgstr "何か指示を出してくれるのか？"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/common_chat/TALK_COMMON_ALLY.json
msgid "What would you like?"
msgstr "用事は何だ？"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/common_chat/TALK_COMMON_ALLY.json
msgid "Just say the word."
msgstr "詳しく言ってくれ。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/common_chat/TALK_COMMON_ALLY.json
#: data/json/npcs/godco/members/NPC_Olwen_Powell.json
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_main_dialogue.json
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/luo_follower.json
msgid "Can you teach me anything?"
msgstr "何か教えてもらえないか？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/common_chat/TALK_COMMON_ALLY.json
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_main_dialogue.json
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/luo_follower.json
msgid "Can you host a training seminar?"
msgstr "訓練セミナーを開いてもらえないか？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/common_chat/TALK_COMMON_ALLY.json
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_main_dialogue.json
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/luo_follower.json
msgid "I have something to teach you."
msgstr "私が何か教えよう。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/common_chat/TALK_COMMON_ALLY.json
msgid "Let's trade items"
msgstr "アイテムの取引をしよう。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/common_chat/TALK_COMMON_ALLY.json
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_main_dialogue.json
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/luo_follower.json
msgid "Hold on to this item."
msgstr "アイテムを所持してほしい。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/common_chat/TALK_COMMON_ALLY.json
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_main_dialogue.json
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/luo_follower.json
msgid "Guard this position."
msgstr "この場所を見張ってほしい。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/common_chat/TALK_COMMON_ALLY.json
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_main_dialogue.json
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/luo_follower.json
msgid "Find a horse and mount up!"
msgstr "ウマを探して騎乗してほしいんだ！"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/common_chat/TALK_COMMON_ALLY.json
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_main_dialogue.json
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/luo_follower.json
msgid "Drop off any items you're not using."
msgstr "使わないアイテムは置いてほしい。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/common_chat/TALK_COMMON_ALLY.json
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_main_dialogue.json
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/luo_follower.json
msgid "Get off your mount, please."
msgstr "ウマから降りてほしい。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/common_chat/TALK_COMMON_ALLY.json
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_main_dialogue.json
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/luo_follower.json
msgid "Let's talk about your current activity."
msgstr "あなたの現在の行動について話そう。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/common_chat/TALK_COMMON_ALLY.json
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_main_dialogue.json
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/luo_follower.json
msgid "Let's talk about the camp."
msgstr "拠点について話そう。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/common_chat/TALK_COMMON_ALLY.json
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_main_dialogue.json
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/luo_follower.json
msgid "Change your martial arts style."
msgstr "あなたの戦闘スタイルを変えてほしい。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/common_chat/TALK_COMMON_ALLY.json
msgid "Why should I teach you?"
msgstr "どうして教えなきゃならないんだ？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/common_chat/TALK_COMMON_ALLY.json
msgid "Come on, we're friends."
msgstr "いいじゃないか、友達だろう。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/common_chat/TALK_COMMON_ALLY.json
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_main_dialogue.json
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/luo_follower.json
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/npcs/dialogue/follower_dialogue.json
msgid "Forget it, let's get going."
msgstr "その話は忘れて、もう行こう。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/common_chat/TALK_COMMON_ALLY.json
msgid "Why should I host a training seminar?"
msgstr "どうして訓練セミナーを開く必要があるんだ？"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/common_chat/TALK_COMMON_ALLY.json
msgid "You're really leaving?"
msgstr "本当に離脱するのか？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/common_chat/TALK_COMMON_ALLY.json
msgid "Yeah, I'm sure.  Bye."
msgstr "ああ、本気だ。さようなら。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/common_chat/TALK_COMMON_ALLY.json
msgid "Nah, I'm just kidding."
msgstr "いや、ただの冗談だ。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/common_chat/TALK_COMMON_ALLY.json
msgid "Please go to this location…"
msgstr "この場所へ向かってほしい..."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/common_chat/TALK_COMMON_ALLY.json
msgid "Stay at your current position."
msgstr "その場に留まれ。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/common_chat/TALK_COMMON_ALLY.json
msgid "I'm currently <current_activity>."
msgstr "私は現在、<current_activity>をしている。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/common_chat/TALK_COMMON_ALLY.json
msgid "I'm not doing much currently."
msgstr "私は現在は特に何の行動もしていない。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/common_chat/TALK_COMMON_ALLY.json
msgid "I meant what are your goals?"
msgstr "あなたの目標は？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/common_chat/TALK_COMMON_ALLY.json
msgid "Carry on."
msgstr "現在の行動を続けろ。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/common_chat/TALK_COMMON_ALLY.json
msgid "Please stop your current activity."
msgstr "現在の行動を中断してほしい。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/common_chat/TALK_COMMON_ALLY.json
msgid "Please sort out some of these items nearby."
msgstr "付近にあるアイテムを分類してほしい。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/common_chat/TALK_COMMON_ALLY.json
msgid "Please do any construction work that you can."
msgstr "建設区域へ行って建設作業をしてほしい。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/common_chat/TALK_COMMON_ALLY.json
msgid "Please do any mining work that you can."
msgstr "掘削作業をしてほしい。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/common_chat/TALK_COMMON_ALLY.json
msgid "Please go mop the area."
msgstr "拭取区画の液体を拭き取ってほしい。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/common_chat/TALK_COMMON_ALLY.json
msgid "Please study from a book."
msgstr "本を読んで学習してほしい。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/common_chat/TALK_COMMON_ALLY.json
msgid "Please study from an e-book."
msgstr "電子書籍で学習してほしい。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/common_chat/TALK_COMMON_ALLY.json
msgid "Please study from books you have in order."
msgstr "あなたが今所持している本で学習してほしい。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/common_chat/TALK_COMMON_ALLY.json
msgid "Please start deconstructing any vehicles in a deconstruction zone."
msgstr "車両解体エリアにある車両を全て解体してほしい。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/common_chat/TALK_COMMON_ALLY.json
msgid "Please start repairing any vehicles in a repair zone."
msgstr "車両修理エリアにある車両を修理してほしい。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/common_chat/TALK_COMMON_ALLY.json
msgid "Please chop logs into planks."
