#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/godco/members/NPC_Zachary_Montes.json
msgid "Don't worry, I'm not going to hurt you."
msgstr "心配するな、攻撃したりしない。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/godco/members/NPC_Zachary_Montes.json
msgid ""
"I got here first, therefore this place belongs to me.  Them's the rules in "
"the <the_cataclysm>."
msgstr "私が最初にここに来た。だからこの場所は私のものだ。それが<the_cataclysm>後のルールだろ。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/godco/members/NPC_Zachary_Montes.json
msgid "Now that's an archaic belief.  I'll see you around."
msgstr "古臭いルールだな。それじゃあ、また。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/godco/members/NPC_Zachary_Montes.json
msgid ""
"I ain't leaving, <name_g>.  Not until you or someone else has checked out "
"that nightmare for me."
msgstr "私はここを離れないぞ、<name_g>。誰かがあの悪夢について調べてくれるまでは。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/godco/members/NPC_Zachary_Montes.json
msgid "Thanks, <name_g>.  I sure owe you one."
msgstr "ありがとう、<name_g>。借りができたな。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/godco/members/NPC_Zachary_Montes.json
msgid ""
"I ain't leaving, <name_g>.  Not until that eldritch screeching nightmare is "
"dead 'n buried."
msgstr "私は絶対にここを離れないぞ、<name_g>。あの不気味な金切り声の悪夢が消え去るまではな。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/godco/members/NPC_Zachary_Montes.json
msgid "What nightmare?"
msgstr "悪夢とは？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/godco/members/NPC_Zachary_Montes.json
msgid "I'll see you around then."
msgstr "また今度。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
#: data/json/npcs/godco/members/NPC_Zachary_Montes.json
msgctxt "u:f"
msgid ""
"That ain't the point here, chum.  Don'tcha get it?  This was MY territory, "
"but they took it away from me.  Now they think of us as nothin' but a "
"<swear> nuisance."
msgstr ""
"お前、そんなことはどうでもいいだろ。分からないのか？ここは私の縄張りだったのに、奴らに奪われたんだ。今や厄介者としか思われてない、<swear>。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
