#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/godco/members/NPC_Zachary_Montes.json
msgid ""
"No chance!  Its not you, its the world out there I'm worried about.  All "
"those <swear> monsters really give me the creeps, and as far as I know this "
"church is the last bastion of humanity in the <the_cataclysm>."
msgstr ""
"無理だ！私が怖いのはあんたじゃない、外の世界だ。<swear>、化け物だらけで、動けやしない。<the_cataclysm>以来、この教会が人間の最後の砦なんだ。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/godco/members/NPC_Zachary_Montes.json
msgid "That's understandable."
msgstr "分かるよ。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/godco/members/cook.json
msgid ""
"Could you be on your way, please?  We don't take kindly to sinners like you."
msgstr "頼むから、他のところへ行ってもらえないか？罪人に分け与える慈悲はないよ。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/godco/members/cook.json
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_staff/Smokes/free_merchant_shopkeep_talk.json
msgid "Hello again.  What do you need?"
msgstr "また会ったな。何か用か？"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/godco/members/cook.json
msgid "*waves you over.  \"Hey <u_name>.  How's it going for you?\""
msgstr "*は手を挙げて挨拶しました。「やあ、<u_name>。調子はどうだい？"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
