msgid "Really, I haven't heard anything about it.  What's it you need?"
msgstr "何だ、そんな話は聞いていない。何が要るんだ？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/godco/visitors/TALK_CARAVAN_GUARD_PREDATORY.json
msgid "The boss wants your accounting papers, I need them."
msgstr "ボスが取引帳簿を見せろと言っている。渡してもらおう。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/godco/visitors/TALK_CARAVAN_GUARD_PREDATORY.json
msgid "Oh nothing, I must have the wrong person."
msgstr "ああ、何でもない。人違いだったみたいだ。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/godco/visitors/TALK_CARAVAN_GUARD_PREDATORY.json
msgid "They're not ready yet, you'll have to come back later."
msgstr "まだ出来上がってないから、また後で来てもらおうか。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/godco/visitors/TALK_CARAVAN_GUARD_PREDATORY.json
msgid "I'll just take them as is, thanks.  Everything can be finalized later."
msgstr "途中でもいい、今受け取ろう。仕上げはその後で構わない。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/godco/visitors/TALK_CARAVAN_GUARD_PREDATORY.json
msgid "We both know that's a lie.  Hand them over, or else."
msgstr "分かり切った嘘を言わなくてもいい。すぐに渡さないと、どうなるだろうな。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/godco/visitors/TALK_CARAVAN_GUARD_PREDATORY.json
msgid "Could I get them for a price?"
msgstr "金を支払ったら渡してもらえるか？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/godco/visitors/TALK_CARAVAN_GUARD_PREDATORY.json
msgid "When will they be ready?"
msgstr "いつ完成する？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/godco/visitors/TALK_CARAVAN_GUARD_PREDATORY.json
msgid "Okay, see ya."
msgstr "分かった、また今度。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
#: data/json/npcs/godco/visitors/TALK_CARAVAN_GUARD_PREDATORY.json
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid "I told you already, I'm not finished with them, come back later."
msgstr "言った筈だが、まだ出来てない。後で来てくれ。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
#: data/json/npcs/godco/visitors/TALK_CARAVAN_GUARD_PREDATORY.json
msgctxt "npc:m"
msgid "I told you already, I'm not finished with them, come back later."
msgstr "言った筈だが、まだ出来てない。後で来てくれ。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
#: data/json/npcs/godco/visitors/TALK_CARAVAN_GUARD_PREDATORY.json
msgctxt "npc:n"
msgid "I told you already, I'm not finished with them, come back later."
msgstr "言った筈だが、まだ出来てない。後で来てくれ。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/godco/visitors/TALK_CARAVAN_GUARD_PREDATORY.json
msgid ""
"Just two more days is all I need with them, then the boss can do whatever.  "
"Is that good?"
msgstr "2日もあれば十分だ。その後はボスが好きに確認すればいい。それでいいか？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/godco/visitors/TALK_CARAVAN_GUARD_PREDATORY.json
msgid "Alright, I'll be back then."
msgstr "分かった、また今度。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/godco/visitors/TALK_CARAVAN_GUARD_PREDATORY.json
msgid "No, I need them now."
msgstr "駄目だ、今すぐ必要だ。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/godco/visitors/TALK_CARAVAN_GUARD_PREDATORY.json
msgid ""
"I don't know what the hell you want them for, but I sure don't care.  Take "
"'em, <name_b>."
msgstr "何でこんなもの欲しがってるのか知らないが、勝手にすりゃいいさ。もってけ、<name_b>。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/godco/visitors/TALK_CARAVAN_GUARD_PREDATORY.json
msgid "Thanks, <name_b>."
msgstr "ありがとう、<name_b>。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/godco/visitors/TALK_CARAVAN_GUARD_PREDATORY.json
msgid "How much are you thinking?"
msgstr "いくら支払える？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/godco/visitors/TALK_CARAVAN_GUARD_PREDATORY.json
msgid "Does $5 sound good?"
msgstr "5ドルでどうだろう？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/godco/visitors/TALK_CARAVAN_GUARD_PREDATORY.json
msgid "How about $20?"
msgstr "20ドルくらい？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/godco/visitors/TALK_CARAVAN_GUARD_PREDATORY.json
msgid "I'll give you $50, my best offer."
msgstr "50ドル支払う。太っ腹だろう。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/godco/visitors/TALK_CARAVAN_GUARD_PREDATORY.json
msgid ""
"*holds their abdomen as they nearly keel over from laughter.  \"You better "
"be glad that I think you're funny, anyone else would find it an insult.  "
"$150 is more like it to me."
msgstr ""
"*は腹を抱えて笑い始めました。「お前、コメディアンの才能あるよ。他の奴にその金額を言ったら、バカにしてると思われるだろうな。150ドル、これが適正価格だ。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/godco/visitors/TALK_CARAVAN_GUARD_PREDATORY.json
msgid "Alright, here it is."
msgstr "分かった、どうぞ。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/godco/visitors/TALK_CARAVAN_GUARD_PREDATORY.json
msgid "I don't take kindly to your jokes, <name_b>.  Hand 'em over or else."
msgstr "その冗談はあまり面白くない、<name_b>。さっさと渡せ、さもなくばどうなるだろうな。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/godco/visitors/TALK_CARAVAN_GUARD_PREDATORY.json
msgid ""
"*seems to get lost in thought for a moment, before looking back at you.  "
"\"Alright, you have a deal."
msgstr "*はしばらく考え込み、やがてこちらに向き直りました。「よし、契約成立だ。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/godco/visitors/TALK_CARAVAN_GUARD_PREDATORY.json
msgid "Pleasure doing business."
msgstr "ビジネスってのはいいもんだな。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/godco/visitors/TALK_CARAVAN_GUARD_PREDATORY.json
msgid ""
"*seems to get lost in thought for a moment, before looking back at you.  "
"\"Nah, I think $150 would be a better price."
msgstr "*はしばらく考え込み、やがてこちらに向き直りました。「いいや、150ドル支払ってもらおう。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/godco/visitors/TALK_CARAVAN_GUARD_PREDATORY.json
msgid "How about I don't give you any money instead?  Hand 'em over or else."
msgstr "びた一文支払わないって選択はどうだろう。さっさと渡せ、さもなくばどうなるだろうな。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
#: data/json/npcs/godco/visitors/TALK_CARAVAN_GUARD_PREDATORY.json
msgctxt "u:f"
msgid "Ah, a rich man I see.  I think you have yourself a deal."
msgstr "いやぁ、本当に太っ腹だねぇ。交渉成立だ。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
#: data/json/npcs/godco/visitors/TALK_CARAVAN_GUARD_PREDATORY.json
msgctxt "u:m"
msgid "Ah, a rich man I see.  I think you have yourself a deal."
msgstr "いやぁ、本当に太っ腹だねぇ。交渉成立だ。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
#: data/json/npcs/godco/visitors/TALK_CARAVAN_GUARD_PREDATORY.json
msgctxt "u:n"
msgid "Ah, a rich man I see.  I think you have yourself a deal."
msgstr "いやぁ、本当に太っ腹だねぇ。交渉成立だ。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/godco/visitors/TALK_CARAVAN_GUARD_PREDATORY.json
msgid "Sounds great to me."
msgstr "いい取り引きができた。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/godco/visitors/TALK_CARAVAN_GUARD_PREDATORY.json
msgid "I think you can go a bit higher, $150 and the records are yours."
msgstr "ちょっと足りないな、150ドルは支払ってもらわないと、帳簿は渡せないね。"

#. ~ NPC makes sound in effect in EoC "EOC_BRIBE_20_FALSE_EFFECT"
#. ~ NPC makes sound in effect in EoC "EOC_BRIBE_50_FALSE_EFFECT"
#. ~ NPC makes sound in effect in EoC "EOC_BRIBE_150_FALSE_EFFECT"
#: data/json/npcs/godco/visitors/TALK_CARAVAN_GUARD_PREDATORY.json
msgid "Come back later when you have the money, then we'll talk."
msgstr "金が用意出来たらまた来い。話はそれからだ。"

#. ~ NPC makes sound in effect in EoC "EOC_BRIBE_LATER_TRUE_EFFECT"
#: data/json/npcs/godco/visitors/TALK_CARAVAN_GUARD_PREDATORY.json
msgid "A pleasure doin' business with you."
msgstr "いい取り引きができたな。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/godco/visitors/TALK_CARAVAN_MERCHANT_PREDATORY.json
msgid ""
"Well well well, another traveler.  Don't try anything suspicious, you're "
"outnumbered here and we're well armed, and my boss will know what happens "
"soon enough."
msgstr ""
"おやおやおや、旅の方だね。くれぐれも迂闊な真似はするなよ。ここではあんたの方が数で不利だ。こっちには武器もある。うちのボスもすぐ異変に気付くぞ。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/godco/visitors/TALK_CARAVAN_MERCHANT_PREDATORY.json
#: data/json/npcs/random_encounters/free_merchant_caravans.json
msgid "Are you threatening me?"
msgstr "それは脅しなのか？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/godco/visitors/TALK_CARAVAN_MERCHANT_PREDATORY.json
#: data/json/npcs/random_encounters/free_merchant_caravans.json
msgid "What's your deal here?"
msgstr "ここで何をしているんだ？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/godco/visitors/TALK_CARAVAN_MERCHANT_PREDATORY.json
#: data/json/npcs/random_encounters/free_merchant_caravans.json
msgid "I won't try anything if you don't.  Just passing through."
msgstr "通りがかっただけだ。そちらが何もしてこないなら、手は出さないよ。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/godco/visitors/TALK_CARAVAN_MERCHANT_PREDATORY.json
#: data/json/npcs/militia/GM_Militia_Merchant.json
#: data/json/npcs/random_encounters/free_merchant_caravans.json
msgid "Do you have anything to trade?"
msgstr "何か取り引きできる物資はある？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/godco/visitors/TALK_CARAVAN_MERCHANT_PREDATORY.json
msgid "Your prices seem awfully high."
msgstr "価格が高過ぎる気がする。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/godco/visitors/TALK_CARAVAN_MERCHANT_PREDATORY.json
#: data/json/npcs/random_encounters/free_merchant_caravans.json
msgid "Nothing much.  Just passing through."
msgstr "いいや。通りがかっただけだ。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/godco/visitors/TALK_CARAVAN_MERCHANT_PREDATORY.json
#: data/json/npcs/random_encounters/free_merchant_caravans.json
msgid ""
"No, not at all.  Just being cautious.  You know how it gets out here.  We're"
" not looking for trouble.  In fact, if you've got anything worthwhile, maybe"
" we could do a little trading."
msgstr ""
"いやいや、滅相もない。用心に越したことはないということさ。ここがどこか知らない訳じゃないだろう？トラブルはご免だよ。もし何か売れそうなものを持っているなら、取り引きしてもいい。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/godco/visitors/TALK_CARAVAN_MERCHANT_PREDATORY.json
#: data/json/npcs/random_encounters/free_merchant_caravans.json
msgid "Sure, let's trade."
msgstr "ああ、取り引きしよう。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/godco/visitors/TALK_CARAVAN_MERCHANT_PREDATORY.json
#: data/json/npcs/random_encounters/free_merchant_caravans.json
msgid "That suits me fine.  I'll be on my way."
msgstr "いや、結構。もう失礼するよ。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
#: data/json/npcs/godco/visitors/TALK_CARAVAN_MERCHANT_PREDATORY.json
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
"I'm a businessman, and business is my game.  I came out here to help these "
"poor, poor people who are doing without in such a bad time."
msgstr "こっちは商売人だ。商売が生業だよ。私がここへ来たのは、こんな厳しい時代に少ない物資をやりくりしてる、気の毒な人らを助けるためなんだから。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
