#. ~ Unique name of a male NPC
#. ~ A naked prisoner, from the isherwood faction trapped in a horrifying
#. cage, watching horrible things happen.
#. ~ Name of an NPC class
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Barry_Isherwood.json
msgid "Barry Isherwood"
msgstr "ﾊﾞﾘｰ ｲｼｬｰｳｯﾄﾞ"

#. ~ Job description of "Barry Isherwood" NPC class
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Barry_Isherwood.json
msgid "Missing member of the Isherwood family."
msgstr "行方不明になっていたイシャーウッド家の人間だ。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Barry_Isherwood.json
msgid ""
"*crouches on the bottom of his cell, shivering, then looks up as you "
"approach.  He blinks a few times, then stands up.  He's totally nude, and "
"his tanned body is covered in tiny, precise-looking scars of varying ages.  "
"\"I can't believe my eyes.  Please get me outta here…\""
msgstr ""
"*は独房の隅にうずくまって震えていましたが、近寄ると顔を上げ、何度か瞬きしてから立ち上がりました。衣服は身に付けておらず、日焼けした肉体のあちこちに小さな傷跡が残っています。「信じられない。頼む、ここから出してくれ..."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Barry_Isherwood.json
msgid "Are you Barry Isherwood?"
msgstr "あなたがバリー・イシャーウッドか？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Barry_Isherwood.json
msgid "I'll get you out of here, just stay calm.  Let's hit the road."
msgstr "落ち着いて。あなたを助けに来たんだ。さあ行こう。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Barry_Isherwood.json
msgid "I'm Luke Skywalker, I'm here to rescue you."
msgstr "ルーク・スカイウォーカーです。助けに来ました。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Barry_Isherwood.json
msgid "You just hold tight here for a second."
msgstr "気を確かに、少しここで待っていてほしい。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Barry_Isherwood.json
msgid ""
"What?\"  The naked, traumatized man stares at you blankly, as though he'd "
"never seen Star Wars, which is clearly ridiculous.  \"Rescue me?  Yes, oh "
"please yes!"
msgstr ""
"はぁ？」トラウマを抱えた全裸の男性は、まるで「スター・ウォーズ」を一度も見たことがないかのように、ぽかんとした顔でこちらを見ています。「助けてくれるんだな？ああ、頼むよ！"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Barry_Isherwood.json
msgid "Okay then, your family's outside.  Let me go get them."
msgstr "よし分かった。外にいるあなたの家族に知らせてこよう。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Barry_Isherwood.json
msgid "Hang on.  I've got questions."
msgstr "ちょっと待った。聞きたいことがある。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Barry_Isherwood.json
msgid "Just hold on a little longer, okay?"
msgstr "もう少しそこで待っていてもらえないか？"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Barry_Isherwood.json
msgid ""
"*gulps.  \"I sure as hell am.  Did my family send you?  Please, we gotta go."
"  There are more of those things.  They're everywhere.\""
msgstr "*は頷きました。「ああ、そうだ。私の家族から頼まれたのか？助けてくれ、早く逃げないと。奴らはあちこちにいる。どこにでもいるんだ。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Barry_Isherwood.json
msgid "Yeah, they did, I'll go get them."
msgstr "そのとおり、あなたの家族に頼まれた。知らせてこよう。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Barry_Isherwood.json
msgid "Yeah, Chris did, we're taking you home."
msgstr "そのとおり、クリスに頼まれた。家まで連れて行こう。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Barry_Isherwood.json
msgid ""
"*switches, abruptly, to pure white-hot rage.  \"DOES THIS LOOK LIKE A TIME "
"FOR FUCKING QUESTIONS?\"  He stops, shaking, and returns to how he was "
"before.  \"I'm sorry.  I'm so sorry.  Oh god, I'm sorry.  I need to get out "
"of here.\""
msgstr ""
"*は突然、激高しました。「そんなクソ下らん質問をしてる暇があるのか？」そこで彼は言葉を切り、震え、元の状態に戻りました。「悪かった。悪かったよ。本当にすまない。ここから出ないと。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Barry_Isherwood.json
msgid "Okay, me too, let's go."
msgstr "いや、私も悪かった。さあ行こう。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Barry_Isherwood.json
msgid "All right, we're leaving, but you better not test me again."
msgstr "分かった、出発しよう。私を試すような態度は止めてもらいたいね。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Barry_Isherwood.json
msgid "Okay, me too.  I'll go get your family."
msgstr "いや、私も悪かった。あなたの家族に知らせてこよう。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Barry_Isherwood.json
msgid ""
"All right, we're leaving, but you better not test me again.  I'll be back "
"with your family."
msgstr "分かった、出発しよう。私を試すような態度は止めてもらいたいね。あなたの家族を連れてまた戻ってくる。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Barry_Isherwood.json
msgid "Pff.  If you're gonna treat me like that, you can stay here."
msgstr "ふーん。そんな態度を取るなら、これからもここで過ごせばいい。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Barry_Isherwood.json
msgid "Let's get back to the farm, as fast as possible."
msgstr "出来るだけ早く、農場に戻ろう。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Barry_Isherwood.json
msgid "What farm?"
msgstr "その農場はどこにある？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Barry_Isherwood.json
msgid ""
"That shouldn't take long, your family's outside waiting.  I'll be back with "
"them."
msgstr "それほど時間は掛からない。あなたの家族が外で待っている。一緒に行こう。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Barry_Isherwood.json
msgid ""
"That shouldn't take long, I brought some of your family with me.  Let's get "
"you home."
msgstr "それほど時間は掛からない。あなたの家族が外で待っている。家まで連れて行こう。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Barry_Isherwood.json
msgid ""
"\"Oh, so my family didn't send you then.\"  Barry looks downtrodden for a "
"brief moment.  \"Look, we just need to get out of here first, I'll tell you "
"about it later.\""
msgstr ""
"「ああ、それじゃあ、私の家族に頼まれたわけじゃないのか。」バリーは一瞬落ち込んだ表情を浮かべました。「とにかく、まずはここから脱出しないと。後で話そう。」"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Barry_Isherwood.json
msgid "Okay, sounds good to me.  Let's go."
msgstr "ああ、それがいい。行こう。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Barry_Isherwood.json
msgid "Sorry about the Luke Skywalker joke."
msgstr "急にスター・ウォーズのジョークなんか言って、悪かった。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Barry_Isherwood.json
msgid "Hey buddy, feel like talking about what you saw in that tower?"
msgstr "やあ友よ、あの塔で何を見たのか話してもらえないか？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Barry_Isherwood.json
msgid "What farm were you going to tell me about earlier?"
msgstr "さっき言っていた農場とはどこのことだ？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Barry_Isherwood.json
msgid ""
"I've thought about it some more, and I'd like to have the directions to your"
" farm."
msgstr "よく考えてみたら、農場までの道順を教えてもらわないといけない。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Barry_Isherwood.json
msgid ""
"Maybe let's talk about you a little bit.  What's your role in this family?"
msgstr "あなたの身の上について少し話が聞きたい。一家の中で、あなたはどんな立場？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Barry_Isherwood.json
msgid "Alright, let's get going."
msgstr "よし、行こう。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Barry_Isherwood.json
msgid ""
"Come on, let's get out of here while we still can.  I don't want to spend "
"any longer around here then we need too."
msgstr "いや、足が動くうちにここから離れた方がいい。ここには長居したくないんだ。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Barry_Isherwood.json
msgid "*lights up as you approach, but also looks wary.  \""
msgstr "*は明るい表情を見せましたが、警戒もしているようです。「"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Barry_Isherwood.json
msgid "Hey, Jedi.\""
msgstr "やあ、ジェダイ。」"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Barry_Isherwood.json
msgid "Hey, <name_g>.\""
msgstr "やあ、<name_g>。」"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Barry_Isherwood.json
msgid "I can't wait to get back home and see everyone.\""
msgstr "家に帰って皆の顔を見るのが待ちきれない。」"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Barry_Isherwood.json
msgid "*nods.  \"Of course, what'd you want to ask?\""
msgstr "*は頷きました。「もちろん、何が聞きたいんだ？」"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Barry_Isherwood.json
msgid ""
"Yeah, I think we need to talk about it, but I'm not ready yet.  Let me "
"reclaim my life for a while."
msgstr "ああ、話さなきゃダメだとは思うけど、まだ覚悟ができていない。自分を取り戻すまで、少し時間がほしい。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Barry_Isherwood.json
msgid "Sounds good, Barry."
msgstr "それもそうだな、バリー。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Barry_Isherwood.json
msgid ""
"*laughs.  \"It was terrible timing, but I have to admit, you don't see many "
"situations that perfect for that reference.  Sorry I didn't get it at the "
"time.\""
msgstr ""
"*は笑いました。「ジョークを言うタイミングとしては最悪だったが、あれほどぴったりな状況は滅多に無いからな。上手く返事できなかったのが悔しいね。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Barry_Isherwood.json
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_staff/NPC_free_merchant_teamster.json
msgid "Can I ask you some questions?"
msgstr "いくつか聞いてもいいか？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Barry_Isherwood.json
msgid "Well, I should head out."
msgstr "さて、そろそろ行こう。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Barry_Isherwood.json
msgid ""
"It's still a bit fresh, but okay.  Yeah.  Let me sit down first.\"  Barry "
"takes a seat, his hands shaking even at the prospect of discussing the tower"
" and the things he saw.  \"What should we talk about?"
msgstr ""
"まだ少し生々しく感じるが、大丈夫だ。よし。ちょっと座らせてくれ。」バリーは座り込みました。塔のことや目撃したものについて話そうとすると、手が震えるようです。「何を話そうか？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Barry_Isherwood.json
msgid "What happened to you in there?"
msgstr "あの場所で何が起きたんだ？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Barry_Isherwood.json
msgid "On second thought, I think you should recover more."
msgstr "止めておこう、もう少し回復を待った方がいい。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Barry_Isherwood.json
msgid ""
"*shivers, though the room is warm, and moves his mouth wordlessly for a few "
"seconds.  \"It's hard to remember details.  The air in that place messes "
"with your brain, makes it all feel like some kind of dream.  Makes it so you"
" can't fight back.  Not that I could have anyway.\"  He stares into space "
"for a moment, then swallows hard.  \"They cut into me, over and over.  I "
"don't think they took anything out.  They just opened me up, poked around.  "
"I was awake for all of it, as awake as for anything else.  Sometimes I felt "
"pain, other times they did something to me so I could feel it but it didn't "
"hurt.  There were big, pale ones that did the cutting.\"  His voice gets "
"increasingly detached as he speaks, and his shaking grows worse.  You're not"
" sure it would be wise for him to go further."
msgstr ""
"*は口を動かし、数秒後にやっと声を発しました。身体は気温とは無関係に震えています。「細かく思い出すのは難しい。あの場所の空気のせいで頭が混乱して、まるで夢を見ているようだった。戦う気も起きなかった。まあ、戦うなんて土台無理だったと思うが。」彼はしばらく虚空を見つめ、ゴクリと唾を飲みました。「奴らは私を、何度も何度も、切り裂いた。何か切除されたりはしなかった、と思う。ただ切り裂いて、あちこちつつくんだ。その間私は、起きているときのような感じで、ずっと意識があった。時々痛みを感じたが、何か処置をされたせいか、痛くないこともあった。メスを入れるのは、大きくて青白い奴だ。」話が進むにつれて彼の口調はどこか他人事のようになり、震えは更に酷くなっています。これ以上話を続けさせていいものか、判断に迷います。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Barry_Isherwood.json
msgid "[Let him continue.]"
msgstr "[話を続けさせる]"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Barry_Isherwood.json
msgid "That's enough for now, Barry."
msgstr "ひとまずはそれで十分だ、バリー。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Barry_Isherwood.json
msgid ""
"*shudders, looking like he might vomit.  \"What did they want?  Why me?  "
"Every time, they'd put me back together again, seal it up and make it look "
"almost like nothing happened.\"  He yanks up his shirt to show the scars.  "
"\"But I know what happened, it was REAL, goddammit!\"  He drops the shirt, "
"bends forward, and dry heaves for a few seconds.  Wordless, he hides his "
"face in his hands, and stops responding."
msgstr ""
"*は吐き気をこらえ、震えています。「奴らは何がしたかったんだ？どうして私なんだ？奴らは私を切り刻んでは塞ぎ、ほとんど傷も残らないように治すんだ。」彼は着衣をたくし上げ、傷跡を見せました。「でも、何が起きたのかは分かってる。本当に起きたことなんだ、畜生！」シャツを掴んだ手を放してうずくまり、しばらくえずきました。それ以上は何も喋りません。手で顔を覆い、動かなくなりました。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Barry_Isherwood.json
#: data/json/npcs/robofac/NPC_Cranberry_Foster.json
#: data/json/npcs/robofac/robofac_intercom/robofac_intercom.json
msgid "[Leave.]"
msgstr "[立ち去る]"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Barry_Isherwood.json
msgid ""
"Yeah.  Yeah.\"  He takes a long, shaky breath.  \"Yeah, you're right.  This "
"isn't going anywhere good.  Claire's been talking about making some "
"dandelion wine,\" he says with a hollow smile.  \"Maybe I'll go see if she "
"needs help."
msgstr ""
"ああ。うん。」彼は震え、ため息をつきました。「そう、その通り。無理は良くないな。そういや、クレアがタンポポ酒を作りたいと言っていた。」虚ろな笑みを浮かべています。「何か手伝えることがないか、聞いてみるか。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Barry_Isherwood.json
msgid ""
"How about we change the subject instead?  What's your role in this family?"
msgstr "他の話題を話してみるのはどうだろう？あなたは一家の中でどういう立場なんだ？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Barry_Isherwood.json
msgid "Good idea."
msgstr "それがいい。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Barry_Isherwood.json
msgid ""
"&He wipes his hand across his face, tension leaving him as he runs his "
"fingers through his hair.  \"Yeah, okay.  To be honest, years ago I was the "
"black sheep.  Moved off the family farm, lived out in Bunyan.  Went to "
"college, thought I'd get a job in computers.\"  He shuffles in his chair, "
"smiling half-heartedly.  \"I did sysadmin stuff for a while, back when the "
"internet was fairly new.  Then my dad died.  Carlos and Jesse had just "
"gotten married, and at the time it looked like they might be getting some "
"land of their own, and Eddie was out finding himself.  My dad and I had "
"never got along, but Jack…\" he stops.  \"Sorry, I don't think you were "
"looking for my life story.  What did you ask, again?\""
msgstr ""
"&彼は顔を手で拭い、髪をかき上げました。少し緊張がほぐれたようです。「ああ、分かったよ。正直言って、昔の私は家族の中でも浮いていた。農場を飛び出して、バンヤンに移り住んだ。コンピュータ関連の仕事に就くことを目指して、大学で勉強していたんだ。」椅子に座り直し、曖昧な笑みを浮かべました。「インターネットがまだ新技術と言われてた頃、システム管理の会社に就職した。その後、父が亡くなった。カーロスとジェスは当時結婚したばかりで、他の土地に引っ越すかもと言っていた。エディはいつの間にか家を出ていた。父と私は元々仲のいい方ではなかったが、ジャックは...」彼はそこで言葉を切りました。「悪い、私の半生を聞きたい訳じゃないよな。ええと、質問は何だった？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Barry_Isherwood.json
msgid "No, go on."
msgstr "いや、その話を続けてほしい。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Barry_Isherwood.json
msgid "You're right.  I was asking something different."
msgstr "そうだ。他に聞きたいことがある。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Barry_Isherwood.json
msgid "It's okay, I'm going to head out."
msgstr "構わない、もう行くよ。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Barry_Isherwood.json
msgid ""
"Fair enough, you asked for it.\"  He stretches his arms out.  \"Jack and I "
"stayed close, even after my old man and I fell out, so when it looked like "
"he was going to be saddled with the entire farm to run, I took a good long "
"look at my life and realized I hated it.  It was never the farm I was trying"
" to get away from, you know?  I packed up my things, quit my job, and came "
"out to help Jack.  Never looked back.\"  He chuckles.  \"Damn hard finding a"
" partner for a guy like me out here though.  I was in a long-term "
"relationship when I left, but that fell apart.  I haven't been too lonely "
"though, I've got my people."
msgstr ""
"そう言うなら、続けよう。」彼は伸びをしました。「老いた父とは疎遠だったが、ジャックとはずっと仲が良かった。だから、彼が農場の経営を一手に引き受けさせられそうな状況になって、私はようやく自分自身を見つめ直し、本当に嫌ってたのは自分の生き方自体だと気付いたんだ。農場から逃げたからって何の解決にもならない、そうだろう？私は荷物をまとめ、仕事を辞め、ジャックを手伝うために戻って来た。後悔は無かったな。」そこまで話すと、笑顔になりました。「でも、ここで私のような人間が結婚相手を見つけるのはとても難しいんだ。その時長く交際していたパートナーとは、農場に戻ってから別れた。でも、孤独だとは思わない。家族がいるからな。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Barry_Isherwood.json
msgid ""
"[PER 9] Was your choice in partners part of the problem with your father?"
msgstr "[感覚 9] 交際のことも、あなたの父親との確執に関係していたんだな？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Barry_Isherwood.json
msgid "Thanks for taking the time to talk to me.  I had some other questions."
msgstr "詳しく話してくれてありがとう。他にも聞きたいことがある。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Barry_Isherwood.json
msgid "Thanks for the story, I'm going to head out."
msgstr "話してくれてありがとう、もう行くよ。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Barry_Isherwood.json
msgid ""
"&His eyebrows shoot up, briefly surprised, then he smiles.  \"You nailed it "
"in one.  Yeah, we're talking about a rural farmer in the nineties, here.  My"
" dad never understood me, even before he knew, and he did find out, although"
" I tried to keep the closet door closed.  Jack, though, he always saw me for"
" me.  Never let it change our relationship.  That's real love, and that's "
"what made me come back when he needed me.  Meanwhile, the man I thought I'd "
"marry, back in Bunyan, he couldn't be assed even to come out and see the "
"family farm, let alone think about moving here.  He was dead weight, and "
"I've never doubted that decision.\"  He shrugs.  \"There's folks like me "
"wherever you go, I've had a few relationships since then.  Just nothing that"
" stuck, and I'm okay with that.  If nothing else, it proved what I already "
"knew: aside from my old man, none of my family treated me or them any "
"different for it.  They're good people.\""
msgstr ""
"&彼は一瞬あっけにとられ、微笑みました。「ご明察。そう、これは90年代の田舎の農場の話だ。そもそも昔から、聞く耳を持つような人じゃなかった。だから、私は自分から秘密を打ち明けようとはしなかったが、結局気付かれた。逆にジャックは、いつも私のことを気に掛けてくれていた。私たち兄弟の関係が壊れることはなかった。それはそれとして、私が結婚を考えていた男は、ここへの引っ越しを考えることはおろか、農場を見に来ることすらせず、バンヤンに残った。梃子でも動こうとはしなかったし、私はその決断を尊重した。」彼は肩をすくめました。「どこだろうが私のような人間はいる。それ以来、何度か他の人と交際もしたが、特に進展はなかった。でもそれでいい。少なくとも、頑固な父を除く家族全員が、こういうことで私や交際相手を特別扱いするような人じゃないことを改めて知れたからな。それは、本当にありがたいことだ。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Barry_Isherwood.json
msgid ""
"Oh, yeah, now I remember.  That farm I was talking about is where I live, "
"almost the whole Isherwood family lives there, including me.  I just wanted "
"to get back home as fast as possible so I can see everyone again, and so "
"everyone knows that I'm okay."
msgstr ""
"ああ、そうだった、話すのを忘れていたな。私の言う農場というのは、自宅のことだ。私を含め、イシャーウッド家の者がそこに住んでいる。できるだけ早く家に帰って皆の顔が見たい。私が無事だと知らせなくては。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Barry_Isherwood.json
msgid "Can you give me some directions to it?"
msgstr "道順を教えてもらえるか？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Barry_Isherwood.json
msgid "That's pretty cool.  I'd like to ask you about something else."
msgstr "それはいいことだ。他にも聞きたいことがある。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Barry_Isherwood.json
msgid "I'm going to head out."
msgstr "そろそろ行かないと。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Barry_Isherwood.json
msgid ""
"Sure, can I please see your map?\"  Barry takes your map, orients himself, "
"and points out a route to the farm.  \"Once we've done that, I'll head on "
"myself so everyone won't be surprised by you coming.  Sound good?"
msgstr ""
"分かった、地図を見せてもらえるか？」バリーは地図を受け取り、自分の位置を確認すると農場への道順を示しました。「無事に着いたら、君のことを見て皆が警戒しないよう、私が先行しよう。それでいいか？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Barry_Isherwood.json
msgid "Sounds good to me, let's hit the road."
msgstr "それがいい、出発しよう。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Barry_Isherwood.json
msgid "I'd like to think about it some more."
msgstr "少し考えさせてほしい。"

#. ~ Mission name
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Barry_Isherwood.json
msgid "Return Barry to Isherwood's farm."
msgstr "バリーをイシャーウッド一家の農場に連れて行く"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Carlos_Isherwood.json
msgid "Hi, looks like you are building a forge setup."
msgstr "やあ。鍛冶場を作っているようだな。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Carlos_Isherwood.json
msgid "Hi, Jack and Claire suggested I come talk to you about a job."
msgstr "やあ、ジャックとクレアから話を聞いて、仕事について話しにきたんだ。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Carlos_Isherwood.json
msgid ""
"*is an older middle-aged man, well-muscled and darkly tanned, with worried "
"lines around the corners of his eyes and mouth.  He looks up as you get "
"close"
msgstr "*は筋肉質の中年男性です。黒く日に焼けており、目と口の周りの皺が不安げな表情を作っています。近寄るとこちらに目を向け"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Carlos_Isherwood.json
msgid ""
", and then puts his hand on the butt of the rifle slung across  his back.  "
"\"I see that badge, I think you need to keep on walking, straight off this "
"property.\""
msgstr "、背負っているライフルの銃床に手を掛けました。「バッジが見えたぞ、うちの敷地の外にさっさと出て行った方がいいんじゃないか。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Carlos_Isherwood.json
msgid ", then smiles distantly.  \"Hello Sir, what brings you here?"
msgstr "、わざとらしく笑いました。「ごきげんよう、サー。こちらへはどんな御用で？"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Carlos_Isherwood.json
msgid ", then smiles distantly.  \"Hello Ma'am, what brings you here?\""
msgstr "、わざとらしく笑いました。「ごきげんよう、マム。こちらへはどんな御用で？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Carlos_Isherwood.json
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Eddie_Isherwood.json
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Jesse_Isherwood.json
msgid "Yeah, I'm a Marshal, what are you going to do about it?"
msgstr "ああ、私は執行官だ。どうしてそんなことを言うんだ？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Carlos_Isherwood.json
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Chris_Isherwood.json
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Eddie_Isherwood.json
msgid "…[Leave.]"
msgstr "...[立ち去る]"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Carlos_Isherwood.json
msgid ""
"* glares at you, his hand moving again to his gun.  \"I see that badge, I "
"think you need to keep on walking, straight off this property.\""
msgstr "*はこちらを睨みつけ、再び銃に手を掛けました。「バッジが見えたぞ、うちの敷地の外にさっさと出て行った方がいいんじゃないか。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Carlos_Isherwood.json
msgid ""
"*rolls his eyes.  \"I'm not an idiot.  You think if you don't wear your "
"badge, I won't know who you're working for?  Get out of here.\""
msgstr "*は目を剥いて呆れました。「俺はバカじゃない。バッジを付けてなけりゃ誰の手下かバレない、なんて思ってるのか？さっさと出てけ。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Carlos_Isherwood.json
msgid ""
"Look, I took it off to show I'm not here as a marshal.  I'm just here as a "
"traveler, someone who can maybe help you out.  I know you've got problems "
"bigger than you can handle right now."
msgstr ""
"いいや、執行官としてここへ来た訳ではないことを示すために外したんだ。ここへは単に旅のついでに寄っただけだ。助けになれるかもしれない。あなたが対処できないような重大な問題を抱えていることは知っている。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Carlos_Isherwood.json
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Eddie_Isherwood.json
msgid "…(Leave)"
msgstr "...(立ち去る)"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Carlos_Isherwood.json
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Eddie_Isherwood.json
msgid "*looks up warily as you approach"
msgstr "*に近寄ると、こちらに警戒の目を向け"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Carlos_Isherwood.json
msgctxt "u:f"
msgid ""
", looking at your marshal badge immediately.  \"You said you'd keep that "
"goddamn piece of tin out of my sight.\""
msgstr "、執行官バッジを見つめました。「忌々しいクズ鉄は目のつかない場所にしまっておくって言ってたよな。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Carlos_Isherwood.json
msgctxt "u:m"
msgid ""
", looking at your marshal badge immediately.  \"You said you'd keep that "
"goddamn piece of tin out of my sight.\""
msgstr "、執行官バッジを見つめました。「忌々しいクズ鉄は目のつかない場所にしまっておくって言ってたよな。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Carlos_Isherwood.json
msgctxt "u:n"
msgid ""
", looking at your marshal badge immediately.  \"You said you'd keep that "
"goddamn piece of tin out of my sight.\""
msgstr "、執行官バッジを見つめました。「忌々しいクズ鉄は目のつかない場所にしまっておくって言ってたよな。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Carlos_Isherwood.json
msgid ".  \"Yeah?\""
msgstr "ました。「うん？」"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Carlos_Isherwood.json
msgid "Oh, right… (Leave)"
msgstr "おっと、そうだった...(立ち去る)"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Carlos_Isherwood.json
msgid ""
"*struggles to think of a reply for a moment, then drops his hand from his "
"gun.  \"We've got that under control, but you're not wrong.  An extra pair "
"of hands wouldn't hurt, just now.  Just keep that damn badge out of my "
"sight.\""
msgstr ""
"*はどう返答しようかしばらく思案し、銃から手を離しました。「うちで解決できる問題だが、あんたの言うことも間違っちゃいない。今に限っては、人手が増えて悪いことはないからな。ただし、その忌々しいバッジは見えないところにしまっとけ。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Carlos_Isherwood.json
msgid "Fine.  Thanks.  Tell me more about what happened to Barry."
msgstr "よし。ありがとう。バリーに何が起きたのか詳しく知りたい。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Carlos_Isherwood.json
msgid ""
"It is coming together.  I want to make our own tools, repair our items and "
"even create some weapons and ammunition reloading."
msgstr "計画がまとまってきた。工具を自作して、物の修理や、武器や手詰めの弾薬を製作したいと思っている。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Carlos_Isherwood.json
msgid "I heard about Barry, can you tell me what captured him?"
msgstr "バリーについて聞いた。彼が何に捕まったのか教えてくれないか？"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Carlos_Isherwood.json
msgid ""
"It was pink and really fast, it had lots of limbs, definitely not human.\"  "
"Carlos rubs the back of his hand idly, staring into space.  \"It easily kept"
" up with us when we tried to escape, horrifying stuff.  Barry just dropped "
"to the ground, and the thing swept him away."
msgstr ""
"アレはピンク色で、とても素早く、手足がたくさん生えていて、どう見ても人間じゃなかった。」カーロスは手の甲をさすりながら、ぼんやりと虚空を見つめました。「俺たちは逃げようとしたが、すぐ追いつかれた。恐ろしかった。転んだバリーは一瞬で連れ去られちまった。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Carlos_Isherwood.json
msgid "You all just gonna leave him out there to his fate?"
msgstr "バリーを連れ去られたまま放っておくつもりなのか？"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Carlos_Isherwood.json
msgid ""
"*frowns at you.  \"Of course not.  We tracked it for a while, but lost the "
"trail.  Right now we don't have the resources to try to rescue him.  My son,"
" Chris, has been trying to pick up the trail again and figure out a rescue "
"plan.\""
msgstr ""
"*は眉を寄せました。「そんなわけあるか。追いかけようとしたが、しばらくして見失ったんだ。今の状況じゃ、バリーを助けに行く人手が足りない。息子のクリスは、何とか通った道を探し出して、救出計画を立てようとしてるがな。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Carlos_Isherwood.json
msgid "I could help.  Where did Chris go?"
msgstr "手伝おう。クリスはどこだ？"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Carlos_Isherwood.json
msgid ""
"*shakes his head.  \"Leave Chris be, he knows what he's doing.  Give him "
"some time.  Calling more attention to him could get both of you killed.\""
msgstr ""
"*は首を振りました。「クリスは放っておけ。あいつは何もかも承知で一人でやってるんだ。頭を冷やす時間が必要なのさ。手伝いなんてしたら、あんたもクリスも死んじまうぞ。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Carlos_Isherwood.json
msgid ""
"The big item I need is an anvil, once I have that I can get a lot of repairs"
" done.\"  He smiles briefly.  \"Can't exactly head to town to get it done "
"anymore, but I learned a bit of old world metalwork from my granddad."
msgstr ""
"特に必要なのは金床だな。それがあれば、かなりの量の修理を進められる。」彼は一瞬微笑みました。「もう修理をしに街へ出掛けることもないが、昔ながらの金属加工の技は爺さんから教わったものなんだ。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Carlos_Isherwood.json
msgid ""
"*gestures around the workspace, which looks more set up.  \"I'm figuring "
"things out, getting it worked out.  It's been a while since I did this kind "
"of metalwork."
msgstr ""
"*は準備が進んだように見える作業場を指し示しました。「色々な問題を洗い出して、解決しようと頭をひねってる。こういう仕事をするのも久しぶりだな。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Carlos_Isherwood.json
msgid ""
"Yeah, it's coming along nice.\"  He slaps the surface of the anvil.  "
"\"Thanks for this, I'm still getting my skills back up, but it's going to be"
" real helpful."
msgstr "ああ、順調に進んでるよ。」と言いながら、彼は金床を叩きました。「助かった。鈍った腕を取り戻そうとしてるとこだが、とても役立ってる。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Carlos_Isherwood.json
msgid ""
"Chris is hiking the perimeter of our land, planning some defense options.\""
"  He looks you up and down.  \"Best just let him be."
msgstr "クリスはうちの土地の境界を見回りして、防衛策を練ってる。」彼はこちらをじろじろ見ました。「放っといてやるのが一番だ。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Carlos_Isherwood.json
msgid ""
"*looks at you curiously.  \"Should be where you saw him last.  He's not "
"missing again, is he?\""
msgstr "*は不思議そうにこちらを見ました。「あんたが最後に見た場所にまだいるだろう。まさかまた行方知れずになったのか？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Carlos_Isherwood.json
msgid "Is your forge operational?"
msgstr "鍛冶場は稼働しているのか？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Carlos_Isherwood.json
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Luke_Isherwood.json
msgid "Where can I find Chris?"
msgstr "クリスにはどこで会える？"

#. ~ Mission name
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Carlos_Isherwood.json
msgid "Find an anvil"
msgstr "金床を見つける"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find an anvil"
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Carlos_Isherwood.json
msgid "I need an anvil to do advanced metal work."
msgstr "高度な金属加工作業には金床が必要だ。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find an anvil"
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Carlos_Isherwood.json
msgid "I could really use an anvil."
msgstr "本当に金床が必要なんだ。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find an anvil"
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Carlos_Isherwood.json
msgid "You might be able to find one in a hardware store or similar."
msgstr "工具店などにあるだろうから、探してみてくれ。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find an anvil"
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Carlos_Isherwood.json
msgid "Thanks anyway, we'll find the time to make it ourselves."
msgstr "話だけでも聞いてくれてありがとう。自力で探すことにしよう。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find an anvil"
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Carlos_Isherwood.json
msgid "If you can't find one, maybe you can make one for me."
msgstr "見つからないなら、自分で製作するのも手だな。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find an anvil"
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Carlos_Isherwood.json
msgid "Do you have the anvil?"
msgstr "金床はあったか？"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find an anvil"
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Carlos_Isherwood.json
msgid ""
"I appreciate it, this will really make a difference, here's some horse armor"
" I've been working on.  Eventually I'll have the whole herd outfitted."
msgstr "感謝する。これで状況が改善するかもな。前に作っていた馬鎧を用意したから使ってくれ。最終的には、ここの群れ全部に取り付けられるといいのだが。"

#. ~ Mission name
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Carlos_Isherwood.json
msgid "Find Chris Isherwood"
msgstr "クリス・イシャーウッドを探す"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find Chris Isherwood"
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Carlos_Isherwood.json
msgid ""
"Chris hasn't come back from his latest search for Barry, I'm getting "
"concerned."
msgstr "クリスがバリーを捜しに行ったきり戻って来ない。まいったな。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find Chris Isherwood"
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Carlos_Isherwood.json
msgid "Can you go find my son and tell him to check in with us."
msgstr "息子を見つけたら、うちへ帰ってくるよう伝えといてくれ。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find Chris Isherwood"
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Carlos_Isherwood.json
msgid "Oh well.  I hope he turns up soon."
msgstr "仕方ないな。さっさと帰ってきてくれるといいが。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find Chris Isherwood"
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Carlos_Isherwood.json
msgid ""
"He might be on the property somewhere, maybe by that old cabin near the "
"entrance, sometimes he camps there."
msgstr "息子は敷地内のどこかにいるはずだ。時々入り口近くの古い小屋の傍でキャンプをしているから、今回もそこかもな。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find Chris Isherwood"
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Carlos_Isherwood.json
msgid ""
"Thanks, I was getting ready to go look myself.  Now that I have the anvil, "
"I've been working on new armor for the horses, take this prototype I made."
msgstr ""
"助かるよ、ちょうど探しに行こうかと思っていたところだ。金床が手に入ったから、今は新しい馬用の鎧を作っている。試作品だが、よかったら使ってみてくれ。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find Chris Isherwood"
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Carlos_Isherwood.json
msgid "I hope he didn't meet Barry's fate…"
msgstr "バリーのような目に遭っていないといいんだが..."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Chris_Isherwood.json
msgid ""
"Hi, Your dad asked me to come find you, said you've been looking for your "
"uncle."
msgstr "やあ、あなたのお父さんが探していた。それと、叔父さんの行方を調べているそうだな。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Chris_Isherwood.json
msgid ""
"I was talking to Luke earlier, said you had some interesting ideas about the"
" world ending.  Is it tied to Barry's abduction?"
msgstr "さっきルークと話していたんだ。あなたは世界の崩壊について興味深い考えを持っているようだな。それはバリーの誘拐と関係しているのか？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Chris_Isherwood.json
msgid "Have you had any ideas for what your family could do?"
msgstr "作戦での他の家族の役割について、何かいい考えは浮かんだか？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Chris_Isherwood.json
msgid "Do you think we're ready to try this again?"
msgstr "もう一度挑戦する準備はできたか？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Chris_Isherwood.json
msgid "I've got some SWAT gear that should work for the assault."
msgstr "戦闘に適したSWATの防具ならいくつか持っている。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Chris_Isherwood.json
msgid "I've got enough SWAT gear to set everyone up for the assault."
msgstr "戦闘に適したSWATの防具なら全員分揃っている。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Chris_Isherwood.json
msgid ""
"[LIE] I tried to get the SWAT gear, but it looks like someone looted it "
"before I could get there."
msgstr "[嘘] 防具を探しに行ったが、既に誰かに持ち去られてしまったようだ。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Chris_Isherwood.json
msgid "I've got enough bags to set up a defensive wall."
msgstr "防壁を築くのに十分な数の小さい帆布袋が揃っている。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Chris_Isherwood.json
msgid ""
"*is a young man, perhaps in his early twenties or late teens.  He eyes you "
"up and down.  \""
msgstr "*は10代後半から20代前半あたりに見える、若い男性です。こちらをジロジロと見ています。「"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Chris_Isherwood.json
msgid ""
"I see that badge.  You need to leave our land, my relatives have no fondness"
" for Marshals.\""
msgstr "バッジを着けているな。敷地から出て行った方がいい。うちの家族は執行官が嫌いなんだ。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Chris_Isherwood.json
msgctxt "u:f"
msgid ""
"I see you took the badge off.  Fine, then, but you'd better not let anyone "
"here know you've got ties to the Marshals.\""
msgstr "バッジを外したんだな。賢明だ。執行官のことをうちの家族には話さない方がいい。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Chris_Isherwood.json
msgctxt "u:m"
msgid ""
"I see you took the badge off.  Fine, then, but you'd better not let anyone "
"here know you've got ties to the Marshals.\""
msgstr "バッジを外したんだな。賢明だ。執行官のことをうちの家族には話さない方がいい。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Chris_Isherwood.json
msgctxt "u:n"
msgid ""
"I see you took the badge off.  Fine, then, but you'd better not let anyone "
"here know you've got ties to the Marshals.\""
msgstr "バッジを外したんだな。賢明だ。執行官のことをうちの家族には話さない方がいい。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Chris_Isherwood.json
msgid "Hi, what's up?\""
msgstr "やあ、どうしたの？"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Chris_Isherwood.json
msgid ""
"Yeah, they are always worried about us, I prefer to survey the land and try "
"to track the changes.  I'm thinking about fixing up this cabin for some "
"peace and quiet…"
msgstr ""
"ああ、うちの両親は心配ばかりしているんだ。僕は野外を調査して、変化を見つけるのが好きなのさ。この小屋を修理して、平和と静寂を手に入れたいと思っていてね..."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Chris_Isherwood.json
msgid "Sounds like you are restless, why not leave?"
msgstr "家では落ち着けないような言い方だな。出て行かないのか？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Chris_Isherwood.json
msgid "What sort of changes have you seen?"
msgstr "どんな変化が見つかったんだ？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Chris_Isherwood.json
msgid ""
"I was talking to Luke earlier, said you had some interesting ideas about the"
" world ending."
msgstr "さっきルークと話していたんだ。あなたは世界の崩壊について興味深い考えを持っているようだな。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Chris_Isherwood.json
msgid ""
"My family is convinced that if we stay here, we'll be able to weather this "
"catastrophe.  Since technology has failed, they've doubled down on older "
"traditions.  I think we need to get out there and find some answers before "
"settling on a path."
msgstr ""
"うちの家族は、家に留まっていればこの大惨事を乗り切れると確信している。最新技術が凋落したから、古い伝統に賭ける道を選んだんだ。僕は、皆で外へ出て、一つの道を選ぶ前に他の選択肢を探すべきだと思っている。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Chris_Isherwood.json
msgid ""
"In one of my longer trips looking for Barry, I saw something out in a field."
"  I didn't get close but I swear unbelievable monsters were coming out of "
"it.  It kinda shimmered, almost like it wasn't quite there.  I've been "
"tracking those monsters for a while…"
msgstr ""
"バリーを捜索するための調査でしばらく出かけていた時、野原で何かの集団が現れる場所を見たんだ。まるで実体がないかのように揺らめいていた。僕はしばらく怪物たちを追いかけた..."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Chris_Isherwood.json
msgid "What did you find?"
msgstr "何があったんだ？"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Chris_Isherwood.json
msgid ""
"They made their way to this weird spire like structure, I've never seen "
"anything like it, it glistened in the sun like something organic.  I think "
"they could be holding Barry there, I've seen them arrive and leave with "
"other humans."
msgstr ""
"怪物たちは奇妙な構造の尖塔へ入っていった。あんなものは初めて見たよ。何か有機的な素材で作られていて、太陽に照らされ輝いていた。きっとあそこにバリーが捕まっているんだ。他の人間が連れて来られる場面も目撃したからね。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Chris_Isherwood.json
msgid ""
"I might be able to help you get Barry back, but we've got to plan this out."
msgstr "バリー救出の力になれるかもしれない。まずは計画を立てよう。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Chris_Isherwood.json
msgid ""
"Well, wildlife is more hostile and I've seen gigantic insects around, never "
"mind all these monsters.  I've also found mysterious dead spots and mutated "
"vegetation.  I don't think staying on a farm is sustainable forever, there "
"are big planet wide changes occurring."
msgstr ""
"そうだな、野生動物は気性が荒くなって、巨大な虫も見かけたけど、それはひとまず置いておこう。問題は植物が枯れた妙な区画と変異した草花だ。きっと農場で永遠に生活を続けることはできない。地球全体で大きな変化が起こっているようだ。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Chris_Isherwood.json
msgid "You should leave before my family sees you."
msgstr "家族に見つかる前に出ていった方がいい。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Chris_Isherwood.json
msgid ""
"Your dad asked me to come find you, said you've been looking for your uncle."
msgstr "あなたのお父さんが探していた。それと、叔父さんの行方を調べているそうだな。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Chris_Isherwood.json
msgid ""
"I was talking to Luke earlier, he said you had some interesting ideas about "
"the world ending."
msgstr "先ほどルークから話を聞いた。世界の崩壊について興味深い考えを持っているようだな。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Chris_Isherwood.json
msgid ""
"&Chris looks you up and down, and nods.  \"I'm definitely not going to say "
"no to a willing body, and you look like you know what's up.\"  He sighs.  "
"\"To be honest with you, I've been a bit stuck.  I can't tackle that thing "
"alone, and I'm not willing to bring my dad or Uncle Eddie in either.  Dad's "
"got a bum knee - don't tell him I said that - and Eddie's not that great a "
"shot.  Luke's still too young for something like this… you get the idea.\"  "
"He leans forward, self-consciously running his hand through his hair.  \"I "
"think if we work together maybe we'd stand a chance.  I don't have a great "
"plan though.  That tower doesn't look like something a person could just "
"storm up to full-frontal style.\""
msgstr ""
"&クリスはこちらをまじまじと見つめ、頷きました。「手伝いを申し出てくれる人を断るなんてできない。あなたは何が起きてるのか知っているみたいだし。」そして、ため息をつきました。「正直に言うと、行き詰まりを感じていた。僕一人で解決できる問題じゃないし、父さんやエディ叔父さんが戦力になるとは思えない。父さんは膝を痛めててね。おっと、これは本人には言わないで。叔父さんも射撃が得意って程じゃないし。ルークはまだ子供だから、こういうことには向かない...分かるだろ。」彼は頭を抱え、無意識に髪を撫でつけています。「僕らが力を合わせれば、チャンスはあるかもしれない。でも、いいアイデアが思い浮かばないんだ。あの塔は、人間が正面から突撃して破れるような代物じゃないようだ。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Chris_Isherwood.json
msgid "Actually, I was just planning to go in by myself.  I've handled worse."
msgstr "実は、一人で侵入しようと思っていた。もっと酷い状況も乗り越えてきた経験がある。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Chris_Isherwood.json
msgid ""
"I've got my own team here, we'll take this.  You stay back here, keep the "
"family safe."
msgstr "私には仲間がいる。この仕事は私たちに任せてほしい。あなたは農場に残って家族を守るんだ。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Chris_Isherwood.json
msgid ""
"Yeah, I think we should work together on this.  Do you mind if I take the "
"lead?  I've probably got more experience."
msgstr "確かに、協力して取り組むべきだ。私がリーダーとして指示を出しても構わないか？積み重ねた経験には自信がある。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Chris_Isherwood.json
msgid ""
"*looks at you with obvious doubt.  \"You sure you know what you're getting "
"into?  I can't stop you if you plan on going in solo, but it seems like a "
"terrible idea.  Those things mean business.  I won't be able to go in and "
"help you if you get trapped too.  It's probably better we pair up.\""
msgstr ""
"*は疑いの眼差しを隠しもせずにこちらを見ています。「何をしようとしてるのか分かっているのか？一人で行くっていうなら止めはしないけど、無謀すぎる。ふざけていられる状況じゃないんだ。一人で行って捕まったらどうするつもりなんだ。せめて二人で協力して取り組むべきだ。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Chris_Isherwood.json
msgid "Trust me.  See you in a bit."
msgstr "私を信じてほしい。また後で。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Chris_Isherwood.json
msgid "If you insist, yeah, we could team up."
msgstr "そこまで言うなら、そうだな、協力した方がいいか。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Chris_Isherwood.json
msgid ""
"Yeah, bringing your own people in is reasonable.  Still, the more the "
"better.  It's my uncle in there, I'm more than willing to help out.  I know "
"my way around, I won't get in your way."
msgstr ""
"そうだな、確かに人手は揃っていた方がいい。それも、多ければ多いほど助かる。捕まってるのは僕の叔父なんだ。当然、僕も手を貸すよ。現場の位置を知ってるし、あなたたちの邪魔にならないよう動くつもりだ。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Chris_Isherwood.json
msgid ""
"All right.  As long as you follow my lead, we could use another pair of "
"hands."
msgstr "分かった。こちらの指示には従ってもらうが、人手が増えるのはありがたい。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Chris_Isherwood.json
msgid ""
"It's all right.  We've got this, you get things ready for when we return "
"with Barry."
msgstr "心配ない、私たちだけでやり遂げる。家でバリーが帰ってきたときに備えておくといい。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Chris_Isherwood.json
msgid ""
"*nods.  \"I'm fine following your lead.  I'm a good scout and hunter, but "
"I've never done anything like this before.  When you set the time, I'll head"
" out and wait near the scout tower for you with the best gear I can get.\""
msgstr ""
"*は頷きました。「ちゃんと指示通り動くようにする。野外探索や狩りには自信があるけど、こんな仕事は今までしたことがない。集合時間を決めてくれ。手に入る最高の装備を揃えて、塔の近くで待っているよ。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Chris_Isherwood.json
msgid "All right.  Let's kick some alien butt."
msgstr "よし。エイリアンを蹴散らしてやろう。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Chris_Isherwood.json
msgid "Is there anyone else around here that could help us?"
msgstr "他に協力してくれそうな人はいないのか？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Chris_Isherwood.json
msgid ""
"You mentioned that Carlos, Eddie and Luke probably can't help in a "
"firefight.  Is there any other way we could use them?"
msgstr "カーロスとエディとルークは、射撃には参加できなさそうだと言っていたな。他の役割はどうだろう？"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Chris_Isherwood.json
msgid ""
"Like I said, I don't really think my dad or uncle should help, and I think "
"Luke's more likely to get injured than be helpful."
msgstr "前に言ったけど、僕は、父さんや叔父さんが戦力になるとはあまり思わない。ルークは助けになるどころか、逆にケガをするに決まってる。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Chris_Isherwood.json
msgid "What about Lisa?  She seems like she could handle herself."
msgstr "リサはどうだろう？彼女は問題なく動けそうだ。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Chris_Isherwood.json
msgid "Well, I guess it's just us.  Let's go."
msgstr "うーん、私たちでやるしかないな。よし、行こう。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Chris_Isherwood.json
msgid ""
"*blinks.  \"My… yeah, of course Lisa could come.  Damn, she'd smack me if "
"she knew I didn't think of that myself.  Mind if I go talk to her about it?"
"  I'll get her to come out with me and we'll meet you together, if she's "
"willing.\""
msgstr ""
"*は目を瞬かせました。「ああ...そうか、リサなら大丈夫だ。クソッ、こんなことも考え付かなかったなんてリサにバレたら殴られるぞ。早速リサにこの話を伝えに行っていいか？助けを得られそうなら、連れてくるよ。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Chris_Isherwood.json
msgid ""
"Okay, I'll give you about an hour to talk with her about it.  I'll be back "
"soon."
msgstr "分かった、説得の時間が必要だろうから、1時間ほど後にまた来よう。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Chris_Isherwood.json
msgid ""
"Probably.  They'd want to, for sure.\"  He looks thoughtful.  \"I'm sure we "
"could use more help, but this isn't my strong suit.  Let me think about it."
"  If you have any ideas, run them by me.\""
msgstr ""
"そうだな。確かに、何か手伝いたいだろうしな。」彼は考え込んでいます。「何かいいやり方がある筈だけど、こういうのは僕の得意分野じゃない。ちょっと考えてみよう。そっちも何か思い付いたら、教えてほしい。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Chris_Isherwood.json
msgid "OK.  Let's talk about it again in a bit."
msgstr "分かった。しばらく後でまた話そう。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Chris_Isherwood.json
msgid ""
"Yeah.  I think they should cover our exit.  We've got an old truck they "
"could set up as a platform, where Dad can put down covering fire without his"
" knee being an issue.  Eddie can drive, instead of shoot, and Luke or Mom "
"can be ready with some first aid supplies.  Then when we get out, we've got "
"an easy getaway set up, and there's less chance of us getting flanked while "
"we're in there looking for Barry.\"  He looks at you, suddenly nervous.  "
"\"Is that a good plan?"
msgstr ""
"ああ。撤退ルートをカバーする役割を思いついたんだ。うちにある古いトラックを射撃陣地として使えば、父さんも膝を気にせず援護射撃ができる。エディは射撃じゃなくて車両運転担当、ルークと母さんは医療品を揃えて応急手当の準備だ。これで、僕らが塔から脱出したときに楽に撤退できるし、塔に入ってバリーを探している間に側面から攻撃される可能性も低くなる。」彼は緊張した面持ちでこちらを見つめました。「上手くいくと思う？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Chris_Isherwood.json
msgid "Seems like a good plan to me."
msgstr "上手くいきそうだ。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Chris_Isherwood.json
msgid "I think it's better we take my vehicle, and just leave them out of it."
msgstr "あなたの家族を車に乗せるのは止めて、私たちが車で向かった方がいいと思う。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Chris_Isherwood.json
msgid ""
"I don't think one farmer with a hunting rifle is going to be enough to keep "
"our backs safe."
msgstr "ハンティングライフルを持った農家が一人いるだけでは、安全を確保するのには不十分だ。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Chris_Isherwood.json
msgid ""
"I think we need some kind of secure fallback point for the family, maybe a "
"defensive wall?"
msgstr "家族の安全を守るためには、防護壁のような撤退陣地が必要じゃないか？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Chris_Isherwood.json
msgid ""
"We're going to need some way to breach the tower itself, possibly some form "
"of explosives.  Do you know anyone who could help us with that?"
msgstr "塔の外壁を突破するには、例えば爆発物などの準備が必要になるだろう。手を貸してくれる人に心当たりはないか？"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Chris_Isherwood.json
msgid ""
"*looks crestfallen for a moment, then straightens up.  \"All right.  Yeah, "
"maybe better not to put them at risk I guess.  So we're back to going in "
"without them.  Maybe that's better, I don't want to lose anyone else.\""
msgstr ""
"*は一瞬肩を落としましたが、すぐ立ち直りました。「分かった。そうだな、家族を危険に晒すのは止めた方がいい。やっぱり他の家族の手を借りるのは無しだ。きっとその方がいい。もう誰も失いたくない。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Chris_Isherwood.json
msgid ""
"Can you think of anything else we might need, or should we put this into "
"action?"
msgstr "他にやっておくべきことはあるかな。それとも作戦を始めようか？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Chris_Isherwood.json
msgid "Let's go get your uncle back."
msgstr "よし、あなたの叔父さんを救出しに行こう。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Chris_Isherwood.json
msgid ""
"I've changed my mind.  I think it's better we take my vehicle, and just "
"leave them out of it."
msgstr "やっぱり気が変わった。あなたの家族を車に乗せるのは止めて、私たちが車で向かった方がいいと思う。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Chris_Isherwood.json
msgid ""
"I'm a bit worried about defenses.  Do you folks have any armor or equipment "
"to help keep yourselves safe?"
msgstr "防御面が少し不安だ。皆は身を守るための防具類を持っているのか？"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Chris_Isherwood.json
msgid ""
"*looks thoughtful.  \"Well, we can wear our usual wrangling gear, but you're"
" right.  It's no good against those claws.\"  He sighs.  \"I don't want to "
"delay, but I don't want to lose another family member either.  If we could "
"get our hands on some riot gear, that might give us a better chance to fend "
"off the monsters.  Not too far away, our corrupt-as-hell local cops kept "
"enough of that gear on hand to easily set our family up.  As if they needed "
"it in this place.  Just used it to keep the boot on, y'know?\"  He spits on "
"the ground.  \"I can show you where their stores were, it'd feel nice to put"
" that stuff to good use.  Of course, any riot gear would do, if you happen "
"to have already looted some.\""
msgstr ""
"*は悩んでいるようです。「確かに、喧嘩をしに行くような服装じゃ、あの爪は防げないだろうな。」彼はため息をつきました。「先延ばしにしたくはないけど、また家族を失うのも嫌だ。暴徒鎮圧で使ってるような防具が手に入れば、怪物を追い払える勝算も高くなる。そう遠くない場所に、地元の腐りきった警察の建物がある。あそこへ行けば、家族の分の防具も十分揃いそうだ。丁度いい場所に建っててくれて助かった。まったく、こういう準備だけはバッチリなんだよな？」そう言って、地面に唾を吐きました。「建物の場所を伝えておこう。有効活用できそうだ。もちろん暴動鎮圧用の防具を既に持ってるなら、それでも構わない。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Chris_Isherwood.json
msgid ""
"I think you're right, that would take too long.  We'll have to count on "
"offense being our best defense."
msgstr "確かにその通りだが、悠長に準備はしていられない。攻撃が最大の防御だと信じよう。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Chris_Isherwood.json
msgid "Show me where, and I'll try to get some riot gear for you."
msgstr "教えてもらった場所で、防具がないか見てこよう。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Chris_Isherwood.json
msgid ""
"*smiles slightly.  \"Awesome, getting our team kitted out better will go a "
"long way to making this possible.\""
msgstr "*は少し微笑みました。「すごい、防具を改善できれば、きっとこの作戦も成功する筈だ。」"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Chris_Isherwood.json
msgid "[5 Riot Armor] I've got enough riot armor for everyone."
msgstr "[5 ライオットアーマー] 家族の分の防具を用意できた。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Chris_Isherwood.json
msgid "[5 Riot Helmet] These crowd control helmets should help a lot."
msgstr "[5 ライオットヘルメット] ヘルメットはきっと役に立つ筈だ。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Chris_Isherwood.json
msgid ""
"[5 Riot Arm Guard] I hope these armguards won't interfere with people's aim."
msgstr "[5 ライオットアームガード] アームガードが照準の邪魔にならないことを願おう。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Chris_Isherwood.json
msgid ""
"[5 Riot Leg Guard] I've got these leg guards to keep people from getting "
"hobbled."
msgstr "[5 ライオットレッグガード] 足を掴まれて攫われないように、レッグガードを揃えた。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Chris_Isherwood.json
msgid ""
"We have enough full sets of riot control armor to cover everyone, head to "
"toe."
msgstr "家族の分の暴動鎮圧用防具が揃った。これで頭からつま先までしっかり守れる。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Chris_Isherwood.json
msgid "That's all for now.  Let's talk about something else."
msgstr "今のところ、これが集められる全てだ。他のことについて話そう。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Chris_Isherwood.json
msgid "That's all for now.  I'd better get going."
msgstr "これで全部だ。私はそろそろ行かないと。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Chris_Isherwood.json
msgid ""
"*nods intently, looking at the assembled pile of equipment.  \"Like I said, "
"I'll get this distributed to everyone who's coming.  It's starting to feel "
"more real, but less impossible.  Thanks for doing this.\""
msgstr ""
"*は並べられた防具の山を眺めて熱心に頷きました。「前に言った通り、作戦に参加する家族全員がこの防具を着用する。段々現実味が出てきた。上手くいくかもしれない。助けてくれてありがとう。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Chris_Isherwood.json
msgid "Before you get on to that, I wanted to talk about something else."
msgstr "本代に入る前に、他に話したいことがある。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Chris_Isherwood.json
msgid "I'll let you get on that."
msgstr "防具の確認は任せた。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Chris_Isherwood.json
msgctxt "u:f"
msgid ""
"*nods slowly.  \"I understand.  You tried.  We could maybe… no, nevermind.  "
"Time is important here, we can't spend forever hoping to get everything in "
"place if we want to get Uncle Barry back alive.  Let's do it without the "
"gear.\""
msgstr ""
"*はゆっくりと頷きました。「これでいい。あなたは十分やってくれた。多分...いや、止めておこう。今は時間が大事だ。バリー叔父さんを連れ戻すなら、完璧に準備できるまでずっと先延ばしを続ける訳にはいかない。今ある防具だけで、やり遂げよう。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Chris_Isherwood.json
msgctxt "u:m"
msgid ""
"*nods slowly.  \"I understand.  You tried.  We could maybe… no, nevermind.  "
"Time is important here, we can't spend forever hoping to get everything in "
"place if we want to get Uncle Barry back alive.  Let's do it without the "
"gear.\""
msgstr ""
"*はゆっくりと頷きました。「これでいい。あなたは十分やってくれた。多分...いや、止めておこう。今は時間が大事だ。バリー叔父さんを連れ戻すなら、完璧に準備できるまでずっと先延ばしを続ける訳にはいかない。今ある防具だけで、やり遂げよう。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Chris_Isherwood.json
msgctxt "u:n"
msgid ""
"*nods slowly.  \"I understand.  You tried.  We could maybe… no, nevermind.  "
"Time is important here, we can't spend forever hoping to get everything in "
"place if we want to get Uncle Barry back alive.  Let's do it without the "
"gear.\""
msgstr ""
"*はゆっくりと頷きました。「これでいい。あなたは十分やってくれた。多分...いや、止めておこう。今は時間が大事だ。バリー叔父さんを連れ戻すなら、完璧に準備できるまでずっと先延ばしを続ける訳にはいかない。今ある防具だけで、やり遂げよう。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Chris_Isherwood.json
msgid "Sorry.  Let's talk about something else."
msgstr "申し訳ない。他のことについて話そう。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Chris_Isherwood.json
msgid "I'm sorry.  I'm going to go take care of a few more things."
msgstr "申し訳ない。くれぐれも慎重に作戦を進めよう。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Chris_Isherwood.json
msgid ""
"Good idea.  A sandbag wall would be easy enough, we've had to do those a few"
" times when we've had flooding and everyone knows the drill.  Back then we "
"just grabbed supplies from the hardware store, though.  Maybe you'd be able "
"to make a run for those?  Something like 20 canvas bags would probably do "
"it.  We can fill them up in advance and toss them out of the truck to get a "
"decent barricade."
msgstr ""
"いいアイデアだな。土嚢で壁を作るくらいなら簡単だ。洪水で土嚢を積まないといけないことは何度かあったから、作り方は誰でも知ってる。ただし、材料はホームセンターから買ってくるだけで済んだけどね。何とかして、材料を揃えてもらえないか？小さい帆布袋が20枚あれば十分足りるんだ。事前に土を詰めてトラックで運べば、立派なバリケードが出来上がる。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Chris_Isherwood.json
msgid ""
"I think this is going to take too long, honestly.  Let's just stick with the"
" truck."
msgstr "正直に言って、時間が掛かり過ぎると思う。トラックだけで救助に向かおう。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Chris_Isherwood.json
msgid "I know where to find those canvas bags, I'll go get them."
msgstr "小さな帆布袋の在り処なら分かる。早速取りに行ってこよう。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Chris_Isherwood.json
msgid ""
"All right.  I think that's everything we need.  Let me get it out to the "
"family and we'll have it all prepped by tomorrow."
msgstr "よし。これでやるべきことは全てやった。家族に作戦を伝えてくる。明日までには準備も終わるだろう。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Chris_Isherwood.json
msgid "Before I go, let's talk about something else."
msgstr "その前に、他のことについて話そう。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Chris_Isherwood.json
msgid ""
"I'll let you get on that, I've got my own preparations to take care of."
msgstr "後は任せた。私も準備を整えてくる。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Chris_Isherwood.json
msgid ""
"* looks thoughtful for a moment, then becomes a bit nervous.  \"Wait, won't "
"that run the risk of injuring Barry, or possibly collapsing the tower?  I "
"don't want him hurt during this, or anyone else if this bomb sends back a "
"bunch of shrapnel.  What do you think about it?\""
msgstr ""
"*はしばらく考え込み、不安げな表情を浮かべました。「待った、その方法だとバリーがケガしたり、塔が崩れたりしないか？爆発で飛び散った瓦礫で被害を受けるのは避けたい。どう思う？」"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Chris_Isherwood.json
msgid ""
"Don't worry, I know what I'm doing.  I've taken a look at these sorts of "
"towers before, and I know that the structure itself is pretty solid.  If we "
"tune it right, then the tower won't fall over."
msgstr "心配ない。やり方は分かっているんだ。以前にも似たような塔を見たが、かなり頑丈な構造だった。適切に爆発を調整すれば、塔が崩落する心配もない。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Chris_Isherwood.json
msgid ""
"Well, I trust you on this.  If you need a good hand with chemistry, go see "
"Luke about it.  He knows a lot, you'd be surprised.  \" He pauses for a "
"moment, and thinks as if trying to recall something.  \"Luke should be over "
"in the old outbuilding near the dairy, that's on the other end of the "
"property."
msgstr ""
"そうだな、この件に関してはあなたを信頼している。科学知識が必要なら、ルークに相談してみるといい。あいつは本当に物知りなんだ。」彼はしばし立ち止まり、何かを思い出そうとしているように考え込みました。「そうそう、ルークは酪農場の近くの古い離れにいる筈だ。敷地の丁度反対側にある。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Chris_Isherwood.json
msgid ""
"That sounds great, I'll go talk to him about it.  Let's talk about something"
" else first, though."
msgstr "それは頼もしい、後で相談してみよう。ところで、他にも話しておきたいことがある。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Chris_Isherwood.json
msgid "That sounds great, I'll go talk to him about it."
msgstr "それは頼もしい。相談してこよう。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Chris_Isherwood.json
msgid ""
"If you think we're ready, I think we can try another go.  Even… even if it's"
" too late for Uncle Barry, I think we've got to try to take that damn tower "
"out of commission."
msgstr ""
"準備ができたら、もう一度挑戦してみよう。もし...もしバリー叔父さんが間に合わなかったとしても、あのふざけた塔だけは何とかして潰しておきたい。"

#. ~ Mission name
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Chris_Isherwood.json
msgid "Free Barry from the mysterious structure"
msgstr "奇妙な構造物でバリーを救出する"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Free Barry from the mysterious structure"
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Chris_Isherwood.json
msgid ""
"We need to investigate the alien encampment and try to find out what "
"happened to Barry."
msgstr "エイリアンの陣地を調査して、バリーに何が起こったのか調べたいんだ。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Free Barry from the mysterious structure"
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Chris_Isherwood.json
msgid "I can take you to the structure, I tracked them to it."
msgstr "構造物の場所までは僕が案内するよ。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Free Barry from the mysterious structure"
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Chris_Isherwood.json
msgid "Awesome, I want some answers!"
msgstr "ありがとう、謎を解明できるといいな！"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Free Barry from the mysterious structure"
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Chris_Isherwood.json
msgid "Thanks anyway, I'll keep my eye on it, maybe I'll find a way one day."
msgstr "話だけでも聞いてくれてありがとう。警戒を怠らなければ、きっと僕だけでもなんとかなるだろう。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Free Barry from the mysterious structure"
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Chris_Isherwood.json
msgid ""
"I feel like we are underprepared if they see us, I marked the location for "
"you."
msgstr "奴らに見つかってしまうようでは準備不足だろう。構造物がある地点は印をつけておいた。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Free Barry from the mysterious structure"
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Chris_Isherwood.json
msgid "You ready?"
msgstr "準備はいいか？"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Free Barry from the mysterious structure"
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Chris_Isherwood.json
msgid ""
"It's taller then I remember, we should look for prisoners.  I left a note "
"for my family before we left.  If we survive, the cabin should be fixed up "
"and ready for you to move in if you want to stay."
msgstr ""
"前に見た時より大きくなっているな。捕まっている人を捜そう。出発前に家族への手紙を書いておいた。もし生きて帰れたら、小屋の修理も終わっているだろうし、引っ越してきてくれても構わないよ。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Free Barry from the mysterious structure"
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Chris_Isherwood.json
msgid "Well it was here…"
msgstr "ここだったかな..."

#. ~ Mission name
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Chris_Isherwood.json
msgid "Retrieve 5 sets of riot armor for the Isherwoods"
msgstr "イシャーウッド家のために5個のライオットアーマーを集める"

#. ~ Mission name
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Chris_Isherwood.json
msgid "Retrieve Canvas Bags for Chris"
msgstr "クリスに20個の帆布袋Sを渡す"

#. ~ Unique name of a female NPC
#. ~ Matriarch of the Isherwood family.
#. ~ Name of an NPC class
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Claire_Isherwood.json
msgid "Claire Isherwood"
msgstr "ｸﾚｱ ｲｼｬｰｳｯﾄﾞ"

#. ~ Job description of "Claire Isherwood" NPC class
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Claire_Isherwood.json
msgid "I'm the matriarch of the Isherwood family"
msgstr "私はイシャーウッド家の女家長だ。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Claire_Isherwood.json
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Jack_Isherwood.json
msgid "Is that a U.S. Marshal's badge you're wearing?"
msgstr "あなたが着けているのは、合衆国執行官のバッジ？"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Claire_Isherwood.json
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Lisa_Isherwood.json
msgid "Hi, what brings you here?"
msgstr "あら、何の用？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Claire_Isherwood.json
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Jack_Isherwood.json
msgid "Yes, I'm a marshal."
msgstr "ああ、私は執行官だ。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Claire_Isherwood.json
msgid "Hi, nice farm you have here."
msgstr "やあ、素敵な農場だな。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Claire_Isherwood.json
msgid "Hi, Jack suggested I stop by and say hello."
msgstr "やあ、ジャックから話を聞いて、挨拶しておこうと思ったんだ。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Claire_Isherwood.json
#: data/json/npcs/isolated_road/isolated_road_cody_dialogue.json
#: data/json/npcs/isolated_road/isolated_road_jay_dialogue.json
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_staff/Smokes/free_merchant_shopkeep_talk.json
#: data/json/npcs/robofac/ROBOFAC_SURFACE_FREEMERCHANT.json
#: data/json/npcs/robofac/robofac_intercom/robofac_intercom.json
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/npc/TALK_FORGE_ARDELIA.json
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/npc/TALK_FORGE_HELEN_TAVREL.json
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/npc/TALK_FORGE_MERCHANT.json
msgid "Let's trade."
msgstr "取り引きしよう。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Claire_Isherwood.json
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Jack_Isherwood.json
msgid "Hey, when would more of this stuff be ready?"
msgstr "やあ、新しい商品はいつ頃入荷する？"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Claire_Isherwood.json
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Jack_Isherwood.json
msgid "Around <interval>."
msgstr "だいたい<interval>後かね。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Claire_Isherwood.json
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Jack_Isherwood.json
msgid "Alright then, bye."
msgstr "なるほど、さようなら。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Claire_Isherwood.json
msgid "I live here with my husband, Jack.  He is working out in his shop."
msgstr "あたしは夫のジャックとここに住んでるんだ。ジャックは作業場の方にいるよ。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Claire_Isherwood.json
msgid "You are lucky to have your family still together."
msgstr "家族で一緒に過ごせるなんて運の良い人だ。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Claire_Isherwood.json
msgid "Must be nice, to have the quiet place amid so much madness."
msgstr "狂った世界で平穏な場所を守りたいなら、少しでもいい暮らしをしないとね。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Claire_Isherwood.json
msgid ""
"You don't need as much luck if you are prepared and work together.  We've "
"had our losses, my brother in law, Barry, was our best hunter but things are"
" so different now…"
msgstr ""
"なによりも準備と協力が大事さ。運の良さはそれほど必要ないよ。それに、失ったものもある。義理の兄のバリーは最高の狩人だったのに、大変なことに巻き込まれてしまってね..."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Claire_Isherwood.json
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Luke_Isherwood.json
msgid "What happened to Barry?"
msgstr "バリーに何があったんだ？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Claire_Isherwood.json
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Jack_Isherwood.json
msgid "A farm must be a pretty safe place these days."
msgstr "今の状況では農場はかなり安全なはずだ。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Claire_Isherwood.json
msgid ""
"Well, nice to meet you.  I imagine Jack was boasting about my herbal "
"remedies, he's proud of what we've put together here."
msgstr "あぁ、はじめまして。あたしが薬草で作った薬のことをジャックが自慢してただろう。夫はあたしたちがここで作ったものが誇りなんだよ。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Claire_Isherwood.json
msgid "He did mention you make remedies, are they effective?"
msgstr "あなたは医薬品を作れると聞いたが、効果はあるのか？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Claire_Isherwood.json
msgid "I'd like to ask you something else…"
msgstr "他に聞きたいことがある..."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Claire_Isherwood.json
msgid ""
"I have always studied and made some natural remedies, but now they are more "
"essential than ever.  Who knows the next time we'll see a trained doctor.  "
"These remedies aren't always as effective, but they can do the job in a "
"pinch."
msgstr ""
"自然療法について色々と調べたり、試したりしてきたけど、今まで以上に大事になっているね。次にいつまともな医者に会えるかなんて、誰にも分からないもの。薬草で作った医薬品は絶対に効果が出るとは言えないが、ピンチの時には役立つものさ。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Claire_Isherwood.json
msgid ""
"Some of their cows were killed before we realized what was happening, Barry "
"and Carlos went into the forest to find the predator but it was like nothing"
" they'd ever seen.  Carlos may be willing to tell you more."
msgstr ""
"事が起きる前に、ウシが何頭か殺されたんだ。バリーとカーロスは犯人を探しに森に入ったけど、そこで今まで見たこともないようなものに出くわした。カーロスに聞いてみれば、もっと詳しく話してくれるはずだよ。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Claire_Isherwood.json
msgid ""
"We've always tried to live a quiet life out here, I suppose we are doing "
"better than most."
msgstr "あたしたちは今までずっとここで平穏に暮らしてきたけど、大抵の人よりも順調に生き延びられている気がするよ。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Claire_Isherwood.json
msgid ""
"Jack and I have been together for 40 years.  He's been my anchor through all"
" of this chaos."
msgstr "ジャックとあたしは40年間も一緒なんだ。こんな酷い状況では、あの人があたしの支えさ。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Claire_Isherwood.json
msgid ""
"Jesse and her family live up at the horse farm.  They may have some jobs for"
" you."
msgstr "ジェスの一家は馬牧場の方に住んでいるよ。きっと手伝いが必要だろうから、聞いてみるといい。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Claire_Isherwood.json
msgid ""
"Eddie's dairy is at the end of the road.  He's may have some jobs for you if"
" you are interested."
msgstr "道の突き当りにエディの酪農場がある。もし興味があるなら、仕事を手伝ってやるといい。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Claire_Isherwood.json
msgid "You should get off our land, you have no business here."
msgstr "うちの土地から出て行きな。あんたがいるべき所じゃないよ。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Claire_Isherwood.json
msgid "Ask away."
msgstr "どんどん聞いとくれ。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Claire_Isherwood.json
msgid "Tell me about your husband, is he around?"
msgstr "あなたの旦那について聞きたい。ここにいる人か？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Claire_Isherwood.json
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Jack_Isherwood.json
msgid "Your daughter lives down the road?"
msgstr "あなたの娘はこの道沿いの家に住んでいるのか？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Claire_Isherwood.json
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Jack_Isherwood.json
msgid "Where is your brother's place?"
msgstr "あなたの兄弟はどこにいるんだ？"

#. ~ Mission name
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Claire_Isherwood.json
msgid "Gather 50 dandelions"
msgstr "50個のタンポポを集める"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Gather 50 dandelions"
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Claire_Isherwood.json
msgid "I could use some help foraging ingredients."
msgstr "食べ物を探すのを手伝ってくれると助かるんだけど。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Gather 50 dandelions"
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Claire_Isherwood.json
msgid ""
"I could use some fresh dandelions for the next batch of wine.  Can you bring"
" me 50 dandelions?"
msgstr "次に作るワインには新鮮なタンポポを使いたいんだ。タンポポを50個集めてきてもらえないか？"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Gather 50 dandelions"
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Claire_Isherwood.json
msgid "Thank you, I'll put these to good use."
msgstr "ありがとう、きっと役に立つよ。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Gather 50 dandelions"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find 20 bee balm seeds"
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Claire_Isherwood.json
msgid "Oh well.  Maybe some other time, thanks."
msgstr "しかたがない、また今度にするとしよう。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Gather 50 dandelions"
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Claire_Isherwood.json
msgid "You can find them in the fields during the spring and summer months."
msgstr "春から夏にかけて、野原で見かける花だよ。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Gather 50 dandelions"
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Claire_Isherwood.json
msgid "Thanks.  Here's a small reward to show my appreciation for your help."
msgstr "ありがとう。これは感謝の証だ、もらっとくれ。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Gather 50 dandelions"
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Claire_Isherwood.json
msgid "I wonder if the wildlife ate all the greens…"
msgstr "野生動物が全部食べ尽くしたのかね..."

#. ~ Mission name
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Claire_Isherwood.json
msgid "Find 20 bee balm seeds"
msgstr "20個の種(ビーバーム)を見つける"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find 20 bee balm seeds"
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Claire_Isherwood.json
msgid "I could use some seeds from the forest."
msgstr "森で見つかる種が必要なんだ。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find 20 bee balm seeds"
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Claire_Isherwood.json
msgid ""
"We could use some seeds for the next planting season.  Can you bring me 20 "
"bee balm seeds?"
msgstr "次の植え付けの時期までに種を揃えたい。ビーバームの種を20個集めてきてもらえないか？"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find 20 bee balm seeds"
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Claire_Isherwood.json
msgid ""
"Thank you.  It's important to have a good stock before the flu season hits."
msgstr "ありがとう。インフルエンザの季節が来る前にしっかり集めておかないと。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find 20 bee balm seeds"
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Claire_Isherwood.json
msgid ""
"You should search through the forest, make sure to check in the underbrush "
"for bee balm and then harvest its seeds."
msgstr "森の中で探すといい。ビーバームの種を採取するには、藪が生えている所を漁る必要がある。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find 20 bee balm seeds"
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Claire_Isherwood.json
msgid ""
"Wow, perfect.  Here are some of my own remedies and if those don't work try "
"my other gift."
msgstr "まあ、完璧だよ。さあ、自作の薬を受け取っておくれ。もし効果がなかったら、他のも試してみるといい。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find 20 bee balm seeds"
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Claire_Isherwood.json
msgid "I'll have to find someone more at home in the forest…"
msgstr "森へ行ってくれるよう家族に頼まないと..."

#. ~ Mission name
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Claire_Isherwood.json
msgid "Find and capture a cat"
msgstr "ネコを捕獲する"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find and capture a cat"
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Claire_Isherwood.json
msgid "I could use a barn cat to keep the mice down."
msgstr "納屋でネコを飼えばネズミを退治できるね。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find and capture a cat"
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Claire_Isherwood.json
msgid ""
"I saw some feral cats out by the old cabin.  Can you capture one for me?"
msgstr "古い小屋の傍に野良猫がいるんだ。捕まえてきてくれないか？"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find and capture a cat"
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Claire_Isherwood.json
msgid ""
"Thank you!  Please hurry back!  Take this cage so you have a chance of "
"capturing one."
msgstr "助かるよ！なるべく急いどくれ！このケージを使えば捕まえられるはずさ。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find and capture a cat"
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Claire_Isherwood.json
msgid "I didn't want to use chemicals on these rats."
msgstr "殺鼠剤は使いたくなかったんだけどね。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find and capture a cat"
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Claire_Isherwood.json
msgid ""
"Take this pet carrier; if you can get close to a cat, you can put it inside."
"  If you're having problems, try befriending it with cat food."
msgstr "ペットキャリーを使えば捕獲できる。ネコに近づけば中に入れられるはずだよ。警戒しているようなら、キャットフードで手懐ければいい。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find and capture a cat"
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Claire_Isherwood.json
msgid "Have you found a cat?"
msgstr "ネコは見つかったかい？"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find and capture a cat"
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Claire_Isherwood.json
msgid ""
"Thank you so much, I want you to have this copy of my natural remedy "
"journal.  I'll name this handsome fellow Joshua."
msgstr "本当にありがとう。お礼に自然療法について書いた手記を受け取っておくれ。このハンサムなお友達は、ジョシュアという名前にしようかね。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find and capture a cat"
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Claire_Isherwood.json
msgid "What?!  You're lying, I can tell!  Did you even bring back my cage?"
msgstr "何ですって？！嘘おっしゃい！ケージだけでも返しておくれ？"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find and capture a cat"
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Claire_Isherwood.json
msgid "Oh no!  I guess they are too nimble for you…"
msgstr "あらあら！素早すぎて難しかったかね..."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Eddie_Isherwood.json
msgid "Nice dairy, must be tough keeping it running."
msgstr "素晴らしい乳製品だ。生産を続けるのは大変だろうな。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Eddie_Isherwood.json
msgid "When will your cows produce again?"
msgstr "牧場の商品はいつ頃入荷する？"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Eddie_Isherwood.json
msgid ""
"*is a sun-worn, middle-aged man with crows feet and graying hair.  He looks "
"up as you approach, "
msgstr "*は日に焼けた中年男性です。目尻には皺が寄り、髪には白髪が混じっています。近付くとこちらに目をやり、"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Eddie_Isherwood.json
msgid ""
"then sneers as he spots the Old Guard Marshal badge gleaming on your chest."
"  \"I already told your kind not to come around here.  You need to keep on "
"walking, straight off this property.\""
msgstr "胸元に光るオールドガード執行官のバッジを見て冷笑を浮かべました。「ここに来るなと言っておいた筈だがな。うちの土地からさっさと立ち去れ。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Eddie_Isherwood.json
msgid ""
"then gives you a little greeting wave.  \"Hello Sir, what brings you here?\""
msgstr "軽く手を振って挨拶しました。「ごきげんよう、サー。こちらへはどんな御用で？"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Eddie_Isherwood.json
msgid ""
"then gives you a little greeting wave.  \"Hello Ma'am, what brings you "
"here?\""
msgstr "軽く手を振って挨拶しました。「ごきげんよう、マム。こちらへはどんな御用で？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Eddie_Isherwood.json
msgid ""
"Luke said you guys have some issues with the Old Guard.  What's up with "
"that?"
msgstr "オールドガードと確執があることはルークから聞いている。何があったんだ？"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Eddie_Isherwood.json
msgid "*glares at your marshal badge.  \"I said, keep *walking*, G-man.\""
msgstr "*は執行官のバッジを睨みました。「言った筈だ、*立ち去れ*ってな、お役人。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Eddie_Isherwood.json
msgid ""
"*spits on the ground, glancing at where your marshal badge would have been, "
"and shaking his head.  \"Nice try.  You can take off the badge, but I know "
"what you are, I'm not some country rube.  Get out.\""
msgstr ""
"*は執行官バッジを付けていた位置に目をやると地面に唾を吐き、首を振りました。「惜しかったな。バッジを外すのはいい考えだが、お前が何者かはもう知っている。バカな田舎者だと思ったか。消え失せろ。」"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Eddie_Isherwood.json
msgid ""
"<color_green>[Social 3]</color> I swear, I'm not here to cause trouble.  I "
"just volunteer with those guys to help travelers, things like that.  I don't"
" speak for them."
msgstr ""
"<color_green>[社交 3]</color> "
"私は誓ってトラブルを起こしに来たわけじゃない。単に出会った人を好意で助けて回っているだけだ。別に政府の代理人を気取るつもりもない。　"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Eddie_Isherwood.json
msgid ""
"<color_yellow>[Social <3]</color> I took it off man, what more do you want "
"from me?"
msgstr "<color_yellow>[社交 3未満]</color> バッジを外した、それで十分じゃないか。これ以上何を望む？　"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Eddie_Isherwood.json
msgid "Fine, I'm gone."
msgstr "分かった、もう行こう。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Eddie_Isherwood.json
msgid ""
", looking at your marshal badge immediately.  \"Nope.  Agreement or not, I'm"
" not talking to you while you're wearing their sign, and I don't appreciate "
"the disrespect.\""
msgstr ""
"、執行官バッジに素早く目をやりました。「おっと、そっちがどう思っていようが、奴らの印を身に付けているなら話はしない。こちらを軽視するような言動を見逃すつもりもない。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Eddie_Isherwood.json
msgid ""
", his eyes darting to the spot where your marshal badge would be.  \"What "
"now?\""
msgstr "、執行官バッジがあった位置に素早く目をやりました。「今度は何だ？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Eddie_Isherwood.json
msgid "What's the deal with you and the Old Guard, anyway?"
msgstr "まず、オールドガードと何があったのか教えてもらえないか？"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Eddie_Isherwood.json
msgid ""
"*spits on the ground.  \"Didn't much care for the government and the cops "
"before everything happened, care for them quite a bit less now.  We've had a"
" run-in or two with the folks calling themselves the 'Old Guard'.  That's "
"all I care to say about it.  They'll never be welcome on my land and I don't"
" believe for a second that they didn't cause all this in the first place.\""
msgstr ""
"*は地面に唾を吐き捨てました。「事が起こる前は政府や警察なんて特に気にしちゃいなかったが、もう話が変わったんだ。自分たちのことを「オールドガード」と呼ぶ連中とのいざこざが何度かあった。言いたいことはそれだけだ。奴らの仲間はうちの土地では歓迎されない。奴らがこの騒ぎを引き起こした元凶じゃないなんて言い訳は、まったく信じられない。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Eddie_Isherwood.json
msgid "Thanks for telling me.  Bye."
msgstr "教えてくれてありがとう。さようなら。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Eddie_Isherwood.json
msgid ""
"*grimaces.  \"Fine, I'll give you a chance, but you don't mess with me or my"
" family, you understand?  This is our land, not yours.  Or theirs.\""
msgstr "*は顔をしかめました。「分かった、見逃そう。ただし、私や家族に余計な干渉はするなよ？ここは私たちの土地だ。お前のでも、奴らのでもない。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Eddie_Isherwood.json
msgid "Thanks for hearing me out."
msgstr "聞き入れてくれてありがとう。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Eddie_Isherwood.json
msgid "Thanks.  I'll give you space for now."
msgstr "ありがとう。ひとまず出直すことにする。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Eddie_Isherwood.json
msgid "I feel like maybe you didn't hear me right.  Get.  Off.  My.  Land."
msgstr "私の声がよく聞こえていなかったようだな。うちの。土地から。消え失せろ。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Eddie_Isherwood.json
msgid "You can't make me."
msgstr "嫌だね。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Eddie_Isherwood.json
msgid "If the cows don't get anything nasty it should be around <interval>."
msgstr "ウシがトラブルにでも巻き込まれない限り、<interval>後には入荷できるはず。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Eddie_Isherwood.json
msgid "Cheers, bye."
msgstr "ありがとう、それじゃ。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Eddie_Isherwood.json
msgid ""
"I run this dairy with my son, Luke.  It's been a tough job keeping the herd "
"together, hasn't left a lot of time for other projects."
msgstr "私は息子のルークと一緒にこの酪農場を運営しているんだ。群れをまとめるが大変で、他の仕事には中々手を付けられないよ。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Eddie_Isherwood.json
msgid ""
"I heard about Barry, such a tragedy.  Can you tell me more about what "
"happened?"
msgstr "バリーという人が悲惨な目に遭ったそうだな。何が起きたのかもっと詳しく教えてくれないか？"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Eddie_Isherwood.json
msgid ""
"*speaks in a quiet monotone, like he's reading off a page.  \"Barry and "
"Carlos went to hunt down something that killed our livestock, they tracked "
"it into the forest.  It grabbed Barry and ran off, you might be able to get "
"Carlos to tell you the story, if he can bring himself to share what "
"happened.\""
msgstr ""
"*は文章を読み上げるように、淡々と静かに話しました。「家畜を殺した何者かを追って、バリーとカーロスは森に入った。何かがバリーを掴んで逃げ去った。カーロスならきっと詳しい話を聞かせてくれる。すぐに打ち明けるかどうかは、分からんがな。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Eddie_Isherwood.json
msgid ""
"Yeah, I could use some help getting materials.  I want to outfit that old "
"building across the road with some kilns.  We want to make our own jars and "
"pottery so we aren't dependent on scavenging."
msgstr ""
"ああ、物資の入手を手伝ってくれ。道の向かいの古い建物に窯をいくつか取り付けたくてね。自分で瓶や陶器を作って、拾い物に頼らずやっていきたいんだ。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Eddie_Isherwood.json
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Luke_Isherwood.json
msgid "That is a good idea, what do you need?"
msgstr "それはいい考えだ。何か手伝いが必要か？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Eddie_Isherwood.json
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Jack_Isherwood.json
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Jesse_Isherwood.json
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Luke_Isherwood.json
msgid "I'm not interested right now, I'd better get going."
msgstr "今はその話はいい、そろそろ行くよ。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Eddie_Isherwood.json
msgid ""
"Luke was going to start college this year, now everything is upside down.  "
"He is adaptable though, had an idea to begin manufacturing our own jars and "
"pottery.  He's out in the old outbuilding right now, cleaning up the place."
msgstr ""
"ルークは今年から大学へ行くはずだったのに、全部台無しだ。でもこの暮らしにもすぐに慣れたみたいで、瓶や陶器を自作する計画を立てているそうだよ。今は古い別棟に掃除をしに行っているんじゃないかな。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Eddie_Isherwood.json
msgid ""
"Jesse manages the horses and other livestock, she is amazing with animals."
msgstr "ジェスはウマなんかの家畜を世話している。動物が大好きなんだ。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Eddie_Isherwood.json
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Jesse_Isherwood.json
msgid ""
"Carlos will be in his workshop if he isn't out hunting.  He is trying to get"
" a forge set up."
msgstr "カーロスは狩りへ出かけてなければ作業場にいるんじゃないか。鍛冶場を作る準備をしている筈だ。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Eddie_Isherwood.json
msgid "Your son helps with the dairy?"
msgstr "あなたの息子は酪農を手伝っているのか？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Eddie_Isherwood.json
msgid "So, Jesse runs the horse farm?"
msgstr "だから、ジェスは馬牧場の仕事をしているんだな？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Eddie_Isherwood.json
msgid "Where can I find Carlos?"
msgstr "カーロスにはどこで会える？"

#. ~ Mission name
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Eddie_Isherwood.json
msgid "Gather 120 Rocks"
msgstr "120個の石を集める"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Gather 120 Rocks"
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Eddie_Isherwood.json
msgid "We need to build some kilns."
msgstr "窯をいくつか作る必要がある。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Gather 120 Rocks"
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Eddie_Isherwood.json
msgid "I could use 120 rocks to construct some kilns."
msgstr "窯をいくつか作るために、石を120個用意してもらいたい。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Gather 120 Rocks"
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Eddie_Isherwood.json
msgid ""
"You can break up some larger stones, or gather them up from the fields."
msgstr "大きな岩を砕くか、野原に落ちているものを集めるといいだろう。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Gather 120 Rocks"
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Eddie_Isherwood.json
msgid "Thanks anyway, we'll find the time to get them ourselves."
msgstr "話だけでも聞いてくれてありがとう。自力で探すことにしよう。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Gather 120 Rocks"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Gather 75 Rocks"
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Eddie_Isherwood.json
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_foreman.json
msgid "Mining would always be an option if you had the resources."
msgstr "可能なら、地下で石を掘るというのも選択肢の一つだな。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Gather 120 Rocks"
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Eddie_Isherwood.json
msgid "Do you have the stone?"
msgstr "石は手に入ったか？"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Gather 120 Rocks"
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Eddie_Isherwood.json
msgid "I appreciate it, this will make Luke happy."
msgstr "感謝するよ。ルークも満足するだろう。"

#. ~ Mission name
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Eddie_Isherwood.json
msgid "Gather 2000 units of sand"
msgstr "2000個の砂を集める"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Gather 2000 units of sand"
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Eddie_Isherwood.json
msgid "I do have some resource gathering I could use help with."
msgstr "資材の収集を手伝ってもらいたい。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Gather 2000 units of sand"
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Eddie_Isherwood.json
msgid ""
"Now that the forge is set up, we could use 2000 units of sand to get "
"production going."
msgstr "完成した窯で製作を始めるために、材料となる2000単位の砂が必要なんだ。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Gather 2000 units of sand"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Gather 100 units of clay"
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Eddie_Isherwood.json
msgid "Oh well.  I'll try to find time to get it myself, thanks."
msgstr "仕方ないな。自分で集めるとしよう。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Gather 2000 units of sand"
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Eddie_Isherwood.json
msgid ""
"You can find it along river banks, or maybe landscaping supplies and "
"hardware stores."
msgstr "川沿いの地面を探すか、造園用品を売っている店や工具店で見つけるといい。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Gather 2000 units of sand"
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Eddie_Isherwood.json
msgid "Thanks, now Luke can get started.  Here's a token of my thanks."
msgstr "ありがとう、これでルークも作業を始められる。これは感謝のしるしだ。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Gather 2000 units of sand"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Gather 100 units of clay"
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Eddie_Isherwood.json
msgid "I wonder where all the sand went…"
msgstr "全ての砂がどこかに消えてしまったんだろうか..."

#. ~ Mission name
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Eddie_Isherwood.json
msgid "Gather 100 units of clay"
msgstr "100個の粘土を集める"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Gather 100 units of clay"
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Eddie_Isherwood.json
msgid "I do have some resource gathering I could use help if you have time."
msgstr "手が空いてるなら、資材の収集を手伝ってもらいたい。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Gather 100 units of clay"
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Eddie_Isherwood.json
msgid ""
"Now that the clay kiln is set up, we could use 100 units of clay to get "
"production going."
msgstr "完成した陶芸窯で製作を始めるために、材料となる粘土が100単位必要なんだ。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Gather 100 units of clay"
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Eddie_Isherwood.json
msgid ""
"You can find it along river banks, or maybe look for deposits in the forest."
msgstr "川沿いの地面か、森の中の粘土質になっている箇所で探すといい。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Gather 100 units of clay"
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Eddie_Isherwood.json
msgid ""
"Thanks, now Luke can get started making jugs, We'd like to give you a cow, "
"Here's Daisy, take good care of her and she'll provide you with milk."
msgstr "ありがとう、これでルークが水差しを作れる。感謝のしるしとして、ウシのデイジーを譲ろう。ちゃんと世話をすれば、ミルクを出してくれる筈だ。"

#. ~ Nickname for creature 'mon_cow' in an effect
#. ~ Snippet in category "<dog_name>"
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Eddie_Isherwood.json
#: data/json/snippets/snippets.json
msgid "Daisy"
msgstr "ﾃﾞｲｼﾞｰ"

#. ~ Unique name of a male NPC
#. ~ Patriarch of the Isherwood family.
#. ~ Name of an NPC class
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Jack_Isherwood.json
msgid "Jack Isherwood"
msgstr "ｼﾞｬｯｸ ｲｼｬｰｳｯﾄﾞ"

#. ~ Job description of "Jack Isherwood" NPC class
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Jack_Isherwood.json
msgid "I'm the patriarch of the Isherwood family"
msgstr "私はイシャーウッド家の家長だ。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Jack_Isherwood.json
msgctxt "u:f"
msgid "Hello traveler, what brings you here?"
msgstr "やあ旅の人、何しに来たんだ？"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Jack_Isherwood.json
msgctxt "u:m"
msgid "Hello traveler, what brings you here?"
msgstr "やあ旅の人、何しに来たんだ？"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Jack_Isherwood.json
msgctxt "u:n"
msgid "Hello traveler, what brings you here?"
msgstr "やあ旅の人、何しに来たんだ？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Jack_Isherwood.json
msgid "I'm here to deliver some resources."
msgstr "物資を渡しに来た。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Jack_Isherwood.json
msgid "This is a lot of land, you been here since the collapse?"
msgstr "広い土地だな。崩壊以来ここで暮らしているのか？"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Jack_Isherwood.json
msgid ""
"I live here with my wife, this is our family's land.  My daughter's family "
"and son live down the road."
msgstr "妻とここで暮らしている。ここは私たち家族の土地さ。娘一家と息子はこの道を行った先の家に住んでいる。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Jack_Isherwood.json
msgid "Your whole family survived?"
msgstr "家族全員が生き残ったのか？"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Jack_Isherwood.json
msgid ""
"We've had our losses… now we stay close to home, preparing for trouble.  "
"We've always taken disaster preparedness seriously, but we didn't expect "
"anything like this though."
msgstr ""
"いや、失ったものもある...今は家の近くで過ごして、トラブルに備えているのさ。儂らは常に災害への備えを真剣に考えてきたが、まさかこんな事が起こるなんて。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Jack_Isherwood.json
msgid ""
"Even out here we've had some attacks and seen… other things.  We have been "
"working on our defenses, but it takes time.  We've been able to keep up with"
" the crops and animals though so we won't have to risk our necks for "
"supplies."
msgstr ""
"ここでも襲撃があったし、他にも色々と...目撃した。防御を固めようとしているが、時間がかかるな。作物や動物は枯渇しておらんから、食料のために命を危険に晒す心配はない。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Jack_Isherwood.json
msgid "What sort of defenses do you want?"
msgstr "どのように防御を固めるつもりなんだ？"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Jack_Isherwood.json
msgid ""
"We want to put up more fencing and build some look out spots, maybe lay some"
" traps for the monsters.  We could use some extra resources.  If you want to"
" bring me logs, sand, clay, wire, nails, wood planks, and metal chunks, I'll"
" give you signed chits you can use to buy goods from any of the family."
msgstr ""
"柵を延長して、見張り台をいくつか作りたいと思っとる。それから、化け物を嵌める罠だ。もっと資材があればいいのだが。もし丸太、砂、粘土、鉄線、釘、木材、金属片などを持ってきてくれたら、一家の誰との取り引きにも使える署名付き伝票を渡そう。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Jack_Isherwood.json
msgid "Sounds reasonable, I'll see what I can do."
msgstr "それはいい。渡せるものがないか探してみよう。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Jack_Isherwood.json
msgid ""
"Claire and I have been together for 40 years now, couldn't run this place "
"without her.  She's quite the herbalist too, been real useful lately.  She "
"is probably in the house, you should stop in."
msgstr ""
"クレアとはもう40年も連れ添ってるが、あいつなしではここの暮らしは立ち行かなかった。あいつは優秀な薬草医でもあるんだ。近頃は本当に助かっているよ。家にいるから、挨拶していくといい。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Jack_Isherwood.json
msgid ""
"Jesse and her family live up at the horse farm.  Her husband, Carlos, may "
"have some jobs for you."
msgstr "ジェスとその家族は馬牧場の方だ。ジェスの旦那のカーロスは何か仕事をよこしてくれるだろうから、聞いてみるといい。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Jack_Isherwood.json
msgid ""
"Eddie's dairy is at the end of the road.  It's just him and his son since "
"Barry was taken by that thing in the woods."
msgstr "エディの酪農場は道の突き当りだ。バリーが森で連れ去られてからは、エディとその息子だけが住んでいる。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Jack_Isherwood.json
msgid ""
"You should get off my land, the government proved its incompetence with this"
" catastrophe."
msgstr "うちの土地から出て行け。政府はこの大災害で無能さを散々晒しおったな。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Jack_Isherwood.json
msgid "Tell me about your wife, is she around?"
msgstr "あなたの奥さんについて聞きたい。近くにいるこの人か？"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Jack_Isherwood.json
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_staff/NPC_free_merchant_broker.json
msgid "Excellent.  What've you brought us?"
msgstr "素晴らしい。何を持ってきた？"

#. ~ Mission name
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Jack_Isherwood.json
msgid "Find 10 3 L jars"
msgstr "10個のガラス瓶(3L)を見つける"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find 10 3 L jars"
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Jack_Isherwood.json
msgid "I could use some help scavenging."
msgstr "物資を探すのを手伝ってくれると助かるのだが。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find 10 3 L jars"
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Jack_Isherwood.json
msgid ""
"We could use some 3 liter jars to preserve our produce.  Can you bring me 10"
" large three liter jars?  I'll give you some preserves in exchange."
msgstr "ガラス瓶を使って農作物を保存したいんだ。3Lのガラス瓶を10個持ってきてもらえんか？報酬としてジャムを渡そう。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find 10 3 L jars"
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Jack_Isherwood.json
msgid "Thank you.  It's important to preserve foods while we can."
msgstr "ありがとう。できる限り食料を保存しておくのは大事なことだ。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find 10 3 L jars"
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Jack_Isherwood.json
msgid "Oh well.  I'll see if I can find another way, thanks."
msgstr "しかたがない。他の方法を探すことにするよ。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find 10 3 L jars"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find 100 wheat seeds"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "In a Pickle Pt. 2"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "In a Pickle"
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Jack_Isherwood.json
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_staff/NPC_free_merchant_broker.json
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_staff/Smokes/free_merchant_shopkeep_missions.json
msgid "Grocery stores, house kitchens, there's plenty of places to look."
msgstr "食料雑貨店に家屋の台所、探す場所はたくさんある。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find 10 3 L jars"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find 100 wheat seeds"
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Jack_Isherwood.json
msgid "Wow, perfect.  Thanks.  Here's your reward."
msgstr "よし、完璧だ。ありがとう。報酬を受け取ってくれ。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find 10 3 L jars"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "In a Pickle Pt. 2"
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Jack_Isherwood.json
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_staff/NPC_free_merchant_broker.json
msgid "I wonder where all the jars went…"
msgstr "世界中の瓶がどこかに消えてしまったんだろうか..."

#. ~ Mission name
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Jack_Isherwood.json
msgid "Find 100 wheat seeds"
msgstr "100個の種(小麦)を見つける"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find 100 wheat seeds"
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Jack_Isherwood.json
msgid "I do have some more scavenging for you."
msgstr "もう一つ物資集めを手伝ってもらいたい。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find 100 wheat seeds"
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Jack_Isherwood.json
msgid ""
"We could use some seeds for the next planting season.  Can you bring me 100 "
"wheat seeds?  I'll give you some fresh produce."
msgstr "次の植え付けシーズンまでに種を揃えたい。小麦の種を100個集めてきてもらえんか？報酬として、取れたての食材を譲ろう。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find 100 wheat seeds"
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Jack_Isherwood.json
msgid "Thank you.  It's important to preserve healthy foods while we can."
msgstr "ありがとう。体に良い食料をできる限りたくさん確保しておくのが大事だ。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find 100 wheat seeds"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "In a Pickle Pt. 2"
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Jack_Isherwood.json
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_staff/NPC_free_merchant_broker.json
msgid "Oh well.  I'll see if I can find another supplier, thanks."
msgstr "しかたがない。他の仕入れ先を探すことにするよ。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find 100 wheat seeds"
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Jack_Isherwood.json
msgid "I wonder where all the seeds went…"
msgstr "世界中の小麦の種がどこかに消えてしまったんだろうか..."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Jesse_Isherwood.json
msgid "Leave our property, Marshal."
msgstr "執行官め、うちの土地から出て行きな。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Jesse_Isherwood.json
msgid "Hello.  We don't see many people these days."
msgstr "ごきげんよう。このご時世に人間なんて珍しいね。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Jesse_Isherwood.json
msgid "Hi, it looks like you are doing well here."
msgstr "やあ、ここで上手くやっているようだな。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Jesse_Isherwood.json
msgid "Hi, Jack and Claire suggested I come down here and meet you."
msgstr "やあ、ジャックとクレアから話を聞いて、挨拶に来たんだ。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Jesse_Isherwood.json
msgid ""
"It would be a lot harder without family.  Keeping the animals safe is "
"essential to our future."
msgstr "家族がいなければ、もっと苦労してただろうね。家畜の安全を守り続けることは、私たちの未来そのものさ。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Jesse_Isherwood.json
msgid "Sounds like you are betting on civilization not coming back."
msgstr "まるで今後も文明が復興しないと思っているようだな。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Jesse_Isherwood.json
msgid "Do you have any animal care tips?"
msgstr "動物を世話するコツは？"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Jesse_Isherwood.json
msgid ""
"We can't wait for someone else to fix things, we need to take care of "
"ourselves."
msgstr "他人がどうにかしてくれるのを待ってても仕方ないよ。自力で生きていかないとね。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Jesse_Isherwood.json
msgid ""
"Horses make good all around companions.  They can get places that cars can't"
" and also help when all the engines fail.  They become very trusting if you "
"feed them some nice fodder."
msgstr ""
"馬は群れで飼った方がいい。車両が入れない土地にも入れるし、エンジンが故障したときも役に立つ。いい飼料を与えれば、飼い主を信頼するようになるよ。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Jesse_Isherwood.json
msgid ""
"Oh good, I'm sure Jack wanted to put you to work.  If you're interested, I "
"could use a hand clearing out the woods.  My son, Chris has his hands full "
"trying to keep the predators under control."
msgstr ""
"それは良かった、ジャックが人手を欲しがってたからね。それから、もし興味があるなら森の安全を守るために手を貸してもらいたい。うちのクリスが化け物をどうにかしようと苦労してるんだ。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Jesse_Isherwood.json
msgid "I'd like to speak with Carlos too about some work."
msgstr "カーロスと仕事について話がしたい。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Jesse_Isherwood.json
msgid ""
"Is Chris around?  I'd like to know what he's run into out in the woods."
msgstr "クリスはこの辺りにいるのか？彼は森で何に出くわしたんだ？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Jesse_Isherwood.json
msgid "What needs killing?"
msgstr "何を倒せばいいんだ？"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Jesse_Isherwood.json
msgid "He's out back in the workshop."
msgstr "カーロスは作業場に戻ってるよ。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Jesse_Isherwood.json
msgid ""
"He's out doing some surveying, we are planning on adding a fence line and "
"some defenses."
msgstr "土地を調査しているよ。敷地に柵や防壁を追加する計画を立てているんだ。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Jesse_Isherwood.json
msgid "You should get off my farm, I won't deal with a government stooge."
msgstr "うちの農場から出て行きな。政府の策略には乗らないよ。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Jesse_Isherwood.json
msgid "Looks like you are doing well here."
msgstr "ここで上手くやっているようだな。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Jesse_Isherwood.json
msgid "Jack and Claire suggested I come talk to you."
msgstr "ジャックとクレアから話を聞いて、会いにきたんだ。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Jesse_Isherwood.json
msgid "Is Chris around?"
msgstr "クリスはこの辺りにいるのか？"

#. ~ Mission name
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Jesse_Isherwood.json
msgid "Kill wolves"
msgstr "複数のオオカミを殺す"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Kill wolves"
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Jesse_Isherwood.json
msgid "We could use some help killing some wolves."
msgstr "オオカミを殺す手伝いをしてくれると助かるんだけど。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Kill wolves"
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Jesse_Isherwood.json
msgid ""
"There's been some wolves that keep scaring our chickens and horses, I'd be "
"grateful if you can kill them."
msgstr "オオカミがいるせいでニワトリやウマが怯えているんだ。狩りを手伝ってくれたら助かるね。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Kill wolves"
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Jesse_Isherwood.json
msgid "Wonderful, let me know when it is done."
msgstr "よかった。終わったら教えておくれ。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Kill wolves"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Kill monsters"
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Jesse_Isherwood.json
msgid "Thanks anyway, we will try some traps."
msgstr "話だけでも聞いてくれてありがとう。罠でも仕掛けてみようかね。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Kill wolves"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Kill monsters"
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Jesse_Isherwood.json
msgid "A gun will probably help."
msgstr "きっと銃が役に立つはずだよ。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Kill wolves"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Kill monsters"
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Jesse_Isherwood.json
msgid "Did you kill it?"
msgstr "倒したのかい？"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Kill wolves"
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Jesse_Isherwood.json
msgid ""
"I appreciate it, I've got this old saddle I want you to have.  I'll be happy"
" to put a horse under it if you want to do some more heroics."
msgstr "感謝するよ。使い古しだけど、この鞍をもらっとくれ。ウマに着けて乗れば、気分はさながら英雄さ。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Kill wolves"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Kill monsters"
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Jesse_Isherwood.json
msgid "Show me the bodies."
msgstr "死体はどこだい。"

#. ~ Mission name
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Jesse_Isherwood.json
msgid "Kill monsters"
msgstr "複数のモンスターを殺す"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Kill monsters"
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Jesse_Isherwood.json
msgid "We could use some help killing some monsters."
msgstr "化け物を倒すのを手伝ってくれると助かるんだけど。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Kill monsters"
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Jesse_Isherwood.json
msgid ""
"We could use some help killing a pack of monsters.  I don't know what they "
"are, but they're very fast, I'm willing to outfit you with a horse if you "
"succeed."
msgstr "化け物を倒すのを手伝ってほしいんだ。正体が何なのか分からないが、すごく素早い奴さ。上手く倒してくれたら、ウマを一頭譲ろう。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Kill monsters"
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Jesse_Isherwood.json
msgid "Be ready for anything."
msgstr "何があっても慌てないようにね。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Kill monsters"
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Jesse_Isherwood.json
msgid ""
"I appreciate it, this will help keep our animals safe.  This is, Steve, he's"
" a good, steady horse.  You should talk to Carlos about some armor for him."
msgstr ""
"感謝するよ。これで動物たちも安心だ。この子はスティーブ。大人しくて賢いウマなんだ。カーロスと話せば、ウマに着ける鎧のことを聞けるんじゃないかな。"

#. ~ Nickname for creature 'mon_horse' in an effect
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Jesse_Isherwood.json
msgid "Steve"
msgstr "ｽﾃｨｰﾌﾞ"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Lisa_Isherwood.json
msgid ""
"I see that badge, I think you need to keep on walking, straight off this "
"property."
msgstr "バッジを付けてるじゃない。うちの敷地から出てった方がいいよ。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Lisa_Isherwood.json
msgid "Hi, this is a nice farm, your family lives here?"
msgstr "やあ、素敵な農場だな。あなたの家族はここに住んでいるのか？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Lisa_Isherwood.json
msgid "Hi, I'm looking for Jesse."
msgstr "やあ、ジェスを探しているんだ。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Lisa_Isherwood.json
msgid "Hi, I'm looking for Chris."
msgstr "やあ、クリスを探しているんだ。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Lisa_Isherwood.json
msgid ""
"I talked to Chris about rescuing Barry.  He thinks you might be able to "
"help."
msgstr "バリーの救出作戦についてクリスと話したんだ。クリスは協力者の候補としてあなたを挙げていた。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Lisa_Isherwood.json
msgid ""
"My family owns all the land around here, my parents are out in the barn and "
"my other family is down he road."
msgstr "この辺りの土地は全部うちの家族のもの。両親は納屋にいるし、他の家族は道を進んだ先にいるよ。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Lisa_Isherwood.json
msgid "Ok, I'll go find them."
msgstr "分かった、探してみるよ。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Lisa_Isherwood.json
msgid ""
"Mom is in her office, in the barn.  Be careful that you don't let our horses"
" out."
msgstr "ママは馬小屋の中の事務室にいるよ。入る時はウマを逃がさないよう注意してね。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Lisa_Isherwood.json
msgid "Chris is out hunting or something right now."
msgstr "クリスなら、今は狩りか何かしてるんじゃないかな？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Lisa_Isherwood.json
msgid "Oh, ok."
msgstr "ああ、分かった。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Lisa_Isherwood.json
msgid "Or something?"
msgstr "狩りか何か？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Lisa_Isherwood.json
msgid "Nice talking to you, bye."
msgstr "話せて良かったよ、またな。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Lisa_Isherwood.json
msgid ""
"Well he's supposed to be hunting, but since you've been talking to Luke, I "
"bet he mentioned Chris wants to learn more about the end of the world.  "
"Sometimes he'll take off for a few days and I end up patching him up so my "
"parents don't know he left the property."
msgstr ""
"ええと、狩りをしてることになってる。ルークと話したことがあるなら、クリスが世界の崩壊についてもっと知りたがってることは聞いたでしょ。クリスは時々家を何日か空けるんだけど、それが両親にバレないよう、わたしが取り繕ってあげてるんだ。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Lisa_Isherwood.json
msgid ""
"Yeah, Chris talked to me a minute ago.\"  She touches the shoulder strap on "
"her rifle.  \"I can't believe he's not trying to talk me out of it, really, "
"but I'd do anything to save Uncle Barry.  I'll be ready at the tower, when "
"you need me."
msgstr ""
"ええ、さっきクリスからその話は聞いた。」彼女はライフルの負い紐に触れました。「本当、クリスがわたしに今まで協力を持ち掛けなかったことが信じらんない。とにかく、バリーおじさんを助けるためならどんなことでもする。そのときが来たら、塔で会いましょう。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Lisa_Isherwood.json
msgid "Great.  I'll see you there."
msgstr "頼もしい。ではまた今度。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Lisa_Isherwood.json
msgid ""
"He did?\"  She touches the shoulder strap on her rifle.  \"Like, action?  "
"Yeah, I'm a pretty good shot, and I'd do anything to save Uncle Barry.  I'm "
"surprised Chris didn't try to go all protective older brother on me.  What's"
" the plan?\""
msgstr ""
"あいつが？」彼女はライフルの負い紐に触れました。「戦闘、ってこと？ええ、射撃には自信があるし、バリーおじさんのためなら何だってするよ。兄貴面してわたしをのけ者にすると思ってたのに、ちょっと意外。それで、どんな計画？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Lisa_Isherwood.json
msgid "[Explain the plan.]"
msgstr "[計画を説明する]"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Lisa_Isherwood.json
msgid ""
"&She listens intently as you explain.  \"All right.  I'll be ready at the "
"tower when you need me.\""
msgstr "&彼女は計画を熱心に聞いています。「分かった。そのときになったら、塔で会いましょう。」"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Luke_Isherwood.json
msgid ""
"*is a young man in his mid teens, wearing threadbare but clean work trousers"
" and a plain shirt with a few holes in it.  He looks you up and down as you "
"approach"
msgstr ""
"*は10代半ばの少年です。擦り切れてはいるものの清潔そうな作業ズボンと、所々に穴が開いた無地のシャツを着ています。近付くと、こちらをジロジロと眺め"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Luke_Isherwood.json
msgid ""
", then scowls as he spots the Old Guard Marshal badge gleaming on your "
"chest.  \"I see that badge.  You should leave before my father spots it.\""
msgstr "、胸元に光るオールドガードの執行官バッジを見付けて顔をしかめました。「そのバッジ。父さんに見つかる前にここから出てった方がいい。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Luke_Isherwood.json
msgid ""
", and nods once when he sees you've taken off your marshal badge.  \"Tread "
"carefully around here, we don't have a lot of respect for your type of "
"lawman.\""
msgstr ""
"、執行官バッジが外されているのを確認して、頷きました。「ここでは慎重に動いた方がいい。うちの家族はみんな、政府の人間に愛想よくしたりはしない。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Luke_Isherwood.json
msgid ", then raises a hand to greet you.  \"Hello.\""
msgstr "、手を挙げて挨拶しました。「どうも。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Luke_Isherwood.json
msgid ""
", then raises his hand to his forehead in an old fashioned hat-tipping sort "
"of gesture.  \"Hello.\""
msgstr "、帽子を傾ける昔ながらの挨拶をしました。「どうも。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Luke_Isherwood.json
msgid "What's wrong with me being a marshal?"
msgstr "私が執行官であることの何が問題なんだ？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Luke_Isherwood.json
msgid "Your dad said you were out here fixing up this place."
msgstr "あなたのお父さんから、ここを修繕していると聞いた。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Luke_Isherwood.json
msgid "How are those books doing for you?"
msgstr "本は役に立ったか？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Luke_Isherwood.json
msgid ""
"Chris and I have a little project for you that we've cooked up, if you're "
"interested."
msgstr "クリスと私が考えているちょっとした計画について、あなたの力を借りたい。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Luke_Isherwood.json
msgid "We've got the truck, what's next?"
msgstr "トラックは手に入った。次は何だ？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Luke_Isherwood.json
msgid ""
"I've got the dynamite you requested, I can't wait to see how this works out."
msgstr "お望みのダイナマイトを入手した。活躍が楽しみだ。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Luke_Isherwood.json
msgid "Hey, what are you doing out here?"
msgstr "やあ、ここで何をしているんだ？"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Luke_Isherwood.json
msgid ""
"I don't see how it's much of your business what our story is.  You can try "
"asking my dad, Eddie, if you really want.  Just don't start acting like some"
" little piece of tin in your pocket means you can come in like you own the "
"place."
msgstr ""
"あなたがそんなにオレに話を聞きたがってる理由も分からないな。父さんのエディに聞いたらいい。安っぽいバッジを持ってるからって、よその土地を偉そうに歩き回れるとは思わないでほしいね。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Luke_Isherwood.json
msgid ""
"Yeah, I work on it when I have the time.  I can't leave the farm too long, "
"so I can't find some things I need."
msgstr "ああ、空いた時間に作業してるよ。農場をあまり長く空けられないから、必要な物資が中々揃わないんだ。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Luke_Isherwood.json
msgid "Maybe I can help out.  What do you need?"
msgstr "もしかしたら手伝えるかもしれない。何が必要だ？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Luke_Isherwood.json
msgid ""
"Must be tough having the world fall apart when you had you future to look "
"forward to."
msgstr "将来が楽しみな時期に世界が崩壊するなんて、辛かっただろうな。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Luke_Isherwood.json
msgid ""
"*gestures to where they sit on a shelf.  \"I've been trying to look at them,"
" but I can't focus too much right now.\"  He smiles sadly.  \"Hope to get to"
" them soon.\""
msgstr ""
"*は棚に置かれた本を指し示しました。「読もうとは思ってるけど、今はあまり集中できない。」彼は悲しそうに微笑みました。「早く帰ってきてくれないかな。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Luke_Isherwood.json
msgid "Because of Barry?"
msgstr "バリーのことか？"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Luke_Isherwood.json
msgid ""
"*winces a little at the name.  \"Yeah.  Because of Barry.\"  You can see "
"he'd rather not pursue the topic."
msgstr "*はその名前を聞くと、少したじろぎました。「そう。バリーのこと。」その話題にはあまり触れたくないようです。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Luke_Isherwood.json
msgid ""
"*smiles.  \"Bit early to tell, but I've been doing some night time reading "
"and trying a few things out.\""
msgstr "*は微笑みました。「それはまだ分からないけど、寝る前に本を読み進めて、実際に試したりもしてる。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Luke_Isherwood.json
msgid ""
"*smiles brightly.  \"Real great, thanks!  I've learned a lot from them "
"already.  Tried my hand at some basic stuff, it's fun to learn new things.\""
msgstr ""
"*は満面の笑みを浮かべました。「とても役立ってる、ありがとう！色々なことを知れた。基本的な技法を試したりもしてる。新しいことを学ぶのって楽しいな。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Luke_Isherwood.json
msgid ""
"*gestures around at the worn down shed surrounding you.  \"I've been "
"cleaning up this old building to make it into a workshop.  I want to put up "
"a pottery kiln and forge.  My dad doesn't want me leaving the farm to find "
"some things"
msgstr ""
"*はボロボロの小屋を指さしました。「この古い建物を綺麗にして、作業場にしたんだ。陶器を作る窯と炉を置きたいと思ってる。物資を探しに農場の外へ行きたいけど、父さんは嫌がるんだ。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Luke_Isherwood.json
msgid ""
", says it is too dangerous.  After what happened with Barry, well, I tend to"
" agree with him.\"  He smiles thinly.  \"Don't want you to have to run out "
"saving another one of us, right?\""
msgstr ""
"危険すぎるって。バリーにあんなことがあったから、まあ、行かない方がいいってのは分かるんだけど。」彼は薄笑いを浮かべました。「命を落とすくらいなら家族を救うために動け、ってとこかな？"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Luke_Isherwood.json
msgid ""
", says it's too dangerous.  I used to think he was being a pain in the butt,"
" but lately…\" he stops abruptly, and says nothing more."
msgstr "危険すぎるって。前は一々うるさいなと思ってたけど、最近は...」彼はそこで言葉を切り、押し黙りました。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Luke_Isherwood.json
msgid ""
"I know all the grown-ups worry about us, but I think we can adapt better "
"than them in the long run.  Chris - my cousin - has some interesting "
"thoughts on the matter."
msgstr ""
"大人がオレらを心配してることは分かってるさ。でも長い目で見たら、きっと大人よりもこの世界で上手くやっていけると思うんだ。従兄のクリスも、これからのことをしっかり考えてる。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Luke_Isherwood.json
msgid "What sort of ideas does Chris have?"
msgstr "クリスはどう考えているんだ？"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Luke_Isherwood.json
msgid ""
"&His shoulders slump a little at the question.  \"Things have been tough for"
" my dad since Barry was captured.  He works till he falls asleep most "
"nights…\""
msgstr "&彼は肩を落とし、答えました。「バリーが捕まってから、父さんは大変そうだ。夜遅くまでずっと忙しそうで..."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Luke_Isherwood.json
msgid ""
"*looks around, then leans in just a little closer.  \"He's doing OK now that"
" Barry's home, but, well, things still aren't the same.  I imagine that'll "
"take time.\""
msgstr ""
"*は辺りを見回し、少し身を寄せて答えました。「バリーが戻ってきたお陰で、父さんも元気になったみたいだ。まあ、全部元通りって訳じゃない。時間はかかると思う。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Luke_Isherwood.json
msgid ""
"*goes a bit pale.  \"I shouldn't have said that.  Not my place to talk to a "
"stranger about it.\""
msgstr "*は顔を青くしました。「こんなこと言うべきじゃなかった。赤の他人に話すことじゃない。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Luke_Isherwood.json
msgid ""
"I already know Barry got captured.  I just wanted to know a bit more about "
"it.  Maybe I can help."
msgstr "バリーが捕まったことは知っている。もう少し詳しい話が聞きたかったんだ。もしかすると、何か手伝えるかもしれない。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Luke_Isherwood.json
msgid "I might be able to help, though."
msgstr "何か助けになれるかもしれない。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Luke_Isherwood.json
msgid ""
"*frowns.  \"I don't know how much I can tell you.  Your best bet is to talk "
"to Uncle Carlos.\""
msgstr "*は眉を寄せました。「どこまで話していいのか分からないな。カーロス叔父さんに聞いてみるといいよ。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Luke_Isherwood.json
msgid ""
"I really… okay.  Maybe ask my grandma, Claire.  She'll know if it's okay to "
"talk about."
msgstr "ええと...分かった。クレア婆ちゃんに聞いてみたらいい。話して大丈夫かどうか、ちゃんと分かってるだろうから。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Luke_Isherwood.json
msgid ""
"Chris is a little older than me, he's up at the horse farm with his parents "
"and sister, Lisa."
msgstr "クリスはオレよりちょっと年上で、両親と妹のリサと一緒に馬牧場で暮らしてる。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Luke_Isherwood.json
msgid ""
"Well, he doesn't agree that what we're doing here will last.  He thinks "
"things will only get worse.\"  Luke shrugs, as if to say he doesn't have a "
"strong opinion on the matter.  \"It's tough to get the adults to listen "
"though, much less agree with his solution.  You can go talk to him more "
"about it if you want."
msgstr ""
"ええと、ここでの生活は長くは持たないって考えてるみたい。これから先も状況は悪くなる一方だってさ。」ルークはどちらの意見に賛成するか決めかねているように、肩をすくめました。「でも、大人にそんなこと言ったって、聞いてもらえないさ。ましてや賛成してもらうだなんて。詳しく聞きたかったら、本人と話してみればいい。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Luke_Isherwood.json
msgid "You won't find any help here."
msgstr "何か助けを借りようったって無駄さ。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Luke_Isherwood.json
msgid "Tell me about your dad."
msgstr "あなたの父親について聞きたい。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Luke_Isherwood.json
msgid "How does this all come together?"
msgstr "集めたもので一体何をするんだ？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Luke_Isherwood.json
msgid ""
"Well, we are going to turn this truck into a bomb that'll give us a big "
"enough opening in the tower to let out some of the heat and gas.  But small "
"enough that it won't kill Barry unless it's right next to him."
msgstr ""
"トラックに爆弾を積んで塔に突っ込ませ、十分な大きさの穴を開けて熱とガスを排出させようと思っている。もちろん、爆発はバリーが離れていれば安全な規模のものだ。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Luke_Isherwood.json
msgid "Are you serious?  This is your brother we are risking here!"
msgstr "本気か？オレらの家族が危ない目に遭うじゃないか！"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Luke_Isherwood.json
msgid "Exactly, and I wouldn't do anything to risk him unnecessarily."
msgstr "不必要な危険に晒すつもりはまったくない、保証しよう。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Luke_Isherwood.json
msgid ""
"OK so I have an idea on how we can breach that tower.  We need a truck and "
"some dynamite.  I've heard about some bandits in a truck robbing people "
"nearby.  If you can take care of the bandits I'll pick up the truck later"
msgstr ""
"それなら、あの塔の壁を破るいい方法がある。トラックとダイナマイトが要るな。ちょうど、近所でトラックに乗った二人組が強盗を繰り返してるって話を聞いた。強盗たちをやっつけてくれたら、後でトラックを取りにいくよ。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Luke_Isherwood.json
msgid "I think I can manage two bandits."
msgstr "二人組程度ならなんとかなりそうだ。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Luke_Isherwood.json
msgid "Surely we can think of a better way in."
msgstr "もっといいやり方があるんじゃないか。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Luke_Isherwood.json
msgid ""
"So now that we've got the truck we need the boom.  See if you can find some "
"dynamite at the old mines?  Once we got the dynamite I'll rig that up to a "
"kitchen timer and we'll have a bomb on wheels.  I'll need 50lbs to light "
"that truck up like the 4th of July!"
msgstr ""
"トラックが調達できたら、次は爆発物だ。古い鉱山だったら、ダイナマイトが見つかるかな？ダイナマイトを手に入れてくれたら、キッチンタイマーと組み合わせて自走爆弾を作ってやるよ。独立記念日の花火みたいに派手にやるなら、50ポンド爆弾が要るだろうな！"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Luke_Isherwood.json
msgid "This is gonna rad as heck as long as it works."
msgstr "首尾よく爆弾を調達できたら、きっと作戦も成功するだろうな。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Luke_Isherwood.json
msgid "Not doing it."
msgstr "そう上手くいくだろうか。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Luke_Isherwood.json
msgid ""
"I've got everything I need to make this breaching truck for us.  Thanks!"
msgstr "突撃トラックを作るのに必要なものは全部揃った。ありがとう！"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Luke_Isherwood.json
msgid "[heck yeah]"
msgstr "[強く頷く]"

#. ~ Mission name
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Luke_Isherwood.json
msgid "Find The Art of Glassblowing book"
msgstr "本(学習/硝子吹き製法)を見つける"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find The Art of Glassblowing book"
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Luke_Isherwood.json
msgid "I need more knowledge to get the glass blowing started."
msgstr "硝子吹きを始めるには、もっと知識が必要だな。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find The Art of Glassblowing book"
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Luke_Isherwood.json
msgid ""
"I could really use a book on glass blowing.  With the internet gone, I don't"
" have any handy references."
msgstr "硝子吹きに関する本を何とかして読みたいんだ。インターネットがなくなったから、便利な参考資料も見られない。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find The Art of Glassblowing book"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find a copy of DIY Compendium"
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Luke_Isherwood.json
msgid "Fantastic, I'm not supposed to leave our land."
msgstr "やった。オレがこの農場を離れるわけにはいかないからね。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find The Art of Glassblowing book"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find a copy of DIY Compendium"
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Luke_Isherwood.json
msgid "Oh well, figured I'd have to do a lot of practice anyway."
msgstr "仕方ないか。とにかく練習して学ぶしかないな。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find The Art of Glassblowing book"
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Luke_Isherwood.json
msgid "A library, bookstore or a glass blower's studio should have one."
msgstr "図書館、書店、硝子吹きの工房なんかを探せばあると思う。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find The Art of Glassblowing book"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find a copy of DIY Compendium"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find a copy of Homebrewer's Bible"
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Luke_Isherwood.json
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_foreman.json
msgid "Do you have the book?"
msgstr "本は見つかったか？"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find The Art of Glassblowing book"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find a copy of DIY Compendium"
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Luke_Isherwood.json
msgid "I appreciate it, this will make my life so much easier."
msgstr "ありがとう。これで生活がずっと楽になる。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find The Art of Glassblowing book"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find a copy of DIY Compendium"
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Luke_Isherwood.json
msgid "I don't see a book…?"
msgstr "本はどこだ...？"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find The Art of Glassblowing book"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find a copy of DIY Compendium"
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Luke_Isherwood.json
msgid "At least you escaped with your life…"
msgstr "少なくとも生きては帰ってきた..."

#. ~ Mission name
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Luke_Isherwood.json
msgid "Find a copy of DIY Compendium"
msgstr "本(学習/日曜大工全書)を見つける"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find a copy of DIY Compendium"
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Luke_Isherwood.json
msgid "I need more knowledge to get better pottery."
msgstr "もっと高品質な陶器を作るには、もっと知識が必要だな。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find a copy of DIY Compendium"
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Luke_Isherwood.json
msgid ""
"I could really use the book, DIY Compendium.  With the internet gone, I "
"don't have any handy references."
msgstr "「日曜大工全書」という本を何とかして読みたいんだ。インターネットがなくなったから、便利な参考資料も見られない。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find a copy of DIY Compendium"
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Luke_Isherwood.json
msgid "A library, bookstore should have one, schools are another good idea."
msgstr "図書館や書店を探してもいいし、学校にもあるかもな。"

#. ~ Mission name
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Luke_Isherwood.json
msgid "Retrieve the Truck for Luke Isherwood"
msgstr "ルークのためにトラックを奪う"

#. ~ Description of mission "Retrieve the Truck for Luke Isherwood"
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Luke_Isherwood.json
msgid "Kill the two bandits for Luke Isherwood to get their truck."
msgstr "ルーク・イシャーウッドがトラックを調達できるように、二人の盗賊を殺しましょう。"

#. ~ Mission name
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Luke_Isherwood.json
msgid "Retrieve Some Dynamite for Luke"
msgstr "ルークのためにダイナマイトを調達する"

#. ~ Description of mission "Retrieve Some Dynamite for Luke"
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Luke_Isherwood.json
msgid ""
"Get 50 pounds of dynamite for Luke Isherwood to make a bomb.  There's a "
"known shipment at a mine in the region."
msgstr "ルーク・イシャーウッドが爆弾を作れるように、50ポンドのダイナマイトを手に入れましょう。この地域の鉱山に在庫が残っているようです。"

#. ~ Name suffix of an NPC
#. ~ Former prisoner with a melee or ranged weapon and prison clothing.
#. Sometimes they also have prison guards' gear.
#. ~ A naked prisoner trapped in a horrifying cage, watching horrible things
#. happen.
#: data/json/npcs/island_prison/prisoners.json
#: data/json/npcs/prisoners/mi-go_prisoners.json
msgid "prisoner"
msgstr "囚人"

#. ~ Name suffix of an NPC
#. ~ Former prisoner with a melee or ranged weapon and prison clothing.
#. Sometimes they also have prison guards' gear.
#: data/json/npcs/island_prison/prisoners.json
msgid "gatekeeper"
msgstr "看守"

#. ~ Name suffix of an NPC
#. ~ Former prisoner with a melee or ranged weapon and prison clothing.
#. Sometimes they also have prison guards' gear.
#: data/json/npcs/island_prison/prisoners.json
msgid "leader of prisoners"
msgstr "囚人リーダー"

#. ~ Name of an NPC class
#. ~ Skills intentionally kept low.  This character should probably have a
#. higher chance of having insanity type traits eventually.
#: data/json/npcs/island_prison/prisoners.json
#: data/json/npcs/prisoners/mi-go_prisoners.json
msgid "Prisoner"
msgstr "囚人"

#. ~ Job description of "Prisoner" NPC class
#: data/json/npcs/island_prison/prisoners.json
msgid "I'm here to kick ass."
msgstr "ここで滅茶苦茶カマしてやるんだ。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/island_prison/prisoners.json
msgid "Ok, sorry, I'm already leaving!"
msgstr "分かった、ごめん、もう行くよ！"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/island_prison/prisoners.json
msgid "Hey, <fuck_you>!"
msgstr "おい、<fuck_you>！"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
#: data/json/npcs/island_prison/prisoners.json
msgctxt "u:f"
msgid ""
"Hey, who the fuck are you?  I haven't seen you 'round.  Ah, fuck it, it doesn't matter.\n"
"Here's the rules.  The first and most important one: ALWAYS CLOSE THE FUCKING ENTRY DOOR BEHIND YOUR ASS!  If you're okay with that, the following rules are: don't fuck with us, don't steal from us, don't start a fight without a reason with someone from us.  Got it, punk?  Now get lost."
msgstr ""
"おい、誰だこいつは？知らない奴だ。ああ、クソッ、別に構わねぇ。\n"
"ここでのルール。まず一番重要なこと。お前がケツを向けてる、そこの出入口を常に閉じておけ！理解できたな、じゃあ次のルールだ。一つ、仲間を怒らせるな。一つ、仲間から盗むな。一つ、理由もなく仲間と喧嘩をするな。ひよっ子、分かったか？分かったら、失せな。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
