"I worked here before <the_cataclysm> dumped everything in the <swear> bin.  "
"I took care of all the animals here, and when the <zombies> started roaming "
"the streets, I gathered every pet or stray I could.  I still take care of "
"them, just gotta worry about the <zombies> now on top of disease, "
"cleanliness, etc."
msgstr ""
"ここは職場だった。<the_cataclysm>で全部めちゃくちゃになる前の話だよ、<swear>。ここでは動物の世話をしていた。<zombies>が街を徘徊し始めた時期に、ペットや野良犬を引き取ったんだ。今も世話を続けているが、病気や衛生状態に加えて、<zombies>の心配もしなきゃならないとはね。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
