msgid ""
"I'm going south.  Hopefully somebody down there fared better than the people"
" I knew up here.  Besides, I won't have to worry about freezing my <swear> "
"butt off when winter comes."
msgstr "南へ向かう。ここよりまともな人が多いと助かるんだがな。それに、<swear>、南へ行けば、冬にケツが凍る心配をせずに済む。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
