#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/beggars/BEGGAR_3_Luo_Meizhen.json
msgid "Yo.  Anyone else keen on moving from this bus stop to your tent city?"
msgstr "やあ。待合所からあんたのテント街に引っ越したがる奴は見つかったかい？"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/beggars/BEGGAR_3_Luo_Meizhen.json
msgid "Hey there.  Good to see you again."
msgstr "やあ、また会えて嬉しいよ。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/beggars/BEGGAR_3_Luo_Meizhen.json
msgid ""
"Careful, I'm getting hangry again and am not totally responsible for my own "
"actions."
msgstr "気をつけな、また腹が減ってきた。こうなると何をしでかすか分かったもんじゃないよ。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/beggars/BEGGAR_3_Luo_Meizhen.json
msgctxt "u:f"
msgid ""
"Look, I'm sorry for freaking out earlier.  You might be an asshole but I'm "
"sure you didn't mean it like that.  My blood sugar is hella low, I get a bit"
" cranky.  We cool?"
msgstr ""
"ねえ、前はキレてしまって悪かったよ。あんたはクソったれかも知れないけど、誤解があったのかもしれない。血糖値がどん底なんだ。キレやすくなってる。分かるだろう？"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/beggars/BEGGAR_3_Luo_Meizhen.json
