#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Alonso_Lautrec.json
msgid "I give to you what of I got.  And this is Alonso so I mean it's a lot."
msgstr "私のものを君に捧げよう。私はアロンソだ。あげられるものはたくさんある。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Alonso_Lautrec.json
msgid "Yeah, I'd better get going."
msgstr "やぁ、もうそろそろ行くよ。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Alonso_Lautrec.json
msgid ""
"\"\n"
"\n"
"After shooting Alonso a smile of genuine respect, Liam gives you a sly wink, heads to the door, theatrically produces a sock from - somewhere, you're not sure where - slides it on the doorknob, and leaves the room."
msgstr ""
"」\n"
"\n"
"リアムはアロンソに心からの尊敬の表情を向けると、こちらにいたずらっぽくウィンクしてドアに向かい、芝居がかった仕草で靴下を取り出し(一体どこから出したのか全く分かりません)、それをドアノブに嵌め、部屋から出て行きました。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Alonso_Lautrec.json
msgid "Sorry kid, you're younger than my little sister was.  Seems wrong."
msgstr "悪いね、妹より若い奴の相手はちょっとマズい。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Alonso_Lautrec.json
msgid "Alonso thinks maybe we should wait a few years?"
msgstr "アロンソが思うに、あと数年待った方がいいのでは？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Alonso_Lautrec.json
msgid "Sigh."
msgstr "はぁ。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Alonso_Lautrec.json
msgid ""
"I'm sorry.  I… saw things back there, when it all went sideways.  I can't go"
" back, not for anything."
msgstr "申し訳ない。私は...あの場所で事件が起こった時、動転してしまってね。何があっても、あそこへは行きたくないんだ。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Alonso_Lautrec.json
msgid ""
"Alonso, alas, is sorry, but he cannot sully his hands with blood.  It is not"
" that he does not wish to prove his strength, but he… he is not strong "
"enough."
msgstr ""
"アロンソは、ああ、申し訳ないが、その手を血で染めたくない。自分の強さを証明したくないことはないが、アロンソは...アロンソはそんなに強くない。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Alonso_Lautrec.json
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/shared_dialogue.json
msgid "Thanks anyway.  What were you saying before?"
msgstr "気持ちだけでも嬉しいよ。そういえば、前に言ってた話は何だっけ？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Alonso_Lautrec.json
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/shared_dialogue.json
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_staff/NPC_free_merchant_guard_generic.json
msgid "Well, thanks anyway."
msgstr "いや、気持ちだけでも嬉しいよ。"

