"I found this weird cartoon sign with a map on it, pointing to some kind of "
"trade center.  Haven't been there yet but I can show you my copy of the map "
"if you want."
msgstr ""
"荒野で妙なものを色々と見つけたんだ。ちょっと前に見たのは、マップが付いた絵文字の看板さ。交易拠点って意味だったと思うんだがね。看板が指してる場所には行ってないが、もし興味があるなら場所を教えようか。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_visitors/NPC_visiting_scavenger.json
msgid "Sure, show me where to find this guy."
msgstr "ああ、その人物の居場所を知りたい。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_visitors/NPC_visiting_scavenger.json
msgid ""
"I'm always open to meet new survivors.  Where are these acquaintances of "
"yours?"
msgstr "新たな生存者なら、喜んで会いに行こう。その人たちはどこにいるんだ？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_visitors/NPC_visiting_scavenger.json
msgid "Weird.  I guess I could check that out too, sure."
msgstr "妙だな。ぜひ調べてみたいものだ。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_visitors/NPC_visiting_scavenger.json
msgid "Ah, yeah, I've heard of that too.  It's a weird world out there, hey?"
msgstr "ああ、なんだ、それなら私も知っている。この世界は本当に妙なことばかり起きるな？"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_visitors/NPC_visiting_scavenger.json
msgid "Sure, here, I'll draw you up a little map."
msgstr "よしよし、簡単なマップを書いておこう。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_visitors/NPC_visiting_scavenger.json
msgid "Thanks!  What's your story?"
msgstr "ありがとう！あなたはどうしてこんな暮らしをするようになったんだ？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_visitors/NPC_visiting_scavenger.json
msgid "Thanks!  I'd better get going."
msgstr "ありがとう！そろそろ行くよ。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_visitors/NPC_visiting_scavenger.json
msgid ""
"Sorry, I have people of my own to look out for.  I can't leave them in the "
"lurch."
msgstr "悪いね、こっちも世話してる奴らがいて、放って出て行く気にはなれないんだ。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_visitors/NPC_visiting_scavenger.json
msgid "They could come along too."
msgstr "その人たちも一緒に来ればいい。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_visitors/NPC_visiting_scavenger.json
msgid "Why don't I come back to your hideout?"
msgstr "あなたの拠点へ行ってもいい？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_visitors/NPC_visiting_scavenger.json
msgid "Oh well, I'd better get going."
msgstr "そうだったか。私はそろそろ行くよ。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_visitors/NPC_visiting_scavenger.json
msgid ""
"It doesn't really work that way.  They're back in safety, and I've got to go"
" check in with them with some supplies.  You know how it is, not everyone is"
" suited to risk travel these days."
msgstr "そうもいかない。せっかく安全な拠点が確保できたんだし、物資を持ち帰ってやらないと。危険な旅ができない奴だっているんだから。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_visitors/NPC_visiting_scavenger.json
msgid ""
"Look, I don't know a better way to put this.  I don't know you, I can't "
"bring some random back with me.  For all I know you're a cannibal psycho or "
"something.  We all saw too much of that during <the_cataclysm>.  Me and "
"mine, we're not looking to expand our tribe just now, OK?"
msgstr ""
"おい、こんなことは言いたかないがな。あんたのことは何も知らないし、危険かもしれない奴は入れたくない。あんたが人食いの狂人って可能性もある。<the_cataclysm>でそんな奴は山ほど見てきた。俺らは仲間を増やす気なんてない、分かったか？"

#. ~ Unique name of an NPC
#. ~ Appears in the the surface of Hub 01 as an external mercenary.
#: data/json/npcs/robofac/NPC_Cranberry_Foster.json
msgid "Cranberry Foster"
msgstr "ｸﾗﾝﾍﾞﾘｰ ﾌｫｽﾀｰ"

#. ~ Name suffix of an NPC
#. ~ Appears in the the surface of Hub 01 as an external mercenary.
#. ~ Name of an NPC class
#: data/json/npcs/robofac/NPC_Cranberry_Foster.json
msgid "Hub Mercenary"
msgstr "傭兵(ハブ01)"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/robofac/NPC_Cranberry_Foster.json
msgid "Better keep our eyes on the road."
msgstr "道中は気を付けて行動しろよ。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/robofac/NPC_Cranberry_Foster.json
msgid "*looks at you expectantly."
msgstr "*は期待に満ちた表情でこちらを見つめています。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/robofac/NPC_Cranberry_Foster.json
msgid "Better be careful around here."
msgstr "この辺では行動に気を付けろ。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/robofac/NPC_Cranberry_Foster.json
msgid "Got something to say?"
msgstr "何か用か？"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/robofac/NPC_Cranberry_Foster.json
msgid "I charge hourly, y'know."
msgstr "この仕事、時給制なんだよな。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/robofac/NPC_Cranberry_Foster.json
msgid "Hey."
msgstr "やあ。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/robofac/NPC_Cranberry_Foster.json
#: data/json/npcs/robofac/robofac_intercom/robofac_intercom.json
msgid "Good to see you."
msgstr "会えて嬉しいよ。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/robofac/NPC_Cranberry_Foster.json
msgid "Did I scare you off the first time?"
msgstr "初対面の時は、驚かせてしまったか？"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/robofac/NPC_Cranberry_Foster.json
msgid "Hi again, other person."
msgstr "やあ、また来たんだな。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/robofac/NPC_Cranberry_Foster.json
msgid "*waves."
msgstr "*は手を振って挨拶しました。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/robofac/NPC_Cranberry_Foster.json
msgid ""
"&There's a person reclined on the sofa here.  They're very tall, with their legs reaching to the other armrest, and they're wearing a set of Hub 01's modular armor.  An environmental suit in blue-and-brown is crumpled in a misshapen heap on the floor near the table, and leaning against the far armrest is a rifle looking like nothing you've seen before.\n"
"\n"
"They look up towards you as you come through the door and wave a hand.  \"Placeholder text.\""
msgstr ""
"&ハブ01のアーマーを身に付けた人物が一人、ソファに寝そべっています。非常に背が高く、肘掛けの端まで足が届くほどです。テーブルの傍の床には青と茶色の二色デザインの防護スーツが乱雑に置かれ、奥の肘掛けには見たこともないデザインのライフルが立て掛けてあります。\n"
"\n"
"その人物は入室者を見上げ、手を挙げました。「ここにテキストを入力。」"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/robofac/NPC_Cranberry_Foster.json
msgid "…Did you just say \"placeholder text\" out loud?"
msgstr "...今、「ここにテキストを入力。」って言わなかったか？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/robofac/NPC_Cranberry_Foster.json
msgid "Uh… okay.  Who are you?"
msgstr "ええと...まあいいか。あなたは誰だ？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/robofac/NPC_Cranberry_Foster.json
msgid "About those jobs…"
msgstr "それらの仕事について..."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/robofac/NPC_Cranberry_Foster.json
msgid "Want help with something else?"
msgstr "何か手伝ってほしいことはある？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/robofac/NPC_Cranberry_Foster.json
msgid "Let's set up a combat strategy."
msgstr "戦闘準備に入ろう。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/robofac/NPC_Cranberry_Foster.json
msgid "Good to have some company."
msgstr "仲間がいてくれて良かったよ。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/robofac/NPC_Cranberry_Foster.json
msgid "Have something to say?"
msgstr "何か話があるのか？"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/robofac/NPC_Cranberry_Foster.json
msgid "Did you want something?"
msgstr "何か用か？"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/robofac/NPC_Cranberry_Foster.json
msgid "*waits expectantly."
msgstr "*は期待を込めてこちらを見ています。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/robofac/NPC_Cranberry_Foster.json
msgid "So what's going on?"
msgstr "それで、今何をしているんだ？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/robofac/NPC_Cranberry_Foster.json
msgid "Anything on your mind?"
msgstr "何か気になることが？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/robofac/NPC_Cranberry_Foster.json
msgid "What was <the_cataclysm> like for you?"
msgstr "<the_cataclysm>はどんな状況だった？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/robofac/NPC_Cranberry_Foster.json
msgid "Want help with something?"
msgstr "何か手伝おうか？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/robofac/NPC_Cranberry_Foster.json
msgid "What do you know about our employers?"
msgstr "雇用主について何か情報は？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/robofac/NPC_Cranberry_Foster.json
msgid "That gun isn't like anything I've ever seen.  What am I looking at?"
msgstr "今までに見たこともない銃を持っているな。それは何だ？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/robofac/NPC_Cranberry_Foster.json
msgid "What's the deal with your gun again?"
msgstr "その銃はどうしたんだ？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/robofac/NPC_Cranberry_Foster.json
msgid ""
"I've helped you out now.  Do you think you could vouch for me with our "
"employers?"
msgstr "あなたを助けてあげただろう。雇い主に私のことを紹介してもらえるか？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/robofac/NPC_Cranberry_Foster.json
msgid "How can I get a gun like that?"
msgstr "そんな銃をどうやって手に入れたんだ？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/robofac/NPC_Cranberry_Foster.json
msgid ""
"I just realized, we've been in touch for a while now and I don't actually "
"know; are you a man or a woman?"
msgstr "そう言えば、しばらく話をしていたのに気付かなかった。あなたは男性、それとも女性？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/robofac/NPC_Cranberry_Foster.json
msgid "About the gold you wanted…"
msgstr "あなたが欲しがっていた金について..."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/robofac/NPC_Cranberry_Foster.json
msgid "Well, I should get going."
msgstr "ああ、もう行くよ。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ Snippet in category "magic_8ball_good"
#: data/json/npcs/robofac/NPC_Cranberry_Foster.json
#: data/json/snippets/snippets.json
msgid "Yes."
msgstr "はい。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/robofac/NPC_Cranberry_Foster.json
msgid "I don't know what I was expecting."
msgstr "答えを期待したのが間違いだった。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/robofac/NPC_Cranberry_Foster.json
msgid "Cool."
msgstr "いいじゃん。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/robofac/NPC_Cranberry_Foster.json
msgid ""
"I sure did.  Sorry, just a stupid icebreaker.  Old habits and all that.\"  "
"They sit up.  \"What's up?"
msgstr "ああ、うん。悪かった、単なるくだらない洒落だ。昔からの癖みたいなもので。」クランベリーは座り直しました。「どうかした？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/robofac/NPC_Cranberry_Foster.json
msgid "Who exactly are you?"
msgstr "あなたは何者なんだ？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/robofac/NPC_Cranberry_Foster.json
msgid "I thought I was the only one working for the people here."
msgstr "この施設で雇われている者が他にもいるとは知らなかった。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/robofac/NPC_Cranberry_Foster.json
msgid "Just saying hi.  I'll be on my way now."
msgstr "挨拶しにきただけだ。もう行くよ。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
#: data/json/npcs/robofac/NPC_Cranberry_Foster.json
msgctxt "u:f"
msgid ""
"Surprise!\"  They do jazz hands.  \"Sorry.  Well, I'm told that I'm part of "
"a small group right now.  Maybe you were the first."
msgstr "驚いただろう！」クランベリーは両手をひらひらと動かしておどけました。「失礼、小規模なグループだとは聞いている。多分あんたが先輩だろう。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
#: data/json/npcs/robofac/NPC_Cranberry_Foster.json
msgctxt "u:m"
msgid ""
"Surprise!\"  They do jazz hands.  \"Sorry.  Well, I'm told that I'm part of "
"a small group right now.  Maybe you were the first."
msgstr "驚いただろう！」クランベリーは両手をひらひらと動かしておどけました。「失礼、小規模なグループだとは聞いている。多分あんたが先輩だろう。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
#: data/json/npcs/robofac/NPC_Cranberry_Foster.json
msgctxt "u:n"
msgid ""
"Surprise!\"  They do jazz hands.  \"Sorry.  Well, I'm told that I'm part of "
"a small group right now.  Maybe you were the first."
msgstr "驚いただろう！」クランベリーは両手をひらひらと動かしておどけました。「失礼、小規模なグループだとは聞いている。多分あんたが先輩だろう。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/robofac/NPC_Cranberry_Foster.json
msgid ""
"Just the same as you.  Some nobody doing dirty work for scraps.  Uh, no "
"offense."
msgstr "あんたと同じ。クズのために汚い仕事をしてる雑魚だ。ああ、いや、言い方が悪かったか。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/robofac/NPC_Cranberry_Foster.json
msgid "None taken.  I guess that makes two of us."
msgstr "大丈夫。私たちは似た者同士だ。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/robofac/NPC_Cranberry_Foster.json
msgid "Well, never mind."
msgstr "いえ、お気になさらず。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/robofac/NPC_Cranberry_Foster.json
msgid ""
"I guess so.\"  They beam sheepishly.  \"Uh, call me Cranberry.  Cran is fine"
" too.  It's nice to meet someone else from here.  I guess having some "
"company for once wouldn't be awful."
msgstr ""
"そうだな。」クランベリーは気まずそうに笑いました。「ええと、名前はクランベリーだ。クランでもいい。会えて嬉しいよ。交友を深めるのもたまには悪くない。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/robofac/NPC_Cranberry_Foster.json
msgid "I guess I could stay for a while."
msgstr "しばらくここに滞在するつもりだ。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/robofac/NPC_Cranberry_Foster.json
msgid "Actually, I have some places to be right now.  Good to meet you."
msgstr "悪いけど、今から行く場所があるんだ。話せてよかった。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/robofac/NPC_Cranberry_Foster.json
msgid ""
"Not a whole lot, really.  They made me track down and destroy some "
"government documents a while back.  Obviously I read them first, but it "
"wasn't much.  As far as I know, this place had an experimental computer "
"network before everything went to hell.  What's going on in there now is "
"anybody's guess."
msgstr ""
"本当、大した仕事じゃない。前に頼まれたのは、政府文書の在り処を突き止めて処分しろって仕事だった。もちろん処分前に読んではみたが、大した内容でもない。世界が地獄と化すより前、ここには実験的なコンピュータネットワークがあったらしい。それが今どうなっているかは、誰にも分からないけど。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/robofac/NPC_Cranberry_Foster.json
msgid "Hold on, government documents?"
msgstr "ちょっと待った、政府文書？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/robofac/NPC_Cranberry_Foster.json
msgid "Computer network?"
msgstr "コンピュータネットワーク？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/robofac/NPC_Cranberry_Foster.json
msgid "Strange bedfellows…"
msgstr "妙な仕事もあるものだ..."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/robofac/NPC_Cranberry_Foster.json
msgid ""
"Yeah!  Crazy shit.  They sent me to an office building to find a folder with"
" a certain serial and get rid of it.  They didn't even care what was on it."
"  By the time I got there, though, the building was pretty much a wreck.  "
"The folder had been sitting in a puddle for God knows how long, and there "
"was nothing even remotely legible by then."
msgstr ""
"マジの話！イカれてるよ。オフィスビルで特定のシリアル番号が振られたフォルダを探して処分しろって言われたんだ。中身はどうでもいいらしい。でも、ビルに到着したときには、もう滅茶苦茶になっていた。フォルダも長い間水に浸かっていたようで、中身も読めない状態だったよ。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/robofac/NPC_Cranberry_Foster.json
msgid ""
"That's what the news said, anyway.  It was only about a 20-minute trip from "
"my apartment and sometimes I'd drive past it, so I was curious and I did "
"some research into it.  The only info I could find about it online said that"
" it was a NASA lab for computer research, but that was probably bullshit.  I"
" mean, do you see any NASA logos?  Sure, we got huge steel doors and 15-foot"
" concrete walls, but not a logo in sight.  The building probably goes "
"underground, right?  It's way too small to be a whole laboratory up here."
msgstr ""
"確かニュースで、そんなことを言ってたような。うちのアパートから車で20分程度だし、時々前を通るから、気になって調べてみたんだ。ネット検索したら、NASAのコンピュータ研究所としか出てこなかったが、きっとデタラメだ。NASAのロゴがどこにもないだろう？巨大な鉄のドアと4m超のコンクリ壁は確かにある。でもロゴがない。活動拠点は地下にあるのかもな？研究所にしては狭すぎる。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/robofac/NPC_Cranberry_Foster.json
msgid ""
"Just trying to get some rest.  I don't have anywhere else to stay, so they "
"let me sleep on the couch out here as long as I keep my gun handy."
msgstr "ちょっと休憩中。他に休めるところもないし、銃だけは手放さないようにして、ここのソファで寝泊まりしているんだ。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/robofac/NPC_Cranberry_Foster.json
msgid "They don't let you in to sleep?"
msgstr "雇い主は寝床を用意してくれないのか？"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/robofac/NPC_Cranberry_Foster.json
msgid ""
"Dude, I wish.  It sounds like there's different people on the mic at "
"different times, but all of them give me the same spiel: nobody's allowed in"
" right now.  I guess I shouldn't raise a fuss about it, honestly.  All being"
" considered, this compound is pretty safe, and the couch ain't so bad."
msgstr ""
"用意してくれたらいいんだけどな。通信係は時間帯によって違うみたいだけど、皆が口をそろえてこう言う。今は誰も入れない。別に怒るほどのことでもないし、いいんだけどさ。よく考えるとここは結構安全だし、ソファも悪くない。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
#: data/json/npcs/robofac/NPC_Cranberry_Foster.json
msgctxt "u:f"
msgid ""
"Yeah.  Have you noticed how they pay us in these tiny little gold coins?\"  "
"Cranberry holds one up for emphasis.  \"It's bizarre.  You'd think they have"
" a gold mine in there, but no, they don't, so they make me cross the damn "
"world grabbing gold bars.  As far as scrip goes, it seems inconvenient as "
"hell to make."
msgstr ""
"ああ。ちっぽけな金貨が支払われただろう？」クランベリーは一枚のコインを掲げました。「妙な話だ。別に近所に金鉱脈がある訳じゃない。ろくでもない世界の隅から隅まで探し回って、金を集める仕事があるんだよ。臨時の貨幣なんて不便なものを作る奴がこの世にいるとはね。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
