" a gold mine in there, but no, they don't, so they make me cross the damn "
"world grabbing gold bars.  As far as scrip goes, it seems inconvenient as "
"hell to make."
msgstr ""
"ああ。ちっぽけな金貨が支払われただろう？」クランベリーは一枚のコインを掲げました。「妙な話だ。別に近所に金鉱脈がある訳じゃない。ろくでもない世界の隅から隅まで探し回って、金を集める仕事があるんだよ。臨時の貨幣なんて不便なものを作る奴がこの世にいるとはね。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/robofac/NPC_Cranberry_Foster.json
msgid "You sound frustrated about it."
msgstr "随分と苛立っているようだ。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/robofac/NPC_Cranberry_Foster.json
msgid "Now that you mention it, it does seem rather strange."
msgstr "そう言われると、何だかおかしく思えてきた。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/robofac/NPC_Cranberry_Foster.json
msgid "Thinking I should go hunt something soon…"
msgstr "さてと、狩りにでも出掛けるか..."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/robofac/NPC_Cranberry_Foster.json
msgid "Just wondering if things will get better someday."
msgstr "この世界もいつかはマトモになるんだろうか。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/robofac/NPC_Cranberry_Foster.json
msgid ""
"Hmm?  Nothing, I guess I just like resting in this place.  I feel good "
"today."
msgstr "うーん？いや、ただここで一休みしてるだけ。今日は気分がいい。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
#: data/json/npcs/robofac/NPC_Cranberry_Foster.json
msgctxt "u:f"
msgid "Have you ever noticed how… wait no, never mind."
msgstr "ちょっと気づいたんだが...いや、何でもない。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
#: data/json/npcs/robofac/NPC_Cranberry_Foster.json
msgctxt "u:m"
msgid "Have you ever noticed how… wait no, never mind."
msgstr "ちょっと気づいたんだが...いや、何でもない。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
#: data/json/npcs/robofac/NPC_Cranberry_Foster.json
msgctxt "u:n"
msgid "Have you ever noticed how… wait no, never mind."
msgstr "ちょっと気づいたんだが...いや、何でもない。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/robofac/NPC_Cranberry_Foster.json
msgid ""
"Wondering if the whole world is like this now.  It has to be, right?  I was "
"watching some foreign news channels when everything was going down, and it "
"sounded like things were just as bad there…"
msgstr ""
"今、世界中がこんな感じなのかって、考えてたんだ。きっとそうなんだろうな。世界が崩壊したとき、外国のニュース番組を見たけれど、こっちと同じくらい酷い状況だった..."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
#: data/json/npcs/robofac/NPC_Cranberry_Foster.json
msgctxt "u:f"
msgid ""
"Hey, did you notice that there's working wi-fi here?  Not that anything else"
" is online anymore, but still."
msgstr "なあ、ここでWi-Fiが使えるって知ってた？いや、ネットには繋がってないんだけどさ。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
#: data/json/npcs/robofac/NPC_Cranberry_Foster.json
msgctxt "u:m"
msgid ""
"Hey, did you notice that there's working wi-fi here?  Not that anything else"
" is online anymore, but still."
msgstr "なあ、ここでWi-Fiが使えるって知ってた？いや、ネットには繋がってないんだけどさ。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
#: data/json/npcs/robofac/NPC_Cranberry_Foster.json
msgctxt "u:n"
msgid ""
"Hey, did you notice that there's working wi-fi here?  Not that anything else"
" is online anymore, but still."
msgstr "なあ、ここでWi-Fiが使えるって知ってた？いや、ネットには繋がってないんだけどさ。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/robofac/NPC_Cranberry_Foster.json
msgid "Just vibing."
msgstr "今日はゴロゴロしたい気分だ。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/robofac/NPC_Cranberry_Foster.json
msgid ""
"*picks the gun up and shows it to you from a few different angles.  You've never seen anything like it; it has a steel body with composite blue furniture, and looks lightweight and cutting-edge.  It features a modern hybrid scope, built-in attachments, and a strange quick-release button on the side.  The magazine looks like something for an assault rifle, but the magazine well itself is strangely designed and seems to be fitted with an adapter to make the magazine actually fit.\n"
"\n"
"\"Whatcha think?\""
msgstr ""
"*は銃を手に取り、こちらに見せました。スチール製の本体に青い合成材の部品、斬新で軽そうな作りをしています。最新のハイブリッドスコープ、一体型アタッチメント、側面には妙なボタン。弾倉はアサルトライフル用のものに見えますが、弾倉挿入部の構造が特異で、アダプターを使って本体に取り付けているようです。\n"
"\n"
"「どうよ？」"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/robofac/NPC_Cranberry_Foster.json
msgid "Is that a custom Hub rifle?"
msgstr "ハブ01の特製ライフルか何か？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/robofac/NPC_Cranberry_Foster.json
msgid "Where'd you find that thing?"
msgstr "どこで手に入れたんだ？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/robofac/NPC_Cranberry_Foster.json
msgid "Sweet piece of salvage."
msgstr "凄いものを拾ったんだな。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/robofac/NPC_Cranberry_Foster.json
msgid ""
"It's from our employers.  Apparently, it's a custom platform they make for "
"field agents.  It's got quick swap barrels for 9mm, the standard NATO "
"cartridges, and shotgun shells too.  It's great for if you're on a long "
"field mission and run out of ammo.  A lot of dudes bit the dust on their way"
" home from the gun store with a box of nine-mil.  I guess it's better them "
"than us; they don't need it now."
msgstr ""
"雇用主から支給された。外部スタッフのために作られた特注品だ。9mm弾とNATO弾、12ゲージの銃身を交換できるから、弾薬が不足しがちな長期任務に打って付けさ。銃砲店から9mm弾を持ち帰る途中に死んだ奴は大勢いる。あんな風にはなりたくないね。この銃ならそういう苦労をせずに済むわけだよ。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/robofac/NPC_Cranberry_Foster.json
msgid "Damn.  Where can I get one of those?"
msgstr "驚いたな。どうすれば貰えるんだ？"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/robofac/NPC_Cranberry_Foster.json
msgid ""
"You'll have to work that out with the intercom.  They seem stingy with them."
msgstr "通信係と交渉してみたらいい。本当にケチだけどな。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/robofac/NPC_Cranberry_Foster.json
msgid ""
"I do owe you one.  Tell you what: I'll let the Hub know that you're worth "
"manufacturing some proper gear for.  Let 'em know that I sent you next time "
"you talk with them and I'm sure they'll help you."
msgstr ""
"確かに、一つ借りがある。あんたにはちゃんとした銃を渡すだけの価値があるって、次にハブの職員と話すときに伝えておこう。そうすれば、きっと装備が支給される筈。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/robofac/NPC_Cranberry_Foster.json
msgid ""
"You'll have to work it out with the intercom.  I don't want to vouch for "
"someone I don't really know."
msgstr "自分で通信係に掛け合ってみればいい。信頼関係もない人間を推薦したくはないよ。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/robofac/NPC_Cranberry_Foster.json
msgid "Anything I can do to change your mind?"
msgstr "何をしたら信頼してくれるんだ？"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/robofac/NPC_Cranberry_Foster.json
msgid "Once we finish up this job, I'll vouch for you.  Pinkie promise."
msgstr "仕事が無事に完了したら、あんたが信頼できる人間だってことを雇い主に伝えておこう。約束する。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/robofac/NPC_Cranberry_Foster.json
msgid ""
"*goes quiet.  They chew their lip, looking off towards a point in space."
msgstr "*は口を噤みました。唇を噛み、虚空を見つめています。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/robofac/NPC_Cranberry_Foster.json
msgid "I'm sorry.  Too personal?"
msgstr "申し訳ない。私的な話はしたくなかったか？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/robofac/NPC_Cranberry_Foster.json
msgid "Hey, it can wait."
msgstr "うーん、喋ってくれるまで待つよ。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/robofac/NPC_Cranberry_Foster.json
msgid ""
"No, no!  It's fine, promise.  It's just been a hot minute, and I'm trying to"
" remember it.  It's been a while.  You sure you want to hear it?"
msgstr "いや、問題ない！本当、大丈夫だ。久々にそんなことを聞かれたから、思い出そうとしてただけだよ。どうだったかな。本当に聞きたいのか？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/robofac/NPC_Cranberry_Foster.json
msgid "I'm sure."
msgstr "ああ。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/robofac/NPC_Cranberry_Foster.json
msgid "I might not have the time.  Hold that thought for later."
msgstr "今は時間がない。その話は後にしよう。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/robofac/NPC_Cranberry_Foster.json
msgid ""
"*stares at a point at the wall, thinking.  Their wedding ring glints on "
"their left hand."
msgstr "*は壁の一点を見つめています。左手の指には結婚指輪がきらめいています。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/robofac/NPC_Cranberry_Foster.json
#: data/json/npcs/robofac/robofac_intercom/robofac_intercom_missions.json
msgid "[Wait.]"
msgstr "[待つ]"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/robofac/NPC_Cranberry_Foster.json
msgid ""
"…Alright.  Well.  For starters, I lived alone in an apartment, and I didn't "
"have any family or relatives I really cared about, so things were a lot "
"easier for me than they could have been."
msgstr "...よし。そうだな。私は、アパートに一人で住んでいた。すごく親しい家族や親戚もいなかったから、それなりに気楽に過ごしていた。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/robofac/NPC_Cranberry_Foster.json
msgid "[Listen.]"
msgstr "[話を聞く。]"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/robofac/NPC_Cranberry_Foster.json
msgid ""
"I've never really been a prepper, but I was into conspiracy theories.  Not "
"as a participant, just as an observer.  I think information spread is "
"interesting.\"  They pause.  \"I think it was in early March that I started "
"thinking something was wrong.  Like, the riots were bad beforehand, right?  "
"And that just seemed like normal unrest.  But then suddenly you're seeing it"
" happening in other countries where the normal explanations don't work.  So "
"I dug deeper, and once I did, I realized that this had been happening since "
"January, and getting worse since then.  That was when I started to take it "
"seriously."
msgstr ""
"私はプレッパーではなかったけど、その手の陰謀には興味があった。当事者としてではなく、あくまで第三者として。情報が伝わる様子を観察するのは、面白いからね。」クランベリーはしばし考え込みました。「何かがおかしいと感じ始めたのは、三月上旬ごろだった。暴動は以前から酷かっただろ？あんなのは普通だろと思っていた。でも、突然、他の国でも同じような事件が起きるようになった。普通では説明が付かない。だから、もっと詳しく調べてみたら、こういう事件は一月ごろから起きていて、どんどん酷くなってきていたことが分かったんだ。その辺りで、これは真剣に考えるべきだと思うようになった。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/robofac/NPC_Cranberry_Foster.json
msgid ""
"But like, I was a park ranger.  I wasn't exactly making six figures, and you"
" know how bad rent was.  I couldn't buy a ton of canned food, but what I "
"*could* do is can things myself.  Not in tin cans, but in jars; the old way."
"  So every paycheck, I'd use a little bit to buy one or two big glass jars, "
"and on the weekends I'd spend a few hours filling them up with food and "
"sealing them.  I started brushing up at the range too.  Proud gun owner, "
"baby."
msgstr ""
"でも、私は自然保護官だ。年収は6ケタに届かないし、家賃の高さは知っての通り。缶詰を大量に買うことはできないから、自分で保存食を作った。昔ながらの瓶詰めだね。給料が出る度に大きなガラス瓶を1つか2つ買って、休みの日に数時間かけて食材を浸けて封をしたんだ。射撃場で練習も始めた。誇り高き銃所持者って奴だね。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/robofac/NPC_Cranberry_Foster.json
msgid "What food were you canning?"
msgstr "どんな食材を保存したんだ？"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/robofac/NPC_Cranberry_Foster.json
msgid ""
"I bought fruit and veggies from the store for my greens, but I figured those"
" didn't really have enough calories for the long-term, so I hunted.  To be "
"more accurate, I poached in the park I worked at.  It was never anything "
"huge; I had to be able to conceal this stuff, remember.  But we were on a "
"shoestring budget as it is and we never had the people we needed, so it was "
"trivial to bag an animal using a rifle from one of the ranger stations.  I'd"
" dress the carcass, then leave it in a place that I could either bring with "
"me in my truck that day or come back later to sneak it out.  I never got "
"caught.  I'm not proud of it, but I'm not really ashamed of it, either.  "
"Besides, venison is great."
msgstr ""
"果物や野菜を店で買っていたが、長期的に考えるとカロリーが足りないと思って、狩りをすることにした。具体的には、勤め先の公園で密猟をね。そんな大袈裟な話じゃない。予算は少ないし人員も足りていなかったから、詰め所に置いてあるライフルを使って、簡単に仕留められたよ。獲物は切り分けてその日のうちにトラックで運ぶか、隠してから後でこっそり取りに行った。一度も捕まらなかったよ。自慢するわけじゃないが、別に恥だとも思わない。何より、鹿肉は最高に美味いんだ。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/robofac/NPC_Cranberry_Foster.json
msgid ""
"So I figured that this wasn't going to be a problem a few months down the "
"line, right?  Just a flash in the pan.  I had my emergency stock of food in "
"case things went bad for a little while.  Best case scenario, I never have "
"to worry about it, things go back to normal after a bit, and I save some "
"money on groceries for a while.  And I wanted to keep doing this for a few "
"more weeks, but…"
msgstr ""
"数か月後には、元通りの生活に戻るだろうと思ってたのにな？こんな暮らしはすぐに終わる。多少悪い状況になった時のために、非常食を蓄えるだけのつもりだった。何の心配もいらない、少し経てば何もかも元に戻り、しばらくの間食費が節約できる。それが、考えていた中でも一番マシなシナリオだった。もう数週間はこんな暮らしが続くのもいいな、なんて思っていたのに..."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/robofac/NPC_Cranberry_Foster.json
msgid "But what?"
msgstr "思っていたのに...？"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/robofac/NPC_Cranberry_Foster.json
msgid ""
"March 30th happened.\"  Cranberry seems shaken, and talks a little louder "
"for a second.  \"You remember that video, right?  That was what set off "
"alarm bells in my head.  That shit was fucking scary.  And at that point I "
"realized, okay, I think things are about to get bad and this is for real."
msgstr ""
"3月30日だ。」クランベリーは思わず声を震わせました。「あの動画、覚えているだろ？あれが私の頭の中で、警報を鳴らした。マジで、怖かった。あれを見たとき、私は悟ったんだ。これはヤバい、マジでヤバいって。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/robofac/NPC_Cranberry_Foster.json
msgid "I don't remember the video."
msgstr "動画のことは覚えていない。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/robofac/NPC_Cranberry_Foster.json
msgid ""
"Whoo-ee, someone was living under a rock, huh?  It was all over the news.  "
"Video on YouTube, it was a livestream of one of the riots in Minneapolis.  A"
" mom was…\"  They hesitate.  \"I don't want to go into detail, but it was "
"real bad.  Real bad.  That's what set off people panicking."
msgstr ""
"えっ、洞窟にでも棲んでたのか？ニュースでやってただろう。YouTubeの動画、ミネアポリスでの暴動を撮ったライブストリーミングだよ。母親が子を...」クランベリーは続きを言うのをためらいました。「詳しくは言いたくない、本当に酷かった。本当にね。それがパニックを広げたんだ。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/robofac/NPC_Cranberry_Foster.json
msgid ""
"People started freaking out.  I did, too.  I don't know how bad things got elsewhere, but shit was flying off the shelves where I lived.  Empty racks at grocery stores everywhere you looked.  I had enough food for a few weeks, so it wasn't a problem for me, but it still shook me up bad.  Every day some horrible new shit was happening somewhere in the world, and things got just worse and worse.  Then that insanity with Rhode Island happened, and once the national emergency came out, I knew that okay, this is happening, it's actually happening.\"\n"
"\n"
"\"Did you know that I was still going to work that entire time?  I don't know, it just felt meditative.  I lived in a pretty rural area, so there wasn't the kind of chaos in the cities and congestion on the roads.  I could just take a side road there and have a day of quiet.  Just the woods and whoever else actually bothered to show up that day.  The park closed for visitors closed a day or two before the state of emergency, and it was really peaceful, being there alone."
msgstr ""
"皆が混乱していた。私もそうだ。他の地域でどれだけ状況が悪くなっていたのか知らないけど、私の住む地域では、あらゆる商品が店の棚から消えた。どこの食料品店も空っぽだ。私は数週間分の食料を持っていたから問題は無かったけど、それでも酷く動揺してた。毎日、世界のどこかしらで酷い事件が起きて、事態はどんどん悪化していった。ロードアイランドの事件があって、非常事態宣言が出されたとき、これは現実なんだ、実際に起きてるんだって、ようやく実感がもてた。」\n"
"\n"
"「そんな時でも、ずっと仕事に行ってたんだ。信じられるか？仕事中はなんだか、瞑想でもしてる気分だった。自宅も田舎だったから、都会みたいな大混乱や渋滞もなかった。一つ脇道に入れば、静かに一日を過ごせた。森と、その日公園を訪れた人たち以外、何とも関わらない。公園は非常事態宣言の数日前に閉園することになったけど、その後も独りで仕事を続けているときは、本当に平和な気分になれた。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/robofac/NPC_Cranberry_Foster.json
msgid ""
"Then the portals happened, and you know the rest from there.  Two days "
"later, the world was over.  There was a lot of chaos in my complex.  I just "
"nailed shut my front door, drew all the curtains, kept my shotgun loaded, "
"and probably slept maybe ten hours total that week.  I don't know if there "
"was someone up in the sky watching over me, but if there was, I sure as hell"
" owe them big time."
msgstr ""
"その後、ポータルが大量発生して、それから先はご存じの通り。2日後には、世界は崩壊していた。うちの近所も大混乱だった。私は玄関のドアを釘で打ち付けて、カーテンを全部閉じて、ショットガンに弾を込めて、一週間に合わせて10時間くらいしか眠れなかったと思う。神様が私を守ってくれていたのかは分からないけど、もしそうだとしたら心から感謝しないといけないな。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/robofac/NPC_Cranberry_Foster.json
msgid ""
"I kind of lost track of the days.  Every day was the same; eat, check the "
"barricades, look on the Internet, play some games with the sound off to try "
"and distract myself.  I filled up my bathtub, and once the water went out, "
"I'd drink from there with a lifestraw when I needed to hydrate.  Meal "
"planning got easier after I was down to just my canned stuff.  The Internet "
"didn't stay on for long, though, which I guess was a blessing because of how"
" many people were sharing their fear and awful experiences in real time.  I "
"did that routine every day until that emergency broadcast came through that "
"no help was coming, and then I knew it was over."
msgstr ""
"その内、時間の感覚が分からなくなってきた。食事をして、バリケードを確認して、インターネットを見て、気晴らしのゲームをミュートでプレイする。バスタブに水を張っておいて、水道が止まったらライフストローで水を飲む。食べるものが保存食だけになってからは、献立を決めるのも楽になった。ネット上ではたくさんの人がリアルタイムで恐ろしくおぞましい体験を投稿していた。回線が早めに止まって逆に良かったのかもしれない。毎日そんなルーチンを続けていたけれど、救助が来ないっていう緊急放送が流れてきた時は、もう終わったと思ったね。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/robofac/NPC_Cranberry_Foster.json
msgid ""
"It took a bit for me to muster the nerve to leave, but I wanted to.  Had to "
"see, y'know?  It was… a shock, zombies just walking in the parking lot.  "
"Like, sure, I could look out the window, but it feels different up close.  I"
" had my knife handy, and I didn't want to make too much noise, so that's "
"what I used.  I stabbed one of my dead neighbors in the neck that day.\"  "
"They smile wistfully.  \"I threw up on my shoes after the first one, but it "
"got easier."
msgstr ""
"外へ出る勇気はちょっと出なかったけど、それでも外へは出たかった。そういう気持ち、分かるだろう？ゾンビが駐車場を歩いている光景は、衝撃的だった。窓の外から見るのとは、また違う感情が沸いた。あまり音は立てたくなかったから、持っていたナイフを使った。あの日、私は、死んだご近所さんの首を刺したんだ。」クランベリーは物憂げに笑いました。「一回目は靴にゲロを吐いたけど、だんだん気にならなくなった。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/robofac/NPC_Cranberry_Foster.json
msgid ""
"My truck was still there, and was on half a tank of gas.  I thought, okay, "
"this isn't gonna be easy, but I can pack my food and the things I need to "
"take with me into the truck, and then drive to that building I know about "
"that was so reinforced.\"  They gesture around them.  \"This building.  The "
"Hub.  So I got some stuff into a bugout bag in the cabin and filled up the "
"truck bed, and off I went.  The roads were bad, but I'm not a bad driver.  "
"Zombies are slow."
msgstr ""
"トラックは駐車場に置きっぱなしになっていて、ガソリンはタンクの半分まで残ってた。ここからは簡単に行かないなと思ったけど、食料と貴重品を荷台に詰めて、場所を知っている頑丈な建物まで運転していくことにした。」クランベリーは周囲を指し示しました。「この建物、ハブだ。荷物を詰めるだけ詰めた非常持ち出し袋を座席と荷台に載せて、出発した。道は悪かったけど、私も運転は下手じゃない。ゾンビは鈍いしね。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/robofac/NPC_Cranberry_Foster.json
msgid "And the rest is history."
msgstr "そこから先は、私も知っている。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/robofac/NPC_Cranberry_Foster.json
msgid ""
"If only, huh?  No, not quite.  About five miles away I hit a bad pothole and"
" skidded off the road and got stuck.  That's not a problem on its own, but a"
" few minutes into trying to get it unstuck, I saw a big furrow of dirt "
"coming towards me and decided, you know what, maybe I should get off the "
"side of the road.  So I grab my bugout bag from the cabin and a little food "
"from the bed, and I book it onto the road.  Now, I don't know what this "
"thing was, but it hit the truck from below and *flipped it over*.  That was "
"enough to make me say 'Nope, I can go on foot.'"
msgstr ""
"それが、そうでもないんだな？大変だった。8kmほど進んだところで車が大きな窪みを踏んでしまって、車道から外れて動かなくなったんだ。それだけならまだいい。数分後には、大きな土山がこっちへ迫ってくるのが見えた。だから座席に置いた持ち出し袋と荷台の食料少しを持って、車道へ飛び出した。アレの正体が何だったのか、分からない。でも、下からトラックにぶつかって*ひっくり返した*んだ。それを見たらもう、「よし、歩いて行こう」と思うしかなかったね。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/robofac/NPC_Cranberry_Foster.json
msgid ""
"It took me a few days from there.  I had a heavy load, and it was slow "
"going.  I slept on the road the first night because I was so freaked out by "
"what I saw, but the day after I got the nerves to walk through the woods.  I"
" had a tent, so it wasn't so bad.  Every now and then, I'd run into a "
"zombie, or a wrecked car that still had some of them buckled in.  I left my "
"shotgun behind in the truck, so I got better at using the knife.  It gets "
"easier, y'know?"
msgstr ""
"そこからは数日かかった。荷物が重くて、なかなか進めやしない。最初の夜は、トラックを壊したヤツが怖くて道路上で寝たけど、翌日からは、ヒヤヒヤしながら森の中を歩いた。テントを持っていたから、寝心地はそれなりだったけど。時々ゾンビに遭遇したり、乗客がシートベルトをしたまま座ってる事故車両を見つけたりした。ショットガンはトラックに置いてきたから、ナイフを使うようになった。意外と、簡単なもんだよ？"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/robofac/NPC_Cranberry_Foster.json
msgid ""
"A while later, I made it here.  The gate was open, so I just walked right "
"in.  I tried the intercom, but nobody answered, which I'm sure you had "
"happen to you, too.  Then I realize: this building is super reinforced, "
"unlocked, and seems abandoned now.  Why don't I just stay here?  So I set up"
" my stuff in this here lobby and I spend the night there.  Then I try the "
"intercom again."
msgstr ""
"しばらくして、ここにたどり着いた。ゲートは開いてたから、そのまま中へ入ったんだ。通信装置を鳴らしたけど、誰も出てこない。そのうち、この建物はすごく頑丈に造ってあるのに、鍵もかかっていなくてまるで廃墟だってことに気付いたんだ。じゃあ、このままここで暮らせばいいんじゃないか？というわけで、このロビーに荷物を置いて、一晩過ごした。その後改めて、通信装置を鳴らしてみた。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/robofac/NPC_Cranberry_Foster.json
msgid "Did they answer that time?"
msgstr "今度は返答があったのか？"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/robofac/NPC_Cranberry_Foster.json
msgid ""
"Hoo boy, yes they did, and let me tell you, they were not happy campers "
"about me crashing on their couch.  Now, these people don't tell me who they "
"are, but they tell me to get off the premises immediately.  I wasn't having "
"that.  I had been through hell and come out the other end, and I don't "
"remember what I said to them, but it was along the lines of 'I have nowhere "
"to go, and your building is nice and cozy, so if you want me to leave, you "
"can come out here and make me.'\"  They laugh.  \"They weren't expecting me "
"to bite back.  So I turn off the intercom and I go eat lunch.  When I go "
"back again, the first thing they ask is if I want a job."
msgstr ""
"うーん、その通り。どうやらソファを占領していたことが気に入らなかったらしい。正体も教えてくれず、その代わりここから出て行けと言ってきた。私は言うことを聞かなかった。こっちだって酷い経験をしてきたんだ。どう言ったかは覚えてないけど『行くあてがないし、この建物は居心地がいい。出て行ってほしいなら、力づくでやってみろ』って感じで返答してやった。」クランベリーは笑いました。「反抗されるなんて思ってなかったんだろうな。ともかく、そこで通信装置を切って、昼飯を食べに行った。戻ってくると開口一番に、仕事が欲しくないかと尋ねられた。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/robofac/NPC_Cranberry_Foster.json
msgid "Just like that?"
msgstr "それだけ？"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/robofac/NPC_Cranberry_Foster.json
msgid ""
"Well, no.  It was obvious they just wanted to get rid of me, but I decided I wanted to show that I was useful.  They tell me to find a crashed drone somewhere in the surrounding area and bring it back here.  No directions, of course.  Y'know, go find this drone in the middle of the woods, it'll be easy.  But I had some tools in my bag, right?  And yours truly has repaired some drones in the park service.\"\n"
"\n"
"\"So it takes me a whole-ass afternoon, but I find their stupid drone stuck in a tree.  I can see the camera's still on, so I pick it up and I tell the lens: 'Hey, you want me to fix it too?'  And I do.  It was just a cracked frame and the wiring to the rotors was sliced up.  The propellers themselves were fine.  So I bring it out of the woods and turn it off.  Then I open up the casing, solder up the wires, and use superglue to hold the frame together, which wasn't perfect, but I figured it'd hold until it got back home.  Then I turned it back on, and wouldn't you know, it immediately starts up and sits there for a minute, like 'What the fuck?  Why am I working again?'  And then it flies away, and I walk my smug ass back home."
msgstr ""
"いや、違う。私を厄介払いしたいだけなのは明らかだったけど、自分が役に立つってことを示せばなんとかなると思ったんだ。近くのどこかに墜落したドローンを見つけてこいと言われたよ。監視ロボットに似てるけど、塗装が違うものがいて、それを回収して持ってくる仕事だ。森の中でドローンを見つけろ。もちろん位置は分からない。さあやってこい、ってわけ。でも、荷物になってた役立つ工具類を今使わずいつ使う？しかも、ドローンの修理は公園管理の仕事で経験がある。」\n"
"\n"
"「午後までかかったけど、木に引っかかった気の毒なドローンは見つかった。カメラの電源が入ったままだったから、顔を見せ、レンズに向かってこう言った。「さあ、直してほしいか？」で、直してやった。フレームが割れて、ローターへの配線が切れてただけだった。プロペラそのものは問題ない。とりあえず森の外へ持ち出して筐体を開け、配線をはんだ付けし直して、フレームを瞬間接着剤でくっつけた。完璧な修理とは言えなかったけど、おうちに帰る程度の時間なら持ちこたえるだろと思ったんだ。電源を入れ直すと、ドローンは『なんだこれ？どうしてまだ動けるんだ？』って感じで1分くらいその場にいたけど、そのうち飛び立ったから、私も歩いて帰った。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/robofac/NPC_Cranberry_Foster.json
msgid "And *now* the rest is history."
msgstr "*今度こそ*、そこから先は、私も知っている。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/robofac/NPC_Cranberry_Foster.json
msgid ""
"You got it.\"  Cranberry grins.  \"I ask them if their drone got home in one"
" piece, and it did.  They said that my work wasn't bad at all and did a "
"little impromptu interview asking where I learned my skills and how I got to"
" the building.  I got the canned intro of 'we underestimated your "
"usefulness', and like you say, the rest is history.  Now we're here."
msgstr ""
"大正解。」クランベリーはニヤリと笑いました。「ドローンが無事帰ってきたか尋ねたら、大丈夫だった。悪くない成果だと褒められ、どこで技術を学んだとか、どうやって建物に入ったとか、ちょっとした質問をされた。そして、『私たちは君の有用性をひどく過小評価していたようだ』とかなんとか、いかにもな定型文を返された。後はあんたの言うとおり、私たちがここで会うことになったというわけだ。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/robofac/NPC_Cranberry_Foster.json
msgid ""
"That's quite the story.  You seem to be feeling pretty good, in spite of the"
" world ending."
msgstr "一大巨編だったな。世界が崩壊したのに、随分と元気そうだ。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/robofac/NPC_Cranberry_Foster.json
msgid ""
"I guess I am, yeah.  It feels nice to be putting all my skills to use instead of working an underpaid job to walk around the same woods flying a quadcopter around and being a glorified PR rep to cranky parents who are only at the park because they promised their kids they'd go.  Mind you, I'd still go back to it if I could.\"  Their expression falters a little.  \"We all had our struggles, but things are different now, you know?  We get to worry about the future in a whole new way; an existential way that we never had to consider before, not really.  Sure, there was the occasional nuke scare, but as a society, we had things pretty good.  Unless the dead stop getting back up, I… don't think things are going to ever go back to normal.\"\n"
"\n"
"Cranberry pauses for a moment, then shakes it off.  \"But… right now, I'm feeling at peace with everything, despite it all.  Maybe I'm just in shock, and it'll all come crashing down one of these days.  Things might get worse, and they may never get better.  But I feel alright.  And I think that's enough for me."
msgstr ""
"まあ、そうかもね。同じように森でドローンを飛ばして回るのでも、子供と約束したから仕方なく公園に来たような不機嫌な親御さんに頑張ってPRして安い賃金を貰う仕事より、自分の技能を全力で生かせる今の状況の方が気分はいい。でも、できることなら、元の生活に戻りたいよ。」クランベリーは表情を少し曇らせました。「あの頃も確かに大変だったけど、今とは状況が全然違う。以前は考えもしなかったような根源的な思いで、これまでにない形で、将来を心配しなきゃならなくなったんだ。もちろん、以前も核兵器とか、心配事は色々あったけど、社会全体で見ればかなりマシな方だった。死者が蘇る今の状況が変わらない限り、世界が今後まともになることは絶対にないだろうね。」\n"
"\n"
"クランベリーはしばし考え込み、やがて首を振りました。「でも...今は、色々なことを穏やかに感じていられるんだ。もしかしたら、ただ麻痺してるだけで、いつか何もかもに絶望するようになるかもしれない。事態は悪くなるばかりで、良くなることは永遠にないのかもしれない。でも、私は大丈夫だと思ってる。それで、十分だと思うんだ。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/robofac/NPC_Cranberry_Foster.json
msgid "Thank you for telling me."
msgstr "話してくれてありがとう。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/robofac/NPC_Cranberry_Foster.json
msgid ""
"*smiles at you, genuine and warm.  \"It feels nice to tell it.  You're "
"welcome.\""
msgstr "*は心からの温かい微笑みを浮かべました。「こっちも話してると気分がよくなる。どういたしまして。」"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/robofac/NPC_Cranberry_Foster.json
msgid "[Spend a while in silence.]"
msgstr "[しばらくの間、穏やかな時を過ごす。]"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/robofac/NPC_Cranberry_Foster.json
msgid ""
"I'm sorry, that's a bit personal.  Like, you seem alright, but that's kind "
"of heavy stuff, y'know?  Maybe I can tell you another time."
msgstr "ごめん、ちょっと他人に話そうとは思えないんだ。聞く方は大丈夫だろうけど、今話すのは重すぎるというか、ね？また機会があれば話そう。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/robofac/NPC_Cranberry_Foster.json
msgid ""
"I guess I am, yeah.  Feels like a stupid fetch quest.\"  They suddenly "
"pause.  \"Hey.  If you happen across any gold out in the world, I'll pay you"
" to bring it back for me.  Right now my assignment stipulates eight scrip "
"per kilo, and I'd be willing to give you all of that.  I just want something"
" else to do.  Just maybe don't mention it to the intercom, alright?  This is"
" supposed to be my job."
msgstr ""
"ああ、そうかも。つまらないお使いを頼まれた気分だ。」クランベリーは思案しました。「そうだ。もし、旅の途中で金を見つけたら、持ってきてほしい。謝礼は支払うよ。今私が任されている仕事では、金1kgで報酬が金貨8枚って契約だ。全額あんたに譲るよ。他にやりたいことがあるからね。雇い主には内緒だ、いいね？これは私がやることになってる仕事なんだから。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/robofac/NPC_Cranberry_Foster.json
msgid "You got it.  I'll let you know if I find any gold."
msgstr "分かった。金を見つけたら持ってくるよ。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/robofac/NPC_Cranberry_Foster.json
msgid "Actually, I don't think I have time for that, sorry."
msgstr "悪いけど、そんな暇はないんだ。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/robofac/NPC_Cranberry_Foster.json
msgid "Thanks a lot."
msgstr "本当にありがとう。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/robofac/NPC_Cranberry_Foster.json
msgid "Got some gold for me?"
msgstr "金を持ってきてくれた？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/robofac/NPC_Cranberry_Foster.json
msgid "[200 gold] Here's a batch for you."
msgstr "[200 金] はい、どうぞ。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/robofac/NPC_Cranberry_Foster.json
msgid "I don't have 200 gold for you right now."
msgstr "今は200単位の金を持っていない。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/robofac/NPC_Cranberry_Foster.json
msgid "I appreciate it.  Here's the scrip; don't spend it all in one place."
msgstr "感謝するよ。ほら、金貨だ。大事に使うといい。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/robofac/NPC_Cranberry_Foster.json
msgid "Honestly, sometimes I feel like an ATM."
msgstr "なんだかATMになった気分だ。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/robofac/NPC_Cranberry_Foster.json
msgid ""
"Thanks.  I never thought I'd get exhausted of carrying pure gold around, but"
" here we are."
msgstr "ありがとう。純金を運ぶのがこんなに煩わしいとはね。とにかく、謝礼をどうぞ。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/robofac/NPC_Cranberry_Foster.json
msgid ""
"Exchanging my money for goods and services.  Just as the founding fathers "
"intended."
msgstr "お金を商品やサービスと交換する。建国の父の思し召し通りだ。"

#. ~ Mission name
#: data/json/npcs/robofac/NPC_Cranberry_Foster.json
msgid "Active Noise Control"
msgstr "ノイズを消し去る"

#. ~ Description of mission "Active Noise Control"
#: data/json/npcs/robofac/NPC_Cranberry_Foster.json
msgid ""
"Investigate Hub 01's radio tower, discover the source of the interference, "
"and fix the problem."
msgstr "ハブ01の電波塔を調査して電波への干渉源を見つけ出し、問題を解決しましょう。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Active Noise Control"
#: data/json/npcs/robofac/NPC_Cranberry_Foster.json
msgid ""
"Well… a little while ago, I set up a radio transmitter in the radio tower "
"not far from here, but apparently it's stopped transmitting.  If you're "
"willing to back me up while I check it out, I'll owe you a favor."
msgstr ""
"そうだな...しばらく前に、ここからそれほど遠くない電波塔に無線送信機を設置したんだけど、どうやら機能が停止してしまったようなんだ。もし、確認に行くのを手伝ってくれたら、私に貸しを作れるんじゃないか。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Active Noise Control"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Return to Hub 01"
#: data/json/npcs/robofac/NPC_Cranberry_Foster.json
msgid "Alright, let's be off.  You don't mind taking point, right?"
msgstr "よし、さっそく現場へ向かおう。もちろん、来てくれるよな？"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Active Noise Control"
#: data/json/npcs/robofac/NPC_Cranberry_Foster.json
msgid "Well, thanks for offering."
msgstr "まあ、話を聞いてくれただけでも嬉しいよ。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Active Noise Control"
#: data/json/npcs/robofac/NPC_Cranberry_Foster.json
msgid ""
"I'm sure we'll figure it out once there.  Bring a good weapon and some ammo "
"just in case, if you can; no idea what insanity <the_cataclysm> has brought "
"us this time."
msgstr ""
"一度現場へ行ってみないと、原因は分からないだろうな。できれば、戦闘の準備をした方がいい。<the_cataclysm>がどんなイカレた事態を引き起こすか分からないからね。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Active Noise Control"
#: data/json/npcs/robofac/NPC_Cranberry_Foster.json
msgid "You think we fixed the problem?"
msgstr "問題を解決できたのか？"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Active Noise Control"
#: data/json/npcs/robofac/NPC_Cranberry_Foster.json
msgid ""
"Sure seems like it.  What even was that…?  Eh, doesn't matter.  Let's go "
"back to the Hub; hopefully the tower's working now."
msgstr "そのようだ。あれは一体何だったんだ...？まあ、気にしない方がいいか。ハブに戻ろう。電波塔の機能が復活してるといいんだけど。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Active Noise Control"
#: data/json/npcs/robofac/NPC_Cranberry_Foster.json
msgid "*frowns at you.  \"I've been with you this whole time, dude.  C'mon."
msgstr "*は顔をしかめました。「一緒に行動していたのに、そりゃないよ。まったく。"

#. ~ Mission name
#: data/json/npcs/robofac/NPC_Cranberry_Foster.json
msgid "Return to Hub 01"
msgstr "ハブ01へ戻る"

#. ~ Description of mission "Return to Hub 01"
#: data/json/npcs/robofac/NPC_Cranberry_Foster.json
msgid ""
"With the source of the radio tower's interference fixed, return to Hub 01 "
"with Cranberry."
msgstr "電波塔の電波が干渉を受ける原因を取り除き、クランベリーと共にハブ01へ戻りましょう。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Return to Hub 01"
#: data/json/npcs/robofac/NPC_Cranberry_Foster.json
msgid "Let's get back home."
msgstr "わが家へ戻ろうか。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Return to Hub 01"
#: data/json/npcs/robofac/NPC_Cranberry_Foster.json
msgid "Hey, you have a map, don't you?  You can use mine, if you need."
msgstr "なあ、地図を持ってるんだろう？失くしたなら私のを見ればいい。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Return to Hub 01"
#: data/json/npcs/robofac/NPC_Cranberry_Foster.json
msgid "Thanks a lot for having my back.  Like I said, I owe you one."
msgstr "手伝ってくれてありがとう。一つ借りができたな。"

#. ~ Unique name of a male NPC
#. ~ A cold ex-mercenary from a third world country you have never heard of
#. before.  Third in charge after Melchior and Director Cohen.
#: data/json/npcs/robofac/NPC_Ulysses_Rourke.json
msgid "U. Rourke"
msgstr "U. ﾙｰｸ"

#. ~ Name suffix of a male NPC
#. ~ A cold ex-mercenary from a third world country you have never heard of
#. before.  Third in charge after Melchior and Director Cohen.
#: data/json/npcs/robofac/NPC_Ulysses_Rourke.json
msgid "Head of Security"
msgstr "警備主任"

#. ~ Name of an NPC class
#. ~ Needs his own unique background.
#: data/json/npcs/robofac/NPC_Ulysses_Rourke.json
msgid "Head of security"
msgstr "警備主任"

#. ~ Job description of "Head of security" NPC class
#. ~ Needs his own unique background.
#. ~ Job description of "Hub Security" NPC class
#: data/json/npcs/robofac/NPC_Ulysses_Rourke.json
#: data/json/npcs/robofac/NPC_robofac_generic_security.json
msgid "I'm part of the Hub security team."
msgstr "ハブの警備班のリーダーだ。"

#. ~ Name suffix of an NPC
#. ~ A generic guard for Hub 01.
#. ~ Name of an NPC class
#: data/json/npcs/robofac/NPC_robofac_generic_security.json
msgid "Hub Security"
msgstr "警備員(ハブ01)"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/robofac/NPC_robofac_generic_security.json
msgid "Keep it civil, merc."
msgstr "大人しくしていろよ。"

#. ~ Name suffix of an NPC
#. ~ A free merchant caravanner that temporarily supplies the hq with
#. foodstuff.
#: data/json/npcs/robofac/ROBOFAC_SURFACE_FREEMERCHANT.json
msgid "Free Merchant"
msgstr "自由商人"

#. ~ Name of an NPC class
#. ~ This is a unique NPC who doesn't get randomly selected background traits
#: data/json/npcs/robofac/ROBOFAC_SURFACE_FREEMERCHANT.json
msgid "Caravaneer"
msgstr "隊商指揮者"

#. ~ Job description of "Caravaneer" NPC class
#. ~ This is a unique NPC who doesn't get randomly selected background traits
#: data/json/npcs/robofac/ROBOFAC_SURFACE_FREEMERCHANT.json
msgid "I'm the owner of a trade caravan."
msgstr "私は隊商のオーナーだ。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/robofac/ROBOFAC_SURFACE_FREEMERCHANT.json
msgid ""
"Still plenty of outlaws in the roads, perhaps you should tend to your job, "
"marshal…"
msgstr "まだ外には無法者がうろついてる。執行官、あなたの仕事は多い..."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/robofac/ROBOFAC_SURFACE_FREEMERCHANT.json
msgid "You see anything you want, marshal?"
msgstr "執行官、何か欲しいものがありますか？"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/robofac/ROBOFAC_SURFACE_FREEMERCHANT.json
msgid "Oh, a U.S. marshal, how quaint."
msgstr "ああ、連邦執行官か。乙だねぇ。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/robofac/ROBOFAC_SURFACE_FREEMERCHANT.json
msgid "Welcome…"
msgstr "ようこそ..."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/robofac/ROBOFAC_SURFACE_FREEMERCHANT.json
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/npc/TALK_FORGE_MERCHANT.json
msgid "Here to trade, I hope?"
msgstr "取り引きするかい？"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/robofac/ROBOFAC_SURFACE_FREEMERCHANT.json
msgid "Safe travels, scavenger."
msgstr "お気を付けて、スカベンジャー。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/robofac/ROBOFAC_SURFACE_FREEMERCHANT.json
msgid "When is the next shipment?"
msgstr "次の商品入荷はいつ頃？"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/robofac/ROBOFAC_SURFACE_FREEMERCHANT.json
msgid ""
"I keep to my own business, and you keep to yours, marshal.  Seems like a "
"fair deal?"
msgstr "私は私の仕事を続け、あなたはあなたの仕事を続ける。執行官、これは公正な取り引きでしょう？"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/robofac/ROBOFAC_SURFACE_FREEMERCHANT.json
msgid ""
"We have been supplying this lab here with food from a few hunting and "
"farming communities nearby.  The roads are tough and dangerous, but it makes"
" good money, and beats scavenging the cities for scraps."
msgstr ""
"私たちは、研究所の近くにあるハンターや農家のコミュニティから食料の供給を受けてきた。路上は危険だが、金になる物はあるし、都市部でガラクタを集めて回るよりもいい。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/robofac/ROBOFAC_SURFACE_FREEMERCHANT.json
msgid "Keep safe, then."
msgstr "では、おたっしゃで。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/robofac/ROBOFAC_SURFACE_FREEMERCHANT.json
msgid "Around <interval>, if the caravan doesn't run into trouble."
msgstr "隊商にトラブルがなければ、<interval>後には入荷できる。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/robofac/ROBOFAC_SURFACE_FREEMERCHANT.json
msgid "Thanks for the info, bye."
msgstr "情報をありがとう、さようなら。"

#. ~ Job description of "Mercenary" NPC class
#. ~ An experienced survivor doing low importance work for Hub 01, or working
#. under another ancillary. Has no access to Hub 01s custom gear.
#: data/json/npcs/robofac/robofac_ancilla_npcs/NC_ANCILLA_GRUNT.json
msgid "Fighting in the name of Hub 01 and money, mostly money."
msgstr "ハブ01と金のために戦ってる。主目的は金の方だけどな。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<ANCILLA_barkeep_suggestion>"
#: data/json/npcs/robofac/robofac_ancilla_npcs/NPC_ANCILLA_BARKEEP.json
msgid ""
"Ahh but if you want suggestions and are one for craft beers, I certainly "
"suggest having some old world brew before it all goes flat or sour."
msgstr "おっと、もしクラフトビールがお望みなら、気が抜けたり酸っぱくなったりしないうちに、旧世界産のやつを飲んでおくんだね。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<ANCILLA_barkeep_suggestion>"
#: data/json/npcs/robofac/robofac_ancilla_npcs/NPC_ANCILLA_BARKEEP.json
msgid ""
"Speaking off, Cranberry here brought me a whole cask of Cabernet a few days "
"ago.  So if red wines are your thing I can offer that by the gallon."
msgstr "そういや何日か前に、クランベリーが樽一杯のカベルネ・ソービニヨンを持ってきてくれたんだ。赤ワインがお望みなら、ガロン単位で出してやれるよ。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<ANCILLA_barkeep_suggestion>"
#: data/json/npcs/robofac/robofac_ancilla_npcs/NPC_ANCILLA_BARKEEP.json
msgid ""
"Just bought some of this new \"Free Whiskey\" from the caravaneer up above."
"  It's vile if you ask me, but it packs a good punch.  A real drink of the "
"apocalypse I suppose."
msgstr "そうそう、行商人から「フリー・ウイスキー」ってのを新しく仕入れたんだ。味は下品だけど、パンチが効いてる。文明崩壊に似合いの酒だね。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<ANCILLA_barkeep_suggestion>"
#: data/json/npcs/robofac/robofac_ancilla_npcs/NPC_ANCILLA_BARKEEP.json
msgid ""
"The water I boiled from a pool by the rails, so I don't suggest you get "
"some."
msgstr "ただし、水は線路脇の水たまりから汲んだやつだ。あまりお勧めはできないね。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<ANCILLA_barkeep_suggestion>"
#: data/json/npcs/robofac/robofac_ancilla_npcs/NPC_ANCILLA_BARKEEP.json
msgid ""
"And you can also try chatting with some of the other patrons if networking "
"is your thing."
msgstr "それと、もし人脈を作りたいなら、他の客に話しかけてみるといいよ。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<ANCILLA_barkeep_suggestion>"
#: data/json/npcs/robofac/robofac_ancilla_npcs/NPC_ANCILLA_BARKEEP.json
msgid "Also have some old world sodas if alcohol isn't your kind of thing."
msgstr "あぁ、アルコールがダメな人は旧世界のソーダをどうぞ。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<ANCILLA_barkeep_suggestion>"
#: data/json/npcs/robofac/robofac_ancilla_npcs/NPC_ANCILLA_BARKEEP.json
msgid ""
"Not much fruit juice to make fancy drinks, but I can scrounge up some still."
msgstr "洒落た酒を造れるほど果汁はストックできていないけど、多少なら残ってるよ。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<ANCILLA_barkeep_suggestion>"
#: data/json/npcs/robofac/robofac_ancilla_npcs/NPC_ANCILLA_BARKEEP.json
msgid ""
"Can also sell some dry foods if you want to stock for a trip somewhere."
msgstr "あとは、長旅に役立つ乾物も好評発売中だ。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<ANCILLA_barkeep_suggestion>"
#: data/json/npcs/robofac/robofac_ancilla_npcs/NPC_ANCILLA_BARKEEP.json
msgid "Also good for a chat if you don't want anything."
msgstr "飲みたいものがないなら、お喋りだけでもしていってくれ。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/robofac/robofac_ancilla_npcs/NPC_ANCILLA_BARKEEP.json
msgid "Ah great to see you around."
msgstr "会えて嬉しいよ。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/robofac/robofac_ancilla_npcs/NPC_ANCILLA_BARKEEP.json
msgid "How goes the surface?  All dead and walkey still?"
msgstr "外の様子はどう？相変わらず死人が歩いてるのかい？"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/robofac/robofac_ancilla_npcs/NPC_ANCILLA_BARKEEP.json
msgid ""
"Should hang around one of these days, help me out in the bar for a change, "
"what do you say, eh?"
msgstr "外をぶらつくのに飽きたら、気分転換にここで仕事を手伝ってみるのはどうだい？"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/robofac/robofac_ancilla_npcs/NPC_ANCILLA_BARKEEP.json
#: data/json/npcs/robofac/robofac_ancilla_npcs/NPC_ANCILLA_DOCTOR.json
msgid "Oh, what can I do for you today?"
msgstr "ああ、今日はどこの処置だ？"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/robofac/robofac_ancilla_npcs/NPC_ANCILLA_BARKEEP.json
msgid "Feel free to lounge around, and ask if there's anything you need."
msgstr "どうぞごゆっくり。何か注文したいなら、声を掛けてくれ。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/robofac/robofac_ancilla_npcs/NPC_ANCILLA_BARKEEP.json
msgid ""
"Welcome to the Terminal, scavenger, longest standing underground bar in the "
"state.  Feel free to ask if you need something."
msgstr "ターミナルへようこそ、スカベンジャー。ここは州内で最も歴史ある秘密のバーだ。注文したいなら、遠慮なく言ってくれ。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/robofac/robofac_ancilla_npcs/NPC_ANCILLA_BARKEEP.json
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_bartender.json
msgid "Let me see what you keep behind the counter."
msgstr "店の商品を見せてもらおう。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/robofac/robofac_ancilla_npcs/NPC_ANCILLA_BARKEEP.json
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_bartender.json
msgid "What do you have on tap?"
msgstr "どんな酒がある？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/robofac/robofac_ancilla_npcs/NPC_ANCILLA_BARKEEP.json
msgid "There should be a package for me here."
msgstr "私宛てのものを預かっている筈だ。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/robofac/robofac_ancilla_npcs/NPC_ANCILLA_BARKEEP.json
msgid "Any good rumors?"
msgstr "何かいい話はある？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/robofac/robofac_ancilla_npcs/NPC_ANCILLA_BARKEEP.json
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_bartender.json
msgid "I'll be going…"
msgstr "もう行かないと..."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/robofac/robofac_ancilla_npcs/NPC_ANCILLA_BARKEEP.json
msgid ""
"If what you want are jobs and opportunities, you'll probably be better off asking to my other patrons.  Have regulars from well across the state, I'm sure some can offer what you want.\"\n"
"\n"
" \"Really, I just tend the bar and don't ask many questions.  Things tend work out better that way."
msgstr ""
"仕事やチャンスがほしいなら、他の常連客に聞いてみるといい。州内各地から来てる奴らだから、きっと期待通りの話をしてくれるよ」\n"
"\n"
"「私は単なるバーテンだから、客を詮索しない。そうした方が店は上手くいくものさ。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/robofac/robofac_ancilla_npcs/NPC_ANCILLA_BARKEEP.json
msgid "I'll ask around, thank you."
msgstr "客に聞いてみるよ、ありがとう。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/robofac/robofac_ancilla_npcs/NPC_ANCILLA_BARKEEP.json
msgid ""
"Just the best spirits the whole of New England has to offer.  Well the best we've managed to loot so far at least.\n"
"\n"
" <ANCILLA_barkeep_suggestion>"
msgstr ""
"ニューイングランドで一番旨い蒸留酒があるよ。今回手に入ったのは、間違いなくこれまでの人生で一番の酒だ。\n"
"\n"
"<ANCILLA_barkeep_suggestion>"

#. ~ Affirmative response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/robofac/robofac_ancilla_npcs/NPC_ANCILLA_BARKEEP.json
msgid "Just some water."
msgstr "水だけでいい。"

#. ~ Negative response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/robofac/robofac_ancilla_npcs/NPC_ANCILLA_BARKEEP.json
msgid "[$2] Just some water."
msgstr "[$2] 水だけでいい。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/robofac/robofac_ancilla_npcs/NPC_ANCILLA_BARKEEP.json
msgid "[$3] I'll take a beer"
msgstr "[$3] ビールを1杯いただこう。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/robofac/robofac_ancilla_npcs/NPC_ANCILLA_BARKEEP.json
msgid "[$3] Get me a cup of red wine"
msgstr "[$3] 赤ワインを1杯飲みたいな。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/robofac/robofac_ancilla_npcs/NPC_ANCILLA_BARKEEP.json
msgid "[$3] I'll take a shot of rum"
msgstr "[$3] ラム酒を1杯いただこう。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/robofac/robofac_ancilla_npcs/NPC_ANCILLA_BARKEEP.json
msgid "[$3] I'll take a shot of whiskey"
msgstr "[$3] ウイスキーを1杯いただこう。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/robofac/robofac_ancilla_npcs/NPC_ANCILLA_BARKEEP.json
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_bartender.json
msgid "On second thought, don't bother."
msgstr "ただの思い付きだ、気にしないでくれ。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/robofac/robofac_ancilla_npcs/NPC_ANCILLA_BARKEEP.json
msgid ""
"Oh yes of course, think this should be all, well that's all there is anyhow."
msgstr "ああ、もちろん。これで全部だと思う、じゃなかった、間違いなくこれで全部だ。"

#. ~ Unique name of a male NPC
