#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/robofac/robofac_ancilla_npcs/BAR_ENCOUNTER_MERCENARIES/BEM_human_sample.json
msgid "Oh yes.  I actually have one right here."
msgstr "ああ。それなら実はもう持っている。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/robofac/robofac_ancilla_npcs/BAR_ENCOUNTER_MERCENARIES/BEM_human_sample.json
msgid "I might be."
msgstr "詳しく聞きたい。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/robofac/robofac_ancilla_npcs/BAR_ENCOUNTER_MERCENARIES/BEM_human_sample.json
msgid "No, but I might be looking to buy some."
msgstr "仕事は受けないが、私もサンプルを購入したい。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/robofac/robofac_ancilla_npcs/BAR_ENCOUNTER_MERCENARIES/BEM_human_sample.json
msgid "No, not at all."
msgstr "いや、止めておこう。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/robofac/robofac_ancilla_npcs/BAR_ENCOUNTER_MERCENARIES/BEM_human_sample.json
msgid ""
"Most I can give is two gold coins.  I've arranged a drop in the nearby "
"woods, put the goods there and you can get your cash with the barkeep here."
msgstr "悪いが、報酬はハブ01金貨2枚だけだ。近くの森に受け渡し地点を作っておいた。サンプルを置いたら、ここのバーテンから報酬を受け取れ。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/robofac/robofac_ancilla_npcs/BAR_ENCOUNTER_MERCENARIES/BEM_human_sample.json
msgid "It'll get done."
msgstr "やっておこう。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/robofac/robofac_ancilla_npcs/BAR_ENCOUNTER_MERCENARIES/BEM_human_sample.json
msgid "Not interested after all?"
msgstr "あまりそそられないな？"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
#: data/json/npcs/robofac/robofac_ancilla_npcs/BAR_ENCOUNTER_MERCENARIES/BEM_human_sample.json
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
"&The mercenary gives you a quick appraisal.  \"Five coins for three, special"
" price just for you.  Pay in advance, and I'll arrange a drop in the subway "
"rails here for you to pick within two days.  Deal or not?"
msgstr ""
"&傭兵は素早くこちらを見定めました。「値段はサンプル3個でハブ01金貨5枚、特別価格だ。代金は前払い。支払いから2日以内に、ここの地下鉄の線路沿いに置いておくよう手配しよう。どうだ？」"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
