#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/Nunez/NPC_Dana_Tacoma.json
msgctxt "u:n"
msgid ""
"*stands in the middle of a cramped kitchen, covered in flour.  The scene "
"looks reminiscent of easier times, but the illusion is broken as he apron "
"shifts to reveal a heavy machete and holstered pistol on  her belt.  She "
"looks up as you approach, then beams in recognition.  \"Welcome to Dana's "
"Bakery, stranger!\"  She laughs brightly.  \"Glad you made out this way.  "
"What can I do for you?\""
msgstr ""
"*は穀粉塗れになりながら、狭いキッチンに立っています。かつての平和だった頃を思い出す光景ですが、エプロンの下、ベルトに刺さっている大きなナタとホルスターに収まったハンドガンを見ると、現実に引き戻されます。近寄ると彼女は顔を上げ、目を輝かせました。「ダナのパン屋にようこそ、お客さん！」明るく笑っています。「来てくれて嬉しいよ、ご注文は？」"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/Nunez/NPC_Dana_Tacoma.json
msgid "Hi Dana, how are things here?"
msgstr "やあダナ。調子はどう？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/Nunez/NPC_Dana_Tacoma.json
msgid "Got any bread for sale?"
msgstr "パンは売っているか？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/Nunez/NPC_Dana_Tacoma.json
msgid "Hello, Dana!  What's with the trailer?"
msgstr "やあ、ダナ！このトレーラーは一体？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/Nunez/NPC_Dana_Tacoma.json
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/Nunez/NPC_Pablo_Tacoma.json
msgid "Hey, Pablo!  Dana said you had some plans to build a bakery?"
msgstr "やあ、パブロ！ダナから聞いたけど、パン屋を作る計画を立てているのか？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/Nunez/NPC_Dana_Tacoma.json
msgid "Nice to see you Dana, I'm just checking in."
msgstr "ごきげんよう、ダナ。様子を見に来たんだ。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/Nunez/NPC_Dana_Tacoma.json
msgid ""
"Not bad.  Much better than before.  Pablo and I have privacy, and the folks "
"here actually appreciate my bread instead of paying me a pittance for it and"
" then taking it to the basement without so much as a 'thanks'."
msgstr ""
"悪くないね。いや、ずっと良くなった。パブロと私のプライバシーも保てる。前なんて、はした金を払って「ありがとう」すら言わず地下に引っ込むお客ばっかりだったから。ちゃんと私のパンを買って喜んでもらえるのは嬉しいよ。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/Nunez/NPC_Dana_Tacoma.json
msgid "What's with the trailer?"
msgstr "このトレーラーは一体どうしたんだ？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/Nunez/NPC_Dana_Tacoma.json
msgid "Any luck with the pregnancy?"
msgstr "家族計画は上手くいってる？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/Nunez/NPC_Dana_Tacoma.json
msgid "I'd better go.  See you later."
msgstr "もう行かないと。また今度。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/Nunez/NPC_Dana_Tacoma.json
msgid ""
"Ha, this thing!\"  She dusts the flour off her hands and tucks a loose lock "
"of hair back behind her ear.  \"You remember, we signed on as caravan hands "
"to get us out here.  Well, we had a bunch of stops along the way first.  We "
"were headed to a little group of survivors that snagged themselves a huge "
"stock of dry food somehow, and passed this trailer sales yard smack dab in "
"the middle of nowhere, nobody to be seen for miles.  Pablo managed to sweet "
"talk the group into taking a rest stop there.  We searched the yard, and a "
"lot of the stuff wasn't suitable, but this baby was ready to go.  Long story"
" short, we got the keys to that vintage truck outside, hitched this thing "
"up, and upgraded our caravan.\""
msgstr ""
"ああ、これね！」彼女は手についた穀粉を払い、緩んできた髪の束を耳に掛けました。「覚えてるかしら、私たちは避難センターを出るにあたって、隊商の一員になったんだ。隊商は、どうにかしてドライフードを大量に手に入れた生存者グループの小さな拠点に向かっていた。その途中で、人里離れた空き地に中古のトレーラーが野ざらしになってるのを見かけたんだよ。本当に誰も住んでないような場所さ。パブロが何とかして隊商を引き留めて、そこで休憩することになった。空き地に使えるものが置いてないか調べたら、大体はボロボロだったけど、この子は完璧だったってわけ。そんなこんなで、車の鍵も見つかって、この子を連れ出して、隊商は更に豪華になったってわけ。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/Nunez/NPC_Dana_Tacoma.json
msgid "How did you get the keys to the truck?"
msgstr "どうやってトレーラーの鍵を見つけたんだ？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/Nunez/NPC_Dana_Tacoma.json
msgid "What made this trailer so good?"
msgstr "このトレーラーは性能がいいのか？"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/Nunez/NPC_Dana_Tacoma.json
msgid ""
"*turns serious.  \"We went inside the dealership to see if they were there."
"  Owner was still in there.  I… I think he took his own life, maybe figured "
"destroying the brain would keep him from reviving.  It… it didn't.  The "
"shotgun took out enough though, he couldn't, uh, he couldn't really see.  "
"Just this miserable, half-faced… we put him down.  I think we did him a "
"favor, if there was any of him left in there.  Didn't feel wrong going "
"through his pockets.  Gross, but not wrong.\"  She blows out a stream of "
"air, sending a small cloud of flour rising in the air, then shrugs."
msgstr ""
"*は真剣な表情になりました。「オーナーがいるかと思って、中に入ったんだ。確かにオーナーはそこにいた。つまり...頭を撃てば蘇ることはないと思って、自殺したんだろうね。でも...そうはならなかった。確かに散弾は当たったけど、ええと、それじゃ足りなかったみたい。可哀そうに、顔が半分なくなって...私たちはその人を倒したよ。生きて迎えてくれたら、きっと仲良くなれただろうに。ポケットを探るのに嫌悪感はなかった。酷いやり方だけど、間違ってはいなかったと思う。」彼女は大きなため息をついて穀粉を散らし、肩をすくめました。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/Nunez/NPC_Dana_Tacoma.json
msgid ""
"It's all propane!\"  She grins.  \"The oven, especially.  We don't need "
"electric, which means we don't need to run the gennie and attract "
"attention.\""
msgstr ""
"全部プロパンガスで動くんだ！」彼女はニヤリと笑いました。「特にオーブンね。電気が要らないから、騒がしい発電機で余計な注意を惹くこともないよ。」"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/Nunez/NPC_Dana_Tacoma.json
msgid "Seems like a tiny kitchen for a bakery."
msgstr "まるで小さなパン工房だ。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/Nunez/NPC_Dana_Tacoma.json
msgid "Won't you run out of propane?"
msgstr "プロパンガスが不足しないのか？"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/Nunez/NPC_Dana_Tacoma.json
msgid ""
"*sighs and nods.  \"Making do with what I've got, but yeah.  I can only "
"crank out a couple loaves a day, and can't do anything fun.  Pablo has been "
"talking about setting me up a separate kitchen to really get going, but "
"we've got so much critical work to do, and fresh bread is a luxury, even if "
"it's great for morale.\""
msgstr ""
"*はため息をつき、頷きました。「備蓄の分でなんとかしのいでいるけど、悩ましいね。パンも一日に数個しか焼けないし、面白そうなことも試せない。パブロが本格的なパン屋開店のために交渉してくれているけど、やらなきゃならない重要な仕事はたくさん残ってる。たとえ皆の士気が高まるといっても、まだまだパンは贅沢品だね。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/Nunez/NPC_Dana_Tacoma.json
msgid ""
"You bet we will.  We've been collecting tanks and have enough for a while, "
"but I'm burning through it faster than the scavengers can bring in more.  "
"Pablo is working out some plans with the others to get me a real wood fired "
"kitchen soon, and that'll also boost my capacity.  Maybe he could give you "
"some scavenging work if you ask."
msgstr ""
"それが悩みの種なんだよ。しばらく使うには十分な量のタンクが揃ってるけど、スカベンジャー部隊が集めてくる量より、こっちが使う量の方が多いんだ。いつか使い果たしてしまうだろうね。パブロは他の住人と協力して、本物の薪ストーブのキッチンを用意する計画を立ててくれてる。きっと私のパン作りの修行にもなるよ。もしプロパンが余ってるなら、彼に言えば買ってくれるんじゃないかな。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/Nunez/NPC_Dana_Tacoma.json
msgid ""
"*shrugs.  \"We got our hands on a few boxes of test strips so that's good.  "
"Being stressed isn't good for conception and I've been pretty fuckin' "
"stressed for a while.  I like our chances a lot better now, that's for sure."
"  And, well, we've got our own private space at least.\"  She smirks and "
"then blushes slightly, hiding it by fiddling with her baking project."
msgstr ""
"*は肩をすくめました。「ひとまず検査薬が数箱集まったのがいい知らせだね。ストレスは妊娠に良くないけど、私はここ最近かなりストレスに悩まされていた。でも、今はずっと気分が楽になった気がする、間違いなくね。それに、夫婦のプライベートスペースを用意してもらえてる。」彼女は少し顔を赤らめてにやけ、パン生地を捏ねて恥じらいを誤魔化しました。"

#. ~ Name suffix of a male NPC
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/Nunez/NPC_Pablo_Tacoma.json
msgid "bookkeeper"
msgstr "簿記係"

#. ~ Name of an NPC class
#. ~ Pablo is a young professional who survived with his wife, but she was
#. pregnant and lost the baby.
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/Nunez/NPC_Pablo_Tacoma.json
msgid "Bookkeeper"
msgstr "簿記係"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/Nunez/NPC_Pablo_Tacoma.json
msgid ""
"*looks up at you from a ledger, takes a moment to place you, then smiles "
"broadly.  \"Great to see you, my friend.  To what do I owe the pleasure?\""
msgstr ""
"*は台帳から目線をこちらに移し、しばらく見つめ、満面の笑みを浮かべました。「友よ、来てくれるなんて、本当に嬉しいよ。一体どういう風の吹き回しだい？」"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/Nunez/NPC_Pablo_Tacoma.json
msgid "Hi, Pablo!  How are things going here?"
msgstr "やあ、パブロ！ここでの調子はどう？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/Nunez/NPC_Pablo_Tacoma.json
msgid "Hello, Pablo!  What's with the trailer?"
msgstr "やあ、パブロ！このトレーラーはどうしたんだ？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/Nunez/NPC_Pablo_Tacoma.json
msgid "Hey, Pablo!  I heard you might be willing to trade for propane?"
msgstr "やあ、パブロ！プロパンガスを買ってくれると聞いたんだけど？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/Nunez/NPC_Pablo_Tacoma.json
msgid "Just popping in to say hi.  Talk to you later!"
msgstr "ちょっと挨拶に寄っただけだ。また今度話そう！"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/Nunez/NPC_Pablo_Tacoma.json
msgid ""
"Can't complain,\" he stretches his neck and pops his shoulder.  \"No, "
"really, I can't.  The work is hard, but people here really want to *do* "
"something, not just hide inside and hope someone saves us.  I've been "
"helping doing general labor a bit, but also working out an inventory system "
"for our supplies.  It's already helped us get a few important bits in "
"earlier than we'd have noticed otherwise.  Post-apocalyptic accounting, ha!"
"  Who'd have thought?\""
msgstr ""
"悪くないね。」彼は背筋を伸ばし、肩をほぐしました。「いや、本当に、悪くない。仕事は大変だけど、ここの人たちは皆、ただこっそり隠れて誰かの助けを待つんじゃなくて、心から何かを*やりたい*と思って動いている。私は労働者としての手伝いもしつつ、消耗品の在庫システムの構築を進めているんだ。これで、重要な物資の不足にできる限り早く気付き、準備することができる。まったく、崩壊した世界の会計士とはね！こんな仕事は考えたこともなかったよ。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/Nunez/NPC_Pablo_Tacoma.json
msgid "Keeping inventory is similar to accounting?  Really?"
msgstr "在庫管理と会計業務って似ているのか？本当に？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/Nunez/NPC_Pablo_Tacoma.json
msgid "Well, I'd better go."
msgstr "そうか、そろそろ行かないと。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/Nunez/NPC_Pablo_Tacoma.json
msgid ""
"If you want the honest truth, only a bit.  It's not much like filing income "
"tax.  Still, I know my way around a spreadsheet and I don't mind staring at "
"numbers all day.  I think people were dubious at first, but now that it's "
"starting to show real value they're coming around.\""
msgstr ""
"正直言って、ほとんど共通点はない。所得税の申告業務よりは似ているかな。それでも精算表の扱いには慣れているから、一日中数字を見ているのは苦にならない。最初、他の皆は半信半疑だったみたいだけど、今ではこの仕事の価値を分かってもらえたみたいで、信用も得られたよ。」"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/Nunez/NPC_Pablo_Tacoma.json
msgid ""
"Oh, Dana tells that story better than me.  Basically we found it at an old "
"trailer park and she liked the bakery, so we figured out a way to get it "
"back here.  We definitely earned some cred for coming with our own shelter."
msgstr ""
"ああ、その話ならダナに聞いた方がいい。簡単に言うと、古いトレーラーパークで見つけてきたんだ。ダナはパン屋の仕事が大好きだから、ここでの再開にこぎ着けた。自分たちの住居を持ってきたことで、ここの人たちにある程度信用してもらえたみたいだね。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/Nunez/NPC_Pablo_Tacoma.json
msgid ""
"Yeah, she would say that.\"  He makes intense eye contact.  \"Not just a "
"bakery, my friend.  A real, post apocalyptic, honest-to-god culinary "
"experience!  We're planning to grow food and crops here.  Central's plan is "
"to import our crops directly, and pay us for our work.  I don't think "
"they've even thought much about transport, outside just shipping them back "
"home.  If we do local site processing we can prevent storage losses, and "
"make higher value material to sell out!  And Central still benefits from "
"having a dedicated bread basket!"
msgstr ""
"そうさ、彼女に聞いたんだな。」彼は情熱のこもった目で見返しました。「友よ、ただのパン屋じゃないぞ。崩壊した世界に、正真正銘、本物の、本格的な料理が味わえる店を作るんだ！ここで食料や農作物を栽培する計画も始まっていてね。避難センターの構想では、農作物をここからセンターへ直接納入し、私たちはその対価を得ることになる。輸送方法は具体的に決まっていないようだけど、荷物を積み替えて往復することになるだろう。こちらで加工までできるようになれば、保管ロスを防ぎ、より価値の高い作物を余らせることなく用意できる。そしてセンター側も、専用の穀倉地の恩恵にあずかれるというわけだよ。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/Nunez/NPC_Pablo_Tacoma.json
msgid "Do you know anything about building a 'culinary experience'?"
msgstr "その「本格的な料理」を味わうためには、何が必要になる？"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/Nunez/NPC_Pablo_Tacoma.json
msgid ""
"I'm being a bit tongue-in-cheek there.  Really I want some big wood fired "
"ovens, tools for milling grain, tinning and canning equipment, stuff like "
"that.  We'll make flour, jam, pickles, bread, maybe some sauerkraut and "
"things.  All the old school ways of preserving food, from before fridges "
"were commonplace."
msgstr ""
"そんなに大げさなものでもないよ。必要なのは、大型の薪オーブン、穀物を製粉する設備、ブリキ缶の生産や缶詰に必要な工具類だ。それさえあれば、穀粉、ジャム、酢漬け、パン、ザワークラウトなどが作れるだろう。冷蔵庫が普及する前から存在する、昔ながらの保存食品だね。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/Nunez/NPC_Pablo_Tacoma.json
msgid "Okay, but do you know anything about that?"
msgstr "なるほど、料理についても詳しいのか？"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/Nunez/NPC_Pablo_Tacoma.json
msgid ""
"Well…\" he tugs jokingly at his collar as though letting off steam.  \"I "
"know a bit.  I used to make pickles and jams as a hobby.  With my mom.  When"
" I was a teenager.  But I know the principles!  And Dana knows more than "
"you'd think about grain and flour because she's a huge nerd for her craft.  "
"We do have some knowledge gaps between design and implementation though."
msgstr ""
"まあ...」彼は冗談めかして服の襟を整えました。「多少はね。趣味でピクルスやジャムを作ったことがある。母の手伝いで。十代の頃。原理はちゃんと理解しているよ！それに、ダナは自作料理に関しては大の凝り性だからね。彼女は穀物や穀粉についてもよく知っている。でも、構想を実現するためには足りないものを埋める必要があるだろうな。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/Nunez/NPC_Pablo_Tacoma.json
msgid "What kind of gaps?"
msgstr "足りないものというのは？"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/Nunez/NPC_Pablo_Tacoma.json
msgid ""
"Not where you might think.\"  He sets aside his ledger and pulls out a page "
"of bullet-point notes written in neat block letters.  \"Everyone is on board"
" with the idea and the amount of actual building to get it online is small "
"enough that the carpenters are willing to help out, so I don't need any "
"assistance with design.  For the really short term I basically just need "
"materials.  I've been collecting spare wood, but to get a good wood-fired "
"oven I need to secure a source of firebrick.  In the longer run, Dana knows "
"the principles of milling, but I need a resource book if I want to set up a "
"functioning mill, first a muscle-powered one and then a windmill for long "
"term.  I wish I'd thought of asking Jenny.  She's a mechanical engineer, but"
" she would probably know how to get me started at least.  I'm also still "
"looking into how to make a good vermin-proof cellar.  Longer term, I will "
"need to work my way around our reliance on sugar, salt, and vinegar from "
"before the cataclysm, but our stocks of those will hold out for months while"
" I sort things out."
msgstr ""
"「簡単に手に入るようなものではないね。」彼は台帳を脇に置き、几帳面な字体で書かれた箇条書きのメモを取り出しました。「ここの全ての住人が計画に賛同してくれているし、建設に必要な人員も小規模、大工も喜んで手を貸してくれる。設計面では問題はない。超短期的な観点から見れば、必要なのは資材だけだ。余った木材を集めてはいるけど、いい薪オーブンを作るなら耐熱レンガの供給源を確保しないとな。それから、ダナは確かに製粉の原理を理解しているけど、長期的な構想を練るには、継続して稼働する製粉所を稼働させるための参考資料が要るだろう。最初は人力の製粉機で足りるだろうが、長時間稼働させるなら風車が必要だ。ジェニーに相談できたらよかったんだけどな。彼女は機械エンジニアだが、製粉所稼働のための指針程度なら示してくれたかもしれない。そして、害虫を防ぐ完璧な地下倉庫の作り方。これは私もまだ調べている最中だ。超長期的な観点から見ると、大変動以前に作られた砂糖、塩、酢への依存から抜け出す必要もあるが、これは結論を出すまでの数ヶ月間は持ちこたえてくれるね。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/Nunez/NPC_Pablo_Tacoma.json
msgctxt "u:f"
msgid "Seriously?  You've already done so much.  I won't say no, though."
msgstr "本当に？今までもたくさん助けてもらったのに。でも、手伝ってくれるなら心強いよ。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/Nunez/NPC_Pablo_Tacoma.json
msgctxt "u:m"
msgid "Seriously?  You've already done so much.  I won't say no, though."
msgstr "本当に？今までもたくさん助けてもらったのに。でも、手伝ってくれるなら心強いよ。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/Nunez/NPC_Pablo_Tacoma.json
msgctxt "u:n"
msgid "Seriously?  You've already done so much.  I won't say no, though."
msgstr "本当に？今までもたくさん助けてもらったのに。でも、手伝ってくれるなら心強いよ。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/Nunez/NPC_Pablo_Tacoma.json
msgid "No problem.  What were you saying before?"
msgstr "問題ない。前の話をもう一度聞かせてもらえる？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/Nunez/NPC_Pablo_Tacoma.json
msgid "Well, I'd better go look into that."
msgstr "ああ、早速手筈を整えてこよう。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/Nunez/NPC_Pablo_Tacoma.json
msgid ""
"I… I honestly don't know why I didn't think of that.  I could even have "
"asked the supply caravans to do it.  If it comes down to it though, I trust "
"you more than them.  Would you mind?"
msgstr ""
"そうか...正直、今まで何故その方法を思い付けなかったんだろう。補給品の隊商に頼むこともできたのに。でも、君に頼んだ方が確実だろうな。引き受けてもらえるかな？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/Nunez/NPC_Pablo_Tacoma.json
msgid "Sure.  What were you saying before?"
msgstr "もちろん。さっきの話をもう一度聞かせてもらえる？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/Nunez/NPC_Pablo_Tacoma.json
msgid "Sure, I'll see what I can do."
msgstr "もちろん、できる限りのことをやってみよう。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/Nunez/NPC_Pablo_Tacoma.json
msgid ""
"Oh… oh, ok!  It's a good thing you showed me this, my basic guesses missed "
"some important points.  Thanks, this will be helpful for a lot more than "
"just the bakery."
msgstr ""
"あっ...ああ、なるほど！教えてくれて本当にありがとう。私の考えたやり方だと、重要な点に間違いがあったようだ。この手法はきっとパン屋以外でも役立つぞ。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/Nunez/NPC_Pablo_Tacoma.json
msgid "Any time!  But I'd better go."
msgstr "それは良かった！もうそろそろ行かないと。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/Nunez/NPC_Pablo_Tacoma.json
msgid "I heard you might be willing to trade for propane?"
msgstr "プロパンガスを買ってくれると聞いたんだけど？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/Nunez/NPC_Pablo_Tacoma.json
msgid "Dana said you had some plans to build a bakery?"
msgstr "やあ、パブロ！ダナから聞いたけど、パン屋を作る計画を立てているのか？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/Nunez/NPC_Pablo_Tacoma.json
msgid "I don't mind keeping my eye out for some firebricks for you."
msgstr "耐熱レンガを探してこよう。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/Nunez/NPC_Pablo_Tacoma.json
msgid ""
"I can pass a note to Jenny about helping with the mill designs, if you want."
msgstr "もし良かったら、設計についてのアドバイスをジェニーに頼んでみようか。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/Nunez/NPC_Pablo_Tacoma.json
msgid ""
"[Survival 4, Fabrication 4] I know how to build a good root cellar.  Here, "
"let me show you."
msgstr "[ｻﾊﾞｲﾊﾞﾙ4、製作4]便利な貯蔵穴の作り方なら知っている。こうやって、こんな感じだ。"

#. ~ Mission name
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/Nunez/NPC_Pablo_Tacoma.json
msgid "Get Pablo some fire bricks."
msgstr "パブロに耐熱レンガを渡す"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Get Pablo some fire bricks."
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/Nunez/NPC_Pablo_Tacoma.json
msgid "Find some fire bricks to help Pablo build an oven."
msgstr "オーブン造りを手伝うために、パブロに耐熱レンガを渡しましょう。"

#. ~ Mission name
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/Nunez/NPC_Pablo_Tacoma.json
msgid "Pass a message to Jenny Forcette."
msgstr "ジェニーに構想を伝える"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Pass a message to Jenny Forcette."
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/Nunez/NPC_Pablo_Tacoma.json
msgid "Ask Jenny Forcette if she can help Pablo Nunez with his mill designs."
msgstr "ジェニー・フォセッテにパブロ・ヌニェスの製粉工場の構想を伝え、アドバイスを貰いましょう。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
msgid "Any time, what's on your mind?"
msgstr "ああ、どうした？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_main_dialogue.json
msgid "I'd like your opinion on a job we're doing."
msgstr "取り組んでいるミッションについて意見が聞きたい。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
msgid "[Raise your hand for a high-five.]"
msgstr "[手を挙げてハイタッチを促す]"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
msgid "Can I ask you a bit about yourself?"
msgstr "あなた自身についての話を聞いてもいい？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
msgid "You picked up a lot of useful skills over the years, hey."
msgstr "何年もかけて役立つ技術を色々と身につけてきたんだな。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/luo_follower.json
msgid "I just wanted to chat, you know.  To relax."
msgstr "ただ雑談がしたかったんだ。リラックスするために。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
msgid ""
"The way you said something earlier made me realize… you have a crush on "
"Jenny Forcette, don't you."
msgstr "その言い方で気付いた...ジェニー・フォセッテに一目惚れしたんだな。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
msgid "*high fives you back enthusiastically."
msgstr "*は元気よくハイタッチを返しました。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
msgid "*returns the high five with a flourish"
msgstr "*は豪快なハイタッチを返しました。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
msgid "*leaps into the air and gives you a spinning high five."
msgstr "*は飛び上がり、スピンしながらハイタッチを返しました。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
msgid "*smacks your hand with a resounding clap."
msgstr "*とのハイタッチの音が心地よく響きました。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
msgid ""
"*pretends to fake you out for a moment, then grins and returns the high five"
msgstr "*はフェイントを繰り出してニヤリと笑い、その後ハイタッチを返しました。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
msgid "[Nod and continue talking.]"
msgstr "[満足して頷き雑談を続ける]"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
msgid "[Nod and head on out.]"
msgstr "[満足して頷き話を切り上げる]"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
msgid ""
"Sure.  Can I tell you about this idea I had for a comic I'm never gonna "
"make?"
msgstr "いいね。この前思い付いた漫画の構想について話そうか？漫画なんて絶対描かないんだけどな。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
msgid ""
"Lately I've been thinking about my Steam library and all those games I was "
"putting off for a bad time.  Now it's a bad time and I can't play 'em.  "
"Tragedy of our era, right?"
msgstr "最近、Steamライブラリとか、積みっぱなしのゲームのことをよく考える。今はプレイできる状況じゃないけど。嫌な時代になったもんだよな？"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
msgid ""
"You remember that girl from high school I had that huge crush on?  Emily?  I"
" wonder if she's still alive.  I shoulda asked her out."
msgstr "俺が高校時代に惚れてた子のこと覚えてるか？ほら、エミリーだよ？まだ生きてるかな。デートに誘っときゃよかった。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
msgid ""
"Aw dude.  I was just remembering about this crowdfunded board game I backed "
"right before things went to hell.  It'd be fulfilling right about now, I "
"bet."
msgstr ""
"あっ、そういえば。こんな状況になる前にクラウドファンディングのボードゲームを支援してたんだった。何も起きなけりゃ絶対資金調達できてたって、間違いないぜ。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
msgid ""
"Does it ever seem to you like the stars are in different places from where "
"they used to be?  I can find all the old constellations, but they look "
"different now."
msgstr "空の星が前と全然別の位置にあるような気がしないか？昔は星座だって辿れたのに、今は違って見える。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
msgid ""
"Since everything went down, I keep having this recurring dream where I'm at "
"Foodplace again, and Luke Skywalker is there, demanding an EB2 combo with "
"extra Beverage, and he's being a real Karen about it.  Do you think it means"
" something?"
msgstr ""
"世界が崩壊して以来、何度も同じ夢を見る。またフードプレイスで働いてたら、ルーク・スカイウォーカーがやって来てEB2とセットドリンクを注文して、そしたらルークがいつの間にかクレーマーおばさんになってるんだ。何か意味があると思うか？"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
msgid ""
"Maybe it's weird but this whole thing sorta feels like an extended camping "
"trip.  With zombies."
msgstr "変な話だけど、これが全部、ちょっと長いキャンプ旅行みたいだって感じることがある。ゾンビがいるけどな。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
msgid "I slept weird last night.  Got this awful crick in my neck."
msgstr "昨日寝違えたみたいだ。首が痛ぇ。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
msgid ""
"Do you think the internet is still out there somewhere, floating around in "
"some still-functional servers somehow?  It's weird to think about what "
"happened to all that data."
msgstr "どうにかしてまだ機能してるサーバー上には、インターネットが今も残ってるだろうか？インターネット全部が使えなくなったとは思えない。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
msgid ""
"Remember that guy Daren in elementary who used to tell all those weird-ass "
"creepy stories?  Chris hated him but I thought he was interesting.  I wonder"
" if he's alive, he'd have loved this."
msgstr ""
"小学生の頃、不気味な話をよくしてたダレンって奴のことを覚えてるか？クリスはあいつが嫌いだったけど、俺は面白いと思ってた。もしまだ生きてたら、この状況を楽しんだかもな。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
msgid "You know what I could really use right now?  A hot bath."
msgstr "今一番欲しいものが何か分かるか？熱い風呂さ。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
msgid ""
"Next time we hit a library, I'm gonna see if they've got a copy of Gideon "
"the Ninth.  I read that book a while ago, but I was super high and I don't "
"remember much of it."
msgstr ""
"今度図書館に行ったら、「ギデオン 第九王家の騎士」がないか探してみるつもりだ。少し前に読んだけど、滅茶苦茶興奮しすぎて内容をあまり思い出せない。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
msgid "Do you remember what day of the week it is?"
msgstr "今日は何曜日だっけ？"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
msgid ""
"Next time I get a chance, I'm gonna make a nice big bowl of mac and cheese."
msgstr "もし機会があれば、ボウルにいっぱいのマカロニチーズを作ってみたい。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
msgid ""
"Y'know, these shoes are surprisingly comfy.  You wouldn't think it to look "
"at 'em."
msgstr "知ってるか、この靴は最高に履き心地がいいんだ。見ただけじゃそうは思えないだろうけどな。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
msgid ""
"Do you think zombies know what's going on?  Like, are the original people "
"still in there watching all this happen?  I sure hope not."
msgstr "ゾンビは何が起きてるか理解してると思うか？つまり、元の人格が残ってて、自分に起きたこを認識してるのか？そうじゃないと良いんだが。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
msgid ""
"It's funny how fast all this weird shit starts to feel normal, don't you "
"think?"
msgstr "こんなにおかしな状況にもう慣れ始めてるなんて、笑える話だよな？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/xe_liam_chat.json
msgid ""
"We're always gonna be friends, right?  Even with the apocalypse… changing "
"us?"
msgstr "私たちはこれからもずっと親友だと信じていいのか？世界が滅びたら...変わるんだろうか？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/xe_liam_chat.json
msgid "What do you miss most about the internet?"
msgstr "インターネット関係で一番恋しいものって何だろう？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/xe_liam_chat.json
msgid ""
"Now that we've got no responsibilities, is there anything you'd like to see "
"or do?"
msgstr "あらゆる義務から解放された今、何か見たいものとか、やりたいことはある？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/xe_liam_chat.json
msgid "What do you think the rest of the world is like these days?"
msgstr "世界の他の場所はどんな状況なんだろうな？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/xe_liam_chat.json
msgid "Do you miss any food from the old days?"
msgstr "かつての食事を恋しく思う？"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
msgid "<talk_snippet_modded_liam_Friends4ever>"
msgstr "<talk_snippet_modded_liam_Friends4ever>"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
msgid ""
"Aww, of course.  No matter what happens, you're always you and I'm always "
"me, right?  We've been through worse than this.\"  He pauses, his brow "
"furrowed.  \"Well, okay, maybe we haven't.  But we've stuck through it all "
"for so many years, what's a little apocalypse gonna change?  Or a little "
"mutation, or grievous bodily harm, or zombies, or interdimensional monster "
"attacks and serious life-altering PTSD, or whatever.  Who cares.  You're my "
"family, more than my birth family ever was."
msgstr ""
"そりゃ、もちろん。何が起きても、お前はいつもお前で、俺はいつも俺だ。今の状況より酷い経験だってしてきただろ。」彼は眉間にしわを寄せて思案しました。「そういうのを全部乗り越えて、今まで生きてきた。多少世界が滅んだくらいがなんだ？多少の、突然変異、酷いケガ、ゾンビ、異界生物の襲撃、人生が一変するPTSD、それがどうした。気にするもんか。お前と俺は家族、いや、血の繋がった家族以上の存在だ。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/xe_liam_chat.json
msgid "[Continue chatting.]"
msgstr "[雑談を続ける]"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
msgid ""
"OK, I know you're leading me up to say something dirty, and yeah I miss "
"that, but you know what?  Really the thing I miss most is social media.  No "
"seriously!  Stop looking at me like that!  I liked being able to just talk "
"to people no matter where they were, any time.  I had friends in Sweden, and"
" Brazil, and the West Coast.  I'm never gonna know what happened to them, "
"and that busts me up bad.  They mattered to me, you know?\"  His voice "
"catches a bit, and he coughs.  \"You're here though, and that helps a lot.  "
"Can't imagine trying to do this lone-wolf.  How about you, what were you "
"thinking of when you asked?"
msgstr ""
"おい、何か下品なことを言わせようとしてるってのはお見通しだぞ。確かに、恋しいとは思ってるけどな？マジで一番恋しいと思ってるのはSNSだよ。いや、本当だって！そんな目で見るのは止めろ！いつでも、どこでも、気軽に話せるのがよかった。スウェーデンと、ブラジルと、西海岸に友達がいた。あいつらに今何が起きてるのか絶対に知りようがない、それって最悪なことだ。そういう、繋がりが大事なんだ、そうだろ？」彼は少しどもり、咳き込みました。「でも、お前がここにいてくれて、マジで助かってるよ。この状況に一人で立ち向かうなんて想像もしたくない。というか、質問してきたそっちは逆に何が恋しいんだ？"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
msgid ""
"Well, I mean, there's the obvious stuff like, uh, video streaming,\" he "
"winks at you, \"but I think lately I'm missing Wikipedia.  I have all these "
"random questions about things, and I can't answer them.  I feel like I'm "
"living in a box.  How did we survive for thousands of years like this?"
msgstr ""
"うーん、そうだな、間違いなくこれってのは、まあ、動画ストリーミングだけど...」彼はこちらにウィンクしました。「でも、最近はウィキペディアが見たくて仕方ない。色々と疑問が浮かぶことはよくあるのに、答えが見つからない。箱の中に閉じ込められて生きてるみたいだ。こんな状態で俺らの祖先はどうやって何千年も命を繋いできたんだ？"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
msgid ""
"Online restaurant reviews.\"  He stares at you without a shred of irony.  "
"\"I'm serious, I used to love browsing looking for the funniest or weirdest "
"reviews.  I guess I could broaden it, I miss pointless doom scrolling.  It's"
" harder to find things to keep my mind off things now, and I've got more I "
"wish I could keep my mind off.  What about you?"
msgstr ""
"レストランのレビューだな。」彼は真面目な表情でこちらを見ました。「マジな話、読み応えのあるレビューとかおかしなレビューを探して読むのが大好きだったんだ。もっと役に立つことを検索しろって思うけど、そうやって延々と時間を無駄にするのが止められなかった。今の状況は、気を紛らわすものを見つけるだけでも大変だ。そうやって気晴らしができたらいいのに、って思うことはよくある。お前はどうだ？"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
msgid ""
"*laughs.  \"You know me, I was never high on the ambition front.  Honestly, "
"if you weren't around I'd probably clean up my dad's old cabin, try to learn"
" how to set up a power supply, and scavenge for parts until I'd built the "
"best damn gaming rig the world will ever see.  Then I'd load up whatever "
"games I could find.\"  He pauses.  \"Or maybe it'd be easier to set up a "
"console, I dunno.  Most consoles aren't gonna like the no-internet thing "
"right?  There's probably a way to crack 'em but without the internet where "
"would we even check?\"  He rubs his chin.  \"Still.  I'd have maybe found a "
"way.  How about you, what's the big overarching plan for all this?\""
msgstr ""
"*は笑いました。「知っての通り、俺は別に野心家じゃない。正直、お前が来なかったら、親父の古い小屋を掃除して、電源を確保する方法を勉強して、必要な部品を死ぬまで漁り続けてただろうな。」彼はふと思案しました。「いや、ゲーム機を使えるようにする方が先か。どうだろう。多分、大抵のゲーム機はネットに繋がってないと使えないよな？どうにかしてクラックする方法はあるかも、でもネットがないのにやり方をどう調べる？」顎をさすりながら考え込んでいます。「まあ。俺ならいつかやり遂げたはずだ。お前はどうなんだ、これよりデカい野望を抱いてるのか？"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
msgid ""
"Oh, well.  I don't really think of life that way, you know?  I guess I'm "
"pretty happy to just hang out with you, doing the shit we're doing, seeing "
"what life brings.  Still, I guess I could see settling down somewhere nice, "
"somewhere quiet, somewhere zombie-free.  I bet it wouldn't take long to get "
"enough food and supplies to live on forever, and then I'd just let myself "
"turn into some kinda wild bush man, with a big crazy long beard.  I'd smell "
"like weed and B.O. and I'd have this giant stack of books to read.  Other "
"survivors would come find me, like a guru on a mountaintop, to ask me "
"questions about Batman.  In time, as the old world was forgotten, I'd "
"convince them that he was a real person.\"  He grins.  \"How 'bout you?"
msgstr ""
"まいったな。そんな風に人生を考えたことがない。お前と一緒にこうやって色々やって、その結果を味わってるだけで十分幸せだと思う。そうすればいつか、どこか素敵で、静かな、ゾンビがいない場所に定住できる日が来る。寿命まで十分足りる食料とか日用品を集めるのにそれほど時間はかからないだろう。俺はきっと髭をバカみたいに長く伸ばして、ブッシュマンの仲間入りをするんだ。薬中とホームレスが合わさった匂いを漂わせてさ。そうなったら大量の本を読みたいね。他の生存者たちは俺のことを山の頂に住まう教祖みたいに扱って、バットマンとは一体誰なんだ、とか質問してくる。古い世界が忘れられるほど時が流れたら、俺はバットマンが実在人物だってペテンを吹き込んでやるのさ。」彼はニヤリと笑いました。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
msgid ""
"Oh dude, good question.  The news reports made it sound like this is "
"everywhere, you know?  Still, somewhere out there's gotta be better than "
"this, right?  Maybe like, up in the Yukon or Siberia or something it's all "
"kinda normal?  I think most places are like this though, just one big fucked"
" up mess.  Maybe they've got different monsters though, like, carnivorous "
"rocks or some shit.  How 'bout you, what do you think is out there?"
msgstr ""
"へぇ、面白い質問だな。ニュースだと、どこでも似たような状況だって言ってた。それでも、ここよりマシな場所はどこかにあるんじゃないか？例えば、ユーコンとか、シベリアとか、そういう地域ならもっと普通の暮らしができてるかも？まあ、大抵はこんな感じで、デカい混乱が起きて滅茶苦茶になってるだろうけどな。ゾンビがいなくても、何か、そう、人食い岩とか、そんな感じで、別のモンスターがいるかも。お前は他の地域にどんなのがいると思う？"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
msgid ""
"See, I like that about you.  Here we are just trying to keep alive and "
"you're thinking all these big thoughts about the rest of the world.  I got "
"no clue how they're doing out there, so I'm just gonna imagine that things "
"are kinda like here, but maybe a bit better.  There's a few places where "
"folks have settled in and they're figuring stuff out.  Those folks are gonna"
" last a long time, maybe they're how we start rebuilding."
msgstr ""
"ほら、お前のそういうところが気に入ってるんだ。ただ生きてるだけで大変な状況でも、世界の他の場所とか、大きなことを考えられる。遠くの地域がどうなってるのか全く分からないし、想像するしかないが、ここと似たような状況か、多少はマシなところもあるといい。一か所に定住して、生活について考えてる人たちもいる。きっと長く生き残れるだろうし、そういう人たちが再興のきっかけになるのかもな。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
msgid ""
"I never thought I'd hear myself say this, but I kinda miss the Ediburger3 "
"from Foodplace.  I worked there so long, I hated everything, but as soon as "
"you tell me I'm *never* gonna have a fresh, greasy EB3 again, suddenly it's "
"all my stomach wants.  Don't try to track one down or anything though.  I'm "
"pretty sure I miss the *idea* more than the actual *thing*.  And I don't "
"think we could cook up a copy, it'd be pretty hard to get the right blend of"
" animal product and sawdust for the Meatcylinder.\"  He stares wistfully "
"into space for a moment.  \"How about you, what were you thinking of when "
"you asked?"
msgstr ""
"こんなこと言うなんて思ってもみなかったけど、フードプレイスのエディバーガー3がちょっと恋しくなってきた。あそこでは長く働いてたから、何もかも嫌いだったけど、あの出来立ての脂っこいEB3を食べる機会は*二度と*訪れないって思い知らされると、突然胃がEB3を強烈に欲しがるんだ。ただし、EB3をどうにかして探し出そうなんて考えるなよ。俺はきっと*現物*より*イデア*を求めてる。それに、あれのコピーを作り出すのは不可能だ。動物性たんぱく質と成型肉の残りカスを上手くブレンドするのがかなり難しい。」彼はしばらく物欲しそうに虚空を見つめました。「そっちはどうなんだよ、どんな食べ物が恋しい？"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
msgid ""
"Delivery pizza.  It's not the quality of the pizza I miss, it's the "
"delivery.  Having someone just show up at the door with a god damn pizza, "
"ready for you to eat.  We lived in paradise and we knew it not.  How about "
"you?"
msgstr ""
"宅配ピザだ。別に美味いピザじゃなくていい、宅配ってのが大事だ。玄関までピザを持ってきてもらえて、すぐに食べられる。俺たちはかつて楽園に住んでいたのに、気付きもしなかったんだ。お前は何が恋しい？"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
msgid ""
"You know, my friend, I could really go for an egg salad sandwich right now."
"  Nice, fresh eggs, some cheap-ass white bread, bit of pickle on there, hint"
" of mustard.  Egg salad gets a bad rap because it sucks if you get it from "
"the store, but you make a good homemade one?  That's something else, I tell "
"you.  What's your poison?"
msgstr ""
"親友、そりゃ決まってるさ、今なら本物のエッグサラダサンドが食べられる。新鮮で美味しい卵、安っぽい食パン、そこに多少のピクルス、そしてかぐわしいマスタード。エッグサラダは店で買うと大抵不味いから悪く言われがちだけど、今なら手製の上手い奴が作れるだろ？そういうのでいいんだよ。そっちは、何か食べたくてたまらないものはあるのか？"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
msgid ""
"You know, I'm kinda in the mood for some pub nachos right now.  The whole "
"pub ambience would be good too, but I like how they'd put 'em on wax paper "
"that'd be so soaked with cheese grease you could see right through it.  "
"Those little black olive wheels that tasted like rubber, they were only ever"
" good with pub nachos, you know?  Any other time, garbage.  I'd love to have"
" a big tray of pub nachos, go to a karaoke night, and just sing fuckin' Abba"
" songs until my throat hurt.  You in?"
msgstr ""
"そうだな、パブのナチョスが食べたくてたまらない。パブの雰囲気ももちろん大事だが、チーズの油が紙トレイに透けるほど染み込んでるのがいいんだ。ゴムみたいな味のちっぽけな黒オリーブの輪切りとパブのナチョスの相性は最高だ。パブ以外でそんなもの出されたらゴミだけどな。デカいトレイごとナチョスをかっ込んで、カラオケナイトに参加して、喉が痛くなるまでABBAの曲をひたすら歌うんだ。お前は？"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
msgid ""
"Well, sure.  I dunno what more there is to tell, we've known each other for "
"ages."
msgstr "ううん、そうだな。俺とお前は昔からの親友、他に何も言うことはない。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
msgid ""
"We hadn't caught up in a while before <the_cataclysm>.  What've you been "
"doing?"
msgstr "<the_cataclysm>前から、しばらく会っていなかっただろう。どんな状況だった？"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
msgid ""
"*shrugs.  \"Same as I was when we used to hang out more, mostly.  I quit my "
"job at Foodplace a while back, got tired of the stupid outfits.  Worked "
"doing labor in construction for a bit, but I didn't like my boss so I "
"ditched it.  Got a job doing deliveries for Amazon, which was absolutely "
"shitty, but I managed to jump from that to a bit of a better delivery job "
"for a smaller company.  It was actually going pretty good before everything "
"happened.\""
msgstr ""
"*は肩をすくめました。「ずっと昔、もっと頻繁にお前とつるんでた頃と同じさ。ほとんどな。しばらく前にフードプレイスの仕事は辞めた。バカげた制服に飽きたんだ。その後は建設現場で肉体労働をしていたが、上司が気に入らなかったからすぐ辞めた。それからAmazonの配送の仕事をやって、それも心底クソだったから辞めた。でもその次は、小さな会社の多少マシな運送の仕事を見つけられたんだ。実際、世界が終わるまではかなり順調だった。」"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
msgid "How did you make it through the Cataclysm?"
msgstr "大変動をどうやって乗り切った？"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
msgid ""
"I wanna say it was a hell of a story, but really, I was on the way back to "
"Boston from a delivery and a thing about the riots came on the radio.  I was"
" close to the cabin so I just thought, 'this is starting to sound really "
"fuckin bad.'  I called in sick and took a few days to hunker down out of "
"civilization.  By the time I had to think about going back to work, we were "
"into that wild time when half the people were trying to keep things running "
"and the other half were trying to burn everything down.  I shut the blinds "
"and stayed in, until Chris showed up acting like a freak."
msgstr ""
"とんでもない目に遭った、と言いたいところだが、実は仕事が終わってボストンへ戻る途中で、暴動のことはラジオ番組でもう聴いていた。「これはマジでヤバいことが始まる」って思ったとき、丁度山小屋の近くに来ていたんだ。会社には体調不良だと連絡して、数日間は文明世界から遠ざかってた。そろそろ仕事に戻らないと、なんて思い始めた頃には、生きてる人間の半分は仕事を続けようと四苦八苦して、もう半分は何もかも焼き払おうとしていた。大混乱時代の幕開けさ。俺はひとまず窓のブラインドを閉めて引き籠ろうとした。様子のおかしなクリスがやってくるまでは。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
msgid ""
"It doesn't feel that way, but I guess so.  I don't know if I ever told you, "
"but my dad was quite the weirdo prepper.  He built the cabin and when I was "
"a kid we'd head out and do drills for the end of the world.  It's part of "
"why I was kinda wacked out on apocalypse stuff when you and I first met, "
"back when we made the plan for where to meet up and all.  He taught me "
"archery and some survival skills but I never really took to it, partly "
"because my ol' man was a real piece of work.\"  He stares off for a minute."
"  \"To be honest, though, now that we're in the middle of a real-ass "
"apocalypse, I can see a lot of what he taught me was just crap anyway.\""
msgstr ""
"あまり意識してなかったけど、そうなんだろうな。前にも話したかもしれないが、親父はかなり変人だった。自分で山小屋を建てて、まだ子供だった俺と一緒に、世界崩壊に備えて訓練をしていた。お前と初めて会ったときや、山小屋に避難する計画を立てたとき、俺が終末思想なんてうんざりだって態度だった理由がそれだ。父はアーチェリーやサバイバルスキルを教えてくれたが、どうも指導に熱が入りすぎて、あまり楽しくはなかった。」彼はしばらく空を見つめました。「正直言って、本当に世界が崩壊した今、親父の教えの大半は役に立たないものだってことが分かったよ」"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
msgid "What happened to your father?  You never talked about him much."
msgstr "あなたのお父さんはどうしてる？前から家族の話は聞いたことがなかったな。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
msgid ""
"*snorts.  \"I was pretty low-contact with him the last couple years.  He got"
" me that job in construction and when I left it, he tried to hit me, found "
"out I'm not so much of a pushover as when I was fifteen.  Asshole.  I was "
"still texting my mom a bit, apparently when things went to shit, he tried to"
" join the riots.  I hope he got gunned down.\""
msgstr ""
"*は鼻を鳴らしました。「ここ数年、親父とはほとんど顔を合わせてない。建設業の仕事を持ってきたのも親父なんだ。辞めようとしたときは、殴られそうになったよ。15歳の頃ほどは怖いと感じなかったな。クソッたれ。母さんとはメールで多少やり取りしていたが、どうやら親父は最悪の状況で暴動に参加しようとしていたらしい。撃たれちまえばいいんだ。」"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
msgid ""
"I remember your mom as kind of a quiet lady, she seemed all right.  Should "
"we be trying to find her?"
msgstr "あなたのお母さんは、物静かだけど気丈そうな人だったな。行方を探してみようか？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
msgid "Harsh, but I hear you.  <end_talking>"
msgstr "辛辣だ、でも気持ちは分かる。<end_talking>"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
msgid ""
"Well, things with her weren't as bad as with my dad, but I don't know if I'd"
" go trying to hunt for her in a zombified city or anything.  Like, sure she "
"didn't beat me up, but she didn't ever lift a finger to help me either.  She"
" was still with him right up until the end, even when it was obvious that "
"she was choosing him over me.  I don't wanna judge her for the life she led,"
" but - \" he trails off for a moment, then twitches his shoulders and "
"resumes.  \"Well, it's like I said.  I hope she's okay but I'm not gonna go "
"risk my neck trying to find her.  You and Chris were my real family, you got"
" me through those years."
msgstr ""
"まあ、親父ほど悪い関係じゃなかったが、ゾンビがうろつく街まで探しに行けるかと言われると、迷うな。確かに、母さんは俺を殴らなかった。でも、俺を助けようと手を差し伸べてくれなかった。最後まで親父と一緒に居たんだから、俺じゃなく親父を選んだってことだ。別に母さんの人生をどうこう言うつもりはないけど、でも...」肩を震わせる彼の声は次第に小さくなり、しばらくして話を再開しました。「まあ、最初に言った通りだ。無事を願ってはいるが、危険を冒してまで探しに行くつもりはない。お前とクリスが本当の家族だ。皆がいたから、今まで生きてこられた。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
msgid ""
"*stares at you wide-eyed for a beat, then breaks into a shy grin.  \"Aw man,"
" busted.  You *know* I dig those distracted nerdy chicks who don't react to "
"my presence in any way.  It's all good though, you know?  Don't tell her.  I"
" barely know her and it's not like she's in a place to be dating some "
"stranger.\""
msgstr ""
"*は目を見開いてしばらくこちらを見つめ、照れ笑いを浮かべました。「畜生、やられたよ。*見ての通り*、俺のことを何とも思ってなさそうな、悩み多きオタク女子に惚れちまった。でもまあ、そういうこともあるだろ？本人には言うなよ。俺はまだ彼女のことを全然知らないし、赤の他人とデートするような状況でもない。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
msgid "Your secret's safe with me.  I wanted to talk about something else."
msgstr "秘密は守るよ。他にも話したいことがある。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
msgid "Your secret's safe with me.  Let's go."
msgstr "秘密は守るよ。さあ行こう。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/xe_liam_chat.json
msgid "My opinion?  Sure, my friend, hit me up, what's eating you?"
msgstr "意見？よし親友、話してみな、何を悩んでるんだ？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/xe_liam_chat.json
msgid ""
"Check this out, I found an address of some kind of central refugee "
"management facility.  Should we check it out?  Maybe they'll have answers?"
msgstr "これを見てほしい。避難者を集めている大きな施設の場所が分かった。調べた方がいいか？助けてもらえるだろうか？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/xe_liam_chat.json
msgid "You thinking what I'm thinking about this mystery dropoff for Smokes?"
msgstr "スモークスが預かっていた謎の荷物について、私が何を考えていると思う？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
msgid "Any ideas about this job to clear out the back bay for Smokes?"
msgstr "スモークスに頼まれた建物の一角を掃除する仕事について、何か考えはある？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
msgid "What do you think about taking down this bandit camp?"
msgstr "盗賊の野営地をどうにかする仕事について、何か考えはある？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
msgid "Any thoughts about bringing this prospectus out to the ranch?"
msgstr "発起書を農園から届ける仕事について、何か考えはある？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
msgid "What's the fastest way to find these guys some solar panels?"
msgstr "ソーラーパネルを用意する一番手っ取り早い方法は何だろう？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
msgid "Liam, I need a lot of jars.  A shocking amount of jars."
msgstr "リアム、瓶が大量に必要だ。とんでもなく大量の瓶が。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
msgid "Liam, we need bigger jars."
msgstr "リアム、もっと大きな瓶が必要だ。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
msgid "How about finding this guy some cigarettes?"
msgstr "頼まれたタバコ探しは上手くいくだろうか？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
msgid "Should we go check out those farmers the teamster mentioned?"
msgstr "運転手が言っていた農家を調べに行った方がいいだろうか？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
msgid ""
"A secret lab in the wilds, with survivors in it, Liam.  You heard the "
"teamster."
msgstr "リアム、荒野に隠された研究所に生存者がいるらしい。運転手がそう言っていた。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
msgid "This 'scrap metal castle' sounds far fetched to me."
msgstr "「屑鉄の砦」なんて、とても信じられない。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
msgid ""
"What sounds better to you, a 'bullet bank' or a woman who feeds visitors?"
msgstr "「弾薬銀行」と食事を出してくれる女性、どっちがいい？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
msgid "What do you think about helping out this Dave guy?"
msgstr "デイブという奴の手伝いについて、何か考えはある？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
msgid ""
"At least Dave has some practicality, and isn't just asking for more trash, "
"right?"
msgstr "デイブに頼まれた仕事は、少なくとも当人にとっては意味のあることで、ただのゴミ集めじゃないんだよな？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
msgid "Any thoughts on Dave's cardboard needs?"
msgstr "デイブが段ボールを欲しがってることについて、何か考えはある？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
msgid "Looks like we might be done with cardboard for Dave, it's plastic now."
msgstr "デイブの段ボール熱は冷めたらしい。今度はビニールシートだ。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
msgid "I have a feeling this is the last of the cardboard for Dave."
msgstr "デイブが段ボールを欲しがるのも、これで最後のような気がする。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
msgid "Hey, this is a different direction for Dave, don't you think?"
msgstr "なあ、これがデイブにとっての転換点になるような気がしないか？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
msgid "Do you think it's dangerous to get zombie blood, besides the obvious?"
msgstr "分かり切ったことだけど、ゾンビの血を手に入れるのは危険な仕事だと思うか？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
msgid "Sneaking into a lab to run some data analysis can't be bad, right?"
msgstr "データ分析のために研究所に忍び込む、分が悪い仕事じゃないよな？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
msgid ""
"Who could have guessed there'd be some further complications to our stolen "
"data analysis?"
msgstr "忍び込んで分析したデータが、さらにややこしい仕事を呼び込むなんて想像できたか？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
msgid "What do you think about checking out this freezing portal lab?"
msgstr "極低温のポータルがある研究所の調査についてどう思う？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
msgid ""
"If you were tired of underground labs, now we're gonna check out secret "
"underground lab tunnels!"
msgstr "地下研究所に飽きてきたなら、今度は研究所に通じる地下トンネルを探検だ！"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
msgid "Do you know how to build a still?"
msgstr "蒸留器の作り方は分かるか？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
msgid ""
"How long does brewer's yeast last in the package?  Can we just find it at a "
"supermarket?"
msgstr "ビールの酵母は封を開けない状態でどのくらい保つだろう？食料品店で見つかるだろうか？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
msgid "Any idea where we could find sugar beet seeds for the bartender?"
msgstr "バーテンダーに頼まれたサトウダイコンの種はどこで探せばいい？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
msgid "Do you like big jugs, Liam?"
msgstr "リアム、たぷんたぷんのでっかいタンクは好きか？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
msgid "How are we gonna transport two giant drums?"
msgstr "巨大なドラム缶を2つも、どうやって運べばいい？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
msgid ""
"Bringing a professional arsonist some commercial fertilizer seems like a "
"normal thing to do."
msgstr "放火のプロが、肥料なんてごく普通の物資を欲しがるものなんだな。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
msgid "So, uh.  Alonso's pants, hey."
msgstr "それで、ええと、アロンソのズボン、だったかな。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
msgid ""
"What do you think about helping these guys clean up all that dead zombie "
"mess?"
msgstr "ゾンビの死骸を片付ける人員集めの仕事について、何か考えはある？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
msgid "Any thoughts on finding Boris a power saw?"
msgstr "ボリスに電動丸ノコギリを渡す仕事について、何か考えはある？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
msgid "We're looking for Boris' kid's old laptop.  Thoughts?"
msgstr "ボリスの息子が使っていたノートパソコンを探そう。何か考えは？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
msgid "You ever used a sourdough starter?"
msgstr "サワー種スターターを使ったことはあるか？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
msgid "Draco seems like a kindred spirit for you."
msgstr "ドラコはあなたと気が合いそうだ。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
msgid "Are you okay with tracking down a copy of the Quran?"
msgstr "コーランを探しに行く準備はできたか？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
msgid ""
"Any idea where to find a really specific reference book about pneumatic "
"guns?"
msgstr "空圧式の銃に関する詳細な参考書なんてどこにあるんだろう？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
msgid "What do you think, where should we look for a motor for Jenny?"
msgstr "ジェニーに渡すモーターはどこで探せばいいと思う？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
msgid "It shouldn't be too hard to find Jenny a big metal tank, right?"
msgstr "ジェニーに頼まれた金属製の大型タンクなんて、そんなに見つけにくいものだろうか？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
msgid "You ever seen gunsmithing books just lying around?"
msgstr "銃器製造の本がその辺に落ちてないだろうか？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
msgid "So, we're finding a book about guns for your sweet nerd-girl."
msgstr "さて、愛しのオタク女子のために銃の本を探すとしよう。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
msgid ""
"Do you think it's the right thing, trying to help the Nunez family move to "
"Tacoma?"
msgstr "ヌーニェス夫妻がタコマへ移住するのを手助けすべきだろうか？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
msgid "Any thoughts on helping Uyen out with her antiseptic?"
msgstr "ホェンに消毒薬を渡す仕事について、何か考えはある？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
msgid "Any thoughts on helping Uyen out with her bandages?"
msgstr "ホェンに包帯を渡す仕事について、何か考えはある？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
msgid "Any thoughts on helping Uyen out with her antidepressants?"
msgstr "ホェンに抗うつ剤を渡す仕事について、何か考えはある？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
msgid "You and me: hairdressing supply vendors now."
msgstr "さて、これからは美容院向けのベンダーに転職だ。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
msgid ""
"What're your thoughts on this mission to kill bandits for the old guard?"
msgstr "オールドガードに頼まれた盗賊の討伐任務について、何か考えはある？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
msgid "How do you think we should track down this enemy informant?"
msgstr "敵に情報を漏らした人物をどうやって突き止めればいいんだろう？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
msgid "What do you think about these robots?  Crazy stuff, hey?"
msgstr "ロボットの目撃情報についてどう思う？どうも妙な依頼だと思わないか？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
msgid ""
"Do you think it's really a monster hitting those trade caravans?  Any ideas "
"how we should deal with it?"
msgstr "隊商は怪物にでも襲われたんだろうか？何かいい対処法はないか？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
msgid ""
"So, we're officially assassins for hire now.  How do you feel about that?"
msgstr "私たちは政府から公式に暗殺者として雇われたことになる。何か考えはある？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
msgid "Well, now we're radio technicians.  Sounds fun, don't you think?"
msgstr "さて、私たちは無線技士になったわけだ。何だか楽しそうだと思わないか？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
msgid ""
"What do you make of these weird pictographs?  I think they're directions "
"somewhere."
msgstr "この妙なピクトグラムをどう思う？どこかに向かう経路にも見える。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
msgid "Where do you think we can get some anesthetic for that robot guy?"
msgstr "あのロボット人間に頼まれた麻酔はどこで手に入ると思う？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
msgid "Any thoughts on this scouting mission, checking out this bunker thing?"
msgstr "掩体壕を偵察する仕事について、何か考えはある？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
msgid ""
"How do you think we should start looking for this lost interdimensional "
"building?"
msgstr "異次元人の建物なんて、どうやって探せばいいんだろう？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
msgid "You ready to go burn some shit down?"
msgstr "どこかの屑の家を燃やしに行く覚悟はできたか？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
msgid "It's not gonna be a problem that we're hunting down Foodperson, is it?"
msgstr "フードパーソンを倒してしまって大丈夫なのか？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
msgid "What do you think about clearing out these pizzeria squatters?"
msgstr "ピッツァ屋の不法占拠者をどうにかする仕事について、何か考えはある？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
msgid "So, cake and a party.  Think it was all worth it?"
msgstr "さて、ケーキでお祝いだ。今までの仕事にそれだけの価値はあったのか？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
msgid "What do you think, you in the mood to hunt some slimes?"
msgstr "どうだろう、スライムを狩りたい気分になってきた？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
msgid "Hey Liam!  Liam!  Bughunt!"
msgstr "ほら、リアム！リアム！虫狩りだ！"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
msgid ""
"Looks like I've got you doing deliveries again.  Where should we look for "
"all this lumber?"
msgstr "また配達員に戻ってもらうことになるかもしれない。木材はどこで探せばいい？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
msgid ""
"I dunno if you heard, but guess what we're gonna deliver now?  More lumber!"
msgstr "聞いたかもしれないが、また配達の仕事になりそうだな？もっと木材が必要だ！"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
msgid "Any idea where we can find some ropes?"
msgstr "ロープはどこで見つければいいんだろう？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
msgid "These guys need a wood saw.  You carrying one?"
msgstr "ノコギリを必要としてる人がいる。持ってないか？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
msgid "Where could we find a shovel?"
msgstr "シャベルはどこで探せばいい？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
msgid "We're looking for a charcoal smoker now.  You seen one?"
msgstr "燻製器を探している。見たことあるか？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
msgid ""
"This guy wants us to find a Remington 870 Express for a client.  You know a "
"bit about that stuff, don't you?"
msgstr "取り引きで使うレミントン870を探してほしいと頼まれた。少しでも何か知らないか？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
msgid ""
"Nothing ever went wrong tracking down a nice old guy in a cabin in the "
"woods, right?"
msgstr "森の中の小屋にいる親切な老人に会いに行くのに、何も心配する必要はないだろうな？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
msgid "You fine with helping this guy and his rabbits?"
msgstr "老人とウサギを助けることに異論はないな？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
msgid "Does blackberry hunting sound nice?"
msgstr "ブラックベリー狩りって、何だか素敵だと思わないか？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
msgid "Mind helping Mr. Lapin get in touch with his friends?"
msgstr "ウサギ飼育家が知り合いと連絡を取るのを手伝ってもいいよな？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
msgid "Seen an anvil around recently?"
msgstr "最近どこかで金床を見かけなかったか？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
msgid "Anything we should consider before trying to find Chris Isherwood?"
msgstr "クリス・イシャーウッドを探す前に考えておくべきことはある？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
msgid "Looks like Barry Isherwood's got himself into some trouble."
msgstr "バリー・イシャーウッドがトラブルに巻き込まれたようだ。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
msgid "Want to help me collect some dandelions?"
msgstr "タンポポ集めを手伝ってもらえないか？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
msgid "Hey Liam.  Bee balm?"
msgstr "なあ、リアム。ビーバームって？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
msgid "Tonight, on 'to catch a predator'…"
msgstr "さて、今夜の「トゥ・キャッチ・ア・プレデター」は..."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
msgid "Eddie wants a *lot* of rocks."
msgstr "エディが*大量*の石を欲しがってる。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
msgid "So, Liam, you ready to gather sand?"
msgstr "さて、リアム、砂を集める準備はできたか？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
msgid "I told Eddie we'd help him gather some clay."
msgstr "粘土集めの手伝いをエディに申し出たんだ。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
msgid "Where should we look for jars for the Isherwoods?"
msgstr "イシャーウッド家に渡す瓶はどこで探せばいいだろう？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
msgid "Any thoughts about looking for wheat seeds?"
msgstr "小麦の種集めについて、何か考えはある？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
msgid "Liam, you're not afraid of the big bad wolf, are you?"
msgstr "リアム、オオカミなんか怖くないよな？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
msgid "What do you think about hunting some mystery monsters for Jesse?"
msgstr "ジェスに頼まれた謎の怪物退治についてどう思う？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
msgid "Hey, you ever seen a book about glassblowing?"
msgstr "さて、硝子吹きについての本なんて見たことあるか？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
msgid "Luke Isherwood wants a copy of the DIY Compendium."
msgstr "ルーク・イシャーウッドが『日曜大工全書』を欲しがってる。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
msgid "You think Barry's gonna be okay?"
msgstr "バリーは大丈夫だろうか？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
msgid ""
"Liam!  There's a chef, trapped in a restaurant!  Want to help save them?"
msgstr "リアム！料理人がレストランに閉じ込められてるみたいだ！助けに行くべきだろうか？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
msgid ""
"What do you think about tracking down these survivors camping out on a farm?"
msgstr "農場に集まっている生存者たちを訪ねることについて、何か考えはあるか？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
msgid "Should we go track down this mystery cabin?"
msgstr "山小屋を見に行くべきだろうか？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
msgid ""
"Liam, I've got the location of a prepper bunker.  Should we check this out?"
msgstr "リアム、プレッパーのシェルターの場所を教えてもらった。調べに行くべきだろうか？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
msgid "How do you feel about checking out a zombie-infested farm?"
msgstr "ゾンビだらけの農場を見に行くことについて、何か考えはあるか？"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
msgid ""
"Sweet, road trip!  That sounds like as good a plan as any, my friend.  Gives"
" me some first season Walking Dead vibes, you know?  Maybe the place will be"
" run by sinister G-men, or a lone crazy scientist who thinks he can cure "
"zombies if he can just get his hands on one super-rare ingredient.  Road "
"trip!"
msgstr ""
"いいね、遠征だ！すごくいい計画だと思うぜ、親友。ウォーキング・デッドのシーズン1っぽい空気だ。きっとその場所は邪悪な捜査官か、もしくはゾンビ治療のために希少な素材を探してる孤独なマッドサイエンティストが牛耳ってる筈だ。遠征かぁ！"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
msgid "Road trip!  I'd like your opinion on something else, actually."
msgstr "遠征だ！その前に、他にも意見を聞きたいことがある。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
msgid ""
"I'm thinking this kinda sounds like that intercom and their vague-yet-"
"menacing government agency.\"  He pauses.  \"That might be a deep cut, if "
"you never listened to Night Vale.  Anyway, I bet that's where we're going."
msgstr ""
"俺は思うんだが、妙に偉そうな通信装置がある、政府施設みたいな場所のことじゃないのか。」彼はそこで言葉を切りました。「Night "
"Valeのポッドキャストを知らない奴にとっては、衝撃の展開かもしれないな。ともかく、きっと宛て先はそこだ。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
msgid ""
"I'm thinking this sounds *awesome*, and also possibly we're gonna die.  At "
"least we'll die investigating a vague-yet-menacing government agency.\"  He "
"pauses.  \"That might be a deep cut, if you never listened to Night Vale."
msgstr ""
"そうだな、*すげぇ*ってところか。あと、生きて帰れないかも。少なくとも、なんだかヤバそうな政府機関なんて嗅ぎまわってたら、きっと死ぬぜ。」彼はそこで言葉を切りました。「Night"
" Valeのポッドキャストを知らない奴にとっては、衝撃の展開かもしれないな。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
msgid "Yep, same page.  I'd like your opinion on something else, actually."
msgstr "大体同じ考えだ。実は他にも意見を聞きたいことがある。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
msgid ""
"*rubs his chin thoughtfully.  \"Maybe we can set up a bottleneck in the "
"hallway?  First we drag a few lockers or something to funnel them, then one "
"of us hangs close to the barricade and the other stands back and fires "
"arrows or something?\"  He shrugs.  \"I'm not great at tactics, and I'm a "
"bit nervous about what's back there.\""
msgstr ""
"*は顎をさすりながら思案しました。「狭い通路を作って誘い込むとか？まず、ロッカーか何かを引きずって、一か所に集める。それから、俺らのどっちかが作ったバリケードの近くに立って、もう一人が離れた場所から弓矢か何かで攻撃する。」彼は肩をすくめました。「戦術を考えるなんて苦手だし、正直自信はない。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
msgid "Thanks man.  I'd like your opinion on something else, actually."
msgstr "ありがとう。実は他にも意見を聞きたいことがある。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
msgid ""
"You sure we haven't bit off more than we can chew here?\"  He stares at you "
"for a moment.  \"This isn't DOTA2, this is real life.  These guys are gonna "
"have guns and shit.  I know we've been through a lot together but if they're"
" ready for us they could take us out before we're even close enough to see "
"them.  I mean, I'm with you if you think we can do it, but be careful, okay?"
msgstr ""
"俺に意見を聞くほどややこしいことか？」彼はこちらをぽかんと見つめました。「これはDOTA2じゃない。現実だ。盗賊は銃なんかを持ってるだろうな。俺たちは一緒に色々なことを乗り越えてきたことは分かってる。でも、あっちに先に気付かれたら、きっとこっちが仕掛ける前に先制攻撃されるだろう。つまり、できることなら俺も協力して取り掛かりたいが、くれぐれも慎重に、な？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
msgid ""
"Thanks man, I'll keep that in mind.  We gotta do this though.  Any "
"suggestions for how to do it safely?"
msgstr "ありがとう、心に留めておこう。でも、この仕事はやり遂げないといけない。どうすれば安全に進められるだろうか？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
msgid ""
"Thanks man, I'll keep that in mind.  We'll do this carefully.  I'd like your"
" opinion on something else, actually."
msgstr "ありがとう、心に留めておこう。この仕事は慎重に進めることにしよう。実は、他にも意見を聞きたいことがある。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
msgid ""
"If you're gonna insist on it then I say we drive up quick in the dark, take "
"cover behind the car, and make a ton of noise.  Then we take cover and when "
"they come to check things out, we pick them off.  Or maybe we come in "
"silent, from a distance, and take out their sentries.  A bow is great for "
"that, if we can make the shots.  This whole thing still seems ridiculous "
"though."
msgstr ""
"そんなに言うなら、暗闇に紛れて車を素早く野営地まで持ってきて、車の背後で大騒ぎすればいいんじゃないか。それから遠くに隠れて、盗賊たちが様子を確認しにやってきたところを、狙い撃ちする。あとは、遠くから見張りを静かに排除するとか。射撃さえ上手くいけば、弓は最適だ。でも、なんだかバカげた作戦のようにも思えるな。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
msgid ""
"I'm kinda looking forward to it.  It's good to see people already building "
"up something to last, after everything that's gone down.  Wonder what we'll "
"find out there."
msgstr "ちょっとワクワクしてる。全てが崩壊した後でも、新しいものを作って続けていく計画があるってのはいいもんだ。どんな経験ができるか楽しみだな。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
msgid ""
"That's optimistic, thanks man.  I'd like your opinion on something else, "
"actually."
msgstr "前向きな意見をありがとう。実は他にも意見を聞きたいことがある。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
msgid ""
"You know, I read an article about how those stupid FEMA evac shelters all "
"had solar power for emergencies.  I bet nobody's looting those, let's track "
"some down and unbolt 'em."
msgstr ""
"そうだな、あの馬鹿げたFEMAの避難キャンプには、必ず緊急用の太陽光発電が設置されてるそうだ。何かの記事で読んだ気がする。きっと誰もわざわざ盗みに行ってないだろう。探しに行って拝借しよう。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
msgid "Not a bad thought.  I'd like your opinion on something else, actually."
msgstr "悪い考えじゃなさそうだ。実は他にも意見を聞きたいことがある。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
msgid ""
"Look, you're the one that agreed to this.  I don't know why you keep "
"agreeing to this stuff.  Maybe we can check hardware stores?  Or just eat a "
"lot of jarred food, and keep the empties?  A hundred jars.  That's a lot, my"
" friend.\"  He shakes his head.  \"You don't have to agree to do "
"*everything* people ask you to do, you know?"
msgstr ""
"おいおい、自分で受けた仕事だろ。どうして人の頼みごとを何でもかんでもOKしちまうんだ。ホームセンターを探してみるのはどうだ？それか、瓶詰めの保存食を平らげて、空っぽにする。100個の瓶か。はぁ、多すぎるだろ。」彼は首を振りました。「別に頼まれたからって*全部*引き受ける必要はないんだぜ？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
msgid ""
"Your objection is noted.  I'd like your opinion on something else, though."
msgstr "そういう意見もあることは心に留めておこう。実は他にも意見を聞きたいことがある。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
msgid ""
"*shakes his head at you.  \"Look, you asked last time, and I told you you "
"didn't have to keep taking jobs like this.  Now you're asking again?  *I "
"dunno, stop offering to bring a billion jars to people if you don't know "
"where to find them.*\"  He laughs.  \"I'm just messing with you.\"  His eyes"
" narrow.  \"Or am I?\""
msgstr ""
"*は首を振りました。「ほら見ろ、前にも聞いてきたが、その時俺はこういう仕事は別に受けなくてもいいって答えた。それで、また聞くのか？*どうやって集めるのか考えてないなら、とんでもなく大量の瓶を集めろなんて依頼は受けるな*ってことだよ。」彼は目を細めて笑いました。「ちょっとからかっただけだって。あれ、もしかして俺がからかわれてる？」"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
msgid ""
"How about it?  Seems like a nice enough thing to do I guess.  I bet plenty "
"of zombies are carrying smokes, and there's probably tons in people's "
"abandoned cars."
msgstr "大丈夫なんじゃないか？すぐに集められそうだ。ゾンビもタバコを持ち歩いてるだろうし、その辺に乗り捨てられてる車の中にもたくさん残ってる筈だ。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
msgid "Yeah.  I'd like your opinion on something else."
msgstr "そうだな。他にも意見を聞きたいことがある。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
msgid "Isn't he just directing us out to that Isherwood farm?"
msgstr "この農家ってのは、イシャーウッド一家のことじゃないか？"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
msgid ""
"Sounds good.  I'm a bit nervous about what we might find, though.  Who knows"
" what the apocalypse would do to a bunch of gun-toting back country folks?  "
"On the other hand, maybe they're sweet, salt-of-the-earth types.  Only one "
"way to find out!"
msgstr ""
"いいと思うぜ。だが、どんなことになるか、ちょっと不安だな。銃を持ってる郊外の農家がこの騒ぎをどう思ってるかなんて、分かったもんじゃない。でも逆に、思いやりのある高潔な人たちかもしれない。とにかく、確かめに行くしかないな！"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
msgid "Right.  I'd like your opinion on something else."
msgstr "その通り。他にも意見を聞きたいことがある。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
msgid ""
"Is that just that Hub place, with the intercom?  Not that it's not cool, but"
" it's nothing new to us.  Woah… we've really seen some shit, haven't we."
msgstr ""
"これって、通信装置が置いてあるハブってとこの話じゃないか？どうでもいい発見って訳じゃないが、俺たちにとっちゃ新しい情報でもない。はぁ...知り過ぎるのも考えものだな。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
msgid ""
"It sounds to me like this might be that intercom we found out in that weird "
"building?  I'm just guessing.  We should go confirm."
msgstr "これって、通信装置が付いてた妙な建物のことじゃないか？ただの推測だけどな。確認しに行った方がいい。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
msgid ""
"Hell yeah, this sounds so badass!  Let's be careful though, 'secret lab' "
"sounds like a place that's gonna have some defenses."
msgstr "ああ、何だか凄そうな予感がするぜ！ただ、「隠された研究所」ってぐらいだから、侵入を防ぐシステムがあるかもしれない。気を付けていこう。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
msgid "You bet.  I'd like your opinion on something else."
msgstr "確かに。他にも意見を聞きたいことがある。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
msgid ""
"We've been there, remember?  It's got those cyborg guys, the cockney ones."
msgstr "行ったことがある場所だ、覚えてるだろ？訛りの強いサイボーグ人間がいる建物だよ。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
msgid ""
"Far-fetched and awesome!  Let's go see.  Maybe it's an abandoned theme park "
"or something."
msgstr "突拍子もないし、凄そうだ！見に行こう。もしかすると、廃墟になった遊園地とかかもしれない。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
msgid "I'd like your opinion on something else."
msgstr "他にも意見を聞きたいことがある。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
msgid "We've been there, remember"
msgstr "行ったことのある場所だ、覚えてるだろ"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
msgid "?  Cody, the blacksmith, she's the food lady"
msgstr "？ほら、鍛冶師のコディが、食事を出す女性のことさ"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
msgid ""
"?  I'm guessing the blacksmith we didn't talk to is the one who would have "
"fed us"
msgstr "？ほら、まだ話を聞いてなかった鍛冶師が、食事を出す女性なんだろう"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
msgid ", and Jay is the one with the weird bullet bank."
msgstr "。それで、ジェイが妙な弾薬銀行の発案者。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
msgid ", and the other guy there must be the one with the bullet bank."
msgstr "。それで、もう一人の男の方が、多分弾薬銀行をやってるんだろう。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
msgid ""
"I'm open to anything if it means getting fed.  Ugh, unless it's unidentified"
" meat.  I guess we have to be more careful of strangers than we used to.  "
"Still, let's find out."
msgstr ""
"俺は腹ごしらえできるなら何でもいいね。おっと、正体不明の肉はごめんだけどな。面識のない人間には注意するべきだとは思うが、ともかく、調べてみよう。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
msgid ""
"Well, I like his fashion choices, but he, um.  Well, you know.  You met him."
"  I don't mind helping him out, in theory, but I don't know if bringing him "
"piles of trash is really going to do anyone any good.  The Merchants might "
"think it's a fire hazard."
msgstr ""
"ええと、ファッションセンスはいいと思う、ただ、まあ。何というか、そうだな。せっかく知り合ったんだしな。理屈の上では、別に手伝うのは構わない。ただ、ゴミの山を持ち込んで人助けになるかと言われると疑問だね。火事になったら危ないし、商人は嫌がるかも。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
msgid "Let's try it out anyway.  I'd like your opinion on something else."
msgstr "ともかくやってみよう。他にも意見を聞きたいことがある。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
msgid ""
"Right, I guess.  I don't quite get why you're doing this stuff for him, he's"
" probably just going to keep piling up the stuff and not doing anything with"
" it.\"  He shrugs.  \"On the other hand, maybe he'll make a kick-ass box "
"fort, I'd be all about that."
msgstr ""
"多分、そうだな。どうしてそこまでして手伝ってやるのか俺にはよく分からない。何に使うでもなく、ただ積み上げてるだけじゃないか。」彼は肩をすくめました。「でも、もしかしたらとてつもない段ボール要塞が完成するかもしれない、それはちょっと気になってる。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
msgid "That's my hope.  I'd like your opinion on something else."
msgstr "楽しみだな。他にも意見を聞きたいことがある。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
msgid ""
"I'm telling you, this is just going to go on and on forever.\"  He looks "
"sad.  \"I'd really love to see him get a cool box fort and feel better, but "
"I think we're just enabling his delusions, my friend."
msgstr ""
"言っておくが、きっと永遠に終わらないぞ。」彼は悲しげな表情を浮かべました。「確かにカッコイイ要塞が完成して喜ぶ奴の顔は見てみたい。でもな、親友、手伝うことで妄想を無駄に焚きつけてるだけじゃないかとも思うんだ。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
msgid ""
"Let's see this through a bit longer.  I'd like your opinion on something "
"else."
msgstr "こうなったら最後まで見届けたいんだ。他にも意見を聞きたいことがある。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
msgid ""
"I gotta admit, this one surprised me.  I take back some of what I said "
"earlier, I'm just confused now.  Let's see where it goes."
msgstr "正直、驚いたぜ。ちょっと混乱してるよ。以前言っちまった文句は一部撤回させてもらおう。どうなるか楽しみだ。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
msgid "Right?  I'd like your opinion on something else."
msgstr "そうだろう？他にも意見を聞きたいことがある。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
msgid ""
"It had better be!  I'm not sure why you're doing this, but I do think it's "
"good you're trying to help him.  Maybe we should stop eventually though?\"  "
"He sighs.  \"I don't know what to make of Dave.  I worked with a guy with "
"schizophrenia back at Foodplace, and Dave is nothing like that.  I don't "
"know if he's actually got some kind of mental illness or if it's a stress "
"reaction or something.  He doesn't act like any real person I've ever met, "
"and we got all kinds of strung-out types there."
msgstr ""
"そうだといいんだけどな！どうしてここまで熱心なのか知らないが、人の手助けを進んでやろうとするお前の心意気は大したもんだよ。それともどこかで止めるべきだったのか？」彼はため息をつきました。「デイブはどうしたものかな。フードプレイスで統合失調症の人と働いてたこともあるが、彼はそういう感じとも違う。実際に何か精神を患ってるのか、それともストレス反応なのか知らないがな。これまでもラリってる奴は色々見てきたが、こういうタイプは初めてだ。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
msgid "That's good insight.  I'd like your opinion on something else."
msgstr "そういう見方もあるな。他にも意見を聞きたいことがある。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
msgid ""
"Well, I'm definitely interested to see where it goes.  I hope it helps Dave "
"somehow.  I don't know what's going on with him except that it's nothing "
"like any schizophrenia or anything like that I've ever seen, and I've seen "
"practically anything you can imagine, working service."
msgstr ""
"ああ、どう決着するのか気になって仕方ない。どうにかデイブのためになる方法で進めてもらいたいもんだ。彼がどうしてああなったのか知らないが、俺は無数の職場を転々とする中で、精神を病んだ人を大勢見てきた。デイブは統合失調症とも違う感じがするんだよな。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
msgid "I have a good feeling.  I'd like your opinion on something else."
msgstr "いい方向に進むといいな。他にも意見を聞きたいことがある。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
msgid ""
"Well, it probably isn't going to come back alive.  They ooze blood "
"everywhere, when we fight 'em.  It's kinda thicker and goopier than human "
"blood, but I guess not so bad it'd be hard to draw?"
msgstr ""
"そうだな、生きて戻れないことも覚悟してる。ゾンビと戦ってると、身体のあちこちから血が滲み出てるのが見えるよな。人間の血よりもドロッとしてるが、注射器で吸い出せないほどではないんじゃないか？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
msgid "Thanks.  I'd like your opinion on something else."
msgstr "ありがとう。他にも意見を聞きたいことがある。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
msgid ""
"This sounds *nuts* man.  How are we going to get in and out alive?  A place "
"like that is going to be crawling with zombies and who knows what else.\"  "
"He shudders.  \"Let's be careful, right?"
msgstr ""
"その意見は*マヌケ*が過ぎるぜ。まずどうやって生きて帰ってくるんだ？きっとゾンビがうじゃうじゃいるだろうし、他にも何が潜んでるか分かったもんじゃない。」彼は震えました。「くれぐれも慎重に、な？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
msgid "Okay.  I'd like your opinion on something else."
msgstr "分かった。他にも意見を聞きたいことがある。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
msgid ""
"This was a total surprise to everyone,\" he grumbles.  \"Still, this can't "
"be any worse than getting the first analysis done, right?"
msgstr "まったく、驚いたね。」彼はぼやきました。「しかも、今回の仕事は血液の分析より厄介そうな感じがしないか？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
msgid "Let's hope not.  I'd like your opinion on something else."
msgstr "問題が起きないことを祈ろう。他にも意見を聞きたいことがある。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
msgid ""
"&He grins.  \"I'm gonna level with you, this sounds incredibly *cool*.\"  He"
" laughs at his own joke.  \"Seriously though, it's probably going to be a "
"really tricky one"
msgstr ""
"&彼はニヤリと笑いました。「お前と同じ気持ちだよ。すごく*クール*だ。」そして、自分の冗談で笑いました。「真面目な話、とんでもなく苦労するだろうな、とは思ってる"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
msgid ""
".  It'd be good to maybe try cybernetics to help us with the cold, they "
"won't be as bulky and confining to fight in as winter gear."
msgstr "。寒さをしのげる生体部品があれば、移植してみるのもいいな。冬服よりはかさばらないし、軽快に動けるだろう。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
msgid ".  We'll need to bundle up extra toasty, that'll make fighting tough."
msgstr "。暖かい服を重ね着したいが、そうすると戦闘で動き辛くなるな。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
msgid "Good thoughts.  I'd like your opinion on something else."
msgstr "いい考えだ。他にも意見を聞きたいことがある。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
msgid ""
"Compared to what we've done, this doesn't sound so bad.  Creepy as heck "
"though.  We should tell ghost stories on the way."
msgstr "今までの探検に比べたら、そんなに悪くはなさそうだな。しかし、不気味なのは変わらない。道中で怪談話でもするか。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
msgid ""
"I mean, I have a basic understanding of the principles.  We could also see "
"if we could just find a couple stills though, we're not far from the "
"mountains.  I bet every second farm's gonna have a moonshine still set up in"
" one of the sheds."
msgstr ""
"ええと、基本的な原理だったら分かる。でも、大量に自作する必要もないわけだし、蒸留器を探して回るのもよさそうだ。この辺に立ってる小屋の二軒に一軒くらいは、密造酒を作ってる拠点だったりするんじゃないか。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
msgid ""
"Good point, although really, how hard can it be to make one?  I'd like your "
"opinion on something else, too."
msgstr "確かにそうかも。でも実際のところ、簡単に自作できそうな気もするな？他にも意見を聞きたいことがある。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
msgid ""
"I think a supermarket might be the *yeast* likely place to find it!\"  He "
"watches your expression for a moment, then shrugs.  \"Worth a shot.  Anyway,"
" as far as I know, dry yeast lasts practically forever.  Should be able to "
"find some of it anywhere people did baking or brewing."
msgstr ""
"食料品店は*酵母*探しの*候補*には入らないと思うぜ！」彼はこちらの表情をしばらく観察し、肩をすくめました。「言ってみただけだ。ともかく、俺が知る限り酵母はすごく長持ちする。パンを焼いたり醸造したりする店だったら、きっと置いてる筈だ。」"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
msgid "Thanks, man.  I'd like your opinion on something else, actually."
msgstr "ありがとう。実は他にも意見を聞きたいことがある。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
msgid ""
"Those Tacoma folks really think about sustainability, hey?  I like that.  "
"Buy local, you know?  I got no idea where to find sugar beet seeds though.  "
"I don't remember having any stocked at the cabin.  Maybe a farm or farm "
"supply store would have them?"
msgstr ""
"タコマの人たちは持続可能性って奴を真剣に考えてるな。いいことだ。地産地消って奴だな？だが、サトウダイコンの種がどこにあるかは分からないな。山小屋に備蓄してあった記憶もない。きっと農場とか、農業用品店にあるんじゃないか？"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
msgid ""
"*laughs.  \"If we track these things down for the bartender, I hope we get a"
" nice, sincere 'tanks' at the end.\""
msgstr "*は笑いました。「バーテンダーにタンクを渡せば、きっと心のこもった最高のサンキューを貰えるだろうよ。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
msgid "Me too.  I'd like your opinion on something else, actually."
msgstr "違いない。実は他にも意見を聞きたいことがある。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
msgid ""
"There's only one way for two folks like us to transport two huge liquid "
"storage drums.  We bundle ourselves in them and roll them down the hill.  "
"First one to the bar buys the other one a drink."
msgstr ""
"俺たち二人で二つの巨大なドラム缶を運ぶ方法は一つしかない。一人ずつドラム缶に入って、丘を転がり落ちるんだ。そして最初にバーに着いた方が、もう一人に酒を奢る。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
msgid ""
"You know it'd be me.  I'd like your opinion on something else, actually."
msgstr "それは私が奢るってことだな。実は他にも意見を聞きたいことがある。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
msgid "Of all the jobs we've agreed to do, this is certainly one of them."
msgstr "色んな依頼を引き受けてきたんだ、こういうのもあるさ。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
msgid ""
"You can say that again.  I'd like your opinion on something else, actually."
msgstr "確かにその通りだ。実は他にも意見を聞きたいことがある。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
msgid ""
"I guess I get why the one Boris guy can't do it but I don't quite see why we"
" have to go around asking everyone for him.  He lives here!  Anyway, you "
"know I'm okay with getting my hands dirty, if you want to go offer to help "
"him out I'll get busy with a scrubby.  I've cleaned worse things out of the "
"Foodplace washroom.  Hell, I've cleaned worse things out of the back of my "
"van when I was running for Amazon.\"  He gets a thousand-yard-stare for a "
"moment.  \"Let's not discuss this any more."
msgstr ""
"ボリスって奴がこの仕事を嫌がる理由も分かるが、どうして俺たちがわざわざ全員に聞いて回らないといけないんだろうな。ここに住んでる奴がやればいいのに！それはともかく、俺は汚い仕事も平気だから、手伝うならタワシ片手に参加しよう。フードプレイスの洗面所でもっと酷いものを掃除したことだってある。おっと、Amazonの配送をやってた頃は、バンの荷台で更に酷いものを片付けたこともあったな。」彼はふと、遥か遠くの虚空を見つめました。「この話は止めとくか。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
msgid "Thanks Liam, I knew I could count on you."
msgstr "ありがとうリアム、頼りにしている。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
msgid ""
"It's just a fetch job, right?  I'd say our best first bet would be to see if"
" Smokes up at the Free Merchant desk has one, and just shell out to get it "
"covered.  These guys are broke as heck, but we can easily make the cash back"
" by doing some good old fashioned scavenging."
msgstr ""
"単にどこかで調達してくればいいんだろ？まず最初に自由商人のスモークスに在庫がないか確認して、取り引きで手に入らないか試してみるべきだな。商人との取り引きに金銭は通用しないが、地道に物資を漁っていれば、物々交換は簡単だ。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
msgid "Worth checking.  I'd like your opinion on something else, actually."
msgstr "確認しておこう。実は他にも意見を聞きたいことがある。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
msgid ""
"&His voice comes out a bit softer and lower than usual.  \"This is just a "
"sad one, my friend.  I don't think we'll have any troubles with the "
"delivery, but it's so goddamn sad.\""
msgstr "&彼の声はいつもより少し低く、柔らかです。「ただただ悲しい仕事だな、親友。持ってくるだけなら何も問題はないだろうが、畜生、本当に悲しい。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
msgid ""
"Nah, not me.  I hear they're hard to keep alive or something, and that makes"
" me nervous.  I was never really that much of a baker to be honest.  I love "
"the bread though, pretty excited to see what she makes.\"  He looks "
"thoughtful for a moment.  \"Depending on where the bakery is though, this "
"could be a heck of a job.  We should make sure we're ready to sneak past a "
"lot of zed to get to it."
msgstr ""
"いや、ない。ダメになりやすい材料だって聞いたことがあるから、ちょっと心配だな。正直、俺はパン屋なんて全然知らないが、パンは好きだ。彼女がどんなパンを作ってるれるか楽しみだな。」そこまで喋ると、彼は考え込みました。「パン屋の立地によっては、厄介な仕事になるかもしれないぞ。大量のゾンビを避けて目的地にたどり着けるように、前もって準備しておくべきだ。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
msgid ""
"Or we could clear the area some other way.  I'd like your opinion on "
"something else, actually."
msgstr "あるいは、店の付近一帯の敵を一掃するという手もある。実は他にも意見を聞きたいことがある。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
msgid ""
"*grins.  \"Yeah, he sure is.  I never got the hang of the guitar, myself, "
"but I respect the journey.  It shouldn't be too hard to find one, right?  "
"Lots of people have them in their houses, or we could maybe loot a music "
"store if we want to get fancy.\""
msgstr ""
"*はニヤリと笑いました。「ああ、そうかもな。俺自身はギターなんてからっきしだが、そういう旅には憧れてる。ギターを見つけるのはそんなに難しくないよな？自宅にギターを持ってる人は多いだろうし、もう少し派手にやりたいなら、楽器店で拝借するのもいいな。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
msgid ""
"With your singing voice, I'm glad you never learned.  I'd like your opinion "
"on something else, actually."
msgstr "あなたの歌声を考えると、楽器は習わなくて良かったと思うよ。実は他にも意見を聞きたいことがある。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
msgid ""
"Of course!  People need what comfort they can get, right?  I've always been "
"kinda spiritual, but I'm not the sort to put a label on it or anything.  I "
"don't have a clue where to find one though, I'm not sure I'd even recognize "
"a mosque if I saw one.  Do they stock books like that in normal stores?\"  "
"He frowns.  \"I feel like I should know this, but… well, no Wikipedia, "
"right?"
msgstr ""
"もちろん！人間には心の安らぎって奴が必要だろ？俺も信心深いところはあるが、他人の信仰にとやかく言うタイプじゃないからな。しかし、探すべき場所は見当もつかない。モスクと言われても、どの建物がそうなのかも分からない。普通の店でそんな本見たことあるか？」彼は眉を寄せました。「知っておくべき常識なのかもしれないが...ウィキペディアとか、検索できないよな？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
msgid ""
"Cell phones were something else.  I'd like your opinion on a different thing"
" though."
msgstr "あの頃のスマートフォンは本当に便利だったな。ところで、他にも意見を聞きたいことがある。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
msgid ""
"&He scratches his head.  \"No.  I guess a library or a bookstore.  I have a "
"feeling this is going to be a tough one though.  Maybe we could try like, "
"hardware stores?  Or school libraries?\"  He thinks a bit more.  \"Those "
"seem like our best bets to me, but I'm just guessing.\""
msgstr ""
"&彼は頭を掻きました。「さあね。図書館か本屋だろう。しかし、探すのにかなり苦労しそうな予感がするな。ホームセンターとか、学校の図書館とか、一通り見て回った方がいい。」そして更に考え込みました。「自信満々で言ってるように聞こえたかもしれないが、単なる思い付きだぜ。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
msgid "Thanks, man.  I'd like your opinion on a different thing though."
msgstr "いや、助かるよ。ところで、他にも意見を聞きたいことがある。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
msgid ""
"This one sounds easy to me.  Let's just take apart some old machinery until "
"we find a good one."
msgstr "これは簡単に終わりそうだな。ちゃんと動く奴が見つかるまで、その辺の機械を分解し続ければいい。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
msgid ""
"Kinda wonder why she didn't just get us to get her a compressor, but she "
"probably has her reasons.\"  You notice a bit of an odd tone to his voice.  "
"\"Maybe we could take apart a big compressor for her, the tank would "
"probably be perfect."
msgstr ""
"コンプレッサー自体を持ってくるよう頼めばよかったのに、どうして彼女はそうしなかったのか、きっと何か理由がある。」彼の声はどこか浮ついています。「大型のコンプレッサーを分解して、タンクを見つけて彼女に渡せば、完璧だ。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
msgid "Dude.  You have a crush on Jenny."
msgstr "おや。ジェニーに一目惚れかな。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
msgid ""
"*blushes, for some reason.  \"Uh, yeah.  Gun books, hey?  I guess we should "
"look in um, gun stores or libraries?  Or high school lockers, haha.  Oh, "
"that made me sad.\""
msgstr ""
"*は何故か赤面しています。「ええと、うん。銃の本、だっけ？そうだな、銃砲店とか、図書館とか？学校のロッカーにあったりして、ハハハ。いや、自分で言っといてなんだが落ち込んできた。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
msgid ""
"*blushes.  \"Yeah we are.\"  He smiles dopily, apparently forgetting that "
"you'd asked for his thoughts."
msgstr "*は赤面しました。「おお、そうだな。」間の抜けた笑みを浮かべています。依頼について意見を聞きたかったのですが、それどころではないようです。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
msgid "Any opinions on the job itself?"
msgstr "依頼の中身について、何か考えはあるか？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
msgid ""
"Just wanted to point that out.  I'd like your opinion on a different thing "
"though."
msgstr "よかったな。ところで、他にも意見を聞きたいことがある。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
msgid ""
"Uh, right.  Maybe a gun store?  Or a library?  Or we could check high school"
" lockers, haha.  Oh, that made me sad."
msgstr "ああ、そうだった。例えば、銃砲店？あとは、図書館？学校のロッカーにあったりして、ハハハ。いや、自分で言っといてなんだが落ち込んできた。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
msgid ""
"You've got it *bad*, dude.  I'd like your opinion on a different thing "
"though."
msgstr "むしろ*舞い上がってる*って感じだ。ところで、他にも意見を聞きたいことがある。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
msgid ""
"&He looks at you, a bit surprised.  \"Yeah, of course.  I mean, that "
"situation they're in now is miserable, no matter how much we've helped folks"
" out there.  Can you imagine trying to be a young couple in that cramped "
"space?\"  He waggles his eyebrows suggestively.  \"They're tryin' to have a "
"*baby*, you know.  Gonna be hard in a bunkhouse.  Let's get them out to a "
"nice farm, some fresh air, and, *you* know.\"  He winks, to drive the point "
"far, far further home than necessary.  \"Let the magic happen, right?\""
msgstr ""
"&彼は少し驚いてこちらを見ました。「そりゃ当然だろ。今までにもたくさん人助けをしてきたが、あの二人が置かれてる状況は悲惨だぜ。若い夫婦が、狭い空間に閉じ込められて、分かるだろ？」思わせぶりに眉を動かしています。「だから、*子供*が欲しいんだって。集団宿泊所みたいな寝床じゃ、色々と大変だろ。暮らしやすい農場に移って、新鮮な空気を吸って、そんでもって、ほら、*アレ*だよ。」ウインクしながら、必要以上に言葉の一部を強調して言いました。「奇跡を起こす手伝いをしてやろうって、な？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
msgid ""
"That was unnecessarily clear.  Still, I'd like your opinion on a different "
"thing, somehow."
msgstr "そこまで強調してもらわなくても分かる。それはともかく、他にも意見を聞きたいことがある。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
msgid ""
"Seems pretty cut and dry to me.  Let's raid a few first aid kits.  I'm "
"pretty sure you can find that stuff in the basement of those government evac"
" shelters, for example."
msgstr "簡単そうな仕事だな。救急箱の中身を漁ってみたらいい。政府が用意してた避難シェルターの地下にも、そういう備蓄があったと思うぜ。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
msgid "Thanks.  I'd like your opinion on a different thing, though."
msgstr "ありがとう。ところで、他にも意見を聞きたいことがある。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
msgid ""
"Kinda don't think she needs our help on this one, but she's in a bind I "
"guess.\"  He pauses.  \"No pun intended this time,\" he chuckles.  \"Anyway,"
" let's just find some spare fabric, choppy-choppy, and Bob's your uncle.\"  "
"He thinks for a moment.  \"Actually she'll probably want them disinfected, "
"and we should find her some tape too just to be on the safe side."
msgstr ""
"この程度なら自力で用意できそうなもんだが、そんなに包帯が膨大にいるのかね。」彼はそこで言葉を切りました。「今のは偶然だ、韻を踏んだわけじゃない。」と言い、思わず吹き出しました。「とにかく、余ってる布切れをかき集めよう。」何か考え込んでいます。「きっと包帯は消毒された状態の方がいい。念のために布を留めるテープも用意したいな。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
msgid "Fair enough.  I'd like your opinion on a different thing, though."
msgstr "言うとおりだ。ところで、他にも意見を聞きたいことがある。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
msgid ""
"I admit, I haven't been paying attention to it, but I'm sure those things "
"must be around in half the medicine cabinets in the area, right?  Seems like"
" an easy looting job to me."
msgstr ""
"実を言うと、そんな薬があるかどうか気を付けてみたことがない。その辺りの救急箱を集めれば、半分くらいには常備されてるんじゃないか？簡単な物資漁りの仕事って感じだな。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
msgid "Good point.  I'd like your opinion on a different thing, though."
msgstr "参考になる。ところで、他にも意見を聞きたいことがある。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
msgid ""
"Worse things we could do for people than help them get haircuts,\" he "
"shrugs.  \"No job too small, right?  Vanessa seems a bit cranky to me, but "
"I'm not judging.  Those folks are in a tough spot.  Maybe she'll turn "
"suddenly nice if we bring her the hair stuff she wants.\"  He grins.  \"I'm "
"one hundred percent sure that's what'll happen."
msgstr ""
"俺たちが散髪の手伝いをするよりは喜ばれるんじゃないか。」彼は肩をすくめました。「雑用を押し付けられたってほどでもないだろ？ヴァネッサはちょっと気難しそうだが、軽率に判断しちゃいけないな。皆大変な状況なんだから。ちゃんとした散髪道具を持って行けば、途端に優しくなるかもしれないぞ。」そしてニヤリと笑いました。「絶対そうに違いないって、信用しろよ。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
msgid ""
"That's my optimistic Liam.  I'd like your opinion on a different thing, "
"though."
msgstr "楽観的なところがリアムらしい。ところで、他にも意見を聞きたいことがある。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
msgid ""
"*laughs.  \"Look, Makayla is a trained professional, she knows what she's "
"doing with several kilograms of improvised explosives, doesn't she?\"  He "
"shrugs.  \"If not, let's just stay far away when she tests it.\""
msgstr ""
"*は笑いました。「マケイラは訓練を積んだプロだからな。数キロの爆発物を即席で作って仕事をこなすんだろうよ。」そして肩をすくめました。「もし違ったら、あいつが何か作り始めたら近寄らない方がいい。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
msgid ""
"*blows out a long breath.  \"Well, my friend, I do think it's good to help "
"clean out some of the mess that's going on.  I'll be with you for it.  I'm "
"just not sure why you figure I'm the right guy for this job.  Shouldn't you "
"have, like, a cop or a soldier or something?  I'm a delivery driver.\""
msgstr ""
"*は深いため息をつきました。「なあ、親友、今起きてる混乱をどうにかする手伝いをしようってのはいい心掛けだ。俺も協力する。どうして俺がこの仕事に適任だと思ってるのかはさっぱりだがな。警官か軍人でも雇うべきじゃないのか？俺はただの配達員だ。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
msgid "Don't sell yourself short, Liam.  You've got my back."
msgstr "リアム、謙遜しすぎはよくない。あなたは心強い仲間だ。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
msgid ""
"I'll handle the tough parts, Liam.  You're there to cover my back, that's "
"all."
msgstr "リアム、荒事は私が受け持つ。あなたは私の背中を守ってくれればいい。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
msgid "In troubled times, we learn what sort of people we really are."
msgstr "厳しい環境でこそ、私たちは自分が本当はどんな人間なのか学べるんだ。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
msgid "Meh.  What's a few bandits?  We'll flatten 'em."
msgstr "ふん。盗賊が集まったからって何だ？全部ぶっ潰してやろう。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
msgid ""
"Thanks.  You're right.  Okay, I can do this.\"  He shakes his shoulders and "
"limbers up, like a boxer preparing for a match.  \"Let's go."
msgstr "ありがとう、その通りだな。よし、できる気がしてきた。」彼は試合前のボクサーのように肩を回し、準備運動を始めました。「行くか。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
msgid "Hold up Balboa, I'd like your opinion on something else, actually."
msgstr "ロッキー・バルボア、ちょっと待った。実は他にも意見を聞きたいことがある。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
msgid ""
"Oh, oh yeah that makes sense.  Okay, well, that's something I can do.  I'll "
"cover your back like it's never been covered before.  You and me like Calvin"
" and Hobbes, baby."
msgstr ""
"ああ、確かにそれがいい。よし、分かった、それが俺にできることだな。今までもそこまで守れてきた気はしないが、とにかくお前の背中は守ろう。「カルビンとホッブス」みたいな感じで行こうぜ。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
msgid "Thanks, Hooch.  I'd like your opinion on something else, actually."
msgstr "頼んだよ、フーチ。実は他にも意見を聞きたいことがある。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
msgid ""
"*sniffs the air around your head.  \"You been getting in the ganja?  No "
"judgment if so, but maybe you shouldn't be taking mercenary jobs while "
"you're high, y'know?\""
msgstr ""
"*はこちらの匂いを嗅ぎました。「ガンジャでもやってるのか？確かなことは言えないが、ハイになってるときに傭兵の仕事を受けるのはいい考えじゃないと思うぞ？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
msgid ""
"Shut up, you're not my dad!  Anyway, I'd like your opinion on something "
"else, actually."
msgstr "そんなお説教みたいな意見は聞きたくない！実は他にも意見を聞きたいことがある。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
msgid ""
"*gives you some serious side-eye.  \"You okay?  This is serious shit, you're"
" making me kinda worried getting so gung-ho about it.\""
msgstr "*は深刻そうな眼差しをこちらに向けました。「大丈夫か？これは大変な仕事だぞ。そこまでやる気満々だとちょっと心配になる。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
msgid ""
"Don't worry, man.  Trust me, it'll be great.  Anyway, I'd like your opinion "
"on something else."
msgstr "心配ない、きっと上手くいくから信じてほしい。それはともかく、他にも意見を聞きたいことがある。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
msgid ""
"You know, this sounds like it's gonna be some big exciting mystery "
"whodunnit, but I have this feeling if we just look around for someone who is"
" acting obviously and extremely suspicious it'll all fall apart at once."
msgstr ""
"確かに、この仕事はハラハラドキドキのミステリーって感じだけど、どうみても怪しい行動をしてる奴が周囲にいないか探すだけで、一気に解決しちまいそうな気がするな。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
msgid ""
"I dunno, but compared to the last two missions for that guy, I gotta admit "
"I'm kinda stoked.  Robots?  This sounds *wicked*.  Do you think we're "
"talking more Terminator, or Wall-E?  Doesn't matter.  Robots!"
msgstr ""
"分からないが、あいつから受けた前の二つの仕事より面白そうだってことは間違いないな。ロボットだって？何だか*ヤバい*香りがする。ターミネーターとウォーリー、どっちが出てくるんだ？まあいい。とにかくロボットを探そう！"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
msgid ""
"Uh, well, we *did* meet that weird cyborg guy in the castle full of giant "
"robot dogs matching this exact description, right?  Tell me you remember "
"that.  Damn, it's worse saying it out loud.  I still can't really believe "
"all this stuff has really happened."
msgstr ""
"ええと、まさに依頼で説明されてたようなデカいロボット犬がうろついてる砦で、妙なサイボーグ人間に*既に会った*よな？頼むから覚えてると言ってくれ。クソ、改めて口に出すと何だそれって感じだ。あれが現実で本当に起きたことだなんて、今も信じられない。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
msgid ""
"Oh, right, I remember that.  I'd like your opinion on something else, "
"though."
msgstr "ああ、確かに覚えている。実は他にも意見を聞きたいことがある。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
msgid ""
"You know me my friend,\" he shrugs and grins at you.  \"I'd have said it was"
" some kinda cryptid or something *before* the world got flooded with "
"monsters and mutants.  Nowadays, I think I'd be more surprised if it was "
"bandits again.  As for how to deal with it, well, I guess we're getting "
"pretty good at dealing with this kind of thing now.  Let's handle it how we "
"usually do: with style."
msgstr ""
"俺のことはよく知ってるだろ。」彼は肩をすくめて笑いました。「世界が怪物や変異生物で溢れかえる*前*だったら、未確認生物かも、なんて言ってただろうな。最近じゃ、盗賊が出てきた方が驚くようになっちまった。どうやっつけるかって話なら、ここんとこ俺たちはこういう仕事も上手くやれるようになってきた。いつもと同じように、格好よく片付けようぜ。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
msgid "Damn straight.  I'd like your opinion on something else, though."
msgstr "おっしゃる通り。実は他にも意見を聞きたいことがある。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
msgid ""
"I dunno,\" he points to your Marshal badge.  \"I guess if they give you a "
"shiny bit of metal you're not really an assassin for hire anymore, you're "
"the law.  Judge, jury, and executioner.\"  He scratches his neck and looks "
"away for a moment.  \"You know how I feel about all these high risk "
"missions, but we've gotten this far.  It's different now than when we "
"started out.  I don't think you need my advice, you know I'll have your back"
" whatever happens."
msgstr ""
"さあね。」彼はこちらの執行官バッジを指し示しました。「キラキラ光る立派なバッジを貰ったんなら、もう雇われ暗殺者なんかじゃない。お前が法律だ。裁判官、陪審員、そして死刑執行人。」そして首を掻き、しばらく目を逸らしました。「こういう危ない仕事について俺がどう思ってるかは知ってるだろうが、ともかく俺たちはここまで来た。ひよっこだった頃とは違う。俺から意見することも特にないが、何が起きてもお前をサポートする。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
msgid ""
"I might not need it, but I still like to hear it.  I'd like your opinion on "
"something else, anyway."
msgstr "必要ない意見でも、聞いておきたかったんだ。実は他にも意見を聞きたいことがある。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
msgid ""
"Honestly my friend, this is the kinda stuff I hoped we'd be doing when we "
"offered to help these guys out.  Fresh air, great views, climbing on things "
"we'd have gotten in trouble for in the old days, maybe pushing a zombie off "
"the edge of a maintenance platform to see how big a splat it leaves at the "
"bottom.  Sounds wicked.  Let's bring a couple cold ones up to the top and "
"crack a brew while we survey the wasteland, hey?"
msgstr ""
"正直言って、まさにこんな仕事を依頼されたかったんだ、って感じだよな。新鮮な空気、素晴らしい景色。そんな建物によじ登るなんて、昔ならまず無理だった。メンテナンス用の通路の端からゾンビを落っことして、地面にどれだけデカい血飛沫が残るか実験したりな。邪悪な楽しみだ。頂上まで冷えたビールを持って行って、調査がてら酒盛りといくか？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
msgid ""
"Sounds like a great idea.  I'd like your opinion on something else, though."
msgstr "素晴らしいアイデアだ。実は他にも意見を聞きたいことがある。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
msgid ""
"Yeah, I'm with you there, it's some kind of weird map.  The smart thing to "
"do is probably avoid it, this is some really weird shit.  I've never been "
"one to do the smart thing though, myself.  Probably gonna have troubles "
"sleeping until I know what that thing is trying to lead us to."
msgstr ""
"ああ、同感だ。妙な地図だな。本当に妙だが、賢い奴はきっと確認なんてしに行かない。でも、俺はどっちかと言えば賢くない方だ。地図が示す場所に何があるか分かるまで、眠れない日が続くだろうな。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
msgid "I know what you mean.  I'd like your opinion on something else."
msgstr "確かにそうかもしれない。実は他にも意見を聞きたいことがある。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
msgid ""
"I just like, wanna back up a second.  We're trying to score drugs for a "
"cyborg so it can do surgery on you?  That's really where life's taking us, "
"now?"
msgstr ""
"ちょっと冷静に考えたいんだが。俺たちは、サイボーグに薬を渡して、それで手術してもらおうとしてるんだよな？これは今俺たちの人生に実際に起きてる出来事なんだよな？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
msgid "…Yes."
msgstr "...はい。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
msgid ""
"*grins.  \"Okay, just wanted to clear that up.  I thought maybe I was having"
" some kind of psychotic break, glad it's at least mutual.  Anyway, first "
"place that comes to mind for that kinda stuff would be a hospital, but "
"that's suicide.  Maybe a pharmacy?  Would they have the right stuff?  Seems "
"like a stretch.  Maybe like, a vet clinic or a private surgery clinic might "
"be safer?  I'll level with you, I never got into anything harder than Mary "
"Jane, this is past my pay grade.\""
msgstr ""
"*はニヤリと笑いました。「よし、はっきり分かってよかった。もしかしたら、頭がおかしくなったのかと思ったが、少なくともそうじゃないってお互い確認できたな。ともかく、そういう薬で真っ先に思い浮かぶのは病院だが、探しに行くのは自殺行為だろう。多分だけど。薬局にもそういう薬は売ってるか？ちょっと無さそうだ。動物病院とか、手術もやってる診療所を探す方が安全かもな？俺は一般人だ。MJみたいな完璧な仕事は期待するなよ。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
msgid ""
"Something about this kinda rubs me the wrong way, my friend.  I don't know "
"what it is.  That Rubik guy seems nice enough but I feel like we're not "
"getting the whole story.  Just tread carefully, okay?"
msgstr ""
"なあ親友、この仕事はどうも嫌な予感がする。どうしてなのかは分からない。あのルビクって奴は確かに悪人じゃなさそうだが、話の全体像が見えてこないんだよな。くれぐれも慎重に頼むぜ？"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
msgid ""
"Seems to me we could be wandering the area forever just looking for this "
"thing, to be honest.  I guess we could go up somewhere high like a radio "
"tower, maybe with some binoculars, and see if we can spot it?  Our best bet "
"might be to ask a few folks that have been around though, pool our "
"resources."
msgstr ""
"正直言って、ちっぽけな建物を探すためだけにこの辺りを永遠に彷徨うことになりそうだ。双眼鏡を持って、電波塔いたいな高い場所から探してみるのがいいんじゃないか？一番いいのは、これまで会ってきた人たちに色々聞いて情報共有することかもな。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
msgid ""
"*leans in close, speaking softly, clearly trying to avoid notice from the "
"pizzaiolo.  \"Are you sure we should be hanging with this guy?  He's not "
"exactly all there, is he?  He reminds me a bit of Chris before things went "
"all chompy-chompy.\""
msgstr ""
"*は体を寄せて、小声で答えました。明らかにピッツァ職人に気付かれないように警戒しています。「あいつと一緒に行動して本当に大丈夫か？まともな奴だって保証はないだろ？襲い掛かってくる前のクリスに少し似てる気がするんだ。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
msgid "Chill, man.  It's just a little light arson, it'll be fine."
msgstr "落ち着いて。ちょっと火をつけるだけだから、大丈夫だろう。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
msgid ""
"I hear you, but he's following us now and I don't know how else to get rid "
"of him."
msgstr "分かってる。でも付いてくるんだから仕方がないだろう。追い払う方法も思いつかない。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
msgid ""
"I guess everything else is wrecked already anyway, what's one more burning "
"building?  And like, it *does* sound fun.  Let's just keep an eye on this "
"guy, he's a slice short of a full pie, if you catch my drift."
msgstr ""
"もう色んなものが滅茶苦茶になってる訳だし、燃えてる店が一つ増えたところで今更かもな？それに*間違いなく*楽しそうだ。あいつへの警戒も怠らないようにしよう。言葉では表しにくいんだが、あっち側に行っちまう一歩手前、って感じがする。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
msgid ""
"I knew you'd come around.  I'd like your opinion on something else, "
"actually."
msgstr "そう言ってくれると心強い。実は他にも意見を聞きたいことがある。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
msgid ""
"True enough, and I don't wanna like, just *kill* him.  Well, I don't have "
"anything against a bonfire this season I suppose.  Let's just make sure "
"neither of us ends up lying face-down in a wood-fired oven, y'know?"
msgstr ""
"それもそうだ。でも、奴を*殺す*のは、できれば避けたい。まあ、この状況で今更建物が一軒燃えたってどうでもいいって気持ちもある。くれぐれも、俺たちが薪オーブンにくべられないよう、気を付けたいもんだな？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
msgid ""
"We're on the same page.  I'd like your opinion on something else, actually."
msgstr "同意見だ。実は他にも意見を聞きたいことがある。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
msgid ""
"No.\"  He stares at you, his eyes wild.  For a moment, you barely know the "
"man in front of you.  \"The things I've seen when I wore that mask… it "
"changes you.  It's a burden you can't truly understand unless you've borne "
"it.\"  He shudders, and becomes again the Liam you know.  \"Anyone who "
"chooses to keep wearing it after the end of the world… putting them down "
"would be a kindness, believe me."
msgstr ""
"ああ。」彼は狂乱した瞳でこちらを見つめました。一瞬、目の前にいる男が誰なのか分からなくなるほど、空気が変化しました。「マスクごしに見る景色...あれは人を変えちまう。あれは、実際に経験した奴じゃないと理解できない苦しみだ。」リアムは震え、そしてよく知る普段の様子に戻りました。「世界が崩壊してもあれを着続けることを選んだ奴なんだ...終わらせてやるのが慈悲ってもんだろう。信じてくれ。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
msgid "Uh… okay.  I'd like your opinion on something else, anyway."
msgstr "わ...分かった。さて、他にも意見を聞きたいことがある。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
msgid ""
"*shrugs.  \"My thoughts on Murder Mario haven't changed much, but he hasn't "
"killed us yet.  I don't love the idea of just killing some other survivors "
"for him.  Foodperson doesn't count.\"  He shudders and takes a quick breath."
"  \"I have a funny feeling they won't let us talk them out of there, though."
msgstr ""
"*は肩をすくめました。「きちがいイタリアンに対する俺の考えはそれほど変わってないが、ひとまず俺たちには襲い掛かってはこないよな。あいつの依頼で人殺しをするってのは、あまり考えたくない。フードパーソンは別だが。」彼は一瞬震え、ため息をつきました。「でも、追い出すだけでは気が済まないんだろうなって、妙な予感があるんだ。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
msgid ""
"What if the cake is a lie?  Also do you really want to follow this guy back "
"to his house?  We both know that's not tomato sauce on his apron.  Don't eat"
" anything he cooks.\"  He shrugs, giving a nonplussed look.  \"Still, we've "
"committed actual murder for him multiple times now, so I guess I'm being a "
"bit of a hypocrite.  Let's party."
msgstr ""
"ケーキが嘘だったらどうする？本当にあいつの家にお邪魔するのか？俺たち二人とも、あいつのエプロンに付いてる赤いのがトマトソースじゃないことは分かってるだろ。手作り料理は絶対に口に入れるなよ。」彼は肩をすくめ、困惑した表情を浮かべました。「それでも、俺たちがあいつのために何度か人を殺してるのは本当だ。偽善者っぽいことを言っちまった。さて、パーティーに取り掛かろう。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
msgid "You didn't have fun?  I think this whole adventure has been a…"
msgstr "ワクワクしなかったのか？ここ最近の冒険は..."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
msgid ""
"I think it's worth it all, for the cake.  I'd like your opinion on something"
" else, actually."
msgstr "ケーキを食べるだけの価値があったと思いたい。実は他にも意見を聞きたいことがある。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
msgid ""
"…SLICE!\"  Liam shouts along with you, then gives you a leaping high five "
"before dissolving into belly laughter.  \"OK fine, that makes all the murder"
" and arson worth it, you mad bastard."
msgstr ""
"...ワクワクしたさ！」リアムは叫び、飛び跳ねながらハイタッチを交わし、腹を抱えて笑い転げました。「よし分かった、確かに人殺しと放火の経験には価値があったってことだよ、お前はぶっ飛んでるな。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
msgid ""
"That, and the cake.  I'd like your opinion on something else, actually."
msgstr "ケーキを食べるだけの価値はある。実は他にも意見を聞きたいことがある。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
msgid ""
"I feel like at some point we must have switched to playing Stardew Valley, "
"and I'm not quite sure when that happened.\"  He scratches his head.  \"Oh "
"well, let's just be sure to wear gumboots."
msgstr ""
"いつの間にかスターデューバレーの世界に来てたみたいだ、気が付かなかった。」彼は頭を掻きました。「とりあえず、ゴム長グツを履いた方がいいんだろうな。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
msgid "And aprons.  I'd like your opinion on something else, actually."
msgstr "それからエプロンも。実は他にも意見を聞きたいことがある。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
msgid ""
"BUGHUNT!\"  Liam raises his arms over his head and grins.  \"BUUUG HUUUNT!\""
"  He mimes stomping on ants.  \"I'm doing my part!"
msgstr "虫狩りだ！」リアムは万歳をして笑いました。「むーしーがーりー！」アリを踏みつける真似をしています。「私は戦います！」"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
msgid "I did actually want your opinion on something though."
msgstr "実は他にも意見を聞きたいことがある。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
msgid ""
"It's all good, I never minded doing deliveries, especially with a friend for"
" company.  I guess we could try to find lumber in a lumberyard, right?  "
"Probably not a lot of zombies hanging out in lumber yards.  Or maybe we "
"could find an old barn and knock it down and take all the pieces.\"  He "
"laughs.  \"Or saw it ourselves from scratch, if you're feeling like a mad "
"lad.  Make sure we've got a vehicle that can fit it though, that much lumber"
" ain't gonna fit in a hatchback."
msgstr ""
"問題ない。特に親友と組んで配達するなら何の苦もないさ。材木置き場で探してみるのがいいんじゃないか？きっとそういう場所にはゾンビも多くないだろう。それか、古い納屋を見つけたら、解体すれば廃材は好きなだけ取り放題だ。」彼は笑いました。「あるいは、元気が有り余って仕方ないなら、伐採から自分たちでやるとかな。ただし、ハッチバッグにそこまで大量の木材は積み込めない。たくさん積める車両を用意した方がいい。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
msgid "I'd like your opinion on something else, actually."
msgstr "実は他にも意見を聞きたいことがある。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
msgid ""
"Something, something, wood pun, something something.  This is starting to "
"feel like Settlers of Catan, think they'll give us some sheep in return?"
msgstr "木材を使った何か気の利いた洒落は、うーん。この仕事はカタンの開拓者みたいだ。お返しにヒツジが貰えるかな？"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
msgid ""
"Six ropes?  I find it hard to believe these guys can't just get 'em "
"themselves, but, uh, OK I guess.  Maybe we could take some old seatbelts and"
" tie them together, or something.  It shouldn't be hard to find a few ropes "
"laying around."
msgstr ""
"6本のロープねぇ？そんなもの自分たちで持ってくりゃいいじゃないかと思うが、まあいいや。ボロのシートベルトを何本か取ってきて、結び付ければそれっぽくなるんじゃないか。ロープ自体もその辺に落ちてそうだ。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
msgid ""
"Okay, wait, what?  One wood saw?  Why are you agreeing to this?  I like "
"deliveries as much as the next guy, but it's a *single wood saw*.  It's "
"starting to feel like you'll just agree to do anything anyone asks.\"  He "
"sighs.  \"No worries though I guess.  One time I delivered a single cold "
"soda to a guy living way out in the back woods.  Cost him seventy bucks.  "
"People are weird."
msgstr ""
"はぁ、待て、何だって？ノコギリ一つ？なんでこんな仕事受けたんだ？俺もごく普通の人程度には配達の仕事が好きだが、*ノコギリ一つ*だぞ。お前は依頼の断り方を知らないんじゃないかって思えてきた。」彼はため息をつきました。「ま、心配は無用だ。森の奥深くに住んでる男に冷えたソーダを一本届けたこともある。配送料は70ドル。人間ってのは不思議だな。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
msgid "A shovel?"
msgstr "シャベル？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
msgid "Yeah, a shovel."
msgstr "そう、シャベル。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
msgid "A shovel."
msgstr "シャベルか。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/npcs/dialogue/generic_dialogue.json
msgid "That's right."
msgstr "それでいい。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
msgid "You're not joking."
msgstr "冗談だろ。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
msgid "*stares at you for a few seconds.  \"At the shovel store, I guess.\""
msgstr "*はしばらくこちらをじっと見つめました。「シャベル屋にある、間違いない。」"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
msgid ""
"What now, a vegetable peele… oh, a smoker?  That's actually kinda legit I "
"guess.  Maybe we should hunt through peoples' backyards.  We could jump over"
" fences like in Shaun of the Dead!"
msgstr ""
"まず、野菜は皮を剥いて...ん、やり方じゃなくて燻製器の方？市販の奴なら分かる。人んちの裏庭を探すべきだ。ショーン・オブ・ザ・デッドみたいに柵越えしなきゃな！"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
msgid ""
"I'm not a great expert on guns, to be honest.  I know how to shoot a bit, "
"but my focus was always on archery when I was a kid.  That sounds like a "
"pretty rare gun though, I think maybe we should see if we can find some old "
"collector rather than trying to raid a gun store?  Just a guess."
msgstr ""
"正直な話、俺は銃の専門家じゃない。射撃のやり方は少しなら分かるが、子供の頃にやってたのはアーチェリーの方だ。かなりレアな銃っぽいし、銃砲店を漁るよりも古い銃のコレクターを探すべきなか？まあ単なる推測だけど。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
msgid ""
"Nah, you got it.  This is the sort of job that never, ever went wrong, "
"certainly not in any one of a thousand TV tropes.  Let's go find an unknown "
"old man in a secluded cabin."
msgstr ""
"ああ、大丈夫。こういうのは失敗しないタイプの仕事だ。TV tropesにも載ってなかったと思う。人里離れた小屋へ見知らぬ老人を探しに行こう。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
msgid ""
"Glad we're on the same page.  I'd like your opinion on something else, "
"actually."
msgstr "意見が一致して嬉しいよ。実は他にも意見を聞きたいことがある。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
msgid ""
"Hell yeah I am.  This guy seems nice.  Bunnies are cute.  This is the sort "
"of job I like, let's find him some logs.  We should be able to just hunt "
"around the woods for 'em, right?  Might need a hatchet or a saw."
msgstr ""
"もちろん、賛成だ。優しそうなご老人。かわいらしいウサギさんたち。こういう仕事がやりたかったんだよ。早速森の中で丸太を探してきてやるか？ハチェットかノコギリが要るかもな。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
msgid ""
"It sure does!  Is it blackberry season though?  I guess if they're not ripe,"
" we could check around abandoned kitchens and fridges, see if we can find "
"some that are still intact."
msgstr ""
"確かにな！ところで、今はブラックベリーの季節だったか？もし実ってなかったら、廃屋のキッチンや冷蔵庫を漁って、痛んでない奴がないか見てみよう。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
msgid ""
"Nah.  Lapin's sweet.  I wanna smoke a joint with the bunny man.  If you ever"
" turn into a zombie I'm gonna come back here and settle down as an assistant"
" bunny tamer.  Hope you don't mind."
msgstr ""
"もちろん。あのご老人は優しいな。ウサギ人間と一緒にジョイントを吸いたくなってきた。もしお前がゾンビになったら、俺はウサギ飼育家のところに逃げ込んで助手になろうと思う。冗談だって。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
msgid "No hard feelings.  I'd like your opinion on something else, actually."
msgstr "別に文句はないよ。実は他にも意見を聞きたいことがある。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
msgid ""
"An anvil?  Where do you come up with this stuff?  Yeah, I met this guy, "
"Wile-E Coyote, he had a bunch of 'em."
msgstr "金床？一体どこで探せばいいんだ？そういや、ワイリー・コヨーテって奴がたくさん持ってた気がするぜ。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
msgid ""
"I'll track him down.  I'd like your opinion on something else, actually."
msgstr "そいつを追ってみようか。実は他にも意見を聞きたいことがある。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
msgid ""
"I'm worried for these guys.  My gut tells me they're dealing with something "
"really dangerous.  Let's make sure we're packing heat, you know?"
msgstr "どうも安否が心配だ。これは俺の直感だが、マジで危険なことに巻き込まれてる気がする。銃か何かを用意した方がいいんじゃないか？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
msgid "Roger that.  I'd like your opinion on something else, actually."
msgstr "そうしよう。実は他にも意見を聞きたいことがある。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
msgid ""
"You can say that again.  This is some serious shit, my friend.  I know we've"
" been through a lot, but this might be the big one.  We need to make sure "
"we're ready for anything before we even consider going in there."
msgstr ""
"どうやらそうらしいな。これはとてつもなくヤバいんじゃないか、親友。俺たちは今まで色々な経験を積んできたが、ここまで危ない仕事は初めてかもしれない。現地に向かう前に、しっかりと準備しておいたほうがいい。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
msgid "Roger that.  I'd like your opinion on something else, first."
msgstr "そうしよう。準備の前に、他にも意見を聞きたいことがある。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
msgid ""
"After the shit these poor bastards have gone through, picking some "
"dandelions for them seems kind of anticlimactic.  Still, I am a big fan of "
"dandelion wine."
msgstr "大変な仕事を片付けたら、今度は呑気にタンポポ摘みだなんて、何だか気が抜けるな。それでも、俺はタンポポ酒が大好きなんだ。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
msgid ""
"Picking flowers in a field seems okay to me.  I don't mind helping Claire "
"out, she's a nice enough person.  Gotta say though, I get a bit of a weird "
"vibe off these guys.  They're so… I don't know.  It's like we walked into a "
"Norman Rockwell painting in the middle of the end of the world."
msgstr ""
"野原でお花摘み、いいんじゃないか。クレアも根っからの善人みたいだし、手伝ってやるのも構わない。ただ、何と言うか、あの家族からはちょっと妙な雰囲気を感じるんだよな。具体的には...分からん。世界が崩壊する真っただ中で、ノーマン・ロックウェルのイラストの中に入り込んじまった、って感じだろうか。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
msgid ""
"Bee bombs!  Kaboom!\"  He mimes an explosion with his hands.  \"Seriously "
"though it's a very versatile plant, we should get some seeds for ourselves."
msgstr "ビー・ボムだ！ババーン！」彼は両手で爆発を表現しました。「真面目な話、色々な用途がある植物だよ。種をどこかで見つけてこないとな。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
msgid ""
"I'll see what I can do.  I'd like your opinion on something else, actually."
msgstr "探してみよう。実は他にも意見を聞きたいことがある。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
msgid ""
"*laughs.  \"I was going to make a joke about herding cats, but yours is "
"better.  I was always more of a dog man myself, I don't know anything about "
"catching a feral cat.  Maybe we open a can of tuna?  Or is that a cliché?\""
msgstr ""
"*は笑いました。「ネコの群れで一つ洒落を考えてたが、お前の奴の方が出来がいいな。俺はどっちかと言えばイヌ派だから、ノラネコの捕まえ方なんて何も分からない。ツナ缶を開ければいいのか？それともあれは誇張なのか？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
msgid ""
"I'm still… 'feline' it out myself.  I'd like your opinion on something else,"
" actually."
msgstr "洒落を褒めたって、その手には「ノラ」ない。実は他にも意見を聞きたいことがある。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
msgid ""
"Even if we work together it's gonna take a while to just find enough good "
"rocks lying around.  We'll probably want to get a shovel and dig around a "
"bit maybe?  Or break up bigger ones with a sledge.  I'm impressed at these "
"guys, keeping going after everything that's happened."
msgstr ""
"俺たちが協力しても、その辺に転がってる十分な大きさの石を拾い集めてたら、時間が掛かって仕方ない。シャベルがあるなら、地面を掘って探すのがいいか？それか、大きい岩を砕くとか。しかし、イシャーウッド一家は凄いな。何が起きても前に進み続けようとしてる。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
msgid ""
"Even if we work together it's gonna take a while to just find enough good "
"rocks lying around.  We'll probably want to get a shovel and dig around a "
"bit maybe?  Or break up bigger ones with a sledge.  Something about this "
"stuff feels weird to me though.  Too pastoral for the apocalypse."
msgstr ""
"俺たちが協力しても、その辺に転がってる十分な大きさの石を拾い集めてたら、時間が掛かって仕方ない。シャベルがあるなら、地面を掘って探すのがいいか？それか、大きい岩を砕くとか。しかし、この仕事は何だか変だ。滅亡した世界でやることにしては牧歌的すぎる。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
msgid "Yeah, I hear you.  I'd like your opinion on something else, actually."
msgstr "賛成だ。実は他にも意見を聞きたいことがある。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
msgid ""
"Gathering sand sounds, honestly, sort of pleasant.  Like, meditative, you "
"know?  Maybe we find some batteries and get a bit of music going, smoke a "
"joint if you're so inclined, then fill some buckets of sand for Eddie to do "
"whatever the hell he's doing with it.  No zombies, no gunfire, just sand."
msgstr ""
"砂を掘ってる時の音って、何だか気持ちいいよな。瞑想って感じがしないか？もし電池が余ってるなら音楽を流して、気分が乗ってきたらジョイントを吸って、バケツに砂を汲み入れながら、エディが砂で何を作るのか思いを巡らせよう。ゾンビも銃声も聞こえない。ただ砂だけがある。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
msgid ""
"I believe he's making bricks.  I'd like your opinion on something else, "
"though."
msgstr "きっと彼はレンガを作るんだろう。実は他にも意見を聞きたいことがある。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
msgid ""
"I like a good, well defined physical job.  Let's go to the riverside!  I "
"feel like the odds of getting badly injured while gathering clay are sort of"
" low.  Make sure to get some music going though, right?  Maybe bring some "
"refreshments?  And shovels."
msgstr ""
"肉体を使う分かりやすい作業は好きだ。川辺に行こうぜ！粘土採集で大けがをする心配は、まぁきっとないだろう。ただし、BGMは欲しいな。それからおやつも、だろ？あとはシャベルだ。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
msgid ""
"You do make it sound good.  I'd like your opinion on something else, "
"actually."
msgstr "いいアイデアだ。実は他にも意見を聞きたいことがある。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
msgid ""
"Big jars aren't really that uncommon.  Lots of people got super into canning"
" in the last few months before shit really hit the fan, like they did with "
"toilet paper a few years back.  Maybe a bit more reasonable, I guess, though"
" learning how to pickle meat probably didn't save anyone from zombies.  I "
"bet we can track down a few just by raiding houses, and if they're not empty"
" we'll just have to eat what's inside or something."
msgstr ""
"大きめの瓶はそんなに珍しいもんじゃない。世界がひっくり返る前は、何年か前のトイレットペーパーみたいに、数か月くらい保存食ブームが続いてた。多少は頭のいい過ごし方だったと思うが、肉を漬ける方法を学んだ奴がゾンビから逃げられるとは限らない、ってことだ。きっと家屋を漁ればいくつか見つかるだろうし、空き瓶じゃなければ中身を食べればいいだけだ。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
msgid ""
"Do you need a snack, man?  Never mind.  I'd like your opinion on something "
"else, actually."
msgstr "空腹なのか？いや、まあいい。実は他にも意見を聞きたいことがある。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
msgid ""
"I'm sort of surprised they don't have plenty of wheat seeds of their own,\" "
"Liam shrugs.  \"What the hell do I know about farming though?  Nothing, "
"that's what.  Including having no idea about where to find wheat seeds, "
"sorry man.  I would have said 'on a farm' but we're on one and they're "
"asking us, so I just don't know what to think anymore.  My life is a "
"shambles."
msgstr ""
"一家が自分たちの小麦の種をそれほど持ってないことに、ちょっと驚いてる。」リアムは肩をすくめました。「ところで、俺に農業の知識があると思うか？実際、まったくない。悪いが、小麦の種がある場所なんてさっぱり分からない。「農場にある」と言いたいとこだったんだが、農場に住んでる奴から頼まれちまったら、もうお手上げだ。人生ってのは上手くいかないな。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
msgid "Fair enough.  I'd like your opinion on something else, actually."
msgstr "まったくだ。実は他にも意見を聞きたいことがある。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
msgid ""
"You know, it's a harmful stereotype that wolves are dangerous to humans.  Of"
" course I'm not afraid.\"  He smirks at you, then grins.  \"Except let's be "
"honest, this is probably going to be a giant monster zombie wolf or "
"something, right?  Let's go take the bastard down."
msgstr ""
"オオカミが人間を脅かす害獣だってのは、危険な固定観念だ。もちろん怖くないさ。」彼は歯を見せてニヤリと笑いました。「正直言って、どうせゾンビ化したデカいオオカミの化け物が出るんだって思ってるだろ？害獣を倒しに行こうぜ。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
msgid "That's the spirit.  I'd like your opinion on something else, actually."
msgstr "そうこなくっちゃ。実は他にも意見を聞きたいことがある。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
msgid ""
"Fast, unidentified monsters are killing the local wildlife, and we're going "
"to get 'em.\"  He looks thoughtful.  \"I'm pretty sure this was an episode "
"of the X-Files.  Or like, several episodes?  As long as we're Scully and "
"Mulder we'll be fine, but if we're the local cops coming in to investigate, "
"we're *toast*.  Just in case, let's make sure we've got our good gear."
msgstr ""
"正体不明の敏捷な怪物が野生動物を殺して回ってる。で、それをどうにかすると。」彼は考え込んでいるようです。「こんな話、Xファイルにあったよな。いや、何度もあったっけ？もし俺たちがスカリーとモルダーなら無事に済むだろうが、調査に来た地元警官だったら*破滅*だ。念のため、まともな装備を準備しておいた方がいい。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
msgid "Will do, Scully.  I'd like your opinion on something else."
msgstr "よしスカリー、やってやろう。他にも意見を聞きたいことがある。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
msgid ""
"Funny you should ask, yeah I have.  My dad borrowed it from the library once"
" and I leafed through it.  So I guess we could try looking at a library?  I "
"got no better ideas, I was like thirteen, I don't remember what was in the "
"thing, and he got all pissy at me for checking it out anyway."
msgstr ""
"奇遇だな、実はあるんだよ。一度、親父が図書館で借りてきたのをパラパラめくった覚えがある。だから、図書館を探すのがいいんじゃないか？これ以上いいアイデアは思い浮かばないね。読んだのは13歳くらいだから、何が書いてあったかは流石に覚えてない。勝手に読んだからって親父に滅茶苦茶怒られたんだった。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
msgid ""
"Well, yeah he does, because he's a man of discerning tastes.\"  Liam nods "
"approvingly.  \"Or because he wants something to prop his car up while he "
"changes the tire.  It's a big book, is what I'm saying.  We should make sure"
" we've got a copy for ourselves though, it's one of the prepper bibles."
msgstr ""
"ああ、そうみたいだな。ルークは工作が得意そうだ。」リアムは納得して頷きました。「いや、もしかすると、タイヤを交換するために車を持ち上げる支えが欲しいのかもしれないぞ。つまり、この本はかなり分厚いってこと。プレッパーのための聖書みたいな本だから、もう一冊手に入れて手元に置いておきたいな。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
msgid ""
"Great info, thanks.  I'd like your opinion on something else, actually."
msgstr "いい情報が知れた。実は他にも意見を聞きたいことがある。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
msgid ""
"*leans in close, speaking softly.  \"I do not say this lightly: this "
"motherfucker has *seen some shit*.  Look at that thousand-yard-stare.  We "
"did a good thing getting him out, but I don't know if he's ever really gonna"
" be *out*, you know?\""
msgstr ""
"*は体を寄せ、小声で話しました。「軽い気持ちで大丈夫とは言えないな。こいつは*とてつもなく酷い目に遭った*。どこか遠くを眺めてるあの目つきを見ろよ。確かに脱出作戦は上手くいった。だが、こいつが本当の意味で*脱出*できるかどうか、まだ分からないだろ？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
msgid "Do you think we can do anything for him?"
msgstr "彼のために何かできることはないだろうか？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
msgid "He'll suck it up.  We've all been through shit."
msgstr "それがどうした。私たちは誰だって、酷い目に遭ってきてる。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
msgid "Scary stuff.  I'd like your opinion on something else."
msgstr "恐ろしいことだ。他にも意見を聞きたいことがある。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
msgid ""
"We can get him home in one piece.  Get him back to his people.  I'd offer "
"him a drink or a toke, but I think they're like, Amish or something.  After "
"that, our best bet is to make ourselves scarce, to him we're always gonna be"
" the people he met in the tower.  He won't wanna be reminded of that."
msgstr ""
"無事に家に連れて戻してやるんだ。仲間の元に帰るのが一番だろう。酒でも勧めればいいのかもしれないが、どうやら彼は、アーミッシュか何かみたいだ。家に辿り着けた後で俺たちにできるのは、さっさとどこかに消えることだけだ。彼にとって俺たちは、塔で会った奴らって印象が強いだろ。捕まってた時のことなんて、思い出したくもないだろうからな。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
msgid "How do you know so much about this?"
msgstr "対処法に詳しいな？"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
msgid ""
"*looks abruptly uncomfortable.  \"You know a bit about me and my dad, right?"
"  I went to counseling for a few years after I got out.  Since what went "
"down with Chris, I've been thinking about it more too.\"  He shakes his "
"head.  \"We could all use a decent counsellor, honestly.  Even before the "
"world ended.\""
msgstr ""
"*は顔をしかめました。「俺と親父の関係は多少知ってるだろ？家を出てからは、数年間カウンセリングに通ってた。クリスとのことがあって以来、その頃の話をよく思い出すようになったんだ。」彼は首を振りました。「正直言って、俺たち皆、ちゃんとしたカウンセリングを受けるべき状態なんだ。世界が終わる前だったらそれができたのにな。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
msgid ""
"Thanks, man.  You have layers.  I'd like your opinion on something else."
msgstr "ありがとう。重みのある言葉だ。実は他にも意見を聞きたいことがある。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
msgid ""
"Yeah, I guess we have.\"  Liam looks off into the distance for a moment.  "
"\"We sure fuckin' have."
msgstr "ああ、そうかもな。」リアムはしばらく遠くを見つめました。「まったく、その通りだ。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
msgid "Damn straight.  I'd like your opinion on something else."
msgstr "何も言うことはない。実は他にも意見を聞きたいことがある。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
msgid ""
"*rubs his chin.  \"Mmmaaaybe?  What kind of chef?  I worked as a dishwasher "
"in a fancy place for a couple months.  If they're a line chef, then yes.  "
"Sous-chef or above?  Leave 'em for the zombies.  I hated that job.\""
msgstr ""
"*は顎をさすりました。「本当かよぉ？一体どんな料理人だ？俺だって高級店で数か月間皿洗いをしてたことはある。そいつが部門シェフなら、まあ助けてやってもいい。副料理長より上の奴なら、ゾンビたちのためにも放っておいてやろう。あの仕事は二度とごめんだ。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
msgid "Duly noted.  I'd like your opinion on something else, though."
msgstr "なるほど。実は他にも意見を聞きたいことがある。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
msgid ""
"Seems like a good idea to me.  If they're alive, then we meet some new "
"people, that's always fun.\"  He hesitates.  \"Well, it used to always be "
"fun.  New people are a bit scarier these days.  But still, as a general "
"rule, I'm a fan.  Anyway, if they're not alive, then we clear 'em out and we"
" have a farm of our very own.  It's win-win, as long as none of us gets "
"devoured by an undead menace."
msgstr ""
"いいと思うぜ。そいつらがまだ生きてたら、新たな仲間との楽しい出会いが待ってるってことだからな。」そこまで言うと、彼はためらいがちに続けました。「そう、昔はいつも楽しかったんだ。最近、新しい出会いに少しビビってる。でも、まあ基本的に、楽しい出会いだ。ともかく、もし死んじまってたら、対処しよう。そうすれば、俺らは農場を手に入れられる。ゾンビにやられない限りは、どっちに転んでも美味しい仕事ってことだ。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
msgid "Well summarized.  I'd like your opinion on something else, actually."
msgstr "分かりやすい要約は助かる。実は他にも意見を聞きたいことがある。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
msgid ""
"We could if you want.  I got complex feelings about prepper cabins in the "
"woods, obviously.  As far as loot goes though, they're pretty top tier, and "
"low-risk.  Maybe we'll find a nice bow.  Or like, guns or whatever.  Or a "
"bow!"
msgstr ""
"行きたいなら反対はしない。プレッパーの山小屋って聞くと、どうしても割り切れない気持ちが浮かんできちまう。ただし、戦利品に関して言えばかなり期待できるし、リスクも低いだろうな。もしかしたら素敵な弓が見つかるかもしれない。もしくは銃か。いや、やっぱり弓だな！"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
msgid ""
"You and your death springs.  I'd like your opinion on something else, "
"actually."
msgstr "山小屋はあなたの源泉、そしてあなたの災難の源泉だ。実は他にも意見を聞きたいことがある。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
msgid ""
"Fuck yeah we should.  Usually I'd be all, 'be careful my friend, preppers "
"leave traps 'n shit', but in this case we have said prepper's word on the "
"matter.  We could be running our operation from a cozy, well protected "
"bunker!  What are we waiting for?"
msgstr ""
"そりゃ絶対行くべきだ。いつもなら俺はこう言うだろうな。「気を付けろ親友、プレッパーは罠を残す。」だが今回は当人のプレッパーから話を聞いたんだからな。居心地のいい、安全なシェルターで生活できるかもしれないんだ！グズグズしてる暇なんてないだろ？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
msgid ""
"Thanks for the enthusiasm.  I'd like your opinion on something else, "
"actually."
msgstr "熱い意見をありがとう。実は他にも意見を聞きたいことがある。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
msgid ""
"Normally I'd say something about needing to be careful, blah blah, and "
"that's all true, but we're doing this for a friend, so I'm way more keen.  "
"Let's help out our new pal.  The three of us can handle this, right?"
msgstr ""
"普段だったら、あれこれ気を付けるべきことを並べ立てるだろうな。気を付けて動くべきなのはマジだが、今回は新たな仲間のためにやる仕事だ。いつもより乗り気だぜ。手伝ってやろう。これだけ仲間がいれば何とかなるだろ？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
msgid "Right on.  I'd like your opinion on something else, actually."
msgstr "その通り。実は他にも意見を聞きたいことがある。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
msgid "I want to talk about something a bit more fundamental now."
msgstr "そろそろもっと別の話をしたくなってきた。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
msgid "Can we chat about something else?"
msgstr "何か他のことについて話さないか？"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_main_dialogue.json
msgid ""
" *pshhhttt* This is big turtle, I read you loud and clear, red burrito."
msgstr "...ザザザザ...こちらビッグタートル。レッドブリトーへ、受信状態良好だ。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_main_dialogue.json
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/luo_follower.json
msgid "So, here we are.  What's up?"
msgstr "さてと。調子はどう？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_main_dialogue.json
msgid "Big turtle?  Red burrito?  Seriously?"
msgstr "ビッグタートル？レッドブリトー？何それ？"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_main_dialogue.json
msgid "*shrugs.  \"Not my favorite job, but sure.  I'll keep an eye out.\""
msgstr "*は肩をすくめました。「あまり得意な仕事じゃないが、分かった。しっかり見ておこう。」"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_main_dialogue.json
msgid ""
"As you know, I am experienced in practically every low-wage job on the "
"Eastern seaboard, and I'm probably a regional leading expert on video games."
"  My dad made me learn archery and I kinda kept it up.  What else is there?"
msgstr ""
"知っての通り、俺は東海岸のありとあらゆる低賃金労働をこなしてきた。それからビデオゲームなら誰にも負けない、多分な。あとは、親父に習ったアーチェリーをずっと続けてる。他に何かあったっけ？"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_main_dialogue.json
msgid ""
"Sounds weird calling it \"orders\", I'm your friend, not your minion.  No "
"worries though, what up?"
msgstr "何か「命令」かな、いや、部下でもない友人に対してしっくりこないか。気にしないでくれ、どうした？"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_main_dialogue.json
msgid "Sure, what do you want?"
msgstr "ああ、何だ？"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_main_dialogue.json
msgid "I mean, I'm not sure what I can teach you about, but okay."
msgstr "問題ないが、さて、何か俺に教えられることがあったかな。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_main_dialogue.json
msgid "Don't sell yourself short, Liam.  I just wanted to know about…"
msgstr "リアム、謙遜しすぎはよくない。ちょっと知りたいことがあって..."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_main_dialogue.json
msgid ""
"A… seminar?  About what, how not to burn yourself on the frier at Foodplace?"
msgstr "せ...セミナー？フードプレイスのフライヤーを火傷せずに扱う方法とか、そんな感じか？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_main_dialogue.json
msgid "Y'know, you have more useful skills than you think."
msgstr "いいや、あなたは自分が思っている以上に役立つスキルを身につけているよ。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_main_dialogue.json
msgid ""
"Roger that red burrito, that's a ten-forward on the callsigns.  Glad you "
"like 'em."
msgstr "ラジャー、レッドブリトー。コールサインはテン・フォワードだ。ツッコミに感謝する。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_main_dialogue.json
msgid "You're weird, my friend.  Red burrito, out."
msgstr "変なことを思い付くもんだ。レッドブリトー、アウト。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_starting_follower.json
msgid ""
"Years ago, you and your old group of friends made a pact.  It seemed like a joke at the time: if the world ended, you'd all meet up at Liam's cabin, if you could, and work together to help each other out.  Now, the unthinkable has happened, and somehow you've made it out in one piece.  It's been years since you saw those friends, though you've kept a little bit in touch on social media, and you can only hope that the others perhaps took the idea seriously.  Even if they did, it would be a hard trip.  The roads were blocked off by military forces trying to prevent the riots from spreading, and you had to make the last part of the journey on foot.\n"
"\n"
"As the morning light breaks into day, you've reached Liam's cabin, a ramshackle building in the woods outside <city>.  You can see Liam's car in front, looking a bit more run down since you last saw him a few years ago.  You feel a swell of relief: at least Liam seems to have made it!  As you approach the door, you hear a shout of terror from inside, and then the unmistakable sound of a gunshot.  Were you a moment too late?"
msgstr ""
"今から何年も前のこと、旧知の友人たちと一つの約束をしました。もし世界が崩壊したら、皆でリアムの山小屋に集まって、お互いに助け合って生き延びよう。当時はただの冗談だと思っていました。さて、冗談が現実になり、しかもどういう訳か上手く生き残れています。ソーシャルメディアで多少連絡を取り合ってはいるものの、友人たちと最後に会ってからかなり年月が経っています。他の皆があの約束を真剣に考えてくれることを願いましょう。しかし覚えていたとしても、辿り着くまでが困難です。暴動の拡大を阻止しようとする軍が道路を封鎖していたため、旅の後半は自分の足に頼るしかありませんでした。\n"
"\n"
"朝日が辺りを染める頃、リアムの山小屋に到着しました。<city>付近の森の中に、ボロボロの建物が見えます。小屋の前にはリアムの車が停まっていますが、数年前に最後に目にしたときより少し年季が入っているように見えます。少なくとも、リアムは約束を果たしました。玄関ドアに近付いたその時、中から恐怖に満ちた叫び声と、銃声としか思えない爆発音が聞こえました。間に合わなかったのでしょうか？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_starting_follower.json
msgid "I'd better get in there and check it out."
msgstr "中へ入って調べよう。"

#. ~ Unique name of a male NPC
#. ~ Special NPC you can only meet through the 'start with a friend' scenario.
#. Will need his own class and items before completing this.
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_starting_follower.json
msgid "Liam"
msgstr "ﾘｱﾑ"

#. ~ Name of an NPC class
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_starting_follower.json
msgid "expert in entry level jobs"
msgstr "プロ新入社員"

#. ~ Job description of "expert in entry level jobs" NPC class
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_starting_follower.json
msgid "It's you and me in this together, buddy."
msgstr "俺とお前、二人揃ってないとな、相棒。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_starting_follower.json
msgid ""
"*, your old friend, stares at you with blank, confused eyes.  He is standing"
" over a freshly mangled corpse, a smoking shotgun at his feet.  \"Holy shit "
"dude.\"  He blinks.  \"Is this about Chris?  If you're here to kill me, just"
" get it over with man.  I don't know what the fuck is happening but I can't "
"take you out too.\""
msgstr ""
"*、昔からの友人は、混乱した虚ろな瞳でこちらを見つめています。その傍にはズタボロに傷ついた新鮮な死体が倒れ、足元には硝煙を漂わせるショットガンが転がっています。「クソ、最悪だ。」彼は目を瞬かせました。「これがクリスかよ？お前も俺を殺しに来たっていうなら、もう一思いにやってくれ。一体何が起きてるのか知らないが、もう抵抗する気も失せた。」"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_starting_follower.json
msgid "Get ahold of yourself, man.  What's happening?  Chris?"
msgstr "なあ、気を確かに持て。何が起きたんだ？クリス？"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_starting_follower.json
msgid ""
"*gestures at the body.  \"Chris.  You know Chris, you've known Chris for "
"years.  We all agreed to meet up here if shit got bad, remember?  We got "
"here around the same time, set up a little camp.  Something seemed really "
"off since we arrived though, Chris kept going on and on about how the food "
"wasn't good enough.\"  He shifts his gaze back to you, eyes red.  \"We got "
"plenty of food!  I tried to calm him down but just now the fucker came "
"running in with an axe, tried to take my head off!  I… I…\" Liam gestures "
"again to the corpse.  \"Then you came in.  Do you got anything to do with "
"this?\""
msgstr ""
"*は死体を示しました。「あのクリスだよ。分かるだろ、長い付き合いだった。皆で、もし天変地異が起きたらここに集まろうって約束したこと、覚えてるか？俺とクリスはほぼ同時にここに着いて、小さな避難所を設営してたんだ。その時もう様子がおかしかった。クリスはずっと、食べ物が不味い不味いって言い続けてた。」彼は充血した目をこちらに向けました。「食料ならたくさんある！そう言って落ち着かせようとしたら、あいつ、斧を持って駆け寄ってきて、俺の首に振り下ろそうとしたんだ！俺...俺は...」そこまで言うと、再び死体を指しました。「それで、お前が入ってきた。そっちは？」"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_starting_follower.json
msgid ""
"I heard gunshots, so I came in to see what's up.  I was just on my way here "
"to see if you'd made it."
msgstr "銃声が聞こえたので、様子を見に来た。ここには着いたばかりで、あなたの無事を確認しようとしていたところだ。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_starting_follower.json
msgid ""
"Well, shit.  I'm guessing my story sounds like a lot of bullshit then.\"  "
"Liam sags into the sofa behind him, wiping his eyes with his sleeve.  \"What"
" the hell are we gonna do?  Holy shit."
msgstr ""
"ああ、クソ。こんな話してもデタラメだと思うだろうけどな。」リアムは背後のソファに腰を下ろし、袖で目元を拭いました。「一体どうすりゃいいんだ？最悪だ。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_starting_follower.json
msgid ""
"I believe you.  People have been acting crazy for weeks, it must have got "
"Chris too.  Come on.  We're in this together."
msgstr "あなたを信じよう。おかしな行動を取る人は何週間も前から見かけていた。クリスも同じだったに違いない。行こう。一緒に生き延びるんだ。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_starting_follower.json
msgid ""
"Pull yourself together.  You did what you had to.  The shit has hit the fan,"
" no time for moping around."
msgstr "気を確かに。やるべきことをやったんだろう。大変なことが起きているのは確かだ。落ち込んでいる暇はない。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_starting_follower.json
msgid ""
"Thanks.  It's good to hear that.  Look, I'm sure I should be questioning you"
" and making sure you're not gonna attack me with an axe or something, but I "
"just can't anymore.  Come on, let's get Chris out of here and then figure "
"out what to do next."
msgstr ""
"そう言ってもらえると助かる。ありがとよ。本当はお前をちゃんと尋問して、斧か何かを持ち出さないよう縛っておくべきなんだろうが、もう止めだ。さあ、クリスを外に出してやって、次に何をしたらいいか考えよう。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_starting_follower.json
msgid "Sure thing.  Let's go."
msgstr "そうだな。さあ行こう。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_starting_follower.json
msgid ""
"All right, yeah.  Fair call.  I'm just a bit shell shocked, but it's good to"
" see you.  Let's get Chris out of here and figure out what to do next"
msgstr ""
"確かに、そうだ。ああ、その通り。ちょっと呆然としちまったけど、とにかく会えて嬉しいよ。クリスを外に出してやって、次に何をしたらいいか考えよう。"

#. ~ Mission name
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_starting_follower.json
msgid "Check to see if Liam is OK"
msgstr "リアムの無事を確認する"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/luo_follower.json
msgid " *pshhhttt* Hey stinkyface.  It's your favorite mushroom girl.  Over."
msgstr "...ザザザザ...やあ、待ち遠しかったかい。キノコ女子の登場だよ。オーバー。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/luo_follower.json
msgid "I love just standing around, it's what I was made for."
msgstr "ただつっ立ってるの大好き。天職だって感じるね。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/luo_follower.json
msgid ""
"My 'abilities'?  I can shapeshift, and teleport, but I can't do it on "
"command.  Also, I have unique powers of thyroid failure."
msgstr "「能力」だって？実は変身やテレポートの力があるけど、命令されてもやらないよ。そうそう、甲状腺機能不全も特殊能力に入るかね。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/luo_follower.json
msgid "Sure.  Here we are, talking."
msgstr "いいね。早速話そうか。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/luo_follower.json
msgid "What's your story, anyway?"
msgstr "それでは、あなたの話を聞かせて？"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/luo_follower.json
msgctxt "u:f"
msgid "Seen any good movies lately?"
msgstr "最近は、何かいい映画を見た？"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
