msgid "extended bullpup shotgun"
msgid_plural "extended bullpup shotguns"
msgstr[0] "ショットガン(12ga/大容量ﾌﾞﾙﾊﾟｯﾌﾟ)"

#. ~ Description of gun "extended bullpup shotgun"
#: data/json/obsoletion_and_migration_0.I/gun.json
msgid ""
"This pump-action shotgun uses a system of twin magazines to carry 24 total "
"rounds of 12-gauge shotgun shells.  Each tube must be loaded separately, but"
" this offers the option of loading different ammunition for different "
"situations.  As the weapon's trigger is situated forwards of the chamber in "
"what is termed as a 'bullpup' design, the firearm's still only as long as "
"conventional shotguns despite having a comparatively far higher capacity."
msgstr ""
"2つの弾倉に12ゲージ弾を合計24発装填できるポンプアクション式ショットガンです。弾倉毎に弾薬を装填しておく必要はありますが、状況に応じて弾種を使い分けることもできます。トリガーを薬室の前方に配置した「ブルパップ」と呼ばれる設計のため、一般的なショットガンに比べて装弾数が非常に多く、なおかつ長さは同程度に収まっています。"

#. ~ Variant name of gun "extended bullpup shotgun"
#: data/json/obsoletion_and_migration_0.I/gun.json
msgid "Kel-Tec KSG-25 shotgun"
msgid_plural "Kel-Tec KSG-25 shotguns"
msgstr[0] "ショットガン(12ga/ｹﾙﾃｯｸKSG-25)"

#. ~ Description of variant "extended bullpup shotgun" of gun "Kel-Tec KSG-25
#. shotgun"
#: data/json/obsoletion_and_migration_0.I/gun.json
msgid ""
"A bullpup pump-action shotgun, the Kel-Tec KSG-25 uses a pair of magazine "
"tubes to increase its capacity.  Each tube has to be loaded separately, but "
"this offers the option of loading different ammunition for different "
"situations.  The big brother of the KSG, it has a longer barrel and longer "
"magazine tubes."
msgstr ""
"ブルパップ・ポンプアクション式のショットガンです。2本のチューブ型弾倉を内蔵しており、装弾数が大幅に向上しています。チューブは左右に独立しており別々に装填する必要がありますが、状況に応じて異なる弾薬を装填しておく使い方も可能です。ケルテックKSGよりも銃身やチューブが長い、いわゆる兄貴分です。"

#. ~ Gun mod name
#: data/json/obsoletion_and_migration_0.I/gun.json
msgid "KSG-25 second magazine"
msgid_plural "KSG-25 second magazines"
msgstr[0] "KSG-25予備弾倉(12ga)"

#. ~ Description of gun mod "KSG-25 second magazine"
#: data/json/obsoletion_and_migration_0.I/gun.json
msgid ""
"The integrated second tube magazine of the Kel-Tec KSG-25, which holds 12 "
"shots.  It's irremovable."
msgstr "ケルテックKSG-25に対応する、弾薬を12発装填できる2つ目のチューブ型弾倉です。この部品は銃から取り外せません。"

#. ~ Name of a gun
#: data/json/obsoletion_and_migration_0.I/gun.json
msgid "Colt Lightning .45 Carbine"
msgid_plural "Colt Lightning .45 Carbines"
msgstr[0] "ライフル(.45口径ｺﾙﾄ/ﾗｲﾄﾆﾝｸﾞ)"

#. ~ Description of gun "Colt Lightning .45 Carbine"
#: data/json/obsoletion_and_migration_0.I/gun.json
msgid ""
"A modern reproduction of a Colt pump-action rifle.  Originally chambered in "
".44-40, modern versions most commonly use .45 Colt, complementing the Single"
" Action Army as a Cowboy Action Shooting firearm."
msgstr ""
"コルト社のポンプアクション式ライフルを復刻したものです。元々は.44-40口径弾を使いましたが、現代ではもっぱら.45口径コルト弾が使われ、カウボーイ・シューティング競技に用いるシングルアクションアーミーとして脚光を浴びています。"

#. ~ Reload noise of gun "Colt Lightning .45 Carbine"
#: data/json/obsoletion_and_migration_0.I/gun.json
msgid "chik chik."
msgstr "カチッカチッ。"

#. ~ Magazine name
#: data/json/obsoletion_and_migration_0.I/gun.json
msgid "AF2011A1 16-round double magazine"
msgid_plural "AF2011A1 16-round double magazines"
msgstr[0] "弾倉(.38口径ｽｰﾊﾟｰ/AF2011A1/16発)"

#. ~ Description of magazine "AF2011A1 16-round double magazine"
#: data/json/obsoletion_and_migration_0.I/gun.json
msgid ""
"Two .38 Super 8-round box magazines attached to a single base plate, holding"
" up to 16 rounds in total, used by the AF2011A1 double-barrel pistol."
msgstr "2つの銃身をもつAF2011A1に対応する、2つの.38口径スーパー弾用8発箱型弾倉が1つに結合された弾倉です。"

#. ~ Name of a gun
#: data/json/obsoletion_and_migration_0.I/gun.json
msgid "AF2011A1 .38 Super"
msgid_plural "AF2011A1 .38 Super"
msgstr[0] "ハンドガン(.38口径ｽｰﾊﾟｰ/AF2011A1)"

#. ~ Description of gun "AF2011A1 .38 Super"
#: data/json/obsoletion_and_migration_0.I/gun.json
msgid ""
"A double-barrel semi-automatic pistol of Italian origin, firing two bullets "
"per shot, a derivative of the M1911 pistol."
msgstr "1度に2発の弾薬を発射する、M1911の派生モデルとなるイタリア製のセミオートピストルです。"

#. ~ Vitamin name
#: data/json/obsoletion_and_migration_0.I/migration_mutation.json
msgid "Instability"
msgstr "不安定"

#. ~ Name of effect type id "genetics_damaged"
#: data/json/obsoletion_and_migration_0.I/migration_mutation.json
msgid "Spent Phenotype"
msgstr "表現型低落"

#. ~ Name of effect type id "genetics_damaged"
#: data/json/obsoletion_and_migration_0.I/migration_mutation.json
msgid "Depleted Phenotype"
msgstr "表現型劣化"

#. ~ Name of effect type id "genetics_damaged"
#: data/json/obsoletion_and_migration_0.I/migration_mutation.json
msgid "Bankrupt Phenotype"
msgstr "表現型破綻"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Spent Phenotype"
#: data/json/obsoletion_and_migration_0.I/migration_mutation.json
msgid ""
"Mutation has left you with a persistent mild discomfort.  It seems harmless "
"for now, but you can't predict if it'll get worse."
msgstr "変異の影響による軽い不快感が続いています。今のところは無害のようですが、今後悪化する可能性もあります。"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Depleted Phenotype"
#: data/json/obsoletion_and_migration_0.I/migration_mutation.json
msgid ""
"There's an enervating sense of dysmorphia throughout your whole body.  It "
"waxes and wanes, but never quite goes away.  Mutating this much can't be "
"good for you…"
msgstr "全身に倦怠感が残っています。多少楽になることもありますが、完全に解消はされません。過剰な変異が身体に良い筈がありません..."

#. ~ Description of effect type "Bankrupt Phenotype"
#: data/json/obsoletion_and_migration_0.I/migration_mutation.json
msgid ""
"You're haunted by phantom pains across your entire body now.  Everything "
"aches from an exhaustion that never seems to fade.  Any further mutation "
"right now is very unlikely to have a happy ending."
msgstr ""
"ある筈のない痛みを全身に感じています。倦怠感がまったく取れず、常に苦痛が伴っています。これ以上変異を続けても、良い結末を迎えられそうにありません。"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Conjunctivitis"
#: data/json/obsoletion_and_migration_0.I/obsolete_effect.json
msgid ""
"Commonly known as pinkeye, this minor infection can be treated with "
"antihistamines.  If it's bacterial, antibiotics may help, but you can't tell"
" without a lab analysis."
msgstr ""
"一般的に感染性結膜炎と知られるこの軽い感染症は、抗ヒスタミン薬で治療できます。 "
"細菌性であれば抗生物質が効くかもしれませんが、検査をしなければ分かりません。"

#. ~ Apply message of effect type "Conjunctivitis"
#: data/json/obsoletion_and_migration_0.I/obsolete_effect.json
msgid "Your itchy eye leaks a filmy discharge."
msgstr "目元が痒く、目ヤニが出ています。"

