#. ~ Description of furniture "mutant sapling"
#: data/json/obsoletion_and_migration_0.I/obsolete_furniture.json
msgid ""
"A twisted and gnarled little tree.  Its shape is at once alien and familiar."
msgstr "捻じれて節くれだった小さな樹木です。異質であると同時に、よく見慣れた姿にも見えます。"

#. ~ Furniture name
#: data/json/obsoletion_and_migration_0.I/obsolete_furniture.json
