"IHAVETHECOOLESTDADINTHEWORLD.\""
msgstr ""
"「パパとぼくは一週間森に住んでいます。狩りに行くときはピストルを持たせてくれます。でも、ぼくにおそいかかってきたオオカミ人間は倒せなかった。だからぼくは一晩中、オオカミが入れない小さな穴の中で隠れていました。そうしたら、なんと、パパがぼくをみつけて、オオカミ人間を退治してくれました。ぼくの誕生日のプレゼントに、オオカミ人間でジャケットを作ってくれるそうです。世界一かっこいいパパです。」"

#. ~ Snippet in category "note_child"
#. ~ The grammar and punctuation mistakes are there on purpose 9/10 times.
#. Keep in mind that those notes are supposed to be written by primary-school-
#. level children.
#: data/json/snippets/children_notes.json
msgid ""
"\"I discovered 10 new stars tonight!  To bad that mom and dad aren't home.  "
"They even forgot to close the front door.\""
msgstr "「今夜は知らない星を10も見つけた！パパとママが留守で残念だ。玄関のドアを閉めるのも忘れて出掛けちゃうなんて。」"

#. ~ Snippet in category "note_child"
#. ~ The grammar and punctuation mistakes are there on purpose 9/10 times.
#. Keep in mind that those notes are supposed to be written by primary-school-
#. level children.
#: data/json/snippets/children_notes.json
msgid ""
"\"An unrecognizable child's drawing made with what appears to be blood and "
"feces.\""
msgstr "[血や汚物で描かれたと思しき、得体の知れない絵]"

#. ~ Snippet in category "note_child"
#. ~ The grammar and punctuation mistakes are there on purpose 9/10 times.
#. Keep in mind that those notes are supposed to be written by primary-school-
#. level children.
#: data/json/snippets/children_notes.json
msgid ""
"\"We all ate together as a big happy family.  Even Mike was there even "
"though mom normally puts him to bed at 8pm.  Atleast he won't cry in the "
"middle of the night anymore.\""
msgstr "「たのしいだいかぞくは、みんないっしょにたべました。いつも8じにねるマイクも、いっしょにたべました。もうよるもなかずにいられるね」"

#. ~ Snippet in category "note_child"
#. ~ The grammar and punctuation mistakes are there on purpose 9/10 times.
#. Keep in mind that those notes are supposed to be written by primary-school-
#. level children.
#: data/json/snippets/children_notes.json
msgid ""
"\"Daddy and Mommy, some really scary storm is happening outside.  I hear "
"some people telling me everything will be okay and everything will be over "
"if I get out, so I'm going with them to help find you, and if not i left a "
"message to you so you know where I'm gone!  I'm just too hungry to keep "
"waiting anymore…  I'm sorry.\""
msgstr ""
"「父さんと母さんへ、外はものすごい嵐です。外に出ればきっと大丈夫だと言ってくれる人たちがいるので、一緒に父さんと母さんを探しに行きます！おなかが空いて、これ以上は待てません...ごめんなさい。」"

#. ~ Snippet in category "note_child"
#. ~ The grammar and punctuation mistakes are there on purpose 9/10 times.
#. Keep in mind that those notes are supposed to be written by primary-school-
#. level children.
#: data/json/snippets/children_notes.json
msgid ""
"\"Mommy is behind me forcing me to draw and write notes.  I don't know why, "
"but she has been acting weirder everyday, and I think she hurt daddy…  I'm "
"scared im scared, someone help, im scared im…  (The rest of the note seems "
"to be endless begging for help until it ends in a bloody smear)\""
msgstr ""
"「ママがわたしの後ろから、ずっと絵をかけとか作文をかけとか怒ってきます。どうしてか分からないけど、ママは毎日おかしくて、パパをぶったみたいで...怖い、怖い、誰か助けて、助けて、怖い、怖い、怖い、(延々と助けを求めており、記述の最後は血にまみれて読み取れない。)」"

#. ~ Snippet in category "note_child"
#. ~ The grammar and punctuation mistakes are there on purpose 9/10 times.
#. Keep in mind that those notes are supposed to be written by primary-school-
#. level children.
#: data/json/snippets/children_notes.json
msgid ""
"\"I hate it here.  I want to go home.  Abba and Ima told me things would be "
"okay and we will be here a for a few days and then a bus will come take us "
"and we will be safe but I heard them arguing last night.  Ima cried.  I'm "
"scared.  I wanna go home.\""
msgstr ""
"「ここはイヤだ。いえにかえりたい。アッバもイッマも、だいじょうぶで、もう少しいればバスが来てあんしんだといっていた。でも、きのうの夜は、ケンカをしていた。イッマは泣いていた。わたしはこわい。いえにかえりたい。」"

#. ~ Snippet in category "note_child"
#. ~ The grammar and punctuation mistakes are there on purpose 9/10 times.
#. Keep in mind that those notes are supposed to be written by primary-school-
#. level children.
#: data/json/snippets/children_notes.json
msgid ""
"\"A child's drawing of a house with three stick figures outside.  The sky is"
" a swirling mess of a dozen contrasting colors with purple and red blotches "
"in it.  The three figures are frowning.\""
msgstr ""
"[屋外にいる3人のしかめ面をした棒人間が、拙い手つきで描かれている。空は十色以上の派手な渦巻き模様になっており、あちこちに紫色や赤色のシミが付いている。]"

#. ~ Snippet in category "note_child"
#. ~ The grammar and punctuation mistakes are there on purpose 9/10 times.
#. Keep in mind that those notes are supposed to be written by primary-school-
#. level children.
#: data/json/snippets/children_notes.json
msgid ""
"\"I saw two huge dragonflies hugging.  It was kinda cute but my brother just"
" said they were having sex.  He's gross.\""
msgstr "「2匹の大きなトンボがハグしてるのをみた。ちょっとかわいいと思ったけど、弟は、セックスしてるんだとか言ってた。ほんとキモい。」"

#. ~ Snippet in category "note_child"
#. ~ The grammar and punctuation mistakes are there on purpose 9/10 times.
#. Keep in mind that those notes are supposed to be written by primary-school-
#. level children.
#: data/json/snippets/children_notes.json
msgid ""
"\"There is some really pretty floating swirly outside.  I was told to not go"
" near it, but I can hear voices from it.  I want to see what's inside.\""
msgstr "「外に、とてもきれいなうずまきが浮いている。近付くなって言われたけど、声が聞こえてくる。中に何があるのか見たい。」"

#. ~ Snippet in category "note_child"
#. ~ The grammar and punctuation mistakes are there on purpose 9/10 times.
#. Keep in mind that those notes are supposed to be written by primary-school-
#. level children.
#: data/json/snippets/children_notes.json
msgid ""
"\"I can hear mom's voice crying my name and crying for help in the forest.\""
msgstr "「森の中からママの声が聞こえる。泣きながら私の名前を呼んでる。」"

#. ~ Snippet in category "note_child"
#. ~ The grammar and punctuation mistakes are there on purpose 9/10 times.
#. Keep in mind that those notes are supposed to be written by primary-school-
#. level children.
#: data/json/snippets/children_notes.json
msgid ""
"\"Mom is acting weird.  She thinks I'm 2 and that Mike still lives here and "
"that she's still married to dad.  It's like my little sister doesn't exist "
"to her so I have to take care of her now.  She's just a baby and it's so "
"hard.\""
msgstr ""
"「ママが変になった。私が2才で、マイクがここに今も住んでて、パパとも離婚してないと思ってる。妹はムシされてるから、私が世話をしないといけない。まだ赤ちゃんだからとても大変。」"

#. ~ Snippet in category "note_child"
#. ~ The grammar and punctuation mistakes are there on purpose 9/10 times.
#. Keep in mind that those notes are supposed to be written by primary-school-
#. level children.
#: data/json/snippets/children_notes.json
msgid ""
"\"Mom fell asleep in the bathtub.  I keep trying to wake her up but she's "
"getting cold.\""
msgstr "「ママがおふろでねちゃった。おこそうとしてるけどおきないしつめたい。」"

#. ~ Snippet in category "note_child"
#. ~ The grammar and punctuation mistakes are there on purpose 9/10 times.
#. Keep in mind that those notes are supposed to be written by primary-school-
#. level children.
#: data/json/snippets/children_notes.json
msgid ""
"\"The crows I used to feed have gotten HUGE!  One brought me a super pretty "
"watch and another an earring but there was weird black gunk on it.\""
msgstr ""
"「前にエサをやったカラスたちが超デカくなってた！一匹はすごくきれいな腕時計をもってきて、もう一匹はイヤリングをもってきたけど、なんか変な黒いごみがついてた。」"

#. ~ Snippet in category "note_child"
#. ~ The grammar and punctuation mistakes are there on purpose 9/10 times.
#. Keep in mind that those notes are supposed to be written by primary-school-
#. level children.
#: data/json/snippets/children_notes.json
msgid ""
"\"Felt queasy and threw up yesterday, puke looked weird.  I took pills for "
"stomach aches but I don't feel any better.\""
msgstr "「昨日は気分が悪くなって吐いた。吐いたものが変な感じだった。お腹の薬を飲んだけど、まだよくならない。」"

#. ~ Snippet in category "note_child"
#. ~ The grammar and punctuation mistakes are there on purpose 9/10 times.
#. Keep in mind that those notes are supposed to be written by primary-school-
#. level children.
#: data/json/snippets/children_notes.json
msgid ""
"\"I got woke up by mom and dad trembling on their sleep and drooling a lot."
"  I think it is that weird big crow we ate the other day.  I don't feel too "
"good as well…\""
msgstr ""
"「おきたら、パパとママがガタガタふるえて、よだれをダラダラたらしていた。きっとこの前食べた変な大きなカラスのせいだ。私も気分がよくない...」"

#. ~ Snippet in category "note_child"
#. ~ The grammar and punctuation mistakes are there on purpose 9/10 times.
#. Keep in mind that those notes are supposed to be written by primary-school-
#. level children.
#: data/json/snippets/children_notes.json
msgid ""
"\"We going to hide in the subways, but I keep hearing really weird screams "
"down there.\""
msgstr "「地下鉄にかくれるつもりだったけど、変な叫び声が聞こえる。」"

#. ~ Snippet in category "note_child"
#. ~ The grammar and punctuation mistakes are there on purpose 9/10 times.
#. Keep in mind that those notes are supposed to be written by primary-school-
#. level children.
#: data/json/snippets/children_notes.json
msgid ""
"\"I saved a puppy that was being harassed by giant bugs the other day.  He "
"is scratching a lot but seems fine, i hope i can keep him.\""
msgstr "「でっかい虫に追いかけられてた子犬を助けてあげた。元気だから飼いたいけど、なんだかかゆそうにしてる。」"

#. ~ Snippet in category "note_child"
#. ~ The grammar and punctuation mistakes are there on purpose 9/10 times.
#. Keep in mind that those notes are supposed to be written by primary-school-
#. level children.
#: data/json/snippets/children_notes.json
msgid ""
"\"I'm alone in this shelter now…  i can see some people outside but they are"
" just standing there really quiet and not doing anything.  The monsters "
"seems to ignore them too, maybe they will help me?\""
msgstr ""
"「とうとうシェルターに一人ぼっちだ...外に何人か人がいるけど、だまって立ってるだけで、何もしてない。化け物もあの人たちを無視してるみたいだし、もしかしたら、助けてくれるかも？」"

#. ~ Snippet in category "note_child"
#. ~ The grammar and punctuation mistakes are there on purpose 9/10 times.
#. Keep in mind that those notes are supposed to be written by primary-school-
#. level children.
#: data/json/snippets/children_notes.json
msgid ""
"\"In case of emergency fill out this form so that you may present it to "
"emergency personnel for identification purposes.  Keep this form with your "
"emergency supplies.  If You need to request new copies of this form, speak "
"with the school safety office.  Remember to keep calm, and stay in one "
"location if possible, this will help emergency personnel to find you.  If "
"this form is found please contact Oak Grove Elementary School.  Name: Aiden."
"  Parent or Guardian: Mommy Daddy.  Phone number where you can be reached: I"
" don't remember I think it has a 5 in it.  Teacher: Miss daisy.  Current "
"location: I dont no I'm scared, Im hear all alone.  Medical Conditions i.e "
"diabetes: I dont no what that is.  Additional Information: Why is everyone "
"acting so weird?!\""
msgstr ""
"「用紙に必要事項を記入し、救急隊員に提示することで、緊急時の本人確認が可能です。この用紙は、非常用持ち出し品と共に保管してください。用紙の再発行が必要な場合は、当校の安全管理課にご相談ください。非常時は落ち着いて、可能な限り移動しないように努めてください。この用紙を発見された方は、オーク・グローブ小学校にご連絡ください。氏名:"
" エイデン 両親または保護者: ママとパパ 連絡が可能な電話番号: おぼえてないけど5なんとかだっけ 担任教諭: デイジーせんせい 現在地: "
"わかんないこわい一人でいます 持病(糖尿病など): なんてよむかわからない 追加情報: なんかへんだけどどうなってるの！？」"

#. ~ Snippet in category "note_child"
#. ~ The grammar and punctuation mistakes are there on purpose 9/10 times.
#. Keep in mind that those notes are supposed to be written by primary-school-
#. level children.
#: data/json/snippets/children_notes.json
msgid ""
"\"After we were evacuated and I had to leave my toys behind I started "
"collecting empty bullets.  The soldiers here sometimes give me more.  "
"Lieutenant Mora gave me two little ones today, but she looked upset.  I "
"asked her where mom and pa were because I saw them in the back of the camp "
"with her and some soldiers, there was something wrong with dad's face.  Mrs "
"Mora just hugged me and started crying.\""
msgstr ""
"「避難するときにおもちゃを置いていっちゃったから、空の弾を集めるようになった。ここの兵隊さんが、ときどき分けてくれる。今日はモーラ中尉が小さいやつを2つくれた。なにか慌ててるみたいだった。ママが何人かの兵隊さんと一緒にキャンプの後ろにいて、パパの顔がなんか変だった。ママとパパはどこへいくのか聞いたら、モーラ中尉はぎゅってしてくれて、泣いちゃった。」"

#. ~ Snippet in category "note_child"
#. ~ The grammar and punctuation mistakes are there on purpose 9/10 times.
#. Keep in mind that those notes are supposed to be written by primary-school-
#. level children.
#: data/json/snippets/children_notes.json
msgid ""
"\"Mom went to pick up Cristy early from school today, but she isn't back "
"yet.  I don't know why the monster outside is wearing her face.\""
msgstr "「ママは今日、学校へ早めにクリスティを迎えに行ったけど、まだ帰ってこない。外にいる怪物がママの顔をしてるのはなんでだろう。」"

#. ~ Snippet in category "note_child"
#. ~ The grammar and punctuation mistakes are there on purpose 9/10 times.
#. Keep in mind that those notes are supposed to be written by primary-school-
#. level children.
#: data/json/snippets/children_notes.json
msgid ""
"\"It's a drawing of a small stick figure cowering in the corner.  The rest "
"of the page is colored black, with strange faces sneering and laughing at "
"them.\""
msgstr "[小さな棒人間が隅の方でうずくまっている。それ以外の余白は黒く塗り潰され、嘲笑するような奇妙な顔がたくさん描かれている。]"

#. ~ Snippet in category "note_child"
#. ~ The grammar and punctuation mistakes are there on purpose 9/10 times.
#. Keep in mind that those notes are supposed to be written by primary-school-
#. level children.
#: data/json/snippets/children_notes.json
msgid ""
"\"I saw millie playing in the playground, but all she does is walk around in"
" circles.\""
msgstr "「ミリーがうんどうじょうであそんでたけど、ずっとぐるぐるあるいてる」"

#. ~ Snippet in category "note_child"
#. ~ The grammar and punctuation mistakes are there on purpose 9/10 times.
#. Keep in mind that those notes are supposed to be written by primary-school-
#. level children.
#: data/json/snippets/children_notes.json
msgid "\"nobody ever tells me anything so im gonna run away, i hate you mom\""
msgstr "「だれも何もおしえてくれないからもうにげます。ママ大きらい」"

#. ~ Snippet in category "note_child"
#. ~ The grammar and punctuation mistakes are there on purpose 9/10 times.
#. Keep in mind that those notes are supposed to be written by primary-school-
#. level children.
#: data/json/snippets/children_notes.json
msgid ""
"\"i want chocolate bars i want lollipops i want ice cream i want gummy bears"
" i want bubble gum but i dont want another protien bar\""
msgstr "「チョコレートバーがほしいペロペロキャンディがほしいグミがほしいふうせんガムがほしいプロテインバーはほしくない」"

#. ~ Snippet in category "note_child"
#. ~ The grammar and punctuation mistakes are there on purpose 9/10 times.
#. Keep in mind that those notes are supposed to be written by primary-school-
#. level children.
#: data/json/snippets/children_notes.json
msgid ""
"\"today we didnt really learn anything, the teacher kept talking about "
"random things and threw a pencil at me when I asked to go to the bathroom\""
msgstr "「今日はぜんぜん勉強できなかった。先生は意味分からないことずっと言ってるし、トイレに行きたいって言ったらえんぴつを投げられた」"

#. ~ Snippet in category "note_child"
#. ~ The grammar and punctuation mistakes are there on purpose 9/10 times.
#. Keep in mind that those notes are supposed to be written by primary-school-
#. level children.
#: data/json/snippets/children_notes.json
msgid ""
"\"the neigbors dogs kept playing with each other all day they played so much"
" they split raspberry jam evrywere it was very funny\""
msgstr "「となりの家の犬たちが一日中あそんでいる。あそびすぎてラズベリージャムがあちこち飛びちってすごく面白かった」"

#. ~ Snippet in category "note_child"
#. ~ The grammar and punctuation mistakes are there on purpose 9/10 times.
#. Keep in mind that those notes are supposed to be written by primary-school-
#. level children.
#: data/json/snippets/children_notes.json
msgid ""
"\"Dear Diary, I was at the park today with Percy.  Danny always told me that"
" she was very sad when her dog died, so I broke Percy's neck because I "
"wanted to see how I'd feel.  I think I was sad for a little, but I kept "
"playing with him but I had to stop after too many pieces fell off and Percy "
"became gross.  I buried him in the park so mom and dad wouldn't find out, "
"but Mr. Luca and Mrs Annaliese saw me.  I'm scared they'll tell on me.  "
"Daddy thinks I don't know where he keeps the keys to his gun safe.\""
msgstr ""
"「今日の日記、今日はパーシーと公園に行った。犬が死んだら悲しいっていつもダニーが言ってたから、どんな気持ちになるかやってみようと思って、パーシーの首を折った。少し悲しかった気がするけど、ずっとパーシーで遊んでたらボロボロがたくさん落ちてなんだかグロくなったから止めた。パパとママに見つからないように公園に埋めたけど、ルカさんとアナリーゼさんに見られちゃった。バレたらどうしよう。パパはぼくが銃のたなのカギの隠し場所を知らないと思ってる。」"

#. ~ Snippet in category "note_child"
#. ~ The grammar and punctuation mistakes are there on purpose 9/10 times.
#. Keep in mind that those notes are supposed to be written by primary-school-
#. level children.
#: data/json/snippets/children_notes.json
msgid ""
"\"Dear diary.  Mommy and dad have been making us live in the basement for "
"the last few days.  It's to keep us safe, they say, but it gets really "
"stuffy during the night and I can't sleep, so I sometimes sneak upstairs.  "
"Sometimes I talk to Aunt Maria.  She always stays in the back yard and "
"appears when the sky goes all weird and when scary noises come from outside."
"  I always ask her to come in, but she tells me she can't and that I should "
"go out instead.  I think it's because dad doesn't want her around, he always"
" told me she died in 2001.  He's a liar, and I think he wants the monsters "
"to eat her.  The door's always locked, but I can reach the garage "
"controls.\""
msgstr ""
"「今日の日記、ママとパパに言われて何日か地下室で暮らしている。私たちの安全を守るためだって。夜中にとても暑くて眠れなくなるので、私はときどきこっそり二階に行く。そしてときどき、マリアおばさんと話をする。マリアおばさんはいつも裏庭にいて、天気がおかしくなったときや外で怖い音がしたときに来る。私はいつもおばさんに、中に入ってと言うけど、おばさんは、わたしは入れない、代りにあなたが外に出て、って言う。パパに嫌がられるからだと思う。パパはいつも、おばさんは2001年に死んだと言っていた。パパはうそをついて、おばさんをモンスターのエサにしようとしてるんだと思う。玄関はカギがかかってるけど、ガレージのスイッチには手が届く。」"

