msgstr "卒業生の横には若い女性が立っており、その顔には愛情と憧れの表情が浮かんでいます。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<grad_details>"
#. ~ These snippets are for graduation photos in hp_nested_2.  They are meant
#. to add a little fluff/additional information.
#: data/json/snippets/home_pictures.json
msgid ""
"A proud father stands with a hand on the shoulder of the recent graduate."
msgstr "その横では父親が、卒業生の肩に手を添えて誇らしげに立っています。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<grad_details>"
#. ~ These snippets are for graduation photos in hp_nested_2.  They are meant
#. to add a little fluff/additional information.
#: data/json/snippets/home_pictures.json
msgid ""
"Someone in the background holds a sign that reads \"No More Teachers' Dirty "
"Looks!\""
msgstr "背後に「先生の汚い面ともおさらば！」と書かれたプラカードを持った人が写り込んでいます。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<grad_details>"
#. ~ These snippets are for graduation photos in hp_nested_2.  They are meant
#. to add a little fluff/additional information.
#: data/json/snippets/home_pictures.json
msgid "A cap and tassel lie discarded in the grass."
msgstr "辺りの芝生には帽子と飾り房が散らばっています。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<grad_details>"
#. ~ These snippets are for graduation photos in hp_nested_2.  They are meant
#. to add a little fluff/additional information.
#: data/json/snippets/home_pictures.json
msgid ""
"The recent graduate isn't alone; a much younger sibling stands with their "
"face buried in the folds of the gown."
msgstr "よく見るともう一人写っています。年の離れた弟が、ガウンのひだに顔を埋めて足元に立っています。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<puzzle_desc>"
