#. ~ Snippet in category "mutant_kid_boss"
#: data/json/snippets/lab.json
msgid ""
"A faded crayon drawing on the backside of a random observational log.  Half "
"a dozen badly-proportioned black and white figures stand around what's "
"probably supposed to be a child lying on a table under an overhead light.  "
"The faces of the large figures are blank, but the child's eyes are wide "
"open."
msgstr ""
"何かしらの観察記録の裏にクレヨンで描かれた、色褪せた絵です。照明の下、テーブルの上に横たわる子供らしき人物の周囲に、奇妙な形状の人物が6人、モノクロで描かれています。6人の大人の顔には表情が描かれていませんが、子供の目は大きく見開かれています。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "mutant_kid_boss"
#: data/json/snippets/lab.json
msgid ""
"A faded crayon drawing on a page torn out from a notebook.  In it a small "
"figure is surrounded by three colorful monsters, each labeled with a name in"
" horrible handwriting."
msgstr ""
"切り取ったメモ帳に描かれた、色褪せたクレヨン画です。小柄な人間が3匹のカラフルなモンスターに囲まれています。モンスターにはおどろおどろしい文字でそれぞれの名前が書かれています。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "mutant_kid_boss"
#: data/json/snippets/lab.json
msgid ""
"Two black-and-white crayon drawings on a piece of cardboard.  The first "
"shows an adult figure leading a small animal away from a child.  On the "
"second, the child is sitting next to a larger, meaner-looking creature."
msgstr ""
"厚紙に黒いクレヨンだけで描かれた2枚の絵です。1枚目には、子供と小動物が大人によって引き離されている様子が、2枚目には、意地悪な顔をした巨大な生物の隣に座る子供が描かれています。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "mutant_kid_boss"
#: data/json/snippets/lab.json
msgid ""
"A faded crayon drawing on the back of a bureaucratic form.  It shows a small"
" child sitting on a chair surrounded by many adults.  Most of them are only "
"indistinct blobs of white and black, but a single figure stands out by being"
" lovingly colored - and labeled with a large \"T\"."
msgstr ""
"手続き用紙の裏面に描かれた、色褪せたクレヨン画です。椅子に座った小さな子供が、たくさんの大人たちに囲まれています。大人たちのほとんどは黒いクレヨンで曖昧に描かれていますが、ただ一人、大きく「T」と書かれた人物には、丁寧に色が塗ってあります。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "mutant_kid_boss"
#: data/json/snippets/lab.json
msgid ""
"A faded pencil drawing on a scrap of paper.  It shows a small child playing "
"with building blocks under the gaze of a security camera.  In the background"
" the fuzzy outlines of an adult are seen through a large window."
msgstr ""
"紙切れに鉛筆で描かれた、色褪せた絵です。小さな子供が積み木で遊んでいる様子を、監視カメラが見ています。その背後の大きな窓に、ぼんやりとした大人の輪郭だけが映っています。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "lab_postit_bio"
#: data/json/snippets/lab.json
msgid "Subject amortization too high.  Lower dosage?"
msgstr "被験体の消耗率が高すぎる。投与量を減らす？"

#. ~ Snippet in category "lab_postit_bio"
#: data/json/snippets/lab.json
msgid "Enrichment makes for better data.  Coloring book?"
msgstr "発展学習でデータの質を高める。塗り絵？"

#. ~ Snippet in category "lab_postit_bio"
#: data/json/snippets/lab.json
msgid "Reduce caloric intake.  Stress potentiates the process."
msgstr "カロリー摂取量を減らす。ストレスで過程を早める。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "lab_postit_bio"
#: data/json/snippets/lab.json
msgid "WHEN IN DOUBT, INCINERATE"
msgstr "困ったときは焼却処分"

#. ~ Snippet in category "lab_postit_bio"
#: data/json/snippets/lab.json
msgid "Requisition more subjects when half have been processed."
msgstr "過半数が処分されたら被験体の追加を要求"

#. ~ Snippet in category "lab_postit_bio"
#: data/json/snippets/lab.json
msgid "Droppings caustic, handle with care"
msgstr "糞は腐食性、取り扱い注意"

#. ~ Snippet in category "lab_postit_bio"
#: data/json/snippets/lab.json
msgid "DON'T remove from cage between 10-12 PM (it knows)"
msgstr "午後10時～12時はケージから出すな(気付かれるので)"

#. ~ Snippet in category "lab_postit_bio"
#: data/json/snippets/lab.json
msgid "Can walk on ceiling"
msgstr "天井歩行能力"

#. ~ Snippet in category "lab_postit_bio"
#: data/json/snippets/lab.json
msgid "More eggs, keeps eating them"
msgstr "食料の卵を追加"

#. ~ Snippet in category "lab_postit_bio"
#: data/json/snippets/lab.json
msgid "DON'T LICK"
msgstr "舐めるな危険"

#. ~ Snippet in category "lab_postit_blob"
#: data/json/snippets/lab.json
msgid "Dismember within 15 minutes"
msgstr "15分以内に分割"

#. ~ Snippet in category "lab_postit_blob"
#: data/json/snippets/lab.json
msgid "No weight difference - superpositional?"
msgstr "重量差なし - 重層化？"

#. ~ Snippet in category "lab_postit_blob"
#: data/json/snippets/lab.json
msgid "TODO: terminate subject within a week"
msgstr "やること: 1週間以内に問題を片付ける"

#. ~ Snippet in category "lab_postit_blob"
#: data/json/snippets/lab.json
msgid "Need more bodies - Mass General?"
msgstr "もっと死体が必要 - マサチューセッツ総合病院は？"

#. ~ Snippet in category "lab_postit_blob"
#: data/json/snippets/lab.json
msgid "Reinforce doors"
msgstr "ドアを補強する"

#. ~ Snippet in category "lab_postit_blob"
#: data/json/snippets/lab.json
msgid "Where does the energy come from?"
msgstr "このエネルギーはどこから来ている？"

#. ~ Snippet in category "lab_postit_blob"
#: data/json/snippets/lab.json
msgid "Anaerobic conditions without change in activity <-> temperature?!"
msgstr "<->度かつ無酸素状態でも活動量に変化なし！？"

#. ~ Snippet in category "lab_postit_blob"
#: data/json/snippets/lab.json
msgid "Ashes still contaminated"
msgstr "灰の汚染が残っている"

#. ~ Snippet in category "lab_postit_blob"
#: data/json/snippets/lab.json
msgid "Removed parts fuse preferentially to original host"
msgstr "除去された部位は元の宿主に優先的に融合する"

#. ~ Snippet in category "lab_postit_blob"
#: data/json/snippets/lab.json
msgid "Never dead"
msgstr "死なない"

#. ~ Snippet in category "lab_postit_migo"
#: data/json/snippets/lab.json
msgid "Don't listen"
msgstr "話を聞くな"

#. ~ Snippet in category "lab_postit_migo"
#: data/json/snippets/lab.json
msgid ""
"Damage -> Resin\n"
"Armor?\n"
"Blood?\n"
"Bribe?"
msgstr ""
"ダメージ -> 樹脂\n"
"装甲？\n"
"血液？\n"
"餌？"

#. ~ Snippet in category "lab_postit_migo"
#: data/json/snippets/lab.json
msgid "Stay quiet.  They can hear you."
msgstr "喋るな。声を聞かれる。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "lab_postit_migo"
#: data/json/snippets/lab.json
msgid ""
"Resin return: 0.45 on vegetable matter, 0.51 on meat, 0.66 on nonsedated "
"live meal (vertebrate preference)"
msgstr "樹脂回復: 植物性物質 - 0.45、動物性物質 - 0.51、非加熱の生体(主に脊椎動物) - 0.66"

#. ~ Snippet in category "lab_postit_migo"
#: data/json/snippets/lab.json
msgid "How can they see me up here?"
msgstr "どうやって見ている？"

#. ~ Snippet in category "lab_postit_migo"
#: data/json/snippets/lab.json
msgid "Only post-mortems on the big ones from now on -- equipment's expensive"
msgstr "今後の検死は大物のみ -- 機材コストが高すぎる"

#. ~ Snippet in category "lab_postit_migo"
#: data/json/snippets/lab.json
msgid "Dim lights before feeding for lightshow"
msgstr "給餌前に照明を落としておく"

#. ~ Snippet in category "lab_postit_migo"
#: data/json/snippets/lab.json
msgid ""
"Prefers prey capable of vocalization -- implanted speakers work but no "
"repeats"
msgstr "声を出す獲物を好む -- 埋め込み型スピーカーは使える、繰り返しは不可"

#. ~ Snippet in category "lab_postit_migo"
#: data/json/snippets/lab.json
msgid "Blast with white noise as a deterrent?"
msgstr "ホワイトノイズの爆音で抑止？"

#. ~ Snippet in category "lab_postit_migo"
#: data/json/snippets/lab.json
msgid "Likes it warm, not bothered by cold"
msgstr "温暖を好む、寒冷は苦手"

#. ~ Snippet in category "lab_postit_portal"
#: data/json/snippets/lab.json
msgid "Increase frequencies in odd steps - local discontinuity!"
msgstr "変則的な段階を踏んで周波数を上げる - 局所的な不連続性！"

#. ~ Snippet in category "lab_postit_portal"
#: data/json/snippets/lab.json
msgid "Limit time spent in-phase to 29.1 minutes"
msgstr "次元内滞在時間を29.1分に制限"

#. ~ Snippet in category "lab_postit_portal"
#: data/json/snippets/lab.json
msgid "Sub-plane 117RA likes prime-numbered calibration pings"
msgstr "副次元117RAのキャリブレーションpingは素数か"

#. ~ Snippet in category "lab_postit_portal"
#: data/json/snippets/lab.json
msgid "First the candle, then the blood, NOT THE OTHER WAY AROUND"
msgstr "最初にロウソク、次が血、絶対に逆にしないこと"

#. ~ Snippet in category "lab_postit_portal"
#: data/json/snippets/lab.json
msgid "Remember Jake?  Me neither."
msgstr "ジェイクを覚えてる？まさかね"

#. ~ Snippet in category "lab_postit_portal"
#: data/json/snippets/lab.json
msgid "Keep line of sight minimal"
msgstr "なるべく見るな"

#. ~ Snippet in category "lab_postit_portal"
#: data/json/snippets/lab.json
msgid "Calibrate on 013TQ for manned transfers"
msgstr "013TQで有人転移のキャリブレーション"

#. ~ Snippet in category "lab_postit_portal"
#: data/json/snippets/lab.json
msgid "No touching returning probes, even if they beg you to"
msgstr "懇願されたとしても、帰還した調査隊には絶対に触らない"

#. ~ Snippet in category "lab_postit_portal"
#: data/json/snippets/lab.json
msgid "Remember to forget.  Forget to remember."
msgstr "絶対に忘れろ。絶対に思い出すな。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "lab_postit_portal"
#: data/json/snippets/lab.json
msgid "Scream at Maintenance for a replacement again"
msgstr "整備担当に再交換するよう抗議しておく"

#. ~ Snippet in category "lab_postit_tech"
#: data/json/snippets/lab.json
