"In your dream, you lie on an operating table, surrounded by doctors.  They "
"remove something from your body, then start yelling and screaming as the "
"thing they've cut out of you begins to tear them apart.  You find yourself "
"unable to move or even scream as it finishes with the doctors and comes for "
"you…"
msgstr ""
"複数の医師に囲まれて手術台に横たわる夢を見ました。肉体から切除された何かが、叫ぶ医師たちを襲い、引き裂いています。それは医師を全員黙らせ、こちらへやってきますが、動くことも、叫ぶこともできません..."

