msgstr "装備している武器が手を感電させました！"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<schizo_weapon_drop>"
#. ~ In the future, it would be preferable for the snippet to use the object's
#. name, instead of "Your weapon"
#: data/json/snippets/schizophrenia.json
msgid "Your weapon was working for… THEM"
msgstr "装備している武器は、「奴ら」のために動いています..."

#. ~ Snippet in category "<schizo_weapon_drop>"
#. ~ In the future, it would be preferable for the snippet to use the object's
#. name, instead of "Your weapon"
#: data/json/snippets/schizophrenia.json
msgid "Your weapon is running away!"
msgstr "装備している武器が逃げ出そうとしました！"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<schizo_weapon_drop>"
#. ~ In the future, it would be preferable for the snippet to use the object's
#. name, instead of "Your weapon"
#: data/json/snippets/schizophrenia.json
msgid "Your weapon is a dirty traitor!"
msgstr "装備している武器は薄汚い裏切り者です！"

