#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
msgid "\"WE WERE RIGHT THE GOVERNMENT DID IT\""
msgstr "「我々が正しかった。政府はやり遂げた」"

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
msgid ""
"\"Have seen a zombie making its kin raise even despite damage that normally "
"would take them down, the surrounding air shimmered like around that hole in"
" the air we've seen creatures coming through back home\""
msgstr ""
"「普通なら動かなくなるほどのダメージを負ったゾンビを復活させるゾンビを見た。復活しつつあるゾンビも似たような感じだったが、そいつの周囲の空気は揺らめいていた」"

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
msgid "\"I shot the sheriff; but I couldn't find the deputy\""
msgstr "「俺は保安官を撃った。だけど助手は見つからない」"

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
msgid ""
"\"Some plant vines started chasin after me, so I took a gas mask and some "
"teargas and I ran through them.\""
msgstr "「後ろから追いかけてくる蔓がいたから、ガスマスクと催涙ガスを持ってきて、それを使って逃げてきた」"

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
msgid "\"Slingshot right through the windshield k?\""
msgstr "「フロントガラス越しにスリングショットを使え、いいな？」"

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
msgid ""
"\"When I was a kid I used to slingshot at bugs and birds.  Its really "
"playing off nowadays, Ill tell you what\""
msgstr "「子供の頃はスリングショットで虫や鳥を撃っていた。この災難が、今こそ試合の本番がやってきたって教えてくれたよ」"

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
msgid ""
"\"ALL YOU STONERS WITH YOUR VIDEYA GAMES - I BET YOU WISH YOU TOOK THE TIME "
"TO LEARN A SKILL NOW DONTYA\""
msgstr "「ゲームの中ではみんな殺人鬼になれる。今はただスキルを学ぶ時間が欲しい、そう思ってるんだろ」"

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
msgid "\"I tried to be a bard, but the rats didn't like my piping.\""
msgstr "「吟遊詩人を目指してみたが、どうやらネズミは私の笛が気に入らないらしい」"

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
msgid ""
"\"I found a chocolate bar on my pillow when I got home last night.  I left "
"and don't wanna go back.\""
msgstr "「昨晩家に帰ってきたら、枕元にチョコレートバーが置いてあった。すぐに家を出た。二度と戻りたくない」"

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
msgid ""
"\"this demon thing came after me  it got me good  i shot it but i dont know "
"if ill make it\""
msgstr "「恐ろしい奴が追いかけてきたちくしょう撃ってはみたが倒せたのかわからない」"

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
msgid ""
"\"DANNY IF YOU READ THIS THIS IS CLARA WE'RE ALL OKAY AND WE'RE HEADING TO "
"THE RIVER.  A BOAT SAID THEY WERE DOCKED NEARBY.\""
msgstr "「ダニー、もしこれを読んでいるなら私たちはみんな無事で川へ向かっている。ボートを見るに、奴らは近くのドックに停まっていたようだ」"

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
msgid ""
"\"When I think of all the dead people I get mad, because I was supposed to "
"be the next big leader.  WHERES MY CHANCE!??\""
msgstr "「あの死人どもの事を考えると頭に来る。次代の有力な指揮官は俺のはずだったのに、次のチャンスはどこだ！？？」"

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
msgid "\"A man in a black robe came up to me, said he wanted to make a deal…\""
msgstr "「黒いローブの男がやってきて、契約せよとか言いだした...」"

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
msgid ""
"\"Cha-cha-cha-chia!  Saw a woman today, with fungus coming out her head like"
" hair tendrils.\""
msgstr "「チャ、チャ、チャ、チア！今日見かけた女、真菌が頭から飛び出てパーマみたいになってやんの」"

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
msgid ""
"\"The damn Autodoc overrides wouldn't work and I didn't have my hospital ID."
"  I couldn't save them alone.\""
msgstr "「忌々しいオートドクはプログラムの上書きもできないし、病院のIDカードも手元にない。一人では安全も確保できない」"

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"\"Gotta slow down, man.  I don't think we spend more than 20% of our time "
"fightin',  Put some Marley on and take off that racketus tripcore nonsense, "
"man.\""
msgstr ""
"「いったん立ち止まろうよ。20パーセント以上の時間を戦いに費やしたくはない。ハッパをやって騒いだりトリップしたり無意味なことをして休もうよ」"

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
msgid "\"I kept shooting with my handgun, but I never got any better!\""
msgstr "「ハンドガンを撃ち続けているが、状況が一向に良くならない！」"

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
msgid ""
"\"ITS OKEY GUYS!  I BARRYED A TIME CAPSUL IN MY BACKYARD!  I PUT IN SOME "
"HOEHOES.\""
msgstr "「やぁお前ら！裏庭にタイムカプセルを埋めたぞ！かなり深くに埋めてある」"

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
msgid ""
"\"I got my tinfoil hat on.  Good thing too, cause this monster was starrin "
"at me kinda funny, trying to freeze my mind in place.\""
msgstr "「アルミ箔帽をかぶってみた。幸運にも、この怪物はおかしな様子でこちらをじっと見つめているだけだ。私を驚かそうとしているらしい」"

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
msgid "\"You want my advice?  Smoke crack, it gets shit done.\""
msgstr "「アドバイスが欲しい？クラックをキメて、さっさと仕事をやっつけよう」"

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
msgid ""
"\"ALWAYS WITH THE EFFICIENCY GUYS; YOU'RE ALWAYS WORKING TO GO HOME TO PAY "
"RENT TO SLEEP TO WAKE UP TO WORK AGAIN.  STOP\""
msgstr ""
"「常に効率を求める者へ。君たちはいつでも家に帰るために働き家賃を払うために家に帰り眠るために家賃を払い起きるために眠り働くために起き続ける。もう止めよう」"

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
msgid "\"IM OFF TO THUNDERDOME, BYE SUCKERS.\""
msgstr "「サンダードームを去る、さらばクソども」"

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
msgid ""
"\"If you get a parasite, take some sand and some vodka.  Rub the sand into "
"the afflicted area, real good too; like you're washing your hair.  Then "
"rinse with vodka.\""
msgstr "「寄生虫にやられたら、砂とウォッカを飲みなさい。ちょうどシャンプーのように砂が患部を洗うのでとてもよく効く。ウォッカはリンスだ」"

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
msgid ""
"\"I put my toilet water into a gastank.  Then I poured it into a glass cup."
"  Then I drank it without vomiting my insides back into the toilet.\""
msgstr "「ガソリンタンクに貯めておいたトイレの水をグラスに注いだ。水にガソリンが混じってトイレにゲロする、なんてことはなく普通に飲み干せた」"

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
msgid ""
"\"This isn't real this is a test to turn you into a Manchurian Candidate!\""
msgstr "「これは現実ではなくあなたをスパイに仕立て上げるテストだ」"

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
msgid ""
"\"They're all hiding on an oil rig, I heard it myself over the AM airwaves."
"  They think they're the nobles of the 21st century, the prigs.\""
msgstr "「石油プラットフォームに隠れている集団がいる。中波放送で確かにそう聞いた。きっと21世紀の貴族、うぬぼれ屋どもだ」"

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
msgid ""
"\"Some of 'em are big.  Real big.  Don't stick around, I saw my mate get "
"fucking torn in half!\""
msgstr "「奴はクソデカい。マジでクソデカい。仲間がクソ真っ二つに引き裂かれたのを見ちまった。クソが」"

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
msgid "\"po p y fl ow er s don t ea at them\""
msgstr "「ケ...の花...食べ......危険だ」"

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
msgid ""
"\"Some guy is walking through the horde without a scratch.  Please tell me "
"they're docile now.  Please fucking tell me.\""
msgstr "「群れの傍を無傷で通り抜けた男を見た。奴らをおとなしくする方法を教えてくれ。頼むから教えてくれ」"

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
msgid "\"Why are all the lawnmowers broken?!\""
msgstr "「どうしてあちこちの芝刈り機が壊されているんだ！？」"

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
msgid ""
"\"Some bridges, they're right next to each other, right?  If you see "
"something up ahead one of those, just careen through to the other side.  My "
"van was long enough to bridge right across!\""
msgstr ""
"「たまに、途中で途切れている橋があるだろ？橋の先が見えるぐらいの近さだったら、思い切ってかっ飛ばして通ってみるんだ。私のバンは途切れた橋を渡れるぐらい長かったよ！」"

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
msgid "\"BURN BURN BURN BURN BURN ALL BURN ALL BURN ALL BURN\""
msgstr "「燃える、燃える、全て燃える、燃える、燃える、全ては燃える」"

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
msgid ""
"\"I took all the supplies.  Don't follow me.  I'm sorry, man.  I have to "
"look out for myself now.\""
msgstr "「食べ物は全て貰って行く。追って来るな。悪いね、君。私は自分が一番大切なんだ」"

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
msgid "\"My next-door neighbor had a katana in his basement!\""
msgstr "「なんて幸運だ！隣人が地下室に刀を隠していたなんて！」"

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
msgid "\"Am I the last one alive?\""
msgstr "「わたし以外はみんなしんだの？」"

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
msgid ""
"\"Boyfriend stole my pistol while I was asleep.  I locked him in the "
"bathroom and set the house on fire.  At least he attracted their "
"attention.\""
msgstr "「私が寝ている間に彼は私のピストルを盗んだ。 私は彼を浴室に閉じ込めて、家に火をつけた。彼は時間稼ぎとして私の役に立てた」"

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
msgid "\"I get air conditioners, but… this whole place is frozen to ice!\""
msgstr "「エアコンを手に入れた、けど...ここは何もかも氷漬けだ！」"

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
msgid ""
"\"A wood ax works pretty well against them.  So does a machete, but you "
"can't cut down a tree.\""
msgstr "「斧は使いづらい。だからマチェットを使う。しかしマチェットでは木を切れない」"

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
msgid ""
"\"Why would you hide in a farm?  Sure, it's isolated, but if they know where"
" you are, you don't exactly have cover on all sides.\""
msgstr "「どうして農場に隠れない？確かに孤立した場所だ。だがそれはお前らが集まらないからだ。お前らが集まれば全方位をカバーできるんだ」"

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
msgid "\"Imagine if this spread to, like, Australia.  Zombie kangaroos.  Haha…\""
msgstr "「想像が膨らむよな。例えば、オーストラリアには、ゾンビカンガルーとか、ハハハ...」"

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
msgid ""
"\"I tried playing memorial music for my dead brother, on a radio.  They must"
" have been attracted to it.  I can't see his grave through the crowd "
"anymore.\""
msgstr ""
"「私はラジオで死んだ兄弟を悼む曲を流したのです。するとおそらく音楽に惹きつけられたのでしょう。彼の墓は集まった群衆達によって取り囲まれ、もう見えなくなってしまいました」"

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
msgid ""
"\"Took a picture of a dead dog leaping right onto a soldier.  Sweet fucking "
"shot!\""
msgstr "「兵士に飛びかかる瞬間のゾンビ犬の写真が撮れたぜ。超ベストショット！」"

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
msgid "\"Gas mask is nice and all, but I can hardly run with it on.\""
msgstr "「ガスマスクは優秀。しかし付けたまま走るのは難しい」"

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
msgid ""
"\"They set up the roadblock guns to run automatically.  TV said those fuckin"
" things needed a human to keep em safe, they ain't safe now.\""
msgstr "「封鎖された道路のタレットは自動で射撃するよう設定されている。テレビでは人間の安全を守るために必要な措置と言っていたが、全然安全じゃない」"

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
msgid ""
"\"The evac shelters are a death trap.  They took everyone else away but "
"something in the driver's eyes told me not to go.  Now it's just me.\""
msgstr "「避難シェルターは死の罠だ。皆は車で連れていかれたが、運転手の目は乗るなと訴えていた。今ここには私しかいない」"

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
msgid ""
"\"I made mushroom babies.  My arms hurt.  I hurt.  I had mushroom babies.  "
"They are growing now.\""
msgstr "「私にきのこの赤ちゃんができました。腕が痛い。痛い。きのこの赤ちゃん。すくすくそだつ」"

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
msgid "\"It doesn't matter how you die.  You're gonna turn into one of them.\""
msgstr "「どいつがどのように死ぬかなんてどうでもいい。どうせ死体の一つになるだけだ」"

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
msgid "\"WHY DO ALL THE DEAD CHILDREN GO TO SCHOOL\""
msgstr "「なぜ学校の子供達が全滅していたんだ」"

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
msgid "\"Don't keep your goddamn casings!  They'll just weigh you down.\""
msgstr "「空薬莢はさっさと捨てよう！あんなの重荷にしかならない」"

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
msgid ""
"\"Local auto shop is full of the things.  And to think I worked with them on"
" repairing cars… now they're just… fucking corpses.\""
msgstr "「地元の自動車整備工場なら物資がたくさんある。ついでに車の修理も手伝ってもらおうと思っていたが...着いてみたら...死体しかなかった」"

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
msgid "\"DON'T EAT THE SLIME DON'T EAT THE SLIME DON'T EAT THE SLIME\""
msgstr "「粘液は食べるな 粘液は食べるな 粘液は食べるな」"

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
msgid ""
"\"I used to be human.  But… my arms… they are like tentacles.  I slither "
"along akin to a snail and I shed my feathers every day.\""
msgstr "「私は人間だった。でも...私の腕は...触手になった。カタツムリのように這って動くし、羽毛が毎日生え変わる」"

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
msgid ""
"\"Killed a giant worm thing, but now I'm only three feet tall.  Should've "
"just left the damn worm alone, now none of my clothes fit!\""
msgstr ""
"「気味の悪いニョロニョロしたものと戦っていたら、身長が90cmまで縮んでしまった。あんな忌々しい化け物は放っておけばよかった。どの服もサイズがブカブカだ！」"

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
msgid "\"I don't have enough time to double tap.  You don't either.\""
msgstr "「もうとどめを刺す余裕がない。お前もそうだろ？」"

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
msgid "\"PINK TALL ONES RUN RUN RUN RUN RUN\""
msgstr "「ピンクのおおきななにか。にげろにげろにげろ」"

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
msgid "\"Are they still human inside?\""
msgstr "「あいつらはまだ人間？」"

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
msgid "\"the eye it watches me it follows me everywhere help\""
msgstr "「その目はいつでも私を見ていて、いつでも私についてきて、どこでも助けてくれる」"

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
msgid "\"tHE Portal it's so COld\""
msgstr "「ポぉタルちョぅつめたぃ」"

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
msgid "\"GOD CAN'T SAVE US\""
msgstr "「神は我らを見捨てたもう」"

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
msgid "\"SHOOT YOURSELF, LET IT END QUICKLY\""
msgstr "「自分自身を撃て。それで全てが終わる」"

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
msgid ""
"\"There are five basic rules to survival.  One, stay prepared and watchful."
"  Two, keep your iron sights lined up or succumb.  Three, stay FAR WAY from "
"all\""
msgstr ""
"「サバイバルには基本的なルールが5つある。一つ、見晴らしの良い場所を確保しろ。二つ、アイアンサイトを持て。無理なら死ね。三つ、全てから距離を取れ。無理なら」"

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
msgid ""
"\"The bricks of this bathroom look like a face.  Haha… it's all I can focus "
"on.  At least let me shit before you break down the door.  Please…\""
msgstr "「バスルームの煉瓦が顔に見える。ハハ... それ以外何も見えない。ドアが壊される前に糞を出しきれるといいな。頼むよ...」"

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
msgid "\"What the hell are they mining for in these shafts?\""
msgstr "「一体全体、この坑道はなんのために掘られたんだ？」"

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
msgid "\"I am one with the plants.\""
msgstr "「私は植物と一体化している」"

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
msgid "\"Broadsword!  Yeah!\""
msgstr "「ブロードソードをゲット！よっしゃ！」"

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
msgid ""
"\"If you see a trail of dirt getting displaced in your direction… run.  Run "
"for your life.\""
msgstr "「もしも汚いものが這った痕を見つけたら...全力で逃げ。命が惜しければすぐに逃げて」"

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
msgid "\"DINT ATE THE MUSHROM\""
msgstr "「きのこはたべるな」"

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
msgid "\"Libraries are useless after the apocalypse.\""
msgstr "「図書館なんて大変動が起きてからは無用の長物だな」"

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
msgid ""
"\"I swear to God I've seen these plant things before!  In a book, or "
"something!  I swear…\""
msgstr "「おお神よ、私はあの植物を知っています！本か何かで！間違いない...」"

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
msgid "\"Is robbing a bank easier or harder now that all the guards are undead?\""
msgstr "「警備員共がゾンビになってやがる今、銀行強盗は簡単になったのか難しくなったのか...どっちなんだ？」"

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
msgid "\"Make sure your car is REALLY stopped before you get out.\""
msgstr "「降りる前に車が間違いなく止まっているかどうかを確認しろ」"

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
msgid ""
"\"I found some kind of stone pyramid with spikes.  I feel… I feel like I'm "
"being watched.\""
msgstr "「トゲが生えたピラミッド型の石を見つけた。なんだか...誰かに見られてるような気がする」"

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
msgid ""
"\"Why would you ever hide in a damn gun store?  The owner… he was a moron "
"alright.\""
msgstr "「どうしてこんな銃砲店に隠れちまったんだ？ひとつ言えるのは...店主はクソ忌々しいことに無事だろうってことだ」"

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
msgid "\"THEY DON'T feel ANYTHING\""
msgstr "「あいつらはなにも感じない」"

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
msgid "\"What was the government doing, anyway?\""
msgstr "「政府は一体何をやらかしたんだ？」"

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
msgid ""
"\"Is that one pharmaceutical company gonna come out with a, like, cure for "
"this anytime soon?\""
msgstr "「製薬会社は治療薬をすぐに開発してくれるんでしょうか？」"

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
msgid "\"THE MARLEY WAS RIGHT\""
msgstr "「ボブ・マーリー最高」"

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
msgid ""
"\"Squeeze some ammonia into zombie flesh and hold it tight.  You smell like "
"one of them!  I think.\""
msgstr "「汚染肉にアンモニアを加えて揉み込むとゾンビの匂いの出来上がり。コレを使えば...」"

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
msgid ""
"\"I thought my damn terminal cancer was bad enough… now the dead are "
"rising?!\""
msgstr "「末期癌が見つかるなんて最悪の事態だと思っていたけど...今度は死者が生き返っただって！？」"

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
msgid "\"THE GOO IS IN THE WATER DON'T DRINK WATER\""
msgstr "「妙なものが水に混じっている。水は飲むな」"

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
msgid ""
"\"Don't let the ember go out please don't go out I need you precious fire.\""
msgstr "「火口は切らすな、いいか絶対外に切らすなよ、火は貴重なんだ」"

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
msgid ""
"\"Everyone used their gas to get to another town… but it's the same story "
"everywhere.\""
msgstr "「誰もが別の街に逃げようと車で走り去った、だがどこの街でも同じ事が起きたと聞く」"

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
msgid "\"There's still an evacuation point at Concord, spread the word.\""
msgstr "「コンコードにはまだ避難場所がある、拡散希望」"

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
msgid "\"STAY AWAY FROM CONCORD\""
msgstr "「コンコードから離れろ」"

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
msgid ""
"\"Most things can be taken out with a shotgun.  More things can be taken out"
" with a grenade.  Imagine what a mini-nuke does.\""
msgstr "「ほとんどの人は散弾銃を手にした。さらに手榴弾を手にした人もいた。では、小型核爆弾はどうだろう」"

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
msgid ""
"\"Come to the bar if you see this, let's re-enact a zombie movie, friends.\""
msgstr "「これを見たらバーに来てくれ。ゾンビ映画を再現しようぜ、友よ」"

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
msgid "\"They are NOT slow!  They are NEVER slow!\""
msgstr "「奴らはノロくない！奴らはノロくならない！」"

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
msgid "\"I had a phobia of bees BEFORE they grew to enormous sizes.\""
msgstr "「ハチ恐怖症だったけど、ハチが巨大化したら克服できた」"

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
msgid ""
"\"Your backpack's gonna weigh you down in the water.  Hell, feel free to get"
" naked.  Nobody's going to judge your modesty.\""
msgstr "「バックパックは水に沈む。泳ぐなら裸になれ。もはや慎み深さを問う人間などいない」"

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
msgid "\"Guns too loud.  Crossbow too long.  Running is best.\""
msgstr "「銃はうるさい。クロスボウは時間が掛かる。逃げるが勝ちだ」"

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
#, no-c-format
msgid "\"99.9% dead?  I'd like to see a million zombies on Wall Street.\""
msgstr "「99.9%が死んだ？ウォール街を埋め尽くす１００万体のゾンビが見られるかな」"

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
msgid "\"Crawled in through the vents.  Whole office building is infested.\""
msgstr "「通気口を介して感染しているようだ。オフィスビルは駄目だな」"

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
msgid ""
"\"Don't shoot the people who get bit!  It's OK!  Death is the only thing "
"that makes you turn!\""
msgstr "「死にかけの奴に銃を使うな！殺しさえすればこっちのもんだ！」"

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
msgid ""
"\"Check your friends for bites, don't let them hide it and turn on you.  "
"Only way out is to shoot em in the head.\""
msgstr "「友人に咬まれた跡がないか調べるんだ。隠したり、振り向いたりされないように。もしそうなったら、頭を撃ち抜くしかない」"

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
msgid ""
"\"Zombies, walkers, dead ones, undead, reanimated, zed, animata, biters.  "
"Did I miss any?\""
msgstr "「ゾンビ、彷徨う死体、不死者、アンデッド、復活者、Z、グール、ナイトウォーカー。他に何か名前はあったっけ？」"

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
msgid ""
"\"All I've got is this keg of beer and an appetite.  Come at me, "
"apocalypse!\""
msgstr "「持っているのは樽いっぱいのビールと食欲だけだ。さあ来い災厄！」"

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
msgid ""
"\"My cousin says that murder nowadays is just a war crime.  War for what, I "
"don't know, since the undead seem to be rebels without a cause.\""
msgstr "「こんな状況じゃ殺人も戦争犯罪だな、従兄がそう言っていた。不死者どもは理由もなく襲い掛かってくる。これは何のための戦争なんだ。」"

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
msgid "\"SWAMPS RUN SWAMPS NO SWAMPS RUN\""
msgstr "「沼　逃げろ 沼は嫌 沼　逃げろ」"

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
msgid ""
"\"They said a walking cane was a useless weapon… but then I hit one of them "
"with it.\""
msgstr "「人々はステッキなど武器にならないと言った。しかし今、私はそれで敵を打ち倒している」"

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
msgid ""
"\"River water around these parts is extremely safe.  Probably more safe than"
" the damn tap water at this point.\""
msgstr "「川の水はおそらく安全です。あの忌々しい水道水よりは」"

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
msgid "\"DON't bomB THe PORtals it MAKES iT WORSE\""
msgstr "「ポータルを爆撃するな状況が悪化するだけ」"

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
msgid ""
"\"No wonder all the camps got overrun, they kept a goddamn zombie test "
"subject!  Each and every one of 'em!\""
msgstr "「キャンプがゾンビで溢れてるのはそこで実験をしていたからだったなんて！そりゃゾンビの巣窟にもなるわ！」"

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
msgid "\"I just realized how damn demented those fliers are.\""
msgstr "「ようやく気付いた。チラシにはとんでもなくイカレた事が書いてある」"

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
msgid "\"I propose a new currency: 9mm.\""
msgstr "「私は新しい通貨の制定を提案する。9mm弾だ」"

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
msgid "\"My skin is crawling and I teleport every few minutes… what is going o\""
msgstr "「肌がむずむずして数分おきにテレポートしている...何が起こ」"

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
msgid "\"You can't see them through the smoke but they can't either.\""
msgstr "「煙の向こうは見えないが、向こうからもこちらが見えない」"

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
msgid "\"There's gotta be a better use of all this rebar…\""
msgstr "「鉄筋を有効に活用する方法があるはずだ...」"

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
msgid ""
"\"met schoolhouse of people, all crazy and mad they were, ate killed all of "
"them, yum\""
msgstr "「校舎で会った人たちは頭がイカレていたのでみんな殺して食べた。おいしいね」"

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
msgid "\"STAY AWAY FROM THE BIG ONES IN THE FOREST\""
msgstr "「森にはデカイのがいるから近付くんじゃねぇぞ」"

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
msgid ""
"\"got into a prison with a halligan bar.  makes me wonder how they kept "
"prisoners inside\""
msgstr "「刑務所でハリガンバールを見つけた。囚人の脱走を防ぐ方策について思いを馳せる」"

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
msgid ""
"\"This thing isn't a car any more.  It's just a fucking mountain of metal on"
" wheels, which I live in.\""
msgstr "「これはもう車じゃない。車輪の上にくず鉄製の家が乗ってるだけだ。」"

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
msgid ""
"\"Anyone else seen those really… SQUARE-looking towns?  I don't think "
"they're normal.\""
msgstr "「誰か他に...正方形の街を見た者はいないのか？あれは狂っている」"

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
msgid ""
"\"big z threw me on top of the building, legs broken but at least im safe "
"for a few more minutes\""
msgstr "「巨大なゾンビが私を建物の上まで投げ飛ばした。脚は折れたが、少なくともあと数分は安全だ」"

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
msgid ""
"\"I'm starting to feel bad about disabling all these turrets and stealing "
"their ammunition.\""
msgstr "「全てのタレットの電源を切って弾薬を盗んだのはマズかったかな」"

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
msgid ""
"\"Make sure you strip the house for all available resources-- tubes, pipes, "
"ceramics, sheets, strings, and more\""
msgstr "「利用できるすべての資源を確保しろ--ゴムホース、パイプ、セラミック、シーツ、糸、他」"

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
msgid "\"FUCK FAUX-MUTANTS, BEING 'EXTREMELY THIRSTY' DOES NOT COUNT\""
msgstr "「変異原っぽい物質のくそったれ、『瞬間乾燥』なんていらねぇ」"

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
msgid ""
"\"There's nothing wrong with eating people if you HAVE to.  I mean, I only "
"did it because I didn't want to waste my potato chips!\""
msgstr ""
"「そうしなければならない理由があるなら人間を食べるのは何も間違っていない。ポテトチップスを食べるのがもったいないと言うのは正当な理由だと思うよ！」"

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
msgid "\"CHINA DID THIS\""
msgstr "「これは中国の仕業」"

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
msgid "\"RUSSIA DID THIS\""
msgstr "「これはロシアの仕業」"

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
msgid ""
"\"Thank You RivTech.  Thank You For Good Coffee.  Will Always Stay Awake For"
" You Rivtech.\""
msgstr "「ありがとうRivTech社。美味しいコーヒーをありがとう。Rivtech社のために生き続けます」"

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
msgid "\"dont try to leave they will shoot you\""
msgstr "「こちらを発砲しそうな相手は生かして返すな」"

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
msgid "\"Makayla Sanchez burned down my fucking house\""
msgstr "「マケイラ・サンチェスが自宅を燃やしやがった」"

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
msgid "\"he calls himself the 'man with the hands', don't approach\""
msgstr "「あいつは『管理者』を自称している。あいつに近づくな」"

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
msgid ""
"\"So… what happens if the military rescues us?  We're all freaks by now, "
"right?  How the fuck are we gonna go back to real life?\""
msgstr "「それで...軍に救助されたとして、それからどうなる？みんな頭がおかしくなってる、そうだろ？どうやって普通の生活に戻れっていうんだ？」"

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
msgid ""
"\"Not sure if my companion WANTED to turn into a bird, but I was the one "
"giving her the serum, and I saved her life!  That's fair, right?\""
msgstr "「私の友達が鳥に変身したがっていたかどうかは知らない。でも、私は彼女に薬液を注射して命を救ってあげた！間違ってないよね？」"

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
msgid "\"I've never been very confident, is that why my shots keep missing?\""
msgstr "「こんなに不安になったことは無い、どうしてショットガンをいつまでたっても見つけられないんだろう？」"

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
msgid "\"FIRE BAD.  NOW NAKED.  PLEASE HELP.\""
msgstr "「火はまずい。素っ裸なんだ。誰か助けて」"

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
msgid ""
"\"Heard of a place up in Maine where people have their shit together.  "
"Hundreds of people, defense, food and shelter… let's go raid it, guys!\""
msgstr "「メーン州の方で生き残った者が集まってなんとかやっていると聞いた。たくさんの人、防衛施設、食料と避難所...よし、皆で襲いに行こう！」"

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
msgid "\"KASHWAK: NO-FO\""
msgstr "「カシュワク＝圏外」"

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
msgid ""
"\"The whispering fog is taking me in like a blanket.  I'm warm now.  I'm "
"finally\""
msgstr "「ささやく霧が毛布のように私を包む。暖かい。これで終わりだ」"

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
msgid ""
"\"got a video recording of hour one when the portals were still up.  pretty "
"cool\""
msgstr "「ポータルがまだ起動している間に、１時間ほど録画しておいたんだ。これはすごいぞ」"

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
msgid ""
"\"Stuck here.  Zombies outside.  Friends were outside too, now they're part "
"of zombies.  Need to be quiet\""
msgstr "「立ち往生だ。ゾンビ共が外にいる。友達も外にいたが今や奴らの仲間だ。静かにしていないと」"

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
msgid ""
"\"if anyones reading this, please tell my mom i was right about insects "
"being superior\""
msgstr "「だれかこれをよんでいる人がいるなら、おかあさんに、虫がふえてるって話はほんとうだったでしょって伝えてください」"

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
msgid ""
"\"Diamond coated sword!  Diamond coated hammer!  Diamond coated clothes!  "
"Diamond coated hands help\""
msgstr "「ダイヤモンドコーティングソード！ダイヤモンドコーティングハンマー！ダイヤモンドコーティング布！ ダイヤモンドコーティングは皆の味方」"

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
msgid "\"waded through 14 miles of sewage for playboy magazine, wasn't worth it\""
msgstr "「下水道を14マイルも歩いて見つけたのはプレイボーイだけ、骨折り損だ」"

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
msgid ""
"\"I'm coming back for this note in twelve hours.  If I don't, take all my "
"shit!\""
msgstr "「12時間後にこのメモの所へ戻ってくる。戻れなかったらここの物は全部やるよ！」"

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
msgid ""
"\"all my friends died when they came near me.  there's nothing funny about "
"that\""
msgstr "「友達が近づいてきたと思ったら全員死人だった。つまらない話だ」"

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
msgid "\"DOG NOT REAL DOG\""
msgstr "「その犬は偽者だ」"

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
msgid ""
"\"This is all just a dream, right??!  I'M GOING TO WAKE UP, SHE'S GOING TO "
"BE OK\""
msgstr "「これはただの夢、そうだろ？？！僕が目覚めたら、彼女も無事、そうだよな」"

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
msgid "\"wek ik spak\""
msgstr "「ウェック・イック・スパック」"

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
msgid "\"IT'S BURIED!  THE TEMPLE IS BURIED!\""
msgstr "「埋まってる！神殿が埋まってる！」"

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
msgid ""
"\"If I had a dollar for every cash card I've found, I'd have more money than"
" is on these stupid things!\""
msgstr "「今までに拾った全部のキャッシュカードがドル紙幣だったら、こんなゴミ束よりずっと価値があったのにな！」"

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
msgid ""
"\"can never have enough Kevlar.  basically just live in a Kevlar turtle "
"shell.\""
msgstr "「どうしてもケブラーが足りない。要するにケブラー亀の甲羅の中に住みたい」"

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
msgid "\"MY GLITTERING SNAKE COMPELS YOU!  OBEY!\""
msgstr "「俺のきらめくヘビが怖いだろう！従え！」"

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
msgid ""
"\"can sunstasin self frorever off fof my funggnaloid babiues oout fo yme "
"arms eat themm up eatbtb my chidlldren\""
msgstr "「えいえんにいきられるわたしのきのこあかちゃんうまれたわたしのうでたべてわたしのこどもたべて」"

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
msgid ""
"\"Gonna settle down one day.  Nice big orchard, couple of friends/future "
"family to spend time with, and a nice system of fortifications to keep us "
"safe.\""
msgstr "「いつかは落ち着いて暮らしたい。素敵な広い果樹園、友達や将来家族になる人と過ごす日々、そして安全を保障する立派な要塞。」"

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
msgid ""
"\"a ctulaly don t mi nd  t he cold it   s  f i ne in h ere  nn    o "
"problem\""
msgstr "「ぜぜぜぜんぜぜんんささささむくくななないだだだいじょぶぶぶぶ」"

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
msgid ""
"\"Tried wearing dead zombie clothes, but they still knew I was alive!  It's "
"like they're a hivemind, man!\""
msgstr "「ゾンビの服を着て死人に扮してみたが、奴らは私が生きているのが分かるようだ！まるで、第六感でもあるみたいだ！」"

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
msgid ""
"\"riddle.  what's 1/4 feathers, 1/4 scales, 1/4 metal, and 1/4 flesh?  "
"answer: sorry, but you should know this one.\""
msgstr "「なぞなぞです。1/4が羽、1/4が鱗、1/4が金属、1/4が肉、なんだ？答え:内緒。でも、分かるはずだよ」"

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
msgid ""
"\"For anyone that's reading this, I just want to confirm (FROM AN UNBIASED "
"SOURCE) that it was NOT the scientists' fault.\""
msgstr "「誰かこれを読んでいる人へ、一つ(信頼できるソースで)確認したいんだけど、原因は科学者ではないよね」"

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
msgid ""
"\"We're the eagle-eyes in the sky!  Just two mutant avians in our "
"helicopter!  Filming the Cataclysm!  Check us out on any working "
"electronics!\""
msgstr "「鷹の目を手に入れた！私たちのヘリには2人の鳥類変異者が乗っている！大変動を記録に残すんだ！動いている機械が無いか調査しよう！」"

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
msgid "\"WE'RE GOING TO SAIL TO CANADA, BITCHES!\""
msgstr "「船でカナダまで行ってくるぜ、あばよ！」"

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
msgid ""
"\"Anyone hear about that guy who tried to sail his family to Canada?  What a"
" moron, right?\""
msgstr "「船で家族と一緒にカナダへ行こうとした奴を知ってるか？ひどい間抜けがいたもんだな？」"

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
msgid "\"recently canadian border has gotten more dangerous don't go there\""
msgstr "「カナダとの国境は最近ここより危険になってるらしい」"

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
msgid "\"Hey, what happened to my dad's airboat?!\""
msgstr "「ちょっと、パパのエアボートに何が起きたの？！」"

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
msgid "\"Reading is good!  Never stop reading.  Read EVERYTHING.\""
msgstr "「読書はいいぞ！読書を続けよう。全てを読み尽くそう」"

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
msgid ""
"\"I'm gonna be honest here, I'm really gonna die soon so I dont want to gt "
"forgnottedn ples dont forntget me y nrmmy name is h@@hbhbh\""
msgstr "「正直に言うと、私はもうすぐ死ぬからわたしのなまえわすれないでなまえはふぶふふぶふふ」"

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
msgid "\"all it takes to seal a wound is a sawblade and a match!  trust me\""
msgstr "「傷を塞ぐために必要なのは刃物とマッチだけ！本当だよ」"

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
msgid ""
"\"I wonder what's in this sarcophagus?  Maybe it's a real sarcophagus.  "
"Maybe there's a big guy named God under here.\""
msgstr "「この石棺の中には何があるんだろう？たぶんこれは本当の棺なんだ。神と呼ばれた偉大な者が眠っているんだ」"

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
msgid "\"these hulks aint so incredible when ya got .50\""
msgstr "「.50口径があれば巨体ゾンビとも対峙できる」"

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
msgid ""
"\"WBLF 970 went off-air three days ago.  There's nobody left on the radio.  "
"Might as well throw this thing away…\""
msgstr "「WBLF970が3日前に停波してしまった。ラジオからは誰の声も聞こえない。もう捨てていいだろう...」"

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
msgid ""
"\"I've heard it's safer across the Mississippi.  Going to start driving "
"today.  If you're reading this, pray for me\""
msgstr "「ミシシッピ州は比較的安全だと聞いた。今から車で向かう。これを読んだ人がいたら、私の無事を祈ってほしい。」"

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
msgid "\"We have Landed our Comet.  The Sky is Ablaze.\""
msgstr "「コメットを着陸させた。空は輝いていた。」"

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
msgid ""
"\"Last one standing.  It's good feeling.  I win.  I win I win I win I win I "
"win\""
msgstr "「最後に残るのは一人だけ。いい感じだ。私が勝つぞ。勝つぞ勝つぞ勝つぞ勝つぞ勝つぞ」"

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
msgid "\"Adderall cures weakness, tramadol cures death\""
msgstr "「アデロールは弱さを克服し、トラマドールは死を克服する」"

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
msgid "\"These turrets keep dodging my FUCKING BULLETS!\""
msgstr "「タレット共が弾丸を避け続けやがる！」"

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
msgid ""
"\"Best way to train is by throwing pebbles at birds.  You'll be a legend.\""
msgstr "「最善の訓練法は鳥に小石を投げることだ。きっと伝説になれる」"

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
msgid "\"new bedford is overrun.  i'm sorry.  we tried.\""
msgstr "「ニューベッドフォードはもう駄目だ。すまない。手は尽くした」"

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
msgid ""
"\"Check out my cooking show on The Television!  Making Mannwurst sausages "
"out of some of those assholes who tried to raid my kitchen earlier…\""
msgstr ""
"「テレビをご覧の皆様、クッキングショーをお見逃しなく！以前我が家のキッチンを略奪しようとしたろくでなし共を使って人肉ソーセージを作りましょう...」"

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
msgid ""
"\"Renting out my rat tunnels for 50 9mm rounds a night.  I dug them with my "
"own claws, so you know they're the best.\""
msgstr "「夜のうちに私のネズミ穴に隠しておいた50発の9mm弾を貸してあげよう。穴は自分の爪で掘ったんだけど、すごくいい出来だよ」"

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
msgid ""
"\"Anyone wanna listen to some music at full volume and shoot the Zs that "
"approach?  You pick the tunes if I get some ammo.\""
msgstr "「大音量で音楽をかけながらゾンビを撃つ奴がいるか？弾丸を持ってる奴の前では、選曲に気を付けるんだな」"

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
msgid ""
"\"Lots of new easy ways to burn calories now.  Fighting animata, managing "
"the fields, running with my wings buzzing, and more.\""
msgstr "「カロリーを簡単に消費する方法を思いついた。激しく戦ったり、現場監督をやったり、羽をバタつかせながら走ったり、他にもいろいろ」"

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
msgid "\"FLAMING SWORD HUMANE.  CAUTERIZES WOUNDS.  SURGICAL.\""
msgstr "「燃える剣は慈悲深い。傷を焼灼できる。外科手術だ」"

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
msgid "\"knife screams it screams i cant breathe so scared help me please help\""
msgstr "「ナイフが叫んでる叫んでる息ができない怖い助けておねがいたすけて」"

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
msgid "\"when it started, we could still hope The Man was gonna save us…\""
msgstr "「事が起きたばかりの頃は、政府が助けてくれると思っていた...」"

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
msgid ""
"\"Hey, Ted.  Alexander and Cass and I are heading to Z-Mobile for the last "
"of the meth.  Keep the lizard fetus fed for us, OK?\""
msgstr "「やあテッド。アレクサンダーとキャスと私は最後のヤクを探して車を走らせてるよ。私らに配るトカゲの胎児はちゃんと持ってるね？」"

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
msgid ""
"\"i say we call the material from melting down cars and dead robots "
"'massachusetite' or 'vermontsteel' or 'connecticut composite'\""
msgstr "「車や壊れたロボットを溶かして作った素材を『マサチューセッタイト』とか『バーモントスチール』とか『コネクティカット』とか名付けてる」"

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
msgid ""
"\"Sometimes what you need when you're infected, bleeding, sick and hungover "
"is a J and some chips.\""
msgstr "「感染症や病気や二日酔いになったときに、たまに欲しくなるのがマリファナとポテトチップス」"

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
msgid ""
"\"This has to be China's fault.  Seriously, why is nobody suspecting the "
"people we're having a cold war with!  This is an invasion!  These aren't "
"zombies, it's just camouflage!  WAKE UP, SHEEPLE!\""
msgstr ""
"「間違いなく中国の仕業だ。真剣な話、どうして冷戦を仕掛けてくるような国を疑おうとしないんだ！これは侵略だ！ゾンビはただの隠れ蓑だ！シープルよ、目覚めよ！」"

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
msgid ""
"\"Hahahahaa stupid fuck in his mansion, with his plate armor and big axe.  "
"Guy never swung the thing in his life.  Can't block bullets, dipshit\""
msgstr ""
"「ハハハハ、あの屋敷にはプレートアーマーと斧をつけたアホが住んでるぞ。人生で一度も武器を使ったことなんてないんだろうな。弾丸は防げないんだよ、マヌケ」"

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
msgid ""
"\"I woke up with a dozen bears in a tribe outside the vault.  One was "
"covered in red markings, glowing-- speaking.\""
msgstr "「気づいたら地下シェルターの外で、十数匹のクマの群れに囲まれていた。一匹は毛皮が血まみれで、しかも...喋るんだ」"

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
msgid ""
"\"poor guy.  watched him from afar with my binocs for months and months.  "
"today he died fighting.  feels like i knew him even though i never "
"approached.\""
msgstr ""
"「気の毒に。彼のことはCBMを使って遠くから何か月も観察していた。今日彼は戦って死んだ。彼に直接会ったことは無いが、知り合いだったような気分だ」"

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
msgid "\"ENGLAND DID THIS\""
msgstr "「これは英国の仕業」"

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
msgid ""
"\"That little fakkin rat din say anythin till we whacked him with a steel "
"chain!  Then 'e just wanted to know if he could buy the chain!\""
msgstr "「あのくそったれチビネズミの騒音には参ったな、鉄鎖でぶっ叩くまで治まりやしない！鎖を買いたいなら言ってくれたらよかったのに！」"

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
msgid ""
"\"tom, adorned with fluid sacs three layers deep, crawls to safety like a "
"slug\""
msgstr "「トムは3層にもなる分厚い流体嚢に覆われ、ナメクジのように這っており無事だ」"

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
msgid ""
"\"my friend turned fuckin insane and ate his arms and then his sister's "
"arms!  he looked rather cross\""
msgstr "「友達の頭がおかしくなって彼の姉や彼自身の腕を食べ始めた！彼はなにか怒っているみたいだった」"

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
msgid "\"Starting today, the hallucinations are my only friends.\""
msgstr "「今日からは、幻覚だけが私の友達」"

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
msgid "\"For sale: zombaby shoes, very filthy\""
msgstr "「売ります：赤ちゃんゾンビの靴、非常に不潔」"

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
msgid ""
"\"Started my own brewery recently.  I just need some glass bottles, now!  "
"Several thousand!  I'm planning way ahead.\""
msgstr "「最近自分の醸造所を建てました。ガラス瓶が今すぐ必要です！数千本！ずっと先の計画まで立てています」"

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
msgid ""
"\"Heard recently of some radio op who lives in a skyscraper, announcing "
"where those hordes are going.  Couldn't find the frequency, though.\""
msgstr "「超高層ビルに住んでる奴が暗号化していない通信を最近拾ったらしい。しかし、周波数は分からない」"

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
msgid "\"Woah, bud!  Not all cannibals eat meat!\""
msgstr "「うわぁ、やめてよ！全ての食人嗜好者が肉好きとは限らないんだ！」"

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
msgid "\"ay why aint my bullets fuckin explodin\""
msgstr "「あ あ なんで くそ だんや く ふはつ」"

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
msgid "\"Those Fiktok clan people picked this place clean… no food…\""
msgstr "「強盗団がここの食べ物を持ち去っていった...何もない...」"

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
msgid "\"The fewer people in New England, the stronger we'll become.\""
msgstr "「ニューイングランドにいる人間が少なければ少ないほど、私たちはもっと強くなる」"

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
msgid "\"It all boils down to the Apex Predator.\""
msgstr "「最後に残るのは頂点捕食者」"

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
msgid "\"Got my mortar and pestle.  Now if I could just find some avocados…\""
msgstr "「乳鉢と乳棒を見つけた。あとはアボカドさえあれば...」"

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
msgid ""
"\"saw a girl standing with the mushrooms.  spores coming out of slits in her"
" neck.  she looked happy.\""
msgstr "「キノコの群生地に立っている女の子を見た。首が裂け、中から胞子が噴き出していた。幸せそうな顔だった」"

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
msgid ""
"\"Found some pink berries.  Eating them makes bushes into more pink berries."
"  Infinite berry.\""
msgstr "「ピンク色のベリーが実っていた。食べていたら、周りの茂みにもっとたくさん実りだした。無限ベリーだ」"

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
msgid "\"m ust grow                 unity\""
msgstr "「栄 え   る    べ        し」"

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
msgid "\"AMY IS FUNGUS.  DO NOT LISTEN IF SHE ASKS YOU TO TAKE OFF MASK\""
msgstr "「エイミーは真菌だ。マスクを取れと言われても絶対に無視しろ」"

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
msgid ""
"\"my rabbi follows a new god now.  asks us to call him a local guide.  i "
"dont mind, he keeps us fed\""
msgstr "「先生は今、新たな神に従っておられる。原住世界の案内人と呼べとおっしゃる。ご指導を続けていただけるなら、なにも問題はない」"

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
msgid "\"Fungus are helping us.  Help them and they will unite us\""
msgstr "「真菌が私たちを救う。真菌を助ければ、真菌と一つになれる」"

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
msgid ""
"\"Saw a boy couldnt be older than 16.  Walked straight through the mushroom "
"tower.  THROUGH IT\""
msgstr "「中学生にもなっていないぐらいの男の子を見かけた。キノコの塔のすぐ傍を通り過ぎて行った。そう、まったく無事に通り過ぎたんだよ」"

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
msgid ""
"\"Found some food in a box outside my house.  We ate it and now the "
"fungaloids aren't harming us.  I think we are a mushroom now\""
msgstr "「家の外に食料の入った箱を見つけた。皆でそれを食べてみたら、真菌人が襲ってこなくなった。きっと、私たちもキノコになってしまったんだ」"

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
msgid ""
"\"saw the girl again.  she looked dead exhausted and walked right into the "
"fungus.  30 mins later and she walked out good as new\""
msgstr ""
"「またあの子を見かけた。疲れて死にそうな顔で、真菌の雲の中にまっすぐ入っていった。30分後、彼女は生まれ変わったように元気になって戻って来た」"

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
msgid "\"HADENSBROOK REBUILT AROUND FUNGUS.  THEY EAT GRAY APPLES AND SPREAD IT\""
msgstr "「ヘイデンスブルックは真菌によって再建した。あそこの住人は灰色のリンゴを食べ、リンゴの木を拡散している」"

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
msgid "\"mycus must grow\""
msgstr "「ミカズ栄えるべし」"

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
msgid ""
"\"School bus with solar panels = TRUST.  Gave us berries and seeds, we were "
"out of food\""
msgstr "「ソーラーパネルを付けたスクールバスは信用できる。食べ物がなくなって困っていたが、果実と種を分けてくれた」"

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
msgid "\"d o nThelp scho Ol buss makE seeeedS ARe FUNGUS!! !\""
msgstr "「スくーるバす しん   じルな  たね      ハ 真 菌！！  ！」"

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
msgid ""
"\"Go to every fungus patch you find but WEAR A SUIT.  Food there is very "
"very filling.  Look for pink berries, blue flowers\""
msgstr "「どこでも良いから真菌地帯に行ってみろ。ただし防護スーツは絶対着ろ。食べ物が大量にある。ピンク色のベリーと青い花を探せ」"

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
msgid "\"red blue yellow berry seed sap bloom flowers tower mycus mycus mycus.\""
msgstr "「赤青黄色、果実種樹液、発生源花塔、ミカズ、ミカズ、ミカズ」"

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
msgid ""
"\"Husband 30 yrs died in bombs.  Mushrooms brought him back.  GIVE YOURSELF "
"TO THEm AND THEY WILL HELP YOU\""
msgstr "「夫は30歳の時、爆弾で死にました。キノコが夫を生き返らせてくれました。ソのみをサさげヨさすレばスくいがあたえラれん」"

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
msgid ""
"\"Lisa always was a fan of sports.  Thank God these Global Athletics Games "
"in Harran started some time before the outbreak, so she was able to leave "
"New England before it was quarantined.  I can only hope there are no "
"zombies, as we do have here, in the city she flew to.\""
msgstr ""
"「リサはスポーツが好きだった。事件前からハラン市で国際陸上競技の大会が開催されていたので、彼女はニューイングランドを離れていた。あっちにはゾンビがおらず、彼女が無事でいることを願う」"

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
msgid ""
"\"Don't mix powders, them books said.  Do Not Mix powders.  Didn't listen "
"did I.  Blew my goddamn pinky off, near lost my right eye.\""
msgstr "「粉末同士を混ぜるな、と本に書いてあった。粉末同士を混ぜるな。私は従わなかった。そして私のちっぽけな小指は吹っ飛び、右目は無くなった。」"

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
msgid ""
"\"followed what toby wrote down.  shells looked like theyd hold more, I put "
"in some more.  traded most to h raiders for crank.  shot my 38 today and it "
"fuckn exploded.  low on crank, good as dead, no gun, no toby.  headed to "
"montreal real sorry bout the bullets\""
msgstr ""
"「トビーが書いたとおりにやった。薬莢にもっと入りそうだったから、更に追加した。クランク入手のために、レイダー達と取り引きもした。今日その.38口径の銃が暴発した。クランクはなくなり、死にかけ、銃は消え、トビーもいない。モントリオールへ向かう。弾薬の事はわたしのせいだ」"

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
msgid ""
"\"…damn those hybrid cars are efficient.  wish I was smart enough to finagle"
" that engine controller out of it… heard scrapper Joe put one in his "
"deathmobile and now doesn't need gas at all… then again, Joe is full of "
"shit…\""
msgstr ""
"「...ハイブリッドカーの燃費はサイコーだ。スマートエンジン制御装置を使いこなせるくらいに賢くなりたいもんだ...自慢の改造車に積んで以来ガソリンがほとんど要らなくなったって、解体屋のジョーが言ってたが...ジョーめ、またでたらめ言って...」"

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
msgid ""
"\"⋯bioluminescent, 5' diameter⋯  appears to be an immense disembodied "
"eyeball, capable of flight and [illegible] thought\""
msgstr "「...生物発光、直径約150cm...肉体から分離した巨大な眼球のように見え、飛行能力をもち、思考[判読不能]ようだ」"

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
msgid ""
"\"What's the deal with boiling water?  Rain water is distilled naturally!  "
"It's perfectly safe, you could save so much time if you didn't boil it.  I "
"drunk some river water, and I'm fine!\""
msgstr ""
"「まだ水を沸騰させているの？雨水は自然に蒸留されてる。そのままでも安全だし、煮沸なんて時間の無駄だ。川の水を飲んだけど、ピンピンしてるよ！」"

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
msgid ""
"\"Went to the emergency shelter, some guy walked in, walked out, grabbed a "
"rock, smashed a bench to bits, carved a plank out of it, walked out again.  "
"Haven't seen them in 3 days… wonder what their story is.\""
msgstr ""
"「避難シェルターにいたら、知らない人たちが入ってきて、出て行って、石を掴んで、また入ってきて、ベンチを叩き壊して、板を削って、また出て行った。あの人たちの姿はもう3日も見ていない...一体何だったんだろう」"

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
msgid ""
"This note is covered in gray goo, ew… \"I know I have a fetish but THIS IS "
"TOO MUCH.  My hands are made of slime.  My hair is slime.  My body is "
"covered in slime.  I can't even use a crowbar 'cause of slime.  Wherever I "
"go I leave a trail of slime.  Everything's slime.  My bag is falling off my "
"back into slime.\""
msgstr ""
"うわっ、このメモは灰色の粘液に覆われています...「私はスライムフェチだが、これはやりすぎだ。両手もスライム。髪の毛もスライム。全身スライムだ。スライムのせいでバールも握れない。どこへ行ってもスライムの痕跡が残る。何もかもスライム。バッグもスライムの海に沈んでしまった」"

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
msgid ""
"A page from a notebook, with a morse code reference and the following "
"decoded message: \"Whiskey echo whiskey - Lima alpha delta\""
msgstr ""
"ノートの1ページに、モールス信号とそれらを解読したメッセージが記されています。「Whiskey Echo Whiskey - Lima Alpha "
"Delta :wew lad(やれやれ)」"

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
msgid ""
"\"See if you want to be, extra annoying you can, nod off to the, dump and "
"go, help, Erin to dig up the, last, peice\""
msgstr "「たとえば貴方に すこしだけでも けっして諦めぬ おもいが有れば より強くだいた んに食いつない でいけるだろう」"

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
msgid ""
"\"I saw one of those Foodplace workers on the street.  Honestly, they look "
"no different alive than dead.\""
msgstr "「街でフードプレイスの従業員を見かけた。正直言って、あいつら生きてても死んでても見た目が変わらないよな」"

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
msgid ""
"\"I can imagine people sending their 'love and prayers' on social media.  "
"Love doesn't kill zeds, prayer doesn't put food in my belly.\""
msgstr "「SNSで『愛と祈り』を送るやつらの姿が目に浮かぶね。愛はゾンビを殺さないし、祈りで腹は膨れない」"

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
msgid ""
"\"I used to take everything at face value.  If you couldn't measure it, "
"couldn't explain it, couldn't put a number to it, it wasn't real.  Then this"
" shit happened.  Real funny.\""
msgstr ""
"「以前の私は、こんな思想を鵜呑みにしていた。測定できなければ、説明できなければ、数字で表現できなければ、それは現実ではない。それが今じゃこのザマだ。笑うしかないよ」"

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
msgid "This note is covered in gray goo, ew… \"Blorble\""
msgstr "うわっ、このメモは灰色の粘液に覆われています...「ブロブロブ」"

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
msgid ""
"\"Saw some chick in the forest.  Her body is all green and shit, and she was"
" covered in leaves and vines.\""
msgstr "「森の中で若い女を見かけた。全身の皮膚が緑色で、葉や蔓に覆われていた」"

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
msgid ""
"\"Good news: My teachers aren't trying to tear my limbs off about my "
"homework.  Bad news: My teachers are trying to tear my limbs off "
"regardless.\""
msgstr "「良いニュース: 宿題を忘れても先生が手足を引き裂こうとしてこない。悪いニュース: 良い子にしてても先生が手足を引き裂こうとしてくる」"

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
msgid ""
"\"G, I've stopped the bleeding, I'll be fine.  Can't stay here any longer, "
"there's too much commotion outside.  Meet me back at our usual spot, we will"
" retrieve our stuff together, don't go alone.  Be careful when exiting out "
"the back, I saw one of them running around with a spear.\""
msgstr ""
"「Gへ、出血は止めたから大丈夫。もうこれ以上ここにはいられない。外が騒がしい。いつもの場所で落ち合って、荷物を回収しよう。一人で行くなよ。裏から出るときは気をつけろ。槍を持って走り回ってる奴を見た」"

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
msgid ""
"\"To whoever may find this, I've had enough of cowering and hiding.  I have "
"realized I can't outlast whatever this is.  I saw something different at the"
" grocery store down the block.  Skulking around on all four, faster than all"
" the others.  It jumped at me from behind a car.  It's as if they were all "
"changing.  I'm sure I'll see many more of these as time goes on.  I'm "
"leaving.  Whatever you want, take it.\""
msgstr ""
"「このメモを見た人へ。私はもう身を隠すのは止めた。何が起きてるのか分からないが、きっと私は長く生きられない。この先の食料品店前に、ヤバいのが居た。四つん這いになって凄いスピードでカサカサ動き回ってた。車の陰から飛び出してきた。奴らはみんな変化してる。時間が経てばあんなのをもっと大勢見ることになる。もう嫌だ。欲しいものがあれば勝手に持っていけ」"

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
msgid ""
"\"G, I hope you're finding my notes and the supply drops.  Use my binocs, if"
" they're still there, and check out the roof.  Avoid the huge tower.  I "
"don't know what's inside, but the noises that come out of it can't signal "
"anything good.\""
msgstr ""
"「Gへ、私のメモと支援物資はちゃんと見つけられただろうか。双眼鏡がまだ残っていたら、屋上から見渡してみるといい。巨大な塔は避けろ。どんな状況なのか知らないが、中から嫌な音がする」"

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
msgid ""
"\"Anyone reading this, stay off the roads.  Me and the boys were ambushed by"
" some goons there.  If you see a fallen tree blocking your path, just turn "
"around and go back.\""
msgstr ""
"「これを読んでいる人へ。車道沿いに歩いて行くのは止めろ。私と子供たちはそこで強盗に待ち伏せされた。倒木が道を塞いでいたら、すぐ引き返した方がいい」"

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
msgid ""
"\"Mike, we have your dog and that ginger fuck you run around with.  You know"
" where to find us.  Come alone, it's time to pay up.\""
msgstr "「マイクへ。イヌは預かった。元気に走り回っているぞ。どこにいるかは分かってるんだ。一人で来い。清算の時が来た」"

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
msgid ""
"\"5 gallons of water, 3 cans of chicken, 3 cans of soup, 14 9mm rounds.  "
"GUNSHOP -> CHECK GARAGE -> CUT THROUGH YARDS -> HOME\""
msgstr "「水5ガロン、鶏肉3缶、スープ3缶、9mm弾14発 銃砲店 -> ガレージ調べる -> 庭抜ける -> 自宅」"

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
msgid ""
"\"G, don't head straight through, go around.  There's a glowing one just "
"hanging out in the alley.  I tried stabbing it but it zapped me with some "
"sort of static electricity and I ran back here.  I'll try to whack it with a"
" club next time.\""
msgstr ""
"「Gへ。真っすぐ向かわず、回り道しろ。道に光ってる奴がいる。刺してみたらビリっと来たから、ここへ引き返した。次は木の棒で叩いてみることにする」"

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
msgid "\"STOP FOLLOWING ME I CAN HEAR YOU IN THE DARK\""
msgstr "「ついてくるのは止めろ暗闇でも音は聞こえてるぞ」"

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
msgid ""
"\"G, if you find this, I'm at the farm just out of town.  I'll need to stay "
"there a few days, I've been wounded by one of those overgrown bastards, shot"
" a spike right into my thigh.  I'll wait for you there as long as I can, "
"stay safe.\""
msgstr ""
"「Gへ。もしこのメモを見つけたら、私は街はずれの農場に居る。数日は留まることになると思う。ツタが生い茂ってる奴にやられた。脚に棘を撃ち込まれた。できる限り長く待ってるつもりだ。気を付けて来てくれ。」"

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
msgid ""
"\"G, the city is full of them.  I don't know how, it's as if we never came "
"through here.  They're the same ones we'd put down, I am sure of it.  They "
"got back up and now look more dangerous than ever.  I saw one of them just "
"snatch a bird right off the roof with its long hands.  You have to use the "
"sewers.  I know we agreed not to travel underground, but as horrible as it "
"is down there, I fear our world up here is no longer ours either.\""
msgstr ""
"「Gへ。奴らが街中に溢れている。どうしてなんだ、まるで初めて通った道みたいじゃないか。以前倒したのと同じ奴らだ、間違いない。また起き上がって、更に危険になってるみたいだ。長い腕で鳥を捕まえていた。下水道を使おう。下水道は怖いから止めとこうと以前言ったけど、地上の世界ももはや私たちのものじゃない」"

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
msgid ""
"\"G, move only after dark.  I saw lights in the distance, I think there "
"might be someone living around here.  Wish I had my radio right now.\""
msgstr "「Gへ、移動は暗くなってからにしよう。遠くに明かりが見えたから、この辺に誰か住んでるのかもしれない。手元に無線機があればいいんだけど」"

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
msgid ""
"\"G, I have not found any of your notes, which means you're either taking a "
"different path or have already made your way back home.  In the case you're "
"still out here somewhere, if you see the sky suddenly grow dark, hide "
"indoors immediately, I have a feeling this storm is far from over.\""
msgstr ""
"「Gへ。あなたの書いたメモは見つからなかった。ってことは、別の方向へ向かっているか、もう家に帰ったのかな。もしまだどこかにいるなら、空が急に暗くなった時はすぐに屋内に隠れるんだ。この嵐はまだ終わっていない気がする」"

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
msgid "\"2236\""
msgstr "「2236」"

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
msgid ""
"\"G, be careful around those bulging and pulsating corpses.  I saw one "
"today.  I think there's something eating away at those things.  I didn't "
"stick around to find out.  I burnt the entire building down, just to be "
"sure, so you should have relatively safe passage.\""
msgstr ""
"「Gへ。膨れ上がって脈打ってる死体が近くにあったら要注意だ。今日も見かけた。何かに浸食されてるみたいだったから、近寄らないように気を付けた。念のため建物ごと焼いておいたから、安全に通れるとは思う」"

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
msgid ""
"\"G, I ran into an actual human today!  He was looking for his daughter.  We"
" exchanged some food and traded information on the surrounding area.  He "
"spoke of a family living on a farm out in the fields, surviving and "
"thriving!  Maybe it's time we carved ourselves a peaceful place in this "
"hell.  We'll discuss this once we meet back home.\""
msgstr ""
"「Gへ。今日は、生きてる人間に会ったんだ！その人は娘を捜していた。食べ物を取り引きして、周辺の情報を交換した。彼の家族は田舎の農場に住んでるらしい。しかも、元気に生き延びてるそうだ！この地獄にも、平穏な場所が作れるってことだ。家で落ち合えたら、詳しく話そう」"

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
msgid ""
"\"G, there's something not right with the forests here.  The ground there "
"feels soft and is overgrown with some sort of mushrooms.  Be careful not to "
"breathe in the dust they kick up, I accidentally took a whiff and have been "
"coughing and vomiting since.  The map shows there's a cabin just outside "
"town, I'll lay low there until I feel better.  I'm almost home.  I know you "
"will be waiting for me there.\""
msgstr ""
"「Gへ。ここの森は何かおかしい。地面は柔らかく、キノコのようなものが生い茂っている。塵を吸わないよう気をつけて。私はうっかり吸い込んで、それ以来咳と吐き気が治まらない。地図によれば街外れに小屋があるから、そこで休むつもりだ。もうすぐ家に帰れる。きっと君が待ってるんだろうな。」"

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
msgid ""
"\"I saw a zombie covered in shrooms emitting some strange dust.  When "
"another zombie got close, the two tore each other apart.  I'd rather not "
"stay here anymore.  Im packing up my stuff soon.\""
msgstr ""
"「キノコに覆われたゾンビが妙な粉を振りまいているのを見た。別のゾンビが近付き、互いを攻撃し始めた。もうここにはいたくない。すぐに荷物をまとめるつもりだ。」"

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
msgid ""
"\"I can see a large tower in the distance, And strange stalk-like creatures "
"are around it.  I feel sick just looking at it, and fire hasn't solved it.  "
"Those things seem to stay around it though.\""
msgstr "「遠くに大きな塔があり、その周りに奇妙な細長い化け物がいる。見ているだけで気持ち悪いし、火でも退治できない。まだ辺りに残っているようだ。」"

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
msgid ""
"\"These berries are delicious!  Maybe taking these were worth it.  And the "
"more I eat, the more of it appears!  it's like an infinite food cycle!\""
msgstr "「美味しいベリーを見つけた！いいものを手に入れた。食べれば食べるほど出てくる！無限の食料だ！」"

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
msgid ""
"\"I found a corpse with strange berries shoved down their gullet, seems to "
"have choked to death on the stuff.  greedy bastard\""
msgstr "「奇妙な果実を喉に詰まらせた死体を見つけた。どうやら窒息死らしい。大した食い意地だ」"

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
msgid ""
"\"Don't trust them.  The mushrooms aren't your friends.  They're "
"delusional\""
msgstr "「奴らを信じるな。キノコは仲間じゃない。とんだ妄想だ」"

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
msgid ""
"\"trust me!  The mushrooms are your friends!  They brung her back!  they'll "
"bring everybody back!\""
msgstr "「信じろ！キノコは仲間だ。キノコはあの人を連れ戻してくれる！キノコは皆を連れ戻してくれる！」"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<triffid_harvest>"
#: data/json/snippets/triffid_anatomy.json
msgid ""
"The bark of this \"plant\" has a bark like texture, but is more leathery in "
"consistency."
msgstr "この「植物」の樹皮は確かに樹木の皮のような質感ですが、丈夫さは革に近いように感じます。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<triffid_harvest>"
#: data/json/snippets/triffid_anatomy.json
msgid ""
"The smell emanating from the creature when you dissect it reminds you of "
"vegetables."
msgstr "解剖中は、辺りに野菜のような匂いが漂っています。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<triffid_harvest>"
#: data/json/snippets/triffid_anatomy.json
msgid "The monster's sap is sticky and somewhat greenish."
msgstr "このモンスターの樹液は粘質で、薄い緑色をしています。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<triffid_harvest>"
#: data/json/snippets/triffid_anatomy.json
msgid ""
"While outwardly plant like, the creature's muscles look surprisingly similar"
" to those of normal animals."
msgstr "外見は植物のように見えますが、体内の筋肉は驚くほど動物のものにそっくりです。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<triffid_harvest>"
#: data/json/snippets/triffid_anatomy.json
msgid ""
"Thick fibers are found throughout the body of the creature.  Perhaps they "
"serve a scaffolding purpose similar to that of (very flexible) bones."
msgstr "死体の全身に太い繊維が走っています。恐らくこれらは(非常に柔軟な)骨や支柱の役割を果たしていたのでしょう。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<triffid_harvest>"
#: data/json/snippets/triffid_anatomy.json
msgid ""
"The creature's whip like sting drips from poison.  You take extra care not "
"to accidentally scratch yourself on it."
msgstr "死体から伸びた鞭のような棘の先からは毒が滴り落ちています。誤って刺さらないよう、細心の注意を払って作業を進めました。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<triffid_harvest_deeper>"
#: data/json/snippets/triffid_anatomy.json
msgid ""
"The creature appears to have a vascular system vaguely similar to those of "
"animals, with a branching network of vein, although the organization is "
"unfamiliar."
msgstr "体内に通っているあちこちで枝分かれした管は、どことなく動物の血管系を連想させますが、その構造は動物とはまったく異なります。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<triffid_harvest_deeper>"
#: data/json/snippets/triffid_anatomy.json
msgid ""
"You find what you think is a heart, although it doesn't look like any "
"configuration you know of from Earth.  In fact, you find four hearts, each "
"seemingly supporting a lateral quarter of the body."
msgstr ""
"心臓のような臓器を見つけましたが、地球上の既知の動物の心臓とはまったく異なっています。体内に心臓が縦に四個並んでおり、それぞれが全身を四層に分けた各範囲を担当しているようです。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<triffid_harvest_deeper>"
#: data/json/snippets/triffid_anatomy.json
msgid ""
"A sac connected to the sting is filled with some fluid.  Might it perhaps "
"have some useful properties?"
msgstr "棘に繋がっている嚢には液体が溜まっています。何かに再利用できるでしょうか？"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<triffid_harvest_deeper>"
#: data/json/snippets/triffid_anatomy.json
msgid ""
"While the roots of the plant creature contain muscles and veins, they also "
"contain finer networks indicating a use for nutrient uptake when the roots "
"are lodged into the soil."
msgstr "この植物の根には筋肉と葉脈が編み込まれていますが、更に細い管も通っています。根を土に刺して栄養を吸収するために使っていたのでしょう。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<triffid_harvest_deeper>"
#: data/json/snippets/triffid_anatomy.json
msgid ""
"At the top of the creature you find what you assume is a brain, although it "
"seems to employ quadrilateral symmetry and thus is shaped and organized "
"completely differently from that of terrestrial versions."
msgstr "死体の上部に脳のような器官を見つけましたが、四角い対称形をしており、地上生物の脳とは全く異なる物質でできています。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<triffid_harvest>"
#: data/json/snippets/triffid_anatomy.json
msgid "<triffid_harvest>"
msgstr "<triffid_harvest>"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<triffid_harvest>"
#: data/json/snippets/triffid_anatomy.json
msgid "<triffid_harvest_deeper>"
msgstr "<triffid_harvest_deeper>"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<triffid_harvest>"
#: data/json/snippets/triffid_anatomy.json
msgid "<triffid_harvest>  <triffid_harvest_deeper>"
msgstr "<triffid_harvest><triffid_harvest_deeper>"

#. ~ Snippet in category "tutorial_messages"
#: data/json/snippets/tutorial.json
msgid ""
"Welcome to the Cataclysm tutorial!  As you play, pop-ups like this one will appear to guide you through the basic game actions.\n"
"\n"
"At any time, you can press <keybind:HELP_KEYBINDINGS> to open the <color_light_cyan>Keybindings menu</color> to view or modify the controls for the game or specific menu that you are in.\n"
"\n"
"Pressing <keybind:POPUP_WAIT:QUIT> will close the pop-up."
msgstr ""
"Cataclysmチュートリアルへようこそ！ゲームの基本的な操作方法は、このようにポップアップ表示で説明されます。\n"
"\n"
"ゲーム中の操作方法については、<keybind:HELP_KEYBINDINGS>を押して<color_light_cyan>キー割当メニュー</color>を開けば、いつでも確認や変更が可能です。\n"
"\n"
"<keybind:POPUP_WAIT:QUIT>を押してポップアップを閉じましょう。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "tutorial_messages"
#: data/json/snippets/tutorial.json
msgid ""
"The character in the center of the screen represents you.  By default, you can move around using the <color_yellow>numpad</color>, <color_yellow>vikeys</color>, or the <color_yellow>arrow keys</color>.\n"
"\n"
"Movement Controls:\n"
"North: <keybind:UP>\n"
"South: <keybind:DOWN>\n"
"West: <keybind:LEFT>\n"
"East: <keybind:RIGHT>\n"
"Northwest: <keybind:LEFTUP>\n"
"Northeast: <keybind:RIGHTUP>\n"
"Southwest: <keybind:LEFTDOWN>\n"
"Southeast: <keybind:RIGHTDOWN>\n"
"Wait in place: <keybind:pause>\n"
"\n"
"You can also use <keybind:SELECT> to select the location you want to move, and then press it again to confirm the movement.\n"
"\n"
"To continue the tutorial, please move to the door to the east."
msgstr ""
"画面中央にいるキャラクターが、あなたです。既定の設定では、<color_yellow>テンキー</color>、<color_yellow>viキー</color>、<color_yellow>方向キー</color>を使って移動できます。\n"
"\n"
"移動操作:\n"
"北: <keybind:UP>\n"
"南: <keybind:DOWN>\n"
"西: <keybind:LEFT>\n"
"東: <keybind:RIGHT>\n"
"北西: <keybind:LEFTUP>\n"
"北東: <keybind:RIGHTUP>\n"
"南西: <keybind:LEFTDOWN>\n"
"南東: <keybind:RIGHTDOWN>\n"
"その場に留まる: <keybind:pause>\n"
"\n"
"また、<keybind:SELECT>を押して移動したい位置を選択し、もう一度押すことで移動を確定する操作も可能です。\n"
"\n"
"東側にある扉の傍まで移動して、チュートリアルを続けましょう。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "tutorial_messages"
#: data/json/snippets/tutorial.json
msgid ""
"Most of the time your character will be walking when you move.  But sometimes it's useful to change your movement mode to something else.\n"
"\n"
"There are four movement modes:\n"
"<color_light_cyan>Walking</color>: default mode, average movement speed, stamina draining speed, and noise\n"
"<color_light_cyan>Running</color>: <color_light_green>move much faster</color>, but will <color_light_red>drain your stamina quickly</color>\n"
"<color_light_cyan>Crouching</color>: will make your character <color_light_green>less visible to monsters</color> by allowing you to hide behind some obstacles, <color_light_red>decreased movement speed</color> and <color_light_green>noise</color>\n"
"<color_light_cyan>Prone</color>: <color_light_green>even less visibility</color> to monsters, <color_light_red>even less movement speed</color> and <color_light_green>noise</color>\n"
"\n"
"Pressing <keybind:open_movement> will open the <color_light_cyan>Movement Mode</color> menu, which allows you to switch the mode at any time.  There are extra keybindings that can be set to switch to each mode individually for convenience.\n"
"\n"
"To continue the tutorial, please move to the end of the corridor."
msgstr ""
"大抵の場合、あなたのキャラクターは歩行モードで移動します。しかし、別の移動モードを使った方がいい状況もあります。\n"
"\n"
"4種類の移動モード\n"
"- <color_light_cyan>歩行</color>: 既定のモードです。移動速度、スタミナ消耗、足音の大きさはどれも平均的です。\n"
"- <color_light_cyan>駆足</color>: キャラクターの<color_light_green>移動速度が上昇</color>しますが、<color_light_red>スタミナ消耗速度が上昇</color>します。\n"
"- <color_light_cyan>中腰</color>: 障害物に身を隠すことで、<color_light_green>モンスターからの視認性が低下</color>します。<color_light_red>移動速度が低下</color>し、<color_light_green>足音が軽減</color>されます。\n"
"- <color_light_cyan>臥位</color>: <color_light_green>モンスターからの視認性が大きく低下</color>し、<color_light_red>移動速度が大きく低下</color>、<color_light_green>足音が大きく軽減</color>されます。\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"<color_yellow>を押すと<color_light_cyan>移動モードメニュー</color>が表示され、いつでもモードを切り替えられます。各モードに割り当てられたキーを押せば、モード切替を更に便利に扱えます。\n"
"\n"
"通路の端まで移動して、チュートリアルを続けましょう。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "tutorial_messages"
#: data/json/snippets/tutorial.json
msgid ""
"You can also use the mouse to see things around you.  The "
"<color_light_cyan>Mouse view</color> window will appear on the sidebar, and "
"you'll be able to get information on the terrain, monsters, and items in the"
" world around you.  Alternatively, you can press <keybind:look> to open the "
"<color_light_cyan>Look Around</color> window."
msgstr ""
"マウスを使って周囲を見回すことができます。<color_light_cyan>マウスビュー</color>ウィンドウがサイドバーに表示され、周囲の地形やモンスター、アイテムなどの情報を確認できます。また、<keybind:look>を押して<color_light_cyan>周囲確認</color>ウィンドウを開くこともできます。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "tutorial_messages"
#: data/json/snippets/tutorial.json
msgid ""
"You're standing next to a closed door.  To open it, either walk into it, or "
"press <keybind:open> and then a movement key.  Using <keybind:open> will "
"also let you open windows, gates, fences, safes and more."
msgstr ""
"閉じたドアの横に立っていますね。ドアを開けるときは、ドアがある方向へ移動するか、<keybind:open>を押してから移動キーでドアがある方向を指定しましょう。<keybind:open>はドアだけでなく、窓、門、フェンス、金庫などを開けるときにも使えます。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "tutorial_messages"
#: data/json/snippets/tutorial.json
msgid ""
"You can close an opened door by pressing <keybind:close> and then a movement"
" key.  Closing doors behind you can often slow down crowds of monsters "
"greatly."
msgstr "開いているドアは<keybind:close>を押せば閉じられます。ドアを閉じておけば、モンスターの移動を大幅に遅らせることができます。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "tutorial_messages"
#: data/json/snippets/tutorial.json
msgid ""
"Most monsters will have to smash their way through a closed door.  If a door"
" is locked or partially broken, you can smash it by pressing <keybind:smash>"
" and then a movement key."
msgstr ""
"大抵のモンスターは、通り道を邪魔する閉じたドアを叩き壊そうとします。施錠されている、壊れかけているなどの理由で開かないドアは、<keybind:smash>を押してから移動キーで方向を指定し、叩き壊しましょう。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "tutorial_messages"
#: data/json/snippets/tutorial.json
msgid ""
"You can smash through windows by pressing <keybind:smash> and then a "
"movement key.  A smashed window takes a long time to climb through, and it's"
" possible to hurt yourself on the broken glass, but it's a good last-ditch "
"escape route.  Smashing a broken window again will clear the glass so you "
"can move through it safely, although it will still be quite slow.  Almost "
"everything can be smashed, given you have enough strength or are doing "
"enough damage."
msgstr ""
"窓ガラスは<keybind:smash>を押してから移動キーで方向を指定すれば、叩き割れます。ガラスが割れた窓は、通り抜けるのに時間が掛かり、ガラス片で怪我をする危険性もありますが、土壇場での脱出経路にうってつけです。割れた窓をもう一度叩けば、残っていたガラス片がなくなって安全に通り抜けられますが、作業には時間がかかります。十分な筋力、あるいは十分な威力の武器があれば、大抵のものを叩き壊せます。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "tutorial_messages"
#: data/json/snippets/tutorial.json
msgid ""
"You just stepped on a space with one or more items.  If you wish to pick it up, press <keybind:pickup>.  To select the tile directly underneath you, press <keybind:pause>.\n"
"\n"
"In the <color_light_cyan>Pickup</color> menu, press:\n"
"<keybind:RIGHT> to select the items you wish to pick up\n"
"<keybind:LEFT> to deselect\n"
"<keybind:CONFIRM> to confirm\n"
"\n"
"Note that you don't need to stand directly on the space with items to pick them up, you can pick them up when standing near them.\n"
"\n"
"If the item is too big to fit in any of your pockets, or is a weapon that you want to wield, you can press <keybind:wield> to wield it from the ground or from the <color_light_cyan>Pickup</color> menu.\n"
"\n"
"To continue the tutorial, please pick up the <color_light_cyan>baseball bat</color> you're standing on and move to the door to the south."
msgstr ""
"複数のアイテムが落ちているタイル上に移動しました。<keybind:pickup>を押せばアイテムを拾えます。キャラクター直下のタイルを選択する時は、<keybind:pause>を押しましょう。\n"
"\n"
"<color_light_cyan>拾得メニュー</color>操作:\n"
"<keybind:RIGHT>: 拾得するアイテムを選択\n"
"<keybind:LEFT>: 選択解除\n"
"<keybind:CONFIRM>: 確定\n"
"\n"
"アイテムがあるタイルの位置まで移動しなくても、ある程度まで近寄れば拾得できます。アイテムが大きすぎて所持できない、あるいは武器として使いたい場合、<keybind:wield>を押してから置いてあるアイテムを選択するか、<color_light_cyan>拾得メニュー</color>からアイテムを選択することで、手に装備できます。\n"
"\n"
"<color_light_cyan>野球バット</color>を拾い、南側のドアの傍まで移動して、チュートリアルを続けましょう。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "tutorial_messages"
#: data/json/snippets/tutorial.json
msgid ""
"There is a display rack next to you with a steel spear lying on it.  You can press <keybind:wield> to directly wield an item, without the need of picking it up first.  Pressing <keybind:wield> will open the <color_light_cyan>Wield item</color> menu.  Select the item you want to wield and confirm by pressing <keybind:CONFIRM>.\n"
"\n"
"As you have no free space in your inventory, you will have to drop the <color_light_cyan>baseball bat</color> on the ground before you can wield the spear.\n"
"\n"
"If you wish to free your hands (i.e. wield nothing), press <keybind:wield> and select your currently wielded item.  Alternatively, you could drop the wielded item by pressing <keybind:drop> and selecting your currently wielded item.\n"
"\n"
"To continue the tutorial, please wield the spear and move to the counters west of you."
msgstr ""
"隣の金属棚にはスチールスピアが置いてありますね。<keybind:wield>を押せば、わざわざアイテムを一度拾得することなく装備することができます。<keybind:wield>を押すと<color_light_cyan>アイテム装備</color>メニューが表示されるので、手に持ちたいアイテムを選択し、<keybind:CONFIRM>キーで確定します。\n"
"\n"
"所持容量が足りないため、スチールスピアを装備するには<color_light_cyan>野球バット</color>をその場に落とす必要があります。\n"
"両手を空けたい(何も装備しない状態にしたい)場合は、<keybind:wield>を押してから装備中のアイテムを選択しましょう。もしくは、<keybind:drop>キーを押してから装備中のアイテムを選択する操作でも、装備中のアイテムをその場に落とすことができます。\n"
"\n"
"スチールスピアを装備したら、西側のカウンターまで移動して、チュートリアルを続けましょう。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "tutorial_messages"
#: data/json/snippets/tutorial.json
msgid ""
"There is a <color_light_cyan>water dispenser</color> around the corner.  "
"Pick up the <color_light_cyan>plastic bottle</color> from the rack and "
"proceed to the dispenser."
msgstr ""
"角を曲がったところに<color_light_cyan>ウォーターサーバー</color>があります。棚にある<color_light_cyan>ペットボトル(500ml/ﾌﾟﾗｽﾁｯｸ)</color>を拾得して、ウォーターサーバーのところまで移動しましょう。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "tutorial_messages"
#: data/json/snippets/tutorial.json
msgid ""
"The item you just picked up is a type of clothing!  To wear clothing, press "
"<keybind:wear> and then select an item.  To take off clothing, press "
"<keybind:take_off>, or simply take it off and drop it in one action by "
"pressing <keybind:drop>."
msgstr ""
"着用できるアイテムを拾いましたね！<keybind:wear>を押してアイテムを選択すれば着用できます。<keybind:take_off>を押せば脱ぎま。<keybind:drop>を押せば、アイテムを脱いでその場に落とす操作を一度に実行できます。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "tutorial_messages"
#: data/json/snippets/tutorial.json
msgid ""
"The item you just picked up is a good weapon!  To wield a weapon, press "
"<keybind:wield>, then pick what to wield.  To wield nothing, either drop "
"your weapon with <keybind:drop>, or press <keybind:wield> to put it away.  A"
" zombie has spawned nearby.  To attack it, simply move into it."
msgstr ""
"武器になりそうなアイテムを拾いましたね！装備するには<keybind:wield>を押し、アイテムを選択します。何も装備していない状態にしたい時は、<keybind:drop>を押して装備中のアイテムを落とすか、<keybind:wield>を押して外しましょう。近くにゾンビが出現しました。攻撃対象がいる方向に移動するだけで、攻撃を繰り出せます。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "tutorial_messages"
#: data/json/snippets/tutorial.json
msgid ""
"The item you just picked up is a comestible!  To eat a comestible, press "
"<keybind:eat>.  Comestibles are items you can use up, like food, drink, "
"pills, etc.  Most food expires eventually, so be careful.  Some comestibles,"
" especially drugs, can cause subtle, long-term effects."
msgstr ""
"消費アイテムを拾いましたね！<keybind:eat>で摂取できます。食べ物や飲み物、薬などは、一度使うとなくなります。大抵の食べ物は、いつかは消費期限が切れるので注意が必要です。消費アイテムの中でも薬には、特殊な効果や長期間持続する効果をもつアイテムが多く存在します。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "tutorial_messages"
#: data/json/snippets/tutorial.json
msgid ""
"The item you just picked up is a tool!  To activate a tool, press "
"<keybind:apply>.  Some tools have a set charge, which can be reloaded once "
"depleted.  Others are single-use items, and still others are reusable."
msgstr ""
"道具として使えるアイテムを拾いましたね！使用するには<keybind:apply>を押しましょう。道具には、充填した他のアイテムを消費して機能するものや、一度使い切っても再充填できるもの、一度しか使えないもの、何度でも使えるものなど、様々な種類があります。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "tutorial_messages"
#: data/json/snippets/tutorial.json
msgid ""
"The item you just picked up is a firearm!  Guns are very powerful weapons "
"but they require ammunition.  Firearms have many special attributes.  Most "
"modify the damage done by their ammunition.  They also have dispersion, "
"which affects their chance to hit.  Some guns are semi-automatic, while "
"others can fire a burst.  Some firearms (mainly bows and other muscle-"
"powered weapons) have a range, which is added on top of the ammo's range "
"when firing."
msgstr ""
"銃を拾いました！銃は非常に強力な武器ですが、弾薬を必要とします。銃には様々な特性があります。大抵の銃は、使う弾薬によって与えられるダメージが変動します。命中精度の算出に用いられる分散の値も、弾薬によって決まります。銃の中にはセミオートのものや、バースト射撃が可能なものがあります。一部の小型遠距離武器(主に弓などの筋力を必要とするもの)には射程距離が設定されており、この値に弾薬の射程の値を足したものが実際の射程距離です。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "tutorial_messages"
#: data/json/snippets/tutorial.json
msgid ""
"The item you just picked up is ammunition, used with a gun.  It has many "
"special attributes.  The damage value is the maximum done on a standard hit;"
" a critical hit or headshot will do much more damage.  Some monsters or NPCs"
" will wear armor which reduces the damage from gunfire; a high armor-pierce "
"value will reduce this effect.  The range is the maximum range the ammo can "
"achieve, and the dispersion affects its chance to hit."
msgstr ""
"銃の弾薬を拾いました。弾薬は特殊な性質を多数もっています。威力の値は普通に命中した時に与える最大ダメージを示しており、会心やヘッドショット時のダメージは更に高くなります。銃のダメージを減少させる装甲を身につけたモンスターやNPCもいますが、弾薬に設定されている貫通の値が高いほど、ダメージが装甲に影響されにくくなります。射程距離は射撃が届く距離を表し、分散は命中精度に影響します。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "tutorial_messages"
#: data/json/snippets/tutorial.json
msgid ""
"You just put on an article of clothing that provides physical protection.  "
"There are three types of damage that clothing defends against: "
"<color_light_cyan>bashing</color>, <color_light_cyan>cutting</color>, and "
"<color_light_cyan>ballistic</color>.  Most monsters deal bashing damage, but"
" cutting is often the more deadly of the two.  Not many enemies deal "
"ballistic damage; among them are some robots, turrets, and non-playable "
"characters (NPCs)."
msgstr ""
"肉体を保護する衣服を着用しました。着用アイテムのダメージ防御性能には、<color_light_cyan>耐打</color>、<color_light_cyan>耐斬</color>、<color_light_cyan>防弾</color>の3種類があります。大抵のモンスターは打撃攻撃を繰り出しますが、斬撃攻撃はより致命的です。防弾性能が必要な攻撃を繰り出す敵はそれほど多くありませんが、ロボットやタレット、ノンプレイヤーキャラクター(NPC)がその代表格です。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "tutorial_messages"
#: data/json/snippets/tutorial.json
msgid ""
"You just put on an article of clothing that provides ample storage space.  This will allow you to carry more stuff, but be aware that there is also a limit on the weight you can carry which depends on your strength.  The item you put on also encumbered your torso.  This will make combat a little more difficult.  To check encumbrance, press <keybind:player_data>.\n"
"\n"
"To continue the tutorial, please move to the corridor to the north and wear all clothing you find on the racks."
msgstr ""
"十分な収納容積をもつ衣服を着用しました。これで更に多くのアイテムを所持できるようになりましたが、筋力によって所持重量の限界があるので注意が必要です。また、着用したアイテムは胴の動作を妨げるため、少しだけ戦闘し辛くなります。着用アイテムの動作制限を確認するときは、<keybind:player_data>キーを押しましょう。\n"
"\n"
"北側の通路に移動し、棚にある全ての服を着用して、チュートリアルを続けましょう。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "tutorial_messages"
#: data/json/snippets/tutorial.json
msgid ""
"You just put on an article of clothing that protects against the "
"environment.  The most common and important are respiratory devices, which "
"will protect you against smoke, airborne toxins or organisms, and other "
"common hazards.  However, they also make it a little harder to breathe when "
"running, so you'll move more slowly.  To check your encumbrance, press "
"<keybind:player_data>."
msgstr ""
"周囲の環境から肉体を保護するアイテムを着用しました。この種のアイテムの中で最も一般的かつ重要なのは、口を覆うアイテムです。煙や空気中に含まれる有害物質、生物が放出する毒素などの様々な危険から呼吸器を守ってくれます。一方で、着用しながら走ると息苦しくなるため、移動速度が低下します。<keybind:player_data>を押せば各部位の動作制限を確認できます。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "tutorial_messages"
#: data/json/snippets/tutorial.json
msgid ""
"If you press <keybind:inventory> and then the letter of your weapon, you'll "
"see its combat stats.  Bashing damage ignores most armor, but varies greatly"
" and requires strength.  Cutting damage is a fixed amount, but is blocked by"
" armor.  The To-hit bonus affects your chances of hitting.  The amount of "
"time it takes to swing your melee weapon depends on both its size and "
"weight; small, compact weapons are the fastest."
msgstr ""
"<keybind:inventory>キーを押し、アイテムに割り当てられているキーを押すと、武器としての性能が表示されます。打撃攻撃は大抵の装甲を無視しますが、威力にバラつきがあり、相応の筋力が必要です。斬撃は威力が一定していますが、装甲によって防がれます。命中補正は攻撃の命中精度に影響します。近接武器での攻撃にかかる時間は、そのサイズと重量の両方に依存します。小さくて軽量な武器は素早く振るえる、ということです。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "tutorial_messages"
#: data/json/snippets/tutorial.json
msgid ""
"Hitting a monster will stun it briefly, allowing you to escape or get in "
"another attack.  Your dexterity and melee skills are used to determine "
"whether an attack hits, while strength affects damage."
msgstr ""
"攻撃を命中させるとモンスターを一時的に気絶させることがあり、逃げたり次の攻撃を加えたりできます。器用と近接攻撃スキルは命中精度に影響し、筋力はダメージ量に影響します。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "tutorial_messages"
#: data/json/snippets/tutorial.json
msgid ""
"Looks like you suddenly felt pain.  The pain status is indicated on the sidebar and also in the <keybind:player_data> menu.\n"
"\n"
"Small amounts of pain are tolerable, but as it gets worse your stats will drop and you will move much slower.  To reduce pain, take painkillers like <color_light_cyan>codeine</color> on the rack nearby (by activating it with <keybind:apply>), or simply wait it out."
msgstr ""
"急に痛みを感じだしたようですね。苦痛のレベルは、サイドバーや、<keybind:player_data>を押して表示されるメニューで確認できます。\n"
"\n"
"多少の苦痛は我慢できますが、あまりに強い苦痛は能力値を低下させ、動作を鈍らせます。痛みを和らげたいなら、付近の棚に置いてある<color_light_cyan>コデイン</color>などの鎮痛剤を(<keybind:apply>を押して)服用するか、ただひたすら待つことです。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "tutorial_messages"
#: data/json/snippets/tutorial.json
msgid ""
"When you kill a monster it will often leave behind a corpse.  Corpses can be"
" important sources of food, but you must butcher them by standing on the "
"corpse and pressing <keybind:butcher>.  You'll need a bladed weapon in your "
"inventory, preferably a small, very sharp one.  An unskilled butcher may "
"only get a few pieces of meat, or none at all.  Note that many monsters, "
"such as zombies, leave tainted meat, unsuitable for consumption."
msgstr ""
"モンスターを殺すと、大抵は死体が残ります。死体は貴重な食料源ですが、まず死体があるタイル上で<keybind:butcher>を押して解体する必要があります。解体には(できれば小型で鋭い)刃物を所持している必要があります。作業に慣れていないと、肉が少ししか採れない、あるいはまったく採れないこともあります。ゾンビなどの多くのモンスターの肉は汚染されており、食用に適さないことは覚えておきましょう。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "tutorial_messages"
#: data/json/snippets/tutorial.json
msgid ""
"That drug you just took is a <color_light_cyan>painkiller</color>.  Painkillers are very important to keep on hand, as pain both penalizes your stats and makes you slower.  Be careful though, as the stronger painkillers can make you woozy, and some are even addictive.\n"
"\n"
"Please also note that painkillers don't work the moment you take them.  They need some time to start working, and you don't need to take another dose right now if you don't see the immediate effect.  Just wait, and sooner or later the pain will start going away."
msgstr ""
"<color_light_cyan>鎮痛</color>効果をもつ薬を摂取しましたね。苦痛を感じていると能力値が低下したり動きが鈍ったりするため、鎮痛剤を常備しておくことはとても重要です。ただし、強力な鎮痛剤を服用すると眩暈がすることもあり、中には依存性がある薬もあるため、注意が必要です。\n"
"\n"
"鎮痛剤は飲んだ瞬間に効くものではないことにも気を付けましょう。すぐに効果が表れなくても、すかさず追加で服用してはいけません。しばらく待っていれば、鎮痛剤の効果が表れて苦痛は治まります。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "tutorial_messages"
#: data/json/snippets/tutorial.json
msgid ""
"That drug you just took placed an effect on you.  To check your effects, "
"press <keybind:player_data>.  Most only last a short while, while others, "
"like chronic disease, last until cured by some other means."
msgstr ""
"薬が効いてきましたね。<keybind:player_data>を押して確認してみましょう。ほとんどの場合、表示されている効果は短時間で消えますが、治療手段を取らない限り慢性的に残り続ける効果もあります。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "tutorial_messages"
#: data/json/snippets/tutorial.json
msgid ""
"You just drank a bottle of water, reducing your thirst level and reducing "
"the water level in the bottle.  You'll probably want to drop empty bottles, "
"or you might want to save them to refill from a water source later."
msgstr "水を飲むと渇きを癒すことができます。空のボトルは捨てたいと思うかもしれませんが、後で水場から汲むために取っておきましょう。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "tutorial_messages"
#: data/json/snippets/tutorial.json
msgid ""
"You just activated a grenade!  You probably want to throw it.  To throw an "
"item, press <keybind:throw> and then select the item to throw.  The maximum "
"range depends on your strength and the object's weight and size.  Throwing "
"isn't very good in most combat situations, but if you've got some fire "
"power…"
msgstr ""
"手榴弾のピンを引き抜きました！投げた方がよさそうです。アイテムを投げるには、<keybind:throw>を押したあと投げるアイテムを選択します。投擲できる範囲は、自身の筋力と投げるアイテムの重量・体積によって異なります。投擲は、戦闘中に役立つことはあまりありませんが、爆発物を持っているなら話は別です..."

#. ~ Snippet in category "tutorial_messages"
#: data/json/snippets/tutorial.json
msgid ""
"This thing here on the floor is a <color_light_cyan>trap</color>.  Traps are"
" permanent until set off, and can be an important defensive tactic, "
"particularly when sleeping in unsafe territory.  Try stepping on the bubble "
"wrap.  Don't worry, it's harmless, but it will make some noise.  There are "
"other types of traps that will cause varying amounts of damage or even "
"teleport you, so watch your step carefully."
msgstr ""
"床の上に<color_light_cyan>罠</color>が設置されていますね。罠は発動するまで永久に設置場所に残ります。安全が確保されていない場所で眠りたいなら、特に重要な防衛策です。試しに気泡シートを踏んでみましょう。大丈夫、踏んでも少し音がするだけで、ダメージはありません。罠には、様々なダメージを与える、テレポートさせるなど、色々な種類があります。足元には十分注意しておきましょう。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "tutorial_messages"
#: data/json/snippets/tutorial.json
msgid ""
"In the next room you'll find a row of racks with a gun, a magazine for it, and ammo for it.  To be able to fire a gun, you'll need to insert a magazine with ammo in it.  Press <keybind:reload_item> to open the <color_light_cyan>Reload item</color> menu and put ammo in the magazine, and then press <keybind:reload_item> once again to insert a magazine into a gun.\n"
"\n"
"If you wish to unload your gun, possibly to change ammunition types, press <keybind:unload>."
msgstr ""
"次の部屋には、棚に銃と弾倉、そして弾薬が置いてあります。銃を撃てるようにするには、弾薬入りの弾倉を銃に装填する必要があります。<keybind:reload_item>を押して<color_light_cyan>アイテム装填</color>メニューを開いて弾薬を弾倉に装填し、もう一度<keybind:reload_item>を押して今度は弾倉を銃に装填しましょう。\n"
"\n"
"弾薬の種類を変えたい場合もあるかもしれません。装填したものを抜き取るときは、<keybind:unload>を押しましょう。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "tutorial_messages"
#: data/json/snippets/tutorial.json
msgid ""
"Finally, to fire a gun, press <keybind:fire>. You'll automatically target the last monster you shot at, or the closest monster to you.  You can change your target with the <color_yellow>movement keys</color>, or cycle through monsters with <keybind:TARGET:PREV_TARGET> and <keybind:TARGET:NEXT_TARGET>.  Select the <color_light_cyan>dummy</color> as a target and press <keybind:fire> to fire a single shot.  With many guns, you can change the fire mode to burst or full auto by pressing <keybind:select_fire_mode>.\n"
"\n"
"There are detailed instructions on how to aim and fire in the <color_light_cyan>Aiming and firing</color> menu, so make sure to check it carefully.\n"
"\n"
"To continue the tutorial, please fire a couple of times at the dummy and move to the corridor to the west."
msgstr ""
"それでは、<keybind:fire>を押して銃を撃ちましょう。最も近い位置にいるモンスターか、最後に撃ったモンスターを自動的に狙います。<color_yellow>方向キー</color>で標的を変更し、<keybind:TARGET:PREV_TARGET>と<keybind:TARGET:NEXT_TARGET>で標的を順に切り替えます。<color_light_cyan>ダミー</color>を標的として選択し、<keybind:fire>を押すと弾が一発だけ発射されます。バースト射撃モードが備わっている銃も多数あります。射撃モードを切り替えるときは<keybind:select_fire_mode>キーを押しましょう。\n"
"\n"
"狙い方や撃ち方については<color_light_cyan>照準と発射メニュー</color>に詳しい説明があるので、しっかり確認しておきましょう。\n"
"\n"
"ダミーに向かって何度か発砲してみたら、西側の通路に移動してチュートリアルを続けましょう。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "tutorial_messages"
#: data/json/snippets/tutorial.json
msgid ""
"Firing your gun will increase your recoil level.  You can see its level in "
"the <color_light_cyan>Aiming and firing</color> menu (by pressing "
"<keybind:fire>).  Generally speaking, the more damaging the ammo, the worse "
"the recoil.  Recoil severely reduces your chance to hit, but you can "
"eliminate recoil by pausing (<keybind:pause>) for a turn.  High strength "
"reduces recoil, so weak characters might want to stick to .22 or 9x19mm "
"guns."
msgstr ""
"銃を発射すると、反動が発生します。<color_light_cyan>照準と発射メニュー</color>(<keybind:fire>を押す)で反動の強さを確認できます。一般的に、弾の威力が高いほど反動も強くなります。反動が残っている状態で銃を撃つと命中精度が大幅に悪くなりますが、しばらく待つ(<keybind:pause>を1回押すと1ターン経過)ことで反動は減少していきます。筋力が高いほど反動は低減されるので、筋力が高いほど反動を抑えられるので、筋力が低いキャラクターは.22口径や9x19ｍｍなどの小口径銃を使った方がいいかもしれません。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "tutorial_messages"
#: data/json/snippets/tutorial.json
msgid ""
"This is a staircase leading down.  To go downstairs, step onto the staircase"
" and press the <keybind:LEVEL_DOWN> key.  Similarly, to go upstairs, stand "
"on the staircase leading up and press the <keybind:LEVEL_UP> key."
msgstr ""
"下層へ続く階段がありますね。階段を下りるには、階段があるタイル上に立って<keybind:LEVEL_DOWN>を押しましょう。同様に、階段を上るときは<keybind:LEVEL_UP>を押しましょう。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "tutorial_messages"
#: data/json/snippets/tutorial.json
msgid ""
"It's dark down here!  Without a source of light, you'll be limited to seeing"
" only one space in any direction.  You'll encounter darkness while "
"underground or at night.  Press <keybind:LEVEL_UP> to go back upstairs, and "
"look around for a flashlight."
msgstr ""
"真っ暗です！光源がなければ視界は周囲1タイル分しか効きません。夜間や地下は大抵真っ暗です。<keybind:LEVEL_UP>を押して階段を上がり、懐中電灯を探しましょう。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "tutorial_messages"
#: data/json/snippets/tutorial.json
msgid ""
"It's dark down here!  Fortunately, you have a "
"<color_light_cyan>flashlight</color>.  Press <keybind:apply> and then select"
" your flashlight to turn it on."
msgstr ""
"真っ暗です！しかし幸いなことに、<color_light_cyan>懐中電灯</color>を所持しています。<keybind:apply>を押してから懐中電灯を選択し、オンにしましょう。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "tutorial_messages"
#: data/json/snippets/tutorial.json
msgid ""
"From a water source like this, you can fill any containers you might have.  Examine the dispenser by pressing <keybind:examine>.  Next, press <color_yellow>'c'</color> to fill a container, then select the <color_light_cyan>plastic bottle</color> to put the water into.\n"
"\n"
"The Examine command (<keybind:examine>) can be used for interacting with many types of terrain and furniture.\n"
"\n"
"To continue the tutorial, please fill the plastic bottle with water, drink a little of it (by pressing <keybind:eat> and selecting <color_light_cyan>clean water</color>), and then move to the corridor to the north."
msgstr ""
"このような水源があれば、様々な容器に水を汲み入れることができます。<keybind:examine>を押してウォーターサーバーを調べ、次に<color_yellow>c</color>キーを押してから<color_light_cyan>ペットボトル(500ml)</color>を選択すれば、水を汲めます。\n"
"\n"
"調べるコマンドの<keybind:examine>を押せば、様々な地形や設置物を使った行動を取ることができます。\n"
"\n"
"ボトルに水を入れられたら一口飲み(<keybind:eat>を押してから<color_light_cyan>飲料水</color>を選択)、北側の通路に移動してチュートリアルを続けましょう。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "tutorial_messages"
#: data/json/snippets/tutorial.json
msgid ""
"There is a <color_light_cyan>dummy</color> standing before you.  Let's attack it.  To do this, simply move into it.\n"
"\n"
"After you've dealt with it, please move to the door behind it."
msgstr ""
"目の前に<color_light_cyan>ダミー</color>が立っていますね。攻撃してみましょう。やり方は簡単、攻撃対象がいる方向に移動するだけです。\n"
"\n"
"倒せたら、その先のドアまで移動してください。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "tutorial_messages"
#: data/json/snippets/tutorial.json
msgid ""
"This door is locked.  There are several ways to deal with locked doors (lockpicking and prying being the most common), but right now you don't have the necessary tools at hand.  Instead, you can simply bash it with your <color_light_cyan>baseball bat</color> by pressing <keybind:smash> and then selecting the direction.\n"
"\n"
"Note that not every door can be bashed down.  Some doors will require more strength than you have or a stronger weapon.  If you're not seeing any damage being done after a few swings, an alternative approach might be needed.\n"
"\n"
"To continue the tutorial, please smash the door."
msgstr ""
"このドアは施錠されています。ゲーム内で施錠されたドアに対処する方法は(ピッキング、こじ開けるなど)複数ありますが、今は必要な道具が手元にありません。そこで今回は、<color_light_cyan>野球バット</color>を装備した状態で<keybind:smash>を押し、次に叩きたい方向を指定して破壊しましょう。\n"
"\n"
"ただし、全てのドアを叩き壊せるわけではありません。今の筋力や武器では絶対に破壊できないドアもあります。もし、数回叩いてもダメージを与えられていないようなら、他の方法を考えましょう。\n"
"\n"
"ドアを叩き壊したら、チュートリアルを続けましょう。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "tutorial_messages"
#: data/json/snippets/tutorial.json
msgid ""
"Bashing things is hard work that will deplete your stamina.  You can see how much stamina you have on the sidebar.  The less stamina you have, the slower your movement and most actions will be.  To restore stamina, you need only to wait.  You can press <keybind:wait> to open the <color_light_cyan>Wait for how long</color> menu and select the amount of time you want to wait.  Select option <color_light_cyan>Wait until you catch your breath</color> to fully restore all lost stamina.\n"
"\n"
"Be careful about doing too many strenuous activities as you will build up your weariness over time, which will stack movement and action penalties on top of your stamina cost.  You can watch your <color_light_cyan>Weary Transition</color> in the sidebar as you are performing longer activities to see their effect on  your weariness.  To reduce your weariness, you just need to rest or do less strenuous activities for a while."
msgstr ""
"ものを叩き壊すのは激しい運動であり、スタミナを消耗します。現在のスタミナ量は、サイドバーで確認できます。スタミナが減ると、移動などの動作が鈍くなります。スタミナを回復するには、ただ待つだけで大丈夫です。<keybind:wait>を押すと<color_light_cyan>待機時間メニュー</color>が表示されるので、いつまで待機するか選択しましょう。<color_light_cyan>息を整える</color>を選べば、スタミナが完全に回復するまで待機することになります。\n"
"\n"
"あまりに激しい運動をし続けると、時間と共に疲労が蓄積され、スタミナ消費に加えて移動や行動にペナルティが課されてしまうため、注意が必要です。長時間の行動を実行に移す時は、サイドバーの<color_light_cyan>疲労推移</color>を見て、疲労度への影響を確認しましょう。疲労を解消したいときは、しばらく休む、激しい運動を控えるなどしましょう。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "tutorial_messages"
#: data/json/snippets/tutorial.json
msgid ""
"There is another <color_light_cyan>dummy</color> standing behind the counters.  Most melee weapons require standing directly adjacent to your target in order to hit it.\n"
"\n"
"Fortunately, some long weapons such as spears are able to perform reach attack with a range of 2 or 3, so if you have one, you don't need to climb onto the counters to stand next to the dummy.  The <color_light_cyan>steel spear</color> has a range of 2, so you can hit the dummy right over the counters.  To use the reach attack, press the <keybind:fire> key.  Once you select your target, press <keybind:CONFIRM> to confirm.\n"
"\n"
"After you've dealt with the dummy, please move to the corridor to the south."
msgstr ""
"カウンターの裏にまた<color_light_cyan>ダミー</color>が立っていますね。大抵の近接武器は、標的と隣接した位置にいないと攻撃が命中しません。\n"
"\n"
"嬉しいことに、槍などの長柄武器は2マス、3マス離れた位置への攻撃が可能です。そういった武器を装備していれば、わざわざカウンターの上に乗ってダミーに隣接する必要もありません。<color_light_cyan>スチールスピア</color>の射程は2なので、カウンター越しにダミーを攻撃できます。遠距離攻撃をするときはまず<keybind:fire>を押し、標的を選択したら<keybind:CONFIRM>を押して実行に移しましょう。\n"
"\n"
"ダミーを倒せたら、南側の通路に移動しましょう。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "tutorial_messages"
#: data/json/snippets/tutorial.json
msgid ""
"Always wielding a <color_light_cyan>steel spear</color> in your hands might be inconvenient.  Fortunately, there is a <color_light_cyan>spear strap</color> lying on the rack nearby.  You can wear it by pressing <keybind:wear>.\n"
"To take off any worn item, you can press <keybind:take_off>.\n"
"\n"
"To continue the tutorial, please wear the spear strap."
msgstr ""
"常に<color_light_cyan>スチールスピア</color>を手に持ち続けていると、不便なこともあるかもしれません。幸運にも、棚に<color_light_cyan>スピアストラップ</color>が置いてあります。<keybind:wear>を押して着用しましょう。\n"
"着用したアイテムを脱ぐときは、<keybind:take_off>を押します。\n"
"\n"
"スピアストラップを着用できたら、チュートリアルを続けましょう。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "tutorial_messages"
#: data/json/snippets/tutorial.json
msgid ""
"You can put the <color_light_cyan>steel spear</color> in the <color_light_cyan>spear strap</color> to free your hands.  Press <keybind:apply> to open the <color_light_cyan>Use item</color> menu, then select the spear strap, then select the spear, and finally press <keybind:CONFIRM> to confirm.\n"
"\n"
"To continue the tutorial, please put the <color_light_cyan>steel spear</color> in the <color_light_cyan>spear strap</color> and move down the corridor."
msgstr ""
"装備している<color_light_cyan>スチールスピア</color>を<color_light_cyan>スピアストラップ</color>に収納すれば、両手が自由になります。<keybind:apply>を押して<color_light_cyan>アイテム使用メニュー</color>を開き、スピアストラップを選択したら、続けて収納したい槍を選択し、最後に<keybind:CONFIRM>を押して操作を実行しましょう。\n"
"\n"
"<color_light_cyan>スチールスピア</color>を<color_light_cyan>スピアストラップ</color>に収納できたら、通路を進んでチュートリアルを続けましょう。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "tutorial_messages"
#: data/json/snippets/tutorial.json
msgid ""
"Cataclysm uses a container-based inventory.  Putting something into your inventory requires wearing some clothing or container with pockets that are big enough to hold it.  The <color_light_cyan>spear strap</color> is one example of such containers.  Pockets have finite dimensions, so you can't put an item that has more volume or is longer than a pocket.\n"
"\n"
"To view your inventory, press <keybind:inventory>.  You'll see that you have only your worn clothes, of which only your jeans have 4 small pockets.  Select your jeans and press <keybind:CONFIRM> to see their description and amount of pockets.  To scroll through the description, press <keybind:PAGE_UP> and <keybind:PAGE_DOWN>.\n"
"\n"
"To continue the tutorial, move to the western rack and wear (<keybind:wear>) the <color_light_cyan>backpack</color> to increase the available capacity of your inventory."
msgstr ""
"このゲームでは収納アイテムベースの所持システムを採用しています。つまり、アイテムを所持したいなら、ポケット付きの服といった収納アイテムを着用しておく必要がある、ということです。<color_light_cyan>スピアストラップ</color>もそのような収納アイテムの一つです。ポケットの寸法は有限なので、ポケットの容積より大きいアイテムや長いアイテムは収納できません。\n"
"\n"
"所持品を見るには<keybind:inventory>を押しましょう。着用している服が表示されますが、ジーンズだけに4つの小さなポケットが付いていることが分かりますね。ジーンズを選択して<keybind:CONFIRM>を押せば、ジーンズについての説明とポケットの数が表示されます。説明をスクロールしたいときは<keybind:PAGE_UP>と<keybind:PAGE_DOWN>を押しましょう。\n"
"\n"
"棚に置いてある<color_light_cyan>バックパック</color>を着用(<keybind:wear>を押す)して所持容量を増やしたら、チュートリアルを続けましょう。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "tutorial_messages"
#: data/json/snippets/tutorial.json
msgid ""
"There is a <color_light_cyan>flashlight</color> and a <color_light_cyan>light disposable battery</color> lying on the rack.  Flashlights are very useful tools as they allow you to see in the dark.\n"
"\n"
"To continue the tutorial, please reload the flashlight by pressing <keybind:reload_item>.  Take it with you and move to the stairs."
msgstr ""
"棚に<color_light_cyan>懐中電灯</color>と<color_light_cyan>乾電池S</color>が置いてありますね。懐中電灯は、暗闇で視界を確保できるとても便利な道具です。\n"
"\n"
"<keybind:reload_item>を押して懐中電灯に乾電池Sを装填したら、それを持って階段がある地点まで移動し、チュートリアルを続けましょう。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "tutorial_messages"
#: data/json/snippets/tutorial.json
msgid ""
"A <color_light_cyan>flashlight</color> is a good thing to have, but it drains its battery quickly, so it won't last very long.  A much better solution for long-lasting lighting is a <color_light_cyan>gasoline lantern</color>.  Reload the lantern with <color_light_cyan>gasoline</color> (<keybind:reload_item>) and then activate it (<keybind:apply>) while standing nearby.  A <color_light_cyan>lighter</color> will help you to fire the lantern.\n"
"\n"
"Some tools (such as lamps, dehydrators, bathroom scales etc) don't need to be picked up before activating and allow remote use.\n"
"\n"
"After you light the lantern, you can safely turn off your flashlight to conserve its energy; the lit lantern will give you enough light for any actions and will last much longer.\n"
"\n"
"To continue the tutorial, please light the lantern and then move to the corridor to the east."
msgstr ""
"<color_light_cyan>懐中電灯</color>はとても便利ですが、電池の消耗が激しいため、明かりがあまり長持ちしません。長持ちする照明としては、<color_light_cyan>ガソリンランタン</color>の方がはるかに優秀です。ガソリンランタンに<color_light_cyan>ガソリン</color>を装填(<keybind:reload_item>を押す)し、付近にある状態で起動(<keybind:apply>を押す)しましょう。<color_light_cyan>ライター</color>があれば、ランタンに火が灯る筈です。\n"
"\n"
"一部の道具(ランプや食料脱水機、体重計など)は、所持していない状態でも、ある程度近い地点からであれば起動できます。\n"
"\n"
"ランタンに火が灯ったら、電池を節約するために、念のため懐中電灯をオフにしておきましょう。\n"
"\n"
"ランタンを点灯させたら、東側の通路に移動してチュートリアルを続けましょう。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "tutorial_messages"
#: data/json/snippets/tutorial.json
msgid ""
"Looks like you're hungry!  The hunger status is indicated on the sidebar.  Let's make a <color_light_cyan>peanut butter sandwich</color> from <color_light_cyan>peanut butter</color> and <color_light_cyan>crackers</color> on the counter next to the wall.\n"
"\n"
"To make food, you need to use the <color_light_cyan>Crafting</color> menu.  Press <keybind:craft> to open the menu.  Press <keybind:NEXT_TAB> and <keybind:PREV_TAB> to toggle crafting categories and select the <color_light_cyan>FOOD</color> category.  From there, select peanut butter sandwich and press <keybind:CONFIRM> to start crafting.\n"
"\n"
"Note that you don't need to stand directly near the counter to be able to craft.  The <color_light_cyan>crafting radius</color> is 6 tiles, so while you're standing no farther than 6 tiles from any crafting components and tools, your character is able to still get them in order to use them.\n"
"\n"
"To continue the tutorial, please craft the peanut butter sandwich and then eat it by pressing <keybind:eat>."
msgstr ""
"お腹が空いているようですね！サイドバーに空腹の状態が表示されています。壁際のカウンターに置いてある<color_light_cyan>ピーナッツバター</color>と<color_light_cyan>クラッカー</color>を使って、<color_light_cyan>サンドイッチ(ﾋﾟｰﾅｯﾂﾊﾞﾀｰ)</color>を作ってみましょう。\n"
"\n"
"料理をするときは、<color_light_cyan>製作メニュー</color>を使います。<keybind:craft>を押して、メニューを開きましょう。<keybind:NEXT_TAB>と<keybind:PREV_TAB>を使って製作カテゴリーを切り替え、<color_light_cyan>食料</color>カテゴリーを選んでください。一覧の中からサンドイッチ(ﾋﾟｰﾅｯﾂﾊﾞﾀｰ)を選択し、<keybind:CONFIRM>を押せば製作が開始されます。\n"
"\n"
"なお、カウンターに隣接していない場所でも製作は可能です。<color_light_cyan>製作作業範囲</color>は半径6タイルなので、材料や道具がキャラクターから6タイル以内にあれば、それらを利用した製作作業を進められます。\n"
"\n"
"サンドイッチ(ﾋﾟｰﾅｯﾂﾊﾞﾀｰ)を製作し、<keybind:eat>を押して食べたら、チュートリアルを続けましょう。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "tutorial_messages"
#: data/json/snippets/tutorial.json
msgid ""
"In the next room, you can find a <color_light_cyan>paint brush</color> and several cans of <color_light_cyan>paint</color>.  You can use them to paint the wall in your preferred color.  To do this, open the <color_light_cyan>Construction</color> menu by pressing <keybind:construct> and toggling the categories with <keybind:LEFT> and <keybind:RIGHT>.  Find the <color_light_cyan>Decorative</color> category and select one of the options to paint the wall.\n"
"\n"
"To continue the tutorial, please paint some walls and move further south."
msgstr ""
"隣の部屋には、<color_light_cyan>刷毛</color>と缶に入った<color_light_cyan>塗料</color>がいくつか置いてあります。これらを使って、壁を好きな色に塗ってみましょう。<keybind:construct>を押して<color_light_cyan>建設メニュー</color>を開き、<keybind:LEFT>と<keybind:RIGHT>でカテゴリーを切り替えます。<color_light_cyan>装飾</color>カテゴリーを見つけたら、その中から壁を塗る項目を一つ選びましょう。\n"
"\n"
"壁に色を塗ったら、更に南へ移動してチュートリアルを続けましょう。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "tutorial_messages"
#: data/json/snippets/tutorial.json
msgid ""
"There are 10 <color_light_cyan>baseballs</color> lying on the floor.  You might not need all 10, or you might not have enough space in your pockets.  To pick up a specific amount of items, press <keybind:pickup>, select the stack of items, and type a number on the keyboard (Multiple numbers can be used for large stacks).  Finish the selection with <keybind:INVENTORY:TOGGLE_ENTRY>.  The cursor should change to a <color_light_cyan>#</color> symbol.\n"
"\n"
"You can throw a baseball at the <color_light_cyan>dummy</color> in the end of the corridor by pressing <keybind:throw>.\n"
"\n"
"To complete the tutorial, throw some baseballs at the dummy and then move to the end of the corridor to the north."
msgstr ""
"床に10個の<color_light_cyan>野球ボール</color>が転がっていますね。10個も必要ない、あるいはポケットが足りず所持できないこともあるでしょう。数を指定してアイテムを拾うには、<keybind:pickup>を押して、次に拾得したい数を数字キーで入力し(2桁以上の数も入力できます)、最後にアイテムを選択しましょう。カーソルが<color_light_cyan>#</color>に変わりましたね。\n"
"通路の奥にいる<color_light_cyan>ダミー</color>に野球ボールを投げつけてみましょう。<keybind:throw>を押せばアイテムを投擲できます。\n"
"\n"
"ダミーに野球ボールをいくつか投げつけてから、北側の通路の端まで移動すれば、チュートリアルは完了です。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "tutorial_messages"
#: data/json/snippets/tutorial.json
msgid ""
"Congratulations!  You have completed the tutorial.  Here is some last-minute advice.\n"
"\n"
"You can press <keybind:action_menu> to open the <color_light_cyan>Action menu</color>.  It provides a convenient way to access various actions.\n"
"\n"
"Not sure what keys you can press in a given menu?  Press the <keybind:HELP_KEYBINDINGS> to open the <color_light_cyan>Keybindings</color> menu.  It allows you to view the existing keybindings and modify them to your liking.  Sometimes there will be lesser used or convenience actions without a default keybinding, which you can also set.\n"
"\n"
"You can continue exploring the tutorial rooms, or you can exit the tutorial by pressing <keybind:save>.  This will save your game and exit to the main menu."
msgstr ""
"おめでとうございます！チュートリアルを完了しました。最後に、いくつかのアドバイスを紹介します。\n"
"\n"
"<keybind:action_menu>を押すと、<color_light_cyan>行動メニュー</color>が表示されます。これを使えば、何十種類もの行動の中から適切なものを簡単に選べます。\n"
"\n"
"どのメニューでどのキーを使うのか分からなくなった？<keybind:HELP_KEYBINDINGS>を押せば、<color_light_cyan>キー割当メニュー</color>を開けます。このメニューから、初期設定のキー割り当てを好みに合わせて変更することもできます。既定でキーが割り当てられていない操作にキーを割り当てることも可能です。\n"
"\n"
"このままチュートリアル部屋の探索を続けても構いませんし、<keybind:save>を押せば、チュートリアルが終了し、ゲームが保存され、メインメニューに戻ります。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "valentine"
#: data/json/snippets/valentines.json
msgid ""
"There is a picture of a kitten pouncing; blood faintly drips from its claws."
"  \"I'd kill!  For you to be my valentine.\""
msgstr "飛び跳ねる子猫の絵が載っています。猫の爪からは血が滴り落ちています。「恋人になってくれなかったら、殺してやる！」"

#. ~ Snippet in category "valentine"
#: data/json/snippets/valentines.json
msgid ""
"A police robot stalks between office cubicles while an indistinct person "
"hides under a desk.  \"Don't hide from love!\""
msgstr "デスクの下に隠れている人物のもとへ、警官ロボットがオフィスのパーティションの間を縫って忍び寄る絵が載っています。「愛から逃げちゃダメ！」"

#. ~ Snippet in category "valentine"
#: data/json/snippets/valentines.json
msgid "A picture of a bloody steak.  \"My love can feed you.\""
msgstr "血が滴るステーキの絵が載っています。「私の愛を召し上がれ」"

#. ~ Snippet in category "valentine"
#: data/json/snippets/valentines.json
msgid ""
"A rustic campground at night lit by a campfire.  \"We should go away "
"together.  Where no one can find us.\""
msgstr "焚き火に照らされる素朴な夜のキャンプ場の絵が載っています。「二人で抜け出しちゃおうか、誰にも見つからない場所へ」"

#. ~ Snippet in category "valentine"
#: data/json/snippets/valentines.json
msgid ""
"A girl with a giant spoon stirs a cauldron with a boy inside and a fire "
"below.  \"You suit my taste just right, Valentine\""
msgstr ""
"火にかけられた大釜の中には男の子が入っており、それを女の子が巨大なスプーンでかき回している絵が載っています。「愛しい人、あなたは私の好みにピッタリ」"

#. ~ Snippet in category "valentine"
#: data/json/snippets/valentines.json
msgid ""
"A person stepping out from the forest.  \"Don't be afraid, it's me, your "
"valentine!\""
msgstr "森から抜け出そうとする人の絵が載っています。「怖がらないで、私よ、あなたの恋人よ！」"

#. ~ Snippet in category "valentine"
#: data/json/snippets/valentines.json
msgid ""
"A building that says 'Crematorium' on it.  \"Ashes to ashes, dust to dust, "
"show me a Valentine, that I can trust\""
msgstr "「火葬場」と書かれた建物の絵が載っています。「灰は灰に、塵は塵に。信じられる愛をちょうだい」"

#. ~ Snippet in category "valentine"
#: data/json/snippets/valentines.json
msgid ""
"A popular RPG character.  \"We should adventure together.\"  In the "
"background, a village in flames."
msgstr "人気RPGのキャラクターと、炎に包まれた村の絵が載っています。「一緒に冒険しよう」"

#. ~ Snippet in category "valentine"
#: data/json/snippets/valentines.json
msgid ""
"A picture of a room that looks like your bedroom.  \"I can't wait to see you"
" again, Valentine.  Sweet dreams.\""
msgstr "見覚えのある自室のベッドの写真が載っています。「また会えるのが待ちきれないよ、大好き、良い夢を」"

#. ~ Snippet in category "valentine"
#: data/json/snippets/valentines.json
msgid ""
"A girl smiles into the camera.  Behind her a house is on fire.  \"I'm "
"burning, I'm burning, I'm burning for you, my valentine!\""
msgstr "燃える家屋を背景にカメラ目線で微笑む女の子の写真が載っています。「わたし燃えてるの、燃えてるの、あなたのために燃えてるの、愛してる」"

#. ~ Snippet in category "Vitrifaction_Blocked"
#: data/json/snippets/vitrified_snippets.json
msgid "There's nothing that way but a plane of featureless black."
msgstr "何もありません。特徴のない黒い平面が広がっています。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "Vitrifaction_Ambient_1"
#: data/json/snippets/vitrified_snippets.json
msgid ""
"With all this glass, you expected it to be brighter here.  It's not.  That's"
" okay, it would have hurt your eyes otherwise."
msgstr "これ程ガラスがあるならもっと光を透過しそうですが、周囲はそこまで明るくありません。目を傷める心配はせずに済みそうです。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "Vitrifaction_Ambient_1"
#: data/json/snippets/vitrified_snippets.json
msgid "A gust of wind blows across the farm.  Glass chimes in the breeze."
msgstr "一陣の風が農場を吹き抜けました。ガラスが風に揺られて音を立てています。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "Vitrifaction_Ambient_1"
#: data/json/snippets/vitrified_snippets.json
msgid "You are suddenly very aware of your heartbeat, but only for a moment."
msgstr "急に自分の心臓の音がひどく気になりましたが、すぐに不安は治まりました。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "Vitrifaction_Ambient_1"
#: data/json/snippets/vitrified_snippets.json
msgid ""
"The glass around you isn't sparkling; it doesn't reflect.  The glimmers that"
" cross it in the corner of your eye are your imagination."
msgstr "周囲のガラスは光をまったく反射していません。目の端にちらつく光は想像の産物です。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "Vitrifaction_Ambient_1"
#: data/json/snippets/vitrified_snippets.json
msgid "It's very cold here."
msgstr "ここはとても寒いです。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "Vitrifaction_Ambient_1"
#: data/json/snippets/vitrified_snippets.json
msgid ""
"You didn't realize there had been an ache at the base of your neck all day "
"until just now, when you notice it's gone."
msgstr "以前から首の付け根がひどく凝っていたような気がしましたが、思い過ごしでした。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "Vitrifaction_Ambient_1"
#: data/json/snippets/vitrified_snippets.json
msgid ""
"There's nothing here, really.  How long has it been since you've felt truly "
"safe?"
msgstr "本当に、ここには何もありません。真に安全な世界に来たと感じてから、どのくらいの時間が経ったのでしょうか？"

#. ~ Snippet in category "Vitrifaction_Ambient_1"
#: data/json/snippets/vitrified_snippets.json
msgid ""
"You find yourself wondering what the glass tastes like.  You're ashamed of "
"the thought."
msgstr "ガラスはどんな味がするのか、ふと気になりましたが、馬鹿げた思考を振り払いました。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "Vitrifaction_Ambient_1"
#: data/json/snippets/vitrified_snippets.json
msgid ""
"The glass is solid under your feet.  It supports you completely, but the "
"feeling of it under your feet is dull, somehow."
msgstr "足元のガラスは安定しています。しっかりと身体を支えてくれていますが、どこか覚束なく感じます。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "Vitrifaction_Ambient_1"
#: data/json/snippets/vitrified_snippets.json
msgid ""
"You can't see it's light, but you know the sun is there.  It's the same "
"perfect black as the rest of the sky."
msgstr "光は見えませんが、どこかで太陽が輝いていることは分かります。空一面が真っ黒に塗られています。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "Vitrifaction_Ambient_1"
#: data/json/snippets/vitrified_snippets.json
msgid ""
"You are seized with a brief desire to smash something, anything.  You don't "
"know why you'd think such an unseemly thing.  It doesn't feel at all like "
"you."
msgstr "何かをとにかく叩き壊したいという、つかの間の欲求に駆られました。どうしてそんな不穏当なことを考えたのか分かりません。耳を疑う考えです。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "Vitrifaction_Ambient_2"
#: data/json/snippets/vitrified_snippets.json
msgid ""
"The edges of the glass are very sharp.  But that is the nature of glass.  "
"Isn't it?"
msgstr "ガラスの縁は非常に鋭利です。しかし、それがガラスというものです。違いますか？"

#. ~ Snippet in category "Vitrifaction_Ambient_2"
#: data/json/snippets/vitrified_snippets.json
msgid ""
"You think, for a moment, that you might start flying.  You don't, but it "
"doesn't trouble you much."
msgstr "一瞬、空を飛べるかもしれないと思いました。そんなことはあり得ません。くだらない考えです。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "Vitrifaction_Ambient_2"
#: data/json/snippets/vitrified_snippets.json
msgid ""
"Somewhere, inside a ribcage, something is beating very fast.  Something "
"about that strikes you as very funny."
msgstr "胸郭の内側のどこかで、何かが非常に素早く脈打っています。何故かとても奇妙だと感じます。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "Vitrifaction_Ambient_2"
#: data/json/snippets/vitrified_snippets.json
msgid "How long has it been since you blinked?  It probably doesn't matter."
msgstr "前に瞬きをしたのはいつだったでしょうか？もうどうでもいいことですが。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "Vitrifaction_Ambient_2"
#: data/json/snippets/vitrified_snippets.json
msgid ""
"You spend a moment looking at your reflection in the glass.  What a nice "
"smile you have!"
msgstr "ガラスに映った自分の姿をしばらく眺めました。なんて素敵な笑顔なのでしょう！"

#. ~ Snippet in category "Vitrifaction_Ambient_2"
#: data/json/snippets/vitrified_snippets.json
msgid ""
"How very smooth it all is.  Even the sharp parts; especially the sharp "
"parts.  Pristine, and perfect."
msgstr "全てがとても滑らかです。尖っている部分も、いえ、尖っている部分こそが最も滑らかです。純粋で完璧です。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "Vitrifaction_Ambient_2"
#: data/json/snippets/vitrified_snippets.json
msgid "You're so glad you decided to visit."
msgstr "ここに来られて本当によかったと感じています。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "Vitrifaction_Ambient_2"
#: data/json/snippets/vitrified_snippets.json
msgid ""
"You were shivering, a little bit ago.  It's stopped now.  You must have "
"warmed up."
msgstr "少し前まで震えが止まりませんでした。今は止まっています。きっと身体が温まったのでしょう。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "Vitrifaction_Ambient_2"
#: data/json/snippets/vitrified_snippets.json
msgid ""
"Everything seems so much more real than usual.  It's all right there.  Reach"
" out; touch it."
msgstr "全てがいつもよりずっとリアルに感じます。何も問題ありません。手を差し伸べ、触れてみましょう。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "Vitrifaction_Ambient_2"
#: data/json/snippets/vitrified_snippets.json
msgid ""
"The place you left behind was much worse than this.  All noise and uneven "
"edges."
msgstr "かつていた場所はここよりずっと醜かったと感じます。全てにノイズが入り、どこもかしこも不均一でした。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "Vitrifaction_Ambient_2"
#: data/json/snippets/vitrified_snippets.json
msgid ""
"Perhaps you should rest?  The furniture here is all hard glass, but you're "
"sure it won't trouble you.  You can't imagine anything hurting, here."
msgstr "そろそろ一休みすべきでしょうか？ここの家具は全て硬いガラス製ですが、問題ありません。傷つけられるなんて想像もできません。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "Vitrifaction_Ambient_3"
#: data/json/snippets/vitrified_snippets.json
msgid "The people here are so kind.  Their smiles are so bright."
msgstr "ここの人々はとても親切です。皆が明るい笑顔を浮かべています。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "Vitrifaction_Ambient_3"
#: data/json/snippets/vitrified_snippets.json
msgid ""
"Everything here is in its proper place.  Except you.  But there's still "
"time."
msgstr "ここのものはすべて、適切な場所にあります。違和感があるのは自分自身だけですが、まだ時間はあります。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "Vitrifaction_Ambient_3"
#: data/json/snippets/vitrified_snippets.json
msgid ""
"Some of the dust is blown up into a thick cloud.  You take a deep lungful; "
"it's like incense, but cleaner."
msgstr "粉塵が吹き上げられて、濃い靄を作り出しています。深く息を吸い込みました。香に似ていますが、もっと清浄だと感じます。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "Vitrifaction_Ambient_3"
#: data/json/snippets/vitrified_snippets.json
msgid "Your teeth are the best part of you, really."
msgstr "歯というのは、本当に素晴らしい部位です。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "Vitrifaction_Ambient_3"
#: data/json/snippets/vitrified_snippets.json
msgid ""
"Before you decided to visit, you might have thought you were feeling pain.  "
"How silly you were!"
msgstr "ここに来る前は、危険な目に遭うと思っていました。なんて愚かな思い違いでしょうか！"

#. ~ Snippet in category "Vitrifaction_Ambient_3"
#: data/json/snippets/vitrified_snippets.json
msgid ""
"It feels like your ribs are finally able to tuck inwards, where they belong,"
" now that all that mess and noise is settling down."
msgstr "混乱と騒音が全て落ち着き、肋骨の内側がようやく完璧な状態になったと感じます。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "Vitrifaction_Ambient_3"
#: data/json/snippets/vitrified_snippets.json
msgid "What a wonderful place.  What a wonderful place!"
msgstr "なんてすばらしいのでしょう。なんてすばらしいのでしょう！"

#. ~ Snippet in category "Vitrifaction_Ambient_3"
#: data/json/snippets/vitrified_snippets.json
msgid ""
"You catch a glimpse of your hands.  They're all wrong.  They won't do at "
"all.  Not all askew like this."
msgstr "手が視界に映りました。何もかも間違っています。まったく正しくありません。こんなに歪んでいるなんて。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "Vitrifaction_Ambient_3"
#: data/json/snippets/vitrified_snippets.json
msgid ""
"The glass is singing.  Or is that you?  No, it's both.  Your voices are "
"beautiful together."
msgstr "ガラスが歌っています。歌っているのは自分自身でしょうか？いいえ、皆が歌っています。美しい声です。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "Vitrifaction_Ambient_3"
#: data/json/snippets/vitrified_snippets.json
msgid ""
"When you turn your head, you can hear the wet click of tendons in your neck."
"  How dreadful.  It won't be a problem, soon."
msgstr "首を動かすと、腱がミチリと湿った音を立てました。とても恐ろしいことですが、すぐに問題なくなります。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "Vitrifaction_Ambient_3"
#: data/json/snippets/vitrified_snippets.json
msgid ""
"It would be a very good idea to lie down and close your eyes.  You could "
"listen to the glass sing you to sleep."
msgstr "横になって目を閉じましょう。ガラスが眠りにいざなう歌を歌ってくれます。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "Vitrifaction_Ambient_3"
#: data/json/snippets/vitrified_snippets.json
msgid ""
"Your head feels heavy on your neck, your arms heavy on your shoulders.  What"
" an awful demand, to expect you to hold them up with a few strips of muscle."
"  You poor thing."
msgstr ""
"首の上に乗った頭が重く感じます。肩から伸びた腕が重く感じます。これっぽっちの筋でこれらの部位を支えるなんて、酷い仕打ちをするものです。かわいそうに。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "Vitrifaction_Ambient_3"
#: data/json/snippets/vitrified_snippets.json
msgid ""
"What a blessing it is, to be in a place without distractions like this.  "
"What a joy, to think clearly for the first time in your life."
msgstr " 気を散らす物事がない世界にいられるのは、本当に幸せなことです。生れて初めて、明確に思考できました。本当に喜ばしいことです。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "Vitrifaction_Ambient_4"
#: data/json/snippets/vitrified_snippets.json
msgid ""
"You were thinking about leaving, before.  You don't remember why; the "
"thought has been trimmed so neatly."
msgstr "以前は、立ち去ることを考えていました。理由は覚えていません。かつての思考は、きれいさっぱり失われました。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "Vitrifaction_Ambient_4"
#: data/json/snippets/vitrified_snippets.json
msgid ""
"Stand straighter.  Straighter.  Not like that.  How will you ever fit in "
"like that?"
msgstr "もっと真っ直ぐに立ちましょう。もっとです。まだ足りません。どうすれば真っ直ぐになれるでしょうか？"

#. ~ Snippet in category "Vitrifaction_Ambient_4"
#: data/json/snippets/vitrified_snippets.json
msgid ""
"The wind stirs the glass, and interrupts its melody with ugly noise.  You "
"think you might like to kill the wind."
msgstr "風がガラスを揺さぶり、醜い音で旋律がかき消されました。風を消せないものでしょうか。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "Vitrifaction_Ambient_4"
#: data/json/snippets/vitrified_snippets.json
msgid ""
"You remember thinking they were reflections.  You laugh, high and bright and"
" perfect."
msgstr "以前はただの反射だと思っていたのを覚えていますか。声を立てて笑いました。高く澄んだ、完璧な音がします。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "Vitrifaction_Ambient_4"
#: data/json/snippets/vitrified_snippets.json
msgid ""
"Your nerves are alight.  Not crackling like they were before; instead, "
"perfect snaps, one two three one two three four."
msgstr "神経が麻痺しています。肉体が以前のような歪んだ音を立てることは、もうありません。今聞こえるのは、完璧な音です。1、2、3、1、2、3、4。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "Vitrifaction_Ambient_4"
#: data/json/snippets/vitrified_snippets.json
msgid ""
"You'd really like to sit down.  No, no, not that; and let your heavy head "
"bow your spine?  Lying would be much better.  Lying flat."
msgstr "本当は座り込みたいのでしょう。いや、それも、違いますね。重い頭が背筋を歪めていませんか？寝転ぶのが一番です。横になりましょう。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "Vitrifaction_Ambient_4"
#: data/json/snippets/vitrified_snippets.json
msgid ""
"There are so many parts of you that are wrong.  But that's not their fault."
"  Once they're clipped away and laid out, they'll all fit."
msgstr "この肉体は間違いだらけです。でも、それは肉体のせいではありません。切り取ってあげれば、全て正しくなります。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "Vitrifaction_Ambient_4"
#: data/json/snippets/vitrified_snippets.json
msgid ""
"Every move you make, your bones crackle and pop.  They're getting closer.  "
"How wonderful!"
msgstr "動く度に骨がカチカチと音を立てます。もうすぐです。なんてすばらしいのでしょう！"

#. ~ Snippet in category "Vitrifaction_Ambient_4"
#: data/json/snippets/vitrified_snippets.json
msgid ""
"Something somewhere is screaming.  Forcing air out of the nasty sacks in its"
" chest.  You're so glad that's not you."
msgstr "どこかで何かが叫んでいます。胸の中の厄介な嚢から、空気を無理やり搾り出しました。こんな肉体はまっぴらごめんです。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "Vitrifaction_Ambient_4"
#: data/json/snippets/vitrified_snippets.json
msgid ""
"For the first time in your life, you are free of the ugly sound of your "
"pulse in your ears.  How did you ever function, beaten down by that hideous "
"rhythm?"
msgstr "生れて初めて、耳の奥で聞こえる不快な拍動から解放されました。あのおぞましいリズムに支配された状態で、どうやって生きてきたのでしょう？"

#. ~ Snippet in category "Vitrifaction_Ambient_4"
#: data/json/snippets/vitrified_snippets.json
msgid ""
"It's been quite a while since you had a thought.  Noticing that, itself, "
"screeches unpleasantly in your cold, clear mind."
msgstr "もう思考を止めてかなりの時間が経ちます。その事実に気付いたことで、冷たく澄んだ心のどこかが不快な金切り声を上げました。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "Vitrifaction_Ambient_5"
#: data/json/snippets/vitrified_snippets.json
msgid ""
"You try to walk in time, one two three one two three four, but your legs "
"aren't right.  They need to be fixed."
msgstr "1、2、3、1、2、3、4、調子を合わせて歩こうとしましたが、足が間違っています。修正する必要があります。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "Vitrifaction_Ambient_5"
#: data/json/snippets/vitrified_snippets.json
msgid ""
"Something is pushing out from under your skin.  Taking the ugly mess away, "
"to iron it flat."
msgstr "皮膚の下から何かが押し出される感覚に満たされました。醜い汚れを排出し、アイロンをかけて平らにしましょう。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "Vitrifaction_Ambient_5"
#: data/json/snippets/vitrified_snippets.json
msgid ""
"You don't have enough edges.  You could fix that.  Right now.  Look; the "
"glass is so sharp."
msgstr "鋭さが足りません。修正しましょう。今すぐに。ほら、ガラスはこんなにも鋭い。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "Vitrifaction_Ambient_5"
#: data/json/snippets/vitrified_snippets.json
msgid ""
"Don't let go of this.  Cling tighter.  No, tighter.  If it breaks, the "
"pieces will be prettier anyway."
msgstr "手放してはいけません。もっとしっかり抱きしめましょう。もっと強く。割れてしまっても、破片はとても綺麗です。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "Vitrifaction_Ambient_5"
#: data/json/snippets/vitrified_snippets.json
msgid ""
"Look how well it all fits together.  Nice, neat lines.  The curves are the "
"best; a million little lines and a million again."
msgstr "ほら、全てが上手く調和しています。整った最高の直線。曲線も最高です。ここにも、あそこにも、無限の小さな直線。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "Vitrifaction_Ambient_5"
#: data/json/snippets/vitrified_snippets.json
msgid "Stop moving.  You're ruining it."
msgstr "動くのを止めましょう。全てが台無しになってしまいます。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "Vitrifaction_Ambient_5"
#: data/json/snippets/vitrified_snippets.json
msgid ""
"You can't cut well enough yet, but you're so close.  Smaller and sharper and"
" cleaner, all of it."
msgstr "まだ余分なものを切り落とせていませんが、完成は近いです。あらゆるものを、もっと小さく、もっと鋭く、もっと美しく。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "Vitrifaction_Ambient_5"
#: data/json/snippets/vitrified_snippets.json
msgid ""
"Every motion shaves you down, finer and finer and finer and finer and finer "
"and finer."
msgstr "あらゆる動作が肉体を、もっと、もっと、もっと、もっと細かく削ります。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "Vitrifaction_Ambient_5"
#: data/json/snippets/vitrified_snippets.json
msgid ""
"It's so selfish of you to keep yourself this ugly whole, when you could be "
"so many perfect pieces."
msgstr "どこまでも完璧になれるのに、自分自身をこんな醜い姿のままにしておくなんて、とても利己的な考えです。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "Vitrifaction_Ambient_5"
#: data/json/snippets/vitrified_snippets.json
msgid ""
"You have brought pain to this place of peace; the pain of being incorrect.  "
"It is awful of you.  But you are forgiven."
msgstr "この平和な場所に痛みをもたらしました。誤った姿を持ち込んだ痛みです。しかし、それも間もなく赦されます。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "Vitrifaction_Ambient_5"
#: data/json/snippets/vitrified_snippets.json
msgid ""
"Such a rare and beautiful blessing, you have been given.  You are so "
"grateful that you might cry, if you still needed that ugly function."
msgstr "何ものにも代えがたい素晴らしい祝福を賜りました。あまりの嬉しさに涙を流しそうですが、もうそのような醜い機能は残っていません。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "Vitrifaction_Ambient_5"
#: data/json/snippets/vitrified_snippets.json
msgid ""
"You've done so well!  You've been so patient, while you are being fixed.  "
"This is why you were chosen for it.  You deserve it."
msgstr "よく頑張りました！修復されている間も、とても辛抱強く耐えていましたね。だからこそ選ばれたのです。あなたは、選ばれるに値する者です。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "Vitrifaction_Ambient_5"
#: data/json/snippets/vitrified_snippets.json
msgid ""
"Sleep now.  It will be dreamless, and empty, as it always should have been."
msgstr "さあ、眠りましょう。そこには夢もなく、何も存在しません。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "Vitrifaction_Ambient_6"
#: data/json/snippets/vitrified_snippets.json
msgid "Thoughts are slow now.  Simple.  Clean."
msgstr "思考がゆったりと流れています。簡潔。純粋。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "Vitrifaction_Ambient_6"
#: data/json/snippets/vitrified_snippets.json
msgid "Sharper.  Sharper.  Sharper."
msgstr "より鋭く。より鋭く。より鋭く。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "Vitrifaction_Ambient_6"
#: data/json/snippets/vitrified_snippets.json
msgid "You're almost complete."
msgstr "これでほぼ完璧です。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "Vitrifaction_Ambient_6"
#: data/json/snippets/vitrified_snippets.json
msgid "You should rest.  You've never rested before now."
msgstr "休むべきです。今まで一度も休んだことがありません。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "Vitrifaction_Ambient_6"
#: data/json/snippets/vitrified_snippets.json
msgid "You're glittering.  Finally, you're glittering."
msgstr "輝いています。ついに、輝きを得ました。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "Vitrifaction_Ambient_6"
#: data/json/snippets/vitrified_snippets.json
msgid "This is it.  Your flourishing.  Your apotheosis."
msgstr "ついにここまで来ました。栄華。理想。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "Vitrifaction_Ambient_6"
#: data/json/snippets/vitrified_snippets.json
msgid ""
"The parts of you you don't need are howling.  They don't understand yet."
msgstr "必要とされなくなった部分が吠えています。まだ理解できないのでしょうか。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "Vitrifaction_Ambient_6"
#: data/json/snippets/vitrified_snippets.json
msgid "All your facets are here.  Every one smooth, perfect."
msgstr "全てがここにあります。全てが滑らかで、完璧です。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "Vitrifaction_Ambient_6"
#: data/json/snippets/vitrified_snippets.json
msgid "Cold.  So cold.  Perfect.  Perfect."
msgstr "寒い。とても寒い。完璧。完全。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "Vitrifaction_Ambient_6"
#: data/json/snippets/vitrified_snippets.json
msgid ""
"The song.  The silence.  The song.  The silence.  The song.  The silence."
msgstr "歌。静寂。歌。静寂。歌。静寂。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "Vitrifaction_Ambient_6"
#: data/json/snippets/vitrified_snippets.json
msgid "Smooth.  Clean.  The best of you, finally."
msgstr "平穏。清浄。最高に至る。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "Vitrifaction_Ambient_6"
#: data/json/snippets/vitrified_snippets.json
msgid "Almost nothing left now.  It's all been shaved away."
msgstr "ほとんど何も残っていません。全て削り取られました。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "Vitrifaction_Ambient_6"
#: data/json/snippets/vitrified_snippets.json
msgid "Look how you catch the light, now.  Never look away."
msgstr "さあ、光がどのように反射するか見てみましょう。目を逸らしてはいけません。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "Vitrifaction_Ambient_6"
#: data/json/snippets/vitrified_snippets.json
msgid "Be still, now.  There is nothing left to do."
msgstr "今はじっとしていましょう。もう何もすることはありません。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "Vitrifaction_Ambient_6"
#: data/json/snippets/vitrified_snippets.json
msgid "Edges.  Lines.  Points.  Happy.  Happy."
msgstr "鋭利。直線。先端。しあわせ。しあわせ。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "Vitrifaction_Ambient_6"
#: data/json/snippets/vitrified_snippets.json
msgid "Let go, now.  Let what you are clutching become perfect too."
msgstr "さあ、手放しましょう。最後に残ったものを手放せば、完璧になれます。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "Vitrifaction_Final"
#: data/json/snippets/vitrified_snippets.json
msgid ""
"You don't think about what has happened to you.  You don't think, ever "
"again.  There's no need.  Every part of you is finally as it should be."
msgstr ""
"自分の身に何が起きたのか考えていません。もう二度と考えることはありません。必要ないからです。あらゆるものが、ついに本来あるべき姿になりました。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "Vitrifaction_Bleed_1"
#: data/json/snippets/vitrified_snippets.json
msgid "Blood drips from your cuts.  It doesn't reach the ground."
msgstr "切り傷から血が滴りましたが、地面に落ちる前に消えました。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "Vitrifaction_Bleed_1"
#: data/json/snippets/vitrified_snippets.json
msgid "Your cuts don't hurt anymore.  Or do they?  It's different, somehow."
msgstr "切り傷の痛みがもう消えました。本当でしょうか？何だか妙です。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "Vitrifaction_Bleed_1"
#: data/json/snippets/vitrified_snippets.json
msgid "Blood falls from your wounds in ugly little drops.  It's disgusting."
msgstr "傷口から血が醜い小さな滴となって落ちました。嫌な気分です。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "Vitrifaction_Bleed_1"
#: data/json/snippets/vitrified_snippets.json
msgid "You feel a little better, with some of your blood gone.  Cleaner."
msgstr "血を失ったことで、少し気分がよくなりました。肉体が綺麗になった気がします。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "Vitrifaction_Bleed_2"
#: data/json/snippets/vitrified_snippets.json
msgid ""
"It's horrible, the stuff dripping from you.  How kind it is of the glass to "
"let you be free of it."
msgstr "気味の悪いものが体内から排出されました。身体を血から解放してくれるなんて、ガラスはなんて優しいのでしょう。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "Vitrifaction_Bleed_2"
#: data/json/snippets/vitrified_snippets.json
msgid ""
"You are not open enough.  How will you be clean and dry, with only these few"
" little cuts?"
msgstr "まだ完全に排出できていません。清らかで乾いた状態になるには、どれだけ切り取ればいいのでしょうか？"

#. ~ Snippet in category "Vitrifaction_Bleed_2"
#: data/json/snippets/vitrified_snippets.json
msgid ""
"Your blood isn't quite liquid anymore.  Slurry, like crushed ice.  It's not "
"good enough yet."
msgstr "血液は完全な液体ではなく、砕いた氷のような状態になっています。しかし、まだ十分ではありません。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "Vitrifaction_Bleed_2"
#: data/json/snippets/vitrified_snippets.json
msgid ""
"Out it comes, the nasty fluid sloshing through your tubes.  Out it comes to "
"be fixed."
msgstr "管の中を流れていた不快な液体が排出されました。これも修復していきましょう。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "Vitrifaction_Bleed_3"
#: data/json/snippets/vitrified_snippets.json
msgid "More.  Bleed more.  You're almost clean."
msgstr "もっと。もっと血を。どんどんきれいになっています。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "Vitrifaction_Bleed_3"
#: data/json/snippets/vitrified_snippets.json
msgid "Your fluids are so ugly.  You're so close to being free."
msgstr "体液はとても醜いものです。もっと自由に近づきましょう。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "Vitrifaction_Bleed_3"
#: data/json/snippets/vitrified_snippets.json
msgid ""
"Look.  You're bleeding snowflakes.  A thousand little parts of you are "
"finding themselves."
msgstr "ほら。傷口から雪の結晶が流れ出ています。何千、何万もの自分自身の一部分です。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "Vitrifaction_Bleed_3"
#: data/json/snippets/vitrified_snippets.json
msgid ""
"If you broke your skin just a little more, it would be that much easier to "
"lift it away."
msgstr "もう少し切り口を広げれば、皮膚を難なく剥がせそうです。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "weed_Freakazoid_1"
#: data/json/snippets/weed_messages.json
msgid ""
"The scariest thing in the world would be… if all the air in the world turned"
" to WOOD!"
msgstr "何が恐ろしいって...この世の空気が全て木になってしまったらと思うと！"

#. ~ Snippet in category "weed_Freakazoid_2"
#: data/json/snippets/weed_messages.json
msgid ""
"Okay, like, the scariest thing in the world would be… if like you went to "
"grab something and it wasn't there!"
msgstr "そう、ほら、何が恐ろしいかって...掴みたいものがここに無いことだよな！"

#. ~ Snippet in category "weed_Simpsons_1"
#: data/json/snippets/weed_messages.json
msgid ""
"Could Jesus microwave a burrito so hot, that he himself couldn't eat it?"
msgstr "ブリトーをこんなに熱くチンしたら神様だって食えやしないだろう？"

#. ~ Snippet in category "weed_Simpsons_2"
#: data/json/snippets/weed_messages.json
msgid "They call them fingers, but I never see them fing."
msgstr "連中の名はフィンガーだというが、フィングしてるのを見たことがないぞ。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "weed_Simpsons_3"
#: data/json/snippets/weed_messages.json
msgid "…oh, there they go."
msgstr "...おお、やってるやってる。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "weed_Timothy_Leary"
#: data/json/snippets/weed_messages.json
msgid "Science is all metaphor."
msgstr "科学は隠喩。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "weed_IASIF"
#: data/json/snippets/weed_messages.json
msgid "Science is a liar sometimes."
msgstr "科学はたまに嘘つき。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "weed_Durr"
#: data/json/snippets/weed_messages.json
msgid "Science is… wait, what was I talking about again?"
msgstr "科学は... 待った、何を言ってるんだ？"

#. ~ Snippet in category "weed_Dazed_and_Confused_1"
#: data/json/snippets/weed_messages.json
msgid ""
"Behind every good man there is a woman, and that woman was Martha "
"Washington, man."
msgstr "良き男の陰には女がいる、そしてその女とはマーサ・ワシントンなのだ。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "weed_Dazed_and_Confused_2"
#: data/json/snippets/weed_messages.json
msgid ""
"Every day, George would come home, and she would have a big fat bowl waiting"
" for him when he came in the door, man."
msgstr "ジョージが家に帰って来て、ドアを開けると、そう毎日、あの女が大きな水たばこを持って待っているんだ。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "weed_Dazed_and_Confused_3"
#: data/json/snippets/weed_messages.json
msgid "She was a hip, hip, hip lady, man."
msgstr "彼女は超、超、超いい女、そうだろ。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "weed_Dazed_and_Confused_4"
#: data/json/snippets/weed_messages.json
msgid "Walkin' down the hall, by myself, smokin' a j with fifty elves."
msgstr ""
"Walkin' down the hall, by myself, smokin' a j with fifty elves. "
"(ごきげんで歌っている･･･)"

#. ~ Snippet in category "weed_Half_Baked_1"
#: data/json/snippets/weed_messages.json
msgid "You ever see the back of a twenty dollar bill… on weed?"
msgstr "20ドル札の裏を見たことあるか...大麻吸いながら？"

#. ~ Snippet in category "weed_Half_Baked_2"
#: data/json/snippets/weed_messages.json
msgid ""
"Oh, there's some crazy shit, man.  There's a dude in the bushes.  Has he got"
" a gun?  I dunno!"
msgstr "おお、なんだよあれは、おい。茂みに知らない男がいるぞ。銃を持ってる？知らん！"

#. ~ Snippet in category "weed_Half_Baked_3"
#: data/json/snippets/weed_messages.json
msgid "RED TEAM GO, RED TEAM GO!"
msgstr "赤組がんばれ！赤組がんばれ！"

#. ~ Snippet in category "weed_Half_Baked_4"
#: data/json/snippets/weed_messages.json
msgid "That weed was the shiz-nittlebam snip-snap-sack."
msgstr "あの草はシズニトルバムスニップスナップサックだ。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "weed_Bible"
#: data/json/snippets/weed_messages.json
msgid "You have a sudden urge to flip your bible open to Genesis 1:29…"
msgstr "突然、創世記1章29節を開きたいという耐え難い衝動に襲われました..."

#. ~ Snippet in category "weed_Big_Lebowski"
#: data/json/snippets/weed_messages.json
msgid "That rug really tied the room together…"
msgstr "あの絨毯は本当に部屋にぴったりだ..."

#. ~ Snippet in category "weed_Mitch_Hedberg"
#: data/json/snippets/weed_messages.json
msgid "I used to do drugs… I still do, but I used to, too."
msgstr "ドラッグをやったことはある...今もやってる、でもやったこともある。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "weed_Bob_Marley"
#: data/json/snippets/weed_messages.json
msgid "The herb reveals you to yourself."
msgstr "ハッパを吸えば自分自身のことがわかる。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "weed_Bill_Hicks"
#: data/json/snippets/weed_messages.json
msgid ""
"You suddenly realize that all matter is merely energy condensed to a slow "
"vibration, and we are all one consciousness experiencing itself "
"subjectively."
msgstr "あなたは突如として全ての問題は単に緩やかな振動へのエネルギー蓄積であって我々は主観的統一意識の体験なのだという真実に到達しました。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "weed_Steve_Martin_1"
#: data/json/snippets/weed_messages.json
msgid "I usually only smoke in the late evening."
msgstr "私はたいてい深夜にだけ一服するんだ。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "weed_Steve_Martin_2"
#: data/json/snippets/weed_messages.json
msgid ""
"Oh, occasionally the early evening, but usually the late evening, or the "
"mid-evening."
msgstr "ああ、たまに夕方、でもいつもは夜遅く、それか夜。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "weed_Steve_Martin_3"
#: data/json/snippets/weed_messages.json
msgid "Just the early evening, mid-evening and late evening."
msgstr "夕方だ、夜か、それか深夜だ。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "weed_Steve_Martin_4"
#: data/json/snippets/weed_messages.json
msgid ""
"Occasionally, early afternoon, early mid-afternoon, or perhaps the late mid-"
"afternoon."
msgstr "たまに、午後、午後の早いうち、か、午後の遅いうち。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "weed_Steve_Martin_5"
#: data/json/snippets/weed_messages.json
msgid "Oh, sometimes the early-mid-late-early-morning."
msgstr "ああ、たまに朝の早くて中ごろで遅い朝早いうち。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "weed_Steve_Martin_6"
#: data/json/snippets/weed_messages.json
msgid "…But never at dusk."
msgstr "...夕暮れ時は絶対にやらない。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "weed_Cheech_and_Chong"
#: data/json/snippets/weed_messages.json
msgid "Dave's not here, man."
msgstr "デイブならいないぜ。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "weed_Real_Life_1"
#: data/json/snippets/weed_messages.json
msgid "Man, a cheeseburger sounds SO awesome right now."
msgstr "なあ、チーズバーガーってスッゲェいい響きだよな。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "weed_Real_Life_2"
#: data/json/snippets/weed_messages.json
msgid "Eh… maybe not."
msgstr "いや...そうでもないか。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "weed_Real_Life_3"
#: data/json/snippets/weed_messages.json
msgid "I guess, maybe, without the cheese… yeah."
msgstr "そう、たぶん、チーズが要らないんだな...うん。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "tainted_innards_desc"
#: data/json/snippets/zombie_anatomy.json
msgid ""
"This looks like a stomach and length of intestine, if they were made of lung"
" tissue.  Every now and then you notice it expanding or contracting "
"slightly.  It looks dangerous to eat, maybe even to handle."
msgstr ""
"この臓器の形状は胃や腸のようですが、質感は肺に似ています。時々わずかに膨らんだり縮んだりしているようです。当然食べるのは危険でしょうし、触りたいとも思いません。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "tainted_innards_desc"
#: data/json/snippets/zombie_anatomy.json
msgid ""
"A clump of rotten entrails.  The sallow membranes that link these lobes of "
"flesh together are lined with blackened veins and capillaries.  A caul of "
"slime coats them all in a greasy sheen.  You should not put this anywhere "
"near your mouth."
msgstr ""
"腐った内臓の塊です。肉片同士をつなぐ黄褐色の膜には黒ずんだ血管や毛細血管が張り付き、全体が脂っこい粘液に包まれ光沢を帯びています。口の傍に近付けることすら憚られます。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "tainted_innards_desc"
#: data/json/snippets/zombie_anatomy.json
msgid ""
"Zombie guts.  Your appetite may have been spoiled by one look at the "
"twisted, compacted tubes and sacs that form this clump of foul entrails.  "
"Why then does it make you think of frozen spaghetti and meatballs?"
msgstr ""
"ゾンビの臓物です。捻じれて縮んだ管や嚢からなる悪臭を放つ塊を一目見ただけで、食欲が減退しそうです。でも、どうして冷凍スパゲティやミートボールを連想してしまうのでしょうか？"

#. ~ Snippet in category "tainted_innards_desc"
#: data/json/snippets/zombie_anatomy.json
msgid ""
"The inner contents of the walking dead.  It's hard to tell exactly what kind"
" of tissue this may have once been.  Several structures appear to have "
"molded together."
msgstr "動く死体の中身です。かつてどんな機能を果たしていたのかさっぱり分かりません。いくつかの臓器が癒着し一つにまとまったような形状です。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "skull_human_tainted_desc"
#: data/json/snippets/zombie_anatomy.json
msgid ""
"The stained skull of what was once a human being.  It is rotted and "
"noticeably warped from its living form."
msgstr "かつては人間のものだった、汚染された頭蓋骨です。生前の状態から形がかなり歪み、腐っています。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "skull_human_tainted_desc"
#: data/json/snippets/zombie_anatomy.json
msgid ""
"The stained skull of a former human.  Whatever turned their flesh to walking"
" in death, it left its mark on their bones."
msgstr "かつては人間のものだった、汚染された頭蓋骨です。何が原因で化け物になったのか分かりませんが、骨にはその痕跡が確かに残っています。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "skull_human_tainted_desc"
#: data/json/snippets/zombie_anatomy.json
msgid ""
"A rotted skull from a human zombie.  It feels more flexible than it should, "
"like stiff leather, no longer natural bone."
msgstr "かつては人間のものだった、汚染された頭蓋骨です。少し弾力があり、骨というよりは硬い革のような手触りです。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "skull_human_tainted_desc"
#: data/json/snippets/zombie_anatomy.json
msgid ""
"The brain has ossified inside this tainted skull.  It doesn't feel "
"noticeably heavier and you surmise that the brain-turned-bone must be deeply"
" porous or hollow itself."
msgstr "汚染された頭蓋骨の中には、硬化した脳が入っています。特に重くはないので、恐らく脳はスポンジ状か中空になっているのでしょう。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "skull_human_tainted_desc"
#: data/json/snippets/zombie_anatomy.json
msgid ""
"This pitted human skull is filled with teeth, few of them where they should "
"be.  You can see them growing in the hollows that have developed, their "
"roots grown long and winding, more like those of a tree."
msgstr ""
"表面に凹凸の多い人間の頭蓋骨です。歯が残っていますが、どれもでたらめな位置から生えています。どの歯も広い空間内で野放図に伸び、歯根もまるで木の根のように曲がりくねっています。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "skull_human_tainted_desc"
#: data/json/snippets/zombie_anatomy.json
msgid ""
"The teeth of this lopsided human skull have melded together like hot wax and"
" joined with the maxilla.  The eye sockets are drooping and canted to the "
"side as if shaped while soft.  Most of the suture joints of the cranium are "
"fused over with thick lines of growth as if soldered together with bone."
msgstr ""
"形状が歪んだ人間の頭蓋骨です。歯が蝋のように溶けて上顎の骨と一体化しています。眼窩は柔らかい状態で押し潰したように垂れ下がって横に伸びています。頭部の接合部には、はんだ付けでもされたかのような太い筋が通り、ほとんど癒着しています。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "arm_zed_desc"
#: data/json/snippets/zombie_anatomy.json
msgid ""
"A rotted and then shredded arm.  Not much use unless you want to scrape the "
"rancid meat from the bones."
msgstr "腐ってちぎれた腕です。こそぎ取ってまで腐った肉を採取したい状況でもない限り、役には立ちません。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "arm_zed_desc"
#: data/json/snippets/zombie_anatomy.json
msgid ""
"Little tainted meat remains on whatever limb bones these were.  It still "
"bends at the joint but doesn't look to be moving on its own anymore."
msgstr "汚染された肉がほとんど削げ落ち、四肢のどの部分かも分かりません。関節は残っていますが、もう勝手に動くことはありません。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "arm_zed_desc"
#: data/json/snippets/zombie_anatomy.json
msgid ""
"This jaundiced zombie's arm still bears a full sleeve tattoo.  Quality work "
"from what you can tell through all the rot."
msgstr "黄色く変色した腕全体に、今でもタトゥーが残っています。素晴らしい出来栄えであることは、肉が腐っていても分かります。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "leg_zed_desc"
#: data/json/snippets/zombie_anatomy.json
msgid ""
"You think this decaying severed limb ends in a foot.  It's actually hard to "
"tell after the hell it's been through."
msgstr "ちぎれて朽ち果てた脚のように見えますが、この地獄のような状況でははっきりと断定もできません。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "leg_zed_desc"
#: data/json/snippets/zombie_anatomy.json
msgid ""
"A fat zombie haunch.  It doesn't look tasty but the shape is undeniably "
"close to a large fried chicken leg.  The skin is even the right texture, "
"though for the wrong reasons."
msgstr ""
"太ったゾンビの脚です。美味しそうには見えませんが、この形はどう見てもフライドチキンです。皮膚の状態もフライドチキンそっくりですが、もちろん調理された訳ではありません。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_humanoid_harvest_general>"
#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_animal_harvest_general>"
#: data/json/snippets/zombie_anatomy.json
msgid ""
"As you make your first cut into its skin, a pressurized jet of decaying "
"blood almost hits your face."
msgstr "皮膚に入れた切り込みから腐敗した血液が勢いよく噴き出し、危うく顔にかかるところでした。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_humanoid_harvest_general>"
#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_animal_harvest_general>"
#: data/json/snippets/zombie_anatomy.json
msgid ""
"The overbearing sweet smell of decay emanating from the carcass forces you "
"to take short breaks during your work to not puke."
msgstr "死骸から放たれる強烈な腐敗臭に圧倒され、吐き気を抑えるために休憩を取りながら少しずつ作業を進めました。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_humanoid_harvest_general>"
#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_animal_harvest_general>"
#: data/json/snippets/zombie_anatomy.json
msgid "As you cut through the muscle, it tenses up in reaction."
msgstr "筋肉を切断すると、腱が連動して死体がピクリと震えました。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_humanoid_harvest_general>"
#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_animal_harvest_general>"
#: data/json/snippets/zombie_anatomy.json
msgid ""
"You spot a few flies and maggots in the corpse, their chosen carcass not "
"seeming to be very good for them, as most seem moribund."
msgstr "死骸の内部には何匹かのハエや蛆虫がいました。あまり居心地のいい棲家ではなかったようで、どの個体も死にかけています。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_humanoid_harvest_general>"
#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_animal_harvest_general>"
#: data/json/snippets/zombie_anatomy.json
msgid ""
"Random cavities in its body make you think it was at least partially feeding"
" on its own tissues to keep functioning."
msgstr "筋肉のあちこちに空洞ができています。肉体の機能を維持するために、自分自身の組織を栄養として消費していたのかもしれません。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_humanoid_harvest_general>"
#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_animal_harvest_general>"
#: data/json/snippets/zombie_anatomy.json
msgid "The corpse twitches as you begin.  It didn't feel like rigor mortis."
msgstr "作業を始めると死骸がピクピクと動きました。死後硬直しているようには思えません。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_humanoid_harvest_general>"
#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_animal_harvest_general>"
#: data/json/snippets/zombie_anatomy.json
msgid ""
"The body stirs as you open it up, suggesting it's still trying to attack, "
"and reminding you to be cautious."
msgstr "切り開いた肉体が、こちらを攻撃しようとするかのようにビクリと震えたため、気を引き締め直しました。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_humanoid_harvest_general>"
#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_animal_harvest_general>"
#: data/json/snippets/zombie_anatomy.json
msgid ""
"You begin your dissection - though, vivisection would be more appropriate, "
"as you find the corpse not as still as you once thought."
msgstr "解剖を始めましたが、死体とは思えないほどあちこちが動いています。これでは生きたまま解体しているのと同じです。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_humanoid_harvest_general_deeper>"
#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_humanoid_harvest_headless_deeper>"
#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_animal_harvest_general_deeper>"
#: data/json/snippets/zombie_anatomy.json
msgid ""
"The majority of the digestive tract seems to have reshaped into a singular "
"stomach."
msgstr "消化管の大部分が繋がって、一つの胃に変化しています。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_humanoid_harvest_general_deeper>"
#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_humanoid_harvest_headless_deeper>"
#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_animal_harvest_general_deeper>"
#: data/json/snippets/zombie_anatomy.json
msgid "Some organs have atrophied or outright dissolved entirely."
msgstr "一部の臓器は萎縮しているか、完全に溶けてしまっています。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_humanoid_harvest_general_deeper>"
#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_humanoid_harvest_headless_deeper>"
#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_animal_harvest_general_deeper>"
#: data/json/snippets/zombie_anatomy.json
msgid "The heart is overtaken by a mass of fistulas and other growths."
msgstr "心臓のあちこちに穴が開き、大量の腫瘍ができています。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_humanoid_harvest_general_deeper>"
#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_humanoid_harvest_headless_deeper>"
#: data/json/snippets/zombie_anatomy.json
msgid ""
"The thing's innards resemble one giant tumor more than the body of a human "
"being."
msgstr "人間の体内というよりも、巨大な腫瘍を切り開いているように思えます。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_humanoid_harvest_general_deeper>"
#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_humanoid_harvest_headless_deeper>"
#: data/json/snippets/zombie_anatomy.json
msgid ""
"The thing's feet are entirely calloused and the smaller toes are completely "
"vestigal, simply a bump with a dead nail on them."
msgstr "足の表面はカチカチに硬くなっています。小さな足の指はほとんど退化し、血色の悪い爪が付いた瘤のようにしか見えません。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_humanoid_harvest_general_deeper>"
#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_humanoid_harvest_headless_deeper>"
#: data/json/snippets/zombie_anatomy.json
msgid ""
"This person had a tattoo on their arm - said tattoo has reappeared in "
"multiple spots along the inner tissues and the walls of organs."
msgstr "この人物は生前にタトゥーを彫っていたようですが、同じ模様が内部組織や臓器の表面などあちこちに浮き出ています。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_humanoid_harvest_general_deeper>"
#: data/json/snippets/zombie_anatomy.json
msgid ""
"The front part of the brain is completely missing, with spongy, half-formed "
"bone in its place."
msgstr "脳の前部は完全に失われており、その代わりにスポンジ状の未熟な骨が入っています。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_humanoid_harvest_general_deeper>"
#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_humanoid_harvest_headless_deeper>"
#: data/json/snippets/zombie_anatomy.json
msgid ""
"While its individual fingers appear to be losing their dexterity, the "
"zombie's flexor muscles are tense and swollen."
msgstr "指の一本一本は器用に動きそうに思えませんが、折り曲げるための筋肉だけは大きく発達しています。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_humanoid_harvest_general_deeper>"
#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_humanoid_harvest_headless_deeper>"
#: data/json/snippets/zombie_anatomy.json
msgid ""
"This person had an artificial hip, but it's completely overgrown with bone "
"now."
msgstr "人工股関節を入れていたようですが、今では完全に本来の骨に覆われています。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_humanoid_harvest_general_deeper>"
#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_humanoid_harvest_headless_deeper>"
#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_animal_harvest_general_deeper>"
#: data/json/snippets/zombie_anatomy.json
msgid ""
"Organs in the lower abdomen, mainly the kidneys and the reproductive organs,"
" are absent."
msgstr "下腹部の臓器、主に腎臓と生殖器が無くなっています。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_humanoid_harvest_general_deeper>"
#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_humanoid_harvest_headless_deeper>"
#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_animal_harvest_general_deeper>"
#: data/json/snippets/zombie_anatomy.json
msgid ""
"The heart makes an odd, swallowing sound on occasion as you work around it."
msgstr "心臓の周りを切り開いていると、時折心臓から何かを飲み込むような奇妙な音が聞こえます。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_humanoid_harvest_general_deeper>"
#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_animal_harvest_general_deeper>"
#: data/json/snippets/zombie_anatomy.json
msgid ""
"You try pulling out some teeth to better analyze them, only to find they've "
"fused with the jawbone."
msgstr "より詳しく分析するために歯を抜こうとしましたが、顎の骨と融合してしまっています。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_humanoid_harvest_general_deeper>"
#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_humanoid_harvest_headless_deeper>"
#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_animal_harvest_general_deeper>"
#: data/json/snippets/zombie_anatomy.json
msgid ""
"Inside the chest is some unfamiliar organ, a Frankenstein of nearby tissues "
"and black veins."
msgstr "胴体の内部には、見慣れない臓器や、周囲の組織と黒い血管が継ぎはぎになった部位が存在しています。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_humanoid_harvest_general_deeper>"
#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_humanoid_harvest_headless_deeper>"
#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_animal_harvest_general_deeper>"
#: data/json/snippets/zombie_anatomy.json
msgid ""
"Inside the chest is some unfamiliar organ, fatty and wrinkled like brain "
"tissue."
msgstr "胴体の内部には、脳組織のような、脂質に皺が寄った見慣れない臓器が存在しています。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_humanoid_harvest_general_deeper>"
#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_humanoid_harvest_headless_deeper>"
#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_animal_harvest_general_deeper>"
#: data/json/snippets/zombie_anatomy.json
msgid ""
"Your search nets you no explanation as to how the creature's black blood "
"still circulates through it, and you come to the disturbing conclusion it "
"moves on its own."
msgstr "どれだけ調べても、なぜこの生物の黒い血が今も体内を循環しているのか解明できません。ひょっとすると、血液が自ら動いているのでしょうか。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_humanoid_harvest_general_deeper>"
#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_animal_harvest_general_deeper>"
#: data/json/snippets/zombie_anatomy.json
msgid ""
"The vestibular organs seem to be nonfunctional, but your question of how the"
" creature balances itself is answered by an odd mass in the center of the "
"brain, that you liken to a gyroscope."
msgstr ""
"前庭器官は機能していないように見えますが、この生物はどのようにしてバランスを取っていたのでしょうか。その答えは、脳の中心部の奇妙な物体にありました。これはまさにジャイロスコープです。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_humanoid_harvest_general_deeper>"
#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_animal_harvest_general_deeper>"
#: data/json/snippets/zombie_anatomy.json
msgid ""
"While some parts of the blackened brain have lost their wrinkles, in others "
"the wrinkles are surprisingly uniform."
msgstr "黒ずんだ脳のある部分の皺が消えていますが、他の部分には驚くほど均一な皺が入っています。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_humanoid_harvest_general_deeper>"
#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_humanoid_harvest_headless_deeper>"
#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_animal_harvest_general_deeper>"
#: data/json/snippets/zombie_anatomy.json
msgid ""
"You find a clump of malformed tissue leading deeper inwards, at the center "
"of which is a bullet."
msgstr "奇妙な歪んだ組織の塊は奥深くまで続いており、その中心に弾丸を見つけました。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_humanoid_harvest_general_deeper>"
#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_humanoid_harvest_headless_deeper>"
#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_animal_harvest_general_deeper>"
#: data/json/snippets/zombie_anatomy.json
msgid ""
"Its tissue has significant trouble separating from the bone in some spots."
msgstr "一部の組織は骨に密着しており、とても切り離せそうにありません。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_humanoid_harvest_general_deeper>"
#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_humanoid_harvest_headless_deeper>"
#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_animal_harvest_general_deeper>"
#: data/json/snippets/zombie_anatomy.json
msgid ""
"The skin is loose on the muscle in some places and melded with it in others."
msgstr "皮膚の一部が筋肉を包むようにたるんでおり、筋肉と癒着している部分もあります。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_humanoid_harvest_general_deeper>"
#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_humanoid_harvest_headless_deeper>"
#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_animal_harvest_general_deeper>"
#: data/json/snippets/zombie_anatomy.json
msgid "The thing's innards churn slightly even as you dig through them."
msgstr "かき出そうとした内臓がわずかに脈打ちました。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_humanoid_harvest_general_deeper>"
#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_humanoid_harvest_headless_deeper>"
#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_animal_harvest_general_deeper>"
#: data/json/snippets/zombie_anatomy.json
msgid ""
"As you finish up, you notice your earliest cuts seem to be the tiniest bit "
"smaller."
msgstr "作業を進めているうちに、最初にメスを入れた切り口はこんなに小さかっただろうかと疑問が浮かびました。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_humanoid_harvest_general_deeper>"
#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_humanoid_harvest_headless_deeper>"
#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_animal_harvest_general_deeper>"
#: data/json/snippets/zombie_anatomy.json
msgid ""
"To your \"delight,\" you find a tapeworm in its gut, turgid but seemingly "
"dead."
msgstr "「大当たり」です。腹の中にサナダムシが入っていました。丸々と太っていますが、死んでいるようです。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_humanoid_harvest_general_deeper>"
#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_humanoid_harvest_headless_deeper>"
#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_animal_harvest_general_deeper>"
#: data/json/snippets/zombie_anatomy.json
msgid ""
"As you cut into its stomach, the insane fragmentary remains of some creature"
" it devoured, which appears to have melded with its own tissues, attempt to "
"claw at your hand before you bludgeon them until they cease moving."
msgstr ""
"胃に切り込みを入れると、内部で死骸と融合した何かの生物の部位がこちらの手を引っ掻こうと狂ったように暴れ始めたため、慌てて殴りつけ、動きを止めました。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_animal_harvest_general_deeper>"
#: data/json/snippets/zombie_anatomy.json
msgid ""
"The thing's innards resemble one giant tumor more than the body of a living "
"being."
msgstr "生物の体内というよりも、巨大な腫瘍を切り開いているように思えます。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_animal_harvest_general_deeper>"
#: data/json/snippets/zombie_anatomy.json
msgid "The thing has extra teeth leading all the way down into the stomach."
msgstr "この死骸には歯が余分に生えており、歯列は胃の奥まで続いています。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_harvest_screamer_general>"
#: data/json/snippets/zombie_anatomy.json
msgid ""
"The lungs of this creature are cavernous, seemingly having been repurposed "
"from their respiratory function to house an impressive volume of air."
msgstr "この生物のスポンジ状の肺は、大量の空気を溜めておく用途に使われていたようです。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_harvest_screamer_general>"
#: data/json/snippets/zombie_anatomy.json
msgid ""
"Its massive diaphragm seems to have been the only correctly sustained muscle"
" of this starved corpse."
msgstr "巨大な横隔膜は、この痩せこけた死体が唯一維持できていた立派な筋肉だったようです。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_harvest_screamer_general>"
#: data/json/snippets/zombie_anatomy.json
msgid ""
"A careless move dislodges some remaining air causing the throat of the "
"undead monster to emit one more choked scream."
msgstr "不用意に死体を動かしたことで体内に残っていた空気が排出され、死んだ筈の怪物は再び耳をつんざく叫び声を発しました。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_harvest_screamer_general>"
#: data/json/snippets/zombie_anatomy.json
msgid ""
"The slack jaws and starved body of this creature make you think that it "
"would have struggled to seriously harm anything on its own."
msgstr "伸びきった顎と痩せ衰えた肉体を見ると、この怪物単体では何かに襲い掛かって仕留めることすら難しかったのではないかと思えます。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_harvest_screamer_general>"
#: data/json/snippets/zombie_anatomy.json
msgid ""
"Its distended lungs seem to be partially lined with a black and sticky mucus"
" membrane."
msgstr "膨らんだ肺の一部は、粘着性のある黒い液体で覆われています。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_humanoid_harvest_bone_general>"
#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_animal_harvest_bone_general>"
#: data/json/snippets/zombie_anatomy.json
msgid ""
"Removing its bone plates proves more arduous than you would have thought, "
"requiring you to almost put your entire weight on your tool to pry them off."
msgstr "骨の装甲を取り外すのは想像以上に困難です。道具に全体重を掛けなければ、とてもこじ開けられそうにありません。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_humanoid_harvest_bone_general>"
#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_animal_harvest_bone_general>"
#: data/json/snippets/zombie_anatomy.json
msgid ""
"Black liquid bubbles in the places where you managed to remove its skeletal "
"growths."
msgstr "発達した骨を苦労して取り除くと、内部には泡立つ黒色の液体が入っていました。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_humanoid_harvest_bone_general>"
#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_animal_harvest_bone_general>"
#: data/json/snippets/zombie_anatomy.json
msgid ""
"This one's armor falls off surprisingly easily, almost as if whatever "
"puppets it wishes for it to lose the extra weight."
msgstr "この死骸の装甲は驚くほど簡単に脱落しました。重い鎧を早く脱ぎ捨てたいと願っていたのでしょうか。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_humanoid_harvest_bone_general>"
#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_animal_harvest_bone_general>"
#: data/json/snippets/zombie_anatomy.json
msgid ""
"The layout and segmentation of its bony carapace disturbingly resembles what"
" you want to call plate mail, but it's closer to the armor of an arthropod."
msgstr "骨でできた装甲の形状や並びは、プレートメイルと呼ばれる防具に不気味なほど似ていますが、節足動物の外殻のようにも見えます。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_humanoid_harvest_bone_general>"
#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_animal_harvest_bone_general>"
#: data/json/snippets/zombie_anatomy.json
msgid ""
"These plates are almost impossible to remove until you realize they are "
"linked to the internal skeleton with calcified pillars you must break before"
" removing its armor."
msgstr "装甲はびくともしませんでしたが、内部の骨格に繋がっている石灰化した支柱のような部位を壊すと、綺麗に剥がれました。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_humanoid_harvest_acid_general>"
#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_animal_harvest_acid_general>"
#: data/json/snippets/zombie_anatomy.json
msgid ""
"The sheer pungent acrid odor of the carcass makes you temporarily recoil and"
" reconsider the safety of delving into its entrails."
msgstr "死骸が発する強烈な刺激臭を嗅いでいると、本当に安全に内臓を取り出せるのか疑問に思えてきました。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_humanoid_harvest_acid_general>"
#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_animal_harvest_acid_general>"
#: data/json/snippets/zombie_anatomy.json
msgid ""
"The sputters of acid on your gear you earned by digging into this corpse "
"could maybe warrant the use of some water to douse."
msgstr "この死骸から取り出した物体には例外なく酸が付着しています。後で洗った方がいいかもしれません。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_humanoid_harvest_acid_general>"
#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_animal_harvest_acid_general>"
#: data/json/snippets/zombie_anatomy.json
msgid ""
"Pressed against the liver is a swollen gland the size of a golfball, still "
"somewhat functioning, pumping out acrid fluids."
msgstr "肝臓にゴルフボールほどのサイズの膨らんだ腺が張り付いています。まだある程度機能が残っているのか、刺激臭を放つ液体が漏れ出ています。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_humanoid_harvest_acid_general>"
#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_animal_harvest_acid_general>"
#: data/json/snippets/zombie_anatomy.json
msgid ""
"Most cavities in its anatomy seem to have been filled with an acidic "
"solution mixed with a foul black liquid and pieces of its slowly melting "
"tissues."
msgstr "袋のような構造の中には、黒く汚れた粘液と、酸性の溶液、そしてゆっくりと溶解していく組織の破片が入っています。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_humanoid_harvest_acid_general>"
#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_animal_harvest_acid_general>"
#: data/json/snippets/zombie_anatomy.json
msgid ""
"You are almost certain that its flesh should not be able to contain such a "
"virulently aggressive liquid, yet, it does."
msgstr "肉の中にこれほど毒性の強い危険な液体が染み込んでいるなんてまず有り得ませんが、実際に目の前に存在しています。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_humanoid_harvest_acid_general>"
#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_animal_harvest_acid_general>"
#: data/json/snippets/zombie_anatomy.json
msgid ""
"You have to step back as a gland you inadvertently cut into seems to perform"
" a neutralization reaction between its contents and the rest of its fluids."
msgstr "うっかり何かの腺に傷をつけてしまい、内部に残った液体と肉が中和反応を起こしている間、少し下がって待つことになりました。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_humanoid_harvest_shadow_general>"
#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_animal_harvest_shadow_general>"
#: data/json/snippets/zombie_anatomy.json
msgid ""
"This corpse seems completely ordinary now, and dissection brings you no "
"further to asserting what gave the creature its peculiar properties."
msgstr ""
"この死骸は今では他の死骸と何ら変わらないように見えます。解剖をしてみても、どうしてこの怪物が特異な性質を持っていたのか、説明できそうにありません。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_humanoid_harvest_shadow_general>"
#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_animal_harvest_shadow_general>"
#: data/json/snippets/zombie_anatomy.json
msgid ""
"The lingering shadows surrounding it make your work quite a lot harder as "
"they seem to deliberately grow more opaque around your tool as if they "
"wished to hide the monster's secrets."
msgstr "周囲に残った暗い影が、まるでこの怪物の秘密を隠そうとするかのように道具の周りに集まってくるため、作業は困難を極めました。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_humanoid_harvest_shadow_general>"
#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_animal_harvest_shadow_general>"
#: data/json/snippets/zombie_anatomy.json
msgid ""
"You spot a few pores still weakly sputtering thin puffs of black smoke, "
"investigating them further reveals glands full of fuming black liquid linked"
" to the pores with long tubes."
msgstr ""
"まだ皮膚の一部には、黒いもやをわずかに吐き出し続ける部分が残っています。詳しく調べてみると、皮膚の毛穴には長い管が通っており、黒い液体で満たされた腺に繋がっていました。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_humanoid_harvest_shadow_general>"
#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_animal_harvest_shadow_general>"
#: data/json/snippets/zombie_anatomy.json
msgid ""
"You make one incision and the resulting cloud of black smoke forces you to "
"take a short break as it becomes impossible to see anything."
msgstr "少し切り込みを入れただけで黒いもやが立ち込めて何も見えなくなるため、作業は少しずつしか進みません。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_humanoid_harvest_shadow_general>"
#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_animal_harvest_shadow_general>"
#: data/json/snippets/zombie_anatomy.json
msgid ""
"Despite it not being very evident from the outside, it seems the entire "
"digestive tract of the abomination was bloated with its obscuring smoke."
msgstr "外側からは分かりませんでしたが、この忌まわしい怪物の消化管すべてが、もやのようなものを溜め込んで膨らんでいるようです。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_animal_harvest_shadow_general>"
#: data/json/snippets/zombie_anatomy.json
msgid ""
"The black camouflage evaporates off the body where you put your tool "
"through, completely odorless."
msgstr "少し刃を入れただけで、肉体から黒いもやが発散され、あっという間に消えてしまいました。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_harvest_kevlar_general>"
#: data/json/snippets/zombie_anatomy.json
msgid ""
"The inner tissues are a mosaic of somewhat normal flesh and flesh interlaced"
" with fibers of the armor."
msgstr "内部組織は、正常に見える肉質と鎧のように硬い繊維質がモザイク状に絡み合っています。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_harvest_kevlar_general>"
#: data/json/snippets/zombie_anatomy.json
msgid ""
"Separating what is flesh and what is synthetic is difficult, as some parts "
"appear to be between the two."
msgstr "内部組織の一部が硬質の人工物と完全に混じり合っているため、どこからどこが肉なのか判別できません。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_harvest_kevlar_general>"
#: data/json/snippets/zombie_anatomy.json
msgid ""
"Fibers of Kevlar-like material spread through the body like a cobweb, "
"originating from a tiny entry wound in the abdomen."
msgstr "腹部にできた小さな傷口を中心に、ケブラーのような繊維素材がクモの巣のように体内に広がっています。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_harvest_kevlar_general>"
#: data/json/snippets/zombie_anatomy.json
msgid ""
"You cut off some scraps of the uniform that were still adhered to the body, "
"finding tendrils of flesh anchored into them."
msgstr "肉に張り付いていた衣服の切れ端を剥ぎ取ると、まるで蔦のように肉が繊維に固着していました。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_harvest_kevlar_general>"
#: data/json/snippets/zombie_anatomy.json
msgid ""
"Upon closer examination, some of the Kevlar isn't Kevlar - its off color and"
" composition suggest it's the creature's flesh reformed to imitate it."
msgstr ""
"よく調べてみると、ケブラー素材の一部はただのケブラーではありません。くすんだ色と質感を見るに、この怪物の肉体がケブラーを模倣して作り出した素材のようです。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_harvest_kevlar_general>"
#: data/json/snippets/zombie_anatomy.json
msgid ""
"Some strands of the bulletproof material snake deep into the body like roots"
" of an invading organism."
msgstr "防弾素材の一部は、まるで植物のように体内の奥深くまで根を張っています。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_harvest_kevlar_general>"
#: data/json/snippets/zombie_anatomy.json
msgid ""
"Strong fibers run alongside the muscles in a way that you want to compare to"
" marbling."
msgstr "強靭な繊維が筋肉に沿って並んでおり、まるで霜降り肉のようです。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_harvest_kevlar_general>"
#: data/json/snippets/zombie_anatomy.json
msgid ""
"Under the skin, crushing against the ribcage, you find a thick growth of "
"flesh and Kevlar formed from a mutated diaphragm."
msgstr "胴体の皮膚の下には、変異した横隔膜とケブラー素材が分厚い装甲を形作っており、胸郭を押し潰すように広がっています。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_harvest_hulk_general>"
#: data/json/snippets/zombie_anatomy.json
msgid ""
"The sheer scale of the carcass leaves you only with a luxury of choice on "
"where to start your work."
msgstr "死体のサイズが尋常ではないため、どこから手を付けるかじっくり悩むことができます。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_harvest_hulk_general>"
#: data/json/snippets/zombie_anatomy.json
msgid ""
"Its legs seem to have been reinforced with a strange lattice of skeletal "
"bracing and muscle fibers to support its immense bulk."
msgstr "巨大な胴を支えるその両脚の内部では、筋繊維が奇妙な格子模様を形作り、中心を通る骨の柱をしっかりと補助しています。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_harvest_hulk_general>"
#: data/json/snippets/zombie_anatomy.json
msgid ""
"Along joints in the limbs and torso you find strange new muscly organs "
"filled with fluid, suggesting this behemoth moved with some form of organic "
"hydraulics."
msgstr ""
"四肢と胴の関節部には筋肉でできた袋状の器官が見られ、その内部は液体で満たされています。この巨大な怪物は何かの有機的な水力学を使って動いているのでしょうか。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_harvest_hulk_general>"
#: data/json/snippets/zombie_anatomy.json
msgid ""
"Portions of the spine and surrounding bones have grown and fused into a "
"single piece, presumably to hold up the creature's bulk - but even then, it "
"still shows signs of strain."
msgstr ""
"脊椎の一部とその周囲の骨が肥大し、融合して単一構造となっています。この怪物の肉体を支える強度はあったようですが、かなり無理をしていたように思えます。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_harvest_hulk_general>"
#: data/json/snippets/zombie_anatomy.json
msgid ""
"The ropey muscles are still unbelievably tense along the corpse's back, your"
" own back aches just looking at them."
msgstr "死体の背中の筋肉は未だに張り詰めて縄のように浮かび上がっており、見ているだけで自分の背中も痛くなってきます。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_harvest_hulk_general>"
#: data/json/snippets/zombie_anatomy.json
msgid ""
"You find that shoulder and upper arm bones are supported by smaller, similar"
" bone growths."
msgstr "肩と上腕部の骨は、同じ形状の一回り小さい骨の構造で支えられているようです。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_harvest_hulk_general>"
#: data/json/snippets/zombie_anatomy.json
msgid ""
"The more delicate joints in the body such as the wrists and neck have fused "
"with surrounding tissue."
msgstr "手首や首などの繊細な動きをつかさどる関節部は、周囲の組織と融合してしまっています。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_harvest_hulk_general>"
#: data/json/snippets/zombie_anatomy.json
msgid ""
"Your search for the source of the creature's size has you discover a cluster"
" of glandular organs deep in the body, most of which you are unable to "
"identify."
msgstr ""
"巨大な怪物の肉体を徹底的に調べ上げ、体内の奥深くに何かの腺のような器官の集合体を見つけましたが。どんな機能をもっていたのかさっぱり分かりません。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_harvest_hulk_general>"
#: data/json/snippets/zombie_anatomy.json
msgid ""
"It seems most of the creature was grown as some sort of suit looking as if "
"it was piloted by the still normal sized human corpse found in a fetal "
"position in its torso."
msgstr "怪物の下腹部には、通常サイズの人間の死体が操縦者のように収まっていました。この怪物はある種のスーツとして機能していたのでしょうか。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_harvest_hulk_general>"
#: data/json/snippets/zombie_anatomy.json
msgid ""
"The overall anatomy of this enormous monstrosity leaves you only to wonder "
"how it possibly could achieve the range of motion you witnessed while it was"
" still standing."
msgstr "巨大な怪物の全体的な構造を調べていると、この肉体でどうやってあれだけの可動域を確保していたのか不思議に思えてきます。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_harvest_hulk_general>"
#: data/json/snippets/zombie_anatomy.json
msgid ""
"You cut into its abdomen, and discover its utter lack of internal organs, "
"the expected cavity replaced by nothing but more flesh and muscle."
msgstr "腹部を切り裂くと、内臓は完全に消え去っていました。そこにあったのは空洞ではなく、筋肉の塊です。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_harvest_grabber_general>"
#: data/json/snippets/zombie_anatomy.json
msgid ""
"The sheer remaining tension in each of the muscles of its arms and shoulders"
" makes them unwind with a sonorous thwang each time you cut one off the "
"supporting bones."
msgstr "腕と肩の筋肉は未だに張り詰めています。支えになっていた骨を切断する度に、ドスンと音を立てて筋肉が緩んでいきます。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_harvest_grabber_general>"
#: data/json/snippets/zombie_anatomy.json
msgid ""
"The tremendous growth of its upper body's muscle mass must have rendered the"
" creature almost incapable of efficiently surveying its surroundings."
msgstr "上半身の筋肉があまりにも大きく発達しすぎたせいで、この怪物は辺りを歩き回ることすら一苦労だったと思われます。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_harvest_grabber_general>"
#: data/json/snippets/zombie_anatomy.json
msgid ""
"You realize the muscles of the zombie's arms are hollow, their marrow "
"replaced by a thick oily black liquid.  You wonder if the ridiculous muscle "
"mass surrounding them is the other half of a strange hydraulic system."
msgstr ""
"ゾンビの腕の筋肉は内部が空洞になっており、中心には粘度の高い油のような液体が詰まっていました。バカバカしいほどに発達した巨大な筋肉の塊は、もしかすると奇妙な油圧機構だったのかもしれません。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_harvest_grabber_general>"
#: data/json/snippets/zombie_anatomy.json
msgid ""
"You cut into the arms of the creature and realize that instead of what you "
"would expect from what you know of normal human anatomy, its muscles wind "
"around the bones in what looks like a tight spring."
msgstr "怪物の腕を切り開いてみると、通常の人体構造からかけ離れた状態になっていました。骨の周りに、張り詰めたバネのような筋肉が巻き付いています。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_harvest_grabber_general>"
#: data/json/snippets/zombie_anatomy.json
msgid ""
"While you are cutting into it, the creature suddenly moves and grabs one of "
"your limbs.  Despite considerable effort, you are unable to pry open the "
"creature's iron grip and resign yourself to chop off the hand instead."
msgstr ""
"切り刻んでいた怪物の手が突然動き、がっちりと掴まれてしまいました。必死に引き剥がそうとしましたが、万力のように締め付けられて外れそうにありません。仕方なく、怪物の腕の付け根から切り落としました。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_harvest_dog_general>"
#: data/json/snippets/zombie_anatomy.json
msgid ""
"Opening its jaw wide, you notice the presence of multiple additional tongues"
" deeper it in its throat."
msgstr "顎を大きく開いてみると、喉の奥に複数の舌が生えていることが分かります。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_harvest_dog_general>"
#: data/json/snippets/zombie_anatomy.json
msgid ""
"You notice cysts in its fur, you cut into them and alternatively find acrid "
"fluids, flakes of bone or twitching strands of muscle."
msgstr "毛皮の中に瘤があることに気付き、切り開いてみると、刺激臭を放つ液体、骨の欠片、痙攣する腱などが入っていました。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_harvest_dog_general>"
#: data/json/snippets/zombie_anatomy.json
msgid ""
"The rear of this greying zombified dog shows strange reinforcements, as if a"
" previous pathology was being remediated."
msgstr "ゾンビ化した灰色のイヌの背中は、まるで何かの疾患が治った痕跡のように、妙に分厚くなっています。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_harvest_dog_general>"
#: data/json/snippets/zombie_anatomy.json
msgid ""
"Inside its muzzle you notice strange glands and fibrous growths, almost as "
"if the creature's sense of smell was in the process of being overhauled."
msgstr "鼻面の内側には、まるでこの怪物の嗅覚を徹底的に強化していたかのような、奇妙な腺と発達した繊維質が入っていました。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_harvest_dog_general>"
#: data/json/snippets/zombie_anatomy.json
msgid ""
"Lodged into the neck area of the creature and grown over you find a corroded"
" tag reading the following \"Max my best friend forever\"."
msgstr "怪物の首筋に何かが突き刺さっています。取り出してみると、それは「ずっと親友だよ、マックス」と書かれた、腐食したネームタグでした。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_harvest_electric_general>"
#: data/json/snippets/zombie_anatomy.json
msgid ""
"You find strange tubular glands across the creature contained alternating "
"layers of two alien tissue types soaked in a black liquid, its smell putrid "
"but saltier than usual for a zombie."
msgstr ""
"この怪物の全身に奇妙な管状の腺が張り巡らされており、黒い液状の見たこともない組織と共に層をなしています。腐ったような匂いがしますが、通常のゾンビより刺激臭が強い気がします。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_harvest_electric_general>"
#: data/json/snippets/zombie_anatomy.json
msgid ""
"Uncomfortable static forces you to ground yourself multiple times during "
"your work."
msgstr "作業中に不快な静電気が何度も発生し、その度にアースを取る羽目になりました。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_harvest_electric_general>"
#: data/json/snippets/zombie_anatomy.json
msgid ""
"A roaming insect attracted by the carcass gets fried after landing on an "
"organ glowing a faint blue, making you decide to avoid it with the utmost "
"care."
msgstr "死骸に引き寄せられてやってきた虫が、薄青色に輝く器官に触れて、ジュッと焦げ付きました。細心の注意を払って解体を進めましょう。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_harvest_electric_general>"
#: data/json/snippets/zombie_anatomy.json
msgid ""
"The creature's heart seems to still be beating, but rather than pumping "
"blood, it strangely reminds you of some sort of biological dynamo."
msgstr "この怪物の心臓は今も拍動しているように見えますが、血液ポンプというよりも、生物の素材でできたある種の発電機のような姿をしています。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_harvest_electric_general>"
#: data/json/snippets/zombie_anatomy.json
msgid ""
"There are bundles of nerves snaking all throughout the tissues, still "
"channeling small amounts of electricity."
msgstr "組織全体に太い神経網が張り巡らされており、依然として微弱な電気が流れています。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_harvest_electric_general>"
#: data/json/snippets/zombie_anatomy.json
msgid ""
"The blackened veins of the creature seem strangely rigid, and you see faint "
"crackles of electricity course across them."
msgstr "怪物の黒ずんだ血管が硬く張り詰め、小さな火花が散りました。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_humanoid_harvest_mushroom_general>"
#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_animal_harvest_mushroom_general>"
#: data/json/snippets/zombie_anatomy.json
msgid ""
"Despite the carcass lying still, you still notice churning while "
"investigating its entrails, as if whatever was originally animating this "
"corpse is wrestling with the mycelium fibers to retake control."
msgstr ""
"死骸は動くことなく横たわっていますが、体内は未だに波打っています。まるで最初にこの死体を動かしていた何かが菌糸に襲い掛かり、制御を取り戻そうとしているかのようです。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_humanoid_harvest_mushroom_general>"
#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_animal_harvest_mushroom_general>"
#: data/json/snippets/zombie_anatomy.json
msgid ""
"Under the stomach you notice a wrinkled fruit that you can't help but think "
"somewhat appetizing despite where you found it."
msgstr "胃の中に皺だらけの果実が入っていました。こんなところに入っていたにもかかわらず、どこか美味しそうに見えます。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_humanoid_harvest_mushroom_general>"
#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_animal_harvest_mushroom_general>"
#: data/json/snippets/zombie_anatomy.json
msgid ""
"The skin feels absolutely turgid, oozing water mixed in with traces of a "
"black liquid where you make your incisions."
msgstr "全身の皮膚が硬化しています。切り開いた部分からは、黒い粘液と共に水が滲み出てきます。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_humanoid_harvest_mushroom_general>"
#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_animal_harvest_mushroom_general>"
#: data/json/snippets/zombie_anatomy.json
msgid ""
"Fungal stalks still sway gently despite the lack of movement of the formerly"
" shambling corpse."
msgstr "ふらふらと動いていた死体は動かなくなりましたが、菌糸は依然として穏やかに揺れています。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_humanoid_harvest_mushroom_general>"
#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_animal_harvest_mushroom_general>"
#: data/json/snippets/zombie_anatomy.json
msgid ""
"The putrefied blood that leaks from your incisions is visibly saturated with"
" spores."
msgstr "切り口から漏れ出る腐敗した血液には、胞子が混じっているようです。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_harvest_pupating_general>"
#: data/json/snippets/zombie_anatomy.json
msgid ""
"The cavities of this creature are filled with lethargic winged creatures "
"hanging off tubes oozing a greyish milky substance."
msgstr ""
"この死骸の体内には空洞があり、内部には翼をもつ動かなくなった怪物で満たされています。空洞内に生えた管に張り付き、灰色がかった乳状の物質を吸っていたようです。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_harvest_pupating_general>"
#: data/json/snippets/zombie_anatomy.json
msgid ""
"The corpse is inundated with smaller forms, increasing in complexity and "
"size as you near its central cavity where they wait for their release in "
"neat clusters."
msgstr ""
"死骸の空洞には小さな怪物が大量に埋まっています。それらは中央へ近付くにしたがって大きく複雑な構造になり、完璧な姿で外に放出される日を待っていたようです。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_harvest_pupating_general>"
#: data/json/snippets/zombie_anatomy.json
msgid ""
"The inside of this carcass resembles more an industrial production line than"
" anything vaguely natural."
msgstr "この死骸の体内は、とても生物のものには見えません。敢えて何かに例えるなら、工場の生産ラインに似ています。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_harvest_pupating_general>"
#: data/json/snippets/zombie_anatomy.json
msgid ""
"You find several unfinished creatures inside the main cavity, you have a "
"vague feeling something greater discarded them, founding them wanting."
msgstr "体内の大きな空洞には、未発達の怪物が何体か入っていました。より大きな怪物に栄養を奪われ、飢えていたように感じます。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_harvest_pupating_general>"
#: data/json/snippets/zombie_anatomy.json
msgid ""
"You are almost certain this zombie was pregnant before its undeath, the "
"fetus within the womb having been twisted into the abomination it was "
"carrying."
msgstr "このゾンビが生前に妊娠していたことは明らかです。子宮内の胎児が、忌まわしい怪物に取り込まれ一体となっています。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_humanoid_generic_harvest>"
#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_humanoid_headless_harvest>"
#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_screamer_harvest>"
#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_humanoid_bone_harvest>"
#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_humanoid_acid_harvest>"
#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_humanoid_shadow_harvest>"
#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_hulk_harvest>"
#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_bone_hulk_harvest>"
#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_humanoid_kevlar_harvest>"
#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_kevlar_hulk_harvest>"
