#. ~ Vehicle part name
#: data/json/vehicleparts/wheel.json
msgid "tricycle wheels"
msgstr "三輪車ホイール"

#. ~ Description of vehicle part "tricycle wheels"
#: data/json/vehicleparts/wheel.json
msgid ""
"A set of three plastic wheels, with a larger one in the front, mounted with "
