msgid "82x225mm flashbulb"
msgid_plural "82x225mm flashbulbs"
msgstr[0] "弾薬(82x225mm/ｽﾄﾛﾎﾞ)"

#. ~ Name of an ammunition type
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/ammo_type.json
msgid "ferrous rail projectile"
msgstr "磁性体"

#. ~ Name of an ammunition type
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/ammo_type.json
msgid "5x50mm flechette"
msgstr "5x50mm矢弾"

#. ~ Description of "freezer"
#. ~ Description of vehicle part "exosuit maintenance gantry"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/appliances.json
#: data/mods/Aftershock/vehicles/vehicle_parts.json
msgid ""
"A gantry for supporting an exosuit upright during maintenance and repair.  "
"Includes the specialized tools needed for complex repairs and will also "
"charge the suit's power when active."
msgstr "外骨格スーツを直立状態のまま整備、修理する際に用いる整備台です。難しい修理に必要な専用工具が付属しており、起動時にはスーツが充電されます。"

#. ~ Vehicle part name
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/appliances.json
msgid "U-344 RTG (deployed)"
msgstr "U-344放射性同位体熱電気転換器(展開)"

#. ~ Description of vehicle part "U-344 RTG (deployed)"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/appliances.json
msgid ""
"A compact radioisotope thermoelectric generator, complying with UASTA 344 "
"standards.  It provides a steady if limited supply of power."
msgstr "UASTA344規格に準拠した小型の放射性同位体熱電気転換器です。少量の電力を安定供給します。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/armor.json
msgid "bag of holding"
msgid_plural "bags of holding"
msgstr[0] "保存の鞄"

#. ~ Description of "bag of holding"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/armor.json
msgid ""
"A sleek, unfathomably-complicated machine covered in dozens of blinking "
"lights, worn on the back by sturdy faux-leather straps.  An electrode "
"dangles from the back, attaching to your forehead.  How it operates without "
"annihilating spacetime isn't quite clear, but a localized portal allows "
"things to be stored in an extradimensional space."
msgstr ""
"何十もの明滅するライトが付いた、複雑で不可解な機械です。後部から伸びた電極コードを額に貼り付けて使います。なぜ時空を消滅させることなく動作するのかよく分かっていませんが、局在化したポータルの力でアイテムを次元外の空間に格納できます。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/armor.json
msgid "titanium vest"
msgid_plural "titanium vests"
msgstr[0] "チタンベスト"

#. ~ Description of "titanium vest"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/armor.json
msgid ""
"A lightweight armor vest made of pieces of titanium sewn together, with "
"cloth padding for comfort.  Brittle against blunt force, but highly "
"resistant to cuts and corrosion."
msgstr "チタン屑が織り込まれた軽量の装甲ベストです。打撃に対しては脆いですが、斬撃や酸の腐食に対して非常に有効な防具です。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/armor.json
msgid "hologram cloak Mk. II"
msgid_plural "hologram cloaks Mk. II"
msgstr[0] "ホログラムクロークMk.2"

#. ~ Description of "hologram cloak Mk. II"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/armor.json
msgid ""
"When activated, creates a holographic decoy of its wearer.  Powered by an "
"experimental n-space energy generator, it slowly recharges itself for free, "
"probably by siphoning excess energy from some unknown hyperdimensional "
"space."
msgstr ""
"起動すると、着用者の姿を模したホログラムが生成されます。実験的なn次元エネルギー発電機を搭載しており、サイフォン原理を利用して未知の超次元空間から余剰エネルギーを吸い上げることによってゆっくりと自動的に充電されます。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/armor.json
msgid "sentinel-lx cloak"
msgid_plural "sentinel-lx cloaks"
msgstr[0] "センチネルLXクローク"

#. ~ Description of "sentinel-lx cloak"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/armor.json
msgid ""
"The vantablack cloak of sentinel-lx hangs around ones shoulders as a solid, "
"unnatural shadow.  Made from woven graphene, it's lightweight and resistant,"
" but cannot be repaired."
msgstr ""
"センチネルLXの肩に不自然な影のように掛かっていた、ベンタブラック塗料を塗った外套です。軽量で耐久性のあるグラフェン素材が織り込まれており、修復できません。"

#. ~ Item name
#. ~ Variant name of item "IX-2110 computer"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/armor.json
msgid "IX-2110 computer"
msgid_plural "IX-2110 computers"
msgstr[0] "IX-2110汎用コンピュータ"

#. ~ Description of "IX-2110 computer"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/armor.json
msgid ""
"The original Imagos IX-2110, a general use wrist computer originally "
"designed to support operations within hazardous environments.  Among the "
"most successful pieces of technology ever created, millions of these were "
"produced and sold to the explorers that first tamed the stars during the "
"early Hyperspace Era.  The slow attrition of technological prowess since the"
" discontinuity has left slightly slower than its modern counterparts."
msgstr ""
"イマゴスIX-2110は、元来は危険な環境下での作業をサポートするために設計されていた、腕時計型汎用コンピュータです。惑星を開拓する探検家向けに数百万台が製造されており、超光速時代の初期におけるもっとも成功したテクノロジーの一つと言っても過言ではありません。『断絶』以後の世界の技術力は緩やかに衰退しているため、現代の類似製品よりわずかに劣る程度の高い性能を有しています。"

#. ~ Description of variant "IX-2110 computer" of item "IX-2110 computer"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/armor.json
msgid ""
"The original Imagos IX-2110, a general use wrist computer originally "
"designed to support operations within hazardous environments.  Among the "
"most successful pieces of technology ever created, millions of these were "
"produced and sold to the explorers that first tamed the stars during the "
"early Hyperspace Era.  The slow attrition of technological prowess since the"
" discontinuity means its only slightly less capable than its modern "
"counterparts."
msgstr ""
"イマゴスIX-2110は、元来は危険な環境下での作業をサポートするために設計されていた、腕時計型汎用コンピュータです。惑星を開拓する探検家向けに数百万台が製造されており、超光速時代の初期におけるもっとも成功したテクノロジーの一つと言っても過言ではありません。『断絶』以後の世界の技術力は緩やかに衰退しているため、現代の類似製品よりわずかに劣る程度の高い性能を有しています。"

#. ~ Variant name of item "IX-2110 computer"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/armor.json
msgid "IX-2330S computer"
msgid_plural "IX-2330S computers"
msgstr[0] "IX-2330S汎用コンピュータ"

#. ~ Description of variant "IX-2330S computer" of item "IX-2110 computer"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/armor.json
msgid ""
"A rugged and radiation shielded wirst computer specifically designed to "
"support salvage operations.  It can perform general computing tasks and "
"might be used to interface with most ancient computer systems."
msgstr ""
"サルベージ作業を支援するために特別に設計された、放射線遮蔽が施された頑丈な腕時計型コンピュータです。一般的なコンピューティングタスクを実行する機能が備わっており、大抵の旧型システムのインターフェースとして利用できます。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/armor.json
msgid "XL jeans"
msgid_plural "pairs of XL jeans"
msgstr[0] "XLジーンズ"

#. ~ Description of "XL jeans"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/armor.json
msgid "A pair of XL blue jeans with two deep pockets."
msgstr "2つの深いポケットが付いた青色の大きなジーンズです。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/armor.json
msgid "XL work pants"
msgid_plural "pairs of XL work pants"
msgstr[0] "XL作業用パンツ"

#. ~ Description of "XL work pants"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/armor.json
msgid "A pair of gray work pants."
msgstr "灰色の作業用パンツです。"

#. ~ Snippet of item "XL work pants"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/armor.json
msgid "A pair of XL blue work pants."
msgstr "青色の大きな作業用パンツです。"

#. ~ Snippet of item "XL work pants"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/armor.json
msgid "A pair of XL gray work pants."
msgstr "灰色の大きな作業用パンツです。"

#. ~ Snippet of item "XL work pants"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/armor.json
msgid "A pair of XL light-blue work pants."
msgstr "水色の大きな作業用パンツです。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/armor.json
msgid "XL work t-shirt"
msgid_plural "XL work t-shirts"
msgstr[0] "XL作業用Tシャツ"

#. ~ Description of "XL work t-shirt"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/armor.json
msgid "A gray XL work t-shirt with a small front pocket."
msgstr "小さな前ポケットが付いた灰色の大きな作業用Tシャツです。"

#. ~ Snippet of item "XL work t-shirt"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/armor.json
msgid "An XL blue work t-shirt with a small front pocket."
msgstr "小さな前ポケットが付いた青色の大きな作業用Tシャツです。"

#. ~ Snippet of item "XL work t-shirt"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/armor.json
msgid "An XL gray work t-shirt with a small front pocket."
msgstr "小さな前ポケットが付いた灰色の大きな作業用Tシャツです。"

#. ~ Snippet of item "XL work t-shirt"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/armor.json
msgid "An XL light-blue work t-shirt with a small front pocket."
msgstr "小さな前ポケットが付いた水色の大きな作業用Tシャツです。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/armor.json
msgid "quantum solar backpack (folded)"
msgid_plural "quantum solar backpacks (folded)"
msgstr[0] "携帯型量子ソーラーパネル(折畳)"

#. ~ Description of "quantum solar backpack (folded)"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/armor.json
msgid ""
"Personal portable charging system consisting of an array of quantum solar "
"panels neatly folded in the form of a large backpack.  It can be worn as "
"one, and has an integrated cable to plug it into a cable charger system.  "
"Cutting edge technology."
msgstr ""
"折り畳まれたバックパック型の量子ソーラーアレイからなる、個人用の携行充電システムです。着用することができ、ケーブル充電システムに対応した一体型ケーブルが付属しています。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/armor.json
msgid "quantum solar backpack (unfolded)"
msgid_plural "quantum solar backpacks (unfolded)"
msgstr[0] "携帯型量子ソーラーパネル(展開)"

#. ~ Description of "quantum solar backpack (unfolded)"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/armor.json
msgid ""
"Unfolded array of portable quantum solar panels ready to push some power "
"into an active cable charger system."
msgstr "量子ソーラーアレイは展開されており、稼働しているケーブル充電システムに電力を供給する準備ができています。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/armor.json
msgid "Uplifted Enforcer armor"
msgid_plural "Uplifted Enforcer armors"
msgstr[0] "知性化生物用戦闘アーマー"

#. ~ Description of "Uplifted Enforcer armor"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/armor.json
msgid ""
"An extra large suit of black bulletproof armor with lots of pockets.  "
"Specifically designed for Uplifted officers such as Mastodons."
msgstr "ポケットがたくさん付いた、特大サイズの黒い防弾性装甲スーツです。知性マストドンのような知性化生物の戦闘員用に特別に設計されたものです。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/armor.json
msgid "empty XL ballistic vest"
msgid_plural "empty XL ballistic vests"
msgstr[0] "XL防弾ベスト(空)"

#. ~ Description of "empty XL ballistic vest"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/armor.json
msgid ""
"Oversized ballistic armor without any armor inserts.  The soft armor plate "
"carrier is still protective but it won't stop high energy projectiles."
msgstr "プレートを挿入していない特大サイズの防弾ベストです。この状態でも防護性能に優れていますが、威力の高い弾丸などは防げません。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/armor.json
msgid "XL ESAPI ballistic vest"
msgid_plural "XL ESAPI ballistic vests"
msgstr[0] "XL-ESAPI防弾ベスト"

#. ~ Description of "XL ESAPI ballistic vest"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/armor.json
msgid "Oversized ballistic armor with ESAPI ceramic armor plates."
msgstr "ESAPIセラミックアーマープレートを内蔵した特大サイズの防弾装備です。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/armor.json
msgid "pair of XL combat boots"
msgid_plural "pairs of XL combat boots"
msgstr[0] "XLコンバットブーツ"

#. ~ Description of "pair of XL combat boots"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/armor.json
msgid "Modern oversized reinforced tactical combat boots.  Very durable."
msgstr "近代的な強化を施した、特大サイズの戦闘用コンバットブーツです。耐久性に優れています。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/armor.json
msgid "pair of XL tactical gloves"
msgid_plural "pairs of XL tactical gloves"
msgstr[0] "XLタクティカルグローブ"

#. ~ Description of "pair of XL tactical gloves"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/armor.json
msgid ""
"A pair of oversized reinforced Kevlar tactical gloves.  Commonly used by "
"police and military units."
msgstr "ケブラーで強化した特大サイズのタクティカルグローブです。一般的に警察や軍隊が使用しています。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/armor.json
msgid "pair of Killophant gloves"
msgid_plural "pairs of Killophant gloves"
msgstr[0] "殺人ゾウグローブ"

#. ~ Description of "pair of Killophant gloves"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/armor.json
msgid ""
"A pair of reinforced Kevlar tactical gloves, specifically designed to "
"accommodate three-fingered Killophants.  Thinner than regular oversized "
"tactical gloves."
msgstr ""
"補強が施されたケブラー製タクティカルグローブです。3本指の殺人ゾウが着用できる特別製で、通常のタクティカルグローブよりも薄く作られています。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/armor.json
msgid "XL leather belt"
msgid_plural "XL leather belts"
msgstr[0] "XLレザーベルト"

#. ~ Description of "XL leather belt"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/armor.json
msgid ""
"An XL leather belt.  Useful for making your pair of pants fit if you need "
"really big pants."
msgstr "革製の大きなベルトです。非常に大きなサイズのズボンをきちんと履く時に役立ちます。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/armor.json
msgid "XL police duty belt"
msgid_plural "XL police duty belts"
msgstr[0] "XL警官用ベルト"

#. ~ Description of "XL police duty belt"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/armor.json
msgid ""
"An XL black leather belt used by extremely large uplifted police officers.  "
"It has several pouches and a holder for a baton."
msgstr "体格の大きな知性化生物の警察官が着用する革製の黒い大きなベルトです。いくつかのポーチと警棒を収納するホルダーが付いています。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/armor.json
msgid "XL tactical full helmet"
msgid_plural "XL tactical full helmets"
msgstr[0] "XLタクティカルフルヘルメット"

#. ~ Description of "XL tactical full helmet"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/armor.json
msgid ""
"An all-encompassing massive black helmet that covers your entire face and "
"neck, providing excellent protection from all sorts of damage."
msgstr "フルフェイスの黒い大きなヘルメットです。顔全体と首を覆い、あらゆるダメージから身を守ります。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/armor.json
msgid "XL leg ammo pouch"
msgid_plural "XL leg ammo pouches"
msgstr[0] "XL弾倉レッグポーチ"

#. ~ Description of "XL leg ammo pouch"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/armor.json
msgid ""
"An XL fabric ammo pouch that can be strapped to your leg; capable of holding"
" two magazines close at hand."
msgstr "ストラップで脚に固定できる、大きな布製弾倉ポーチです。取り出しやすい位置に弾倉を2つ収納できます。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/armor.json
msgid "Cecaelia wetsuit"
msgid_plural "Cecaelia wetsuits"
msgstr[0] "シセイリアスーツ"

#. ~ Description of "Cecaelia wetsuit"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/armor.json
msgid ""
"A wetsuit designed for the Octopus Uplifts known as Cecaelia.  This is the "
"explorer suit with no head or tentacle protection."
msgstr "シセイリアという名前で知られる知性タコ用に作られた、頭部と触手を保護しない探索用ウェットスーツです。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/armor.json
msgid "combat wetsuit"
msgid_plural "combat wetsuits"
msgstr[0] "戦闘用シセイリアスーツ"

#. ~ Description of "combat wetsuit"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/armor.json
msgid ""
"The combat version of the Cecaelia wetsuit; made of neoprene and Kevlar, it "
"will provide some level of protection for deep dwellers."
msgstr "ネオプレンとケブラーで作られた、深海の住人にある程度の防御力を与える戦闘用のウェットスーツです。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/armor.json
msgid "nanomesh vest"
msgid_plural "nanomesh vests"
msgstr[0] "ナノメッシュベスト"

#. ~ Description of "nanomesh vest"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/armor.json
msgid ""
"A lightweight nanomesh vest designed to face down many of the perils of "
"space travel.  These vests are mass produced and often stacked in starship "
"lockers."
msgstr "宇宙旅行中に遭遇する様々な危険に対処するために作られた、軽量のベストです。大量生産品であり、大抵の宇宙船のロッカーに積み上げられています。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/armor.json
msgid "XL nanomesh vest"
msgid_plural "XL nanomesh vests"
msgstr[0] "XLナノメッシュベスト"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/armor.json
msgid "vacuum cast cuirass"
msgid_plural "vacuum cast cuirasses"
msgstr[0] "真空注型キュイラス"

#. ~ Description of "vacuum cast cuirass"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/armor.json
msgid ""
"This piece of armor harkens back to renaissance designs.  It differs in that"
" it is cast as a single piece in deep space installations where conditions "
"can be controlled absolutely."
msgstr "ルネッサンス時代のデザインを彷彿とさせる甲冑です。宇宙空間にある装置を使い、一枚板の素材の状態を完全制御して成型している点が特徴です。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/armor.json
msgid "XL vacuum cast cuirass"
msgid_plural "XL vacuum cast cuirasses"
msgstr[0] "XL真空注型キュイラス"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/armor.json
msgid "XS vacuum cast cuirass"
msgid_plural "XS vacuum cast cuirasses"
msgstr[0] "XS真空注型キュイラス"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/armor_helmets.json
msgid "carbide raider's helmet"
msgid_plural "carbide raider's helmets"
msgstr[0] "カーバイドヘルメット"

#. ~ Description of "carbide raider's helmet"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/armor_helmets.json
msgid ""
"This helmet is designed for the individual that is worried about catching "
"heavy weapons fire to the face.  It is unwieldy and heavy, and lacks basic "
"environmental protection features, but it just might stop even the largest "
"of ballistic rounds."
msgstr ""
"このヘルメットは、重火器による攻撃を顔面に受けないか不安な人のために設計されました。重くて扱いにくく、基本的な環境保護機能もありませんが、最大級の威力をもつ弾丸すら止められるかもしれません。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/armor_helmets.json
msgid "UICAS Tip of the Spear helmet"
msgid_plural "UICAS Tip of the Spear helmets"
msgstr[0] "UICASフルヘルメット"

#. ~ Description of "UICAS Tip of the Spear helmet"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/armor_helmets.json
msgid ""
"An all-environment combat helmet issued to UICA espatiers.  Commonly known "
"as 'the jar' due to its unusual clear polymer canopy that leaves its "
"wearer's face visible."
msgstr ""
"UICAの宇宙兵に支給される、全環境対応型のコンバットヘルメットです。キャノピーは透明なポリマー製で顔が見えるようになっており、通称「瓶」と呼ばれています。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/armor_helmets.json
msgid "UICAS Point of Impact helmet"
msgid_plural "UICAS Point of Impact helmets"
msgstr[0] "UICASヘルメット"

#. ~ Description of "UICAS Point of Impact helmet"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/armor_helmets.json
msgid ""
"A lightweight black helmet that provides excellent protection from all sorts"
" of damage, unless it's airborne.  UICAS makes the point of designing all "
"headgear whenever possible with clear faceplates, in order to provide a "
"human touch to all interactions."
msgstr ""
"空気中の毒物を除くあらゆるダメージに対して優れた防御力を発揮する、黒い軽量ヘルメットです。人間同士のコミュニケーションを円滑にするため、UICASはあらゆる頭部装備で可能な限り透明なフェイスプレートを採用しています。"

