#. ~ Furniture name
#: data/mods/Aftershock/maps/furniture_and_terrain/furniture_alienciv.json
msgid "coral obelisk"
msgstr "珊瑚のオベリスク"

#. ~ Description of furniture "coral obelisk"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/maps/furniture_and_terrain/furniture_alienciv.json
msgid ""
"Facets of white coral erupt from the ground and assemble themselves into a "
"free standing column.  The living surface is bioluminescent and rarely "
"sparkles with golden light."
msgstr "白い珊瑚が地面から隆起し、柱状に立っています。表面の生きている珊瑚は発光しており、時折金色に輝きます。"

#. ~ Furniture name
#: data/mods/Aftershock/maps/furniture_and_terrain/furniture_alienciv.json
msgid "coral pedestal"
msgstr "珊瑚の台座"

#. ~ Description of furniture "coral pedestal"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/maps/furniture_and_terrain/furniture_alienciv.json
msgid "Fluted white coral gently coils itself into a short pedestal."
msgstr "溝のある珊瑚が低い台座を優しく包んでいます。"

#. ~ Furniture name
#: data/mods/Aftershock/maps/furniture_and_terrain/furniture_habitat.json
msgid "habitat kitchenette"
msgstr "簡易キッチン"

#. ~ Description of furniture "habitat kitchenette"
#. ~ Description of terrain "gunship kitchenette"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/maps/furniture_and_terrain/furniture_habitat.json
#: data/mods/Aftershock/maps/furniture_and_terrain/terrain_spaceship.json
msgid ""
"A tiny sink and cooking surface only big enough to fit an electric hotplate,"
" placed above and below many integrated storage units.  The minimal space in"
" which you could technically cook."
msgstr ""
"電動ホットプレートが入る程度の小さな調理台とシンクが、大型収納ユニットの上下に配置されています。まともに調理ができる最小限のスペースが確保できます。"

#. ~ Furniture name
#. ~ Terrain name
#: data/mods/Aftershock/maps/furniture_and_terrain/furniture_habitat.json
#: data/mods/Aftershock/maps/furniture_and_terrain/terrain_spaceship.json
msgid "storage board"
msgstr "壁掛け収納"

#. ~ Description of furniture "storage board"
#. ~ Description of terrain "storage board"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/maps/furniture_and_terrain/furniture_habitat.json
#: data/mods/Aftershock/maps/furniture_and_terrain/terrain_spaceship.json
msgid "The wall-mounted, steel and plastic storage solution of tomorrow."
msgstr "壁に掛けて使う、鋼鉄とプラスチックでできた未来の収納家具です"

#. ~ Furniture name
#: data/mods/Aftershock/maps/furniture_and_terrain/furniture_habitat.json
msgid "integrated washroom"
msgstr "洗浄室"

#. ~ Description of furniture "integrated washroom"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/maps/furniture_and_terrain/furniture_habitat.json
msgid ""
"Waste and water pipes, conjoined into the most compact bathroom that could "
"possibly be built."
msgstr "排水管と給水管に接続されている、非常に小さなバスルームです。"

#. ~ Furniture name
#: data/mods/Aftershock/maps/furniture_and_terrain/furniture_habitat.json
msgid "industrial floodlight"
msgstr "工業用投光照明"

#. ~ Description of furniture "industrial floodlight"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/maps/furniture_and_terrain/furniture_habitat.json
msgid ""
"A wall mountable floodlight, designed to illuminate large areas with a "
"bright, white light.  Still functional thanks to some unknown backup power "
"source."
msgstr "明るい白色光で広範囲を照らす、壁に取り付けられる投光器です。どこかに予備電源があるのか、今も機能しています。"

#. ~ Furniture name
#: data/mods/Aftershock/maps/furniture_and_terrain/furniture_habitat.json
msgid "screen mirror"
msgstr "スクリーンミラー"

#. ~ Description of furniture "screen mirror"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/maps/furniture_and_terrain/furniture_habitat.json
msgid ""
"A wall mounted digital display.  It would once have served as an "
"entertainment and advertising system."
msgstr "壁に取り付けてあるデジタルディスプレイです。かつては娯楽や広告用のシステムとして機能していたのでしょう。"

#. ~ Description of furniture "screen mirror"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/maps/furniture_and_terrain/furniture_habitat.json
msgid "The screen wall is awash with rolling advertisements."
msgstr "壁のスクリーンは広告で溢れています。"

#. ~ Furniture name
#. ~ Terrain name
#: data/mods/Aftershock/maps/furniture_and_terrain/furniture_habitat.json
#: data/mods/Aftershock/maps/furniture_and_terrain/terrain_spaceship.json
msgid "intermodal shipping crate"
msgstr "一貫輸送クレート"

#. ~ Description of furniture "intermodal shipping crate"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/maps/furniture_and_terrain/furniture_habitat.json
msgid ""
"A sealed metal crate used to ferry cargo to and from orbit.  This one "
"appears to be open."
msgstr "軌道上で貨物を輸送するための、密封可能な金属製の箱です。開いているようです。"

#. ~ Furniture name
#: data/mods/Aftershock/maps/furniture_and_terrain/furniture_habitat.json
msgid "sealed intermodal crate"
msgstr "電子ロック一貫輸送クレート"

#. ~ Description of furniture "sealed intermodal crate"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/maps/furniture_and_terrain/furniture_habitat.json
msgid ""
"A sealed metal crate used to ferry cargo to and from orbit.  This one "
"appears to be secured with an electric lock."
msgstr "軌道上で貨物を輸送するための、密封可能な金属製の箱です。電子錠でロックされているようです。"

#. ~ Furniture name
#: data/mods/Aftershock/maps/furniture_and_terrain/furniture_habitat.json
msgid "reinforced display case"
msgstr "強化陳列ケース"

#. ~ Description of furniture "reinforced display case"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/maps/furniture_and_terrain/furniture_habitat.json
msgid ""
"A secure metal case at about waist-height, with reinforced glass panelling "
"on top.  Useful for storing valuable things while still showing them off.  "
"Secured with an electronic lock."
msgstr ""
"強化ガラスの蓋に覆われた、腰までの高さがある頑丈そうな金属製のケースです。貴重品を目視できる状態で保管するのに便利です。ケースの蓋は電子ロックによって施錠されています。"

#. ~ Description of furniture "reinforced display case"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/maps/furniture_and_terrain/furniture_habitat.json
msgid ""
"A secure metal case at about waist-height, with reinforced glass panelling "
"on top.  Useful for storing valuable things while still showing them off.  "
"This one had its lock hacked and is open."
msgstr ""
"強化ガラスの蓋に覆われた、腰までの高さがある頑丈そうな金属製のケースです。貴重品を目視できる状態で保管するのに便利です。ケースの蓋の電子ロックが解除され、開いてます。"

#. ~ Description of furniture "broken display case"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/maps/furniture_and_terrain/furniture_habitat.json
msgid ""
"A secure metal case at about waist-height, with reinforced glass panelling "
"on top.  Would be useful for storing valuable things while still showing "
"them off, if the glass hadn't been shattered."
msgstr ""
"強化ガラスの蓋に覆われた、腰までの高さがある頑丈そうな金属製のケースです。貴重品を目視できる状態で保管するのに便利でしたが、今はガラスが粉々に割れています。"

#. ~ Furniture name
#: data/mods/Aftershock/maps/furniture_and_terrain/furniture_habitat.json
msgid "Net Breacher recliner"
msgstr "アクセスポイントチェア"

#. ~ Description of furniture "Net Breacher recliner"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/maps/furniture_and_terrain/furniture_habitat.json
msgid ""
"A reclined metal chair adorned with soft fabric padding.  A number of cables"
" dangle from the headrest, waiting to be connected to a bionic interface.  "
"In the past, this state-of-the-art equipment would have served as a "
"hypercloud access point for cyber security specialists."
msgstr ""
"リクライニング式の金属製の椅子の表面は、柔らかい布地で覆われています。ヘッドレストからは数本のケーブルが垂れ下がり、生体部品に接続されるのを待っています。かつて最先端だったこの機器は、サイバーセキュリティの専門家がクラウドにアクセスするために活用していました。"

#. ~ Furniture name
#: data/mods/Aftershock/maps/furniture_and_terrain/furniture_habitat.json
msgid "security override panel"
msgstr "セキュリティ操作パネル"

#. ~ Description of furniture "security override panel"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/maps/furniture_and_terrain/furniture_habitat.json
msgid ""
"A slim wall mounted metal panel covering an electronic interface to manually"
" override nearby security systems."
msgstr "壁に掛かった薄い金属製のパネルには、付近のセキュリティシステムを手動で無効化するための電子インターフェースが取り付けられています。"

#. ~ Furniture name
#: data/mods/Aftershock/maps/furniture_and_terrain/furniture_habitat_machinery.json
msgid "ECU"
msgstr "電子制御ユニット"

#. ~ Description of furniture "ECU"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/maps/furniture_and_terrain/furniture_habitat_machinery.json
msgid ""
"The central node of a life support system, tasked with regulating "
"atmospherics and water flow to the rest of an habitat or ship."
msgstr "入植地や宇宙船内での大気や水の供給と調整を行う、生命維持システムの中枢です。"

#. ~ Furniture name
#: data/mods/Aftershock/maps/furniture_and_terrain/furniture_habitat_machinery.json
msgid "Cryo-fluid pump"
msgstr "低温流体ポンプ"

#. ~ Description of furniture "Cryo-fluid pump"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/maps/furniture_and_terrain/furniture_habitat_machinery.json
msgid ""
"An insulated metal tank prepared for the storage of exotic cryo-coolants.  "
"Relatively advanced in construction, it can be salvaged for valuable scrap."
msgstr "特殊な冷却剤を貯蔵する、断熱性の高い金属タンクです。比較的高度な装置であり、分解すれば貴重な部品を入手できます。"

#. ~ Furniture name
#: data/mods/Aftershock/maps/furniture_and_terrain/furniture_habitat_machinery.json
msgid "atmospherics controller"
msgstr "空調設備"

#. ~ Description of furniture "atmospherics controller"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/maps/furniture_and_terrain/furniture_habitat_machinery.json
msgid ""
"An imposing brick of circuitry inlaid tubing adorned with a single console."
"  It might still half-work, even after all this time."
msgstr "チューブと回路と一台の操作端末で構成された箱型の装置です。これだけ時間が経っても、まだ半数程度は機能しているようです。"

#. ~ Furniture name
#: data/mods/Aftershock/maps/furniture_and_terrain/furniture_spaceship_machinery.json
msgid "Direct fusion drive"
msgstr "直接核融合ドライブ"

#. ~ Description of furniture "Direct fusion drive"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/maps/furniture_and_terrain/furniture_spaceship_machinery.json
msgid ""
"A powerful fusion engine fuelled by helium.  A miracle of hyperspace age "
"technology, painstakingly reproduced from original schematics without true "
"understanding.  Its core components are notably expensive."
msgstr ""
"ヘリウムを燃料とする強力な核融合エンジンです。原理を真に理解しないまま原初の回路図から苦労を重ねて再現された、超高速時代のテクノロジーの奇跡です。内部の構造物は非常に貴重です。"

#. ~ Furniture name
#: data/mods/Aftershock/maps/furniture_and_terrain/furniture_spaceship_machinery.json
msgid "Multi-axis maneuvering thruster"
msgstr "多軸操縦スラスター"

#. ~ Description of furniture "Multi-axis maneuvering thruster"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/maps/furniture_and_terrain/furniture_spaceship_machinery.json
msgid ""
"A set of highly maneuverable chemical thrusters used is small to medium "
"spacecraft."
msgstr "小型から中型の宇宙船に搭載されている、機動性の高い化学燃料式スラスターです。"

#. ~ Description of furniture "radioactive slag"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/maps/furniture_and_terrain/furniture_spaceship_machinery.json
msgid ""
"A pile of melted slag from a destroyed spaceship reactor.  Incandescently "
"hot and highly radioactive, you'd need a purposefully armored suit to even "
"approach it."
msgstr "宇宙船内の破壊された原子炉から溶け出たスラグの塊です。白熱しており放射線レベルが高いため、近寄るだけでも専用の装甲服を着る必要があります。"

#. ~ Terrain name
#: data/mods/Aftershock/maps/furniture_and_terrain/terrain.json
msgid "foamcrete wall"
msgstr "壁(発泡ｺﾝｸﾘｰﾄ)"

#. ~ Description of terrain "foamcrete wall"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/maps/furniture_and_terrain/terrain.json
msgid ""
"A lightweight wall made from unreinforced foamcrete.  Not nearly as "
"resilient as a real wall, but it will block sight and the elements "
"nonetheless."
msgstr "補強されていない発砲コンクリートで作られた軽い壁です。一般的な壁よりは弱いですが、視界や物体を遮ります。"

#. ~ Terrain name
#: data/mods/Aftershock/maps/furniture_and_terrain/terrain.json
msgid "foamcrete floor"
msgstr "床(発泡ｺﾝｸﾘｰﾄ)"

#. ~ Description of terrain "foamcrete floor"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/maps/furniture_and_terrain/terrain.json
msgid "A relatively flat slab of unreinforced foamcrete."
msgstr "補強されていない発砲コンクリートで作られた、比較的平らな床です。"

#. ~ Terrain name
#: data/mods/Aftershock/maps/furniture_and_terrain/terrain.json
msgid "clearcrete wall"
msgstr "壁(クリアクリート)"

#. ~ Description of terrain "clearcrete wall"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/maps/furniture_and_terrain/terrain.json
msgid ""
"A barrier made of clearcrete, perfect for greenhouses but looks extremely "
"fragile.  It is most definitely not fragile, and it's probably alarmed in "
"the event of a breach."
msgstr ""
"温室に最適な、透明なコンクリートで作られた壁です。非常に壊れやすそうに見えますが、壊すことはほぼ不可能で、突破しようとすれば警報が鳴ります。"

#. ~ Bashing sound
#: data/mods/Aftershock/maps/furniture_and_terrain/terrain.json
msgid "a cross between steel bending and stone shattering!"
msgstr "[鋼鉄がひしゃげる音！][石が砕けるような音！]"

#. ~ Description of terrain "foamcrete wall"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/maps/furniture_and_terrain/terrain.json
msgid ""
"Automatically deployed by the ship to block breaches and seal off damaged "
"sections, this foamcrete wall is a temporary solution at best."
msgstr "自動的に噴射され、船体の裂け目を覆って損傷部分を密閉する発泡コンクリート製の壁です。この修復は単なる一時しのぎにしかなりません。"

#. ~ Description of terrain "foamcrete floor"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/maps/furniture_and_terrain/terrain.json
msgid ""
"Automatically deployed by the ship to block breaches and seal off damaged "
"sections, this foamcrete floor is a temporary solution at best."
msgstr "自動的に噴射され、船体の裂け目を覆って損傷部分を密閉する発泡コンクリート製の床です。この修復は単なる一時しのぎにしかなりません。"

#. ~ Terrain name
#: data/mods/Aftershock/maps/furniture_and_terrain/terrain.json
msgid "hard vacuum"
msgstr "高真空空間"

#. ~ Description of terrain "hard vacuum"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/maps/furniture_and_terrain/terrain.json
msgid ""
"The cold inhospitable vacuum of space.  Going this way without an EVA pack "
"will end in either a slow cold death as your life support fades or a slow "
"hot death as you drop into the planet's atmosphere."
msgstr ""
"人間の生存に適さない過酷な宇宙空間です。環境防護スーツなしで乗り込めば、生命維持装置の停止によって低温環境でゆっくりと死ぬか、あるいは惑星の大気圏に落下して高温環境でゆっくりと死ぬことになります。"

#. ~ Terrain name
#: data/mods/Aftershock/maps/furniture_and_terrain/terrain_alienciv.json
msgid "coral floor"
msgstr "床(珊瑚)"

#. ~ Description of terrain "coral floor"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/maps/furniture_and_terrain/terrain_alienciv.json
msgid ""
"Thin shelves of coral latch together into a flat mosaic and portray the "
"geometries of life."
msgstr "薄い珊瑚がモザイク状に平たく貼りつき、生命の幾何学模様を描いています。"

#. ~ Description of terrain "coral floor"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/maps/furniture_and_terrain/terrain_alienciv.json
msgid ""
"Filaments of white coral grow tall and weave themselves into a sinuous wall."
"  The living surface is ornately grooved, and golden light slowly flows "
"within its gaps."
msgstr ""
"白い珊瑚が細く高く伸び、しなやかな壁を作り出しています。表面の生きた珊瑚の溝は美しい模様を描いており、窪みを金色の光がゆっくりと流れています。"

#. ~ Terrain name
#: data/mods/Aftershock/maps/furniture_and_terrain/terrain_card_readers.json
msgid "Old TSKBEM Card Reader"
msgstr "カードリーダー(TsKBEM)"

#. ~ Description of terrain "Old TSKBEM Card Reader"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/maps/furniture_and_terrain/terrain_card_readers.json
msgid ""
"A smartcard based lock system once fitted to TSKBEM prefab industrial "
"facilities.  While an original key would be impossible to find, the machine "
"is ancient and obsolete, and it can be hacked or masterkeys can be obtained "
"to bypass it."
msgstr ""
"スマートカード式のロック機構です。このプレハブ施設は、かつてはTsKBEMの産業基盤区画でした。オリジナルのキーは見つかりませんが、この時代遅れの装置にハッキングを仕掛けるか、マスターキーを入手すればアクセスできそうです。"

#. ~ Terrain name
#: data/mods/Aftershock/maps/furniture_and_terrain/terrain_card_readers.json
msgid "Old Enforcer Card Reader"
msgstr "カードリーダー(警察機関)"

#. ~ Description of terrain "Old Enforcer Card Reader"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/maps/furniture_and_terrain/terrain_card_readers.json
msgid ""
"A smartcard based lock system once fitted to corporate police prefab "
"facilities.  While an original key would be impossible to find, the machine "
"is ancient and obsolete, and it can be hacked or masterkeys can be obtained "
"to bypass it."
msgstr ""
"スマートカード式のロック機構です。このプレハブ施設は、かつては企業のセキュリティ部門の活動拠点でした。オリジナルのキーは見つかりませんが、この時代遅れの装置にハッキングを仕掛けるか、マスターキーを入手すればアクセスできそうです。"

#. ~ Terrain name
#: data/mods/Aftershock/maps/furniture_and_terrain/terrain_floraxeno.json
msgid "leviathan annelids"
msgstr "リヴァイアサンワーム"

#. ~ Description of terrain "leviathan annelids"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/maps/furniture_and_terrain/terrain_floraxeno.json
msgid ""
"Several massive protrusions emerge from the ground, coiled together into a "
"tower.  At the top, blue and purple tentacles sway in the wind."
msgstr "複数の巨大な突起物が地面から生え、塔のようにとぐろを巻いて鎮座しています。塔の上部では、青色と紫色の触手が風に揺れています。"

#. ~ Terrain name
#: data/mods/Aftershock/maps/furniture_and_terrain/terrain_floraxeno.json
msgid "lichen tree"
msgstr "地衣類の木"

#. ~ Description of terrain "lichen tree"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/maps/furniture_and_terrain/terrain_floraxeno.json
msgid ""
"A massive corrugated body sprouts from the lichen here, branching out into "
"mushroom-like limbs, dust filling the air as the wind meets it."
msgstr "幹からひだの付いた巨大な茎が芽吹き、枝分かれした先端はキノコのような形状になっています。風が吹くと大気中に粒子をばら撒きます。"

#. ~ Terrain name
#: data/mods/Aftershock/maps/furniture_and_terrain/terrain_floraxeno.json
msgid "fossilized conifer"
msgstr "石化針葉樹"

#. ~ Description of terrain "fossilized conifer"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/maps/furniture_and_terrain/terrain_floraxeno.json
msgid ""
"A long dead tree standing on spindly legs similar to a Cypress which tapers "
"into a point until spreading out in a hollow dodecahedron."
msgstr "イトスギに似た鋭い枝葉が特徴的な、背の高い枯れ木です。幹の内部は空洞になっており、先端は細く根本は十二角形に広がっています。"

#. ~ Terrain name
#: data/mods/Aftershock/maps/furniture_and_terrain/terrain_floraxeno.json
msgid "infested fossilized conifer"
msgstr "侵食された石化針葉樹"

#. ~ Description of terrain "infested fossilized conifer"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/maps/furniture_and_terrain/terrain_floraxeno.json
msgid ""
"A long dead tree standing on spindly legs similar to a Cypress which tapers "
"into a point until spreading out in a hollow dodecahedron.  The trunk seems "
"to be splitting as tendrils of mold dig into it, clinging onto the tree like"
" a frame."
msgstr ""
"イトスギに似た鋭い枝葉が特徴的な、背の高い枯れ木です。先端は細く根本は十二角形に広がっています。カビの菌糸が骨組みのように樹木全体を蝕み、まるで幹が裂けているように見えます。"

#. ~ Terrain name
#: data/mods/Aftershock/maps/furniture_and_terrain/terrain_floraxeno.json
msgid "lichen shrub"
msgstr "地衣類の低木"

#. ~ Description of terrain "lichen shrub"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/maps/furniture_and_terrain/terrain_floraxeno.json
msgid ""
"A small mound of lichen grows here, noticeably bigger than the lichen and "
"moss around it."
msgstr "この場所は周囲よりも地衣類の成長が早く、小さな山のようになっています。"

#. ~ Bashing failed sound
#: data/mods/Aftershock/maps/furniture_and_terrain/terrain_floraxeno.json
msgid "squish."
msgstr "グシャッ。"

#. ~ Description of terrain "lichen shrub"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/maps/furniture_and_terrain/terrain_floraxeno.json
msgid ""
"A small mound of lichen grows here, noticeably bigger than the lichen and "
"moss around it.  A few clumps have been removed."
msgstr "この場所は周囲よりも地衣類の成長が早く、小さな山のようになっています。地衣類の塊がいくつか採取されています。"

#. ~ Furniture name
#: data/mods/Aftershock/maps/furniture_and_terrain/terrain_floraxeno.json
msgid "moss bush"
msgstr "苔の茂み"

#. ~ Description of furniture "moss bush"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/maps/furniture_and_terrain/terrain_floraxeno.json
msgid "A mound of moss, with large colorful stems protruding out of it."
msgstr "大きな色とりどりの柄が突き出た苔の山です。"

#. ~ Furniture name
#: data/mods/Aftershock/maps/furniture_and_terrain/terrain_floraxeno.json
msgid "geothermal bladder"
msgstr "地熱溜まり"

#. ~ Description of furniture "geothermal bladder"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/maps/furniture_and_terrain/terrain_floraxeno.json
msgid ""
"Black veins support a large formation of bleached coral as it grows around "
"the rim of this geothermal vent.  Above it, red and purple tentacles caress "
"a balloon-shaped organ as it breathes."
msgstr ""
"地熱溜まりの傍で黒い穴が成長すると、広範囲のサンゴが白化します。穴の上に生えた赤と紫の触手は、呼吸するように揺れながら風船状の器官を撫でています。"

#. ~ Description of furniture "breather"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/maps/furniture_and_terrain/terrain_floraxeno.json
msgid ""
"On the ground here lay several colorless coral reefs, the black veins are "
"noticeably more engorged as they breathe."
msgstr "地面には色を失くしたサンゴ礁がいくつか残っています。黒い穴が呼吸するように動き、徐々に赤みを増しています。"

#. ~ Furniture name
#: data/mods/Aftershock/maps/furniture_and_terrain/terrain_floraxeno.json
msgid "overgrown vent"
msgstr "熱気噴出穴"

#. ~ Description of furniture "overgrown vent"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/maps/furniture_and_terrain/terrain_floraxeno.json
msgid ""
"The coral and veins on the ground here have fused into a sea anemone-like "
"structure; pufts of smoke and hot air emit from its mouth."
msgstr "地面のサンゴと穴はイソギンチャクのような構造と融合しています。煙と熱気が穴から放出されます。"

#. ~ Terrain name
#: data/mods/Aftershock/maps/furniture_and_terrain/terrain_groundxeno.json
msgid "lichen"
msgstr "地衣類"

#. ~ Description of terrain "lichen"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/maps/furniture_and_terrain/terrain_groundxeno.json
msgid ""
"Many colorful species of ice-lichen, thriving above an uncharacteristically "
"fertile segment of ice.  Either endemic, or surviving genecraft from an "
"aborted terraforming project."
msgstr ""
"肥沃な氷の上であればどんな環境でも繁殖する、氷に着生するカラフルな地衣類です。この地域の固有種、あるいは中止されたテラフォーミング計画に使われていた遺伝子組み換え生物の生き残りでしょうか。"

#. ~ Bashing sound
#: data/mods/Aftershock/maps/furniture_and_terrain/terrain_groundxeno.json
msgid "splosh."
msgstr "バシャッ。"

#. ~ Terrain name
#: data/mods/Aftershock/maps/furniture_and_terrain/terrain_groundxeno.json
msgid "lichen bed"
msgstr "地衣類の苗床"

#. ~ Description of terrain "lichen bed"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/maps/furniture_and_terrain/terrain_groundxeno.json
msgid ""
"Familiar, yet unfamiliar.  Lichens and moss cling to rocks and lifeless dirt"
" here, providing a squishy but colorful grass."
msgstr ""
"よくある地形に見えますが、よく見ると違います。地衣類や苔が岩や他に植物も生えていない地面に着生し、色とりどりの柔らかい草地を形作っています。"

#. ~ Terrain name
#: data/mods/Aftershock/maps/furniture_and_terrain/terrain_groundxeno.json
msgid "glacial ice"
msgstr "氷河"

#. ~ Description of terrain "glacial ice"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/maps/furniture_and_terrain/terrain_groundxeno.json
msgid ""
"A small segment from the near planet-wide glacier of Salus IV.  Gets called "
"'ground' around these parts."
msgstr "惑星サルスIVのほぼ全域に広がる氷河の一部分です。氷河の周囲一帯は「陸地」と呼ばれています。"

#. ~ Bashing failed sound
#: data/mods/Aftershock/maps/furniture_and_terrain/terrain_groundxeno.json
#: data/mods/TropiCataclysm/tropical_terrain.json
msgid "fweet!"
msgstr "キュッ！"

#. ~ Description of terrain "dirt"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/maps/furniture_and_terrain/terrain_groundxeno.json
msgid ""
"A relatively flat area of black dirt with no observable growth on it, caked "
"with shards of rock.  The only real ground besides the glacial ice."
msgstr "礫混じりの見るからに養分の少ない土で構成された、黒っぽく比較的平らな地面です。氷河以外で唯一の、本当の陸地です。"

#. ~ Terrain name
#: data/mods/Aftershock/maps/furniture_and_terrain/terrain_groundxeno.json
msgid "basalt floor"
msgstr "床(玄武岩)"

#. ~ Description of terrain "basalt floor"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/maps/furniture_and_terrain/terrain_groundxeno.json
msgid "A relatively flat area of gray stone, warm to the touch."
msgstr "触ると温かみを感じる、灰色の石で構成された比較的平らな地面です。"

#. ~ Furniture name
#: data/mods/Aftershock/maps/furniture_and_terrain/terrain_groundxeno.json
msgid "geothermal vent"
msgstr "地熱噴出孔"

#. ~ Description of furniture "geothermal vent"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/maps/furniture_and_terrain/terrain_groundxeno.json
msgid ""
"A basalt column stands here, perpetually emitting foul-smelling gas, similar"
" to rotten eggs.  It is very warm to the touch, hot enough to burn you if "
"you aren't careful."
msgstr ""
"そびえ立つ玄武岩の柱は、腐った卵のような悪臭のガスを絶えず噴出しています。触ると非常に温かく、時折焼けるほどの熱さになるため注意が必要です。"

#. ~ Terrain name
#: data/mods/Aftershock/maps/furniture_and_terrain/terrain_groundxeno.json
msgid "fumarolic ice tower"
msgstr "冷気噴出孔"

#. ~ Description of terrain "fumarolic ice tower"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/maps/furniture_and_terrain/terrain_groundxeno.json
msgid ""
"A solid cloud-like structure, formed when water vapor escapes from the crust"
" and meets the freezing air.  It is still emitting some gases."
msgstr "地殻から漏れた水蒸気が冷気と混ざって形成される、雲のような固形の物質です。現在もガスを放出し続けています。"

#. ~ Description of terrain "fumarolic ice tower"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/maps/furniture_and_terrain/terrain_groundxeno.json
msgid ""
"A solid cloud-like structure, formed when water vapor escapes from the crust"
" and meets the freezing air."
msgstr "地殻から漏れた水蒸気が冷気と混ざって形成される、雲のような固形の物質です。"

#. ~ Terrain name
#: data/mods/Aftershock/maps/furniture_and_terrain/terrain_groundxeno.json
msgid "fumarole"
msgstr "噴気孔"

#. ~ Description of terrain "fumarole"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/maps/furniture_and_terrain/terrain_groundxeno.json
msgid "A hole in the ground from which steam and other gases are escaping."
msgstr "地面に開いた、蒸気やガスが噴き出す穴です。"

#. ~ Furniture name
#: data/mods/Aftershock/maps/furniture_and_terrain/terrain_groundxeno.json
msgid "basalt rocks"
msgstr "玄武岩"

#. ~ Description of furniture "basalt rocks"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/maps/furniture_and_terrain/terrain_groundxeno.json
msgid "Various sharp rocks jut out of the ground here."
msgstr "色々な形の鋭い岩が地面から突き出しています。"

#. ~ Terrain name
#: data/mods/Aftershock/maps/furniture_and_terrain/terrain_groundxeno.json
msgid "snow"
msgstr "雪"

#. ~ Description of terrain "snow"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/maps/furniture_and_terrain/terrain_groundxeno.json
msgid "A patch of thick snow, very cold."
msgstr "とても冷たい、分厚く積もった雪です。"

#. ~ Description of terrain "snow"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/maps/furniture_and_terrain/terrain_groundxeno.json
msgid "A patch of thick snow on top of rocks, very cold."
msgstr "とても冷たい、岩の上に分厚く積もった雪です。"

#. ~ Terrain name
#: data/mods/Aftershock/maps/furniture_and_terrain/terrain_groundxeno.json
msgid "basalt wall"
msgstr "壁(玄武岩)"

#. ~ Description of terrain "basalt wall"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/maps/furniture_and_terrain/terrain_groundxeno.json
msgid "A sturdy basalt wall."
msgstr "頑丈な玄武岩の壁です。"

#. ~ Terrain name
#: data/mods/Aftershock/maps/furniture_and_terrain/terrain_groundxeno.json
msgid "glacial ice wall"
msgstr "壁(氷)"

#. ~ Description of terrain "glacial ice wall"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/maps/furniture_and_terrain/terrain_groundxeno.json
msgid "A solid wall of glacial ice."
msgstr "堅い氷壁です。"

#. ~ Terrain name
#: data/mods/Aftershock/maps/furniture_and_terrain/terrain_groundxeno.json
msgid "snow wall"
msgstr "壁(雪)"

#. ~ Description of terrain "snow wall"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/maps/furniture_and_terrain/terrain_groundxeno.json
msgid "A solid mass of piled snow."
msgstr "硬く分厚い雪の壁です。"

#. ~ Terrain name
#: data/mods/Aftershock/maps/furniture_and_terrain/terrain_groundxeno.json
msgid "downward snow slope"
msgstr "下り坂(雪)"

#. ~ Description of terrain "downward snow slope"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/maps/furniture_and_terrain/terrain_groundxeno.json
msgid "A downward-facing slope of snow."
msgstr "雪で作られた下り坂の斜面です。"

#. ~ Terrain name
#: data/mods/Aftershock/maps/furniture_and_terrain/terrain_groundxeno.json
msgid "upward snow slope"
msgstr "上り坂(雪)"

#. ~ Description of terrain "upward snow slope"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/maps/furniture_and_terrain/terrain_groundxeno.json
msgid "An upward-facing slope of snow."
msgstr "雪で作られた上り坂の斜面です。"

#. ~ Terrain name
#: data/mods/Aftershock/maps/furniture_and_terrain/terrain_groundxeno.json
msgid "downward glacial ice slope"
msgstr "下り坂(氷)"

#. ~ Description of terrain "downward glacial ice slope"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/maps/furniture_and_terrain/terrain_groundxeno.json
msgid "A downward-facing glacial slope."
msgstr "氷で作られた下り坂の斜面です。"

#. ~ Terrain name
#: data/mods/Aftershock/maps/furniture_and_terrain/terrain_groundxeno.json
msgid "upward glacial ice slope"
msgstr "上り坂(氷)"

#. ~ Description of terrain "upward glacial ice slope"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/maps/furniture_and_terrain/terrain_groundxeno.json
msgid "An upward-facing glacial slope."
msgstr "氷で作られた上り坂の斜面です。"

#. ~ Terrain name
#: data/mods/Aftershock/maps/furniture_and_terrain/terrain_groundxeno.json
msgid "downward basalt slope"
msgstr "下り坂(玄武岩)"

#. ~ Description of terrain "downward basalt slope"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/maps/furniture_and_terrain/terrain_groundxeno.json
msgid "A downward-facing slope of basalt."
msgstr "玄武岩で作られた下り坂の斜面です。"

#. ~ Terrain name
#: data/mods/Aftershock/maps/furniture_and_terrain/terrain_groundxeno.json
msgid "upward basalt slope"
msgstr "上り坂(玄武岩)"

#. ~ Description of terrain "upward basalt slope"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/maps/furniture_and_terrain/terrain_groundxeno.json
msgid "An upward-facing slope of basalt."
msgstr "玄武岩で作られた上り坂の斜面です。"

#. ~ Furniture name
#: data/mods/Aftershock/maps/furniture_and_terrain/terrain_groundxeno.json
msgid "small snow mound"
msgstr "小さな雪山"

#. ~ Description of furniture "small snow mound"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/maps/furniture_and_terrain/terrain_groundxeno.json
msgid "A small pile of snow."
msgstr "雪で作られた小さな山です。"

#. ~ Bashing sound
#: data/mods/Aftershock/maps/furniture_and_terrain/terrain_groundxeno.json
msgid "flump!"
msgstr "ボフッ！"

#. ~ Furniture name
#: data/mods/Aftershock/maps/furniture_and_terrain/terrain_groundxeno.json
msgid "snow mound"
msgstr "雪山"

#. ~ Description of furniture "snow mound"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/maps/furniture_and_terrain/terrain_groundxeno.json
msgid "A large pile of snow"
msgstr "雪で作られた大きな山です。"

#. ~ Furniture name
#: data/mods/Aftershock/maps/furniture_and_terrain/terrain_groundxeno.json
msgid "large snow mound"
msgstr "大きな雪山"

#. ~ Description of furniture "large snow mound"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/maps/furniture_and_terrain/terrain_groundxeno.json
msgid "A large pile of snow blocks your path here."
msgstr "雪で作られた通り越せないほど大きな山です。"

#. ~ Furniture name
#: data/mods/Aftershock/maps/furniture_and_terrain/terrain_groundxeno.json
msgid "small ice boulder"
msgstr "小さな氷塊"

#. ~ Description of furniture "small ice boulder"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/maps/furniture_and_terrain/terrain_groundxeno.json
msgid "A small chunk of ice sits in the ground here."
msgstr "地面に小さな氷塊があります。"

#. ~ Furniture name
#: data/mods/Aftershock/maps/furniture_and_terrain/terrain_groundxeno.json
msgid "ice boulder"
msgstr "氷塊"

#. ~ Description of furniture "ice boulder"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/maps/furniture_and_terrain/terrain_groundxeno.json
msgid "A large chunk of ice juts out of the ground here."
msgstr "大きな氷塊が地面から突き出しています。"

#. ~ Furniture name
#: data/mods/Aftershock/maps/furniture_and_terrain/terrain_groundxeno.json
msgid "large ice boulder"
msgstr "大きな氷塊"

#. ~ Description of furniture "large ice boulder"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/maps/furniture_and_terrain/terrain_groundxeno.json
msgid "A large piece of glacial ice stands here, blocking your path."
msgstr "通り越せないほど大きな氷塊です。"

#. ~ Terrain name
#: data/mods/Aftershock/maps/furniture_and_terrain/terrain_groundxeno.json
msgid "bleached coral floor"
msgstr "白化したサンゴ"

#. ~ Description of terrain "bleached coral floor"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/maps/furniture_and_terrain/terrain_groundxeno.json
msgid ""
"Small outgrowths of white coral spring from an underlying lattice of black, "
"pulsating veins."
msgstr "格子状になった脈動する黒い管の下から、小さな白いサンゴが伸びています。"

#. ~ Description of terrain "closed metal door"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/maps/furniture_and_terrain/terrain_habitat_doors.json
msgid ""
"A galvanized steel door, forged to withstand punishment and impede anyone or"
" anything.  This one is secured with an electronic lock."
msgstr "過酷な環境にも耐え、誰の侵入も許さないように鍛造された、亜鉛メッキ鋼製の扉です。電子ロックによって施錠されています。"

#. ~ Terrain name
#: data/mods/Aftershock/maps/furniture_and_terrain/terrain_habitat_doors.json
msgid "open security gate"
msgstr "開いたセキュリティゲート"

#. ~ Description of terrain "open security gate"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/maps/furniture_and_terrain/terrain_habitat_doors.json
msgid ""
"A metal floor adorned with hazard lines indicating the presence of a "
"security gate."
msgstr "セキュリティゲートが降りてくることを示す警告ラインで囲まれた金属製の床です。"

#. ~ Terrain name
#: data/mods/Aftershock/maps/furniture_and_terrain/terrain_habitat_doors.json
msgid "closed security gate"
msgstr "閉じたセキュリティゲート"

#. ~ Description of terrain "closed security gate"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/maps/furniture_and_terrain/terrain_habitat_doors.json
msgid ""
"An extremely resilient gate made of assorted steel, carved and pounded into "
"shape."
msgstr "削り出しと鍛造によって成形された合金鋼製の非常に強靭なゲートです。"

#. ~ Terrain name
#: data/mods/Aftershock/maps/furniture_and_terrain/terrain_habitat_floor.json
msgid "clearcrete skylight"
msgstr "天窓(クリアクリート)"

#. ~ Description of terrain "clearcrete skylight"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/maps/furniture_and_terrain/terrain_habitat_floor.json
msgid ""
"A roof made from transparent fiber-reinforced concrete, allowing light to "
"pass through.  Often used to build greenhouses in unfavorable environments."
msgstr "透明な繊維強化コンクリートで作られた、光を透過する屋根です。植物の生育に適さない土地に温室を建設する際によく使われます。"

#. ~ Bashing sound
#: data/mods/Aftershock/maps/furniture_and_terrain/terrain_habitat_floor.json
msgid "stone shattering"
msgstr "[岩が砕ける音]"

#. ~ Terrain name
#: data/mods/Aftershock/maps/furniture_and_terrain/terrain_habitat_floor.json
msgid "metal floor, with inactive overhead light"
msgstr "床(金属)と天井灯(オフ)"

#. ~ Description of terrain "metal floor, with inactive overhead light"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/maps/furniture_and_terrain/terrain_habitat_floor.json
msgid ""
"High-quality and tough checkered metal flooring to reduce the risk of slips "
"and falls, with a still-functioning inactive light attached to the ceiling "
"above."
msgstr ""
"スリップや転倒のリスクを軽減する、高品質で強靭な金属でできた格子模様のフローリングです。上部の天井に取り付けられた照明は消灯していますが、今も機能します。"

#. ~ Description of terrain "linoleum tile"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/maps/furniture_and_terrain/terrain_habitat_floor.json
msgid ""
"A section of flooring made out of a tough, rubbery material.  Colored a "
"simple white.  There is a still-functioning inactive light attached to the "
"ceiling above."
msgstr "ゴムのような丈夫な素材でできた、シンプルな白色の床です。上部の天井に取り付けられた照明は消灯していますが、今も機能します。"

#. ~ Terrain name
#: data/mods/Aftershock/maps/furniture_and_terrain/terrain_habitat_wall.json
msgid "habitat wall"
msgstr "壁(入植地)"

#. ~ Description of terrain "habitat wall"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/maps/furniture_and_terrain/terrain_habitat_wall.json
msgid ""
"An industrially fabricated assembly of lightweight metallic framing and "
"insulated cover sheets, used to quickly assemble standardized colonial "
"infrastructure.  Capable of resisting the merciless cold and not much else."
msgstr ""
"規格化された入植インフラを迅速に整えるために使われる、軽量金属フレームと断熱シートを工業的手段によって組み合わせた資材です。極寒環境に耐える特性を持っていますが、その他にこれといった特徴はありません。"

#. ~ Terrain name
#: data/mods/Aftershock/maps/furniture_and_terrain/terrain_habitat_wall.json
msgid "habitat window"
msgstr "窓(入植地)"

#. ~ Description of terrain "habitat window"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/maps/furniture_and_terrain/terrain_habitat_wall.json
msgid ""
"A prefabricated porthole style window, equipped with metallic shutters for "
"both protection and privacy purposes.  It cannot be opened, but with its "
"shutters are retracted, it could be smashed with no particular difficulty."
msgstr ""
"防護とプライバシーの確保のために金属製のシャッターが付属した、プレハブ工法で作られた丸窓です。開けることはできませんが、シャッターは開いているため問題なく破壊できます。"

#. ~ Terrain name
#: data/mods/Aftershock/maps/furniture_and_terrain/terrain_habitat_wall.json
msgid "habitat window (shutters)"
msgstr "シャッター窓(入植地)"

#. ~ Description of terrain "habitat window (shutters)"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/maps/furniture_and_terrain/terrain_habitat_wall.json
msgid ""
"A porthole style window of standard design, completely covered by sturdy "
"metallic shutters."
msgstr "頑丈な金属製のシャッターで完全に覆われた、標準的なデザインの丸窓です。"

#. ~ Terrain name
#: data/mods/Aftershock/maps/furniture_and_terrain/terrain_habitat_wall.json
msgid "broken habitat window (shutters)"
msgstr "割れたシャッター窓(入植地)"

#. ~ Description of terrain "broken habitat window (shutters)"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/maps/furniture_and_terrain/terrain_habitat_wall.json
msgid ""
"The shutters of this porthole are deployed, but the lack of a window between"
" them allows the frozen air to leak into the room."
msgstr "丸窓のシャッターは閉まっていますが、窓自体が割れているため、凍える空気が部屋に入ってきています。"

#. ~ Terrain name
#: data/mods/Aftershock/maps/furniture_and_terrain/terrain_habitat_wall.json
msgid "broken habitat window"
msgstr "割れた窓(入植地)"

#. ~ Description of terrain "broken habitat window"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/maps/furniture_and_terrain/terrain_habitat_wall.json
msgid ""
"The glass panel that would have covered this porthole has been broken, "
"allowing unfettered access to the rooms within."
msgstr "丸窓に嵌っていたはずのガラス板が割れているため、自由に出入りできます。"

#. ~ Terrain name
#: data/mods/Aftershock/maps/furniture_and_terrain/terrain_habitat_wall.json
msgid "broken habitat segment"
msgstr "破壊された入植資材"

#. ~ Description of terrain "broken habitat segment"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/maps/furniture_and_terrain/terrain_habitat_wall.json
msgid ""
"Exposed structural ribs and battered plate metal are all what remains of "
"this habitat segment."
msgstr "入植地を形作っていた資材は破壊され、露出した補強部材とボロボロの装甲板だけが残っています。"

#. ~ Terrain name
#: data/mods/Aftershock/maps/furniture_and_terrain/terrain_spaceship.json
msgid "spaceship hull"
msgstr "宇宙船体"

#. ~ Description of terrain "spaceship hull"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/maps/furniture_and_terrain/terrain_spaceship.json
msgid ""
"A hull segment from a civilian spaceship.  Only sufficiently armored to "
"defend against the vacuum and radiation of space, the only dangers you'd "
"expect to find on the other side."
msgstr "民間宇宙船の船体部品です。宇宙の真空と放射線から身を守るのに十分な装甲ですが、想像を絶する危険に対しては無力です。"

#. ~ Terrain name
#: data/mods/Aftershock/maps/furniture_and_terrain/terrain_spaceship.json
msgid "broken treads"
msgstr "壊れた履帯"

#. ~ Description of terrain "broken treads"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/maps/furniture_and_terrain/terrain_spaceship.json
msgid "A large set of broken and frozen over vehicle treads."
msgstr "壊れて凍り付いた車両の履帯です。"

#. ~ Terrain name
#: data/mods/Aftershock/maps/furniture_and_terrain/terrain_spaceship.json
msgid "gunship hull"
msgstr "武装宇宙船体"

#. ~ Description of terrain "gunship hull"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/maps/furniture_and_terrain/terrain_spaceship.json
msgid ""
"A hull segment from a combat rated civilian gunship.  Provides some defense "
"against weapons fire."
msgstr "民間の武装宇宙船の船体の一部です。銃器に対してある程度の防御力が備わっています。"

#. ~ Terrain name
#: data/mods/Aftershock/maps/furniture_and_terrain/terrain_spaceship.json
msgid "gunship locker"
msgstr "武装宇宙船ロッカー"

#. ~ Description of terrain "gunship locker"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/maps/furniture_and_terrain/terrain_spaceship.json
msgid "A locker built into the hull of a ship.  May contain equipment."
msgstr "船体に組み込まれているロッカーです。備品が入っている可能性があります。"

#. ~ Terrain name
#: data/mods/Aftershock/maps/furniture_and_terrain/terrain_spaceship.json
msgid "bathroom unit"
msgstr "バスルームユニット"

#. ~ Description of terrain "bathroom unit"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/maps/furniture_and_terrain/terrain_spaceship.json
msgid "A bathroom unit for a gunship.  Unlikely to be working."
msgstr "武装宇宙船のバスルームユニットです。機能していないようです。"

#. ~ Terrain name
#: data/mods/Aftershock/maps/furniture_and_terrain/terrain_spaceship.json
msgid "gunship refrigeration unit"
msgstr "武装宇宙船冷蔵ユニット"

#. ~ Description of terrain "gunship refrigeration unit"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/maps/furniture_and_terrain/terrain_spaceship.json
msgid "A refrigeration unit for a gunship.  Unlikely to be working."
msgstr "武装宇宙船の冷蔵ユニットです。機能していないようです。"

#. ~ Terrain name
#: data/mods/Aftershock/maps/furniture_and_terrain/terrain_spaceship.json
msgid "ruined hull"
msgstr "壊れた船体"

#. ~ Description of terrain "ruined hull"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/maps/furniture_and_terrain/terrain_spaceship.json
msgid ""
"This patch of hull has more holes in it than an ancient terran cheese.  It "
"may provide some cover or it might get shot through."
msgstr ""
"この部分の船体には、いにしえの地球にあったチーズよりたくさんの穴が開いています。遮蔽物として役立つかもしれませんが、船体ごと撃ち抜かれる可能性もあります。"

#. ~ Description of terrain "gunship hull"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/maps/furniture_and_terrain/terrain_spaceship.json
msgid "A closed hatch in the wall of a spaceship."
msgstr "宇宙船の壁面に付いている密閉されたハッチです。"

#. ~ Description of terrain "gunship hull"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/maps/furniture_and_terrain/terrain_spaceship.json
msgid "An open hatch in the wall of a spaceship."
msgstr "宇宙船の壁面に付いている開いたハッチです。"

#. ~ Terrain name
#: data/mods/Aftershock/maps/furniture_and_terrain/terrain_spaceship.json
msgid "prison grating"
msgstr "鉄格子"

#. ~ Description of terrain "prison grating"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/maps/furniture_and_terrain/terrain_spaceship.json
msgid ""
"A detention wall made up of crisscrossed stainless steel bars.  There "
"doesn't appear to be a lock on the bars, maybe look for a computer nearby?"
msgstr "ステンレス鋼を十字に組み合わせた、監房の鉄格子です。錠などは見当たりません。付近のコンピュータで操作するのでしょうか？"

#. ~ Terrain name
#: data/mods/Aftershock/maps/furniture_and_terrain/terrain_spaceship.json
msgid "retracted prison grating"
msgstr "開いた鉄格子"

#. ~ Description of terrain "retracted prison grating"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/maps/furniture_and_terrain/terrain_spaceship.json
msgid ""
"A floor and ceiling where you can see that bars can come out of each side to"
" meet in the middle."
msgstr "床と天井に金属棒が格納されています。棒が伸びて格子が形成される作りになっているようです。"

#. ~ Terrain name
#: data/mods/Aftershock/maps/furniture_and_terrain/terrain_spaceship.json
msgid "gunship kitchenette"
msgstr "武装宇宙船簡易キッチン"

#. ~ Terrain name
#: data/mods/Aftershock/maps/furniture_and_terrain/terrain_spaceship.json
msgid "view port"
msgstr "覗き窓"

#. ~ Terrain name
#: data/mods/Aftershock/maps/furniture_and_terrain/terrain_spaceship.json
msgid "Iblis Interplanetary Drive"
msgstr "イブリース惑星間ドライブ"

#. ~ Description of terrain "Iblis Interplanetary Drive"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/maps/furniture_and_terrain/terrain_spaceship.json
msgid ""
"The housing and guts of an Interplanetary drive engine.  It is plastered "
"with warning signs.  If it's not working you could probably try to break "
"into it for parts."
msgstr "表面に警告表示が貼られた、惑星間航行エンジンが格納されている筺体です。動作しないのであれば、破壊して部品を再利用するのも手です。"

#. ~ Terrain name
#: data/mods/Aftershock/maps/furniture_and_terrain/terrain_spaceship.json
msgid "Iblis Interplanetary Drive Console"
msgstr "イブリース惑星間ドライブ操作端末"

#. ~ Description of terrain "Iblis Interplanetary Drive Console"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/maps/furniture_and_terrain/terrain_spaceship.json
msgid ""
"The control panel for the engines and generators that power the drive.  It "
"would likely render the ship irrecoverable but it might do some damage to "
"any robots near or in the ship if you set the engines to overload."
msgstr ""
"ドライブに動力を供給するエンジンと発電機の操作端末です。エンジンをオーバーロードさせれば付近や船内のロボットにダメージを与えられる可能性がありますが、宇宙船も回復不能な損傷を負います。"

#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_AFS_GUNSHIP_DRIVE_OVERLOAD" in
#. examine action of terrain "Iblis Interplanetary Drive Console"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/maps/furniture_and_terrain/terrain_spaceship.json
msgid "You hear a high pitched whine start and increase in volume."
msgstr "甲高い音が徐々に大きく響き始めました。"

#. ~ Query message shown in a popup
#: data/mods/Aftershock/maps/furniture_and_terrain/terrain_spaceship.json
msgid "Do you want to overload the ship's drive?"
msgstr "宇宙船のエンジンをオーバーロードさせますか？"

#. ~ Description of terrain "Iblis Interplanetary Drive Console"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/maps/furniture_and_terrain/terrain_spaceship.json
msgid "The engine has been overloaded and burnt out."
msgstr "エンジンに過負荷が掛かり、焼き付きました。"

#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_AFS_GUNSHIP_DRIVE_OVERLOADED" in
#. examine action of terrain "Iblis Interplanetary Drive Console"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/maps/furniture_and_terrain/terrain_spaceship.json
msgid "The engine is burnt out and worthless."
msgstr "エンジンは焼き付いており、機能しません。"

#. ~ Terrain name
#: data/mods/Aftershock/maps/furniture_and_terrain/terrain_spaceship.json
msgid "Iblis Interplanetary Navigation Console"
msgstr "イブリース惑星間航行操作端末"

#. ~ Description of terrain "Iblis Interplanetary Navigation Console"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/maps/furniture_and_terrain/terrain_spaceship.json
msgid ""
"The control panel for navigation.  Useless here on the ground but in space "
"the only way to plot long distance travel."
msgstr "航行用の操作端末です。地上では役に立ちませんが、宇宙ではこの装置が長距離航行の唯一の手段です。"

#. ~ Terrain name
#: data/mods/Aftershock/maps/furniture_and_terrain/terrain_spaceship.json
msgid "Wraitheon Gunnery AI"
msgstr "レイセオン砲撃AI"

#. ~ Description of terrain "Wraitheon Gunnery AI"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/maps/furniture_and_terrain/terrain_spaceship.json
msgid ""
"The display screen for interacting with the gunnery ai is blank, there's no "
"telling right now if the ai module survived the crash or not from here."
msgstr "砲撃AIとやり取りをするディスプレイには、何も映っていません。AIモジュールが墜落の影響を受けているかどうかは、現時点では分かりません。"

#. ~ Terrain name
#: data/mods/Aftershock/maps/furniture_and_terrain/terrain_spaceship.json
msgid "command console"
msgstr "制御端末"

#. ~ Description of terrain "command console"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/maps/furniture_and_terrain/terrain_spaceship.json
msgid ""
"The display screen for interacting with the ships command and control "
"console is dead.  Normally the ship's AI runs most systems but there is no "
"way to know whether it survived."
msgstr ""
"宇宙船の指揮制御用コンソールの表示画面は機能していません。通常はAIが宇宙船のほとんどのシステムを制御していますが、現在その機能が生き残っているかどうか知る術はありません。"

#. ~ Terrain name
#: data/mods/Aftershock/maps/furniture_and_terrain/terrain_spaceship.json
msgid "Prisoner Cell Console"
msgstr "監房操作端末"

#. ~ Description of terrain "Prisoner Cell Console"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/maps/furniture_and_terrain/terrain_spaceship.json
msgid ""
"The control panel for the prisoner cell.  Might be able to open and close "
"cell grating."
msgstr "監房の操作端末です。鉄格子を開閉できるかもしれません。"

#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_AFS_PRISON_CONSOLE_OPEN" in examine
#. action of terrain "Prisoner Cell Console"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/maps/furniture_and_terrain/terrain_spaceship.json
msgid "The cell grates retract into the floor and ceiling."
msgstr "監房の格子が床と天井に格納されました。"

#. ~ Query message shown in a popup
#: data/mods/Aftershock/maps/furniture_and_terrain/terrain_spaceship.json
msgid "Do you want to open the cell?"
msgstr "監房を開放しますか？"

#. ~ Terrain name
#: data/mods/Aftershock/maps/furniture_and_terrain/terrain_spaceship.json
msgid "diamond-matrix glass"
msgstr "ダイヤモンドガラス"

#. ~ Description of terrain "diamond-matrix glass"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/maps/furniture_and_terrain/terrain_spaceship.json
msgid ""
"The diamond cubic lattice distorts distant light sources into eight pointed "
"stars.  The galactic core is visible through the glass, but no spacer would "
"ever give it more than a passing glance."
msgstr ""
"立方格子型のダイヤモンドガラスが、遠くに見える星明かりを八つの鋭い輝きに歪めています。ガラス越しであれば銀河核すら眺められますが、宇宙に暮らす者にとっては、見慣れた光景以上の価値はありません。"

#. ~ Terrain name
#: data/mods/Aftershock/maps/furniture_and_terrain/terrain_spaceship.json
msgid "Port Augustmoon hull"
msgstr "オーガストムーン宇宙港船体"

#. ~ Description of terrain "Port Augustmoon hull"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/maps/furniture_and_terrain/terrain_spaceship.json
msgid ""
"The ancient hull of Port Augustmoon, spun into orbit several lifetimes ago."
msgstr "遥か昔から惑星軌道上を回り続けている、オーガストムーン宇宙港の船体です。"

#. ~ Terrain name
#: data/mods/Aftershock/maps/furniture_and_terrain/terrain_spaceship.json
msgid "escape pod guidance system"
msgstr "脱出ポッドガイドシステム"

#. ~ Description of terrain "escape pod guidance system"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/maps/furniture_and_terrain/terrain_spaceship.json
msgid ""
"The rudimentary descent guidance system and easy-use control console of an "
"escape pod.  It apparently broke during the descent."
msgstr "脱出ポッドに内蔵されている、基本的な降下誘導システムと扱いやすい制御コンソールです。降下中に壊れたようです。"

#. ~ Description of terrain "escape pod guidance system"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/maps/furniture_and_terrain/terrain_spaceship.json
msgid ""
"The rudimentary descent guidance system and easy-use control console of an "
"escape pod.  Can be activated to launch the pod."
msgstr "脱出ポッドに内蔵されている、基本的な降下誘導システムと扱いやすい制御コンソールです。調べることでポッドを起動できます。"

#. ~ Terrain name
#: data/mods/Aftershock/maps/furniture_and_terrain/terrain_spaceship.json
msgid "escape pod floor"
msgstr "脱出ポッド床"

#. ~ Description of terrain "escape pod floor"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/maps/furniture_and_terrain/terrain_spaceship.json
msgid ""
"A relatively flat slab of heat-treated metal, designed to withstand the "
"crushing pressure of space and the searing heat of reentry."
msgstr "熱処理された金属製の平たく厚い床です。宇宙の圧力と大気圏突入の灼熱に耐えられるように設計されています。"

#. ~ Terrain name
#: data/mods/Aftershock/maps/furniture_and_terrain/terrain_spaceship.json
msgid "closed spaceship hatch"
msgstr "閉じた宇宙船ハッチ"

#. ~ Description of terrain "closed spaceship hatch"
#. ~ Description of terrain "open spaceship hatch"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/maps/furniture_and_terrain/terrain_spaceship.json
msgid ""
"An armored and airtight spaceship hatch.  A side mounted lever allows for "
"its manual operation."
msgstr "気密性が高い、装甲で覆われた宇宙船のハッチです。側面に取り付けられたレバーを使えば、手動で操作できます。"

#. ~ Terrain name
#: data/mods/Aftershock/maps/furniture_and_terrain/terrain_spaceship.json
msgid "open spaceship hatch"
msgstr "開いた宇宙船ハッチ"

#. ~ Terrain name
#: data/mods/Aftershock/maps/furniture_and_terrain/terrain_spaceship.json
msgid "Locker room card reader"
msgstr "カードリーダー(ロッカールーム)"

#. ~ Description of terrain "Locker room card reader"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/maps/furniture_and_terrain/terrain_spaceship.json
msgid ""
"This is a smartcard reader.  Bold lettering proclaims that this controls "
"access to the locker room.  You could swipe an appropriate crew ID card near"
" it to unlock the gates."
msgstr ""
"ロッカールームの出入口を制御していることが太字で記載されているスマートカードリーダーです。適切な乗員IDカードをかざすとドアロックが解除されます。"

#. ~ Terrain name
#: data/mods/Aftershock/maps/furniture_and_terrain/terrain_spaceship.json
msgid "Armory card reader"
msgstr "カードリーダー(武器庫)"

#. ~ Description of terrain "Armory card reader"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/maps/furniture_and_terrain/terrain_spaceship.json
msgid ""
"This is a smartcard reader.  Bold lettering proclaims that this controls "
"access to the armory.  You could swipe an appropriate crew ID card near it "
"to unlock the gates."
msgstr "武器庫の出入口を制御していることが太字で記載されているスマートカードリーダーです。適切な乗員IDカードをかざすとドアロックが解除されます。"

#. ~ Terrain name
#: data/mods/Aftershock/maps/furniture_and_terrain/terrain_spaceship.json
msgid "Exobay card reader"
msgstr "カードリーダー(外骨格スーツ保管室)"

#. ~ Description of terrain "Exobay card reader"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/maps/furniture_and_terrain/terrain_spaceship.json
msgid ""
"This is a smartcard reader.  Bold lettering proclaims that this controls "
"access to the exosuit bay.  You could swipe an appropriate crew ID card near"
" it to unlock the gates."
msgstr ""
"外骨格スーツ保管室の出入口を制御していることが太字で記載されているスマートカードリーダーです。適切な乗員IDカードをかざすとドアロックが解除されます。"

#. ~ Terrain name
#: data/mods/Aftershock/maps/furniture_and_terrain/terrain_spaceship.json
msgid "Shuttle Guidance Console"
msgstr "シャトル案内端末"

#. ~ Description of terrain "Shuttle Guidance Console"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/maps/furniture_and_terrain/terrain_spaceship.json
msgid ""
"The simplified guidance interface of a drone shuttle.  Activating it will "
"transport you to Port Augustmoon."
msgstr "無人シャトル内の簡素な案内インターフェースです。起動するとオーガストムーン宇宙港へ出発します。"

#. ~ Description of terrain "intermodal shipping crate"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/maps/furniture_and_terrain/terrain_spaceship.json
msgid ""
"A sealed metal crate used to ferry cargo to and from orbit.  Any items "
"placed inside will be taken with you to and from Port Augustmoon."
msgstr "軌道上で貨物を輸送するための、密封された金属製の容器です。中に置いたアイテムはオーガストムーン宇宙港間を移送されます。"

#. ~ Description of terrain "intermodal shipping crate"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/maps/furniture_and_terrain/terrain_spaceship.json
msgid "A sealed metal crate used to ferry cargo to and from orbit."
msgstr "軌道上で貨物を輸送するための、密封された金属製の箱です。"

#. ~ Terrain name
#: data/mods/Aftershock/maps/furniture_and_terrain/terrain_spaceship.json
