#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/computers/escape_pod_control.json
msgid ""
"&Escape pod launch procedure:\n"
"\n"
"    1) Ready escape pod.  (COMPLETE)\n"
"    2) Secure Passengers/Cargo.\n"
"    3) Launch from pod controls."
