"\n"
"    1) 射出準備(完了)\n"
"    2) 乗員・貨物の安全確保\n"
"    3) コントロールパネルによる射出操作"

#. ~ Name of an NPC class
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/cyborg_npcs/npc_classes_cyborg.json
msgid "Hive Ganger"
msgstr "ﾊｲﾌﾞ ｶﾞﾝｶﾞｰ"

#. ~ Job description of "Hive Ganger" NPC class
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/cyborg_npcs/npc_classes_cyborg.json
msgid ""
"I've survived all my life with the whole world against me, how is this any "
"different."
msgstr "私は全世界を敵に回して生き抜いてきた。今の状況も似たようなものだ。"

#. ~ Name of an NPC class
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/cyborg_npcs/npc_classes_cyborg.json
msgid "Corporate Wetworks Operative"
msgstr "起業暗殺部隊員"

#. ~ Job description of "Corporate Wetworks Operative" NPC class
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/cyborg_npcs/npc_classes_cyborg.json
msgid ""
"I made a good living working in the shadows of the old world.  I can survive"
" it's twilight."
msgstr "旧世界では裏の仕事で生計を立ててきた。この黄昏の時代もきっと生き抜けるさ。"

#. ~ Name of a bionic
#: data/mods/Aftershock/player/bionics.json
msgid "Solar Panels"
msgstr "ソーラーパネル"

#. ~ Description of bionic "Solar Panels"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/player/bionics.json
msgid ""
"Installed on your back is a set of retractable, reinforced solar panels "
"resembling angular butterfly wings.  When in direct sunlight, they will "
"automatically deploy and slowly recharge your power level."
msgstr ""
"背中に角ばった蝶の羽根のような折り畳み式強化ソーラーパネルが取り付けられています。直射日光が当たる場所で自動的に展開し、ゆっくりと充電を行います。"

#. ~ Name of a bionic
#: data/mods/Aftershock/player/bionics.json
msgid "Microfusion Generator"
msgstr "小型核融合炉"

#. ~ Description of bionic "Microfusion Generator"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/player/bionics.json
msgid ""
"An implanted fusion reactor with its own internal nuclear fuel reservoir.  "
"It will last over a century without servicing."
msgstr "内部に核燃料貯蔵庫を備えた、体内に埋め込む核融合炉です。メンテナンスなしでも一世紀以上は稼働し続けます。"

#. ~ Name of a bionic
#: data/mods/Aftershock/player/bionics.json
msgid "Archeotech Grav Chute"
msgstr "重力パラシュート"

#. ~ Description of bionic "Archeotech Grav Chute"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/player/bionics.json
msgid ""
"Pre-Discontinuity bionic module that was implanted into elite drop troops "
"who could jump from their insertion vehicle during the radar disruption of "
"reentry.  Clenching your fist allows you to activate what scientists call a "
"grav chute that allows a safe fall; while active, the field will prevent "
"damage to your body from severe impacts, at the cost of impaired movement.  "
"It's best not to think about how many bodies this has been in before yours."
msgstr ""
"空挺部隊の精鋭隊員に移植され、レーダー障害時の大気圏再突入において降下ポッドから脱出する際に用いられた、『断絶』以前のCBMです。拳を握ることで研究者が「重力パラシュート」と呼ぶシステムが起動し、安全に落下できるようになります。起動中は肉体へのダメージを防ぐ強力なフィールドが展開されますが、動作が阻害される欠点があります。このCBMがここへ来るまでにどれだけ使い回されたのかは、考えない方がよさそうです。"

#. ~ Name of a bionic
#: data/mods/Aftershock/player/bionics.json
msgid "Deployable Grenade Launcher"
msgstr "折畳式グレネードランチャー"

#. ~ Description of bionic "Deployable Grenade Launcher"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/player/bionics.json
msgid ""
"Your right hand can fold inward to reveal a mechanism capable of igniting "
"and firing 40mm grenades across medium distances."
msgstr "右手を内側に折り畳むことで、40mm擲弾を中距離範囲に精密発射するランチャーが現れます。"

#. ~ Name of a bionic
#: data/mods/Aftershock/player/bionics.json
msgid "Monofilament Whip"
msgstr "モノフィラメントウィップ"

#. ~ Name of a bionic
#: data/mods/Aftershock/player/bionics.json
msgid "Linguistic Coprocessor"
msgstr "言語処理支援プロセッサ"

#. ~ Description of bionic "Linguistic Coprocessor"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/player/bionics.json
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The left hemisphere of your brain has been augmented with a microcomputer "
"that moderately increases the speed that language and written words are "
"processed, granting a 15% increase to reading speed."
msgstr "左脳にマイクロコンピュータを移植し、言語や文字の処理速度を適度に増強しています。読書速度が15%向上します。"

#. ~ Name of a bionic
#: data/mods/Aftershock/player/bionics.json
msgid "Dopamine Stimulators"
msgstr "ドーパミン刺激装置"

#. ~ Description of bionic "Dopamine Stimulators"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/player/bionics.json
msgid ""
"Tiny cybernetic stimulators have been installed throughout your ventral "
"tegmental area, and trigger at set intervals using bionic power.  This "
"slowly releases a stream of reward chemicals and hormones into your brain, "
"inducing a state of euphoria that notably elevates mood."
msgstr ""
"小型のドーパミン刺激装置が脳の腹側被蓋野全体に移植されています。装置は電力を消費して一定間隔で作動します。報酬系を刺激する化学物質やホルモンを脳内に放出し、気分を高めて多幸状態を引き起こします。"

#. ~ Name of a bionic
#: data/mods/Aftershock/player/bionics.json
msgid "Counteractive Reflexes"
msgstr "被攻撃時反射神経活性化"

#. ~ Name of a bionic
#: data/mods/Aftershock/player/bionics.json
msgid "Synthetic Marrow"
msgstr "骨髄内血液合成装置"

#. ~ Description of bionic "Synthetic Marrow"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/player/bionics.json
msgid ""
"The interior of your femurs have been scrapped clean, the marrow replaced "
"with a Mercurial brand bio-factory that produces high efficiency blood "
"analogues.  The blood substitutes are fine-tuned for combat, increasing "
"stamina, disease resistance and clotting speed."
msgstr ""
"大腿骨の内部の骨髄を全て廃棄し、血液に類似した液体を生成するマーキュリアル社の血液合成装置に置き換えました。合成血液は戦闘用に繊細な調整がされており、スタミナ、病気への抵抗力、凝固速度が向上しています。"

#. ~ Name of a bionic
#: data/mods/Aftershock/player/bionics.json
msgid "Blood Neurology"
msgstr "神経系血管"

#. ~ Description of bionic "Blood Neurology"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/player/bionics.json
msgid ""
"Your blood is laced with neuron-analogue nanites, allowing your entire "
"circulatory system to function as a secondary brain.  This radical "
"modification increases your intelligence, reflexes and perception by 4, "
"increases your pain tolerance and allows you to survive brain damage that "
"would otherwise prove fatal."
msgstr ""
"ニューロンに類似したナノ物質が血液に含まれており、循環系全体が第二の脳として機能します。この抜本的な改造によって知性、器用、感覚が4増加し、苦痛への耐性が高まり、頭部への致命的なダメージを受けても即死することはありません。"

#. ~ Name of a bionic
#: data/mods/Aftershock/player/bionics.json
msgid "Melee Optimization Unit"
msgstr "近接攻撃最適化ユニット"

#. ~ Description of bionic "Melee Optimization Unit"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/player/bionics.json
msgid ""
"An implanted AI module calculates the optimal followup to each of your melee"
" strikes, allowing you to chain them with unnatural speed and grace.  This "
"bionic must be active to function."
msgstr ""
"状況に応じた最適の近接攻撃を実行するAIモジュールによって、異常なスピードで優雅に連続攻撃を繰り出せるようになります。CBMを有効化することで機能します。"

#. ~ Name of a bionic
#: data/mods/Aftershock/player/bionics.json
msgid "Chemical Enhancement Rig and computer"
msgstr "化学強化投薬コンピュータ"

#. ~ Description of bionic "Chemical Enhancement Rig and computer"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/player/bionics.json
msgid ""
"An implanted AI module and medication dispenser calculates the optimal "
"chemical mix to keep you on your toes and ready for combat.  This bionic "
"must be active to function and while it functions your body is at a "
"heightened performance but if it turns off it will take you several days to "
"get back to normal.  There are a significant number of baseline bonuses "
"granted by this setup but people around will notice your junkie behavior."
msgstr ""
"体内に移植したAIモジュールと投薬装置が移植者の肉体に適した化学物質の構成を自動計算し、戦闘力を向上させます。このCBMは起動することで機能し、起動中は肉体の運動能力が向上しますが、停止すると元の状態に回復するまで数日かかります。起動さえしておけば仕事で大抵の特別手当を獲得できますが、周囲には間違いなく薬物中毒だと思われるでしょう。"

#. ~ Name of a bionic
#: data/mods/Aftershock/player/bionics.json
msgid "Speed Injection System"
msgstr "速度強化投薬装置"

#. ~ Description of bionic "Speed Injection System"
#. ~ Description of bionic "Strength Injection System"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/player/bionics.json
msgid ""
"The chemical injection system and microcomputer that when activated greatly "
"enhances your reaction times and overall speed.  Upon deactivation, the user"
" may experience dizziness, heart palpitations and ravenous appetites."
msgstr ""
"マイクロコンピュータを搭載した化学物質注入システムです。起動すると速度や反射神経が大幅に向上しますが、停止後にめまいや動悸、食欲不振などの症状が出る可能性があります。"

#. ~ Name of a bionic
#: data/mods/Aftershock/player/bionics.json
msgid "Pain Suppression Injection System"
msgstr "痛覚抑制投薬装置"

#. ~ Description of bionic "Pain Suppression Injection System"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/player/bionics.json
msgid ""
"The chemical injection system and microcomputer that when activated gives a "
"burst of chemicals that allows your blood to work a little harder at "
"stabilizing the body and then flushes your system with a powerful anesthetic"
" that allows you to continue operating at high capacity.  Upon deactivation,"
" the user may experience extreme lethargy, sudden loss of consciousness, "
"among other symptoms that may prove potentially fatal if not in a safe "
"location."
msgstr ""
"マイクロコンピュータを搭載した化学物質注入システムです。起動すると化学物質が体内に行き渡って血流を安定させ、同時に強力な麻酔で痛覚を鈍らせて高い身体能力を発揮し続けられる状態にします。停止後に極度の無気力、突然の意識喪失などの症状が出る可能性があるため、しばらくは安静に過ごさなければ命にかかわります。"

#. ~ Name of a bionic
#: data/mods/Aftershock/player/bionics.json
msgid "Strength Injection System"
msgstr "筋力強化投薬装置"

#. ~ Name of a bionic
#: data/mods/Aftershock/player/bionics.json
msgid "Power Storage, salvaged"
msgstr "中古蓄電装置"

#. ~ Description of bionic "Power Storage, salvaged"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/player/bionics.json
msgid ""
"A battered and used Compact Bionics Module that increases your power "
"capacity by 50 kJ.  Having at least one of these is a prerequisite to using "
"powered bionics.  You will also need a power supply, found in various CBMs."
msgstr ""
"使い古されてボロボロになった、蓄電容量を50kJ増加させる小型モジュールです。最低でも1つは移植しなければ電力が必要となるCBMを使えませんが、これとは別に様々な方法で発電するためのCBMも移植する必要があります。"

#. ~ Name of a bionic
#: data/mods/Aftershock/player/bionics.json
msgid "HawkingCorps GravyField Mark I"
msgstr "重力フィールドMk.I"

#. ~ Description of bionic "HawkingCorps GravyField Mark I"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/player/bionics.json
msgid ""
"Imagine a computer inside your body playing pong against the universe.  The "
"paddles are made of gravity fields and how it causes this to happen are "
"trade secrets.  -From the owners manual of HawkingCorps GravyField Mark I.  "
"Activating the field will reduce incoming bashing and cut damage by 5 "
"points."
msgstr ""
"「体内にあるコンピュータが、宇宙を相手に卓球をしていると想像してみてください。ラケットはエネルギー場で作られていますが、どのようにして生成するかは企業秘密です」ホーキング社重力フィールドMk.Iのオーナーズマニュアルにはこのように書かれています。起動中は打撃・斬撃ダメージを5ポイント軽減します。"

#. ~ Name of a bionic
#: data/mods/Aftershock/player/bionics.json
msgid "HawkingCorps GravyField Mark II"
msgstr "重力フィールドMk.II"

#. ~ Description of bionic "HawkingCorps GravyField Mark II"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/player/bionics.json
msgid ""
"The HawkingCorps GravyField Mark II was designed for police actions during "
"food riots and other civilian uprisings.  It has proven capable of "
"protecting against most improvised weapons.  Activating the field will "
"reduce incoming bashing and cut damage by 15 points."
msgstr ""
"ホーキング社の重力フィールドMk.IIは、食糧難に伴う暴動などの市民反乱に対応する警察向けに設計されました。大抵の即席武器による攻撃を防ぐことが実証されています。起動中は打撃・斬撃ダメージを15ポイント軽減します。"

#. ~ Name of a bionic
#: data/mods/Aftershock/player/bionics.json
msgid "Debt Collection Agent GravyField"
msgstr "債権回収業務用重力フィールド"

#. ~ Description of bionic "Debt Collection Agent GravyField"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/player/bionics.json
msgid ""
"This class of personal gravity manipulator often sees action on both sides "
"of the vicious ship-to-ship boarding fights that are common with both "
"repossession and piracy.  It remains practically impenetrable to melee "
"weapons that lack sharp piercing points.  Activating the field will reduce "
"incoming bashing and cut damage by 25 points."
msgstr ""
"このクラスの個人用重力フィールドは、宇宙船同士の激しい移乗攻撃において守備隊と海賊の双方が使っていることも珍しくありません。鋭く貫通する近接武器でなければ、エネルギー場を破ることはほぼ不可能です。打撃・斬撃ダメージを25ポイント軽減します。"

#. ~ Name of a bionic
#: data/mods/Aftershock/player/bionics.json
msgid "Point Energy Conversion Field"
msgstr "集束エネルギー変換フィールド"

#. ~ Description of bionic "Point Energy Conversion Field"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/player/bionics.json
msgid ""
"The PEC, as it is commonly known, works by converting kinetic energy into "
"forms that are less damaging to the wearer, such as light.  Since this can "
"be problematic, various types of shielding have been developed that do "
"different emissions.  However, the ability to stop ballistic and piercing "
"damage in its tracks often makes up for any inconvenience these emissions "
"can cause.  Activating the field will reduce incoming ballistic and piercing"
" damage by 10 points."
msgstr ""
"一般に知られているPEC(集束エネルギー変換)システムは、運動エネルギーを光エネルギーなど着用者に損傷を与えにくい形に変換する機能を持っています。変換されたエネルギーが支障とならないよう様々なタイプのシールドが開発されていますが、このシステムの銃弾や貫通ダメージを防ぐ力は、エネルギー放出が引き起こす不都合を補って余りあるものです。起動中は銃弾・貫通ダメージを10ポイント軽減します。"

#. ~ Name of a bionic
#: data/mods/Aftershock/player/bionics.json
msgid "Holtzman Personal Shield Generator"
msgstr "ホルツマン個人用シールド発生装置"

#. ~ Description of bionic "Holtzman Personal Shield Generator"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/player/bionics.json
msgid ""
"Personal shielding against bullets and sharp-pointed weapons comes in a "
"variety of types.  This version is known for drastically increasing an "
"individual soldier's lifespan while often decreasing that of anyone - friend"
" or foe - in close proximity.  Activating the field will reduce incoming "
"ballistic and piercing damage by 20 points."
msgstr ""
"弾丸や一点を貫通する武器に対する個人用シールドには様々な種類があります。このモデルは個々の兵士の生存率を飛躍的に向上させることで知られていますが、敵味方を問わず付近の者の生存率を下げることも少なくありません。銃弾・貫通ダメージを20ポイント軽減します。"

#. ~ Name of a bionic
#: data/mods/Aftershock/player/bionics.json
msgid "Kinetic Annulment System"
msgstr "運動エネルギー無効化システム"

#. ~ Name of a bionic
#: data/mods/Aftershock/player/bionics.json
msgid "Neurosoft: Aeronautics"
msgstr "航空学ニューロソフト"

#. ~ Name of a bionic
#: data/mods/Aftershock/player/bionics.json
msgid "Implanted Translocator"
msgstr "内蔵トランスロケーター"

#. ~ Description of bionic "Implanted Translocator"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/player/bionics.json
msgid ""
"An experimental teleportation system carefully weaved into bone marrow and "
"alongside your skeletal system.  Allows you to safely and readily teleport "
"toward previously activated telepads."
msgstr ""
"実験的な瞬間移動システムを、骨髄から各骨格に沿って慎重に埋め込みました。事前に起動しておいた転移プレートへと安全かつ容易に瞬間移動することができます。"

#. ~ Name of a bionic
#: data/mods/Aftershock/player/bionics.json
msgid "Cranium Bomb"
msgstr "頭蓋爆弾"

#. ~ Description of bionic "Cranium Bomb"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/player/bionics.json
msgid ""
"You've worked for some nasty people.  People who installed a bomb at the top"
" of your spine.  They are all dead now but there is unfortunately a dead man"
" switch if you don't check in roughly every thirty days.  Those thirty days "
"are almost up but you can't remember exactly how many are left.  You need "
"this out and fast."
msgstr ""
"脊椎の上部に爆弾を移植され、働かされていましたが、卑劣な設置者たちは全員死んでしまいました。残念ながら、30日ごとにコードを入力しないと爆発して死んでしまいます。もうすぐ次の期限がやってきますが、正確な日数は思い出せません。早くコードを見つける必要があります。"

#. ~ Description of bionic "Emergency Insulation"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/player/bionics.json
msgid ""
"Described in design documents as emergency insulation to protect against "
"exposure to hard vacuum, this CBM is also useful in any encounter that "
"causes instant frostbite."
msgstr "緊急時に高真空環境から肉体を保護する断熱材として機能するCBMです。急激な凍傷を引き起こすような状況でも役立ちます。"

#. ~ Name of a bionic
#: data/mods/Aftershock/player/bionics.json
msgid "Skullgun"
msgstr "スカルガン"

#. ~ Description of bionic "Skullgun"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/player/bionics.json
msgid ""
"Concealed in your head is a single shot 10mm pistol.  Activate the bionic to"
" fire and reload the skullgun."
msgstr "頭部に10mm単発ハンドガンが埋め込まれています。起動することで射撃と装填を実行します。"

#. ~ Profession name for male
#: data/mods/Aftershock/player/hobbies.json
msgctxt "profession_male"
msgid "Speed Freak"
msgstr "強化薬中毒者"

#. ~ Description of profession "Speed Freak" for male
#: data/mods/Aftershock/player/hobbies.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"Were you a mercenary, a criminal, a pirate or a very dedicated adrenaline "
"junkie?  Whatever you were before, now you've got a speed freak rig pumping "
"drugs into your veins 24/7.  Statistically you'll die young, your body "
"burned out by all the drugs, but what other chance did you have to become an"
" immortal legend?  None."
msgstr ""
"傭兵、犯罪者、略奪者、あるいは熱烈なアドレナリンジャンキーでしょうか？以前はどうであれ、今は強化薬中毒者として24時間365日、血管内に薬を送り込み続けています。統計的に言えば、若くして肉体が限界を迎え、死に至るでしょう。しかし、不滅の伝説になる方法はこれ以外考えられません。"

#. ~ Profession name for female
#: data/mods/Aftershock/player/hobbies.json
msgctxt "profession_female"
msgid "Speed Freak"
msgstr "強化薬中毒者"

#. ~ Description of profession "Speed Freak" for female
#: data/mods/Aftershock/player/hobbies.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"Were you a mercenary, a criminal, a pirate or a very dedicated adrenaline "
"junkie?  Whatever you were before, now you've got a speed freak rig pumping "
"drugs into your veins 24/7.  Statistically you'll die young, your body "
"burned out by all the drugs, but what other chance did you have to become an"
" immortal legend?  None."
msgstr ""
"傭兵、犯罪者、略奪者、あるいは熱烈なアドレナリンジャンキーでしょうか？以前はどうであれ、今は強化薬中毒者として24時間365日、血管内に薬を送り込み続けています。統計的に言えば、若くして肉体が限界を迎え、死に至るでしょう。しかし、不滅の伝説になる方法はこれ以外考えられません。"

#. ~ Profession name for male
#: data/mods/Aftershock/player/hobbies.json
msgctxt "profession_male"
msgid "Earth born"
msgstr "地球生まれ"

#. ~ Description of profession "Earth born" for male
#: data/mods/Aftershock/player/hobbies.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"Your mannerisms and accent are a dead giveaway that you were raised on "
"Earth.  Whatever your thoughts about the homeworld might be, the simple fact"
" that you can call it home is likely to affect relationships with people "
"liable to care about such things."
msgstr ""
"所作や言葉遣いから、地球で生まれ育ったことがよく分かります。故郷をどう思っているかは別として、故郷があるというシンプルな事実が、それを気にする他者との関係に影響を与える可能性があります。"

#. ~ Profession name for female
#: data/mods/Aftershock/player/hobbies.json
msgctxt "profession_female"
msgid "Earth born"
msgstr "地球生まれ"

#. ~ Description of profession "Earth born" for female
#: data/mods/Aftershock/player/hobbies.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
