#. ~ Profession name for male
#: data/mods/Aftershock/player/hobbies.json
msgctxt "profession_male"
msgid "Armament License"
msgstr "武装ライセンス"

#. ~ Description of profession "Armament License" for male
#: data/mods/Aftershock/player/hobbies.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You have a license to own and operate military grade weaponry and can "
"legally purchase such items without any difficulty.  A privilege usually "
"reserved for the politically or economically favored."
msgstr ""
"軍用兵器の所持および使用を許可されており、その種のアイテムを合法的に購入できます。通常はこのようなライセンスは、政治的または経済的に恵まれた者にしか与えられない特権です。"

#. ~ Profession name for female
#: data/mods/Aftershock/player/hobbies.json
msgctxt "profession_female"
msgid "Armament License"
msgstr "武装ライセンス"

#. ~ Description of profession "Armament License" for female
#: data/mods/Aftershock/player/hobbies.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You have a license to own and operate military grade weaponry and can "
"legally purchase such items without any difficulty.  A privilege usually "
"reserved for the politically or economically favored."
msgstr ""
"軍用兵器の所持および使用を許可されており、その種のアイテムを合法的に購入できます。通常はこのようなライセンスは、政治的または経済的に恵まれた者にしか与えられない特権です。"

#. ~ Profession name for male
#: data/mods/Aftershock/player/hobbies.json
msgctxt "profession_male"
msgid "Space Operations"
msgstr "宇宙活動"

#. ~ Description of profession "Space Operations" for male
#: data/mods/Aftershock/player/hobbies.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You have ample experience working in space, either on a station or on a "
"ship.  You are familiar with safety protocols, capable of piloting small "
"shuttlecraft and can operate and perform maintenance on a variety of space "
"equipment and colony systems."
msgstr ""
"ステーションや宇宙船内で働き、豊富な経験を積んでいます。安全プロトコルに精通しており、小型宇宙船の操縦法を心得ており、宇宙で用いる様々な機械やコロニー管理システムの操作と整備が可能です。"

#. ~ Profession name for female
#: data/mods/Aftershock/player/hobbies.json
msgctxt "profession_female"
msgid "Space Operations"
msgstr "宇宙活動"

#. ~ Description of profession "Space Operations" for female
#: data/mods/Aftershock/player/hobbies.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You have ample experience working in space, either on a station or on a "
"ship.  You are familiar with safety protocols, capable of piloting small "
"shuttlecraft and can operate and perform maintenance on a variety of space "
"equipment and colony systems."
msgstr ""
"ステーションや宇宙船内で働き、豊富な経験を積んでいます。安全プロトコルに精通しており、小型宇宙船の操縦法を心得ており、宇宙で用いる様々な機械やコロニー管理システムの操作と整備が可能です。"

#. ~ Profession name for male
#: data/mods/Aftershock/player/hobbies.json
msgctxt "profession_male"
msgid "Empathic Leadership"
msgstr "リーダーシップ"

#. ~ Description of profession "Empathic Leadership" for male
#: data/mods/Aftershock/player/hobbies.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You have a natural talent for leadership and can easily see yourself in "
"others.  Quite literally.  In fact, you can swap control to any other "
"character that follows you."
msgstr ""
"天性のリーダーシップを備えており、他者の行動を自分自身のことのように捉える力をもっています。まさしく、文字通りに。他の仲間キャラクターに操作を切り替えることができます。"

#. ~ Profession name for female
#: data/mods/Aftershock/player/hobbies.json
msgctxt "profession_female"
msgid "Empathic Leadership"
msgstr "リーダーシップ"

#. ~ Description of profession "Empathic Leadership" for female
#: data/mods/Aftershock/player/hobbies.json
