#. ~ Profession name for male
#: data/mods/Aftershock/player/professions.json
msgctxt "profession_male"
msgid "Engineered Deep Sea Explorer"
msgstr "深海探査者"

#. ~ Description of profession "Engineered Deep Sea Explorer" for male
#: data/mods/Aftershock/player/professions.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"Created with the exploration of the deep sea in mind, Cecaelia are "
"hybridized from cephalopod and fish DNA.  While you were mostly spared from "
"the corporate wars by your scientific proclivities, the polite niceties of "
"the surface are mostly forgotten underwater.  You were on dry land when the "
"Cataclysm occurred and you have no idea if it's safer here or beneath the "
"seas."
msgstr ""
"シセイリアは、深海探査のために頭足類と魚類のDNAを操作して作られました。設計された性質上、企業戦争に巻き込まれることはありませんでしたが、礼儀や心の機微は水中に忘れてきてしまいました。大変動が起きた時は乾燥した大地の上にいましたが、ここと深海、どちらがより安全なのかは判然としません。"

#. ~ Profession name for female
#: data/mods/Aftershock/player/professions.json
msgctxt "profession_female"
msgid "Engineered Deep Sea Explorer"
msgstr "深海探査者"

#. ~ Description of profession "Engineered Deep Sea Explorer" for female
#: data/mods/Aftershock/player/professions.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"Created with the exploration of the deep sea in mind, Cecaelia are "
"hybridized from cephalopod and fish DNA.  While you were mostly spared from "
"the corporate wars by your scientific proclivities, the polite niceties of "
"the surface are mostly forgotten underwater.  You were on dry land when the "
"Cataclysm occurred and you have no idea if it's safer here or beneath the "
"seas."
msgstr ""
"シセイリアは、深海探査のために頭足類と魚類のDNAを操作して作られました。設計された性質上、企業戦争に巻き込まれることはありませんでしたが、礼儀や心の機微は水中に忘れてきてしまいました。大変動が起きた時は乾燥した大地の上にいましたが、ここと深海、どちらがより安全なのかは判然としません。"

#. ~ Profession name for male
#: data/mods/Aftershock/player/professions.json
msgctxt "profession_male"
msgid "Roboticist"
msgstr "ロボット技術者"

#. ~ Description of profession "Roboticist" for male
#: data/mods/Aftershock/player/professions.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"Scavenging and reselling abandoned robotics is what you call your \"job.\" "
"It certainly isn't official in any means of the word, but it rakes in the "
"dough and that is all that matters to you, even if it involves dangerous "
"activities, be it cracking old Wraitheon security cyphers or crossing well-"
"worn wires on ancient mining drones."
msgstr ""
"捨てられたロボットを拾い集めて転売する「仕事」をしています。もちろん認可は貰っていませんが、ぼろ儲けできることが重要なのです。たとえ業務内容が、型落ちしたレイセオンのセキュリティ暗号を解読したり、古びた採掘ドローンを混線させるといった、危険を伴う活動であっても。"

#. ~ Profession name for female
#: data/mods/Aftershock/player/professions.json
msgctxt "profession_female"
msgid "Roboticist"
msgstr "ロボット技術者"

#. ~ Description of profession "Roboticist" for female
#: data/mods/Aftershock/player/professions.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"Scavenging and reselling abandoned robotics is what you call your \"job.\" "
"It certainly isn't official in any means of the word, but it rakes in the "
"dough and that is all that matters to you, even if it involves dangerous "
"activities, be it cracking old Wraitheon security cyphers or crossing well-"
"worn wires on ancient mining drones."
msgstr ""
"捨てられたロボットを拾い集めて転売する「仕事」をしています。もちろん認可は貰っていませんが、ぼろ儲けできることが重要なのです。たとえ業務内容が、型落ちしたレイセオンのセキュリティ暗号を解読したり、古びた採掘ドローンを混線させるといった、危険を伴う活動であっても。"

#. ~ Profession name for male
#: data/mods/Aftershock/player/professions.json
msgctxt "profession_male"
msgid "Academy Technologist"
msgstr "学会所属技術者"

#. ~ Description of profession "Academy Technologist" for male
#: data/mods/Aftershock/player/professions.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"A senior technologist from the Planetary Academy of Khorat, sent to Salus IV"
" to oversee the procurement of valuable technological artifacts.  Although "
"generously equipped, you are neither a fighter nor a good fit for life in "
"the frontier.  You'd feel far more comfortable and capable commanding this "
"salvage operation from the faraway safety of your office."
msgstr ""
"ホラート惑星学会の上級技術者です。科学的に貴重な遺物の採取を感得するためにサルスIVに派遣されました。十分な装備を持ち込んではいますが、戦闘経験はなく、辺境での生活に慣れている訳でもありません。もし遠く離れた安全なオフィスから採取作業を指揮していたら、どれほど快適かつ円滑に仕事ができただろうと考えずにはいられません。"

#. ~ Profession name for female
#: data/mods/Aftershock/player/professions.json
msgctxt "profession_female"
msgid "Academy Technologist"
msgstr "学会所属技術者"

#. ~ Description of profession "Academy Technologist" for female
#: data/mods/Aftershock/player/professions.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"A senior technologist from the Planetary Academy of Khorat, sent to Salus IV"
" to oversee the procurement of valuable technological artifacts.  Although "
"generously equipped, you are neither a fighter nor a good fit for life in "
"the frontier.  You'd feel far more comfortable and capable commanding this "
"salvage operation from the faraway safety of your office."
msgstr ""
