msgstr "[Ψ]ﾃﾚﾊﾟｼｯｸ･ｻｼﾞｪｽﾁｮﾝ"

#. ~ Description of recipe crafting "EOC_PRACTICE_AFS_TELEPATH_CONFUSION"
#. ~ Description of recipe crafting "EOC_PRACTICE_TELEPATH_CONFUSION"
