msgstr "[Ψ]ｾﾝｻﾘｰ･ﾃﾞﾌﾟﾘﾍﾞｰｼｮﾝ"

#. ~ Description of recipe crafting "EOC_PRACTICE_TELEPATHIC_BLAST"
