msgstr "[Ψ]ｼﾅﾌﾟﾃｨｯｸ･ｵｰﾊﾞｰﾛｰﾄﾞ"

#. ~ Snippet in category "AFS_NIGHT_MESSAGES_1"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/snippets/effect_on_condition.json
msgid ""
"A mountainside in the distance is littered with erratic flashes of light "
"that suggest extended combat.  It's too far to tell any other details."
msgstr "遠くの山肌に不規則な閃光が映っています。長時間にわたる戦闘が繰り広げられているようですが、遠すぎて詳細はよく分かりません。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "AFS_NIGHT_MESSAGES_1"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/snippets/effect_on_condition.json
msgid ""
"You hear a sudden CRACK of ice breaking and then the low roar of what must "
"be an avalanche just outside your line of sight."
msgstr "突然、氷が割れる音がしたかと思うと、視界外のどこかで雪崩が発生したかのような低い轟音が響き渡りました。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "AFS_NIGHT_MESSAGES_1"
#. ~ Snippet in category "XE_NIGHT_MESSAGES_1"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/snippets/effect_on_condition.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/snippets/effect_on_condition.json
msgid ""
"Winged shadows cross the ground, but when you look into the sky you can't "
"seem to see any movement or shapes at all."
msgstr "翼のある影が地面を横切りましたが、空を見ても何も見当たりません。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "AFS_NIGHT_MESSAGES_1"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/snippets/effect_on_condition.json
msgid ""
"Catch a falling star and put it in your pocket, watch it blaze on through "
"the night sky.  It's a peaceful sign despite all the chaos here below."
msgstr "流れ星を捕まえてポケットに入れるふりをしました。混沌とした世界にあっても、星は平和の兆しです。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "AFS_NIGHT_MESSAGES_1"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/snippets/effect_on_condition.json
msgid ""
"Some craft swiftly hovers across the night sky, searchlights flaring out "
"from its belly in figure-eight patterns.  It circles in an ever larger "
"pattern until it pauses and weapons fire lashes from it to the ground like "
"lightning.  A full five seconds of broadsides to the ground, then only the "
"searchlights pointed where the shots seemed to land, then those lights cut "
"off and it might as well be invisible to you."
msgstr ""
"底部からサーチライトを八の字型に照射しつつ夜空を高速で旋回する機体を見つけました。その機体はことさら大きく旋回し、ある地点で停止すると、稲妻のような光線を伴う武器を地面に向けて発射しました。機体は約5秒間にわたって砲撃を行うと、その後サーチライトを砲撃地点に投げかけ、やがてその光も消えて見えなくなりました。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "AFS_NIGHT_MESSAGES_1"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/snippets/effect_on_condition.json
msgid ""
"From where you stand, you can see at the edge of the horizon something "
"rocketing from planetside into orbit."
msgstr "地平線の端に、惑星上から発射されるロケットのようなものが見えました。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "afs_personal_card"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/snippets/personal_cards.json
msgid ""
"There is a picture of a shuttle taking off with happy people waving from the viewports.  \"Salus is cold.\n"
"\n"
" Our love is true\n"
"\n"
" I hope to see you\n"
"\n"
" On Croatan 2\n"
"\n"
" My dearest, please join me.  I don't believe there are many shuttles left before people will be stuck here forever.\""
msgstr ""
"宇宙港の展望台から手を振る幸せそうな人々と、離陸するシャトルの写真が載っています。「サルスは寒いよ。\n"
"\n"
"僕らの愛は本物だ\n"
"\n"
"クロアタン2で\n"
"\n"
"また会いたいよ\n"
"\n"
"愛しい人よ、頼むから来てくれ。シャトルはすぐに足りなくなるだろう。ここで永遠に立ち往生することになる」"

#. ~ Snippet in category "afs_personal_card"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/snippets/personal_cards.json
msgid ""
"A person wrapped up in bandages in a hospital bed is pictured on the front of this card.  \"Get well soon!!!\n"
"\n"
" Torrance, I'm sorry you feel ill but many new colonists forget to process any foodstuffs from Salus IV to remove the macronutrient.\""
msgstr ""
"カードの表面には、病院のベッドに横たわる包帯を巻いた人の写真が載っています。「はやく回復するといいな！！！\n"
"\n"
"トーランス、気分が悪い話ですまないが、新規入植者の大半は、サルスIVから持ってきた食料の神経毒素を除去し忘れるんだ」"

#. ~ Snippet in category "afs_personal_card"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/snippets/personal_cards.json
msgid ""
"A picture of a bloody steak.  This card appears particularly old.  \"Gauchos"
" Steaks.  Deliveries made monthly from Brazil to Salus IV.  Sign up today!\""
msgstr "血が滴るステーキの写真が載っている、古ぼけたカードです。「ガウチョステーキ。ブラジルからサルスIVへ毎月お届け。今すぐ登録してね！」"

#. ~ Snippet in category "afs_personal_card"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/snippets/personal_cards.json
msgid ""
"A glossy image of flowers and funeral statuary.  \"I'm sorry for your loss."
"  Ebby was an excellent grandparent and we hate for you that he was infected"
" with the Moxphoria and wandered into the wastes.\""
msgstr ""
"花に囲まれた墓廟の写真が光沢印刷されています。「お悔やみ申し上げます。エビーは素晴らしい祖父でした。彼がモクスフォリアに感染して荒野を彷徨っていたことについて、私たち一同はあなたを心の底から憎みます」"

#. ~ Snippet in category "afs_personal_card"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/snippets/personal_cards.json
msgid ""
"An orbital view of Salus IV.  \"Happy Colonization Day!\n"
"\n"
" Leonid,\n"
"\n"
" This place is cold as Hell but we've made a life out here in the last ten years.\""
msgstr ""
"衛星軌道上から撮られたサルスIVの写真が載っています。「入植記念日おめでとう！\n"
"\n"
"レオニド\n"
"\n"
"ここは地獄のように寒いが、もう10年も耐えて生きてこられたんだ」"

#. ~ Snippet in category "afs_personal_card"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/snippets/personal_cards.json
msgid ""
"An old style movie theater.  \"Showing the vintage film Aelita!\n"
"\n"
" Tovarishch,\n"
"\n"
" Come with me to the movies.  My grandfather says that this movie is one of the classics.\""
msgstr ""
"古めかしい映画館の写真が載っています。「ヴィンテージ作品、アエリータを上映します！\n"
"\n"
"トバリシチ\n"
"\n"
"よかったら一緒に行きませんか。祖父はこの映画を古典の名作だと言っています」"

#. ~ Snippet in category "alien_organ"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/snippets/snippets.json
msgid "A strange lumpy pink organ, it pulsates in your hand."
msgstr "ピンク色でゴツゴツとした、脈動し続ける奇妙な器官です。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "alien_organ"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/snippets/snippets.json
msgid "A trio of bean-shaped organs connected by webbing."
msgstr "豆の形をした器官が3つ、糸で連なっています。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "alien_organ"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/snippets/snippets.json
msgid "A spiral covered in spines, it unfolds in your hand."
msgstr "手に持つとダラリと弛緩する、棘に覆われた渦巻き状の器官です。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "alien_organ"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/snippets/snippets.json
msgid "A hollow organ filled with awful-smelling mucus."
msgstr "この器官の中には、酷い臭いのする粘液が入っています。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "alien_organ"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/snippets/snippets.json
msgid "A worm-like object."
msgstr "ワームのような物体です。"

#. ~ Message in effect "afs_generic_free_turn"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/spells/enchantments.json
msgid "You react with machine-like precision."
msgstr "機械のような正確さで反応しました。"

#. ~ NPC message in effect "afs_generic_free_turn"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/spells/enchantments.json
#, c-format
msgid "%1$s's reacts with robotic precision."
msgstr "%1$sは機械のような正確さで反応しました。"

#. ~ Message in effect "conversion_field_flash"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/spells/enchantments.json
msgid "Your shield reacts with a flash of light and sound."
msgstr "変換フィールドが反応して閃光と音を発しました。"

#. ~ NPC message in effect "conversion_field_flash"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/spells/enchantments.json
#, c-format
msgid "%1$s's shield goes off with a flash of light and sound."
msgstr "%1$sの変換フィールドが反応して閃光と音を発しました。"

#. ~ Message in effect "static_field"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/spells/enchantments.json
msgid "Your shield reacts with an arc of electricity."
msgstr "シールドが反応して電撃を放出しました。"

#. ~ NPC message in effect "static_field"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/spells/enchantments.json
#, c-format
msgid "%1$s's shield goes off with an arc of electricity."
msgstr "%1$sのシールドが反応して電撃を放出しました。"

#. ~ Spell name
#: data/mods/Aftershock/spells/hologram_spells.json
msgid "Holographic Field"
msgstr "ﾎﾛｸﾞﾗﾌｨｯｸ･ﾌｨｰﾙﾄﾞ"

#. ~ Description of spell "Holographic Field"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/spells/hologram_spells.json
msgid "Creates several short-lived holograms around you."
msgstr "短時間で消滅する複数のホログラムを周囲に作り出します。"

#. ~ Spell name
#: data/mods/Aftershock/spells/hologram_spells.json
msgid "Holographic Decoy"
msgstr "ﾎﾛｸﾞﾗﾌｨｯｸ･ﾃﾞｺｲ"

#. ~ Description of spell "Holographic Decoy"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/spells/hologram_spells.json
msgid "Creates a short-lived hologram."
msgstr "短時間で消滅するホログラムを作り出します。"

#. ~ Spell name
#: data/mods/Aftershock/spells/hologram_spells.json
msgid "Holographic Flash"
msgstr "ﾎﾛｸﾞﾗﾌｨｯｸ･ﾌﾗｯｼｭ"

#. ~ Description of spell "Holographic Flash"
#. ~ Description of spell "Holographic Flash Explosion"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/spells/hologram_spells.json
msgid ""
"Causes an existing hologram to explode into burning light, harming and "
"stunning enemies close to it."
msgstr "既存のホログラムを爆発させて強い光を発生させ、付近の敵にダメージを与えて気絶させます。"

#. ~ Spell name
#: data/mods/Aftershock/spells/hologram_spells.json
msgid "Holographic Flash Explosion"
msgstr "ﾎﾛｸﾞﾗﾌｨｯｸ･ﾌﾗｯｼｭ爆発"

#. ~ Spell name
#: data/mods/Aftershock/spells/hologram_spells.json
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/technomancer.json
msgid "Holographic Transposition"
msgstr "ﾎﾛｸﾞﾗﾌｨｯｸ･ﾄﾗﾝｽﾎﾟｼﾞｼｮﾝ"

#. ~ Description of spell "Holographic Transposition"
#. ~ Description of "Scroll of Holographic Transposition"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/spells/hologram_spells.json
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/technomancer.json
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spell_scrolls.json
msgid ""
"Allows you to swap places with a previously existing holographic image of "
"yourself.  If the universe itself can't tell you apart, who could?"
msgstr "自分とホログラムの位置を交換する呪文です。世界が自分とホログラムを区別できないなら、他に区別する方法はあるのでしょうか？"

#. ~ Spell name
#: data/mods/Aftershock/spells/jetpack_spells.json
msgid "Rocket Jump"
msgstr "ジェットパック跳躍"

#. ~ Description of spell "Rocket Jump"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/spells/jetpack_spells.json
msgid ""
"Take to the skies with a rocket assisted jump or dash.  You might target a "
"hostile creature to perform a powerful rocket kick at the end of the dash.  "
"The rocket pack allows for a brief moment of air control or hovering after a"
" jump."
msgstr ""
"ジェット噴射の力でジャンプや高速移動に勢いをつけ、空中を飛行します。高速移動の到達地点に狙いを定め、標的に強力な飛翔攻撃を繰り出すこともできます。ジェットパックを使えば、ジャンプ後の一瞬の空中制御やホバリングができるようになります。"

#. ~ Spell name
#: data/mods/Aftershock/spells/jetpack_spells.json
msgid "Rocket Jump Levitation"
msgstr "ジェットパック浮遊"

#. ~ Description of spell "Rocket Jump Levitation"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/spells/jetpack_spells.json
msgid ""
"Chained before a rocket jump.  Grants a brief instant of levitation to "
"simulate a rocket pack-s limited flying ability."
msgstr "ジェットパックジャンプの詠唱前に詠唱されます。ジェットパックの限定的な飛行能力を表す呪文であり、短時間浮遊します。"

#. ~ Spell name
#: data/mods/Aftershock/spells/monster_spells.json
msgid "Isohypsa Coordination"
msgstr "ドローン調整"

#. ~ Description of spell "Isohypsa Coordination"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/spells/monster_spells.json
msgid "Increases the speed of simpler Wraitheon drones."
msgstr "レイセオン系ロボットの速度を上昇させます。"

#. ~ Description of spell "Heat Drain"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/spells/monster_spells.json
msgid "Spews a burst of very cold air."
msgstr "極寒の空気を噴出させます。"

#. ~ Spell name
#: data/mods/Aftershock/spells/teleport_spells.json
msgid "Translocation"
msgstr "転移"

#. ~ Description of spell "Translocation"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/spells/teleport_spells.json
msgid "Translocates the user to an encoded buoy."
msgstr "あらかじめ指定した座標に詠唱者を移動させます。"

#. ~ Description of spell "Translocation"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/spells/teleport_spells.json
msgid "Slowly translocates the user to an encoded buoy."
msgstr "あらかじめ指定した座標に時間をかけて詠唱者を移動させます。"

#. ~ Spell name
#: data/mods/Aftershock/spells/psionics/classless.json
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/classless.json
msgid "[Ψ]Stop Concentrating"
msgstr "[Ψ]精神統一中断"

#. ~ Description of spell "[Ψ]Stop Concentrating"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/spells/psionics/classless.json
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/classless.json
msgid ""
"End your concentration on all of your maintained powers.\n"
"\n"
"Channeling this power <color_green>always succeeds</color>."
msgstr ""
"超能力の維持に必要な精神統一を中断します。\n"
"\n"
"この行動は<color_green>必ず成功</color>します。"

#. ~ Message of spell "[Ψ]Stop Concentrating"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/spells/psionics/classless.json
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/classless.json
msgid "You stop concentrating."
msgstr "精神統一を止めました。"

#. ~ Spell name
#: data/mods/Aftershock/spells/psionics/electrokinesis.json
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/electrokinesis.json
msgid "[Ψ]Spark Sight (C)"
msgstr "[Ψ]ｽﾊﾟｰｸ･ｻｲﾄ(C)"

#. ~ Description of spell "[Ψ]Spark Sight (C)"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/spells/psionics/electrokinesis.json
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/electrokinesis.json
msgid ""
"Open your senses to the flow of electricity, revealing nearby electrical creatures or robots.\n"
"\n"
"This power <color_yellow>is maintained by concentration</color> and <color_red>may fail</color> if <color_yellow>concentration is interrupted</color>."
msgstr ""
"電気の流れを読み取り、周囲の電撃を放つ生物やロボットの存在を感知します。\n"
"\n"
"この超能力は<color_yellow>精神統一によって維持</color>されており、<color_yellow>精神統一を中断</color>すると<color_red>効果が停止</color>します。"

#. ~ Spell name
#: data/mods/Aftershock/spells/psionics/electrokinesis.json
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/electrokinesis.json
msgid "[Ψ]Static Touch"
msgstr "[Ψ]ｽﾀﾃｨｯｸ･ﾀｯﾁ"

#. ~ Description of spell "[Ψ]Static Touch"
#. ~ Description of spell "[Ψ]Static Touch Monster"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/spells/psionics/electrokinesis.json
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/monsters/monsters_spells.json
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/electrokinesis.json
msgid ""
"Unleash a shock when touching a target, doing a small amount of damage and "
"dazing them."
msgstr "標的に触れて電撃を流し込み、多少のダメージを与えて放心状態にします。"

#. ~ Sound description of spell "[Ψ]Static Touch"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/spells/psionics/electrokinesis.json
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/electrokinesis.json
msgid "zzzaaaaapp!"
msgstr "ビビビビビビ！"

#. ~ Message of spell "[Ψ]Static Touch"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/spells/psionics/electrokinesis.json
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/electrokinesis.json
msgid "Your hands crackle with sparks!"
msgstr "両手で火花が飛び散りました！"

#. ~ Spell name
#: data/mods/Aftershock/spells/psionics/electrokinesis.json
msgid "[Ψ]Electrical Discharge"
msgstr "[Ψ]ｴﾚｸﾄﾘｶﾙ･ﾃﾞｨｽﾁｬｰｼﾞ"

#. ~ Description of spell "[Ψ]Electrical Discharge"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/spells/psionics/electrokinesis.json
msgid ""
"Build up a charge in your body, zapping anyone who attempts to attack you in"
" melee.  It will also protect you from EMP attacks."
msgstr "体内に電気を蓄積しておき、近接攻撃してきた相手に反撃します。EMP攻撃を防ぐ効果もあります。"

#. ~ Message of spell "[Ψ]Electrical Discharge"
#. ~ Description of effect type "Eerie Glow"
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_ELECTROKIN_ZAP_ENEMIES_INITIATE"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/spells/psionics/electrokinesis.json
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effects/effects_monster.json
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/electrokinesis_concentration_eocs.json
msgid "Your skin tingles."
msgstr "肌がヒリヒリします。"

#. ~ Spell name
#: data/mods/Aftershock/spells/psionics/electrokinesis.json
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/electrokinesis.json
msgid "[Ψ]Hacking Interface (C)"
msgstr "[Ψ]ﾊｯｷﾝｸﾞ･ｲﾝﾀｰﾌｪｰｽ(C)"

#. ~ Description of spell "[Ψ]Hacking Interface (C)"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/spells/psionics/electrokinesis.json
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/electrokinesis.json
msgid ""
"Create an electrical interface with your powers, allowing you to hack nearby devices as if you were using a computer.\n"
"\n"
"This power <color_yellow>is maintained by concentration</color> and <color_red>may fail</color> if <color_yellow>concentration is interrupted</color>."
msgstr ""
"超能力で仮想インターフェースを作り出し、コンピュータ操作と同じ感覚で周囲のデバイスをハッキングできます。\n"
"\n"
"この超能力は<color_yellow>精神統一によって維持</color>されており、<color_yellow>精神統一を中断</color>すると<color_red>効果が停止</color>します。"

#. ~ Spell name
#: data/mods/Aftershock/spells/psionics/electrokinesis.json
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/electrokinesis.json
msgid "[Ψ]Electron Overflow (C)"
msgstr "[Ψ]ｴﾚｸﾄﾛﾝ･ｵｰﾊﾞｰﾌﾛｰ(C)"

#. ~ Description of spell "[Ψ]Electron Overflow (C)"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/spells/psionics/electrokinesis.json
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/electrokinesis.json
msgid ""
"Generate power for UPS compatible devices on your person.\n"
"\n"
"This power <color_yellow>is maintained by concentration</color> and <color_red>may fail</color> if <color_yellow>concentration is interrupted</color>."
msgstr ""
"UPS給電が可能なアイテムに電力を送り込みます。\n"
"\n"
"この超能力は<color_yellow>精神統一によって維持</color>されており、<color_yellow>精神統一を中断</color>すると<color_red>効果が停止</color>します。"

#. ~ Spell name
#: data/mods/Aftershock/spells/psionics/electrokinesis.json
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/electrokinesis.json
msgid "[Ψ]Re-energize"
msgstr "[Ψ]ﾘ･ｴﾅｼﾞｬｲｽﾞ"

#. ~ Description of spell "[Ψ]Re-energize"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/spells/psionics/electrokinesis.json
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/electrokinesis.json
msgid ""
"Turn your own energy into power for a vehicle or appliance.  You need merely"
" touch the vehicle or any part of the power grid to recharge the batteries."
msgstr "体内のエネルギーを車両や設備の電力に変換します。車両や電気配線の一部に触れるだけで充電できます。"

#. ~ Message of spell "[Ψ]Re-energize"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/spells/psionics/electrokinesis.json
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/electrokinesis.json
msgid "Power flows into your target."
msgstr "電力を流し込みました。"

#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC
#. "EOC_AFS_ELECTROKIN_SEE_ELECTRICITY_INITIATE"
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_ELECTROKIN_SEE_ELECTRICITY_INITIATE"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/spells/psionics/electrokinesis_concentration_eocs.json
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/electrokinesis_concentration_eocs.json
msgid "You open your senses to the flow of current."
msgstr "電気の流れに意識を集中させました。"

#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC
#. "EOC_AFS_ELECTROKIN_HACKING_INTERFACE_INITIATE"
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC
#. "EOC_ELECTROKIN_HACKING_INTERFACE_INITIATE"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/spells/psionics/electrokinesis_concentration_eocs.json
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/electrokinesis_concentration_eocs.json
msgid "You now have the ability to hack into nearby electronics."
msgstr "周囲の電子機器をハッキングできるようになりました。"

#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC
#. "EOC_AFS_ELECTROKIN_PERSONAL_BATTERY_INITIATE"
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC
#. "EOC_ELECTROKIN_PERSONAL_BATTERY_INITIATE"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/spells/psionics/electrokinesis_concentration_eocs.json
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/electrokinesis_concentration_eocs.json
msgid "The hair on your body stands up on end."
msgstr "全身の毛が逆立っています。"

#. ~ Spell name
#: data/mods/Aftershock/spells/psionics/enchantments.json
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/enchantments/enchantments_player.json
msgid "Electrokinetic aura thorns"
msgstr "エレクトロキネシスオーラ反撃"

#. ~ Description of spell "Electrokinetic aura thorns"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/spells/psionics/enchantments.json
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/enchantments/enchantments_player.json
msgid ""
"Do electrical damage to a monster that attacked you.  If you have this "
"directly its a bug."
msgstr "攻撃者に反撃して電撃ダメージを与えます。通常は表示されません。"

#. ~ Spell name
#: data/mods/Aftershock/spells/psionics/telepathy.json
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/telepathy.json
msgid "[Ψ]Telepathic Shield (C)"
msgstr "[Ψ]ﾃﾚﾊﾟｼｯｸ･ｼｰﾙﾄﾞ(C)"

#. ~ Description of spell "[Ψ]Telepathic Shield (C)"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/spells/psionics/telepathy.json
msgid ""
"You can protect your mind from the dangers of Salus IV.\n"
"\n"
"This power <color_yellow>is maintained by concentration</color> and <color_red>may fail</color> if <color_yellow>concentration is interrupted</color>."
msgstr ""
"サルスIVの危険な存在から精神を守ります。\n"
"\n"
"この超能力は<color_yellow>精神統一によって維持</color>されており、<color_yellow>精神統一を中断</color>すると<color_red>効果が停止</color>します。"

#. ~ Spell name
#: data/mods/Aftershock/spells/psionics/telepathy.json
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/telepathy.json
msgid "[Ψ]Sense Minds (C)"
msgstr "[Ψ]ｾﾝｽ･ﾏｲﾝﾄﾞ(C)"

#. ~ Description of spell "[Ψ]Sense Minds (C)"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/spells/psionics/telepathy.json
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/telepathy.json
msgid ""
"You can use your powers to detect the tell-tale hum of a living, sapient mind, no matter how strange or alien it may be.\n"
"\n"
"This power <color_yellow>is maintained by concentration</color> and <color_red>may fail</color> if <color_yellow>concentration is interrupted</color>."
msgstr ""
"どれほど奇妙で異質な対象であっても、知性ある生物であれば心の声を感知できるようになります。\n"
"\n"
"この超能力は<color_yellow>精神統一によって維持</color>されており、<color_yellow>精神統一を中断</color>すると<color_red>効果が停止</color>します。"

#. ~ Spell name
#: data/mods/Aftershock/spells/psionics/telepathy.json
msgid "[Ψ]Telepathic Suggestion (C)"
msgstr "[Ψ]ﾃﾚﾊﾟｼｯｸ･ｻｼﾞｪｽﾁｮﾝ(C)"

#. ~ Description of spell "[Ψ]Telepathic Suggestion (C)"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/spells/psionics/telepathy.json
msgid ""
"You can subtly influence the thoughts of others, making them more amenable to your point of view.\n"
"\n"
"This power <color_yellow>is maintained by concentration</color> and <color_red>may fail</color> if <color_yellow>concentration is interrupted</color>."
msgstr ""
"他人の思考にわずかな影響を与え、自分に有利な行動を取らせやすくします。\n"
"\n"
"この超能力は<color_yellow>精神統一によって維持</color>されており、<color_yellow>精神統一を中断</color>すると<color_red>効果が停止</color>します。"

#. ~ Spell name
#: data/mods/Aftershock/spells/psionics/telepathy.json
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/telepathy.json
msgid "[Ψ]Sensory Deprivation"
msgstr "[Ψ]ｾﾝｻﾘｰ･ﾃﾞﾌﾟﾘﾍﾞｰｼｮﾝ"

#. ~ Description of spell "[Ψ]Sensory Deprivation"
#. ~ Description of spell "[Ψ]Sensory Deprivation Monster"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/spells/psionics/telepathy.json
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/monsters/monsters_spells.json
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/telepathy.json
msgid ""
"Disconnect a target's brain from its senses, leaving it blinded and "
"confused."
msgstr "標的の脳と感覚器との繋がりを切り離し、盲目と混乱の効果を付与します。"

#. ~ Message of spell "[Ψ]Sensory Deprivation"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/spells/psionics/telepathy.json
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/telepathy.json
msgid "You lock your target's mind away!"
msgstr "標的の心を幽閉します！"

#. ~ Spell name
#: data/mods/Aftershock/spells/psionics/telepathy.json
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/telepathy.json
msgid "[Ψ]Sensory Deprivation blind Effect"
msgstr "[Ψ]ｾﾝｻﾘｰ･ﾃﾞﾌﾟﾘﾍﾞｰｼｮﾝ盲目効果"

#. ~ Description of spell "[Ψ]Sensory Deprivation blind Effect"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/spells/psionics/telepathy.json
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/telepathy.json
msgid ""
"The is the part of the Sensory Deprivation that blinds the target.  It's a "
"bug if you have it."
msgstr "センサリー・デプリベーションに付随する、標的を盲目にする効果です。通常は表示されません。"

#. ~ Spell name
#: data/mods/Aftershock/spells/psionics/telepathy.json
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/telepathy.json
msgid "[Ψ]Synaptic Overload"
msgstr "[Ψ]ｼﾅﾌﾟﾃｨｯｸ･ｵｰﾊﾞｰﾛｰﾄﾞ"

#. ~ Description of spell "[Ψ]Synaptic Overload"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/spells/psionics/telepathy.json
msgid ""
"Short-circuit and overwhelm a target's brain, causing extreme damage or "
"death.  Does not work on targets without living minds, such as robots."
msgstr "標的の脳をショートさせて打ちのめし、大ダメージを与えるか死亡させます。ロボットなどの生命体ではない標的には効果がありません。"

#. ~ Message of spell "[Ψ]Synaptic Overload"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/spells/psionics/telepathy.json
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/telepathy.json
msgid "You assault the mind of your target!"
msgstr "標的の精神を攻撃しました！"

#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_AFS_TELEPATH_SHIELD_INITIATE"
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_TELEPATH_SHIELD_INITIATE"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/spells/psionics/telepathy_concentration_eocs.json
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/telepathy_concentration_eoc.json
msgid "You begin shielding your thoughts."
msgstr "自分自身の精神に盾を築きました。"

#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_AFS_TELEPATH_SENSE_MINDS_INITIATE"
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_TELEPATH_SENSE_MINDS_INITIATE"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/spells/psionics/telepathy_concentration_eocs.json
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/telepathy_concentration_eoc.json
msgid "You reach out with your powers, looking for nearby minds."
msgstr "思考の手を伸ばし、周囲の心を探りました。"

#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_AFS_TELEPATH_SUGGESTION_INITIATE"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/spells/psionics/telepathy_concentration_eocs.json
msgid "You prepare to subtly influence others' thoughts."
msgstr "他人の思考にわずかに影響を与える準備を整えました。"

#. ~ Item name
#. ~ Vehicle part name
#: data/mods/Aftershock/vehicles/part_items.json
#: data/mods/Aftershock/vehicles/vehicle_parts.json
#: data/mods/BlazeIndustries/vehicleparts/vehicle_parts.json
#: data/mods/BlazeIndustries/vehicles/part_items.json
msgid "ultralight frame"
msgid_plural "ultralight frames"
msgstr[0] "超軽量フレーム(チタン)"

#. ~ Description of "ultralight frame"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/vehicles/part_items.json
#: data/mods/BlazeIndustries/vehicles/part_items.json
msgid "A sturdy, lightweight frame made from titanium.  Useful for crafting."
msgstr "チタンから作られた頑丈な軽量フレームです。アイテム製作材料として使います。"

#. ~ Item name
#. ~ Vehicle part name
#: data/mods/Aftershock/vehicles/part_items.json
#: data/mods/Aftershock/vehicles/vehicle_parts.json
#: data/mods/BlazeIndustries/vehicleparts/vehicle_parts.json
#: data/mods/BlazeIndustries/vehicles/part_items.json
msgid "ultralight foldable frame"
msgid_plural "ultralight foldable frames"
msgstr[0] "超軽量折畳フレーム(チタン)"

#. ~ Description of "ultralight foldable frame"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/vehicles/part_items.json
#: data/mods/BlazeIndustries/vehicles/part_items.json
msgid "A sturdy, lightweight foldable frame made from titanium."
msgstr "チタン製の頑丈で軽い折り畳み式フレームです。"

#. ~ Description of "control station"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/vehicles/part_items.json
msgid ""
"A large and complex piloting station from a military vehicle, including a "
"camera station, steering tools, and electronics controls."
msgstr "カメラ操作、ステアリング、電子制御装置などの機能をもった、軍用車両用の複雑な大型制御装置です。"

#. ~ Item name
#. ~ Vehicle part name
#: data/mods/Aftershock/vehicles/part_items.json
#: data/mods/Aftershock/vehicles/vehicle_parts.json
msgid "quantum solar panel"
msgid_plural "quantum solar panels"
msgstr[0] "量子ソーラーパネル"

#. ~ Description of "quantum solar panel"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/vehicles/part_items.json
msgid ""
"This solar panel is obviously cutting-edge technology and given where you "
"found it, it should probably provide a LOT of power.  It's covered in "
"strange-looking material, but the covering looks rather fragile; it doesn't "
"look like it could support a reinforcing sheet, either."
msgstr ""
"このソーラーパネルは明らかに最先端技術の結晶であり、莫大な電力を供給するでしょう。ソーラーセルにあたる面は不思議な素材で覆われており、いかにも壊れやすそうに見えます。ガラス板等で補強するのもどうやら無理そうです。"

#. ~ Item name
#. ~ Vehicle part name
#: data/mods/Aftershock/vehicles/part_items.json
#: data/mods/Aftershock/vehicles/vehicle_parts.json
msgid "minireactor"
msgid_plural "minireactors"
msgstr[0] "小型反応炉"

#. ~ Description of "minireactor"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/vehicles/part_items.json
msgid "A small, portable plutonium reactor.  Handle with great care!"
msgstr "小型の携帯式プルトニウム反応炉です。細心の注意を払って取り扱いましょう！"

#. ~ Vehicle part name
#: data/mods/Aftershock/vehicles/vehicle_parts.json
msgid "cargo trough"
msgstr "簡易カーゴ"

#. ~ Description of vehicle part "cargo trough"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/vehicles/vehicle_parts.json
msgid ""
"This is little more than a sheet metal basin welded to the bottom of the "
"vehicle, extending below it.  Though it holds a lot of stuff, its shoddiness"
" makes it fragile."
msgstr "盆状に変形したシートを車両の下部に溶接しただけのカーゴです。たくさんの荷物が載りますが、作りが粗雑なため破損しやすいです。"

#. ~ Vehicle part name
#: data/mods/Aftershock/vehicles/vehicle_parts.json
msgid "crude plating"
msgstr "装甲板(粗製)"

#. ~ Description of vehicle part "crude plating"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/vehicles/vehicle_parts.json
msgid ""
"A piece of sheet metal welded onto a vehicle as armor.  Thin, and not as "
"protective as proper armor, but it'll do if there's nothing else available."
msgstr "装甲として車両に溶接された板金です。薄いため本物の装甲ほどは役に立ちませんが、何も取り付けないよりはましです。"

#. ~ Description of vehicle part "control station"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/vehicles/vehicle_parts.json
msgid ""
"A large and complex dashboard mounted with steering controls and several LCD"
" touch screens for controlling vehicle systems."
msgstr "ステアリング機構と車両制御用の液晶タッチスクリーンが複数搭載された、大きく複雑なダッシュボードです。"

#. ~ Vehicle part name
#: data/mods/Aftershock/vehicles/vehicle_parts.json
msgid "mounted external tank (200L)"
msgstr "設置型タンク(200L)"

#. ~ Description of vehicle part "ultralight frame"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/vehicles/vehicle_parts.json
#: data/mods/BlazeIndustries/vehicleparts/vehicle_parts.json
msgid ""
"An ultralight titanium framework.  Other vehicle components can be mounted "
"on it, and it can be attached to other frames to increase the vehicle's "
"size."
msgstr "非常に軽いチタン製フレームです。この上に他の車両部品を設置できます。隣にフレームを更に取り付けて、車両のサイズを広げることも可能です。"

#. ~ Description of vehicle part "ultralight foldable frame"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/vehicles/vehicle_parts.json
#: data/mods/BlazeIndustries/vehicleparts/vehicle_parts.json
msgid ""
"An ultralight titanium foldable framework.  Other vehicle components can be "
"mounted on it, and it can be attached to other frames to increase the "
"vehicle's size."
msgstr ""
"非常に軽いチタン製折り畳み式フレームです。この上に他の車両部品を設置できます。隣にフレームを更に取り付けて、車両のサイズを広げることも可能です。"

#. ~ Description of vehicle part "quantum solar panel"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/vehicles/vehicle_parts.json
msgid ""
"An extremely high-performance solar panel.  Will recharge the vehicle's "
"electrical power when exposed to the sun.  Clouds will slow the recharge "
"speed.  Extremely fragile and cannot be armored."
msgstr ""
"太陽光に当てると車両の電力をゆっくりと充電する、超高性能のソーラーパネルです。曇りの時も、非常に時間は掛かりますが充電され続けます。非常に壊れやすいため、装甲としては役に立ちません。"

#. ~ Description of vehicle part "minireactor"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/vehicles/vehicle_parts.json
msgid ""
"A small nuclear reactor.  When loaded with plutonium cells and turned on, "
"will generate a lot of electrical power."
msgstr "小型の原子炉です。原子力電池を装填してから起動すると、膨大な電力を生み出します。"

#. ~ Vehicle part name
#: data/mods/Aftershock/vehicles/vehicle_parts.json
msgid "robot_carrier"
msgstr "ロボット運搬カーゴ"

#. ~ Description of vehicle part "robot_carrier"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/vehicles/vehicle_parts.json
msgid ""
"A cargo space for carrying robots.  'e'xamine it to capture a robot next to "
"you, or to release the robot currently contained.  When selecting a robot to"
" capture, choose its tile relative to you, not the part."
msgstr ""
"ロボットを運搬するためのカーゴスペースです。調べる(e)ことで自分の周囲のタイルのロボットを搬入するか、中に入っているロボットを搬出できます。ロボットを搬入する時は、カーゴが設置されたタイルの周囲ではなく、自分自身の周囲のタイルを選択します。"

#. ~ Vehicle name
#: data/mods/Aftershock/vehicles/vehicles.json
msgid "Atomic Compact"
msgstr "アトミックコンパクトカー"

#. ~ Vehicle name
#: data/mods/Aftershock/vehicles/vehicles.json
msgid "Atomic SUV"
msgstr "アトミックSUV"

#. ~ Vehicle name
#: data/mods/Aftershock/vehicles/vehicles.json
msgid "Atomic Car"
msgstr "アトミックカー"

#. ~ Vehicle name
#: data/mods/Aftershock/vehicles/vehicles.json
msgid "Robotic Taxi"
msgstr "無人タクシー"

#. ~ Vehicle name
#: data/mods/Aftershock/vehicles/vehicles.json
msgid "Armored Robot Carrier"
msgstr "装甲ロボット運搬車"

#. ~ Vehicle name
#: data/mods/Aftershock/vehicles/vehicles.json
msgid "Atomic Sports Car"
msgstr "アトミックスポーツカー"

#. ~ Vehicle name
#: data/mods/Aftershock/vehicles/vehicles.json
msgid "Enforcer Patrol Car"
msgstr "警察機関巡回車"

#. ~ Vehicle name
#: data/mods/Aftershock/vehicles/vehicles.json
msgid "Bubble Car"
msgstr "バブルカー"

#. ~ Vehicle name
#: data/mods/Aftershock/vehicles/vehicles.json
msgid "Light Cycle"
msgstr "警察機関巡回バイク"

#. ~ Item name
#. ~ Variant name of item "strange object"
#: data/mods/Backrooms/artifacts.json
msgid "strange object"
msgid_plural "strange objects"
msgstr[0] "奇妙な物体"

#. ~ Description of "strange object"
#: data/mods/Backrooms/artifacts.json
msgid "An object of uncertain origin, unusually heavy for its size."
msgstr "大きさの割に異様に重い、材質すら分からない物体です。"

#. ~ Description of variant "strange object" of item "strange object"
#: data/mods/Backrooms/artifacts.json
msgid ""
"It looks like a glob of white plastic streaked with bits of red and black "
"has melted over a jagged chunk of mixed scrap metals.  There are two large "
"and sharp pieces of metal jutting out from the side in parallel.  The metal "
"is very slightly, inexplicably slimy to the touch.  If you hold it up to "
"your ear, it emits a low, oscillating hum very quietly.  Unsettling…"
msgstr ""
"赤黒い断片が混じった白いプラスチック球のような物体が、凸凹した金属質の塊の上で溶けかかっています。金属塊からは2本の鋭利な棒が平行に伸びており、触ると少しヌルヌルしています。耳に当ててみると、非常に小さな振動音が聞こえてきて、心が落ち着きません..."

#. ~ Description of variant "strange object" of item "strange object"
#: data/mods/Backrooms/artifacts.json
msgid ""
"It's a brown, flaky rock just bigger than your fist.  Horrifically, what "
"seem to be small animal bones stick out of it at weird angles.  Something "
"that looks suspiciously like blood very slowly oozes out from between the "
"layers in the rock - almost imperceptibly slow - almost as if something "
"living were freshly crushed between the sedimentary layers.  But that would "
"be impossible…"
msgstr ""
"拳より少し大きなサイズの、脆そうな茶色い石です。恐ろしいことに、石には小動物の骨のようなものが異様な角度で突き刺さっています。石のヒビの間からは、ほとんど止まって見えるほどにゆっくりと、血のようなものが滲み出しています。まるで生物が今しがたこの石の隙間で潰されたようにも思えますが、そんなことはあり得ない筈です..."

#. ~ Description of variant "strange object" of item "strange object"
#: data/mods/Backrooms/artifacts.json
msgid ""
"It's a small wooden cuboid with a large rectangular hole running from one side to the other.  The wood is well-treated and it seems completely mundane at first.\n"
"\n"
"If you look through the hole, everything looks normal.  It's only when you wave your hand in front that you realize that you can't see yourself!  If you stick your finger inside the hole, it doesn't seem to come out the other side.  How is that possible?!"
msgstr ""
"小さな木質の立方体を貫くように、長方形の穴が開いています。表面は滑らかに処理されており、まったくもって普通の物体のように見えます。\n"
"\n"
"穴を覗いてみても、何も異常はありません。しかし、穴の出口を塞ぐように手で塞いでも、穴から覗くと何故か手が見えません。穴の中に指を入れても、反対側から出てきません。こんなことがあり得るのでしょうか！？"

#. ~ Description of variant "strange object" of item "strange object"
#: data/mods/Backrooms/artifacts.json
msgid ""
"You could be wrong, but it appears to be maybe 6 or 7 colorful glass bongs "
"fused together in a ball-shaped mess of melted glass, reminding you "
"strangely of an art exhibition you saw once.  When you pick up the object, "
"you notice a pale purple ooze trapped in the middle of the glass meld.  It's"
" iridescent, colloidal, and slightly viscous, although it doesn't remind you"
" of any fluid you've ever seen before."
msgstr ""
"6、7個のガラス製の喫煙具が溶けて歪み、球状にまとまっています。まるでいつか見た美術展の作品のようで、不思議な気持ちになります。手に取ってってよく見ると、融合したガラスの中心部に、淡い紫色の液体が入っています。光の反射で色を変える粒子混じりのこの液体は、多少の粘性があるように見えます。"

#. ~ Description of variant "strange object" of item "strange object"
#: data/mods/Backrooms/artifacts.json
msgid ""
"It's colored jet black and looks suspiciously like the ridged horn of a "
"goat, only seemingly studded with red gems and carved with inscriptions.  "
"You're no expert, but these inscriptions are unlike anything you've ever "
"seen humans make, with many geometric shapes inside squares that could be "
"words or characters.  There are thin, intricate lines weaving all over the "
"horn, curving in a way that you're sure could only be achieved with laser "
"engraving technology yet you feel certain they were not."
msgstr ""
"ヤギの角のような形をした漆黒の物体の表面には、赤い宝石が散りばめられ、何かが彫られているようです。四角形の囲いの中に文字や記号のように見える幾何学的な形が刻まれていますが、専門家ではなくとも、これが人間が使っている文字ではないことを理解できます。レーザーでなければ彫刻できない、しかしまるで手彫りされたかのような精緻なカーブを描く、細かく複雑な紋様が刻まれています。"

#. ~ Description of variant "strange object" of item "strange object"
#: data/mods/Backrooms/artifacts.json
msgid ""
"It appears like a normal book with a bright blue cover from a distance, but "
"when you pick the object up you notice it's simply a thick slab of some "
"dense material shaped like a book.  It's oddly stocky and brightly colored, "
"textured with low-resolution images almost like an object that fell straight"
" out of an old video game.  On the cover is just the number \"19\" and below"
" it the words \"A new bible by\" but there's no author listed.  In fact, "
"there's no other text on the entire object."
msgstr ""
"遠目には、ただの鮮やかな青色の表紙の本のように見えますが、手に取ってみると、本の形をした何か密度の高い素材の厚板だということに気付きます。妙に分厚く色鮮やかなこの物体は、まるで昔のテレビゲームの世界からそのまま飛び出してきたかのような、解像度の低い画像が貼りついているようにも見えます。表紙には「19」という数字と「新聖書」という文字があるだけで、著者の名前は書かれていません。それどころか、他に文字らしいものは何も見当たりません。"

#. ~ Description of variant "strange object" of item "strange object"
#: data/mods/Backrooms/artifacts.json
msgid ""
"It seems to be a heavy chunk of light pink amber.  Suspended inside the amber are… fossils?  You're unsure what to call them.\n"
"\n"
"One appears to be a small ball of hair with copper wires reaching out in one direction, reminiscent of an amoeba reaching for something.  Another appears to be a tiny fern, only made out of a highly iridescent metal, with blades quite literally as thin as a razor.  A third, particularly horrifying one appears to be the shrunken head of a human with a network of dark red nerves instead of hair."
msgstr ""
"薄ピンク色の、琥珀のような重い塊です。内部に入っているのは...3つの化石でしょうか？どれも名状しがたい形です。\n"
"\n"
"化石のようなものの一つは、絡んだ銅線を一方向に伸ばしたような姿をしており、まるで繊毛を伸ばすアメーバのようです。もう一つは小さなシダ植物に見えますが、表面は虹色の光沢をもつ金属質で、薄く平たい形状はカミソリそっくりです。最後の一つは特に恐ろしい姿をしています。人間の頭を縮めたような形ですが、髪の毛の代わりに暗赤色の神経網のようなものが生えています。"

#. ~ Description of variant "strange object" of item "strange object"
#: data/mods/Backrooms/artifacts.json
msgid ""
"It seems almost like a children's toy has somehow melted into a solid chunk "
"of brass.  There are bright red, green, and yellow plastic pieces fused into"
" the sides and a very distinct purple button in the middle.  When you press "
"it, however, there's a sickening squelch and you can't help but feel like "
"you're pressing into a pile of ground meat protected by this metal outer "
"shell.  Disgusting."
msgstr ""
"子供の玩具のようなものが溶けて歪み、真鍮の殻と硬く融合しています。側面には赤色、緑色、黄色のプラスチック片が癒着しており、前面には紫色のボタンが溶けずに残っています。ボタンを押すと耳障りな音が鳴り響き、まるでこの金属外装の中に入った肉塊を押し潰してしまったような気分になります。気味が悪いですね。"

#. ~ Description of variant "strange object" of item "strange object"
#: data/mods/Backrooms/artifacts.json
msgid ""
"It seems like a small, jagged rock uniformly and evenly covered in bright "
"red velvet.  You feel certain that the rock came to be this way through some"
" supernatural process.  When you hold it to your ear, it emits a very low, "
"oscillating hum.  Very strange."
msgstr ""
"真っ赤なビロードにぴったり覆われた、凹凸のある小石です。この石が何か超常的なプロセスを経て今の状態になったことは疑いようもありません。耳に当ててみると、非常に低い振動音が聞こえます。本当に妙ですね。"

#. ~ Description of variant "strange object" of item "strange object"
#: data/mods/Backrooms/artifacts.json
msgid ""
"It appears to be a small black box made out of some kind of hard metal.  Although it has no discernable openings, you call it a box because when you shake it you can feel things moving around inside.  Strangely, though, what's inside always seems to be… changing.  One moment it's a liquid, the next it feels like marbles or rocks, and then the next it feels like sand.\n"
"\n"
"Although probably inconsequential, the object emits a fairly strong odor of ginger at all times."
msgstr ""
"硬い金属でできた、黒い小箱のようなものです。開口部はありませんが、振ると中で何かが音を立てるので、ひとまず箱と呼んでも差し支えないでしょう。不思議なことに、中の物体は変化し続けているようで、あるときは液体、またある時はビー玉か石ころ、砂のような物音がすることもあります。\n"
"\n"
"どうでもいい情報かもしれませんが、この物体はかなり強いショウガの臭いを常に発し続けています。"

#. ~ Terrain name
#: data/mods/Backrooms/furniture_terrain.json
msgid "faded wall"
msgstr "色褪せた壁"

#. ~ Description of terrain "faded wall"
#: data/mods/Backrooms/furniture_terrain.json
msgid ""
"A yellowed, numbingly monotonous wallpaper decorates these thin walls.  They"
" smell of mildew and have a faintly damp feel."
msgstr "心が麻痺しそうなほど単調な模様の壁紙が貼られた、黄ばんだ薄い壁です。カビ臭く、かすかに湿っています。"

#. ~ Terrain name
#: data/mods/Backrooms/furniture_terrain.json
msgid "faded gray wall"
msgstr "色褪せた灰色の壁"

#. ~ Description of terrain "faded gray wall"
#: data/mods/Backrooms/furniture_terrain.json
msgid ""
"A drab gray drywall barrier with no finishing.  Feels almost damp to the "
"touch and smells faintly of cleaner chemicals."
msgstr "何の仕上げも施されていない、無味乾燥な灰色の石壁です。ほのかに洗剤の香りが漂っており、少し湿っている気がします。"

#. ~ Terrain name
#: data/mods/Backrooms/furniture_terrain.json
msgid "faded carpet, overhead light"
msgstr "色褪せた絨毯と天井灯"

#. ~ Description of terrain "faded carpet, overhead light"
#: data/mods/Backrooms/furniture_terrain.json
msgid ""
"A slightly moist carpet, stained yellow with age.  Overhead, a fluorescent "
"light hums a little too loudly."
msgstr "少し湿っている、経年劣化で汚れて黄ばんだ絨毯です。頭上では、蛍光灯が耳障りなノイズを発しながら灯っています。"

#. ~ Terrain name
#: data/mods/Backrooms/furniture_terrain.json
msgid "faded carpet"
msgstr "色褪せた絨毯"

#. ~ Description of terrain "faded carpet"
#: data/mods/Backrooms/furniture_terrain.json
msgid "A slightly moist carpet, stained yellow with age."
msgstr "少し湿っている、経年劣化で汚れて黄ばんだ絨毯です。"

#. ~ Terrain name
#: data/mods/Backrooms/furniture_terrain.json
msgid "faded tile, overhead light"
msgstr "色褪せたタイルと天井灯"

#. ~ Description of terrain "faded tile, overhead light"
#: data/mods/Backrooms/furniture_terrain.json
msgid ""
"These cheap white tiles, which seem to be plastic rather than actual "
"ceramic, are grayed with age and slightly warped at their corners.  "
"Overhead, a fluorescent light hums a little too loudly."
msgstr ""
"陶器というよりプラスチックのような質感の、安っぽい白色のタイルです。真っすぐに並んでおらず、経年劣化で灰色に変色しています。頭上では、蛍光灯が耳障りなノイズを発しながら灯っています。"

#. ~ Terrain name
#: data/mods/Backrooms/furniture_terrain.json
msgid "faded tile"
msgstr "色褪せたタイル"

#. ~ Description of terrain "faded tile"
#: data/mods/Backrooms/furniture_terrain.json
msgid ""
"These cheap white tiles, which seem to be plastic rather than actual "
"ceramic, are grayed with age and slightly warped at their corners."
msgstr "陶器というよりプラスチックのような質感の、安っぽい白色のタイルです。真っすぐに並んでおらず、経年劣化で灰色に変色しています。"

#. ~ Furniture name
#: data/mods/Backrooms/furniture_terrain.json
msgid "water cooler"
msgstr "ウォータークーラー"

#. ~ Description of furniture "water cooler"
#: data/mods/Backrooms/furniture_terrain.json
msgid ""
"A plastic jug of water mounted on a dispenser.  Normally dispenses hot water"
" in addition to cold, but not with the power out.  You could probably "
"salvage the unwieldy jug on top with little effort, but any water still in "
"it would spill."
msgstr ""
"ディスペンサーが付いた、水を入れるプラスチック製の容器です。普段は冷水と温水が出ますが、停電時は冷水しか出ません。多少無理をすれば容器を取り外せそうですが、内部の水はこぼれてしまうでしょう。"

#. ~ Bashing sound
#: data/mods/Backrooms/furniture_terrain.json
msgid "wobbling plastic!"
msgstr "[プラスチックが割れる音！]"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Backrooms/items.json
msgid "water cooler jug"
msgid_plural "water cooler jugs"
msgstr[0] "ウォーターサーバー"

#. ~ Description of "water cooler jug"
#: data/mods/Backrooms/items.json
msgid ""
"A sizable blue plastic jug meant to hold and supply water in a water cooler "
"or similar dispenser.  Holds a lot of liquid, but unfortunately it doesn't "
"come with a cap, making it hard to carry around when full."
msgstr ""
"ウォータークーラーに水を補給するための、プラスチック製の青い大型容器です。水が大量に入りますが、残念ながら蓋が破損しているため、満杯にすると持ち運ぶのに苦労します。"

#. ~ Description of "newspaper page"
#: data/mods/Backrooms/items.json
msgid ""
"A single sheet of newspaper broadsheet.  The date on it is so old it seems "
"actually impossible for it to have lasted this long in such good condition."
"  Most of the information on there is shockingly uninteresting for an "
"artifact so old, but one thing catches your eye briefly."
msgstr ""
"1枚の新聞紙です。日付が非常に古い割にはやけに状態が良く、記事も問題なく読み取れます。内容の大部分は取るに足らない上に、古い情報ばかりです。しかし、ある記事の一文が目に留まりました。"

#. ~ Description of "newspaper page"
#: data/mods/Backrooms/items.json
msgid ""
"A single sheet of newspaper broadsheet.  The date on it suggests it's "
"decades old, but miraculously it appears to be much newer.  Most of the "
"information on there is terribly trivial, or out of date, but one thing "
"catches your eye briefly."
msgstr ""
"1枚の新聞紙です。日付からして何十年も前のもののようですが、妙に状態が良く、記事も問題なく読み取れます。内容の大部分は取るに足らない上に、古い情報ばかりです。しかし、ある記事の一文が目に留まりました。"

#. ~ Description of "newspaper page"
#: data/mods/Backrooms/items.json
msgid ""
"A single sheet of newspaper broadsheet.  It doesn't look like any newspaper "
"you're familiar with and the text on it makes no sense…"
msgstr "見慣れた新聞とは異なる大きなサイズの、1枚の新聞紙です。書いてある内容も意味不明です..."

#. ~ Description of "newspaper page"
#: data/mods/Backrooms/items.json
msgid ""
"A single sheet of newspaper broadsheet.  It was printed a few years ago.  "
"Most of the information on there is terribly trivial, or out of date, but "
"one thing catches your eye briefly."
msgstr ""
"1枚の新聞紙です。日付を見ると数年以上前に印刷されたもののようです。内容の大部分は取るに足らない上に、古い情報ばかりです。しかし、ある記事の一文が目に留まりました。"

#. ~ Description of "newspaper page"
#: data/mods/Backrooms/items.json
msgid ""
"A single sheet of newspaper broadsheet.  There seems to be an important "
"article about a missing person."
msgstr "一般的なサイズより大きな1枚の新聞紙です。行方不明者に関する重大な記事が載っています。"

#. ~ Description of "newspaper page"
#: data/mods/Backrooms/items.json
msgid ""
"A single sheet of newspaper broadsheet.  It was printed within the last few "
"months.  Most of the information on there is terribly trivial, or out of "
"date, but one thing catches your eye briefly."
msgstr ""
"1枚の新聞紙です。日付を見るとここ数か月に印刷されたもののようです。内容の大部分は取るに足らない上に、古い情報ばかりです。しかし、ある記事の一文が目に留まりました。"

#. ~ Name of map extra
#: data/mods/Backrooms/map_extras.json
msgid "Red room"
msgstr "レッドルーム"

#. ~ Description of map extra "Red room"
#: data/mods/Backrooms/map_extras.json
msgid "There's a red room here."
msgstr "レッドルームがあります。"

#. ~ Name of map extra
#: data/mods/Backrooms/map_extras.json
msgid "Autodoc room"
msgstr "オートドク室"

#. ~ Description of map extra "Autodoc room"
#: data/mods/Backrooms/map_extras.json
msgid "There's an autodoc here."
msgstr "オートドクがあります。"

#. ~ MOD name
#. ~ Name of starting location "sloc_backrooms"
#: data/mods/Backrooms/modinfo.json data/mods/Backrooms/scenarios.json
msgid "The Backrooms"
msgstr "The Backrooms"

#. ~ Description of MOD "The Backrooms"
#: data/mods/Backrooms/modinfo.json
msgid ""
"A strange place between dimensions traps you.  Can you survive among endless halls of yellowed carpet and harshly humming fluorescents?\n"
"\n"
"Replaces all normal worldgen: no wilderness, no rivers, no cities, no farms, no sky.  Just endless, winding indoor halls of mildewy carpeting, faded drywall, desolate breakrooms and abandoned boardrooms.\n"
"\n"
"Recommended city size is 0.  Play Now!  (Default Scenario) is not supported."
msgstr ""
"次元の狭間にある奇妙な場所に閉じ込められてしまいました。蛍光灯のノイズが響く、黄ばんだ絨毯が敷かれたどこまでも続くホールの中で、あなたは生き残ることができるでしょうか？\n"
"\n"
"通常生成される世界から平野も、川も、都市も、農場も、空も削除され、カビ臭い絨毯、飾り気のない色褪せた壁、荒れ果てた休憩室、放置された役員室が延々と続く曲がりくねった広間に置き換えられます。\n"
"\n"
"推奨される街のサイズは0です。ぜひプレイしてみてください！既定シナリオには対応していません。"

#. ~ Overmap terrain name
#: data/mods/Backrooms/overmap_terrain.json
msgid "backroom chamber"
msgstr "バックルーム"

