#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/BombasticPerks/perks.json
msgid "Open Perk Menu"
msgstr "特典メニュー"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Open Perk Menu"
#: data/mods/BombasticPerks/perks.json
msgid "Direct access to the perk menu."
msgstr "特典メニューを直接開きます。"

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/BombasticPerks/perks.json
msgid "Stronger"
msgstr "更なる強さ"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Stronger"
#: data/mods/BombasticPerks/perks.json
msgid "Have you been working out?  +1 Strength."
msgstr "最近筋トレしてますか？筋力+1"

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/BombasticPerks/perks.json
msgid "Even Stronger"
msgstr "遥かなる強さ"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Even Stronger"
#: data/mods/BombasticPerks/perks.json
msgid "You HAVE been working out.  +2 Strength."
msgstr "完全に仕上がっています。筋力+2"

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/BombasticPerks/perks.json
msgid "Faster"
msgstr "更なる素早さ"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Faster"
#: data/mods/BombasticPerks/perks.json
msgid "Have you been doing cardio?  +1 Dexterity."
msgstr "最近有酸素運動してますか？器用+1"

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/BombasticPerks/perks.json
msgid "Even Faster"
msgstr "遥かなる素早さ"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Even Faster"
#: data/mods/BombasticPerks/perks.json
msgid "You HAVE been doing cardio.  +2 Dexterity."
msgstr "完全に有酸素運動をやり遂げています。器用+2"

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/BombasticPerks/perks.json
msgid "Smarter"
msgstr "更なる賢さ"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Smarter"
#: data/mods/BombasticPerks/perks.json
msgid "Have you been reading?  +1 Intelligence."
msgstr "最近読書してますか？知性+1"

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/BombasticPerks/perks.json
msgid "Even Smarter"
msgstr "遥かなる賢さ"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Even Smarter"
#: data/mods/BombasticPerks/perks.json
msgid "You HAVE been reading.  +2 Intelligence."
msgstr "完全に書物を読みこなしています。知性+2"

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/BombasticPerks/perks.json
msgid "Sharper"
msgstr "更なる鋭さ"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Sharper"
#: data/mods/BombasticPerks/perks.json
msgid "Have you been staring out into the middle distance?  +1 Perception."
msgstr "最近虚空を見つめてますか？感覚+1"

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/BombasticPerks/perks.json
msgid "Even Sharper"
msgstr "遥かなる鋭さ"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Even Sharper"
#: data/mods/BombasticPerks/perks.json
msgid "You HAVE been staring out into the middle distance.  +2 Perception."
msgstr "完全に虚空を見つめ切っています。感覚+2"

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/BombasticPerks/perks.json
msgid "Sight Beyond Sight"
msgstr "超感覚的知覚"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Sight Beyond Sight"
#: data/mods/BombasticPerks/perks.json
msgid ""
"You have an instinctive sense for the uncanny and unearthy.  Activate this "
"perk to close your eyes and become aware of nearby Nether creatures."
msgstr "超自然的な存在に気付く感覚を本能で身につけています。この特質を有効化すると、目を閉じて周囲にいる異界モンスターを感知します。"

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/BombasticPerks/perks.json
msgid "Mighty Thews"
msgstr "筋骨隆々"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Mighty Thews"
#: data/mods/BombasticPerks/perks.json
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Your rippling muscles enable you to split the skulls of your enemies.  +5% "
"to Lifting, Grip, and Manipulator limb scores."
msgstr "たくましい筋肉で敵の頭蓋骨をかち割ることすらできます。吊り上げ、握力、動作のスコアが5%増加します。"

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/BombasticPerks/perks.json
msgid "Pantherish Grace"
msgstr "しなやかな肉体"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Pantherish Grace"
#: data/mods/BombasticPerks/perks.json
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Your movements bring to mind a multitude of cat-based metaphors.  +5% to "
"Balance, Footing, and Reaction limb scores."
msgstr "ネコ科動物を思わせる動きを身につけています。バランス、足取り、反応のスコアが5%増加します。"

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/BombasticPerks/perks.json
msgid "Eagle Eyes"
msgstr "鋭い視力"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Eagle Eyes"
#: data/mods/BombasticPerks/perks.json
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Your sharp gazes misses little.  +25% to Vision and Night Vision limb "
"scores."
msgstr "何一つ見逃さない鋭い視力を身につけています。視界、暗所視界のスコアが25%増加します。"

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/BombasticPerks/perks.json
msgid "Holdout Pocket"
msgstr "追加ポケット"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Holdout Pocket"
#: data/mods/BombasticPerks/perks.json
msgid ""
"Never leave home without it!  You have a secret pocket no one knows about "
"that can easily store a weapon."
msgstr "これを持たずに出掛けるなんて考えられません！武器を素早く収納できる、誰も知らない秘密のポケットをもっています。"

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/BombasticPerks/perks.json
msgid "Built Tough"
msgstr "頑丈な肉体"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Built Tough"
#: data/mods/BombasticPerks/perks.json
#, no-c-format
msgid "You're like a walking tank!  Take 5% less damage from all sources."
msgstr "まるで歩く戦車です！全てのタイプの被ダメージが5%軽減されます。"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Hauler"
#: data/mods/BombasticPerks/perks.json
msgid ""
"All that hauling has paid off.  You can carry 10kg of additional items."
msgstr "日頃の運搬の苦労が報われました。所持重量上限が10kg上昇します。"

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/BombasticPerks/perks.json
msgid "Vacationer"
msgstr "バケーション"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Vacationer"
#: data/mods/BombasticPerks/perks.json
msgid ""
"Every day in the apocalypse is just like the beach.  You are more "
"comfortable in cold and warm weather."
msgstr "崩壊した世界がまるでビーチのようです。寒い日も暑い日も、より快適に過ごせます。"

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/BombasticPerks/perks.json
msgid "Gym Rat"
msgstr "ジムの常連"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Gym Rat"
#: data/mods/BombasticPerks/perks.json
msgid ""
"Your time exercising has gotten you used to being drenched in your own "
"sweat.  Being wet doesn't bother you as much anymore."
msgstr "滝のような汗を流しながら運動することにも慣れてきました。濡れ状態がそれほど気にならなくなります。"

#. ~ Mutation name
#. ~  'To have your bell rung' means to be hit on the head.
#: data/mods/BombasticPerks/perks.json
msgid "Bellringer"
msgstr "めった打ち"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Bellringer"
#: data/mods/BombasticPerks/perks.json
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"You're very good at the follow-through when your enemies are reeling.  When "
"in melee combat with an enemy that is dazed or stunned, you do +33% extra "
"bash damage."
msgstr ""
"敵がふらついているときに追撃をお見舞いするのが上手です。放心または朦朧状態の敵に近接攻撃でダメージを与えたとき、+33%の打撃ダメージを追加します。"

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/BombasticPerks/perks.json
msgid "Thick Skull"
msgstr "厚い頭蓋骨"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Thick Skull"
#: data/mods/BombasticPerks/perks.json
msgid ""
"You've taken so many blows to the head you've lost count.  You've got "
"additional skull armor."
msgstr "数えきれないほど頭を殴られ続けた成果かもしれません。頭の防御力が上昇します。"

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/BombasticPerks/perks.json
msgid "Way of the Open Palm"
msgstr "開いた掌"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Way of the Open Palm"
#: data/mods/BombasticPerks/perks.json
msgid ""
"You've dealt enough blows that your hands have callused, and your knifehand "
"strikes are sharp enough to draw blood."
msgstr "手を極限まで鍛えます。手刀が敵を出血させるほど鋭くなります。"

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/BombasticPerks/perks.json
msgid "Way of the Closed Fist"
msgstr "閉じた拳"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Way of the Closed Fist"
#: data/mods/BombasticPerks/perks.json
msgid ""
"You've dealt enough blows that your hands have callused, and your hammerfist"
" strikes are as strong as a real hammer."
msgstr "手を極限まで鍛えます。拳骨がハンマーでの打撃と同じくらい重くなります。"

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/BombasticPerks/perks.json
msgid "Way of the Pinched Fingers"
msgstr "尖った指"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Way of the Pinched Fingers"
#: data/mods/BombasticPerks/perks.json
msgid ""
"You've dealt enough blows that your hands have callused, your spearhand "
"strikes can pierce armor, and your grip can turn bolts barehanded."
msgstr "手を極限まで鍛えます。鋭い突きは槍のように装甲を貫き、握力だけでボルトも回せます。"

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/BombasticPerks/perks.json
msgid "Quickdraw"
msgstr "早撃ち"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Quickdraw"
#: data/mods/BombasticPerks/perks.json
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Practicing with handguns has improved your draw speed with pretty much "
"everything.  Retrieve objects 25% faster from containers."
msgstr "ハンドガンの早撃ちを練習しているうちに、ほとんどあらゆるものを素早く取り出せるようになりました。収納物を取り出す速度が25%向上します。"

#. ~ Mutation name
#. ~ Name of a enchantment
#: data/mods/BombasticPerks/perkdata/vengeful.json
#: data/mods/BombasticPerks/perks.json
msgid "Vengeful"
msgstr "復讐心"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Vengeful"
#: data/mods/BombasticPerks/perks.json
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Oh, they're not getting away with THAT.  You do +15% damage for two turns "
"after you're hit."
msgstr ""
"絶対に、ただでは済まさない。\n"
"\n"
"攻撃を受けた後、2ターンの間与ダメージが+15%されます。"

#. ~ Mutation name
#. ~ This is a pun, based on undying literally meaning 'does not die' but also
#. the figurative meaning of an emotion that lasts forever.
#. ~ Name of effect type id "effect_perk_undying_loyalty"
#: data/mods/BombasticPerks/perkdata/undying_loyalty.json
#: data/mods/BombasticPerks/perks.json
msgid "Undying Loyalty"
msgstr "固い献身"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Undying Loyalty"
#: data/mods/BombasticPerks/perks.json
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"You inspire your allies to protect you when you're seriously injured.  If "
"attacked when your head or torso health are at 50% or lower, all allies "
"within 15 meters will take 20% reduced damage for one minute.  This effect "
"can only trigger once every five minutes."
msgstr ""
"重傷を負ったときには、仲間を鼓舞して守ってもらいます。頭または胴の体力が50%以下の状態で攻撃を受けると、1分間にわたって周囲15mの全ての仲間の被ダメージが20%軽減されます。この効果は5分に1回しか発動しません。"

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/BombasticPerks/perks.json
msgid "Ghost"
msgstr "幽霊"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Ghost"
#: data/mods/BombasticPerks/perks.json
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"You've gotten pretty good at sneaking up on people.  When you have no allies"
" within 20 squares, enemies' vision detection range is reduced by 15%."
msgstr "忍び寄るのがかなり上手になりました。半径20タイル以内に仲間がいない状態で、敵から視認される距離が15%縮小されます。"

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/BombasticPerks/perks.json
msgid "Big Eater"
msgstr "大食い"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Big Eater"
#: data/mods/BombasticPerks/perks.json
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"You can really put it away.  You eat food 10% faster and can eat 33% more "
"food at a time."
msgstr "いくらでも平らげることができます。食事速度が10%上昇し、一度に食べられる量が33%増加します。"

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/BombasticPerks/perks.json
msgid "Tuck and Roll"
msgstr "受け身"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Tuck and Roll"
#: data/mods/BombasticPerks/perks.json
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"At some point you got really good at falling off rooftops.  Take 40% less "
"fall damage."
msgstr "屋根から飛び降りるのがとても上手になりました。落下ダメージが40%軽減されます。"

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/BombasticPerks/perks.json
msgid "Grit Your Teeth"
msgstr "歯を食いしばる"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Grit Your Teeth"
#: data/mods/BombasticPerks/perks.json
msgid ""
"When you have to you can wipe the blood off your chin, grit your teeth, and get it done.  Use to reduce your pain by 30 or half (whichever is greater) for 3 minutes.\n"
"\n"
"The cooldown on this perk scales based on your pain at the time you used it."
msgstr ""
"窮地に立たされたときも、こびりついた血を拭い、歯を食いしばり、やるべきことをこなします。有効化すると、苦痛が30、もしくは現在の値の半分(いずれか大きい方)軽減されます。\n"
"\n"
"再使用できる間隔は、使用時の苦痛の値によって変化します。"

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/BombasticPerks/perks.json
msgid "Surgical Strikes"
msgstr "寸分違わぬ一撃"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Surgical Strikes"
#: data/mods/BombasticPerks/perks.json
msgid ""
"Careful aim allows you to take down game with little tissue damage.  Enemies"
" you kill tend to stay intact."
msgstr "慎重に狙いを定め、体組織をなるべく傷つけずに対象を殺します。殺害した敵の死体が損傷せず残りやすくなります。"

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/BombasticPerks/perks.json
msgid "Bloody Mess"
msgstr "木っ端みじん"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Bloody Mess"
#: data/mods/BombasticPerks/perks.json
msgid ""
"For whatever reason you seem to always make a real mess of things.  Enemies "
"you kill tend to explode into a mess of viscera."
msgstr "何故かよく惨劇を引き起こしてしまいます。殺害した敵が頻繁に破裂してバラバラになります。"

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/BombasticPerks/perks.json
msgid "Perfect Timing"
msgstr "絶対時感"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Perfect Timing"
#: data/mods/BombasticPerks/perks.json
msgid ""
"You used to annoy your friends before the Cataclysm by always being "
"*exactly* on time and you've maintained that characteristic to this day.  "
"You always know what time it is and can set alarms even without a watch or a"
" phone."
msgstr ""
"大変動以前から、常に*時間通り*に行動して友人たちにうるさがられていましたが、今もその能力は残っています。時計や携帯電話なしでいつでも時間を正確に知覚でき、アラームすら設定できます。"

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/BombasticPerks/perks.json
msgid "Bedtime Stories"
msgstr "夜の読書習慣"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Bedtime Stories"
#: data/mods/BombasticPerks/perks.json
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"You've always loved reading, especially before you fall asleep, and have "
"gotten very good at tearing through books as a way to wind down.  You read "
"books 50% faster, but only when you read them between 8 p.m. and 1 a.m."
msgstr ""
"昔から読書が好きでしたが、特に寝る前は、気分を落ち着かせるために好んで本を読んでいました。午後8時から午前1時の間に限り、読書速度が50%上昇します。"

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/BombasticPerks/perks.json
msgid "Tingly"
msgstr "電位感知"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Tingly"
#: data/mods/BombasticPerks/perks.json
msgid ""
"Ever since the apocalypse you get a funny feeling during storms and have "
"trouble trusting small appliances.  You usually have a pretty good idea "
"where they are though."
msgstr ""
"世界の崩壊以来、荒天時には肌がヒリヒリし、小さな電化製品を信用できなくなりました。しかし、電子機器を積んだモンスターの位置を感知できるのは便利です。"

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/BombasticPerks/perks.json
msgid "Static Stockpile"
msgstr "帯電体質"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Static Stockpile"
#: data/mods/BombasticPerks/perks.json
msgid ""
"You can't touch a door without zapping yourself.  Whenever there is a "
"shocker or a robot within 15 squares, or you are outside during a storm, you"
" gain 500J of bionic power per second and your melee attacks will do a small"
" amount of extra electrical damage."
msgstr ""
"静電気を逃がさないとドアノブに触れられません。15タイルの範囲内に電撃を放つモンスター、あるいはロボットがいる場合、または嵐の天候で屋外にいる場合、毎秒500JのCBM電力を獲得し、近接攻撃に少量の電撃与ダメージが追加されます。"

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/BombasticPerks/perks.json
msgid "Jumpy"
msgstr "敏捷"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Jumpy"
#: data/mods/BombasticPerks/perks.json
msgid ""
"You've not been the same since the apocalypse, almost everything makes you "
"jump.  You are just a bit quicker to act though."
msgstr "世界の崩壊以来、あらゆるものに飛びつきたくなる衝動に駆られています。しかし、行動が素早くなったのは便利です。"

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/BombasticPerks/perks.json
msgid "Quick Recovery"
msgstr "即時復帰"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Quick Recovery"
#: data/mods/BombasticPerks/perks.json
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"You get knocked down, but you get up again.  There is a 75% chance when you "
"are downed that you will stand up again immediately."
msgstr "倒れてもすぐに立ち上がります。転倒した際に、75%の確率ですぐに体勢を立て直せます。"

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/BombasticPerks/perks.json
msgid "Easy Sleeper"
msgstr "寝つきがいい"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Easy Sleeper"
#: data/mods/BombasticPerks/perks.json
msgid ""
"You've always been able to fall asleep within a few minutes of closing your "
"eyes, no matter what else is going on around you.  You have a much easier "
"time falling asleep."
msgstr "周囲で何が起きていても、目を閉じれば数分以内に眠りに就けます。通常よりずっと簡単に眠れます。"

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/BombasticPerks/perks.json
msgid "Early to Rise"
msgstr "早起き"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Early to Rise"
#: data/mods/BombasticPerks/perks.json
msgid ""
"That health, wealth, and wisdom is coming any day now.  When you wake up "
"between 4 and 7 a.m., you gain a mood boost for that morning."
msgstr "はやく起きれば健康、富、知恵が簡単に手に入ります。午前4時から午前7時までに起床すると、その日の朝の意欲が高まります。"

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/BombasticPerks/perks.json
msgid "Duck and Weave"
msgstr "素早い回避"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Duck and Weave"
#: data/mods/BombasticPerks/perks.json
msgid ""
"Run without rhythm.  After a short wind-up period, you gain 5 effective "
"dodge and +1 bonus dodge attempt as long as you keep running."
msgstr "不規則に走りましょう。駆足状態をしばらく続けていると、回避スキルが5上昇し、回避試行数が+1追加されます。"

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/BombasticPerks/perks.json
msgid "Hobbyist"
msgstr "趣味人"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Hobbyist"
#: data/mods/BombasticPerks/perks.json
msgid ""
"No work, no social obligations, lots of time to focus on your hobbies.  You "
"feel like you've been picking up skills faster recently."
msgstr "仕事も社会的な義務もなく、趣味に没頭できる時間はたっぷりあります。最近、スキルの習得が早くなってきたように思いませんか？"

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/BombasticPerks/perks.json
msgid "Non-Combatant"
msgstr "非戦闘員"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Non-Combatant"
#: data/mods/BombasticPerks/perks.json
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Hey, that's against the Geneva Convention!  When not wielding a weapon, or "
"object that could be used as an improvised weapon, you take -25% reduced "
"damage."
msgstr "おい、それはジュネーブ条約違反だ！武器、または即席の武器として扱われるアイテムを装備していない場合、被ダメージが25%軽減されます。"

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/BombasticPerks/perks.json
msgid "Recycler"
msgstr "リサイクル"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Recycler"
#: data/mods/BombasticPerks/perks.json
msgid ""
"Even with no one around you feel obligated to clean up the streets.  You "
"find full cans of soda in the weirdest places."
msgstr "たとえ人が周りにいなくても、街をきれいにすべきだという義務感を抱いています。妙な場所に落ちている缶飲料を発見できます。"

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/BombasticPerks/perks.json
msgid "Trouble seeker"
msgstr "揉め事好き"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Trouble seeker"
#: data/mods/BombasticPerks/perks.json
msgid ""
"As if the apocalypse itself wasn't enough, you are constantly looking for "
"some trouble.  Zombies will sometimes appear out of nowhere to attack you.  "
"Fortunately, they always appear at a good distance from you.  Activate to "
"toggle."
msgstr ""
"常に揉め事を探しており、ただの大変動では物足りないと感じています。ゾンビがどこからともなく現れ、攻撃してきます。幸いなことに、常に程よい距離を保って出現してくれます。起動/停止を切り替えられます。"

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/BombasticPerks/perks.json
msgid "Hemophage"
msgstr "血液食"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Hemophage"
#: data/mods/BombasticPerks/perks.json
msgid ""
"You do not drink…wine.  You are immune to the negative consequences of "
"drinking blood, such as parasitic infection."
msgstr "その赤い液体はワイン...ではありません。寄生虫感染などの飲血による悪影響を受けません。"

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/BombasticPerks/perks.json
msgid "The Blood is the Life"
msgstr "血は命なり"

#. ~ Description of mutation "The Blood is the Life"
#: data/mods/BombasticPerks/perks.json
msgid ""
"Drinking blood makes you feel really good.  REALLY good.  So good that all "
"your aches and pains just seem to fade away.  Every time you drink blood, "
"you heal a bit of damage and lose a bit of pain."
msgstr ""
"血液を飲むと活力が漲ります。全身に力が満ちることで、肉体や精神の痛みが消え去ります。血液を飲む度に体力が少しずつ回復し、苦痛が少しずつ軽減されます。"

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/BombasticPerks/perks.json
msgid "Of sailors and spinach"
msgstr "船乗りにホウレンソウ"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Of sailors and spinach"
#: data/mods/BombasticPerks/perks.json
msgid ""
"You spent several years on the high sea and now your muscles visibly swell "
"and clench when you eat raw spinach."
msgstr "数年間外洋で暮らしていました。生のホウレンソウを食べると筋肉が目に見えて発達します。"

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/BombasticPerks/perks.json
msgid "Playing God"
msgstr "神の真似事"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Playing God"
#: data/mods/BombasticPerks/perks.json
msgid ""
"You've been dissecting critters since high school.  Last night a voice gave "
"you an idea for how to bring them back to life.  Activate the perk to gain "
"insight into the nature of life itself!"
msgstr ""
"高校時代から頻繁に生き物の解剖をしていました。ある夜、声が聞こえ、死んだ生物を生き返らせる方法を教えてもらいました。有効化すると、生命そのものの本質を究明できます！"

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/BombasticPerks/perks.json
msgid "Safety net"
msgstr "セーフティネット"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Safety net"
#: data/mods/BombasticPerks/perks.json
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"You've always felt like someone was looking out for you upstairs.  When you "
"are attacked there is a 5% chance the attack will deal no damage."
msgstr "誰かが空の上から見守ってくれているような気がします。攻撃を受けた際、5%の確率でダメージが無効化されます。"

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/BombasticPerks/perks.json
msgid "Lucky dodge"
msgstr "まぐれ回避"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Lucky dodge"
#: data/mods/BombasticPerks/perks.json
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"You have a habit of always ducking at the right time.  You have a 5% chance "
"to dodge any incoming attack."
msgstr "適切なタイミングで身をかわすことができます。5%の確率で攻撃を回避します。"

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/BombasticPerks/perks.json
msgid "Long shot"
msgstr "長距離射撃"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Long shot"
#: data/mods/BombasticPerks/perks.json
msgid ""
"You always ate your carrots, that good eyesight is paying off.  You can use "
"ranged weapons effectively up to 4 more tiles away."
msgstr "毎日ニンジンを食べていたお陰で視力が良くなり、射撃に活用できます。遠距離武器の射程が通常より4タイル延長されます。"

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/BombasticPerks/perks.json
msgid "Firstest Aid"
msgstr "特急手当"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Firstest Aid"
#: data/mods/BombasticPerks/perks.json
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"It's called \"First Aid\", right, so obviously it's better the faster you "
"apply it.  Your bandages are 50% better at stopping bleeding, but only if "
"you apply them within 2 minutes of taking damage."
msgstr ""
"「応急手当」と呼ばれているなら、速ければ速いほどいい筈です。部位にダメージを受けてから2分以内に包帯を使用した場合に限り、止血効果が50%上昇します。"

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/BombasticPerks/perks.json
msgid "Absit Invidia"
msgstr "悪よ去れ"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Absit Invidia"
#: data/mods/BombasticPerks/perks.json
msgid ""
"Your Nana told you about the evil eye and how to protect yourself when you "
"were a small child.  You don't remember her telling you the evil eye was "
"giant, disembodied, and on fire, but some of the things she taught you work "
"all the same.  You are immune to the Tainted Mind effect as long as you're "
"wearing a holy symbol necklace, and can use some salt to remove it if you do"
" acquire it."
msgstr ""
"幼い頃におばあちゃんから、邪悪な目玉の話や悪魔から身を守る方法を聞かせてもらいました。実体のない巨大な燃える目玉の話はよく覚えていませんが、魔除けの知識は今も役に立ちそうです。聖なる象徴を着用していると精神侵食の影響を受けません。塩を使用して精神侵食の影響を除去できます。"

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/BombasticPerks/perks.json
msgid "Metamagic: Quicken Spell"
msgstr "ﾒﾀﾏｼﾞｯｸ: 高速詠唱"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Metamagic: Quicken Spell"
#: data/mods/BombasticPerks/perks.json
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"You have learned to cast spells in a way that is much quicker, but also more"
" wasteful.  -95% cast time, +100% cast cost.  Can be toggled on or of by "
"activating this trait.  Does not work on spells that consumes runes."
msgstr ""
"はるかに速く無駄のないやり方で呪文を詠唱する技術を学びました。詠唱時間が95%軽減され、詠唱コストが100%増加します。特質の有効化、無効化を切り替えられます。ルーンを消費する呪文には効果がありません。"

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/BombasticPerks/perks.json
msgid "Metamagic: Widen Spell"
msgstr "ﾒﾀﾏｼﾞｯｸ: 範囲拡大"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Metamagic: Widen Spell"
#: data/mods/BombasticPerks/perks.json
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"You have learned to cast spells that affects a larger area.  +100% area of "
"effect, +50% cast cost.  Can be toggled on or of by activating this trait.  "
"Does not work on spells that consumes runes."
msgstr ""
"より広い範囲に影響を与えられるように呪文を詠唱する技術を学びました。効果範囲が100%拡大し、詠唱コストが50%増加します。特質の有効化、無効化を切り替えられます。ルーンを消費する呪文には効果がありません。"

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/BombasticPerks/perks.json
msgid "Metamagic: Reach Spell"
msgstr "ﾒﾀﾏｼﾞｯｸ: 射程延長"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Metamagic: Reach Spell"
#: data/mods/BombasticPerks/perks.json
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"You have learned to cast spells from a longer distance.  +100% reach, +50% "
"cast cost.  Can be toggled on or of by activating this trait.  Does not work"
" on spells that consumes runes."
msgstr ""
"より遠くに影響を与えられるように呪文を詠唱する技術を学びました。射程距離が100%延長され、詠唱コストが50%増加します。特質の有効化、無効化を切り替えられます。ルーンを消費する呪文には効果がありません。"

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/BombasticPerks/perks.json
msgid "Metamagic: Silent Spell"
msgstr "ﾒﾀﾏｼﾞｯｸ: 無音詠唱"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Metamagic: Silent Spell"
#: data/mods/BombasticPerks/perks.json
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"You have learned to cast spells quietly.  -100% noise, +20% cast cost, "
"ignores mouth encumbrance.  Can be toggled on or of by activating this "
"trait.  Does not work on spells that consumes runes."
msgstr ""
"音を立てずに呪文を詠唱する技術を学びました。詠唱時の音が100%軽減され、詠唱コストが20%増加します。特質の有効化、無効化を切り替えられます。ルーンを消費する呪文には効果がありません。"

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/BombasticPerks/perks.json
msgid "Metamagic: Still Spell"
msgstr "ﾒﾀﾏｼﾞｯｸ: 不動詠唱"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Metamagic: Still Spell"
#: data/mods/BombasticPerks/perks.json
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"You have learned to cast spells without moving.  +20% cast cost, ignores "
"arm, leg, and hand encumbrance.  Can cast spells while holding items.  Can "
"be toggled on or of by activating this trait.  Does not work on spells that "
"consumes runes."
msgstr ""
"身体を動かさずに呪文を詠唱する技術を学びました。腕、脚、手の動作制限が詠唱に影響しなくなり、詠唱コストが20%増加します。特質の有効化、無効化を切り替えられます。ルーンを消費する呪文には効果がありません。"

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/BombasticPerks/perks.json
msgid "Metamagic: Careful Spell"
msgstr "ﾒﾀﾏｼﾞｯｸ: 緻密詠唱"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Metamagic: Careful Spell"
#: data/mods/BombasticPerks/perks.json
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"You take your time when casting spells in order to get it right.  +200% cast"
" time, -5 difficulty.  Can be toggled on or of by activating this trait."
msgstr "時間をかけて呪文を正確に詠唱します。詠唱時間が200%増加し、難易度が-5されます。特質の有効か、無効化を切り替えられます。"

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/BombasticPerks/perks.json
msgid "Metamagic: Intuitive Spell"
msgstr "ﾒﾀﾏｼﾞｯｸ: 無心詠唱"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Metamagic: Intuitive Spell"
#: data/mods/BombasticPerks/perks.json
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Casting spells comes more naturally for you.  You don't have to think as "
"much when casting.  Focus no longer affects casting, +20% cast cost.  Can be"
" toggled on or of by activating this trait.  Only affects spells that are "
"affected by focus.  Does not work on spells that consumes runes."
msgstr ""
"より自然に、強く意識せずに呪文を詠唱する技術を学びました。集中力が詠唱に影響しなくなり、詠唱コストが20%増加します。特質の有効化、無効化を切り替えられます。ルーンを消費する呪文には効果がありません。"

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/BombasticPerks/perks.json
msgid "Crafty hands"
msgstr "職人の手"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Crafty hands"
#: data/mods/BombasticPerks/perks.json
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"You really like to do stuff with your own hands.  +10% for crafting speed."
msgstr "自らの手で何かを作り出すことが大好きです。製作速度が+10%上昇します。"

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/BombasticPerks/perks.json
msgid "Chainsmoker"
msgstr "チェーンスモーカー"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Chainsmoker"
#: data/mods/BombasticPerks/perks.json
msgid ""
"Smoking is bad, but damn it's badass.  You deal more damage and shoot more "
"accurately when you smoke."
msgstr "喫煙は健康に悪い筈なのに、体の調子が良くなっている気がします。喫煙中の与ダメージと射撃の命中精度が向上します。"

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/BombasticPerks/perks.json
msgid "Complimentary Remarks"
msgstr "褒め言葉"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Complimentary Remarks"
#: data/mods/BombasticPerks/perks.json
msgid ""
"The way you take care of the enemies is commendable, so much so that someone"
" or something seems to praise your ways of fighting.  For every kills you "
"have made, a praise may be given in the message log."
msgstr "敵に対処するとどこからともなく賞賛の声が聞こえてきます。敵を倒した際、時折メッセージログに誉め言葉が表示されます。"

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/BombasticPerks/perks.json
msgid "Empath"
msgstr "エンパス"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Empath"
#: data/mods/BombasticPerks/perks.json
msgid ""
"You've always had a passion for people, and a deep understanding of their "
"thoughts and feelings.  Now that almost everyone's dead that has to extend "
"to other things too!  When you kill a creature gain some of its abilities "
"temporarily."
msgstr ""
"他人の感情を大事にしており、思考や気分を深く理解しようと努めてきました。他人がほとんど死に絶えましたが、この能力を更に活用できるようになりました！モンスターを殺害すると、その能力の一部を一時的に得られます。"

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/BombasticPerks/perks.json
msgid "Iron arm"
msgstr "鉄腕"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Iron arm"
#: data/mods/BombasticPerks/perks.json
msgid ""
"You've always been a bit of a bull in a china shop; people used to call you "
"heavy handed but now they aren't saying much at all.  You deal extra damage "
"based on how protective your right arm is."
msgstr ""
"はた迷惑な乱暴者などと呼ばれていましたが、今はそんな文句を言う人は残っていません。右腕の着用アイテムの防御力に応じて追加ダメージを与えられます。"

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/BombasticPerks/perks.json
msgid "Skin and bones"
msgstr "骸骨人間"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Skin and bones"
#: data/mods/BombasticPerks/perks.json
msgid ""
"People always used to tell you that you should eat more.  It seems you "
"needed their reminders because you can see your bones at this point.  You "
"have skeletal armor."
msgstr "もっと食事を摂れとよく言われていましたが、気にせずにいた結果、骨が皮膚を覆うように生えてきてしまいました。全身に骨の鎧を纏っています。"

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/BombasticPerks/perks.json
msgid "Compressed Eating Window"
msgstr "忙しい食生活"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Compressed Eating Window"
#: data/mods/BombasticPerks/perks.json
msgid ""
"You're so used to squeezing all your meals into a short time that your body "
"has adapted to it.  You gain 2.5 times as many calories and vitamins from "
"any meals eaten between noon and 6 p.m., but 0 calories and vitamins for any"
" meals eaten outside that time period."
msgstr ""
"短い時間に食べ物を胃に詰め込む生活に慣れ、肉体が適応してしまいました。正午から午後6時の間の食事によって摂取できる熱量と栄養が、通常の2.5倍に増加します。それ以外の時間帯の食事では熱量と栄養を全く摂取できません。"

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/BombasticPerks/perks.json
msgid "The Great Communicator"
msgstr "THE GREAT COMMUNICATOR"

#. ~ Description of mutation "The Great Communicator"
#: data/mods/BombasticPerks/perks.json
msgid ""
"You've always had something to say about ripping apart things with "
"chainsaws.  You can swing powered blades faster."
msgstr "チェーンソーで何かを引き裂くことにこだわりがあります。刃が動力で稼働する武器をより速く振るえます。"

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/BombasticPerks/perks.json
msgid "Olde Reliables"
msgstr "古き良き品々"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Olde Reliables"
#: data/mods/BombasticPerks/perks.json
msgid ""
"You've always had a bit of a fondness for the older firearms.  Post "
"apocalypse, this has translated into a damage boost when using WWII and "
"older weapons."
msgstr "以前から古い銃器が好きでした。第二次世界大戦時やそれ以前の銃器の射撃ダメージが増加します。"

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/BombasticPerks/perks.json
msgid "Moonstruck"
msgstr "月触"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Moonstruck"
#: data/mods/BombasticPerks/perks.json
msgid ""
"You've always been greatly affected by the phases of the moon.  During a "
"full moon, you gain a +3 bonus to all stats.  During a waxing moon, you gain"
" a +1 bonus to all stats, and during a new moon, you suffer a -2 penalty to "
"all stats."
msgstr ""
"月の満ち欠けに強く影響を受けます。満月の期間中は全ての能力値に+3のボーナスを得ます。月が欠けている期間中は全ての能力値に+1のボーナスを得ます。朔の期間中は全ての能力値に-2のペナルティを受けます。"

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/BombasticPerks/perks.json
msgid "In a Crimson Mist"
msgstr "異界憎悪"

#. ~ Description of mutation "In a Crimson Mist"
#: data/mods/BombasticPerks/perks.json
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Far from being terrified or even unnerved by the creatures of the Nether, "
"their presence fills you with atavistic killing fury.  You do +35% melee "
"damage when in melee combat with Nether beings and take 15% less damage from"
" all sources, but if you attack any other target when there is a Nether-"
"beast to slay, you suffer a large penalty to your accuracy."
msgstr ""
"異界のモンスターに怯えたり不安になったりするどころか、存在を認識するだけで本能的な怒りに満たされます。異界のモンスターへの近接攻撃ダメージが35%増加し、異界のモンスターから受ける全てのダメージが15%軽減されますが、敵対している異界のモンスターが視界内にいる状況で他の標的を攻撃すると、命中率が著しく低下します。"

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/BombasticPerks/perks.json
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/fantasy_species.json
msgid "Nocturnal"
msgstr "夜行性"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Nocturnal"
#: data/mods/BombasticPerks/perks.json
msgid ""
"Darkness is your ally.  Others have merely adopted the dark, but you were "
"born in it, molded by it.  You gain +2 Perception and +1 Intelligence at "
"night, and have a much easier time sleeping during the day.  However, you "
"also suffer -2 Perception when outdoors during the day and have a harder "
"time sleeping at night."
msgstr ""
"闇が味方してくれます。単に暗闇を受け入れただけの人間と違い、暗闇の中で生まれ、暗闇によって育てられました。夜間は感覚が+\n"
"2、知性が+1増加し、日中に眠りやすくなります。その代わり、日中は感覚が-2減少し、夜間に眠りにくくなります。"

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/BombasticPerks/perks.json
msgid "Ascetic Empowerment"
msgstr "断食効果"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Ascetic Empowerment"
#: data/mods/BombasticPerks/perks.json
msgid ""
"People talk about getting a high from fasting and for you that's true on a "
"more visceral level.  You gain bonuses to all stats that scale with how "
"hungry, thirsty, and tired you are."
msgstr ""
"断食中はハイになるという話を聞きますが、それは真実だと直感的に分かります。空腹、口渇、倦怠の度合いに応じて、全ての能力値にボーナスを得ます。"

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/BombasticPerks/perks.json
msgid "Thick-blooded"
msgstr "濃い血液"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Thick-blooded"
#: data/mods/BombasticPerks/perks.json
msgid ""
"Your blood has always been thicker than most, making you lose less of it "
"when bleeding."
msgstr "体内の血液が常に濃く、通常より出血量が少なく済みます。"

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/BombasticPerks/perks.json
msgid "Armor of dreams"
msgstr "夢の鎧"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Armor of dreams"
#: data/mods/BombasticPerks/perks.json
msgid ""
"People often say that they feel safer when they sleep, but in your case you "
"are literally safer when asleep.  As long as you sleep, most attacks won't "
"injure you."
msgstr ""
"眠っているときが一番安心するという人がいますが、本当に文字通り眠っているときの方が安全に過ごせます。睡眠中はほとんどの攻撃でダメージを受けません。"

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/BombasticPerks/perks.json
msgid "Red rage"
msgstr "血の滾り"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Red rage"
#: data/mods/BombasticPerks/perks.json
msgid ""
"You hate the feeling of your blood leaking so much that it empowers you.  "
"Deal more melee damage the more you are bleeding."
msgstr "出血する感覚を嫌うあまり、出血すると逆に力が湧いてきます。出血量が多いほど近接攻撃の世ダメージが増加します。"

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/BombasticPerks/perks.json
msgid "Peer pressure"
msgstr "同調圧力"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Peer pressure"
#: data/mods/BombasticPerks/perks.json
msgid ""
"You know how to leverage your allies' presence when talking with others, "
"granting you a small boost to lying, persuading and intimidating for each "
"nearby ally."
msgstr ""
"会話する際に、自分の仲間の存在を上手く生かして有利に立ち回ります。他者との会話中、周囲にいる仲間が多いほど嘘、説得、威嚇の成功確率が上昇します。"

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/BombasticPerks/perks.json
msgid "Numb from the toxin"
msgstr "毒麻酔"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Numb from the toxin"
#: data/mods/BombasticPerks/perks.json
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Poisons tend to make you feel numb.  When poisoned, feel 80% less pain."
msgstr "毒によって感覚を麻痺させます。毒状態のとき苦痛が80%軽減されます。"

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/BombasticPerks/perks.json
msgid "Unopenable grip"
msgstr "強い握力"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Unopenable grip"
#: data/mods/BombasticPerks/perks.json
msgid ""
"After being stolen the things you held in your hands countless times, your "
"grip became strong enough to keep anything in your hands as long as you will"
" it.  Activate to toggle the ability to drop your held item."
msgstr ""
"装備アイテムをうっかり取り落とし続けた結果、手に持ったものを絶対に離さない握力を手に入れました。有効化すると、装備アイテムを掴んで離さない状態になります。"

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/BombasticPerks/perks.json
msgid "Radioactive infusion"
msgstr "放射性付与"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Radioactive infusion"
#: data/mods/BombasticPerks/perks.json
msgid ""
"You somehow learned to focus on an item to make it emit radiation forever.  "
"You still have trouble understanding how this could ever be useful, but "
"maybe you might find a use for it.  Activate to use."
msgstr ""
"どういうわけか、アイテムに力を集中させて放射性物質に変える方法を会得しました。この力がどのように役立つのか今は分かりませんが、使い道が見つかるかもしれません。有効化すると力を使います。"

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/BombasticPerks/perks.json
msgid "Speedballing"
msgstr "スピードボール"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Speedballing"
#: data/mods/BombasticPerks/perks.json
msgid ""
"You love the rush of taking different drugs at once, and now this rush is "
"much more impactful than before.  You gain +3 speed for each recreational or"
" combat-enhancing drug currently affecting you."
msgstr ""
"一度に様々な薬物を摂取して興奮するのが大好きです。その興奮は以前より遥かに強力な作用をもたらすようになりました。影響を受けている娯楽用・戦闘強化用薬物1種につき速度が+3上昇します。"

#. ~ Mutation name
#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/BombasticPerks/perkdata/flawless_memory.json
#: data/mods/BombasticPerks/perks.json
msgid "Flawless memory"
msgid_plural "Flawless memory"
msgstr[0] "超記憶"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Flawless memory"
#: data/mods/BombasticPerks/perks.json
msgid ""
"You cannot forget anything at all, ever.  This makes your skills rustproof, "
"grant you the ability to memorize books for you to read in your head later "
"and make you able to store mental images so detailled it's almost as if you "
"were taking pictures with your mind."
msgstr ""
"覚えたことは決して忘れません。スキルレベルが劣化せず、一度読んだ本は記憶して後で読むことができ、見たものは丸で写真のように非常に詳細に覚えておくことができます。"

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/BombasticPerks/perks.json
msgid "Blood of the Forge"
msgstr "血液鍛冶"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Blood of the Forge"
#: data/mods/BombasticPerks/perks.json
msgid ""
"Your blood might not be able to make weapons, but it still can make anything"
" coated with sturdier but unable to be repaired.  Activate to use."
msgstr ""
"血で武器を作ることはできませんが、血を使って武器にコーティングを施し、より頑丈にすることができます。ただし、損傷の修復はできなくなります。有効化すると能力を使います。"

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/BombasticPerks/perks.json
msgid "Stormwrought: Bird"
msgstr "嵐の変異作用: 鳥"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Stormwrought: Bird"
#. ~ Description of mutation "Stormwrought: Feline"
#. ~ Description of mutation "Stormwrought: Insect"
#. ~ Description of mutation "Stormwrought: Lupine"
#. ~ Description of mutation "Stormwrought: Plant"
#. ~ Description of mutation "Stormwrought: Spider"
#: data/mods/BombasticPerks/perks.json
msgid ""
"Exposure to portal storms and related phenomena causes your body change "
"along predictable lines.  When out in a portal storm without any protection,"
" you periodically have a chance to mutate."
msgstr ""
"ポータルの嵐やそれに類する現象に晒されると、特定の変異が引き起こされます。ポータルの嵐の天候時に屋外にいると、定期的に変異を引き起こす可能性があります。"

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/BombasticPerks/perks.json
msgid "Stormwrought: Feline"
msgstr "嵐の変異作用: ネコ"

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/BombasticPerks/perks.json
msgid "Stormwrought: Insect"
msgstr "嵐の変異作用: 虫"

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/BombasticPerks/perks.json
msgid "Stormwrought: Lupine"
msgstr "嵐の変異作用: オオカミ"

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/BombasticPerks/perks.json
msgid "Stormwrought: Plant"
msgstr "嵐の変異作用: 植物"

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/BombasticPerks/perks.json
msgid "Stormwrought: Spider"
msgstr "嵐の変異作用: クモ"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/mods/BombasticPerks/corefiles/config_menu.json
msgid "What settings would you like to modify?"
msgstr "どのような設定を変更しますか？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/mods/BombasticPerks/corefiles/config_menu.json
msgid "Notifications"
msgstr "通知"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/mods/BombasticPerks/corefiles/config_menu.json
msgid "Exp to level"
msgstr "レベル上昇に必要なEXP"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/mods/BombasticPerks/corefiles/config_menu.json
msgid "Requirements"
msgstr "前提条件"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/mods/BombasticPerks/corefiles/config_menu.json
msgid "Should the perk menu pop up on level up?"
msgstr "レベル上昇時に特典メニューを表示しますか？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#. ~ EOC option name in effect in EoC "EOC_XE_RIDDLE_20"
#. ~ Key binding name
#: data/mods/BombasticPerks/corefiles/config_menu.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/eocs/eoc_riddles.json data/raw/keybindings.json
msgid "Yes"
msgstr "Yes"

#. ~ Failure explanation for NPC dialogue response
#: data/mods/BombasticPerks/corefiles/config_menu.json
msgid "Current Setting"
msgstr "現在の設定"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#. ~ EOC option name in effect in EoC "EOC_XE_RIDDLE_20"
#. ~ Key binding name
#: data/mods/BombasticPerks/corefiles/config_menu.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/eocs/eoc_riddles.json data/raw/keybindings.json
msgid "No"
msgstr "No"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/mods/BombasticPerks/corefiles/config_menu.json
msgid ""
"Set exp required per level.  Does not affect levels already gained, or "
"current level."
msgstr "レベル上昇に必要なEXPを設定します。現在のレベルや取得済みEXPには影響しません。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/mods/BombasticPerks/corefiles/config_menu.json
msgid "None (0 exp)"
msgstr "なし(0 EXP)"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/mods/BombasticPerks/corefiles/config_menu.json
msgid "Normal (300 XP)"
msgstr "普通(300 XP)"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/mods/BombasticPerks/corefiles/config_menu.json
msgid "Large (1000 XP)"
msgstr "多量(1000 XP)"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/mods/BombasticPerks/corefiles/config_menu.json
msgid "Very Large (10000 XP)"
msgstr "膨大(10000 XP)"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/mods/BombasticPerks/corefiles/config_menu.json
msgid "Should there be requirements to get perks?"
msgstr "特典の獲得に必要な前提条件を定めますか？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/mods/BombasticPerks/corefiles/config_menu.json
msgid "Prerequisites"
msgstr "前提条件あり"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/mods/BombasticPerks/corefiles/config_menu.json
#: data/mods/BombasticPerks/corefiles/welcomemenu.json
msgid "No Prerequisites"
msgstr "前提条件なし"

#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_bombastic_perks_initialize"
#: data/mods/BombasticPerks/corefiles/core_eocs.json
msgid ""
"Bombastic Perks is loaded, configuration menu should appear.  If the mod is "
"properly loaded you should have a new mutation called \"perk menu\".  If you"
" do not, you can enable the mod manually by activating the "
"\"EOC_bombastic_perks_try_configure\" EOC in debug."
msgstr ""
"「変更 - "
"特典アンロックシステム」がロードされ、設定メニューが表示されます。MODが正しくロードされている状態では、「特典メニュー」の変異が新たに追加されます。上手くいかない場合は、デバッグメニューの「有効化"
" - 条件付効果」からEOC_bombastic_perks_try_configureを有効化することで、手動でMODを導入できます。"

#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_bombastic_perks_try_configure"
#: data/mods/BombasticPerks/corefiles/core_eocs.json
msgid ""
"Configuration menu closed, if Bombastic Perks was not properly configured "
"menu will open again in 30 seconds."
msgstr "特典の設定メニューが閉じられましたが、特典アンロックシステムMODが正しく設定されていない場合、30秒後に再度メニューが表示されます。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/mods/BombasticPerks/corefiles/welcomemenu.json
msgid ""
"Welcome to Bombastic Perks.  Once you complete this configuration, your character should receive a \"perk menu\" trait which you can use to check your EXP, level, and browse available perks.\n"
"Please configure the mod with the settings below."
msgstr ""
"特典アンロックシステムMODへようこそ。この設定を完了すると、キャラクターに「特典メニュー」の特質が付与され、EXPやレベルの確認、取得可能な特典の閲覧ができるようになります。以下の項目を設定してください。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/mods/BombasticPerks/corefiles/welcomemenu.json
msgid "Use Default Settings"
msgstr "既定の設定を使用する"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/mods/BombasticPerks/corefiles/welcomemenu.json
msgid "Customize Settings"
msgstr "設定を変更する"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/mods/BombasticPerks/corefiles/welcomemenu.json
msgid "How much experience should be required to get to the first level?"
msgstr "レベル1到達までに必要な経験値"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/mods/BombasticPerks/corefiles/welcomemenu.json
msgid "Default (100 exp)"
msgstr "既定(100 EXP)"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/mods/BombasticPerks/corefiles/welcomemenu.json
msgid "Custom Value"
msgstr "カスタム数値"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/mods/BombasticPerks/corefiles/welcomemenu.json
msgid ""
"How much more experience should be required to get to each additional level?"
msgstr "レベル上昇に必要な経験値"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/mods/BombasticPerks/corefiles/welcomemenu.json
msgid "Default (300 XP)"
msgstr "既定(300 XP)"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/mods/BombasticPerks/corefiles/welcomemenu.json
msgid "Should some perks be allowed to be locked behind prerequisites?"
msgstr "一部の特典の取得に前提条件を定めますか？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/mods/BombasticPerks/corefiles/welcomemenu.json
msgid "Prerequisites (default)"
msgstr "前提条件(既定)"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/mods/BombasticPerks/corefiles/welcomemenu.json
msgid ""
"Normal perks are considered lifestyle perks and are small bonuses to help "
"your character progress.  Playstyle perks on the other hand can vary wildly "
"in power, in some cases aren't well balanced, and will define your "
"character's playstyle.  Do you want to enable playstyle perks and if so, how"
" many perk points should they cost?"
msgstr ""
"通常の特典はライフスタイル特典と呼ばれており、キャラクターの進歩を助けるちょっとしたボーナスを得られます。一方、プレイスタイル特典は各特典に大きな差があり、キャラクターのプレイスタイルを左右します。場合によっては、ゲームバランスが悪くなる場合もあります。プレイスタイル特典を有効にしますか？有効にする場合、獲得に必要なポイントはいくつにしますか？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/mods/BombasticPerks/corefiles/welcomemenu.json
msgid "Default (4 perk points)"
msgstr "既定 (4 ポイント)"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/mods/BombasticPerks/corefiles/welcomemenu.json
msgid "Enabled, Custom Cost"
msgstr "有効、カスタムポイント"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/mods/BombasticPerks/corefiles/welcomemenu.json
msgid "Disabled"
msgstr "無効"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/mods/BombasticPerks/corefiles/welcomemenu.json
msgid ""
"You are about to enable the mod with:\n"
"First perk at: <u_val:exp_to_perk> exp.\n"
"Additional exp required per level: <u_val:exp_per_level>.\n"
"<u_val:dialogue_perks_prereq_note>\n"
"<u_val:dialogue_perks_playstyle_note>"
msgstr ""
"以下の設定でMODを有効化します:\n"
"レベル1到達に必要な経験値: <u_val:exp_to_perk> EXP\n"
"レベル上昇に必要な経験値: <u_val:exp_per_level> EXP\n"
"<u_val:dialogue_perks_prereq_note>\n"
"<u_val:dialogue_perks_playstyle_note>"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/mods/BombasticPerks/corefiles/welcomemenu.json
msgid "Confirm"
msgstr "決定"

#. ~ Please leave anything in <angle brackets> unchanged.
#. ~ Description of JSON flag "ANTI_EVIL_EYE_GEAR"
#: data/mods/BombasticPerks/perkdata/absit_invidia.json
msgid "Wearing this will protect you from the Evil Eye."
msgstr "着用すると邪視を防ぎます。"

#. ~ "description" action message of item "salt"
#: data/mods/BombasticPerks/perkdata/absit_invidia.json
msgid "Throw some salt over your shoulder."
msgstr "肩に塩をかけて邪気を払います。"

#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_PERK_ABSIT_INVIDIA_SALT"
#: data/mods/BombasticPerks/perkdata/absit_invidia.json
msgid ""
"You toss the salt over your shoulder and mutter under your breath the words "
"that you remember from your childhood."
msgstr "肩に塩をかけながら、子供の頃に覚えたまじないの言葉を呟きました。"

#. ~ Name of effect type id "effect_perk_bellringer"
#: data/mods/BombasticPerks/perkdata/bellringer.json
msgid "Bell-ringing"
msgstr "無抵抗"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Bell-ringing"
#: data/mods/BombasticPerks/perkdata/bellringer.json
msgid ""
"This is really going to hurt.  Applied to targets of the Bellringer perk."
msgstr "かなり参っています。めった打ちの対象に付与される効果です。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/BombasticPerks/perkdata/closedfist.json
#: data/mods/BombasticPerks/perkdata/openpalm.json
#: data/mods/BombasticPerks/perkdata/pinchedfingers.json
msgid "callused hands"
msgid_plural "callused hands"
msgstr[0] "鍛えられた両手"

#. ~ Description of "callused hands"
#: data/mods/BombasticPerks/perkdata/closedfist.json
msgid ""
"You've dealt so many blows your hands are rough with calluses.  The bottoms "
"of your hand can deal blows hard enough to hammer or finely crush objects."
msgstr "極限まで鍛えられ、引き締まった手です。手でハンマーのように打撃を加えたり、ものを細かく砕いたりできます。"

#. ~ Name of effect type id "effect_perk_duck_and_weave"
#: data/mods/BombasticPerks/perkdata/duck_and_weave.json
msgid "Running without Rhythm"
msgstr "不規則な駆足"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Running without Rhythm"
#: data/mods/BombasticPerks/perkdata/duck_and_weave.json
msgid ""
"You definitely won't attract the worm.  +5 effective dodge, +1 dodge "
"attempt."
msgstr "絶対に虫は寄ってきません。回避スキル+5、回避試行数+1。"

#. ~ Morale text
#: data/mods/BombasticPerks/perkdata/early_to_rise.json
msgid "Early Riser"
msgstr "早起き"

#. ~ Name of effect type id "effect_zombie"
#: data/mods/BombasticPerks/perkdata/empath.json
msgid "Zombie Empathy"
msgstr "ゾンビ共感"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Zombie Empathy"
#: data/mods/BombasticPerks/perkdata/empath.json
msgid ""
"You are really feeling for the last zombie you killed.  That must have been "
"really hard for it to die again.  Though you aren't really feeling pain "
"right now."
msgstr ""
"殺したゾンビに強い共感を抱いています。再びの死は、どれほど苦痛に満ちたものだったでしょうか。それはともかく、一時的に苦痛をまったく感じない肉体を手に入れました。"

#. ~ Apply message of effect type "Zombie Empathy"
#: data/mods/BombasticPerks/perkdata/empath.json
msgid "You feel a bit hungry for brains."
msgstr "脳みそに齧りつきたいような気がしています。"

#. ~ Decay message of effect type "Zombie Empathy"
#: data/mods/BombasticPerks/perkdata/empath.json
msgid "Brains are overrated anyways."
msgstr "脳みそに齧りつくのは止めようと思い直しました。"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Animal Empathy"
#: data/mods/BombasticPerks/perkdata/empath.json
msgid ""
"You are really feeling for the last animal you killed.  Reminds you of that "
"scene in the movie where they kill the pet, really sad stuff.  Though you "
"are feeling ready to learn to fight right now."
msgstr ""
"殺した動物に強い共感を抱いています。ペットが死んでしまう映画のワンシーンを思い出して、辛い気分になりました。それはともかく、一時的に戦い方を効率よく学べるようになりました。"

#. ~ Apply message of effect type "Animal Empathy"
#: data/mods/BombasticPerks/perkdata/empath.json
msgid "You are ready for a fight."
msgstr "戦いに身を投じる準備ができました。"

#. ~ Decay message of effect type "Animal Empathy"
#: data/mods/BombasticPerks/perkdata/empath.json
msgid "Your animal instincts dissipate."
msgstr "動物的な本能が消え去りました。"

#. ~ Name of effect type id "effect_nether"
#: data/mods/BombasticPerks/perkdata/empath.json
msgid "Nether Empathy"
msgstr "異界生物共感"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Nether Empathy"
#: data/mods/BombasticPerks/perkdata/empath.json
msgid ""
"You are really feeling for the last demon you killed.  Must be hard to die "
"when you don't truly exist.  Though you are feeling rejuvenated."
msgstr ""
"殺した異界生物に対して強い共感を抱いています。実在が疑わしい生物なんて、死ぬときはさぞ苦しかったことでしょう。それはともかく、一時的に肉体が若返ったような気分になっています。"

#. ~ Apply message of effect type "Nether Empathy"
#: data/mods/BombasticPerks/perkdata/empath.json
msgid "You feel your wounds begin to seal."
msgstr "傷が塞がり始めている気がします。"

#. ~ Decay message of effect type "Nether Empathy"
#: data/mods/BombasticPerks/perkdata/empath.json
msgid "Your regeneration ceases."
msgstr "体調が元に戻りました。"

#. ~ Name of effect type id "effect_fungus"
#: data/mods/BombasticPerks/perkdata/empath.json
msgid "Fungal Empathy"
msgstr "真菌共感"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Fungal Empathy"
#: data/mods/BombasticPerks/perkdata/empath.json
msgid ""
"You are really feeling for the last mushroom you killed.  You always hated "
"mushrooms on food, too earthy for your taste.  Though you feel like your "
"illness is gone."
msgstr ""
"殺した真菌に強い共感を抱いています。以前から、キノコを料理して食べるなんてとんでもないことだと思っていました。それはともかく、一時的に肉体の不調が気にならなくなりました。"

#. ~ Apply message of effect type "Fungal Empathy"
#: data/mods/BombasticPerks/perkdata/empath.json
msgid "You feel like something eats all the sickness inside you."
msgstr "何かが体内のあらゆる病原体を食い尽くしてくれている気がします。"

#. ~ Name of effect type id "effect_insect"
#: data/mods/BombasticPerks/perkdata/empath.json
msgid "Bug Empathy"
msgstr "虫共感"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Bug Empathy"
#: data/mods/BombasticPerks/perkdata/empath.json
msgid ""
"You are really feeling for the last bug you killed.  You always hated "
"squishing bugs, what did they ever do to you.  Though you feel like your "
"skin has hardened."
msgstr ""
"殺した虫に強い共感を抱いています。以前から、虫を潰すのが嫌でした。虫が一体何をしたと言うのでしょう。それはともかく、一時的に皮膚が硬くなった気がします。"

#. ~ Apply message of effect type "Bug Empathy"
#: data/mods/BombasticPerks/perkdata/empath.json
msgid "Your skin hardens significantly."
msgstr "皮膚が非常に硬くなりました。"

#. ~ Decay message of effect type "Bug Empathy"
#: data/mods/BombasticPerks/perkdata/empath.json
msgid "Your skin softens again."
msgstr "皮膚が元通りの柔らかさに戻りました。"

#. ~ Description of "Flawless memory"
#: data/mods/BombasticPerks/perkdata/flawless_memory.json
msgid ""
"You can remember with perfect detail everything you've ever lived, even "
"allowing you to read books and play games by remembering them."
msgstr "今までの人生の中で経験した全てのことを完璧に覚えています。記憶を辿ることによって、頭の中で読書やゲームをすることもできます。"

#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_forge_blood_check_blood" in nested
#. EOCs in effect in EoC "EOC_forge_blood_check" in nested EOCs on true
#. condition in effect in EoC "EOC_forge_blood"
#: data/mods/BombasticPerks/perkdata/forge_blood.json
msgid "You pour some of your blood on the object, imbuing it with durability."
msgstr "自分の血液をアイテムに塗り、耐久性を高めます。"

#. ~ Player message in false effect in EoC "EOC_forge_blood_check_blood" in
#. nested EOCs in effect in EoC "EOC_forge_blood_check" in nested EOCs on true
#. condition in effect in EoC "EOC_forge_blood"
#: data/mods/BombasticPerks/perkdata/forge_blood.json
msgid "You do not have enough blood to safely use this ability."
msgstr "この力を安全に使うだけの血液がありません。"

#. ~ Player message in false effect in EoC "EOC_forge_blood_check" in nested
#. EOCs on true condition in effect in EoC "EOC_forge_blood"
#: data/mods/BombasticPerks/perkdata/forge_blood.json
msgid ""
"This object is durable enough, there's no need to use your blood on it."
msgstr "このアイテムは既に十分に耐久性が高いため、血を使う必要はありません。"

#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_frankenstein_insight"
#: data/mods/BombasticPerks/perkdata/frankenstein.json
msgid "You have already mastered the art of bringing back the undead!"
msgstr "死体を蘇らせる技術を既に習得しています！"

#. ~ Player message in false effect in EoC "EOC_frankenstein_insight"
#: data/mods/BombasticPerks/perkdata/frankenstein.json
msgid ""
"With a flash of insight you now understand how to bring the dead back to "
"life!"
msgstr "死体を生き返らせる方法を思いつきました！"

#. ~ Item name
#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/BombasticPerks/perkdata/frankenstein.json
msgid "homunculus"
msgid_plural "homunculi"
msgstr[0] "ホムンクルス"

#. ~ Description of "homunculus"
#: data/mods/BombasticPerks/perkdata/frankenstein.json
msgid ""
"A stitched together monstrosity of meat and bone, with limbs as wide as "
"trash cans.  This one is still sleeping.  It would require a master's touch "
"to bring it to life."
msgstr "手足がゴミ箱のように太い、肉と骨を縫い合わせて作った怪物です。まだ眠っており、命を吹き込むには熟練の技が必要です。"

#. ~ Description of monster "homunculus"
#: data/mods/BombasticPerks/perkdata/frankenstein.json
msgid ""
"A stitched together monstrosity of meat and bone, with limbs as wide as "
"trash cans."
msgstr "手足がゴミ箱のように太い、肉と骨を縫い合わせて作った怪物です。"

#. ~ Player message in false effect in EoC "EOC_PERK_GRIT_YOUR_TEETH"
#: data/mods/BombasticPerks/perkdata/grit_your_teeth.json
msgid ""
"You need more time to collect yourself before you can grit your teeth again."
msgstr "再び歯を食いしばるには、しばらく心を落ち着ける必要があります。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/BombasticPerks/perkdata/holdout_pocket.json
msgid "holdout pocket"
msgid_plural "holdout pocket"
msgstr[0] "追加ポケット"

#. ~ Description of "holdout pocket"
#: data/mods/BombasticPerks/perkdata/holdout_pocket.json
msgid "A secret pocket no one knows about that can easily store a weapon."
msgstr "武器を素早く収納できる、誰も知らない秘密のポケットです。"

#. ~ Name of effect type id "effect_perk_moonstruck_full"
#: data/mods/BombasticPerks/perkdata/moonstruck.json
msgid "Moonstruck: Full Moon"
msgstr "月触: 満月"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Moonstruck: Full Moon"
#: data/mods/BombasticPerks/perkdata/moonstruck.json
msgid ""
"Under the clear light of the full moon, you have unlocked your greatest "
"potential."
msgstr "満月の澄んだ光を浴び、最大限の可能性を解き放ちました。"

#. ~ Name of effect type id "effect_perk_moonstruck_waxing"
#: data/mods/BombasticPerks/perkdata/moonstruck.json
msgid "Moonstruck: Waxing Moon"
msgstr "月触: 欠月"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Moonstruck: Waxing Moon"
#: data/mods/BombasticPerks/perkdata/moonstruck.json
msgid "The silver light of the waxing moon enhances your prowess."
msgstr "銀色に輝く欠けた月の光を浴び、力が込み上げてきました。"

#. ~ Name of effect type id "effect_perk_moonstruck_new"
#: data/mods/BombasticPerks/perkdata/moonstruck.json
msgid "Moonstruck: New Moon"
msgstr "月触: 朔月"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Moonstruck: New Moon"
#: data/mods/BombasticPerks/perkdata/moonstruck.json
msgid "In the dark of the moon, you feel your vital essence weaken."
msgstr "暗い月によって力が弱まりました。"

