msgstr "金満傭兵"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Money Makin' Mercenary"
#: data/mods/Defense_Mode/mod_interactions/BombasticPerks/perks.json
msgid ""
"You've always had a knack for finding the value in life, whether it's $200 "
"or $50 for a life.  You get more money from completing hordes."
msgstr "命の価値が200ドルだろうが50ドルだろうが、とにかくよく稼ぐコツを心得ています。群れを全滅させた際により多くの金銭を得られます。"

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Defense_Mode/mod_interactions/BombasticPerks/perks.json
msgid "Slice n' Dice"
msgstr "みじん切り"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Slice n' Dice"
#: data/mods/Defense_Mode/mod_interactions/BombasticPerks/perks.json
msgid ""
"You've become very skilled with cutting weapons of all sorts, and know how "
"to use them better."
msgstr "あらゆる種類の斬撃武器の扱いに長けており、より上手く活用する方法を心得ています。"

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Defense_Mode/mod_interactions/BombasticPerks/perks.json
msgid "Bash n' Mash"
msgstr "たこ殴り"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Bash n' Mash"
#: data/mods/Defense_Mode/mod_interactions/BombasticPerks/perks.json
msgid ""
"You've become very skilled with blunt instruments of all sorts, and know how"
" to use them better."
msgstr "あらゆる種類の打撃武器の扱いに長けており、より上手く活用する方法を心得ています。"

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Defense_Mode/mod_interactions/BombasticPerks/perks.json
