msgid ""
"This heavily armored four legged dinosaur corpse has a beak and large bony "
"plates covering the back.  Its eyes ooze black, putrid tears."
msgstr "くちばしと、背中を覆う大きな骨板をもつ、重装甲の四足歩行恐竜のゾンビです。目元に黒い液体が涙のように滲んでいます。"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/DinoMod/monsters/zed-dinosaur.json
