msgid_plural "panoplosaurus zombies"
msgstr[0] "ゾンビパノプロサウルス"

#. ~ Description of monster "panoplosaurus zombie"
#: data/mods/DinoMod/monsters/zed-dinosaur.json
msgid ""
"This heavily armored four legged dinosaur corpse has a lumpy armored head "
"with a beak and thick plates protecting the cheeks, thick back armor, and "
"small short spikes along the sides.  Its eyes ooze black, putrid tears."
msgstr ""
"くちばしと、特に頬を厳重に覆う頭部装甲、厚い背中の装甲、側面から生えた小さく短い棘をもつ、重装甲の四足歩行恐竜のゾンビです。目元に黒い液体が涙のように滲んでいます。"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/DinoMod/monsters/zed-dinosaur.json
msgid "edmontonia zombie"
msgid_plural "edmontonia zombies"
msgstr[0] "ゾンビエドモントニア"

#. ~ Description of monster "edmontonia zombie"
#: data/mods/DinoMod/monsters/zed-dinosaur.json
msgid ""
"This heavily-armored dinosaur corpse is covered with small ridged bony "
"plates with long, bony spikes.  Its eyes ooze black, putrid tears."
msgstr "小さな骨板と長い骨の棘が生えた分厚い装甲をもつ恐竜のゾンビです。目元に黒い液体が涙のように滲んでいます。"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/DinoMod/monsters/zed-dinosaur.json
