msgid "skeletal anzu brute"
msgid_plural "skeletal anzu brutes"
msgstr[0] "凶暴骸骨ゾンビアンズー"

#. ~ Description of monster "skeletal anzu brute"
#: data/mods/DinoMod/monsters/zinosaur_upgrade.json
msgid ""
"Distorted outgrowths of calcified bone plates cover this dinosaur's rotting "
"flesh, long neck and beak.  Joints and cracks around its body ooze with "
"black goo."
msgstr ""
"恐竜の腐った皮膚と長い首やくちばしの表面を、石灰化し歪んだ骨の装甲が覆っています。関節部にはヒビが入り、そこから黒い粘液が染み出しています。"

#. ~ Description of monster "skeletal beaked juggernaut"
#: data/mods/DinoMod/monsters/zinosaur_upgrade.json
msgid ""
"This hideous colossus of plated bones and misshapen flesh drags its heavy, "
"pointed limbs behind it.  Already strong and dangerous, bones grew around "
"its form to protect it - only, they kept growing.  The shape and twisting "
"beak suggest some kind of two legged beaked dinosaur."
msgstr ""
"骨の鎧と歪に膨れ上がった肉でできた恐ろしい巨体が、鋭く尖った重厚な四肢を引きずって歩いています。このままでも十分に危険な存在ですが、骨の鎧は今も成長を続けています。体格と歪んだくちばしから、恐らく二足歩行恐竜の一種だったことが分かります。"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/DinoMod/monsters/zinosaur_upgrade.json
msgid "skeletal dromaeosaurid brute"
msgid_plural "skeletal dromaeosaurid brutes"
msgstr[0] "凶暴骸骨ゾンビユタラプトル"

#. ~ Description of monster "skeletal dromaeosaurid brute"
#: data/mods/DinoMod/monsters/zinosaur_upgrade.json
msgid ""
"Distorted outgrowths of calcified bone plates cover this dinosaur's rotting "
"flesh, claws, and sharp teeth.  Joints and cracks around its body ooze with "
"black goo."
msgstr "恐竜の腐った皮膚と爪、鋭い歯列の表面を、石灰化し歪んだ骨の装甲が覆っています。関節部にはヒビが入り、そこから黒い粘液が染み出しています。"

#. ~ Description of monster "skeletal theropod juggernaut"
#: data/mods/DinoMod/monsters/zinosaur_upgrade.json
msgid ""
"This hideous colossus of plated bones and misshapen flesh drags its heavy, "
"pointed limbs behind it.  Already strong and dangerous, bones grew around "
"its form to protect it - only, they kept growing.  The shape and twisting "
"claws and sharp teeth suggest some kind of two legged dinosaur."
msgstr ""
"骨の鎧と歪に膨れ上がった肉でできた恐ろしい巨体が、鋭く尖った重厚な四肢を引きずって歩いています。このままでも十分に危険な存在ですが、骨の鎧は今も成長を続けています。体格と尖った爪や歯から、恐らく二足歩行恐竜の一種だったことが分かります。"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/DinoMod/monsters/zinosaur_upgrade.json
msgid "skeletal thescelosaurus brute"
msgid_plural "skeletal thescelosaurus brutes"
msgstr[0] "凶暴骸骨ゾンビテスケロサウルス"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/DinoMod/monsters/zinosaur_upgrade.json
msgid "dilophosaurus acidic zombie"
msgid_plural "dilophosaurus acidic zombies"
msgstr[0] "強酸ゾンビディロフォサウルス"

#. ~ Description of monster "dilophosaurus acidic zombie"
#: data/mods/DinoMod/monsters/zinosaur_upgrade.json
msgid ""
"The shuffling corpse of a dinosaur with sharp teeth and two prominent bony "
"crests on its head, with ragged strips of ripped flesh hanging down like a "
"frill.  Sticky yellow fluid oozes out from sores in the scales."
msgstr ""
"脚を引きずって歩く恐竜のゾンビです。鋭い牙が生えており、頭部には特徴的な骨ばった2つのとさかがあります。傷ついた身体から肉片がフリルのように垂れ下がっています。裂けた鱗の隙間から粘つく黄色い液体が滲み出ています。"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/DinoMod/monsters/zinosaur_upgrade.json
msgid "ceratosaurus acidic zombie"
msgid_plural "ceratosaurus acidic zombies"
msgstr[0] "強酸ゾンビケラトサウルス"

#. ~ Description of monster "ceratosaurus acidic zombie"
#: data/mods/DinoMod/monsters/zinosaur_upgrade.json
msgid ""
"This zombie is enormous, scaly, and studded with bony spikes.  Sticky yellow"
" fluid oozes out from sores in the scales."
msgstr "鱗で覆われた皮膚のあちこちから骨の棘が生えた、巨大な恐竜のゾンビです。裂けた鱗の隙間から粘つく黄色い液体が滲み出ています。"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "TYRANT"
#: data/mods/DinoMod/mutations/dreams.json
msgid "You dream of a strange jungle with giant ferns."
msgstr "巨大なシダが生い茂る奇妙なジャングルの夢を見ました。"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "TYRANT"
#: data/mods/DinoMod/mutations/dreams.json
msgid "Dreams of being the king are all you can remember."
msgstr "王になる夢を見ました。その他の内容は何も覚えていません。"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "TYRANT"
#: data/mods/DinoMod/mutations/dreams.json
msgid ""
"You brush through tree sized ferns as you hunt for your prey.  The rain "
"falls slick upon your skin."
msgstr "夢の中で狩りをしていました。樹木と見紛うシダが身体を撫で、降り注ぐ雨が皮膚を滑り落ちていきます。"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "TYRANT"
#: data/mods/DinoMod/mutations/dreams.json
msgid "Thunderous footsteps shake the earth, are they yours?"
msgstr "雷鳴のような轟音が大地を揺さぶる夢を見ました。これは自分の足音でしょうか？"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "TYRANT"
#: data/mods/DinoMod/mutations/dreams.json
msgid "Your teeth, how do you have so many teeth?  Am I growing extra teeth?"
msgstr "夢で感じた自分の口の中には、どうしてこれほど大量の歯があるのでしょうか？余分な歯が生えたのでしょうか？"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "TYRANT"
#: data/mods/DinoMod/mutations/dreams.json
msgid "The hairless apes around you smell like food.  Are they?"
msgstr "美味しそうな匂いがする毛の無いサルの夢を見ました。現実でもひょっとすると？"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "TYRANT"
#: data/mods/DinoMod/mutations/dreams.json
msgid "So close, you can taste the rebirth of a glorious past."
msgstr "輝かしい過去をもうすぐ取り戻せそうな気がします。"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "TYRANT"
#: data/mods/DinoMod/mutations/dreams.json
msgid "King, nay not a king.  A god among beasts."
msgstr "夢の中で獣の王、いや、そんなものでは足りません。獣の神になりました。"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "STEGO"
#: data/mods/DinoMod/mutations/dreams.json
msgid "The warm sun upon your skin.  A heavier air, golden dreams."
msgstr "暖かな日光を肌に感じる夢を見ました。空気は濃く、幸せな気分です。"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "STEGO"
#. ~ Dream of mutation category "HORNS"
#: data/mods/DinoMod/mutations/dreams.json
msgid "You dream of eating the largest fern you've ever seen."
msgstr "今まで見た中で一番大きなシダの葉を食べる夢を見ました。"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "STEGO"
#: data/mods/DinoMod/mutations/dreams.json
msgid ""
"Large, you are becoming larger every day.  Armored skin, to protect you from"
" the world.  These are the gifts you are receiving."
msgstr "日に日に大きく育つ夢を見ました。皮膚は世界から肉体を守る装甲になっており、素晴らしい力を手に入れたと感じました。"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "STEGO"
#: data/mods/DinoMod/mutations/dreams.json
msgid ""
"You dream of before the Cataclysm, but you are different somehow.  The other"
" humans all seem so soft to you."
msgstr "大変動以前の世界の夢を見ましたが、何か違和感があります。他の人々は皆、とても柔らかそうに見えます。"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "STEGO"
#: data/mods/DinoMod/mutations/dreams.json
msgid ""
"Slower, trudging through the universe, you cease to notice those that try to"
" stop you as you walk through them."
msgstr "妨害しようとする者たちを気にすることなく、のんびりと世界を歩き回る夢を見ました。"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "STEGO"
#. ~ Dream of mutation category "HORNS"
#: data/mods/DinoMod/mutations/dreams.json
msgid "Why is this world so cold compared to the one in your dreams?"
msgstr "夢の中の世界と比べて、この世界はどうしてこんなに寒いのでしょうか？"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "STEGO"
#: data/mods/DinoMod/mutations/dreams.json
msgid ""
"Is this how superman feels?  Bulletproof?  But superman is much faster than "
"you."
msgstr ""
"夢の中で感じたのは、スーパーマンになった気分でしょうか？しかし、いくら皮膚が防弾仕様とはいえ、スーパーマンのように素早くは動けませんでした。"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "STEGO"
#: data/mods/DinoMod/mutations/dreams.json
msgid "Nothing less than an asteroid can kill you."
msgstr "夢の中で、隕石でも降ってこない限り誰にも殺されないだろうと感じました。"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "HORNS"
#: data/mods/DinoMod/mutations/dreams.json
msgid "The warm sun upon your skin after escaping from a hard shell."
msgstr "硬い殻を破って肌に暖かい太陽の光を浴びる夢を見ました。"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "HORNS"
#: data/mods/DinoMod/mutations/dreams.json
msgid ""
"Large, you are becoming larger every day.  Majestic horns, to protect you "
"from the world and show your power.  These are the gifts you are receiving."
msgstr "日に日に大きく育つ夢を見ました。雄大な角は肉体を守る防具にも、力を示す武器にもなります。素晴らしいものを手に入れたと感じました。"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "HORNS"
#: data/mods/DinoMod/mutations/dreams.json
msgid ""
"You dream of before the Cataclysm, but you are different somehow.  The other"
" humans all seem so flat and weak to you."
msgstr "大変動以前の世界の夢を見ましたが、何か違和感があります。他の人々は皆、尖っておらず弱そうに見えます。"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "HORNS"
#: data/mods/DinoMod/mutations/dreams.json
msgid ""
"Wandering peacefully through the woods with your family, easily knocking "
"down anything in your path, fearing nothing."
msgstr "夢の中で、家族と共に森の中を楽しく散策し、行く手を阻むものをたやすくなぎ倒していました。怖いものなど何もありません。"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "HORNS"
#: data/mods/DinoMod/mutations/dreams.json
msgid ""
"Giant teeth come down on you, finding horns.  The screaming and blood is not"
" yours."
msgstr "夢の中で巨大な牙が襲い掛かってきましたが、角に気付いていなかったようです。周囲は敵の悲鳴と血で満たされています。"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "HORNS"
#: data/mods/DinoMod/mutations/dreams.json
msgid ""
"While you are not the most feared, your majestic horns and powerful herd "
"command respect."
msgstr "夢の中で、最も恐れられているわけではないものの、雄大な角と力強い群れによって敬われる存在になっていました。"

#. ~ Mutation class name
#: data/mods/DinoMod/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Tyrant"
msgstr "ティラノサウルス"

#. ~ "mutagen_message" of mutation class "Tyrant"
#: data/mods/DinoMod/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "You feel additional teeth working their way into your mouth."
msgstr "余分な歯が口の中に生えてきた気がします。"

#. ~ Memorial message of mutation class "Tyrant" for male
#: data/mods/DinoMod/mutations/mutations.json
msgctxt "memorial_male"
msgid "Struck by a rogue asteroid."
msgstr "はぐれ小惑星に吹っ飛ばされてきました。"

#. ~ Memorial message of mutation class "Tyrant" for female
#: data/mods/DinoMod/mutations/mutations.json
msgctxt "memorial_female"
msgid "Struck by a rogue asteroid."
msgstr "はぐれ小惑星に吹っ飛ばされてきました。"

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/DinoMod/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Tyrano Sapien"
msgstr "ティラノ・サピエンス"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Tyrano Sapien"
#: data/mods/DinoMod/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"Thunder lizard, dragon, tyrant.  All these names pale before your majesty."
msgstr "雷竜、ドラゴン、暴君。数々の異名もこの威厳の前には霞みます。"

#. ~ Mutation class name
#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/DinoMod/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Stego"
msgstr "ステゴサウルス"

#. ~ "mutagen_message" of mutation class "Stego"
#: data/mods/DinoMod/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "You feel your skin toughen.  You are the armor."
msgstr "皮膚が丈夫になった気がします。肉体こそが鎧です。"

#. ~ Memorial message of mutation class "Stego" for male
#: data/mods/DinoMod/mutations/mutations.json
msgctxt "memorial_male"
msgid "The end of an era."
msgstr "一つの時代が幕を閉じました。"

#. ~ Memorial message of mutation class "Stego" for female
#: data/mods/DinoMod/mutations/mutations.json
msgctxt "memorial_female"
msgid "The end of an era."
msgstr "一つの時代が幕を閉じました。"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Stego"
#: data/mods/DinoMod/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Slow, methodical, heavily armored.  A walking tank."
msgstr "鈍く、しかし整然とした重装甲です。まさに歩く戦車です。"

#. ~ "mutagen_message" of mutation class "Horns"
#: data/mods/DinoMod/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"You feel your face, scalp, and neck stretch and change into something "
"greater."
msgstr "顔、頭皮、首が成長し、より大きなものに変化していくのを感じます。"

#. ~ Memorial message of mutation class "Horns" for male
#: data/mods/DinoMod/mutations/mutations.json
msgctxt "memorial_male"
msgid "Got the horns."
msgstr "角を手に入れました。"

#. ~ Memorial message of mutation class "Horns" for female
#: data/mods/DinoMod/mutations/mutations.json
msgctxt "memorial_female"
msgid "Got the horns."
msgstr "角を手に入れました。"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Horns"
#: data/mods/DinoMod/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"Big, strong, fierce, brave, and a loyal friend, always leading with horns."
msgstr "大きく、強く、凄まじく、勇ましい角こそが忠実な友であり先導者です。"

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/DinoMod/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Tough-Skinned"
msgstr "硬い肌"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Tough-Skinned"
#: data/mods/DinoMod/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"Your skin is getting tougher.  Greatly improves protection against all sorts"
" of damage.  Makes you less dextrous though."
msgstr "肌が更に強靭になりました。あらゆるダメージに対する防御力が大幅に向上しましたが、手先は不器用です。"

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/DinoMod/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Diamond-Skinned"
msgstr "ダイヤモンドの肌"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Diamond-Skinned"
#: data/mods/DinoMod/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"Your skin is developing Kevlar-like qualities.  Makes you slower though, and"
" is rather cumbersome."
msgstr "皮膚がケブラーのように頑丈ですが、動きが鈍く、細かい操作が困難になります。"

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/DinoMod/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Apatosaurus Back"
msgstr "アパトサウルスの体格"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Apatosaurus Back"
#: data/mods/DinoMod/mutations/mutations.json
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"You are capable of carrying inhuman amounts - more than others with similar "
"strength could.  Your maximum weight carried is increased by 70%."
msgstr "同程度の筋力を持つ人よりも、ありえないほど大量の物を持ち運べます。最大所持重量が70%増加します。"

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/DinoMod/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Serrated Teeth"
msgstr "鋸歯"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Serrated Teeth"
#: data/mods/DinoMod/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"Your mouth has reshaped to accommodate many serrated teeth.  They make it "
"impossible to wear mouthgear and difficult to eat… but tear giant wounds in "
"your prey."
msgstr ""
"口の形状が変化し、大量の鋸歯が生えてきました。口にアイテムを着用できず、食べるのも困難になりますが、噛みつき攻撃によって獲物に大ダメージを与えられます。"

#. ~ Message when player with mutation "Serrated Teeth" attacks
#: data/mods/DinoMod/mutations/mutations.json
#, c-format
msgid "You tear into %s with your serrated teeth!"
msgstr "ギザギザの歯で%sを引き裂きました！"

#. ~ Message when NPC with mutation "Serrated Teeth" attacks
#: data/mods/DinoMod/mutations/mutations.json
#, c-format
msgid "%1$s tears into %2$s with their serrated teeth!"
msgstr "%1$sはギザギザの歯で%2$sを引き裂きました！"

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/DinoMod/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Triceratops Horns"
msgstr "トリケラトプスの角"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Triceratops Horns"
#: data/mods/DinoMod/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"You have three long, pointed horns, like those of a triceratops.  They allow"
" you to make a strong piercing headbutt attack, but prevent wearing headwear"
" that is not made of fabric."
msgstr ""
"トリケラトプスのような長く鋭い三本角が生えています。攻撃時、稀に強力な刺突属性の頭突きを繰り出します。頭に布製以外のアイテムを着用できません。"

#. ~ Message when player with mutation "Triceratops Horns" attacks
#: data/mods/DinoMod/mutations/mutations.json
#, c-format
msgid "You stab %s with your three pointed horns!"
msgstr "鋭い三本角で%sを突き刺しました！"

#. ~ Message when NPC with mutation "Triceratops Horns" attacks
#: data/mods/DinoMod/mutations/mutations.json
#, c-format
msgid "%1$s stabs %2$s with their three pointed horns!"
msgstr "%1$sは鋭い三本角で%2$sを突き刺しました！"

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/DinoMod/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Horned Tail"
msgstr "棘付きの尾"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Horned Tail"
#: data/mods/DinoMod/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"You have a long, thick, tail with sharp pointed horns.  It helps you balance"
" a bit but also makes a heavy bludgeon.  Prevents wearing non-fabric pants."
msgstr ""
"先端に鋭い棘が付いた、トカゲのような長くて太い尻尾が生えています。身体のバランスを多少補助し、重い棍棒にもなります。布製以外のアイテムを脚に着用できません。"

#. ~ Message when player with mutation "Horned Tail" attacks
#. ~ Message when player with mutation "Dragon Tail" attacks
#: data/mods/DinoMod/mutations/mutations.json
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/mutations.json
#, c-format
msgid "You smash %s with your tail!"
msgstr "尾で%sを砕きました！"

#. ~ Message when NPC with mutation "Horned Tail" attacks
#. ~ Message when NPC with mutation "Dragon Tail" attacks
#: data/mods/DinoMod/mutations/mutations.json
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/mutations.json
#, c-format
msgid "%1$s smashes %2$s with their tail!"
msgstr "%1$sは尾で%2$sを砕きました！"

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/DinoMod/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Pack Leader"
msgstr "群れのボス"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Pack Leader"
#: data/mods/DinoMod/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"Puny as they may seem, a leader needs a pack, and some of those hairless "
"bipeds may yet prove some worth.  You gain combat skills at an elevated "
"rate, and maintain a level of critical thinking that supports cooperation."
msgstr ""
"群れを率いるには仲間が必要です。ひ弱な二足歩行の毛無しザルにも使い道があるかもしれません。戦闘スキルが効率的に上昇し、批判的思考によって協調性を維持しています。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/DinoMod/obsolete/egg.json
msgid "mosasaurus egg"
msgid_plural "mosasaurus eggs"
msgstr[0] "卵(モササウルス)"

#. ~ Overmap terrain name
#: data/mods/DinoMod/obsolete/fieldoffice.json
msgid "wildlife field office"
msgstr "鳥獣保護センター"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/DinoMod/obsolete/monsters.json
msgid "Dimorphodon zombie"
msgid_plural "Dimorphodon zombie"
msgstr[0] "ゾンビディモルフォドン"

#. ~ Description of monster "Dimorphodon zombie"
#: data/mods/DinoMod/obsolete/monsters.json
msgid ""
"The raggedly flying corpse  of a feathered reptile over three feet long, "
"with short wings and a big colorful beak."
msgstr "全長約90cmの翼をもつ、羽毛がボロボロになった飛行爬虫類のゾンビです。短い翼と大きく色鮮やかなくちばしを持っています。"

#. ~ Description of monster "Winged Horror"
#: data/mods/DinoMod/obsolete/monsters.json
msgid ""
"The flying corpse of a feathered reptile over three feet long, with short "
"wings and a big colorful beak.  Its entire body bulges with distended "
"muscles and swollen, festering wounds."
msgstr ""
"全長約90cmを超える翼をもつ、羽毛がボロボロになった飛行爬虫類のゾンビです。短い翼と大きく色鮮やかなくちばしを持っています。発達した全身の筋肉と化膿で膨れ上がった傷口によって、非常に大柄に見えます。"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/DinoMod/obsolete/monsters.json
msgid "Dimorphozombie bio-operator"
msgid_plural "Dimorphozombie bio-operators"
msgstr[0] "改造兵ゾンビディモルフォドン"

#. ~ Description of monster "Dimorphozombie bio-operator"
#: data/mods/DinoMod/obsolete/monsters.json
msgid ""
"The raggedly flying corpse of a feathered reptile, with short wings and a "
"colorful glowing beak.  It has been implanted with crackling bionics and is "
"dripping black goo."
msgstr ""
"短い翼を使ってフラフラと飛んでいる、くちばしが鮮やかに光る恐竜のゾンビです。生体部品がパチパチと音を立てており、あちこちから黒い粘液が垂れています。"

#. ~ Name of map extra
#: data/mods/DinoMod/overmap/map_extras.json
msgid "achelousaurus nest"
msgstr "アケロウサウルスの巣"

#. ~ Description of map extra "achelousaurus nest"
#: data/mods/DinoMod/overmap/map_extras.json
msgid "An achelousaurus nest."
msgstr "アケロウサウルスの巣です。"

#. ~ Name of map extra
#: data/mods/DinoMod/overmap/map_extras.json
msgid "acrocanthosaurus nest"
