"A signal flare grenade cartridge.  It will burn brightly for up to a minute,"
" and will also leave a streak of smoke cover in its wake."
msgstr "信号擲弾です。発射後1分程明るく燃え上がり、その軌跡に煙の筋を残します。"

#. ~ Item name
