#. ~ Description of profession "Pizza Delivery Boy" for male
#: data/mods/Isolation-Protocol/Player/profession.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"A late night delivery to a lonely building, a cry for help from under the "
"elevator, and a terrible conspiracy.  You are not drunk enough for this."
msgstr ""
"人里離れた施設への深夜の配達、エレベーターの下から聞こえる足す声を求める叫び声、そして恐るべき陰謀。そこまで酔っ払ってはいない筈なのですが。"

#. ~ Description of profession "Pizza Delivery Girl" for female
#: data/mods/Isolation-Protocol/Player/profession.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"A late night delivery to a lonely building, a cry for help from under the "
"elevator, and a terrible conspiracy.  You are not drunk enough for this."
msgstr ""
"人里離れた施設への深夜の配達、エレベーターの下から聞こえる足す声を求める叫び声、そして恐るべき陰謀。そこまで酔っ払ってはいない筈なのですが。"

#. ~ Description of profession "Police Officer" for male
#: data/mods/Isolation-Protocol/Player/profession.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"A small-town deputy who got the call and was ready to come to the rescue.  "
"If only you'd known what you were getting into…"
msgstr ""
"通報を受けて救助に向かう手はずを整えた、小さな街の保安官補です。自分が何に巻き込まれたのか分かっていれば、こんなことにならなかったのですが..."

#. ~ Description of profession "Police Officer" for female
#: data/mods/Isolation-Protocol/Player/profession.json
