msgid "Mutant Bilateral Amputee"
msgstr "変異した両腕欠損者"

#. ~ Profession name for female
#: data/mods/Limb_WIP/professions.json
msgctxt "profession_female"
msgid "Mutant Bilateral Amputee"
msgstr "変異した両腕欠損者"

#. ~ Profession name for male
#: data/mods/Limb_WIP/professions.json
msgctxt "profession_male"
msgid "Mutant Quadruple Amputee"
msgstr "変異した四肢欠損者"

#. ~ Profession name for female
#: data/mods/Limb_WIP/professions.json
msgctxt "profession_female"
msgid "Mutant Quadruple Amputee"
msgstr "変異した四肢欠損者"

#. ~ Profession name for male
#: data/mods/Limb_WIP/professions.json
msgctxt "profession_male"
msgid "Para-Amputee"
msgstr "両脚欠損者"

#. ~ Description of profession "Para-Amputee" for male
#: data/mods/Limb_WIP/professions.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"By some unfortunate means, you have lost both of your legs.  Since then, you"
" have learned to live with your disability and have adapted around it very "
"well, living a normal life.  Even if society has collapsed, so long as "
"you've got your trusty wheelchair, you'll be alright."
msgstr ""
"不運にも両脚を失って以来、障害と共に生きることを学び、障害に上手く適応しながら普通の生活を送っています。社会が崩壊しても、頼れる車椅子があればきっと大丈夫です。"

#. ~ Profession name for female
#: data/mods/Limb_WIP/professions.json
msgctxt "profession_female"
msgid "Para-Amputee"
msgstr "両脚欠損者"

#. ~ Description of profession "Para-Amputee" for female
#: data/mods/Limb_WIP/professions.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"By some unfortunate means, you have lost both of your legs.  Since then, you"
" have learned to live with your disability and have adapted around it very "
"well, living a normal life.  Even if society has collapsed, so long as "
"you've got your trusty wheelchair, you'll be alright."
msgstr ""
"不運にも両脚を失って以来、障害と共に生きることを学び、障害に上手く適応しながら普通の生活を送っています。社会が崩壊しても、頼れる車椅子があればきっと大丈夫です。"

#. ~ Profession name for male
#: data/mods/Limb_WIP/professions.json
msgctxt "profession_male"
msgid "Bilateral Amputee"
msgstr "両腕欠損者"

#. ~ Description of profession "Bilateral Amputee" for male
#: data/mods/Limb_WIP/professions.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"By some unfortunate means, you have lost both of your arms.  Since then, you"
" have learned to live with your disability and have adapted around it very "
"well, living a normal life.  You only need your legs to kick somebody's ass,"
" if it comes down to it."
msgstr ""
"不運にも両腕を失って以来、障害と共に生きることを学び、障害に上手く適応しながら普通の生活を送っています。とりあえず脚さえあれば、敵を蹴っ飛ばすことはできます。"

#. ~ Profession name for female
#: data/mods/Limb_WIP/professions.json
msgctxt "profession_female"
msgid "Bilateral Amputee"
msgstr "両腕欠損者"

#. ~ Description of profession "Bilateral Amputee" for female
#: data/mods/Limb_WIP/professions.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"By some unfortunate means, you have lost both of your arms.  Since then, you"
" have learned to live with your disability and have adapted around it very "
"well, living a normal life.  You only need your legs to kick somebody's ass,"
" if it comes down to it."
msgstr ""
"不運にも両腕を失って以来、障害と共に生きることを学び、障害に上手く適応しながら普通の生活を送っています。とりあえず脚さえあれば、敵を蹴っ飛ばすことはできます。"

#. ~ Profession name for male
#: data/mods/Limb_WIP/professions.json
msgctxt "profession_male"
msgid "Quadruple Amputee"
msgstr "四肢欠損者"

#. ~ Description of profession "Quadruple Amputee" for male
#: data/mods/Limb_WIP/professions.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"By some unfortunate means, you have lost all of your limbs.  Since then, you"
" have learned to live with your disability and have adapted around it very "
"well, living a relatively normal life with a bit of help.  What are you "
"going to do now that all the doctors are dead?"
msgstr ""
"不運にも両腕と両脚を失って以来、障害と共に生きることを学び、障害に上手く適応し多少の援助を受けながら普通の生活を送っています。医者が全員死んでしまったら、これからどうすればいいのでしょうか？"

