#. ~ Furniture name
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/furniture.json
msgid "Translocator Gate"
msgstr "転移ゲート"

#. ~ Description of furniture "Translocator Gate"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/furniture.json
msgid ""
"A gate for translocation.  Cast the translocation spell or use a "
"translocator to choose this gate as a destination."
msgstr "転移用のゲートです。転移に関する呪文を詠唱するか転移装置を使用すれば、このゲートを目的地として転移できます。"

#. ~ Furniture name
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/furniture.json
msgid "Magic Circle"
msgstr "魔法陣"

#. ~ Description of furniture "Magic Circle"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/furniture.json
msgid ""
"This is a rough magic circle, carved into the ground and decorated with "
"blood, candles, and other small knick-knacks."
msgstr "地面に刻まれた荒い作りの魔法陣は、血やろうそく、その他の小物類で彩られています。"

#. ~ Description of furniture "Magic Circle"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/furniture.json
msgid ""
"This is a rough magic circle, carved into the ground and decorated with "
"blood, candles, and other small knick-knacks.  It has been enhanced with "
"silver to channel more mana."
msgstr "地面に刻まれた荒い作りの魔法陣は、血やろうそく、その他の小物類で彩られています。銀で強化されており、より多くのマナと繋がることができます。"

#. ~ Furniture name
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/furniture.json
msgid "large glowing boulder"
msgstr "輝く大岩"

#. ~ Description of furniture "large glowing boulder"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/furniture.json
msgid "Something about this doesn't look right."
msgstr "この岩は何かが普通ではない気がします。"

#. ~ Furniture name
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/furniture.json
msgid "enchanter's workbench"
msgstr "魔法の作業台"

#. ~ Description of furniture "enchanter's workbench"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/furniture.json
msgid ""
"An ornate oak cabinet topped by a durable resin countertop resistant to most"
" alchemical spills and burns.  It has wired in electrical and gas fittings, "
"and has been decorated with several protection runes - mostly ornamental."
msgstr ""
"錬金術での大抵の液体流出や出火に強い、頑丈な樹脂で表面をコーティングされた豪華なオーク材の収納棚です。電気とガスの配線が付属しており、守護のルーンで装飾されています。"

#. ~ Furniture name
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/furniture.json
msgid "standing alembic"
msgstr "アランビック"

#. ~ Description of furniture "standing alembic"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/furniture.json
msgid ""
"A large glass and copper alembic for distilling alchemical concoctions.  It "
"consists of a copper pot with rising spires of twisted glass draining into "
"various removable bottles."
msgstr ""
"錬金術において調合物を蒸留する際に使う、ガラスと銅の大きな蒸留器です。銅の鍋の上部にガラス製の細い管が伸びており、その先端に付いた取り外し可能な瓶の中に蒸留物が流れ込みます。"

#. ~ Furniture name
#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/furniture.json data/mods/Magiclysm/items/furniture.json
msgid "orrery"
msgid_plural "orreries"
msgstr[0] "太陽系儀"

#. ~ Description of furniture "orrery"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/furniture.json
msgid ""
"This is a beautiful, non-scale model of the solar system.  A complex series "
"of gears allows the relative motions of the planets to be studied at the "
"turn of a crank.  This more modern version also has bluetooth and could have"
" been controlled with an app, if there was any power anymore."
msgstr ""
"美しい姿の、縮尺が均一でない太陽系の模型です。クランクを回すと歯車が複雑に連動し、惑星の相対的な動きを観察することができます。最新のものにはBluetoothが搭載されており、電源があればアプリを使って制御できるそうです。"

#. ~ Furniture name
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/furniture.json
msgid "huge mana crystal"
msgstr "巨大マナクリスタル"

#. ~ Description of furniture "huge mana crystal"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/furniture.json
msgid ""
"This is a mana crystal that juts from the ground as if it had sprouted up "
"like a weed.  It pulses with a delicate yellow energy, occasionally bursting"
" with flashes of pent-up light."
msgstr "芽を出す雑草のように地面から飛び出したマナクリスタルです。エネルギーを発してほのかな黄色に脈動し、時折まばゆい光を迸らせています。"

#. ~ Bashing failed sound
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/furniture.json
msgid "mana crackling!"
msgstr "[マナが爆ぜる音！]"

#. ~ Furniture name
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/furniture.json
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/furniture_and_terrain/furniture.json
msgid "stone altar"
msgstr "石の祭壇"

#. ~ Description of furniture "stone altar"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/furniture.json
msgid ""
"This is a big stone altar.  Most commonly used in morally questionable "
"rituals."
msgstr "大きな石の祭壇です。道徳的に疑問視される儀式において頻繁に登場します。"

#. ~ Furniture name
#. ~ Overmap terrain name
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/furniture.json
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/worldgen/overmap_terrain.json
msgid "attunement altar"
msgstr "調和の祭壇"

#. ~ Description of furniture "attunement altar"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/furniture.json
msgid ""
"An ancient stone plinth covered in symbols that appear to be combinations "
"and variations of the eight magic classes.  Eight depressions are on the top"
" with the original symbols of the classes, each look as though they can hold"
" an item."
msgstr ""
"8つの魔法の分類を組み合わせたシンボルに覆われた、古くからある石の台座です。上部には基本的な魔法の分類を示すシンボルが描かれた8つのくぼみがあり、それぞれ1つずつアイテムを置けるようになっています。"

#. ~ Furniture name
#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/furniture.json data/mods/Magiclysm/items/tools.json
msgid "demon forge"
msgid_plural "demon forges"
msgstr[0] "デーモンフォージ"

#. ~ Description of furniture "demon forge"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/furniture.json
msgid ""
"This is a forge made of the chitin of a huge, red spider that has a penchant"
" for flames.  Custom made to withstand the heat from alumentum, this forge "
"can resmelt the magical metals into their workable, ingot form."
msgstr ""
"炎を好む巨大な赤いクモのキチン質を使って作られた炉です。アルメンタムの熱に耐えられる特別製であり、魔法の金属を溶かして加工しやすい鋳塊にすることができます。"

#. ~ Furniture name
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/furniture.json
msgid "candelabra of everlasting candles"
msgstr "不朽のろうそく"

#. ~ Description of furniture "candelabra of everlasting candles"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/furniture.json
msgid ""
"A candelabra, strangely the candles never seem to burn down.  Smashing it "
"doesn't seem like it'd produce any worthwhile salvage."
msgstr "燭台に置かれたろうそくは、奇妙なことに決して燃え尽きません。破壊しても、苦労に見合うものは回収できそうにありません。"

#. ~ Furniture name
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/furniture.json
msgid "everfrost crystal"
msgstr "溶けない氷"

#. ~ Description of furniture "everfrost crystal"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/furniture.json
msgid ""
"This massive mana crystal juts from the ground as if it had sprouted up like"
" a weed.  It pulses with an angry white light, occasionally flickering "
"brighter."
msgstr "地面から雑草のように生えた、巨大なマナクリスタルの結晶です。白くまばゆい光を放っており、時折周囲の大気が激しく揺らめきます。"

#. ~ Furniture name
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/furniture.json
msgid "flat boulder"
msgstr "平らな岩"

#. ~ Description of furniture "flat boulder"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/furniture.json
msgid ""
"Smooth, flat boulder.  You can use it both as a table and an anvil.  It "
"responds to your force, and you can easily move it."
msgstr "机や金床の代わりになりそうな、平たく滑らかな岩です。魔法の力に反応して動き、簡単に片付けられます。"

#. ~ Bashing sound
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/furniture.json
msgid "The boulder recedes into the ground."
msgstr "巨大な岩は地中に沈みました。"

#. ~ Furniture name
#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/furniture.json data/mods/Magiclysm/items/furniture.json
msgid "everburning torch candelabra"
msgid_plural "everburning torch candelabras"
msgstr[0] "消えずの松明台"

#. ~ Description of furniture "everburning torch candelabra"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/furniture.json
msgid ""
"A candelabra made of a half-dozen everburning torches attached to a wooden "
"support structure.  Plenty of light with no worries about power usage or "
"smoke.  Plus, how can you be a real wizard unless your tower is lit by the "
"flicking light of imperishable flames?"
msgstr ""
"木製の支柱に、常に燃え続ける6本の松明が取り付けられています。非常に明るく、消費電力や煙を心配する必要もありません。それに何より、本物の魔法使いであれば、消えずの炎に照らされる根城に棲んでしかるべきだと思いませんか？"

#. ~ Profession name for male
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/hobbies.json
msgctxt "profession_male"
msgid "Spellcraft (Beginner)"
msgstr "呪文学(初級)"

#. ~ Description of profession "Spellcraft (Beginner)" for male
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/hobbies.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You took a few classes about magical theory before the Cataclysm and still "
"remember most of it."
msgstr "大変動以前に魔法理論に関する講義をいくつか受講しており、今でもかなりの内容を覚えています。"

#. ~ Profession name for female
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/hobbies.json
msgctxt "profession_female"
msgid "Spellcraft (Beginner)"
msgstr "呪文学(初級)"

#. ~ Description of profession "Spellcraft (Beginner)" for female
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/hobbies.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You took a few classes about magical theory before the Cataclysm and still "
"remember most of it."
msgstr "大変動以前に魔法理論に関する講義をいくつか受講しており、今でもかなりの内容を覚えています。"

#. ~ Profession name for male
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/hobbies.json
msgctxt "profession_male"
msgid "Spellcraft (Intermediate)"
msgstr "呪文学(中級)"

#. ~ Description of profession "Spellcraft (Intermediate)" for male
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/hobbies.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You were either a practicing mage or made a formal study of magical theory."
"  You could have designed spells in your spare time, if you had wanted."
msgstr "魔法使いとして活躍していたか、あるいは魔法理論を研究する職に就いていました。時間を掛ければ、呪文を一から設計することもできました。"

#. ~ Profession name for female
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/hobbies.json
msgctxt "profession_female"
msgid "Spellcraft (Intermediate)"
msgstr "呪文学(中級)"

#. ~ Description of profession "Spellcraft (Intermediate)" for female
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/hobbies.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You were either a practicing mage or made a formal study of magical theory."
"  You could have designed spells in your spare time, if you had wanted."
msgstr "魔法使いとして活躍していたか、あるいは魔法理論を研究する職に就いていました。時間を掛ければ、呪文を一から設計することもできました。"

#. ~ Profession name for male
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/hobbies.json
msgctxt "profession_male"
msgid "Spellcraft (Expert)"
msgstr "呪文学(上級)"

#. ~ Description of profession "Spellcraft (Expert)" for male
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/hobbies.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You could have taught magical theory to mages, whether you know any spells "
"or not."
msgstr "呪文を習得しているかどうかはともかく、魔法使いに魔法理論を教えることもできます。"

#. ~ Profession name for female
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/hobbies.json
msgctxt "profession_female"
msgid "Spellcraft (Expert)"
msgstr "呪文詠唱(上級)"

#. ~ Description of profession "Spellcraft (Expert)" for female
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/hobbies.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You could have taught magical theory to mages, whether you know any spells "
"or not."
msgstr "呪文を習得しているかどうかはともかく、魔法使いに魔法理論を教えることもできます。"

#. ~ Profession name for male
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/hobbies.json
msgctxt "profession_male"
msgid "Dabbler (Freshen Up)"
msgstr "日常魔法(ﾌﾚｯｼｪﾝ･ｱｯﾌﾟ)"

#. ~ Description of profession "Dabbler (Freshen Up)" for male
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/hobbies.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You were one of the hundreds of millions of people who knew a single spell."
"  In your case, Freshen Up, the most common spell in the pre-Cataclysm "
"world.  It saved up a lot of time before work in your old life and you've "
"certainly made a lot of use of it now that there's no more running water."
msgstr ""
"呪文を一つだけ身に付けている何億人もの人々の内の一人です。大変動以前の世界では最も一般的だったフレッシェン・アップを習得していました。以前の生活でも出勤までの時間節約に役立っていましたが、水道が使えなくなった今の状況では更に活躍しそうです。"

#. ~ Profession name for female
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/hobbies.json
msgctxt "profession_female"
msgid "Dabbler (Freshen Up)"
msgstr "日常魔法(ﾌﾚｯｼｪﾝ･ｱｯﾌﾟ)"

#. ~ Description of profession "Dabbler (Freshen Up)" for female
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/hobbies.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You were one of the hundreds of millions of people who knew a single spell."
"  In your case, Freshen Up, the most common spell in the pre-Cataclysm "
"world.  It saved up a lot of time before work in your old life and you've "
"certainly made a lot of use of it now that there's no more running water."
msgstr ""
"呪文を一つだけ身に付けている何億人もの人々の内の一人です。大変動以前の世界では最も一般的だったフレッシェン・アップを習得していました。以前の生活でも出勤までの時間節約に役立っていましたが、水道が使えなくなった今の状況では更に活躍しそうです。"

#. ~ Profession name for male
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/hobbies.json
msgctxt "profession_male"
msgid "Dabbler (Crystallize Mana)"
msgstr "日常魔法(ｸﾘｽﾀﾗｲｽﾞ･ﾏﾅ)"

#. ~ Description of profession "Dabbler (Crystallize Mana)" for male
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/hobbies.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You were one of the hundreds of millions of people who knew a single spell."
"  In your case, Crystallize Mana.  Sure, it ruined your social life and you "
"slept for 12 hours a day, but you made a tidy sum of money producing mana "
"crystals for mages who needed them.  Too bad all that money is useless now."
msgstr ""
"呪文を一つだけ身に付けている何億人もの人々の内の一人です。クリスタライズ・マナを習得していました。一日12時間睡眠が必要になり生活リズムは崩壊していましたが、マナクリスタルを生産して魔法使いに供給する商売でかなりの額を稼ぎました。残念ながら、苦労して得た金銭にはもう価値がありません。"

#. ~ Profession name for female
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/hobbies.json
msgctxt "profession_female"
msgid "Dabbler (Crystallize Mana)"
msgstr "日常魔法(ｸﾘｽﾀﾗｲｽﾞ･ﾏﾅ)"

#. ~ Description of profession "Dabbler (Crystallize Mana)" for female
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/hobbies.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You were one of the hundreds of millions of people who knew a single spell."
"  In your case, Crystallize Mana.  Sure, it ruined your social life and you "
"slept for 12 hours a day, but you made a tidy sum of money producing mana "
"crystals for mages who needed them.  Too bad all that money is useless now."
msgstr ""
"呪文を一つだけ身に付けている何億人もの人々の内の一人です。クリスタライズ・マナを習得していました。一日12時間睡眠が必要になり生活リズムは崩壊していましたが、マナクリスタルを生産して魔法使いに供給する商売でかなりの額を稼ぎました。残念ながら、苦労して得た金銭にはもう価値がありません。"

#. ~ Profession name for male
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/hobbies.json
msgctxt "profession_male"
msgid "Dabbler (Magical Light)"
msgstr "日常魔法(ﾏｼﾞｶﾙ･ﾗｲﾄ)"

#. ~ Description of profession "Dabbler (Magical Light)" for male
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/hobbies.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You were one of the hundreds of millions of people who knew a single spell."
"  In your case, Magical Light.  It was mostly a party trick, to be honest, "
"and the weeks learning to cast a spell that any smartphone could replicate "
"showed you how much work trying to learn real magic actually was.  But the "
"nights are dark enough nowadays that you're glad you put in the effort."
msgstr ""
"呪文を一つだけ身に付けている何億人もの人々の内の一人です。マジカル・ライトを習得していました。正直に言って、宴会芸にしかならないような代物です。大抵のスマートフォンで再現できる簡単なものでも、数週間学んだだけで真の魔法を身に付けることがどれほど困難か分からされました。しかし、夜の暗さが脅威になる今の状況では、努力した甲斐があったと思えます。"

#. ~ Profession name for female
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/hobbies.json
msgctxt "profession_female"
msgid "Dabbler (Magical Light)"
msgstr "日常魔法(ﾏｼﾞｶﾙ･ﾗｲﾄ)"

#. ~ Description of profession "Dabbler (Magical Light)" for female
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/hobbies.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You were one of the hundreds of millions of people who knew a single spell."
"  In your case, Magical Light.  It was mostly a party trick, to be honest, "
"and the weeks learning to cast a spell that any smartphone could replicate "
"showed you how much work trying to learn real magic actually was.  But the "
"nights are dark enough nowadays that you're glad you put in the effort."
msgstr ""
"呪文を一つだけ身に付けている何億人もの人々の内の一人です。マジカル・ライトを習得していました。正直に言って、宴会芸にしかならないような代物です。大抵のスマートフォンで再現できる簡単なものでも、数週間学んだだけで真の魔法を身に付けることがどれほど困難か分からされました。しかし、夜の暗さが脅威になる今の状況では、努力した甲斐があったと思えます。"

#. ~ Profession name for male
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/hobbies.json
msgctxt "profession_male"
msgid "Dabbler (Aura of Protection)"
msgstr "日常魔法(ｵｰﾗ･ｵﾌﾞ･ﾌﾟﾛﾃｸｼｮﾝ)"

#. ~ Description of profession "Dabbler (Aura of Protection)" for male
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/hobbies.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You were one of the hundreds of millions of people who knew a single spell."
"  In your case, Aura of Protection.  To be honest, you originally learned it"
" to try to replace the umbrella you kept leaving at home and were very "
"disappointed when that didn't work.  It's saved you at least once from some "
"strange gas in the air, though, so all that effort paid off."
msgstr ""
"呪文を一つだけ身に付けている何億人もの人々の内の一人です。オーラ・オブ・プロテクションを習得していました。実を言うと、家によく置きっぱなしにしていた傘代わりにこの呪文を学びました。詠唱に失敗したときは酷く落ち込んだものです。空気中に漂っていた奇妙なガスから身を守れたときは、努力が報われたと心から思ったものです。"

#. ~ Profession name for female
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/hobbies.json
msgctxt "profession_female"
msgid "Dabbler (Aura of Protection)"
msgstr "日常魔法(ｵｰﾗ･ｵﾌﾞ･ﾌﾟﾛﾃｸｼｮﾝ)"

#. ~ Description of profession "Dabbler (Aura of Protection)" for female
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/hobbies.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You were one of the hundreds of millions of people who knew a single spell."
"  In your case, Aura of Protection.  To be honest, you originally learned it"
" to try to replace the umbrella you kept leaving at home and were very "
"disappointed when that didn't work.  It's saved you at least once from some "
"strange gas in the air, though, so all that effort paid off."
msgstr ""
"呪文を一つだけ身に付けている何億人もの人々の内の一人です。オーラ・オブ・プロテクションを習得していました。実を言うと、家によく置きっぱなしにしていた傘代わりにこの呪文を学びました。詠唱に失敗したときは酷く落ち込んだものです。空気中に漂っていた奇妙なガスから身を守れたときは、努力が報われたと心から思ったものです。"

