msgid "Dabbler (Cure Light Wounds)"
msgstr "日常魔法(ｷｭｱ･ﾗｲﾄ･ｳｰﾝｽﾞ)"

#. ~ Description of profession "Dabbler (Cure Light Wounds)" for male
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/hobbies.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You were one of the hundreds of millions of people who knew a single spell."
"  In your case, Cure Light Wounds.  Certainly no one ever asked your reasons"
" for studying biomancy, especially after you saw that guy get hit by a truck"
" running a red light and managed to stop him from bleeding out before the "
"paramedics arrived.  As long as you're light on your feet, you won't have to"
" worry about dying of your injuries now."
msgstr ""
"呪文を一つだけ身に付けている何億人もの人々の内の一人です。キュア・ライト・ウーンズを習得していました。何故バイオマンシーなんて学ぶのかと聞かれることもありましたが、ある日赤信号で突っ込んできたトラックに轢かれた男を治癒し、救急隊員が到着するより速く出血を止めて以来、疑問を口にする者は居なくなりました。今の状況でも足取りさえ軽ければ、ケガで死ぬ心配はありません。"

