#. ~ Profession name for male
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/hobbies.json
msgctxt "profession_male"
msgid "Dabbler (Water's Cooling Touch)"
msgstr "日常魔法(ｳｫｰﾀｰｽﾞ･ｸｰﾘﾝｸﾞ･ﾀｯﾁ)"

#. ~ Description of profession "Dabbler (Water's Cooling Touch)" for male
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/hobbies.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You were one of the hundreds of millions of people who knew a single spell."
"  In your case, Water's Cooling Touch.  You always hated summer, the "
"stickiness, the heat, the sunburns, and your dislike of the weather drove "
"you to study druidic magic to overcome it.  With your water bottle handy, "
"you'll never have to worry about being too hot in the sun again."
msgstr ""
"呪文を一つだけ身に付けている何億人もの人々の内の一人です。ウォーターズ・クーリング・タッチを習得していました。汗でベタつく肌、暑さ、日焼け、気候。夏を嫌うあまり、克服のためにドルイドの魔法を勉強しました。手元に水さえ備えておけば、もう晴れた屋外で暑さを心配する必要もありません。"

#. ~ Profession name for female
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/hobbies.json
