#. ~ Profession name for male
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/hobbies.json
msgctxt "profession_male"
msgid "Dabbler (Traverse the Wilds)"
msgstr "日常魔法(ﾄﾗｳﾞｧｰｽ･ｻﾞ･ﾜｲﾙｽﾞ)"

#. ~ Description of profession "Dabbler (Traverse the Wilds)" for male
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/hobbies.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You were one of the hundreds of millions of people who knew a single spell."
"  In your case, Traverse the Wilds.  Part of the joy of hiking is taking "
"your time, of being away from the tyranny of clocks and schedules and "
"deadlines.  But sometimes, it was nice to just see the miles fly by, to "
"reach the summit before sunrise and take in the view without getting up at 2"
" a.m., to finish the entire trail and still have time to sit down and eat a "
"leisurely dinner.  And it's not like you teleported, after all.  Regardless "
"of the magic, you still had to walk every single step."
msgstr ""
"呪文を一つだけ身に付けている何億人もの人々の内の一人です。トラヴァース・ザ・ワイルズを習得していました。ハイキングの楽しみの一つは、時計やスケジュール、刻限の支配から離れてゆったり過ごすことです。しかし、とてつもない速さで散歩したり、午前二時に起床することなく山頂から日の出を眺めたり、自然歩道を完走してから座ってゆっくり夕食を味わうのも、たまにはいいものです。瞬間移動ではないことが重要です。たとえ魔法の力を借りたとしても、一歩一歩踏みしめることが大事なのです。"

#. ~ Profession name for female
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/hobbies.json
msgctxt "profession_female"
msgid "Dabbler (Traverse the Wilds)"
msgstr "日常魔法(ﾄﾗｳﾞｧｰｽ･ｻﾞ･ﾜｲﾙｽﾞ)"

#. ~ Description of profession "Dabbler (Traverse the Wilds)" for female
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/hobbies.json
