#. ~ Profession name for male
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/hobbies.json
msgctxt "profession_male"
msgid "Dabbler (Flames of Passion)"
msgstr "日常魔法(ﾌﾚｲﾑｽﾞ･ｵﾌﾞ･ﾊﾟｯｼｮﾝ)"

#. ~ Description of profession "Dabbler (Flames of Passion)" for male
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/hobbies.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You were one of the hundreds of millions of people who knew a single spell."
"  In your case, Flames of Passion.  Alcohol is a social lubricant, and if "
"you already had a drink in your hand, why not use it to let you loosen up "
"and make it easier to talk to people?  You were out at parties almost every "
"weekend and had a wide circle of friends.  Hopefully at least a few of them "
"made it through all of this."
msgstr ""
"呪文を一つだけ身に付けている何億人もの人々の内の一人です。フレイムズ・オブ・パッションを習得していました。アルコールは人間関係の潤滑油です。手元に用意してこの呪文を使えば、気分がリラックスして人々と話しやすくなるでしょう。この魔法を活用して毎週末パーティーに参加し、幅広い交友を築いてきました。世界が崩壊した今、一体何人の友人が生き延びているでしょうか。"

#. ~ Profession name for female
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/hobbies.json
msgctxt "profession_female"
msgid "Dabbler (Flames of Passion)"
msgstr "日常魔法(ﾌﾚｲﾑｽﾞ･ｵﾌﾞ･ﾊﾟｯｼｮﾝ)"

