#. ~ Profession name for male
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/hobbies.json
msgctxt "profession_male"
msgid "Dabbler (Windrunning)"
msgstr "日常魔法(ｳｨﾝﾄﾞﾗﾝﾆﾝｸﾞ)"

#. ~ Description of profession "Dabbler (Windrunning)" for male
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/hobbies.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You were one of the hundreds of millions of people who knew a single spell."
"  In your case, Windrunning.  It's embarrassing to admit, but you became a "
"mage because you were always running late.  Just one spell made it much "
"easier to catch that bus, to beat that red light across the crosswalk, to "
"make it to work on time instead of a few minutes late.  Nowadays you have a "
"lot more practice at running and that speed still comes in handy."
msgstr ""
"呪文を一つだけ身に付けている何億人もの人々の内の一人です。ウィンドランニングを習得していました。きまりの悪い話ですが、この呪文を覚えたのは頻繁に遅刻をしていたからです。たった一回唱えるだけで、バスに飛び乗るのも、赤信号を無視して横断歩道を渡るのも、出勤時刻の数分前に会社に着くのも、ずっと簡単にこなせます。今の状況では走る機会も多いですが、そのスピードは頼りになります。"

#. ~ Profession name for female
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/hobbies.json
msgctxt "profession_female"
msgid "Dabbler (Windrunning)"
msgstr "日常魔法(ｳｨﾝﾄﾞﾗﾝﾆﾝｸﾞ)"

#. ~ Description of profession "Dabbler (Windrunning)" for female
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/hobbies.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You were one of the hundreds of millions of people who knew a single spell."
"  In your case, Windrunning.  It's embarrassing to admit, but you became a "
"mage because you were always running late.  Just one spell made it much "
"easier to catch that bus, to beat that red light across the crosswalk, to "
"make it to work on time instead of a few minutes late.  Nowadays you have a "
"lot more practice at running and that speed still comes in handy."
msgstr ""
"呪文を一つだけ身に付けている何億人もの人々の内の一人です。ウィンドランニングを習得していました。きまりの悪い話ですが、この呪文を覚えたのは頻繁に遅刻をしていたからです。たった一回唱えるだけで、バスに飛び乗るのも、赤信号を無視して横断歩道を渡るのも、出勤時刻の数分前に会社に着くのも、ずっと簡単にこなせます。今の状況では走る機会も多いですが、そのスピードは頼りになります。"

#. ~ Profession name for male
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/hobbies.json
msgctxt "profession_male"
msgid "Dabbler (Fire Spark)"
msgstr "日常魔法(ﾌｧｲｱ･ｽﾊﾟｰｸ)"

#. ~ Description of profession "Dabbler (Fire Spark)" for male
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/hobbies.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You were one of the hundreds of millions of people who knew a single spell."
"  In your case, Fire Spark.  Most people when they wanted to light a fire "
"thought of kelvinists, but electricity always fascinated you.  You used to "
"love watching the storms roll in, sitting on your porch as the lightning "
"played across the sky, and while summoning lightning bolts wouldn't have "
"been useful for anything at all, catching fires with a spark has come in "
"handy."
msgstr ""
"呪文を一つだけ身に付けている何億人もの人々の内の一人です。ファイア・スパークを習得していました。火が欲しいと思ったとき大抵の人はケルビニストの魔法を思い浮かべますが、電気の力もいいものです。空に雷鳴が轟くとベランダに出て、押し寄せる嵐を好んで眺めていました。火花を散らす魔法はあまり役には立ちませんが、火を起こすことは可能です。"

