#. ~ Profession name for male
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/hobbies.json
msgctxt "profession_male"
msgid "Dabbler (Air Bubble)"
msgstr "日常魔法(ｴｱ･ﾊﾞﾌﾞﾙ)"

#. ~ Description of profession "Dabbler (Air Bubble)" for male
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/hobbies.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You were one of the hundreds of millions of people who knew a single spell."
"  In your case, Air Bubble.  It was originally because of your diving trips."
"  You were sick of having the goggles and the respirator between you and the"
" sea, and if one simple spell would make it so you didn't have to worry "
"about that again, you were willing to put in the time to learn it.  When you"
" had to swim across that river to escape the horde a while ago, it "
"definitely proved its worth."
msgstr ""
"呪文を一つだけ身に付けている何億人もの人々の内の一人です。エア・バブルを習得していました。元々はダイビング旅行のためにこの魔法を学びました。ゴーグルやレギュレータを身に付ける作業にうんざりしており、簡単な呪文を一つ覚えて解決するというなら時間をかけて学ぶ価値もあると考えたのです。川を泳いで渡りゾンビの大群から逃げおおせたことで、この呪文の価値がはっきりと証明されました。"

