#. ~ Profession name for male
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/professions.json
msgctxt "profession_male"
msgid "Magic Drunkard"
msgstr "幸運な飲んだくれ"

#. ~ Description of profession "Magic Drunkard" for male
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/professions.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You were lucky enough to find a weird flask that refills itself with "
"whiskey!  You now spend your days just waiting for every refill and keeping "
"it from the hands of any envious neighbor of yours."
msgstr ""
"幸運にも、ウイスキーを勝手に補充してくれる奇妙な酒瓶を見つけました！これからは、嫉妬深い隣人たちの手からこの酒瓶を守りつつ、酒が湧き出るのをひたすら待つだけの日々を過ごすつもりです。"

#. ~ Profession name for female
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/professions.json
msgctxt "profession_female"
msgid "Magic Drunkard"
msgstr "幸運な飲んだくれ"

