#. ~ Description of spell "Sorcerer's Hand"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/alien_mages.json
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/magus.json
msgid "Pull a target or set of items to you."
msgstr "標的またはアイテムを引き寄せます。"

#. ~ Spell name
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/alien_mages.json
