msgstr "ｳｯﾃﾞﾝ･ｼｬﾌﾄ"

#. ~ Description of spell "Wooden Shaft"
#. ~ Description of "Scroll of Wooden Shaft"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/druid.json
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spell_scrolls.json
msgid ""
"This spell creates a projectile of hardwood that shoots forth from the "
"caster's hand at high speed to stab into an enemy."
msgstr "手から硬い木の枝を生み出して高速で射出し、敵に突き刺します。"

#. ~ Spell name
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/druid.json
msgid "Nature's Bow"
msgstr "ﾈｲﾁｬｰｽﾞ･ﾎﾞｳ"

#. ~ Description of spell "Nature's Bow"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/druid.json
msgid ""
"This spell conjures a magical wooden recurve bow, as well as a quiver and a "
"set of arrows to go with it."
msgstr "魔法の木でできたリカーブボウと矢筒、矢を作り出します。"

#. ~ Spell name
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/druid.json
msgid "Nature's Quiver"
msgstr "ﾈｲﾁｬｰｽﾞ･ﾎﾞｳ矢筒生成"

#. ~ Description of spell "Nature's Quiver"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/druid.json
msgid ""
"This spell conjures a magical quiver as part of the nature's bow spell.  "
"It's a bug if you have it directly."
msgstr "魔法の矢筒を生成する、ネイチャーズ・ボウの副次呪文です。通常は表示されません。"

#. ~ Spell name
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/druid.json
msgid "Nature's Arrows"
msgstr "ﾈｲﾁｬｰｽﾞ･ﾎﾞｳ矢生成"

#. ~ Description of spell "Nature's Arrows"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/druid.json
msgid ""
"This spell conjures magical arrows as part of the nature's bow spell.  It's "
"a bug if you have it directly."
msgstr "魔法の矢を生成する、ネイチャーズ・ボウの副次呪文です。通常は表示されません。"

#. ~ Spell name
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/druid.json
msgid "Improved Nature's Bow"
msgstr "ﾈｲﾁｬｰｽﾞ･ﾎﾞｳ改"

#. ~ Description of spell "Improved Nature's Bow"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/druid.json
msgid ""
"This spell conjures a magical wooden recurve bow, as well as a quiver and a "
"set of arrows to go with it.  Now you know this spell like the back of your "
"hand, and have started to design your own version."
msgstr "魔法の木でできたリカーブボウと矢筒、矢を作り出します。元来の呪文を知り尽くしたことで、改良した呪文を編み出すことができました。"

#. ~ Spell name
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/druid.json
msgid "Nature's Trance"
msgstr "ﾈｲﾁｬｰｽﾞ･ﾄﾗﾝｽ"

#. ~ Description of spell "Nature's Trance"
#. ~ Description of "Scroll of Nature's Trance"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/druid.json
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spell_scrolls.json
msgid ""
"Your connection to living things allows you to go into a magical trance.  "
"This allows you to recover from fatigue quickly in exchange for mana."
msgstr "生きとし生けるものとの繋がりによって、魔術的なトランス状態に入ります。マナを消費して倦怠感を素早く吹き飛ばします。"

#. ~ Spell name
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/druid.json
msgid "Bag of Cats"
msgstr "ﾊﾞｸﾞ･ｵﾌﾞ･ｷｬｯﾂ"

#. ~ Description of spell "Bag of Cats"
#. ~ Description of "Scroll of Bag of Cats"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/druid.json
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spell_scrolls.json
msgid "Are you the crazy cat lady?"
msgstr "ネコはお好きですか？"

#. ~ Spell name
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/druid.json
msgid "Cause Bear"
msgstr "ｺｰｽﾞ･ﾍﾞｱ"

#. ~ Description of spell "Cause Bear"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/druid.json
msgid ""
"This spell appears to be very smudged.  You're fairly sure the name should "
"be Cause Fear, but you're also fairly sure it won't have the desired effect "
"because the instructions are hardly legible.  No time like the Cataclysm to "
"find out, though!"
msgstr ""
"この呪文は大変な効果をもたらす気がします。呪文の名前がコーズ・ベアであることは明らかですが、効果の内容がほとんど読み取れなくなっているため、どんな事になるか想像もつきません。ともかく、大変動を生き抜くためにも、まずは唱えてみましょう！"

#. ~ Spell name
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/druid.json
msgid "Kill Fungus"
msgstr "ｷﾙ･ﾌｧﾝｶﾞｽ"

