#. ~ Player message in false effect in EoC "EOC_VALIDATE_FORGE"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/effects/eoc_forge.json
msgid "MANUALLY FINDING THE FORGE AS A FALLBACK (PRESS SPACE)."
msgstr "代替措置として驚異の炉を手動で検索しています。(スペースキーを押してください)"

#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_FORGE_TELEPORT"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/effects/eoc_forge.json
msgid ""
"As you recite the incantation the runes on the scroll begin to shift.  And "
"in the blink of an eye you are suddenly somewhere else."
msgstr "呪文を唱えると巻物に書かれたルーン文字が動き始め、そしていつの間にか、別の場所に転移していました。"

#. ~ Player message in false effect in EoC "EOC_FORGE_TELEPORT"
#. ~ Player message in false effect in EoC "EOC_FORGE_RETURN_TELEPORT"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/effects/eoc_forge.json
msgid "You need to be able to see, read, and speak to recite the incantation."
msgstr "呪文を詠唱するには視覚、識字能力、発声能力が必要です。"

#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_FORGE_RETURN_TELEPORT"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/effects/eoc_forge.json
msgid ""
"As you recite the incantation the scroll burns away in your hands.  And in "
"the blink of an eye you are suddenly somewhere else."
msgstr "呪文を唱えると瞬く間に別の場所に転移し、持っていた巻物が燃え尽きました。"

#. ~ EOC option name in effect in EoC "EOC_DRUID_SHIFTER_GIVE_FORM_2"
