#: data/mods/Magiclysm/effects/eoc_transformations.json
msgid ""
"Your body shifts and expands as fur sprouts from your skin and your mouth "
"and teeth lengthen."
msgstr "肉体が大きく膨れ上がり、肌は毛むくじゃらになり、口と歯が引き伸ばされました。"

#. ~ Player message in false effect in EoC
#. "EOC_DRUID_SHIFTER_BEAR_FORM_activated_3" in nested EOCs in effect in EoC
