#. "EOC_DRUID_SHIFTER_BEAR_FORM_activated"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/effects/eoc_transformations.json
msgid "You don't have enough mana to transform into a bear."
msgstr "マナが不足しており、クマに変化できません。"

#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_DRUID_SHIFTER_BEAR_FORM_deactivated"
#. in nested EOCs in false effect in EoC
#. "EOC_DRUID_SHIFTER_BEAR_FORM_activated_2" in nested EOCs in effect in EoC
