#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/eocs/shapeshifter_eocs.json
msgid "Your body shifts and contracts and you return to your humanoid form."
msgstr "肉体が歪んで縮み、人間の姿に戻りました。"

#. ~ Player message in false effect in EoC
#. "EOC_DRUID_SHIFTER_BEAR_FORM_activated"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/effects/eoc_transformations.json
msgid "You cannot transform into a bear if you are already in an animal form."
msgstr "既に動物の形態に変化している場合は、クマに変化できません。"

#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_DRUID_SHIFTER_DEER_FORM_activated_3"
#. in nested EOCs in effect in EoC "EOC_DRUID_SHIFTER_DEER_FORM_activated_2"
#. in nested EOCs in effect in EoC "EOC_DRUID_SHIFTER_DEER_FORM_activated"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/effects/eoc_transformations.json
msgid ""
"Your body shifts and warps as your fingers and feet fuse into hooves and "
"majestic antlers sprout from your head."
msgstr "肉体が歪んで形を変え、手足の指が集まって蹄になり、頭から立派な枝角が生えてきました。"

#. ~ Player message in false effect in EoC
#. "EOC_DRUID_SHIFTER_DEER_FORM_activated_3" in nested EOCs in effect in EoC
#. "EOC_DRUID_SHIFTER_DEER_FORM_activated_2" in nested EOCs in effect in EoC
#. "EOC_DRUID_SHIFTER_DEER_FORM_activated"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/effects/eoc_transformations.json
msgid "You don't have enough mana to transform into a deer."
msgstr "マナが不足しており、シカに変化できません。"

#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_DRUID_SHIFTER_DEER_FORM_deactivated"
#. in nested EOCs in false effect in EoC
#. "EOC_DRUID_SHIFTER_DEER_FORM_activated_2" in nested EOCs in effect in EoC
#. "EOC_DRUID_SHIFTER_DEER_FORM_activated"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/effects/eoc_transformations.json
msgid ""
"Your body shifts and your fingers separate as you return to your humanoid "
"form."
msgstr "肉体が歪み、蹄が分かれて指になり、人間の姿に戻りました。"

#. ~ Player message in false effect in EoC
#. "EOC_DRUID_SHIFTER_DEER_FORM_activated"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/effects/eoc_transformations.json
msgid "You cannot transform into a deer if you are already in an animal form."
msgstr "既に動物の形態に変化している場合は、シカに変化できません。"

#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC
#. "EOC_DRUID_SHIFTER_RAVEN_FORM_activated_3" in nested EOCs in effect in EoC
#. "EOC_DRUID_SHIFTER_RAVEN_FORM_activated_2" in nested EOCs in effect in EoC
#. "EOC_DRUID_SHIFTER_RAVEN_FORM_activated"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/effects/eoc_transformations.json
