#. in EoC "EOC_DRUID_SHIFTER_RAVEN_FORM_activated_2" in nested EOCs in effect
#. in EoC "EOC_DRUID_SHIFTER_RAVEN_FORM_activated"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/effects/eoc_transformations.json
msgid "Your body shifts and changes and you return to your humanoid form."
msgstr "肉体が歪んで変化し、人間の姿に戻りました。"

#. ~ Player message in false effect in EoC
#. "EOC_DRUID_SHIFTER_RAVEN_FORM_activated"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/effects/eoc_transformations.json
msgid ""
"You cannot transform into a raven if you are already in an animal form."
