#. ~ Description of "Scroll of Dark Sight"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spell_scrolls.json
msgid ""
"The darkness holds no secrets for the arcane.  Adjust your sight to see in "
"perfect darkness!"
msgstr "秘儀の前では暗闇も秘密を隠せません。完全な暗闇も見通せる視覚を手に入れましょう！"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spell_scrolls.json
msgid "Scroll of Sound Bomb"
msgid_plural "Scrolls of Sound Bomb"
msgstr[0] "呪文書(サウンド・ボム)"

#. ~ Item name
