#. ~ Description of "Scroll of Obfuscated Body"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spell_scrolls.json
msgid ""
"A magical aura distorts light around your body, making it easier to dodge "
"enemy attacks."
msgstr "魔法のオーラが身体の周りの光を歪め、敵の攻撃を避けやすくなります。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spell_scrolls.json
