msgid_plural "Scrolls of Thought Shield"
msgstr[0] "呪文書(ソウト・シールド)"

#. ~ Description of "Scroll of Thought Shield"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spell_scrolls.json
msgid ""
"Harried by evil spirits or creatures from beyond?  This spell will keep your"
" mind safe!"
msgstr "悪霊や異界の化け物にお困りですか？この呪文があれば心の平穏が守られます！"

#. ~ Item name
