msgid_plural "Scrolls of Restoration"
msgstr[0] "呪文書(レストレーション)"

#. ~ Description of "Scroll of Restoration"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spell_scrolls.json
msgid "Directed magical energy that slowly heals your body from wounds."
msgstr "傷ついた肉体をゆっくりと癒す、指向性の高い魔法です。"

#. ~ Item name
