msgstr "%1$sが呪文を叫ぶと、不気味な雷が迸り<npcname>の%2$sに激突しましたがダメージはありませんでした。"

#. ~ Monster message of special attack of monster "feral thaumaturgical
#. researcher"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/monsters/feral_wizards.json
#, c-format
msgid "%1$s gestures and light explodes everywhere!"
msgstr "%1$sが手を振りかざすと、あちこちで光が爆発しました！"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/monsters/feral_wizards.json
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/monsters/mics.json
msgid "feral radiation mage"
msgid_plural "feral radiation mages"
msgstr[0] "狂ったラジエーションメイジ"

#. ~ Description of monster "feral radiation mage"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/monsters/feral_wizards.json
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/monsters/mics.json
msgid ""
"A research thaumaturge with the international radiation danger symbol in "
"front of a pentagram on their lab coat.  If you had a geiger counter active,"
" it would probably be going crazy right now."
msgstr ""
"五芒星と国際放射能標識マークが付いた白衣を着ている魔法学者です。もしガイガーカウンターが正常に作動していたら、きっと絶望していたに違いありません。"

#. ~ Monster message of special attack of monster "feral radiation mage"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/monsters/feral_wizards.json
#, c-format
msgid "%1$s gestures and a sudden force slams you to the ground!"
msgstr "%1$sが手を振りかざすと、突然地面に叩きつけられました！"

#. ~ Monster message of special attack of monster "feral radiation mage"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/monsters/feral_wizards.json
#, c-format
msgid "%1$s makes arcane motions and the air is filled with burning gas!"
msgstr "%1$sが不可解な身振りをすると、周囲に危険なガスが広がりました！"

#. ~ Monster message of special attack of monster "feral radiation mage"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/monsters/feral_wizards.json
#, c-format
msgid "%1$s smiles and duplicates appear!"
msgstr "%1$sが笑顔を作ると、分身が現れました！"

#. ~ Monster message of special attack of monster "feral radiation mage"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/monsters/feral_wizards.json
#, c-format
msgid ""
"%1$s intones words of power and a corpse claws its way out of the ground!"
msgstr "%1$sが魔法の言葉を発すると、地下から死体が這い出しました！"

#. ~ Monster message of special attack of monster "feral radiation mage"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/monsters/feral_wizards.json
#, c-format
msgid "%1$s waves their hands in a gesture of negation!"
msgstr "%1$sは手を振って打ち消す仕草をしました！"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/monsters/feral_wizards.json
msgid "feral druid"
msgid_plural "feral druids"
msgstr[0] "狂ったドルイド"

#. ~ Description of monster "feral druid"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/monsters/feral_wizards.json
msgid ""
"A member of a druidic order with the bloodshot eyes you've come to recognize"
" and dread.  Patches of their skin are covered in bark and fur, leaves grow "
"in their hair, and long claws grow from the ends of their fingers.  "
"Protecting nature is obviously the last thing on their mind now."
msgstr ""
"血走った恐ろしい目をした、ドルイド教団の一員です。肌には樹皮と毛皮がまだらに生えており、髭には葉が混じり、指先には長い爪が突き出ています。自然を守ることなど、少しも考えていないようです。"

#. ~ Monster message of special attack of monster "feral druid"
#. ~ Monster message of special attack of monster "feral high druid"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/monsters/feral_wizards.json
#, c-format
msgid "%1$s weaves their hands in a complicated gesture!"
msgstr "%1$sは手を複雑に動かしました！"

#. ~ Monster attack message
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/monsters/feral_wizards.json
#, c-format
msgid ""
"%1$s screams words of magic and jagged shards of wood impact your %2$s!"
msgstr "%1$sが呪文を叫ぶと、棘の生えた樹木が%2$sに激突しました！"

#. ~ Monster attack message
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/monsters/feral_wizards.json
#, c-format
msgid ""
"%1$s screams words of magic and jagged shards of wood impact <npcname>'s "
