#. ~ Monster message of special attack of monster "feral druid"
#. ~ Monster message of special attack of monster "feral high druid"
#. ~ Monster message of special attack of monster "goblin thornweaver"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/monsters/feral_wizards.json
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/monsters/goblin.json
#, c-format
msgid "%1$s waves their hands and roots burst from the ground around you!"
msgstr "%1$sが手を動かすと、周りの地面から根が飛び出しました！"

#. ~ Monster name
#. ~ High here meaning Grand, Powerful, Mighty, like High Elf
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/monsters/feral_wizards.json
msgid "feral high druid"
msgid_plural "feral high druids"
msgstr[0] "狂った高位ドルイド"

#. ~ Description of monster "feral high druid"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/monsters/feral_wizards.json
msgid ""
"One a leader of a druidic order, this feral is barely recognizable anymore "
"beneath the patches of bark, fur, and scales that cover their skin.  They "
"occasionally stop and sniff the air like an animal."
msgstr ""
"ドルイド教団の幹部の一人であるこの狂人は、全身を樹木や毛皮、鱗にまだらに覆われており、肌がほとんど見えません。時折立ち止まり、動物のように空気の匂いを嗅いでいます。"

#. ~ Monster attack message
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/monsters/feral_wizards.json
#, c-format
msgid ""
"%1$s screams words of magic and sharp roots thrust from the ground into your"
" %2$s!"
msgstr "%1$sが呪文を叫ぶと、鋭く尖った根が%2$sに突き刺さりました！"

#. ~ Monster attack message
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/monsters/feral_wizards.json
