msgstr "%1$sが呪文を叫ぶと、鋭く尖った根が<npcname>の%2$sに当たりましたがダメージはありませんでした。"

#. ~ Monster message of special attack of monster "feral high druid"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/monsters/feral_wizards.json
#, c-format
msgid "%1$s throws back their head and howls!"
msgstr "%1$sはのけぞり、大声で吠えました！"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/monsters/feral_wizards.json
msgid "feral earthshaper"
msgid_plural "feral earthshapers"
msgstr[0] "狂ったアースシェイパー"

#. ~ Description of monster "feral earthshaper"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/monsters/feral_wizards.json
msgid ""
"An earthen wizard, obvious by the rocky texture of their skin and the "
"granite dust that flakes off of them when they move.  Their eyes, still "
"obviously human, are bloodshot and their gaze is unfocused."
msgstr ""
"この狂人が土の魔法を扱うことは、岩のような皮膚の質感と、動く度に剥がれ落ちる花崗岩の欠片によって明らかです。人間ではあるようですが、充血したその目は焦点が合っていません。"

#. ~ Monster attack message
#. ~ Monster message of special attack of monster "gnome"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/monsters/feral_wizards.json
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/monsters/nature_spirits.json
#, c-format
msgid "%1$s stomps heavily and the ground shakes!"
msgstr "%1$sが足を踏み鳴らすと、大地が揺れました！"

#. ~ Monster attack message
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/monsters/feral_wizards.json
#, c-format
msgid "%1$s rumbles words of magic and heavy chunks of rock impact your %2$s!"
msgstr "%1$sが呪文を大声で叫ぶと、重い岩の塊が%2$sに激突しました！"

