msgstr "%1$sが呪文を大声で叫ぶと重い岩の塊が飛んできましたが、間一髪で避けました！"

#. ~ Monster attack message
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/monsters/feral_wizards.json
#, c-format
msgid ""
"%1$s rumbles words of magic and <npcname> narrowly avoids heavy chunks of "
