msgstr "%1$sが呪文を叫ぶと、重い岩の塊が<npcname>の%2$sに当たりましたがダメージはありませんでした。"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/monsters/feral_wizards.json
msgid "feral high earthshaper"
msgid_plural "feral high earthshapers"
msgstr[0] "狂った上位アースシェイパー"

#. ~ Description of monster "feral high earthshaper"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/monsters/feral_wizards.json
msgid ""
"Once a master of earthshaping, this feral now wanders haphazardly through "
"the post-Cataclysmic world.  Their skin is stone covered in fine crystalline"
" spikes, and their bloodshot eyes glitter like polished gems, but their "
"movements are uncoordinated.  Occasionally, the earth shakes when they take "
"a step."
msgstr ""
"かつて大地を操る達人であったこの狂人は、今では大変動後の大地をでたらめに彷徨っています。岩のような皮膚の表面には小さな結晶質の棘が生えており、焦点の合わない血走った目は宝石のように輝いています。足を踏み出すと、時折大地が震動します。"

#. ~ Monster attack message
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/monsters/feral_wizards.json
#, c-format
msgid ""
"%1$s rumbles words of magic and your %2$s is impacted by heavy chunks of "
"rock, but they do no damage."
msgstr "%1$sが呪文を大声で叫ぶと、重い岩の塊が%2$sに当たりましたがダメージはありませんでした。"

#. ~ Monster attack message
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/monsters/feral_wizards.json
#, c-format
msgid "%1$s reaches out and touches your %2$s!"
msgstr "%1$sが手をこちらに伸ばし、%2$sに触れました！"

#. ~ Monster attack message
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/monsters/feral_wizards.json
#, c-format
msgid "%1$s reaches out and touches <npcname>'s %2$s!"
msgstr "%1$sが手を伸ばし、<npcname>の%2$sに触れました！"

#. ~ Monster attack message
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/monsters/feral_wizards.json
#, c-format
msgid "%1$s reaches out and you narrowly avoid their touch!"
msgstr "%1$sが手を伸ばしてきましたが、間一髪で回避できました！"

#. ~ Monster attack message
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/monsters/feral_wizards.json
#, c-format
msgid "%1$s reaches out and <npcname> narrowly avoids their touch!"
msgstr "%1$sが手を伸ばしてきましたが、<npcname>は間一髪で回避しました！"

#. ~ Monster message of special attack of monster "feral high earthshaper"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/monsters/feral_wizards.json
#, c-format
msgid "%1$s claps both hands in the air and shouts at %3$s."
msgstr "%1$sが両手を打ち合わせ、%3$sに向かって叫びました。"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/monsters/forgedwellers.json
msgid "forge born"
msgid_plural "forge born"
msgstr[0] "フォージボーン"

#. ~ Description of monster "forge born"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/monsters/forgedwellers.json
msgid ""
"The most elaborate, gaudy and overwrought clockwork creature that you've "
"ever seen.  Each one has its face designed in a mask displaying a single "
"emotion.  Blades extend from the wrists in combat."
msgstr ""
"今まで見た中で最も精巧で、派手で、贅を尽くした姿の、カラクリ仕掛けの怪物です。顔には単一の感情を表すデザインのマスクが嵌め込まれています。戦闘時には手首から刃が出現します。"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/monsters/forgedwellers.json
msgid "goblin forgemaster"
msgid_plural "goblin forgemasters"
msgstr[0] "ゴブリンの機工士"

#. ~ Description of monster "goblin forgemaster"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/monsters/forgedwellers.json
msgid ""
"A goblin like none you've ever seen before.  He directs workers and "
"automatons with confidence and style."
msgstr "今までに見たことのない姿をしたゴブリンです。自信と優雅さを滲ませながら作業員やロボットに指示を飛ばします。"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/monsters/forgedwellers.json
msgid "lizardfolk forgemaster"
msgid_plural "lizardfolk forgemasters"
msgstr[0] "リザードフォークの機工士"

#. ~ Description of monster "lizardfolk forgemaster"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/monsters/forgedwellers.json
msgid ""
"Lizardfolk rarely live outside of their tribes.  This one has found freedom "
"and purpose beyond serving their draconic masters."
msgstr "リザードフォークが縄張りの外で生活することはめったにありません。この個体は首長に仕えることを良しとせず、自由と目的を探しに来たようです。"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/monsters/forgedwellers.json
msgid "gracken forgemaster"
msgid_plural "gracken forgemasters"
msgstr[0] "グラッケンの機工士"

#. ~ Description of monster "gracken forgemaster"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/monsters/forgedwellers.json
msgid ""
"This is some form of eldritch monstrosity; an uncouth black being with "
"smooth, oily, skin and unpleasant horns that curve inward toward each other."
"  Tall and thin, the shadows cling unnaturally to its vaguely defined "
"humanoid form as it shuffles along, its hands twitching and spasming so "
"rapidly as to appear a little more than a black blur of claws.  This one "
"politely asks you to mind your step as this is a working environment."
msgstr ""
"内側に湾曲した不快な黒い二本角が艶のある油っぽい皮膚から生えている、不気味な怪物です。体格は痩せ細っており、人間に似てはいますが不自然です。両手は素早く痙攣するように動き続けており、あまりの速度に黒い爪の残像が残り、たくさん生えているようにも見えます。ここは仕事場なので足下に注意してほしいと、丁寧にお願いしています。"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/monsters/forgedwellers.json
msgid "forge demon"
msgid_plural "forge demons"
msgstr[0] "フォージデーモン"

#. ~ Description of monster "forge demon"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/monsters/forgedwellers.json
msgid ""
"The first thing you notice is that this creature has five arms.  The next is"
" that it walks on three legs.  It walks amongst the vault until it notices "
"you then throws itself at the walls screaming bloody murder.  Its mere "
"presence fills you with an unfathomable dread."
msgstr ""
"まず目につくのは、この怪物には5本の腕があるということです。次に、3本の足で歩行していることに気付きます。部屋の中を歩き回り、時折殺人鬼に殺されたかのような叫び声を発して壁に体当たりします。存在していること自体が、心の中に計り知れない恐怖を生み出します。"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/monsters/forgedwellers.json
msgid "vengeance spirit"
msgid_plural "vengeance spirits"
msgstr[0] "報復霊"

#. ~ Description of monster "vengeance spirit"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/monsters/forgedwellers.json
msgid ""
"It looks like a will-o-the-wisp, darting back and forth, until it catches "
"sight of its prey.  When the sickly green balefires light up inside the "
"eyeholes of a skull, the mouth opens and a deep moan vibrates up through the"
" legs of those standing nearby."
msgstr ""
"柳の葉のようにゆらゆらと漂い、獲物が来るのを待っている頭蓋骨です。眼窩に恐ろしい緑色の炎を灯しており、口から発される低い呻き声は付近の者の足をビリビリと振るわせます。"

#. ~ Monster message of special attack of monster "vengeance spirit"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/monsters/forgedwellers.json
msgid "The spirit flickers and reappears!"
msgstr "報復霊の炎が揺らめきました！"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/monsters/forgedwellers.json
msgid "forge worker"
msgid_plural "forge workers"
msgstr[0] "フォージワーカー"

#. ~ Description of monster "forge worker"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/monsters/forgedwellers.json
msgid ""
"A squat humanoid that looks quite sturdily built.  They style their hair in "
"mohawks and other strange fashions that seem to be dictated by what parts of"
" their skin aren't scarred from burns.  Their clothes are designed to "
"protect them from the intense environment they work in."
msgstr ""
"ずんぐりした体型の、非常に頑強そうな人型生物です。モヒカンなどの奇妙な髪型をしていますが、これは火傷で負傷していない頭部の皮膚の位置によって髪型を決めているからのようです。厳しい作業環境から身体を守るように設計された服を着ています。"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/monsters/forgedwellers.json
msgid "forge hound"
msgid_plural "forge hounds"
msgstr[0] "フォージハウンド"

#. ~ Description of monster "forge hound"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/monsters/forgedwellers.json
msgid ""
"A metallic hound steps out of a nearby angle and growls at you.  Run!!!"
msgstr "金属質の猟犬が付近の隅から飛び出し、こちらに向かって唸っています。逃げましょう！！！"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/monsters/goblin.json
msgid "goblin warrior"
msgid_plural "goblin warriors"
msgstr[0] "ゴブリンの戦士"

#. ~ Description of monster "goblin warrior"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/monsters/goblin.json
msgid ""
"A goblin, but like something out of history.  Over the dirty, tattered "
"remnants of their street clothes, they're wearing improvised armor and "
"carrying a heavy club.  They look at you like a wolf seeing a particularly "
"juicy hunk of lamb."
msgstr ""
"まさに伝統的なゴブリンの格好をしたゴブリンです。汚れたボロ布の上から即席の鎧を着て、重い棍棒を携えています。美味しそうな太った子羊を見るオオカミのような目でこちらを見ています。"

#. ~ Monster attack message
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/monsters/goblin.json
#, c-format
msgid "%1$s hits your %2$s with a cudgel!"
msgstr "%1$sは%2$sを棍棒で殴りました！"

#. ~ Monster attack message
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/monsters/goblin.json
#, c-format
msgid "%1$s hits <npcname>'s %2$s with a cudgel!"
msgstr "%1$sは<npcname>の%2$sを棍棒で殴りました！"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/monsters/goblin.json
msgid "goblin slinger"
msgid_plural "goblin slingers"
msgstr[0] "ゴブリンの投石兵"

#. ~ Description of monster "goblin slinger"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/monsters/goblin.json
msgid ""
"A goblin, but like something out of history.  Over the dirty, tattered "
"remnants of their street clothes, they're wearing improvised armor and "
"carrying a sling with a pouch for extra stones.  They look at you like a "
"wolf seeing a particularly juicy hunk of lamb."
msgstr ""
"まさに伝統的なゴブリンの格好をしたゴブリンです。汚れたボロ布の上から即席の鎧を着て、予備の石を入れるポーチが付いたスリングを持っています。美味しそうな太った子羊を見るオオカミのような目でこちらを見ています。"

#. ~ Description of special attack of monster "goblin slinger"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/monsters/goblin.json
msgid "The goblin slings a rock at you!"
msgstr "ゴブリンは石を投げつけました！"

#. ~ No ammo sound of special attack of monster "goblin slinger"
#. ~ No ammo sound of special attack of monster "orc archer"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/monsters/goblin.json
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/monsters/orcs.json
msgid "grunting"
msgstr "[低い唸り声]"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/monsters/goblin.json
msgid "goblin leader"
msgid_plural "goblin leaders"
msgstr[0] "ゴブリンの長"

#. ~ Description of monster "goblin leader"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/monsters/goblin.json
msgid ""
"A goblin, slightly larger than the others and bearing a weapon with more "
"craftsmanship.  The goblins around them scurry to obey their orders."
msgstr "他のゴブリンよりわずかに体格が大きく、より立派な武器を持ったゴブリンです。周囲のゴブリンたちはこのゴブリンの指示に従い動き回っています。"

#. ~ Monster attack message
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/monsters/goblin.json
#, c-format
msgid "%1$s hits your %2$s with their spear!"
msgstr "%1$sは槍で%2$sを攻撃しました！"

#. ~ Monster attack message
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/monsters/goblin.json
#, c-format
msgid "%1$s hits <npcname>'s %2$s with their spear!"
msgstr "%1$sは槍で<npcname>の%2$sを攻撃しました！"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/monsters/goblin.json
msgid "goblin thornweaver"
msgid_plural "goblin thornweavers"
msgstr[0] "茨編みゴブリン"

#. ~ Description of monster "goblin thornweaver"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/monsters/goblin.json
msgid ""
"A goblin in tattered clothing, muttering to themselves.  Occasionally, they "
"wave a hand and an eldritch viridian glow trails after it."
msgstr "何やらブツブツ呟いている、ボロ布を着たゴブリンです。時折手を動かすと、その軌跡が青緑色に輝きます。"

#. ~ Monster attack message
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/monsters/goblin.json
#, c-format
msgid ""
"%1$s chatters words of magic and your %2$s is surrounded by a cloud of "
"scratching thorns!"
msgstr "%1$sが呪文を唱えると、%2$sに鋭い茨が巻き付きました！"

#. ~ Monster attack message
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/monsters/goblin.json
#, c-format
msgid ""
"%1$s chatters words of magic and <npcname>'s %2$s is surrounded by a cloud "
"of scratching thorns!"
msgstr "%1$sが呪文を唱えると、<npcname>の%2$sに鋭い茨が巻き付きました！"

#. ~ Monster attack message
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/monsters/goblin.json
#, c-format
msgid ""
"%1$s chatters words of magic and you narrowly avoid a cloud of scratching "
"thorns!"
msgstr "%1$sが呪文を唱え茨を巻き付かせようとしましたが、間一髪で避けました！"

#. ~ Monster attack message
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/monsters/goblin.json
#, c-format
msgid ""
"%1$s chatters words of magic and <npcname> narrowly avoids a cloud of "
"scratching thorns!"
msgstr "%1$sが呪文を唱え茨を巻き付かせようとしましたが、<npcname>は間一髪で避けました！"

#. ~ Monster attack message
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/monsters/goblin.json
#, c-format
msgid ""
"%1$s chatters words of magic and your %2$s is surrounded by a cloud of "
"scratching thorns, but they do no damage."
msgstr "%1$sが呪文を唱えると%2$sに鋭い茨が巻き付きましたが、ダメージを受けませんでした。"

#. ~ Monster attack message
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/monsters/goblin.json
#, c-format
msgid ""
"%1$s chatters words of magic and <npcname>'s %2$s is surrounded by a cloud "
"of scratching thorns, but they do no damage."
msgstr "%1$sが呪文を唱えると<npcname>の%2$sに鋭い茨が巻き付きましたが、ダメージを受けませんでした。"

#. ~ Monster message of special attack of monster "goblin thornweaver"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/monsters/goblin.json
#, c-format
msgid "%1$s waves their hands and %1$s is surrounded in greenish vapors."
msgstr "%1$sが手を動かすと、%1$sが緑色の霧に包まれました。"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/monsters/goblin.json
msgid "warg"
msgid_plural "wargs"
msgstr[0] "ワーグ"

#. ~ Description of monster "warg"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/monsters/goblin.json
msgid ""
"An enormous wolf, a meter and a half high at the shoulder, as large as a "
"young horse.  Tamed wargs were common as pets before the Cataclysm, but this"
" one looks anything but tame."
msgstr ""
"足から肩まで約1.5mの高さがある、若いウマほど体格の巨大なオオカミです。大変動以前は、飼い慣らされたワーグはペットとして一般的でしたが、このワーグは間違いなく飼い慣らされていないようです。"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/monsters/goblin.json
msgid "bugbear"
msgid_plural "bugbears"
msgstr[0] "バグベア"

#. ~ Description of monster "bugbear"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/monsters/goblin.json
msgid ""
"An enormous gray-green humanoid, over two meters tall with thick fur at "
"their joints and long, tufted ears, this creature no longer has much "
"resemblance to a goblin other than the color.  Despite their size, they move"
" in almost complete silence and hold a long bladed weapon in their hand."
msgstr ""
"身長が2m以上ある巨大な灰緑色の人形生物です。関節には厚い毛皮が生え、耳は長い房状になっており、もはや体色以外にゴブリンとの共通点はありません。体格の割にほとんど音を立てずに動き、手には長い刃が付いた武器を握っています。"

#. ~ Monster attack message
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/monsters/goblin.json
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/monsters/orcs.json
#, c-format
msgid "%1$s hits your %2$s with their blade!"
msgstr "%1$sは刃で%2$sを攻撃しました！"

#. ~ Monster attack message
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/monsters/goblin.json
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/monsters/orcs.json
#, c-format
msgid "%1$s hits <npcname>'s %2$s with their blade!"
msgstr "%1$sは刃で<npcname>の%2$sを攻撃しました！"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/monsters/goblin.json
msgid "bugbear stalker"
msgid_plural "bugbear stalkers"
msgstr[0] "バグベアの追跡者"

#. ~ Description of monster "bugbear stalker"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/monsters/goblin.json
msgid ""
"An enormous gray-green humanoid, over two meters tall with thick fur at "
"their joints and long, tufted ears, this creature no longer has much "
"resemblance to a goblin other than the color.  Despite their size, they move"
" in almost complete silence and hold a long spear in their hand.  Strangely,"
" you can only see them when you're looking directly at them; when in the "
"corner of your vision they simply fade from sight."
msgstr ""
"身長が2m以上ある巨大な灰緑色の人形生物です。関節には厚い毛皮が生え、耳は長い房状になっており、もはや体色以外にゴブリンとの共通点はありません。体格の割にほとんど音を立てずに動き、手には長い槍を握っています。不思議なことに、直接視線を合わせると視認できますが、視界の端に留めようとすると消えてしまいます。"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/monsters/golems.json
msgid "clay golem"
msgid_plural "clay golems"
msgstr[0] "ゴーレム(粘土)"

#. ~ Description of monster "clay golem"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/monsters/golems.json
msgid ""
"A large, humanoid golem made from clay.  Its proportions are off and it "
"seems fragile."
msgstr "粘土で作られた大きな人型のゴーレムです。バランスが取れておらず、壊れやすいようです。"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/monsters/golems.json
msgid "plastic golem"
msgid_plural "plastic golems"
msgstr[0] "ゴーレム(ﾌﾟﾗｽﾁｯｸ)"

#. ~ Description of monster "plastic golem"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/monsters/golems.json
msgid ""
"Traditionally, making a golem is a months-long process involving hand tools "
"and precision craftsmanship.  A stone golem is as much a work of art as it "
"is a magical device.  The advent of 3D printing made it easy to get into the"
" golem-making hobby, and plastic golems have soared in popularity."
msgstr ""
"伝統的なゴーレムの作成は、道具と緻密な職人技を駆使してなお数か月かかります。石のゴーレムは魔法の装置であると同時に芸術品なのです。ところが3Dプリント技術の浸透によってゴーレム作成は趣味にできるほど気軽になり、プラスチック製ゴーレムの人気は急上昇しています。"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/monsters/golems.json
msgid "stone golem"
msgid_plural "stone golems"
msgstr[0] "ゴーレム(石)"

#. ~ Description of monster "stone golem"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/monsters/golems.json
msgid ""
"A large, humanoid golem made from stone.  Its fists look similar to rockets."
msgstr "石で作られた大きな人型のゴーレムです。その拳の形はまるでロケットのようです。"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/monsters/golems.json
msgid "iron golem"
msgid_plural "iron golems"
msgstr[0] "ゴーレム(鉄)"

#. ~ Description of monster "iron golem"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/monsters/golems.json
msgid ""
"A large, humanoid golem made from iron.  Some sort of noxious gas seems to "
"be seeping from its mouth."
msgstr "鉄で作られた大きな人型のゴーレムです。口から何らかの有毒ガスが染み出しています。"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/monsters/golems.json
msgid "earthshaper's golem"
msgid_plural "earthshaper's golems"
msgstr[0] "ゴーレム(ｱｰｽｼｪｲﾊﾟｰ)"

#. ~ Description of monster "earthshaper's golem"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/monsters/golems.json
msgid ""
"This golem is easy to separate from other golems - the metallic "
"earthshaper's emblem shines on its smooth body, and it's eyes and hands are "
"made out of amethyst."
msgstr ""
"ゴーレムの滑らかなボディ表面には、金属で形作られたアースシェイパーの紋章が輝いており、目と手はアメジストでできているため、他のゴーレムとの違いは一目瞭然です。"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/monsters/holiday_magiclysm.json
msgid "Yule cat"
msgid_plural "Yule cats"
msgstr[0] "ユールキャット"

#. ~ Description of monster "Yule cat"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/monsters/holiday_magiclysm.json
msgid ""
"Magical beast from Icelandic folklore, known for their catlike appearance "
"and their hobby of eating Workshop Elves."
msgstr "アイスランドの民間伝承で語られる魔法の獣です。ネコのような姿をしていることと、サンタの工房にいるエルフを好んで食べることで知られています。"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/monsters/holiday_magiclysm.json
msgid "Yule cat cub"
msgid_plural "Yule cat cubs"
msgstr[0] "ユールキャット(幼体)"

#. ~ Description of monster "Yule cat cub"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/monsters/holiday_magiclysm.json
msgid ""
"The child of a Yule cat, this catlike creature looks as if it poses no "
"threat to you, but looks can be deceiving."
msgstr "ネコのような姿をした、ユールキャットの幼体です。無害であるように見えますが、見た目に騙されてはいけません。"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/monsters/holiday_magiclysm.json
msgid "workshop elf"
msgid_plural "workshop elves"
msgstr[0] "クリスマスエルフ"

#. ~ Description of monster "workshop elf"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/monsters/holiday_magiclysm.json
msgid ""
"Magical humanoids who are known for working in workshops, wearing green, and"
" being proficient at making toys."
msgstr "緑色の服を着ており、サンタの工房で働き、おもちゃを作るのが上手なことで知られている、魔法の国の住人です。"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/monsters/holiday_magiclysm.json
msgid "leprechaun"
msgid_plural "leprechauns"
msgstr[0] "レプラコーン"

#. ~ Description of monster "leprechaun"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/monsters/holiday_magiclysm.json
msgid ""
"Mischievous shoemakers who wear green and love pulling pranks on mortals."
msgstr "緑色の服を着た、人間にいたずらをするのが大好きな愛嬌のある靴屋です。"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/monsters/lizardfolk.json
msgid "lizardfolk warrior"
msgid_plural "lizardfolk warriors"
msgstr[0] "リザードフォークの戦士"

#. ~ Description of monster "lizardfolk warrior"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/monsters/lizardfolk.json
msgid ""
"A tall, powerful, reptilian humanoid with a muscular tail whose skin is "
"covered in dark gray-green scales.  They are tribal and tend to be found in "
"caves and near water, especially in areas inhabited by dragons and wyrms.  "
"They aren't particularly hostile, though they don't care for outsiders and "
"are highly dangerous when provoked.  While they usually prefer to fight with"
" their greatclubs, they are equally ferocious with their sharp teeth and "
"claws."
msgstr ""
"筋肉質の尾をもち、皮膚は濃い緑灰色の鱗で覆われた、背が高く力が強い人型の爬虫類です。部族として生活し、洞窟や水辺、特にドラゴンやウィルムが生息する地域でよく見かけます。別段敵対的ではありませんが、部外者には容赦せず、挑発するのは非常に危険です。一般的に立派な棍棒を持って戦うことを好みますが、鋭い歯と爪も強力な武器になります。"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/monsters/lizardfolk.json
msgid "lizardfolk hunter"
msgid_plural "lizardfolk hunters"
msgstr[0] "リザードフォークの狩人"

#. ~ Description of monster "lizardfolk hunter"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/monsters/lizardfolk.json
msgid ""
"The hunter is a smaller lizardfolk than a warrior, but equally as deadly, "
"with their lithe figures and accurate javelin throws."
msgstr "リザードフォークの狩人は同種の戦士よりも小柄ですが、危険性は同程度であり、しなやかな動きと槍の腕を駆使します。"

#. ~ Description of special attack of monster "lizardfolk hunter"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/monsters/lizardfolk.json
msgid "The hunter hurls a barbed javelin at you!"
msgstr "リザードフォークの狩人は棘付きの槍を投げました！"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/monsters/lizardfolk.json
msgid "lizardfolk shaman"
msgid_plural "lizardfolk shamans"
msgstr[0] "リザードフォークの呪術師"

#. ~ Description of monster "lizardfolk shaman"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/monsters/lizardfolk.json
msgid ""
"Lizardfolk are very intelligent and cunning, but magical ability is a rare "
"quality.  Shamans are chosen from the tribe during childhood, when magical "
"abilities mark the fate of the young tribesman.  Not much is known about the"
" initiation ritual they must undergo, but few survive the experience.  "
"Shamans are druidic spellcasters that can use the forces of nature to battle"
" enemies, as well as summoning assistance when needed."
msgstr ""
"リザードフォークは非常に知的で狡猾な種族ですが、魔法の力を持っている個体は非常に稀です。呪術師は幼少期に選び出されるため、魔力の有無は若い部族民の命運を左右します。呪術師が受けなければならない儀式についてはあまり知られていませんが、生き残れるものはほとんどいないと言われています。呪術師はドルイドに近い存在で、自然の力で敵と戦い、必要に応じて仲間を召喚します。"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/monsters/lizardfolk.json
msgid "lizardfolk chieftain"
msgid_plural "lizardfolk chieftains"
msgstr[0] "リザードフォークの族長"

#. ~ Description of monster "lizardfolk chieftain"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/monsters/lizardfolk.json
msgid ""
"Among the lizardfolk, ambition is a rare quality.  Chieftains earn their "
"place by exhibiting unusually high levels of ambition, often mistaken by "
"outsiders as excessive, brutal violence.  This chief is the largest and "
"strongest member of its tribe and carries a fierce trident to compliment its"
" teeth and claws."
msgstr ""
"野心をもったリザードフォークは非常に珍しい存在です。非常に強い野心を示した者だけが族長の地位を獲得しますが、この行動は外部の者から見れば過度な残忍性や暴力性と誤解されがちです。族長はその部族で最大かつ最強であり、その歯と爪の強さを褒めたたえる獰猛なトライデントを贈られます。"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/monsters/lizardfolk.json
#: data/mods/TropiCataclysm/monsters/tropical_reptile_amphibian.json
msgid "crocodile"
msgid_plural "crocodiles"
msgstr[0] "ワニ"

#. ~ Description of monster "crocodile"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/monsters/lizardfolk.json
msgid ""
"A once-and-future lizardfolk shaman, this large crocodile no longer has any "
"hint of any humanoid characteristics and looks very, very dangerous."
msgstr "いずれは呪術師になるはずだったリザードフォークは、人型の特徴が退化し、非常に危険な巨大ワニと化しています。"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/monsters/mi-go.json
msgid "mi-go fleshwarper"
msgid_plural "mi-go fleshwarpers"
msgstr[0] "ミ＝ゴ・フレッシュワーパー"

#. ~ Description of monster "mi-go fleshwarper"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/monsters/mi-go.json
msgid ""
"An alien creature of uncertain origin.  Its shapeless pink body bears "
"numerous sets of paired appendages of unknown function, and a pair of "
"ribbed, membranous wings which seem to be quite useless.  Its odd, vaguely "
"pyramid-shaped head bristles with numerous wavering antennae, and it moves "
"with an uncanny fluidity on its many legs.  Its flesh occasionally ripples, "
"as though something inside was squirming and trying to get free."
msgstr ""
"外宇宙からやって来た起源不明の怪物です。ピンク色をした不定形の肉体からは、数え切れないほどたくさんの未知の器官と、ちゃんと飛べるのかも分からない骨の通った膜状の一対の翅が生えています。どことなくピラミッドに似た形の奇妙な頭部には大量の触角が揺れており、大量の肢を使って驚くほど滑らかに移動します。この個体は時折肉体を波打たせています。まるで中に入っている何かが解き放たれようとしているかのようです。"

#. ~ Monster message of special attack of monster "mi-go fleshwarper"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/monsters/mi-go.json
#, c-format
msgid "%1$s's numerous antennae move rhythmically for a moment."
msgstr "%1$sに生えた多数の触角が、一瞬だけ規則正しく動きました。"

#. ~ Monster message of special attack of monster "mi-go fleshwarper"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/monsters/mi-go.json
#, c-format
msgid "%1$s's numerous antennae twitch in all directions for a moment."
msgstr "%1$sに生えた多数の触角が、一瞬だけバラバラに引きつりました。"

#. ~ Monster message of special attack of monster "mi-go fleshwarper"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/monsters/mi-go.json
#, c-format
msgid "As %1$s touches %3$s, the flesh warps and twists!"
msgstr "%1$sが%3$sに触れると、その部分の肉が捻じれました！"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/monsters/mi-go.json
msgid "mi-go nethermancer"
msgid_plural "mi-go nethermancers"
msgstr[0] "ミ＝ゴ・ネザーマンサー"

#. ~ Description of monster "mi-go nethermancer"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/monsters/mi-go.json
msgid ""
"An alien creature of uncertain origin.  Its shapeless pink body bears "
"numerous sets of paired appendages of unknown function, and a pair of "
"ribbed, membranous wings which seem to be quite useless.  Its odd, vaguely "
"pyramid-shaped head bristles with numerous wavering antennae, and it moves "
"with an uncanny fluidity on its many legs.  Its carapace is covered in "
"regular patterns which occasionally shift as you look at them before "
"settling into a new configuration."
msgstr ""
"外宇宙からやって来た起源不明の怪物です。ピンク色をした不定形の肉体からは、数え切れないほどたくさんの未知の器官と、ちゃんと飛べるのかも分からない骨の通った膜状の一対の翅が生えています。どことなくピラミッドに似た形の奇妙な頭部には大量の触角が揺れており、大量の肢を使って驚くほど滑らかに移動します。この個体の甲殻は規則的な模様で覆われており、しかも模様は常に変化し続けています。"

#. ~ Monster message of special attack of monster "mi-go nethermancer"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/monsters/mi-go.json
#, c-format
msgid ""
"%1$s twitches its antennae at %3$s and %3$s is lifted up and pulled towards "
"them!"
msgstr "%1$sが%3$sに触角を向けると、%3$sが持ち上げられ、引き寄せられました！"

#. ~ Monster message of special attack of monster "mi-go nethermancer"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/monsters/mi-go.json
#, c-format
msgid "%1$s's numerous antennae sync their movements for a brief moment."
msgstr "%1$sに生えた多数の触角の動きが、一瞬だけ同期しました。"

#. ~ Monster message of special attack of monster "mi-go nethermancer"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/monsters/mi-go.json
#, c-format
msgid "%1$s's numerous antennae weave in a complicated pattern."
msgstr "%1$sに生えた多数の触角が、複雑な模様を描きました。"

#. ~ Monster message of special attack of monster "mi-go nethermancer"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/monsters/mi-go.json
#, c-format
msgid "%1$s numerous antennae point directly at %3$s."
msgstr "%1$sに生えた多数の触角が%3$sを真っすぐ指し示しました。"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/monsters/mics.json
msgid "animated blade"
msgid_plural "animated blades"
msgstr[0] "魔剣"

#. ~ Description of monster "animated blade"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/monsters/mics.json
msgid ""
"A conjured glowing longsword that darts and dodges around, slicing and "
"cutting your foes into small pieces."
msgstr "呪文によって召喚された、光り輝きながら素早く動き回って敵を細切れにするロングソードです。"

#. ~ Description of monster "hologram"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/monsters/mics.json
msgid "Hologram copy of you."
msgstr "自分にそっくりな姿をしたホログラムです。"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/monsters/mics.json
msgid "watcher spirit"
msgid_plural "watcher spirits"
msgstr[0] "見張り精"

#. ~ Description of monster "watcher spirit"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/monsters/mics.json
msgid ""
"A summoned watcher spirit, translucent and barely visible.  It gazes all "
"around itself."
msgstr "半透明でほとんど視認できない、召喚された見張り精です。周囲を監視します。"

#. ~ Death message of monster "watcher spirit"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/monsters/mics.json
#, c-format
msgid "The %s dissipates in a gust of wind!"
msgstr "%sはあっという間に消えてしまいました！"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/monsters/monsters.json
msgid "owlbear"
msgid_plural "owlbears"
msgstr[0] "オウルベア"

#. ~ Description of monster "owlbear"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/monsters/monsters.json
msgid ""
"The horrible owlbear is probably the result of genetic experimentation by "
"some insane wizard.  These creatures inhabit the tangled forest regions of "
"every temperate clime, as well as subterranean labyrinths.  They are "
"ravenous eaters, aggressive hunters, and evil tempered at all times.  They "
"attack prey on sight and will fight to the death."
msgstr ""
"狂った魔法使いか何かによる遺伝子実験の産物としか思えない、恐ろしい怪物です。地下迷宮はもちろんのこと、気候の温暖な森林の奥深くにも生息しています。貪欲かつ攻撃的なハンターであり、常に悪意を振りまいています。非常に好戦的であり、獲物が死ぬまで戦い続けます。"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/monsters/monsters.json
msgid "black pudding"
msgid_plural "black puddings"
msgstr[0] "ブラックプディング"

#. ~ Description of monster "black pudding"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/monsters/monsters.json
msgid ""
"Writhing, sticky, black sludge undulates across the ground.  A faint "
"sizzling sound comes from the ground beneath it as it lurches toward you."
msgstr "べたつく黒いドロドロが震えながら動き回っています。接地面からは何かが焼けるような音がかすかに聞こえてきます。"

#. ~ Monster message of special attack of monster "black pudding"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/monsters/monsters.json
#, c-format
msgid "The black pudding burns %3$s with acid!"
msgstr "ブラックプディングの酸が%3$sを焼きました！"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/monsters/monsters.json
msgid "krabgek"
msgid_plural "krabgeks"
msgstr[0] "単眼魔獣"

#. ~ Description of monster "krabgek"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/monsters/monsters.json
msgid ""
"A large baleful eye peers out from the darkness, its gleam hinting at a "
"weird intelligence and unnerving malevolence.  The eye oozes some pinkish "
"liquid, and the weirdly humanoid figure is covered in sharp blue-black "
"triangular plates."
msgstr ""
"闇の中からこちらを覗く邪悪な単眼は、奇妙な知性と不穏な悪意にきらめいています。瞳からはピンク色の液体が染み出し、全身が鋭く尖った三角形の青黒い装甲で覆われています。"

#. ~ Monster message of special attack of monster "krabgek"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/monsters/monsters.json
#, c-format
msgid "The krabgek gazes at %3$s!"
msgstr "単眼魔獣は%3$sを凝視しました！"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/monsters/monsters.json
msgid "hunllef lamb"
msgid_plural "hunllef lambs"
msgstr[0] "ヒンシェヴシープ(幼体)"

#. ~ Description of monster "hunllef lamb"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/monsters/monsters.json
msgid ""
"The offspring of the Hunllef rams are much more docile but still have wicked"
" looking horns like their parents."
msgstr "ヒンシェヴシープの幼体は非常に大人しいですが、成体と同じ凶悪そうな角が生えています。"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/monsters/monsters.json
msgid "hunllef ram"
msgid_plural "hunllef rams"
msgstr[0] "ヒンシェヴシープ"

#. ~ Description of monster "hunllef ram"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/monsters/monsters.json
msgid ""
"Hunllef rams, also known as Nightmare Sheep, are a particularly vicious "
"breed of sheep suspected to be from another plane of existence.  Both males "
"and females display deadly horns and a willingness to use them on most other"
" creatures that come near them.  They are the most biddable source of "
"parabolan wool and often take a protective stance towards other sheep, so "
"some farmers will risk life and limb to keep them."
msgstr ""
"悪夢のヒツジという別名でも知られるヒンシェヴシープは、異次元の世界から来たと言われている凶暴なヒツジです。雌雄ともに凶悪な角をもっており、近づいてきた生物に突き刺そうとします。パラボラウールの採取に最も適しており、他のヒツジを守ろうとすることも多いため、命懸けで飼育する農家もいます。"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/monsters/monsters.json
msgid "owlbear cub"
msgid_plural "owlbear cubs"
msgstr[0] "オウルベア(幼体)"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/monsters/monsters.json
msgid "bulette"
msgid_plural "bulettes"
msgstr[0] "ブレイ"

#. ~ Description of monster "bulette"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/monsters/monsters.json
msgid ""
"The bulette (or landshark) was the result of a mad wizard's experimental "
"cross breeding of a snapping turtle and armadillo with infusions of demons' "
"ichor.  They range temperate climates feeding on horses, men, and most other"
" flesh.  The stupid bulette is irascible and always hungry, and they fear "
"nothing."
msgstr ""
"ブレイ(または陸鮫)とは、魔術師が実験的に生み出したカメとアルマジロの交配種に、更に悪魔の膿漿を注入して作りだされた怪物です。温暖な環境でウマや人間、その他の大抵の生物の肉を食べて暮らしています。頭が悪く、短気で、いつも腹を空かせており、怖いもの知らずな性格です。"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/monsters/monsters.json
msgid "will-o-wisp"
msgid_plural "will-o-wisps"
msgstr[0] "ウィルオウィスプ"

#. ~ Description of monster "will-o-wisp"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/monsters/monsters.json
msgid ""
"Will-o'-wisps can be yellow, white, green, or blue.  They are easily "
"mistaken for lanterns, especially in the foggy marshes and swamps where they"
" reside."
msgstr "黄色や白色、緑色、青色などに光る精霊です。霧の濃い湿地帯や沼地を好み、度々ランタンの明かりと間違えられます。"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/monsters/monsters.json
msgid "troll"
msgid_plural "trolls"
msgstr[0] "トロール"

#. ~ Description of monster "troll"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/monsters/monsters.json
msgid ""
"A monstrous, green-skinned humanoid, almost three meters tall but as thin as"
" the average human.  Trolls are renowned for their thick hides and natural "
"regenerative ability."
msgstr ""
"緑色の肌をもつ、奇怪な人型生物です。身長は3mほどありますが、体格は平均的な人間とそれほど変わりません。分厚い皮膚と高い自然治癒力で知られています。"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/monsters/monsters.json
msgid "rock troll"
msgid_plural "rock trolls"
msgstr[0] "岩トロール"

#. ~ Description of monster "rock troll"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/monsters/monsters.json
msgid ""
"A monstrous, gray-skinned humanoid, almost three meters tall but as thin as "
"the average human.  Rock trolls have rocky skin that's almost impervious to "
"hand weapons, but they turn to stone in the sunlight."
msgstr ""
"灰色の肌をもつ、奇怪な人型生物です。身長は3mほどありますが、体格は平均的な人間とそれほど変わりません。その名の通り肌が岩のようにゴツゴツしており、武器で殴ってもほとんど効果がありませんが、日光が当たると石化してしまいます。"

#. ~ Death message of monster "rock troll"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/monsters/monsters.json
#, c-format
msgid "The %s turns to stone."
msgstr "%sは石化しました。"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/monsters/monsters.json
msgid "sea troll"
msgid_plural "sea trolls"
msgstr[0] "海トロール"

#. ~ Description of monster "sea troll"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/monsters/monsters.json
msgid ""
"A monstrous, green-skinned humanoid, almost three meters tall but as thin as"
" the average human.  Sea trolls are just as mean and dangerous as trolls on "
"land, but they can also swim and breathe in water."
msgstr ""
"緑色の肌をもつ、奇怪な人型生物です。身長は3mほどありますが、体格は平均的な人間とそれほど変わりません。海トロールは陸トロールと同様に狡猾で危険なモンスターであり、水中でも呼吸し泳ぐことができます。"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/monsters/monsters.json
msgid "stirge"
msgid_plural "stirges"
msgstr[0] "スタージ"

#. ~ Description of monster "stirge"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/monsters/monsters.json
msgid ""
"This horrid flying creature looks like a cross between a large bat and "
"oversized mosquito."
msgstr "巨大なコウモリと蚊を掛け合わせたような姿の、恐ろしい飛行生物です。"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/monsters/monsters.json
msgid "shrieker"
msgid_plural "shriekers"
msgstr[0] "シュリーカー"

#. ~ Description of monster "shrieker"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/monsters/monsters.json
msgid ""
"A shrieker is a human-sized mushroom that emits a piercing screech to drive "
"off creatures that disturb it."
msgstr "敵を追い払うために鋭い金切り声を発する、人間ほどのサイズのキノコです。"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/monsters/monsters.json
msgid "frog"
msgid_plural "frogs"
msgstr[0] "カエル"

#. ~ Description of monster "frog"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/monsters/monsters.json
msgid ""
"A conspicuously average American bullfrog.  You better keep prince charming "
"away from it."
msgstr "アメリカで一般的なウシガエルです。王子様は逃げた方がよさそうです。"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/monsters/monsters.json
msgid "lemure"
msgid_plural "lemures"
msgstr[0] "レムレー"

#. ~ Description of monster "lemure"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/monsters/monsters.json
msgid ""
"A lemure resembles a molten mass of flesh with a vaguely humanoid head and "
"torso."
msgstr "どことなく人間に似た頭部と胴体をもつ、溶けた肉の塊です。"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/monsters/monsters.json
msgid "winter wolf"
msgid_plural "winter wolves"
msgstr[0] "ウィンターウルフ"

#. ~ Description of monster "winter wolf"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/monsters/monsters.json
msgid ""
"A pure white dire wolf.  If you squint, you can see a faint mist surrounding"
" its coat, and ice shards slowly descend from its breath."
msgstr "真っ白なダイアウルフです。よく見ると、毛皮の周りに氷の破片が霧のようにゆっくりと漂っているのが分かります。"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/monsters/monsters.json
msgid "loup garou"
msgid_plural "loup garous"
msgstr[0] "ルー＝ガルー"

#. ~ Description of monster "loup garou"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/monsters/monsters.json
msgid ""
"Previously thought extinct outside of rural Quebec and Louisiana this cursed"
" creature has been known to breed with true wolves when it isn't madly "
"destroying any signs of humanity in its territory."
msgstr ""
"かつてケベック州とルイジアナ州以外では絶滅したと考えられていた、恐るべき怪物です。本物のオオカミと繁殖し、縄張りに残った人間の痕跡を見つけると狂ったように破壊すると言われています。"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/monsters/monsters.json
msgid "fiery nightmare"
msgid_plural "fiery nightmares"
msgstr[0] "炎の悪鬼"

#. ~ Description of monster "fiery nightmare"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/monsters/monsters.json
msgid ""
"A colossal figure which seems to consist entirely of shadows engulfed in "
"flames.  Their immense dark wings extend from wall to wall.  Two eyes that "
"resemble burning coals are gazing down on you with hatred.  In one hand they"
" hold a huge sword, in the other a many thonged whip, both glowing with red-"
"hot flames."
msgstr ""
"燃え盛る影としか言い表しようがない、巨大な怪物です。黒く大きな翼を堂々と広げ、燃える石炭のような二つの瞳がこちらを憎々しげに見下ろしています。一方の手には大振りの剣、もう一方の手にはいくつにも枝分かれした鞭が握られており、どちらの武器も炎に包まれ赤熱しています。"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/monsters/monsters.json
msgid "teravolt"
msgid_plural "teravolts"
msgstr[0] "テラボルト"

#. ~ Description of monster "teravolt"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/monsters/monsters.json
msgid "A small energy sphere that slowly floats towards the target."
msgstr "標的に向かってゆっくりと浮遊する、小さなエネルギーの塊です。"

#. ~ Death message of monster "teravolt"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/monsters/monsters.json
#, c-format
msgid "The %s explode, creating a giant cloud of sparks."
msgstr "%sが爆発し、周囲に電撃の雲をまき散らしました。"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/monsters/monsters.json
msgid "razor butterfly"
msgid_plural "razor butterflies"
msgstr[0] "カミソリチョウ"

#. ~ Description of monster "razor butterfly"
#. ~ Description of monster "skyglass butterfly"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/monsters/monsters.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/monsters/elementals.json
msgid ""
"A large, brightly colored butterfly with crystalline wings, fluttering "
"incongruously through the air.  This one seems to be patterned with orange "
"runes, and its wings look razor-sharp."
msgstr ""
"水晶のような翅をもつ色鮮やかなチョウが、奇妙な動きで宙を舞っています。体表にオレンジ色のルーンが映っており、翅の縁は鋭く研ぎ澄まされているように見えます。"

#. ~ Death message of monster "razor butterfly"
#. ~ Death message of monster "shambling mound"
#. ~ Death message of monster "thunder pillar"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/monsters/monsters.json
#, c-format
msgid "The %s dissolves."
msgstr "%sは溶解しました。"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/monsters/monsters.json
msgid "shambling mound"
msgid_plural "shambling mounds"
msgstr[0] "シャンブリングマウンド"

#. ~ Description of monster "shambling mound"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/monsters/monsters.json
msgid ""
"This giant plant mess is one of the oldest magic species in the world.  They"
" were very rare before the Cataclysm, but their population has since "
"dramatically increased."
msgstr "世界で最も古い魔法種である、植物型の巨大生物です。大変動以前は大変な希少種でしたが、現在は生息数が劇的に増加しています。"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/monsters/monsters.json
msgid "electric demon"
msgid_plural "electric demons"
msgstr[0] "電撃インプ"

#. ~ Description of monster "electric demon"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/monsters/monsters.json
msgid ""
"Small, pure electric elemental that jumps from target to target, attacking "
"anything and everything in their sight bar the caster."
msgstr "純粋な電気エレメンタルの小塊です。標的から標的へと飛び移り、視界に入った敵を攻撃します。"

#. ~ Death message of monster "electric demon"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/monsters/monsters.json
#, c-format
msgid "A %s explode!"
msgstr "%sが爆発しました！"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/monsters/monsters.json
msgid "thunder pillar"
msgid_plural "thunder pillars"
msgstr[0] "雷柱"

#. ~ Description of monster "thunder pillar"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/monsters/monsters.json
msgid ""
"They look like a giant floating stone shard, but are actually an intelligent"
" creature that can use electric branches as their own bodies."
msgstr "見た目は浮遊する巨大な石柱ですが、その正体は電撃を自在に操る知的生命体です。"

#. ~ Monster message of special attack of monster "thunder pillar"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/monsters/monsters.json
msgid "The pillar weaves electricity around themself!"
msgstr "柱が電撃を帯びました！"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/monsters/monsters.json
msgid "ankheg"
msgid_plural "ankhegs"
msgstr[0] "アンケグ"

#. ~ Description of monster "ankheg"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/monsters/monsters.json
msgid ""
"A huge, segmented, burrowing insect, two meters long and pale greenish-"
"yellow in color."
msgstr "節のある巨大な虫です。穴を掘ることができ、体調は2m、色は淡い緑がかった黄色です。"

#. ~ Monster message of special attack of monster "ankheg"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/monsters/monsters.json
#, c-format
msgid "The ankheg spits a stream of acid at %3$s!"
msgstr "アンケグは%3$sに酸を吐きました！"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/monsters/monsters.json
msgid "otyugh"
msgid_plural "otyughs"
msgstr[0] "アティアグ"

#. ~ Description of monster "otyugh"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/monsters/monsters.json
msgid ""
"An enormous, bulbous body dominated by a toothy maw, with three tentacles "
"extending from the top.  Two tentacles are tipped with grasping filaments "
"and the last has several dark spots that might be eyes.  It smells "
"indescribably foul."
msgstr ""
"巨大な球根型の胴に大きな口が開き、中に歯が並んでいます。上部から3本の触手が伸びており、その内2本の先端には物を掴める細い繊維が、1本には目のような複数の黒い点が付いています。形容しがたい悪臭を放っています。"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/monsters/nature_spirits.json
msgid "mossling"
msgid_plural "mosslings"
msgstr[0] "モスリング"

#. ~ Description of monster "mossling"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/monsters/nature_spirits.json
msgid ""
"A dog-sized mass of lichen and plant matter, ambling about on a series of "
"short limbs.  It looks around the forest floor for fallen leaves to eat."
msgstr "イヌほどのサイズの地衣類と植物の塊が短い肢で歩き回っています。森の中で落ち葉を食べて暮らしています。"

#. ~ Death message of monster "mossling"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/monsters/nature_spirits.json
#, c-format
msgid "The %s collapses into a pile of moss."
msgstr "%sは崩壊して苔の山になりました。"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/monsters/nature_spirits.json
msgid "dryad"
msgid_plural "dryads"
msgstr[0] "ドライアド"

#. ~ Description of monster "dryad"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/monsters/nature_spirits.json
msgid ""
"You would have thought this was a tree until it suddenly moved.  It is "
"human-shaped and human-sized, but with wood for skin and leaves for hair.  "
"It regards you impassively."
msgstr ""
"突然動き出すまでは樹木としか思えない姿をしています。人型で人間ほどのサイズですが、皮膚は樹皮、髪は木の葉でできています。こちらに興味がないようです。"

#. ~ Death message of monster "dryad"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/monsters/nature_spirits.json
#, c-format
msgid "The %s collapses into splinters."
msgstr "%sは砕け散りました。"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/monsters/nature_spirits.json
msgid "brackenwight"
msgid_plural "brackenwights"
msgstr[0] "ブラッケンワイト"

#. ~ Description of monster "brackenwight"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/monsters/nature_spirits.json
msgid ""
"An animate pile of moss, leaves, sticks, and other forest detritus, towering"
" almost three meters high.  Three pits near the top with a lambent green "
"glow might be eyes.  It slowly walks on massive limbs."
msgstr ""
"苔、葉、木の枝など森林の堆積物が集まってできた、高さ約3メートルの動く小山です。頂上部で緑色に光っている3つの穴は、恐らく目のようです。太い肢が生えており、ゆっくりと歩きます。"

#. ~ Death message of monster "brackenwight"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/monsters/nature_spirits.json
#, c-format
msgid "The %s collapses into a massive pile of leaves and sticks."
msgstr "%sは崩壊し、葉や枝の山になりました。"

#. ~ Monster message of special attack of monster "brackenwight"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/monsters/nature_spirits.json
#, c-format
msgid "Questing roots explode out of %1$s toward %3$s!"
msgstr "%1$sの根が%3$sに襲い掛かりました！"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/monsters/nature_spirits.json
msgid "gnome"
msgid_plural "gnomes"
msgstr[0] "ノーム"

#. ~ Description of monster "gnome"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/monsters/nature_spirits.json
msgid ""
"A small mass of animate stone in the rough shape of a human, with clay for "
"joints.  Two gemstone eyes stare at you without blinking."
msgstr "人間に似た姿をした、小さな動く石の塊です。関節部は粘土になっており、宝石のような二つの目が瞬きもせずにこちらを見つめています。"

#. ~ Death message of monster "gnome"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/monsters/nature_spirits.json
#, c-format
msgid "The %s collapses into broken stone!"
msgstr "%sは砕け、石になって崩れ落ちました。"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/monsters/ogre.json
msgid "ogre"
msgid_plural "ogres"
msgstr[0] "オーガ"

#. ~ Description of monster "ogre"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/monsters/ogre.json
msgid ""
"An enormous, pale green beast known for living in swamps and eating "
"passersby, clutching a gigantic club in a single meaty hand; it will kill "
"anything it gets its hands on."
msgstr ""
"通行人を襲って食うことで知られている、沼地に棲む巨大な薄緑色の怪物です。大きな手に大きな棍棒を握りしめており、近寄ったものは手当たり次第に殺します。"

#. ~ Monster attack message
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/monsters/ogre.json
#, c-format
msgid "%1$s hits your %2$s with an enormous club!"
msgstr "%1$sは巨大な棍棒で%2$sを殴りました！"

#. ~ Monster attack message
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/monsters/ogre.json
#, c-format
msgid "%1$s hits <npcname>'s %2$s with an enormous club!"
msgstr "%1$sは巨大な棍棒で<npcname>の%2$sを殴りました！"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/monsters/ogre.json
msgid "ogre mage"
msgid_plural "ogre mages"
msgstr[0] "オーガメイジ"

#. ~ Description of monster "ogre mage"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/monsters/ogre.json
msgid ""
"An enormous, blue beast known for living in swamps and eating passersby, "
"slightly smaller than the other ogres you've seen.  This ogre has a more "
"calculating look.  As it idly waves the hand not holding a club, you see "
"sparkles trail through the air after its fingers."
msgstr ""
"通行人を襲って食うことで知られている、巨大な青色の怪物です。通常のオーガよりわずかに小さく、狡猾そうな表情を浮かべています。棍棒は持っておらず、手で妙な動きをすると指先がきらめきます。"

#. ~ Monster attack message
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/monsters/ogre.json
#, c-format
msgid "%1$s rumbles words of magic and an eldritch bolt impacts your %2$s!"
msgstr "%1$sが呪文を唱えると、不気味な雷が迸り%2$sに激突しました！"

#. ~ Monster attack message
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/monsters/ogre.json
#, c-format
msgid ""
"%1$s rumbles words of magic and an eldritch bolt impacts <npcname>'s %2$s!"
msgstr "%1$sが呪文を唱えると、不気味な雷が迸り<npcname>の%2$sに激突しました！"

#. ~ Monster attack message
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/monsters/ogre.json
#, c-format
msgid "%1$s rumbles words of magic and you narrowly avoid an eldritch bolt!"
msgstr "%1$sが呪文を唱えると不気味な雷が迸りましたが、間一髪で避けました！"

#. ~ Monster attack message
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/monsters/ogre.json
#, c-format
msgid ""
"%1$s rumbles words of magic and <npcname> narrowly avoids an eldritch bolt!"
msgstr "%1$sが呪文を唱えると不気味な雷が迸りましたが、<npcname>は間一髪で避けました！"

#. ~ Monster attack message
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/monsters/ogre.json
#, c-format
msgid ""
"%1$s rumbles words of magic and your %2$s is impacted by an eldritch bolt, "
"but it does no damage."
msgstr "%1$sが呪文を唱えると、不気味な雷が迸り%2$sに激突しましたがダメージはありませんでした。"

#. ~ Monster attack message
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/monsters/ogre.json
#, c-format
msgid ""
"%1$s rumbles words of magic and <npcname>'s %2$s is impacted by an eldritch "
"bolt, but it does no damage."
msgstr "%1$sが呪文を唱えると、不気味な雷が迸り<npcname>の%2$sに激突しましたがダメージはありませんでした。"

#. ~ Monster message of special attack of monster "ogre mage"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/monsters/ogre.json
#, c-format
msgid "%1$s gestures and %1$s is enveloped in darkness!"
msgstr "%1$sが手を振りかざすと、%1$sが闇に包まれました！"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/monsters/ogre.json
msgid "ettin"
msgid_plural "ettins"
msgstr[0] "エティン"

#. ~ Description of monster "ettin"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/monsters/ogre.json
msgid ""
"An enormous, clay-colored beast known for living in swamps and eating "
"passersby.  This one has two heads, both moving independently and gazing "
"around at their surroundings."
msgstr "通行人を襲って食うことで知られている、巨大な粘土色の怪物です。二つの頭部が独立して動き、周囲を見張っています。"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/monsters/ogre.json
msgid "ettercap"
msgid_plural "ettercaps"
msgstr[0] "エターキャップ"

#. ~ Description of monster "ettercap"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/monsters/ogre.json
msgid ""
"A hideous monstrosity, like a spider in the shape of a man.  Its dark purple"
" skin is half-covered in chitin, long claws extend from its hands and feet, "
"and eight eyes peer out from a distorted humanlike face."
msgstr ""
"人型のクモのような恐ろしい怪物です。濃い紫色の体表の半分はキチン質で覆われており、手足からは長い爪が伸び、人間に似た歪んだ顔には8つの目玉が並んでいます。"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/monsters/ogre.json
msgid "athach"
msgid_plural "athach"
msgstr[0] "アハッハ"

#. ~ Description of monster "athach"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/monsters/ogre.json
msgid ""
"A gigantic, ogre-like monster, nearly half again as tall as an ogre.  Two "
"huge tusks jut forth from a mouth twisted into a snarl, and a third arm "
"protrudes from the center of its chest."
msgstr ""
"オーガの約1.5倍のサイズの、オーガに似た巨大な怪物です。唸り声を発する歪んだ口からは2本の巨大な牙が突き出し、胴の中央から3本目の腕が伸びています。"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/monsters/orcs.json
msgid "orc warrior"
msgid_plural "orc warriors"
msgstr[0] "オークの戦士"

#. ~ Description of monster "orc warrior"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/monsters/orcs.json
msgid ""
"Like a goblin, but stretched and exaggerated until they're as tall as a "
"human but much more heavily muscled, wearing improvised armor and carrying a"
" spear."
msgstr "ゴブリンに似た姿ですが、身長は成人ほどあり、人間よりも遥かに筋肉質です。即席の鎧をまとい、槍を構えています。"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/monsters/orcs.json
msgid "orc archer"
msgid_plural "orc archers"
msgstr[0] "オークの射手"

#. ~ Description of monster "orc archer"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/monsters/orcs.json
msgid ""
"Like a goblin, but stretched and exaggerated until they're as tall as a "
"human but much more heavily muscled, wearing improvised armor and carrying a"
" bow.  They smile silently, baring a set of sharp teeth, as they aim at you."
msgstr ""
"ゴブリンに似た姿ですが、身長は成人ほどあり、人間よりも遥かに筋肉質です。即席の鎧をまとい、弓を手にしています。鋭い歯を剥き出しにしてほくそ笑み、静かにこちらを狙っています。"

#. ~ Description of special attack of monster "orc archer"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/monsters/orcs.json
msgid "The orc shoots you with laser accuracy!"
msgstr "オークは狙い違わずまっすぐに矢を発射しました！"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/monsters/orcs.json
msgid "blood orc"
msgid_plural "blood orcs"
msgstr[0] "ブラッドオーク"

#. ~ Description of monster "blood orc"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/monsters/orcs.json
msgid ""
"Like a goblin, but stretched and exaggerated until they're as tall as a "
"human but much more heavily muscled, wearing improvised armor and carrying "
"an enormous metallic club.  There are red streaks all over their skin, like "
"they had bathed themselves in blood."
msgstr ""
"ゴブリンに似た姿ですが、身長は成人ほどあり、人間よりも遥かに筋肉質です。即席の鎧をまとい、巨大な金属製の棍棒を握っています。皮膚全体に赤い筋が入っており、まるで血を浴びたかのように見えます。"

#. ~ Monster attack message
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/monsters/orcs.json
#, c-format
msgid "%1$s hits your %2$s with their mace!"
msgstr "%1$sはメイスで%2$sを攻撃しました！"

#. ~ Monster attack message
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/monsters/orcs.json
#, c-format
msgid "%1$s hits <npcname>'s %2$s with their mace!"
msgstr "%1$sはメイスで<npcname>の%2$sを攻撃しました！"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/monsters/orcs.json
msgid "orc blood-mage"
msgid_plural "orc blood-mages"
msgstr[0] "オークの呪術師"

#. ~ Description of monster "orc blood-mage"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/monsters/orcs.json
msgid ""
"Like a goblin, but stretched and exaggerated until they're as tall as a "
"human but much more heavily muscled, wearing improvised armor.  There are "
"red streaks all over their skin, like they had bathed themselves in blood, "
"and their hands glow faintly red."
msgstr ""
"ゴブリンに似た姿ですが、身長は成人ほどあり、人間よりも遥かに筋肉質です。即席の鎧をまとい、手元がほのかに赤く光っています。皮膚全体に赤い筋が入っており、まるで血を浴びたかのように見えます。"

#. ~ Monster attack message
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/monsters/orcs.json
#, c-format
msgid ""
"%1$s growls words of magic and your %2$s is impacted by a bolt of carmine "
"energy!"
msgstr "%1$sが呪文を呟くと、%2$sを赤いエネルギーの奔流が襲いました！"

#. ~ Monster attack message
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/monsters/orcs.json
#, c-format
msgid ""
"%1$s growls words of magic and <npcname>'s %2$s is impacted by a bolt of "
"carmine energy!"
msgstr "%1$sが呪文を呟くと、<npcname>の%2$sを赤いエネルギーの奔流が襲いました！"

#. ~ Monster attack message
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/monsters/orcs.json
#, c-format
msgid ""
"%1$s growls words of magic and you narrowly avoid a bolt of carmine energy!"
msgstr "%1$sが呪文を呟き赤いエネルギーの奔流を放ちましたが、間一髪で避けました！"

#. ~ Monster attack message
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/monsters/orcs.json
#, c-format
msgid ""
"%1$s growls words of magic and <npcname> narrowly avoids a bolt of carmine "
"energy!"
msgstr "%1$sが呪文を呟き赤いエネルギーの奔流を放ちましたが、<npcname>は間一髪で避けました！"

#. ~ Monster attack message
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/monsters/orcs.json
#, c-format
msgid ""
"%1$s growls words of magic and your %2$s is surrounded by a cloud of "
"scratching thorns, but they do no damage."
msgstr "%1$sが呪文を呟き%2$sに赤いエネルギーの奔流を放ちましたが、ダメージを受けませんでした。"

#. ~ Monster attack message
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/monsters/orcs.json
#, c-format
msgid ""
"%1$s growls words of magic and <npcname>'s %2$s is surrounded by a cloud of "
"scratching thorns, but they do no damage."
msgstr "%1$sが呪文を呟き<npcname>の%2$sに赤いエネルギーの奔流を放ちましたが、ダメージを受けませんでした。"

#. ~ Monster message of special attack of monster "orc blood-mage"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/monsters/orcs.json
#, c-format
msgid ""
"%1$s makes a frenzied cry and as they point, %3$s is surrounded by a red "
"glow."
msgstr "%1$sが狂ったように叫んで指をさすと、%3$sが赤い光に包まれました。"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/monsters/plants.json
msgid "tanglevine"
msgid_plural "tanglevines"
msgstr[0] "絡みつく蔓"

#. ~ Description of monster "tanglevine"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/monsters/plants.json
msgid ""
"A thick mass of animated vine, lashing back and forth at anything that comes"
" within reach.  Long thorns grow from its sides."
msgstr "長い棘で覆われた自在に動く太い蔦が、届く範囲にあるものを激しく打ち据えます。"

#. ~ Death message of monster "tanglevine"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/monsters/plants.json
#, c-format
msgid "The %s rots into nothingness in moments."
msgstr "%sは一瞬で枯れて消えました。"

#. ~ Monster attack message
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/monsters/plants.json
#, c-format
msgid "%1$s squeezes and its thorns dig into your %2$s!"
msgstr "%1$sがのしかかり、棘が%2$sに食い込みました！"

#. ~ Monster attack message
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/monsters/plants.json
#, c-format
msgid "%1$s squeezes <npcname>!"
msgstr "%1$sは<npcname>にのしかかりました！"

#. ~ Monster attack message
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/monsters/plants.json
#, c-format
msgid "%1$s tries to squeeze you, but you fight back!"
msgstr "%1$sがのしかかろうとしましたが、飛びのきました！"

#. ~ Monster attack message
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/monsters/plants.json
#, c-format
msgid "%1$s tries to squeeze <npcname>, but they fight back!"
msgstr "%1$sがのしかかろうとしましたが、<npcname>は飛びのきました！"

#. ~ Monster attack message
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/monsters/plants.json
#, c-format
msgid "%1$s squeezes your %2$s, but fails to penetrate your armor."
msgstr "%1$sが%2$sを押し潰そうとしましたが、装甲に阻まれました。"

#. ~ Monster attack message
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/monsters/plants.json
#, c-format
msgid "%1$s squeezes <npcname>, but fails to penetrate their armor."
msgstr "%1$sが<npcname>を押し潰そうとしましたが、装甲に阻まれました。"

#. ~ Description of monster "shadow"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/monsters/shadows.json
msgid ""
"This is an animate shadow.  Looking like nothing more than an errant patch "
"of normal shadow, it draws your attention by the way it moves subtly and "
"whispers softly in the back of your mind.  Strange intrusive thoughts "
"accompany the quiet murmur, awakening your most horrific memories and fears."
msgstr ""
"動き回る影です。見た目は通常の影を逸脱したものに過ぎませんが、その巧妙な動きと心の奥底に囁きかけてくる声には注意が必要です。精神に入り込む際に、心の奥の最も恐ろしい記憶や恐怖心を呼び覚ますような、静かな音をたてます。"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/monsters/triffids.json
msgid "triffid vineweaver"
msgid_plural "triffid vineweavers"
msgstr[0] "蔦編みトリフィド"

#. ~ Description of monster "triffid vineweaver"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/monsters/triffids.json
msgid ""
"A particularly large mobile plant, taller than a moose.  It has a single "
"bark-covered stalk supporting a flowery head with a paralyzing sting "
"concealed within.  Some of its fronds move in particular patterns, an "
"eldritch light trailing after them.  Nature will be healed."
msgstr ""
"ヘラジカよりも背が高い、特に大きな動く植物です。樹皮で覆われた茎の先端には花が咲いており、内部には麻痺毒の針が隠れています。葉の一部は一定のパターンで動いており、不気味な光が後を追うようにまとわりついています。自然が回復している証拠ですね。"

#. ~ Monster message of special attack of monster "triffid vineweaver"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/monsters/triffids.json
#, c-format
msgid "%1$s waves its fronds in a deliberate pattern."
msgstr "%1$sが葉を周期的に動かしました。"

#. ~ Monster message of special attack of monster "triffid vineweaver"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/monsters/triffids.json
#, c-format
msgid "%1$s waves its fronds toward the ground."
msgstr "%1$sは葉を地面に向けて振りました。"

#. ~ Monster message of special attack of monster "triffid vineweaver"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/monsters/triffids.json
#, c-format
msgid "%1$s twitches its base and roots burst from the ground around %3$s."
msgstr "%1$sの根本がヒクヒクと動き、%3$sの周りの地面から根が飛び出しました。"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/monsters/triffids.json
msgid "triffid seedshaper"
msgid_plural "triffid seedshapers"
msgstr[0] "花粉トリフィド"

#. ~ Description of monster "triffid seedshaper"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/monsters/triffids.json
msgid ""
"A creeping mobile plant, as tall as a moose.  It has a single bark-covered "
"stalk supporting a flowery head with a paralyzing sting concealed within.  A"
" hazy cloud of pollen hangs around it."
msgstr ""
"ヘラジカほどの大きさにまで成長した、這い回る植物です。樹皮で覆われた茎の先端には花が咲いており、内部には麻痺毒の針が隠れています。周囲に花粉を雲のように撒き散らしています。"

#. ~ Monster message of special attack of monster "triffid seedshaper"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/monsters/triffids.json
#, c-format
msgid "%1$s waves its fronds and pollen erupts out in a cone!"
msgstr "%1$sが葉を振ると、花粉が噴き出しました！"

#. ~ Monster message of special attack of monster "triffid seedshaper"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/monsters/triffids.json
#, c-format
msgid "%1$s waves its fronds and a glow surrounds %3$s."
msgstr "%1$sが葉を揺らすと、%3$sの周囲が光に包まれました。"

#. ~ Monster message of special attack of monster "triffid seedshaper"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/monsters/triffids.json
#, c-format
msgid "%1$s waves its fronds and %3$s starts moving faster!"
msgstr "%1$sが葉を振ると、%3$sの動きが素早くなりました！"

#. ~ Monster message of special attack of monster "triffid seedshaper"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/monsters/triffids.json
#, c-format
msgid "%1$s waves its fronds and golden pollen cascades down over %3$s!"
msgstr "%1$sが葉を振ると、黄金色の花粉が滝のように%3$sに降り注ぎました！"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/monsters/zombified_monsters.json
msgid "rotting wolf man"
msgid_plural "rotting wolf men"
msgstr[0] "人狼ゾンビ"

#. ~ Description of monster "rotting wolf man"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/monsters/zombified_monsters.json
msgid ""
"The classic half man half wolf of the movies, but with a new twist: UNDEATH!"
"  This monster lopes along alternating between two and four legged gaits.  "
"It's jet black eyes seething with insatiable hunger.  Now you will know why "
"you fear the night."
msgstr ""
"映画にも登場する古典的な半人半狼の怪物に、「ゾンビ」という一捻りを加えました！2足歩行と4足歩行が混ざったように歩き、真っ黒な瞳からは永久に続く飢餓感が溢れています。出会った瞬間に、生物が夜を恐れる真の理由を知ることになるでしょう。"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/monsters/zombified_monsters.json
msgid "zorc"
msgid_plural "zorcs"
msgstr[0] "ゾンビオーク"

#. ~ Description of monster "zorc"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/monsters/zombified_monsters.json
msgid ""
"This unholy beast looks at you with a piercing stare so strong it might "
"scare your soul away."
msgstr "魂を凍てつかせるような強く鋭い視線をこちらに向ける、不浄な獣です。"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/monsters/zombified_monsters.json
msgid "zowlbear"
msgid_plural "zowlbears"
msgstr[0] "ゾンビオウルベア"

#. ~ Description of monster "zowlbear"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/monsters/zombified_monsters.json
msgid ""
"This horrible mutant monster has been zombified.  Though it looks weaker "
"than its living counterpart, you feel much more hostility from its black "
"oily eyes."
msgstr "ゾンビ化した恐ろしい変異体の怪物です。生前よりも弱っているように見えますが、黒い油のような液体が垂れる瞳からは、強い敵意が感じられます。"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/monsters/zombified_monsters.json
msgid "zowlbear predator"
msgid_plural "zowlbear predators"
msgstr[0] "凶暴ゾンビオウルベアー"

#. ~ Description of monster "zowlbear predator"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/monsters/zombified_monsters.json
msgid ""
"A once zombified owlbear, now faster and much bigger in size.  Its thick "
"skin protects the monster from harm, a sharp beak capable of rending through"
" metal and a fury in its eyes warns you to stay away."
msgstr ""
"ゾンビ化したオウルベアが、より素早く、より巨大になりました。全身が厚い皮膚で覆われており、鋭いくちばしは金属すら引き裂きます。瞳に怒りを宿しており、迂闊に近づいてはいけないと感じます。"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/monsters/zombified_monsters.json
msgid "undying"
msgid_plural "undying"
msgstr[0] "ゾンビトロール"

#. ~ Description of monster "undying"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/monsters/zombified_monsters.json
msgid ""
"An enormous humanoid monster with a yellowish-green skin.  Trolls are "
"renowned for their thick hides and natural regenerative ability.  After "
"death, its pus filled body seems to have much grown stronger, it looks at "
"you ferociously with hunger in its eyes."
msgstr ""
"肌が黄緑色に変色した、巨大な人型のモンスターです。分厚い皮膚と生来の再生能力には定評がありましたが、膿に満たされた死後の肉体は更に強くなったように見えます。瞳に飢餓の感情を宿し、どう猛そうな表情でこちらを見ています。"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/monsters/zombified_monsters.json
msgid "zombified Yule cat"
msgid_plural "zombified Yule cats"
msgstr[0] "ゾンビユールキャット"

#. ~ Description of monster "zombified Yule cat"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/monsters/zombified_monsters.json
msgid ""
"A magical beast from Icelandic folklore, known for their catlike appearance "
"and their hobby of eating Workshop Elves.  It creepily stumbles on its 4 "
"legs with its squirming uneven body after meeting demise and being reborn "
"just to eat you."
msgstr ""
"アイスランドの民間伝承に語られる魔法の獣です。ネコのような姿をしていることと、サンタの工房にいるエルフを好んで食べることで知られています。一度死んで生まれ変わった後は人間だけを好んで食べるようになり、よろめきながらボロボロになった肉体を4本の足で支えています。"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/monsters/zombified_monsters.json
msgid "Tod cat"
msgid_plural "Tod cats"
msgstr[0] "凶暴ゾンビユールキャット"

#. ~ Description of monster "Tod cat"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/monsters/zombified_monsters.json
msgid ""
"Once used to its decomposed body, this nightmarish cat with thick teeth and "
"razor-sharp claws seems to be looking around for things to \"play\" with.  "
"Though its head is of a feline, it grins at you sadistically with a glint in"
" its cold demonic eyes."
msgstr ""
"腐った肉体に慣れてしまった恐るべきユールキャットは、太い牙とカミソリのような爪に相応しい「遊び相手」を探し回っています。悪魔のような瞳は冷たく輝いており、口元にはサディスティックな笑みが浮かんでいます。"

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/debug_mutations.json
msgid "Vault Defender"
msgstr "炉の守護者"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Vault Defender"
#. ~ Description of mutation "library defender"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/debug_mutations.json
msgid "To cast bug killing spells."
msgstr "バグ退治の呪文を唱え放題です。"

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/debug_mutations.json
msgid "library defender"
msgstr "書庫の守護者"

#. ~ Mutation class name
#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/dragon_mutation_category.json
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Black Dragon"
msgstr "ブラックドラゴン"

#. ~ "mutagen_message" of mutation class "Black Dragon"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/dragon_mutation_category.json
msgid ""
"Acid boils through your veins.  You feel ancient power swell within you."
msgstr "血管の中で酸が沸騰しています。古代の力が体内で膨らんでいる気がします。"

#. ~ Memorial message of mutation class "Black Dragon" for male
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/dragon_mutation_category.json
msgctxt "memorial_male"
msgid "Settled to slumber with their hoard."
msgstr "宝と共にまどろむことを決めました。"

#. ~ Memorial message of mutation class "Black Dragon" for female
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/dragon_mutation_category.json
msgctxt "memorial_female"
msgid "Settled to slumber with their hoard."
msgstr "宝と共にまどろむことを決めました。"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "DRAGON_BLACK"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/dreams.json
msgid "You have a strange dream about dragons."
msgstr "竜に関する奇妙な夢を見ました。"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "DRAGON_BLACK"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/dreams.json
msgid "You have a disturbing dream of rampaging in a village."
msgstr "村を滅茶苦茶に破壊する不穏な夢を見ました。"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "DRAGON_BLACK"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/dreams.json
msgid ""
"While dreaming, you see a distinctively dragon-like reflection of yourself."
msgstr "夢の中で、自分は竜のような姿になっていました。"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "DRAGON_BLACK"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/dreams.json
msgid ""
"You blissfully dream of soaring over a human village.  The thought of "
"destroying it and abducting the chiefs daughter is somewhat disturbing."
msgstr "人間が棲む村の上空を飛ぶという、この上なく心地よい夢を見ました。村を破壊して村長の娘を誘拐することを考え、そわそわした気分になっています。"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "DRAGON_BLACK"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/dreams.json
msgid "You have a disturbingly lifelike dream of living as a dragon."
msgstr "竜のように生活する不穏な夢を見ました。"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "DRAGON_BLACK"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/dreams.json
msgid "In your dream you are the nightmare of a human."
msgstr "夢の中で、人間にとっての悪夢として暴れ回りました。"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "DRAGON_BLACK"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/dreams.json
msgid "You have a disturbingly satisfying dream of ravaging a human village."
msgstr "人里を滅茶苦茶に破壊する、不穏で楽しい夢を見ました。"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "DRAGON_BLACK"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/dreams.json
msgid "You dream of raiding a castle and abducting the princess."
msgstr "城を襲って姫を誘拐する夢を見ました。"

#. ~ Mutation class name
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/fantasy_species.json
msgid "Dwarf"
msgstr "ドワーフ"

#. ~ "mutagen_message" of mutation class "Dwarf"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/fantasy_species.json
msgid "Your heart beats in time with the rhythm of the Earth."
msgstr "心臓が地球のリズムに合わせて脈動しています。"

#. ~ Memorial message of mutation class "Dwarf" for male
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/fantasy_species.json
msgctxt "memorial_male"
msgid "Entered the halls of the King Under the Mountain."
msgstr "山の下の王の広間に入りました。"

#. ~ Memorial message of mutation class "Dwarf" for female
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/fantasy_species.json
msgctxt "memorial_female"
msgid "Entered the halls of the King Under the Mountain."
msgstr "山の下の王の広間に入りました。"

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/fantasy_species.json
msgid "Child of the Stone"
msgstr "石の子"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Child of the Stone"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/fantasy_species.json
msgid ""
"Trust the humans to make a mess of the world.  Trust a dwarf to rebuild it "
"better than they found it."
msgstr "世界を混乱させているのはきっと人間です。ドワーフなら人間よりもっといい世界を作れます。"

#. ~ Vitamin name
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/fantasy_species.json
msgid "Dwarven Purifier"
msgstr "変異治療(ドワーフ)"

#. ~ Mutation class name
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/fantasy_species.json
msgid "Elf"
msgstr "エルフ"

#. ~ "mutagen_message" of mutation class "Elf"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/fantasy_species.json
msgid "You hear the songs of nature."
msgstr "自然の歌が聞こえてきます。"

#. ~ Memorial message of mutation class "Elf" for male
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/fantasy_species.json
msgctxt "memorial_male"
msgid "Passed into the West."
msgstr "西方へ向かいました。"

#. ~ Memorial message of mutation class "Elf" for female
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/fantasy_species.json
msgctxt "memorial_female"
msgid "Passed into the West."
msgstr "西方へ向かいました。"

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/fantasy_species.json
msgid "Firstborn"
msgstr "最初に生まれた者"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Firstborn"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/fantasy_species.json
msgid ""
"The first elves sprang forth from magic and moonlight before the ancestors "
"of humanity stopped scurrying through the underbrush to avoid the dinosaurs."
"  You won't let that legacy die with you."
msgstr ""
"人類の祖先が恐竜を避けて草むらを走り回っていた時代より以前、最初のエルフは魔法と月の光から生まれました。至宝をこのまま消滅させるわけにはいきません。"

#. ~ Vitamin name
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/fantasy_species.json
msgid "Elven Purifier"
msgstr "変異治療(エルフ)"

#. ~ Mutation class name
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/fantasy_species.json
msgid "Goblin"
msgstr "ゴブリン"

#. ~ "mutagen_message" of mutation class "Goblin"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/fantasy_species.json
msgid "You feel the urge to steal a baby or two."
msgstr "赤ん坊の一人か二人、攫ってしまいたい気分です。"

#. ~ Memorial message of mutation class "Goblin" for male
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/fantasy_species.json
msgctxt "memorial_male"
msgid "Went full goblin mode."
msgstr "完全なゴブリンモードに突入しました。"

#. ~ Memorial message of mutation class "Goblin" for female
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/fantasy_species.json
msgctxt "memorial_female"
msgid "Went full goblin mode."
msgstr "完全なゴブリンモードに突入しました。"

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/fantasy_species.json
msgid "Night Stalker"
msgstr "夜魔"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Night Stalker"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/fantasy_species.json
msgid ""
"Long ago, the others feared your people as hunters in the night.  In this "
"new world, it's time to revive that legacy."
msgstr "かつては他の種族から夜の狩人として恐れられていました。この新世界で、その古い呼び名を復活させる時が来たのです。"

#. ~ Vitamin name
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/fantasy_species.json
msgid "Goblin Purifier"
msgstr "変異治療(ゴブリン)"

#. ~ Mutation class name
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/fantasy_species.json
msgid "Lizardfolk"
msgstr "リザードフォーク"

#. ~ "mutagen_message" of mutation class "Lizardfolk"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/fantasy_species.json
msgid "You remember the warmth of your home swamps."
msgstr "故郷の沼地の温もりを思い出しました。"

#. ~ Memorial message of mutation class "Lizardfolk" for male
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/fantasy_species.json
msgctxt "memorial_male"
msgid "Returned to the World Egg."
msgstr "世界卵に還りました。"

#. ~ Memorial message of mutation class "Lizardfolk" for female
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/fantasy_species.json
msgctxt "memorial_female"
msgid "Returned to the World Egg."
msgstr "世界卵に還りました。"

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/fantasy_species.json
msgid "Scaled One"
msgstr "鱗ある者"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Scaled One"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/fantasy_species.json
msgid ""
"The old world was nothing like your home swamps, but this new world is "
"something you understand."
msgstr "かつての世界は故郷の沼地とは程遠いものでしたが、この新世界であれば馴染めそうです。"

#. ~ Vitamin name
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/fantasy_species.json
msgid "Lizardfolk Purifier"
msgstr "変異治療(リザードフォーク)"

#. ~ Mutation class name
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/fantasy_species.json
msgid "Ravenfolk"
msgstr "レイヴンフォーク"

#. ~ "mutagen_message" of mutation class "Ravenfolk"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/fantasy_species.json
msgid ""
"You feel the call of the sky.  There are treasures out there to collect."
msgstr "空の呼び声を感じます。集めるべき宝が見つかりそうな気がします。"

#. ~ Memorial message of mutation class "Ravenfolk" for male
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/fantasy_species.json
msgctxt "memorial_male"
msgid "Fell from your perch on the World Tree."
msgstr "世界樹の枝から飛び立ちました。"

#. ~ Memorial message of mutation class "Ravenfolk" for female
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/fantasy_species.json
msgctxt "memorial_female"
msgid "Fell from your perch on the World Tree."
msgstr "世界樹の枝から飛び立ちました。"

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/fantasy_species.json
msgid "Thought and Memory"
msgstr "思考と記憶"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Thought and Memory"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/fantasy_species.json
msgid ""
"In the ruins of the old world, you're sure there are plenty of new places to"
" go and new things to find."
msgstr "旧世界の廃墟には、新たな場所や発見がたくさんある筈です。"

#. ~ Vitamin name
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/fantasy_species.json
msgid "Ravenfolk Purifier"
msgstr "変異治療(レイヴンフォーク)"

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/fantasy_species.json
msgid "Dwarven Build"
msgstr "ドワーフの体格"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Dwarven Build"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/fantasy_species.json
msgid ""
"Dwarves are smaller than humans, the better to deal with confined spaces "
"underground, but as solid as the mountains (+2 STR, -1 DEX)."
msgstr "一般的な人間よりも小さいため地下の狭い空間での行動が得意であり、山のように堅固です(筋力+2、器用-1)。"

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/fantasy_species.json
msgid "Earthborn Artisan"
msgstr "大地の職人"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Earthborn Artisan"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/fantasy_species.json
msgid ""
"Born from the living earth, your people are naturally adept at the "
"manipulation of the physical world."
msgstr "大地から生まれた者は、生まれたときから自然界の物質の細工に熟達しています。"

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/fantasy_species.json
msgid "Darksight"
msgstr "ダークサイト"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Darksight"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/fantasy_species.json
msgid ""
"Long ages underground or under the night boughs have made your people "
"capable of seeing into the infrared spectrum."
msgstr "地下や宵闇で長い年月を過ごしたお陰で、赤外線スペクトルを視認できるようになりました。"

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/fantasy_species.json
msgid "Elven Build"
msgstr "エルフの体格"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Elven Build"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/fantasy_species.json
msgid ""
"Elves are more lithe and frail than humans, but possess an almost "
"otherworldly grace (-1 STR, +2 DEX)."
msgstr "一般的な人間よりもしなやかで弱く、この世のものとは思えないほど優雅に動きます(筋力-1、器用+2)。"

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/fantasy_species.json
msgid "Passing Fair"
msgstr "並外れた美貌"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Passing Fair"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/fantasy_species.json
msgid ""
"The elves are often called the \"Fair Folk\" due to their preternatural "
"beauty, and you are no exception to this custom."
msgstr "エルフはその超自然的な美貌から「美しい民」と呼ばれており、この顔も例外ではありません。"

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/fantasy_species.json
msgid "Elven Hearing"
msgstr "エルフの聴覚"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Elven Hearing"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/fantasy_species.json
msgid ""
"Your delicate pointed ears allow you to hear all the sounds of the world."
msgstr "繊細な尖った耳は、世界のあらゆる音を聞き分けます。"

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/fantasy_species.json
msgid "Reverie"
msgstr "夢想"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Reverie"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/fantasy_species.json
msgid ""
"Rather than sleep insensate like humans do, you blend living night and "
"dreams into a harmonious whole.  You are not bothered by light levels, and "
"need much less sleep per night."
msgstr ""
"人間のように意識を失って眠るのではなく、肉体を夜の夢と一体化して調和を保ち眠ります。明るさに関係なく眠ることができ、睡眠時間が大幅に短縮されます。"

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/fantasy_species.json
msgid "Natural Stride"
msgstr "木々の足取り"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Natural Stride"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/fantasy_species.json
msgid ""
"The elves were born of nature and the elements, and long ages under the "
"trees allow them to quickly pass through their forest homes."
msgstr "エルフは自然と元素から生まれ、長い間木々と共に過ごしてきました。森は自宅のようなものであり、素早く通り抜けられます。"

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/fantasy_species.json
msgid "Goblin Build"
msgstr "ゴブリンの体格"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Goblin Build"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/fantasy_species.json
msgid ""
"Goblins are much smaller than humans, often no more than half the height.  "
"You have a harder time carrying things and can't eat as much, but you're "
"better at dodging and make very little noise when you move."
msgstr ""
"一般的な人間よりも遥かに小さく、身長が人間の半分に満たないこともあります。物を運ぶのが大変で食も細くなりますが、攻撃の回避は得意で、動いてもほとんど音を立てません。"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Nocturnal"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/fantasy_species.json
msgid ""
"Your people have always had an easier time operating at night, away from the"
" hated light of the sun."
msgstr "不快な太陽の光を避け、夜間に活動することを好みます。"

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/fantasy_species.json
msgid "Goblin Teeth"
msgstr "ゴブリンの歯"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Goblin Teeth"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/fantasy_species.json
msgid ""
"Your teeth are longer and more pointed than not.  Before the Cataclysm it "
"was considered extremely gauche to bite anything in a fight; it was a mark "
"of the goblins' uncivilized past.  But, needs must."
msgstr ""
"歯が通常より長く尖っています。大変動以前は、喧嘩の相手に噛みつくことはゴブリンの野蛮な過去の名残であり、非常に品位を欠いた行動とされていました。しかし、今はニーズがあります。"

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/fantasy_species.json
msgid "Nocturnal Vision"
msgstr "夜行性生物の視界"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Nocturnal Vision"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/fantasy_species.json
msgid ""
"While your reddish eyes have been known to give other people a start, they "
"help you see in the dark.  You have much better night vision than a human."
msgstr "赤みがかった特異な瞳は非常に目立ちますが、暗闇の中でも視界を確保できます。夜間は、人間よりも遥かに視力が高まります。"

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/fantasy_species.json
msgid "Lizardfolk Build"
msgstr "リザードフォークの体格"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Lizardfolk Build"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/fantasy_species.json
msgid ""
"Lizardfolk are taller and stronger than humans but not much thicker and are "
"surprisingly fast for their size (+1 STR, +1 DEX)."
msgstr "人間よりも背が高く強靭ですが、それほど太ってはおらず、体格の割に驚くほど俊敏です(筋力+1、器用+1)。"

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/fantasy_species.json
msgid "Lizardfolk Feet"
msgstr "リザードフォークの足"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Lizardfolk Feet"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/fantasy_species.json
msgid ""
"Your feet are heavily webbed, with three large scaled toes and a dewclaw in "
"the back, allowing you to swim faster.  However, your feet are not designed "
"for human footwear."
msgstr "水かきが発達した足です。狼爪が生えており、足指は大きな鱗で覆われており、より速く泳げますが、人間用の靴を履ける形状ではありません。"

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/fantasy_species.json
msgid "Ectothermia"
msgstr "変温性"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Ectothermia"
#. ~ Description of mutation "Draconic Ectothermia"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/fantasy_species.json
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/mutations.json
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Your body has become permanently cold-blooded.  Your speed lowers or raises "
"1% for every 2 (1.1) degrees below or above 65 F (18.3 C).  All this and you"
" need even more food to maintain your energy."
msgstr ""
"完全に変温動物化しました。摂氏18.3度(華氏65度)を境とした1.1度(2度)ごとの外気温の変化によって、速度が1%ずつ増減します。身体を動かし続けるために更に大量の食事が必要になります。"

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/fantasy_species.json
msgid "Scalefolk Mindset"
msgstr "鱗持ちの精神"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Scalefolk Mindset"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/fantasy_species.json
msgid ""
"While not completely predatory, the lizardfolk are generally not "
"particularly invested in the welfare of warmbloods.  Their death does not "
"affect you greatly, and your ability to maintain combat skills is enhanced."
msgstr ""
"リザードフォークは根っからの利己主義ではありませんが、通常は温血種の生存にあまり頓着していません。温血種が死んでも精神にほとんど影響を受けず、戦闘能力を維持し続けられます。"

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/fantasy_species.json
msgid "Lizardfolk Muzzle"
msgstr "リザードフォークの鼻面"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Lizardfolk Muzzle"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/fantasy_species.json
msgid ""
"Your face and jaws are those of a predatory lizard, with a set of sharp "
"teeth to go with them.  They look NASTY--as do the bite wounds they can "
"inflict--but prevent wearing mouthgear."
msgstr ""
"顎を含む顔全体が肉食性のトカゲのような形状で、口には鋭い歯が並んでいます。酷い噛み傷を負わされそうな恐ろしい外見ですが、口にアイテムを着用して隠すのも困難です"

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/fantasy_species.json
msgid "Ravenfolk Build"
msgstr "レイヴンフォークの体格"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Ravenfolk Build"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/fantasy_species.json
msgid ""
"Ravenfolk are about the same size as humans, though their feathers and wings"
" obviously set them apart."
msgstr "一般的な人間とほぼ同じサイズですが、羽毛と翼がある点が大きな違いです。"

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/fantasy_species.json
msgid "Ravenfolk Legs"
msgstr "レイヴンフォークの脚"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Ravenfolk Legs"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/fantasy_species.json
msgid ""
"Your legs and feet are those of a raven, with three long talons at the front"
" and one at the back, ending in wicked claws and preventing you from wearing"
" shoes.  Fortunately they don't impede your movement."
msgstr ""
"脚と足がワタリガラスのような形状になりました。つま先の代わりに、長い爪が前方に3本、後方に1本伸びており、特に後方の鉤爪は非常に鋭く尖っています。足にアイテムを着用できなくなりますが、幸いにも爪が移動の邪魔になることはありません。"

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/fantasy_species.json
msgid "Raven Beak"
msgstr "嘴(ワタリガラス)"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Raven Beak"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/fantasy_species.json
msgid ""
"Your large beak allows you to imitate nearly every sound humans can make.  "
"And also rip into flesh, if it comes to that."
msgstr "大きなくちばしのお陰で、人間が発するほぼ全ての音を上手に真似できます。肉を裂くのにも適した形状です。"

#. ~ Message when player with mutation "Raven Beak" attacks
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/fantasy_species.json
#, c-format
msgid "You stab into %s with your beak!"
msgstr "くちばしで%sを刺しました！"

#. ~ Message when NPC with mutation "Raven Beak" attacks
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/fantasy_species.json
#, c-format
msgid "%1$s stabs into %2$s with their beak!"
msgstr "%1$sはくちばしで%2$sを刺しました！"

#. ~ Description of mutation ""
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/fantasy_species.json
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Your bones are nearly hollow, a remnant of your people's past as creatures "
"of the air.  Your body is very light as a result, enabling you to move and "
"attack 20% faster, but also frail; you can carry 40% less, and bashing "
"attacks injure you more."
msgstr ""
"かつて大気と同一であった先祖の名残なのでしょう。骨がスカスカなお陰で身体がとても軽くなり、軽快に動けます。移動と攻撃の速度に20%のボーナスを得ますが、所持重量に-40%のペナルティーを受けます。打撃によって受けるダメージが大きくなります。"

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/magical.json
msgid "Form of the Forest King"
msgstr "森林の王者への変身"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Form of the Forest King"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/magical.json
msgid "You can transform yourself into a bear.  Roar."
msgstr "クマに変身できます。ガオー。"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Bear Form"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/magical.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/temporary.json
msgid ""
"You are a bear.  This provides the actual effects of bear form.  Should not "
"be player-visible"
msgstr "クマの姿をしています。クマ形態の実際の効果を実行するものであり、通常は表示されません。"

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/magical.json
msgid "Form of the Swift Runner"
msgstr "軽やかな走り手への変身"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Form of the Swift Runner"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/magical.json
msgid "You can transform yourself into a deer."
msgstr "シカに変身できます。"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Deer Form"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/magical.json
msgid ""
"You are a deer.  This provides the actual effects of deer form.  Should not "
"be player-visible"
msgstr "シカの姿をしています。シカ形態の実際の効果を実行するものであり、通常は表示されません。"

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/magical.json
msgid "Form of the Soaring Wings"
msgstr "舞い上がる双翼への変身"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Form of the Soaring Wings"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/magical.json
msgid "You can transform yourself into a raven and take wing."
msgstr "ワタリガラスに変身して空を飛べます。"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Raven Form"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/magical.json
msgid ""
"You are a raven.  This provides the actual effects of raven form.  Should "
"not be player-visible."
msgstr "ワタリガラスの姿をしています。ワタリガラス形態の実際の効果を実行するものであり、通常は表示されません。"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Dragon Terror"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/mutation_effects.json
msgid "You are uneasy and fearful from a Dragon's mighty presence"
msgstr "強大なドラゴンに対して不安と恐怖を感じています。"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Dragon Boost"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/mutation_effects.json
msgid "You are filled with the power of Dragons."
msgstr "身体がドラゴンの力で満たされています。"

#. ~ Apply message of effect type "Dragon Boost"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/mutation_effects.json
msgid "You let out a mighty roar as you are filled with the power of Dragons!"
msgstr "身体がドラゴンの力で満たされています。強大な咆哮をあげました！"

#. ~ Remove message of effect type "Dragon Boost"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/mutation_effects.json
msgid "The Draconic energy fades from within you."
msgstr "ドラゴンの力が体内から消えていきます。"

#. ~ Name of effect type id "dragon_acidburn"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/mutation_effects.json
msgid "Dragon Acid burn"
msgstr "強酸の爆発"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Dragon Acid burn"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/mutation_effects.json
msgid "Burned with a black dragon's acid"
msgstr "ブラックドラゴンの酸に蝕まれています。"

#. ~ Name of effect type id "lesser_dragon_acidburn"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/mutation_effects.json
msgid "Lesser Dragon Acid burn"
msgstr "酸の爆発(黒竜)"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Lesser Dragon Acid burn"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/mutation_effects.json
msgid "Burned with a less potent version of a black dragon's acid"
msgstr "威力の低いブラックドラゴンの酸に蝕まれています。"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Black Dragon"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"You sometimes think back about the world you left behind.  You're glad you "
"burned it in your wake."
msgstr "置き去りにした世界について時折思い返します。起き掛けに世界を燃やし尽くすことが何よりの喜びです。"

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Black Dragon Scales"
msgstr "黒竜鱗"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Black Dragon Scales"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"A set of heavy black scales has grown to cover your body, acting as natural "
"armor.  While difficult to penetrate, it also greatly limits your "
"flexibility, resulting in a -4 penalty to Dexterity.  Greatly reduces wet "
"effects."
msgstr ""
"重厚な黒色の鱗が体を覆っています。天然の鎧として働きます。特に貫通に強いものの、体の可動範囲がやや制限されています。器用さに-2のペナルティを受けます。水濡れの影響を大幅に軽減します。"

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Reptilian Legs"
msgstr "爬虫類の脚"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Reptilian Legs"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"Your legs and feet have become reptile-like and your toenails have grown "
"into short claws.  Fortunately they don't impede your movement."
msgstr "足腰が爬虫類のような形状に変化し、足指の先には短い鉤爪が生えています。幸いなことに、動きの邪魔にはなりません。"

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Dragon Legs"
msgstr "竜の脚"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Dragon Legs"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"Your legs and feet have become dragon-like and the claws on your toes have "
"developed into incredibly tough talons.  These are fearsome and powerful, "
"but prevent you from wearing shoes and slightly impede your movement."
msgstr ""
"足腰がドラゴンのような形状に変化し、足指の先には非常に頑丈で立派な鉤爪が生えています。鉤爪攻撃は凶悪ですが、足にアイテムを着用できず、少し移動し辛くなります。"

#. ~ Message when player with mutation "Dragon Legs" attacks
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/mutations.json
#, c-format
msgid "You slash %s with your clawed feet!"
msgstr "%sを足の鉤爪で切り裂きました！"

#. ~ Message when NPC with mutation "Dragon Legs" attacks
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/mutations.json
#, c-format
msgid "%1$s slashes %2$s with their clawed feet!"
msgstr "%1$sは%2$sを足の鉤爪で切り裂きました！"

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Inconvenient Draconic Growth"
msgstr "竜の体躯(レベル1)"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Inconvenient Draconic Growth"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"You have grown noticeably taller, broader, and menacing.  Much of it is "
"useful muscle mass (Strength +2), but you find it throws off your balance "
"and you get in your own way (+10 torso and arm encumbrance), and you notice "
"people are starting to treat you differently."
msgstr ""
"縦にも横にも明らかに大きく威嚇的な、不便なほどの巨体に成長しました。見た目に恥じない筋力を誇りますが、全体のバランスに欠け、自分の体が邪魔で動きにくくなっています。筋力に+2のボーナスを得ますが、胴と腕に+10の動作制限を受けます。"

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Draconic Growth"
msgstr "竜の体躯(レベル2)"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Draconic Growth"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"You carry your rugged body with the dignity you deserve, but are all the "
"more menacing for it.  Strength +2."
msgstr "威厳と風格の漂う、巨岩のごとき肉体を手に入れました。筋力に+2のボーナスを得ます。"

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Freakish Draconic Maturity"
msgstr "竜の体躯(レベル3)"

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Wyrmling Strength"
msgstr "竜の筋力(レベル1)"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Wyrmling Strength"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"Your muscles are enhanced by some growing innate magic.  You are slightly "
"stronger.  Strength + 1"
msgstr "身体に備わる魔法の力によって筋肉が少し逞しくなりました。 筋力+1"

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Young Dragon Strength"
msgstr "竜の筋力(レベル2)"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Young Dragon Strength"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"The connection to your inner magic is growing and your muscles are stronger,"
" but you're a little more clumsy.  Strength + 3, Dexterity - 1"
msgstr "内なる魔法の力との繋がりが強くなり、筋肉がより強く発達し、少し不器用になりました。筋力+3、器用-1"

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Draconic Strength"
msgstr "竜の筋力(レベル3)"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Draconic Strength"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"The magic within you courses through your muscles, greatly empowering them."
"  This costs you valuable flexibility and coordination, however.  Strength +"
" 5, Dexterity - 2"
msgstr "内なる魔法が筋肉にまで浸透し、強い力を手に入れました。ただし、柔軟性やバランス感覚は犠牲になっています。筋力+5、器用-2"

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Ancient Draconic Strength"
msgstr "竜の筋力(レベル4)"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Ancient Draconic Strength"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"Your internal magic has filled you with unimaginable strength, but you can't"
" move as freely as your form once could.  This is no problem.  Strength + 8,"
" Dexterity - 3"
msgstr "内なる魔法の力が想像を絶するレベルで全身に行き渡りましたが、以前ほど自在には動けません。そんなことは些細な問題ですが。筋力+8、器用-3"

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Draconic Maturity"
msgstr "竜の体躯(レベル4)"

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Dragon Horns"
msgstr "竜の角"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Dragon Horns"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"You have a pair of long, curved back, dragon-like horns.  They allow you to "
"make a strong bashing headbutt attack, but prevent wearing headwear that is "
"not made of fabric."
msgstr "竜のような後ろにカーブした角が生えています。強力な打撃属性の頭突きを繰り出せるようになりますが、頭に布製以外のアイテムを着用できません。"

#. ~ Message when player with mutation "Dragon Horns" attacks
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/mutations.json
#, c-format
msgid "You headbutt %s with your draconic horns!"
msgstr "竜の角で%sを突きました！"

#. ~ Message when NPC with mutation "Dragon Horns" attacks
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/mutations.json
#, c-format
msgid "%1$s headbutts %2$s with their draconic horns!"
msgstr "%1$sは竜の角で%2$sを突きました！"

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Black Dragon Wings"
msgstr "黒竜の翼"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Black Dragon Wings"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"You have a pair of large, black scaled dragon wings.  While you have control"
" of them and can make attacks with them, they are not large enough nor "
"strong enough to allow you to fly and they throw you off balance, greatly "
"reducing your ability to dodge.  They can be used to cast a protective spell"
" on yourself however."
msgstr ""
"ドラゴンの鱗に覆われた大きな翼が生えています。翼は自由に動かして攻撃に利用することも可能ですが、空を飛ぶには大きさと強度が足りません。身体のバランスが崩れるため、回避能力は大幅に低減します。自分自身に防御呪文をかけることができます。"

#. ~ Message when player with mutation "Black Dragon Wings" attacks
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/mutations.json
#, c-format
msgid "You bash %s with your powerful wings!"
msgstr "%sに翼を叩きつけました！"

#. ~ Message when NPC with mutation "Black Dragon Wings" attacks
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/mutations.json
#, c-format
msgid "%1$s bashes %2$s with their powerful wings!"
msgstr "%1$sは%2$sに翼を叩きつけました！"

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Overly Acidic Digestion"
msgstr "強酸性の消化液"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Overly Acidic Digestion"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"Your digestive issues have developed to become overly acidic which greatly "
"impacts your ability to normally digest food, resulting in getting far less "
"nutrition from the food you eat and making your need to eat more often."
msgstr ""
"消化液が強い酸性になり、食べ物を消化する能力に大きな影響を与えています。食べたものから得られる養分が通常より非常に少なくなり、より頻繁に食事をする必要があります。"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Black Dragon Breath"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"Your digestive issues may not have settled entirely, but you can somewhat "
"control them and now you have the ability to spit acid!"
msgstr "消化についての問題はまったく解決していませんが、消化液の制御法を身に着け、口から酸を吐き出すことすらできるようになりました！"

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Draconic Heat Dependence"
msgstr "竜の変温(レベル1)"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Draconic Heat Dependence"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/mutations.json
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Your muscle response is dependent on ambient temperatures.  You lose 1% of "
"your speed for every 5 (2.8) degrees below 65 F (18.3 C).  Unfortunately, "
"this doesn't seem to help you conserve any energy."
msgstr ""
"筋肉の反応速度が外気温に左右されます。外気温が摂氏18.3度(華氏65度)を2.8度(5度)下回るごとに、速度に-1%のペナルティーを受けます。残念ながら、必要なエネルギー量に影響はありません。"

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "High Draconic Heat Dependence"
msgstr "竜の変温(レベル2)"

#. ~ Description of mutation "High Draconic Heat Dependence"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/mutations.json
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Your muscle response is highly dependent on ambient temperatures.  You lose "
"1% of your speed for every 3 (1.7) degrees below 65 F (18.3 C).  "
"Unfortunately, it seems you have to exert more energy to keep moving."
msgstr ""
"筋肉の反応速度が外気温に左右されます。外気温が摂氏18.3度(華氏65度)を1.7度(3度)下回るごとに、速度に-1%のペナルティーを受けます。残念ながら、動き続けるためにより多くのエネルギーを費やす必要があるようです。"

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Draconic Ectothermia"
msgstr "竜の変温(レベル3)"

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Draconic Magic"
msgstr "竜の魔力"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Draconic Magic"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"You are imbued with the ancient magic powers of black dragons, improving "
"your mana reserves and opening your mind to amazing feats of magic."
msgstr "ブラックドラゴンの持つ古代の魔力が体内に満ち溢れています。マナ貯蔵力が上昇し、恐るべき魔法の呪文を習得します。"

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Draconic Spellcasting"
msgstr "竜の呪文詠唱"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Draconic Spellcasting"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"Your mind has fully opened to the power and ancient heritage of dragons.  "
"You can access even greater quantities of mana and you have access to more "
"dragon spells."
msgstr "ドラゴンのもつ古代の力を完全にものにしました。更に多くのマナを取り込め、様々なドラゴンの呪文を覚えられます。"

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Scaled Mouth"
msgstr "竜の鼻面"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Scaled Mouth"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"Your scales have grown up and around your mouth, digging into your gums and "
"retracting your lips.  On the down side, it makes speaking difficult.  On "
"the positive side, it makes it very easy to bite things, though what's "
"driving you to do that?"
msgstr ""
"口元に鱗が生え始め、歯茎と唇が退化しました。言語を発し辛いのは欠点ですが、噛みつきやすくなる利点があります。この長所を何に生かしましょうか？"

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Black Dragon Maw"
msgstr "黒竜の顎"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Black Dragon Maw"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"Your face and jaws have extended to a long, toothy dragon maw.  It's "
"fearsome and causes grievous wounds, but prevents wearing mouth gear."
msgstr "顎と鼻が前方に伸び、歯は常に剥き出しです。非常に威力の高い攻撃を繰り出せますが、口にアイテムを着用できません。"

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Stubby Dragon Tail"
msgstr "短い竜の尻尾"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Stubby Dragon Tail"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"You have a short, stubby tail that has strange bumps and ridges.  You can "
"wiggle it, but it serves no purpose."
msgstr "ごつごつとした奇妙な短い尻尾が生えています。小刻みに動かせますが、何の役にも立ちません。"

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Short Dragon Tail"
msgstr "竜の尻尾"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Short Dragon Tail"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"You have a short, dragonlike tail.  You can use it decently as a club of "
"sorts, but it's not doing anything to help you balance.  Prevents wearing "
"non-fabric pants."
msgstr ""
"ドラゴンのような短く太い尻尾が生えています。棍棒のように振り回して攻撃できますが、身体のバランスを取る助けにはなりません。布製以外のアイテムを脚に着用できません。"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Dragon Tail"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"You have a long, thick, dragonlike tail.  It doesn't help you balance or "
"dodge any better, but it is a powerful bashing weapon.  Prevents wearing "
"non-fabric pants."
msgstr ""
"ドラゴンのような長く太い尻尾が生えています。身体のバランスを取る助けになり、回避行動も容易になりますが、一番の利点は強力な打撃武器として利用できることです。布製以外のアイテムを脚に着用できません。"

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Scaled Hands"
msgstr "手の鱗"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Scaled Hands"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"Your scales have grown to cover your hands and elongate the tips in to "
"jagged claws that can be serviceable as cutting and piercing weapons in "
"unarmed combat.  You can still use them normally, but you can't wear gloves."
msgstr ""
"両手が鱗で覆われており、指の先端には長細い尖った爪が生えています。素手格闘攻撃が斬撃・刺突攻撃として扱われます。細かい作業も問題なくこなせますが、手にアイテムを着用できません。"

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Black Dragon Talons"
msgstr "黒竜の鉤爪"

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Draconic Predator"
msgstr "暴竜"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Draconic Predator"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"You have become something more than human.  Something better - and far, far "
"worse.  Combat skills are easy to learn and maintain, and unlike lesser "
"predators, your mental faculties don't suffer at all."
msgstr ""
"人間を超越し、より優れた、そして遥かに凶悪な存在になりました。戦闘に関連するスキルが上達しやすく、劣化しにくくなりました。並みの肉食動物と違い、精神的な悪影響もまったくありません。"

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Draconic Apex Predator"
msgstr "暴竜王"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Draconic Apex Predator"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"Your mind and brain have fully adapted to your new place at the top of the "
"magical food chain.  You can effortlessly master and maintain combat skills,"
" and your malevolent intellect only grows."
msgstr ""
"魔法の食物連鎖の頂点にふさわしい完璧な脳と精神構造を手に入れました。先頭に関連するスキルが更に上達しやすく、劣化しにくくなり、悪意ある知性も向上しています。"

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/mutations.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Iron Intolerance"
msgstr "金属アレルギー"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Iron Intolerance"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/mutations.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"You were born with an allergy to iron and, to a lesser extent, steel.  "
"Wearing or touching anything made of iron or steel will cause you pain and "
"discomfort."
msgstr "生まれつき鉄に対して、また程度は低いものの鋼に対してもアレルギーがあります。鉄や鋼でできたアイテムを着用、装備すると苦痛や痒みを感じます。"

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/temporary.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/temporary.json
msgid "Giant-sized"
msgstr "巨大化"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Giant-sized"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/temporary.json
msgid "Magic has made you grow to enormous size!"
msgstr "魔法によって体格が巨大になりました！"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Lashing Tentacles"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/temporary.json
msgid ""
"You have a pair of vicious barbed tentacles growing from your shoulders."
msgstr "両肩から凶悪な棘をまとった触手が生えています。"

#. ~ Message when player with mutation "Lashing Tentacles" attacks
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/temporary.json
#, c-format
msgid "You lash at %s with your tentacles!"
msgstr "触手を%sに打ち付けました！"

#. ~ Message when NPC with mutation "Lashing Tentacles" attacks
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/temporary.json
#, c-format
msgid "%1$s lashes at %2$s with their tentacles!"
msgstr "%1$sは触手を%2$sに打ち付けました！"

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/temporary.json
msgid "Stony Sleep"
msgstr "石の眠り"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Stony Sleep"
#. ~ Description of mutation "Sleeping in the Earth"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/temporary.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/ierde_mutations.json
msgid ""
"You are resting in the depths of the earth.  You should never actually see "
"this."
msgstr "地中で休んでいます。通常は表示されません。"

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/vanity.json
msgid "Skin tone: blue"
msgstr "肌色: 青色"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Skin tone: blue"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/vanity.json
msgid "You have a sky- or sea-colored skin tone."
msgstr "肌の色は空色、もしくは海の色です。"

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/vanity.json
msgid "Skin tone: green"
msgstr "肌色: 緑色"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Skin tone: green"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/vanity.json
msgid "You have a green skin tone."
msgstr "肌の色は緑色です。"

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/vanity.json
msgid "Skin tone: gray"
msgstr "肌色: 灰色"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Skin tone: gray"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/vanity.json
msgid "You have a gray skin tone."
msgstr "肌の色は灰色です。"

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/vanity.json
msgid "Skin tone: midnight"
msgstr "肌色: 闇色"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Skin tone: midnight"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/vanity.json
msgid "You have an almost pure black skin tone."
msgstr "肌の色は純粋な黒色です。"

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/vanity.json
msgid "Skin tone: opal"
msgstr "肌色: オパール"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Skin tone: opal"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/vanity.json
msgid ""
"You have an opalescent skin tone, pale with a faint shimmering rainbow of "
"colors."
msgstr "乳白色にかすかにきらめく虹色が混じった肌です。"

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/vanity.json
msgid "Skin tone: red"
msgstr "肌色: 赤色"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Skin tone: red"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/vanity.json
msgid "You have a reddish or very ruddy skin tone."
msgstr "肌の色は純粋な赤色、もしくは非常に濃い赤色です。"

#. ~ Unique name of a female NPC
#. ~ The Librarian of the Forge of Wonders.
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/npc/TALK_FORGE_ARDELIA.json
msgid "Librarian, A"
msgstr "司書"

#. ~ Name suffix of a female NPC
#. ~ The Librarian of the Forge of Wonders.
#. ~ The Pirate of the Forge of Wonders.
#. ~ Name suffix of a male NPC
#. ~ The Lord of the Forge of Wonders.
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/npc/TALK_FORGE_ARDELIA.json
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/npc/TALK_FORGE_HELEN_TAVREL.json
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/npc/TALK_FORGE_MERCHANT.json
msgid "Forge Lord"
msgstr "フォージロード"

#. ~ Name of an NPC class
#. ~ This is a unique NPC who doesn't get randomly selected background traits
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/npc/TALK_FORGE_ARDELIA.json
msgid "Forge Librarian"
msgstr "司書"

#. ~ Job description of "Forge Librarian" NPC class
#. ~ This is a unique NPC who doesn't get randomly selected background traits
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/npc/TALK_FORGE_ARDELIA.json
msgid "I take care of the books and scrolls."
msgstr "書物や巻物の手入れをしております。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/npc/TALK_FORGE_ARDELIA.json
msgid ""
"I keep Valzain's books.  There are many floors of bookshelves among his "
"pocket dimensions, with more magic than a mortal mind like yours could "
"comprehend.  These happen to be the ones I think it most likely he'll read "
"soon.  I can sell some that we have extra copies of."
msgstr ""
"私はヴァルザイン氏の本を管理しております。彼の次元ポケットに収められている書物は建物数階分に及び、あなたのような常人の精神では耐えられない程の魔法が綴られております。ここにあるものは、頻繁に読まれる可能性が高いと私が判断した書物だけです。余っている分はお売りすることもできますよ。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/npc/TALK_FORGE_ARDELIA.json
msgid "Do you have any more books in the back?"
msgstr "新しい書物は増えたか？"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/npc/TALK_FORGE_ARDELIA.json
msgid ""
"I organize the books, I sell extra books, back when we still lent books I "
"would hunt down those with late books to return.  I have done this for aeons"
" past and I will continue to do this for aeons to come."
msgstr ""
"私は書物を整理し、余っている書物を売っております。まだ貸し出しを行っていた頃は、返却が遅れている書物の回収もしておりましたね。私はこの仕事に長年従事しており、今後も続けていくつもりでございます。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/npc/TALK_FORGE_ARDELIA.json
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/npc/TALK_FORGE_DIVINER.json
msgid "Let's talk business then."
msgstr "取り引きをしよう。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/npc/TALK_FORGE_ARDELIA.json
msgid ""
"It shouldn't take Valzain too long to read what he desires from what I have "
"out.  Check back in <interval> and I should have some new books set out."
msgstr ""
"私が書物をお渡ししてからヴァルザイン氏が目当ての知識を見つけられるまで、それほど時間は掛かりません。<interval>後にまたお越しください。新たな書物を何冊かご用意できる筈です。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/npc/TALK_FORGE_ARDELIA.json
msgid "Safe readings."
msgstr "よい読書生活を。"

#. ~ Unique name of a female NPC
#. ~ The Diviner of the Forge of Wonders.
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/npc/TALK_FORGE_DIVINER.json
msgid "Mary Machen"
msgstr "ﾒｱﾘｰ ﾏｯﾍﾝ"

#. ~ Name suffix of a female NPC
#. ~ The Diviner of the Forge of Wonders.
#. ~ Name of an NPC class
#. ~ This is a unique NPC who doesn't get randomly selected background traits
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/npc/TALK_FORGE_DIVINER.json
msgid "Diviner"
msgstr "占い師"

#. ~ Job description of "Diviner" NPC class
#. ~ This is a unique NPC who doesn't get randomly selected background traits
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/npc/TALK_FORGE_DIVINER.json
msgid "I see the past, the present, and the future."
msgstr "過去も、現在も、未来も視える。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/npc/TALK_FORGE_DIVINER.json
msgid ""
"Are you looking for something?  I can help with anything but your own stuff."
"  You'll have to ask your mother for help with that."
msgstr "何かお探しかい？失せ物以外なら、何でも手伝ってやれるよ。失せ物だったらママにでも聞くんだね。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/npc/TALK_FORGE_DIVINER.json
msgid "Can you help me find something?"
msgstr "探しものを手伝ってもらえないか？"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/npc/TALK_FORGE_DIVINER.json
msgid ""
"What are any of us really doing here in this dead and dying world?  I "
"specialize in scrying, and while I wish I could say I'm in it to help lost "
"souls find their way, the collective pockets of a thousand realities is a "
"very good incentive.  I can help you find any number of things, but I take "
"no responsibility for what happens when you find what you're looking for."
msgstr ""
"この死と滅びの世界で、本物の占い師なんて一体何人残っておると思う？私は占いの専門家だよ。失われた魂が道を見つけるのを助けるためにやってる、と言いたいとこだが、現実世界の色々なものを探す方がずっと本腰で取り組めるってものさ。私はあんたの探しものを手伝うことができるが、見つけた先でどんな目に遭っても私の知ったこっちゃないよ。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/npc/TALK_FORGE_DIVINER.json
msgid "Perhaps.  What do you seek?"
msgstr "なるほど。何を探している？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/npc/TALK_FORGE_DIVINER.json
msgid "A dangerous location."
msgstr "危険な場所だ。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/npc/TALK_FORGE_DIVINER.json
msgid "A man made structure."
msgstr "人工的な建物だ。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/npc/TALK_FORGE_DIVINER.json
msgid "A geological formation."
msgstr "自然の地形だ。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/npc/TALK_FORGE_DIVINER.json
msgid "A plant."
msgstr "植物だ。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/npc/TALK_FORGE_DIVINER.json
msgid "An animal."
msgstr "動物だ。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/npc/TALK_FORGE_DIVINER.json
msgid "A god."
msgstr "神だ。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/npc/TALK_FORGE_DIVINER.json
msgid "About something else…"
msgstr "別の話をしよう..."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/npc/TALK_FORGE_DIVINER.json
msgid "A thrill seeker, are you?  So what will it be?"
msgstr "刺激を求めている、というわけだね？では、その場所には何がある？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/npc/TALK_FORGE_DIVINER.json
msgid "An ant nest."
msgstr "アリの巣だ。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/npc/TALK_FORGE_DIVINER.json
msgid "An acid ant nest."
msgstr "酸性アリの巣だ。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/npc/TALK_FORGE_DIVINER.json
msgid "Spiders."
msgstr "クモだ。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/npc/TALK_FORGE_DIVINER.json
msgid "A fungal growth."
msgstr "真菌の繁殖地だ。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/npc/TALK_FORGE_DIVINER.json
msgid "A mi-go building."
msgstr "ミ＝ゴの構造物だ。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/npc/TALK_FORGE_DIVINER.json
msgid "A triffid grove."
msgstr "トリフィドの森だ。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/npc/TALK_FORGE_DIVINER.json
msgid "A kraken cave."
msgstr "クラーケンの巣穴だ。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/npc/TALK_FORGE_DIVINER.json
msgid "A slime pit."
msgstr "粘液穴だ。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/npc/TALK_FORGE_DIVINER.json
msgid "A goblin camp."
msgstr "ゴブリンの住処だ。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/npc/TALK_FORGE_DIVINER.json
msgid "A swamp dragon cave!"
msgstr "ドラゴンが棲む沼地だ！"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/npc/TALK_FORGE_DIVINER.json
msgid "A balrog mine"
msgstr "バルログの坑道だ。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/npc/TALK_FORGE_DIVINER.json
msgid ""
"Seeking to pick around your civilization's corpse?  You're not the first and"
" you won't be the last."
msgstr "文明の死体を漁りに行くのかい？まあ何ともありきたりな探しものだね。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/npc/TALK_FORGE_DIVINER.json
msgid "A lab."
msgstr "研究所だ。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/npc/TALK_FORGE_DIVINER.json
msgid "An Exodii location."
msgstr "エクゾディの施設だ。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/npc/TALK_FORGE_DIVINER.json
msgid "A strange temple."
msgstr "奇妙な神殿だ。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/npc/TALK_FORGE_DIVINER.json
msgid "An attunement altar."
msgstr "調和の祭壇だ。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/npc/TALK_FORGE_DIVINER.json
msgid "A magic academy."
msgstr "魔法学校だ。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/npc/TALK_FORGE_DIVINER.json
msgid "A wizard tower."
msgstr "魔法の塔だ。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/npc/TALK_FORGE_DIVINER.json
msgid "A druid tower."
msgstr "ドルイドの塔だ。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/npc/TALK_FORGE_DIVINER.json
msgid "A goblin city."
msgstr "ゴブリンが暮らしている場所だ。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/npc/TALK_FORGE_DIVINER.json
msgid ""
"This reality does not seem to have a history of being inhabited by humans.  "
"Perhaps humanity never evolved?  Or perhaps they never discovered this "
"continent?  Either way, due to the portal storms, humans are here now.  And "
"so are orcs and goblins.  I should be able to help you find some artificial "
"structures.  What are you looking for?"
msgstr ""
"この世界には、人類が繁栄していた過去はないようだ。もしや、進化できなかったのだろうか？あるいは、この大陸を発見できなかったのかもしれないね。いずれにせよ、ポータルの嵐のお陰で、人類が今ここにいられるという訳さ。オークやゴブリンもね。しからば、人工的な建物も見つかるだろう。その場所には何がある？"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/npc/TALK_FORGE_DIVINER.json
msgid "Sure.  Looking for a nice spot to watch the world end, perhaps?"
msgstr "承知した。世界の終焉を眺めるのに最適な場所をお探しかい？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/npc/TALK_FORGE_DIVINER.json
msgid "A river."
msgstr "川だ。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/npc/TALK_FORGE_DIVINER.json
msgid "A clay deposit."
msgstr "粘土層だ。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/npc/TALK_FORGE_DIVINER.json
msgid "A sand deposit."
msgstr "砂地だ。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/npc/TALK_FORGE_DIVINER.json
msgid "A hot spring."
msgstr "温泉だ。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/npc/TALK_FORGE_DIVINER.json
msgid "A cave."
msgstr "洞窟だ。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/npc/TALK_FORGE_DIVINER.json
msgid "A plant you say?  Which one?"
msgstr "植物とな？どのような植物だ？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/npc/TALK_FORGE_DIVINER.json
msgid "A magical plant."
msgstr "魔法の植物だ。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/npc/TALK_FORGE_DIVINER.json
msgid "I'm afraid I can't do that right now.  Sorry."
msgstr "済まないが、今すぐには見つからんようだね。面目ない。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/npc/TALK_FORGE_DIVINER.json
msgid "Fair enough.  About something else…"
msgstr "仕方ない。別の話をしよう..."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/npc/TALK_FORGE_DIVINER.json
msgid "Nevermind then."
msgstr "やっぱり止めておこう。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/npc/TALK_FORGE_DIVINER.json
msgid ""
"I see.  You could get some from trading with the merchants around here.  The"
" librarian is crazy for beech nuts, for example.  I saw her trade away all "
"her money and books for a literal truckload of the things in another reality"
" earlier.  Not sure what she does with them.  You see, she's lined her "
"private rooms with lead which just so happens to block my scrying.  Almost "
"like she doesn't trust me.  Not sure why."
msgstr ""
"ふうむ。ここいらの商人と取り引きをすれば、手に入るだろうね。例えば、ここの司書は、ビーチナッツに目がない。先程などは別の世界で、金目の物も書物も全て投げうって、トラック一台分のビーチナッツを受け取っていた。あんなにたくさんどうするのやら。あやつは部屋に鉛を敷き詰めていてな。運の悪いことに私の念視が効かんのだ。私のことを信頼しておらんのだろうか。さっぱり分からぬわ。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/npc/TALK_FORGE_DIVINER.json
msgid ""
"I see a giant ant cutting down a tree with her mandibles.  Did you know that"
" worker ants are all female?  I see her friends around her as well.  I'll "
"mark the location on your map for one denarius."
msgstr ""
"視える、大アリが逞しい顎で樹木を切り倒しているのが視える。知っておったか、働きアリは皆メスなのだそうだぞ？仲間のアリも大勢集まっておるわ。デナリウス硬貨を1枚支払えば、場所を教えてやろう。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/npc/TALK_FORGE_DIVINER.json
msgid "It's a deal."
msgstr "取り引き成立だ。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/npc/TALK_FORGE_DIVINER.json
msgid "I can't afford that right now."
msgstr "今は持ち合わせがない。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/npc/TALK_FORGE_DIVINER.json
msgid ""
"I see a giant ant lobbing globs of acids at a group of unfortunate dogs.  It"
" seems to be quite effective.  I'll mark the location on your map for one "
"denarius."
msgstr "視える、大アリが気の毒な犬ころ共に酸を吹きかけているのが視える。中々に痛そうだね。デナリウス硬貨を1枚支払えば、場所を教えてやろう。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/npc/TALK_FORGE_DIVINER.json
msgid ""
"Why would you ever want to get close to those creatures?  Don't you know "
"they lay eggs inside of other creatures!?  Including humans!  Well, if "
"you're sure you want to go there, I'll mark the location on your map for one"
" denarius.  But don't come crying to me if you get poked full of dermatik "
"larvae.  Seriously, don't.  I would like to keep my lunch.  If they do give "
"you problems though, you might find that drinking mugwort oil helps.  It's "
"made with, uh, mugwort.  And oil.  I think."
msgstr ""
"どうしてあんな化け物にわざわざ近寄ろうとする？奴らが他の生き物の胎の中に卵を産むことを知らないのかい！人間も襲われるんだよ！まあ、本当に行きたいのなら、デナリウス硬貨を1枚支払えば、場所を教えてやろう。だが、寄生バチの幼虫をたっぷり蓄えて、私に泣きついてこないでおくれ。絶対にだよ。昼飯を虫に取られたくないからね。もし、寄生虫に困っていたら、ヨモギの油を飲むと楽になるかもしれん。作り方は、そうだね、ヨモギと、油だったかねぇ。うむ。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/npc/TALK_FORGE_DIVINER.json
msgid "Sure, why not."
msgstr "ぜひ教えてほしい。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/npc/TALK_FORGE_DIVINER.json
msgid "On second <swear> thought…"
msgstr "<swear>、やっぱり他のものにしよう..."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/npc/TALK_FORGE_DIVINER.json
msgid "Nope!  <swear> this.  I'm out."
msgstr "止めておこう！<swear>、もう行くよ。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/npc/TALK_FORGE_DIVINER.json
msgid ""
"Spiders it is then.  But of course, there are several different kinds of "
"spiders out there.  Which type are you interested in?"
msgstr "クモ、クモね。しかし、クモにも種類がある。どのようなクモを探しているんだい？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/npc/TALK_FORGE_DIVINER.json
msgid "Web spinners in a forest."
msgstr "森に巣を張るクモだ。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/npc/TALK_FORGE_DIVINER.json
msgid "A pit full of spiders."
msgstr "たくさんの落とし穴を掘るクモだ。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/npc/TALK_FORGE_DIVINER.json
msgid "Demonic spiders."
msgstr "デーモンみたいなクモだ。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/npc/TALK_FORGE_DIVINER.json
msgid ""
"I see a grove covered in webs.  And legs.  So many legs.  I'll mark the "
"location on your map for one denarius.  Just don't bring any of them back "
"here."
msgstr ""
"視える、クモの巣に覆われた木立が視える。ああ、たくさんの肢もある。デナリウス硬貨を1枚支払えば、場所を教えてやろう。ただし、ここには連れてこないでおくれ。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/npc/TALK_FORGE_DIVINER.json
msgid ""
"There is a burrow not too far away that is absolutely crawling with spiders."
"  Probably.  I didn't get a close look.  And I don't intend to.  I'll mark "
"the location on your map for one denarius."
msgstr ""
"そう遠くないところに、クモがうようよしている場所が間違いなく見つかるよ。恐らくね。まあ、よく見なけりゃ分からないだろう。よく見るつもりもないがね。デナリウス硬貨を1枚支払えば、場所を教えてやろう。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/npc/TALK_FORGE_DIVINER.json
msgid ""
"Fascinating creatures, really.  They have evolved a way to channel their "
"innate mana into potent fire spells.  Some demonic spider queens collect "
"magical items as well.  Perhaps they have a way of absorbing the mana in "
"them and use it for themselves?  I'll mark the lair of such a queen on your "
"map for one denarius.  You might want to bring fire resistant clothing."
msgstr ""
"実に美しい怪物だね。奴らは体内のマナを強力な魔法の炎に変える術に長けておる。この類のクモの女王は、魔法の道具を集めていることもあるらしいね。もしかすると、道具からをマナを吸い取って自分のものとするやり方を知っているんだろうか？ともかく、デナリウス硬貨を1枚支払えば、女王の隠れ家を教えてやろう。火に強い服をまとった方がいいかもしれないね。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/npc/TALK_FORGE_DIVINER.json
msgid "No thanks.  Giant fire-breathing spiders are no joke."
msgstr "いや、結構だ。火を噴く巨大なクモなんて洒落にならない。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/npc/TALK_FORGE_DIVINER.json
msgid ""
"Ah yes, the extradimensional fungal dispersed intelligence known as the "
"Mycus.  Quite a menace to interdimensional travelers, I tell you.  Some see "
"them as a god.  Some see them as an existential threat.  And yet others see "
"them as a good source of plant fibers.  Their cellular structure makes them "
"highly adaptive to a wide variety of levels of reality, much like other "
"fungal lifeforms.  Should you find yourself infected and without antifungal "
"medicine, you can try rubbing sulphur on your skin.  It might not work, and "
"it might irritate your skin, but anything is preferable to letting it run "
"its course.  Should medication fail, don't bother with a bullet through your"
" head.  It won't save you from your impending fate.  Instead, use fire, "
"that's my advice.  Now then, the Mycus have a few different manifestations."
"  Which one are you interested in?"
msgstr ""
"ああ、ミカズという名で知られる、次元の向こうからやってきた、念で通じ合う菌類の群れのことだね。次元の旅人にとってあれは脅威だ。ある者からは神とみなされ、またある者からは存亡の危機とみなされる。植物繊維の供給源に丁度いいと言う者さえいる。他の菌類と同じように、あの細胞はどんな土地にもよく馴染む。もし真菌に感染してしまって、抗真菌薬も手元にないなら、硫黄を肌に塗ってみるといい。ちゃんと効くとは限らないし、肌が痛むかもしれないが、何もしないよりはましさ。薬が効かなくとも、頭を銃で撃ち抜くことはない。そんなことをしても運命からは逃れられないからね。代わりに火を使いな。私からの忠告だよ。さて、ミカズは様々な形をもつ。どれを探しているんだい？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/npc/TALK_FORGE_DIVINER.json
msgid "A bloom."
msgstr "真菌発生源だ。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/npc/TALK_FORGE_DIVINER.json
msgid "A tower."
msgstr "真菌塔だ。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/npc/TALK_FORGE_DIVINER.json
msgid "Some flowers."
msgstr "真菌花だ。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/npc/TALK_FORGE_DIVINER.json
msgid "On second thought, maybe I'll go for something else…"
msgstr "やっぱり止めた、他のものにしよう..."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/npc/TALK_FORGE_DIVINER.json
msgid "You know what?  Nevermind."
msgstr "何だって？この話は止めておこう。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/npc/TALK_FORGE_DIVINER.json
msgid ""
"I can almost smell them through the crystal ball.  Disturbing.  I'll mark "
"the location on your map for one denarius.  Good luck.  You might need it."
msgstr ""
"水晶玉からも匂いが漂ってきそうだよ。不穏な匂いがね。デナリウス硬貨を1枚支払えば、場所を教えてやろう。幸運を祈ってるよ。一番必要なものだろうからね。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/npc/TALK_FORGE_DIVINER.json
msgid ""
"Scrying on these things makes me uneasy, but I'll mark the location on your "
"map for one denarius."
msgstr "こんなものを念視するなんていい気分じゃないが、デナリウス硬貨を1枚支払えば、場所を教えてやろう。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/npc/TALK_FORGE_DIVINER.json
msgid ""
"I can't even number the times I've scraped this mess off of the forge.  It's"
" like walking into a spider web at an hundred miles an hour, and the web "
"also smells terribly and tries to eat you.  At least the magical torches the"
" forgemaster has installed help a bit.  See, the Mycus fears fire, and for "
"good reasons.  Anyways, I'll mark the location on your map for one denarius."
"  Don't eat the fruit."
msgstr ""
"炉からあのゴミを何度掻き出したことか。こんな場所へ行くなんて、勢いよくクモの巣に顔を突っ込むようなものだよ。しかもこのクモの巣は酷い臭いがして、人間を食うときた。少なくともここでは、機工士共が置いた魔法の松明が少しは役に立っているようだ。ミカズは火を恐れるが、それには理由があるんだよ。ともかく、デナリウス硬貨を1枚支払えば、場所を教えてやろう。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/npc/TALK_FORGE_DIVINER.json
msgid ""
"Right.  Fungal crustaceans from space.  Mighty unpleasant fellas, if you ask"
" me.  But, uh, don't tell them I said so.  The forge lord says they mean no "
"offense, that cutting people up is just their way of saying 'hi'.  "
"Personally I find it rude, but perhaps that's anthropocentric of me.  But I "
"digress.  Are you interested in an encampment or a scout tower?"
msgstr ""
"よし。宇宙から来た、甲羅をかぶった菌類共だね。まったく不愉快な奴らだ。おっと、奴らに告げ口するんじゃないよ。フォージロード曰く、悪気はないそうだからね。奴らが人間を切り刻むのは、私らの「やあ、こんにちは」と同じなんだとさ。私は失敬なやり方だとしか思えないが、それも勝手な考え方なのかねぇ。ああ、話が逸れたね。奴らの野営地や偵察塔に興味があるのかい？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/npc/TALK_FORGE_DIVINER.json
msgid "An encampment."
msgstr "野営地だ。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/npc/TALK_FORGE_DIVINER.json
msgid "A scout tower."
msgstr "偵察塔だ。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/npc/TALK_FORGE_DIVINER.json
msgid "On second thought…"
msgstr "ちょっと考え直そう..."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/npc/TALK_FORGE_DIVINER.json
msgid ""
"Have you seen mi-go architecture?  They make these living, organic "
"structures out of resin.  Kind of cool.  And disturbing, I guess.  Of "
"course, they'll cut you to pieces if you gawk at it too long.  I'll mark the"
" location of one of these places on your map for one denarius.  I heard a "
"story, not sure if it was true, but allegedly one guy tried to use the mi-go"
" building resin as armor.  Apparently, it bore into the poor guy's flesh!  "
"Like lichen!  His friends tried to tear it off, but it wouldn't bulge.  He "
"was in so much pain they decided to put him out of his misery.  But they "
"couldn't do it, because the armor was too good!  So I guess that in a sense "
"it worked.  Heh.  The mental image still keeps me awake at night, "
"occasionally.  And now you have it too.  You're welcome."
msgstr ""
"ミ＝ゴの作った建物を見たことはあるかい？奴らはまるで生き物みたいな建物を樹脂で作るんだ。なかなか洒落ているじゃないか。しかも不気味だ。もちろん、のんびり眺めていたら、奴らに切り刻まれるよ。デナリウス硬貨を1枚支払えば、場所を教えてやろう。本当かどうか知らないが、こんな話がある。ある男が、ミ＝ゴの建物に使われていた樹脂を、鎧の材料にしたそうだ。ところが、樹脂の鎧は男の肉にくっついちまった！コケのように皮膚に根付いたのさ！仲間たちがなんとかして鎧を引き剥がそうとしたが、無駄だった。男があまりに痛がるものだから、気の毒に思った仲間たちは、男を楽にしてやろうと決めた。だが、鎧があまりに硬すぎて、それすらできなかったのさ！ある意味、完璧な鎧だったわけだね。ヒッヒッヒ。私は今でもこの話を時々思い出して、眠れなくなることがある。あんたにもおすそ分けしてやろう。礼は要らないよ。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/npc/TALK_FORGE_DIVINER.json
msgid "Uh sure.  Thanks?  It's a deal."
msgstr "ええと、興味深い話をどうも？硬貨を支払おう。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/npc/TALK_FORGE_DIVINER.json
msgid ""
"The mi-go seem to abduct humans and animals for some alien purpose, and then"
" build these towers for their spaceships to dock with to move the prisoners "
"of-world.  Did I mention they have space ships?  Well, I've never actually "
"seen one dock with a tower, but still.  I'll mark such a tower on your map "
"for one denarius."
msgstr ""
"ミ＝ゴの目的なんて知ったこっちゃないが、奴らは塔に宇宙船を停めて、誘拐してきた人間や動物を連れて行っちまうそうだよ。宇宙船なんてあるんだろうか？塔に何か停泊していることなんて、この目で見たことは一度もないがね。デナリウス硬貨を1枚支払えば、場所を教えてやろう。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/npc/TALK_FORGE_DIVINER.json
msgid ""
"Right.  Extradimensional intelligent plants with a mean streak.  They seem "
"to have a method of traveling from reality to reality without traversing the"
" hazards between.  Interesting, no?  I'd ask them how they do it but I don't"
" think I could get a word in edgewise before they cut me to pieces.  I'll "
"mark one of their groves on your map for one denarius."
msgstr ""
"ああ。次元の向こうから来た、悪知恵の働く植物のことかい。奴らはある場所から別の場所へ、危険を避けて移動する方法を知っているらしい。面白いとは思わないかい？やり方を尋ねたいところだが、声を掛けるより速く八つ裂きにされるだろうね。デナリウス硬貨を1枚支払えば、場所を教えてやろう。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/npc/TALK_FORGE_DIVINER.json
msgid ""
"It seems that a group of mutated cephalopods have set up camp in a cave near"
" the water.  I don't know what they're up to, but if you want to go and "
"investigate I'll mark the cave on your map for one denarius."
msgstr ""
"水辺の洞窟に、変異した頭足類共が集まっているようだ。奴らが何を企んでいるのか知らないが、もし見に行きたいなら、デナリウス硬貨を1枚支払えば、場所を教えてやろう。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/npc/TALK_FORGE_DIVINER.json
msgid ""
"Do you like slime?  Do you like living slime that tries to eat you?  Do you "
"wish you were surrounded by lots and lots and lots of it?  Then perhaps this"
" place is the place for you.  I'll mark the place on your map for one "
"denarius."
msgstr ""
"スライムが好きなのかい？人間を食おうとする生きたスライムが？そんな奴らに囲まれて暮らしたいのかい？それなら、ぴったりの場所がある。デナリウス硬貨を1枚支払えば、場所を教えてやろう。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/npc/TALK_FORGE_DIVINER.json
msgid ""
"Good choice.  It seems that shortly before the world started to end, a few "
"of them got it in their heads to just leave civilization alone for a bit and"
" go live in the woods with other goblins.  And wargs.  Not a terrible idea "
"if you ask me.  Anyways, theres a few different types of places they gather,"
" are you looking for an encampment or an outpost?"
msgstr ""
"いい選択だね。世界が終わりを迎える少し前、ゴブリンの何人かは文明から少し離れ、森の中で集まって暮らそうと思いついたようだよ。それからワーグもね。私に言わせれば、中々にいい考えじゃないか。それはともかく、奴らが集まる場所にはいくつか種類がある。野営地と前哨地、どちらを探すんだい？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/npc/TALK_FORGE_DIVINER.json
msgid "An outpost."
msgstr "前哨地だ。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/npc/TALK_FORGE_DIVINER.json
msgid ""
"You've got a long walk deep into the forest ahead of you.  Oh, and did I "
"mention the wargs?  They've got these wargs that are absolutely adorable.  "
"Of course they'll maul you if you try to pet them, but the temptation is "
"always there.  I'll mark one of their camps on your map for one denarius."
msgstr ""
"森の奥深くまで続く長い道のりが視える。ああ、ワーグのことは聞いているかい？奴らが飼ってるワーグは本当に愛らしいんだよ。もちろん、撫でようとすれば喰われるが、誘惑というのは抑えがたいものさ。デナリウス硬貨を1枚支払えば、野営地の場所を教えてやろう。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/npc/TALK_FORGE_DIVINER.json
msgid ""
"Contrary to popular belief, goblins are not actually orcs.  Its the other "
"way around.  Orcs are goblins who have taken one too many unlabeled potions "
"and lived to tell the tale.  Sometimes this awakens powers much like my own."
"  Well, not exactly, if it did I'd be out of a job faster than a Magus could"
" cast Phase Door.  Luckily for you, you shouldn't have to delve too deep "
"into a forest to see for yourself.  I'll mark one of their outposts on your "
"map for one denarius."
msgstr ""
"ゴブリンとオークは別物だと、間違って覚えてる奴が多いらしいね。ゴブリンとオークは同じだよ。中身の分からないポーションをがぶ飲みして生き延びたゴブリンが、オークになるのさ。その中には、私が持ってるのと同じような力に目覚めた者もいる。まあ、正確には同じ力じゃないが。もし同じ力に目覚めてたら、私は魔法使いがフェイズドアを詠唱し終えるより早く職を失ってただろうね。あんたは幸運だ。真相を確かめるために森の奥深くを探し回る必要はない。デナリウス硬貨を1枚支払えば、前哨地の場所を教えてやろう。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/npc/TALK_FORGE_DIVINER.json
msgid ""
"Oh, fancy yourself a dragon slayer, eh?  It's my understanding they use a "
"lot of acid, so be ready for that.  And remember that the body parts of "
"dragons are quite valuable.  Even the blood, so you might wanna bring "
"something to keep said blood in, and bleed the corpses before you butcher.  "
"I'll mark it on your map for one denarius."
msgstr ""
"おやおや、竜退治かい？竜は酸をたっぷり吐くらしいから、覚悟をしておくんだね。ドラゴンの肉はとても貴重だよ。そして血もね。血を溜めておけるよう準備した方がいい。そして肉を捌く前に血を抜くんだ。デナリウス硬貨を1枚支払えば、場所を教えてやろう。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/npc/TALK_FORGE_DIVINER.json
msgid ""
"Now there is not a lot I can tell you about this one.  There is some kind of"
" demonic beast living in this cave.  But it only surfaces occasionally, and "
"the heavy metals in the cave walls interfere with my scrying.  There might "
"be treasure down there, or there might not be.  But there is certain to be "
"danger.  I'll mark it on your map for one denarius."
msgstr ""
"その場所について私が語れることはあまりないよ。洞穴の中に、悪魔のような怪物が棲んでいる。ただし、外へは偶にしか姿を見せないし、洞穴の壁が硬い金属でできているから、私でも見通せないのさ。壁の向こうに宝があるかもしれないし、ないかもしれない。だが、危険だってことは間違いないね。デナリウス硬貨を1枚支払えば、場所を教えてやろう。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/npc/TALK_FORGE_DIVINER.json
msgid ""
"Deeply buried secret installations where shady government organizations "
"conducted unethical experiments, free from moral constrains.  Did such "
"places really exist before the cataclysm, or did humanity's collective "
"mistrust, superstition and conspiracy theories cause the portal storms to "
"dream these places into existence?  I honestly can't tell, but I suppose it "
"doesn't matter now.  These places do exist, and are ripe with mysteries, "
"dangers, and loot.  You'll have to specify which kind you're looking for."
msgstr ""
"地中深くの秘密の施設で、怪しげな政府組織が道徳の頸木から解き放たれ、おぞましい実験を行っている。そういう場所が大変動以前から本当にあったのか、それとも、人類の不信、迷信、虚言が集まってポータルの嵐を呼び起こし、そんな場所が生まれたのか。正直なところ、私にも分からないが、今となってはどちらでも構わないね。そういった場所は確かにあり、謎や危険、そして宝に満ちている。どのような場所を探しているのか、詳しく聞こうじゃないか。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/npc/TALK_FORGE_DIVINER.json
msgid "Just a normal one."
msgstr "一般的な研究所だ。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/npc/TALK_FORGE_DIVINER.json
msgid "A central lab."
msgstr "中央研究所だ。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/npc/TALK_FORGE_DIVINER.json
msgid "An ice lab."
msgstr "気温が低い研究所だ。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/npc/TALK_FORGE_DIVINER.json
msgid "A nether lab."
msgstr "異界と繋がった研究所だ。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/npc/TALK_FORGE_DIVINER.json
msgid ""
"Right.  Probably a good call.  I'll mark one on your map for one denarius."
msgstr "なるほど。いい判断だね。デナリウス硬貨を1枚支払えば、場所を教えてやろう。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/npc/TALK_FORGE_DIVINER.json
msgid ""
"A larger lab with more dangers and more treasures.  I'll mark it on your map"
" for one denarius."
msgstr "大きな研究所には、多くの危険と宝が待っているものさ。デナリウス硬貨を1枚支払えば、場所を教えてやろう。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/npc/TALK_FORGE_DIVINER.json
msgid ""
"It's an incredibly cold place, that lab.  The deeper parts might even be "
"below absolute zero.  Now this was of course not possible during the old "
"laws of physics, but times change.  Times change.  I'll mark one on your map"
" for one denarius."
msgstr ""
"とてつもなく寒い研究所だよ。下層では、絶対零度を下回る寒さになるそうだ。かつての物理学の法則ではありえないことだが、時代は変わるものさ。デナリウス硬貨を1枚支払えば、場所を教えてやろう。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/npc/TALK_FORGE_DIVINER.json
msgid "Cool.  It's a deal."
msgstr "武者震いがするな。取り引き成立だ。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/npc/TALK_FORGE_DIVINER.json
msgid "Actually, I got cold feet."
msgstr "冷や汗が出てきた、この話は止めにしよう。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/npc/TALK_FORGE_DIVINER.json
msgid ""
"Here it seems like the scientists managed to break through the walls of "
"reality to the nether.  Of course, they didn't bother to do it correctly, so"
" the whole place is a mess.  Be ready for flaming eyes if you go there.  "
"I'll mark it on your map for one denarius."
msgstr ""
"科学者共が現実世界の壁を突き破り、異界への道が開通してしまった研究所だね。当然、奴らは正しく道を開かなかったから、所内全体が滅茶苦茶になっている。足を踏み入れるなら、相当の覚悟をしておくんだね。デナリウス硬貨を1枚支払えば、場所を教えてやろう。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/npc/TALK_FORGE_DIVINER.json
msgid ""
"Fellow travelers between realities, those ones.  At first I thought they "
"would be competition, but they seem to have little interest in the things we"
" at the forge value.  Nowadays we barely interact with them, except in the "
"rare occasions when we find a group of them marooned in between the worlds."
"  Poor things are almost always driven completely insane by the time we can "
"mount a rescue.  Nevertheless, it's the law of the sea out there, as far as "
"Valzain is concerned.  They seem to have set up shop not too far from here."
"  I'll mark it on your map for one denarius.  You might wanna check the "
"magic item store for an Amulet of Comprehend Languages before you go.  Then "
"again, we might be out of that right now."
msgstr ""
"私らと同じく、世界を行き来する奴らだね。はじめは諍いが起きると思っていたが、どうやら奴ら、この炉で大事にしている物品にはてんで興味がないらしい。今ではほとんど交流もないが、偶に世界の狭間に取り残された奴らを見かけることもある。そういう時なら話は別さ。気の毒なことに、私らが助けに向かうまでに、大抵は正気を失っちまうんだがね。ヴァルザインはそれが海の掟だとか言っておったが。奴らはここからそう遠くないとろこに店を構えているようだ。デナリウス硬貨を1枚支払えば、場所を教えてやろう。向かう前に、魔法道具店で言語理解のアミュレットを買うのを忘れるんじゃないよ。まあ、もう売り切れかもしれないが。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/npc/TALK_FORGE_DIVINER.json
msgid ""
"Yes, a strange location indeed, buried mostly underground.  Was it really "
"built by humans?  I find that rather unlikely.  I can't see very deep into "
"the structure, but there is a strange power somewhere below the entrance.  "
"I'll mark it on your map for one denarius."
msgstr ""
"ああ、ほとんどが地下に埋まっている、実に不思議なところだ。本当に人間が作ったのだろうか？そうは思えないね。奥までは視えないが、入り口の下に、何か不思議な力を感じるよ。デナリウス硬貨を1枚支払えば、場所を教えてやろう。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/npc/TALK_FORGE_DIVINER.json
msgid ""
"You know, if you've got the aptitude, you should go visit an attunement "
"altar.  They help you combine your skills with different classes of magic to"
" incredible effect.  I'll mark one on your map for one denarius."
msgstr ""
"あんたにその資格があるなら、調和の祭壇はぜひ訪れるべきだ。自分の力と様々な種類の魔法を組み合わせれば、信じられない程の力が手に入るよ。デナリウス硬貨を1枚支払えば、場所を教えてやろう。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/npc/TALK_FORGE_DIVINER.json
msgid ""
"This place used to teach magic before the whole Malignance business.  There "
"are probably still spell scrolls and magical items to find there.  And "
"golems.  Can't forget about the golems.  I'll mark one on your map for one "
"denarius."
msgstr ""
"悪意に満たされるまでは、その場所は魔法の学び舎だった。今も呪文書や魔道具が残っておる筈だ。そしてゴーレムもね。デナリウス硬貨を1枚支払えば、場所を教えてやろう。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/npc/TALK_FORGE_DIVINER.json
msgid ""
"Seems like an eccentric wizard once lived here.  Not that there are any "
"other kind of wizards, am I right?  But, uh, don't tell Valzain I said so.  "
"Or any other wizards for that matter.  But you know it's true.  Anyways, "
"I'll mark the building on your map for one denarius."
msgstr ""
"昔は変人の魔法使いが棲んでいたようだ。はて、変人でない魔法使いなぞ居るものだろうか？おっと、今のはヴァルザインには内緒にしとくれよ。他の魔法使いにもね。しかし、真実であることに違いはない。ともかく、デナリウス硬貨を1枚支払えば、場所を教えてやろう。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/npc/TALK_FORGE_DIVINER.json
msgid ""
"Poor druids, they were hit hardest by the rise of technology.  Magi, "
"technomancers, animists, they can just close the windows and keep their "
"chanting low so to not bother the neighbors.  Even earthshapers can just go "
"into the backyard, but druids had to move out to the middle of nowhere.  "
"That's where their tower will be, mind.  There won't be a road there, so "
"you're in for quite the trip.  I'll mark one on your map for one denarius."
msgstr ""
"気の毒なドルイド、科学技術の台頭で一番割を食った奴らだよ。マギやテクノマンサー、アニミストなんかは、ちゃんと窓を閉めて小声で詠唱していれば近所から苦情も出ない。アースシェイパーも裏庭があれば問題ない。ドルイドは人里離れた場所まで行かなけりゃならないからね。その場所こそが、ドルイドの塔がそびえる地さ。道が無いから、たどり着くまでにかなり苦労するだろうね。デナリウス硬貨を1枚支払えば、場所を教えてやろう。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/npc/TALK_FORGE_DIVINER.json
msgid "I could use a nice walk."
msgstr "何事もなく辿り着きたいものだ。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/npc/TALK_FORGE_DIVINER.json
msgid ""
"Rivers.  Water, sand, clay, fish, giant mutant bugs.  Generally pretty big."
"  If you're still having trouble finding one, I'll mark one on your map for "
"one denarius."
msgstr ""
"川ね。水、砂、粘土、魚、変異した巨大な虫。あんなに目立つ地形もないだろうに。どうしても自力で見つけられないっていうなら、デナリウス硬貨を1枚支払えば、場所を教えてやろう。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/npc/TALK_FORGE_DIVINER.json
msgid ""
"Digging clay is quintessential of the Earthshaper.  Forming it into useful "
"tools is quintessential of the Technomancer.  Showing you where you can find"
" it is quintessential of me. For one denarius of course."
msgstr ""
"粘土を掘るのはアースシェイパーの神髄。それを道具に加工するのがテクノマンサーの神髄。そして粘土の採れる場所を教えるのは私の神髄さ。デナリウス硬貨を1枚支払えば、場所を教えてやろう。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/npc/TALK_FORGE_DIVINER.json
msgid ""
"If you're looking for something rough and coarse that gets everywhere, I'll "
"mark a large sand patch on your map for one denarius."
msgstr "どこにでもあるざらついた砂がそんなに気になるかい。デナリウス硬貨を1枚支払えば、広い砂場を教えてやろう。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/npc/TALK_FORGE_DIVINER.json
msgid ""
"The water there is scolding hot.  Perhaps it could help you survive the cold"
" winter months?  I'll mark one on your map for one denarius."
msgstr "火傷するほど熱い湯がある場所だね。もしかすると、寒い冬を乗り切るのに役立つだろうか？デナリウス硬貨を1枚支払えば、場所を教えてやろう。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/npc/TALK_FORGE_DIVINER.json
msgid ""
"If you're interested in the neolithic housing market, I'll mark a cave on "
"your map for one denarius.  Just be warned that the place might already be "
"occupied."
msgstr ""
"新石器時代の家探しがしたいなら、デナリウス硬貨を1枚支払えば、場所を教えてやろう。ただし、もう先客が来ていることもあるから、注意するんだよ。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/npc/TALK_FORGE_DIVINER.json
msgid ""
"Looking for potion ingredients?  I know a place where the leylines converge "
"and such plants grows plentiful.  I'll mark it on your map for one denarius."
msgstr ""
"お目当てはポーションの原料かい？レイラインが集まる場所なら知っているよ。その手の植物が生い茂っている筈だ。デナリウス硬貨を1枚支払えば、場所を教えてやろう。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/npc/TALK_FORGE_DIVINER.json
msgid ""
"Valzain is over at the entrance of the forge, selling overpriced magical "
"knick-knacks.  Or perhaps there was something else you had in mind?"
msgstr "ヴァルザインだったら、炉の入り口で高い魔道具を売っているじゃないか。それとももっと別の神をお探しかい？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/npc/TALK_FORGE_DIVINER.json
msgid "Another forge?"
msgstr "炉は他にもあるのか？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/npc/TALK_FORGE_DIVINER.json
msgid "A Lovecraftian horror."
msgstr "ラブクラフト的な神のことだ。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/npc/TALK_FORGE_DIVINER.json
msgid "The Malignance."
msgstr "悪神のことだ。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/npc/TALK_FORGE_DIVINER.json
msgid ""
"There is only one Forge of Wonders, it's not like this is a multidimensional"
" franchise opportunity."
msgstr "驚異の炉は世界に一つしかないよ。多次元フランチャイズ展開なんかしてないさ。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/npc/TALK_FORGE_DIVINER.json
msgid ""
"There are these city-sized creatures called Void Leviathans that lives in "
"the vast nether regions between realities.  Sometimes they used to wash up "
"onto Earths that had recently had a cataclysm.  Caused all kinds of trouble,"
" they did, so Valzain made it so they would spawn underground instead.  But "
"I haven't seen any of them in quite a while.  Perhaps they retreated deeper "
"into the empty parts of the nether?  Sorry, I haven't seen any in this "
"reality yet.  I can't help you."
msgstr ""
"現実と現実の狭間にある広大な冥界には、ヴォイドリヴァイアサンという都市ほど大きな怪物がおる。時折、大変動を起こしたばかりの世界へ流れつくことがあるのさ。それが地上で暴れて大変なことになったから、それ以来ヴァルザインがこの怪物を地下へ向かうようにしたらしい。だが、ここしばらくは見かけていないね。もしかすると、異界の空白地帯にでも引っ込んじまったんだろうかね。悪いが、この世界で奴を視たことはない。期待には応えられそうにないね。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/npc/TALK_FORGE_DIVINER.json
msgid ""
"The Malignance is the cause for much of our woes.  It is the force animating"
" the zombies.  It is responsible for the portal storms, and it seems to be "
"absolutely bursting with hate.  Valzain theorizes that it used to be a "
"fundamental force of nature or perhaps a school of magic that somehow grew "
"conscious, or perhaps had a consciousness imposed on it. Allegedly, the Mi-"
"Go speak of a time before it existed, or perhaps a time in which it wasn't "
"so dangerous.  By now, it is everywhere on Earth.  As far as I can tell, it "
"builds no structures and has no bases of operation, so there is no place I "
"can point you towards.  Sorry."
msgstr ""
"悪神は私らの苦難の原因だ。ゾンビを動かす源だ。憎悪に満ち溢れた、ポータルの嵐の種だ。ヴァルザインの話によれば、かつてそれは自然の根源的な力、または一種の魔法だったが、何らかの形で意識を持つようになった、もしくは持たされたことでこうなったらしい。ミ＝ゴは、それが存在する前の時代、あるいはまだ危険でなかった時代のことを知っているそうだ。悪神は、今となっては地球上の至る所に存在している。私の知る限り、拠点としている構造物や場所は無い。だから、案内できる場所もないんだよ。面目ないね。"

#. ~ Unique name of a female NPC
#. ~ The Pirate of the Forge of Wonders.
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/npc/TALK_FORGE_HELEN_TAVREL.json
msgid "Helen Tavrel, Former Pirate"
msgstr "ﾍﾚﾝ ﾀﾌﾞﾚﾙ、元海賊"

#. ~ Name of an NPC class
#. ~ This is a unique NPC who doesn't get randomly selected background traits
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/npc/TALK_FORGE_HELEN_TAVREL.json
msgid "Pirate Queen"
msgstr "海賊の女王"

#. ~ Job description of "Pirate Queen" NPC class
#. ~ This is a unique NPC who doesn't get randomly selected background traits
#. ~ Job description of "Pirate" NPC class
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/npc/TALK_FORGE_HELEN_TAVREL.json
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/npc/TALK_FORGE_PIRATE.json
msgid "My adventures would curdle your blood."
msgstr "血が騒ぐような冒険をしているんだ。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/npc/TALK_FORGE_HELEN_TAVREL.json
msgid "Would you try to capture me?"
msgstr "私を捕らえに来たのか？"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/npc/TALK_FORGE_HELEN_TAVREL.json
msgid "I've killed many a government-sanctioned hunter in my life."
msgstr "私はこれまでに、政府公認の賞金稼ぎを何人も殺してきたぞ。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/npc/TALK_FORGE_HELEN_TAVREL.json
msgid ""
"Aren't we all lucky that you are probably the last lawman alive in miles?"
msgstr "お前がここら一帯で生きてる最後の法執行官だ。お互い幸運だったな？"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/npc/TALK_FORGE_HELEN_TAVREL.json
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/npc/TALK_FORGE_MERCHANT.json
msgid "Welcome to the Forge of Wonders."
msgstr "驚異の炉へようこそ。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/npc/TALK_FORGE_HELEN_TAVREL.json
msgid "Reagents and blackpowders!"
msgstr "水薬も火薬もあるよ！"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/npc/TALK_FORGE_HELEN_TAVREL.json
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/npc/TALK_FORGE_PIRATE.json
msgid "Ahoy and other nautical terms!"
msgstr "アホイ！他の海の言葉は分かる？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/npc/TALK_FORGE_HELEN_TAVREL.json
msgid "When are you getting new stuff?"
msgstr "新商品はいつ頃入荷する？"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/npc/TALK_FORGE_HELEN_TAVREL.json
msgid ""
"I hope you're willing to overlook my past because otherwise you're not "
"buying anything from me."
msgstr "私の過去は見逃しておくれ。じゃないと何も売ってやらないよ。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/npc/TALK_FORGE_HELEN_TAVREL.json
msgid ""
"A lifetime of plunder has brought me many a strange item - that you can have"
" for unbeatable prices!"
msgstr "略奪人生を過ごしてきたお陰で、妙なアイテムをたくさん手に入れたんだ。破格の値段だよ！"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/npc/TALK_FORGE_HELEN_TAVREL.json
msgid "Well, shiver me timbers then."
msgstr "船の肋材が震えるくらい驚いたよ。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/npc/TALK_FORGE_HELEN_TAVREL.json
msgid ""
"Do you think me a fool, to tell an officer of the law my current plans?"
msgstr "企みを法執行官に話すなんて、私がそんなへまをすると思うか？"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/npc/TALK_FORGE_HELEN_TAVREL.json
msgid ""
"Not even trying to ask me that undercover?  By the seventeen seas, officers "
"of the law really ARE made worse these days."
msgstr "潜入捜査のフリくらいしたらどうだ？十七の海を股に掛ける私には、法執行官のあくどいやり口なんてお見通しなのさ。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/npc/TALK_FORGE_HELEN_TAVREL.json
msgid ""
"The end of times is here and that's what you're worried about?  You should "
"get your priorities straight."
msgstr "時代の終わりが近付いているのに、そんなことで気を揉んでいるのか？優先すべきことを間違えるなよ。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/npc/TALK_FORGE_HELEN_TAVREL.json
msgid ""
"Well you obviously aren't an officer so here's the deal.  There's a mighty "
"fine galleon making land in <interval>, I'm certain to have something good "
"by then."
msgstr ""
"お前はどう見ても法執行官じゃないし、取り引きを許そう。<interval>後には豪華なガレオン船が接岸するから、その頃なら何かいい商品が入っているだろう。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/npc/TALK_FORGE_HELEN_TAVREL.json
msgid "May the seas be ever in your favor."
msgstr "あなたに海の恵みあれ。"

#. ~ Unique name of a male NPC
#. ~ The Lord of the Forge of Wonders.
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/npc/TALK_FORGE_MERCHANT.json
msgid "Valzain of Psiom"
msgstr "ﾌﾟｼｵﾑのｳﾞｧﾙｻﾞｲﾝ"

#. ~ Name of an NPC class
#. ~ This is a unique NPC who doesn't get randomly selected background traits
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/npc/TALK_FORGE_MERCHANT.json
msgid "Wondrous Dreamer"
msgstr "奇妙な夢想家"

#. ~ Job description of "Wondrous Dreamer" NPC class
#. ~ This is a unique NPC who doesn't get randomly selected background traits
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/npc/TALK_FORGE_MERCHANT.json
msgid "I created this place from dreams and magic."
msgstr "夢と魔法によってこの場所を作ったんだ。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/npc/TALK_FORGE_MERCHANT.json
msgid "The government doesn't subsidize your purchases here anymore."
msgstr "ここでの買い物に政府の補助金は出ないよ。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/npc/TALK_FORGE_MERCHANT.json
msgid "Do you have any tales of adventure I could write down?"
msgstr "何か書き留めてほしい冒険物語はある？"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/npc/TALK_FORGE_MERCHANT.json
msgid ""
"In case you were wondering, we no longer respect any pre-existing weapon "
"laws."
msgstr "念のために言っておくが、かつて存在していた武器に関する法律を遵守するつもりはないよ。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/npc/TALK_FORGE_MERCHANT.json
msgid "Bring me tales and we can trade."
msgstr "物語を持ってきてくれたら、取り引きに応じよう。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/npc/TALK_FORGE_MERCHANT.json
msgid "I have some stories for you."
msgstr "話したいことがある。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/npc/TALK_FORGE_MERCHANT.json
msgid "Anything interesting being worked on?"
msgstr "何か興味深い商品は見つかったか？"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/npc/TALK_FORGE_MERCHANT.json
msgid "Excellent.  What new stories have you brought me?"
msgstr "素晴らしい。新しい情報を聞かせてもらえるか？"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/npc/TALK_FORGE_MERCHANT.json
msgid ""
"Once I was lost in the throes of love, now I've built an empire of material "
"goods.  I've found these two things are equally as powerful, and dangerous."
msgstr "かつて私は愛の渦に迷い込み、今では物質の帝国を築き上げた。これら二つはどちらも強く、そして危険なものだ。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/npc/TALK_FORGE_MERCHANT.json
msgid ""
"Well here and now I am the law, and the law here is that people purchase my "
"goods, they take them out into the world and they die; or they return to buy"
" more of my goods.  Either way, I write poetry about them."
msgstr ""
"さて、今この場所では私が法だ。人々が私の商品を買い、それを世界中へ運び、やがて死ぬ、あるいは私の商品を更に買うためにここへ戻ってくる。どちらにせよ、私はそのような営みについての詩を書く。それがここでの法だ。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/npc/TALK_FORGE_MERCHANT.json
msgid "Good day, sir."
msgstr "では、ごきげんよう。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/npc/TALK_FORGE_MERCHANT.json
msgid ""
"My minions are busy putting the final touches on a few exciting projects, "
"check back in <interval> and see what's new."
msgstr "しもべたちは刺激的な計画の最終仕上げに忙しい。<interval>後にまた来てもらえば、新しい商品が用意できているだろう。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/npc/TALK_FORGE_MERCHANT.json
msgid "May your hammers be accurate."
msgstr "あなたの鎚よ正確であれ。"

#. ~ Name suffix of an NPC
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/npc/TALK_FORGE_PIRATE.json
msgid "Former Pirate"
msgstr "元海賊"

#. ~ Name of an NPC class
#. ~ This is a unique NPC who doesn't get randomly selected background traits
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/npc/TALK_FORGE_PIRATE.json
msgid "Pirate"
msgstr "海賊"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/npc/TALK_FORGE_PIRATE.json
msgid "Walk away afore I kill ya where you stand."
msgstr "あんたを殺しちまう前に、さっさと失せな。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/npc/TALK_FORGE_PIRATE.json
msgid "You've got a lot of nerve wearing that badge these days."
msgstr "そういうバッジをつけてるのは、大抵グチグチうるせえ奴なんだ。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/npc/TALK_FORGE_PIRATE.json
msgid "Boys, I think we should drown this fool."
msgstr "おいおい、このバカを海に沈めてやろうか。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/npc/TALK_FORGE_PIRATE.json
msgid "Watch your step."
msgstr "足元に気をつけな。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/npc/TALK_FORGE_PIRATE.json
msgid "Talk to Captain Tavrel."
msgstr "タブレル船長とお喋りするかい。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/npc/TALK_FORGE_PIRATE.json
msgid "Obviously I should speak to someone else."
msgstr "他の人に聞くことにするよ。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/npc/TALK_FORGE_PIRATE.json
msgid "Pirates should be hung until dead."
msgstr "海賊はさっさと吊るすべきだな。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Kill 50 Zombies"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Kill 150 Zombies"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/npc/TALK_HEALER_GREY.json
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/npc/missiondef.json
msgid "Blessed be."
msgstr "祝福あれ。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/npc/TALK_HEALER_GREY.json
msgid ""
"I must purge this land of its curse.  Will you help or hinder our mission?"
msgstr "この土地の呪いを一掃しなければ。あなたは私たちの使命を援助しに来たのか、それとも妨害に来たのか？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/npc/TALK_HEALER_GREY.json
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/npc/TALK_OLD_MAGUS.json
msgid "Hello <name_g>."
msgstr "こんにちは、<name_g>。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/npc/TALK_HEALER_GREY.json
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/npc/TALK_OLD_MAGUS.json
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/npc/TALK_TECHNO_KID.json
#: data/mods/No_Hope/NPC/NPC_Old_Guard_Captain.json
#: data/mods/No_Hope/NPC/NPC_Old_Guard_Commo.json
msgid "About the mission…"
msgstr "任務について..."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/npc/TALK_HEALER_GREY.json
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/npc/TALK_OLD_MAGUS.json
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/npc/TALK_TECHNO_KID.json
#: data/mods/No_Hope/NPC/NPC_Old_Guard_Captain.json
#: data/mods/No_Hope/NPC/NPC_Old_Guard_Commo.json
msgid "About one of those missions…"
msgstr "任務の1つについて..."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/npc/TALK_HEALER_GREY.json
msgid "Blessed be.  May you purge that which opposes the calm."
msgstr "祝福あれ。平穏を妨げるものは一掃しよう。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/npc/TALK_HEALER_GREY.json
msgid "I must purge this place before I can move on."
msgstr "他の場所へ行く前に、この場所を清めなければ。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/npc/TALK_OLD_MAGUS.json
msgid "Oh, you again."
msgstr "ああ、またお前か。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/npc/TALK_OLD_MAGUS.json
msgid "Huh?  *mumble mumble* …Who are you?"
msgstr "あ？*モゴモゴ*...誰だ？"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/npc/TALK_OLD_MAGUS.json
msgid "I'm busy, what is it?"
msgstr "忙しいのだ、何か用か？"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/npc/TALK_OLD_MAGUS.json
msgid "And leave my tower and all my research?  I think not."
msgstr "我が塔と我が研究を置いてか？そうはいかない。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/npc/TALK_TECHNO_KID.json
msgid "Ah, hello again."
msgstr "ああ、また会ったな。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/npc/TALK_TECHNO_KID.json
msgid "Do you seek power as well?"
msgstr "君も力を求めているのか？"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/npc/TALK_TECHNO_KID.json
msgid "Yes, yes… *electrical crackling* Isn't it beautiful?"
msgstr "やあ、やあ...*電気が爆ぜる音*...美しいだろう？"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/npc/TALK_TECHNO_KID.json
msgid "I must find more power before I can leave."
msgstr "ここを去る前に、まずは更なる力を手に入れたい。"

#. ~ Name of an NPC class
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/npc/classes.json
msgid "Mage Test"
msgstr "魔法使いテスト"

#. ~ Job description of "Mage Test" NPC class
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/npc/classes.json
msgid "I'm a wandering debug tester for the arcane arts."
msgstr "不思議な術を使ってデバッグをしているところだ。"

#. ~ Name of an NPC class
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/npc/classes.json
msgid "Master Magus"
msgstr "熟練メイガス"

#. ~ Job description of "Master Magus" NPC class
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/npc/classes.json
msgid "I'm an old Magus.  Get off my lawn!"
msgstr "私は古のメイガスだ。未熟者は帰れ！"

#. ~ Name of an NPC class
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/npc/classes.json
msgid "Techno-student"
msgstr "テクノマンシー学者"

#. ~ Job description of "Techno-student" NPC class
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/npc/classes.json
msgid "I'm searching for more power."
msgstr "更なる力を求めているんだ。"

#. ~ Name of an NPC class
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/npc/classes.json
msgid "Healer"
msgstr "治療師"

#. ~ Job description of "Healer" NPC class
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/npc/classes.json
msgid "I will purge this land of its curse."
msgstr "この土地の呪いを清めているんだ。"

#. ~ Name of an NPC class
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/npc/classes.json
msgid "Manatouched Mutant"
msgstr "マナタッチ変異体"

#. ~ Job description of "Manatouched Mutant" NPC class
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/npc/classes.json
msgid ""
"I'm becoming something more than mortal.  I need to find a way off this "
"plane."
msgstr "私は人間を超える存在になりつつある。この次元から抜け出す方法を見つけないと。"

#. ~ Name of an NPC class
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/npc/classes.json
msgid "Black Dragon Mutant"
msgstr "黒竜変異体"

#. ~ Job description of "Black Dragon Mutant" NPC class
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/npc/classes.json
msgid "I've got the blood of dragons in my veins.  I need more."
msgstr "私の身体にはドラゴンの血が流れている。もっと血が必要だ。"

#. ~ NPC faction name
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/npc/factions.json
msgid "The Ancient Ones"
msgstr "エンシェント・ワン"

#. ~ Description of NPC faction "The Ancient Ones"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/npc/factions.json
msgid ""
"The spellcrafters of old.  Hidden from the world until the cataclysm, they "
"have their own agenda and care little for you or yours."
msgstr "古の魔法使いです。大変動が起きるまでは世間から隔絶された暮らしをしており、自身の計画に従って動き、他人のことはほとんど気にしません。"

#. ~ NPC faction name
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/npc/factions.json
msgid "The Grey Flame"
msgstr "灰色の炎"

#. ~ Description of NPC faction "The Grey Flame"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/npc/factions.json
msgid ""
"A collection of those cursed by the cataclysm.  They have sworn to rid this "
"world of its curse and will stop at nothing to accomplish their task."
msgstr "大変動に取り憑かれた人々の集団です。この世界の呪いを解くことを目指しており、決して目標達成を諦めません。"

#. ~ NPC faction name
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/npc/factions.json
msgid "The Forge Lords"
msgstr "フォージロード"

#. ~ Description of NPC faction "The Forge Lords"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/npc/factions.json
msgid ""
"Builders and merchants of magical wonders.  They expect to weather this "
"Cataclysm through trade and innovation.  They will take any coin from any "
"land."
msgstr ""
"魔法による驚異の創造者と商人です。貿易と技術革新によってこの大変動を乗り切ろうとしており、どんな土地であっても金を儲けられると信じています。"

