#. ~ Profession name for male
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/hobbies.json
msgctxt "profession_male"
msgid "Chess Enthusiast"
msgstr "チェス愛好家"

#. ~ Description of profession "Chess Enthusiast" for male
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/hobbies.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You never made master, but you did very well in chess competitions before "
"the Cataclysm.  All those hours of staring at the board, trying to keep all "
"the pieces in your mind at once, have left you with a great ability to focus"
" your attention on a single problem when you need to."
msgstr ""
"マスターには手が届きませんでしたが、大変動以前にはチェスの大会で好成績を収めていました。全ての駒の動きを頭の中で再現しようと何時間もチェス盤を見つめ続けるうちに、対処すべき問題に意識を向ける非凡な集中力が身に付きました。"

#. ~ Profession name for female
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/hobbies.json
msgctxt "profession_female"
msgid "Chess Enthusiast"
msgstr "チェス愛好家"

#. ~ Description of profession "Chess Enthusiast" for female
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/hobbies.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You never made master, but you did very well in chess competitions before "
"the Cataclysm.  All those hours of staring at the board, trying to keep all "
"the pieces in your mind at once, have left you with a great ability to focus"
" your attention on a single problem when you need to."
msgstr ""
"マスターには手が届きませんでしたが、大変動以前にはチェスの大会で好成績を収めていました。全ての駒の動きを頭の中で再現しようと何時間もチェス盤を見つめ続けるうちに、対処すべき問題に意識を向ける非凡な集中力が身に付きました。"

#. ~ Profession name for male
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/hobbies.json
msgctxt "profession_male"
msgid "Chess Master"
msgstr "チェスマスター"

#. ~ Description of profession "Chess Master" for male
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/hobbies.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"Before the Cataclysm, many of your weekends were spent either competing in "
"tournaments or studying records of past games, always trying to find the "
"patterns.  All that time has also made you a master of concentrating on a "
"specific subject, despite whatever is going on around you."
msgstr ""
"大変動以前はほぼ毎週末週末トーナメントに出場するか、過去の試合と定跡の研究に時間を費やしてきました。そのような日々を続けてきたお陰で、周囲で何が起こっていようとも対処すべき問題に意識を向けられる、非凡な集中力を身に付けることができました。"

#. ~ Profession name for female
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/hobbies.json
msgctxt "profession_female"
msgid "Chess Master"
msgstr "チェスマスター"

#. ~ Description of profession "Chess Master" for female
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/hobbies.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"Before the Cataclysm, many of your weekends were spent either competing in "
"tournaments or studying records of past games, always trying to find the "
"patterns.  All that time has also made you a master of concentrating on a "
"specific subject, despite whatever is going on around you."
msgstr ""
"大変動以前はほぼ毎週末週末トーナメントに出場するか、過去の試合と定跡の研究に時間を費やしてきました。そのような日々を続けてきたお陰で、周囲で何が起こっていようとも対処すべき問題に意識を向けられる、非凡な集中力を身に付けることができました。"

#. ~ Profession name for male
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/hobbies.json
msgctxt "profession_male"
msgid "Chess Grandmaster"
msgstr "チェスグランドマスター"

#. ~ Description of profession "Chess Grandmaster" for male
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/hobbies.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You were one of the best of the best, awarded a grandmaster title in your "
"early twenties.  Chess was your passion and your life, and you were good "
"enough at it to make a living competing before the Cataclysm.  You have an "
"almost-inhuman ability to focus on a task and ignore all distractions."
msgstr ""
"20代前半でグランドマスターの称号を獲得した、チェス界の逸材でした。チェスこそが情熱の源、人生そのものであり、世界崩壊以前は大会の賞金で生計を立てられる程の腕前をもっていました。普通なら気が散るようなあらゆる要素を無視してタスクに意識を向けられる、超人的な集中力を会得しています。"

#. ~ Profession name for female
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/hobbies.json
msgctxt "profession_female"
msgid "Chess Grandmaster"
msgstr "チェスグランドマスター"

