#. ~ Profession name for male
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/hobbies.json
msgctxt "profession_male"
msgid "Ascended Photokinetic"
msgstr "フォトキネシス覚醒"

#. ~ Description of profession "Ascended Photokinetic" for male
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/hobbies.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"Something happened during the storms that raged during the Cataclysm, and "
"now you can do things that would have once seemed impossible.  Many times a "
"horde has passed within sight of you and simply never noticed you, and the "
"few times they did, you just created illusions of yourself and all ran "
"different directions.  The few stragglers were easy to sear to ash with "
"focused light."
msgstr ""
"大変動によって荒れ狂っていた嵐の中で何かが起こり、かつては不可能に思えたことができるようになりました。モンスターの大群が何度も目の前を通り過ぎていきました。誰もこちらの存在には気付かず、珍しく気付いて追いかけたとしても、それは能力によって作り出された自分自身の幻です。はぐれたごく少数の敵であれば、光を一点に集中させることで簡単に燃えて灰になりました。"

