msgctxt "profession_male"
msgid "Arising Telekinetic"
msgstr "テレキネシス開花"

#. ~ Description of profession "Arising Telekinetic" for male
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/hobbies.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"Something happened during the storms that raged during the Cataclysm, and "
"now you can do things that would have once seemed impossible.  Moving things"
" at a distance is child's play.  You can pick up zombies and fling them away"
" from you, shatter doors with a thought, and jump from the fifth story and "
"land with barely a bruise.  Nothing is going to get close to you now."
msgstr ""
"大変動によって荒れ狂っていた嵐の中で何かが起こり、かつては不可能に思えたことができるようになりました。遠くにあるものを動かすなんて朝飯前です。ゾンビを掴んで放り投げたり、ちょっと念じるだけで扉を粉砕したり、5階から大した傷も負わず飛び降りることもできます。敵は一匹たりとも寄せ付けません。"

