#. ~ Profession name for male
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/hobbies.json
msgctxt "profession_male"
msgid "Ascended Teleporter"
msgstr "テレポーター覚醒"

#. ~ Description of profession "Ascended Teleporter" for male
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/hobbies.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"Something happened during the storms that raged during the Cataclysm, and "
"now you can do things that would have once seemed impossible.  No wall or "
"door is a barrier to you and sometimes when you close your eyes you can "
"travel to places you've already been.  Once you were surprised by a bandit "
"and when he leveled his gun at you, you wished he was somewhere else and he "
"just…disappeared.  Nothing can keep you down now."
msgstr ""
"大変動によって荒れ狂っていた嵐の中で何かが起こり、かつては不可能に思えたことができるようになりました。壁や扉に移動を妨げられることはありません。目を閉じれば、一度行ったことのある場所に行くことができます。強盗に銃を向けられ脅されたときなど、どこかへ行ってしまえと念じただけで、その強盗は忽然と消えました。脅威など何一つありません。"

#. ~ Profession name for female
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/hobbies.json
