#. ~ Profession name for male
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/hobbies.json
msgctxt "profession_male"
msgid "Newly-Awakened Vitakinetic"
msgstr "ヴァイタキネシス原石"

#. ~ Description of profession "Newly-Awakened Vitakinetic" for male
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/hobbies.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"Something happened during the storms that raged during the Cataclysm, and "
"now you can do things that would have once seemed impossible.  You broke "
"your leg when you got caught in a riot, and when things got really bad you "
"were positive you were going to die.  But somehow, after only a few days "
"your leg didn't seem to hurt nearly as much anymore.  By the end of the week"
" you could walk on it, and by now it's like nothing ever happened.  It's not"
" going to help you fight the zombies but it'll sure help you recover "
"afterward."
msgstr ""
"大変動によって荒れ狂っていた嵐の中で何かが起こり、かつては不可能に思えたことができるようになりました。暴動に巻き込まれて脚を骨折し、更に事態が悪化したときは死を覚悟していました。しかしどういう訳か、わずか数日後には脚の痛みがほとんど消えていました。一週間で歩けるようになり、今は何事もなかったかのようにピンピンしています。ゾンビと戦うときには役立ちませんが、戦いの後にはきっと役立ちます。"

#. ~ Profession name for female
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/hobbies.json
msgctxt "profession_female"
msgid "Newly-Awakened Vitakinetic"
msgstr "ヴァイタキネシス原石"

#. ~ Description of profession "Newly-Awakened Vitakinetic" for female
