#. ~ Profession name for male
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/professions.json
msgctxt "profession_male"
msgid "Firestarter"
msgstr "発火能力者"

#. ~ Description of profession "Firestarter" for male
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/professions.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"Fire always fascinated you.  The fires you set almost got you arrested a few"
" times, but the urge was just too powerful.  It was like they were calling "
"to you, urging you to create them.  And ever since the sky broke, you can "
"create fire with merely a thought."
msgstr ""
"いつも火に魅入られていました。放火の罪で逮捕されそうになったこともありましたが、衝動は止められません。火を起こせと、どこからか呼び掛ける声が聞こえます。そして空が割れて以来、ただ心に思い浮かべるだけで火を起こせるようになりました。"

#. ~ Profession name for female
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/professions.json
msgctxt "profession_female"
msgid "Firestarter"
msgstr "発火能力者"

#. ~ Description of profession "Firestarter" for female
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/professions.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
