msgid ""
"Since the start of the Cataclysm, something has been hunting you "
"relentlessly.  You can try to fight it, but each time it falls it will rise "
"again, its powers growing stronger and stronger.  The only escape is for you"
" to die."
msgstr ""
"大変動が始まって以来、何かが執拗に追いかけてきます。戦うこともできますが、いくら殺しても再び立ち上がり、どんどんその力を増していきます。死以外に、この追跡を終わらせる方法はありません。"

#. ~ Description of skill "metaphysics"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/skills.json
