#. ~ Name of effect type id "instability_remover"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effects/effects_items.json
msgid "Morphic Reinforcement"
msgstr "形態耐性"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Morphic Reinforcement"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effects/effects_items.json
