#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/items/ammo.json
msgid "noetic energy"
msgid_plural "noetic energy"
msgstr[0] "精神エネルギー"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/items/ammo.json
msgid "LV429 pulse shot"
msgid_plural "LV429 pulse shot"
msgstr[0] "弾薬(LV429ﾊﾟﾙｽ弾)"

#. ~ Description of "LV429 pulse shot"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/items/ammo.json
msgid "A charge for the LV429."
msgstr "LV429用の弾薬です。"

#. ~ Description of "matrix charge"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/items/ammo.json
msgid "Power charge for matrix technology."
msgstr "マトリクス技術を利用した電力です。"

#. ~ Description of "noetic energy"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/items/ammo.json
msgid "Power charge for psychic phenomena."
msgstr "超能力による現象を引き起こす動力源です。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/items/books.json
msgid "Meditation and You"
msgid_plural "copies of Meditation and You"
msgstr[0] "本(学習/瞑想と貴方)"

#. ~ Description of "Meditation and You"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/items/books.json
msgid ""
"A description of simple meditation and breathing techniques, intended for a "
"beginner."
msgstr "手軽な瞑想と呼吸法について、初心者向けに解説している書籍です。"

#. ~ Variant name of item "Meditation and You"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/items/books.json
msgid "Zen Mind, Beginner's Mind"
msgid_plural "copies of Zen Mind, Beginner's Mind"
msgstr[0] "本(学習/初心・禅心)"

#. ~ Description of variant "Zen Mind, Beginner's Mind" of item "Meditation
#. and You"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/items/books.json
msgid ""
"This is a transcription of lectures given by Suzuki Shunryū, a Buddhist monk"
" who founded the first Zen Buddhist monastery in the United States, "
"containing discussion about Zen meditation and practice."
msgstr "アメリカで初めて禅宗の修行施設を設立した僧侶、鈴木俊隆の講義の書き起こし記録です。禅の瞑想と修行に関する議論が収録されています。"

#. ~ Variant name of item "Meditation and You"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/items/books.json
msgid "How to Meditate: A Practical Guide to Making Friends with Your Mind"
msgid_plural ""
"copies of How to Meditate: A Practical Guide to Making Friends with Your "
"Mind"
msgstr[0] "本(学習/瞑想法:自分の心と仲良くなるための実践ガイド)"

#. ~ Description of variant "How to Meditate: A Practical Guide to Making
#. Friends with Your Mind" of item "Meditation and You"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/items/books.json
msgid ""
"A book on meditation written for a general audience, containing simple "
"techniques on breathing and mindfulness."
msgstr "一般読者向けに書かれた瞑想に関する書籍です。呼吸とマインドフルネスについての簡単な技法が掲載されています。"

#. ~ Variant name of item "Meditation and You"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/items/books.json
msgid "The Wandering Mind: What Medieval Monks Tell Us about Distraction"
msgid_plural ""
"copies of The Wandering Mind: What Medieval Monks Tell Us about Distraction"
msgstr[0] "本(学習/心の迷走:散漫についての中世修道士の教え)"

#. ~ Description of variant "The Wandering Mind: What Medieval Monks Tell Us
#. about Distraction" of item "Meditation and You"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/items/books.json
msgid ""
"A history of monastic attempts at finding calm and peace in the midst of a "
"profane world.  There are far fewer daily distractions now than pre-"
"Cataclysm but there's still some useful techniques you could gain here."
msgstr ""
"世俗的な日常生活の中に静けさと平和を見出そうとする、修道院の試みを記した書籍です。大変動以前と比べれば、今の生活の中に心を迷走させる誘惑はほとんど無いように感じますが、それでもこの本からは有用な技法を学べます。"

#. ~ Variant name of item "Meditation and You"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/items/books.json
msgid ""
"The Miracle of Mindfulness: An Introduction to the Practice of Meditation"
msgid_plural ""
"copies of The Miracle of Mindfulness: An Introduction to the Practice of "
"Meditation"
msgstr[0] "本(学習/マインドフルネスの奇跡:実践的瞑想入門)"

#. ~ Description of variant "The Miracle of Mindfulness: An Introduction to
#. the Practice of Meditation" of item "Meditation and You"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/items/books.json
msgid ""
"A translation of a letter written by Thich Nhat Hanh to colleagues in Viet "
"Nam, this book focuses on mindfulness and breathwork."
msgstr ""
"禅僧のティク・ナット・ハンがベトナムに住む仲間たちに宛てて書いた手紙を翻訳した、マインドフルネスと呼吸法について詳しく解説している書籍です。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/items/books.json
msgid "Secrets of the Zen Masters"
msgid_plural "copies of Secrets of the Zen Masters"
msgstr[0] "本(学習/禅の達人の秘密)"

#. ~ Description of "Secrets of the Zen Masters"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/items/books.json
msgid ""
"This book purports to contain hidden tips that will make you serene and calm"
" in the face of the most grievous calamities.  Cataclysms, one might say."
msgstr ""
"あまりにも悲惨な災害に直面した際に心を穏やかに落ち着けるための、秘密の技を記したとされる書籍です。まさに、大変動に打ってつけかもしれませんね。"

#. ~ Variant name of item "Secrets of the Zen Masters"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/items/books.json
msgid ""
"The Mind Illuminated: A Complete Meditation Guide Integrating Buddhist "
"Wisdom and Brain Science for Greater Mindfulness"
msgid_plural ""
"copies of The Mind Illuminated: A Complete Meditation Guide Integrating "
"Buddhist Wisdom and Brain Science for Greater Mindfulness"
msgstr[0] "本(学習/照らされた心:仏教の知恵と脳科学で優れたマインドフルネスを実現する瞑想完全ガイド)"

#. ~ Description of variant "The Mind Illuminated: A Complete Meditation Guide
#. Integrating Buddhist Wisdom and Brain Science for Greater Mindfulness" of
#. item "Secrets of the Zen Masters"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/items/books.json
msgid ""
"Written by a neuroscientist and meditator practitioner, this book offers a "
"ten-step meditation program that combines science with traditional "
"meditation techniques."
msgstr ""
"瞑想の実践者でもある神経科学者によって書かれたこの書籍は、科学技術と伝統的瞑想テクニックを組み合わせた10ステップの瞑想プログラムを紹介しています。"

#. ~ Variant name of item "Secrets of the Zen Masters"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/items/books.json
msgid ""
"Mastering the Core Teachings of the Buddha: An Unusually Hardcore Dharma "
"Book"
msgid_plural ""
"copies of Mastering the Core Teachings of the Buddha: An Unusually Hardcore "
"Dharma Book"
msgstr[0] "本(学習/ブッダの教えの核心を体得する:決定版教本)"

#. ~ Description of variant "Mastering the Core Teachings of the Buddha: An
#. Unusually Hardcore Dharma Book" of item "Secrets of the Zen Masters"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/items/books.json
msgid ""
"This book argues that meditation is not an eternal progression but can be "
"mastered just like any other skill, and it will tell you how to do it."
msgstr "瞑想の技は永遠に磨き続けなければならないものではなく、他の技術と同様に習得できるものだと主張し、その訓練法を伝授する書籍です。"

#. ~ Variant name of item "Secrets of the Zen Masters"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/items/books.json
msgid "Not Always So: Practicing the True Spirit of Zen"
msgid_plural "copies of Not Always So: Practicing the True Spirit of Zen"
msgstr[0] "本(学習/ノット・オールウェイズ・ソー: 禅の真髄の実践)"

#. ~ Description of variant "Not Always So: Practicing the True Spirit of Zen"
#. of item "Secrets of the Zen Masters"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/items/books.json
msgid ""
"A continuation of the lessons expounded on in \"Zen Mind, Beginner's Mind\","
" this book contains a myriad of parables and koans to help the student grasp"
" the nature of meditation."
msgstr "『初心・禅心』での講義の続編にあたるこの書籍には、学習者が瞑想の性質を理解するのに役立つたくさんのたとえ話や公案が載っています。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/items/books.json
msgid "Lab Journal-Otomo"
msgid_plural "copies of Lab Journal-Otomo"
msgstr[0] "本(学習/研究日誌-オオトモ)"

#. ~ Description of "Lab Journal-Otomo"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/items/books.json
msgid ""
"This notebook is mostly a series of fanciful speculations about something "
"the author alternately calls \"Matrix Mechanics,\", \"Dimensional "
"Metaphysics,\" or \"Netherium Mathematics,\" sometimes using more than one "
"in the same sentence.  Most of it is incoherent, but there is some "
"experimental data about \"Conscious redirection of nether energy\" that "
"catches your eye."
msgstr ""
"筆者が「マトリクス力学」、「次元形而上学」、「ネザラム演算」などと呼称する事象についての、空想的な憶測が綴られています。一文の中にも表記ぶれが大量にあり、内容のほとんどが支離滅裂ですが、「異界エネルギーの意識的出力転換」に関するいくつかの実験データが目を引きます。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/items/books.json
msgid "Report: Channeling Protocol PGS38"
msgid_plural "copies of Report: Channeling Protocol PGS38"
msgstr[0] "本(学習/報告書:PGS38チャネリング法)"

#. ~ Description of "Report: Channeling Protocol PGS38"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/items/books.json
msgid ""
"A formal report on a process to reduce the unpredictable effects of long-"
"term psionic use.  It describes a special meditation technique, performed "
"with the aid of a matrix crystal, though it does warn that the process: "
"\"puts extreme stress on the focus object.  Further refinement is "
"required.\""
msgstr ""
"長期にわたる超能力の行使によって生じる予測不能な影響を軽減するためのプロセスを記した、正式な書式の報告書です。この文書では、マトリクス結晶の助けを借りて実行する特別な瞑想の技法について解説していますが、その技法は「対象に極度のストレスを与えるため、更なる改善が必要である」と但し書きが付されています。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/items/books.json
msgid "Training Manual: Method of Loci and Dimensional Metaphysics"
msgid_plural ""
"copies of Training Manual: Method of Loci and Dimensional Metaphysics"
msgstr[0] "本(学習/訓練マニュアル:場所法と次元的超能力)"

#. ~ Description of "Training Manual: Method of Loci and Dimensional
#. Metaphysics"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/items/books.json
msgid ""
"A formal report on a series of training procedures to allow the practitioner"
" to hold images and ideas in their head for long periods of time without "
"being distracted or losing their train of thought.  The report concludes, "
"\"While the human mind is not adept at holding static images or scenes in "
"place, some minor variation can be allowed for without suffering any adverse"
" effects from the flow of Netherum energy.  Method of Loci allows the "
"mathematician to maintain their thoughts within this area of variation while"
" still exerting effective control over the mathematics.\""
msgstr ""
"注意が散漫になったり思考の流れを中断することなくイメージやアイデアを頭の中に長時間保持することを目指す、一連のトレーニング手法を解説した正式な報告書です。この報告書は、「人間の精神は静的なイメージや情景を記憶することに長けてはいないが、ネザラムエネルギーの流れが多少変化しても悪影響を受けることはない。場所法は、演算者が演算を効果的にコントロールしつつ自らの思考をこの変化の許容範囲内で維持するために有効である。」と結論付けています。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/items/books.json
msgid "Training Manual: VERDANT HAND Combat Protocols"
msgid_plural "copies of Training Manual: VERDANT HAND Combat Protocols"
msgstr[0] "本(学習/VERDANT HAND戦闘プロトコル)"

#. ~ Description of "Training Manual: VERDANT HAND Combat Protocols"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/items/books.json
msgid ""
"A formal report with a mostly-blank cover page, stamped with the Project "
"PHAVIAN logo at the top and a red \"VERDANT HAND - EYES ONLY\" centered "
"underneath.  Contrary to your initial assumption, it is not a martial arts "
"training manual.  Instead, it describes a series of meditations and "
"visualization exercises designed to \"increase the subject's unarmed combat "
"prowess fivefold\".  There are several charts showing the results of a "
"VERDANT HAND combatant against training opponents armed with weapons or "
"firearms at various engagement distances.  It's clearly still not as good as"
" just having a rifle, but the data look pretty promising if you can get "
"these exercises down."
msgstr ""
"PHAVIAN計画のロゴと赤色の「VERDANT HAND - "
"極秘」という刻印以外は表紙に何も書かれていない、公式文書です。意外なことに、何かの戦闘スタイルを訓練する内容ではありません。ここに記されているのは、「被験体の非武装時の戦闘能力を通常の5倍まで高める」ことを目的とした瞑想と実技訓練の手順です。訓練を受けたVERDANT"
" "
"HAND戦闘員が、武器や銃器で武装した敵とさまざまな距離で相対した場合の効果を示すグラフが載っています。流石にライフルには負けるようですが、訓練を続ければかなり戦闘を有利に進められるというデータが並んでいます。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/items/chemicals.json
msgid "psychoreactive catalyst"
msgid_plural "psychoreactive catalyst"
msgstr[0] "精神反応性触媒"

#. ~ Description of "psychoreactive catalyst"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/items/chemicals.json
msgid ""
"A thick liquid, mixed with ground matrix crystal and ready to be catalyzed."
"  In total darkness, it glows very faintly."
msgstr "マトリクス結晶の粉末が混じっている、触媒作用をもつ濃厚な液体です。真っ暗闇の中でぼんやりと光ります。"

#. ~ Item name
