"The triffid lays your weak points bare and shares them with others through "
"the heartmind.  It's a bug if you have this."
msgstr "トリフィドが標的の弱点を看破し、心臓を通じて仲間と情報を共有します。通常は表示されません。"

#. ~ Spell name
