#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/pyrokinesis.json
msgid ""
"Create an expanding fireball that catches multiple targets in its wake."
msgstr "標的の背後まで貫通する大きな火球を作り出します。"

#. ~ Spell name
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/monsters/monsters_spells.json
