#. ~ Spell name
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/monsters/monsters_spells.json
msgid "Inertial Barrier Monster Effect"
msgstr "ｲﾅｰｼｬﾙ･ﾊﾞﾘｱモンスター効果"

#. ~ Description of spell "Inertial Barrier Monster Effect"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/monsters/monsters_spells.json
msgid "Grants the Inertial Barrier effect to a monster."
