#. ~ Description of spell "[Ψ]Network Effect Monster Real"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/monsters/monsters_spells.json
msgid "Adds the telepathic network effect to the monster's ally."
msgstr "モンスターの仲間にテレパシーの繋がり効果を追加します。"

