msgstr "<npc_name>に触れ、内なる力の感覚を伸ばし、病巣を探りました。心を覆う影がすぐに見つかり、それを自らの体内に引き込みました。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/npcs/dialogue/follower_dialogue.json
msgid "Hold still.  *Remove <npc_name>'s kaluptic psychosis*"
msgstr "じっとして。*<npc_name>の精神病を治す*"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/npcs/dialogue/follower_dialogue.json
msgid "Hold still.  *Remove <npc_name>'s muscle jitters*"
msgstr "じっとして。*<npc_name>の筋けいれんを治す*"

#. ~ Player message in an effect
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/npcs/dialogue/follower_dialogue.json
msgid ""
"You touch <npc_name> and reach out with your powers, looking for the illness"
" within them.  You soon find it, a shadow over their limbs, and draw it into"
