msgstr "<npc_name>に触れ、内なる力の感覚を伸ばし、病巣を探りました。全身を覆う影がすぐに見つかり、それを自らの体内に引き込みました。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/npcs/dialogue/follower_dialogue.json
msgid "Hold still.  *Remove <npc_name>'s narcolepsy*"
msgstr "じっとして。*<npc_name>の睡眠発作を治す*"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/npcs/dialogue/follower_dialogue.json
msgid "Hold still.  *Remove <npc_name>'s seasonal allergies*"
msgstr "じっとして。*<npc_name>の花粉症を治す*"

#. ~ Player message in an effect
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/npcs/dialogue/follower_dialogue.json
msgid ""
"You touch <npc_name> and reach out with your powers, looking for the illness"
" within them.  You soon find it, a shadow over their head and lungs, and "
"draw it into yourself."
msgstr "<npc_name>に触れ、内なる力の感覚を伸ばし、病巣を探りました。頭と肺を覆う影がすぐに見つかり、それを自らの体内に引き込みました。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/npcs/dialogue/follower_dialogue.json
msgid "Hold still.  *Remove <npc_name>'s seasonal affective disorder*"
msgstr "じっとして。*<npc_name>の季節性感情障害を治す*"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/npcs/dialogue/follower_dialogue.json
msgid "Actually, maybe now's not the best time."
msgstr "いや、やっぱり今は止めておこう。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/npcs/dialogue/generic_dialogue.json
msgid "[Telepathy Check] What are you talking about?  This is mine."
msgstr "[ﾃﾚﾊﾟｽ判定] 何を言っている？これは私のものだ。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/npcs/dialogue/generic_dialogue.json
msgid "Oh, I…I don't know what I was thinking.  I…sorry."
msgstr "ああ、あ...あれ、一体何を考えていたんだろう。も...申し訳ない。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/npcs/dialogue/generic_dialogue.json
msgid "It is?  Oh, it…it is.  Right.  Right."
msgstr "えっ？あっ、た、確かに。そうだった。うん。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/npcs/dialogue/generic_dialogue.json
msgid "I…I thought that…never mind."
msgstr "そ...そうだった...さっきの発言は気にしないで。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/npcs/dialogue/generic_dialogue.json
msgid "But you…no, I thought…I just…"
msgstr "いやでも...ううん、確かに...そうか..."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/npcs/dialogue/generic_dialogue.json
msgid "What?  But that's…we've had…how did you…"
msgstr "えっ？でもそれは...確かに...どうなってるんだろう..."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/npcs/dialogue/generic_dialogue.json
msgid ""
"*'s weapon flies out of his hands.\n"
"\n"
"\"<swear> <name_b>!  You some kind of witch?"
msgstr ""
"*の武器が手元から滑り落ちました。\n"
"\n"
"「<swear>、<name_b>！これは何の魔法だ？"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/npcs/dialogue/generic_dialogue.json
msgid "*'s weapon flies out of his hands and he lets out a startled yelp."
msgstr "*は自分の武器が手元から滑り落ちたことに驚き、叫び声を上げました。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/npcs/dialogue/generic_dialogue.json
msgid ""
"*'s weapon flies out of her hands.\n"
"\n"
"\"<swear> <name_b>!  You some kind of witch?"
msgstr ""
"*の武器が手元から滑り落ちました。\n"
"\n"
"「<swear>、<name_b>！これは何の魔法だ？"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/npcs/dialogue/generic_dialogue.json
msgid "*'s weapon flies out of her hands and she lets out a startled yelp."
msgstr "*は自分の武器が手元から滑り落ちたことに驚き、叫び声を上げました。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/npcs/dialogue/generic_dialogue.json
msgid "Get out of here before I do worse."
msgstr "痛い目を見たくないなら、さっさと立ち去れ。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/npcs/dialogue/generic_dialogue.json
msgid "[Telekinesis Check] *Try to rip their weapon out of their hands*."
msgstr "[ﾃﾚｷﾈｼｽ判定] *武器を手放すよう念じる*"

#. ~ Player message in an effect
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/npcs/dialogue/generic_dialogue.json
msgid "Your telekinesis attempt failed!"
msgstr "テレキネシスに失敗しました！"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/npcs/dialogue/generic_dialogue.json
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/npcs/dialogue/refugee_guards_traitor.json
msgid "[Brilliant Flash Check] *blind <npc_name>*"
msgstr "[ﾌﾞﾘﾘｱﾝﾄ･ﾌﾗｯｼｭ判定] *<npc_name>の目をくらませる*"

#. ~ Player message in an effect
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/npcs/dialogue/generic_dialogue.json
msgid "<npc_name> looks away as the air erupts in a burst of light!"
msgstr "何もない空間が急に激しく光り、<npc_name>は目を瞑りました！"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/npcs/dialogue/generic_dialogue.json
msgid "[Mood Stablization Check] You don't want to hurt me."
msgstr "[ﾑｰﾄﾞ･ｽﾀﾋﾞﾗｲｾﾞｰｼｮﾝ判定] あなたは私を傷つけない。"

#. ~ Player message in an effect
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/npcs/dialogue/generic_dialogue.json
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/npcs/dialogue/refugee_guards_traitor.json
msgid "Your telepathy attempt failed!"
msgstr "テレパシーに失敗しました！"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/npcs/dialogue/generic_dialogue.json
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/npcs/dialogue/refugee_guards_traitor.json
msgid "[Sensory Deprivation Check] *Shut off <npc_name>'s senses*."
msgstr "[ｾﾝｻﾘｰ･ﾃﾞﾌﾟﾘﾍﾞｰｼｮﾝ判定] *<npc_name>の感覚を遮断する*"

#. ~ Player message in an effect
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/npcs/dialogue/generic_dialogue.json
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/npcs/dialogue/refugee_guards_traitor.json
msgid "You failed to affect <npc_name>'s senses!"
msgstr "<npc_name>の感覚に影響を与えられませんでした！"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/npcs/dialogue/generic_dialogue.json
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/npcs/dialogue/refugee_guards_traitor.json
msgid "[Synaptic Overload Check] *Attack <npc_name>'s mind*."
msgstr "[ｼﾅﾌﾟﾃｨｯｸ･ｵｰﾊﾞｰﾛｰﾄﾞ判定] *<npc_name>の精神を攻撃する*"

#. ~ Player message in an effect
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/npcs/dialogue/generic_dialogue.json
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/npcs/dialogue/refugee_guards_traitor.json
msgid "<npc_name> repelled your attack on their mind!"
msgstr "<npc_name>は精神攻撃を跳ね退けました！"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/npcs/dialogue/generic_dialogue.json
msgid "[Mood Stablization Check] I'm not going to hurt you."
msgstr "[ﾑｰﾄﾞ･ｽﾀﾋﾞﾗｲｾﾞｰｼｮﾝ判定] あなたを傷つけるつもりはない。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/npcs/dialogue/portal_future_you.json
msgid "[Premonition] *Determine if the voice is a threat*"
msgstr "[ﾌﾟﾘﾓﾆｼｮﾝ] *声の主の脅威を測る*"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/npcs/dialogue/portal_future_you.json
msgid "[Premonition 8+] *Determine if the voice is a threat*"
msgstr "[ﾌﾟﾘﾓﾆｼｮﾝ 8+] *声の主の脅威を測る*"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/npcs/dialogue/portal_future_you.json
msgid "[Telepath] *Read the voice's mind(?)*"
msgstr "[ﾃﾚﾊﾟｽ] *声の主の心(?)を読む*"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/npcs/dialogue/portal_future_you.json
msgid ""
"&You reach out to the voice's location(?) and try to touch its thoughts.  In"
" an instant, your mind is filled by a babble of your *own* thoughts, at "
"exactly the moment you think them, which then repeat again as you realize "
"what is happening and your thoughts about the experience are reflected back "
"at you and your brain is filled with an agonizing cacophony until you break "
"the connection."
msgstr ""
"&声の在り処(?)に手を伸ばし、その心に触れようとしました。その瞬間、脳内に*自分自身*の思考が溢れ出しました。起きた現象について感情や思考を頭に浮かべると、思いの奔流で心が満たされ、それが延々と繰り返されます。対象の心への接触を切るまで、頭の中に忌々しい不協和音が鳴り響き続けています。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/npcs/dialogue/portal_future_you.json
msgid "Well, that was a mistake."
msgstr "うーん、止めた方がよかったな。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/npcs/dialogue/portal_future_you.json
msgid ""
"&You extend your senses, alert for danger, and are immediately almost "
"blinded.  In the heart of the portal storm, there's danger everywhere.  In "
"the air and ground, in the things half-glimpsed that vanish when you look at"
" them, and in yourself, just waiting for the right conditions to be "
"unleashed.  If there's anything sinister in the voice's offer, you cannot "
"tell."
msgstr ""
"&感覚を研ぎ澄まし、危険を見つけ出そうとすると、すぐに視界が埋め尽くされました。ポータルの嵐の中心部に危険が潜んでいない場所はありません。見ていると消えてしまうもの、半分だけこちらに現れているもの、適切な条件が満たされるのをひたすら待っているものが、空に、地面に満ち、騒いでいます。その騒音には何か邪悪な意味があるのかもしれませんが、それは知りようがありません。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/npcs/dialogue/portal_future_you.json
msgid "*Close your inner eye*"
msgstr "*内なる瞳を閉じる*"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/npcs/dialogue/portal_future_you.json
msgid ""
"&You extend your senses, alert for danger.  Shutting out the ever-present "
"danger of the post-Cataclysmic world and the portal storm, you focus on the "
"voice.  There is danger there, but not directly.  Whatever the outcome of "
"its offer, it is not meant as a trap."
msgstr ""
"&感覚を研ぎ澄まし、危機を察知しようとしました。大変動後の世界とポータルの嵐の中に常に存在する危険を心から締め出し、声に集中してみます。危険は感じ取れますが、直接的な、切迫したものではありません。提案に従った結果が何であれ、罠ではないようです。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/npcs/dialogue/portal_future_you.json
msgid "[Clarity 3+] *Is the voice lying?*"
msgstr "[ｸﾗﾘﾃｨ 3+] *声は嘘をついているか？*"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/npcs/dialogue/portal_future_you.json
msgid ""
"&You open your inner eye and in its light you see the truth.  This *is* you."
"  Was you.  Might be you.  You know it like you know yourself.  Whatever "
"game it's playing, its intentions are not malicious.  They are your own."
msgstr ""
"&内なる瞳を開き、光の中に真実を見出しました。これはあなたです。あなたでした。あなたかもしれません。あなたがあなた自身を知っているように、それのことを知っています。このゲームがどのようなものであろうが、その意図は悪意あるものではありません。それはあなた自身です。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/npcs/dialogue/portal_future_you.json
msgid ""
"[Gateway 8+] Thanks, but here I can leave without your help.  Be seeing you."
"  (End your story)"
msgstr "[ｹﾞｰﾄｳｪｲ 8+] ありがとう。でも、あなたの助けは必要ない。さようなら。(このストーリーを終わらせる)"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/npcs/dialogue/portal_future_you.json
msgid ""
"&Normally you need to have been to your destination to teleport to it, but here in the heart of the chaos you can sense other worlds.  Other times.  An endless torrent of possibility, flowing continuously around and over and through you.  None of it lasts long enough for you to get a good glimpse, but almost anywhere has to be better than here.  With a simple act of will, you reach out and grasp one chance as it floats by, open a doorway, and leave your dying world behind.\n"
"\n"
"And what happens to you afterwards, well, that's another story."
msgstr ""
"&通常、特定の場所にテレポートするには、そこへ実際に行った経験が必要ですが、ここは混沌の中心です。別の次元、別の時間、別の世界すら感じることができます。無限の可能性の奔流が、周囲で延々と渦巻き続けています。どの場所も、じっくりと観察できるほど長くは留まってくれませんが、ここよりマシなものはほとんどありません。あなたは意志を強固にもち、手を伸ばし、流れ続ける可能性の一つを掴み取って飛び出しました。そして後には、滅びゆく世界だけが残りました。\n"
"\n"
"その後のあなたに起きた出来事は、また別のストーリーで語られることでしょう。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/npcs/dialogue/portal_future_you.json
msgid "That's what life's about: making the right choice at the right time."
msgstr "適切なタイミングで適切な選択をすること、それが人生だ。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/npcs/dialogue/portal_interdimensional_traveler.json
msgid "[Telepath] *Read the strange person's mind*"
msgstr "[ﾃﾚﾊﾟｽ] *奇妙な人物の心を読む*"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/npcs/dialogue/portal_interdimensional_traveler.json
msgid "«Jasz vata aralas mat!  On de farah shatan!  Mazeh jast ond!»"
msgstr "«Jasz vata aralas mat!  On de farah shatan!  Mazeh jast ond!»"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/npcs/dialogue/portal_interdimensional_traveler.json
msgid "Well, that didn't help either."
msgstr "うーん、何の役にも立たなかったな。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/npcs/dialogue/refugee_guards_generic.json
msgid ""
"&A quick check reveals nothing out of the ordinary.  To <npc_name>, you're "
"just another face in the crowd."
msgstr "&手早く調べてみましたが、何の以上もありません。<npc_name>にとって、こちらは有象無象の一人に過ぎません。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/npcs/dialogue/refugee_guards_generic.json
msgid ""
"&You open your senses, alert for danger, but don't sense anything.  "
"<npc_name> bears you no ill will at all."
msgstr "&感覚を研ぎ澄まし、危険を感じ取ろうとしましたが、何も感じません。<npc_name>はこちらに対して悪意をもっていないようです。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/npcs/dialogue/refugee_guards_generic.json
msgid "«Oh great.  Another one.»"
msgstr "«おやおや。誰か来たな。»"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/npcs/dialogue/refugee_guards_generic.json
msgid "«Idle hands make a waste of time.»"
msgstr "«こうも暇だと、時間の無駄遣いって感じだ。»"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/npcs/dialogue/refugee_guards_generic.json
msgid ""
"«We need to post sentries outside that'll turn some of these people away.»"
msgstr "«こういう奴を追い払うためにも、外に見張りを置くべきなんだ。»"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/npcs/dialogue/refugee_guards_generic.json
msgid ""
"«We really should start locking the doors at night so these people can't get"
" in.»"
msgstr "«こういう奴が入ってこないように、夜間は扉をロックするべきなんだ。»"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/npcs/dialogue/refugee_guards_generic.json
msgid "«Wow, I'm amazed he's lived this long.»"
msgstr "«いやはや、こいつがこんなに長生きできるとはね。»"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/npcs/dialogue/refugee_guards_generic.json
msgid "«Wow, I'm amazed she's lived this long.»"
msgstr "«いやはや、こいつがこんなに長生きできるとはね。»"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/npcs/dialogue/refugee_guards_generic.json
msgid "«No point in learning his name.  He'll probably be dead soon anyway.»"
msgstr "«名前を憶えてもしょうがないか。この人もどうせ近いうちにくたばるんだから。»"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/npcs/dialogue/refugee_guards_generic.json
msgid "«No point in learning her name.  She'll probably be dead soon anyway.»"
msgstr "«名前を憶えてもしょうがないか。この人もどうせ近いうちにくたばるんだから。»"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/npcs/dialogue/refugee_guards_generic.json
msgid ""
"&You open your senses, alert for danger, but don't sense anything.  "
"<npc_name> is sincere in their friendliness, or least isn't hiding a dagger "
"behind their back."
msgstr ""
"&感覚を研ぎ澄まし、危険を感じ取ろうとしましたが、何も感じません。<npc_name>は誠実で友好的であるか、少なくとも背後から味方に襲い掛かるような人物ではありません。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/npcs/dialogue/refugee_guards_generic.json
msgid "«Not bad playing tour guide.  Better than having to fight.»"
msgstr "«道案内の仕事も悪くない。戦いよりずっとマシだ。»"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/npcs/dialogue/refugee_guards_generic.json
msgid "«Another day after <the_cataclysm>.  One foot in front of the other.»"
msgstr "«また<the_cataclysm>を生き延びた。今日も頑張ろう。»"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/npcs/dialogue/refugee_guards_generic.json
msgid "«So tired.  That's what I get for drawing the night shift.»"
msgstr "«すごく疲れた。夜勤で得られるものなんて疲労だけだ。»"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/npcs/dialogue/refugee_guards_generic.json
msgid "«At least in here I can see them coming.  If I were out there…»"
msgstr "«ここからなら奴らの襲来を発見できる。一つ間違えば私もあっち側にいたのか...»"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/npcs/dialogue/refugee_guards_generic.json
msgid "«How much did it take to get here?  What has he lost?»"
msgstr "«ここまで来るのにどれくらいかかったんだろう？この人は何を失ったんだろう？»"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/npcs/dialogue/refugee_guards_generic.json
msgid "«How much did it take to get here?  What has she lost?»"
msgstr "«ここまで来るのにどれくらいかかったんだろう？この人は何を失ったんだろう？»"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/npcs/dialogue/refugee_guards_traitor.json
msgid "It's you."
msgstr "お前だな。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/npcs/dialogue/refugee_guards_traitor.json
msgid ""
"&You barely open up your senses before you're met with an overpowering sense"
" of menace.  <npc_name> isn't planning to kill you at this exact second but "
"that could change at any moment."
msgstr ""
"&少し感覚を研ぎ澄ましただけで、圧倒的な脅威を見出しました。<npc_name>は今この瞬間に襲い掛かって来るつもりはありませんが、いつ気が変わってもおかしくありません。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/npcs/dialogue/refugee_guards_traitor.json
msgid "«Just what I need.  Come on, leave me alone.»"
msgstr "«頼むよ。おいおい、こっちに構うな。»"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/npcs/dialogue/refugee_guards_traitor.json
msgid "«How am I supposed to…ugh, just go away.»"
msgstr "«どうしたものか...畜生、あっちへ行け。»"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/npcs/dialogue/refugee_guards_traitor.json
msgid "«Who does this asshole think he is?»"
msgstr "«このクソは一体何を考えてるんだ？»"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/npcs/dialogue/refugee_guards_traitor.json
msgid "[Telepathy 8+] *Go deeper*."
msgstr "[ﾃﾚﾊﾟｽ 8+] *更に心の奥に潜る*"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/npcs/dialogue/refugee_guards_traitor.json
msgid ""
"&It's only a moment, but that's enough.  You are looking from behind a tree "
"onto a road where a crude roadblock has been set up.  There's a refugee bus,"
" one of the same ones parked outside the refugee center, stopped at the "
"roadblock, and as the driver gets out to look at the roadblock, there's a "
"loud crack and two spots of red appear on his chest and leg.  As he begins "
"to fall and the people in the bus start screaming, the raiders emerge from "
"the trees, already running with guns raised."
msgstr ""
"&ほんの一瞬の光景ですが、それで十分でした。あなたは木の陰から、粗末なバリケードが築かれた道路を眺めています。避難センターの外に停まっていたものと同じバスがバリケードの手前で停車し、運転手が様子を見るために降りてきたその時、何かが破裂するような大音量が響き、運転手の胸元と足に、赤い飛沫が上がりました。バスの中で人々が騒ぎ始めると、銃を構えた襲撃者が周囲の木々から次々と飛び出していきます。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/npcs/dialogue/refugee_guards_traitor.json
msgid ""
"&Only a few moments have passed.  <npc_name> hasn't noticed anything amiss."
msgstr "&ほんの少し時間が経過しました。<npc_name>は何も気付いていません。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/npcs/dialogue/refugee_guards_traitor.json
msgid ""
"He was only a child, <npc_name>, and you killed him.  Do you remember the "
"blood on his Superman shirt?"
msgstr "あんな小さな子供を、<npc_name>、殺すなんて。あの子が着ていたスーパーマンのシャツに付いた血を覚えてるか？"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/npcs/dialogue/refugee_guards_traitor.json
msgid ""
"I didn't tell you my na-\"  <npc_name>'s face goes white.  \"What the fuck!"
"  You some kind of freak?"
msgstr "その話は誰にも...」<npc_name>の顔がさっと青ざめました。「どうなってる！こいつ、化け物か？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/npcs/dialogue/refugee_guards_traitor.json
msgid "It's over.  Give up."
msgstr "終わりだ。観念しろ。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/npcs/dialogue/refugee_guards_traitor.json
msgid "[Telekinesis Check] *Try to rip <npc_name>'s weapon away*"
msgstr "[ﾃﾚｷﾈｼｽ判定] *<npc_name>の武器を剥ぎ取る*"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/npcs/dialogue/refugee_guards_traitor.json
msgid "[Transposition Check] *Teleport away <npc_name>'s weapon*."
msgstr "[ﾄﾗﾝｽﾎﾟｼﾞｼｮﾝ判定] *<npc_name>の武器をテレポートする*"

#. ~ Player message in an effect
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/npcs/dialogue/refugee_guards_traitor.json
msgid "You failed to teleport <npc_name>'s weapon!"
msgstr "<npc_name>の武器をテレポートできませんでした！"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/npcs/dialogue/refugee_guards_traitor.json
msgid "[Oubliette Check] *Banish <npc_name> to another dimension*."
msgstr "[ｳｰﾌﾞﾘｴｯﾄ判定] *<npc_name>を別の次元に追放する*"

#. ~ Player message in an effect
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/npcs/dialogue/refugee_guards_traitor.json
msgid ""
"<npc_name> seems ready to attack you but suddenly freezes in place.  For a moment, caught between worlds, they stare straight ahead.  As the cold and the darkness of a teleport begin to overtake them and the air around them wavers like summer heat, they open their mouth to scream.\n"
"\n"
"And then, they are gone."
msgstr ""
"<npc_name>はこちらを攻撃しようと動いていましたが、突然その場に固まりました。一瞬の後、この人物が目にすることになるのは、世界の狭間です。テレポート時に発生する冷気と暗闇、そしてうだるような熱に満たされ、叫ぶことしかできません。\n"
"\n"
"そして、一人の人間が消えました。"

#. ~ Player message in an effect
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/npcs/dialogue/refugee_guards_traitor.json
msgid "You failed to teleport <npc_name>!"
msgstr "<npc_name>をテレポートできませんでした！"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/npcs/dialogue/refugee_guards_traitor.json
msgid ""
"*stares at you with eyes wide as their weapon vanishes into thin air.  Their"
" mouth works silently but no sounds come out."
msgstr "*は目を見開いてこちらを見つめています。手にしていた武器はどこかに消えました。何か喋ろうとしているようですが、声になっていません。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/npcs/dialogue/refugee_guards_traitor.json
msgid "Get out of here or you'll be next."
msgstr "ここから出て行け。次はお前を消す。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/npcs/dialogue/refugee_guards_traitor.json
msgid ""
"*starts as the weapon is ripped out of their hands and falls to the floor.  "
"\"Holy shit!  What the fuck?!\""
msgstr "*の武器が手元から引き剥がされ、その場に落ちました。「何だ！いったい何が起きた！？」"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/npcs/dialogue/refugee_guards_traitor.json
msgid "Leave or I'll do the same to you."
msgstr "ここから出て行け。次は直接攻撃だ。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/npcs/dialogue/refugee_guards_traitor.json
msgid "Alright, alright, I'm leaving.  Holy shit."
msgstr "分かった、分かった、退散する。畜生。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/npcs/dialogue/refugee_guards_traitor.json
msgid "I changed my mind.  You're better off in the ground."
msgstr "いや、気が変わった。ちゃんとぶちのめしておいた方がいいな。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/npcs/dialogue/refugee_guards_traitor.json
msgid ""
"*immediately backs away.  They never turn their back on you, but in a few "
"moments they go out the door and are gone."
msgstr "*は素早く後ずさりしました。しばらくこちらに背を向けないよう警戒を続け、外に出た途端、どこかへ去って行きました。"

#. ~ Decay message of effect type "Night Eyes"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/obsolete/effects.json
msgid "The shadows are growing darker and darker to your sight."
msgstr "視界が少しずつ暗くなってきました。"

#. ~ Decay message of effect type "Night Eyes"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/obsolete/effects.json
msgid "Darkness begins to creep across your vision."
msgstr "視界が暗闇に覆われ始めました。"

#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC
#. "EOC_MOM_GAMELOAD_TELEKINESIS_LIFTING_FIELD_UPDATE_TELEKINETIC"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/obsolete/mutations.json
msgid ""
"Your Lifting Field has been updated to a power.  You now know the "
"contemplation recipe and have an appropriate level of field for your "
"previous prowess in the ability."
msgstr "更新によってリフティング・フィールドは超能力に変更されました。瞑想のレシピが追加され、以前の状態に適合した範囲レベルが設定されます。"

