#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/obsolete/nether_attunement_spells.json
msgid "You feel a strange tingling sensation as you concentrate."
msgstr "精神統一中に、奇妙な疼きを感じました。"

#. ~ Spell name
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/obsolete/powers.json
msgid "[Ψ]Primal Terror Effect on self"
msgstr "[Ψ]ﾌﾟﾗｲﾏﾙ･ﾃﾗｰ自己効果"

#. ~ Description of spell "[Ψ]Primal Terror Effect on self"
#. ~ Description of spell "[Ψ]Primal Terror"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/obsolete/powers.json
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/telepathy.json
msgid ""
"Use a target's own inner fears against them, paralyzing them with "
"overwhelming terror.  The effect will not last long, but is completely "
"immobilizing while it does, and it leaves a lingering horror behind in the "
"target."
msgstr ""
"根源的な恐怖心を利用し、感情を圧倒して麻痺させます。短時間しか効果がありませんが、効果中の標的は完全に動けなくなり、効果終了後も恐怖の悪影響が残ります。"

#. ~ Spell name
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/obsolete/powers.json
msgid "[Ψ]Pass Through Wall"
msgstr "[Ψ]ﾊﾟｽ･ｽﾙｰ･ｳｫｰﾙ"

#. ~ Description of spell "[Ψ]Pass Through Wall"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/obsolete/powers.json
msgid "Walls are no barrier to a body of pure spirit."
msgstr "純粋な精神体にとって壁は何の障害にもにもなりません。"

#. ~ Spell name
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/obsolete/powers.json
msgid "[Ψ]Primal Terror Effect"
msgstr "[Ψ]ﾌﾟﾗｲﾏﾙ･ﾃﾗｰ効果"

#. ~ Description of spell "[Ψ]Primal Terror Effect"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/obsolete/powers.json
msgid ""
"Applies a longer debuff when using Primal Terror.  It's a bug if you have it"
" directly."
msgstr "プライマル・テラー使用時により長期間の悪影響を付与します。通常は表示されません。"

#. ~ Description of recipe crafting "EOC_NULL"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/obsolete/recipes.json
msgid "This recipe is Obsolete and does nothing."
msgstr "このレシピは廃止済みであり、効果はありません。"

#. ~ Custom name for recipe crafting "EOC_NULL"
