msgstr "結晶群生"

#. ~ Description of map extra "crystal cluster"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/overmap/map_extras.json
msgid "A patch of crystals and black stone."
msgstr "結晶と黒い石が群生しています。"

#. ~ Overmap terrain name
