msgstr "[Ψ]ｸﾙｰｼﾌﾞﾙ"

#. ~ Description of spell "[Ψ]Crucible"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/pyrokinesis.json
msgid ""
"Concentrate the entirety of your power into a single white-hot point, "
