"各遠征のミッション: <global_val:bonusmissions> / 3\n"
"解禁済ミッションレベル: <global_val:hardmissions_readable> / 3"

#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_statcheck"
#: data/mods/Sky_Island/EOCs.json
msgid ""
"Total expeditions: <global_val:raidstotal>\n"
"Wins: <global_val:raidswon>\n"
"Losses: <global_val:raidslost>\n"
"Missions complete: <u_val:missionswon>\n"
"Slaughter missions complete: <global_val:slaughterswon>\n"
"\n"
"Current difficulty settings:\n"
"Warpsickness at: <global_val:readablepulselimit> pulses.\n"
"Disintegration at: <global_val:readabledisintegrationlimit> pulses.\n"
"Default pulse length: <global_val:readablesicknessintervals> minutes."
msgstr ""
"総遠征数: <global_val:raidstotal>\n"
"遠征成功: <global_val:raidswon>\n"
"遠征失敗: <global_val:raidslost>\n"
"ミッション完了: <u_val:missionswon>\n"
"殺戮ミッション完了: <global_val:slaughterswon>\n"
"\n"
"現在の難易度:\n"
"転移酔い発生: <global_val:readablepulselimit>パルス\n"
"転移崩壊発生: <global_val:readabledisintegrationlimit>パルス\n"
"既定パルス間隔: <global_val:readablesicknessintervals>分"

#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_buildcheck"
#: data/mods/Sky_Island/EOCs.json
msgid ""
"Entrance: <global_val:skyisland_build_base> of 1\n"
"Main Room: <global_val:skyisland_build_bigroom> of 4"
msgstr ""
"エントランス: <global_val:skyisland_build_base> / 1\n"
"中央部屋: <global_val:skyisland_build_bigroom> / 4"

#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_skyisland_versioncheck"
#: data/mods/Sky_Island/EOCs.json
msgid ""
"Your save was last used with an older version of Sky Island.  Attempting to "
"update…"
msgstr "古いバージョンのスカイアイランドMODで保存されたデータです。更新を試みています..."

#. ~ Player message in nested effect in else statement in effect in EoC
#. "EOC_skyisland_versioncheck"
#: data/mods/Sky_Island/EOCs.json
msgid ""
"Error.  Update not applied.\n"
"\n"
"Reason: Cannot update while on expedition.  Return home, save and close your game, and try loading this save again."
msgstr ""
"エラーが発生しました。更新が適用されませんでした。\n"
"\n"
"原因: 地表遠征中はデータを更新できません。空島に帰還し、ゲームを保存して一度終了し、再度ロードしてください。"

#. ~ Player message in nested effect in then statement in effect in EoC
#. "EOC_skyisland_versionupdate"
#: data/mods/Sky_Island/EOCs.json
msgid ""
"Your save was made with a pre-Milestone 1 version of Sky Island, which means"
" it lacks upgrades and the Heart of the Island.  Attempting to update…"
msgstr ""
"このデータはスカイアイランドMODのMilestone "
"1バージョン以前に作成されたものです。アップグレードと空島の核のデータが欠落しています。更新を試みます..."

#. ~ Player message in nested effect in then statement in effect in EoC
#. "EOC_skyisland_versionupdate"
#: data/mods/Sky_Island/EOCs.json
msgid ""
"Milestone 1 applied.  You have been given a Heartseed.  Activate it while on"
" your island to create the new Heart of the Island.  Interact with the Heart"
" to access new upgrade options."
msgstr ""
"Milestone "
"1が適用されました。ハートシードを入手しました。空島でハートシードを使用し、新たに空島の核を設置しましょう。空島の核を調べることで、アップグレード設定にアクセスできます。"

#. ~ Player message in nested effect in then statement in nested effect in
#. then statement in effect in EoC "EOC_skyisland_versionupdate"
#: data/mods/Sky_Island/EOCs.json
msgid ""
"You have been retroactively awarded <global_val:owed_material_tokens> "
"material tokens for your past successful expeditions."
msgstr "既に完了済みの遠征への報酬として、<global_val:owed_material_tokens>個の資材トークンを入手しました。"

#. ~ Player message in nested effect in then statement in effect in EoC
#. "EOC_skyisland_versionupdate"
#: data/mods/Sky_Island/EOCs.json
msgid ""
"The stat stone, healing salve, difficulty adjuster, and similar items are removed.  These options are instead accessed by speaking to the Heart of the Island.\n"
"\n"
"Warped bags and quickheals are obsolete.  If you already have any, they can still be used, or salvaged for a refund of warp shards.\n"
"\n"
"Any further changes are documented in the patch notes."
msgstr ""
"遠征記録、温情の軟膏、難易度調整装置、および同様のアイテムは削除されます。これらの機能には、空島の核を調べることでアクセスできるようになりました。\n"
"\n"
"不思議なバッグと急速回復薬は今後は生成されません。既に持っているものに限り引き続き使用できますが、転移の欠片と交換することも可能です。\n"
"\n"
"その他の変更内容はパッチノートをご確認ください。"

#. ~ Player message in nested effect in else statement in effect in EoC
#. "EOC_skyisland_versionupdate"
#: data/mods/Sky_Island/EOCs.json
msgid "Your save is post-Milestone 1.  Skipping update 1…"
msgstr "Milestone 1以降に作成されたデータです。更新1をスキップしています..."

#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_skyisland_versionupdate"
#: data/mods/Sky_Island/EOCs.json
msgid "Your save should be up to date now."
msgstr "最新のデータに更新されました。"

#. ~ Spell name
#: data/mods/Sky_Island/EOCs.json
msgid "Warp Home"
msgstr "ﾜｰﾌﾟ･ﾎｰﾑ"

#. ~ Description of spell "Warp Home"
#: data/mods/Sky_Island/EOCs.json
msgid ""
"Take a full minute of concentration and return to the safety of your home "
"base."
msgstr "1分間精神を集中させ、安全な拠点へ帰還します。"

#. ~ Spell name
#: data/mods/Sky_Island/EOCs.json
msgid "Warped Return"
msgstr "ﾜｰﾌﾟﾄﾞ･ﾘﾀｰﾝ"

#. ~ Description of spell "Warped Return"
#: data/mods/Sky_Island/EOCs.json
msgid ""
