#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Sky_Island/effects.json
msgid "Earthside"
msgstr "地上遠征中"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Earthside"
#: data/mods/Sky_Island/effects.json
msgid ""
"You are away from your sanctuary island.  Over time, you will begin to "
"succumb to the intangible miasma of the world below, and your stats will "
"suffer.  You have several hours after warp before this becomes a problem, "
"after which it will rapidly get worse until you warp home or die."
msgstr ""
"安全地帯である空島から離れた場所にいます。時間経過と共に肉体が地上の瘴気の影響を受け、能力値が低下します。地上に転移してから悪影響が発生するまで、数時間の猶予があります。その後は、帰還するか死ぬまで、更なる悪影響が発生し続けます。"

#. ~ Name of effect type id "warpsickness"
#: data/mods/Sky_Island/effects.json
msgid "Warp Disintegration!"
msgstr "転移崩壊！"

#. ~ Name of effect type id "warpsickness"
#: data/mods/Sky_Island/effects.json
msgid "Warp Necrosis"
msgstr "転移衰弱"

#. ~ Name of effect type id "warpsickness"
#: data/mods/Sky_Island/effects.json
msgid "Warp Debilitation"
msgstr "転移疲労"

#. ~ Name of effect type id "warpsickness"
#: data/mods/Sky_Island/effects.json
msgid "Warp Sickness"
msgstr "転移酔い"

#. ~ Name of effect type id "warpsickness"
#: data/mods/Sky_Island/effects.json
msgid "Warp Nausea"
msgstr "転移負荷"

#. ~ Name of effect type id "warpsickness"
#: data/mods/Sky_Island/effects.json
msgid "Warp Stability"
msgstr "転移安定"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Warp Disintegration!"
#: data/mods/Sky_Island/effects.json
msgid ""
"You're going to die.  And if you weren't busy leaking blood out of every "
"pore, you'd find a better way to emphasize just how badly you're dying.  "
"Your only hope is to return home immediately."
msgstr ""
"死の危機に瀕しています。全身のありとあらゆる穴から血液が噴き出しているのを見れば、自分の肉体がどれほど酷い状態かは一目瞭然です。唯一の解決策は、すぐに拠点へ帰還することです。"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Warp Necrosis"
#: data/mods/Sky_Island/effects.json
msgid ""
"The very fabric of your being is unraveling!  You're in dire straits.  You "
"need to get back to your sanctuary island NOW!"
msgstr "肉体の存在が崩壊しつつあります！重篤な状態に陥っており、今すぐ安全な空島に戻る必要があります！"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Warp Debilitation"
#: data/mods/Sky_Island/effects.json
msgid ""
"You've stayed earthside WAY too long!  Your body barely responds and your "
"senses are slush.  The world itself feels barbed and frayed, and the very "
"air is like breathing fiberglass.  If you want to survive, you need to warp "
"home as soon as possible."
msgstr ""
"あまりにも長く地上に留まり過ぎました！肉体はほとんど自由に動かず、感覚も鈍っています。世界全体に生えた棘で全身を刺され、呼気にガラス片が混じっているような気分です。生き残りたいのであれば、できるだけ早く拠点へ帰還しましょう。"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Warp Sickness"
#: data/mods/Sky_Island/effects.json
msgid ""
"You've stayed earthside too long.  Your body aches and your senses are "
"dulling.  Every step feels like you're walking through thick mud and "
"breathing hot tar.  You should warp home as soon as you can, or this is only"
" going to get worse."
msgstr ""
"地上に長く滞在し過ぎたようです。身体が痛く、感覚が鈍っています。一歩進むだけで粘つく泥を掻いている気分になり、吸い込む空気は熱いタールのようです。できる限り早く拠点に帰還しましょう。何もしなければ、状況は更に悪化します。"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Warp Nausea"
#: data/mods/Sky_Island/effects.json
msgid ""
"You've overstayed your time earthside.  It's getting hard to concentrate, "
"there's a painful ringing in your ears, and your muscles sting and jolt.  "
"Every action feels delayed.  You need to warp home to refresh yourself, or "
"this is going to get worse.  Probably within just a few hours."
msgstr ""
"地上に長く滞在しすぎました。心がざわつき、酷い耳鳴りが鳴り止まず、全身の筋肉がピリピリと震えています。あらゆる動作が覚束なく感じます。拠点へ帰還して回復しなければ、状況は更に悪化します。猶予は恐らくほんの数時間しかありません。"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Warp Stability"
#: data/mods/Sky_Island/effects.json
msgid ""
"You're fresh from your stay at your sanctuary island.  The intangible miasma"
" of terra firma currently has no effect on you, and you feel fine.  This "
"should last for several hours.  Stay too long, however, and you'll gradually"
" begin to suffer ever-worsening debilitating effects."
msgstr ""
"安全な空島から出た直後であり、地上の目に見えない瘴気の影響をまだ受けておらず、気分も良好です。この状態は数時間は続くでしょうが、あまりにも長期間地上に滞在していると、肉体がどんどん衰弱し始めます。"

#. ~ Decay message of effect type "Warp Disintegration!, Warp Necrosis, Warp
#. Debilitation, Warp Sickness, Warp Nausea, Warp Stability"
#: data/mods/Sky_Island/effects.json
msgid ""
"There are no words to describe how much trouble you're in.  Your body is "
"crumbling to wet paste and your blood is twisting into a viny tangle.  All "
"you know is pain.  You're not just dying, you're dying horribly.  Your only "
"hope is escape to your sanctuary, but oblivion is only moments away."
msgstr ""
"言葉で形容できないほどの苦しみに苛まれています。肉体は湿った泥のように崩れ、血液は蔦のように全身を縛っています。痛み以外は何も感じられません。このままではただ死ぬのではなく、恐ろしい死に直面することになります。唯一の希望は安全な空島に帰還することですが、その思いすら忘却の彼方に消えてしまいそうです。"

#. ~ Decay message of effect type "Warp Disintegration!, Warp Necrosis, Warp
#. Debilitation, Warp Sickness, Warp Nausea, Warp Stability"
#: data/mods/Sky_Island/effects.json
msgid ""
"You taste blood and your eyes sink back into their sockets.  You've stayed "
"out too long.  Your warp sickness is about to consume you entirely and "
"you're falling apart at the seams.  Get home NOW!"
msgstr ""
"両目は眼窩に落ちくぼみ、口の中で血の味がします。長時間地上にいた肉体は転移の病に蝕まれ、あちこちがバラバラに崩れてしまいそうです。今すぐ帰還しましょう！"

#. ~ Decay message of effect type "Warp Disintegration!, Warp Necrosis, Warp
#. Debilitation, Warp Sickness, Warp Nausea, Warp Stability"
#: data/mods/Sky_Island/effects.json
msgid ""
"The ravages of the world intensify.  Everything hurts and existence is a "
"surreal wash of pain.  Your warp sickness is unbearable.  You need to get "
"home as soon as possible."
msgstr ""
"周囲の世界が肉体を苛み、痛みしか感じません。この世に存在していること自体が超自然的な苦痛を生んでいます。これ以上の転移酔いには耐えられそうにありません。できるだけ早く帰還する必要があります。"

#. ~ Decay message of effect type "Warp Disintegration!, Warp Necrosis, Warp
#. Debilitation, Warp Sickness, Warp Nausea, Warp Stability"
#: data/mods/Sky_Island/effects.json
msgid ""
"The bile suddenly rises in your throat and your fingers feel like they're "
"peeling themselves open.  Your warp sickness is getting worse.  You should "
"get home soon."
msgstr "喉の奥から胆汁がせり上がり、指先がチリチリと痛みます。転移による悪影響は強くなる一方です。すぐに帰還するべきです。"

#. ~ Decay message of effect type "Warp Disintegration!, Warp Necrosis, Warp
#. Debilitation, Warp Sickness, Warp Nausea, Warp Stability"
#: data/mods/Sky_Island/effects.json
msgid ""
"The whole world shimmers in front of your eyes.  Everything feels slow and "
"sticky.  Warp sickness is setting in.  You should focus on getting home."
msgstr ""
"周囲の世界が煩わしい光を発しているようです。空気が重く、粘ついているような気がします。転移酔いの症状が現れ始めました。帰還することに集中すべきです。"

#. ~ Name of effect type id "warpdisintegration"
#: data/mods/Sky_Island/effects.json
msgid "Disintegrating!"
msgstr "崩壊！"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Disintegrating!"
#: data/mods/Sky_Island/effects.json
msgid "Prolonged warp is destroying you.  You're coming apart."
msgstr "地上で長時間を過ごしたため、肉体が崩壊し始めています。存在が砕け散るのは時間の問題です。"

#. ~ Apply message of effect type "Disintegrating!"
#: data/mods/Sky_Island/effects.json
msgid "You're being unmade!"
msgstr "肉体が崩壊し始めました！"

#. ~ Remove message of effect type "Disintegrating!"
#: data/mods/Sky_Island/effects.json
msgid ""
"The rending of the warp has finally abated.  You feel like you exist again."
msgstr "転移を原因とする肉体の崩壊が収まってきました。自分の存在が再び確固としたものになりました。"

#. ~ Name of effect type id "warpcloak"
#: data/mods/Sky_Island/effects.json
msgid "Warpcloaked"
msgstr "非実体化"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Warpcloaked"
#: data/mods/Sky_Island/effects.json
msgid ""
"You are invisible for a very brief time.  Now's your chance to get to cover."
"  You're also incorporeal enough to not take fall damage, but hopefully that"
" won't be relevant."
msgstr ""
"非常に短期間ですが、視認されなくなります。どこかに隠れるなら今がチャンスです。肉体が完全に実体化していないため落下ダメージも受けませんが、それでもあ無茶はしないよう気を付けましょう"

#. ~ Remove message of effect type "Warpcloaked"
#: data/mods/Sky_Island/effects.json
msgid "You fully materialize.  You're not invisible anymore!"
msgstr "完全に実体化しました。もう透明な存在ではありません！"

#. ~ Name of effect type id "effect_warped_waterwalking"
#: data/mods/Sky_Island/effects.json
msgid "Warped Waterwalking"
msgstr "水面移動"

#. ~ Furniture name
#: data/mods/Sky_Island/furniture_and_terrain.json
msgid "Warp Obelisk"
msgstr "転移のオベリスク"

#. ~ Description of furniture "Warp Obelisk"
#: data/mods/Sky_Island/furniture_and_terrain.json
msgid ""
"This strange, towering monolith is the only lifeline you have to the outside world.  Despite its massive size, it's surprisingly easy to move around the island.\n"
"\n"
"It seems you can interact with it."
msgstr ""
"そびえ立つ奇妙な一枚岩は、外の世界へ通じる唯一の道です。巨大な見た目ですが、島内であれば驚くほど簡単に位置を動かせます。\n"
"\n"
"調べることで使用できそうです。"

#. ~ Furniture name
#: data/mods/Sky_Island/furniture_and_terrain.json
msgid "Island's Heart"
msgstr "空島の核"

#. ~ Description of furniture "Island's Heart"
#: data/mods/Sky_Island/furniture_and_terrain.json
msgid ""
"A swirling, surreal statue of organic shapes carved from dark stone.  In your head, a voice speaks faintly.  Despite its massive size, it's surprisingly easy to move around the island.\n"
"\n"
"It seems you can interact with it."
msgstr ""
"暗い色の岩でできた、有機的で不合理な渦巻き型の彫像です。頭の中で、かすかに声が聞こえます。巨大な見た目ですが、島内であれば驚くほど簡単に位置を動かせます。\n"
"\n"
"調べることで使用できそうです。"

#. ~ Furniture name
#: data/mods/Sky_Island/furniture_and_terrain.json
msgid "Return Obelisk"
msgstr "帰還のオベリスク"

#. ~ Description of furniture "Return Obelisk"
#: data/mods/Sky_Island/furniture_and_terrain.json
msgid "A strange statue that will take you back home."
msgstr "帰還の力をもつ奇妙な塔です。"

#. ~ Description of terrain "open air"
#: data/mods/Sky_Island/furniture_and_terrain.json
msgid ""
"This is the edge of the island.  A metaphysical border stops you from going "
"over the edge yourself, but anything you drop here will be gone forever."
msgstr "空島の端です。この世界との境界線であり、絶対に越えることはできません。ここに落としたアイテムは完全に消滅します。"

#. ~ Terrain name
#: data/mods/Sky_Island/furniture_and_terrain.json
msgid "warpglass wall"
msgstr "壁(転移ガラス)"

#. ~ Description of terrain "warpglass wall"
#: data/mods/Sky_Island/furniture_and_terrain.json
msgid ""
"A shimmering translucent barrier that almost yields to the touch, but "
"adamantly refuses entry."
msgstr "きらめく半透明の障壁です。触れると弾力がありますが、決して通過することはできません。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Sky_Island/furniture_and_terrain.json
msgid "nearby warp obelisk"
msgid_plural "nearby warp obelisks"
msgstr[0] "転移のオベリスク"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Sky_Island/furniture_and_terrain.json
msgid "nearby infinity tree"
msgid_plural "nearby infinity trees"
msgstr[0] "無限の樹木の傍"

#. ~ Furniture name
#: data/mods/Sky_Island/furniture_and_terrain.json
msgid "infinity tree"
msgstr "無限の樹木"

#. ~ Description of furniture "infinity tree"
#: data/mods/Sky_Island/furniture_and_terrain.json
msgid ""
"Purple-blue shimmers sparkle around the leaves of this small sapling.  New growth seems to spring up in seconds, as if in a timelapse, and yet there never seem to be too many branches.  It's always in equilibrium.  Its strange nature allows you to push it around like furniture.\n"
"\n"
"The power of this tree allows you to produce raw wooden items from material tokens via the crafting menu.\n"
"Just one of these could last forever."
msgstr ""
"葉から紫がかった青色の輝きを放っている、小さな苗木です。まるで早送り再生を見ているかのように、数秒ごとに新たな葉が芽吹いていますが、枝が広がり過ぎることはなく、常に同じサイズを保っています。家具のように掴んで動かせる奇妙な性質があります。\n"
"\n"
"この樹木の力によって、製作メニューから資材トークンを生木の資材に変えることができます。\n"
"一本でも生えていれば永遠に利用し続けることができます。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Sky_Island/furniture_and_terrain.json
msgid "nearby infinity stone"
msgid_plural "nearby infinity stones"
msgstr[0] "無限の岩石の傍"

#. ~ Furniture name
#: data/mods/Sky_Island/furniture_and_terrain.json
msgid "infinity stone"
msgstr "無限の岩石"

#. ~ Description of furniture "infinity stone"
#: data/mods/Sky_Island/furniture_and_terrain.json
msgid ""
"Wisps of iridescent energy spark around this immense stone like miniature fireworks, leaving behind a satisfying showers of pebbles.  Clay and soil shift around its base, erupting in slow motion yet never overflowing.\n"
"\n"
"The power of this stone allows you to produce rocks and natural earthen items from material tokens via the crafting menu.\n"
"Just one of these could last forever."
msgstr ""
"巨石の周囲で虹色のエネルギーの粒子が花火のように輝き、小石を大量に噴き出し続けています。底の辺りでは粘土と土がゆっくりと湧き出し、流れ続けていますが、決して溢れることはありません。\n"
"\n"
"この岩石の力によって、製作メニューから資材トークンを大地から採れる資材に変えることができます。\n"
"一個でも置かれていれば永遠に利用し続けることができます。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Sky_Island/furniture_and_terrain.json
msgid "nearby infinity ore"
msgid_plural "nearby infinity ores"
msgstr[0] "無限の鉱物の傍"

#. ~ Furniture name
#: data/mods/Sky_Island/furniture_and_terrain.json
msgid "infinity ore"
msgstr "無限の鉱物"

#. ~ Description of furniture "infinity ore"
#: data/mods/Sky_Island/furniture_and_terrain.json
msgid ""
"A roiling, rattling mass of ever-churning metal.  Flares of purple energy arc around the formless pile like electricity, and in their wake, thin metal rods and struts jut out, before disappearing into the half-molten heap which never seems to grow or diminish.  Its strange nature allows you to shift it around like furniture.\n"
"\n"
"The power of this ore allows you to produce raw and basic metal items from material tokens via the crafting menu.\n"
"Just one of these could last forever."
msgstr ""
"ガタガタと音を立ててうねり、うごめき続けている金属の塊です。紫色のエネルギーが不定形の鉱石の周りで火花のように飛び散り、塊の中から細い金属の棒や支柱が突き出しては、それ以上伸びることなく溶けるように消えていきます。家具のように掴んで動かせる奇妙な性質があります。\n"
"\n"
"この鉱物の力によって、製作メニューから資材トークンを未加工や単純な金属製の資材に変えることができます。\n"
"一個でも置かれていれば永遠に利用し続けることができます。"

#. ~ Terrain name
#: data/mods/Sky_Island/furniture_and_terrain.json
msgid "warped rock"
msgstr "歪んだ岩石"

#. ~ Description of terrain "warped rock"
#: data/mods/Sky_Island/furniture_and_terrain.json
msgid ""
"A sparkly-black stone that's glassy smooth to the touch.  Seems "
"indestructible by normal means."
msgstr "表面がガラスのように滑らかな、光沢のある黒色の石です。通常の手段では破壊できないようです。"

#. ~ Bashing failed sound
#: data/mods/Sky_Island/furniture_and_terrain.json
msgid "glzt!"
msgstr "ドガッ！"

#. ~ Overmap terrain name
#: data/mods/Sky_Island/island_mapgen.json
msgid "sky island"
msgstr "空島"

#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_memorize_island"
#: data/mods/Sky_Island/island_upgrades.json
msgid "Mapping island for future construction…"
msgstr "今後の建設のために島をマッピングしています..."

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Sky_Island/items.json
msgid "quickheal pill"
msgid_plural "quickheal pills"
msgstr[0] "急速回復薬"

#. ~ Description of "quickheal pill"
#: data/mods/Sky_Island/items.json
msgid ""
"This pseudomagical pill will heal all your damaged parts, but only if "
"swallowed while on your sanctuary island.  No reason to bring this into the "
"field."
msgstr "疑似的な魔法が込められた錠剤です。空島の中で使用した場合に限り、肉体を完全に回復できます。地上に持ち出して使っても効果は得られません。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Sky_Island/items.json
msgid "warped bag"
msgid_plural "warped bags"
msgstr[0] "不思議なバッグ"

#. ~ Description of "warped bag"
#: data/mods/Sky_Island/items.json
msgid "This is a template you shouldn't actually see."
msgstr "通常は表示されないテンプレート用アイテムです。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Sky_Island/items.json
msgid "warped lumberjack's bag"
msgid_plural "warped lumberjack's bags"
msgstr[0] "不思議なバッグ(木こり)"

#. ~ Description of "warped lumberjack's bag"
#. ~ Description of "warped excavator's bag"
#. ~ Description of "warped scrapper's bag"
#: data/mods/Sky_Island/items.json
msgid ""
"THIS ITEM HAS BEEN OBSOLETED.  If you have one from an old save, you may "
"continue to use it, but no more may be crafted.  You can deconstruct this "
"for a full refund on warp shards."
msgstr ""
"このアイテムは廃止されました。古いゲームデータを使っている場合は引き続き使用できますが、新たに製作できません。分解すると、このアイテムのために消費した転移の欠片が全て戻ってきます。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Sky_Island/items.json
msgid "warped excavator's bag"
msgid_plural "warped excavator's bags"
msgstr[0] "不思議なバッグ(掘削者)"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Sky_Island/items.json
msgid "warped scrapper's bag"
msgid_plural "warped scrapper's bags"
msgstr[0] "不思議なバッグ(解体人)"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Sky_Island/items.json
msgid "warped hauler's harness"
msgid_plural "warped hauler's harnesses"
msgstr[0] "不思議な運搬ハーネス"

#. ~ Description of "warped hauler's harness"
#: data/mods/Sky_Island/items.json
msgid ""
"A looped pair of shimmering blue-black straps that can be worn over the "
"shoulders like a harness.  They can snugly fit a single item of nearly any "
"size in comfort, and any burdens carried here feel twice as light.  Ideal "
"for squeezing one more bulky item home through the exit when your hands are "
"already full, or even some container packed full of other items!  Just "
"beware you don't break your back doing it."
msgstr ""
"肩に掛けられる、青黒く光るループ状のベルトです。どんなサイズのアイテムでも一個であれば問題なく収納して快適に着用でき、通常の1/2の重さしか感じません。両手が塞がっているときや、荷物をパンパンに詰め込んだ容器にもう一つアイテムを追加して持ち帰りたいときに最適です。くれぐれも腰を痛めないよう気を付けて使いましょう。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Sky_Island/items.json
msgid "earthbound pill"
msgid_plural "earthbound pills"
msgstr[0] "大地の丸薬"

#. ~ Description of "earthbound pill"
#: data/mods/Sky_Island/items.json
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"This pseudomagical pill extends the amount of time you can stay earthside by"
" 4 pulses, or about 50% of a normal trip.  They're precious, but should help"
" buy time for a difficult extract."
msgstr ""
"疑似的な魔力を込めた丸薬です。地上に滞在できる時間を4パルス分、つまり通常の遠征の約50%分延長します。非常に貴重ですが、探索が困難な際の時間稼ぎに役立つ筈です。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Sky_Island/items.json
msgid "homeward mote"
msgid_plural "homeward motes"
msgstr[0] "生還の小片"

#. ~ Description of "homeward mote"
#: data/mods/Sky_Island/items.json
msgid ""
"Though visibly little more than a glowing dustbunny, this strange ethereal mote of warp essence reveals, on closer inspection, something more.  A tiny, twisting, half-visible thread of shimmering bluish-purple trails away into the sky and far out of sight, unimpeded by any obstacles.\n"
"\n"
"Taking this rare and valuable artifact with you on an expedition is essentially buying life insurance.  If you die with this mote in your inventory, you will instead be restored to full health and brought home, WITH all items and equipment carried.  But this effect will only last for a single expedition.  Even if you extract safely, any and all motes carried on your person when you return home will be DESTROYED."
msgstr ""
"ただの光り輝く塵にしか見えない、超常的な転移の力のエッセンスです。よく観察すると、青紫色に輝く細い半透明の糸が空に向かって伸びているのが見えます。\n"
"\n"
"この希少で有益なアーティファクトを遠征に持って行くのは、本質的には生命保険に加入しているようなものです。所持した状態で死亡すると、欠片を消費して体力うを全回復し、全ての所持品を失くすことなく拠点に帰還します。ただし、この欠片は一度の遠征の間しか存在することができません。通常の方法で安全に帰還した場合も、帰還時に所持していた欠片は破壊されてしまいます。"

#. ~ "description" action message of item "homeward mote"
#: data/mods/Sky_Island/items.json
msgid "A hasty escape."
msgstr "急いで撤退します。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Sky_Island/items.json
msgid "warped animal carrier"
msgid_plural "warped animal carriers"
msgstr[0] "不思議なアニマルケージ"

#. ~ Description of "warped animal carrier"
#: data/mods/Sky_Island/items.json
msgid ""
"A hand-sized cage with a shimmering portal at its aperture.  Despite being "
"shaped more like a cat carrier, the power of warp enables it to capture "
"creatures far bigger than you.  This may be your best bet for bringing "
"animals home to your island sanctuary.  Activate to capture an adjacent "
"animal, or to release a carried animal."
msgstr ""
"開口部がキラキラと輝いている、手のひらサイズのケージです。ネコ用のケージに似た形状ですが、転移の力で人間より遥かに大きな生物も収容できます。動物を空島に保護したいなら、これを使うのが一番です。使用すると、隣接した位置にいる動物を収容するか、収容していた動物を外に出します。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Sky_Island/items.json
msgid "Autodoc copyplate (inert)"
msgid_plural "Autodoc copyplates (inert)"
msgstr[0] "オートドク複製プレート(不活性)"

#. ~ Description of "Autodoc copyplate (inert)"
#: data/mods/Sky_Island/items.json
msgid ""
"This strange obsidian-colored plate is capable of mimicking the advanced "
"tech found within a modern Autodoc, and can be used to create a working copy"
" at your sanctuary.  However, it is inert in its current state and must "
"first be imprinted on a working Autodoc.  To do so, find an Autodoc during "
"an expedition and use the construction menu to imprint this plate."
msgstr ""
"オートドクがもつ高度な機能をコピーし、空島内でオートドクを利用できるようにするための、黒曜石のような奇妙なプレートです。現在プレートは起動しておらず、まずは作動中のオートドクをプレートに複製する必要があります。プレートを持って遠征先でオートドクを見つけ、建設メニューから複製を実行しましょう。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Sky_Island/items.json
msgid "Autodoc copyplate (activated)"
msgid_plural "Autodoc copyplates (activated)"
msgstr[0] "オートドク複製プレート(起動)"

#. ~ Description of "Autodoc copyplate (activated)"
#: data/mods/Sky_Island/items.json
msgid ""
"This strange obsidian-colored plate is capable of mimicking the advanced "
"tech found within a modern Autodoc, and can be used to create a working copy"
" at your sanctuary.  It has been successfully activated and can be used as "
"the catalyst to create a new Autodoc at a location of your choosing using "
"the construction menu.  Be aware this cannot be safely moved once placed, "
"and will also require you to add an adjacent couch, then convert it to an "
"Autodoc couch."
msgstr ""
"オートドクがもつ高度な機能をコピーし、空島内でオートドクを利用できるようにするための、黒曜石のような奇妙なプレートです。正常に起動しており、このプレートを材料に使って建設メニューからオートドクを設置できます。一度設置すると移動させることはできないため、注意が必要です。また、隣接する地形にソファーを設置し、建設メニューからオートドク手術台に変換する作業も必要です。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Sky_Island/items.json
msgid "warped grass seeds"
msgid_plural "warped grass seeds"
msgstr[0] "不思議な草の種"

#. ~ Description of "warped grass seeds"
#: data/mods/Sky_Island/items.json
msgid ""
"While these are certainly imbued with warp, they don't seem to have any "
"supernatural powers beyond just growing quickly.  A nice option if you want "
"to re-plant grass on your island, for decoration's sake."
msgstr "転移の力が染み込んだ草の種ですが、生長が早いこと以外に特別な力はないようです。空島に草を植えて装飾したいときに役立ちます。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Sky_Island/items.json
msgid "vortex token"
msgid_plural "vortex token"
msgstr[0] "渦流トークン"

#. ~ Description of "vortex token"
#: data/mods/Sky_Island/items.json
msgid ""
"This irregular purplish lump seems to slowly pull in air even while you hold"
" it in your hand.  If you have one with you when you activate the return "
"obelisk and the obelisk is correctly configured, it will drag the entire "
"contents of the room with you back up to your island."
msgstr ""
"紫がかった不定形の塊は、手に持っているだけで周囲の空気をゆっくりと吸い込んでいるように見えます。正常に機能している帰還のオベリスクを起動した際にこのアイテムを所持していると、室内のアイテムを全て空島に持ち帰ります。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Sky_Island/items.json
msgid "skyward beacon"
msgid_plural "skyward beacon"
msgstr[0] "空島ビーコン"

#. ~ Description of "skyward beacon"
#: data/mods/Sky_Island/items.json
msgid ""
"This smooth purplish sphere seems like it wants to rise right out of your "
"hand.  If you activate it, you will return directly to the island with "
"everything you are carrying."
msgstr "手から飛び出そうとしているように感じる、滑らかな紫色の球体です。起動すると、所持アイテムと共に空島へ帰還します。"

#. ~ "description" action message of item "skyward beacon"
#: data/mods/Sky_Island/items.json
msgid "Return to the sky."
msgstr "空島へ帰還します。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Sky_Island/items.json
msgid "flotation stone"
msgid_plural "flotation stone"
msgstr[0] "浮遊石"

#. ~ Description of "flotation stone"
#: data/mods/Sky_Island/items.json
msgid ""
"This smooth, whorled stone seems cool and wet to the touch, but when you "
"take your hand off it your skin is perfectly dry.  If you activate it, you "
"will be able to walk on the surface of water for three minutes."
msgstr ""
"渦巻き模様の滑らかな石です。触ると冷たく湿っているように感じますが、手に水分が付くことはありません。起動すると、3分間水面を移動できるようになります。"

#. ~ "description" action message of item "flotation stone"
#: data/mods/Sky_Island/items.json
msgid "Cross the waters."
msgstr "水面を移動できるようになります。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Sky_Island/items.json
msgid "warp shards"
msgid_plural "warp shards"
msgstr[0] "転移の欠片"

#. ~ Description of "warp shards"
#: data/mods/Sky_Island/items.json
msgid ""
"A small quantity of airy-thin material that resembles flaked obsidian.  It "
"glints with a purplish shimmer that seems to stretch off the bounds of "
"itself and into the air itself.  Offered to the powers that be, one could "
"exchange it for valuable artifacts."
msgstr ""
"剥離した黒曜石のような外見の、ほとんど重さのない小さな欠片です。紫色に輝いており、その光は周囲の空気にも伝播しているように見えます。上位存在に献上すれば、貴重なアーティファクトを入手できます。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Sky_Island/items.json
msgid "material token"
msgid_plural "material token"
msgstr[0] "資材トークン"

#. ~ Description of "material token"
#: data/mods/Sky_Island/items.json
msgid ""
"A very tiny disc-shaped blue wafer.  It seems to shift in your grasp, "
"feeling one moment like a grain of sand, then a sharp metal fragment, then a"
" wooden splinter.  These miniature tokens are rewarded for surviving a raid,"
" and can be crafted on your island for a large supply of common resources by"
" using infinity nodes as a catalyst."
msgstr ""
"非常に小さな円盤状の青いトークンです。握っていると感触が次々と変化し、ある瞬間は砂粒、また別のときは鋭い金属片や、木片のように感じることもあります。トークンは生き延びた報酬として得られ、島の中で無限資源を触媒として用いることで、基本的な資材を大量に製作する材料になります。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Sky_Island/items.json
msgid "Labs Catalyst"
msgid_plural "Labs Catalysts"
msgstr[0] "研究触媒"

#. ~ Description of "Labs Catalyst"
#: data/mods/Sky_Island/items.json
msgid ""
"A bit of warp power, a magnetic stripe keycard from a dangerous place, and a"
" little hope, blended well.  This item is required to begin a Labs "
"expedition, and is consumed when leaving."
msgstr ""
"危険地帯で見つけた磁気ストライプ式キーカードに、転移の力と希望をほんの少し混ぜて作り出した物質です。研究所から遠征の開始するために必要なものであり、遠征開始時に消費されます。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Sky_Island/items.json
msgid "Heartseed"
msgid_plural "Heartseeds"
msgstr[0] "ハートシード"

#. ~ Description of "Heartseed"
#: data/mods/Sky_Island/items.json
msgid ""
"A whorl of black stone that feels impossibly heavy for its size.  Activate "
"this on your island to place the Heart of the Island, the catalyst of future"
" upgrades."
msgstr "サイズの割に重量感のある、渦を巻く黒色の石です。空島で使用すると、今後のアップグレードに必要な空島の核が設置されます。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Sky_Island/items.json
msgid "infinity tree sapling"
msgid_plural "infinity tree saplings"
msgstr[0] "無限の樹木の苗"

#. ~ Description of "infinity tree sapling"
#: data/mods/Sky_Island/items.json
msgid ""
"A fragile little wisp of a sapling.  Its leaves shake and quiver, shimmering"
" with strange energies.  Activate this on your island to place an infinity "
"tree, which can be used as a catalyst to turn material tokens into wooden "
"resources."
msgstr ""
"葉が震え、きらめく奇妙なエネルギーをまとっている、小さく弱々しい苗木です。空島で使用すると、資材トークンを木材資源に変えるための触媒になる無限の樹木が設置されます。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Sky_Island/items.json
msgid "infinity stone source"
msgid_plural "infinity stone sources"
msgstr[0] "無限の岩石の破片"

#. ~ Description of "infinity stone source"
#: data/mods/Sky_Island/items.json
msgid ""
"A crackling little cluster of pebbles that spark as they knock together, "
"tumbling about from forces unseen.  Activate this on your island to place an"
" infinity stone, which can be used as a catalyst to turn material tokens "
"into stony and earthen resources."
msgstr ""
"不可視の力で回転し続ける、打ち付けるとパチパチ鳴って火花を散らす小石の塊です。空島で使用すると、資材トークンを石や土の資源に変えるための触媒になる無限の岩石が設置されます。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Sky_Island/items.json
msgid "infinity ore crucible"
msgid_plural "infinity ore crucibles"
msgstr[0] "無限の鉱物の小塊"

#. ~ Description of "infinity ore crucible"
#: data/mods/Sky_Island/items.json
msgid ""
"A miniature tangle of metal that resembles a dust bunny made of barbed wire."
"  It twists in upon itself endlessly, folding and unfolding in ways that "
"don't seem possible.  Activate this on your island to place an infinity ore,"
" which can be used as a catalyst to turn material tokens into metal "
"resources."
msgstr ""
"有刺鉄線の切れ端のようにも見える、捻じれた小さな金属屑です。縮まったり広がったりと、有り得ない形状に変化し続けています。空島で使用すると、資材トークンを金属資源に変えるための触媒になる無限の鉱物が設置されます。"

#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_safely_landed"
#: data/mods/Sky_Island/missions_and_mapgen.json
msgid ""
"You're still materializing and not fully visible yet.  In about "
"<global_val:invistime> seconds, the world will be able to see you, so if you"
" were warped into danger, now's your chance to get to cover."
msgstr ""
"肉体を実体化している最中であり、完全には視認されていません。約<global_val:invistime>秒後には、完全に視認される状態になります。危険な場所に転移した場合は、今のうちに身を守りましょう。"

#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_safely_landed"
#: data/mods/Sky_Island/missions_and_mapgen.json
msgid ""
"You've arrived!\n"
"Press a key when ready and random missions will be generated for this expedition.  This may take another minute."
msgstr ""
"到着しました！\n"
"準備ができたらキーを押してください。この遠征のためのランダムなミッションが生成されます。生成には約1分かかります。"

#. ~ Player message in false effect in EoC "EOC_safely_landed"
#: data/mods/Sky_Island/missions_and_mapgen.json
msgid ""
"Something went wrong.  The game could not find a suitable teleport location."
"  Please try using the obelisk again."
msgstr "何らかの問題が発生しました。適切な転移地点を見つけられませんでした。もう一度オベリスクを使用してください。"

#. ~ Mission name
#: data/mods/Sky_Island/missions_and_mapgen.json
msgid "Reach one of the exit points!"
msgstr "帰還地点に到達する！"

#. ~ Description of mission "Reach one of the exit points!"
#: data/mods/Sky_Island/missions_and_mapgen.json
msgid ""
"If you want to get home with your stuff, you'll need to reach one of these "
"nearby exit points.  They're only things that can bring you back to your "
"sanctuary island in one piece."
msgstr ""
"物資を持って帰還したいなら、周囲にある帰還地点のいずれかに到達する必要があります。無事に安全な空島に帰りたいなら、それ以外の方法はありません。"

#. ~ Mission name
#: data/mods/Sky_Island/missions_and_mapgen.json
msgid "Find the warp shards!"
msgstr "転移の欠片を入手する！"

#. ~ Description of mission "Find the warp shards!"
#: data/mods/Sky_Island/missions_and_mapgen.json
msgid ""
"A very small cluster of warp energy has left shards behind at this location."
"  All you need to do is find and retrieve them.  There may be threats "
"nearby, but unlike most tasks, no special guards are on-site.  A minimal "
"reward, but little risk."
msgstr ""
"非常に小規模の転移エネルギーが発生したことで、この欠片が残りました。それらを見つけて入手すれば、このミッションは成功です。近くに脅威が潜んでいる可能性はありますが、他の大抵のミッションと違い、特殊な敵に守られているということはありません。報酬は最小限ですが、リスクもほとんどありません。"

#. ~ Mission name
#: data/mods/Sky_Island/missions_and_mapgen.json
msgid "Kill the warp-draining zombies!"
msgstr "転移の力に引き寄せられたゾンビたちを殺す！"

#. ~ Description of mission "Kill the warp-draining zombies!"
#: data/mods/Sky_Island/missions_and_mapgen.json
msgid ""
"A handful of zombies are congregating at a location where warp resonance is "
"high.  Clear them out for a minimal reward of warp shards."
msgstr "転移の力が強く共鳴している地点に数体のゾンビが集まっています。それらを一掃すれば、転移の欠片をほんの少し得られます。"

#. ~ Name of the monster group "GROUP_SI_ZOMEASY" placed on map update on
#. start of mission "Kill the warp-draining zombies!"
#. ~ Name of the monster group "GROUP_SI_ZOMEASY" placed on map update on
#. start of mission "Kill the warp-draining horde!"
#. ~ Name of the monster group "GROUP_SI_ZOMEASY" placed on map update on
#. start of mission "Kill the warp-draining evolved zombies!"
