#. of mission "Kill the warp-draining fearsome zombies!"
#. ~ Name of the monster group "GROUP_SI_ZOMHARD" placed on map update on
#. start of mission "Kill the warp-draining fearsome zombies!"
#. ~ Name of the monster group "GROUP_SI_ZOMMID" placed on map update on start
