#. ~ Description of recipe crafting "EOC_spawn_random_artifact_fromrecipe"
#: data/mods/Sky_Island/recipes.json
msgid ""
"Utilizing the unstable, reality-changing nature of the warp shards, you "
"could combine several to create a powerful semi-magical item.  This is a "
"skill you have no way of practicing and a field of science no one's ever "
"really touched, so exactly what you'd get from it is anyone's guess."
msgstr ""
"転移の欠片がもつ不安定な現実改変能力を利用し、複数の欠片を消費して魔法のような効果を発揮する強力なアイテムを製作します。このスキルは訓練する方法がなく、誰も触れたことのない科学分野であるため、出来上がるものを正確に予測することは誰にもできません。"

#. ~ Custom name for recipe crafting "EOC_spawn_random_artifact_fromrecipe"
#: data/mods/Sky_Island/recipes.json
msgid "materialize random artifact"
msgstr "ランダムアーティファクト実体化"

#. ~ Description of recipe crafting "EOC_WARPED_POND_CREATION"
#: data/mods/Sky_Island/recipes.json
msgid ""
"Create a pond on your island.  You must be standing next to a water source "
"to successfully create the pond."
msgstr "島に池を生み出しましょう。池を正常に生成するには、水源の近くにいる必要があります。"

#. ~ Custom name for recipe crafting "EOC_WARPED_POND_CREATION"
#: data/mods/Sky_Island/recipes.json
msgid "Warped Pond"
msgstr "不思議な池"

#. ~ Scenario name for male
#: data/mods/Sky_Island/scenario.json
msgctxt "scenario_male"
msgid "Warper"
msgstr "転移者"

#. ~ Scenario name for female
#: data/mods/Sky_Island/scenario.json
msgctxt "scenario_female"
msgid "Warper"
msgstr "転移者"

#. ~ Description of scenario "Warper" for male
#: data/mods/Sky_Island/scenario.json
msgctxt "scen_desc_male"
msgid ""
"As if the world ending wasn't enough, it seems some kind of extradimensional"
" powers that be have taken an interest in you.  You have been placed on a "
"floating island high above the Earth, safe but isolated.  Only by using the "
"reality-bending powers of warp technology can you visit the world below in "
"brief, randomly-targeted excursions.  Venture down, gather supplies, and "
"return with only what you can carry to upgrade your home base and your stash"
" over time.  The powers of the warp make you unable to ever truly die, so on"
" failing such an expedition, you will simply lose all items and equipment "
"you were carrying and be swiftly returned home at low health."
msgstr ""
"世界の終焉だけでは満足できなかった超次元的な存在に、目を付けられてしまったようです。地球の上空に浮かぶ、孤立した安全な浮島に連れて来られました。転移技術を応用した現実改変能力によって、地表のランダムな地点を訪れ、短期間過ごすことができます。探索してアイテムを集め、できる限り持ち帰り、拠点と物資を少しずつ充実させていきましょう。転移の力によって、死ぬことはできなくなりました。遠征中に死亡すると、所持していたアイテムは全て失われ、体力が低下した状態ですぐに拠点へ戻されます。"

#. ~ Description of scenario "Warper" for female
#: data/mods/Sky_Island/scenario.json
msgctxt "scen_desc_female"
msgid ""
"As if the world ending wasn't enough, it seems some kind of extradimensional"
" powers that be have taken an interest in you.  You have been placed on a "
"floating island high above the Earth, safe but isolated.  Only by using the "
"reality-bending powers of warp technology can you visit the world below in "
"brief, randomly-targeted excursions.  Venture down, gather supplies, and "
"return with only what you can carry to upgrade your home base and your stash"
" over time.  The powers of the warp make you unable to ever truly die, so on"
" failing such an expedition, you will simply lose all items and equipment "
"you were carrying and be swiftly returned home at low health."
msgstr ""
"世界の終焉だけでは満足できなかった超次元的な存在に、目を付けられてしまったようです。地球の上空に浮かぶ、孤立した安全な浮島に連れて来られました。転移技術を応用した現実改変能力によって、地表のランダムな地点を訪れ、短期間過ごすことができます。探索してアイテムを集め、できる限り持ち帰り、拠点と物資を少しずつ充実させていきましょう。転移の力によって、死ぬことはできなくなりました。遠征中に死亡すると、所持していたアイテムは全て失われ、体力が低下した状態ですぐに拠点へ戻されます。"

