#. ~ Player message in an effect
#: data/mods/Sky_Island/upgrade_missions.json
msgid ""
"The northern room would be a lot more useful if it were larger and had a bigger window.  Time to get to work.\n"
"A new recipe has been learned.  Craft this artifact to permanently upgrade the island.\n"
"\n"
"New Structure: North Room 2.  Expand the northern room to fit more loot, furniture, or anything else you may need."
msgstr ""
"北側の部屋はもっと広く、大きな窓があった方が使いやすそうです。さあ、工事の時間です。\n"
" 新たなレシピを習得しました。このアーティファクトを製作し、島を永続的にアップグレードしましょう。\n"
"\n"
"効果: 北部屋2が建設されます。より多くのアイテム、設置物、その他必要なものを収めるために、北側の部屋を拡張します。"

#. ~ Player message in an effect
