msgstr "バナナの種です。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/TropiCataclysm/items/comestibles/seed.json
msgid "kiwi seeds"
msgid_plural "kiwi seeds"
msgstr[0] "種(キウイフルーツ)"

#. ~ Description of "kiwi seeds"
#: data/mods/TropiCataclysm/items/comestibles/seed.json
msgid "Some raw kiwi seeds."
msgstr "キウイフルーツの種です。"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/TropiCataclysm/monsters/tropical_bird.json
msgid "rhea"
msgid_plural "rheas"
msgstr[0] "レア"

#. ~ Description of monster "rhea"
#: data/mods/TropiCataclysm/monsters/tropical_bird.json
msgid ""
"A distant relative of the Ostrich and the Emu.  Found only on the grasslands"
" and other dry places of South America."
msgstr "ダチョウやエミューの遠い親戚です。南米の草原地帯など、乾燥した場所にしか生息していません。"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/TropiCataclysm/monsters/tropical_bird.json
msgid "guinea fowl"
msgid_plural "guinea fowls"
msgstr[0] "ホロホロチョウ"

#. ~ Description of monster "guinea fowl"
#: data/mods/TropiCataclysm/monsters/tropical_bird.json
msgid ""
"A domestic bird that originated from Africa.  Easily recognizable for the "
"strange helmet on its head and its white-gray plumage."
msgstr "奇妙な形状のとさかと薄灰色の羽毛が特徴的な、アフリカ原産の家禽です。"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/TropiCataclysm/monsters/tropical_bird.json
msgid "quail"
msgid_plural "quails"
msgstr[0] "ウズラ"

#. ~ Description of monster "quail"
#: data/mods/TropiCataclysm/monsters/tropical_bird.json
msgid ""
"The common quail is one of the smallest domestic birds used for meat and "
"eggs.  It originated in Eurasia but can be found worldwide and is raised "
"sometimes for hunting or as an ornamental bird."
msgstr ""
"ヨーロッパウズラは肉や卵を食用する最も小さな家禽の一つです。原産地はユーラシア大陸ですが、狩猟や観賞用に他国へ持ち込まれ、飼育されています。"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/TropiCataclysm/monsters/tropical_bird.json
msgid "toco toucan"
msgid_plural "toco toucans"
msgstr[0] "オニオオハシ"

#. ~ Description of monster "toco toucan"
#: data/mods/TropiCataclysm/monsters/tropical_bird.json
msgid ""
"The largest species of toucan sporting dark plumage and a bright colored "
"beak.  This bird can be found pretty much all over South America, feeding on"
" fruits and seeds."
msgstr "黒色の羽毛と鮮やかなくちばしをもつ、オオハシ科の中で最も大きい鳥です。南アメリカ全域に生息しており、果実や種子を食べます。"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/TropiCataclysm/monsters/tropical_bird.json
msgid "white-eyed parakeet"
msgid_plural "white-eyed parakeets"
msgstr[0] "メジロインコ"

#. ~ Description of monster "white-eyed parakeet"
#: data/mods/TropiCataclysm/monsters/tropical_bird.json
msgid ""
"A small bird with bright green-colored plumage and a short hooked beak.  "
"This species is widespread throughout all of South America, on top of being "
"quite intelligent and sometimes kept as pets."
msgstr ""
"明るい緑色の羽毛と短い鉤状のくちばしをもつ小型の鳥類です。南アメリカ全域に広く分布しており、非常に賢いためペットとして飼われることもあります。"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/TropiCataclysm/monsters/tropical_bird.json
msgid "blue-and-yellow macaw"
msgid_plural "blue-and-yellow macaws"
msgstr[0] "ルリコンゴウインコ"

#. ~ Description of monster "blue-and-yellow macaw"
#: data/mods/TropiCataclysm/monsters/tropical_bird.json
msgid ""
"A large parrot sporting beautiful blue plumage.  Intelligent and often kept "
"as a pet."
msgstr "美しい青色の羽毛をもつ大型のインコです。頭がよく、ペットとして飼われることが多いです。"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/TropiCataclysm/monsters/tropical_bird.json
msgid "saffron finch"
msgid_plural "saffron finches"
msgstr[0] "キンノジコ"

#. ~ Description of monster "saffron finch"
#: data/mods/TropiCataclysm/monsters/tropical_bird.json
msgid ""
"A tiny, golden bird bopping around in the canopy of trees.  Its cone-shaped "
"bill tells you it s a seed eater."
msgstr "木々の梢を飛び回っている、非常に小さな金色の鳥類です。くちばしは円錐形をしており、主食は種子であることが分かります。"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/TropiCataclysm/monsters/tropical_bird.json
msgid "great kiskadee"
msgid_plural "great kiskadees"
msgstr[0] "キバラオオタイランチョウ"

#. ~ Description of monster "great kiskadee"
#: data/mods/TropiCataclysm/monsters/tropical_bird.json
msgid ""
"This large flycatcher has a black crown, prominent white eye stripe and a "
"dominantly yellow body.  At almost a foot long, it swoops up a variety of "
"flying insects."
msgstr ""
"全身がほぼ黄色く、頭頂部は黒色で目の周囲に特徴的な白い縞が入った、大型のタイランチョウ科の鳥類です。体長は約30cmで、様々な飛翔性昆虫を捕らえて食べます。"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/TropiCataclysm/monsters/tropical_bird.json
msgid "rufous hornero"
msgid_plural "rufous horneros"
msgstr[0] "セアカカマドドリ"

#. ~ Description of monster "rufous hornero"
#: data/mods/TropiCataclysm/monsters/tropical_bird.json
msgid ""
"A drab, robin-sized ground bird with startling red eyes.  More often spotted"
" are their odd oven shaped nests."
msgstr "派手な赤色の目と地味な色の羽毛をもつ、地上で行動することが多いコマドリほどのサイズの鳥類です。竈ような奇妙な形状の巣を作ります。"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/TropiCataclysm/monsters/tropical_bird.json
msgid "tinamou"
msgid_plural "tinamous"
msgstr[0] "シギダチョウ"

#. ~ Description of monster "tinamou"
#: data/mods/TropiCataclysm/monsters/tropical_bird.json
msgid ""
"One of several species of the Tinamidae family.  These birds converged into "
"shapes similar to fowl but are actually more closely related to the extinct "
"moas."
msgstr "シギダチョウ科の鳥の一種です。鳥に近い姿をしていますが、実は既に絶滅しているモアの近縁種にあたります。"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/TropiCataclysm/monsters/tropical_bird.json
msgid "seriema"
msgid_plural "seriemas"
msgstr[0] "ノガンモドキ"

#. ~ Description of monster "seriema"
#: data/mods/TropiCataclysm/monsters/tropical_bird.json
msgid ""
"A medium sized bird with long legs and a small crest.  It lives on the "
"grasslands of South America and is considered the only living relative of "
"the extinct terror birds."
msgstr "長い脚と小さな冠毛が特徴的な、中型の鳥です。南米の草地に生息し、既に絶滅している恐鳥類の唯一の現生科と言われています。"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/TropiCataclysm/monsters/tropical_bird.json
msgid "chachalaca"
msgid_plural "chachalacas"
msgstr[0] "ヒメシャクケイ"

#. ~ Description of monster "chachalaca"
#: data/mods/TropiCataclysm/monsters/tropical_bird.json
msgid ""
"A bird belonging to the Cracidae family.  They resemble turkeys to a degree "
"and live on scrubby habitats."
msgstr "シチメンチョウに近い姿をした、低木帯に生息しているホウカンチョウ科の鳥です。"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/TropiCataclysm/monsters/tropical_bird.json
msgid "guan"
msgid_plural "guans"
msgstr[0] "シャクケイ"

#. ~ Description of monster "guan"
#: data/mods/TropiCataclysm/monsters/tropical_bird.json
msgid ""
"A bird belonging to the Cracidae family.  They resemble turkeys to a degree "
"and live on forested areas."
msgstr "シチメンチョウに近い姿をした、森林帯に生息しているホウカンチョウ科の鳥です。"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/TropiCataclysm/monsters/tropical_bird.json
msgid "curassow"
msgid_plural "curassows"
msgstr[0] "ホウカンチョウ"

#. ~ Description of monster "curassow"
#: data/mods/TropiCataclysm/monsters/tropical_bird.json
msgid ""
"A bird belonging to the Cracidae family.  They resemble turkeys to a degree "
"and live on forested areas, easily distinguished by their crested heads."
msgstr "シチメンチョウに近い姿をした、森林帯に生息しているホウカンチョウ科の鳥です。トサカがあるためすぐに他のホウカンチョウ科と区別できます。"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/TropiCataclysm/monsters/tropical_fish.json
msgid "crab"
msgid_plural "crabs"
msgstr[0] "カニ"

#. ~ Description of monster "crab"
#: data/mods/TropiCataclysm/monsters/tropical_fish.json
msgid ""
"A crustacean belonging to either Trichodactylidae or Pseudothelphusidae.  "
"Freshwater crabs are widely spread around Central and South America, some "
"even found in mountain streams."
msgstr "トリコダクチルス科、またはシウドテルフーサ科に属する甲殻類です。中南米の淡水域に広く分布しており、山間部の渓流に生息する種もいます。"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/TropiCataclysm/monsters/tropical_fish.json
msgid "baby crab"
msgid_plural "baby crabs"
msgstr[0] "カニ(幼体)"

#. ~ Description of monster "baby crab"
#: data/mods/TropiCataclysm/monsters/tropical_fish.json
msgid ""
"A crab in its larval stage, incredibly fragile and tiny but produced by a "
"truckload of eggs that have been carried by their mother."
msgstr "信じられないほど脆く小さい、カニの幼体です。母ガニが腹部に山ほど抱えていた卵塊から生まれました。"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/TropiCataclysm/monsters/tropical_fish.json
msgid "pancora crab"
msgid_plural "pancora crabs"
msgstr[0] "コシオリエビ"

#. ~ Description of monster "pancora crab"
#: data/mods/TropiCataclysm/monsters/tropical_fish.json
msgid ""
"A crustacean belonging to the Aeglidae family.  They are among the only "
"living freshwater anomurans, being restricted solely to South America."
msgstr "タンスイコシオリエビ科に属する甲殻類です。南米にのみ生息する淡水性のヤドカリ下目の中では、現存している唯一の種です。"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/TropiCataclysm/monsters/tropical_fish.json
msgid "baby pancora crab"
msgid_plural "baby pancora crabs"
msgstr[0] "コシオリエビ(幼体)"

#. ~ Description of monster "baby pancora crab"
#: data/mods/TropiCataclysm/monsters/tropical_fish.json
msgid ""
"A pancora crab in its larval stage, incredibly fragile and tiny but produced"
" by a truckload of eggs that have been carried by their mother."
msgstr "信じられないほど脆く小さい、コシオリエビの幼体です。コシオリエビの母体が腹部に山ほど抱えていた卵塊から生まれました。"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/TropiCataclysm/monsters/tropical_fish.json
msgid "bull shark"
msgid_plural "bull sharks"
msgstr[0] "メジロザメ"

#. ~ Description of monster "bull shark"
#: data/mods/TropiCataclysm/monsters/tropical_fish.json
msgid ""
"The bull shark is one of the few known species of shark capable of living in"
" both fresh and salty waters.  With the advent of the Cataclysm many of them"
" have migrated up river to exploit the new food sources in the waters."
msgstr "淡水と海水の両方に生息できる数少ないサメの一種です。大変動の到来により、多くのサメが新たな餌を求めて川を遡上してきました。"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/TropiCataclysm/monsters/tropical_fish.json
msgid "bull shark pup"
msgid_plural "bull shark pups"
msgstr[0] "メジロザメ(幼体)"

#. ~ Description of monster "bull shark pup"
#: data/mods/TropiCataclysm/monsters/tropical_fish.json
msgid ""
"Unlike other fish bull sharks are viviparous and their pups are as well "
"equipped as their parents."
msgstr "他の魚類と異なり、メジロザメは胎生です。幼体は親と同じような姿をしています。"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/TropiCataclysm/monsters/tropical_fish.json
msgid "lungfish"
msgid_plural "lungfish"
msgstr[0] "ハイギョ"

#. ~ Description of monster "lungfish"
#: data/mods/TropiCataclysm/monsters/tropical_fish.json
msgid ""
"A lungfish.  This strange fish has relatives in both Africa and Australia, "
"all of them can breathe air and some consider them living fossils."
msgstr "この奇妙な魚はアフリカとオーストラリアに近縁種がおり、いずれも肺呼吸が可能です。生きた化石であると考えられています。"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/TropiCataclysm/monsters/tropical_fish.json
msgid "fry"
msgid_plural "fry"
msgstr[0] "稚魚"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/TropiCataclysm/monsters/tropical_fish.json
msgid "electric eel"
msgid_plural "electric eels"
msgstr[0] "デンキウナギ"

#. ~ Description of monster "electric eel"
#: data/mods/TropiCataclysm/monsters/tropical_fish.json
msgid ""
"An electric eel.  A strange elongated fish known for its ability to use "
"electricity to hunt prey, despite their name they are not actually eels."
msgstr "電撃を放出して獲物を狩る特性で知られる、奇妙な細長い魚です。名前に反して、実際はウナギの仲間ではありません。"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/TropiCataclysm/monsters/tropical_fish.json
msgid "pacu"
msgid_plural "pacus"
msgstr[0] "パクー"

#. ~ Description of monster "pacu"
#: data/mods/TropiCataclysm/monsters/tropical_fish.json
msgid ""
"A pacu.  There are several species of these piranha relatives in the rivers "
"of South America, they are usually small to medium size."
msgstr "南米の川に生息するピラニアの近縁種です。複数の種がいますが、大抵は小型から中型のサイズです。"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/TropiCataclysm/monsters/tropical_fish.json
msgid "tambaqui"
msgid_plural "tambaquis"
msgstr[0] "タンバッキー"

#. ~ Description of monster "tambaqui"
#: data/mods/TropiCataclysm/monsters/tropical_fish.json
msgid ""
"Also known as black or giant pacu.  This is the largest member of the family"
" and the most known worldwide."
msgstr "ブラックパクー、ジャイアントパクーなどとも呼ばれる魚です。この種の中では最大サイズであり、世界的にも有名です。"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/TropiCataclysm/monsters/tropical_fish.json
msgid "piranha"
msgid_plural "piranhas"
msgstr[0] "ピラニア"

#. ~ Description of monster "piranha"
#: data/mods/TropiCataclysm/monsters/tropical_fish.json
msgid ""
"A small to medium fish with a wide diet.  Contrary to popular belief these "
"fish are not vicious predators and instead react to the availability of food"
" in their environment."
msgstr "様々なものを食べる小型から中型の魚です。一般的なイメージである凶暴な捕食者ではありませんが、周囲の餌には反応します。"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/TropiCataclysm/monsters/tropical_fish.json
msgid "arowana"
msgid_plural "arowanas"
msgstr[0] "アロワナ"

#. ~ Description of monster "arowana"
#: data/mods/TropiCataclysm/monsters/tropical_fish.json
msgid ""
"A member of the Osteoglossidade family.  These fishes can be found on South "
"America, Asia and Australia."
msgstr "南米、アジア、オーストラリアに生息する、アロワナ科の一種です。"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/TropiCataclysm/monsters/tropical_fish.json
msgid "arapaima"
msgid_plural "arapaimas"
msgstr[0] "ピラルクー"

#. ~ Description of monster "arapaima"
#: data/mods/TropiCataclysm/monsters/tropical_fish.json
msgid ""
"A member of the Arapaimidae family.  These fishes can be found on South "
"America and Africa, some species can grow to truly huge sizes."
msgstr "南米やアフリカに生息するアラパイマ属の一種であり、非常に大きく育つこともあります。"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/TropiCataclysm/monsters/tropical_fish.json
msgid "piraiba"
msgid_plural "piraibas"
msgstr[0] "ピライーバ"

#. ~ Description of monster "piraiba"
#: data/mods/TropiCataclysm/monsters/tropical_fish.json
msgid ""
"A huge species of South American catfish native to the Amazon and Orinoco "
"rivers, they can reach almost 3 meters in length."
msgstr "アマゾン川やオリノコ川が原産の、南米に生息する巨大なナマズの一種です。体長は約3m近くまで成長します。"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/TropiCataclysm/monsters/tropical_fish.json
msgid "pleco"
msgid_plural "plecos"
msgstr[0] "プレコ"

#. ~ Description of monster "pleco"
#: data/mods/TropiCataclysm/monsters/tropical_fish.json
msgid ""
"A catfish species native to South America, Panama and even Costa Rica.  They"
" are distinguished by their bony spines and suction adapted mouths."
msgstr "南米やパナマ、コスタリカなどに生息するナマズの一種です。骨ばった棘と吸盤上の口が特徴です。"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/TropiCataclysm/monsters/tropical_fish.json
msgid "river stingray"
msgid_plural "river stingray"
msgstr[0] "淡水エイ"

#. ~ Description of monster "river stingray"
#: data/mods/TropiCataclysm/monsters/tropical_fish.json
msgid ""
"A fish of the Potamotrygonidae family.  These freshwater stingrays are found"
" mostly in South America with a few bred in other parts of the world."
msgstr "ポタモトリゴン科の軟骨魚です。淡水エイは南米に多く生息していますが、少数であれば世界各地で見られます。"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/TropiCataclysm/monsters/tropical_fish.json
msgid "stingray fry"
msgid_plural "stingray fries"
msgstr[0] "淡水エイ(幼体)"

#. ~ Description of monster "stingray fry"
#: data/mods/TropiCataclysm/monsters/tropical_fish.json
msgid ""
"A baby stingray.  Like many other cartilaginous fishes, river stingrays are "
"ovoviviparous and carry the eggs until the fries are ready to get out in to "
"the world."
msgstr "エイの幼体です。淡水エイも他の多くの軟骨魚類と同様に卵胎生であり、幼生が自然界で生きていける状態になるまでは卵の中で成長します。"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/TropiCataclysm/monsters/tropical_fish.json
msgid "gar"
msgid_plural "gars"
msgstr[0] "ガー"

#. ~ Description of monster "gar"
#: data/mods/TropiCataclysm/monsters/tropical_fish.json
msgid ""
"A fish belonging to the Lepisosteidae family.  These enormous fishes can be "
"found from North America to the Caribbean and are well known for their "
"prehistoric appearance."
msgstr "ガー科の魚です。北アメリカからカリブ海にかけて生息している、先史時代から姿が変わらない巨大魚です。"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/TropiCataclysm/monsters/tropical_fish.json
msgid "tucunaré"
msgid_plural "tucunarés"
msgstr[0] "ツクナレ"

#. ~ Description of monster "tucunaré"
#: data/mods/TropiCataclysm/monsters/tropical_fish.json
msgid ""
"A vicious predatory cichlid found along the northern tributaries of South "
"America from Panama to the Amazon.  Very sought among sport fishing "
"enthusiasts."
msgstr ""
"パナマからアマゾンまでの南米北部の川の支流に生息する、凶暴な肉食性のシクリッドの一種です。スポーツフィッシング愛好家に非常に人気があります。"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/TropiCataclysm/monsters/tropical_fish.json
msgid "discus"
msgid_plural "discuses"
msgstr[0] "ディスカス"

#. ~ Description of monster "discus"
#: data/mods/TropiCataclysm/monsters/tropical_fish.json
msgid ""
"A round and colorful genus of fish native to the Amazon river basin.  Very "
"popular in aquariums but expensive to maintain in captivity."
msgstr "アマゾン川流域に生息する、丸くカラフルな魚です。観賞魚として非常に人気がありますが、飼育には高いコストがかかります。"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/TropiCataclysm/monsters/tropical_fish.json
msgid "angelfish"
msgid_plural "angelfish"
msgstr[0] "エンゼルフィッシュ"

#. ~ Description of monster "angelfish"
#: data/mods/TropiCataclysm/monsters/tropical_fish.json
msgid ""
"A genus of freshwater fish with a triangular shape native to South America."
"  Unrelated to the marine angel fishes and known to be semi-aggressive in "
"captivity."
msgstr ""
"三角形の体型をしている、南米原産の淡水魚です。同名で呼ばれる海水魚とは全く別の種であり、飼育環境では攻撃的な性格になることで知られています。"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/TropiCataclysm/monsters/tropical_fish.json
msgid "koi"
msgid_plural "koi"
msgstr[0] "コイ"

#. ~ Description of monster "koi"
#: data/mods/TropiCataclysm/monsters/tropical_fish.json
msgid ""
"A domestic variant of the Amur carp originally bred in Japan for its color "
"variations.  These fishes are known to devolve quickly to feral status if "
"left to escape."
msgstr ""
"豊富な体色のバリエーションが特徴的な、アムールコイの変種です。日本から持ち込まれた養殖魚ですが、放っておくとすぐに野生化してしまう魚として知られています。"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/TropiCataclysm/monsters/tropical_fish.json
msgid "tilapia"
msgid_plural "tilapias"
msgstr[0] "ティラピア"

#. ~ Description of monster "tilapia"
#: data/mods/TropiCataclysm/monsters/tropical_fish.json
msgid ""
"A genus of cichlids native to Africa but bred worldwide for food.  They are "
"adaptable herbivorous fishes that can survive well even in salt water."
msgstr "シクリッド科に属するアフリカ原産の魚ですが、食用として世界中で養殖されています。淡水草食魚ですが、適応力が高く海水でも十分に生きられます。"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/TropiCataclysm/monsters/tropical_fish.json
msgid "sabalo"
msgid_plural "sabalos"
msgstr[0] "サバロ"

#. ~ Description of monster "sabalo"
#: data/mods/TropiCataclysm/monsters/tropical_fish.json
msgid ""
"A fish belonging to the Prochilodontidae family.  They are native to South "
"America and most species can be found feeding on detritus."
msgstr "プロキロダス科に属する魚です。南米原産であり、大抵は生物の死骸や排泄物を主食としています。"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/TropiCataclysm/monsters/tropical_fish.json
msgid "oscar"
msgid_plural "oscars"
msgstr[0] "オスカー"

#. ~ Description of monster "oscar"
#: data/mods/TropiCataclysm/monsters/tropical_fish.json
msgid ""
"A species of omnivorous cichlid native to South America.  Quite popular in "
"aquariums with several different colored breeds."
msgstr "シクリッド科に属する雑食性の魚です。色彩の異なる様々な品種がおり、観賞魚として人気があります。"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/TropiCataclysm/monsters/tropical_fish.json
msgid "guapote"
msgid_plural "guapotes"
msgstr[0] "グアポーテ"

#. ~ Description of monster "guapote"
#: data/mods/TropiCataclysm/monsters/tropical_fish.json
msgid ""
"A genus of cichlids found in Central America.  All of the species are "
"predatory with different coloration and sizes."
msgstr "中央アメリカに生息するシクリッド科の一種です。色彩や大きさは様々ですが、全ての種が肉食性です。"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/TropiCataclysm/monsters/tropical_fish.json
msgid "mayaheros"
msgid_plural "mayaheri"
msgstr[0] "マヤヘロス"

#. ~ Description of monster "mayaheros"
#: data/mods/TropiCataclysm/monsters/tropical_fish.json
msgid ""
"A genus of adaptable cichlids native to Central America.  They can survive "
"in marine environments with some populations even reaching Florida."
msgstr "シクリッド科に属する、中央アメリカ原産の魚です。海洋でも生存できるほど適応力が高く、フロリダまでやってくる個体もいます。"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/TropiCataclysm/monsters/tropical_fungus.json
#: data/mods/desert_region/desert_monsters.json
msgid "fungal elephant"
msgid_plural "fungal elephants"
msgstr[0] "真菌ゾウ"

#. ~ Description of monster "fungal elephant"
#: data/mods/TropiCataclysm/monsters/tropical_fungus.json
#: data/mods/desert_region/desert_monsters.json
msgid ""
"A horrifying image with tendrils seeping out of many oozing wounds, this "
"elephant's form appears more eldritch than animal."
msgstr "生々しい傷口から触手のようなものが飛び出している、恐ろしいゾウです。とても生きているとは思えない状態です。"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/TropiCataclysm/monsters/tropical_fungus.json
msgid "fungal termite"
msgid_plural "fungal termites"
msgstr[0] "真菌シロアリ"

#. ~ Description of monster "fungal termite"
#: data/mods/TropiCataclysm/monsters/tropical_fungus.json
msgid ""
"A sickly looking termite riddled with fungal spores.  Traces of a gray "
"substance dribble from its mandibles."
msgstr "真菌の胞子が付着した、弱々しい姿のシロアリです。大顎から灰色の何かが滴っています。"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/TropiCataclysm/monsters/tropical_fungus.json
msgid "fungal scorpion"
msgid_plural "fungal scorpions"
msgstr[0] "真菌サソリ"

#. ~ Description of monster "fungal scorpion"
#: data/mods/TropiCataclysm/monsters/tropical_fungus.json
msgid ""
"A huge scorpion infected with a parasitic fungus.  The stinger on its tail "
"gushes with an ominous gray liquid."
msgstr "真菌に寄生された巨大なサソリです。尻尾の針から不気味な灰色の液体を垂れ流しています。"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/TropiCataclysm/monsters/tropical_fungus.json
msgid "fungal cultivator"
msgid_plural "fungal cultivators"
msgstr[0] "真菌獣(産卵期)"

#. ~ Description of monster "fungal cultivator"
#: data/mods/TropiCataclysm/monsters/tropical_fungus.json
msgid ""
"A massive mycoid that shambles around the spore infested environment.  "
"Clusters of small fungal pods seem to grow and from its body."
msgstr "胞子が漂う中、巨大な真菌生物が蠢いています。菌が入った小さな莢を全身にぶら下げているようです。"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/TropiCataclysm/monsters/tropical_fungus.json
msgid "fungal ganglion"
msgid_plural "fungal ganglions"
msgstr[0] "巨大真菌瘤"

#. ~ Description of monster "fungal ganglion"
#: data/mods/TropiCataclysm/monsters/tropical_fungus.json
msgid ""
"An enormous fungus rooted to the ground that seems to be the nexus for all "
"the fungus in the area.  It periodically gives birth to new saprolings."
msgstr "地面に根を張った巨大な真菌塊は、この地域全体に広がる菌糸の根源のようです。定期的に真菌獣を生み出し続けています。"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/TropiCataclysm/monsters/tropical_fungus.json
msgid "saproling"
msgid_plural "saprolings"
msgstr[0] "真菌獣(幼体)"

#. ~ Description of monster "saproling"
#: data/mods/TropiCataclysm/monsters/tropical_fungus.json
msgid ""
"A very small mycoid born out of a fungal pod.  Very vulnerable but over time"
" it will become a proper fungaloid."
msgstr "真菌の莢から生まれた非常に小さな真菌生物です。非常に弱いですが、時間が経つと真菌人に成長します。"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/TropiCataclysm/monsters/tropical_fungus.json
msgid "fungal caretaker"
msgid_plural "fungal caretakers"
msgstr[0] "真菌獣(亜成体)"

#. ~ Description of monster "fungal caretaker"
#: data/mods/TropiCataclysm/monsters/tropical_fungus.json
msgid ""
"A young mycoid that has grown some time on the spore growth.  It is still a "
"juvenile but it can already fend for itself to a degree."
msgstr "生れてからある程度の時間が経った、若い真菌生物です。まだ成体ではありませんが、既に自力で生き延びる力をある程度持っています。"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/TropiCataclysm/monsters/tropical_fungus.json
msgid "fungal perforator"
msgid_plural "fungal perforators"
msgstr[0] "穿孔真菌獣"

#. ~ Description of monster "fungal perforator"
#: data/mods/TropiCataclysm/monsters/tropical_fungus.json
msgid ""
"A skittering fungal creature with a sharp needle-like appendage.  Its sting "
"probably contains spores."
msgstr "鋭い針のような器官をもつ、素早い真菌生物です。胞子が付着した針で敵を刺して攻撃します。"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/TropiCataclysm/monsters/tropical_fungus.json
msgid "fungal quillbag"
msgid_plural "fungal quillbags"
msgstr[0] "棘袋真菌獣"

#. ~ Description of monster "fungal quillbag"
#: data/mods/TropiCataclysm/monsters/tropical_fungus.json
msgid ""
"A strange fungal creature with a thorny covering.  The barbs on its body may"
" contain spores."
msgstr "棘のようなもので覆われた奇妙な真菌生物です。全身の棘には胞子が付着しています。"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/TropiCataclysm/monsters/tropical_fungus.json
msgid "fungal moldspring"
msgid_plural "fungal moldsprings"
msgstr[0] "粘性真菌獣"

#. ~ Description of monster "fungal moldspring"
#: data/mods/TropiCataclysm/monsters/tropical_fungus.json
msgid ""
"A large and amorphous fungal creature.  It slithers around the ground "
"leaving a trail of spores in its wake."
msgstr "大型で不定形の真菌生物です。胞子が混じった痕跡を残しながら、地面を滑るように移動します。"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/TropiCataclysm/monsters/tropical_fungus.json
msgid "fungal dispersor"
msgid_plural "fungal dispersors"
msgstr[0] "放散真菌獣"

#. ~ Description of monster "fungal dispersor"
#: data/mods/TropiCataclysm/monsters/tropical_fungus.json
msgid ""
"A strange fungal creature similar to a moving balloon.  It releases a cloud "
"of spores in all directions."
msgstr "風船のように漂う奇妙な真菌生物です。胞子雲を四方八方に放出します。"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/TropiCataclysm/monsters/tropical_insect_spider.json
msgid "oversized scorpion"
msgid_plural "oversized scorpions"
msgstr[0] "大型サソリ"

#. ~ Description of monster "oversized scorpion"
#: data/mods/TropiCataclysm/monsters/tropical_insect_spider.json
msgid "A mutated scorpion the size of a large dog."
msgstr "大型犬ほどのサイズの変異したサソリです。"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/TropiCataclysm/monsters/tropical_insect_spider.json
#: data/mods/desert_region/desert_insect_spider.json
msgid "giant scorpion"
msgid_plural "giant scorpions"
msgstr[0] "巨大サソリ"

#. ~ Description of monster "giant scorpion"
#: data/mods/TropiCataclysm/monsters/tropical_insect_spider.json
#: data/mods/desert_region/desert_insect_spider.json
msgid ""
"A menacing arachnid with a second set of pedipalps, clacking rabidly as an "
"engorged stinger looms over its body."
msgstr "胴体から生えた4本ものハサミを振り上げて威嚇する、巨大なサソリです。尻尾の針を頭上で振り回し興奮しています。"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/TropiCataclysm/monsters/tropical_insect_spider.json
msgid "scorpling"
msgid_plural "scorplings"
msgstr[0] "サソリ(幼体)"

#. ~ Description of monster "scorpling"
#: data/mods/TropiCataclysm/monsters/tropical_insect_spider.json
msgid "A pale-colored juvenile scorpion, about the size of a beer bottle."
msgstr "ビール瓶ほどのサイズの、色の薄いサソリの幼体です。"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/TropiCataclysm/monsters/tropical_insect_spider.json
msgid "termite nymph"
msgid_plural "termite nymphs"
msgstr[0] "シロアリ(幼生)"

#. ~ Description of monster "termite nymph"
#: data/mods/TropiCataclysm/monsters/tropical_insect_spider.json
msgid ""
"Unlike ants, Termites produce nymphs instead of larvae.  Their nymphs grow "
"first into workers before diverging into the higher castes."
msgstr "シロアリはアリとは異なり、親と似た姿の幼生を産みます。幼生はまず働きアリに成長し、その後生殖虫に分岐します。"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/TropiCataclysm/monsters/tropical_insect_spider.json
msgid "giant termite worker"
msgid_plural "giant termite workers"
msgstr[0] "巨大働きシロアリ"

#. ~ Description of monster "giant termite worker"
#: data/mods/TropiCataclysm/monsters/tropical_insect_spider.json
msgid ""
"An adult termite dedicated to tending the colony.  Termite workers, while "
"developed, are still capable of growing into soldiers or alates given the "
"time."
msgstr "群れの世話に従事するシロアリの成虫です。シロアリの働きアリは既に成虫ですが、時間をかけて兵隊アリや羽アリに変化することもあります。"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/TropiCataclysm/monsters/tropical_insect_spider.json
msgid "giant termite soldier"
msgid_plural "giant termite soldiers"
msgstr[0] "巨大兵隊シロアリ"

#. ~ Description of monster "giant termite soldier"
#: data/mods/TropiCataclysm/monsters/tropical_insect_spider.json
msgid ""
"An enormous termite dedicated to the defense of the colony.  It has a pair "
"of enormous mandibles capable of cutting bone and chitin."
msgstr "群れの防衛に特化した巨大なシロアリです。骨やキチン質を噛みちぎれる巨大な大顎をもっています。"

#. ~ Description of monster "giant termite soldier"
#: data/mods/TropiCataclysm/monsters/tropical_insect_spider.json
msgid ""
"An enormous termite dedicated to the defense of the colony.  It has a "
"strange horn-like projection on its head."
msgstr "群れの防衛に特化した巨大なシロアリです。頭部に角のような奇妙な突起があります。"

#. ~ Monster message of special attack of monster "giant termite soldier"
#: data/mods/TropiCataclysm/monsters/tropical_insect_spider.json
#, c-format
msgid "The %s sprays some chemical out of its head!"
msgstr "%sは頭部から化学物質を噴射しました！"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/TropiCataclysm/monsters/tropical_insect_spider.json
msgid "giant termite alate"
msgid_plural "giant termite alates"
msgstr[0] "巨大羽シロアリ"

#. ~ Description of monster "giant termite alate"
#: data/mods/TropiCataclysm/monsters/tropical_insect_spider.json
msgid ""
"An enormous winged termite dedicated to spreading new colonies.  Does not "
"appear violent, but perhaps you should not test its patience."
msgstr "新たな群れを広げる役割をもつ、巨大な羽をもつシロアリです。凶暴には見えませんが、忍耐力を試そうとすべきではありません。"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/TropiCataclysm/monsters/tropical_insect_spider.json
msgid "giant termite king"
msgid_plural "giant termite kings"
msgstr[0] "巨大王シロアリ"

#. ~ Description of monster "giant termite king"
#: data/mods/TropiCataclysm/monsters/tropical_insect_spider.json
msgid ""
"A gigantic termite dedicated to protecting the queen and their offspring.  "
"While his main role is breeding, the king is certainly well armed as well."
msgstr "女王とその子孫を守る巨大なシロアリです。主な役割は繁殖ですが、王というだけあって十分な戦闘力があります。"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/TropiCataclysm/monsters/tropical_insect_spider.json
msgid "giant termite queen"
msgid_plural "giant termite queens"
msgstr[0] "巨大女王シロアリ"

#. ~ Description of monster "giant termite queen"
#: data/mods/TropiCataclysm/monsters/tropical_insect_spider.json
msgid ""
"A colossal termite making up the basis of the colony along with her king.  "
"Her enlarged abdomen limits her movements but she barely needs to move "
"anyway."
msgstr "王と共に群れの根幹を成す巨大なシロアリです。大きな腹部によって動きが制限されていますが、そもそもほとんど動く必要がありません。"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/TropiCataclysm/monsters/tropical_insect_spider.json
msgid "oversized velvet worm"
msgid_plural "oversized velvet worms"
msgstr[0] "大型カギムシ"

#. ~ Description of monster "oversized velvet worm"
#: data/mods/TropiCataclysm/monsters/tropical_insect_spider.json
msgid "A mutated velvet worm the size of a large dog."
msgstr "大型犬ほどのサイズの変異したカギムシです。"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/TropiCataclysm/monsters/tropical_insect_spider.json
msgid "giant velvet worm"
msgid_plural "giant velvet worms"
msgstr[0] "巨大カギムシ"

#. ~ Description of monster "giant velvet worm"
#: data/mods/TropiCataclysm/monsters/tropical_insect_spider.json
msgid ""
"A mutated velvet worm larger than a person.  These peculiar creatures hunt "
"at night using silent feet and sticky attacks."
msgstr "人間よりも大きな、変異したカギムシです。静かな動作と粘着攻撃を活用して夜に狩りを行います。"

#. ~ Monster message of special attack of monster "giant velvet worm"
#: data/mods/TropiCataclysm/monsters/tropical_insect_spider.json
#, c-format
msgid "The %s shoots strings of goo from the appendages on its head!"
msgstr "%sは頭部の突起から粘着糸を噴出しました！"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/TropiCataclysm/monsters/tropical_insect_spider.json
msgid "colossal velvet worm"
msgid_plural "colossal velvet worms"
msgstr[0] "超巨大カギムシ"

#. ~ Description of monster "colossal velvet worm"
#: data/mods/TropiCataclysm/monsters/tropical_insect_spider.json
msgid ""
"An enormous velvet worm the size of a small car.  Its mouthparts and skin "
"have reinforced to hunt down and defend against the new fauna of the "
"Cataclysm."
msgstr "小型車ほどのサイズの巨大なカギムシです。鍛えられた口器と皮膚によって大変動後の生物を狩り、反撃から身を守ります。"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/TropiCataclysm/monsters/tropical_insect_spider.json
msgid "velvet worm larva"
msgid_plural "velvet worm larvae"
msgstr[0] "カギムシ(幼体)"

#. ~ Description of monster "velvet worm larva"
#: data/mods/TropiCataclysm/monsters/tropical_insect_spider.json
msgid "A pale wriggling worm with a bunch of little legs."
msgstr "たくさんの小さな足が生えた、うごめく青白いワームです。"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/TropiCataclysm/monsters/tropical_mammal.json
#: data/mods/desert_region/desert_mammal.json
msgid "bush elephant"
msgid_plural "bush elephants"
msgstr[0] "アフリカゾウ"

#. ~ Description of monster "bush elephant"
#: data/mods/TropiCataclysm/monsters/tropical_mammal.json
#: data/mods/desert_region/desert_mammal.json
msgid ""
"The African Bush Elephant is a massive terrestrial animal with two long "
"tusks protruding from its mouth.  Elephantry is on the rise since the "
"Cataclysm."
msgstr "口から2本の長い牙を生やした巨大な陸生動物です。大変動の発生以来、ゾウが増加していると言われています。"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/TropiCataclysm/monsters/tropical_mammal.json
msgid "jaguar"
msgid_plural "jaguars"
msgstr[0] "ジャガー"

#. ~ Description of monster "jaguar"
#: data/mods/TropiCataclysm/monsters/tropical_mammal.json
msgid ""
"The largest native feline in the Americas.  With the advent of the Cataclysm"
" these spotted felines have recovered some territory."
msgstr "アメリカ大陸に生息する最大のネコ科動物です。大変動の到来により、この斑点模様の肉食獣はかつての生息域を取り戻しました。"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/TropiCataclysm/monsters/tropical_mammal.json
msgid "spectacled bear"
msgid_plural "spectacled bears"
msgstr[0] "メガネグマ"

#. ~ Description of monster "spectacled bear"
#: data/mods/TropiCataclysm/monsters/tropical_mammal.json
msgid ""
"The Andean bear, sometimes called spectacled bear is the only bear species "
"native to South America.  It lives in a very diverse array of ecosystems on "
"low to high altitudes."
msgstr "アンデスグマとも呼ばれるメガネグマは、南アメリカ大陸に生息する唯一のクマです。低地から高地まで、非常に多様な環境に適応しています。"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/TropiCataclysm/monsters/tropical_mammal.json
msgid "spectacled bear cub"
msgid_plural "spectacled bear cubs"
msgstr[0] "メガネグマ(幼体)"

#. ~ Description of monster "spectacled bear cub"
#: data/mods/TropiCataclysm/monsters/tropical_mammal.json
msgid ""
"A juvenile spectacled bear.  Its mother could be nearby, better not to mess "
"around it."
msgstr "メガネグマの幼体です。付近に母親がいる可能性があるため、そっとしておいた方がよさそうです。"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/TropiCataclysm/monsters/tropical_mammal.json
msgid "ocelot"
msgid_plural "ocelots"
msgstr[0] "オセロット"

#. ~ Description of monster "ocelot"
#: data/mods/TropiCataclysm/monsters/tropical_mammal.json
msgid ""
"A widespread medium sized feline known for its spotted and streaked fur.  It"
" can be found as north as the southern US and even the Caribbean."
msgstr "毛皮の斑点模様が特徴的な、中型のネコ科動物です。北はアメリカ南部から南はカリブ海諸島まで生息しています。"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/TropiCataclysm/monsters/tropical_mammal.json
msgid "tapir calf"
msgid_plural "tapir calfs"
msgstr[0] "バク(幼体)"

#. ~ Description of monster "tapir calf"
#: data/mods/TropiCataclysm/monsters/tropical_mammal.json
msgid ""
"A baby tapir.  Unlike the adults, tapir calves are born with spots and "
"streaks on their fur for camouflage."
msgstr "バクの幼体です。大人と違い、体毛にカモフラージュのための斑点や筋の模様が付いた状態で生まれてきます。"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/TropiCataclysm/monsters/tropical_mammal.json
msgid "tapir"
msgid_plural "tapirs"
msgstr[0] "バク"

#. ~ Description of monster "tapir"
#: data/mods/TropiCataclysm/monsters/tropical_mammal.json
msgid ""
"A medium to large herbivore distantly related to the Rhinoceros.  It is both"
" a capable runner and swimmer in order to evade predators."
msgstr "サイの遠い親戚にあたる、中型から大型の草食動物です。外敵から逃れるために素早く走ったり泳いだりすることもあります。"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/TropiCataclysm/monsters/tropical_mammal.json
msgid "camel"
msgid_plural "camels"
msgstr[0] "ラクダ"

#. ~ Description of monster "camel"
#: data/mods/TropiCataclysm/monsters/tropical_mammal.json
msgid ""
"A large herbivore introduced from the old world via zoos and private owners."
"  Ironically, camels were once native to North America in distant times."
msgstr "旧世界の動物園や個人所有者によって輸入された大型草食動物です。皮肉なことに、遥か昔には北米にもラクダが生息していました。"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/TropiCataclysm/monsters/tropical_mammal.json
msgid "coati"
msgid_plural "coatis"
msgstr[0] "アカハナグマ"

#. ~ Description of monster "coati"
#: data/mods/TropiCataclysm/monsters/tropical_mammal.json
msgid ""
"A relative of the raccoon, coatis can be easily distinguished by their long "
"noses and sometimes ringed tails.  They live as north as Arizona, and form "
"large family groups."
msgstr "尾の縞模様と長い鼻が特徴的な、アライグマの近縁種です。アリゾナ州以北に生息しており、家族で大きな群れを作ります。"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/TropiCataclysm/monsters/tropical_mammal.json
msgid "bush dog"
msgid_plural "bush dogs"
msgstr[0] "ヤブイヌ"

#. ~ Description of monster "bush dog"
#: data/mods/TropiCataclysm/monsters/tropical_mammal.json
msgid ""
"A small and elusive canid native to South and Central America.  It is "
"harmless to humans but their packs can take on prey several times their "
"size."
msgstr "中南米原産の、小型で逃げ足の速いイヌ科動物です。人間には害をなしませんが、群れを作って自分の体格より数倍大きな獲物を狩ることもあります。"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/TropiCataclysm/monsters/tropical_mammal.json
msgid "coipo"
msgid_plural "coipos"
msgstr[0] "ヌートリア"

#. ~ Description of monster "coipo"
#: data/mods/TropiCataclysm/monsters/tropical_mammal.json
msgid ""
"A big rodent similar in shape to a beaver.  In the past it was hunted and "
"raised for its fur."
msgstr "ビーバーに似た姿をしている、大型のげっ歯類です。かつては毛皮を利用するために狩りや飼育が行われていました。"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/TropiCataclysm/monsters/tropical_mammal.json
msgid "baby capybara"
msgid_plural "baby capybaras"
msgstr[0] "カピバラ(幼体)"

#. ~ Description of monster "baby capybara"
#: data/mods/TropiCataclysm/monsters/tropical_mammal.json
msgid ""
"A baby capybara.  Like most rodents they are born by the numbers as they "
"usually get eaten early in their lives by many predators."
msgstr "カピバラの幼体です。他のげっ歯類と同じく、カピバラの幼体も様々な捕食者の餌食になってしまうため、一度に多く出産します。"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/TropiCataclysm/monsters/tropical_mammal.json
msgid "capybara"
msgid_plural "capybaras"
msgstr[0] "カピバラ"

#. ~ Description of monster "capybara"
#: data/mods/TropiCataclysm/monsters/tropical_mammal.json
msgid ""
"The largest rodent in the world.  Capybaras are pretty chill aquatic "
"herbivores that roam around wetlands and rivers in South America."
msgstr "南米の湿地や川に生息する穏やかな性格の水生草食動物であり、世界最大のげっ歯類でもあります。"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/TropiCataclysm/monsters/tropical_mammal.json
msgid "hippopotamus"
msgid_plural "hippopotamus"
msgstr[0] "カバ"

#. ~ Description of monster "hippopotamus"
#: data/mods/TropiCataclysm/monsters/tropical_mammal.json
msgid ""
"A massive and aggressive aquatic mammal.  Hippos originate from Africa but "
"were brought to the Americas by zoos and particularly eccentric criminals."
msgstr "攻撃的な性格の、巨大な半水生哺乳類です。原産地はアフリカ大陸ですが、動物園や珍しいもの好きの犯罪者によってアメリカ大陸に持ち込まれました。"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/TropiCataclysm/monsters/tropical_mammal.json
msgid "peccary piglet"
msgid_plural "peccary piglets"
msgstr[0] "ペッカリー(幼体)"

#. ~ Description of monster "peccary piglet"
#: data/mods/TropiCataclysm/monsters/tropical_mammal.json
msgid ""
"The small offspring of a peccary.  Much like true boar piglets, this one has"
" a mottled fur as camouflage."
msgstr "小さなペッカリーの幼体です。イノシシの幼体によく似た姿ですが、毛はまだら模様になっておりカモフラージュ効果があります。"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/TropiCataclysm/monsters/tropical_mammal.json
msgid "peccary"
msgid_plural "peccaries"
msgstr[0] "ペッカリー"

#. ~ Description of monster "peccary"
#: data/mods/TropiCataclysm/monsters/tropical_mammal.json
msgid ""
"A small furred omnivore native to the American continent.  Despite looking "
"like a boar it is not directly related to them or their domestic brethren."
msgstr "アフリカ大陸原産の、毛皮をもつ小型雑食動物です。姿はイノシシに似ていますが、イノシシやブタとは異なる科の生物です。"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/TropiCataclysm/monsters/tropical_mammal.json
msgid "guinea pig"
msgid_plural "guinea pigs"
msgstr[0] "モルモット"

#. ~ Description of monster "guinea pig"
#: data/mods/TropiCataclysm/monsters/tropical_mammal.json
msgid ""
"Also called cuy by the people of the Andes.  This small rodent was bred "
"originally for food but it has gained the hearts of many as a pet."
msgstr "アンデス地方ではクイと呼ばれている、小型のネズミです。元々は食肉用に飼育されていましたが、今ではペットとして世界中の人々に愛されています。"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/TropiCataclysm/monsters/tropical_mammal.json
msgid "wallaby joey"
msgid_plural "wallaby joeys"
msgstr[0] "ワラビー(幼体)"

#. ~ Description of monster "wallaby joey"
#: data/mods/TropiCataclysm/monsters/tropical_mammal.json
msgid ""
"A baby wallaby.  Most of the time they hide inside their mother's pouch but "
"eventually grow too big."
msgstr "ワラビーの幼体です。大抵は母親の袋の中に隠れていますが、成長するにつれて外で活動するようになります。"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/TropiCataclysm/monsters/tropical_mammal.json
msgid "wallaby"
msgid_plural "wallabies"
msgstr[0] "ワラビー"

#. ~ Description of monster "wallaby"
#: data/mods/TropiCataclysm/monsters/tropical_mammal.json
msgid ""
"A small to large hopping marsupial from Australia and New Guinea.  Even "
"before the Cataclysm there were many feral populations of them around the "
"world."
msgstr ""
"オーストラリアやニューギニアが原産の、飛び跳ねて移動する有袋類です。小型から大型まで様々なサイズの種がおり、大変動以前から世界各地に野生の個体が存在していました。"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/TropiCataclysm/monsters/tropical_nether.json
msgid "aether krill"
msgid_plural "aether krills"
msgstr[0] "エーテルエビ"

#. ~ Description of monster "aether krill"
#: data/mods/TropiCataclysm/monsters/tropical_nether.json
msgid ""
"A tiny flying alien creature brought by the portal storms.  It vaguely "
"resembles a marine crustacean like shrimp."
msgstr "ポータルの嵐と共に現れた、空飛ぶ小型異界生物です。どことなくエビに似ているような気がします。"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/TropiCataclysm/monsters/tropical_nether.json
msgid "paddle crab"
msgid_plural "paddle crabs"
msgstr[0] "パドルクラブ"

#. ~ Description of monster "paddle crab"
#: data/mods/TropiCataclysm/monsters/tropical_nether.json
msgid ""
"An alien creature brought by the portal storms.  It vaguely resembles a crab"
" or lobster with paddles instead of legs."
msgstr "ポータルの嵐と共に現れた異界生物です。どことなくカニやロブスターに似ており、肢の代わりにヘラ状の部位が生えています。"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/TropiCataclysm/monsters/tropical_nether.json
msgid "emperor prawn"
msgid_plural "emperor prawns"
msgstr[0] "ダイオウエビ"

#. ~ Description of monster "emperor prawn"
#: data/mods/TropiCataclysm/monsters/tropical_nether.json
msgid ""
"A large alien creature brought by the portal storms.  It vaguely resembles a"
" prehistoric crustacean with flippers and a set of pincers."
msgstr "ポータルの嵐と共に現れた大型異界生物です。どことなく先史時代の甲殻類に似ており、ヒレとハサミをもっています。"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/TropiCataclysm/monsters/tropical_nether.json
msgid "triglav star"
msgid_plural "triglav stars"
msgstr[0] "トリグラフスター"

#. ~ Description of monster "triglav star"
#: data/mods/TropiCataclysm/monsters/tropical_nether.json
msgid ""
"A tiny alien creature brought by the portal storms.  It vaguely resembles a "
"sea star crawling on three spindly legs."
msgstr "ポータルの嵐と共に現れた小型異界生物です。どことなくヒトデに似ており、3本のひょろ長い肢で這うように動きます。"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/TropiCataclysm/monsters/tropical_nether.json
msgid "scale urchin"
msgid_plural "scale urchins"
msgstr[0] "ウロコウニ"

#. ~ Description of monster "scale urchin"
#: data/mods/TropiCataclysm/monsters/tropical_nether.json
msgid ""
"A tiny alien creature brought by the portal storms.  It vaguely resembles a "
"sea urchin with scales instead of spines."
msgstr "ポータルの嵐と共に現れた小型異界生物です。どことなくウニに似ており、棘ではなく鱗が全身を覆っています。"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/TropiCataclysm/monsters/tropical_nether.json
msgid "thornothurian"
msgid_plural "thornothurians"
msgstr[0] "トゲナマコ"

#. ~ Description of monster "thornothurian"
#: data/mods/TropiCataclysm/monsters/tropical_nether.json
msgid ""
"An alien creature brought by the portal storms.  It vaguely resembles a sea "
"cucumber with a set of thorns running on its body."
msgstr "ポータルの嵐と共に現れた異界生物です。どことなくナマコに似ており、棘が全身を覆っています。"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/TropiCataclysm/monsters/tropical_nether.json
msgid "aer jelly"
msgid_plural "aer jellies"
msgstr[0] "トビクラゲ"

#. ~ Description of monster "aer jelly"
#: data/mods/TropiCataclysm/monsters/tropical_nether.json
msgid ""
"A tiny flying alien creature brought by the portal storms.  It vaguely "
"resembles a jellyfish with balloon-like body."
msgstr "ポータルの嵐と共に現れた、空飛ぶ小型異界生物です。風船のような姿は、どことなくクラゲに似ているような気がします。"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/TropiCataclysm/monsters/tropical_nether.json
msgid "sea papalotl"
msgid_plural "sea papalomeh"
msgstr[0] "パパロトル"

#. ~ Description of monster "sea papalotl"
#: data/mods/TropiCataclysm/monsters/tropical_nether.json
msgid ""
"An alien creature brought by the portal storms.  It vaguely resembles a "
"floating box jellyfish with a translucent body."
msgstr "ポータルの嵐と共に現れた空飛ぶ異界生物です。半透明の姿は、どことなくハコクラゲに似ているような気がします。"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/TropiCataclysm/monsters/tropical_nether.json
msgid "sky phantom"
msgid_plural "sky phantoms"
msgstr[0] "スカイファントム"

#. ~ Description of monster "sky phantom"
#: data/mods/TropiCataclysm/monsters/tropical_nether.json
msgid ""
"A huge alien creature brought by the portal storms.  It resembles a "
"Portuguese man-o'-war fused to a zeppelin."
msgstr "ポータルの嵐と共に現れた超巨大異界生物です。カツオノエボシとツェッペリン型飛行船を掛け合わせたような姿をしています。"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/TropiCataclysm/monsters/tropical_nether.json
msgid "wizard snail"
msgid_plural "wizard snails"
msgstr[0] "マホウマイマイ"

#. ~ Description of monster "wizard snail"
#: data/mods/TropiCataclysm/monsters/tropical_nether.json
msgid ""
"A tiny alien creature brought by the portal storms.  It vaguely resembles a "
"gastropod with a hat-like shell."
msgstr "ポータルの嵐と共に現れた小型異界生物です。帽子型の殻を背負った姿は、どことなくカタツムリに似ているような気がします。"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/TropiCataclysm/monsters/tropical_nether.json
msgid "hyolith conch"
msgid_plural "hyolith conchs"
msgstr[0] "ヒオリテス"

#. ~ Description of monster "hyolith conch"
#: data/mods/TropiCataclysm/monsters/tropical_nether.json
msgid ""
"An alien creature brought by the portal storms.  It vaguely resembles a "
"large conch snail with a straight shell."
msgstr "ポータルの嵐と共に現れた異界生物です。縦長の殻を背負った姿は、どことなく大きな巻貝に似ているような気がします。"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/TropiCataclysm/monsters/tropical_nether.json
msgid "nimbelemnite"
msgid_plural "nimbelemnites"
msgstr[0] "ニンブルムナイト"

#. ~ Description of monster "nimbelemnite"
#: data/mods/TropiCataclysm/monsters/tropical_nether.json
msgid ""
"An alien flying creature brought by the portal storms.  It vaguely resembles"
" an ancient cephalopod and moves quite fast."
msgstr "ポータルの嵐と共に現れた空飛ぶ異界生物です。どことなく古代の頭足類に似ており、かなり素早く動きます。"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/TropiCataclysm/monsters/tropical_nether.json
msgid "atmmonoid"
msgid_plural "atmmonoids"
msgstr[0] "アトモナイト"

#. ~ Description of monster "atmmonoid"
#: data/mods/TropiCataclysm/monsters/tropical_nether.json
msgid ""
"An alien flying creature brought by the portal storms.  It vaguely resembles"
" a prehistoric cephalopod with a helix shell."
msgstr "ポータルの嵐と共に現れた小型異界生物です。螺旋状の殻を背負った姿は、どことなく先史時代の頭足類に似ているような気がします。"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/TropiCataclysm/monsters/tropical_nether.json
msgid "ballistoceras"
msgid_plural "ballistocerae"
msgstr[0] "バリストセラス"

#. ~ Description of monster "ballistoceras"
#: data/mods/TropiCataclysm/monsters/tropical_nether.json
msgid ""
"A large alien flying creature brought by the portal storms.  It vaguely "
"resembles a prehistoric cephalopod with a long straight shell."
msgstr "ポータルの嵐と共に現れた空飛ぶ大型異界生物です。縦長の細い殻を背負った姿は、どことなく先史時代の頭足類に似ているような気がします。"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/TropiCataclysm/monsters/tropical_nether.json
msgid "tiny flying fish"
msgid_plural "tiny flying fish"
msgstr[0] "飛行魚SS"

#. ~ Description of monster "tiny flying fish"
#: data/mods/TropiCataclysm/monsters/tropical_nether.json
msgid "A tiny flying fish."
msgstr "極小サイズの空飛ぶ魚です。"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/TropiCataclysm/monsters/tropical_nether.json
msgid "small flying fish"
msgid_plural "small flying fish"
msgstr[0] "飛行魚S"

#. ~ Description of monster "small flying fish"
#: data/mods/TropiCataclysm/monsters/tropical_nether.json
msgid "A small flying fish."
msgstr "小型サイズの空飛ぶ魚です。"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/TropiCataclysm/monsters/tropical_nether.json
msgid "medium flying fish"
msgid_plural "medium flying fish"
msgstr[0] "飛行魚M"

#. ~ Description of monster "medium flying fish"
#: data/mods/TropiCataclysm/monsters/tropical_nether.json
msgid "A medium flying fish."
msgstr "中型サイズの空飛ぶ魚です。"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/TropiCataclysm/monsters/tropical_nether.json
msgid "large flying fish"
msgid_plural "large flying fish"
msgstr[0] "飛行魚L"

#. ~ Description of monster "large flying fish"
#: data/mods/TropiCataclysm/monsters/tropical_nether.json
msgid "A large flying fish."
msgstr "大型サイズの空飛ぶ魚です。"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/TropiCataclysm/monsters/tropical_nether.json
msgid "huge flying fish"
msgid_plural "huge flying fish"
msgstr[0] "飛行魚LL"

#. ~ Description of monster "huge flying fish"
#: data/mods/TropiCataclysm/monsters/tropical_nether.json
msgid "A huge flying fish."
msgstr "巨大なサイズの空飛ぶ魚です。"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/TropiCataclysm/monsters/tropical_nether.json
msgid "paper kite"
msgid_plural "paper kites"
msgstr[0] "ペーパーカイト"

#. ~ Description of monster "paper kite"
#: data/mods/TropiCataclysm/monsters/tropical_nether.json
msgid ""
"An alien creature brought by the portal storms.  It resembles a miniature "
"manta ray."
msgstr "ポータルの嵐と共に現れた異界生物です。小さなエイのような姿をしています。"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/TropiCataclysm/monsters/tropical_nether.json
msgid "fin wing"
msgid_plural "fin wings"
msgstr[0] "フィンウィング"

#. ~ Description of monster "fin wing"
#: data/mods/TropiCataclysm/monsters/tropical_nether.json
msgid ""
"An alien creature brought by the portal storms.  It resembles a mix between "
"fish and bird."
msgstr "ポータルの嵐と共に現れた異界生物です。魚と鳥を掛け合わせたような姿をしています。"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/TropiCataclysm/monsters/tropical_nether.json
msgid "cloud scale"
msgid_plural "cloud scales"
msgstr[0] "クラウドスケイル"

#. ~ Description of monster "cloud scale"
#: data/mods/TropiCataclysm/monsters/tropical_nether.json
msgid ""
"An alien creature brought by the portal storms.  It resembles a tiny "
"tropical fish, its scales shifting color with the sky."
msgstr "ポータルの嵐と共に現れた異界生物です。小さな熱帯魚のような姿をしており、その鱗は空模様によって色を変えます。"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/TropiCataclysm/monsters/tropical_nether.json
msgid "flag tail"
msgid_plural "flag tails"
msgstr[0] "フラッグテイル"

#. ~ Description of monster "flag tail"
#: data/mods/TropiCataclysm/monsters/tropical_nether.json
msgid ""
"An alien creature brought by the portal storms.  It resembles a tropical "
"fish with a long flowing tail."
msgstr "ポータルの嵐と共に現れた異界生物です。ひらひらとした長い尾をもつ熱帯魚のような姿をしています。"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/TropiCataclysm/monsters/tropical_nether.json
msgid "balloon drifter"
msgid_plural "balloon drifters"
msgstr[0] "バルーンドリフター"

#. ~ Description of monster "balloon drifter"
#: data/mods/TropiCataclysm/monsters/tropical_nether.json
msgid ""
"An alien creature brought by the portal storms.  It resembles a rotund fish "
"filled with gas."
msgstr "ポータルの嵐と共に現れた異界生物です。丸い魚のような姿をしており、体内にはガスが充満しています。"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/TropiCataclysm/monsters/tropical_nether.json
msgid "angel fin"
msgid_plural "angel fins"
msgstr[0] "エンジェルフィン"

#. ~ Description of monster "angel fin"
#: data/mods/TropiCataclysm/monsters/tropical_nether.json
msgid ""
"An alien creature brought by the portal storms.  It resembles a sleek fish "
"with long angelic fins."
msgstr "ポータルの嵐と共に現れた異界生物です。天使のように長い尾をもつ熱帯魚に似た姿をしており、その表皮は滑らかです。"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/TropiCataclysm/monsters/tropical_nether.json
msgid "wing mane"
msgid_plural "wing manes"
msgstr[0] "ウィングメイン"

#. ~ Description of monster "wing mane"
#: data/mods/TropiCataclysm/monsters/tropical_nether.json
msgid ""
"An alien creature brought by the portal storms.  It resembles a lionfish "
"with several fin-like wings."
msgstr "ポータルの嵐と共に現れた異界生物です。たくさんのヒレをもつミノカサゴに似た姿をしています。"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/TropiCataclysm/monsters/tropical_nether.json
msgid "mosaicus"
msgid_plural "mosaicuses"
msgstr[0] "モザイクス"

#. ~ Description of monster "mosaicus"
#: data/mods/TropiCataclysm/monsters/tropical_nether.json
msgid ""
"An alien creature brought by the portal storms.  It resembles a round fish "
"with bright multicolor scales."
msgstr "ポータルの嵐と共に現れた異界生物です。丸い魚のような姿をしており、その鱗は様々な色に彩られています。"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/TropiCataclysm/monsters/tropical_nether.json
msgid "comet bass"
msgid_plural "comet basses"
msgstr[0] "コメットバス"

#. ~ Description of monster "comet bass"
#: data/mods/TropiCataclysm/monsters/tropical_nether.json
msgid ""
"An alien creature brought by the portal storms.  It resembles a bulky fish "
"with cloudy scales."
msgstr "ポータルの嵐と共に現れた異界生物です。頑丈そうな魚の姿をしており、その鱗は白く濁っています。"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/TropiCataclysm/monsters/tropical_nether.json
msgid "aeroctinus"
msgid_plural "aeroctinae"
msgstr[0] "アエロクチヌス"

#. ~ Description of monster "aeroctinus"
#: data/mods/TropiCataclysm/monsters/tropical_nether.json
msgid ""
"An alien creature brought by the portal storms.  It resembles a sleek and "
"lightweight predatory fish."
msgstr "ポータルの嵐と共に現れた異界生物です。細く小さな肉食魚に似た姿をしています。"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/TropiCataclysm/monsters/tropical_nether.json
msgid "boreas banner"
msgid_plural "boreas banners"
msgstr[0] "ボレアスバナー"

#. ~ Description of monster "boreas banner"
#: data/mods/TropiCataclysm/monsters/tropical_nether.json
msgid ""
"An alien creature brought by the portal storms.  It resembles a fast ocean "
"going fish with a large bluish dorsal fin."
msgstr "ポータルの嵐と共に現れた異界生物です。青く大きな背びれをもつ海水魚のような姿をしており、水中を高速で進みます。"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/TropiCataclysm/monsters/tropical_nether.json
msgid "macaw fin"
msgid_plural "macaw fins"
msgstr[0] "マカウフィン"

#. ~ Description of monster "macaw fin"
#: data/mods/TropiCataclysm/monsters/tropical_nether.json
msgid ""
"An alien creature brought by the portal storms.  It resembles a bulky beaked"
" fish with colored scales and fins like a parrot or macaw."
msgstr "ポータルの嵐と共に現れた異界生物です。頑丈な口をもつ魚の姿をしており、その鱗はオウムやコンゴウインコのように鮮やかです。"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/TropiCataclysm/monsters/tropical_nether.json
msgid "astrolaspis"
msgid_plural "astrolaspises"
msgstr[0] "アストロラスピス"

#. ~ Description of monster "astrolaspis"
#: data/mods/TropiCataclysm/monsters/tropical_nether.json
msgid ""
"An alien creature brought by the portal storms.  It resembles a round ocean "
"going fish with a sandy coloration like some ancient sun dial."
msgstr "ポータルの嵐と共に現れた異界生物です。丸い砂色の海水魚のような姿をしており、まるで日時計のように見えます。"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/TropiCataclysm/monsters/tropical_nether.json
msgid "eolocanth"
msgid_plural "eolocanths"
msgstr[0] "エオロカンス"

#. ~ Description of monster "eolocanth"
#: data/mods/TropiCataclysm/monsters/tropical_nether.json
msgid ""
"An alien creature brought by the portal storms.  It resembles a prehistoric "
"fish with pearl scales as if made of porcelain."
msgstr "ポータルの嵐と共に現れた異界生物です。先史時代の魚に似た姿をしており、その鱗はまるで磁器のように白く滑らかです。"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/TropiCataclysm/monsters/tropical_nether.json
msgid "cosmo serpent"
msgid_plural "cosmo serpents"
msgstr[0] "コスモサーペント"

#. ~ Description of monster "cosmo serpent"
#: data/mods/TropiCataclysm/monsters/tropical_nether.json
msgid ""
"An alien creature brought by the portal storms.  It resembles a long eel or "
"moray with dark skin and luminous spots."
msgstr "ポータルの嵐と共に現れた異界生物です。長いウナギやウツボに似た姿をしており、黒い表皮に斑点模様が光り輝いています。"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/TropiCataclysm/monsters/tropical_reptile_amphibian.json
msgid "beaded lizard"
msgid_plural "beaded lizards"
msgstr[0] "ドクトカゲ"

#. ~ Description of monster "beaded lizard"
#: data/mods/TropiCataclysm/monsters/tropical_reptile_amphibian.json
msgid ""
"A genus of venomous lizards found from the US to Guatemala.  The Gila "
"monster makes part of this group."
msgstr "アメリカからグアテマラにかけて生息する、毒をもつトカゲの一種です。ヒラモンスターの近縁種にあたります。"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/TropiCataclysm/monsters/tropical_reptile_amphibian.json
msgid "basiliscus"
msgid_plural "basiliscuses"
msgstr[0] "バシリスク"

#. ~ Description of monster "basiliscus"
#: data/mods/TropiCataclysm/monsters/tropical_reptile_amphibian.json
msgid ""
"A genus of tropical lizards native to Central and South America.  It's know "
"worldwide for its ability to run on the water."
msgstr "熱帯地域に生息する、中南米原産の爬虫類です。水上を走ることで世界的に知られています。"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/TropiCataclysm/monsters/tropical_reptile_amphibian.json
msgid "turipache"
msgid_plural "turipaches"
msgstr[0] "ヘルメットイグアナ"

#. ~ Description of monster "turipache"
#: data/mods/TropiCataclysm/monsters/tropical_reptile_amphibian.json
msgid ""
"A member of the Corytophanes family.  These lizards can be distinguished for"
" their color changing ability and their crested heads."
msgstr "ヘルメットイグアナ属の一種です。体色を変化させることができ、頭部のトサカが特徴的です。"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/TropiCataclysm/monsters/tropical_reptile_amphibian.json
msgid "lemacto"
msgid_plural "lemactos"
msgstr[0] "カンムリトカゲ"

#. ~ Description of monster "lemacto"
#: data/mods/TropiCataclysm/monsters/tropical_reptile_amphibian.json
msgid ""
"A member of the Laemanctus family.  These long legged lizards can be "
"distinguished for their long tails."
msgstr "カンムリトカゲ属の一種です。長い尾と肢が特徴的です。"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/TropiCataclysm/monsters/tropical_reptile_amphibian.json
msgid "chameleon"
msgid_plural "chameleons"
msgstr[0] "カメレオン"

#. ~ Description of monster "chameleon"
#: data/mods/TropiCataclysm/monsters/tropical_reptile_amphibian.json
msgid ""
"A member of Chamaeleonidae.  These lizards are popular worldwide due to "
"their long tongues and color shifting abilities, exported to America via pet"
" trade."
msgstr "カメレオン科の一種です。長い舌と体色を変化させる能力が特徴的な、世界的に人気の高い爬虫類です。ペットとしてアメリカ国内に輸入されています。"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/TropiCataclysm/monsters/tropical_reptile_amphibian.json
msgid "anole"
msgid_plural "anoles"
msgstr[0] "アノールトカゲ"

#. ~ Description of monster "anole"
#: data/mods/TropiCataclysm/monsters/tropical_reptile_amphibian.json
msgid ""
"A member of the Anolis genus.  These tiny lizards are similar to chameleons,"
" living mostly on trees and using a flap on their neck during mating season."
msgstr "アノール属の一種です。カメレオンに似た小さな爬虫類で、主に木の上で生活しており、成熟すると首にある袋のような器官が発達します。"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/TropiCataclysm/monsters/tropical_reptile_amphibian.json
msgid "gecko"
msgid_plural "geckos"
msgstr[0] "ヤモリ"

#. ~ Description of monster "gecko"
#: data/mods/TropiCataclysm/monsters/tropical_reptile_amphibian.json
msgid ""
"A member of Gekkota.  With over 1400 species this suborder of lizards is "
"found in all the hot parts of the world, mostly known as tree dwellers."
msgstr "ヤモリ下目の一種です。世界中に1400種以上が分布している、気温の高い環境を好む爬虫類です。"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/TropiCataclysm/monsters/tropical_reptile_amphibian.json
msgid "skink"
msgid_plural "skinks"
msgstr[0] "トカゲ"

#. ~ Description of monster "skink"
#: data/mods/TropiCataclysm/monsters/tropical_reptile_amphibian.json
msgid ""
"A member of Scincidae.  With over 1500 species these lizards are found all "
"around the world, usually in burrowing niches."
msgstr "トカゲ科の一種です。世界中に1500種以上が分布しており、通常は暗い穴の中を好みます。"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/TropiCataclysm/monsters/tropical_reptile_amphibian.json
msgid "iguana"
msgid_plural "iguanas"
msgstr[0] "イグアナ"

#. ~ Description of monster "iguana"
#: data/mods/TropiCataclysm/monsters/tropical_reptile_amphibian.json
msgid ""
"Iguanas compose a large family of very similar looking lizards found all "
"around the Americas.  The green iguana is one of the most well known and "
"widespread in the tropical parts of the continent."
msgstr ""
"アメリカ大陸の至るところで見られる、非常に姿が似通っている様々なイグアナ科の一種です。もっとも有名なグリーンイグアナは、アメリカ大陸の熱帯地域に広く生息しています。"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/TropiCataclysm/monsters/tropical_reptile_amphibian.json
msgid "monitor lizard"
msgid_plural "monitor lizards"
msgstr[0] "オオトカゲ"

#. ~ Description of monster "monitor lizard"
#: data/mods/TropiCataclysm/monsters/tropical_reptile_amphibian.json
msgid ""
"A member of the Varanus genus.  It's a fairly adaptable lizard brought from "
"Eurasia to via exotic pet trade."
msgstr "オオトカゲ属の一種です。ユーラシア大陸から観賞用に持ち込まれた、かなり適応力の高いトカゲです。"

#. ~ Description of monster "crocodile"
#: data/mods/TropiCataclysm/monsters/tropical_reptile_amphibian.json
msgid ""
"The American crocodile, found from the Orinoco up to southernmost Florida.  "
"It's well adapted to thrive in both fresh and salty waters and can get very "
"large."
msgstr "オリノコ川からフロリダ州の最南端にかけて生息しているアメリカワニです。淡水にも海水にも適応し、非常に大きく成長します。"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/TropiCataclysm/monsters/tropical_reptile_amphibian.json
msgid "caiman"
msgid_plural "caimans"
msgstr[0] "カイマン"

#. ~ Description of monster "caiman"
#: data/mods/TropiCataclysm/monsters/tropical_reptile_amphibian.json
msgid ""
"A smaller relative of the alligator which can be found all around Central "
"and South America.  They range on different sizes and live mostly in "
"freshwater habitats."
msgstr "中南米に生息する、小型のアリゲーターの近縁種です。大きさは様々で、主に淡水域で見られます。"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/TropiCataclysm/monsters/tropical_reptile_amphibian.json
msgid "strange tadpole"
msgid_plural "strange tadpoles"
msgstr[0] "オタマジャクシ"

#. ~ Description of monster "strange tadpole"
#: data/mods/TropiCataclysm/monsters/tropical_reptile_amphibian.json
msgid ""
"An overgrown tadpole that swims around eating algae and other biological "
"matter.  For some reason its legs have not yet started to form."
msgstr "藻などを食べながら泳ぐ、大きく育ち過ぎたオタマジャクシです。何故か、まだ肢が生えていません。"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/TropiCataclysm/monsters/tropical_reptile_amphibian.json
msgid "tadfish"
msgid_plural "tadfish"
msgstr[0] "変異オタマジャクシ"

#. ~ Description of monster "tadfish"
#: data/mods/TropiCataclysm/monsters/tropical_reptile_amphibian.json
msgid ""
"A strange neotenic batrachian grown from a specific kind of tadpole.  "
"Instead of growing legs it has become more fish-like."
msgstr "特殊なオタマジャクシから成長した、奇妙な幼形成熟の両生類です。肢は生えておらず、普通のオタマジャクシより魚に近い形状です。"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/TropiCataclysm/monsters/tropical_reptile_amphibian.json
msgid "axolotl"
msgid_plural "axolotls"
msgstr[0] "アホロートル"

#. ~ Description of monster "axolotl"
#: data/mods/TropiCataclysm/monsters/tropical_reptile_amphibian.json
msgid ""
"A particular neotenic salamander native to Mexico.  Very popular as a pet "
"but critically endangered in the wild."
msgstr ""
"メキシコ原産の、幼形成熟という特殊な性質をもつサンショウウオです。ペットとして非常に人気がありますが、野生の個体は絶滅の危機に瀕しています。"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/TropiCataclysm/monsters/tropical_reptile_amphibian.json
msgid "mutant axolotl"
msgid_plural "mutant axolotls"
msgstr[0] "大型アホロートル"

#. ~ Description of monster "mutant axolotl"
#: data/mods/TropiCataclysm/monsters/tropical_reptile_amphibian.json
msgid ""
"This axolotl seems to have grown to absurd size by the mutated environment."
"  It seems a bit more aggressive than usual."
msgstr "変異によってとてつもない大きさに成長したアホロートルです。一般的な個体より攻撃的な性格です。"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/TropiCataclysm/monsters/tropical_reptile_amphibian.json
msgid "giant axolotl"
msgid_plural "giant axolotls"
msgstr[0] "巨大アホロートル"

#. ~ Description of monster "giant axolotl"
#: data/mods/TropiCataclysm/monsters/tropical_reptile_amphibian.json
msgid ""
"A huge axolotl grown almost the size of a small croc.  It swims and ambushes"
" prey on the murky depths like some distant paleozoic amphibian."
msgstr "小型のワニほどのサイズに成長した、巨大なアホロートルです。濁った水中を泳ぎ獲物を待ち伏せする姿は、まるで古生代の両生類のようです。"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/TropiCataclysm/monsters/tropical_reptile_amphibian.json
msgid "caecilian larva"
msgid_plural "caecilian larvas"
msgstr[0] "アシナシイモリ(幼体)"

#. ~ Description of monster "caecilian larva"
#: data/mods/TropiCataclysm/monsters/tropical_reptile_amphibian.json
msgid ""
"Caecilians are a viviparous.  Their larvae are born inside the female and "
"fed with specials cells until they get out of her body."
msgstr "アシナシイモリは胎生動物であり、幼体はメスの体内で特殊な細胞を摂取して育ちます。"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/TropiCataclysm/monsters/tropical_reptile_amphibian.json
msgid "caecilian"
msgid_plural "caecilians"
msgstr[0] "アシナシイモリ"

#. ~ Description of monster "caecilian"
#: data/mods/TropiCataclysm/monsters/tropical_reptile_amphibian.json
msgid ""
"One of several species of amphibians with a worm like body.  Caecilians can "
"be found in the tropics burrowed in the ground but are equally capable of "
"swimming."
msgstr "ミミズのような姿をした両生類の一種です。熱帯地方で地中生活していることが多いですが、泳ぐこともできます。"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/TropiCataclysm/monsters/tropical_reptile_amphibian.json
msgid "giant caecilian"
msgid_plural "giant caecilians"
msgstr[0] "大型アシナシイモリ"

#. ~ Description of monster "giant caecilian"
#: data/mods/TropiCataclysm/monsters/tropical_reptile_amphibian.json
msgid ""
"A caecilian grown close to a snake in length.  It uses its strong head to "
"dig on the soil looking for mutated worms to devour."
msgstr "ヘビほどの長さのアシナシイモリです。頑丈な頭部で土を掘り、変異したミミズなどを食い荒らします。"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/TropiCataclysm/monsters/tropical_reptile_amphibian.json
msgid "minhocao"
msgid_plural "minhocaos"
msgstr[0] "ミニョーカオン"

#. ~ Description of monster "minhocao"
#: data/mods/TropiCataclysm/monsters/tropical_reptile_amphibian.json
msgid ""
"A huge mutated caecilian as large and heavy as the largest constrictors.  It"
" resembles something out of amazonian folklore, but may be passive unless "
"provoked."
msgstr ""
"超大型のボアコンストリクターに匹敵するサイズと重量の、変異によって誕生した巨大なアシナシイモリです。アマゾンの伝説に語られるような姿をしていますが、挑発しない限りは大人しいようです。"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/TropiCataclysm/monsters/tropical_reptile_amphibian.json
msgid "anaconda"
msgid_plural "anacondas"
msgstr[0] "アナコンダ"

#. ~ Description of monster "anaconda"
#: data/mods/TropiCataclysm/monsters/tropical_reptile_amphibian.json
msgid ""
"The anaconda is one of the largest and heaviest snakes in the world.  It "
"kills its prey by constriction and is a very good swimmer."
msgstr "アナコンダは、世界で最も大きく重いヘビの一種です。非常に泳ぎが上手く、獲物の身体を締め付けて殺します。"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/TropiCataclysm/monsters/tropical_reptile_amphibian.json
msgid "boa"
msgid_plural "boas"
msgstr[0] "ボア"

#. ~ Description of monster "boa"
#: data/mods/TropiCataclysm/monsters/tropical_reptile_amphibian.json
msgid ""
"The boa constrictor is a large but modestly sized snake who shares habitat "
"with the anaconda.  Instead of the water it prefers arboreal and terrestrial"
" environments."
msgstr "ボアコンストリクターの生息域はアナコンダと同じですが、アナコンダほど大きくはありません。水辺よりも樹上や地上の環境を好みます。"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/TropiCataclysm/monsters/tropical_reptile_amphibian.json
msgid "python"
msgid_plural "pythons"
msgstr[0] "ニシキヘビ"

#. ~ Description of monster "python"
#: data/mods/TropiCataclysm/monsters/tropical_reptile_amphibian.json
msgid ""
"Pythons are a family of constrictor snakes native to the old world.  They "
"are in most regards similar in niche to boas but are dedicate egg layers."
msgstr "古くから生息している、巻き付いて獲物を殺すヘビです。ボア属のヘビと様々な共通点がありますが、交雑はできません。"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/TropiCataclysm/monsters/tropical_reptile_amphibian.json
msgid "pond turtle"
msgid_plural "pond turtles"
msgstr[0] "クサガメ"

#. ~ Description of monster "pond turtle"
#: data/mods/TropiCataclysm/monsters/tropical_reptile_amphibian.json
msgid ""
"Distributed worldwide due to pet trade, pond turtles can be found on most "
"temperate to warm climates living in different aquatic environments."
msgstr "ペットとしての需要から世界中に広がり、温帯地域から暖帯地域にかけての様々な水域に生息しています。"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/TropiCataclysm/monsters/tropical_reptile_amphibian.json
msgid "wood turtle"
msgid_plural "wood turtles"
msgstr[0] "モリイシガメ"

#. ~ Description of monster "wood turtle"
#: data/mods/TropiCataclysm/monsters/tropical_reptile_amphibian.json
msgid ""
"Wood turtles can be found mostly in central and south America along with "
"some relatives in Asia and Oceania.  They are adapted to rainforests and can"
" move around on land and water."
msgstr ""
"モリイシガメは主に中央アメリカ、南アメリカに生息していますが、アジアやオセアニアでも発見されています。熱帯雨林の環境に適応しており、陸でも水上でも移動できます。"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/TropiCataclysm/monsters/tropical_reptile_amphibian.json
msgid "snapping turtle"
msgid_plural "snapping turtles"
msgstr[0] "ワニガメ"

#. ~ Description of monster "snapping turtle"
#: data/mods/TropiCataclysm/monsters/tropical_reptile_amphibian.json
msgid ""
"A genus of turtles known for their strong bite.  They can be found beyond US"
" borders from Mexico to some parts of South America."
msgstr "噛み付く力の強さで有名なカミツキガメ科のカメです。アメリカ合衆国だけでなく、メキシコなど南アメリカの一部地域にも生息しています。"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/TropiCataclysm/monsters/tropical_reptile_amphibian.json
msgid "tortoise"
msgid_plural "tortoises"
msgstr[0] "リクガメ"

#. ~ Description of monster "tortoise"
#: data/mods/TropiCataclysm/monsters/tropical_reptile_amphibian.json
msgid ""
"Unlike turtles, tortoises are adapted mostly to dry environments.  Many "
"species worldwide have grown to big sizes if the conditions are just right."
msgstr "水がある環境で暮らすカメと異なり、リクガメは主に乾燥した環境で暮らしています。世界中の多くのリクガメは、条件さえ整えば巨大に成長します。"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/TropiCataclysm/monsters/tropical_reptile_amphibian.json
msgid "giant tortoise"
msgid_plural "giant tortoises"
msgstr[0] "大型リクガメ"

#. ~ Description of monster "giant tortoise"
#: data/mods/TropiCataclysm/monsters/tropical_reptile_amphibian.json
msgid ""
"A large tortoise weighting half a ton.  Probably grown to this size by the "
"Cataclysm instead of ecological isolation."
msgstr "体重が約0.5トンもある大型のカメです。恐らくは生物学的な隔離ではなく大変動の影響でこのサイズまで成長したと思われます。"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/TropiCataclysm/monsters/tropical_reptile_amphibian.json
msgid "titanochelon"
msgid_plural "titanochelons"
msgstr[0] "巨大リクガメ"

#. ~ Description of monster "titanochelon"
#: data/mods/TropiCataclysm/monsters/tropical_reptile_amphibian.json
msgid ""
"A truly massive tortoise similar in shape to a sauropod dinosaur.  Looks "
"quite docile but will react if threatened."
msgstr "竜脚類のような姿をした巨大なカメです。非常に大人しい性格ですが、脅威を感じると攻撃的になります。"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/TropiCataclysm/monsters/tropical_triffid.json
msgid "triffid lifegiver"
msgid_plural "triffid lifegivers"
msgstr[0] "始祖トリフィド"

#. ~ Description of monster "triffid lifegiver"
#: data/mods/TropiCataclysm/monsters/tropical_triffid.json
msgid ""
"An enormous triffid that crawls over the surrounding overgrowth.  It barely "
"moves unlike the others and instead seems to act as a sort of progenitor "
"figure."
msgstr "雑木林に生息している巨大なトリフィドです。他のトリフィドと違ってほとんど動き回らない、トリフィドの祖先のような存在です。"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/TropiCataclysm/monsters/tropical_triffid.json
msgid "triffid overqueen"
msgid_plural "triffid overqueens"
msgstr[0] "巨体女王トリフィド"

#. ~ Description of monster "triffid overqueen"
#: data/mods/TropiCataclysm/monsters/tropical_triffid.json
msgid ""
"An enormous triffid rooted to the ground.  It absorbs nutrients and sunlight"
" all day and night to release new podlings into the garden."
msgstr "地面に根を張った巨大なトリフィドです。昼夜を問わず養分と光を吸収し、新たな苗が入った莢を花畑に解き放っています。"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/TropiCataclysm/monsters/tropical_triffid.json
msgid "triffid podling"
msgid_plural "triffid podlings"
msgstr[0] "トリフィドの苗"

#. ~ Description of monster "triffid podling"
#: data/mods/TropiCataclysm/monsters/tropical_triffid.json
msgid ""
"A very small triffid born out of a triffid pod.  Like all triffids its a "
"very dangerous plant but for now its just a harmless colorful flower."
msgstr "莢から生まれたとても小さなトリフィドです。他のトリフィドと同じく非常に危険な植物ですが、今のところはただ色鮮やかなだけの無害な苗です。"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/TropiCataclysm/monsters/tropical_triffid.json
msgid "triffid gardenling"
msgid_plural "triffid gardenlings"
msgstr[0] "トリフィドの幼木"

#. ~ Description of monster "triffid gardenling"
#: data/mods/TropiCataclysm/monsters/tropical_triffid.json
msgid ""
"A young triffid that has grown some time on the garden grounds.  It is still"
" a juvenile but it can already fend for itself to a degree."
msgstr "花畑の中でしばらく育った若いトリフィドです。まだ成体ではありませんが、ある程度は自分の力で生きていける状態です。"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/TropiCataclysm/monsters/tropical_triffid.json
msgid "dionaea"
msgid_plural "dionaeas"
msgstr[0] "肉食トリフィド"

#. ~ Description of monster "dionaea"
#: data/mods/TropiCataclysm/monsters/tropical_triffid.json
msgid ""
"A strange triffid bearing something similar to a head.  Its false mouth is "
"covered in razorsharp needles."
msgstr "頭のような部位が生えている奇妙なトリフィドです。口にあたる穴は、鋭い針で覆われています。"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/TropiCataclysm/monsters/tropical_triffid.json
msgid "sarracenia"
msgid_plural "sarracenias"
msgstr[0] "ウツボトリフィド"

#. ~ Description of monster "sarracenia"
#: data/mods/TropiCataclysm/monsters/tropical_triffid.json
msgid ""
"A strange triffid with a wide vase-like body.  It moves carefully while "
"carrying what appears to be a half-digested prey."
msgstr "壺のような筒状の葉をもつ奇妙なトリフィドです。消化されかかった獲物を中に入れたまま、ゆっくりと移動します。"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/TropiCataclysm/monsters/tropical_triffid.json
msgid "rafflesia"
msgid_plural "rafflesias"
msgstr[0] "悪臭トリフィド"

#. ~ Description of monster "rafflesia"
#: data/mods/TropiCataclysm/monsters/tropical_triffid.json
msgid ""
"A large walking plant with an enormous flower-like upper body.  Its center "
"has what appears to be a mouth and seems to emit a really bad aroma."
msgstr "上部に巨大な花を咲かせた、動く大型植物です。花の中心部には口のような穴が開いており、そこから酷い悪臭が漂ってきます。"

#. ~ Monster message of special attack of monster "rafflesia"
#: data/mods/TropiCataclysm/monsters/tropical_triffid.json
msgid "The rafflesia spews toxic gas!"
msgstr "悪臭トリフィドが有毒ガスを噴出しました！"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/TropiCataclysm/monsters/tropical_triffid.json
msgid "yateveo"
msgid_plural "yateveos"
msgstr[0] "食人トリフィド"

#. ~ Description of monster "yateveo"
#: data/mods/TropiCataclysm/monsters/tropical_triffid.json
msgid ""
"A large walking plant shaped in the likes of a tree.  It has several long "
"vines ending in sharp wooden spikes."
msgstr "樹木のような形をした動く大型植物です。長い蔓が何本も伸びており、その先端には鋭い棘が生えています。"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/TropiCataclysm/monsters/tropical_zombies.json
#: data/mods/desert_region/desert_monsters.json
msgid "zandcrawler"
msgid_plural "zandcrawlers"
msgstr[0] "ゾンビワーム"

#. ~ Description of monster "zandcrawler"
#: data/mods/TropiCataclysm/monsters/tropical_zombies.json
msgid ""
"A calloused and misshaped form that seems to have adapted to the harsh, dry "
"environment."
msgstr "厳しい乾燥気候に適応した、硬い皮膚を持つ不格好なワームです。"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/TropiCataclysm/monsters/zed_plant.json
msgid "garden zombie"
msgid_plural "garden zombies"
msgstr[0] "緑化ゾンビ"

#. ~ Description of monster "garden zombie"
#: data/mods/TropiCataclysm/monsters/zed_plant.json
msgid ""
"A zombie wearing some kind of gardening or botanic attire and is smeared "
"full of vines, thorns, pollen and sap.  The triffids have it controlled "
"somehow but its purpose remains unclear."
msgstr ""
"庭師や植物学者のような装いの、全身が蔦、棘、花粉、樹液などにまみれたゾンビです。トリフィドが何らかの理由でこのゾンビを制御しているようですが、その目的は不明です。"

#. ~ Monster message of special attack of monster "garden zombie"
#: data/mods/TropiCataclysm/monsters/zed_plant.json
msgid "The zombie spews a cloud of pollen!"
msgstr "ゾンビが花粉を噴き出しました！"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/TropiCataclysm/monsters/zed_plant.json
msgid "garden child"
msgid_plural "garden children"
msgstr[0] "棘蔦子供ゾンビ"

#. ~ Description of monster "garden child"
#: data/mods/TropiCataclysm/monsters/zed_plant.json
msgid ""
"This child zombie seems to have been adopted by plants.  It has several "
"thorny vines and sprouts covering its head and body."
msgstr "植物に乗っ取られた子供ゾンビです。棘のある蔓や芽が頭や胴から生えています。"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/TropiCataclysm/monsters/zed_plant.json
msgid "spriteling"
msgid_plural "spritelings"
msgstr[0] "毒草子供ゾンビ"

#. ~ Description of monster "spriteling"
#: data/mods/TropiCataclysm/monsters/zed_plant.json
msgid ""
"An undead child mutated by alien flora.  It has several colorful flowers on "
"its scalp and an unsettling serene expression."
msgstr "地球外の植物によって変異した子供ゾンビです。頭には鮮やかな花がいくつも咲いており、何ともいえない穏やかな表情をしています。"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/TropiCataclysm/monsters/zed_plant.json
msgid "mossy boomer"
msgid_plural "mossy boomers"
msgstr[0] "棘蔦ブーマー"

#. ~ Description of monster "mossy boomer"
#: data/mods/TropiCataclysm/monsters/zed_plant.json
msgid ""
"A fat and slow zombie covered in plant growths of unknown origin.  Some "
"vines seem to extend into its mouth and guts."
msgstr "正体不明の植物に覆われた、太った鈍いゾンビです。蔓の何本かは口から内臓に向かって伸びているようです。"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/TropiCataclysm/monsters/zed_plant.json
msgid "sap belcher"
msgid_plural "sap belchers"
msgstr[0] "樹液ブーマー"

#. ~ Description of monster "sap belcher"
#: data/mods/TropiCataclysm/monsters/zed_plant.json
msgid ""
"This big and bloated zombie seems full of sap.  Its already overgrown body "
"shows several flowering plants growing over it."
msgstr "樹液をたっぷり飲んで丸々と太ったゾンビです。膨らみきった身体のあちこちから草花が生えています。"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/TropiCataclysm/monsters/zed_plant.json
msgid "pollinated eructor"
msgid_plural "pollinated eructors"
msgstr[0] "花粉ブーマー"

#. ~ Description of monster "pollinated eructor"
#: data/mods/TropiCataclysm/monsters/zed_plant.json
msgid ""
"This engorged zombie has smears of strange pollen on its mouth and plants "
"over its body.  It shambles around eructing the stuff all over the place."
msgstr "全身を植物で覆われ、口の周りに奇妙な花粉が付着しているゾンビです。花粉を吐き出しながら歩き回っています。"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/TropiCataclysm/monsters/zed_plant.json
msgid "bramble brute"
msgid_plural "bramble brutes"
msgstr[0] "凶暴棘蔦ゾンビ"

#. ~ Description of monster "bramble brute"
#: data/mods/TropiCataclysm/monsters/zed_plant.json
msgid "A large and muscular zombie covered in thick alien vegetation."
msgstr "地球外の植物に全身を覆われた、大柄で筋肉質なゾンビです。"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/TropiCataclysm/monsters/zed_plant.json
msgid "overgrown terror"
msgid_plural "overgrown terrors"
msgstr[0] "巨体棘蔦ゾンビ"

#. ~ Description of monster "overgrown terror"
#: data/mods/TropiCataclysm/monsters/zed_plant.json
msgid ""
"This massive muscled zombie has the equivalent of a small garden growing all"
" over its body."
msgstr "巨大なゾンビの全身に蔦が生え、小さな庭園を形作っています。"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/TropiCataclysm/monsters/zed_plant.json
msgid "forest screamer"
msgid_plural "forest screamers"
msgstr[0] "棘蔦絶叫ゾンビ"

#. ~ Description of monster "forest screamer"
#: data/mods/TropiCataclysm/monsters/zed_plant.json
msgid ""
"The plant growth on this slender zombie makes it look like some kind of "
"forest apparition.  It looks like it could throw a curse at you at any "
"moment."
msgstr "身体から植物が生えた、細長いゾンビです。その姿はまるで森の中の幽霊のようで、今にも呪いをかけてきそうです。"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/TropiCataclysm/monsters/zed_plant.json
msgid "glade banshee"
msgid_plural "glade banshees"
msgstr[0] "棘蔦悲鳴ゾンビ"

#. ~ Description of monster "glade banshee"
#: data/mods/TropiCataclysm/monsters/zed_plant.json
msgid ""
"With its ragged looks and overgrown coverage this zombie looks like a hag "
"from some cursed forest."
msgstr "植物が生い茂ったボロボロのゾンビです。まるで呪いの森の魔女のような姿です。"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/TropiCataclysm/monsters/zed_plant.json
msgid "mire walker"
msgid_plural "mire walkers"
msgstr[0] "棘蔦水泳ゾンビ"

#. ~ Description of monster "mire walker"
#: data/mods/TropiCataclysm/monsters/zed_plant.json
msgid ""
"This zombie seems to have been roaming the surrounding swamps and rivers.  "
"It has several water plants clinging to its body."
msgstr "周囲の沼地や川を動き回っていたのか、このゾンビの身体には水草が絡みついています。"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/TropiCataclysm/monsters/zed_plant.json
msgid "mangrove lurker"
msgid_plural "mangrove lurkers"
msgstr[0] "水泳涎垂ゾンビ"

#. ~ Description of monster "mangrove lurker"
#: data/mods/TropiCataclysm/monsters/zed_plant.json
msgid ""
"This zombie seems to have adapted to hunt in the water.  It uses the aquatic"
" plants on its body to hide before hitting with its teeth."
msgstr "水面移動に適応したゾンビです。身体から生えた植物を利用して隠れ、噛み付き攻撃を繰り出します。"

#. ~ Overmap terrain name
#: data/mods/TropiCataclysm/overmap/overmap_terrain/overmap_terrain_nether.json
msgid "alien reef"
msgstr "異星岩礁"

