msgid "blood_hunger"
msgstr "blood_hunger"

#. ~ Description of the "human_blood" addiction's effects as it appears in the
#. player's status
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/addictions.json
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"You suffer from a quite unnatural thirst for the blood of your fellow man.  "
"Unfortunately, the supply has shrunk by about 99% from a few months ago."
msgstr "同族の血に対する不自然なまでの渇望に苦しんでいます。残念なことに、供給量は数か月前に比べて99%ほど減少してしまっています。"

#. ~ Name of the "lotus_blossom" addiction's effect as it appears in the
#. player's status
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/addictions.json
msgid "Lotus Eater"
msgstr "睡蓮花摂取"

#. ~ The name of the "lotus_blossom" addiction's source
