msgid "lotus_eater"
msgstr "lotus_eater"

#. ~ Description of the "lotus_blossom" addiction's effects as it appears in
#. the player's status
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/addictions.json
msgid ""
"You ate the lotus, you experienced the universe.  You washed the pain away."
msgstr "睡蓮花を摂取し、宇宙を体感しました。痛みが洗い流されています。"

