#. ~ Description of effect type "Called the daffodil"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/effects.json
msgid ""
"You recently called some daffodils.  You need to wait a day before you can "
"call more."
msgstr "水仙の戦士たちを召喚したばかりです。1日経過すると再び召喚できるようになります。"

#. ~ Name of effect type id "effect_dream_drainer_speed"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/effects.json
msgid "Accelerated"
msgstr "加速"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Accelerated"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/effects.json
msgid "A burst of speed."
msgstr "爆発的な速度で動いています。"

#. ~ Name of effect type id "effect_dream_drainer_armor"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/effects.json
msgid "Armored"
msgstr "装甲"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Armored"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/effects.json
msgid "The bug is shielded.  This is a bug if you have it."
msgstr "昆虫は装甲をまとっています。通常は操作キャラクターには表示されません。"

#. ~ Name of effect type id "effect_moon_withdrawal"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/effects.json
msgid "Moon-starved"
msgstr "月光不足"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Moon-starved"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/effects.json
msgid ""
"Weakens the Luna-attuned revenant if they are out of the moonlight.  This is"
" a bug if you have it."
msgstr "月光を浴びていない月触亡霊が弱体化します。通常は操作キャラクターには表示されません。"

#. ~ Name of effect type id "last_breath_mist_cooldown"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/effects.json
msgid "Recovering from the last breath's mist"
msgstr "絶息の霧消費"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Recovering from the last breath's mist"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/effects.json
msgid ""
"Triggering your abilities that way has taken their toll on you.  You cannot "
"save yourself from death that way a second time yet."
msgstr "能力を発動し、消耗しています。今の状態では次に瀕死になっても能力が発動しません。"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Restore Flesh and Bone"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/goblin_fruit_effects.json
msgid "Your wounds are slowly healing."
msgstr "傷がゆっくりと癒されていきます。"

#. ~ Remove message of effect type "Restore Flesh and Bone"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/goblin_fruit_effects.json
msgid "Your regeneration slows down as the goblin fruit's magic fades."
msgstr "ゴブリンフルーツの効果が薄れ、回復速度が元に戻りました。"

#. ~ Spell name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/goblin_fruit_effects.json
msgid "Sweet Goblin Fruit Healing Effect"
msgstr "ゴブリンフルーツ(甘味)回復効果"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Quick Blows"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/goblin_fruit_effects.json
msgid "You can attack faster."
msgstr "より素早く攻撃できます。"

#. ~ Remove message of effect type "Quick Blows"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/goblin_fruit_effects.json
msgid "Your muscles twitch as the goblin fruit's magic fades."
msgstr "ゴブリンフルーツの効果が薄れ、筋肉がピクピクと震えました。"

#. ~ Spell name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/goblin_fruit_effects.json
