msgid "Imbuement of Parchment"
msgid_plural "Imbuement of Parchment"
msgstr[0] "毛皮の精髄"

#. ~ Description of "Imbuement of Parchment"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/alchemy.json
msgid ""
"While looking in a mirror Faewild and Dreamdross were ground to dust.  With "
"the remains of the fair, and united with a dollop of fae, and human blood.  "
"The resulting mixture will eventually dissolve into what almost looks like "
"liquid porcelain."
msgstr ""
"鏡を見ていると、妖精の粉と夢鉱が細かく砕け散りました。残骸と妖精の血、そして人間の血が混ざりあった物質は、やがて磁器を溶かしたような滑らかな液体に変じました。"

#. ~ Description of "throwing knife"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/ammo.json
msgid ""
"A thin and flat knife made for throwing.  Its ineffective cutting edge and "
"odd shape makes it unsuitable for use as a tool."
msgstr "投擲用の薄くて平らなナイフです。切れ味が悪く形状も独特なため、道具としての使用には不向きです。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/ammo.json
msgid "moon tears fastener"
msgid_plural "moon tears fasteners"
msgstr[0] "月涙鉱の留め具"

#. ~ Description of "moon tears fastener"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/ammo.json
msgid ""
"A pin-shaped piece of moon tears and dreamdross.  It can be used to repair "
"items made of moon tears."
msgstr "月涙鉱と夢鉱でできた、ピン型の留め具です。月涙鉱製のアイテムの修理に仕えます。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/ammo.json
msgid "moon tear chain link"
msgid_plural "moon tear chain links"
msgstr[0] "チェーンリンク(月涙鉱)"

#. ~ Description of "moon tear chain link"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/ammo.json
msgid ""
"Small metal rings, suitable for constructing chainmail, made from moon "
"tears."
msgstr "チェーンメイルを製作するのに適した、小さな月涙鉱製の鎖です。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/ammo.json
msgid "9x21mm Gyurza SP-10 (7N29)"
msgid_plural "9x21mm Gyurza SP-10 (7N29)"
msgstr[0] "弾薬(9x21mm/ｷﾞｭﾙｻﾞSP-10 7N29)"

#. ~ Description of "9x21mm Gyurza SP-10 (7N29)"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/ammo.json
msgid ""
"The 9×21mm Gyurza (Гюрза, Russian for 'blunt-nosed viper') round is a "
"Russian handgun round designed to defeat body armor that was developed by "
"TsNIITochMash for its SR-1 Vektor semi-automatic pistol and SR-2 Veresk "
"submachine gun.  The 7N29 AP loading fires a 6.7 g (103 gr) bullet at 410 "
"m/s (1,300 ft/s) with 560 J (410 ft⋅lb) of muzzle energy, and will "
"reportedly penetrate two 1.2 mm titanium plates, plus 30 layers of Kevlar, "
"at 50 m (160 ft).  The disadvantage of the rounds is that high impact "
"velocities are needed for them to work effectively, so the bullets are "
"relatively light to maximize their muzzle velocity.  This means they will "
"lose velocity relatively quickly, limiting their effective range."
msgstr ""
"9x21mmギュルザ(Гюрза、ロシア語でマルハナクサリヘビを指す)弾は、ツニートチマッシ社がセミオートピストルのSR-1ベクターとサブマシンガンのSR-2ベレスク用に開発した、ボディアーマーを貫通するロシア製の拳銃弾です。徹甲弾である7N29は重量6.7g(103グレーン)の弾頭を秒速410m(1300フィート)で発射し、エネルギーは560J(410ポンド・フィート)に及び、50m(160フィート)先にある厚さ1.2mmのチタン板2枚と30層のケブラー素材を突き抜けると報告されています。有効に機能するためには初速を高める必要があることが、この弾薬の欠点と言えます。重量が軽く速度が比較的早く低下してしまうため、有効射程距離は限られています。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/ammo.json
msgid "aetheric charge"
msgid_plural "aetheric charge"
msgstr[0] "エーテル"

#. ~ Description of "aetheric charge"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/ammo.json
msgid "Charged ether pulled out of the void between all things."
msgstr "万物の空隙から取り出されたエーテルです。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/ammo.json
