#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/clothes.json
msgid "slightly off t-shirt"
msgid_plural "slightly off t-shirts"
msgstr[0] "Tシャツ(歪)"

#. ~ Description of "slightly off t-shirt"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/clothes.json
msgid ""
"A short-sleeved cotton tee featuring a uniquely odd design that sets it "
"apart from any you've seen before."
msgstr "今までに見たこともない独特の奇抜なデザインが特徴的な、綿製の半袖Tシャツです。"

#. ~ Variant name of item "slightly off t-shirt"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/clothes.json
msgid "Seven Faceless Voids for Seven Brothers t-shirt"
msgid_plural "Seven Faceless Voids for Seven Brothers t-shirts"
msgstr[0] "Tシャツ(七兄弟のための七つの無貌の虚)"

#. ~ Description of variant "Seven Faceless Voids for Seven Brothers t-shirt"
#. of item "slightly off t-shirt"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/clothes.json
msgid ""
"A pink t-shirt with seven ominous figures in bridal wear facing towards "
"seven identical men.  There are tears running down from the eyes of the men."
msgstr ""
"ピンク色の生地にデザインがプリントされたTシャツです。ブライダルウェアに身を包んだ不気味な7人分の人影が、容貌が全て同じ7人の男性と対峙しています。男性たちの目からは涙が流れています。"

#. ~ Variant name of item "slightly off t-shirt"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/clothes.json
msgid "Sawzall the Musical t-shirt"
msgid_plural "Sawzall the Musical t-shirts"
msgstr[0] "Tシャツ(ｿｰｻﾞﾙ･ｻﾞ･ﾐｭｰｼﾞｶﾙ)"

#. ~ Description of variant "Sawzall the Musical t-shirt" of item "slightly
#. off t-shirt"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/clothes.json
msgid ""
"A shirt that says Sawzall the Musical in bold letters, over a giant Sawzall "
"tool."
msgstr "巨大なノコギリ型工具の上に、ソーザル・ザ・ミュージカルと太字で書かれたTシャツです。"

#. ~ Variant name of item "slightly off t-shirt"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/clothes.json
msgid "go t-shirt"
msgid_plural "go t-shirts"
msgstr[0] "Tシャツ(碁)"

#. ~ Description of variant "go t-shirt" of item "slightly off t-shirt"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/clothes.json
msgid ""
"This t-shirt displays a picture of a man standing behind a go table, the "
"text is using an unfamiliar alphabet.  His features seem subtly off."
msgstr "碁盤の前に立つ男がプリントされたTシャツです。見慣れない文字のようなものが書かれており、男の姿にもどこか違和感があります。"

#. ~ Variant name of item "slightly off t-shirt"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/clothes.json
msgid "Tachli t-shirt"
msgid_plural "Tachli t-shirts"
msgstr[0] "Tシャツ(ﾀｸﾘ)"

#. ~ Description of variant "Tachli t-shirt" of item "slightly off t-shirt"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/clothes.json
msgid ""
"A short-sleeved cotton shirt with the logo of a Tachli team printed on its "
"front and back.  It looks like it might be a violent sport."
msgstr "綿製の半袖シャツです。正面と背面にタクリのチームのロゴがプリントされています。よく分かりませんが、暴力的なスポーツのような気がします。"

#. ~ Variant name of item "slightly off t-shirt"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/clothes.json
msgid "rollerball t-shirt"
msgid_plural "rollerball t-shirts"
msgstr[0] "Tシャツ(ﾛｰﾗｰﾎﾞｰﾙ)"

#. ~ Description of variant "rollerball t-shirt" of item "slightly off
#. t-shirt"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/clothes.json
msgid ""
"A short-sleeved cotton shirt with the logo of a rollerball team, whatever "
"that is, printed on its front and back."
msgstr "綿製の半袖シャツです。正面と背面に、それが何かは分かりませんが、ローラーボールのチームのロゴがプリントされています。"

#. ~ Variant name of item "slightly off t-shirt"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/clothes.json
msgid "sunnyvale t-shirt"
msgid_plural "sunnyvale t-shirts"
msgstr[0] "Tシャツ(ｻﾆｰﾍﾞｰﾙ)"

#. ~ Description of variant "sunnyvale t-shirt" of item "slightly off t-shirt"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/clothes.json
msgid ""
"This t-shirt displays a purple sun rising over a town that looks like it "
"came out of a Doctor Seuss book."
msgstr "ドクター・スースの絵本から飛び出してきたような街の上に紫色の太陽が昇っているデザインのTシャツです。"

#. ~ Variant name of item "slightly off t-shirt"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/clothes.json
msgid "CSA t-shirt"
msgid_plural "CSA t-shirts"
msgstr[0] "Tシャツ(CSA)"

#. ~ Description of variant "CSA t-shirt" of item "slightly off t-shirt"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/clothes.json
msgid ""
"A short-sleeved cotton shirt with a globe at the bottom with a C above the "
"globe with an S to the left and A to the right.  The background is like a "
"flag with with the top left being the corner of a black triangle and the "
"bottom right is a red triangle.  They meet in the middle with the globe."
msgstr ""
"綿製の半袖シャツです。下部に地球儀、その上にC、左側にS、右側にAの文字がが描かれています。背景は、地球儀の中央で斜めに二分割するように、左上は黒、右下は赤で塗られた旗のようなものが描いてあります。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/clothes.json
msgid "gossamer tunic"
msgid_plural "gossamer tunics"
msgstr[0] "薄衣のチュニック"

#. ~ Description of "gossamer tunic"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/clothes.json
msgid ""
"A simple garment made of gossamer.  It's very light, and the fabric shimmers"
" in a rainbow of colors in the sunlight."
msgstr "薄衣で作られたシンプルな装束です。非常に軽く、太陽の光を浴びると生地が虹色に輝きます。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/clothes.json
msgid "sleeveless gossamer tunic"
msgid_plural "sleeveless gossamer tunics"
msgstr[0] "薄衣の袖無しチュニック"

#. ~ Description of "sleeveless gossamer tunic"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/clothes.json
msgid ""
"A simple, sleeveless garment made of gossamer.  It's very light, and the "
"fabric shimmers in a rainbow of colors in the sunlight."
msgstr "薄衣で作られた袖のないシンプルな装束です。非常に軽く、太陽の光を浴びると生地が虹色に輝きます。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/clothes.json
msgid "gossamer doublet"
msgid_plural "gossamer doublets"
msgstr[0] "薄衣のダブレット"

#. ~ Description of "gossamer doublet"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/clothes.json
msgid ""
"A thick overshirt of gossamer, shimmering in a rainbow of colors.  This "
"would have made you the king of the Renn Faire."
msgstr "薄衣で作られた虹色に輝く分厚い上着です。これを着れば間違いなくルネッサンス祭りの王になれます。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/clothes.json
msgid "gossamer dress"
msgid_plural "gossamer dresses"
msgstr[0] "薄衣のドレス"

#. ~ Description of "gossamer dress"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/clothes.json
msgid "A gossamer dress, shimmering in a mix of rainbow colors."
msgstr "虹色にきらめく薄衣のドレスです。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/clothes.json
msgid "gossamer evening gown"
msgid_plural "gossamer evening gowns"
msgstr[0] "薄衣のイブニングガウン"

#. ~ Description of "gossamer evening gown"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/clothes.json
msgid "A full-length gossamer gown, like a waterfall of coruscating light."
msgstr "光の滝のように見える、丈の長い薄衣のガウンです。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/clothes.json
msgid "gossamer cloak"
msgid_plural "gossamer cloaks"
msgstr[0] "薄衣のクローク"

#. ~ Description of "gossamer cloak"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/clothes.json
msgid ""
"A gossamer cloak meant to be thrown over your body.  It looks like ripples "
"of multicolored light when worn."
msgstr "羽織って着用する薄衣で作られた外套です。ひるがえすと色とりどりの光の波紋が広がります。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/clothes.json
msgid "gossamer jacket"
msgid_plural "gossamer jackets"
msgstr[0] "薄衣のジャケット"

#. ~ Description of "gossamer jacket"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/clothes.json
msgid ""
"A thin gossamer jacket.  Despite its lack of heft, its surprisingly warm."
msgstr "薄衣で作られた薄手のジャケットです。ほとんど重さを感じませんが、驚くほど暖かいです。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/clothes.json
msgid "gossamer robe"
msgid_plural "gossamer robes"
msgstr[0] "薄衣のローブ"

#. ~ Description of "gossamer robe"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/clothes.json
msgid ""
"A flowing gossamer robe, like a waterfall of light.  There are a surprising "
"amount of pockets cunningly hidden in the iridescent folds."
msgstr "光の滝のように見える、薄衣のローブです。虹色のひだの中に、驚くほど多くのポケットが巧妙に隠されています。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/clothes.json
msgid "pair of gossamer gloves"
msgid_plural "pairs of gossamer gloves"
msgstr[0] "薄衣のグローブ"

#. ~ Description of "pair of gossamer gloves"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/clothes.json
msgid "A pair of gossamer gloves."
msgstr "薄衣で作られたグローブです。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/clothes.json
msgid "gossamer breechcloth"
msgid_plural "gossamer breechcloths"
msgstr[0] "薄衣の腰布"

#. ~ Description of "gossamer breechcloth"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/clothes.json
msgid ""
"A gossamer covering for your loins, for when you want to feel like you're "
"wearing moonbeams."
msgstr "腰を覆う薄衣のグローブです。月光浴をしたい気分のときに着用しましょう。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/clothes.json
msgid "gossamer trousers"
msgid_plural "gossamer trousers"
msgstr[0] "薄衣のズボン"

#. ~ Description of "gossamer trousers"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/clothes.json
msgid "A pair of gossamer pants with two pockets.  They shimmer opalescently."
msgstr "二つのポケットが付いた薄衣のズボンです。乳白色に輝いています。"

#. ~ Item name
#. ~ Hose here refers to the Medieval clothing.
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/clothes.json
msgctxt "clothing"
msgid "gossamer hose"
msgid_plural "gossamer hose"
msgstr[0] "薄衣のショース"

#. ~ Description of "gossamer hose"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/clothes.json
msgid ""
"A pair of tight-fitting gossamer pants with no pockets.  They would have "
"been the absolute height of fashion five hundred years ago."
msgstr "ポケットのない、肌にフィットする薄衣のズボンです。500年前であれば、ファッション業界の頂点に君臨できたかもしれません。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/clothes.json
msgid "gossamer skirt"
msgid_plural "gossamer skirt"
msgstr[0] "薄衣のスカート"

#. ~ Description of "gossamer skirt"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/clothes.json
msgid "A loose gossamer skirt, like a waterfall of light."
msgstr "光の滝のように見える、ゆったりとした薄衣のスカートです。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/clothes.json
msgid "long gossamer skirt"
msgid_plural "long gossamer skirts"
msgstr[0] "薄衣のロングスカート"

#. ~ Description of "long gossamer skirt"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/clothes.json
msgid ""
"A long gossamer skirt that shimmers like a woven rainbow.  It's warmer and "
"more fashionable than a shorter gossamer skirt."
msgstr "まるで虹を編み込んであるようにきらめく、薄衣のロングスカートです。丈の短いスカートより暖かく、お洒落に見えます。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/clothes.json
msgid "pair of gossamer socks"
msgid_plural "pairs of gossamer socks"
msgstr[0] "薄衣の靴下"

#. ~ Description of "pair of gossamer socks"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/clothes.json
msgid ""
"Gossamer socks.  Whether your shoes are made of leather or canvas or "
"moonlight or nightmares, they'll keep your feet from rubbing in them."
msgstr "薄衣で作られた靴下です。履いている靴の素材が革だろうが帆布だろうが月光だろうが悪夢だろうが、靴擦れを防いでくれます。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/clothes.json
msgid "pair of gossamer stockings"
msgid_plural "pairs of gossamer stockings"
msgstr[0] "薄衣のストッキング"

#. ~ Description of "pair of gossamer stockings"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/clothes.json
msgid ""
"A pair of gossamer stockings that shimmer in a rainbow of muted colors."
msgstr "淡い虹色にきらめく薄衣のストッキングです。"

#. ~ Item name
#. ~ Custom name for recipe crafting
#. "EOC_ARVORE_TREESINGING_VERDANT_CLOAK_MANA_CHECK"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/clothes.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/recipes/paraclesians/arvore_recipes.json
msgid "verdant cloak"
msgid_plural "verdant cloaks"
msgstr[0] "新緑のクローク"

#. ~ Description of "verdant cloak"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/clothes.json
msgid ""
"A heavy cloak made of living leaves with long twigs and branches connecting "
"them, meant to be thrown over your body."
msgstr "瑞々しい葉とそれらを繋ぐ長い細枝でできた、重い外套です。胴に羽織って着用します。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/cold_iron.json
msgid "cold iron ingot"
msgid_plural "cold iron ingots"
msgstr[0] "冷鉄鋳塊"

#. ~ Description of "cold iron ingot"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/cold_iron.json
msgid "A five-liter ingot of solid cold iron."
msgstr "体積5Lの冷鉄鋳塊です。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/cold_iron.json
msgid "cold iron arming sword"
msgid_plural "cold iron arming swords"
msgstr[0] "冷鉄アーミングソード"

#. ~ Description of "cold iron arming sword"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/cold_iron.json
msgid ""
"A classic medieval sword, just the right size to use one-handed.\n"
"\n"
"Made with cold iron and lacking a proper grip, this is better than the sticks you swung around as a kid, but you know you can do better."
msgstr ""
"片手で扱うのに丁度良い拵えの、中世様式の長剣です。\n"
"\n"
"刃全体が冷鉄で作られており、柄は手にあまり馴染みません。子供が振り回す棒きれよりはマシですが、もっと品質の高い武器が欲しいものです。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/cold_iron.json
msgid "cold iron battle axe"
msgid_plural "cold iron battle axes"
msgstr[0] "冷鉄バトルアックス"

#. ~ Description of "cold iron battle axe"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/cold_iron.json
msgid ""
"A huge cold iron axe designed for early warfare.  Though intended for use as"
" a weapon, it can also be pressed into service as a rather clumsy "
"woodcutting tool."
msgstr "戦場で使うために設計された冷鉄製の巨大な斧です。武器として使うのが一般的ですが、木を伐れないこともありません。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/cold_iron.json
msgid "cold iron baselard"
msgid_plural "cold iron baselards"
msgstr[0] "冷鉄バーゼラルド"

#. ~ Description of "cold iron baselard"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/cold_iron.json
msgid ""
"A medieval dagger forged from cold iron.  It is not the sharpest tool in the"
" shed, but it is certainly one of the largest."
msgstr "冷鉄を鍛えて作った中世の短剣です。最も鋭い短剣とまでは言えませんが、最大級の短剣であることは確かです。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/containers.json
msgid "candy wrapper"
msgid_plural "candy wrappers"
msgstr[0] "包み紙"

#. ~ Description of "candy wrapper"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/containers.json
msgid ""
"\"Wyld Candy, our flavors span the possible\" is emblazoned proudly upon "
"this shiny colorful wrapper."
msgstr "「ワイルドキャンディ、可能性を広げる味」という一文が記されたカラフルな包装紙です。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/containers.json
msgid "blood bank"
msgid_plural "blood banks"
msgstr[0] "血液貯蔵瓶"

#. ~ Description of "blood bank"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/containers.json
msgid ""
"A large moon tear canteen.  It radiates the cold of the grave and smells "
"strongly of blood.  Any blood stored inside is protected from spoilage by "
"some kind of fae enchantment."
msgstr ""
"月涙鉱でできた大きな便です。墓場の冷気を放ち、血の香りを漂わせています。内部に保存されている血液は、何らかの魔法によって腐敗しないように保護されています。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/containers.json
msgid "blood camel"
msgid_plural "blood camels"
msgstr[0] "血液貯蔵タンク"

#. ~ Description of "blood camel"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/containers.json
msgid ""
"A slim and lightweight insulated moon tear bladder worn on the back or "
"within a hydration pouch in a backpack.  Perfect for the renfield on the go."
"  It has a large pocket and a capped mouth for filling with blood, with a "
"hose that allows the wearer to drink hands-free.  Any blood stored inside is"
" protected from spoilage by some kind of fae enchantment."
msgstr ""
"スリムで軽く断熱性のある、月涙鉱製の大容量血液タンクです。そのまま背負うか、バックパックのウォーターパック用ポケットに収納した状態で利用できるため、外出する吸血鬼には欠かせません。キャップ付きのホースが付いており、手を使わずに内部の血液を飲むことができます。内部に保存されている血液は、何らかの魔法によって腐敗しないように保護されています。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/corpses.json
msgid "broken sniper bot"
msgid_plural "broken sniper bots"
msgstr[0] "壊れた狙撃ロボット"

#. ~ Description of "broken sniper bot"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/corpses.json
msgid "A broken sniper bot.  Total scrap, but some stuff is still useful."
msgstr "壊れた狙撃ロボットです。どう見てもガラクタですが、役立つ部品もありそうです。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/corpses.json
msgid "broken shotgun bot"
msgid_plural "broken shotgun bots"
msgstr[0] "壊れたショットガンロボット"

#. ~ Description of "broken shotgun bot"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/corpses.json
msgid "A broken shotgun bot.  Total scrap, but some stuff is still useful."
msgstr "壊れたショットガンロボットです。どう見てもガラクタですが、役立つ部品もありそうです。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/corpses.json
msgid "broken cutthroater"
msgid_plural "broken cutthroaters"
msgstr[0] "壊れたカミソリロボット"

#. ~ Description of "broken cutthroater"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/corpses.json
msgid "A broken cutthroater.  Total scrap, but some stuff is still useful."
msgstr "壊れたカミソリロボットです。どう見てもガラクタですが、役立つ部品もありそうです。"

#. ~ Description of "broken Exodii quadruped"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/corpses.json
msgid ""
"A broken Exodii Jotunn walker.  Still looks incredibly intimidating despite "
"being permanently inoperative, due to the sheer size, mass, and protruding "
"weapons.  Could be gutted for parts."
msgstr ""
"壊れたエクゾディヨトゥンです。永久に動作不能であるにもかかわらず、その大きさや質量、特徴的な武装のせいで、依然として非常に威圧的に見えます。分解して部品を取り外せそうです。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/corpses.json
msgid "broken dreamforged automaton"
msgid_plural "broken dreamforged automatons"
msgstr[0] "壊れた暴走夢鉱人形"

#. ~ Description of "broken dreamforged automaton"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/corpses.json
msgid ""
"The automaton is now much more broken than it was before.  It resembles a "
"pile of random parts and its internals are fried beyond salvage but could be"
" gutted for materials."
msgstr ""
"動いていた頃よりもずっと酷い状態になった自動人形です。部品が乱雑に散らばり、内部は修復不可能なほど焼け焦げていますが、分解して素材を再利用できます。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/dreamsmith.json
msgid "dreamforged bed of restful repose, folded for travel"
msgid_plural "dreamforged beds of restful repose, folded for travel"
msgstr[0] "安らぎベッド(折畳)"

#. ~ Description of "dreamforged bed of restful repose, folded for travel"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/dreamsmith.json
msgid ""
"A large object folded up into a box for itself, the size of a keyboard."
msgstr "キーボードほどのサイズの箱型に折り畳まれた家具です。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/drugs.json
msgid "faewild dust"
msgid_plural "faewild dust"
msgstr[0] "妖精の粉"

#. ~ Description of "faewild dust"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/drugs.json
msgid ""
"A shimmering silvery dust.  Narcotic with the street name of Faewild.  "
"Causes the user to see colors not normally visible to the naked human eye."
msgstr "煌めく銀色の粉末は、妖精の粉という名前で知られる薬物です。人間の肉眼では見えない色が見えるようになります。"

#. ~ "activation_message" action message of item "faewild dust"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/drugs.json
msgid "You rub the glittering dust into your gums."
msgstr "キラキラと輝く粉末を歯茎にすり込みました。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/drugs.json
msgid "lotus blossom"
msgid_plural "lotus blossoms"
msgstr[0] "睡蓮花"

#. ~ Description of "lotus blossom"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/drugs.json
msgid ""
"A drug that became popular over the last few years before the Cataclysm.  It"
" appears to be exactly as its street name, a dark purple lotus blossom.  "
"It's known to be a strong painkiller while also causing vivid "
"hallucinations."
msgstr ""
"大変動が発生する数年前に流行した薬物です。その名の通り、濃い紫色のハスの花のような形状をしています。強い鎮痛効果がありますが、鮮明な幻覚を見せる作用があることで知られています。"

#. ~ "activation_message" action message of item "lotus blossom"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/drugs.json
msgid "You eat the purple lotus blossom."
msgstr "紫色の睡蓮花を摂取しました。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/drugs.json
msgid "wyld candy"
msgid_plural "wyld candies"
msgstr[0] "ワイルドキャンディ"

#. ~ Description of "wyld candy"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/drugs.json
msgid ""
"Mixed candies purporting to come from 'Fair Folk Industries' these candies "
"appear in areas of the country thought to have significant crossover events."
"  It remains unknown whether these candies are produced by a company from "
"here taking advantage of a thin place or if they came from somewhere else."
msgstr ""
"「フェア・フォーク・インダストリー」が作っているとされるミックスキャンディは、アメリカ国内の境界事件が多発している地域でよく見られます。地元企業が薄利多売で広めているのか、それとも別のどこかから流入しているのか、まったく分かりません。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/drugs.json
msgid "questionable blood treatment"
msgid_plural "questionable blood treatment"
msgstr[0] "自家製血液浄化剤"

#. ~ Description of "questionable blood treatment"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/drugs.json
msgid ""
"This homemade blood treatment purports to reduce the cravings brought on by "
"vampirism and if applied often and early to even reverse some stages of the "
"disease.  But vampires surely can't be real, can they?"
msgstr ""
"この浄化剤を使えば、吸血鬼の本能的欲求が軽減されるそうです。症状初期から頻繁に使っていれば、吸血病の症状のいくつかを克服できるとも言われています。しかし、そもそも吸血鬼なんて実在するのでしょうか？"

#. ~ "description" action message of item "questionable blood treatment"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/drugs.json
msgid "Inject the treatment."
msgstr "薬剤を注入します。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/drugs.json
msgid "cthonic poultice"
msgid_plural "cthonic poultices"
msgstr[0] "大地の湿布"

#. ~ Description of "cthonic poultice"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/drugs.json
msgid ""
"A poultice made from the elements of the earth.  You could use it to heal "
"your wounds, if you were made of stone."
msgstr "大地の素から作られた湿布です。石から生まれた存在なら、傷の治療に使えるでしょう。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/drugs.json
msgid "verdant poultice"
msgid_plural "verdant poultices"
msgstr[0] "新緑の湿布"

#. ~ Description of "verdant poultice"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/drugs.json
msgid ""
"A poultice made from plant life.  You could use it to heal your wounds, if "
"you were grown from plants."
msgstr "植物の素から作られた湿布です。草木から生まれた存在なら、傷の治療に使えるでしょう。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/drugs.json
msgid "cerulean poultice"
msgid_plural "cerulean poultices"
msgstr[0] "紺碧の湿布"

#. ~ Description of "cerulean poultice"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/drugs.json
msgid ""
"A poultice made from the elements of the sea.  You could use it to heal your"
" wounds, if you were liquid as well."
msgstr "海の素から作られた湿布です。水の肉体をもつ存在なら、傷の治療に使えるでしょう。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/drugs.json
msgid "charred sacrifice"
msgid_plural "charred sacrifice"
msgstr[0] "炭化した供物"

#. ~ Description of "charred sacrifice"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/drugs.json
msgid ""
"A devotion to the powers of fire.  You could use it to heal your wounds, if "
"you were born of the flames."
msgstr "火の力で作られた供物です。炎から生まれた存在なら、傷の治療に使えるでしょう。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/drugs.json
msgid "doll repair paste"
msgid_plural "doll repair paste"
msgstr[0] "人形修復ペースト"

#. ~ Description of "doll repair paste"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/drugs.json
msgid ""
"A paste made from paint and glue.  You could use it to heal your wounds, if "
"you were made in man's image."
msgstr "塗料と接着剤を混ぜて作ったペーストです。人間に似せて作られた存在なら、傷の治療に使えるでしょう。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/drugs.json
msgid "ethereal draught"
msgid_plural "ethereal draughts"
msgstr[0] "エーテル薬"

#. ~ Description of "ethereal draught"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/drugs.json
msgid ""
"A concoction made from honey and bread.  You could use it to heal your "
"wounds, if you were born of air and darkness."
msgstr "蜂蜜とパンから作られた水薬です。大気と闇から生まれた存在なら、傷の治療に使えるでしょう。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/drugs.json
msgid "elemental mana draught"
msgid_plural "elemental mana draughts"
msgstr[0] "マナの元素薬"

#. ~ Description of "elemental mana draught"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/drugs.json
msgid "Converting"
msgstr "改訂中"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/electronics.json
msgid "XEDRA laptop"
msgid_plural "XEDRA laptops"
msgstr[0] "XEDRAノートPC"

#. ~ Description of "XEDRA laptop"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/electronics.json
msgid ""
"A heavy, dark laptop with a swappable battery slot.  The back panel is "
"labeled \"PROPERTY OF XEDRA\".  It uses a non-standard OS, so there's not "
"much you can use it for without reinstalling it."
msgstr ""
"交換可能なバッテリースロットを備えた、背面パネルに「XEDRA備品」というラベルが貼ってある暗い色の重いノートPCです。一般的ではないOSが入っているため、再インストールせずに使える機能は多くありません。"

#. ~ "description" action message of item "XEDRA laptop"
#. ~ "description" action message of item "XEDRA laptop - lit screen"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/electronics.json
msgid ""
"You can guess a password and check some classified information, if it has "
"any."
msgstr "パスワード突破を試み、機密情報がないか調べます。"

#. ~ "menu_text" action message of item "XEDRA laptop"
#. ~ "menu_text" action message of item "XEDRA laptop - lit screen"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/electronics.json
msgid "Try to open locked folders"
msgstr "ロックされたフォルダを開く"

#. ~ "menu_text" action message of item "XEDRA laptop"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/electronics.json
msgid "You can reinstall the OS to use it as a common laptop."
msgstr "OSを再インストールすれば普通のノートPCとして使えます。"

#. ~ "msg" action message of item "XEDRA laptop"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/electronics.json
msgid "Reinstall the OS."
msgstr "OSを再インストールする。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/electronics.json
msgid "XEDRA laptop - lit screen"
msgid_plural "XEDRA laptops - lit screen"
msgstr[0] "XEDRAノートPC(ライト)"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/ethereal_items.json
msgid "blurred aura"
msgid_plural "blurred auras"
msgstr[0] "オーラ(冥暗)"

#. ~ Description of "blurred aura"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/ethereal_items.json
msgid ""
"Your edges blur and expand and contract in ways that don't reflect reality."
"  Allows you to dodge two extra attacks in a given turn."
msgstr "身体の輪郭がぼやけて伸び縮みし、実際の行動と異なる動きをしています。1ターンに2回、追加で攻撃を回避できます。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/ethereal_items.json
msgid "precognitive aura"
msgid_plural "precognitive aura"
msgstr[0] "オーラ(予知)"

#. ~ Description of "precognitive aura"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/ethereal_items.json
msgid ""
"A precognitive aura that allows you to dodge things you didn't see coming."
msgstr "予知能力をもつオーラに包まれており、予想外の事態も回避できます。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/ethereal_items.json
msgid "dreamdross rapier"
msgid_plural "dreamdross rapiers"
msgstr[0] "夢鉱レイピア"

#. ~ Description of "dreamdross rapier"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/ethereal_items.json
msgid ""
"This is a thin ephemeral sword with an ornate hand guard.  It looks like the"
" preferred weapon of gentlemen and swashbucklers.  Light and quick, it makes"
" any battle a stylish one."
msgstr "華美な鍔が付いた、紳士と剣士が好む儚げな細剣です。軽量で素早く扱えるため、どんな戦いもスタイリッシュにこなせます。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/ethereal_items.json
msgid "dreamer dagger"
msgid_plural "dreamer daggers"
msgstr[0] "夢見の短剣"

#. ~ Description of "dreamer dagger"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/ethereal_items.json
msgid ""
"This ephemeral dagger is 15 inches long from the hilt to the tip, the "
"double-edged blade itself is a pearly white color and extremely sharp."
msgstr "柄から刃先まで約38cmの長さがある、儚げな両刃の短剣です。刃はパールホワイト色をしており、非常に鋭く研がれています。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/ethereal_items.json
msgid "dream armor"
msgid_plural "dream armor"
msgstr[0] "夢の鎧"

#. ~ Description of "dream armor"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/ethereal_items.json
msgid ""
"A summoned medieval armor made from dreamdross.  It shimmers in the light "
"and provides some protection."
msgstr "召喚して着用する、夢鉱で作られた鎧です。ある程度の防御力が備わっており、光に照らされるとキラキラと輝きます。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/ethereal_items.json
msgid "Drunken Master aura"
msgid_plural "Drunken Master auras"
msgstr[0] "オーラ(成龍酔拳)"

#. ~ Description of "Drunken Master aura"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/ethereal_items.json
msgid "Hey I thought this was America…"
msgstr "へえ、ここはアメリカだと思ってたんだがな..."

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/ethereal_items.json
msgid "Oneiric Hammer"
msgid_plural "Oneiric Hammers"
msgstr[0] "夢幻の鎚"

#. ~ Description of "Oneiric Hammer"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/ethereal_items.json
msgid ""
"The platonic embodiment of a blacksmiths hammer.  This hammer is necessary "
"to forge or repair items made of forged dreamstuff."
msgstr "鍛冶屋の鎚の概念を具現化したものです。夢の素材を使ったアイテムの鍛造や修復に必要です。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/ethereal_items.json
msgid "constructed hammer"
msgid_plural "constructed hammers"
msgstr[0] "夢鉱ハンマー"

#. ~ Description of "constructed hammer"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/ethereal_items.json
msgid ""
"A long handle ending in a two-sided head, one of which is hollow, and the "
"other… does not exist.  Weirdly, both heads are equally useful, and the "
"balance of hammer is pretty good to be useful as a weapon.  By activating "
"and attacking with the hollow part, the hammer creates a tremendous force, "
"able to break a thick tree (or someone's spine) in half, but will be "
"destroyed afterwards."
msgstr ""
"長い柄の先はハンマーのようになっており、ヘッドの片側は中空、もう片側には...何もありません。不思議なことに、どちら側も同じように使えるので、振り回しやすい武器として有用です。起動すると中空部分に膨大な力が集まり、太い樹木(もしくは敵の背骨)を真っ二つに折るほどの攻撃力を一度だけ発揮します。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/ethereal_items.json
msgid "constructed winch"
msgid_plural "constructed winches"
msgstr[0] "引寄石"

#. ~ Description of "constructed winch"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/ethereal_items.json
msgid ""
"A small token that floats near your right hand.  It pulls you to determined "
"coordinates when you command it."
msgstr "右手付近に浮遊している小さな石です。使用者を特定の座標に転移させます。"

#. ~ "description" action message of item "constructed winch"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/ethereal_items.json
msgid "Jump."
msgstr "転移します。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/armor/integrated.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/ethereal_items.json
msgid "water pocket"
msgid_plural "water pockets"
msgstr[0] "水袋"

#. ~ Description of "water pocket"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/ethereal_items.json
msgid ""
"A large pouch of churning water on your back, containing a sealed air "
"bubble.  It shifts and adjusts itself to minimize encumbrance."
msgstr "内部に気泡が入った大きな水の袋が、背中でプルプルと揺れています。荷物を入れると自動的に位置を調整し、負担を最小限に抑えます。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/ethereal_items.json
msgid "Tongues of Flame"
msgid_plural "Tongues of Flames"
msgstr[0] "焔の舌"

#. ~ Description of "Tongues of Flame"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/ethereal_items.json
msgid ""
"A long whip made of red-hot fire.  It crackles menacingly and casts a "
"flickering red glow."
msgstr "赤熱した炎から作られた長い鞭です。威嚇するようにパチパチと音を立て、赤い光を揺らめかせています。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/ethereal_items.json
msgid "undine waters map"
msgid_plural "undine waters maps"
msgstr[0] "ウンディーネ流域図"

#. ~ Description of "undine waters map"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/ethereal_items.json
msgid "The item for ."
msgstr "アイテムです。"

#. ~ "message" action message of item "undine waters map"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/ethereal_items.json
msgid "The waters reveal themselves to you."
msgstr "流水域の位置が明らかになりました。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/ethereal_items.json
msgid "vegetal sphere"
msgid_plural "vegetal spheres"
msgstr[0] "保存の編籠"

#. ~ Description of "vegetal sphere"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/ethereal_items.json
msgid ""
"A large, hollow sphere of plant matter, bark, and wood.  Food placed inside "
"will rot one-fifth as fast as it would if left out in the open air."
msgstr "草の葉や樹皮、枝で作られた、大きな中空の球体です。中に収納した食べ物は、腐敗までの速度が屋外に放置した食べ物の1/5に軽減されます。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/ethereal_items.json
msgid "invulnerable iron skin"
msgid_plural "invulnerable iron skin"
msgstr[0] "不滅の鉄皮"

#. ~ Description of "invulnerable iron skin"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/ethereal_items.json
msgid "The essence of iron."
msgstr "鉄のエッセンスをまとっています。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/ethereal_items.json
msgid "ierde map"
msgid_plural "ierde maps"
msgstr[0] "エルデの地図"

#. ~ Description of "treesung wardrobe"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/furniture_items.json
msgid ""
"A very large wooden cabinet for storing clothes, effectively an upright "
"closet.  It's all made of a single, solid piece of wood, with twists and "
"curves like it grew in place rather than being made."
msgstr ""
"衣類を収納するための、非常に大きな木製の棚、いわば縦長のクローゼットです。全体が一つの木からできており、まるで樹木がそのまま成長してこの形になったかのようです。あちこちが捻じれて曲線を描いています。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/furniture_items.json
msgid "treesung wooden table"
msgid_plural "treesung wooden tables"
msgstr[0] "森のテーブル"

#. ~ Magazine name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/gun_magazine.json
msgid "SR-1 Vektor 18-round magazine"
msgid_plural "SR-1 Vektor 18-round magazines"
msgstr[0] "弾倉(9x21mm/SR-1ﾍﾞｸﾀｰ)"

#. ~ Description of magazine "SR-1 Vektor 18-round magazine"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/gun_magazine.json
msgid "An 18-round box magazine for use with the SR-1 Vektor 9x21mm pistol."
msgstr "9x21mmSR-1ベクターハンドガンに対応する18発箱型弾倉です。"

#. ~ Magazine name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/gun_magazine.json
msgid "AA-12 8-round box magazine"
msgid_plural "AA-12 8-round box magazines"
msgstr[0] "弾倉(12ga/AA-12/8発)"

#. ~ Description of magazine "AA-12 8-round box magazine"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/gun_magazine.json
msgid ""
"A removable plastic 8-round box magazine, for use with the AA-12 shotgun."
msgstr "AA-12ショットガンに対応する、12ゲージ弾を8発装填できる着脱式のプラスチック製箱型弾倉です。"

#. ~ Magazine name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/gun_magazine.json
msgid "AA-12 32-round drum magazine"
msgid_plural "AA-12 32-round drum magazines"
msgstr[0] "弾倉(12ga/AA-12/32発)"

#. ~ Description of magazine "AA-12 32-round drum magazine"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/gun_magazine.json
msgid ""
"A removable plastic 32-round drum magazine, for use with the HAMMER dual "
"AA-12 turret system."
msgstr "2丁のAA-12を備えたタレットに対応する、12ゲージ弾を32発装填できる着脱式のプラスチック製ドラム型弾倉です。"

#. ~ Magazine name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/gun_magazine.json
msgid "AA-12 vehicle drum magazine"
msgid_plural "AA-12 vehicle drum magazines"
msgstr[0] "弾倉(12ga/AA-12/64発)"

#. ~ Description of magazine "AA-12 vehicle drum magazine"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/gun_magazine.json
msgid ""
"A removable plastic 64-round drum magazine, for use with the AA-12 shotgun."
msgstr "AA-12ショットガンに対応する、12ゲージ弾を64発装填できる着脱式のプラスチック製ドラム型弾倉です。"

#. ~ Gun mod name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/gunmod.json
msgid "FN integral suppressor"
msgid_plural "FN integral suppressors"
msgstr[0] "FN内蔵サプレッサー"

#. ~ Description of gun mod "FN integral suppressor"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/gunmod.json
msgid ""
"This is the integrated suppressor for the FN Five-seveN suppressor.  Its "
"large expansion chamber decelerates ammunition via several ports in the "
"barrel, rendering most ammo subsonic at the cost of terminal performance.  "
"It is not as effective as modern designs."
msgstr ""
"FNのファイブセブンに内蔵されたサプレッサーです。大きな拡張銃身内の複数の空気室を介すことで、弾薬の威力を犠牲にして亜音速まで減速させます。最新のものほど効果的ではありません。"

#. ~ Name of a gun
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/guns.json
msgid "FN Five-seveN suppressor"
msgid_plural "FN Five-seveN suppressors"
msgstr[0] "ハンドガン(5.7mm/FNﾌｧｲﾌﾞｾﾌﾞﾝｻﾌﾟﾚｯｻｰ)"

#. ~ Description of gun "FN Five-seveN suppressor"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/guns.json
msgid ""
"Designed to work with FN's proprietary 5.7x28mm round and with a built in "
"suppressor, the Five-seveN is a lightweight integrally suppressed pistol "
"with a very high capacity, best used against armored opponents."
msgstr ""
"FN社独自の5.7x28mm弾に対応する、サプレッサーを内蔵したピストルです。軽量で装弾数が非常に高く、武装した敵に対して使うのが有効です。"

#. ~ Name of a gun
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/guns.json
msgid "SR-1 Vektor Gyurza"
msgid_plural "SR-1 Vektor Gyurza"
msgstr[0] "ハンドガン(9x21mm/SR-1ﾍﾞｸﾀｰ ｷﾞｭﾙｻﾞ)"

#. ~ Description of gun "SR-1 Vektor Gyurza"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/guns.json
msgid ""
"The SR-1 Vektor also known as the Gyurza (Гюрза, Russian for 'blunt-nosed "
"viper') or Serdyukov SPS is a 9×21mm Gyurza semi-automatic pistol designed "
"for the Russian military.  It fires 9x21mm ammunition, which is rare in the "
"States."
msgstr ""
"ギュルザ(Гюрза、ロシア語でマルハナクサリヘビという意味)という別名でも知られるSR-1ベクター、あるいはセルジュコフSPSは、ロシア製の軍用9x21mmセミオートピストルです。アメリカ国内では珍しい9x21mm弾を発射します。"

#. ~ Name of a gun
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/guns.json
msgid "Auto Assault-12"
msgid_plural "Auto Assault-12s"
msgstr[0] "ショットガン(12ga/AA-12)"

#. ~ Description of gun "Auto Assault-12"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/guns.json
msgid ""
"The Atchisson Assault Shotgun, is an automatic combat shotgun developed in "
"1972 by Maxwell Atchisson.  The most prominent feature is reduced recoil."
msgstr ""
"アッチソン・アサルトショットガンは、1972年にマックスウェル・アッチソンが開発したフルオートコンバットショットガンです。反動をほとんど感じない点が特徴です。"

#. ~ Name of a gun
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/guns.json
msgid "HAMMER dual AA-12 turret system"
msgid_plural "HAMMER dual AA-12 turret systems"
msgstr[0] "ショットガン(12ga/HAMMERﾃﾞｭｱﾙAA-12ﾀﾚｯﾄｼｽﾃﾑ)"

#. ~ Description of gun "HAMMER dual AA-12 turret system"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/guns.json
msgid ""
"An electrically driven dual AA-12s mounted together to match to a turret."
msgstr "専用の電動式AA-12を2丁搭載したタレットです。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/hedge_magic_items.json
msgid "Rain Ward"
msgid_plural "Rain Wards"
msgstr[0] "水濡れ除けの守り"

#. ~ Description of "Rain Ward"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/hedge_magic_items.json
msgid "Thanks to the words of the charm you spoke, you won't get wet."
msgstr "まじないの効果によって、肉体が水に濡れなくなっています。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/hedge_magic_items.json
msgid "Witchlight"
msgid_plural "Witchlights"
msgstr[0] "ウィッチライト"

#. ~ Description of "Witchlight"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/hedge_magic_items.json
msgid "A bobbing ball of blueish-green light, just bright enough to read by."
msgstr "青緑色の揺らめく光球です。読書をするのに十分足りる明るさを確保できます。"

#. ~ "description" action message of item "Witchlight"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/hedge_magic_items.json
msgid "Dismiss the witchlight"
msgstr "ウィッチライトを消します。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/hedge_magic_items.json
msgid "life of the crops"
msgid_plural "life of the crops"
msgstr[0] "命の種"

#. ~ Description of "life of the crops"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/hedge_magic_items.json
msgid "Use this to fertilize your crops."
msgstr "使用すると作物の肥料になります。"

#. ~ Item name
#. ~ Spell name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/hedge_magic_items.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/spells/hedge_magic_spells.json
msgid "To Kindle the Flames"
msgid_plural "To Kindle the Flames"
msgstr[0] "火付けのまじない"

#. ~ Description of "To Kindle the Flames"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/hedge_magic_items.json
msgid ""
"The item that starts fires when using To Kindle the Flames.  This should be "
"summoned and deleted as part of the spell, so you should never actually see "
"it."
msgstr "火付けのまじないを詠唱すると火を生成するアイテムです。呪文効果の一部として生成してから削除するため、通常は表示されません。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/hedge_magic_items.json
msgid "Faesight Charm"
msgid_plural "Faesight Charms"
msgstr[0] "異人探しのお守り"

#. ~ Description of "Faesight Charm"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/hedge_magic_items.json
msgid ""
"A small sack with herbs in it to warn you if the Fair Folk are nearby.  You "
"had better wear it under your clothes.  You wouldn't want them to know "
"you're avoiding them.  It's awaiting you to speak the final words of the "
"charm and activate it."
msgstr ""
"こことは異なる世界に棲むものが近付くと警告を発する、薬草が入った小さな袋です。避けていることを知られたら気を悪くするかもしれないので、服の下に隠しておきましょう。まじないの最後の言葉が唱えられるのを待っています。"

#. ~ "msg" action message of item "Faesight Charm"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/hedge_magic_items.json
msgid "You recite that last part of the charm."
msgstr "まじないの最後の言葉を唱えて、お守りを完成させました。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/hedge_magic_items.json
msgid "Faesight Charm (active)"
msgid_plural "Faesight Charms (active)"
msgstr[0] "異人探しのお守り(起動)"

#. ~ Description of "Faesight Charm (active)"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/hedge_magic_items.json
msgid ""
"A small sack with herbs in it to warn you if the Fair Folk are nearby.  You "
"had better wear it under your clothes.  You wouldn't want them to know "
"you're avoiding them."
msgstr ""
"こことは異なる世界に棲むものが近付くと警告を発する、薬草が入った小さな袋です。避けていることを知られたら気を悪くするかもしれないので、服の下に隠しておきましょう。"

#. ~ Dying message of tool "Faesight Charm (active)"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/hedge_magic_items.json
msgid "Your otherworldly senses fade."
msgstr "現実世界の外に棲むものを感知する力が薄れてきました。"

#. ~ Description of "Faesight Charm"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/hedge_magic_items.json
msgid ""
"A small sack with herbs in it to warn you if the Fair Folk are nearby.  You "
"had better wear it under your clothes.  You wouldn't want them to know "
"you're avoiding them.  This charm seems lifeless somehow, its energy spent."
msgstr ""
"こことは異なる世界に棲むものが近付くと警告を発する、薬草が入った小さな袋です。避けていることを知られたら気を悪くするかもしれないので、服の下に隠しておきましょう。力を失って萎れているように見えます。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/hedge_magic_items.json
msgid "betweener's maze"
msgid_plural "betweener's mazes"
msgstr[0] "境界者の迷路"

#. ~ Description of "betweener's maze"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/hedge_magic_items.json
msgid ""
"A yarn contraption similar to a cat's cradle that looks like a three "
"dimensional maze.  When placed properly, it can fascinate the changeling "
"blooded."
msgstr "あやとりに似た立体的な毛糸の仕掛けです。適切に設置すると、チェンジリングを捕えることができます。"

#. ~ "done_message" action message of item "betweener's maze"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/hedge_magic_items.json
msgid "You place the betweener's maze."
msgstr "境界者の迷路を設置しました。"

#. ~ Description of "Blood-and-Ash Paste"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/hedge_magic_items.json
msgid ""
"A disgusting mixture of blood, ashes, and certain herbs.  Using it will "
"allow you to see otherworldly creatures even through walls or in darkness."
msgstr "血、灰、ある種の薬草が混じった気味の悪いペーストです。使用すると、暗闇や壁越しでも異界の存在を感知できるようになります。"

#. ~ "description" action message of item "Blood-and-Ash Paste"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/hedge_magic_items.json
msgid "Rub the paste on your eyes."
msgstr "ペーストを両目に塗り込みます。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/hedge_magic_items.json
msgid "Curative tea"
msgid_plural "Curative teas"
msgstr[0] "悪疫封じの薬茶"

#. ~ Description of "Curative tea"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/hedge_magic_items.json
msgid ""
"Tea with herbs, iron, and a bit of magick.  If you're sick, there's nothing "
"better for your body than this."
msgstr "薬草、鉄分、そして少しの魔法を加えたお茶です。病気に罹っているなら、これほど効果的な飲み物はありません。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/hedge_magic_items.json
msgid "drained bearskin talisman"
msgid_plural "drained bearskin talismans"
msgstr[0] "変化の熊皮(使用済)"

#. ~ Description of "drained bearskin talisman"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/hedge_magic_items.json
msgid ""
"A heavy fur mantle attached to the skull of a bear.  The charm worked into "
"it has been expended."
msgstr "重い毛皮のマントが取り付けられたクマの頭蓋骨です。魔法の効果は失われています。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/hedge_magic_items.json
msgid "bearskin talisman"
msgid_plural "bearskin talismans"
msgstr[0] "変化の熊皮"

#. ~ Description of "bearskin talisman"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/hedge_magic_items.json
msgid ""
"A heavy fur mantle attached to the skull of a bear.  When you put it on, the"
" charm will take effect and grant you the bear's power."
msgstr "重い毛皮のマントが取り付けられたクマの頭蓋骨です。着用すると、魔法の効果によってクマの力を得られます。"

#. ~ "description" action message of item "bearskin talisman"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/hedge_magic_items.json
msgid "Activate to remove the mantle and end the magic."
msgstr "着用している熊皮を外し、魔法の効果を終了させます。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/melee.json
msgid "glasknife"
msgid_plural "glasknives"
msgstr[0] "結晶ナイフ"

#. ~ Description of "glasknife"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/melee.json
msgid ""
"This is a knife that seems to be made of glass, but significantly more "
"durable, like some sort of crystal with the strength of metal."
msgstr "ガラスのような素材で作られたナイフです。結晶は金属と同じくらいの強度があり、ガラスよりもはるかに高い耐久性を備えています。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/melee.json
msgid "mirrored estoc"
msgid_plural "mirrored estocs"
msgstr[0] "鏡のエストック"

#. ~ Description of "mirrored estoc"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/melee.json
msgid ""
"A thin piercing sword no wider than two fingers side by side, it's mirrored "
"surface reflects the world back at it's wielders opponents and is difficult "
"to see to parry.  You've never felt a sword like this before."
msgstr ""
"指2本分ほどの幅しかない細身の剣です。鏡のような表面が周囲を映し出すことで、剣筋を読ませず、受け流すのが困難になります。このような使い心地の剣は今まで触れたことがありません。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/melee.json
msgid "frostrimed estoc"
msgid_plural "frostrimed estocs"
msgstr[0] "氷霜のエストック"

#. ~ Description of "frostrimed estoc"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/melee.json
msgid ""
"This sword is covered in shifting frost and seems to move of its own "
"volition in your hands."
msgstr "剣の表面を覆う霜は、手にするとまるで意志があるように揺らめきます。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/melee.json
msgid "redcap club"
msgid_plural "redcap clubs"
msgstr[0] "レッドキャップの棍棒"

#. ~ Description of "redcap club"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/melee.json
msgid ""
"A giant bloodstained club, barely human wieldable with two hands.  You see "
"shadowy tendrils of blood whenever it connects with an enemy, sticking to "
"whatever it hits and burning like acid."
msgstr "片手ではとても扱えそうにない、巨大な血染めの棍棒です。殴った瞬間に棍棒から血の触手が飛び出し、敵に貼りついて酸のように焼き焦がします。"

#. ~ Spell name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/melee.json
msgid "Blood Tendrils"
msgstr "血の触手"

#. ~ Description of spell "Blood Tendrils"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/melee.json
msgid "Brownish reddish tendrils connect from the club to your enemies."
msgstr "茶色がかった赤色の触手が棍棒から飛び出し、敵を捕らえます。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/melee.json
msgid "pooka gladius"
msgid_plural "pooka gladii"
msgstr[0] "プーカのグラディウス"

#. ~ Description of "pooka gladius"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/melee.json
msgid ""
"A gladius covered in the whorls of Celtic knots.  Sparks seems to pop off "
"the edge of the blade."
msgstr "渦を巻くケルトの紋様で覆われた剣です。刃先から火花が散っているように見えます。"

#. ~ Spell name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/melee.json
msgid "Distant Thunder"
msgstr "雷飛ばし"

#. ~ Description of spell "Distant Thunder"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/melee.json
msgid "Sparks zap at your opponent."
msgstr "標的めがけて電撃を飛ばします。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/melee.json
msgid "dreamdross knife"
msgid_plural "dreamdross knives"
msgstr[0] "夢鉱張りナイフ"

#. ~ Description of "dreamdross knife"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/melee.json
msgid ""
"Covered with thin layer of dreamdross, this knife is a light and sharp tool "
"to work with."
msgstr "薄い夢鉱で覆われた、軽く切れ味のいいナイフです。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/melee.json
msgid "dreamdross club"
msgid_plural "dreamdross clubs"
msgstr[0] "夢鉱張り棍棒"

#. ~ Description of "dreamdross club"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/melee.json
msgid ""
"It was a good tool before, but now it's covered with a thick layer of "
"dreamdross, and it works as a light but deadly weapon."
msgstr "便利な道具を分厚い夢鉱で覆い、軽量で致命的な武器に作り替えました。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/melee.json
msgid "dreamdrossed quarterstaff"
msgid_plural "dreamdrossed quarterstaves"
msgstr[0] "夢鉱張りクォータースタッフ"

#. ~ Description of "dreamdrossed quarterstaff"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/melee.json
msgid ""
"A long stick that's been covered with dreamdross, but lacks any magical "
"properties."
msgstr "両端が夢鉱で覆われた長い棒です。魔法の効果はありません。"

#. ~ Item name
#. ~ Custom name for recipe crafting "dreamforged_q_staff_ench"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/melee.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/recipes/dreamforged_weapon.json
msgid "dreamforged quarterstaff"
msgid_plural "dreamforged quarterstaves"
msgstr[0] "夢鉱クォータースタッフ"

#. ~ Description of "dreamforged quarterstaff"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/melee.json
msgid ""
"A long quarterstaff, forged entirely from dreamdross.  Twice as heavy than a"
" wooden one, but lot sturdier, and still useful as a weapon.  The dreamdross"
" grants it some minor magical properties, but you can't control their "
"effects."
msgstr ""
"純粋な夢鉱を鍛えて作った長いクォータースタッフです。木製のものの約2倍の重量がありますが、頑丈さも増しており、武器として使えます。夢鉱の弱い魔法が宿っていますが、効果を自在に引き出すことはできません。"

