msgstr "鮮やかな緑色の付箋です。"

#. ~ Description of "post-it note"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/notes_and_news.json
msgid "A bright gray post-it note."
msgstr "明るい灰色の付箋です。"

#. ~ Description of "post-it note"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/notes_and_news.json
msgid "A bright pink post-it note."
msgstr "鮮やかなピンク色の付箋です。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/notes_and_news.json
msgid "museum plaque"
msgid_plural "museum plaques"
msgstr[0] "展示プレート"

#. ~ Description of "museum plaque"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/notes_and_news.json
msgid "A paper plaque.  It has words printed on it."
msgstr "文字がプリントされている、紙製の展示プレートです。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/pets.json
msgid "purity crackers"
msgid_plural "purity crackers"
msgstr[0] "ピュリティクラッカー"

#. ~ Description of "purity crackers"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/pets.json
msgid ""
"An incredibly hard cracker.  Squeezing it in your hand it feels as though "
"your teeth might break before the cracker does.  The packaging on the side "
"shows a tall being feeding these crackers to a horned and four legged "
"creature."
msgstr ""
"手でも割れにくく、噛めば前歯が折れてしまいそうなほど硬いクラッカーです。パッケージの側面には、角をもつ四足歩行生物にこのクラッカーを食べさる背の高い人物が描かれています。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/pets.json
msgid "golden bridle"
msgid_plural "golden bridles"
msgstr[0] "金の頭絡"

#. ~ Description of "golden bridle"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/pets.json
msgid ""
"A golden bridle made of spun moon tears, gold, and incredibly strong hair "
"including associated tack that can be placed on a tamed mythical animal that"
" is capable of being ridden."
msgstr "月涙鉱と金と非常に丈夫な毛で作られた、黄金に輝く頭絡と手綱です。手懐けた神話生物に装着すれば、騎乗できるようになります。"

#. ~ Name of a gun
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/range.json
msgid "dreamforged bow"
msgid_plural "dreamforged bows"
msgstr[0] "夢鉱弓"

#. ~ Description of gun "dreamforged bow"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/range.json
msgid ""
"A six-foot bow, forged entirely from dreamdross, including its strings.  "
"Primitive look, devastating power."
msgstr "弦も含め全て夢鉱から鍛造された、全長約1.8mの弓です。見た目は原始的ですが、破壊的な威力をもたらします。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/range.json
msgid "dreamforged arrow"
msgid_plural "dreamforged arrows"
msgstr[0] "矢(夢鉱)"

#. ~ Description of "dreamforged arrow"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/range.json
msgid "A dreamforged arrow with a razor-sharp tip."
msgstr "先端がカミソリのように鋭く尖った夢鉱製の矢です。"

#. ~ Name of a gun
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/range.json
msgid "dreamforged crossbow"
msgid_plural "dreamforged crossbows"
msgstr[0] "夢鉱クロスボウ"

#. ~ Description of gun "dreamforged crossbow"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/range.json
msgid ""
"A medieval crossbow, forged entirely from dreamdross, including its strings."
"  Probably not the optimal weapon in our modern world, but still capable of "
"doing devastating damage while being completely silent."
msgstr ""
"弦も含め全て夢鉱から鍛造された、中世風のクロスボウです。現代世界で最適な射撃武器とは言えませんが、それでも全く音を立てずに壊滅的なダメージを与えられる武器は貴重です。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/range.json
msgid "dreamforged bolt"
msgid_plural "dreamforged bolts"
msgstr[0] "ボルト(夢鉱)"

#. ~ Description of "dreamforged bolt"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/range.json
msgid "A dreamforged crossbow bolt with broadhead tip."
msgstr "放射状に広がる鋭い矢尻が先端に付いた、夢鉱製のボルトです。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/resources.json
msgid "moon tears ingot"
msgid_plural "moon tears ingots"
msgstr[0] "月涙鉱鋳塊"

#. ~ Description of "moon tears ingot"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/resources.json
msgid ""
"An ingot of moon tears.  About 3cm by 7cm by 12cm in size, ready to be used "
"for various blacksmithing tasks."
msgstr "月涙鉱の鋳塊です。サイズは約3cm×7cm×12cmで、そのまま様々な鍛冶作業に使えます。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/resources.json
msgid "moon tear wire"
msgid_plural "moon tear wires"
msgstr[0] "ワイヤー(月涙鉱)"

#. ~ Description of "moon tear wire"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/resources.json
msgid "A length of thin, relatively stiff moon tear wire."
msgstr "比較的硬く細い、月涙鉱製のワイヤーです。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/resources.json
msgid "scrap moon tears"
msgid_plural "scraps of moon tears"
msgstr[0] "月涙鉱屑"

#. ~ Description of "scrap moon tears"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/resources.json
msgid ""
"A bulky assortment of small bits of scrap moon tears, useful for forging "
"into ingots and wire."
msgstr "月涙鉱の小片を集めたものです。鋳塊やワイヤーの製作に役立ちます。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/resources.json
msgid "scrap shadowstuff"
msgid_plural "scraps of shadowstuff"
msgstr[0] "影の欠片"

#. ~ Description of "scrap shadowstuff"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/resources.json
msgid ""
"A bulky assortment of small bits of scrap shadowstuff, possibly useful in "
"ephemeral crafting."
msgstr "影の小片を集めたものです。中間素材の製作に役立ちます。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/resources.json
msgid "chunk shadowstuff"
msgid_plural "scraps of shadowstuff"
msgstr[0] "影の小塊"

#. ~ Description of "chunk shadowstuff"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/resources.json
msgid ""
"A bulky assortment of larger bits of scrap shadowstuff, possibly useful in "
"ephemeral crafting."
msgstr "影の塊を集めたものです。中間素材の製作に役立ちます。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/resources.json
msgid "scrap dreamdross"
msgid_plural "scraps of dreamdross"
msgstr[0] "夢鉱屑"

#. ~ Description of "scrap dreamdross"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/resources.json
msgid ""
"A bulky assortment of small bits of scrap dreamdross, useful in all kinds of"
" ephemeral crafting."
msgstr "夢鉱の小片を集めたものです。夢鉱製アイテムの製作材料として使います。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/resources.json
msgid "lump of dreamdross"
msgid_plural "lumps of dreamdross"
msgstr[0] "夢鉱塊"

#. ~ Description of "lump of dreamdross"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/resources.json
msgid "A heavy formed piece of dreamdross.  Useful for some crafting recipes."
msgstr "非常に重い夢鉱の塊です。アイテム製作の材料として使います。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/resources.json
msgid "dreamdross ingot"
msgid_plural "dreamdross ingots"
msgstr[0] "夢鉱鋳塊"

#. ~ Description of "dreamdross ingot"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/resources.json
msgid ""
"A forged ingot of dreamdross.  About 3cm by 7cm by 12cm in size, ready to be"
" used for various reality forging tasks."
msgstr "夢鉱の鋳塊です。サイズは約3cm×7cm×12cmで、そのまま様々な鍛冶作業に使えます。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/resources.json
msgid "tanned glimmer fur pelt"
msgid_plural "tanned glimmer fur pelts"
msgstr[0] "光輝鞣毛皮"

#. ~ Description of "tanned glimmer fur pelt"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/resources.json
msgid ""
"A folded sheet of glimmer fur made from carefully tanned fae animal pelt.  "
"Can be cut up or used as is."
msgstr "丁寧に鞣し加工された妖魔由来の毛皮を折り畳んだものです。小さく切断して使うこともできます。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/resources.json
msgid "tanning glimmer fur pelt"
msgid_plural "tanning glimmer fur pelts"
msgstr[0] "光輝粗毛皮(鞣し加工中)"

#. ~ Description of "tanning glimmer fur pelt"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/resources.json
msgid ""
"A treated fae animal pelt that is undergoing the chemical processes required"
" to become fur.  You will be able to activate it to unroll and make use of "
"it when it is done."
msgstr "素材として使うために必要な化学処理を施した妖魔の毛皮です。使用すると毛皮を広げ、他の用途に使える状態にします。"

#. ~ "msg" action message of item "tanning glimmer fur pelt"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/resources.json
msgid "You carefully unfold the tanning fae fur pelt and shake it clean."
msgstr "鞣した光輝毛皮を慎重に広げ、揺すって綺麗にしました。"

#. ~ "not_ready_msg" action message of item "tanning glimmer fur pelt"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/resources.json
msgid "The tanning fae fur pelt isn't done yet."
msgstr "光輝毛皮はまだ鞣し終えていません。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/resources.json
msgid "cured glimmer pelt"
msgid_plural "cured glimmer pelts"
msgstr[0] "光輝粗毛皮(乾燥)"

#. ~ Description of "cured glimmer pelt"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/resources.json
msgid ""
"A rolled-up fae animal hide which has been scraped of extraneous hair and "
"flesh and treated to prevent decay.  It still requires tanning to become "
"usable fur."
msgstr "妖魔の毛皮の皮下組織をこそげ落とし、防腐処理を施して丸めたものです。これを鞣し加工することで、素材として利用できる毛皮になります。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/resources.json
msgid "gossamer sheet"
msgid_plural "gossamer sheets"
msgstr[0] "生地(薄衣)"

#. ~ Description of "gossamer sheet"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/resources.json
msgid ""
"A 12-inch by 24-inch sheet of gossamer fabric, like a swatch plucked from a "
"rainbow."
msgstr "縦約61cm、横約30cmの、虹を切り取って作ったような薄衣の生地です。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/resources.json
msgid "patchwork gossamer sheet"
msgid_plural "patchwork gossamer sheets"
msgstr[0] "継ぎ生地(薄衣)"

#. ~ Description of "patchwork gossamer sheet"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/resources.json
msgid ""
"A 12-inch by 24-inch sheet of gossamer sewn together from patches of various"
" clothing parts.  Suitable for making clothing if you lack proper material "
"sheets."
msgstr ""
"縦約61cm、横約30cmの、様々な衣類から切り取った薄衣の端切れを縫い合わせて作った生地です。服作りで材料となる生地が無いときに役立ちます。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/resources.json
msgid "gossamer patch"
msgid_plural "gossamer patches"
msgstr[0] "端切れ(薄衣)"

#. ~ Description of "gossamer patch"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/resources.json
msgid ""
"A 6-inch square gossamer patch, suitable for repairing and tailoring "
"clothing."
msgstr "約16cm四方の薄衣の端切れです。衣服の修復や製作に役立ちます。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/resources.json
msgid "gossamer scraps"
msgid_plural "gossamer scraps"
msgstr[0] "布屑(薄衣)"

#. ~ Description of "gossamer scraps"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/resources.json
msgid "Filmy bits of gossamer, barely there.  Not useful for much."
msgstr "非常に細かい薄衣の断片です。あまり役には立ちません。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/resources.json
msgid "gossamer gambeson batting"
msgid_plural "clumps of gossamer gambeson batting"
msgstr[0] "薄衣のギャンベソン用中綿"

#. ~ Description of "gossamer gambeson batting"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/resources.json
msgid ""
"A pile of shredded gossamer, like wisps of solid moonlight, which could be "
"used to stuff the fabric layers of a gambeson."
msgstr "月の光が形を成したような、細かく裂いた薄衣の山です。ギャンベソンの中綿として使えそうです。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/resources.json
msgid "treesung log"
msgid_plural "treesung logs"
msgstr[0] "森の丸太"

#. ~ Description of "treesung log"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/resources.json
msgid "A large log of living wood, sung from a tree by elemental magick."
msgstr "木々の歌の魔法によって樹木から生成された、瑞々しく大きな丸太です。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/resources.json
msgid "chunk of obsidian"
msgid_plural "chunks of obsidian"
msgstr[0] "黒曜石塊"

#. ~ Description of "chunk of obsidian"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/resources.json
msgid ""
"A chunk of obsidian, smashed from a larger rock vein.  It has several "
"wickedly sharp edges and could probably be formed into a weapon with some "
"work."
msgstr "大きな岩肌を砕いて採取した黒曜石の塊です。非常に鋭く尖った部分があり、加工すれば武器として使えそうです。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/resources.json
msgid "piece of the darkest shadow"
msgid_plural "pieces of the darkest shadow"
msgstr[0] "黒影の小片"

#. ~ Description of "piece of the darkest shadow"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/resources.json
msgid ""
"A chunk of darkness, torn from a powerful shadow.  It is so dark that no "
"light reflect from it."
msgstr "強力な影から剥がれ落ちた闇の塊です。あまりに暗すぎて光をまったく反射しません。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/resources.json
msgid "march lord skull"
msgid_plural "march lord skulls"
msgstr[0] "辺境伯の頭蓋骨"

#. ~ Description of "march lord skull"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/resources.json
msgid ""
"The skull of a march lord.  You can feel its lingering power as you touch "
"it."
msgstr "辺境伯の頭蓋骨です。手で触れるとその力の名残を感じ取れます。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/resources.json
msgid "inert stormwrought blood"
msgid_plural "doses of inert stormwrought blood"
msgstr[0] "荒嵐の血球"

#. ~ Description of "inert stormwrought blood"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/resources.json
msgid ""
"A ball of almost-solid blood, needing to bath in the energies of a portal "
"storm before being useful."
msgstr "ほぼ固体に近い血でできた小球です。活性化させるにはポータルの嵐のエネルギーを浴びる必要があります。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/resources.json
msgid "simmering stormwrought blood"
msgid_plural "doses of simmering stormwrought blood"
msgstr[0] "煮え滾る荒嵐の血球"

#. ~ Description of "simmering stormwrought blood"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/resources.json
msgid ""
"A ball of almost-solid blood with ripples across its surface.  It has been "
"exposed to the energies of the portal storms enough to be used in the "
"ritual."
msgstr "表面に波紋が広がる、ほぼ固体に近い血でできた小球です。ポータルの嵐のエネルギーを十分に浴びており、儀式に利用できます。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/resources.json
msgid "concentrated underhill essence"
msgid_plural "concentrated underhill essence"
msgstr[0] "濃縮精霊エッセンス"

#. ~ Description of "concentrated underhill essence"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/resources.json
msgid "The distilled essence of the Fae.  Can be used as part of rituals."
msgstr "儀式に使う素材の一つである、精霊のエッセンスを蒸留したものです。"

#. ~ "activation_message" action message of item "concentrated underhill
#. essence"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/resources.json
msgid "You drink some concentrated underhill essence."
msgstr "濃縮精霊エッセンスを飲みました。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/resources.json
msgid "dream-drainer mosquito's heart"
msgid_plural "dream-drainer mosquito's hearts"
msgstr[0] "夢喰い蚊の心臓"

#. ~ Description of "dream-drainer mosquito's heart"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/resources.json
msgid ""
"A heartlike object made from dreamdross.  It feels as if it were still "
"beating despite its lack of movement."
msgstr "夢鉱でできた心臓のような物体です。実際には動いていませんが、拍動しているような気がします。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/resources.json
msgid "moonstruck pearl"
msgid_plural "moonstruck pearls"
msgstr[0] "月触真珠"

#. ~ Description of "moonstruck pearl"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/resources.json
msgid "A small pearl brightly shining with moonlight."
msgstr "月の光を浴びた、明るく輝く小さな真珠です。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/resources.json
msgid "Abyssal Hunger's shard"
msgid_plural "Abyssal Hunger's shards"
msgstr[0] "深淵の貪食体の欠片"

#. ~ Description of "Abyssal Hunger's shard"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/resources.json
msgid ""
"A strange object you brought back from the insides of the Abyssal Hunger."
msgstr "深淵の貪食体の内部で手に入れた奇妙な物体です。"

#. ~ Description of "tailor's kit"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/tools.json
#: data/mods/innawood/items/tool_tailoring.json
msgid ""
"This is a high quality kit consisting of a variety of needles, some wooden "
"spools for thread, some small scissors, and an awl.  Use a tailor's kit to "
"customize your clothing and armor.  This uses your tailoring skill."
msgstr ""
"数本の針、木製の糸巻き、小さなハサミ、千枚通しが入った高品質の裁縫セットです。裁縫スキルのレベル次第で、この道具を使って服や防具の仕立て直しや改造が可能になります。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/tools.json
msgid "dreamforged hacksaw"
msgid_plural "dreamforged hacksaws"
msgstr[0] "夢鉱弓ノコギリ"

#. ~ Description of "dreamforged hacksaw"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/tools.json
msgid ""
"A sturdy saw, useful for cutting through metal objects.  Forged from "
"dreamdross, which makes it much lighter."
msgstr "金属製品を切断するのに便利な、頑丈なノコギリです。夢鉱から鍛造されているため、非常に軽量です。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/tools.json
msgid "dreamforged hammer"
msgid_plural "dreamforged hammers"
msgstr[0] "夢鉱ハンマー"

#. ~ Description of "dreamforged hammer"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/tools.json
msgid ""
"A classic carpenter hammer with claw.  Forged from dreamdross, which makes "
"it much lighter."
msgstr "釘抜きが付いた古風なハンマーです。夢鉱から鍛造されているため、非常に軽量です。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/tools.json
msgid "dreamforged Halligan bar"
msgid_plural "dreamforged Halligan bars"
msgstr[0] "夢鉱ハリガンバール"

#. ~ Description of "dreamforged Halligan bar"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/tools.json
msgid ""
"A small tool for breaking into closed locations.  Forged from dreamdross, "
"which makes it really light."
msgstr "閉鎖された場所に侵入するために使う小型の工具です。夢鉱から鍛造されているため、非常に軽量です。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/tools.json
msgid "dreamforged locking pliers"
msgid_plural "dreamforged locking pliers"
msgstr[0] "夢鉱ロッキングプライヤー"

#. ~ Description of "dreamforged locking pliers"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/tools.json
msgid ""
"A pair of strong pliers with an adjustable mechanism.  Forged entirely from "
"dreamdross, which makes it much lighter."
msgstr "サイズが調整できる頑丈なプライヤーです。夢鉱から鍛造されているため、非常に軽量です。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/tools.json
msgid "dreamforged pickaxe"
msgid_plural "dreamforged pickaxes"
msgstr[0] "夢鉱つるはし"

#. ~ Description of "dreamforged pickaxe"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/tools.json
msgid ""
"A classic pickaxe, used for digging.  Forged from dreamdross, which makes it"
" really light, albeit a bit weaker."
msgstr "掘削に使われる古風なつるはしです。夢鉱から鍛造されているため、少し頑丈さは劣りますが、非常に軽量です。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/tools.json
msgid "dreamforged locksmith kit"
msgid_plural "dreamforged locksmith kits"
msgstr[0] "夢鉱精密ロックピック"

#. ~ Description of "dreamforged locksmith kit"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/tools.json
msgid "A set of light and sturdy dreamforged lockpicks and wrenches."
msgstr "軽くて丈夫な夢鉱製のロックピックとレンチのセットです。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/tools.json
msgid "dreamforged scalpel"
msgid_plural "dreamforged scalpels"
msgstr[0] "夢鉱メス"

#. ~ Description of "dreamforged scalpel"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/tools.json
msgid ""
"A very sharp medical knife for surgical operations.  Almost weightless."
msgstr "外科手術に使われる非常に鋭い医療用ナイフです。ほぼ重さを感じません。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/tools.json
msgid "dreamforged entrenching tool"
msgid_plural "dreamforged entrenching tools"
msgstr[0] "夢鉱塹壕用シャベル"

#. ~ Description of "dreamforged entrenching tool"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/tools.json
msgid ""
"A collapsible spade for digging small pits.  Forged from dreamdross to make "
"it even lighter than before."
msgstr "小規模な穴を掘るための折り畳み式シャベルです。夢鉱から鍛造されているため、通常のシャベルより更に軽量です。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/tools.json
msgid "dreamforged axe"
msgid_plural "dreamforged axes"
msgstr[0] "夢鉱斧"

#. ~ Description of "dreamforged axe"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/tools.json
msgid "A large, two-handed axe for chopping wood.  Light, but still useful."
msgstr "木を切るための大きな両手斧です。軽量ですが、ちゃんと役に立ちます。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/tools.json
msgid "sacrifice table"
msgid_plural "sacrifice tables"
msgstr[0] "生贄台"

#. ~ Description of "sacrifice table"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/tools.json
msgid "A magickal space where offerings are sacrificed and transformed."
msgstr "供物を生贄に捧げて変化させる不思議な空間です。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/tools.json
msgid "dream-drainer catalyst"
msgid_plural "dream-drainer catalyst"
msgstr[0] "夢喰い触媒"

#. ~ Description of "dream-drainer catalyst"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/tools.json
msgid ""
"A small ball of dreams, Fae blood and illicit substances from Under the "
"Hill.  Your book claims it will transform any mosquito ingesting it in a "
"dream-eating nightmare."
msgstr ""
"夢、妖魔の血、そして精霊から奪ったエッセンスを混ぜて作った小さな丸薬です。資料には、これを摂取した蚊は夢を喰う怪物に変化する、と書いてあります。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/tools.json
msgid "revenant's effigy"
msgid_plural "revenant's effigy"
msgstr[0] "亡霊の似姿"

#. ~ Description of "revenant's effigy"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/tools.json
msgid ""
"A macabre effigy made of meat and bone, with a heart filled with glass and "
"faewild dust.  When the full moon will shine upon it, you will be able to "
"use it to summon the Luna-attuned revenant."
msgstr ""
"肉と骨で作られ、心臓にはガラスと妖精の粉が詰まっている、不気味な像です。満月に照らされることで、月の力を得た亡霊を召喚できるようになります。"

#. ~ "description" action message of item "revenant's effigy"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/tools.json
msgid "Complete the ritual."
msgstr "儀式を実行します。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/vegetables.json
msgid "triffid heart chunk"
msgid_plural "triffid heart chunks"
msgstr[0] "トリフィドの心臓塊"

#. ~ Description of "triffid heart chunk"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/vegetables.json
msgid ""
"A thick, hulking mass of plant matter and wood that's easily the size of "
"your head, torn from a triffid heart."
msgstr "トリフィドの心臓から引き剥がされた、植物質と木質から成る人間の頭部ほどのサイズの分厚く巨大な塊です。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/vehicle_parts.json
msgid "elemental wave rider engine"
msgid_plural "elemental wave rider engines"
msgstr[0] "元素エンジン"

#. ~ Description of "elemental wave rider engine"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/vehicle_parts.json
msgid ""
"An elementally manifested combustion engine.  Despite operating entirely off"
" of mana rather than normal fuel, it otherwise functions exactly as a "
"conventional internal combustion engine."
msgstr "元素の力が形をなしたエンジンです。通常の燃料ではなくマナでのみ稼働しますが、それ以外の点は従来の内燃エンジンと全く同じです。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/xedra_gear.json
msgid "zebra badge"
msgid_plural "zebra badges"
msgstr[0] "ゼブラバッジ"

#. ~ Description of "zebra badge"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/xedra_gear.json
msgid ""
"A white piece of plastic with a picture of an agent and a barcode "
"underneath.  The lack of other details on badges like it led to them being "
"called 'Zebra Badges'.  It might grant basic access to some Xedra areas."
msgstr ""
"スタッフの写真の下にバーコードが記された、プラスチック製の白い札です。この種のバッジには詳細な情報が記されておらずどれも同じように見えるため、通称「ゼブラバッジ」と呼ばれています。XEDRAが管理する一部のエリアへのアクセスが許可されます。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/armor/armor.json
msgid "pair of glimmer fur boots"
msgid_plural "pairs of glimmer fur boots"
msgstr[0] "光輝ブーツ"

#. ~ Description of "pair of glimmer fur boots"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/armor/armor.json
msgid "Boots lined with glimmer fur for warmth."
msgstr "光輝毛皮製の暖かいブーツです。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/armor/armor.json
msgid "pair of XL glimmer fur boots"
msgid_plural "pairs of XL glimmer fur boots"
msgstr[0] "XL光輝ブーツ"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/armor/armor.json
msgid "pair of XS glimmer fur boots"
msgid_plural "pairs of XS glimmer fur boots"
msgstr[0] "XS光輝ブーツ"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/armor/armor.json
msgid "glimmer fur pants"
msgid_plural "glimmer fur pants"
msgstr[0] "光輝パンツ"

#. ~ Description of "glimmer fur pants"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/armor/armor.json
msgid "A hefty pair of fae fur-lined pants."
msgstr "裏地に妖魔由来の毛皮を用いた丈夫なズボンです。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/armor/armor.json
msgid "pair of XL glimmer fur pants"
msgid_plural "pairs of XL glimmer fur pants"
msgstr[0] "XL光輝パンツ"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/armor/armor.json
msgid "pair of XS glimmer fur pants"
msgid_plural "pairs of XS glimmer fur pants"
msgstr[0] "XS光輝パンツ"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/armor/armor.json
msgid "glimmer fur cloak"
msgid_plural "glimmer fur cloaks"
msgstr[0] "光輝クローク"

#. ~ Description of "glimmer fur cloak"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/armor/armor.json
msgid ""
"A heavy glimmer fur cloak meant to be thrown over your body.  The shimmering"
" nature of the fur made these garments coveted before the Cataclysm."
msgstr "きらめく毛皮で作られた重厚な外套です。光り輝く毛皮は大変動以前から珍重されていました。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/armor/armor.json
msgid "glimmer fur coat"
msgid_plural "glimmer fur coats"
msgstr[0] "光輝コート"

#. ~ Description of "glimmer fur coat"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/armor/armor.json
msgid ""
"A glimmer fur coat with a couple small pockets.  Extremely warm and very "
"rare before the Cataclysm."
msgstr "2つの小さなポケットが付いた光輝毛皮製のコートです。非常に暖かく、大変動以前から珍重されていました。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/armor/armor.json
msgid "XL glimmer fur coat"
msgid_plural "XL glimmer fur coats"
msgstr[0] "XL光輝コート"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/armor/armor.json
msgid "XS glimmer fur coat"
msgid_plural "XS glimmer fur coats"
msgstr[0] "XS光輝コート"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/armor/armor.json
msgid "glimmer fur trenchcoat"
msgid_plural "glimmer fur trenchcoats"
msgstr[0] "光輝トレンチコート"

#. ~ Description of "glimmer fur trenchcoat"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/armor/armor.json
msgid ""
"A thick glimmer fur trenchcoat, lined with pockets.  Great for storage."
msgstr "厚手の光輝毛皮製トレンチコートです。複数のポケットが付いており、収納力に優れています。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/armor/armor.json
msgid "sleeveless glimmer fur trenchcoat"
msgid_plural "sleeveless glimmer fur trenchcoats"
msgstr[0] "光輝袖無しトレンチコート"

#. ~ Description of "sleeveless glimmer fur trenchcoat"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/armor/armor.json
msgid ""
"A thick glimmer fur trenchcoat without sleeves, leaving your arms "
"unencumbered.  Has plenty of storage space due to its many pockets."
msgstr "袖がない厚手の光輝毛皮製トレンチコートです。ポケットが多く、物をたくさん収納できます。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/armor/armor.json
msgid "glimmer fur duster"
msgid_plural "glimmer fur dusters"
msgstr[0] "光輝ダスターコート"

#. ~ Description of "glimmer fur duster"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/armor/armor.json
msgid ""
"A thick glimmer fur full-length duster.  Has many pockets for storage.  "
"Shimmers in direct sunlight and would have been fancy clothing prior to the "
"Cataclysm."
msgstr ""
"厚手の光輝毛皮で作った、全身を覆うダスターコートです。収納用にたくさんのポケットが付いています。直射日光に当たるとキラキラと輝き、大変動以前から豪華な衣装として扱われていました。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/armor/armor.json
msgid "sleeveless glimmer fur duster"
msgid_plural "sleeveless glimmer fur dusters"
msgstr[0] "光輝袖無しダスターコート"

#. ~ Description of "sleeveless glimmer fur duster"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/armor/armor.json
msgid ""
"A thick glimmer fur full-length duster without sleeves, leaving your arms "
"unencumbered.  Has plenty of storage space due to its many pockets."
msgstr "丈が長く袖がない、厚手の光輝毛皮製ダスターコートです。ポケットが多く、物をたくさん収納できます。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/armor/armor.json
msgid "XL glimmer fur duster"
msgid_plural "XL glimmer fur dusters"
msgstr[0] "XL光輝ダスターコート"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/armor/armor.json
msgid "XS glimmer fur duster"
msgid_plural "XS glimmer fur dusters"
msgstr[0] "XS光輝ダスターコート"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/armor/armor.json
msgid "gossamer gambeson"
msgid_plural "gossamer gambesons"
msgstr[0] "薄衣のギャンベソン"

#. ~ Description of "gossamer gambeson"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/armor/armor.json
msgid ""
"A padded greatcoat assembled by quilting gossamer and stuffing the layers "
"with more scraps of gossamer.  It shimmers in a soft rainbow of colors."
msgstr "薄衣をキルト加工し、内部にも薄衣の端切れを詰めて作ったグレートコートです。柔らかな虹色に輝いています。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/armor/armor.json
msgid "gossamer arming pants"
msgid_plural "gossamer arming pants"
msgstr[0] "薄衣のアーミングパンツ"

#. ~ Description of "gossamer arming pants"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/armor/armor.json
msgid ""
"Thick pants made of gossamer, meant to be worn alongside a gambeson under or"
" without armor.  Stylish and as comfortable as armor can be."
msgstr "装甲の下、あるいはギャンベソンと共に着用するように作られた、厚みのある薄衣のズボンです。お洒落かつ快適な鎧として活躍します。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/armor/armor.json
msgid "gossamer gambeson coif"
msgid_plural "gossamer gambeson coifs"
msgstr[0] "薄衣のギャンベソンコイフ"

#. ~ Description of "gossamer gambeson coif"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/armor/armor.json
msgid ""
"A gossamer coif with neck and forehead protection.  Resting on your "
"shoulders, it serves as padding for a helmet.  The sort of thing a fae "
"knight guarding a crossroads would wear when challenging travelers to duels."
msgstr ""
"首と額を保護する薄衣のコイフです。肩まで伸びており、上からヘルメットを被ることもできます。四つ辻を守る妖精の騎士が旅人に決闘を挑む際に着用します。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/armor/armor.json
msgid "pair of moon tears chainmail sleeves"
msgid_plural "pairs of moon tears chainmail sleeves"
msgstr[0] "チェーンメイルスリーブ(月涙鉱)"

#. ~ Description of "pair of moon tears chainmail sleeves"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/armor/armor.json
msgid ""
"Moon tears chainmail arms, found in places where changeling bannermen are "
"numerous.  Each sleeve has straps to connect them with each other.  The lack"
" of fingers makes them less cumbersome and allows them to be used with "
"gloves."
msgstr ""
"チェンジリングの旗手がよく着用している、月涙鉱製チェーンメイルアームです。肩口にはベストと接合するためのストラップが付いています。指の部分は動きを妨げないように空いており、グローブと併用できます。金属に錆や腐食が発生しています。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/armor/armor.json
msgid "pair of XL moon tears chainmail sleeves"
msgid_plural "pairs of XL moon tears chainmail sleeves"
msgstr[0] "XLチェーンメイルスリーブ(月涙鉱)"

#. ~ Description of "pair of XL moon tears chainmail sleeves"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/armor/armor.json
msgid ""
"Moon tears chainmail arms found in places where redcap aspirants are "
"numerous.  Each sleeve has straps to connect them with each other.  The lack"
" of fingers makes them less cumbersome and allows them to be used with "
"gloves.  These are oversized."
msgstr ""
"レッドキャップがよく着用している、月涙鉱製チェーンメイルアームです。肩口にはベストと接合するためのストラップが付いています。指の部分は動きを妨げないように空いており、グローブと併用できます。金属に錆や腐食が発生しています。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/armor/armor.json
msgid "pair of XS moon tears chainmail sleeves"
msgid_plural "pairs of XS moon tears chainmail sleeves"
msgstr[0] "XSチェーンメイルスリーブ(月涙鉱)"

#. ~ Description of "pair of XS moon tears chainmail sleeves"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/armor/armor.json
msgid ""
"Moon tears chainmail arms found in places where pooka aspirants are "
"numerous.  Each sleeve has straps to connect them with each other.  The lack"
" of fingers makes them less cumbersome and allows them to be used with "
"gloves.  These are undersized."
msgstr ""
"プーカがよく着用している、月涙鉱製チェーンメイルアームです。肩口にはベストと接合するためのストラップが付いています。指の部分は動きを妨げないように空いており、グローブと併用できます。金属に錆や腐食が発生しています。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/armor/armor.json
msgid "pair of moon tears chainmail chausses"
msgid_plural "pairs of moon tears chainmail chausses"
msgstr[0] "チェーンメイルショース(月涙鉱)"

#. ~ Description of "pair of moon tears chainmail chausses"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/armor/armor.json
msgid ""
"Moon tears chainmail chausses that cover the feet, like booties made of "
"chainmail.  Found in places where changeling bannermen are numerous."
msgstr "月涙鉱製のチェーンメイルで作られた、ブーツのように足を覆うショースです。チェンジリングの旗手がよく着用しています。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/armor/armor.json
msgid "pair of XL moon tears chainmail chausses"
msgid_plural "pairs of XL moon tears chainmail chausses"
msgstr[0] "XLチェーンメイルショース(月涙鉱)"

#. ~ Description of "pair of XL moon tears chainmail chausses"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/armor/armor.json
msgid ""
"Moon tears chainmail chausses that cover the feet, like booties made of "
"chainmail.  Found in places where redcap aspirants are numerous."
msgstr "月涙鉱製のチェーンメイルで作られた、ブーツのように足を覆うショースです。レッドキャップがよく着用しています。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/armor/armor.json
