msgid_plural "XS moon tears chainmail vests"
msgstr[0] "XSチェーンメイルベスト(月涙鉱)"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/armor/armor.json
msgid "dreamforged ballistic plate"
msgid_plural "dreamforged ballistic plates"
msgstr[0] "防弾プレート(夢鉱)"

#. ~ Description of "dreamforged ballistic plate"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/armor/armor.json
msgid ""
"Manually forged ballistic plate, made to fit the common ballistic plate.  "
"Probably not as good as steel one, but lightweight, and additionally "
"hardened with magic."
msgstr ""
"一般的な防弾ベスト用プレートと同じ規格の、夢鉱を鍛造して作ったプレートです。軽量で、鋼鉄製のものには及びませんが魔法によって防御力が向上しています。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/armor/armor.json
msgid "small dreamforged ballistic plate"
msgid_plural "small dreamforged ballistic plates"
msgstr[0] "小型防弾プレート(夢鉱)"

#. ~ Description of "small dreamforged ballistic plate"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/armor/armor.json
msgid ""
"Manually forged ballistic plate, made to fit the common ballistic plate.  "
"Probably not as good as steel one, but lightweight, and additionally "
"hardened with magic.  Smaller in size, and can fit a side pocket of plate "
"carrier."
msgstr ""
"一般的な防弾ベスト用プレートと同じ規格の、夢鉱を鍛造して作ったプレートです。軽量で、鋼鉄製のものには及びませんが魔法によって防御力が向上しています。サイズが小さく、防具のサイドポケットに収まります。"

#. ~ Item name
#. ~ Custom name for recipe crafting "dreamforged_fullhelmet_ench"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/armor/armor.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/recipes/dreamforged_armor.json
msgid "dreamforged full helmet"
msgid_plural "dreamforged full helmets"
msgstr[0] "夢鉱フルヘルメット"

#. ~ Description of "dreamforged full helmet"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/armor/armor.json
msgid ""
"Manually forged helmet, that resemble the shape of modern army helmets.  "
"This one protect both face and eyes, using a special forged mask, but has no"
" visor, and not so comfortable.  The dreamdross grant it some small magical "
"properties, but you can't control their effects."
msgstr ""
"現代の陸軍で使われているヘルメットの形を模した、夢鉱を鍛造して作ったヘルメットです。特殊なマスクによって顔面と目を保護しますが、バイザーは付いておらず、着け心地はよくありません。夢鉱の効果で弱い魔法が宿っていますが、自由にコントロールすることはできません。"

#. ~ Item name
#. ~ Custom name for recipe crafting "dreamforged_helmet_ench"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/armor/armor.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/recipes/dreamforged_armor.json
msgid "dreamforged helmet"
msgid_plural "dreamforged helmets"
msgstr[0] "夢鉱ヘルメット"

#. ~ Description of "dreamforged helmet"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/armor/armor.json
msgid ""
"Manually forged helmet in the that resemble the shape of modern army "
"helmets."
msgstr "現代の軍隊で使われているヘルメットの形を模した、夢鉱を鍛えて作ったヘルメットです。"

#. ~ Item name
#. ~ Custom name for recipe crafting "dreamforged_plate_armor_ench"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/armor/armor.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/recipes/dreamforged_armor.json
msgid "dreamforged plate armor"
msgid_plural "dreamforged plate armors"
msgstr[0] "夢鉱プレートアーマー"

#. ~ Description of "dreamforged plate armor"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/armor/armor.json
msgid ""
"Lightweight armor, forged using dreamdross.  The only reason it feels soft "
"enough is the magic.  It also has few MOLLE-compatible strips that you can "
"utilize.  The dreamdross grant it some minor magical properties, but you "
"can't control their effects."
msgstr ""
"夢鉱を鍛えて作った軽い鎧です。魔法のお陰で着心地は柔らかく感じます。MOLLEと互換性のあるストラップが複数付いています。夢鉱の効果で弱い魔法が宿っていますが、自由にコントロールすることはできません。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/armor/armor.json
msgid "pair of dreamforged arm guards"
msgid_plural "pairs of dreamforged arm guards"
msgstr[0] "夢鉱アームガード"

#. ~ Description of "pair of dreamforged arm guards"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/armor/armor.json
msgid ""
"Pair of arm protectors, forged entirely from dreamdross.  Instead of straps "
"this one uses a pretty smart locking mechanism, which allows you to adjust "
"it to your hands.  The dreamdross grants it some minor magical properties, "
"but you can't control their effects."
msgstr ""
"純粋な夢鉱を鍛えて作った腕用防具です。ストラップの代わりにロック機構が備わっており、身体のサイズに合わせて調整できます。夢鉱の効果で弱い魔法が宿っていますが、自由にコントロールすることはできません。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/armor/armor.json
msgid "pair of dreamforged boots"
msgid_plural "pairs of dreamforged boots"
msgstr[0] "夢鉱ブーツ"

#. ~ Description of "pair of dreamforged boots"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/armor/armor.json
msgid ""
"Light set of boots, forged from dreamdross.  Surprisingly comfortable for "
"clothing that has no physical padding.  The dreamdross grants it some minor "
"magical properties, but you can't control their effects."
msgstr ""
"夢鉱を鍛えて作った軽いブーツです。内部にパッドは入っていませんが、履き心地は驚くほど快適です。夢鉱の効果で弱い魔法が宿っていますが、自由にコントロールすることはできません。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/armor/armor.json
msgid "berserk helmet"
msgid_plural "berserk helmets"
msgstr[0] "狂戦士の兜"

#. ~ Description of "berserk helmet"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/armor/armor.json
msgid ""
"Thin, smooth helmet, that cover your head, with a wide, sharp two-teeth "
"blade from the forehead.  Fueled by damage of berserk knuckles, your feel "
"the helmet pump the tension right into your veins."
msgstr ""
"額部分に大きく鋭い二枚刃が付いた、頭部を覆う薄く滑らかなヘルメットです。狂戦士の拳による攻撃でダメージを与えると、張り詰めた力が兜から頭の中に流れ込みます。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/armor/armor.json
msgid "pair of dreamforged berserk guards"
msgid_plural "pairs of dreamforged berserk guards"
msgstr[0] "狂戦士の籠手"

#. ~ Description of "pair of dreamforged berserk guards"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/armor/armor.json
msgid ""
"Pair of fiery red armguards, they glow red the more damage you deal, using "
"berserk knuckles, and your physical strength grows respectively."
msgstr "燃えるように赤いアームガードです。狂戦士の拳による攻撃でダメージを与えるほど赤く輝き、着用者の筋肉が強化されます。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/armor/armor.json
msgid "pair of berserker boots"
msgid_plural "pairs of berserker boots"
msgstr[0] "狂戦士のブーツ"

#. ~ Description of "pair of berserker boots"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/armor/armor.json
msgid ""
"Pair of fiery red boots, they are fueled by damage you deal with berserk "
"knuckles, and increase your speed respectively."
msgstr "燃えるように赤いブーツです。狂戦士の拳による攻撃でダメージを与えるほど赤く輝き、着用者の速度が向上します。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/armor/armor.json
msgid "arcane helmet"
msgid_plural "arcane helmets"
msgstr[0] "神秘の兜"

#. ~ Description of "arcane helmet"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/armor/armor.json
msgid ""
"Dreamforged helmet with side protection, and carved runes outside.  It grant"
" you an ability to understand more, and with better world investigation your"
" mana regeneration grows.  Runes are just decorations actually."
msgstr ""
"側面が厚く保護され、表面にルーンが刻まれている、夢鉱製のヘルメットです。着用者により多くの物事を理解する能力を与え、世界を深く理解することでマナ回復速度が向上します。ルーンは単なる装飾で意味はありません。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/armor/armor.json
msgid "\"Gunslinger\""
msgid_plural "\"Gunslinger\""
msgstr[0] "『ガンスリンガー』"

#. ~ Description of ""Gunslinger""
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/armor/armor.json
msgid ""
"Pair of flat armguards, fully carved with numbers and crosses.  Inside the "
"left guard there is a text, cut with something sharp, that starts from "
"\"Sent onto those that escaped limbo's clutches, and unleash the rage of all"
" hell…\"."
msgstr ""
"数字と十字架模様で覆われた、平たいアームガードです。左のアームガードの内側には、鋭利なもので彫られた文章が残っています。「辺獄の呪縛を逃れた者たちのもとに送り込まれ、地獄の怒りを解き放つ...」"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/armor/armor.json
msgid "verdant helmet"
msgid_plural "verdant helmets"
msgstr[0] "新緑の兜"

#. ~ Description of "verdant helmet"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/armor/armor.json
msgid ""
"A helmet made from the of living plant matter, with bark covering the outer "
"surface.  This is definitely not anything that could have existed before the"
" Cataclysm."
msgstr "外側が樹皮で覆われた、瑞々しい植物でできた兜です。大変動以前の世界にこんなものが存在したとはとても思えません。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/armor/armor.json
msgid "verdant cuirass"
msgid_plural "verdant cuirasses"
msgstr[0] "新緑のキュイラス"

#. ~ Description of "verdant cuirass"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/armor/armor.json
msgid ""
"A cuirass made of living plant matter, with bark covering the outer surface."
"  This is definitely not anything that could have existed before the "
"Cataclysm."
msgstr "外側が樹皮で覆われた、瑞々しい植物でできたキュイラスです。大変動以前の世界にこんなものが存在したとはとても思えません。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/armor/armor.json
msgid "pair of verdant gauntlets"
msgid_plural "pairs of verdant gauntlets"
msgstr[0] "新緑のガントレット"

#. ~ Description of "pair of verdant gauntlets"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/armor/armor.json
msgid ""
"A pair of fingerless gauntlets made from living plant matter, with bark "
"covering the outer surface.  This is definitely not anything that could have"
" existed before the Cataclysm."
msgstr "外側が樹皮で覆われた、瑞々しい植物でできた指を覆わないガントレットです。大変動以前の世界にこんなものが存在したとはとても思えません。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/armor/armor.json
msgid "pair of verdant boots"
msgid_plural "pairs of verdant boots"
msgstr[0] "新緑のブーツ"

#. ~ Description of "pair of verdant boots"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/armor/armor.json
msgid ""
"Boots made from living plant matter, with bark covering the outer surface.  "
"This is definitely not anything that could have existed before the "
"Cataclysm."
msgstr "外側が樹皮で覆われた、瑞々しい植物でできたブーツです。大変動以前の世界にこんなものが存在したとはとても思えません。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/armor/changeling.json
msgid "banner of the dark forest"
msgid_plural "banners of the dark forest"
msgstr[0] "軍旗(闇の森)"

#. ~ Description of "banner of the dark forest"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/armor/changeling.json
msgid ""
"A back mounted flag identifying the loyalties of troops.  The heraldry on "
"this banner is of a dark and gloomy forest with red eyes staring out from "
"between the trees."
msgstr "背中に差して軍隊の忠誠心を示す旗です。この旗に描かれているのは、暗く陰気な森の木々の間から複数の赤い瞳が見つめている紋章です。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/armor/changeling.json
msgid "banner of the butterfly knight"
msgid_plural "banners of the butterfly knight"
msgstr[0] "軍旗(蝶の騎士)"

#. ~ Description of "banner of the butterfly knight"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/armor/changeling.json
msgid ""
"A back mounted flag identifying the loyalties of troops.  The heraldry on "
"this banner is of a brilliantly colored butterfly in flight, ridden by a "
"knight in armor.  The knight is striking down a foe with a scythe while the "
"butterfly appears to have bitten the head off a different opponent."
msgstr ""
"背中に差して軍隊の忠誠心を示す旗です。この旗に描かれているのは、色鮮やかな蝶に乗っている、鎧を着た騎士の紋章です。騎士は大鎌で敵を打ち倒し、蝶は別の敵の頭を噛み切っているように見えます。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/armor/changeling.json
msgid "banner of the angry darkness"
msgid_plural "banners of the angry darkness"
msgstr[0] "軍旗(憤怒の闇)"

#. ~ Description of "banner of the angry darkness"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/armor/changeling.json
msgid ""
"A back mounted flag identifying the loyalties of troops.  The heraldry on "
"this banner is of, well you aren't quite sure.  It's a dark cloud, or "
"blackness.  You feel hate radiating from this banner."
msgstr ""
"背中に差して軍隊の忠誠心を示す旗です。この旗は真っ暗で何の紋章が描かれているのかよく分かりませんが、それ自体が闇を表しています。旗の周りに憎悪が振り撒かれているように感じます。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/armor/changeling.json
msgid "banner of starry wisdom"
msgid_plural "banners of starry wisdom"
msgstr[0] "軍旗(星の智慧)"

#. ~ Description of "banner of starry wisdom"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/armor/changeling.json
msgid ""
"A back mounted flag identifying the loyalties of troops.  The heraldry on "
"this banner is of the night sky shining with ancient wisdom, full of stars."
msgstr "背中に差して軍隊の忠誠心を示す旗です。この旗に描かれているのは、夜空に輝く星々と古代の英知を表す紋章です。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/armor/changeling.json
msgid "banner of thunderous rush"
msgid_plural "banners of thunderous rush"
msgstr[0] "軍旗(雷嵐)"

#. ~ Description of "banner of thunderous rush"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/armor/changeling.json
msgid ""
"A back mounted flag identifying the loyalties of troops.  The heraldry on "
"this banner is of lightning striking a tower that is falling."
msgstr "背中に差して軍隊の忠誠心を示す旗です。この旗に描かれているのは、崩れゆく塔に稲妻が落ちている紋章です。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/armor/headgear.json
msgid "phrygian cap"
msgid_plural "phrygian caps"
msgstr[0] "フリジア帽"

#. ~ Description of "phrygian cap"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/armor/headgear.json
msgid ""
"A soft conical hat with the apex bent over.  Commonly worn in antiquity by "
"various cultures in Eastern Europe and Anatolia.  It later signified freedom"
" in both the American and French Revolutions."
msgstr ""
"頂点が折れ曲がった円錐形の柔らかい帽子です。古代の東欧やアナトリア地方では普段使いされてましたが、その後のアメリカ独立戦争やフランス革命では自由の象徴として用いられました。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/armor/headgear.json
msgid "blood red cap"
msgid_plural "blood red caps"
msgstr[0] "赤いフリジア帽"

#. ~ Description of "blood red cap"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/armor/headgear.json
msgid ""
"A soft conical hat with the apex bent over.  Commonly worn in antiquity by "
"various cultures in Eastern Europe and Anatolia.  It later signified freedom"
" in both the American and French Revolutions.  Along the brim the cap "
"appears to be the rusty red of old blood."
msgstr ""
"頂点が折れ曲がった円錐形の柔らかい帽子です。古代の東欧やアナトリア地方では普段使いされてましたが、その後のアメリカ独立戦争やフランス革命では自由の象徴として用いられました。帽子のつばは、古い血の跡のような錆色に染まっています。"

#. ~ Spell name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/armor/headgear.json
msgid "Bleeding Cap"
msgstr "帽子流血"

#. ~ Description of spell "Bleeding Cap"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/armor/headgear.json
msgid "Blood starts seeping out of the cap, down your face."
msgstr "帽子から血が滲み出し、顔にかかります。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/armor/headgear.json
msgid "bloody redcap"
msgid_plural "bloody redcap"
msgstr[0] "血染めの帽子"

#. ~ Description of "bloody redcap"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/armor/headgear.json
msgid ""
"The cap develops a fearsome aura as the blood pours back out of the fibers."
msgstr "繊維から血が染み出す、恐ろしい雰囲気を漂わせる帽子です。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/armor/integrated.json
msgid "flesh roots"
msgid_plural "flesh roots"
msgstr[0] "肉の根"

#. ~ Description of "flesh roots"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/armor/integrated.json
msgid ""
"A layer of bulging rootlike structures distending the upper layers of skin."
"  Helps protect your body from damage."
msgstr "膨らんだ根のようなものが皮膚を覆っています。肉体を攻撃から守る効果があります。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/armor/integrated.json
msgid "pebbled skin"
msgid_plural "pebbled skin"
msgstr[0] "砂利の皮膚"

#. ~ Description of "pebbled skin"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/armor/integrated.json
msgid "Your skin has begun to harden and pebbles have begun to surface."
msgstr "皮膚が硬くなり始め、表面は砂利に覆われています。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/armor/integrated.json
msgid "granite skin"
msgid_plural "granite skin"
msgstr[0] "花崗岩の皮膚"

#. ~ Description of "granite skin"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/armor/integrated.json
msgid "Your skin has hardened into a granite like covering."
msgstr "皮膚が硬くなり、花崗岩に覆われています。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/armor/integrated.json
msgid "ierde eyes"
msgid_plural "ierde eyes"
msgstr[0] "エルデの目"

#. ~ Description of "ierde eyes"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/armor/integrated.json
msgid ""
"Your eyes now reflect your mood in the colors of stone.  You are also immune"
" to the glare of the sun."
msgstr "石色の瞳は気分によって色が変わります。日光の眩しさの影響を受けません。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/armor/integrated.json
msgid "stone fists"
msgid_plural "stone fists"
msgstr[0] "岩の拳"

#. ~ Description of "stone fists"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/armor/integrated.json
msgid ""
"Your stone-like skin means your hands hit like hammers, and can be used like"
" hammers as well."
msgstr "石のように硬い皮膚を活かし、ハンマーのように敵を殴ります。拳を道具のハンマーの代わりにすることもできます。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/armor/integrated.json
msgid "vegetal cuticle"
msgid_plural "vegetal cuticles"
msgstr[0] "植物質の表皮"

#. ~ Description of "vegetal cuticle"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/armor/integrated.json
msgid ""
"A pliable but hefty layer of living plant matter impregnated with various "
"waxy polymers."
msgstr "蝋のようなポリマー素材が染み込んでいる、柔軟で分厚い植物質の層に覆われています。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/armor/integrated.json
msgid "barkskin"
msgid_plural "barkskin"
msgstr[0] "樹皮の皮膚"

#. ~ Description of "barkskin"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/armor/integrated.json
msgid "A thin layer of bark covers your body."
msgstr "全身が薄い樹皮に覆われています。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/armor/integrated.json
msgid "arvore eyes"
msgid_plural "arvore eyes"
msgstr[0] "アルボレの目"

#. ~ Description of "arvore eyes"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/armor/integrated.json
msgid ""
"Your eyes now reflect the seasons: green, yellow, red, orange, or brown.  "
"You are also immune to the glare of the sun."
msgstr "緑、黄、赤、オレンジ、茶色など、季節によって色が移り変わる目です。日光の眩しさの影響を受けません。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/armor/integrated.json
msgid "woody thorns"
msgid_plural "woody thorns"
msgstr[0] "木質の棘"

#. ~ Description of "woody thorns"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/armor/integrated.json
msgid "Your skin is covered in thick, woody thorns."
msgstr "皮膚が太い木質の棘で覆われています。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/armor/integrated.json
msgid "jagged wooden claws"
msgid_plural "jagged wooden claws"
msgstr[0] "尖った木爪"

#. ~ Description of "jagged wooden claws"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/armor/integrated.json
msgid "Your hands and fingers have transformed into jagged wooden claws."
msgstr "手の先から鋭く尖った木質の爪が生えています。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/armor/integrated.json
msgid "burning coals skin"
msgid_plural "burning coals skin"
msgstr[0] "燃える石炭の皮膚"

#. ~ Description of "burning coals skin"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/armor/integrated.json
msgid ""
"Your skin has magical flames flaring out of it on occasion.  You can operate"
" in warmer climates than normal humans but begin to take damage from getting"
" wet."
msgstr "肌から時折魔法の炎が燃え上がります。通常の人間よりも高温環境に耐性がありますが、水に濡れるとダメージを受けます。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/armor/integrated.json
msgid "flaming skin"
msgid_plural "flaming skin"
msgstr[0] "燃え盛る皮膚"

#. ~ Description of "flaming skin"
#. ~ Description of mutation "Flame Skin"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/armor/integrated.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/salamander_mutations.json
msgid ""
"Your skin exudes magickal flames constantly, you can operate in almost any "
"heat now without danger but rain may be a lethal threat."
msgstr "皮膚から常に魔法の炎が噴き出しています。非常に暑い環境でも安全に活動できますが、雨が致命的な脅威となる可能性があります。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/armor/integrated.json
msgid "salamander eyes"
msgid_plural "salamander eyes"
msgstr[0] "サラマンダーの目"

#. ~ Description of "salamander eyes"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/armor/integrated.json
msgid ""
"Your eyes now reflect your mood, the warm red of a campfire or the searing "
"heat of an incendiary weapon.  Glare no longer affects you."
msgstr "目の色が気分に合わせて、キャンプファイヤーの暖かい炎の色や焼夷兵器の灼熱の色に変化します。日光の眩しさの影響を受けません。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/armor/integrated.json
msgid "stove's caress"
msgid_plural "stove's caress"
msgstr[0] "加熱の掌"

#. ~ Description of "stove's caress"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/armor/integrated.json
msgid "Heat from your hands.  You may cook with it at will."
msgstr "手が温まっており、調理に活用できます。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/armor/integrated.json
msgid "liquid skin"
msgid_plural "liquid skin"
msgstr[0] "液状の皮膚"

#. ~ Description of "liquid skin"
#. ~ Description of mutation "Liquid Skin"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/armor/integrated.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/undine_mutations.json
msgid ""
"Your skin has become vaguely gelatinous.  Provides some extra bash defense "
"and immunity to wet effects."
msgstr "皮膚がゼラチン状に変化しています。打撃耐性が増加し、水濡れの影響が軽減されます。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/armor/integrated.json
msgid "wave skin"
msgid_plural "wave skin"
msgstr[0] "波立つ皮膚"

#. ~ Description of "wave skin"
#. ~ Description of mutation "Wave Skin"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/armor/integrated.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/undine_mutations.json
msgid ""
"Your skin is completely replaced by magickal water.  You have become immune "
"to acid effects."
msgstr "皮膚が完全に魔法の水に置き換わっています。酸の影響を受けません。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/armor/integrated.json
msgid "undine eyes"
msgid_plural "undine eyes"
msgstr[0] "ウンディーネの目"

#. ~ Description of "undine eyes"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/armor/integrated.json
msgid ""
"Your eyes now reflect your mood in the colors of the deep waters.  From an "
"aquamarine blue when you are pleased to the pitch black of the depths when "
"you are angry or sad.  You are also immune to the glare of the sun and can "
"see under water."
msgstr ""
"嬉しいときはアクアマリン、怒ったり悲しんだりしたときは漆黒に変化する、深海によく似た目の色です。日光の眩しさの影響を受けず、水中でも視力が低下しません。"

#. ~ Description of "water pocket"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/armor/integrated.json
msgid "Your skin is capable of ."
msgstr "皮膚が水分を溜め込みます。"

#. ~ Item name
#. ~ Name of a enchantment
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/armor/integrated.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/spells/integrated_armor_spells.json
msgid "cloud skin"
msgid_plural "cloud skin"
msgstr[0] "雲の皮膚"

#. ~ Description of "cloud skin"
#. ~ Description of mutation "Cloud Skin"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/armor/integrated.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/sylph_mutations.json
msgid ""
"Your skin is clearly separate from the air around you but has become its own"
" weather system.  If someone reaches out and touches you, they will clearly "
"feel you but you look like someone might reach right through you."
msgstr ""
"皮膚と周囲の空気との境目はありますが、皮膚自体が独自の気象環境を形成しています。誰かに触られると、触った側は感触がありますが、こちらは肉体を突き抜けてしまったように感じます。"

#. ~ Item name
#. ~ Name of a enchantment
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/armor/integrated.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/spells/integrated_armor_spells.json
msgid "storm skin"
msgid_plural "storm skin"
msgstr[0] "嵐の皮膚"

#. ~ Description of "storm skin"
#. ~ Description of mutation "Storm Skin"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/armor/integrated.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/sylph_mutations.json
msgid ""
"Your skin is a roiling storm.  Your flexibility is greatly increased, your "
"ability to ignore temperatures hot and cold have greatly increased but your "
"ability to carry objects has been reduced."
msgstr ""
"皮膚が荒れ狂う嵐に変化しています。肉体の柔軟性が大幅に向上し、暑さや寒さにほとんど影響されなくなりますが、ものを運搬する能力は低下しました。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/armor/integrated.json
msgid "sylph eyes"
msgid_plural "sylph eyes"
msgstr[0] "シルフの目"

#. ~ Description of "sylph eyes"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/armor/integrated.json
msgid ""
"Your eyes now reflect your mood in different weather patterns.  Clear blue "
"skies when you are pleased and storms when you are mad.  You are also immune"
" to the glare of the sun."
msgstr "喜んでいるときは青空、怒っているときは雷雲の色と、気分に合わせて様々な空模様の色に変化する目です。日光の眩しさの影響を受けません。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/armor/integrated.json
msgid "sylph breathe without air"
msgid_plural "sylph breathe without air"
msgstr[0] "シルフの無酸素呼吸"

#. ~ Description of "sylph breathe without air"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/armor/integrated.json
msgid ""
"You can now exist as your own source of oxygen.  Anywhere that you would be "
"impacted by a lack of oxygen should no longer trouble you."
msgstr "自分自身が酸素の源となっており、酸素を外から吸収できない環境でも問題なく活動できます。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/armor/integrated.json
msgid "porcelain skin"
msgid_plural "porcelain skin"
msgstr[0] "磁器の皮膚"

#. ~ Description of "porcelain skin"
#. ~ Description of mutation "Porcelain Skin"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/armor/integrated.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/homullus_mutations.json
msgid ""
"Your skin has smoothed and all your prior blemishes have faded away.  This "
"somewhat reduces wet effects and leads to a more durable yet harder to heal "
"body."
msgstr ""
"皮膚が滑らかで、以前まで残っていた筈の傷跡もまったく見当たりません。水濡れの影響が多少軽減され、頑丈になりますが、自然回復速度が少し遅くなります。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/armor/integrated.json
msgid "latex skin"
msgid_plural "latex skin"
msgstr[0] "ラテックスの皮膚"

#. ~ Description of "latex skin"
#. ~ Description of mutation "Latex Skin"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/armor/integrated.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/homullus_mutations.json
msgid ""
"Your skin has become latex like.  While it provides additional protection "
"and attractiveness it also heals at a much slower rate."
msgstr "ラテックスのような質感の皮膚です。防御力と魅力が向上しますが、自然回復速度が大幅に低下します。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/armor/integrated.json
msgid "homullus eyes"
msgid_plural "homullus eyes"
msgstr[0] "ホムルスの目"

#. ~ Description of "homullus eyes"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/armor/integrated.json
msgid ""
"Your eyes now stare out at the world, impassive and blank like the eyes of a"
" doll.  You are also immune to the glare of the sun."
msgstr "人形の瞳のように虚ろで表情の分からない目です。日光の眩しさの影響を受けません。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/armor/integrated.json
msgid "essence of the makers"
msgid_plural "essence of the makers"
msgstr[0] "製作の真髄"

#. ~ Description of "essence of the makers"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/armor/integrated.json
msgid "The spirits of past artisans guide your hands."
msgstr "職人たちの魂がその手を導きます。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/armor/integrated.json
msgid "net spider's touch"
msgid_plural "net spider's touch"
msgstr[0] "ネットスパイダーの手技"

#. ~ Description of "net spider's touch"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/armor/integrated.json
msgid ""
"With but a touch, you can override the circuits of electronics and grant "
"yourself access."
msgstr "手で触れるだけで電子回路をオーバーライドし、アクセス許可を得ることができます。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/armor/integrated.json
msgid "organic bloodbank"
msgid_plural "organic bloodbank"
msgstr[0] "血液嚢"

#. ~ Description of "organic bloodbank"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/armor/integrated.json
msgid "You can vaguely sense this organ… somewhere in your body."
msgstr "この器官が体内の...どこかにあるのを漠然と感じられます。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/armor/integrated.json
msgid "vestigial lungs"
msgid_plural "vestigial lungs"
msgstr[0] "肺痕跡"

#. ~ Description of "vestigial lungs"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/armor/integrated.json
msgid ""
"Breathing is now something you decide to do, rather than a biological "
"necessity."
msgstr "もはや呼吸は生物学的に必要な運動ではなく、やりたいときにする行為になりました。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/armor/integrated.json
msgid "werewolf claws"
msgid_plural "werewolf claws"
msgstr[0] "人狼の爪"

#. ~ Description of "werewolf claws"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/armor/integrated.json
msgid "You have massive claws on your end of your furry fingers."
msgstr "毛むくじゃらの指先に巨大な爪が生えています。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/armor/integrated.json
msgid "werewolf teeth"
msgid_plural "werewolf teeth"
msgstr[0] "人狼の牙"

#. ~ Description of "werewolf teeth"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/armor/integrated.json
msgid ""
"A mouth full of vicious sharp teeth, almost twice as large as a wolf's."
msgstr "通常のオオカミの約2倍の長さの凶暴で鋭い牙が口内に並んでいます。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/comestibles/goblin_fruits.json
msgid "Abstract Goblin Fruit"
msgid_plural "Abstract Goblin Fruits"
msgstr[0] "ゴブリンフルーツ(汎用)"

#. ~ Description of "Abstract Goblin Fruit"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/comestibles/goblin_fruits.json
msgid ""
"Somehow you got a hold of the platonic goblin fruit, the one fruit to rule "
"them all.  It's a bug if you have this, but the lords of the Bright Lands "
"will surely pay a high price for it."
msgstr ""
"どういうわけか、純粋なゴブリンフルーツ、全てのゴブリンフルーツを支配する唯一のフルーツを手に入れました。通常は表示されませんが、晴れの国の領主がきっと高値で買い取ってくれるでしょう。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/comestibles/goblin_fruits.json
msgid "mysterious fruit"
msgid_plural "mysterious fruits"
msgstr[0] "奇妙な果実"

#. ~ Description of "mysterious fruit"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/comestibles/goblin_fruits.json
msgid ""
"Some sort of fruit sealed in a thick shell.  The shell is rigid but seems "
"surprisingly brittle; you could easily peel it open to see what's inside "
"with your bare hands."
msgstr "分厚い皮に包まれた果実のようなものです。皮は硬いですが、驚くほど剥がれやすく、手で剥いて中身を確認できます。"

#. ~ "description" action message of item "mysterious fruit"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/comestibles/goblin_fruits.json
msgid "Peel open the mysterious fruit."
msgstr "奇妙な果実の皮を剥きます。"

#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_GOBLIN_FRUIT_GACHA"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/comestibles/goblin_fruits.json
msgid ""
"You peel open the mysterious fruit and find another whole fruit inside."
msgstr "奇妙な果実の皮を剥いてみると、中には別の果実が丸ごと入っていました。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/comestibles/goblin_fruits.json
msgid "sweet goblin fruit"
msgid_plural "sweet goblin fruits"
msgstr[0] "ゴブリンフルーツ(甘味)"

#. ~ Description of "sweet goblin fruit"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/comestibles/goblin_fruits.json
msgid ""
"This round goblin fruit is reddish-orange with a waxy texture.  It smells "
"sweet with a hint of petrichor."
msgstr "赤みがかったオレンジ色の丸いゴブリンフルーツです。表面はワックスを塗ったように艶やかで、雨が降り始めたときのような甘い香りがします。"

#. ~ "description" action message of item "sweet goblin fruit"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/comestibles/goblin_fruits.json
msgid "Eat the sweet goblin fruit."
msgstr "甘そうなゴブリンフルーツを食べます。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/comestibles/goblin_fruits.json
msgid "iridescent goblin fruit"
msgid_plural "iridescent goblin fruits"
msgstr[0] "ゴブリンフルーツ(虹色)"

#. ~ Description of "iridescent goblin fruit"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/comestibles/goblin_fruits.json
msgid ""
"This oblong goblin fruit shimmers slightly in a rainbow of colors.  It "
"smells like a mix of peach and freshly-baked bread."
msgstr "ほのかに虹色に輝く長方形のゴブリンフルーツです。モモと焼き立てのパンが混ざったような香りがします。"

#. ~ "description" action message of item "iridescent goblin fruit"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/comestibles/goblin_fruits.json
msgid "Eat the iridescent goblin fruit."
msgstr "虹色のゴブリンフルーツを食べます。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/comestibles/goblin_fruits.json
msgid "silvery goblin fruit"
msgid_plural "silvery goblin fruits"
msgstr[0] "ゴブリンフルーツ(銀色)"

#. ~ Description of "silvery goblin fruit"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/comestibles/goblin_fruits.json
msgid ""
"This round goblin fruit looks like a metal sculpture but has the yielding "
"texture of a peach.  It smells like the tang in the air before a storm."
msgstr "金属を彫って作ったような丸いゴブリンフルーツです。モモの果実のような弾力があり、嵐の直前の空気のような香りがします。"

#. ~ "description" action message of item "silvery goblin fruit"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/comestibles/goblin_fruits.json
msgid "Eat the silvery goblin fruit."
msgstr "銀色のゴブリンフルーツを食べます。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/comestibles/goblin_fruits.json
msgid "spicy goblin fruit"
msgid_plural "spicy goblin fruits"
msgstr[0] "ゴブリンフルーツ(辛味)"

#. ~ Description of "spicy goblin fruit"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/comestibles/goblin_fruits.json
msgid ""
"This long, thin goblin fruit is a subdued green color but has a smell that "
"burns your nostrils."
msgstr "地味な緑色の細長いゴブリンフルーツです。鼻孔が焼けるような強い香りがします。"

#. ~ "description" action message of item "spicy goblin fruit"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/comestibles/goblin_fruits.json
msgid "Eat the spicy goblin fruit."
msgstr "辛そうなゴブリンフルーツを食べます。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/comestibles/goblin_fruits.json
msgid "savory goblin fruit"
msgid_plural "savory goblin fruits"
msgstr[0] "ゴブリンフルーツ(香味)"

#. ~ Description of "savory goblin fruit"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/comestibles/goblin_fruits.json
msgid ""
"This round goblin fruit is a bluish color changing to red at the ends.  It "
"smells like a freshly-roasted hunk of meat."
msgstr "全体が青色で上下だけがほんのりと赤くなっている丸いゴブリンフルーツです。焼きたての肉塊のような香りがします。"

#. ~ "description" action message of item "savory goblin fruit"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/comestibles/goblin_fruits.json
msgid "Eat the savory goblin fruit."
msgstr "香ばしいゴブリンフルーツを食べます。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/comestibles/goblin_fruits.json
msgid "rinded goblin fruit"
msgid_plural "rinded goblin fruits"
msgstr[0] "ゴブリンフルーツ(硬皮)"

#. ~ Description of "rinded goblin fruit"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/comestibles/goblin_fruits.json
msgid ""
"This round goblin fruit has a thick red rind with a leaf still attached to "
"the stem.  The leaf seems to move occasionally even when there is no wind."
msgstr "赤く分厚い皮に包まれたゴブリンフルーツです。茎に残っている葉が風もないのに時々動いています。"

#. ~ "description" action message of item "rinded goblin fruit"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/comestibles/goblin_fruits.json
msgid "Eat the rinded goblin fruit."
msgstr "皮の硬いゴブリンフルーツを食べます。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/comestibles/goblin_fruits.json
msgid "minty goblin fruit"
msgid_plural "minty goblin fruits"
msgstr[0] "ゴブリンフルーツ(清涼)"

#. ~ Description of "minty goblin fruit"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/comestibles/goblin_fruits.json
msgid ""
"This dark purple goblin fruit has an overpowering minty smell.  The smell "
"even escapes sealed containers."
msgstr "濃い紫色のゴブリンフルーツです。ミントの香りがプンプン漂っており、容器に密閉しても匂いが漏れ出します。"

#. ~ "description" action message of item "minty goblin fruit"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/comestibles/goblin_fruits.json
msgid "Eat the minty goblin fruit."
msgstr "ミントの香りのゴブリンフルーツを食べます。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/comestibles/goblin_fruits.json
msgid "cubic goblin fruit"
msgid_plural "cubic goblin fruits"
msgstr[0] "ゴブリンフルーツ(箱型)"

#. ~ Description of "cubic goblin fruit"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/comestibles/goblin_fruits.json
msgid ""
"This pale blue goblin fruit is a cube, and the edges are fine enough to "
"leave a line in your thumb when you press on them.  It smells incredibly "
"sour."
msgstr "薄青色のゴブリンフルーツです。立方体の果実は縁に指を押し付けると痕が残るほど硬く、信じられないほど酸っぱい香りがします。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/comestibles/goblin_fruits.json
msgid "smoky goblin fruit"
msgid_plural "smoky goblin fruits"
msgstr[0] "ゴブリンフルーツ(煙臭)"

#. ~ Description of "smoky goblin fruit"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/comestibles/goblin_fruits.json
msgid ""
"This sharply-curved goblin fruit is an off-white color turning red toward "
"the ends.  It smells like the alley outside a club."
msgstr "鋭く湾曲している、端に向かうにつれて赤くなるオフホワイトのゴブリンフルーツです。ナイトクラブの路地裏のような香りがします。"

#. ~ "description" action message of item "smoky goblin fruit"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/comestibles/goblin_fruits.json
msgid "Eat the smoky goblin fruit."
msgstr "煙臭いゴブリンフルーツを食べます。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/comestibles/goblin_fruits.json
msgid "inky goblin fruit"
msgid_plural "inky goblin fruits"
msgstr[0] "ゴブリンフルーツ(漆黒)"

#. ~ Description of "inky goblin fruit"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/comestibles/goblin_fruits.json
msgid ""
"This large goblin fruit is such a deep black color you can't actually tell "
"exactly what shape it is.  It's roundish, but when you hold it, it seems "
"more like you're holding a hole in the fabric of the world.  It smells like "
"an apple."
msgstr ""
"どのような形状なのか正確には分からないほど真っ黒な、大きなゴブリンフルーツです。丸みを帯びていますが、実際に手に持つと、世界に穴が開いてしまったように見えます。リンゴのような香りがします。"

#. ~ "description" action message of item "inky goblin fruit"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/comestibles/goblin_fruits.json
msgid "Eat the inky goblin fruit."
msgstr "漆黒のゴブリンフルーツを食べます。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/comestibles/goblin_fruits.json
msgid "toroid goblin fruit"
msgid_plural "toroid goblin fruits"
msgstr[0] "ゴブリンフルーツ(環状)"

#. ~ Description of "toroid goblin fruit"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/comestibles/goblin_fruits.json
msgid ""
"This yellow-green goblin fruit is shaped like a donut, with six reddish "
"stems spaced equidistantly around its circumference.  You can't imagine what"
" the plant that grew this one looks like."
msgstr ""
"ドーナツのような形をした黄緑色のゴブリンフルーツです。外側には六本の赤みがかった茎が等間隔に突き出ており、一体どうやって実っていたのか想像もつきません。"

#. ~ "description" action message of item "toroid goblin fruit"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/comestibles/goblin_fruits.json
msgid "Eat the toroid goblin fruit."
msgstr "環状のゴブリンフルーツを食べます。"

#. ~ Item name
#. ~ Dolm is a fictional color from the 1920 book "A Voyage to Arcturus"
#. that's a mix of infrared and blue.
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/comestibles/goblin_fruits.json
msgid "dolm goblin fruit"
msgid_plural "dolm goblin fruits"
msgstr[0] "ゴブリンフルーツ(赤青)"

#. ~ Description of "dolm goblin fruit"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/comestibles/goblin_fruits.json
msgid ""
"This teardrop-shaped goblin fruit hurts to look at.  Sometimes it's a dark "
"blue, sometimes it's a feverish red, and sometimes it's a mix of the two "
"that you would previously have sworn could not exist.  It smells faintly "
"peppery with a hint of lemon."
msgstr ""
"見ているだけで目が痛くなりそうな涙型のゴブリンフルーツです。濃い青色にも、情熱的な青色にも、それら二色どちらにも当てはまる存在しない筈の色にも見え、レモンと胡椒が混ざったようなほのかな香りがします。"

#. ~ "description" action message of item "dolm goblin fruit"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/comestibles/goblin_fruits.json
msgid "Eat the dolm goblin fruit."
msgstr "奇妙な色のゴブリンフルーツを食べます。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/comestibles/goblin_fruits.json
msgid "spikey goblin fruit"
msgid_plural "spikey goblin fruits"
msgstr[0] "ゴブリンフルーツ(棘状)"

#. ~ Description of "spikey goblin fruit"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/comestibles/goblin_fruits.json
msgid ""
"This dark-colored goblin fruit is covered in spikes like a pineapple.  "
"Unlike a pineapple, the spikes are yielding and seem part of the fruit, not "
"a rind.  It smells of freshly-cut grass."
msgstr ""
"パイナップルのような棘に覆われた暗い色のゴブリンフルーツです。棘には弾力があり、皮ではなく果実の一部のように見えます。刈りたての草の香りがします。"

#. ~ "description" action message of item "spikey goblin fruit"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/comestibles/goblin_fruits.json
msgid "Eat the spikey goblin fruit."
msgstr "棘に覆われたゴブリンフルーツを食べます。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/comestibles/goblin_fruits.json
msgid "sanguine goblin fruit"
msgid_plural "sanguine goblin fruits"
msgstr[0] "ゴブリンフルーツ(血色)"

#. ~ Description of "sanguine goblin fruit"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/comestibles/goblin_fruits.json
msgid ""
"A dark red goblin fruit with a heavy iron smell.  It feels warm to the "
"touch."
msgstr "赤黒い濃色のゴブリンフルーツです。触ると温かさを感じます。"

#. ~ "description" action message of item "sanguine goblin fruit"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/comestibles/goblin_fruits.json
msgid "Eat the sanguine goblin fruit."
msgstr "赤黒いゴブリンフルーツを食べます。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/comestibles/goblin_fruits.json
msgid "translucent goblin fruit"
msgid_plural "translucent goblin fruits"
msgstr[0] "ゴブリンフルーツ(透光)"

#. ~ Description of "translucent goblin fruit"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/comestibles/goblin_fruits.json
msgid ""
"This goblin fruit looks like a globe of water with seeds and a stem "
"suspended within it.  Despite that, it feels like kiwi, with a slight fuzz "
"and no moisture left on your fingers when you touch it.  It smells like "
"roses."
msgstr ""
"中に種が入っており茎が突き刺さっている水の球体にしか見えないゴブリンフルーツです。意外なことに触っても水分は付着せず、キウイのような毛羽立った触り心地で、バラの香りがします。"

#. ~ "description" action message of item "translucent goblin fruit"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/comestibles/goblin_fruits.json
msgid "Eat the translucent goblin fruit."
msgstr "透けているゴブリンフルーツを食べます。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/comestibles/goblin_fruits.json
msgid "inconspicuous goblin fruit"
msgid_plural "inconspicuous goblin fruits"
msgstr[0] "ゴブリンフルーツ(無味)"

#. ~ Description of "inconspicuous goblin fruit"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/comestibles/goblin_fruits.json
msgid ""
"This goblin fruit looks like a pear and feels like a pear and smells exactly"
" like a pear.  You have no idea how it tastes because the instant you put "
"your tongue to it, your entire mouth goes numb."
msgstr "洋ナシに似た形状と手触り、香りのゴブリンフルーツです。舌が果実に触れた瞬間に口の中が痺れてしまうため、どんな味なのかは分かりません。"

#. ~ "description" action message of item "inconspicuous goblin fruit"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/comestibles/goblin_fruits.json
msgid "Eat the inconspicuous goblin fruit."
msgstr "味の分からないゴブリンフルーツを食べます。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/comestibles/goblin_fruits.json
msgid "crumbly goblin fruit"
msgid_plural "crumbly goblin fruits"
msgstr[0] "ゴブリンフルーツ(脆弱)"

#. ~ Description of "crumbly goblin fruit"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/comestibles/goblin_fruits.json
msgid ""
"This large, curved goblin fruit is a dark blue color and feels like it's "
"already on the verge of rotting.  It takes very little pressure for your "
"fingers to bruise the skin and the flesh inside flakes off when you touch "
"it.  It smells like sun-ripened strawberries."
msgstr ""
"大きく湾曲した形状の、腐りかけているようにも見える濃い青色のゴブリンフルーツです。指で少し押しただけで皮が破れ、果肉が崩れてしまいます。太陽の光を浴びて熟したイチゴのような香りがします。"

#. ~ "description" action message of item "crumbly goblin fruit"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/comestibles/goblin_fruits.json
msgid "Eat the crumbly goblin fruit."
msgstr "もろいゴブリンフルーツを食べます。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/comestibles/goblin_fruits.json
msgid "star-shaped goblin fruit"
msgid_plural "star-shaped goblin fruits"
msgstr[0] "ゴブリンフルーツ(星型)"

#. ~ Description of "star-shaped goblin fruit"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/comestibles/goblin_fruits.json
msgid ""
"This greenish-white goblin fruit is shaped like a star in a much more "
"literal way than a starfruit.  It's almost like if a starfish was an apple."
"  It smells like freshly-laundered clothing."
msgstr ""
"スターフルーツよりも更に星型に近い、緑がかった白いゴブリンフルーツです。まるでリンゴがヒトデに進化したような形をしており、洗いたての衣類の香りがします。"

#. ~ "description" action message of item "star-shaped goblin fruit"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/comestibles/goblin_fruits.json
msgid "Eat the star-shaped goblin fruit."
msgstr "星型のゴブリンフルーツを食べます。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/comestibles/goblin_fruits.json
msgid "shadowy goblin fruit"
msgid_plural "shadowy goblin fruits"
msgstr[0] "ゴブリンフルーツ(薄暗)"

#. ~ Description of "shadowy goblin fruit"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/comestibles/goblin_fruits.json
msgid ""
"This greyish goblin fruit is shaped like a pear, if pears had scales like a "
"pinecone.  There is a pulpy meat underneath the scales."
msgstr "松かさのようなものに覆われた、ナシに似た灰色のゴブリンフルーツです。かさの下に果肉があります。"

#. ~ "description" action message of item "shadowy goblin fruit"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/comestibles/goblin_fruits.json
msgid "Eat the shadowy goblin fruit."
msgstr "薄暗いゴブリンフルーツを食べます。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/comestibles/goblin_fruits.json
msgid "shiny goblin fruit"
msgid_plural "shiny goblin fruits"
msgstr[0] "ゴブリンフルーツ(光輝)"

#. ~ Description of "shiny goblin fruit"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/comestibles/goblin_fruits.json
msgid ""
"This round blue goblin fruit glows bright enough to read by.  The light "
"flickers like firelight, even when the fruit is simply placed on the table."
"  It smells like pine needles soaked in strong alcohol."
msgstr ""
"読書灯代わりにできるほど明るく光る、青く丸いゴブリンフルーツです。その場に置いておくだけでも、光が火のように揺らめきます。強いアルコールに浸した松葉のような香りがします。"

#. ~ "description" action message of item "shiny goblin fruit"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/comestibles/goblin_fruits.json
msgid "Eat the shiny goblin fruit."
msgstr "輝くゴブリンフルーツを食べます。"

#. ~ Player message in false effect in EoC "EOC_GOBLIN_FRUIT_GIANT_GROWTH"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/comestibles/goblin_fruits.json
msgid "You eat the goblin fruit but nothing happens.  Oh well."
msgstr "ゴブリンフルーツを食べましたが何も起こりません。そういうこともあります。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/comestibles/med.json
msgid "eXtra strength aspirin"
msgid_plural "eXtra strength aspirins"
msgstr[0] "超強力アスピリン"

#. ~ Description of "eXtra strength aspirin"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/comestibles/med.json
msgid "Alchemically altered aspirin.  Take to relieve pain and injury."
msgstr "錬金術の力で強化したアスピリンです。痛みを和らげます。"

#. ~ "activation_message" action message of item "eXtra strength aspirin"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/comestibles/med.json
msgid "You take some eXtra strength aspirin."
msgstr "超強力アスピリンを摂取しました。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/comestibles/med.json
msgid "horny rhino pill"
msgid_plural "horny rhino pills"
msgstr[0] "精力剤"

#. ~ Description of "horny rhino pill"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/comestibles/med.json
msgid ""
"DOES YOUR PARTNER FIND YOUR LACK OF SEXUAL POTENCY PATHETIC?!??!  SMASH YOUR"
" BEDROOM LIKE A WILD ANIMAL ALL NIGHT LONG!!!  -ingredients not confirmed "
"with the FDA."
msgstr ""
"最近どうも自信がない！？パートナーに満足してもらえてるか心配！？！？！？野生動物のように、ベッドで一晩中暴れ回ろう！！！FDA未承認の成分が含まれています。"

#. ~ "activation_message" action message of item "horny rhino pill"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/comestibles/med.json
#, c-format
msgid "You take the %s.  Your skin feels like it is vibrating."
msgstr "%sを摂取しました。肌がビクビクと震えているような気がします。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/comestibles/med.json
msgid "blood of the saints"
msgid_plural "blood of the saints"
msgstr[0] "聖者の血"

#. ~ "description" action message of item "blood of the saints"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/comestibles/med.json
msgid "Drink the blood."
msgstr "血を飲みます。"

#. ~ Player message in false effect in EoC "learn_blood_of_saints_2"
#. ~ Message of spell "Blood of Saints"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/comestibles/med.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/spells/item_spells.json
msgid ""
"You imbibed the concoction and you feel your veins flex in a warm glow."
msgstr "調合物を摂取すると、全身の血管が暖かい光で覆われているのを感じました。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/comestibles/raw_fruit.json
msgid "hawthorn petals"
msgid_plural "hawthorn petals"
msgstr[0] "サンザシの花"

#. ~ Description of "hawthorn petals"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/comestibles/raw_fruit.json
msgid "A small salads worth of hawthorn petals."
msgstr "小さなサラダボウル一杯分のサンザシの花です。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/comestibles/raw_fruit.json
msgid "hawthorn berries"
msgid_plural "hawthorn berries"
msgstr[0] "ホーソンベリー"

#. ~ Description of "hawthorn berries"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/comestibles/raw_fruit.json
msgid ""
"Dense clusters of edible red berries grow enormously during autumn, but try "
"not to eat the seeds as they contain cyanide.  Too tart to be very enjoyable"
" they are often used in jams and jellies."
msgstr ""
"秋に収穫できる、食用の赤い果実がたっぷり実った房です。ただし、種にはシアン化物が含まれているので、吐き出すようにしましょう。酸味が強すぎてあまり美味しくないため、大抵はジャムやゼリーなどに加工されます。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/comestibles/raw_fruit.json
msgid "fig"
msgid_plural "figs"
msgstr[0] "イチジク"

#. ~ Description of "fig"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/comestibles/raw_fruit.json
msgid ""
"Figs are a unique fruit resembling a teardrop.  They're about the size of "
"your thumb, filled with hundreds of tiny seeds, and have an edible purple or"
" green peel.  The flesh of the fruit is pink and has a mild, sweet taste.  "
"The scientific name for the fig is Ficus carica."
msgstr ""
"涙滴型のユニークな果物です。紫色や緑色をした親指ほどの果実は食べることができ、中には数百粒の小さな種が詰まっています。果肉はピンク色で、甘く優しい味わいです。樹木の学名はフィカス・カリカです。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/comestibles/raw_fruit.json
msgid "elder ginseng"
msgid_plural "several elder ginseng"
msgstr[0] "百年ニンジン"

#. ~ Description of "elder ginseng"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/comestibles/raw_fruit.json
msgid ""
"A clump of off white roots in the shape of a humanoid body.  It feels "
"strange to the touch, almost alive."
msgstr "人間の形をしたオフホワイト色の根です。まるで生きているような、不思議な弾力があります。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/inventor/armor.json
msgid "helmet of creative juices"
msgid_plural "helmets of creative juices"
msgstr[0] "創作意欲増強ヘルメット"

#. ~ Description of "helmet of creative juices"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/inventor/armor.json
msgid ""
"The helmet of creative juices may look like a child's homemade toy, but its "
"effects when turned on are real enough.  While wearing it, your thoughts are"
" buffered from the outside world by a soft white noise that varies from "
"person to person as to what they actually hear.  Some hear the ocean, a fan "
"blowing or paper crumpling.  Whatever the sound, it helps you to think "
"faster and more creatively than before."
msgstr ""
"見た目は子供が手作りした玩具のようですが、起動したときの効果は本物です。着用している間は小さな雑音が流れて外界の音を遮断し、深く思考できるようになります。実際に聞こえる音は、波音、扇風機の羽音、紙をくしゃくしゃにする音など、人によって様々ですが、その音によってより速く、より創造的な思考を助けます。"

#. ~ "msg" action message of item "helmet of creative juices"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/inventor/armor.json
msgid "The helmet turns on."
msgstr "ヘルメットを起動しました。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/inventor/armor.json
msgid "helmet of creative juices (on)"
msgid_plural "helmets of creative juices (on)"
msgstr[0] "創作意欲増強ヘルメット(オン)"

#. ~ "msg" action message of item "helmet of creative juices (on)"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/inventor/armor.json
msgid "The helmet turns off."
msgstr "ヘルメットを停止しました。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/inventor/armor.json
msgid "vacuum backpack"
msgid_plural "vacuum backpacks"
msgstr[0] "真空バックパック"

#. ~ Description of "vacuum backpack"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/inventor/armor.json
msgid ""
"A backpack with lot of light aluminum bars inside that hold a perfect "
"vacuum, making the backpack much lighter than it should be."
msgstr "中に軽いアルミニウム製の棒が多数並んでいるバックパックです。内部を完全な真空状態にすることで、荷物が大幅に軽くなります。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/inventor/armor.json
msgid "leg weight suspension system"
msgid_plural "leg weight suspension systems"
msgstr[0] "脚部加重調整サスペンション"

#. ~ Description of "leg weight suspension system"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/inventor/armor.json
msgid ""
"Compact leg attachments that distribute your weight onto the ground nearby "
"using some kind of force.  It makes you leave giant spherical footprints, "
"but makes carrying heavy weight much easier."
msgstr ""
"小型のアタッチメントを脚に取り付けることで、何らかの原理によって加重を地面に分散させます。巨大な球状の足跡が残りますが、重い荷物を楽に運べます。"

#. ~ "msg" action message of item "leg weight suspension system"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/inventor/armor.json
msgid "You turn on the weight suspension system."
msgstr "加重調整サスペンションを有効化しました。"

#. ~ "msg" action message of item "leg weight suspension system"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/inventor/armor.json
msgid "You turn off the weight suspension system."
msgstr "加重調整サスペンションを無効化しました。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/inventor/armor.json
msgid "jump driver"
msgid_plural "jump drivers"
msgstr[0] "ジャンプドライバー"

#. ~ Description of "jump driver"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/inventor/armor.json
msgid ""
"Heavily mechanized boots with small integrated battery slot inside.  Upon "
"activation make you jump higher and farther."
msgstr "小型の電池スロットを内蔵した重装備のブーツです。起動するとより高く、より遠くへ跳躍できます。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/inventor/armor.json
msgid "force shield"
msgid_plural "force shields"
msgstr[0] "フォースシールド"

#. ~ Description of "force shield"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/inventor/armor.json
msgid ""
"A small, thin torus with a huge battery case, and a belt.  You can activate "
"it to emit a field that covers your whole body which will decelerate all "
"objects it touches."
msgstr ""
"巨大な電池ケースとベルトが付属している、小さく薄いリング状の装置です。起動すると全身を覆う力場が発生し、それに触れたあらゆる物体を減速させます。"

#. ~ "msg" action message of item "force shield"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/inventor/armor.json
msgid "The torus start to emit an invisible waves."
msgstr "リングが目に見えない波動を発し始めました。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/inventor/armor.json
msgid "force shield (on)"
msgid_plural "force shields (on)"
msgstr[0] "フォースシールド(オン)"

#. ~ "msg" action message of item "force shield (on)"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/inventor/armor.json
msgid "Torus stops working."
msgstr "リングの波動が停止しました。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/inventor/armor.json
msgid "electronic halo"
msgid_plural "electronic halos"
msgstr[0] "電子光輪"

#. ~ Description of "electronic halo"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/inventor/armor.json
msgid ""
"A compact crown boasting a built-in processor and several tiny projectors "
"that beam information directly onto your eye.  It's equipped with enough "
"internal storage and RAM to support a basic AI.  Along with multiple cameras"
" providing 360-degree coverage, this setup enables you to tackle tasks far "
"more efficiently than before.  Plus, there's a battle mode that activates an"
" energy-intensive radiation detector."
msgstr ""
"小型の冠にプロセッサが搭載されており、複数のマイクロプロジェクターを通して計算した情報を眼球に投影します。基礎的なAIを実行するのに十分な性能の内蔵ストレージとRAMを備えています。周囲360度をカバーするカメラ類との組み合わせによって、以前より遥かに効率的に作業を実行できるようになります。更に、電力を大量消費して相手の気配を検知する戦闘モードに切り替えることもできます。"

#. ~ "menu_text" action message of item "electronic halo"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/inventor/armor.json
msgid "Turn on a battle mode"
msgstr "戦闘モード起動"

#. ~ "msg" action message of item "electronic halo"
#. ~ "msg" action message of item ""Overture""
#. ~ "msg" action message of item "wolf's mask"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/inventor/armor.json
msgid "Turn on."
msgstr "システムを起動しました。"

#. ~ "need_charges_msg" action message of item "electronic halo"
#. ~ "need_charges_msg" action message of item ""Overture""
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/inventor/armor.json
msgid "The halo's charge is too low."
msgstr "光輪の電力が足りません。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/inventor/armor.json
msgid "electronic halo (on)"
msgid_plural "electronic halos (on)"
msgstr[0] "電子光輪(オン)"

#. ~ "menu_text" action message of item "electronic halo (on)"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/inventor/armor.json
msgid "Turn off battle mode"
msgstr "戦闘モードに切替"

#. ~ "msg" action message of item "electronic halo (on)"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/inventor/armor.json
msgid "Turn off."
msgstr "システムを停止しました。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/inventor/armor.json
msgid "heavy CQC system"
msgid_plural "heavy CQC systems"
msgstr[0] "ヘビーCQCシステム"

#. ~ Description of "heavy CQC system"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/inventor/armor.json
msgid ""
"This robust system begins at your hands, where it features a squarish steel "
"frame enhanced with strategic protrusions to amplify impact damage by "
"focusing the point of contact.  It extends along your forearms with thick, "
"hardened steel shields protecting both your limbs and the underlying "
"hydraulic mechanisms.  Aluminum tubes channel these hydraulics up into your "
"upper arms, culminating at your back where the central hub for the hydraulic"
" servos is located.  While the system recovers some energy with each "
"movement, its substantial weight and bulk significantly limit the use of "
"your hands for anything else."
msgstr ""
"尖った突起をもつ鋼鉄製の四角いフレームを両手付近から勢いよく突き出すことで、力を一点に集中して与ダメージを高める大型装置です。厚く硬い鋼鉄フレームは前腕部の装置に組み込まれており、装甲に覆われた油圧システムが腕全体に装着されています。油圧用のアルミニウムチューブは上腕を伝って伸びており、根元は背中に固定された油圧サーボのメインパーツと繋がっています。稼働エネルギーは移動することである程度自然回復しますが、装置全体がかなり重く嵩張るため、手を使った他の作業は大幅に制限されます。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/inventor/armor.json
msgid "advanced heavy CQC system"
msgid_plural "advanced heavy CQC systems"
msgstr[0] "改良型ヘビーCQCシステム"

#. ~ Description of "advanced heavy CQC system"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/inventor/armor.json
msgid ""
"An advanced version of the heavy CQC system.  It contain a self-recharging "
"pneumatic tank that slowly builds pressure that you can use in a fight."
msgstr "改良を加えたヘビーCQCシステムです。自動充填式の内蔵空圧タンクがゆっくりと圧力を高め、起動することで戦闘に活用できます。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/inventor/armor.json
msgid "\"Overture\""
msgid_plural "\"Overtures\""
msgstr[0] "「オーバーチュア」"

#. ~ Description of ""Overture""
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/inventor/armor.json
msgid ""
"A bulky mess of coils and wires that goes from your fists to your shoulder, "
"and a slot for a small battery behind the elbow.  Upon activation it will "
"start to emit huge electrical charges, frying your enemies when attacked in "
"melee."
msgstr ""
"拳から肩にかけて装着する、多数のコイルとワイヤーを寄せ集めて作った装置です。肘の部分には小型の電池用スロットが備わっています。起動すると莫大な電荷を一点に集中させ、近接攻撃力を増大させます。"

#. ~ "menu_text" action message of item ""Overture""
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/inventor/armor.json
msgid "Turn on the overture"
msgstr "起動する"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/inventor/armor.json
msgid "\"Overture\" (on)"
msgid_plural "\"Overtures\" (on)"
msgstr[0] "「オーバーチュア」(オン)"

#. ~ "msg" action message of item ""Overture" (on)"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/inventor/armor.json
msgid "The fist turns off."
msgstr "拳に集まっていた電撃が霧散しました。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/inventor/armor.json
msgid "wolf's mask"
msgid_plural "wolf's masks"
msgstr[0] "狼のマスク"

#. ~ Description of "wolf's mask"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/inventor/armor.json
msgid ""
"A huge, respirator-like mask covering the whole head except for the right "
"eye.  Upon activation it protects you lungs from toxic gases as well as "
"improving your breathing and stamina."
msgstr ""
"右目部分にだけ穴が開いた、顔全体を覆う巨大な人工呼吸器のようなマスクです。起動すると有毒ガスから肺を守り、呼吸機能を改善し、スタミナを向上させます。"

#. ~ "menu_text" action message of item "wolf's mask"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/inventor/armor.json
msgid "Turn on the mask"
msgstr "起動する"

#. ~ "need_charges_msg" action message of item "wolf's mask"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/inventor/armor.json
msgid "The mask's charge is too low."
msgstr "マスクの電力が足りません。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/inventor/armor.json
msgid "wolf's mask (on)"
msgid_plural "a few wolf's mask (on)"
msgstr[0] "狼のマスク(オン)"

#. ~ "msg" action message of item "wolf's mask (on)"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/inventor/armor.json
msgid "The mask stops working."
msgstr "マスクの機能が停止しました。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/inventor/armor.json
msgid "magnetic holster"
msgid_plural "magnetic holsters"
msgstr[0] "マグネティックホルスター"

#. ~ Description of "magnetic holster"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/inventor/armor.json
msgid ""
"A long strap with small, powerful gravity field emitters on the surface.  "
"Allows one to strap and carry almost anything."
msgstr "表面に強力な小型重力場エミッターを備えた長いストラップです。ほとんどあらゆるものを吊るして持ち運べます。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/inventor/bots.json
msgid "inactive sniper bot"
msgid_plural "inactive sniper bots"
msgstr[0] "狙撃ロボット(停止)"

#. ~ Description of "inactive sniper bot"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/inventor/bots.json
msgid ""
"A compressed sniper sentry.  Ludicrous, physical law violating compression "
"allows you to fit them into a small metal cylinder, but the weight "
"compression is not as effective."
msgstr ""
"小さく縮んでいる狙撃ロボットです。物理法則に反する奇妙な圧縮技術によって、金属製の小さな円筒に収めることができますが、重量は起動時とそれほど変わりません。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/inventor/bots.json
msgid "inactive shotgun bot"
msgid_plural "inactive shotgun bots"
msgstr[0] "ショットガンロボット(停止)"

#. ~ Description of "inactive shotgun bot"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/inventor/bots.json
msgid ""
"A compressed shotgun sentry.  Ludicrous, physical law violating compression "
"allows you to fit them into a small metal cylinder, but the weight "
"compression is not as effective."
msgstr ""
"小さく縮んでいるショットガンロボットです。物理法則に反する奇妙な圧縮技術によって、金属製の小さな円筒に収めることができますが、重量は起動時とそれほど変わりません。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/inventor/bots.json
msgid "inactive melee bot"
msgid_plural "inactive melee bots"
msgstr[0] "カミソリロボット(停止)"

#. ~ Description of "inactive melee bot"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/inventor/bots.json
msgid ""
"A compressed melee sentry.  Ludicrous, physical law violating compression "
"allows you to fit them into a small metal cylinder, but the weight "
"compression is not as effective."
msgstr ""
"小さく縮んでいるカミソリロボットです。物理法則に反する奇妙な圧縮技術によって、金属製の小さな円筒に収めることができますが、重量は起動時とそれほど変わりません。"

#. ~ Name of a gun
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/inventor/gun.json
msgid "battery-powered laser pistol"
msgid_plural "battery-powered laser pistols"
msgstr[0] "ハンドガン(電池式ﾚｰｻﾞｰﾋﾟｽﾄﾙ)"

#. ~ Description of gun "battery-powered laser pistol"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/inventor/gun.json
msgid ""
"This handgun looks like it came from some sci-fi journal.  It has a recharge"
" slot that is somehow capable of using almost any type of battery."
msgstr "SF雑誌に掲載されそうな見た目のハンドガンです。充電スロットが付いており、原理は不明ですがほぼあらゆる種類の電池に対応しています。"

#. ~ Valid mod location of gun
#. ~ Location of gun mod
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/inventor/gun.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/inventor/gunmods.json
msgid "heat sink"
msgstr "放熱板"

#. ~ Valid mod location of gun
#. ~ Location of gun mod
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/inventor/gun.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/inventor/gunmods.json
msgid "radiator"
msgstr "放熱タンク"

#. ~ Name of a gun
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/inventor/gun.json
msgid "ray gun"
msgid_plural "ray guns"
msgstr[0] "サブマシンガン(ﾚｲｶﾞﾝ)"

#. ~ Description of gun "ray gun"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/inventor/gun.json
msgid ""
"A ray gun with lots of cylinders and whorling cables that light up. It has a"
" recharge slot that is somehow capable of using almost any type of battery."
msgstr ""
"たくさんのシリンダーや渦巻くケーブルがピカピカ光っている光線銃です。充電スロットが付いており、原理は不明ですがほぼあらゆる種類の電池に対応しています。"

#. ~ Name of a gun
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/inventor/gun.json
msgid "the hyperboloid"
msgid_plural "the hyperboloids"
msgstr[0] "ライフル(ﾊｲﾊﾟｰﾎﾞﾛｲﾄﾞ)"

#. ~ Description of gun "the hyperboloid"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/inventor/gun.json
msgid ""
"Pretty bulky, this laser rifle has double the amount of lenses and emitters,"
" which makes it really devastating after some modding."
msgstr "通常の2倍量のレンズとエミッターが組み込まれた、非常に大きなレーザーライフルです。更に改造を加えれば非常に破壊的な威力を実現できます。"

#. ~ Name of a gun
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/inventor/gun.json
msgid "death ray"
msgid_plural "death rays"
msgstr[0] "ライフル(ﾃﾞｽﾚｲ)"

#. ~ Description of gun "death ray"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/inventor/gun.json
msgid ""
"The Aetheric Death Ray, glowing a menacing green.  It hums with a barely "
"controlled hatred of organic life.  It must recharge on its own, as there "
"are no ports or battery slots on it.  It's sleek and smooth and evil."
msgstr ""
"威嚇的な緑色に輝くエーテリック・デス・レイです。カタカタと震え、有機物に対する憎悪をかろうじて抑えています。電源ポートや充電スロットは付いていないため、何らかの充電方法を探す必要があります。滑らかで艶がある、凶悪な銃です。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/inventor/gun.json
msgid "bio detonator"
msgid_plural "bio detonators"
msgstr[0] "バイオデトネイター"

#. ~ Description of "bio detonator"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/inventor/gun.json
msgid ""
"A long, huge barrel drum mortar with a small device in the very end.  It is "
"collapsible, and you can comfortably wear it using a strap."
msgstr "先端部に小さな装置が付いている、長く巨大な筒状の迫撃砲です。折り畳める作りになっており、ストラップで着用すれば楽に持ち運べます。"

#. ~ Item name
#. ~ Name of an ammunition type
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/inventor/gun.json
msgid "bio-warhead"
msgid_plural "bio-warheads"
msgstr[0] "バイオ弾"

#. ~ Description of "bio-warhead"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/inventor/gun.json
msgid ""
"So you decided to become an inventor and instead of inventing something good"
" for mankind, you invented this?  You should be ashamed."
msgstr "発明家であると言いつつ、人類の役にも立たないこんなものを発明したのは何故ですか？恥を知りなさい。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/inventor/gun.json
msgid "ion rifle"
msgid_plural "ion rifles"
msgstr[0] "イオンライフル"

#. ~ Description of "ion rifle"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/inventor/gun.json
msgid ""
"Something something ion, something something wide area.  Don't even ask."
msgstr "イオンだかなんだかの力によって、広範囲をなんとかかんとかします。これ以上は何も説明できません。"

#. ~ Name of a gun
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/inventor/gun.json
msgid "\"Repeater\""
msgid_plural "\"Repeater\""
msgstr[0] "ライフル(7.62x51mm/\"ﾘﾋﾟｰﾀｰ\")"

#. ~ Description of gun ""Repeater""
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/inventor/gun.json
msgid ""
"A hand-made lever action sniper rifle with an extremely long barrel.  "
"Logically such a barrel shouldn't function properly, but somehow it not only"
" works well enough, it also accelerates the bullet much more than anyone "
"could expect.  Two internal magazine tubes under the barrel accept 15 "
"7.62x51 rounds each."
msgstr ""
"非常に長い銃身をもつ、手製のレバーアクションスナイパーライフルです。常識的に考えて、これほど長い銃身がまともに機能するはずがないのですが、何故か不具合はなく、しかも弾丸を想定以上に加速させます。銃身の下にある2本のチューブ型弾倉には、それぞれ15発の7.62x51弾を装填できます。"

#. ~ Name of a gun
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/inventor/gun.json
msgid "shredder shotgun"
msgid_plural "shredder shotguns"
msgstr[0] "ショットガン(12ga/ｼｭﾚｯﾀﾞｰ)"

#. ~ Description of gun "shredder shotgun"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/inventor/gun.json
msgid ""
"An abominably huge, two barrel Gast system shotgun.  Recoil from the first "
"shot powers the piston that loads a shell into the second barrel, and vice "
"versa, making it shoot approximately 1000rpm at max.  The biggest part of a "
"weapon is a giant, multi tube magazine, which can store 240 shells at once."
"  It makes the weapon extremely bulky, so the only way you can utilize it is"
" by handling it like a chainsaw, or installing it on a turret base."
msgstr ""
"巨大なガスト式二連ショットガンです。片方の銃身から弾を発射した反動でピストンが動き、もう片方の銃身に薬莢を装填して、という動きを繰り返すことで最大1000RPMの連射速度を実現します。この銃の中でも最大のパーツは、一度に240発の弾薬を装填できる巨大なマルチチューブ型弾倉です。弾倉のせいで非常に嵩張るため、チェーンソーのように腰だめで構えるか、あるいはタレットに搭載するくらいしか活用法がありません。"

#. ~ Name of a gun
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/inventor/gun.json
msgid "acceleratron"
msgid_plural "acceleratrons"
msgstr[0] "ライフル(ｱｸｾﾗﾚｲﾄﾛﾝ)"

#. ~ Description of gun "acceleratron"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/inventor/gun.json
msgid ""
"A carbine-sized particle cannon.  It shoots microscopic particles, and due "
"the size of projectile you don't need to reload it for decades.  Instead, "
"you need a ton of energy to generate enough magnetic force.  The damage of "
"the weapon is not great, but it has perfect armor penetration, and no "
"physical armor can stop its bullets."
msgstr ""
"カービン銃サイズの粒子砲です。非常に微細な粒子を発射するため、一度粒子を装填しておけば、その先数十年は再装填の必要がありません。その代わり、粒子を発射できるだけの磁力を発生させるには大量の電力が必要です。威力はそれほど高くありませんが、優れた装甲貫通性能をもっており、どんな物理装甲もこの弾丸を止めることはできません。"

#. ~ Name of a gun
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/inventor/gun.json
msgid "inventor's grenade launcher"
msgid_plural "inventor's grenade launchers"
msgstr[0] "ライフル(ｲﾝﾍﾞﾝﾀｰｽﾞｸﾞﾚﾈｰﾄﾞﾗﾝﾁｬｰ)"

#. ~ Description of gun "inventor's grenade launcher"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/inventor/gun.json
msgid ""
"Transformed from a tool, this weapon can emit giant clouds of energy, "
"destroying everything on their path."
msgstr "工具を改造して作ったこの銃は、巨大なエネルギーの塊を発射して行く手を阻むあらゆるものを破壊します。"

#. ~ Valid mod location of gun
#. ~ Gun mod name
#. ~ Location of gun mod
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/inventor/gun.json
msgid "energy transformer"
msgid_plural "energy transformers"
msgstr[0] "エネルギー変換器"

#. ~ Description of gun mod "energy transformer"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/inventor/gun.json
msgid "A default energy transformer that converts the power into raw energy."
msgstr "電力を攻撃力に変える、基本的な変換器です。"

#. ~ Target of gun mod
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/inventor/gun.json
msgctxt "gun_type_type"
msgid "inventor_glauncher"
msgstr "inventor_glauncher"

#. ~ Gun mod name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/inventor/gun.json
msgid "incendiary energy transformer"
msgid_plural "incendiary energy transformers"
msgstr[0] "エネルギー変換器(焼夷弾)"

#. ~ Description of gun mod "incendiary energy transformer"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/inventor/gun.json
msgid ""
"A modified energy transformer.  It converts the power flow into a slow heat "
"cloud that ignites everything around it."
msgstr "エネルギー変換器を改造したものです。電力を徐々に蓄積する熱の塊に変えることで、周囲のあらゆるものを発火させます。"

#. ~ Gun mod name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/inventor/gun.json
msgid "voltaic energy transformer"
msgid_plural "voltaic energy transformers"
msgstr[0] "エネルギー変換器(電撃弾)"

#. ~ Description of gun mod "voltaic energy transformer"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/inventor/gun.json
msgid ""
"Instead of converting energy this transformer emits it as it is, generating "
"a giant high-voltage cloud."
msgstr "電力を変換せずそのまま送り出すことで、巨大な高電圧の雲を放出します。"

#. ~ Gun mod name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/inventor/gun.json
msgid "focused energy transformer"
msgid_plural "focused energy transformers"
msgstr[0] "エネルギー変換器(光線弾)"

#. ~ Description of gun mod "focused energy transformer"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/inventor/gun.json
msgid ""
"A bunch of powerful lenses and reflectors that transform the energy output "
"into a powerful directed laser beam."
msgstr "強力なレンズと反射装置を使い、電力を威力の高い指向性レーザービームに変換します。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/inventor/gun.json
msgid "inventor's noise grenade"
msgid_plural "inventor's noise grenades"
msgstr[0] "エネルギー手榴弾"

#. ~ Description of "inventor's noise grenade"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/inventor/gun.json
msgid ""
"A small energy grenade with an additional timer slapped onto it.  When "
"triggered, the timer will start to count to 70 seconds.  As it ends a "
"massive explosion will rip your enemies apart."
msgstr "タイマーが付いた小型のエネルギー手榴弾です。起動すると70秒後に大爆発を引き起こし、敵を粉みじんに吹っ飛ばします。"

#. ~ "msg" action message of item "inventor's noise grenade"
#. ~ "msg" action message of item "inventor's noise EMP grenade"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/inventor/gun.json
msgid "You trigger the mechanism, and it starts to whistle!"
msgstr "起動すると、けたたましい音が鳴り響きました！"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/inventor/gun.json
msgid "inventor's noise EMP grenade"
msgid_plural "inventor's noise EMP grenades"
msgstr[0] "エネルギーEMP手榴弾"

#. ~ Description of "inventor's noise EMP grenade"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/inventor/gun.json
msgid ""
"A small energy grenade with an additional timer and a whistle slapped onto "
"it.   When triggered, the timer will start to count to 70 seconds.  As it "
"ends a huge EMP explosion will cover the zone."
msgstr "タイマーとアラームが付いた小型のエネルギー手榴弾です。起動すると70秒後に大規模な電磁パルスが周囲一帯を覆います。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/inventor/gun.json
msgid "inventor's noise fire grenade"
msgid_plural "inventor's noise fire grenades"
msgstr[0] "エネルギー焼夷手榴弾"

#. ~ Description of "inventor's noise fire grenade"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/inventor/gun.json
msgid ""
"A small energy grenade with an additional timer slapped onto it.  When "
"triggered, the timer will start to count to 70 seconds.  As it ends a "
"massive fire explosion will rip your enemies apart."
msgstr "タイマーが付いた小型のエネルギー手榴弾です。起動すると70秒後に大爆発を引き起こし、敵を粉みじんに吹っ飛ばします。"

#. ~ "msg" action message of item "inventor's noise fire grenade"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/inventor/gun.json
msgid "You trigger the mechanism, and it start to whistle!"
msgstr "起動すると、警報音が鳴りだしました！"

#. ~ Name of a gun
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/inventor/gun.json
msgid "sonic gun"
msgid_plural "sonic guns"
msgstr[0] "ソニックガン"

#. ~ Description of gun "sonic gun"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/inventor/gun.json
msgid ""
"A small, square tube with a pistol grip that can emit a sonic waves, "
"creating cavitation and tissue damage inside living creatures.  It's pretty "
"weak as a weapon, but using extremely high frequency sounds makes it silent "
"for most creatures you can met.  It would be fun to listen some music using "
"it, but alas."
msgstr ""
"音波の放射で生物に空洞現象を発生させて肉体にダメージを与える、ピストルグリップが付いた小さな四角い箱です。銃器としての威力はかなり弱いですが、非常に高い周波数の音を発するため、大抵の生物に気付かれずに近付くことができます。これを使って音楽を聴くことができれば楽しそうですが、残念ながらそれは不可能です。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/inventor/gun.json
msgid "\"Boiler\""
msgid_plural "\"Boilers\""
msgstr[0] "「ボイラー」"

#. ~ Description of ""Boiler""
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/inventor/gun.json
msgid ""
"A rifle-sized tool that can concentrate heat in a huge range.  It lost its "
"ability to work as a tool as you don't want to accidentally evaporate your "
"materials, but the damage output pays for this with interest."
msgstr ""
"かなりの広範囲に熱線を照射できる、ライフルサイズの工具です。誤って材料を蒸発させる危険があるため材料を加工する機能が取り除かれていますが、欠点を補って余りある強さの熱を生み出せます。"

#. ~ Name of a gun
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/inventor/gun.json
msgid "blocky pistol"
msgid_plural "blocky pistols"
msgstr[0] "ハンドガン(ﾌﾞﾛｯｸﾋﾟｽﾄﾙ)"

#. ~ Description of gun "blocky pistol"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/inventor/gun.json
msgid ""
"A square abomination resembling a pistol, but with a collapsible outer "
"magazine under the barrel.  This overengineered piece of metal is able to "
"vary the size of chamber, which makes it able to shoot any round up to "
"shotgun shells.  You spent a really long time to make it fit into a common "
"holster."
msgstr ""
"下部に折り畳み式の弾倉が付いた、箱を無秩序に並べて作ったピストルのような銃です。この銃に使われている未知の金属は銃弾に合うように口径を変えられるため、ショットガン用の弾も含めたあらゆる弾薬を発射できます。非常に時間はかかりますが、一般的なホルスターに収納できます。"

#. ~ Gun mod name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/inventor/gunmods.json
msgid "projectile accelerator"
msgid_plural "projectile accelerators"
msgstr[0] "発射体加速装置"

#. ~ Description of gun mod "projectile accelerator"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/inventor/gunmods.json
msgid ""
"A small cylinder, reminiscent of a muzzle booster.  It can be mounted onto "
"the end of your barrel, which somehow increases the speed of the projectile."
"  It also makes the gun much louder and difficult to hold after each shot."
msgstr ""
"リコイルブースターに似た形状の小型パーツです。銃身の先端に装着することで、原理は不明ですが弾丸の発射速度が向上します。また、銃声は大きくなり、発砲する度に保持が困難になるほど反動が増加します。"

#. ~ Gun mod name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/inventor/gunmods.json
msgid "rocket bullets"
msgid_plural "rocket bullets"
msgstr[0] "弾丸ロケット"

#. ~ Description of gun mod "rocket bullets"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/inventor/gunmods.json
msgid ""
"You can't properly explain how this thing works, but the end result should "
"be clear - faster bullet with better damage, but awful dispersion."
msgstr "仕組みはよく分かりませんが、効果は一目瞭然です。弾丸の速度と威力が向上しますが、非常に分散しやすくなります。"

#. ~ Gun mod name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/inventor/gunmods.json
msgid "force silencer"
msgid_plural "force silencers"
msgstr[0] "フォースサイレンサー"

#. ~ Description of gun mod "force silencer"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/inventor/gunmods.json
msgid ""
"This barrel attachment drastically decreases any sound that your gun emits."
"  Sadly, the damage and range of the weapon decrease respectively."
msgstr "銃身に取り付けると銃声を大幅に軽減する部品です。残念ながら、威力と射程は減少します。"

#. ~ Gun mod name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/inventor/gunmods.json
msgid "wide-shot shotgun choke"
msgid_plural "wide-shot shotgun chokes"
msgstr[0] "ワイドショットチョーク"

#. ~ Description of gun mod "wide-shot shotgun choke"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/inventor/gunmods.json
msgid ""
"A choke that makes the pellets spread out wide to hit multiple enemies.  The"
" pellets will have shorter range but somehow deals higher damage."
msgstr "散弾のペレットが拡散して複数の敵を攻撃できるように、ショットガンを改造します。射程距離は短くなりますが、どういう原理か威力が上昇します。"

#. ~ Gun mod name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/inventor/gunmods.json
msgid "pistol booster"
msgid_plural "pistol boosters"
msgstr[0] "ピストルブースター"

#. ~ Description of gun mod "pistol booster"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/inventor/gunmods.json
msgid ""
"A set of mechanisms, that alter the action of the blocky pistol enough to "
"make it something in-between a machine pistol and a submachine gun."
msgstr "ブロックピストルに改造を加え、マシンピストルとサブマシンガンの中間にあたる銃として使えるようにするための部品一式です。"

#. ~ Target of gun mod
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/inventor/gunmods.json
msgctxt "gun_type_type"
msgid "inventor_pistol"
msgstr "inventor_pistol"

#. ~ Gun mod name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/inventor/gunmods.json
msgid "beam array"
msgid_plural "beam arrays"
msgstr[0] "ビームアレイ"

#. ~ Description of gun mod "beam array"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/inventor/gunmods.json
msgid ""
"A set of modified weapon lens that increase the output energy of the laser "
"at expense of its range."
msgstr "レーザーの出力エネルギーが増幅され、射程距離が短くなる、レーザー兵器用の改造レンズセットです。"

#. ~ Description of gun mod "focusing lens"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/inventor/gunmods.json
msgid ""
"A set of modified weapon lens that increases the range of the weapon at the "
"price of its damage."
msgstr "射程距離が長くなり威力が減少する、レーザー兵器用の改造レンズセットです。"

#. ~ Gun mod name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/inventor/gunmods.json
msgid "improved capacitors"
msgid_plural "improved capacitors"
msgstr[0] "改良型コンデンサ"

#. ~ Description of gun mod "improved capacitors"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/inventor/gunmods.json
msgid ""
"A set of powerful capacitors that increase the damage of a beam at the price"
" of doubling power consumption."
msgstr "消費電力が2倍になる代わりにビームの威力が増大する強力なコンデンサセットです。"

#. ~ Gun mod name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/inventor/gunmods.json
msgid "high-powered capacitors"
msgid_plural "high-powered capacitors"
msgstr[0] "高出力コンデンサ"

#. ~ Description of gun mod "high-powered capacitors"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/inventor/gunmods.json
msgid ""
"A set of extremely powerful capacitors which can turn a common laser beam "
"into powerful anti-materiel penetrator.  It spends five times more energy "
"than the default capacitor, so you need a lot of batteries to use it."
msgstr ""
"一般的なレーザービームを強力な対人貫通弾に変える、非常に出力の高いコンデンサセットです。通常のコンデンサの5倍の電力を消費するため、電源を大量に用意しておく必要があります。"

#. ~ Gun mod name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/inventor/gunmods.json
msgid "energy-effective pump sources"
msgid_plural "energy-effective pump sources"
msgstr[0] "高効率励起装置"

#. ~ Description of gun mod "energy-effective pump sources"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/inventor/gunmods.json
msgid ""
"A set of improved electric discharges, that uses energy more efficiently "
"then standard.  It makes you spend much less energy per shot, but the "
"overall output of a system is a bit smaller."
msgstr ""
"標準的なものより効率よく電力を消費する、改良された放電装置です。エネルギー兵器の一発あたりの電力消費が大幅に軽減されますが、威力は全体的に多少低下します。"

#. ~ Gun mod name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/inventor/gunmods.json
msgid "advanced heat exchanger"
msgid_plural "advanced heat exchangers"
msgstr[0] "改良型熱交換器"

#. ~ Description of gun mod "advanced heat exchanger"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/inventor/gunmods.json
msgid ""
"A set of fins in mathematically precise order, that make heat transferring "
"much more efficient than your original implementation."
msgstr "計算し尽くされた冷却フィンの配置によって、通常の部品よりも遥かに効率的に熱が伝達されます。"

#. ~ Gun mod name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/inventor/gunmods.json
msgid "freezing heat sink"
msgid_plural "freezing heat sinks"
msgstr[0] "氷結放熱板"

#. ~ Description of gun mod "freezing heat sink"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/inventor/gunmods.json
msgid ""
"A small piece of completely frozen metal.  It grants a massive cooling "
"improvement, but the weapon circuits don't work properly with this mod, "
"making you spend more energy per shot."
msgstr "冷え切った金属の小片です。銃に取り付けると冷却性能が大幅に改善しますが、内部回路に悪影響を与えるため、1発毎の消費エネルギーは増加します。"

#. ~ Gun mod name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/inventor/gunmods.json
msgid "heat recuperator"
msgid_plural "heat recuperators"
msgstr[0] "熱回収機構"

#. ~ Description of gun mod "heat recuperator"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/inventor/gunmods.json
msgid ""
"Put some amount of the heat exchange from the gun back into platform loop.  "
"Decrease amount of energy used, and increase the heat output of the weapon, "
"but also its heat generation within the loop."
msgstr "銃の放熱の一部をプラットフォーム内のエネルギー循環に再利用します。消費エネルギーが軽減され、銃の出力が増大しますが、放熱量も増加します。"

#. ~ Gun mod name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/inventor/gunmods.json
msgid "glass cannon energy conversion"
msgid_plural "glass cannon energy conversions"
msgstr[0] "攻撃特化エネルギー変換"

#. ~ Description of gun mod "glass cannon energy conversion"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/inventor/gunmods.json
msgid ""
"Alter the energy loop in the platform - instead of doing multiple shots, it "
"store all the power, and use most of it in a single shot.  Effectively "
"transform the weapon into one or two shot recoilless rifle."
msgstr ""
"プラットフォーム内のエネルギー循環システムに変更を加えます。連続で発射する代わりにエネルギーを多く蓄え、一度の射撃に費やします。銃器を1発もしくは2発しか発射できない無反動ライフルに変換します。"

#. ~ Gun mod name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/inventor/gunmods.json
msgid "secondary radiator"
msgid_plural "secondary radiators"
msgstr[0] "追加放熱タンク"

#. ~ Description of gun mod "secondary radiator"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/inventor/gunmods.json
msgid ""
"Additional radiator for your energy weapon.  Someone may say it's because "
"you don't know how to use your gun properly."
msgstr "エネルギー銃器用の追加放熱板です。銃の正しい使い方を知らないからこんな改造をする羽目になるんだと言われてしまいそうです。"

#. ~ Gun mod name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/inventor/gunmods.json
msgid "huge radiator"
msgid_plural "huge radiators"
msgstr[0] "大型放熱タンク"

#. ~ Description of gun mod "huge radiator"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/inventor/gunmods.json
msgid ""
"Replace the entire radiator in the platform into this hefty and bulky piece "
"of metal, trading a portability of a gun for a massive overheat buffer."
msgstr "プラットフォームの放熱タンク全体をこの大きく嵩張る金属塊に置き換えることで、銃の携帯性を犠牲にして、非常に効果的な過熱対策を確保します。"

#. ~ Gun mod name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/inventor/gunmods.json
msgid "skeletonized heat sink"
msgid_plural "skeletonized heat sinks"
msgstr[0] "スケルトン放熱板"

#. ~ Description of gun mod "skeletonized heat sink"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/inventor/gunmods.json
msgid ""
"Replace a large part of the weapon's radiator with an additional cooling "
"unit.  The gun overheats faster, but recovers from it at a faster rate."
msgstr "銃の放熱タンクの大部分を後付け冷却ユニットに置き換えます。銃がより早く過熱しますが、過熱から回復する速度も早まります。"

#. ~ Gun mod name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/inventor/gunmods.json
msgid "additional capacitors"
msgid_plural "additional capacitors"
msgstr[0] "追加コンデンサ"

#. ~ Description of gun mod "additional capacitors"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/inventor/gunmods.json
msgid ""
"Replace a large portion of the radiator with additional capacitors.  The gun"
" will barely cool off, but the damage output may be worth it."
msgstr "銃の放熱タンクの大部分を追加コンデンサに置き換えます。銃はほとんど冷却されませんが、高威力にはそれだけの価値があるかもしれません。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/inventor/melee.json
msgid "wolf sledge"
msgid_plural "wolf sledges"
msgstr[0] "ウルフスレッジ"

#. ~ Description of "wolf sledge"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/inventor/melee.json
msgid ""
"A long, solid, crafted steel haft, and a bulky, comma-like head.  It feels "
"really massive, but it is surprisingly easy to swing, and you will do more "
"damage as your level increases.  You can throw it like a boomerang, and the "
"damage of throw depend on your throwing skill level."
msgstr ""
"頑丈に強化された長い鋼鉄製の柄にコンマ(,)のようゴツゴツした形状のヘッドが付いています。重厚感がありますが、意外と振り回しやすく、上手く扱えばその分敵へのダメージも増加します。投げればブーメランのように手元に戻ってきます。投げて命中した際の与ダメージは投擲のスキルレベルに依存します。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/inventor/melee.json
msgid "chainsaw spear (off)"
msgid_plural "chainsaw spears (off)"
msgstr[0] "チェーンソースピア(オフ)"

#. ~ Description of "chainsaw spear (off)"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/inventor/melee.json
msgid ""
"A hand-made lightened engine, with chain blades on a long stick.  The only "
"reason it works without falling apart is because your calculations can't be "
"wrong."
msgstr "軽量化した自作エンジン付きチェーンソーを長い棒の先端に取り付けた武器です。技術計算が完璧なので、ちゃんと壊れずに起動します。"

#. ~ "msg" action message of item "chainsaw spear (off)"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/inventor/melee.json
msgid "You turn on the chainsaw spear."
msgstr "チェーンソースピアの電源を入れました。"

#. ~ "need_charges_msg" action message of item "chainsaw spear (off)"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/inventor/melee.json
msgid "The chainsaw spear battery is dead."
msgstr "チェーンソースピアの電力が足りません。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/inventor/melee.json
msgid "chainsaw spear (on)"
msgid_plural "chainsaw spears (on)"
msgstr[0] "チェーンソースピア(オン)"

#. ~ "msg" action message of item "chainsaw spear (on)"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/inventor/melee.json
msgid "You turn off the chainsaw spear."
msgstr "チェーンソースピアの電源を切りました。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/inventor/melee.json
msgid "megachette (folded)"
msgid_plural "megachettes (folded)"
msgstr[0] "メガマチェット(折畳)"

#. ~ Description of "megachette (folded)"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/inventor/melee.json
msgid "Probably a great weapon, it is folded now."
msgstr "恐らくすごい武器なのでしょう。今は折り畳まれています。"

#. ~ "msg" action message of item "megachette (folded)"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/inventor/melee.json
msgid "With a quiet click, the megachette is unfolded."
msgstr "小さな音を立てて、メガマチェットの刃が展開されました。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/inventor/melee.json
msgid "megachette (extended)"
msgid_plural "megachettes (extended)"
msgstr[0] "メガマチェット(展開)"

#. ~ Description of "megachette (extended)"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/inventor/melee.json
msgid ""
"A completely flat, single-edged blade.  While very visually appealing, it is"
" no less deadly.  It can be folded more times than makes sense."
msgstr "完全に平らな片刃のマチェットです。非常にすごそうに見えますが、威力はそれなりです。特に意味はありませんが、折り畳めます。"

#. ~ "msg" action message of item "megachette (extended)"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/inventor/melee.json
msgid "With a few moves, the megachette is folded."
msgstr "少し手を動かすだけで、メガマチェットの刃が折り畳まれました。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/inventor/melee.json
msgid "binary sword"
msgid_plural "binary swords"
msgstr[0] "バイナリーソード"

#. ~ Description of "binary sword"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/inventor/melee.json
msgid ""
"A relatively heavy two-handed sword with \"100111100\" inscribed on the "
"blade, perhaps to appear fancier than it truly is.  Still, it is a "
"surprisingly good weapon."
msgstr "装飾のためなのか刃に「100111100」と刻まれている、比較的重い両手剣です。意外と優秀な武器です。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/inventor/melee.json
msgid "\"Neon Angle\" (off)"
msgid_plural "\"Neon Angles\" (off)"
msgstr[0] "「ネオン・エンジェル」(オフ)"

#. ~ Description of ""Neon Angle" (off)"
#. ~ Description of ""Neon Angle" (on)"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/inventor/melee.json
msgid ""
"A light, hollow aluminum bar with an installed plasma torch on the end in "
"the form of a circle, emitting 28000 centrigrades of heat on demand.  This "
"probably violates dozens of OSHA regulations."
msgstr ""
"一端に球形のプラズマトーチが取り付けられた、アルミニウム製の中空の軽い棒です。起動するとセ氏28000度の熱を放出します。恐らく労働安全衛生法に定められた何十もの規制に違反しています。"

#. ~ "msg" action message of item ""Neon Angle" (off)"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/inventor/melee.json
msgid "You turn on your \"Neon Angle\"."
msgstr "「ネオン・エンジェル」の電源を入れました。"

#. ~ "need_charges_msg" action message of item ""Neon Angle" (off)"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/inventor/melee.json
msgid "The \"Neon Angle\" battery is dead."
msgstr "「ネオン・エンジェル」の電力が足りません。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/inventor/melee.json
msgid "\"Neon Angle\" (on)"
msgid_plural "\"Neon Angles\" (on)"
msgstr[0] "「ネオン・エンジェル」(オン)"

#. ~ "msg" action message of item ""Neon Angle" (on)"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/inventor/melee.json
msgid "You turn off your \"Neon Angle\"."
msgstr "「ネオン・エンジェル」の電源を切りました。"

#. ~ Magazine name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/inventor/mics.json
msgid "ultra-light modified battery"
msgid_plural "ultra-light modified batteries"
msgstr[0] "改造電池SS"

#. ~ Description of magazine "ultra-light modified battery"
#. ~ Description of magazine "light modified battery"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/inventor/mics.json
msgid ""
"A light battery cell that was modified and replaced with much more effective"
" cells inside."
msgstr "より効率的なセルに置き替えた改造小型電池です。"

#. ~ Magazine name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/inventor/mics.json
msgid "light modified battery"
msgid_plural "light modified batteries"
msgstr[0] "改造電池S"

#. ~ Magazine name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/inventor/mics.json
msgid "medium modified battery"
msgid_plural "medium modified batteries"
msgstr[0] "改造電池M"

#. ~ Description of magazine "medium modified battery"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/inventor/mics.json
msgid ""
"A medium battery cell that was modified and replaced with much more "
"effective cells inside."
msgstr "より効率的なセルに置き替えた改造中型電池です。"

#. ~ Magazine name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/inventor/mics.json
msgid "heavy modified battery"
msgid_plural "heavy modified batteries"
msgstr[0] "改造電池L"

#. ~ Description of magazine "heavy modified battery"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/inventor/mics.json
msgid ""
"A heavy battery cell that was modified and replaced with much more effective"
" cells inside."
msgstr "より効率的なセルに置き替えた改造大型電池です。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/inventor/mics.json
msgid "inventor's welder"
msgid_plural "inventor's welders"
msgstr[0] "改良溶接装置"

#. ~ Description of "inventor's welder"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/inventor/mics.json
msgid ""
"A lightweight, battery-powered tool to weld metal pieces together using a "
"plasma-inducted electric arc.  A decent tool, but you think you can do more "
"with some modifications."
msgstr "アーク放電を利用して金属同士を溶接する、電池式の軽量な工具です。便利ですが、少し手を加えれば更に便利になりそうな気がします。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/inventor/mics.json
msgid "\"Heater\""
msgid_plural "\"Heaters\""
msgstr[0] "「ヒーター」"

#. ~ Description of ""Heater""
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/inventor/mics.json
msgid ""
"An extremely small and light tool that creates and transfers the heat in an "
"extremely effective way.  You think it would be interesting to develop it "
"further."
msgstr "非常に効率よく熱を生成して放出する、とても小さく軽い道具です。これを更に発展させれば面白いものが作れそうです。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/inventor/mics.json
msgid "IA software"
msgid_plural "IA software"
msgstr[0] "自律知能ソフト"

#. ~ Description of "IA software"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/inventor/mics.json
msgid ""
"A USB thumb drive with a simple intelligent agent to provide support in "
"parsing big layers of information."
msgstr "大規模層情報の解析をサポートする、シンプルな自律知能を搭載したUSBメモリです。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/inventor/spark_artifact_items.json
msgid "intricate and opulent clock"
msgid_plural "intricate and opulent clocks"
msgstr[0] "豪華なからくり時計"

#. ~ Description of "intricate and opulent clock"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/inventor/spark_artifact_items.json
msgid ""
"An incredibly intricate clock where every visible surface appears to be gilded or chrome.\n"
"It may have unknown powers; try activating them."
msgstr ""
"あらゆる箇所が金やクロム合金でメッキ掛けされた、非常に精巧な時計です。\n"
"未知の力を秘めており、使用すると効果を発揮します。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/inventor/spark_artifact_items.json
msgid "crystalline rod"
msgid_plural "crystalline rods"
msgstr[0] "結晶の杖"

#. ~ Description of "crystalline rod"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/inventor/spark_artifact_items.json
msgid ""
"This crystal rod changes hue at random.\n"
"It may have unknown powers; try activating them."
msgstr ""
"次々と色を変え続ける結晶で作られた杖です。\n"
"未知の力を秘めており、使用すると効果を発揮します。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/inventor/spark_artifact_items.json
msgid "baroque monitor"
msgid_plural "baroque monitors"
msgstr[0] "歪んだモニター"

#. ~ Description of "baroque monitor"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/inventor/spark_artifact_items.json
msgid ""
"A strange monitor with a variety of knobs and dials.  When you turn it on, it crackles and then begins tracking things that either aren't there or aren't visible to the naked eye.\n"
"It may have unknown powers; try activating them."
msgstr ""
"様々なツマミやダイヤルが付いた、奇妙なモニターです。電源を入れるとパチパチと音を立て、ある筈のないものや肉眼では見えないものを映し出します。\n"
"未知の力を秘めており、使用すると効果を発揮します。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/inventor/spark_artifact_items.json
msgid "a mess of tubes and wires"
msgid_plural "several messes of tubes and wires"
msgstr[0] "絡まったチューブと配線"

#. ~ Description of "a mess of tubes and wires"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/inventor/spark_artifact_items.json
msgid ""
"What is it for?  What could it do?\n"
"It may have unknown powers; try activating them."
msgstr ""
"何のためのものでしょうか？何ができるのでしょうか？\n"
"未知の力を秘めており、使用すると効果を発揮します。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/inventor/spark_artifact_items.json
msgid "abstract sculpture"
msgid_plural "abstract sculptures"
msgstr[0] "抽象的な彫刻"

#. ~ Description of "abstract sculpture"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/inventor/spark_artifact_items.json
msgid ""
"It's a sculpture, but you can't identify what it depicts.\n"
"It may have unknown powers; try activating them."
msgstr ""
"何かの彫刻ですが、何を表しているのか分かりません。\n"
"未知の力を秘めており、使用すると効果を発揮します。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/inventor/spark_artifact_items.json
msgid "humming disc"
msgid_plural "humming discs"
msgstr[0] "震える円盤"

#. ~ Description of "humming disc"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/inventor/spark_artifact_items.json
msgid ""
"It hums louder when you touch it.\n"
"It may have unknown powers; try activating them."
msgstr ""
"触ると音が大きくなります。\n"
"未知の力を秘めており、使用すると効果を発揮します。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/inventor/spark_artifact_items.json
msgid "an instrument"
msgid_plural "instruments"
msgstr[0] "楽器"

#. ~ Description of "an instrument"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/inventor/spark_artifact_items.json
msgid ""
"This looks like a musical instrument.  But how would you play it?\n"
"It may have unknown powers; try activating them."
msgstr ""
"楽器のように見えますが、どうやって演奏するのでしょうか？\n"
"未知の力を秘めており、使用すると効果を発揮します。"

#. ~ Description of "very thin sheet"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/inventor/spark_artifact_items.json
msgid ""
"A sheet so light and thin that viewing it horizontally makes it almost invisible.\n"
"It may have unknown powers; try activating them."
msgstr ""
"水平にするとほとんど見えなくなるほど薄く軽い布です。\n"
"未知の力を秘めており、使用すると効果を発揮します。"

#. ~ Description of "spiked sphere"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/inventor/spark_artifact_items.json
msgid ""
"A prickly ball that, no matter the force you apply, somehow never feels as if it could cut.\n"
"It may have unknown powers; try activating them."
msgstr ""
"刺々しい見た目の球体ですが、どれだけ強く握っても何故かケガをしません。\n"
"未知の力を秘めており、使用すると効果を発揮します。"

#. ~ Description of "malleable blob"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/inventor/spark_artifact_items.json
msgid ""
"Despite its looseness, this mass of goo keeps its shape as you fold it in your hands.\n"
"It may have unknown powers; try activating them."
msgstr ""
"非常に緩い粘液に見えますが、握っても形状が崩れません。\n"
"未知の力を秘めており、使用すると効果を発揮します。"

#. ~ Description of "spiraling rod"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/inventor/spark_artifact_items.json
msgid ""
"A rod with a bulbous, spiralling knob on the end that seems to spin as you look.\n"
"It may have unknown powers; try activating them."
msgstr ""
"先端に球根のような螺旋型のふくらみがあり、凝視し続けると回転しているように見えます。\n"
"未知の力を秘めており、使用すると効果を発揮します。"

#. ~ Description of "small pin"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/inventor/spark_artifact_items.json
msgid ""
"One of those pins you wear on your shirt, but this one has indecipherable symbols in place of a witty slogan.\n"
"It may have unknown powers; try activating them."
msgstr ""
"服に付けるブローチです。気の利いた文言ではなく、解読不能な記号が書いていあります。\n"
"未知の力を秘めており、使用すると効果を発揮します。"

#. ~ Description of "hollow tube"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/inventor/spark_artifact_items.json
msgid ""
"A tube of unknown material.  A strange noise from nowhere can be heard when you place it next to your ear, as if something's inside.\n"
"It may have unknown powers; try activating them."
msgstr ""
"未知の素材でできたチューブです。耳に近付けると、中から奇妙な音が聞こえてきます。\n"
"未知の力を秘めており、使用すると効果を発揮します。"

#. ~ Description of "regular tetrahedron"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/inventor/spark_artifact_items.json
msgid ""
"A triangular pyramid, inconspicuous in every way.\n"
"It may have unknown powers; try activating them."
msgstr ""
"何の特徴もない三角錐です。\n"
"未知の力を秘めており、使用すると効果を発揮します。"

#. ~ Description of "translucent crystal"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/inventor/spark_artifact_items.json
msgid ""
"A beautiful crystal, which seems to suck in detail rather than merely obscuring it as light passes through.\n"
"It may have unknown powers; try activating them."
msgstr ""
"美しい結晶です。この結晶を通った光は、まるで結晶にすべて吸い取られてしまったかのように消えてしまいます。\n"
"未知の力を秘めており、使用すると効果を発揮します。"

#. ~ Description of "twisted, knotted cord"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/inventor/spark_artifact_items.json
msgid ""
"A bit of spiralling rope, disorienting you as your eyes vainly try to complete following the loop.\n"
"It may have unknown powers; try activating them."
msgstr ""
"もつれた紐を目で辿ろうとすると頭がくらくらします。\n"
"未知の力を秘めており、使用すると効果を発揮します。"

#. ~ Description of "crescent-shaped stone"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/inventor/spark_artifact_items.json
msgid ""
"The sound of the tide can be heard from this stone, as if it were a miniature moon moving the oceans.\n"
"It may have unknown powers; try activating them."
msgstr ""
"石から潮騒が聞こえてきます。まるで潮の満ち引きをつかさどる小さな月のようです。\n"
"未知の力を秘めており、使用すると効果を発揮します。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/inventor/traps.json
msgid "stunning QR trap"
msgid_plural "stunning QR traps"
msgstr[0] "QRトラップ"

#. ~ Description of "stunning QR trap"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/inventor/traps.json
msgid ""
"A jagged and eldritch looking QR code ready to be placed wherever you are "
"concerned about mechanical eyes.  Will trap robots if they wander into it."
msgstr "機械のセンサーが反応する場所に設置する、ギザギザした不気味な見た目のQRコードです。これを踏んだロボットは動けなくなります。"

#. ~ "done_message" action message of item "stunning QR trap"
#. ~ "done_message" action message of item "stunning arg trap"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/inventor/traps.json
msgid "You set the QR code."
msgstr "QRトラップを設置しました。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/inventor/traps.json
msgid "stunning arg trap"
msgid_plural "stunning arg traps"
msgstr[0] "ARGトラップ"

#. ~ Description of "stunning arg trap"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/inventor/traps.json
msgid ""
"A jagged and eldritch looking QR code ready to be placed wherever you are "
"concerned about mechanical eyes.  Will trap cyborgs if they wander into it."
msgstr "機械のセンサーが反応する場所に設置する、ギザギザした不気味な見た目のQRコードです。これを踏んだサイボーグは動けなくなります。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/spell_learning_items/spell_learning_items_classless.json
msgid "magician's hat"
msgid_plural "magician's hats"
msgstr[0] "手品師の帽子"

#. ~ Description of "magician's hat"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/spell_learning_items/spell_learning_items_classless.json
msgid ""
"An old-school cylinder hat, used by illusionists around the world.  Maybe it"
" still remembers some cool tricks?"
msgstr "世界中の奇術師が愛用している、古風なシルクハットです。もしかしたら、驚くべきトリックを披露してくれるかも？"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/spell_learning_items/spell_learning_items_classless.json
msgid "warm ball"
msgid_plural "warm balls"
msgstr[0] "熱の球"

#. ~ Description of "warm ball"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/spell_learning_items/spell_learning_items_classless.json
msgid ""
"A small and light ball of glass with flickering flames inside.  The surface "
"feels scalding hot, yet the temperature does not change."
msgstr "内部で炎が揺らめいている、小さく軽いガラス球です。表面は焼け付くように熱く感じますが、実際の温度は上昇していません。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/spell_learning_items/spell_learning_items_dreamer.json
msgid "magick 8-Ball"
msgid_plural "magick 8-Balls"
msgstr[0] "マヅック8ボール"

#. ~ Description of "magick 8-Ball"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/spell_learning_items/spell_learning_items_dreamer.json
msgid ""
"A fortune-telling device from the 1950s.  If you shake it and look at the "
"bottom it will give you detailed step by step instructions on how to do… "
"something."
msgstr "1950年代に流行った占い装置です。振ってから底を見ると...何かしらの詳しい手順を学ぶことができます。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/spell_learning_items/spell_learning_items_dreamer.json
msgid "glass dagger paperweight"
msgid_plural "glass dagger paperweights"
msgstr[0] "短剣型文鎮"

#. ~ Description of "glass dagger paperweight"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/spell_learning_items/spell_learning_items_dreamer.json
msgid ""
"This paperweight in the shape of a small glass dagger emits a wet wheeze "
"like a punctured lung when held."
msgstr "小さな短剣の形をした、ガラス製の文鎮です。握ると、肺に穴が開いたような不快な声を発します。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/spell_learning_items/spell_learning_items_dreamer.json
msgid "Caravaggio on his deathbed"
msgid_plural "copies of Caravaggio on his deathbed"
msgstr[0] "絵画(死の床のカラヴァッジオ)"

#. ~ Description of "Caravaggio on his deathbed"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/spell_learning_items/spell_learning_items_dreamer.json
msgid ""
"A previously unknown painting in Caravaggio's style of the artist himself "
"lying prone on his deathbed as black ichor seeps from a sword wound in his "
"side.  His own sword rests near his hand and his ever dying breath asks you "
"to take up his blade."
msgstr ""
"カラヴァッジオ特有のタッチで描かれた、未発表の絵画です。死の床に伏した画家自身が描かれており、脇腹の刺し傷から黒い液体が滲み出ています。画家の手には剣が握られており、この剣を持っていけと訴えているようにも見えます。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/spell_learning_items/spell_learning_items_dreamer.json
msgctxt "'hand mirror' but upside down"
msgid "ɹoɹɹᴉɯ puɐɥ"
msgid_plural "sɹoɹɹᴉɯ puɐɥ"
msgstr[0] "鏡手"

#. ~ Description of "ɹoɹɹᴉɯ puɐɥ"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/spell_learning_items/spell_learning_items_dreamer.json
msgid "·ɓuoɹʍ ɓuᴉɥʇǝɯoS  ·ɹoɹɹᴉɯ puɐɥ ʅʅɐɯs Ɐ"
msgstr "。すましが気いしかおがか何。すで鏡手なさ小"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/spell_learning_items/spell_learning_items_dreamer.json
msgid "pair of glasses"
msgid_plural "pairs of glasses"
msgstr[0] "眼鏡"

#. ~ Description of "pair of glasses"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/spell_learning_items/spell_learning_items_dreamer.json
msgid ""
"A pair of a common glasses.  They have no lens or glass inside, only casing."
"  There is a strange engraving of vines, snakes, and foxes covering every "
"surface of the frames.  You think that maybe the engravings are moving when "
"you aren't looking at them."
msgstr ""
"一般的なメガネのように見えますが、蔦、ヘビ、キツネの奇妙な意匠が彫られたフレームには、レンズもガラスも嵌っていません。どうも目を離した隙に動いているような気がしてなりません。"

#. ~ Description of "family photo"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/spell_learning_items/spell_learning_items_dreamer.json
msgid ""
"A photo of a smiling family on a camping trip.  The background is always the"
" same, but people are not.  Do you recall them?"
msgstr ""
"キャンプ旅行中の家族が笑顔で写っています。背景は変わらないのに、写っている人物は毎回異なって見えます。この人たちが誰なのか、思い出せますか？"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/spell_learning_items/spell_learning_items_dreamer.json
msgid "sphere"
msgid_plural "spheres"
msgstr[0] "球体"

#. ~ Description of "sphere"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/spell_learning_items/spell_learning_items_dreamer.json
msgid ""
"A small, black sphere.  It constantly changes its position.  It even tries "
"to roll out of corners you wedge it into."
msgstr "常に動き続ける小さな黒い球体です。隅に追い込んでも、何とか転がり出ようともがきます。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/spell_learning_items/spell_learning_items_dreamer.json
msgid "flashlight"
msgid_plural "flashlights"
msgstr[0] "懐中電灯"

#. ~ Description of "flashlight"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/spell_learning_items/spell_learning_items_dreamer.json
msgid ""
"This looks like a typical household flashlight.  It has no battery holder "
"and it hums when you touch it."
msgstr "一般的な家庭用の懐中電灯のように見えます。電池を入れるスペースがなく、触ると唸るような音がします。"

#. ~ Description of "nail"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/spell_learning_items/spell_learning_items_dreamer.json
msgid "A pin-shaped piece of iron.  You feel the need to hammer it."
msgstr "針のように尖った金属片です。ハンマーで叩きたくなりますね。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/spell_learning_items/spell_learning_items_dreamer.json
msgid "bubble"
msgid_plural "bubbles"
msgstr[0] "泡沫"

#. ~ Description of "bubble"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/spell_learning_items/spell_learning_items_dreamer.json
msgid ""
"A small, transparent bubble.  It divides itself into two, then four, eight, "
"sixteen, endlessly, before turning back to single bubble and repeating the "
"process."
msgstr "透き通った小さな泡です。2つに分かれ、次は4つ、8つ、16と無限に増え、やがて1つの泡に戻る動きを延々と繰り返しています。"

#. ~ Description of "wallet"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/spell_learning_items/spell_learning_items_dreamer.json
msgid ""
"A small, flat case used to carry currency.  Each time you open it, it "
"reveals new pockets, but all of them hold the same one coin, which you can't"
" remove."
msgstr ""
"通貨を持ち歩くための小さく平たいケースです。開くたびに見知らぬポケットが出現し、その中には必ず1枚の同じ硬貨が入っています。しかし、硬貨を取り出すことはできません。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/spell_learning_items/spell_learning_items_dreamer.json
msgid "angel figurine"
msgid_plural "angel figurines"
msgstr[0] "小像(天使)"

#. ~ Description of "angel figurine"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/spell_learning_items/spell_learning_items_dreamer.json
msgid "A delicate figurine of a renaissance angel.  It looks oddly human."
msgstr "精巧に作られたルネサンス期の天使の小像です。妙に人間臭く見えます。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/spell_learning_items/spell_learning_items_dreamer.json
msgid "action figurine"
msgid_plural "action figurines"
msgstr[0] "可動フィギュア"

#. ~ Description of "action figurine"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/spell_learning_items/spell_learning_items_dreamer.json
msgid ""
"A small action figurine of a man with an old computer.  It appears he is "
"attempting to hack it."
msgstr "男を象った小さなアクションフィギュアです。古そうなコンピュータをハッキングしようとしているようです。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/spell_learning_items/spell_learning_items_dreamer.json
msgid "stone feather"
msgid_plural "stone feathers"
msgstr[0] "石の羽"

#. ~ Description of "stone feather"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/spell_learning_items/spell_learning_items_dreamer.json
msgid ""
"You see an incredibly detailed stone feather, almost lifelike in appearance."
msgstr "まるで本物の生物の羽のように見える、驚くほど精巧に作られた石の羽です。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/spell_learning_items/spell_learning_items_dreamer.json
msgid "odd circle"
msgid_plural "odd circles"
msgstr[0] "奇妙な円盤"

#. ~ Description of "odd circle"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/spell_learning_items/spell_learning_items_dreamer.json
msgid ""
"A circular unit of energy, surrounded by a few other circles that almost "
"connect around the center."
msgstr "中心付近に複数の円盤が連結している、円盤型のエネルギー装置です。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/spell_learning_items/spell_learning_items_dreamer.json
msgid "presence"
msgid_plural "presences"
msgstr[0] "霊気"

#. ~ Description of "presence"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/spell_learning_items/spell_learning_items_dreamer.json
msgid ""
"You feel like something took a glance at this place, and it was so menacing "
"that the world itself curled up."
msgstr "何かに見られているような気がします。その視線のあまりの恐ろしさに、世界そのものが歪んで縮こまってしまったように思えます。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/spell_learning_items/spell_learning_items_dreamer.json
msgid "lizard tail"
msgid_plural "lizard tails"
msgstr[0] "トカゲの尻尾"

#. ~ Description of "lizard tail"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/spell_learning_items/spell_learning_items_dreamer.json
msgid "A small lizard tail that was ripped off.  Looks like someone's joke."
msgstr "ちぎれた小さなトカゲの尻尾です。ジョークグッズでしょうか。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/spell_learning_items/spell_learning_items_dreamsmith.json
msgid "set of brass cylinders"
msgid_plural "sets of brass cylinders"
msgstr[0] "円筒印章セット"

#. ~ Description of "set of brass cylinders"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/spell_learning_items/spell_learning_items_dreamsmith.json
msgid ""
"These brass cylinders are engraved with cuneiform and could be rolled across"
" wet clay to create a page of writing per cylinder.  When you touch one of "
"the cylinders you hear a faint voice whisper 'Enki'."
msgstr ""
"真鍮製の円筒の表面には楔形文字が刻まれており、柔らかい粘土の上で転がすと、円筒1本につき1ページ分の文章が印字されるようになっています。円筒の一つに触れると、「エンキ」と小さく囁く声が聞こえます。"

#. ~ Description of "deck of tarot cards"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/spell_learning_items/spell_learning_items_eater.json
msgid ""
"A deck of intricately designed tarot cards.  When you lay out your future "
"they seem to be trying to tell you to take a leap of faith."
msgstr "複雑なデザインのタロットカード一式です。未来を占うと、大丈夫だと信じて思い切ることが大事だと告げられたように感じました。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/spell_learning_items/spell_learning_items_eater.json
msgid "occult seal"
msgid_plural "occult seals"
msgstr[0] "神秘の印章"

#. ~ Description of "occult seal"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/spell_learning_items/spell_learning_items_eater.json
msgid ""
"An intricate occult seal.  When you glance at the bottom left corner you "
"hear the sound of the ocean and smell the salty air of the sea, and sense a "
"river flowing through each point of the seal."
msgstr "複雑なデザインの神秘的な印章です。印章の左下に目をやると、どこからか海の音と匂いが漂い始め、描かれた点から点へと流れる川を幻視できます。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/spell_learning_items/spell_learning_items_eater.json
msgid "hurricane lamp with thorns"
msgid_plural "hurricane lamps with thorns"
msgstr[0] "茨のランタン"

#. ~ Description of "hurricane lamp with thorns"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/spell_learning_items/spell_learning_items_eater.json
msgid ""
"An old style hurricane lamp.  The handle appears to made of vines covered in"
" sharp thorns."
msgstr "古風なハリケーンランタンです。持ち手が棘だらけの茨で作られているように見えます。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/spell_learning_items/spell_learning_items_eater.json
msgid "box of glass berries"
msgid_plural "boxes of glass berries"
msgstr[0] "ガラス細工のベリー"

#. ~ Description of "box of glass berries"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/spell_learning_items/spell_learning_items_eater.json
msgid ""
"A box full of glass berries, when you get distracted you find yourself "
"crunching them in your mouth.  Each one tastes like a mouthful of blood that"
" slowly changes to espresso."
msgstr ""
"思わず口の中で噛み締めてしまいそうになるほど精巧な、箱に詰まったガラス細工のベリーです。口いっぱいに広がる血の味は、徐々にエスプレッソコーヒーの風味へと変化します。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/spell_learning_items/spell_learning_items_eater.json
msgid "polaroid of a missing person"
msgid_plural "polaroids of a missing person"
msgstr[0] "行方不明者のポラロイド写真"

#. ~ Description of "polaroid of a missing person"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/spell_learning_items/spell_learning_items_eater.json
msgid ""
"A polaroid of someone you remember going missing before the Cataclysm.  It "
"caught a ton of media attention due to them being seen near what was shortly"
" after identified as a thin place between dimensions.  The more you stare at"
" the picture, the more you begin to see wounds appear and disappear on the "
"person.  Sometimes they match your old scars."
msgstr ""
"大変動以前に行方不明になった人物が写っているポラロイド写真です。撮影現場が次元の狭間の付近だったと後に判明したため、この事件は多くのメディアで取り上げられました。写真を凝視していると、被写体の身体に突然傷が浮かび上がり、自分がかつて負った傷とまったく同じように見えることもあります。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/spell_learning_items/spell_learning_items_eater.json
msgid "strange cup of coffee"
msgid_plural "strange cups of coffee"
msgstr[0] "奇妙なコーヒー瓶"

#. ~ Description of "strange cup of coffee"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/spell_learning_items/spell_learning_items_eater.json
msgid ""
"A small jar with coffee, moving in weird patterns with no apparent cause.  "
"After watching the swirls for some time, you are sure that it loops back on "
"its movements, like some sort of message."
msgstr ""
"原因不明の奇妙な渦を作っている、小さな瓶に入ったコーヒーです。渦をしばらく眺めていると、何かのメッセージが繰り返し伝えられているような気がしてきます。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/spell_learning_items/spell_learning_items_eater.json
msgid "red devil blindfold"
msgid_plural "red devil blindfolds"
msgstr[0] "悪魔の目隠し布"

#. ~ Description of "red devil blindfold"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/spell_learning_items/spell_learning_items_eater.json
msgid ""
"A red fabric blindfold with a cartoonish devil over the eyes.  You feel some"
" anger when you put it on.  Did that devil just wink at you?"
msgstr ""
"目の位置に悪魔のイラストが描かれた、赤色の目隠し布です。着用すると、心の底から怒りがこみ上げてきます。悪魔に魅入られてしまったのでしょうか？"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/spell_learning_items/spell_learning_items_eater.json
msgid "mother of pearl heart"
msgid_plural "mother of pearl hearts"
msgstr[0] "真珠色の心臓"

#. ~ Description of "mother of pearl heart"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/spell_learning_items/spell_learning_items_eater.json
msgid ""
"A human heart grown in mother of pearl.  It beats loudly when you raise it "
"to your ear."
msgstr "真珠の母貝の中に保存されていた心臓です。耳を当てると大きな鼓動が聞こえます。"

#. ~ Description of "right eye"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/spell_learning_items/spell_learning_items_eater.json
msgid ""
"A tiny human eye.  You can clearly see the green iris and red capillaries.  "
"While holding it in the dark you feel it watching you."
msgstr "緑色の虹彩と赤い毛細血管がはっきりと見える、小さな人間の目玉です。暗い場所で持っていると視線を感じます。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/spell_learning_items/spell_learning_items_eater.json
msgid "cerebellum"
msgid_plural "cerebellums"
msgstr[0] "小脳"

#. ~ Description of "cerebellum"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/spell_learning_items/spell_learning_items_eater.json
msgid ""
"A small, smooth part of the human brain.  Looks slippery.  Feels like "
"rubber."
msgstr "小さく滑らかな、人間の脳の一部です。皺一つなく、ゴムのような弾力があります。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/spell_learning_items/spell_learning_items_eater.json
msgid "skull"
msgid_plural "skulls"
msgstr[0] "頭蓋骨"

#. ~ Description of "skull"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/spell_learning_items/spell_learning_items_eater.json
msgid "A tiny human skull.  His empty orbits are watching you."
msgstr "小さな人間の頭蓋骨です。虚ろな眼窩がこちらを見つめています。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/spell_learning_items/spell_learning_items_eater.json
msgid "ring of Gyges"
msgid_plural "rings of Gyges"
msgstr[0] "ギュゲースの指輪"

#. ~ Description of "ring of Gyges"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/spell_learning_items/spell_learning_items_eater.json
msgid ""
"A small ring.  There is nothing special about it, except the word "
"\"Republic\" embossed on it."
msgstr "小さな指輪です。表面に「Republic(国家)」という単語が彫ってある以外、何の特徴もありません。"

#. ~ Description of "left eye"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/spell_learning_items/spell_learning_items_eater.json
msgid ""
"A tiny human eye.  You can clearly see it has a blue iris and red "
"capillaries.  You feel it can see you no matter how you hide."
msgstr "青色の虹彩と赤い毛細血管がはっきりと見える、小さな人間の目玉です。どれほど上手く隠れても見られているような気がします。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/spell_learning_items/spell_learning_items_eater.json
msgid "Enemy of the World"
msgid_plural "copies of Enemy of the World"
msgstr[0] "呪文書(エネミー・オブ・ザ・ワールド)"

#. ~ Description of "Enemy of the World"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/spell_learning_items/spell_learning_items_eater.json
msgid ""
"A small Korean novel that describes the journey of an incredibly strong "
"protagonist attempting to save the world."
msgstr "とてつもなく強い主人公が世界を救うために旅をする、韓国の短編小説です。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/spell_learning_items/spell_learning_items_eater.json
msgid "horn"
msgid_plural "horns"
msgstr[0] "角"

#. ~ Description of "horn"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/spell_learning_items/spell_learning_items_eater.json
msgid ""
"A large, straight horn of some unknown creature.  It could easily injure a "
"careless person."
msgstr "何の生物のものか分からない、まっすぐ伸びた大きな角です。注意して扱わないとケガをしそうです。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/spell_learning_items/spell_learning_items_eater.json
msgid "muscles"
msgid_plural "muscles"
msgstr[0] "筋肉"

#. ~ Description of "muscles"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/spell_learning_items/spell_learning_items_eater.json
msgid ""
"A long fleshy tendon with joints on both sides.  They contract from time to "
"time."
msgstr "両端で骨同士を繋げている、肉質の長い腱です。時折勝手に収縮します。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/spell_learning_items/spell_learning_items_eater.json
msgid "pile of pain"
msgid_plural "pile of pains"
msgstr[0] "苦痛の塊"

#. ~ Description of "pile of pain"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/spell_learning_items/spell_learning_items_eater.json
msgid "There is nothing here.  It's uncomfortable to hold it."
msgstr "ここには何もありません。持っていると不快な気分になります。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/spell_learning_items/spell_learning_items_eater.json
msgid "pair of spheres"
msgid_plural "pairs of spheres"
msgstr[0] "二つの球体"

#. ~ Description of "pair of spheres"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/spell_learning_items/spell_learning_items_eater.json
msgid ""
"Two perfect spheres.  The first does not move at all, and the second "
"constantly rotates around.  You feel a connection to both of them."
msgstr "一つは全く動かず、もう一つは常に回転している球体です。二つの球体と肉体との繋がりを感じます。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/spell_learning_items/spell_learning_items_eater.json
msgid "fist"
msgid_plural "fists"
msgstr[0] "拳"

#. ~ Description of "fist"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/spell_learning_items/spell_learning_items_eater.json
msgid ""
"A solid, full size cast of a human fist, made out of some gray metal.  Looks"
" menacing."
msgstr "灰色の金属で作られた、人間の拳ほどのサイズのずっしりとした鋳造物です。威圧的な雰囲気があります。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/spell_learning_items/spell_learning_items_inventor.json
msgid "String Theory For Dummies"
msgid_plural "copies of String Theory For Dummies"
msgstr[0] "呪文書(サルでもわかる超ひも理論)"

#. ~ Description of "String Theory For Dummies"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/spell_learning_items/spell_learning_items_inventor.json
msgid ""
"A small hardcover book describing a quite preposterous version of string "
"theory."
msgstr "超ひも理論についてのかなり荒唐無稽な解説が載っている、ハードカバーの短い本です。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/spell_learning_items/spell_learning_items_inventor.json
msgid "taped jumper cable"
msgid_plural "taped jumper cables"
msgstr[0] "補修ジャンパーケーブル"

#. ~ Description of "taped jumper cable"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/spell_learning_items/spell_learning_items_inventor.json
msgid ""
"A 3-ft (or about 1 m) jumper cable, wrapped with blue insulating tape.  Both"
" sides lack connectors."
msgstr "青色の絶縁テープが巻かれた約1mのジャンパーケーブルです。両端にコネクターが付いていません。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/spell_learning_items/spellbooks_hedge.json
msgid "Goody Osborne's Booke of Remedies"
msgid_plural "copies of Goody Osborne's Booke of Remedies"
msgstr[0] "呪文書(賢者オズボーンの治癒の書)"

#. ~ Description of "Goody Osborne's Booke of Remedies"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/spell_learning_items/spellbooks_hedge.json
msgid ""
"This purports to be the 'Reale and True Acounting of the Works and Devices "
"of Sarah Osbourne, a Most Puissant Wiche', but you're pretty sure it's all a"
" front and it was actually written within the last couple decades.  There "
"are some pretty detailed descriptions of rituals in here, mixed among diary "
"entries and accounts of fanciful meetings in the woods."
msgstr ""
"「最も権威ある魔女、サラ・オズボーンの真実の功績と成果」を記した古い書物と称していますが、それは表向きの話で、実際には過去数十年以内に書かれたもののようです。日々の手記や森での風変わりな集会の様子に混じって、複数のまじないに関するかなり詳細な説明が載っています。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/spell_learning_items/spellbooks_hedge.json
msgid "Malleus Maleficarum"
msgid_plural "copies of Malleus Maleficarum"
msgstr[0] "呪文書(魔女に与える鉄槌)"

#. ~ Description of "Malleus Maleficarum"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/spell_learning_items/spellbooks_hedge.json
msgid ""
"A hardcover translation of the infamous 15th century book used as a "
"reference work for witchcraft trials for centuries.  This translation seems "
"to have some handwritten notes in some of the margins."
msgstr ""
"何世紀にもわたって魔女裁判の参考文献として活用されてきた、15世紀の悪名高い書物を翻訳したハードカバー本です。余白の一部に手書きのメモが書き足されています。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/spell_learning_items/spellbooks_hedge.json
msgid "The Cunning Book of Home and Hearth"
msgid_plural "copies of The Cunning Book of Home and Hearth"
msgstr[0] "呪文書(家庭のまじない)"

#. ~ Description of "The Cunning Book of Home and Hearth"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/spell_learning_items/spellbooks_hedge.json
msgid ""
"This mass-market paperback purports to pass down the ancient traditional "
"secrets of English cunning folk, though if that were true, they probably "
"could have gotten more than $12.95 for it.  There are a lot of descriptions "
"of rituals and procedures in here, though--maybe some of them deserve "
"further investigation."
msgstr ""
"大衆向けのペーパーバック本です。カニングフォークと呼ばれるイギリスの呪術師の間で古来より受け継がれてきたまじないについて記したとされていますが、もし真実だとすれば、そんな書籍が12.95ドルで買える筈がありません。ただし、儀式やまじないの手順についての解説は豊富で、詳しく読んでみる価値のあるものも混じっているかもしれません。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/spell_learning_items/spellbooks_hedge.json
msgid ""
"Bloodstoppers and Bearwalkers: Folk Traditions of Michigan's Upper Peninsula"
msgid_plural ""
"copies of Bloodstoppers and Bearwalkers: Folk Traditions of Michigan's Upper"
" Peninsula"
msgstr[0] "本(学習/血止め師とクマ憑き:ミシガン州アッパー半島の民間伝承)"

#. ~ Description of "Bloodstoppers and Bearwalkers: Folk Traditions of
#. Michigan's Upper Peninsula"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/spell_learning_items/spellbooks_hedge.json
msgid ""
"This is an anthropological collection of American folk beliefs in the Upper "
"Peninsula of Michigan, consisting of stories, legends, descriptions of "
"rituals, tall tales, and anything else the author heard during his period of"
" study.  The \"Bloodstoppers\" of the title are individuals believed to be "
"able to stop the flow of blood from a wound, with an incantation or ritual "
"or sheer force of will, and the bearwalkers were allegedly sorcerers who "
"could assume the shape of a bear and cause misfortune."
msgstr ""
"アメリカ合衆国のミシガン州アッパー半島に伝わる民間信仰に関連する物語、伝説、儀式、昔話、その他著者が研究中に集めたあらゆるものについてまとめた書籍です。タイトルにもある「血止め師」は、まじないや儀式、あるいはただ念じるだけで傷口からの出血を止めることができると信じられている者、「クマ憑き」は、クマの姿に変化して惨事を引き起こす妖術師のことを指します。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/spell_learning_items/spellbooks_hedge.json
msgid "Ward your Dreams for a Good Night's Sleep!"
msgid_plural "copies of Ward your Dreams for a Good Night's Sleep!"
msgstr[0] "本(学習/いい睡眠はいい夢から！)"

#. ~ Description of "Ward your Dreams for a Good Night's Sleep!"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/spell_learning_items/spellbooks_hedge.json
msgid ""
"This is a very thin booklet, more of a pamphlet, about various ways to "
"protect from nightmares.  There are quite a few techniques in here, though "
"you're a bit skeptical about whether the author took the end of the world "
"into their calculations."
msgstr ""
"悪夢を退ける様々な方法が掛かれた、非常に薄い小冊子です。かなりの数の手法が載っていますが、世界が崩壊している状況でもちゃんと効果を発揮するのでしょうか。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/spell_learning_items/spellbooks_hedge.json
msgid "Monas Hieroglyphica"
msgid_plural "copies of Monas Hieroglyphica"
msgstr[0] "呪文書(モナス・ヒエログリフィカ)"

#. ~ Description of "Monas Hieroglyphica"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/spell_learning_items/spellbooks_hedge.json
msgid ""
"This is a thin reproduction of John Dee's Monas Hieroglyphica.  A "
"complicated work whose meaning has long been lost without access to the "
"occult oral tradition of it's time.  It's possible that some remnants of "
"that oral tradition still exist today, but it is unknown if they would be "
"able to fully interpret this spellbook."
msgstr ""
"ジョン・ディーの『モナス・ヒエログリフィカ』の複製本です。ページ数は少ないものの内容は非常に複雑で、当時の神秘的な口承が伝わっていないためその意味は長らく失われていました。完全に解き明かせるかどうかは分かりませんが、現代でも使える呪文が載っている可能性があります。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/spell_learning_items/spellbooks_hedge.json
msgid "Parchment of sight beyond sight"
msgid_plural "Parchments of sight beyond sight"
msgstr[0] "呪文書(千里眼の羊皮紙)"

#. ~ Description of "Parchment of sight beyond sight"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/spell_learning_items/spellbooks_hedge.json
msgid ""
"A short parchment that will supposedly teach you how to see through walls."
msgstr "壁の向こうを見通す方法を伝授する小さな羊皮紙です。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/spell_learning_items/spellbooks_hedge.json
msgid ""
"The Bathhouse at Midnight: An Historical Survey of Magic and Divination in "
"Russia"
msgid_plural ""
"copies of The Bathhouse at Midnight: An Historical Survey of Magic and "
"Divination in Russia"
msgstr[0] "呪文書(真夜中の浴室:ロシア魔術史と占術史の調査)"

#. ~ Description of "The Bathhouse at Midnight: An Historical Survey of Magic
#. and Divination in Russia"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/spell_learning_items/spellbooks_hedge.json
msgid ""
"This encyclopediac tome by W. F. Ryan concerns a wide variety of folk magic "
"practices in pre-modern Russia, including their social context, the way that"
" the Church had to work against folk practices like leaving items on the "
"altar for six weeks so they would gain protective powers, the dangers of "
"being alone in the bathhouse, ways to find and keep a husband or wife, when "
"to throw an axe handle over your shoulder when walking into the forest, and "
"how the government mostly suppressed magic because magical power (real or "
"imagined) would have been a threat to secular power.  The description of "
"some of these rituals are extremely detailed."
msgstr ""
"W.F.ライアンが著したこの百科事典は、近代以前のロシアにおける様々な民間魔術の実践について解説しています。魔術の社会的背景、祭壇に6週間捧げものを置き守護の力を得るといった民間魔術を教会が妨害するようになった経緯、浴場で一人で過ごすことの危険性、夫や妻を振り向かせ繋ぎとめる方法、森に入るときに斧の柄を肩に置くタイミング、そして(それが真実であれ嘘であれ)民衆に力を与える魔法を政府が脅威とみなし抑圧することになった顛末などが載っています。いくつかの儀式の説明は非常に詳細に記されています。"

