#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/monsters/bloodsuckers.json
msgid "moroi"
msgid_plural "moroi"
msgstr[0] "モロイ"

#. ~ Description of monster "moroi"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/monsters/bloodsuckers.json
msgid ""
"This creature looks more aware than most of the ferals you have seen and in "
"fact you might even suspect them of being normal if it weren't for the dried"
" blood caked around their mouth and down the front of their clothes.  The "
"light glints against what look to be sharp fangs in their mouth."
msgstr ""
"この人型生物は、これまで見てきたどの狂人よりも意識がはっきりしているようです。実際、口の周りと服に血がこびりついてさえいなければ、普通の人間としか思えません。口の両端からは鋭い牙のようなものが飛び出し、光を反射して輝いています。"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/monsters/bloodsuckers.json
msgid "strigoi"
msgid_plural "strigoi"
msgstr[0] "ストリゴイ"

#. ~ Description of monster "strigoi"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/monsters/bloodsuckers.json
msgid ""
"An incredibly skinny corpse like creature moving with unnatural flexibility."
"  It sniffs the air and opens a mouthful of jagged teeth while the jaws keep"
" distending.  This could easily be the origin creature of Nosferatu."
msgstr ""
"不自然なほど滑らかに動く、やせ細った死体のような姿の生物です。周囲の空気を嗅ぐような動作をしており、顎は大きく発達し、口内にはギザギザとした歯が並んでいます。この生物が吸血鬼ノスフェラトゥの起源なのでしょうか。"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/monsters/bloodsuckers.json
msgid "renfield"
msgid_plural "renfields"
msgstr[0] "レンフィールド"

#. ~ Description of monster "renfield"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/monsters/bloodsuckers.json
msgid ""
"Wild hair and bloodshot eyes, this person constantly mumbles to themselves "
"about food and life.  Renfields care for nothing except protecting their "
"vampire masters."
msgstr "髪は乱れ、目は充血し、食事や生命についての独り言をブツブツと呟き続ける人型生物です。吸血鬼の主人を守ること以外何も考えていません。"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/monsters/bloodsuckers.json
msgid "renfield with a pistol"
msgid_plural "renfields with pistols"
msgstr[0] "レンフィールド(ハンドガン)"

#. ~ Description of monster "renfield with a pistol"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/monsters/bloodsuckers.json
msgid ""
"Wild hair and bloodshot eyes, this person constantly mumbles to themselves "
"about food and life.  They carry a 9mm pistol with no respect for trigger "
"discipline.  Renfields care for nothing except protecting their vampire "
"masters."
msgstr ""
"髪は乱れ、目は充血し、食事や生命についての独り言をブツブツと呟き続ける人型生物です。9mm拳銃を持ち歩いており、今にも発砲しそうです。吸血鬼の主人を守ること以外何も考えていません。"

#. ~ Description of special attack of monster "renfield with a pistol"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/monsters/bloodsuckers.json
msgid "The renfield fires their Glock!"
msgstr "レンフィールドはグロックを発砲しました！"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/monsters/bloodsuckers.json
msgid "renfield with a Remington"
msgid_plural "renfields with shotguns"
msgstr[0] "レンフィールド(ショットガン)"

#. ~ Description of monster "renfield with a Remington"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/monsters/bloodsuckers.json
msgid ""
"Wild hair and bloodshot eyes, this person constantly mumbles to themselves "
"about food and life.  They carry a shotgun loosely one handed until they "
"take aim.  Renfields care for nothing except protecting their vampire "
"masters."
msgstr ""
"髪は乱れ、目は充血し、食事や生命についての独り言をブツブツと呟き続ける人型生物です。ショットガンを片手に構え、狙いを定めています。吸血鬼の主人を守ること以外何も考えていません。"

#. ~ Description of special attack of monster "renfield with a Remington"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/monsters/bloodsuckers.json
msgid "The renfield fires their shotgun!"
msgstr "レンフィールドはショットガンを発砲しました！"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/monsters/bloodsuckers.json
msgid "renfield with a flamethrower"
msgid_plural "renfields with flamethrowers"
msgstr[0] "レンフィールド(火炎放射器)"

#. ~ Description of monster "renfield with a flamethrower"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/monsters/bloodsuckers.json
msgid ""
"Wild hair and bloodshot eyes, this person constantly mumbles to themselves "
"about food and life.  A pilot light runs at the business end of their "
"flamethrower.  Renfields care for nothing except protecting their vampire "
"masters."
msgstr ""
"髪は乱れ、目は充血し、食事や生命についての独り言をブツブツと呟き続ける人型生物です。手に持った火炎放射器の先端から、小さな火が漏れ出ています。吸血鬼の主人を守ること以外何も考えていません。"

#. ~ Description of special attack of monster "renfield with a flamethrower"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/monsters/bloodsuckers.json
msgid "The renfield shoots their flamethrower!"
msgstr "レンフィールドは火炎放射器を使用しました！"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/monsters/bloodsuckers.json
msgid "cyber-renfield"
msgid_plural "cyber-renfields"
msgstr[0] "改造レンフィールド"

#. ~ Description of monster "cyber-renfield"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/monsters/bloodsuckers.json
msgid ""
"A renfield enhanced with cybernetic modules.  These bloodhunting "
"monstrosities will crash through brick walls in search of their masters' "
"foes.  Someone with enough surgical skills might be able to pull some useful"
" bionics from their corpse.  Bionic claws snikt in and out until it finds a "
"target for its hate."
msgstr ""
"CBMで強化されたレンフィールドです。この血に飢えた怪物は主人の敵を見つけ出すためなら、レンガの壁すら突き破ります。強化された爪を出し入れしながら、憎しみをぶつける対象を探しています。外科的なスキルが十分に高ければ、死体からCBMを摘出できるかもしれません。"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/monsters/bloodsuckers.json
msgid "abominable renfield"
msgid_plural "abominable renfields"
msgstr[0] "巨体レンフィールド"

#. ~ Description of monster "abominable renfield"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/monsters/bloodsuckers.json
msgid ""
"A brobdingnagian Renfield, twisted through unnatural alchemies.  Their stump"
" sized legs and feet pound the earth as they move, while their claw like "
"hands to tear you apart."
msgstr "超自然的な力によって変異した、非常に巨大な吸血鬼です。切り株のような脚を大地に叩きつけながら移動し、鉤爪が生えた手で獲物を引き裂きます。"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/monsters/bloodsuckers.json
msgid "vampire bat"
msgid_plural "vampire bats"
msgstr[0] "吸血コウモリ"

#. ~ Description of monster "vampire bat"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/monsters/bloodsuckers.json
msgid ""
"The Northern European Vampire bat, was discovered 8 years previous to the "
"Cataclysm in Lithuania.  Within those years it had spread across the entire "
"northern hemisphere.  It is larger than a regular bat and furrier allowing "
"it to remain active in the colder winters.  They do drink human and animal "
"blood as part of their sustenance.  It roosts in caves and other hollows, "
"and uses a form of echolocation to aerially navigate through tricky terrain "
"at rapid speeds."
msgstr ""
"大変動の8年前にリトアニアで発見され、一年も経たずに北半球全土に生息域を拡大した、ヨーロッパチスイコウモリです。通常のコウモリより大型で、毛皮が生えているため寒い冬でも活動できます。栄養補給のために人間や動物の血を吸い、洞窟などの狭い場所をねぐらにしています。エコーロケーションを使って複雑な地形を把握し、空中を素早く飛び回ります。"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/monsters/bloodsuckers.json
msgid "giant vampire bat"
msgid_plural "giant vampire bats"
msgstr[0] "巨大吸血コウモリ"

#. ~ Description of monster "giant vampire bat"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/monsters/bloodsuckers.json
msgid ""
"The Mega-Chiropteran Vampire (Giant Vampire Bat), began appearing 4 years "
"ago in locations with Northern European Vampire bats.  There were videos of "
"them bringing down large animals like goats and cattle before the Cataclysm "
"as well as pervasive rumors of them coming after humans."
msgstr ""
"吸血コウモリが生息する北欧地域に4年前から現れ始めた、規格外のサイズの翼手目です。大変動以前からヤギやウシなどの大型動物を襲う動画が撮られており、人間を襲うという噂も広まっていました。"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/monsters/changeling.json
msgid "changeling wanderer"
msgid_plural "changeling wanderers"
msgstr[0] "チェンジリング"

#. ~ Description of monster "changeling wanderer"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/monsters/changeling.json
msgid ""
"The outline looks human but the movements of the limbs are too willowy and "
"sinuous, a small knife flickers between its fingers in and out of sight.  "
"Its clothing appears to be skintight silvery chain or scale mail, it shifts "
"in the light."
msgstr ""
"一見すると人間のようですが、四肢は非常にしなやかで、手の中に小さなナイフを隠し持っています。チェーンメイルかスケイルメイルのような銀色の装束は、光の加減でキラキラと輝いて見えます。"

#. ~ Description of special attack of monster "changeling wanderer"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/monsters/changeling.json
msgid "The changeling lithely throws a knife!"
msgstr "チェンジリングはナイフを素早く投げました！"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/monsters/changeling.json
msgid "changeling bannerman"
msgid_plural "changeling bannermen"
msgstr[0] "チェンジリングの旗手"

#. ~ Description of monster "changeling bannerman"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/monsters/changeling.json
msgid ""
"A tall lithe humanoid of indeterminate gender, clad in silvery scale mail "
"and wielding archaic weapons.  Their sea-green eyes promise violence."
msgstr "古風な武器を構えた、銀色の鱗に覆われた背の高い性別不詳の人型生物です。海緑色の瞳の中に暴力衝動が渦巻いています。"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/monsters/changeling.json
msgid "redcap aspirant"
msgid_plural "redcap aspirants"
msgstr[0] "レッドキャップ"

#. ~ Description of monster "redcap aspirant"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/monsters/changeling.json
msgid ""
"With a red feathered plume rising out of their helmet, this large combatant "
"is clearly a cut above many of the foes you've faced.  Ogrish features stare"
" out from under the blood drenched helmet."
msgstr "兜に赤い羽根のような飾りを挿した、いかにも手強そうな難敵です。血に塗れた兜の下から、鬼のように厳めしい顔が覗いています。"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/monsters/changeling.json
msgid "pooka aspirant"
msgid_plural "pooka aspirants"
msgstr[0] "プーカ"

#. ~ Description of monster "pooka aspirant"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/monsters/changeling.json
msgid ""
"This diminutive warrior possesses both animalistic features and custom made "
"arms and armor.  The twinkle in its eye seems to giggle as it readies its "
"weapons."
msgstr "手製の武器や鎧をもった、動物的な動きの戦士です。ギラギラと目を輝かせ、歪んだ笑みを浮かべて武器を構えています。"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/monsters/changeling.json
msgid "March Lord"
msgid_plural "March Lords"
msgstr[0] "辺境伯"

#. ~ Description of monster "March Lord"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/monsters/changeling.json
msgid ""
"Nearly seven feet tall and whip thin, this warlord of the border realm of "
"the Nether is clothed in silks and silvery tightly woven chainmail.  It "
"glares at you and an ethereal sword manifests in its hand."
msgstr ""
"絹の装束と銀色の強固なチェーンメイルを身にまとった、身長2m超の屈強な武将です。優美な剣を構え、異界と現実世界の境界に睨みを利かせています。"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/monsters/changeling.json
msgid "draugr"
msgid_plural "draugrs"
msgstr[0] "ドラウグ"

#. ~ Description of monster "draugr"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/monsters/changeling.json
msgid ""
"One of the changelings risen as the undead.  Shudders and jerks interrupt "
"its previously smooth movements.  The silvery mail that covered much of its "
"body is now tarnished and where it is damaged it looks more like broken skin"
" than broken armor."
msgstr ""
"ゾンビとして蘇ったチェンジリングです。生前の優美な動きは失われ、常にフラフラと揺れています。全身を覆っていた銀色の鎧はくすみ、破損した部分はまるで皮膚ごと破れてしまったように見えます。"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/monsters/changeling.json
msgid "overgrown and cracked mirror"
msgid_plural "overgrown and cracked mirrors"
msgstr[0] "真菌チェンジリング"

#. ~ Description of monster "overgrown and cracked mirror"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/monsters/changeling.json
msgid ""
"What once would have been easily confused for a regular human, now tendrils "
"of fuzz hang loose from every wound this body received before and after "
"death."
msgstr "かつては普通の人間とそれほど変わらない外見でしたが、今は生前と死後に付けられたあらゆる傷口から菌糸を垂らしています。"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/monsters/changeling.json
msgid "childlike fetch"
msgid_plural "childlike fetches"
msgstr[0] "フェッチ"

#. ~ Description of monster "childlike fetch"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/monsters/changeling.json
msgid ""
"It looks like either a child or a child sized doll.  However, the sharp "
"objects in its hands and the reflective nature of its eyes are the real "
"tells this isn't just a living child or doll.  You'd be hard-pressed to not "
"feel like you were killing an actual child by putting it down."
msgstr ""
"子供か、子供サイズの人形のような姿をしていますが、手には鋭利な武器を握り、目はギラギラと輝いています。この生物は単なる生きた子供や人形ではありませんが、実際の子供を殺してしまったときのような罪悪感を簡単に消せるわけではありません。"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/monsters/changeling.json
msgid "daffodil warrior"
msgid_plural "daffodil warriors"
msgstr[0] "ダファディル"

#. ~ Description of monster "daffodil warrior"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/monsters/changeling.json
msgid ""
"Wispy and willowy these fetches are the cannon fodder of the Fae.  Said to "
"grow in vast fields under the hill and harvested right before a battle "
"legends say they live but a day.  Its features are quite plant-like and one "
"arm ends in an ornate club."
msgstr ""
"他の妖魔から使い捨て兵士のように扱われる、小さく華奢なフェッチです。丘のふもとの広大な畑で育ったダファディルは戦いの直前に収穫され、寿命は一日しかもたないという言い伝えがあります。植物のような姿をしており、装飾の入った棍棒を片手で構えています。"

#. ~ Death message of monster "daffodil warrior"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/monsters/changeling.json
#, c-format
msgid "The %s bursts into a rain of pollen!"
msgstr "%sは周囲に花粉をまき散らしました！"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/monsters/changeling.json
msgid "shimmer wolf"
msgid_plural "shimmer wolves"
msgstr[0] "光輝オオカミ"

#. ~ Description of monster "shimmer wolf"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/monsters/changeling.json
msgid ""
"This is some form of otherworldly wolf.  Its luxurious fur shimmers in the "
"light.  If an Irish Wolfhound had an ancestor that couldn't be bothered to "
"mingle with mere mortal men it would be this wolf."
msgstr ""
"異界のオオカミの一種です。豊かな毛並みが光に照らされ、キラキラと輝いています。アイリッシュウルフハウンドの祖先が人間との交流を嫌っていれば、このような生物になっていたかもしれません。"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/monsters/changeling.json
msgid "goblin spider"
msgid_plural "goblin spiders"
msgstr[0] "化けグモ"

#. ~ Description of monster "goblin spider"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/monsters/changeling.json
msgid ""
"A giant, dark gray goblin spider, the size of a pony.  Above the mandibles, "
"where you would expect to see the eyes, instead there is a child's face.  It"
" seems to vanish into the shadows if you take your eyes off it."
msgstr ""
"ポニーほどのサイズの、巨大な暗灰色の化けグモです。大きな顎の上には、複眼ではなく子供の顔が生えています。目を離すと闇に溶け込んでしまいそうです。"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/monsters/changeling.json
msgid "unicorn"
msgid_plural "unicorns"
msgstr[0] "ユニコーン"

#. ~ Description of monster "unicorn"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/monsters/changeling.json
msgid ""
"A hooved grazing creature with a thick, shaggy, shimmering mane of hair, a "
"sweeping tail, and powerful-looking muscles.  Impossible to confuse with a "
"regular horse even if you don't spot the spiraled horn coming from its head."
"  Rumor has it that some of the Fair Lords have ways to tame and ride this "
"magnificent creature."
msgstr ""
"発達した長くきらびやかなたてがみ、箒のような尻尾、強く引き締まった筋肉が特徴的な、蹄をもつ草食動物です。額に生えた螺旋模様の角を見ずとも、普通のウマと混同することはありません。高貴な妖精の中には、この荘厳な生物を乗りこなす方法を知っている者もいるそうです。"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/monsters/changeling.json
msgid "unicorn foal"
msgid_plural "unicorn foals"
msgstr[0] "ユニコーン(幼体)"

#. ~ Description of monster "unicorn foal"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/monsters/changeling.json
msgid ""
"A hooved grazing creature with a thick, shaggy, shimmering mane of hair, a "
"sweeping tail, and powerful-looking muscles.  It has a stubby nub of a horn "
"growth starting.  This one is still a juvenile; it'll take a while before it"
" can be ridden."
msgstr ""
"発達した長くきらびやかなたてがみ、箒に似た尻尾、強く引き締まった筋肉が特徴的な、蹄をもつ草食生物です。額からは短い角が生え始めています。まだ幼いため、すぐには騎乗できません。"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/monsters/changeling.json
msgid "mavka"
msgid_plural "mavkas"
msgstr[0] "マフカ"

#. ~ Description of monster "mavka"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/monsters/changeling.json
msgid ""
"A beautiful woman clad in diaphanous robes that drifts in the water along "
"with her lengthy hair.  As she steps up and across the water you never "
"manage to see her reflection.  Suddenly, her hair moves and grabs some small"
" animal and pulls it towards herself."
msgstr ""
"長い髪を水に漂わせている、ローブをまとった美しく儚げな女性です。水面に立って移動しますが、その瞬間は決して目撃できません。髪の毛を素早く動かして小動物などを掴み、引き寄せる能力をもっています。"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/monsters/changeling.json
msgid "Melian mantis stallion"
msgid_plural "Melian mantis stallions"
msgstr[0] "メリアン"

#. ~ Description of monster "Melian mantis stallion"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/monsters/changeling.json
msgid ""
"An enormous green insect grown to about half the size of a giraffe.  It "
"moves in a weird, dance-like pattern but goes incredibly still as it "
"positions itself to be mounted.  These gargantuan mantis-like monsters are "
"one of the mounts that Seelie aligned knights will ride into combat.  It "
"won't use its attacks while it is ridden but if its rider dismounts or is "
"knocked off, it will stay nearby and protect them."
msgstr ""
"キリンの半分ほどのサイズにまで成長した、巨大な緑色の昆虫です。踊っているような奇妙な足取りで移動しますが、騎乗されるとぴたりと静止します。この巨大なカマキリの怪物は、善なる妖精の騎士が騎乗して戦う、言わば馬の一種です。騎乗中は攻撃を行いませんが、降りる、もしくは落ちると騎乗者を近くで守るように動きます。"

#. ~ Monster message of special attack of monster "shadow"
#. ~ Monster message of special attack of monster "shadow beast"
#. ~ Monster message of special attack of monster "quickling shadow"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/monsters/dream_wound_monsters.json
#, c-format
msgid "%1$s's appears to become two dimensional."
msgstr "%1$sは二次元化しました。"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/monsters/dream_wound_monsters.json
msgid "shadow beast"
msgid_plural "shadow beasts"
msgstr[0] "影の獣"

#. ~ Description of monster "shadow beast"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/monsters/dream_wound_monsters.json
msgid "A large beastly looking shadow"
msgstr "巨大な獣の影が浮かんでいます。"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/monsters/dream_wound_monsters.json
msgid "quickling shadow"
msgid_plural "quickling shadows"
msgstr[0] "俊敏な影"

#. ~ Description of monster "quickling shadow"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/monsters/dream_wound_monsters.json
msgid ""
"A slight and spry shadow about the size of a tall boy, with a shadowy dagger"
" in hand.  It flits through the air from spot to spot, while it flies you "
"can see ragged and frayed threads hanging from the bottom of its feet."
msgstr ""
"背の高い少年ほどのサイズの、小柄でよく動く影です。手に影のような短剣を携えています。あちこちを飛び回りますが、空中にいる間は、足の裏から擦り切れた糸のようなものが伸びています。"

#. ~ Death message of monster "quickling shadow"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/monsters/dream_wound_monsters.json
#, c-format
msgid "Threads stitch the %s back into whatever realm it comes from!"
msgstr "%sは糸に引き寄せられて元の世界へと戻っていきました！"

#. ~ Monster message of special attack of monster "quickling shadow"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/monsters/dream_wound_monsters.json
msgid ""
"The quickling shadow flits across the space almost faster than the eye can "
"see, striking without warning!"
msgstr "俊敏な影は目にも止まらぬ速さで空間を飛び回り、突然襲い掛かってきました！"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/monsters/elementals.json
msgid "stoneling"
msgid_plural "stonelings"
msgstr[0] "ストーンリング"

#. ~ Description of monster "stoneling"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/monsters/elementals.json
msgid ""
"A small humanoid made of rock, it doesn't seem to be fully intelligent but "
"more a mimicry of higher intelligence."
msgstr "岩でできた小さな人型生物です。実際の知性がある訳ではなく、より高度な知性体を模倣しているだけのようです。"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/monsters/elementals.json
msgid "monstrous badger"
msgid_plural "monstrous badgers"
msgstr[0] "大アナグマ"

#. ~ Description of monster "monstrous badger"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/monsters/elementals.json
msgid ""
"A fairly large badger burrowed up through the ground near you.  It is both "
"larger than garden variety badgers and strangely seems to have more "
"intelligence in it."
msgstr "かなり大きなアナグマが、地面に穴を掘っています。庭で見かけるようなアナグマより大柄で、不思議なことに知性があるように見えます。"

#. ~ Monster name
#. ~ Biblical Hebrew term
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/monsters/elementals.json
msgid "shamir"
msgid_plural "shamir"
msgstr[0] "シャミール"

#. ~ Description of monster "shamir"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/monsters/elementals.json
msgid ""
"Poking out of the ground, you see a what looks like a worm, barely bigger "
"than your pinky finger.  Its skin has a craggy, rocky texture, however, and "
"it very clearly has three black eyes on one end.  As you watch, it stares at"
" the ground and in a greenish flash, some dirt and stones vanish."
msgstr ""
"小指よりわずかに大きい程度の虫のようなものが、地面から顔を出しています。その表皮は岩のようにゴツゴツしており、顔と思しき部分には3つの黒い目が付いています。地面をじっと見つめて緑色の閃光を発すると、周りの土や石が消えていきます。"

#. ~ Monster message of special attack of monster "shamir"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/monsters/elementals.json
#, c-format
msgid "%1$s stares at the rock!"
msgstr "%1$sは岩をじっと見ています！"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/monsters/elementals.json
msgid "spitting lizard"
msgid_plural "spitting lizards"
msgstr[0] "水吐きトカゲ"

#. ~ Description of monster "spitting lizard"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/monsters/elementals.json
msgid ""
"A small dog-sized furry lizard colored in ocean blues.  It hisses and then "
"spits gouts of water at whatever attracts its ire."
msgstr "小型犬ほどのサイズの、オーシャンブルーの毛皮をもつトカゲです。脅威を感じるとシューシューと音を立てて水を噴き出します。"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/monsters/elementals.json
msgid "water sprite"
msgid_plural "water sprites"
msgstr[0] "水の精"

#. ~ Description of monster "water sprite"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/monsters/elementals.json
msgid ""
"A mischievous creature made entirely of water, with a vaguely humanoid "
"shape.  Its movements are graceful and fluid, and its voice is a musical "
"tinkling."
msgstr "純粋な水からできている、どことなく人間に似た形状の、いたずら好きな生物です。優雅かつ滑らかに動き、心地よい歌声を響かせます。"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/monsters/elementals.json
msgid "undertow"
msgid_plural "undertows"
msgstr[0] "アンダートウ"

#. ~ Description of monster "undertow"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/monsters/elementals.json
msgid ""
"A pair of frog eyes break the water, with a humanoid shadow below.  The "
"water around it churns against the current."
msgstr "水面からカエルのような両目が飛び出し、その下に人型の影が見えています。周囲の水は流れに逆らい渦を巻いています。"

#. ~ Monster name
#. ~ Biblical Hebrew term
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/monsters/elementals.json
msgid "shabriri"
msgid_plural "shabriri"
msgstr[0] "シャブリリ"

#. ~ Description of monster "shabriri"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/monsters/elementals.json
msgid ""
"You see nothing more than a mist in the air, with the vague impression of "
"darker spots that feel like they're watching you.  When you look at it, your"
" eyes itch and the edges of your vision dim."
msgstr "空気に混じった霧の中から、ぼんやりと暗い斑点がこちらを見ているような気がします。見つめ返すと目が痒くなり、視界の端が黒ずみます。"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/monsters/elementals.json
msgid "nuckalavee"
msgid_plural "nuckalavees"
msgstr[0] "ナックラヴィー"

#. ~ Description of monster "nuckalavee"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/monsters/elementals.json
msgid ""
"A giant grotesque centaur-like beast, with a skinless human torso grafted to"
" an equally skinless horse.  Thick toxic smoke leeches from its two mouths "
"as it affixes you with a gaze of pure malevolence."
msgstr ""
"皮を剥いだ人間とウマを繋ぎ合わせた姿の、気味の悪い巨大なケンタウロスのような獣です。二つの口から有毒な煙を吐き出し、純粋な悪意を滲ませた視線でこちらを見つめています。"

#. ~ Monster message of special attack of monster "nuckalavee"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/monsters/elementals.json
#, c-format
msgid "%1$s breathes out a stream of toxic gas!"
msgstr "%1$sが有毒ガスを噴出しました！"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/monsters/elementals.json
msgid "Ratatosk's child"
msgid_plural "Ratatosk's children"
msgstr[0] "幼ラタトスク"

#. ~ Description of monster "Ratatosk's child"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/monsters/elementals.json
msgid ""
"A large granivorous rodent with a long bushy tail, often seen darting amid "
"the branches of trees.  A skittish varmint with an expression of unwavering "
"austerity, it is the mortal enemy of cat and dog alike."
msgstr ""
"木々の間を飛び回っている姿がよく見られる、ふさふさとした長い尻尾をもつ穀食性の大型げっ歯類です。表情にはまったく動揺を見せませんが実は非常に憶病で、ネコからもイヌからも嫌われる卑劣な害獣です。"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/monsters/elementals.json
msgid "vineling"
msgid_plural "vinelings"
msgstr[0] "ヴァインリング"

#. ~ Description of monster "vineling"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/monsters/elementals.json
msgid ""
"A small animated mass of roots and vines, creeping along the ground with "
"alarming speed.  The tangle is thick enough that the center from which they "
"grow is concealed."
msgstr "驚くべき速度で地面を這い回る根や蔦の塊です。蔦が長く伸びて複雑に絡み合っているため、中心部はまったく見えません。"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/monsters/elementals.json
msgid "thorn-bear"
msgid_plural "thorn-bears"
msgstr[0] "ソーンベア"

#. ~ Description of monster "thorn-bear"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/monsters/elementals.json
msgid ""
"A bear, or something that looks like one.  Its eyes are a brilliant green, "
"moss grows throughout its thick fur, and foot-long woody thorns sprout from "
"its body."
msgstr "クマ、あるいはクマに似た何かです。鮮やかな緑色の目をもち、厚い毛皮には苔が生え、胴から1mほどの複数の木の棘が生えています。"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/monsters/elementals.json
msgid "defender of the wood"
msgid_plural "defenders of the wood"
msgstr[0] "森の守護者"

#. ~ Description of monster "defender of the wood"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/monsters/elementals.json
msgid ""
"An enormous man-like form with the head of a stag, over ten feet tall, "
"covered in short fur and wearing a loincloth of leaves and vines and topped "
"with a rack of majestic antlers.  It carries a long, sharpened stake of wood"
" as thick as a man's arm in one hand."
msgstr ""
"立派な角が生えたシカの頭部をもつ巨人です。身長は3m以上あり、短い毛皮に覆われており、葉と蔓でできた腰巻をまとっています。その手には、人間の腕ほどの太さがある長く尖った木の杭を携えています。"

#. ~ Monster message of special attack of monster "defender of the wood"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/monsters/elementals.json
#, c-format
msgid "%1$s gestures and you hear the creak of growing wood!"
msgstr "%1$sが身振りをすると、周囲の木々が音を立てて成長しました！"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/monsters/elementals.json
msgid "tiny elemental salamander"
msgid_plural "tiny elemental salamanders"
msgstr[0] "小火トカゲ"

#. ~ Description of monster "tiny elemental salamander"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/monsters/elementals.json
msgid ""
"A small dog-sized furry lizard colored in fiery reds.  It hisses and then "
"spits napalm-like fluid at whatever attracts its ire."
msgstr ""
"小型犬ほどのサイズの、炎のように赤い毛皮をもつトカゲです。脅威を感じるとシューシューと音を立てて、ナパーム弾のような性質をもつ液体を噴き出します。"

#. ~ Monster message of special attack of monster "tiny elemental salamander"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/monsters/elementals.json
#, c-format
msgid "%1$s spits!"
msgstr "%1$sは火を吐きました！"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/monsters/elementals.json
msgid "smoke mephit"
msgid_plural "smoke mephits"
msgstr[0] "スモークメフィット"

#. ~ Description of monster "smoke mephit"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/monsters/elementals.json
msgid ""
"A mischievous creature surrounded by smoke and particulates, with a vaguely "
"humanoid shape.  Its movements are sharp and jittery, and its voice is the "
"sound of fire crackling."
msgstr "全体が煙で覆われた、どことなく人間に似た形状の、いたずら好きな生物です。素早く落ち着きなく動き、爆ぜる火の粉のような声を響かせます。"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/monsters/elementals.json
msgid "firebird"
msgid_plural "firebirds"
msgstr[0] "火炎鳥"

#. ~ Description of monster "firebird"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/monsters/elementals.json
msgid ""
"A bird flitting through the air, glowing brightly.  Its outline is obscured "
"by the flames that ripple along its wings and body."
msgstr "明るく輝きながら飛ぶ鳥です。翼や胴の輪郭が炎のように波打ち揺らめいています。"

#. ~ Death message of monster "firebird"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/monsters/elementals.json
#, c-format
msgid "The %s bursts into flames!"
msgstr "%sが燃え上がりました！"

#. ~ Monster message of special attack of monster "firebird"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/monsters/elementals.json
msgid "The firebird lets out a cry and explodes in a burst of flames!"
msgstr "火炎鳥が一鳴きして燃え上がりました！"

#. ~ Monster name
#. ~ Here referencing the serpents in Numbers 21:6, but the same root as the
#. modern word for the type of angel.
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/monsters/elementals.json
msgid "saraph"
msgid_plural "seraphim"
msgstr[0] "セラフィム"

#. ~ Description of monster "saraph"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/monsters/elementals.json
msgid ""
"This four-winged serpent constantly twirls and spins as it flies through the"
" air, its wings always in motion.  Or at least, you think so.  It's glowing "
"so brightly it's painful to look at, and the air around it wavers like the "
"heat haze over pavement at midsummer."
msgstr ""
"常に4枚の翼を羽ばたかせ、回転しながら空を飛んでいるようにしか見えないヘビです。目が眩むほど明るく輝き、周囲の空気は真夏の舗装道路にかかる陽炎のように揺らめいています。"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/monsters/elementals.json
msgid "Venus figurine"
msgid_plural "Venus figurines"
msgstr[0] "ヴィーナス小像"

#. ~ Description of monster "Venus figurine"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/monsters/elementals.json
msgid ""
"Resembling most of all the ancient art form of the Venus figurines, this "
"rounded female body sinously moves side to side as it steps.  It's eyes "
"flash yellow and green as they scan the area surrounding them."
msgstr ""
"古代の美術品であるヴィーナス像に非常によく似ている、丸みを帯びた体つきの女性像です。体をしなやかに揺らして歩き、両目を黄色と緑色に点滅させながら周囲をスキャンします。"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/monsters/elementals.json
msgid "zoomorphic figurine"
msgid_plural "zoomorphic figurines"
msgstr[0] "獣人像"

#. ~ Description of monster "zoomorphic figurine"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/monsters/elementals.json
msgid ""
"A human shaped figure with the head of an animal.  Their skin shifts between"
" skin and fur across the body, and their fingers end in long talons."
msgstr "動物のような頭部をもつ人型の像です。皮膚には毛皮がまだらに生えており、指先には長い爪が伸びています。"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/monsters/elementals.json
msgid "Nimue's dragonfly"
msgid_plural "Nimue's dragonflies"
msgstr[0] "ニムエトンボ"

#. ~ Description of monster "Nimue's dragonfly"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/monsters/elementals.json
msgid ""
"A ferocious, iridescent multi-hued dragonfly, still lightning-fast despite "
"growing to the size of a football.  Its head is little more than a palm-"
"sized pair of rainbow compound eyes, and its legs - already specialized for "
"grasping prey - end in curved talons."
msgstr ""
"鮮やかな虹色の獰猛なトンボです。サッカーボールほどのサイズまで成長したにもかかわらず、超高速で飛び回っています。頭部にある虹色の複眼は拳大に肥大し、獲物を捕らえることに特化した肢の先には湾曲した爪が生えています。"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/monsters/elementals.json
msgid "skyglass butterfly"
msgid_plural "skyglass butterflies"
msgstr[0] "ガラスチョウ"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/monsters/elementals.json
msgid "sheyd"
msgid_plural "shedim"
msgstr[0] "シェディム"

#. ~ Description of monster "sheyd"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/monsters/elementals.json
msgid ""
"An ordinary person, until you look at second time and notice that their "
"shadow has wings and their feet are the clawed feet of a chicken.  When you "
"look away from them for more than a moment, they seem to disappear."
msgstr ""
"一見すると普通の人間ですが、よく観察すると翼が生えており、足にはニワトリの蹴爪のようなものが伸びています。少しでも目を離すと、どこかへ消えてしまいます。"

#. ~ Monster message of special attack of monster "sheyd"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/monsters/elementals.json
#, c-format
msgid "%1$s glares at you!"
msgstr "%1$sがこちらを睨みました！"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/monsters/exodii.json
msgid "Exodii Jotunn"
msgid_plural "Exodii Jotunns"
msgstr[0] "エクゾディヨトゥン"

#. ~ Description of monster "Exodii Jotunn"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/monsters/exodii.json
msgid ""
"A truly massive heavy combat cyborg with six independent legs, two arms that"
" look like a cross between shovels and shields that can be rooted into the "
"ground to provide stabilized cover, two close combat arms that can swing "
"over top of the shields, and a weapon pod mounted on a swiveling turret."
msgstr ""
"6本の独立して動く脚、シャベルと盾を合わせたような形状の、地面に突き刺して頑丈な壁となる2本の防御腕、その上から伸びる2本の近接戦闘腕、全方位タレットに取り付けられた銃器を備えた、巨大な重武装サイボーグです。"

#. ~ Monster message of special attack of monster "Exodii Jotunn"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/monsters/exodii.json
msgid "The Exodii Jotunn fires its weapon pod!"
msgstr "エクゾディヨトゥンが銃器を発射しました！"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/monsters/ferals.json
msgid "deranged zebra agent"
msgid_plural "deranged zebra agents"
msgstr[0] "狂ったXEDRA職員"

#. ~ Description of monster "deranged zebra agent"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/monsters/ferals.json
msgid ""
"This formerly buttoned up professional government agent has become deranged "
"and dangerous.  They move among the undead, handgun at the ready and saucer "
"pupils scanning for threats in a mockery of their former lives."
msgstr ""
"以前は政府の優秀な仕事人でしたが、錯乱して危険な存在になり果てました。ハンドガンを構え、見開いた瞳で敵を探し、かつての職務を嘲笑うかのようにゾンビに混じって行動しています。"

#. ~ Description of special attack of monster "deranged zebra agent"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/monsters/ferals.json
msgid "The deranged agent fires their Five-seveN!"
msgstr "狂ったエージェントはFNファイブセブンを発射しました！"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/monsters/inventor.json
msgid "sniper bot"
msgid_plural "sniper bots"
msgstr[0] "狙撃ロボット"

#. ~ Description of monster "sniper bot"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/monsters/inventor.json
msgid ""
"A doglike robot with a rifle barrel mounted on its back.  The quadrupedal "
"platform appears to grant a high level of stability in order to strike "
"targets at long range."
msgstr "背中にライフル銃を搭載したイヌ型ロボットです。四足歩行プラットフォームによって、遠距離射撃時にも高い安定性を確保します。"

#. ~ Targeting sound of special attack of monster "sniper bot"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/monsters/inventor.json
msgid "\"Steady, steady.\""
msgstr "「安定中、安定中」"

#. ~ No ammo sound of special attack of monster "sniper bot"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/monsters/inventor.json
msgid "chk-chk pop!"
msgstr "カチ、カチ、ピピッ！"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/monsters/inventor.json
msgid "shotgun bot"
msgid_plural "shotgun bots"
msgstr[0] "ショットガンロボット"

#. ~ Description of monster "shotgun bot"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/monsters/inventor.json
msgid ""
"A heavy, but quick two-legged drone that holds a massive shotgun system "
"above himself.  Effectively a machinegun with legs."
msgstr "巨大なショットガンを頭部に搭載した、重厚ながら素早い二足歩行ロボットです。実質的には、脚があるマシンガンです。"

#. ~ No ammo sound of special attack of monster "shotgun bot"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/monsters/inventor.json
msgid "chk-chk!"
msgstr "カチ、カチ！"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/monsters/inventor.json
msgid "cutthroater"
msgid_plural "cutthroaters"
msgstr[0] "カミソリロボット"

#. ~ Description of monster "cutthroater"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/monsters/inventor.json
msgid ""
"A tiny arachnid-like bot with three manipulators with telescopic razor-sharp"
" blades."
msgstr "先端に伸縮自在の鋭い刃をもつ3本のマニピュレータを備えた、クモのような小型ロボットです。"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/monsters/migo.json
msgid "stalking warper"
msgid_plural "stalking warpers"
msgstr[0] "ストーキング・ワーパー"

#. ~ Description of monster "stalking warper"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/monsters/migo.json
msgid ""
"Once the mi-go revealed themselves in the last days before the Cataclysm "
"they released a number of animals to 'gather specimens'.  This four legged "
"beast resembles a cross between a cat and a monitor lizard, tongue flicking "
"out and splitting into multiple appendages.  Before the tvs stopped working "
"people witnessed these creatures biting and injecting some kind of warping "
"venom into their victims.  The changes that its victims would undergo were "
"quite shocking in those days."
msgstr ""
"ミ＝ゴは大変動の直前に地球上に現れ、「被検体を集める」ために大量の動物を放ちました。この四足獣はネコとオオトカゲを掛け合わせたような姿をしており、先端が複数に分かれた触手のような舌が口から覗いています。テレビ番組が機能していた当時は、この種の生物が獲物に噛みついて変異毒を注入する様子も放送されていました。毒によって変異した犠牲者の姿はかなり衝撃的なものでした。"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/monsters/monster.json
msgid "shimmering spider"
msgid_plural "shimmering spiders"
msgstr[0] "光輝グモ"

#. ~ Description of monster "shimmering spider"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/monsters/monster.json
msgid ""
"A dog-sized spider, the air around it has a faint shimmer of light, possibly"
" reflected from tiny strands of webbing."
msgstr "イヌほどのサイズのクモです。周囲の空間がかすかに光っているのは、非常に細い糸で作られた網が光を反射しているためでしょう。"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/monsters/monster.json
msgid "shifter"
msgid_plural "shifters"
msgstr[0] "シフター"

#. ~ Description of monster "shifter"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/monsters/monster.json
msgid ""
"A tall body on four legs, surrounded by a \"glitched\" aura - it constantly "
"changes its own position."
msgstr "4本足で立つ長身のモンスターです。常に座標が変わり続けているため、全身が異常なオーラに包まれています。"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/monsters/monster.json
msgid "duplicator"
msgid_plural "duplicators"
msgstr[0] "デュプリケーター"

#. ~ Description of monster "duplicator"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/monsters/monster.json
msgid ""
"A humanoid on two legs, this creature spies on everything around with its "
"eight eyes, arranged in a circle.  From time to time it splits in two, where"
" the one on the left is in a defensive position, and the other attacks the "
"enemy with its long fists."
msgstr ""
"二足歩行の人型モンスターです。全方位を見渡せるよう、顔には8つの目が付いています。時折二体に分裂し、片方が防御態勢を取り、もう片方が長い腕で敵に襲い掛かります。"

#. ~ Monster message of special attack of monster "duplicator"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/monsters/monster.json
msgid "The body of the duplicator splits in half!"
msgstr "デュプリケーターが2体に分裂しました！"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/monsters/monster.json
msgid "ophanim"
msgid_plural "ophanims"
msgstr[0] "オファニム"

#. ~ Description of monster "ophanim"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/monsters/monster.json
msgid ""
"Their entire bodies\n"
"including their backs, their hands and their wings\n"
"were completely full of eyes\n"
"as were their four wheels."
msgstr ""
"その輪縁、その輻、その輪は\n"
"すべてが目で満ちていた。\n"
"輪は四つすべてが\n"
"この姿であった。"

#. ~ Death message of monster "ophanim"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/monsters/monster.json
#, c-format
msgid "The %s shatter into pieces in silent explosion."
msgstr "%sは音もなく爆発し、粉々に砕け散りました。"

#. ~ Description of monster "light"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/monsters/monster.json
msgid ""
"Flying piece of light in a shape of… a cube?  It constantly changes its "
"form, and each of its attacks tears the piece of space from the reality, "
"causing a ridiculously loud explosion.  Even if it's friendly, some of its "
"action are impossible to explain."
msgstr ""
"光りながら飛翔する立方体...でしょうか？絶えず変形し続け、敵を攻撃する度に現実世界の空間を切り裂き、非常に派手な大爆発を引き起こします。こちらに友好的ではありますが、その行動は常人には理解しがたいものです。"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/monsters/monster.json
msgid "rat king"
msgid_plural "rat kings"
msgstr[0] "ネズミの王"

#. ~ Description of monster "rat king"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/monsters/monster.json
msgid ""
"A towering swarm of mutated rats, their tails knotted together in a filthy "
"mass.  A fetid stench flows from its filthy presence."
msgstr "変異したラットの塊です。不潔な大量の尾が互いに結びあわされており、汚らしい体は酷い悪臭を放っています。"

#. ~ Death message of monster "rat king"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/monsters/monster.json
msgid "Rats suddenly swarm into view."
msgstr "ネズミが突然目の前に群がってきました。"

#. ~ Monster message of special attack of monster "flaming eye"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/monsters/monster.json
#, c-format
msgid "%1$s stares at you and you feel a sense of doom!"
msgstr "%1$sに睨まれ、破滅的な予感に苛まれました！"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/monsters/monster.json
msgid "remains of a dreamforged automaton"
msgid_plural "remains of a dreamforged automatons"
msgstr[0] "暴走夢鉱人形"

#. ~ Description of monster "remains of a dreamforged automaton"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/monsters/monster.json
msgid ""
"A broken robot, still standing and saturated with electricity.  Between the "
"shattered dreamdross plates, the ruined armor and the electrical discharges,"
" you can barely see the remains of the machinery that once animated it, and "
"yet it moves on its two feet, albeit like some sort of puppet."
msgstr ""
"全身に電気をまとったこのロボットは、壊れているものの倒れてはいません。砕けた夢鉱の外装、割れた装甲、飛び散る火花に覆い隠され、かつてロボットを動かしていた機械の残骸はほとんど見えませんが、この自動人形はなおも二本足で動き回っています。"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/monsters/monster.json
msgid "dream-drainer mosquito"
msgid_plural "dream-drainer mosquitos"
msgstr[0] "夢喰い蚊"

#. ~ Description of monster "dream-drainer mosquito"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/monsters/monster.json
msgid ""
"Forged from the wildest dreams and the worst nightmares, this gigantic "
"mosquito bloats as its proboscis syphons the air, as if it was feeding on "
"some invisible thing.  Looking at it, your mind blurs a little, making you "
"feel that what this monster is sucking are your dreams."
msgstr ""
"最もあり得ない夢と最も悪い夢から生まれたこの巨大な蚊は、目に見えない何かを吸っているかのように、口吻で周囲の空気を吸い込み膨らんでいます。まるで自分の夢を吸い取られているように感じ、ずっと見ていると意識が朦朧とします。"

#. ~ Monster message of special attack of monster "dream-drainer mosquito"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/monsters/monster.json
#, c-format
msgid "%1$s shivers as its wounds close."
msgstr "%1$sは身震いし、傷を癒しました。"

#. ~ Monster message of special attack of monster "dream-drainer mosquito"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/monsters/monster.json
#, c-format
msgid "%1$s buzzes loudly as its speed increases."
msgstr "%1$sは大きな音を立てて羽ばたき、速度を上げました。"

#. ~ Monster message of special attack of monster "dream-drainer mosquito"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/monsters/monster.json
#, c-format
msgid "%1$s's shell hardens as you prepare to attack it."
msgstr "%1$sの甲殻が攻撃に備えて硬く引き締まりました。"

#. ~ Monster message of special attack of monster "dream-drainer mosquito"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/monsters/monster.json
#, c-format
msgid "%1$s points its proboscis at you, and a projectile bursts from it!"
msgstr "%1$sが口吻をこちらに向け、何かを発射しました！"

#. ~ Monster message of special attack of monster "dream-drainer mosquito"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/monsters/monster.json
#, c-format
msgid "%1$s hits you with one of its legs with tremendous force."
msgstr "%1$sは片側の肢を勢いよく振り回しました。"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/monsters/monster.json
msgid "Luna-Attuned Revenant"
msgid_plural "Luna-Attuned Revenants"
msgstr[0] "月触亡霊"

#. ~ Description of monster "Luna-Attuned Revenant"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/monsters/monster.json
msgid ""
"Nearly seven feet tall and whip thin, this grotesque mockery of a March Lord"
" is wrapped in fiery moonlight.  Moonlight courses its veins as the heart "
"you granted it pulses with power.  Its face is struck in a grimace of pain "
"and its eyes shine with endless hatred directed at you, the one responsible "
"for its current state of agony."
msgstr ""
"辺境伯とよく似た姿の、鞭のように細く不気味な身長2m超の怪物が、燃えるような月の光を浴びています。儀式によって与えられた心臓は力強く脈打ち、月光は血管を伝い全身を巡っています。表情は苦痛に歪み、両目はこの苦しみをもたらした儀式の実行者に対する果てしない憎しみの光をたたえています。"

#. ~ Death message of monster "Luna-Attuned Revenant"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/monsters/monster.json
#, c-format
msgid "The %s decoheres and is consumed by the moonlight!"
msgstr "%sは崩壊し、月の光に飲み込まれました！"

#. ~ Monster message of special attack of monster "Luna-Attuned Revenant"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/monsters/monster.json
#, c-format
msgid ""
"%1$s points a finger at you, and a projectile suddenly appears from it!"
msgstr "%1$sが指をこちらに向けると、指先から何かが発射されました！"

#. ~ Monster message of special attack of monster "Luna-Attuned Revenant"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/monsters/monster.json
#, c-format
msgid "A ray of moonlight bursts from %1$s!"
msgstr "%1$sは月の光を収束し、放出しました！"

#. ~ Monster message of special attack of monster "Luna-Attuned Revenant"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/monsters/monster.json
#, c-format
msgid "Without the moonlight shining on it, %1$s is weakened!"
msgstr "月光を浴びていない%1$sは弱体化しています！"

#. ~ Monster message of special attack of monster "Luna-Attuned Revenant"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/monsters/monster.json
#, c-format
msgid "%1$s lashes out as it attempts to be exposed to the moonlight again!"
msgstr "%1$sは再び月の光を浴びるため、猛攻撃を仕掛けました！"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/monsters/monster.json
msgid "grasping globule"
msgid_plural "grasping globules"
msgstr[0] "拘束粘液塊"

#. ~ Description of monster "grasping globule"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/monsters/monster.json
msgid ""
"A large, irregular mass of greenish slime.  It forms tendrils as it "
"perceives you, likely to try and bring you closer of its stronger allies."
msgstr "不定形の大きな緑色の粘液塊です。こちらを感知すると触手を生やし、恐らくより強力な球体の傍まで引き寄せようとします。"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/monsters/monster.json
msgid "bashing globule"
msgid_plural "bashing globules"
msgstr[0] "打撃粘液塊"

#. ~ Description of monster "bashing globule"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/monsters/monster.json
msgid ""
"A large, irregular mass of reddish slime, forming appendages to bash its "
"targets.  It wanders blindly, waiting for something to come close enoug for "
"it to notice and crush with its mass."
msgstr ""
"敵を殴り倒すための触手を生やした、不定形の大きな赤みがかった粘液塊です。盲目的にさまよい、何かが近寄ってくるとその巨体で押し潰そうとします。"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/monsters/monster.json
msgid "spewing globule"
msgid_plural "spewing globules"
msgstr[0] "噴射粘液塊"

#. ~ Description of monster "spewing globule"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/monsters/monster.json
msgid ""
"This mass of pale slime quivers as you approach.  Beneath the surface, you "
"see shapes trying to find a way out of it."
msgstr "近寄ると震えだす、青白い粘液塊です。内部では何かが外へ飛び出そうと蠢いています。"

#. ~ Monster message of special attack of monster "spewing globule"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/monsters/monster.json
#, c-format
msgid "%s opens itself, and some small globules crawl out of it!"
msgstr "%sの内部から複数の小さな粘液塊が飛び出しました！"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/monsters/monster.json
msgid "small globule"
msgid_plural "small globules"
msgstr[0] "小粘液塊"

#. ~ Description of monster "small globule"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/monsters/monster.json
msgid ""
"This small, swift ball of slime moves to attack you without hesitation.  "
"Despite its size and lack of strength, its speed must not be underestimated."
msgstr "非常に活発で攻撃的な、小さく素早い粘液塊です。質量が小さく非力ですが、そのスピードを侮ってはいけません。"

#. ~ Spell name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/monsters/monster_spells.json
msgid "Salamander Glob"
msgstr "火トカゲ火炎"

#. ~ Spell name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/monsters/monster_spells.json
msgid "Hungry Thirsty Roots Monster"
msgstr "ﾊﾝｸﾞﾘｰ･ｻｰｽﾃｨ･ﾙｰﾂ(モンスター専用)"

#. ~ Spell name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/monsters/monster_spells.json
msgid "Shamir Dig Pit Spell"
msgstr "シャミール掘削"

#. ~ Spell name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/monsters/monster_spells.json
msgid "Sheyd Evil Eye Spell"
msgstr "シェディム邪視"

#. ~ Spell name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/monsters/monster_spells.json
msgid "Flaming Eye Evil Eye Spell"
msgstr "フレーミングアイ邪視"

#. ~ Spell name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/monsters/monster_spells.json
msgid "Shabriri Blinding Spell"
msgstr "シャブリリ盲目攻撃"

#. ~ Description of spell "Shabriri Blinding Spell"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/monsters/monster_spells.json
msgid ""
"This is a monster only spell.  My mother told me, Shabriri bariri riri iri "
"ri, in my white cup."
msgstr "モンスター専用呪文です。汝の母は警告する。シャブリリ、ブリリ、リリ、リ。呪文は盲目の器に勝る。"

#. ~ Spell name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/monsters/monster_spells.json
msgid "Shadowman Death"
msgstr "影人死亡"

#. ~ Description of spell "Shadowman Death"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/monsters/monster_spells.json
msgid "Eliminates any dream shadows in the area."
msgstr "範囲内の夢の影を全て除去します。"

#. ~ Spell name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/monsters/monster_spells.json
msgid "Close Dreamwound Shadow"
msgstr "影の亀裂停止"

#. ~ Description of spell "Close Dreamwound Shadow"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/monsters/monster_spells.json
msgid "Closes a shadowy wound between reality and dreams."
msgstr "現実と夢の世界を繋ぐ亀裂を閉じます。"

#. ~ Spell name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/monsters/monster_spells.json
msgid "Shadowman Teleport"
msgstr "影人転移"

#. ~ Description of spell "Shadowman Teleport"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/monsters/monster_spells.json
msgid "An explosive movement of shadowy knives."
msgstr "影のナイフによる目にも止まらぬ攻撃です。"

#. ~ Spell name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/monsters/monster_spells.json
msgid "Shadow DR Monster enemy check"
msgstr "影の防御力敵対チェック"

#. ~ Description of spell "Shadow DR Monster enemy check"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/monsters/monster_spells.json
msgid ""
"Preps for using Shadow Damage Reduction when a hostile target is detected."
msgstr "敵対的な標的を検出した場合に影の防御力を使用する準備をします。"

#. ~ Spell name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/monsters/monster_spells.json
msgid "Shadow DR Monster Effect"
msgstr "影の防御力モンスター効果"

#. ~ Description of spell "Shadow DR Monster Effect"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/monsters/monster_spells.json
msgid ""
"Grants the effect for a shadow to gain damage resistance to bash and "
"bullets.."
msgstr "影モンスターに打撃、銃弾ダメージ耐性を付与します。"

#. ~ Spell name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/monsters/monster_spells.json
msgid "Firebird Explosion"
msgstr "火炎鳥爆発"

#. ~ Description of spell "Firebird Explosion"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/monsters/monster_spells.json
msgid "A fireball caused by a zealous firebird."
msgstr "火炎鳥が燃え上がり火球を生成します。"

#. ~ Spell name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/monsters/monster_spells.json
msgid "Firebird Explosion Self"
msgstr "火炎鳥爆発死亡"

#. ~ Description of spell "Firebird Explosion Self"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/monsters/monster_spells.json
msgid ""
"A fireball caused by a zealous firebird that consumes itself.  Damage type "
"pure to actually hurt them since they're immune to heat."
msgstr "火炎鳥が自らの命と引き換えに火球を生成します。火炎鳥は火炎耐性を持っているため、実際には純粋ダメージを受けます。"

#. ~ Spell name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/monsters/monster_spells.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/spells/eater_spells.json
msgid "Trade dreams for health"
msgstr "ﾄﾚｰﾄﾞ･ﾄﾞﾘｰﾑｽ･ﾌｫｰ･ﾍﾙｽ"

#. ~ Description of spell "Trade dreams for health"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/monsters/monster_spells.json
msgid "Absorbs some collective dross and heals damage to the mosquito."
msgstr "吸い取った夢鉱を消費して蚊のHPを回復します。"

#. ~ Description of spell "Endurance"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/monsters/monster_spells.json
msgid "Let the dreams take the blows.  Don't let the world kill you."
msgstr "この世界に殺されないように、夢のエネルギーで防御力を高めます。"

#. ~ Spell name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/monsters/monster_spells.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/spells/eater_spells.json
msgid "Pierce"
msgstr "ﾋﾟｱｽ"

#. ~ Description of spell "Pierce"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/monsters/monster_spells.json
msgid "Throw a long ethereal spear out of your proboscis or finger."
msgstr "口吻または指先から霊的な長槍を投射します。"

#. ~ Description of spell "Rush"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/monsters/monster_spells.json
msgid "Fly.  Fly as fast as you can.  Don't stop."
msgstr "できる限り速く飛び続けましょう。止まってはいけません。"

#. ~ Spell name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/monsters/monster_spells.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/spells/eater_spells.json
msgid "Point Blank"
msgstr "ﾎﾟｲﾝﾄ･ﾌﾞﾗﾝｸ"

#. ~ Description of spell "Point Blank"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/monsters/monster_spells.json
msgid ""
"A straight hit with your leg.  Using additional energy you could probably "
"break a wall with such a powerful strike."
msgstr "エネルギーを込めて脚をまっすぐ突き出すことで、壁すら破壊するキックを繰り出します。"

#. ~ Spell name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/monsters/monster_spells.json
msgid "Lunar Line"
msgstr "月光線"

#. ~ Description of spell "Lunar Line"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/monsters/monster_spells.json
msgid ""
"Create a line of pure destruction.  Doesn't hurt the player that much "
"because that spell will be spammed all over the fight."
msgstr "純粋な破壊の力をもつ光線を繰り出します。この呪文は戦闘中に繰り返し詠唱されるため、プレイヤーへのダメージはそれほど高くありません。"

#. ~ Sound description of spell "Lunar Line"
#. ~ Sound description of spell "Lasing-Out Lunar Line"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/monsters/monster_spells.json
msgid "A crackling sound!"
msgstr "バチチチッ！"

#. ~ Spell name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/monsters/monster_spells.json
msgid "Weakened by the lack of light"
msgstr "月光不足弱体化"

#. ~ Description of spell "Weakened by the lack of light"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/monsters/monster_spells.json
msgid "No more moonlight, no more power."
msgstr "月光がなければ力も湧きません。"

#. ~ Spell name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/monsters/monster_spells.json
msgid "Lasing-Out Lunar Line"
msgstr "月光線攻撃"

#. ~ Description of spell "Lasing-Out Lunar Line"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/monsters/monster_spells.json
msgid ""
"Create a line of pure destruction.  Weakened to account for the massive "
"spam."
msgstr "純粋な破壊の力をもつ光線を繰り出します。繰り返し詠唱されるため威力を弱体化しています。"

#. ~ Spell name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/monsters/monster_spells.json
msgid "Summon small globule"
msgstr "小粘液塊召喚"

#. ~ Description of spell "Summon small globule"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/monsters/monster_spells.json
msgid "Summons a small globule."
msgstr "小粘液塊を召喚します。"

#. ~ Spell name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/monsters/monster_spells.json
msgid "Nuckalavee Toxic Breath"
msgstr "ナックラヴィー有毒ガス"

#. ~ Description of spell "Nuckalavee Toxic Breath"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/monsters/monster_spells.json
msgid "The Nuckalavee breathes out toxic gas.  It's a bug if you have it."
msgstr "ナックラヴィーが有毒ガスを吐き出します。通常は表示されません。"

#. ~ Name of a gun
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/monsters/monsterattacks.json
msgid "thrown knife"
msgid_plural "thrown knifes"
msgstr[0] "投げナイフ"

#. ~ Description of gun "thrown knife"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/monsters/monsterattacks.json
msgid "Shiny reflective throwing knife at the ready."
msgstr "光を受けてキラキラと輝くナイフが用意されています。"

#. ~ Monster attack message
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/monsters/monsterattacks.json
#, c-format
msgid "%1$s tries to impale your %2$s, but fails to penetrate your armor!"
msgstr "%1$sが%2$sを貫こうとしましたが、装甲に阻まれました！"

#. ~ Monster attack message
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/monsters/monsterattacks.json
#, c-format
msgid "%1$s tries to impale <npcname>, but fails to penetrate their armor!"
msgstr "%1$sが<npcname>を貫こうとしましたが、装甲に阻まれました！"

#. ~ Name of a gun
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/monsters/monsterattacks.json
msgid "Glock 19"
msgid_plural "Glock 19"
msgstr[0] "ハンドガン(9x19mm/ｸﾞﾛｯｸ19)"

#. ~ Description of gun "Glock 19"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/monsters/monsterattacks.json
msgid ""
"A poorly maintained and inaccurate version of the Glock 19 for renfields."
msgstr "レンフィールドが使っている、整備不良で精度の低いM9です。"

#. ~ Name of a gun
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/monsters/monsterattacks.json
msgid "renfield Remington"
msgid_plural "renfield Remington"
msgstr[0] "ショットガン(12ga/ﾚﾝﾌｨｰﾙﾄﾞ用ﾚﾐﾝﾄﾝ)"

#. ~ Description of gun "renfield Remington"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/monsters/monsterattacks.json
msgid "A fake shotgun for renfields (because monster aiming is too lethal)."
msgstr "レンフィールド用の疑似セミオートライフルです(モンスターの照準が正確すぎるため)。"

#. ~ Name of a gun
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/monsters/monsterattacks.json
msgid "FN Five-seveN"
msgid_plural "FN Five-seveN"
msgstr[0] "ハンドガン(5.7mm/FNﾌｧｲﾌﾞｾﾌﾞﾝ)"

#. ~ Description of gun "FN Five-seveN"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/monsters/monsterattacks.json
msgid ""
"A poorly maintained and inaccurate version of the Five-seveN for feral "
"agents."
msgstr "狂ったXEDRA職員が使っている、整備不良で精度の低いFNファイブセブンです。"

#. ~ Spell name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/monsters/monsterattacks.json
msgid "Duplicator Shifting"
msgstr "デュプリケーター転移"

#. ~ Description of spell "Duplicator Shifting"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/monsters/monsterattacks.json
msgid "Constantly teleports you around."
msgstr "絶えず周囲を瞬間移動し続けます。"

#. ~ Spell name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/monsters/monsterattacks.json
msgid "Summon Shifter (Monster Version)"
msgstr "ｻﾓﾝ･ｼﾌﾀｰ(モンスター専用)"

#. ~ Description of spell "Summon Shifter (Monster Version)"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/monsters/monsterattacks.json
msgid ""
"Summon a shifter.  Monster version, the creature exists for 1-2 seconds.  "
"Mostly decorative effect to show 'glitchiness'."
msgstr ""
"シフターを1体召喚します。このモンスター専用版では、1-2秒の間だけ存在します。主に「異常なオーラ」を表わすために使われる装飾的な効果です。"

#. ~ Spell name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/monsters/monsterattacks.json
msgid "Sapient Damage"
msgstr "光体攻撃"

#. ~ Description of spell "Sapient Damage"
#. ~ Description of spell "Smash A Target"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/monsters/monsterattacks.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/spells/dreamer_spells.json
msgid "Deal some damage.  You can't see it except in debug mode."
msgstr "ダメージを与えます。デバッグモード以外では表示されません。"

#. ~ Sound description of spell "Sapient Damage"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/monsters/monsterattacks.json
msgid "a loud whisper"
msgstr "[濁った音]"

#. ~ Spell name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/monsters/monsterattacks.json
msgid "Sapient Bash"
msgstr "光体地形破壊"

#. ~ Description of spell "Sapient Bash"
#. ~ Description of spell "Constructed Hammer Bash"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/monsters/monsterattacks.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/spells/dreamer_spells.json
msgid "Bash some terrain.  You can't see it except in debug mode."
msgstr "地形を破壊します。デバッグモード以外では表示されません。"

#. ~ Spell name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/monsters/monsterattacks.json
msgid "Sapient Player Damage"
msgstr "光体操作キャラクターダメージ"

#. ~ Description of spell "Sapient Player Damage"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/monsters/monsterattacks.json
#, c-format
msgid ""
"Deal 34% of player's HP damage to player.  You can't see it except in debug "
"mode."
msgstr "操作キャラクターに最大HPの34%に相当するダメージを与えます。デバッグモード以外では表示されません。"

#. ~ Spell name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/monsters/monsterattacks.json
msgid "Summon Duplicator Pawn"
msgstr "デュプリケーターポーン召喚"

#. ~ Description of spell "Summon Duplicator Pawn"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/monsters/monsterattacks.json
msgid "Summon 1 short life pawn."
msgstr "短期間で消失するデュプリケーターを1体召喚します。"

#. ~ Spell name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/monsters/monsterattacks.json
msgid "Ophanim Death"
msgstr "オファニム死亡"

#. ~ Description of spell "Ophanim Death"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/monsters/monsterattacks.json
msgid "AoE cut damage, when ophanim dies."
msgstr "オファニム死亡時、一定範囲に斬撃ダメージを与えます。"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/monsters/nightmares_and_chimeras.json
msgid "flying shark"
msgid_plural "flying sharks"
msgstr[0] "フライングシャーク"

#. ~ Description of monster "flying shark"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/monsters/nightmares_and_chimeras.json
msgid ""
"It would be funny watching a shark swim through the air, between trees and "
"other objects like kelp under the water.  If it didn't mean the shark was "
"still completely real and capable of flying after you.  Something is very "
"wrong about things here."
msgstr ""
"現実に存在しており、こちらを追って飛んでくる可能性さえなければ、海藻を掻き分けるように木々の間を進むサメを見物するのは、さぞ愉快だったことでしょう。明らかに何かが間違っています。"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/monsters/nightmares_and_chimeras.json
msgid "endless snake"
msgid_plural "endless snakes"
msgstr[0] "無限のヘビ"

#. ~ Description of monster "endless snake"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/monsters/nightmares_and_chimeras.json
msgid ""
"The tail of this snake doesn't seem to end.  Clearly there are places that "
"are not part of the tail of this snake, but when you watch it move you only "
"see the front of the body move forward while the rear stays in it's place "
"eternally elongating.  But that can't be true so your eyes snap to somewhere"
" else and that seems to be an appropriately length snake, isn't it?"
msgstr ""
"このヘビは、どこまで行っても尾の先に辿り着けません。尾以外の部位は確かに存在していますが、前に進むときは体の前半分だけが進み、後ろ半分は永遠にその場に留まったままです。視界の端に留めている限りは、普通の長さのヘビにしか見えません。どういうことなのでしょうか？"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/monsters/nightmares_and_chimeras.json
msgid "swarm of teeth"
msgid_plural "swarms of teeth"
msgstr[0] "歯の大群"

#. ~ Description of monster "swarm of teeth"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/monsters/nightmares_and_chimeras.json
msgid "A buzzing whining sound accompanies this swarm of loose teeth."
msgstr "抜けた歯が群れをなし、ブンブンと唸っています。"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/monsters/nightmares_and_chimeras.json
msgid "twin"
msgid_plural "twins"
msgstr[0] "写し身"

#. ~ Description of monster "twin"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/monsters/nightmares_and_chimeras.json
msgid "Ethereal copy of you."
msgstr "自分にそっくりな姿をした霊体です。"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/monsters/nightmares_and_chimeras.json
msgid "you"
msgid_plural "yous"
msgstr[0] "あなた"

#. ~ Description of monster "you"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/monsters/nightmares_and_chimeras.json
msgid ""
"It is you.  It looks like you, it is equipped like you, it is even has a "
"weapon like you."
msgstr "あなたです。顔も姿も武器もそっくりです。"

#. ~ Description of species "CHANGELING"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/monsters/species.json
msgid "a creature from under the hill"
msgstr "丘のふもとに棲む生物"

#. ~ Description of species "IERDE"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/monsters/species.json
msgid "an earth elemental spirit"
msgstr "地の精"

#. ~ Description of species "UNDINE"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/monsters/species.json
msgid "a water elemental spirit"
msgstr "水の精"

#. ~ Description of species "ARVORE"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/monsters/species.json
msgid "a plant elemental spirit"
msgstr "草木の精"

#. ~ Description of species "SALAMANDER"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/monsters/species.json
msgid "a fire elemental spirit"
msgstr "炎の精"

#. ~ Description of species "HOMULLUS"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/monsters/species.json
msgid "an elemental spirit of humanity"
msgstr "人の精"

#. ~ Description of species "SYLPH"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/monsters/species.json
msgid "an air elemental spirit"
msgstr "風の精"

#. ~ Description of species "RENFIELD"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/monsters/species.json
msgid ""
"a variety of creatures that have partaken of the unholy blood of the vampyr"
msgstr "吸血鬼の呪われた血を飲んだ怪物"

#. ~ Description of species "NIGHTMARE"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/monsters/species.json
msgid "creatures made from dreams, technically not alive"
msgstr "夢が生み出した怪物であり、厳密に言えば生物ではない"

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/classes.json
msgid "Dreamer"
msgstr "ドリーマー"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Dreamer"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/classes.json
msgid ""
"Dreamers are people who are able to tap into the power of dreams and nearby "
"dimensions and create fantastical effects as a result.  They can even pull "
"some of this dream material into our world to build other things with it.  "
"Sometimes they hear outside voices that offer help and presents, and with "
"enough power, dreamers can pull them right from beyond.  Their power scales "
"with their natural perception and intellect."
msgstr ""
"ドリーマーは、夢の世界や近接した次元から力を引き出し、幻想的な効果をもたらします。夢で作られた素材を現実世界に持ち出し、別のものに作り替える力も持っています。時折、援助や贈り物を提供しようとする別世界からの声を聞くことがあります。十分な力があれば、ドリーマーはその助けを直接こちら側の世界へ引き寄せることもできます。その能力は、生来の知性と感覚に比例して強まります。"

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/classes.json
msgid "Eater of Dreams"
msgstr "ドリームイーター"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Eater of Dreams"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/classes.json
msgid ""
"These people are aware of this cross-dimensional contamination and while "
"they can't pull anything over and make new things, they can eat anything "
"they find in our world that doesn't belong and gain abilities and powers "
"from that consumption.  They have larger than normal mana pools but regen "
"that mana much slower as a result, they can cast a spell to convert "
"dreamdross scraps directly into mana.  Their power scales with their natural"
" strength and dexterity."
msgstr ""
"ドリームイーターは次元の混入を察知していますが、別次元から何かを持ち出したり無から何かを作り出したりはできません。現実世界に混じった異界のものを食らい、新たな技や力を獲得します。マナの最大容量が通常より多いですが、回復力は遅くなっています。呪文によって夢鉱屑をマナに変換できます。魔法の強度は生来の筋力と器用さに比例して上昇します。"

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/classes.json
msgid "Dreamsmith"
msgstr "ドリームスミス"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Dreamsmith"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/classes.json
msgid ""
"Dreamsmiths can forge dreamdross into a more durable form and create "
"permanent items that can be repaired."
msgstr "ドリームスミスは夢鉱を鍛えてより頑丈にし、修復可能なアイテムを作り出す能力をもっています。"

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/classes.json
msgid "Mad Genius"
msgstr "マッドジーニアス"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Mad Genius"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/classes.json
msgid ""
"The Mad Genius uses their connection to other dimensions in order to "
"manipulate or even replace the physics of this realm with that of another.  "
"They turn toys and nonsense inventions into machines of incredible "
"sophistication and power, temporarily."
msgstr ""
"マッドジーニアスは次元間の繋がりを利用して、現実世界の物理法則を操作したり、別世界の物理法則に置き換えたりすることができます。単なる玩具やナンセンスな発明品を、一時的に高度で強力な兵器へと変えてしまうことも可能です。"

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/classes.json
msgid "Hedgecraft"
msgstr "まじない"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Hedgecraft"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/classes.json
msgid ""
"The craft of the wise, provenance of cunning men, wise women, soothsayers, "
"knowers, herb-witches, and curse-lifters throughout history.  With the "
"proper components, and at the proper times and places, they can perform "
"miracles."
msgstr ""
"カニングマン、カニングウーマン、賢人、占者、知恵者、薬師、まじない師など、歴史上様々な名で呼ばれてきた者たちを起源とする、まじないの技です。正しい時間と場所で適切な行為を実行すると、魔法のような効果を引き起こすことができます。"

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/cybernetic_traits.json
msgid "XEDRA Neurobionic Interface"
msgstr "XEDRA神経工学インターフェース"

#. ~ Description of mutation "XEDRA Neurobionic Interface"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/cybernetic_traits.json
msgid ""
"The compact bionic command and control interface interwoven with your "
"nervous system had a previous life inside of a cybernetic tribesperson.  "
"Best case scenario, none of them are on this Earth."
msgstr ""
"神経系に織り込まれた小型命令制御インターフェースは、かつてあるサイボーグ種族の体内に入っていたものです。この地球上に奴らが一体も存在しないというのが、最良の筋書きです。"

#. ~ "mutagen_message" of mutation class "Ierde"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/mutation_category.json
msgid "Soil and stone."
msgstr "土と石。"

#. ~ Memorial message of mutation class "Ierde" for male
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/mutation_category.json
msgctxt "memorial_male"
msgid "Returned to the earth."
msgstr "大地に還りました。"

#. ~ Memorial message of mutation class "Ierde" for female
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/mutation_category.json
msgctxt "memorial_female"
msgid "Returned to the earth."
msgstr "大地に還りました。"

#. ~ "mutagen_message" of mutation class "Sylph"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/mutation_category.json
msgid "Wind and weather."
msgstr "風と空。"

#. ~ Memorial message of mutation class "Sylph" for male
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/mutation_category.json
msgctxt "memorial_male"
msgid "Dissipated into the atmosphere."
msgstr "大気に溶け込みました。"

#. ~ Memorial message of mutation class "Sylph" for female
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/mutation_category.json
msgctxt "memorial_female"
msgid "Dissipated into the atmosphere."
msgstr "大気に溶け込みました。"

#. ~ "mutagen_message" of mutation class "Undine"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/mutation_category.json
msgid "Rain and wave."
msgstr "雨と波。"

#. ~ Memorial message of mutation class "Undine" for male
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/mutation_category.json
msgctxt "memorial_male"
msgid "Dissolved into the sea."
msgstr "海に溢れ出しました。"

#. ~ Memorial message of mutation class "Undine" for female
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/mutation_category.json
msgctxt "memorial_female"
msgid "Dissolved into the sea."
msgstr "海に溢れ出しました。"

#. ~ "mutagen_message" of mutation class "Arvore"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/mutation_category.json
msgid "Growth in adversity."
msgstr "逆境の中での生長。"

#. ~ Memorial message of mutation class "Arvore" for male
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/mutation_category.json
msgctxt "memorial_male"
msgid "Fell with a great sound."
msgstr "大きな音を立てて大地から引き抜かれました。"

#. ~ Memorial message of mutation class "Arvore" for female
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/mutation_category.json
msgctxt "memorial_female"
msgid "Fell with a great sound."
msgstr "大きな音を立てて大地から引き抜かれました。"

#. ~ "mutagen_message" of mutation class "Salamander"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/mutation_category.json
msgid "Touched by fire."
msgstr "炎で満たされました。"

#. ~ Memorial message of mutation class "Salamander" for male
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/mutation_category.json
msgctxt "memorial_male"
msgid "Snuffed out."
msgstr "燃やし尽くしました。"

#. ~ Memorial message of mutation class "Salamander" for female
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/mutation_category.json
msgctxt "memorial_female"
msgid "Snuffed out."
msgstr "燃やし尽くしました。"

#. ~ "mutagen_message" of mutation class "Homullus"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/mutation_category.json
msgid "Wish upon a star."
msgstr "星に願いを。"

#. ~ Memorial message of mutation class "Homullus" for male
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/mutation_category.json
msgctxt "memorial_male"
msgid "Real enough for you?"
msgstr "現実だと？"

#. ~ Memorial message of mutation class "Homullus" for female
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/mutation_category.json
msgctxt "memorial_female"
msgid "Real enough for you?"
msgstr "現実だと？"

#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "eoc_eggsac_survivable_or_fatal" in
#. nested EOCs in effect in EoC "eggsac_mantain"
#. ~ Player message in false effect in EoC "eoc_eggsac_survivable_or_fatal" in
#. nested EOCs in effect in EoC "eggsac_mantain"
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "eoc_eggsac_remove_survivable_or_fatal"
#. in nested EOCs in effect in EoC "eggsac_remove"
#. ~ Player message in false effect in EoC
#. "eoc_eggsac_remove_survivable_or_fatal" in nested EOCs in effect in EoC
#. "eggsac_remove"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/mutation_eocs.json
msgid "Spiders erupt from your body!"
msgstr "体内からクモが這い出てきました！"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Ierde"
#. ~ Description of mutation "Arvore"
#. ~ Description of mutation "Undine"
#. ~ Description of mutation "Salamander"
#. ~ Description of mutation "Sylph"
#. ~ Description of mutation "Homullus"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/mutation_thresh.json
msgid "You have ascended into your fae nature."
msgstr "妖精としての性質を昇華しました。"

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Spider egg host"
msgstr "クモ寄生"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Spider egg host"
#. ~ Description of mutation "Transforming into Goblin"
#. ~ Description of mutation "Transforming into Spider"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "You don't feel very well.  On an existential level."
msgstr "決して良い気分ではありません。強い違和感があります。"

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Dreamless"
msgstr "夢の欠如"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Dreamless"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"You live firmly in reality and never experience extremely vivid dreams about"
" choices that have real world consequences.  ( You will be unable to gain "
"Dream magicks from sleeping after strange events)"
msgstr ""
"しっかりと現実に根差して生きており、現実世界にまで影響を与えるような明晰夢を見ることはありません(睡眠中に奇妙な夢を見て魔法を習得するイベントが発生しなくなります)。"

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Transforming into Goblin"
msgstr "ゴブリン変化"

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Transformed into Goblin"
msgstr "ゴブリン変化"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Transformed into Goblin"
#. ~ Description of mutation "Transformed into Spider"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "You feel like you've left behind your old life and form."
msgstr "今までの生や形を捨て去ったような気分です。"

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Transforming into Spider"
msgstr "クモ変化"

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Transformed into Spider"
msgstr "クモ変化"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Ki Strike"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"Who needs weapons?  You deal more melee damage while fighting barehanded and"
" without gloves.  This damage improves as your unarmed skill increases."
msgstr "武器なんて必要ですか？両手に何も着用せずに素手で攻撃すると、近接攻撃の与ダメージが増加します。増加量は素手攻撃スキルに応じて上昇します。"

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Extended Life"
msgstr "延命ポーション"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Extended Life"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"You swallow the potion and feel younger already.  Though the taste lingers "
"long past when you'd hope it would pass."
msgstr "薬を飲み込むと、すぐに肉体が若返ったような気分になりました。しかし、薬の後味はいつまで経っても消えません。"

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Haunted by your dreams made flesh"
msgstr "恐れる夢想家"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Haunted by your dreams made flesh"
#. ~ Description of mutation "Accompanied by your dreams made flesh"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Your dreams can change reality."
msgstr "夢が現実になります。"

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Accompanied by your dreams made flesh"
msgstr "同行する夢想家"

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Infected with the vampire disease"
msgstr "吸血症"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Infected with the vampire disease"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "You have developed a thirst for the blood of your fellow humans."
msgstr "同族の血を欲しています。"

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Gleaming Eyes"
msgstr "輝く瞳"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Gleaming Eyes"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"Your eyes gleam lightly red as the light catches in them and with a few "
"drops of the stolen blood in your veins you are able to see in the dark."
msgstr "瞳が光を反射して赤く輝いています。吸った血の力を流し込むことで、暗闇でも目が見えるようになります。"

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Sanguine Ecstasy"
msgstr "飲血嗜好"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Sanguine Ecstasy"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"Your palate adapted to your new condition.  Drinking human blood will make "
"you feel great."
msgstr "新たな食性に味覚が適応しました。人間の血を摂取すると気分が良くなります。"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Vigor Mortis"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"Your stolen blood reinforces your muscles, making your grip crack bone and "
"your punches dent steel."
msgstr "奪い取った血が筋肉を強化し、握力は骨をも砕き、パンチは鋼鉄をも凹ませます。"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Sanguine Resilience"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"Your cold flesh is not as vulnerable as it once was.  Activate to render it "
"even more resistant to physical damage."
msgstr "冷たくなった肉体は以前ほど脆弱ではありません。有効化すると、物理的なダメージに対する耐性が更に高まります。"

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Predator's Senses"
msgstr "捕食者の五感"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Predator's Senses"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"Your senses are heightened, allowing you to see more clearly, hear even tiny"
" sounds, and smell nearby fresh human blood."
msgstr "五感が鋭くなります。視界はより鮮明になり、小さな音も逃さず聞き取り、付近から漂う新鮮な人間の血の匂いも嗅ぎ分けられます。"

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Silent as Death"
msgstr "死の静寂"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Silent as Death"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Your movements don't make nearby as much noise as they used to."
msgstr "以前より静かに動くことができます。"

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Blood Lungs"
msgstr "吸血管"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Blood Lungs"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"Your fingers have developed bloodsucking properties, you can now suck up "
"blood through them.  You're not sure where the blood goes but with a thought"
" you can use these deposits."
msgstr "指先から他者の血液を吸い取れます。吸った血液がどこに行くかは分かりませんが、体内に取り込んで活用できることは間違いありません。"

#. ~ Mutation name
#. ~ Spell name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/mutations.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/spells/vampire_spells.json
msgid "Unholy Endurance"
msgstr "ｱﾝﾎｰﾘｰ･ｴﾝﾃﾞｭﾗﾝｽ"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Unholy Endurance"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"Your exhaust some of the blood in your veins to boost and recover some of "
"your spent stamina."
msgstr "吸った血の一部を使い、消費したスタミナを回復します。"

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Learn from the Children of the Night"
msgstr "夜の子らとの連帯"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Learn from the Children of the Night"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"You call out to the creatures that inhabit the night.  Wolves, bats, rats "
"and more.  They tell you about what terrain surrounds you."
msgstr "オオカミ、コウモリ、ネズミなどの夜行性の生物に呼び掛け、周囲の地形を教えてもらいます。"

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Walking the shadowed path of blood"
msgstr "昏き血の道を歩む者"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Walking the shadowed path of blood"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "You have new fangs to go along with your thirst for blood."
msgstr "血液を渇望する思いが強まり、立派な牙を手に入れました。"

#. ~ Message when player with mutation "Walking the shadowed path of blood"
#. attacks
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/mutations.json
#, c-format
msgid "You sink your fangs into %s!"
msgstr "牙を%sに突き立てました！"

#. ~ Message when NPC with mutation "Walking the shadowed path of blood"
#. attacks
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/mutations.json
#, c-format
msgid "%1$s sinks their fangs into %2$s!"
msgstr "%1$sは牙を%2$sに突き立てました！"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Coagulant Weave"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Your body prepares to prevent the loss of any blood to combat damage."
msgstr "肉体を強化し、攻撃ダメージによる失血を防ぎます。"

#. ~ Mutation name
#. ~ Spell name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/mutations.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/spells/vampire_spells.json
msgid "Sanguine Restoration"
msgstr "ｻﾝｷﾞﾝ･ﾚｽﾄﾚｰｼｮﾝ"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Sanguine Restoration"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"Your flesh heals visibly while blood disintegrates hidden inside your veins."
msgstr "吸った血を分解して体内に取り込み、肉体を著しく回復させます。"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Flow Like Blood"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"You can move faster than the eye can see, avoiding the claws and teeth and "
"weapons of your enemies."
msgstr "目にも止まらぬ速度で動き、敵の爪や牙、武器を避けます。"

#. ~ Mutation name
#. ~ Spell name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/mutations.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/spells/vampire_spells.json
msgid "Predator's Mien"
msgstr "ﾌﾟﾚﾃﾞﾀｰｽﾞ･ﾐｰﾝ"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Predator's Mien"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"With a bit of stolen blood and a savage expression, you can send your "
"enemies fleeing."
msgstr "奪い取った一滴の血と恐ろしい表情によって、敵を追い払います。"

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Spider's Walk"
msgstr "クモの足取り"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Spider's Walk"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"Gravity seems to have less of an effect than it used it.  With barely an "
"effort you can ascend or descend even sheer walls, and you can fall any "
"distance and land on your feet uninjured."
msgstr "以前ほど重力の影響を受けなくなりました。切り立った壁もほとんど力を入れずに昇り降りでき、どんなに高い所から落下しても無傷で着地できます。"

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Claws of the Beast"
msgstr "獣の爪"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Claws of the Beast"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"You can twist your fingernails into sharp claws, allowing you to inflict "
"extra damage in unarmed combat."
msgstr "指先から鋭い鉤爪が生えており、素手格闘攻撃で追加ダメージを与えられます。"

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Claws of the Beast Extended"
msgstr "獣の長爪"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Claws of the Beast Extended"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"Your fingers are transformed into sharp claws.  You can use them to attack, "
"but performing mundane tasks will be harder."
msgstr "各指が鋭い爪に変化しています。攻撃手段として使えますが、一般的な作業の邪魔になります。"

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Crimson Vision"
msgstr "真紅の視界"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Crimson Vision"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"Your vision has improved and now you can see flowing blood in the vein, like"
" bright trails in the dark."
msgstr "視力が強化され、暗闇の中で血管を流れる血液が輝く軌跡となって見えるようになりました。"

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Mortal hungers are replaced with immortal hungers"
msgstr "永遠の渇望"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Mortal hungers are replaced with immortal
#. hungers"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"You replace some of your regular caloric intake with blood and begin to see "
"some of the more esoteric abilities inherent to vampirism."
msgstr "通常の摂取カロリーの一部を血液で補填することによって、吸血鬼特有の秘技を獲得します。"

#. ~ Mutation name
#. ~ Spell name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/mutations.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/spells/vampire_spells.json
msgid "Hypnotic Gaze"
msgstr "ﾋﾌﾟﾉﾃｨｯｸ･ｹﾞｲｽﾞ"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Hypnotic Gaze"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"You can mesmerize your prey, gazing into their eyes and freezing them in "
"their tracks."
msgstr "獲物の瞳をじっと見つめて魅了し、その場に凍り付かせます。"

#. ~ Mutation name
#. ~ Spell name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/mutations.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/obsoletion_and_migration/spells.json
msgid "Blood-Driven Speed"
msgstr "ﾌﾞﾗｯﾄﾞ･ﾄﾞﾘﾌﾞﾝ･ｽﾋﾟｰﾄﾞ"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Blood-Driven Speed"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"Your body exceeds normal human reaction limits as blood turns to ash in your"
" veins."
msgstr "体内で血液を燃やし、通常の人間の反応限界を超越します。"

#. ~ Mutation name
#. ~ Spell name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/mutations.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/spells/vampire_spells.json
msgid "Blood-Fueled Magic"
msgstr "ﾌﾞﾗｯﾄﾞ･ﾌｭｰｴﾙﾄﾞ･ﾏｼﾞｯｸ"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Blood-Fueled Magic"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"Your exhaust some of the blood in your veins to recover some of your spent "
"mana."
msgstr "吸った血の一部を使い、消費したマナを回復します。"

#. ~ Mutation name
#. ~ Spell name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/mutations.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/spells/vampire_spells.json
msgid "Cowing the Beast"
msgstr "ｶｳｲﾝｸﾞ･ｻﾞ･ﾋﾞｰｽﾄ"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Cowing the Beast"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "You are a supreme predator, and other predators bow at your feet."
msgstr "頂点捕食者の前では、他の捕食者も足元にひれ伏します。"

#. ~ Mutation name
#. ~ Spell name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/mutations.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/spells/vampire_spells.json
msgid "Earthen Slumber"
msgstr "ｱｰｽﾝ･ｽﾗﾝﾊﾞｰ"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Earthen Slumber"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"You can sleep within the earth itself, avoiding the hateful light of the "
"sun."
msgstr "憎むべき太陽光を避け、大地の中で眠ることができます。"

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Discarded their mortality"
msgstr "不死者"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Discarded their mortality"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"You have become a true vampire and are beginning to see some of the most "
"potent abilities vampirism has to offer."
msgstr "真の吸血鬼となり、吸血鬼特有の凄まじい力の一端を実感し始めています。"

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "True Vampire's Potence"
msgstr "真の吸血鬼の力"

#. ~ Description of mutation "True Vampire's Potence"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Your new status as a true vampire has empowered your other abilities."
msgstr "真の吸血鬼の座に至り、能力が強化されました。"

#. ~ Mutation name
#. ~ Name of effect type id "effect_vampire_torpor"
#. ~ Spell name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/mutations.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/vampire_trait_eocs.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/spells/vampire_spells.json
msgid "Torpor"
msgstr "ﾄｰﾊﾟｰ"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Torpor"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"You can enter a deathlike stake known as torpor, in which your wounds will "
"close faster, your fatigue will fully recover and your blood thirst will be "
"less intense.  Be careful, though, as nothing will be able to wake you up "
"until eight hours have passed."
msgstr ""
"瀕死になったときに鈍麻状態に入ることでダメージが早く回復し、疲労が完全に解消され、血への渇望が和らぎます。ただし、8時間が経過するまでは絶対に覚醒できないため注意が必要です。"

#. ~ Mutation name
#. ~ Spell name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/mutations.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/spells/vampire_spells.json
msgid "Dominating Gaze"
msgstr "ﾄﾞﾐﾈｰﾃｨﾝｸﾞ･ｹﾞｲｽﾞ"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Dominating Gaze"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"You can focus your gaze and take control of your target.  Only works against"
" targets that have a mind."
msgstr "標的を凝視することで支配します。精神をもつ標的にのみ効果があります。"

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Facultative Breathing"
msgstr "随意呼吸"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Facultative Breathing"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"You do not need to breathe air to live anymore.  It prevents you from being "
"drowned or suffocated and allows you to ignore inhaled gases."
msgstr "生きるために呼吸をする必要はもうありません。溺れたり窒息したりすることがなくなり、吸い込んだガスの悪影響も受けません。"

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Corpse-like Flesh"
msgstr "臨死の肉体"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Corpse-like Flesh"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"Your undead body is now much more dead than alive.  It prevents mundane "
"illnesses and parasites from affecting you, while granting you a total "
"immunity against radiation.  In addition, your scent is now something most "
"mundane creatures cannot understand."
msgstr ""
"肉体が生よりも死に近い状態に変化しています。一般的な病気や寄生虫の影響を受けなくなり、放射線への完全耐性を得ます。更に、体臭は大抵の生物に感知できない匂いに変化しました。"

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Shape of the Night Flier"
msgstr "コウモリ変化"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Shape of the Night Flier"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "You can transform yourself into a bat and take wing on the night air."
msgstr "コウモリに変身して闇夜を飛ぶことができます。"

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Bat Form"
msgstr "コウモリ形態"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Bat Form"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"You are a bat.  This provides the actual effects of bat form.  Should not be"
" player-visible."
msgstr "コウモリの姿をしています。コウモリ形態の実際の効果を実行するものであり、通常は表示されません。"

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Shape of the Pack Hunter"
msgstr "オオカミ変化"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Shape of the Pack Hunter"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "You can transform yourself into a wolf and stalk your enemies."
msgstr "オオカミに変身して獲物を追跡することができます。"

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Wolf Form"
msgstr "オオカミ形態"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Wolf Form"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"You are a wolf.  This provides the actual effects of wolf form.  Should not "
"be player-visible."
msgstr "オオカミの姿をしています。オオカミ形態の実際の効果を実行するものであり、通常は表示されません。"

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Shape of the Billowing Mists"
msgstr "霧変化"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Shape of the Billowing Mists"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "You can transform yourself into a cloud of mist and flee any dangers."
msgstr "霧に変身してあらゆる脅威から逃れることができます。"

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Mist form traits"
msgstr "霧形態"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Mist form traits"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"This mutation carries the traits for mist form.  You shouldn't be able to "
"see it in-game."
msgstr "霧形態の効果を実行するものであり、通常は表示されません。"

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Fully fueled by the Blood"
msgstr "完全血液食"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Fully fueled by the Blood"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"By reaching the final stage of vampirism, you have freed yourself from your "
"mundane needs.  The only sustenance you need now is blood."
msgstr "吸血鬼の力を最大まで高めることで、人間がもつ欲求から解放されました。血液以外の栄養を摂取する必要がなくなりました。"

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Master the Mortal Mind"
msgstr "人心掌握"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Master the Mortal Mind"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"Your ability to influence others has amplified.  You can now spend blood "
"while talking with someone else to make them like you more, with the "
"costliest application of this power being able to turn them into your "
"obsessed servants.  Not all can be influenced by this power, for anger, "
"panic and strong ties to a group that isn't yours will disrupt the process."
"  Other vampires and the rare saint-blooded are also immune to it."
msgstr ""
"他者に強い影響を与えられるようになりました。生き血を消費して会話することで、相手に好かれやすくなります。この力を最大限強く発揮することで、相手を妄信的な従者に変えてしまうことも可能です。ただし、あらゆる人間に効果があるわけではありません。怒り、混乱、他の人間との強い結びつきは人心掌握を阻害します。他の吸血鬼、稀に存在する聖なる血をもつ者も能力の影響を受けません。"

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Distillate the Inner Blood"
msgstr "血液濃縮"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Distillate the Inner Blood"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"Unlike lesser vampires who bloat as they gorge on blood, you concentrate the"
" blood you consume, making it fit nicely in your veins.  This removes the "
"penalties for containing too much blood, but doesn't expand your maximal "
"capacity."
msgstr ""
"血をたらふく飲むと満腹になる弱い吸血鬼と違い、摂取した血を濃縮して上手に血管に収めることができます。血液の過剰摂取によるペナルティが無効化されますが、摂取できる最大容量は増加しません。"

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Shape of the Shadowed Path"
msgstr "影変化"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Shape of the Shadowed Path"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"You can shroud your body and what you are carrying with shadows, amplifying "
"your combat ability but preventing communication and using other powers "
"until you return to your normal form.  It also costs blood for every second "
"you spend in that state."
msgstr "肉体と所持品を影で覆って戦闘能力を高めます。通常の姿に戻るまで会話や他の能力の使用ができなくなり、1秒ごとに血液を消費します。"

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Shadow Form"
msgstr "影形態"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Shadow Form"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"You are shrouded in shadows.  This provides the actual effects of Shadow "
"form.  Should not be player-visible."
msgstr "影に包まれています。影形態の実際の効果を実行するものであり、通常は表示されません。"

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Last Breath's Mist"
msgstr "絶息の霧"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Last Breath's Mist"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"Your mastery over your mist form has increased to the point that you can now"
" instinctively activate it should you be about to die.  It requires you to "
"have a lot of stolen blood in your body and can't trigger more than once a "
"week but might save your life."
msgstr ""
"霧形態に変化する能力を磨き、瀕死になると反射的に霧形態に変化できるようになりました。使用には大量の生き血が必要で、1週間に1回しか起動できませんが、死を免れることができるかもしれません。"

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Immortal Iron Mind"
msgstr "不死者の信念"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Immortal Iron Mind"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"Your vampiric potency has reinforced your mind beyond what a mortal could "
"ever hope.  You are immune to anything that culd negatively impact your "
"mind."
msgstr "吸血鬼としての力によって、常人を超える精神力を手に入れました。精神に悪影響を与える可能性があるあらゆるものに対して耐性があります。"

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Blind the Sun"
msgstr "日蝕"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Blind the Sun"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"You mastery over the shadowed path of blood has become much more potent, "
"allowing you to use your vampiric powers and a massive expense of blood to "
"blot out the sun for a few dozen minutes."
msgstr "昏き血の道への熟達はいよいよ極まり、吸血鬼の力と大量の生き血を使って数十分間太陽の光を覆い隠せるようになりました。"

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Renfield"
msgstr "レンフィールド"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Renfield"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"This person is now a renfield, a human obsessed with serving their vampire "
"masters.  This obsession impedes their cognition as they struggle to think "
"about anything but serving said vampire masters."
msgstr ""
"この人物は今やレンフィールド、つまり吸血鬼の主人に盲目的に仕える従者になってしまいました。妄信が認識を妨げており、主人に仕える以外のことを考えるのが困難です。"

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Mentor's peace"
msgstr "師の平穏"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Mentor's peace"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"Intended to be hidden.  Prevent the mentor from being killed by vampires and"
" renfields."
msgstr "通常は表示されません。師が吸血鬼やレンフィールドに殺されることを防ぎます。"

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Saint's blood"
msgstr "聖者の血"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Saint's blood"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"Through a complicated ritual utilizing a saint's relic, you have "
"transubstantiated your own blood with the holy blood of the saints.  It'll "
"prevent you from becoming infected with vampirism while you live, effects "
"postmortem unknown."
msgstr "聖遺物を利用した複雑な儀式によって、自らの血に祝福された聖者の血を混ぜました。生きている間は吸血鬼化を防げますが、死後の影響は未知数です。"

#. ~ Mutation name
#. ~ Spell name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/mutations.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/spells/item_spells.json
msgid "Future Sight"
msgstr "未来視"

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Eater's Sixth Sense"
msgstr "イーターの第六感"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Eater's Sixth Sense"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"You are no longer limited to the five senses common to most humans in your "
"hunt for the unnatural."
msgstr "一般的な人間がもつ五感に頼ることなく、異常を探し出すことができます。"

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Fae Authority"
msgstr "精霊の権限"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Fae Authority"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"Boann bestowed upon you the right to summon a few daffodil warriors once a "
"day."
msgstr "ボアンから与えられた、水仙の戦士たちを1日に1回召喚する権限です。"

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/shapeshifters.json
msgid "Natural Shapeshifter"
msgstr "天性の肉体変化"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Natural Shapeshifter"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/shapeshifters.json
msgid ""
"You were born a shapeshifter, and after your gifts manifested themselves, "
"you gained other benefits as well.  Even in human form, you heal a little "
"faster than normal and your broken bones heal straight and true."
msgstr ""
"生まれつき変化能力をもっており、その才能が開花した後は能力の他の活かし方も身に着けました。人間の姿でも通常より治癒速度が上昇しており、骨折も自然治癒します。"

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/shapeshifters.json
msgid "Lupine Form"
msgstr "オオカミ形態"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Lupine Form"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/shapeshifters.json
msgid "You can transform yourself into a wolf and run through the forests."
msgstr "オオカミに変身して森を駆け抜けることができます。"

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/shapeshifters.json
msgid "War Form"
msgstr "人狼形態"

#. ~ Description of mutation "War Form"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/shapeshifters.json
msgid ""
"You can transform yourself into a wolf-human hybrid and rip your enemies to "
"shreds."
msgstr "オオカミと人間の中間のような姿に変化し、敵をズタズタに引き裂くことができます。"

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/shapeshifters.json
msgid "Werewolf Hybrid Form"
msgstr "オオカミ人間形態"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Werewolf Hybrid Form"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/shapeshifters.json
msgid ""
"You are a hybrid of wolf and human.  This provides the actual effects of "
"werewolf hybrid form.  Should not be player-visible"
msgstr "オオカミと人間の中間の姿をしています。人狼形態の実際の効果を実行するものであり、通常は表示されません。"

#. ~ Spell name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/spells.json
msgid "Spider Emergence"
msgstr "クモ出現"

#. ~ Description of spell "Spider Emergence"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/spells.json
msgid "The incubating goblin spider larvae flee their host."
msgstr "孵化したクモの幼生が宿主から飛び出します。"

#. ~ Spell name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/spells.json
msgid "Eggsac Eruption"
msgstr "卵塊破裂"

#. ~ Spell name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/spells.json
msgid "Commune with children of the night Real Spell"
msgstr "夜の子らとの連帯"

#. ~ Description of spell "Commune with children of the night Real Spell"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/spells.json
msgid ""
"This is the spell that actually fires when you cast Commune with Children of"
" the Night.  It's a bug if you have it."
msgstr "夜の子らとの連帯の変異起動時に実際に効果を発揮する呪文です。通常は操作キャラクターには表示されません。"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Giant-sized"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/temporary.json
msgid "Eating that goblin fruit has made you grow to enormous size!"
msgstr "ゴブリンフルーツを食べて巨大化しました！"

#. ~ Mutation name
#. ~ Spell name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/temporary.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/spells/dreamer_spells.json
msgid "Ethereal Wings"
msgstr "ｴｰﾃﾙ･ｳｨﾝｸﾞ"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Ethereal Wings"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/temporary.json
msgid ""
"A wide set of ethereal wings sprouts from your back.  Despite them phasing "
"through every form of matter you've encountered, they still somehow lift you"
" off the ground.  Their mere appearance makes you feel lighter"
msgstr ""
"背中から巨大な一対の翼が生えています。あらゆる物質を通り抜けてしまいますが、何故か肉体を地面から浮かせる力をもっています。翼を見ているだけで気分が軽くなります。"

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/temporary.json
msgid "Karma"
msgstr "カルマ"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Karma"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/temporary.json
msgid ""
"Ethereal hands appear behind your back, making you looks like an ancient "
"god."
msgstr "超常的な複数の手が背中から生えており、まるで古代の神のように見えます。"

#. ~ Mutation name
#. ~ Spell name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/temporary.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/spells/dreamer_spells.json
msgid "Devil's Tail"
msgstr "ﾃﾞﾋﾞﾙｽﾞ･ﾃｲﾙ"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Devil's Tail"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/temporary.json
msgid ""
"While not actually a devil's, this long, triangular pointed tail can stretch"
" very far, allowing it to easily kill someone nearby."
msgstr "本物の悪魔ではありませんが、先端が三角形になった長い尾が尻から生えており、自由に伸ばして周囲の敵を簡単に殺すことができます。"

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/temporary.json
msgid "Stalker's Vision"
msgstr "追跡者の目"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Stalker's Vision"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/temporary.json
msgid ""
"Your eyes transform into the orbits of an unknown creature.  You now see "
"much better in the light and dark."
msgstr "目の構造が未知のモンスターのものに変化しました。明るい場所でも暗い場所でも視力が高まります。"

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/temporary.json
msgid "Sleeper"
msgstr "明晰夢"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Sleeper"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/temporary.json
msgid ""
"You still sleep, yet your dreams still can impact the world.  Activate to "
"wake up."
msgstr "眠っている状態ですが、この夢は世界に影響を与えることができます。有効化すると目覚めます。"

#. ~ Mutation name
#. ~ Spell name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/temporary.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/spells/hedge_magic_spells.json
msgid "To Vanish Amidst the Leaves"
msgstr "木の葉隠れのまじない"

#. ~ Description of mutation "To Vanish Amidst the Leaves"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/temporary.json
msgid "You are a bush and no one can see you."
msgstr "茂みに姿を変えているため視認されません。"

#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_EYEGLEAM_activated_2" in nested EOCs
#. in effect in EoC "EOC_EYEGLEAM_activated"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/vampire_trait_eocs.json
msgid "Your eyes gleam red momentarily as they drink in all available light."
msgstr "周囲の光を吸収し、両目が一瞬赤く輝きました。"

#. ~ Player message in false effect in EoC "EOC_EYEGLEAM_activated_2" in
#. nested EOCs in effect in EoC "EOC_EYEGLEAM_activated"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/vampire_trait_eocs.json
