msgid ""
"You focus you gaze on your target's mind, attempting to take control of it."
msgstr "標的の精神を凝視し、支配を試みました。"

#. ~ NPC message in false effect in EoC "EOC_VAMPIRE_DOMINATE_activated"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/vampire_trait_eocs.json
msgid "You don't have enough blood to activate your dominating gaze."
msgstr "生き血が足りないため、ドミネーティング・ゲイズを有効化できません。"

#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_VAMPIRE_BAT_FORM_activated_2" in
#. nested EOCs in effect in EoC "EOC_VAMPIRE_BAT_FORM_activated"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/vampire_trait_eocs.json
msgid ""
"Your fingers lengthen as flaps of skin grow between them and as your legs "
"shorten, you take to the air."
msgstr "指と指の間の皮が発達し、指が長く伸び、脚が縮み、空中に飛び上がりました。"

#. ~ Player message in false effect in EoC "EOC_VAMPIRE_BAT_FORM_activated_2"
#. in nested EOCs in effect in EoC "EOC_VAMPIRE_BAT_FORM_activated"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/vampire_trait_eocs.json
msgid "You don't have enough blood to transform into a bat."
msgstr "生き血が足りないため、コウモリに変化できません。"

#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_VAMPIRE_BAT_FORM_deactivated" in
#. nested EOCs in false effect in EoC "EOC_VAMPIRE_BAT_FORM_activated"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/vampire_trait_eocs.json
msgid "Your wings recede and you land on now-humanoid legs."
msgstr "翼が退化し、人間の足で着地しました。"

#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_VAMPIRE_WOLF_FORM_activated_2" in
#. nested EOCs in effect in EoC "EOC_VAMPIRE_WOLF_FORM_activated"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/vampire_trait_eocs.json
msgid ""
"Your nose pushes out into a muzzle as you fall forward on all fours and let "
"out a snarl."
msgstr "鼻面が前方に長く伸び、前傾姿勢になって両手を地面につき、唸り声を上げました。"

#. ~ Player message in false effect in EoC "EOC_VAMPIRE_WOLF_FORM_activated_2"
#. in nested EOCs in effect in EoC "EOC_VAMPIRE_WOLF_FORM_activated"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/vampire_trait_eocs.json
msgid "You don't have enough blood to transform into a wolf."
msgstr "生き血が足りないため、オオカミに変化できません。"

#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_VAMPIRE_WOLF_FORM_deactivated" in
#. nested EOCs in false effect in EoC "EOC_VAMPIRE_WOLF_FORM_activated"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/vampire_trait_eocs.json
msgid "Your fur disappears and you walk once again on two legs."
msgstr "毛皮が退化し、再び二本足で歩き始めました。"

#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_VAMPIRE_MIST_FORM_activated_2" in
#. nested EOCs in effect in EoC "EOC_VAMPIRE_MIST_FORM_activated"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/vampire_trait_eocs.json
msgid "Your body falls apart into billowing mist."
msgstr "肉体が渦巻く霧の中に溶け込みました。"

#. ~ Player message in false effect in EoC "EOC_VAMPIRE_MIST_FORM_activated_2"
#. in nested EOCs in effect in EoC "EOC_VAMPIRE_MIST_FORM_activated"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/vampire_trait_eocs.json
msgid "You don't have enough blood to transform into mist."
msgstr "生き血が足りないため、霧に変化できません。"

#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_VAMPIRE_MIST_FORM_deactivated" in
#. nested EOCs in false effect in EoC "EOC_VAMPIRE_MIST_FORM_activated"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/vampire_trait_eocs.json
msgid "You reconstitute yourself from the billowing mists."
msgstr "渦巻く霧の中から肉体を再構築しました。"

#. ~ Player message in false effect in EoC
#. "EOC_VAMPIRE_MIST_FORM_BLOOD_COST_2" in nested EOCs in effect in EoC
#. "EOC_VAMPIRE_MIST_FORM_BLOOD_COST"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/vampire_trait_eocs.json
msgid "You don't have enough blood to maintain your mist form."
msgstr "生き血が足りないため、霧の形態を維持できません。"

#. ~ Player message in nested effect in else statement in nested effect in
#. else statement in nested effect in then statement in effect in EoC
#. "EOC_VAMPIRE_MIST_FORM_SEEP_THROUGH_DOOR_WINDOW"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/vampire_trait_eocs.json
msgid "You must be near a door or window to seep through."
msgstr "障壁を通り抜けるには、ドアや窓に隣接している必要があります。"

#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "eoc_vampire_blood_to_kcal_convert"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/vampire_trait_eocs.json
msgid ""
"Some of your stolen blood is consumed by your body, making it a little less "
"gaunt."
msgstr "奪い取った血の一部が体内に吸収され、痩せ細った肉体が少し健康になりました。"

#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_VAMPIRE_SHADOW_FORM_activated_2" in
#. nested EOCs in effect in EoC "EOC_VAMPIRE_SHADOW_FORM_activated"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/vampire_trait_eocs.json
msgid "Shadows surround you until only your now-glowing eyes remain visible."
msgstr "周囲に影が集まり、光り輝く両目以外の全てを覆い隠しました。"

#. ~ Player message in false effect in EoC
#. "EOC_VAMPIRE_SHADOW_FORM_activated_2" in nested EOCs in effect in EoC
#. "EOC_VAMPIRE_SHADOW_FORM_activated"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/vampire_trait_eocs.json
msgid "You don't have enough blood to shroud yourself in shadow."
msgstr "生き血が足りないため、自分自身を影で覆うことができません。"

#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_VAMPIRE_SHADOW_FORM_deactivated" in
#. nested EOCs in false effect in EoC "EOC_VAMPIRE_SHADOW_FORM_activated"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/vampire_trait_eocs.json
msgid "Your eyes stop glowing and the shadows surrounding you dissipate."
msgstr "両目の輝きが薄れ、周囲を取り囲んでいた影が消えました。"

#. ~ Player message in false effect in EoC
#. "EOC_VAMPIRE_SHADOW_FORM_BLOOD_COST_2" in nested EOCs in effect in EoC
#. "EOC_VAMPIRE_SHADOW_FORM_BLOOD_COST"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/vampire_trait_eocs.json
msgid "You don't have enough blood to maintain the shadows surrounding you."
msgstr "生き血が足りないため、影形態を維持できません。"

#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_last_breath_mist"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/vampire_trait_eocs.json
msgid ""
"As you are about to die, your body instinctively turns to mist before "
"reappearing nearby with some of its wounds closed."
msgstr "死が間近に迫り、反射的に肉体を霧に変化させました。いくらか回復した状態で周囲のどこかに転移します。"

#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_BLIND_THE_SUN_CHECK_FOR_STORM" in
#. nested EOCs in effect in EoC "EOC_VAMPIRE_BLIND_THE_SUN"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/vampire_trait_eocs.json
msgid ""
"You feel that the anomalous energies of the storm would do quick work of any"
" darkness you could summon, so you decide to not attempt to blot out the sun"
" for now."
msgstr "どれほど暗い闇を呼び起こそうが嵐の異常なエネルギーによって消し去られてしまうだろうと悟り、日蝕を引き起こすのは止めておきました。"

#. ~ Player message in false effect in EoC "EOC_BLIND_THE_SUN_CHECK_FOR_STORM"
#. in nested EOCs in effect in EoC "EOC_VAMPIRE_BLIND_THE_SUN"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/vampire_trait_eocs.json
msgid ""
"Using your mastery over the Shadowed Path, you blot out the sun, covering "
"the region around you in darkness for a short period of time."
msgstr "昏き血の道の力の真髄を発揮して太陽を陰らせ、周囲の領域を短時間暗闇で覆い隠しました。"

#. ~ Player message in false effect in EoC "EOC_VAMPIRE_BLIND_THE_SUN"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/vampire_trait_eocs.json
msgid "You don't have enough blood to blot out the sun."
msgstr "生き血が足りないため、太陽を覆い隠せません。"

#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_UNBLOT_THE_SUN"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/vampire_trait_eocs.json
msgid "The darkness you summoned fades away, clearing the sky."
msgstr "呼び起こした闇は消え去り、空が晴れ渡りました。"

#. ~ EOC option name in effect in EoC "EOC_ARVORE_BRIARS_SELECTOR"
#. ~ EOC option name in effect in EoC "EOC_GROWING_WOOD_WALLS_SELECTOR"
#. ~ EOC option name in effect in EoC "EOC_RESHAPE_THE_EARTH_SELECTOR"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/arvore_eocs.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/ierde_eocs.json
msgid "Do nothing"
msgstr "何もしない"

#. ~ EOC option description in effect in EoC "EOC_ARVORE_BRIARS_SELECTOR"
#. ~ EOC option description in effect in EoC "EOC_GROWING_WOOD_WALLS_SELECTOR"
#. ~ EOC option description in effect in EoC "EOC_RESHAPE_THE_EARTH_SELECTOR"
#. ~ EOC option description in effect in EoC "EOC_SYLPH_JUMP_HIGH_ON"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/arvore_eocs.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/ierde_eocs.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/sylph_eocs.json
msgid "Do nothing."
msgstr "何もしません。"

#. ~ Player message in false effect in EoC "EOC_COMMUNE_WITH_NATURE"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/arvore_eocs.json
msgid "You must be surrounded by nature to commune with nature."
msgstr "自然に囲まれた場所でなければ、対話はできません。"

#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_ARVORE_JAGGED_CLAWS_ON"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/arvore_eocs.json
msgid "Your fingers itch as jagged wood rapidly covers them."
msgstr "指先がムズムズし、急に尖った木片に覆われました！"

#. ~ Player message in false effect in EoC "EOC_ARVORE_JAGGED_CLAWS_ON"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/arvore_eocs.json
msgid "The jagged wood covering your hands recedes, leaving no trace behind."
msgstr "手の先を覆っていた鋭い木の爪が縮み、跡形もなくなりました。"

#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_ARVORE_THORNSKIN_ON"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/arvore_eocs.json
msgid "Woody thorns push through your skin."
msgstr "皮膚から木質の棘が飛び出しました。"

#. ~ Player message in false effect in EoC "EOC_ARVORE_THORNSKIN_ON"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/arvore_eocs.json
msgid "Your thorns retract, leaving smooth unbroken skin behind."
msgstr "棘が収縮し、傷ひとつない滑らかな皮膚に戻りました。"

#. ~ Player message in false effect in EoC
#. "EOC_ARVORE_WALK_WILDS_TELEPORT_CHECK"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/arvore_eocs.json
msgid "You need to be in a forest or swamp to traverse the wilds."
msgstr "荒野から移動の力を借りるには、森林か湿地にいる必要があります。"

#. ~ Player message in false effect in EoC "EOC_ARVORE_GOBLIN_FRUIT"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/arvore_eocs.json
msgid "You must be surrounded by the wild to call forth a goblin fruit."
msgstr "ゴブリンフルーツを生み出すには自然に囲まれた場所にいる必要があります。"

#. ~ EOC option name in effect in EoC "EOC_GROWING_WOOD_WALLS_SELECTOR"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/arvore_eocs.json
msgid "Grow Wooden Wall"
msgstr "壁を育てる"

#. ~ EOC option name in effect in EoC "EOC_GROWING_WOOD_WALLS_SELECTOR"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/arvore_eocs.json
msgid "Grow Wooden Floor"
msgstr "床を育てる"

#. ~ EOC option name in effect in EoC "EOC_GROWING_WOOD_WALLS_SELECTOR"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/arvore_eocs.json
msgid "Grow Wooden Door"
msgstr "ドアを育てる"

#. ~ EOC option name in effect in EoC "EOC_GROWING_WOOD_WALLS_SELECTOR"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/arvore_eocs.json
msgid "Grow Leafy Branch"
msgstr "生枝を育てる"

#. ~ EOC option description in effect in EoC "EOC_GROWING_WOOD_WALLS_SELECTOR"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/arvore_eocs.json
msgid ""
"Grow a wall of solid wood from the earth, grow or remove bark from a wall, "
"or turn one of your wooden floors into a bark wall."
msgstr "地面から樹木の壁を生やす、樹木の壁を樹皮で覆う、樹皮を取り除く、樹木の床を壁に変える、などの操作を実行します。"

#. ~ EOC option description in effect in EoC "EOC_GROWING_WOOD_WALLS_SELECTOR"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/arvore_eocs.json
msgid ""
"Grow a floor of bark from the earth, roof over a bark floor, or turn one of "
"your wooden walls into a bark floor."
msgstr "地面から樹木の床を生やす、樹木の床に屋根を付ける、樹木の壁を床に変える、などの操作を実行します。"

#. ~ EOC option description in effect in EoC "EOC_GROWING_WOOD_WALLS_SELECTOR"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/arvore_eocs.json
msgid ""
"Grow a bramble door from a wooden wall or return the wall to solid wood."
msgstr "樹木の壁を植物の扉に変える、扉を壁に戻す、などの操作を実行します。"

#. ~ EOC option description in effect in EoC "EOC_GROWING_WOOD_WALLS_SELECTOR"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/arvore_eocs.json
msgid ""
"Grow a leafy branch.  It won't provide shelter but it helps it feel like "
"home."
msgstr "葉の茂った枝を育てます。シェルターにはなりませんが、自宅にいるような安心感があります。"

#. ~ value of variable 'message_success' in effect in EoC
#. "EOC_ARVORE_VINE_DRAG_activated"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/arvore_eocs.json
msgid "Vines lash out and drag your target in!"
msgstr "蔦が標的に絡みつき引き寄せました！"

#. ~ value of variable 'message_fail' in effect in EoC
#. "EOC_ARVORE_VINE_DRAG_activated"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/arvore_eocs.json
msgid "You are too parched to lash out with any vines."
msgstr "蔦がカラカラに乾いているため振り回せません。"

#. ~ Player message in false effect in EoC
#. "EOC_ARVORE_SUMMON_PRESERVATION_CONTAINER_CHECK"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/arvore_eocs.json
msgid "You must be surrounded by nature to cast To Oppose Decay."
msgstr "自然に囲まれた場所でなければ、トゥ・ウィズスタンド・ディケイを詠唱できません。"

#. ~ Player message in false effect in EoC
#. "EOC_PERENNIAL_REBIRTH_INITIAL_CHECK_2" in nested EOCs in effect in EoC
#. "EOC_PERENNIAL_REBIRTH_INITIAL_CHECK"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/arvore_eocs.json
msgid ""
"You need to be in the heart of the forest or at an attuned elemental altar "
"to successfully bind your soul."
msgstr "魂と自然を上手く繋げるには、森林、あるいは機能している元素の祭壇にいる必要があります。"

#. ~ Player message in false effect in EoC
#. "EOC_PERENNIAL_REBIRTH_INITIAL_CHECK"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/arvore_eocs.json
msgid ""
"Your soul is still attaching itself to your new body.  You need to give it "
"time before attempting to bind it to the forest again."
msgstr "魂は新しい肉体に執着しています。再び自然と繋がるには、しばらく時間をおく必要があります。"

#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_PERENNIAL_REBIRTH_INITIAL"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/arvore_eocs.json
msgid "You bind your soul to the abundance of nature around you."
msgstr "魂を周囲の豊かな自然に繋げました。"

#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_PERENNIAL_REBIRTH"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/arvore_eocs.json
msgid ""
"As your body dies, your fae spirit flies free and, drawn to the pull of the "
"heart of the forest, rebirths itself from the bounty of nature."
msgstr "肉体が死ぬと、精霊の魂が抜け出して森に引き寄せられ、自然の恵みを受けて再生しました。"

#. ~ Player message in false effect in EoC "EOC_ARVORE_OVERGROWTH_2" in nested
#. EOCs in effect in EoC "EOC_ARVORE_OVERGROWTH"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/arvore_eocs.json
msgid ""
"You must be on the surface and not on a building's upper stories to cast "
"Overgrowth!"
msgstr "オーバーグロウスを詠唱するには、建物の上層ではない地上にいる必要があります！"

#. ~ Player message in false effect in EoC "EOC_ARVORE_OVERGROWTH"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/arvore_eocs.json
msgid "You must be outside to cast Overgrowth!"
msgstr "オーバーグロウスを詠唱するには屋外にいる必要があります！"

#. ~ Player message in false effect in EoC
#. "EOC_ARVORE_DAMAGE_ZOMBIES_HEAL_LIVING_2" in nested EOCs in effect in EoC
#. "EOC_ARVORE_DAMAGE_ZOMBIES_HEAL_LIVING"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/arvore_eocs.json
msgid ""
"You must be on the surface and not on a building's upper stories to cast "
"Embrace of the Verdant Mother!"
msgstr "エンブレイス・オブ・ザ・ヴァーダント・マザーを詠唱するには、建物の上層ではない地上にいる必要があります！"

#. ~ Player message in false effect in EoC
#. "EOC_ARVORE_DAMAGE_ZOMBIES_HEAL_LIVING"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/arvore_eocs.json
msgid "You must be outside to cast Embrace of the Verdant Mother!"
msgstr "エンブレイス・オブ・ザ・ヴァーダント・マザーを詠唱するには屋外にいる必要があります！"

#. ~ Player message in nested effect in else statement in nested effect in
#. then statement in effect in EoC "EOC_ARVORE_TREE_SINGING"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/arvore_eocs.json
msgid "You must be near a tree to treesing to it."
msgstr "樹木と心を通わせるには、樹木の付近にいる必要があります。"

#. ~ Verb in activity "ACT_ARVORE_TREESINGING"
#. ~ name of the nested group
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/arvore_eocs.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/recipes/paraclesians/arvore_recipes.json
msgid "treesinging"
msgstr "森の家具"

#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_ARVORE_TREE_SINGING_COMPLETE"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/arvore_eocs.json
msgid ""
"As your song fades, you open your eyes to find a large growth of wood lying "
"on the ground in front of you, separated from the tree without violence."
msgstr "歌が消え、目を開けると、樹木の一部が何の暴力も受けずに切り離され、目の前の地面に横たわっています。"

#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_ARVORE_TREE_SINGING_LEARN_RECIPES"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/arvore_eocs.json
msgid "The trees whisper their knowledge of a recipe to you"
msgstr "木々が製作レシピを教えてくれました。"

#. ~ Player message in false effect in EoC "EOC_ARVORE_TREE_FORM_ON"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/arvore_eocs.json
msgid "You must be outside on diggable ground to become one with the forest."
msgstr "森との合一を果たすには、屋外の掘削可能な地形にいる必要があります。"

#. ~ NPC message in false effect in EoC "EOC_ARVORE_VERDANT_IMPRISONMENT"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/arvore_eocs.json
msgid "Your target must be outdoors to transform them into a tree."
msgstr "標的を樹木に変えるには、屋外にいる必要があります。"

#. ~ Player message in false effect in EoC
#. "EOC_ARVORE_ROOT_TO_ROOT_TRANSLOCATE_CHECK"
#. ~ Player message in false effect in EoC
#. "EOC_ARVORE_ROOT_TO_ROOT_ATTUNEMENT_CHECK"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/arvore_eocs.json
msgid ""
"You must be outdoors and within the depths of the forest to cast this spell."
msgstr "この呪文を唱えるには、森林が広がる屋外にいる必要があります。"

#. ~ Spell name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/arvore_mutation_spells.json
msgid "Arvore Thorns Damage"
msgstr "アルボレ棘反撃"

#. ~ Description of spell "Arvore Thorns Damage"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/arvore_mutation_spells.json
msgid "Sometimes, when an enemy punches your thorns, they hurt themselves."
msgstr "攻撃してきた敵に対して、一定確率で棘を使って反撃します。"

#. ~ Description of spell "Commune with Nature"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/arvore_mutation_spells.json
msgid ""
"You concentrate on nature around you and commune with it, improving your "
"health and calming the nearby wildlife.  This spell may only be cast "
"outdoors in natural surroundings."
msgstr "集中して周囲の自然と交信することで健康を増進し、付近の野生動物を落ち着かせます。この呪文は屋外の自然環境下でのみ詠唱できます。"

#. ~ Spell name
#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/arvore_mutation_spells.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/arvore_mutations.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/homullus_mutations.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/ierde_mutation_spells.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/ierde_mutations.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/salamander_mutation_spells.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/salamander_mutations.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/sylph_mutation_spells.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/sylph_mutations.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/undine_mutation_spells.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/undine_mutations.json
msgid "Cultivate Goblin Fruit"
msgstr "ｶﾙﾃｨﾍﾞｲﾄ･ｺﾞﾌﾞﾘﾝ･ﾌﾙｰﾂ"

#. ~ Description of spell "Cultivate Goblin Fruit"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/arvore_mutation_spells.json
msgid ""
"You may spin a bit of fae magic into a plant, bringing forth a goblin fruit."
"  Goblin fruit have a variety of effects, never predictable but always at "
"least somewhat beneficial.  This spell may only be cast outdoors in natural "
"surroundings."
msgstr ""
"植物に精霊の魔法を掛けることで、ゴブリンフルーツを生み出します。ゴブリンフルーツには様々な効果があり、予測は不可能ですが、少なくともある程度の有益な効果は期待できます。この呪文は屋外の自然環境下でのみ詠唱できます。"

#. ~ Spell name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/arvore_mutation_spells.json
msgid "Treesinging"
msgstr "ﾂﾘｰｼﾝｷﾞﾝｸﾞ"

#. ~ Description of spell "Treesinging"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/arvore_mutation_spells.json
msgid ""
"Using your voice and your magic, bring forth living wood from a tree to "
"provide resources without harming the forest."
msgstr "声と魔法の力で樹木の一部を分けてもらい、森を傷つけることなく資材を手に入れます。"

#. ~ Message of spell "Treesinging"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/arvore_mutation_spells.json
msgid "You close your eyes and sing to the trees."
msgstr "目を閉じ、木々に歌いかけました。"

#. ~ Description of spell "Verdant Infusion"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/arvore_mutation_spells.json
msgid ""
"You draw on your own connection to nature and infuse some of its power into "
"one of your allies, healing them for a small amount and increasing their "
"overall health."
msgstr "自然との繋がりを活用し、その力の一部を仲間の一人に注ぎ込み、少しだけ回復させ、全般的な健康を増進します。"

#. ~ Spell name
#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/arvore_mutation_spells.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/arvore_mutations.json
msgid "Roots Crack the Foundation"
msgstr "ﾙｰﾂ･ｸﾗｯｸ･ｻﾞ･ﾌｧｳﾝﾃﾞｰｼｮﾝ"

#. ~ Description of spell "Roots Crack the Foundation"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/arvore_mutation_spells.json
msgid ""
"Roots can grow through even concrete given time.  With this spell, you can "
"compress that time into a single instant to shatter walls or rip doors off "
"their hinges."
msgstr ""
"たとえコンクリートの中であろうと根は時間を掛けて成長します。この呪文を使うことで、成長に必要な期間を一瞬に圧縮し、壁を粉砕したり、扉の蝶番を引き剥がしたりできます。"

#. ~ Spell name
#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/arvore_mutation_spells.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/arvore_mutations.json
msgid "Call the Children of the Roots"
msgstr "ｺｰﾙ･ｻﾞ･ﾁﾙﾄﾞﾚﾝ･ｵﾌﾞ･ｻﾞ･ﾙｰﾂ"

#. ~ Description of spell "Call the Children of the Roots"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/arvore_mutation_spells.json
msgid "A lesser wood spirit is summoned to support you."
msgstr "あまり強くない友好的な木の精を召喚します。"

#. ~ Spell name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/arvore_mutation_spells.json
msgid "To Withstand Decay"
msgstr "ﾄｩ･ｳｨｽﾞｽﾀﾝﾄﾞ･ﾃﾞｨｹｲ"

#. ~ Description of spell "To Withstand Decay"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/arvore_mutation_spells.json
msgid ""
"While in the wild, weave together some leaves and grasses and magick to form"
" a container that will keep its contents from rotting for a length of time."
"  The container will only last a few weeks at most."
msgstr "自然環境下で草や葉に魔法を込めて編み上げ、収納した食べ物が長持ちする容器を作ります。この容器は長くても数週間しか形を保てません。"

#. ~ Spell name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/arvore_mutation_spells.json
msgid "To Withstand Decay Real"
msgstr "ﾄｩ･ｳｨｽﾞｽﾀﾝﾄﾞ･ﾃﾞｨｹｲ効果"

#. ~ Description of spell "To Withstand Decay Real"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/arvore_mutation_spells.json
msgid ""
"The actual spell that summons the container.  It's a bug if you have it "
"directly."
msgstr "容器を召喚する呪文です。通常は表示されません。"

#. ~ Spell name
#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/arvore_mutation_spells.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/arvore_mutations.json
msgid "Briarwall"
msgstr "ﾌﾞﾗｲｱｳｫｰﾙ"

#. ~ Description of spell "Briarwall"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/arvore_mutation_spells.json
msgid ""
"Call up thick briars and thorns, either in a line to form a wall or an arc "
"to trap an enemy.  They will grow to full size in moments."
msgstr "太い茨を召喚して密集させ、防御用の壁や敵に襲い掛かる罠として活用します。この茨は一瞬で大きく成長します。"

#. ~ Spell name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/arvore_mutation_spells.json
msgid "Summon Briars Arc"
msgstr "ｻﾓﾝ･ﾌﾞﾗｲｱｽﾞ･ｱｰｸ"

#. ~ Description of spell "Summon Briars Arc"
#. ~ Description of spell "Summon Briars Line"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/arvore_mutation_spells.json
msgid ""
"Call up briars and thorns, either in a line to form a wall or an arc to trap"
" an enemy.  They will grow to full size in moments."
msgstr "茨を召喚して密集させ、防御用の壁や敵に襲い掛かる罠として活用します。この茨は一瞬で大きく成長します。"

#. ~ Spell name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/arvore_mutation_spells.json
msgid "Summon Briars Line"
msgstr "ｻﾓﾝ･ﾌﾞﾗｲｱｽﾞ･ﾗｲﾝ"

#. ~ Spell name
#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/arvore_mutation_spells.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/arvore_mutations.json
msgid "Tending the Garden"
msgstr "ﾃﾝﾃﾞｨﾝｸﾞ･ｻﾞ･ｶﾞｰﾃﾞﾝ"

#. ~ Description of spell "Tending the Garden"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/arvore_mutation_spells.json
msgid ""
"Invasive weeds must be rooted out, lest they choke the life from the garden."
"  This spell inflicts a rapid withering on plants and fungus within its area"
" of effect."
msgstr "庭の命がのびのび育つように、入り込んだ雑草は根こそぎ取り除きましょう。効果範囲内の植物や菌類を一瞬で枯らします。"

#. ~ Spell name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/arvore_mutation_spells.json
msgid "Tending the Garden Fungicide"
msgstr "ﾃﾝﾃﾞｨﾝｸﾞ･ｻﾞ･ｶﾞｰﾃﾞﾝ真菌削除"

#. ~ Description of spell "Tending the Garden Fungicide"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/arvore_mutation_spells.json
msgid ""
"This is the fungicidal effect of the Tending the Garden spell.  It's a bug "
"if you have it directly."
msgstr "テンディング・ザ・ガーデンの真菌削除呪文です。通常は表示されません。"

#. ~ Spell name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/arvore_mutation_spells.json
msgid "Entangling Vines Spell"
msgstr "絡み蔦"

#. ~ Description of spell "Entangling Vines Spell"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/arvore_mutation_spells.json
msgid "Pull a target to you."
msgstr "標的を引き寄せます。"

#. ~ Spell name
#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/arvore_mutation_spells.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/arvore_mutations.json
msgid "Nurturing the Green"
msgstr "ﾅｰﾁｬﾘﾝｸﾞ･ｻﾞ･ｸﾞﾘｰﾝ"

#. ~ Description of spell "Nurturing the Green"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/arvore_mutation_spells.json
msgid ""
"You can greatly speed plant growth.  Grass can grow from seed in moments, "
"crops can be brought to ripeness, and even young trees will reach their full"
" bloom."
msgstr "植物の生長速度を大幅に上昇させます。種は一瞬で発芽し、作物は瞬時に熟し、若木はあっという間に満開の花を咲かせます。"

#. ~ Spell name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/arvore_mutation_spells.json
msgid "Spreading the Viridian Mantle"
msgstr "ｽﾌﾟﾚｯﾃﾞｨﾝｸﾞ･ｻﾞ･ﾋﾞﾘｼﾞｱﾝ･ﾏﾝﾄﾙ"

#. ~ Description of spell "Spreading the Viridian Mantle"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/arvore_mutation_spells.json
msgid ""
"Rather than fostering the growth of a single plant, you can cause a wave of "
"growth all around you, affecting an entire field and bringing it towards "
"ripeness."
msgstr "単一の植物の生長を促進するのではなく、周囲に生長の波を引き起こして一定範囲内の作物を完熟させることができます。"

#. ~ Spell name
#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/arvore_mutation_spells.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/arvore_mutations.json
msgid "The Forest Offers Shelter"
msgstr "ｻﾞ･ﾌｫﾚｽﾄ･ｵﾌｧｰｽﾞ･ｼｪﾙﾀｰ"

#. ~ Description of spell "The Forest Offers Shelter"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/arvore_mutation_spells.json
msgid ""
"In natural surroundings, you can create structures out of living wood--"
"walls, floors, doors, and roofs all together."
msgstr "自然環境下で、生きた木でできた壁、床、扉、屋根が揃った構造物を作り出します。"

#. ~ Spell name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/arvore_mutation_spells.json
msgid "The Forest Offers Shelter (Wall)"
msgstr "ｻﾞ･ﾌｫﾚｽﾄ･ｵﾌｧｰｽﾞ･ｼｪﾙﾀｰ(壁)"

#. ~ Description of spell "The Forest Offers Shelter (Wall)"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/arvore_mutation_spells.json
msgid ""
"The walls part of the Forest Offers Shelter spell.  It's a bug if you have "
"it directly."
msgstr "ザ・フォレスト・オファーズ・シェルターで壁を生成する呪文です。通常は表示されません。"

#. ~ Spell name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/arvore_mutation_spells.json
msgid "The Forest Offers Shelter (Floor)"
msgstr "ｻﾞ･ﾌｫﾚｽﾄ･ｵﾌｧｰｽﾞ･ｼｪﾙﾀｰ(床)"

#. ~ Description of spell "The Forest Offers Shelter (Floor)"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/arvore_mutation_spells.json
msgid ""
"The floor part of the Forest Offers Shelter spell.  It's a bug if you have "
"it directly."
msgstr "ザ・フォレスト・オファーズ・シェルターで床を生成する呪文です。通常は表示されません。"

#. ~ Spell name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/arvore_mutation_spells.json
msgid "The Forest Offers Shelter (Branches)"
msgstr "ｻﾞ･ﾌｫﾚｽﾄ･ｵﾌｧｰｽﾞ･ｼｪﾙﾀｰ(枝)"

#. ~ Description of spell "The Forest Offers Shelter (Branches)"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/arvore_mutation_spells.json
msgid ""
"The branches part of the Forest Offers Shelter spell.  It's a bug if you "
"have it directly."
msgstr "ザ・フォレスト・オファーズ・シェルターで枝を生成する呪文です。通常は表示されません。"

#. ~ Spell name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/arvore_mutation_spells.json
msgid "The Forest Offers Shelter (Door)"
msgstr "ｻﾞ･ﾌｫﾚｽﾄ･ｵﾌｧｰｽﾞ･ｼｪﾙﾀｰ(扉)"

#. ~ Description of spell "The Forest Offers Shelter (Door)"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/arvore_mutation_spells.json
msgid ""
"The doors part of the Forest Offers Shelter spell.  It's a bug if you have "
"it directly."
msgstr "ザ・フォレスト・オファーズ・シェルターで扉を生成する呪文です。通常は表示されません。"

#. ~ Spell name
#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/arvore_mutation_spells.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/arvore_mutations.json
msgid "Creeper Ascends the Wall"
msgstr "ｸﾘｰﾊﾟｰ･ｱｾﾝｽﾞ･ｻﾞ･ｳｫｰﾙ"

#. ~ Description of spell "Creeper Ascends the Wall"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/arvore_mutation_spells.json
msgid ""
"Cause a vine to burst out of diggable ground, and rise up into the sky in "
"moments.  It will be easy to climb once its growth is finished."
msgstr "柔らかい地面から蔦が生え、瞬く間に空へと伸びていきます。完全に成長した蔦を使って昇降できます。"

#. ~ Spell name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/arvore_mutation_spells.json
msgid "Den of Brambles"
msgstr "ﾃﾞﾝ･ｵﾌﾞ･ﾌﾞﾗﾝﾌﾞﾙｽﾞ"

#. ~ Description of spell "Den of Brambles"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/arvore_mutation_spells.json
msgid ""
"When outside on diggable ground, create a small structure of wood near the "
"Arvore, offering shelter against the elements."
msgstr "アルボレは屋外の掘削可能な地面に植物でできた構造物を作り出し、風雨をしのぐことができます。"

#. ~ Description of spell "Hungry Thirsty Roots"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/arvore_mutation_spells.json
msgid ""
"Your command over plants allows you to call forth roots from the earth to "
"clutch and grasp at your enemies."
msgstr "植物を操作して大地から根を呼び出し、敵を拘束します。"

#. ~ Spell name
#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/arvore_mutation_spells.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/arvore_mutations.json
msgid "Perennial Rebirth"
msgstr "ﾍﾟﾚﾆｱﾙ･ﾘﾊﾞｰｽ"

#. ~ Description of spell "Perennial Rebirth"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/arvore_mutation_spells.json
msgid ""
"Bind your soul to the heart of the forest, rebirthing yourself if you should"
" die.  You may only perform this in thick forests or at an arvore altar, you"
" may be reborn no more than once in a lunar month."
msgstr ""
"魂を森の奥深くと結びつけ、死亡しても生まれ変われるようにします。鬱蒼とした森の中、もしくはアルボレの祭壇でしか詠唱できず、生まれ変われるのは朔望月ごとに一度だけです。"

#. ~ Spell name
#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/arvore_mutation_spells.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/arvore_mutations.json
msgid "Overgrowth"
msgstr "ｵｰﾊﾞｰｸﾞﾛｳｽ"

#. ~ Description of spell "Overgrowth"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/arvore_mutation_spells.json
msgid ""
"While outdoors and not underground, the Arvore can create a profusion of "
"life around themselves, causing grass to grow through pavement, bushes and "
"flowers to sprout, and trees to grow to full height in moments."
msgstr ""
"地下ではなく屋外にいる間、アルボレは周囲に無数の生命を生み出すことができます。舗装道路に草が生え、茂みや花が芽吹き、木々が瞬時に成長します。"

#. ~ Spell name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/arvore_mutation_spells.json
msgid "Overgrowth Real"
msgstr "ｵｰﾊﾞｰｸﾞﾛｳｽ効果"

#. ~ Description of spell "Overgrowth Real"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/arvore_mutation_spells.json
msgid "The actual spell that casts Overgrowth.  It's a bug if you have it."
msgstr "オーバーグロウスの効果を実行する呪文です。通常は表示されません。"

#. ~ Spell name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/arvore_mutation_spells.json
msgid "Solar Repast Spell"
msgstr "陽光摂取呪文"

#. ~ Description of spell "Solar Repast Spell"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/arvore_mutation_spells.json
msgid ""
"The spell that provides the effects when your Solar Repast is active.  It's "
"a bug if you have it directly."
msgstr "陽光摂取の効果を付与する呪文です。通常は表示されません。"

#. ~ Spell name
#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/arvore_mutation_spells.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/arvore_mutations.json
msgid "Fallen Trees Decay to Soil"
msgstr "ﾌｫｰﾙﾝ･ﾂﾘｰｽﾞ･ﾃﾞｨｹｲ･ﾄｩ･ｿｲﾙ"

#. ~ Description of spell "Fallen Trees Decay to Soil"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/arvore_mutation_spells.json
msgid ""
"Even the mightiest tree returns to soil in the end.  The Arvore may channel this natural process into an area around themselves, infecting everyone within with the energies of rot.\n"
"\n"
"<color_yellow>This spell is indiscriminate</color> and <color_red>should not be used near allies</color>."
msgstr ""
"どれほど強靭な樹木もやがては土に還ります。アルボレはこの自然の移ろいを周囲に集め、範囲内の全員が腐敗エネルギーの影響を受けます。\n"
"\n"
"<color_yellow>この呪文は無差別に影響を与える</color>ため、<color_red>仲間の近くで使うべきではありません</color>。"

#. ~ Description of spell "Traverse the Wilds"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/arvore_mutation_spells.json
msgid ""
"Roots grow together and so forests are connected.  The Arvore may use this "
"connection to quickly transport themselves while standing in a forest or a "
"swamp."
msgstr "根を伸ばし、森と繋がります。アルボレはこの繋がりを活用することで、森や湿地を素早く移動できます。"

#. ~ Spell name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/arvore_mutation_spells.json
msgid "Traverse the Wilds Real"
msgstr "ﾄﾗｳﾞｧｰｽ･ｻﾞ･ﾜｲﾙｽﾞ効果"

#. ~ Description of spell "Traverse the Wilds Real"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/arvore_mutation_spells.json
msgid ""
"This is the actual spell that teleports you when you use Traverse the Wilds."
"  It's a bug if you have it directly"
msgstr "トラヴァース・ザ・ワイルズを詠唱したときに瞬間移動を実際に行う呪文です。通常は表示されません。"

#. ~ Spell name
#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/arvore_mutation_spells.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/arvore_mutations.json
msgid "From Root to Root the Forest Is Joined"
msgstr "ﾌﾛﾑ･ﾙｰﾄ･ﾄｩ･ﾙｰﾄ･ﾌｫﾚｽﾄ･ｲｽﾞ･ｼﾞｮｲﾝﾄﾞ"

#. ~ Description of spell "From Root to Root the Forest Is Joined"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/arvore_mutation_spells.json
msgid ""
"All forests are connected at their hearts.  You can use this connection to "
"travel from the depths of a forest to the depths of another forest, if you "
"properly attune to your destination."
msgstr "全ての森の精神は繋がっています。事前にその土地を訪れて調和しておくことで、森との繋がりを活用して森から森へと転移することができます。"

#. ~ Spell name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/arvore_mutation_spells.json
msgid "Root to Root Attunement"
msgstr "ﾙｰﾄ･ﾄｩ･ﾙｰﾄ(位置登録)"

#. ~ Description of spell "Root to Root Attunement"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/arvore_mutation_spells.json
msgid ""
"Attune to a location for later traveling.  You must attune within the depths"
" of a forest."
msgstr "転移して戻ってくるときのために空間を整えます。森の奥深くで詠唱する必要があります。"

#. ~ Spell name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/arvore_mutation_spells.json
msgid "Root to Root Attunement Real"
msgstr "ﾙｰﾄ･ﾄｩ･ﾙｰﾄ(位置登録)効果"

#. ~ Description of spell "Root to Root Attunement Real"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/arvore_mutation_spells.json
msgid "The actual Root to Root attunement spell.  It's a bug if you have it."
msgstr "ルート・トゥ・ルートの位置登録の効果を実行する呪文です。通常は表示されません。"

#. ~ Spell name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/arvore_mutation_spells.json
msgid "Verdant Imprisonment"
msgstr "ｳﾞｪﾙﾀﾞﾝﾄ･ｲﾝﾌﾟﾘｽﾞﾝﾒﾝﾄ"

#. ~ Description of spell "Verdant Imprisonment"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/arvore_mutation_spells.json
msgid ""
"The ultimate expression of nature's power, you can turn your target into a "
"tree that might have stood for a century or more.  It works best on an "
"already-weakened target, and does not work at all on non-organic targets."
msgstr ""
"標的を樹齢百年以上の樹木に変える、究極的な自然の力の表現した魔法です。弱っている標的に対して特に効果を発揮しますが、有機物ではない標的にはまったく効きません。"

#. ~ Spell name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/arvore_mutation_spells.json
msgid "Verdant Imprisonment Self"
msgstr "ｳﾞｪﾙﾀﾞﾝﾄ･ｲﾝﾌﾟﾘｽﾞﾝﾒﾝﾄ効果"

#. ~ Spell name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/arvore_mutation_spells.json
msgid "One with the Forest Reduce Thirst"
msgstr "森との合一口渇軽減"

#. ~ Description of spell "One with the Forest Reduce Thirst"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/arvore_mutation_spells.json
msgid "This is the actual spell that reduces thirst for tree form."
msgstr "森との合一で口渇を軽減する効果を実行する呪文です。"

#. ~ Spell name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/arvore_mutation_spells.json
msgid "Embrace of the Verdant Mother"
msgstr "ｴﾝﾌﾞﾚｲｽ･ｵﾌﾞ･ｻﾞ･ｳﾞｧｰﾀﾞﾝﾄ･ﾏｻﾞｰ"

#. ~ Description of spell "Embrace of the Verdant Mother"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/arvore_mutation_spells.json
msgid ""
"While outdoors and not underground, the Arvore can unleash the power of nature against their enemies.  The walking dead and most creatures not native to the world suffer the Earthmother's wrath, while animals and humans are healed.  Triffids, being plants, are healed as well.\n"
"\n"
"Note that this power is <color_yellow>indiscriminate</color>: if the Arvore has somehow bound a Nether creature to their service, it will be damaged, and hostile humans will be healed."
msgstr ""
"アルボレは地下ではない屋外にいるとき、大地にあだなす者に対して力を解き放つことができます。ゾンビと大半の異界生物は大地の母の怒りに苦しみますが、人間を含む動物は傷が癒されます。植物であるトリフィドも、動物と同様に治癒します。\n"
"\n"
"この呪文は<color_yellow>無差別</color>に効果を発揮します。詠唱者が何らかの方法で異界のモンスターを仲間にしていた場合、そのモンスターはダメージを受けます。敵対的かどうかにかかわらず、人間を含む動物は治癒効果を受けます。"

#. ~ Spell name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/arvore_mutation_spells.json
msgid "Embrace of the Verdant Mother Damage Zombies and Aliens"
msgstr "ｴﾝﾌﾞﾚｲｽ･ｵﾌﾞ･ｻﾞ･ｳﾞｧｰﾀﾞﾝﾄ･ﾏｻﾞｰ攻撃"

#. ~ Description of spell "Embrace of the Verdant Mother Damage Zombies and
#. Aliens"
#. ~ Description of spell "Embrace of the Verdant Mother Heal Ferals"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/arvore_mutation_spells.json
msgid ""
"The actual spell that damages zombies and aliens as part of Embrace of the "
"Verdant Mother.  It's a bug if you have it."
msgstr "エンブレイス・オブ・ザ・ヴァーダント・マザーの、ゾンビや異界モンスターに対してダメージを与える効果です。通常は表示されません。"

#. ~ Spell name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/arvore_mutation_spells.json
msgid "Embrace of the Verdant Mother Heal Animals"
msgstr "ｴﾝﾌﾞﾚｲｽ･ｵﾌﾞ･ｻﾞ･ｳﾞｧｰﾀﾞﾝﾄ･ﾏｻﾞｰ回復"

#. ~ Description of spell "Embrace of the Verdant Mother Heal Animals"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/arvore_mutation_spells.json
msgid ""
"The actual spell that heals animals and plants as part of Embrace of the "
"Verdant Mother.  It's a bug if you have it."
msgstr "エンブレイス・オブ・ザ・ヴァーダント・マザーの、動物や植物モンスターを回復する効果です。通常は表示されません。"

#. ~ Spell name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/arvore_mutation_spells.json
msgid "Embrace of the Verdant Mother Heal NPCS"
msgstr "ｴﾝﾌﾞﾚｲｽ･ｵﾌﾞ･ｻﾞ･ｳﾞｧｰﾀﾞﾝﾄ･ﾏｻﾞｰNPC回復"

#. ~ Description of spell "Embrace of the Verdant Mother Heal NPCS"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/arvore_mutation_spells.json
msgid ""
"The actual spell that heals NPCs as part of Embrace of the Verdant Mother.  "
"List below is to exclude all species, since NPCs do not have a species.  "
"It's a bug if you have it."
msgstr ""
"エンブレイス・オブ・ザ・ヴァーダント・マザーの、NPCを回復する効果です。NPCには種族が設定されていないため、記述されたリストは全ての種族を除外する者です。通常は表示されません。"

#. ~ Spell name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/arvore_mutation_spells.json
msgid "Embrace of the Verdant Mother Heal Ferals"
msgstr "ｴﾝﾌﾞﾚｲｽ･ｵﾌﾞ･ｻﾞ･ｳﾞｧｰﾀﾞﾝﾄ･ﾏｻﾞｰ狂人回復"

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/arvore_mutations.json
msgid "Viridian Skin"
msgstr "青緑色の皮膚"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Viridian Skin"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/arvore_mutations.json
msgid ""
"Your skin has turned the color of spring growth.  Your skin is now a "
"viridian green.  This has no gameplay effects."
msgstr "皮膚が春の芽吹きの色に変わりました。ビリジアン・グリーンの皮膚です。特に何の効果もありません。"

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/arvore_mutations.json
msgid "Vegetal Cuticle"
msgstr "植物質の表皮"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Vegetal Cuticle"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/arvore_mutations.json
msgid ""
"Your skin has turned into a type of plant matter, which in addition to any "
"armoring slows your loss of fluids."
msgstr "皮膚がある種の植物に似た性質を持っています。防御力が上昇し、体液の損失速度が低下します。"

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/arvore_mutations.json
msgid "Bark Skin"
msgstr "樹皮"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Bark Skin"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/arvore_mutations.json
msgid ""
"The skin on your body has grown into a barklike state.  This provides "
"significantly more armor but reduces flexibility."
msgstr "皮膚が樹皮に似た状態になっています。防御力が大幅に強化されますが、柔軟性は低下します。"

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/arvore_mutations.json
msgid "Patches of Moss"
msgstr "まだらの苔皮"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Patches of Moss"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/arvore_mutations.json
msgid ""
"A viridian moss has grown on your skin, forming whorls and eldritch "
"patterns, providing some protection from the cold and the wet.  It also "
"provides a small amount of armor against acid or fire."
msgstr "青緑色の苔がまだらに生えており、皮膚に渦巻きや不思議な模様を作っています。寒さと水濡れをある程度防ぎ、酸や火への耐性も多少高まります。"

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/arvore_mutations.json
msgid "Greenstride"
msgstr "森歩き"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Greenstride"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/arvore_mutations.json
msgid ""
"The trees recognize you as one of their own and allow you to pass easily "
"beneath their boughs.  The grass moves under your feet to speed your "
"passage, and shrubs bend out of the way.  When walking on grass, trees, or "
"other natural foliage, your movement speed is increased."
msgstr ""
"木々に仲間であると認められ、森の中を楽に通り抜けられるようになります。下草は歩きやすいように足を支え、低木の枝葉は通行の邪魔にならないように避けてくれます。草木などの自然の地形上を移動する際、速度が上昇します。"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Nurturing the Green"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/arvore_mutations.json
msgid ""
"Upon gaining this ability the Arvore may greatly speed plant growth.  With "
"enough practice, you will even be able to bring forth mighty trees from the "
"dry earth."
msgstr "植物の生長を大幅に加速させるアルボレの能力です。十分な経験を積めば、乾いた大地に巨木を生やすことも不可能ではありません。"

#. ~ Description of mutation "The Forest Offers Shelter"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/arvore_mutations.json
msgid ""
"Upon gaining this ability the Arvore may create structures of living wood on"
" natural terrain."
msgstr "自然の地形に生きた樹木の構造物を作り出すアルボレの能力です。"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Commune with Nature"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/arvore_mutations.json
msgid ""
"Upon gaining this ability the Arvore gains the ability to draw on the peace "
"and strength of nature while standing in a wild area."
msgstr "自然環境の中で森林の平穏と強さを自らのものにするアルボレの能力です。"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Briarwall"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/arvore_mutations.json
msgid ""
"Upon gaining this ability the Arvore gains the ability to summon thick "
"tangles of briars to form walls or entrap their enemies."
msgstr "絡み合う太い茨を召喚して防御壁や敵の足止めに活用するアルボレの能力です。"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Traverse the Wilds"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/arvore_mutations.json
msgid ""
"Upon gaining this ability the Arvore gains the ability to transport "
"themselves from tree to nearby tree while within a forest."
msgstr "森林の中で周囲の草木の助けを借りて素早く動くアルボレの能力です。"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Fallen Trees Decay to Soil"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/arvore_mutations.json
msgid ""
"Upon gaining this ability the Arvore gains the ability to induce decay and "
"dissolution in the surrounding area."
msgstr "範囲内の腐敗と崩壊を促進するアルボレの能力です。"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Call the Children of the Roots"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/arvore_mutations.json
msgid ""
"Upon gaining this ability the Arvore gains the ability to summon a wood "
"spirit."
msgstr "樹木の精を召喚するアルボレの能力です。"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Roots Crack the Foundation"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/arvore_mutations.json
msgid ""
"Upon gaining this ability, the Arvore gains the ability to summon "
"semitangible roots that will shatter walls and furniture."
msgstr "自由に形を変える根を召喚して壁や設置物を破壊するアルボレの能力です。"

#. ~ Description of mutation "From Root to Root the Forest Is Joined"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/arvore_mutations.json
msgid ""
"Upon gaining this ability, the Arvore gains the ability to travel great "
"distances, even dozens of miles, in moments, as long as they start and end "
"their journey within the depths of a forest."
msgstr "一度訪れた森林の奥地であれば数十マイル離れていようが一瞬で戻れるアルボレの能力です。"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Overgrowth"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/arvore_mutations.json
msgid ""
"Upon gaining this ability, the Arvore gains the ability to cause rapid plant"
" growth in a radius around themselves."
msgstr "周囲の範囲内の植物を急速に成長させるアルボレの能力です。"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Perennial Rebirth"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/arvore_mutations.json
msgid ""
"Upon gaining this ability the Arvore gains the ability to bind their soul to"
" the heart of the forest, rebirthing themselves when on the verge of death."
msgstr "自らの魂を森の奥深くに繋げ、師の危機に瀕した際に再生するアルボレの能力です。"

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/arvore_mutations.json
msgid "Perennial Rebirth (bound)"
msgstr "ﾍﾟﾚﾆｱﾙ･ﾘﾊﾞｰｽ(稼働)"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Perennial Rebirth (bound)"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/arvore_mutations.json
msgid ""
"You have bound your soul to the forest, and death will merely be a momentary"
" inconvenience."
msgstr "自らの魂を森に繋げているので、死は一時的な面倒ごとに過ぎません。"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Verdant Infusion"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/arvore_mutations.json
msgid ""
"Upon gaining this ability the Arvore gains the ability to infuse their "
"companions with the vitality of the forest."
msgstr "仲間に森の活力を注入するアルボレの能力です。"

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/arvore_mutations.json
msgid "Command the Roots"
msgstr "根の操作"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Command the Roots"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/arvore_mutations.json
msgid ""
"Upon gaining this ability the Arvore gains the ability to call up grasping "
"roots from the ground."
msgstr "根を操作して敵を拘束するアルボレの能力です。"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Creeper Ascends the Wall"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/arvore_mutations.json
msgid ""
"Upon gaining this ability the Arvore gains the ability to summon a thick "
"climbing vine from diggable ground."
msgstr "掘削できる地形から太い蔦を召喚するアルボレの能力です。"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Tending the Garden"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/arvore_mutations.json
msgid ""
"Upon gaining this ability the Arvore gains the ability to damage plant and "
"fungal entities, including others of their own kind."
msgstr "植物、菌類やそれに近い存在を損傷させるアルボレの能力です。"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Cultivate Goblin Fruit"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/arvore_mutations.json
msgid ""
"Upon gaining this ability the Arvore gains the ability to grow a goblin "
"fruit when in natural areas away from civilization."
msgstr "文明から離れた自然の中でゴブリンフルーツを栽培するアルボレの能力です。"

#. ~ Mutation name
#. ~ Spell name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/arvore_mutations.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/obsoletion_and_migration/spells.json
msgid "Commune with the Ancient Oaks"
msgstr "樫の老樹たちとの交信"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Commune with the Ancient Oaks"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/arvore_mutations.json
msgid ""
"The Arvore are closely tied with the forests and may commune with the trees "
"to learn the layout of the land.  Activate this ability to enter the "
"communion."
msgstr "アルボレは森林と密接な関係があり、土地の様子を知るために木々と交信することもあります。有効化すると交信に参加します。"

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/arvore_mutations.json
msgid "Bramble's Bite"
msgstr "茨の一刺し"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Bramble's Bite"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/arvore_mutations.json
msgid ""
"Drawing out the power inherent in growing wood makes weapons composed of it "
"more deadly in your hands.  You do increased damage when wielding a weapon "
"primarily made of wood."
msgstr ""
"木に内在する力を引き出すことで、装備している木製武器がより強力になります。主要な素材が木の装備アイテムで攻撃すると、与ダメージが増加します。"

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/arvore_mutations.json
msgid "Essence of Hemlock"
msgstr "ヘムロックの毒液"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Essence of Hemlock"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/arvore_mutations.json
msgid ""
"With a brief effort of will, the Arvore may infuse their blood with a poison"
" that harms any who bite them."
msgstr "少し念じるだけで血に毒液を混ぜ、噛み付き攻撃をした者に害を及ぼすことができます。"

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/arvore_mutations.json
msgid "Scent of Night-Blooming Flowers"
msgstr "宵闇の花粉"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Scent of Night-Blooming Flowers"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/arvore_mutations.json
msgid ""
"The Arvore may release clouds of pollen that ruin the coordination of their "
"enemies when breathed in."
msgstr "吸い込んだ敵が体調を崩す花粉を放出します。"

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/arvore_mutations.json
msgid "Solar Rejuvenation"
msgstr "陽光の癒し"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Solar Rejuvenation"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/arvore_mutations.json
msgid ""
"Like a tree, you are fueled by the sun.  When standing in the sunlight, you "
"will absorb its energy as nutrients and heal slightly faster."
msgstr "樹木のように、太陽光からエネルギーを吸収します。日光が当たっていると光エネルギーを栄養素として吸収し、体力の回復速度がわずかに高まります。"

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/arvore_mutations.json
msgid "Solar Revitalization"
msgstr "陽光の助け"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Solar Revitalization"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/arvore_mutations.json
msgid ""
"Like a tree, you are fueled by the sun.  When standing in the sunlight, you "
"will absorb its energy as nutrients, heal slightly faster, and your mana "
"regenerates much quicker."
msgstr ""
"樹木のように、太陽光からエネルギーを吸収します。日光が当たっていると光エネルギーを栄養素として吸収し、体力の回復速度がわずかに高まります。マナの回復速度は大幅に高まります。"

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/arvore_mutations.json
msgid "Solar Repast"
msgstr "陽光の恵み"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Solar Repast"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/arvore_mutations.json
msgid ""
"Like a tree, you draw nourishment from the sun and the soil.  When standing "
"in the sunlight and on natural terrain, you absorb its energy as food.  You "
"still need to drink water and you will still get hungry."
msgstr ""
"樹木のように太陽と土から栄養を受け取ります。自然の地形に立ち日光を浴びると、そのエネルギーを肉体に取り込み吸収します。喉の渇きや空腹は通常通り感じるため、依然として飲食は必要です。"

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/arvore_mutations.json
msgid "The Fallen Branch Suffers Not"
msgstr "無痛の枝"

#. ~ Description of mutation "The Fallen Branch Suffers Not"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/arvore_mutations.json
msgid "Filled with the energy of life, pain does not affect you as strongly."
msgstr "全身が生命エネルギーに満ち溢れているため、苦痛をそれほど感じません。"

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/arvore_mutations.json
msgid "Entangling Vines"
msgstr "絡み蔦"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Entangling Vines"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/arvore_mutations.json
msgid ""
"At will, you can extend a cluster of grasping vines to grab one target and "
"drag them in.  They have a range equal to 1/2 your Dexterity."
msgstr "蔦を意のままに操って標的一体を掴み、引き寄せます。射程距離は器用の1/2の値です。"

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/arvore_mutations.json
msgid "Jagged Wooden Claws"
msgstr "尖った木爪"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Jagged Wooden Claws"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/arvore_mutations.json
msgid ""
"At will, you can transform your hands into jagged wooden claws.  They are "
"potent weapons but make anything other than combat more difficult."
msgstr "手の爪を尖った木製の爪を自由に変えられます。武器として役立ちますが、戦闘以外の作業は困難になります。"

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/arvore_mutations.json
msgid "Jagged Wooden Claws Extended"
msgstr "尖った木爪(展開)"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Jagged Wooden Claws Extended"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/arvore_mutations.json
msgid ""
"Your hands are transformed into jagged wooden claws.  You can use them to "
"attack, but performing mundane tasks will be harder."
msgstr "手の先端から尖った木質の爪が生えています。攻撃手段として使えますが、一般的な作業の邪魔になります。"

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/arvore_mutations.json
msgid "Resist Winter's Chill"
msgstr "冬の耐寒"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Resist Winter's Chill"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/arvore_mutations.json
msgid ""
"Plants lose their leaves in winter, but that does not kill them, they simply"
" sleep until the spring comes.  The cold bothers you less now."
msgstr "植物は冬に葉を落としますが、枯れたのではなく、春が来るまでただ眠っているだけです。寒さが気にならなくなりました。"

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/arvore_mutations.json
msgid "Ignore Winter's Chill"
msgstr "冬の強化耐寒"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Ignore Winter's Chill"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/arvore_mutations.json
msgid ""
"Pine trees keep their leaves even in the coldest winter.  The cold bothers "
"you now not at all."
msgstr "マツの木は寒い冬でも葉をつけたままです。寒さがまったく気にならなくなりました。"

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/arvore_mutations.json
msgid "Sensing the Sun"
msgstr "太陽運行感知"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Sensing the Sun"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/arvore_mutations.json
msgid ""
"By the places of the sun and the moon, you can always tell exactly what time"
" it is, as long as you're not underground."
msgstr "太陽と月の位置を感知し、いつでも正確な時刻が分かります。ただし、地下にいると感覚は働きません。"

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/arvore_mutations.json
msgid "Among the Wilds"
msgstr "荒野の恩恵"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Among the Wilds"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/arvore_mutations.json
msgid ""
"The wilderness welcomes you as one of its own, and you have an easier time "
"surviving there and making things from its bounty.  +1.5 Survival skill."
msgstr "大自然に仲間として歓迎されているため、自然の中で生き延び、自然の素材を使って物を作るのが得意です。サバイバルスキルが+1.5上昇します。"

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/arvore_mutations.json
msgid "Supple As a Reed"
msgstr "葦の柔軟"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Supple As a Reed"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/arvore_mutations.json
msgid ""
"Like green wood, you can bend your limbs easily.  You gain a +4 bonus to "
"Dexterity."
msgstr "瑞々しい植物のように、手足を柔らかく曲げられます。器用に+4のボーナスを得ます。"

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/arvore_mutations.json
msgid "Might of the Seedling"
msgstr "新芽の力"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Might of the Seedling"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/arvore_mutations.json
msgid ""
"Like the seedling poking through the soil, you have great strength hidden "
"within you.  +1 Strength."
msgstr "土を突き破って顔を出す新芽のように、大きな力を秘めています。筋力に+1のボーナスを得ます。"

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/arvore_mutations.json
msgid "Might of the Sapling"
msgstr "若木の力"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Might of the Sapling"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/arvore_mutations.json
msgid ""
"Like the young tree reaching for the sun, your limbs are filled with power."
"  +3 Strength."
msgstr "太陽に向かって伸びる若木のように、力が漲っています。筋力に+3のボーナスを得ます。"

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/arvore_mutations.json
msgid "Might of the Ancient Tree"
msgstr "大樹の力"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Might of the Ancient Tree"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/arvore_mutations.json
msgid ""
"Like forest giants that have stood for a hundred years, you are unshakeable."
"  +5 Strength."
msgstr "百年以上生きた森の主のように、揺るぎない力に満ちています。筋力に+5のボーナスを得ます。"

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/arvore_mutations.json
msgid "Insight of the Grove"
msgstr "森の洞察"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Insight of the Grove"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/arvore_mutations.json
msgid ""
"When one tree in a grove is attacked by insects, soon all trees will produce"
" the deterrent.  +3 Perception."
msgstr "森の中の木が一本でも昆虫に食われると、周りの木々はすぐに信号物質を出して対抗します。感覚に+3のボーナスを得ます。"

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/arvore_mutations.json
msgid "Shadow of the Trees"
msgstr "木遁"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Shadow of the Trees"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/arvore_mutations.json
msgid ""
"The forest recognizes your kinship and will hide you beneath its boughs.  "
"When in a forest or in thick foliage, enemies will have a harder time "
"spotting you."
msgstr "木々に仲間であると認められたことで、枝の下に隠してもらえます。森林や木の葉が生い茂った地形にいると、敵に視認されにくくなります。"

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/arvore_mutations.json
msgid "Arvore Eyes"
msgstr "アルボレの目"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Arvore Eyes"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/arvore_mutations.json
msgid ""
"Upon gaining this ability the Arvore's eyes begin reflecting the seasons: a "
"bright yellow-green in spring; verdant green in summer; red, yellow, or "
"orange in autumn, and dark brown in winter.  Glare no longer impacts them."
msgstr ""
"アルボレの目は季節を反映し、夏には瑞々しい緑色、秋には赤色、秋には赤や黄色やオレンジ色、冬には濃い茶色になります。日光の眩しさの影響を受けません。"

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/arvore_mutations.json
msgid "Arvore Ears"
msgstr "アルボレの耳"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Arvore Ears"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/arvore_mutations.json
msgid ""
"The Arvore's ears are longer and pointed, more \"leaf-shaped.\"  While they "
"cannot hear any better, like the trees in the deep forest, they are unphased"
" by loud sounds."
msgstr ""
"アルボレの耳は長く尖っており、より「葉」に近い形をしています。特に聴覚が発達することはありませんが、鬱蒼とした森の木々のように、大きな音を気にしなくなります。"

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/arvore_mutations.json
msgid "Vegetal Blood"
msgstr "植物の血液"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Vegetal Blood"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/arvore_mutations.json
msgid ""
"The Arvore's blood is now composed of sap and vegetable matter.  This does "
"not benefit or harm them in any ways, but humans will be discomfited by it."
msgstr "アルボレの血液は樹液と植物性物質で構成されています。普通の人間から見ると特異ですが、特に利点や害はありません。"

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/arvore_mutations.json
msgid "Sap Seals the Wound"
msgstr "粘性体液"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Sap Seals the Wound"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/arvore_mutations.json
msgid ""
"The Arvore's blood is a sticky sap that oozes rather than gushes from their "
"wounds.  They will bleed more slowly than normal."
msgstr "アルボレの血液は粘性が高く、傷を負ってもゆっくりと染み出すように出血します。出血量が通常より軽減されます。"

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/arvore_mutations.json
msgid "Sap Defends the Trunk"
msgstr "保護体液"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Sap Defends the Trunk"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/arvore_mutations.json
msgid ""
"The Arvore's blood is a sticky sap that oozes rather than gushes from their "
"wounds and has potent defensive properties.  They will bleed more slowly "
"than normal and are immune to parasites and infection."
msgstr ""
"アルボレの血液は粘性が高く、傷を負ってもゆっくりと染み出すように出血します。出血量が通常より軽減され、寄生虫や感染症に対する免疫が高まります。"

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/arvore_mutations.json
msgid "Sap Maintains the Heartwood"
msgstr "強化保護体液"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Sap Maintains the Heartwood"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/arvore_mutations.json
msgid ""
"The Arvore's blood is a sticky sap that that oozes rather than gushes from "
"their wounds and aggressively fights back against invading organisms.  They "
"will bleed much more slowly than normal, are immune to parasites and "
"infection, and cannot be transformed by the Mycus."
msgstr ""
"アルボレの血液は粘性が高く、傷を負ってもゆっくりと染み出すように出血します。出血量が通常より軽減され、寄生虫や感染症に対する免疫が高まり、真菌による影響を受けません。"

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/arvore_mutations.json
msgid "Writhing Vines"
msgstr "蔦伸ばし"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Writhing Vines"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/arvore_mutations.json
msgid ""
"At will, the Arvore can grow long vines from their shoulders and back.  They"
" can be used to climb or to lash at enemies, and can also be detached to "
"serve as a rope if necessary.  Activate to toggle vines on and off."
msgstr ""
"肩や背中から長い蔦を伸ばして意のままに操り、登ったり、敵を攻撃したりするために使えます。必要に応じて蔦をちぎり、ロープの代わりにすることもできます。有効化すると蔓を伸ばします。"

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/arvore_mutations.json
msgid "The Forests' Warning"
msgstr "森の警告"

#. ~ Description of mutation "The Forests' Warning"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/arvore_mutations.json
msgid ""
"In the whispers of the leaves and the movement of the grasses, the forest "
"warns you of approaching dangers.  When outside and near thick foliage, you "
"can detect your enemies."
msgstr "木々や草は葉を揺らして囁き、危険が迫っていることを警告します。屋外や茂った葉の地形にいると敵を感知します。"

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/arvore_mutations.json
msgid "The Whispers of the Leaves"
msgstr "草木の囁き"

#. ~ Description of mutation "The Whispers of the Leaves"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/arvore_mutations.json
msgid ""
"In the whispers of the leaves and the movement of the grasses, the forest "
"warns you of approaching dangers.  When outside and near thick foliage, you "
"can detect your enemies.  Also, you can see further when you're standing in "
"a forest."
msgstr ""
"木々や草は葉を揺らして囁き、危険が迫っていることを警告します。屋外や茂った葉の地形にいると敵を感知します。森の奥深くにいるとより遠くまで感知できます。"

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/arvore_mutations.json
msgid "Verdant Hair"
msgstr "新緑の髪"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Verdant Hair"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/arvore_mutations.json
msgid ""
"Your hair now has flowers and small vines and leaves growing in it.  It's "
"pleasant to look at but has no further game effect."
msgstr "髪から花や小さな蔓、葉が生えています。見た目には楽しいですが、特別な効果はありません。"

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/arvore_mutations.json
msgid "Floral Scent"
msgstr "花の香り"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Floral Scent"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/arvore_mutations.json
msgid ""
"The flowers in your hair produce a pleasant smell, obvious without being "
"overpowering.  You no longer smell anything like a human and other beings "
"will react to you appropriately."
msgstr "髪から花が生え、ほのかに心地よい香りが辺りに漂っています。人間のように体臭を気にする必要がなくなり、他者からの反応がより好意的になります。"

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/arvore_mutations.json
msgid "Hidden Thorns"
msgstr "隠し棘"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Hidden Thorns"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/arvore_mutations.json
msgid ""
"Every rose has its thorn and so do you.  With a moment's concentration, you "
"can exude thorns through your skin that have a chance of damaging attackers "
"while increasing the damage of your unarmed attacks.  However, you cannot "
"wear rigid armor over your thorns."
msgstr ""
"どんなバラにも棘があるように、全身に棘を隠し持っています。意識して棘を表出させることで、素手攻撃の与ダメージが増加し、攻撃を受けると一定確率で反撃します。ただし、棘が出ている間は硬質アイテムを着用できません。"

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/arvore_mutations.json
msgid "Unveiled Thorns Extended"
msgstr "隠し棘(展開)"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Unveiled Thorns Extended"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/arvore_mutations.json
msgid ""
"You are exuding thorns through your skin that have a chance of damaging "
"attackers while increasing the damage of your unarmed attacks.  However, you"
" cannot wear rigid armor over your thorns."
msgstr ""
"皮膚が棘で覆われており、素手攻撃の与ダメージが増加し、攻撃を受けると一定確率で反撃します。ただし、棘が出ている間は硬質アイテムを着用できません。"

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/arvore_mutations.json
msgid "Enchanting Aroma"
msgstr "魅惑的な香り"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Enchanting Aroma"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/arvore_mutations.json
msgid ""
"The flowers in your hair produce an intoxicating smell.  You no longer smell"
" anything like a human and other beings will react to you appropriately.  At"
" will, you can enhance this scent to an overpowering level, beguiling humans"
" and making them more suggestible at the cost of greatly increasing the "
"range at which others can smell you."
msgstr ""
"髪に咲いた花が、うっとりするような香りを放っています。もはや人間のように体臭を気にする必要はなく、他者からの反応がより好意的になります。香りを更に強めることで、匂いで感知される範囲が大幅に広がる代わりに、人間を惑わせて暗示に掛かりやすい状態にすることができます。"

#. ~ Message when transforming from mutation  "Enchanting Aroma" to
#. "ARVORE_MIND_CONTROL_POLLEN_ON"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/arvore_mutations.json
msgid "A cloying scent fills the air."
msgstr "甘ったるい香りを周囲に振り撒きました。"

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/arvore_mutations.json
msgid "Enchanting Aroma (active)"
msgstr "魅惑的な香り(起動)"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Enchanting Aroma (active)"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/arvore_mutations.json
msgid ""
"The flowers in your hair produce an intoxicating smell.  You no longer smell"
" anything like a human and other beings will react to you appropriately.  "
"You are enhancing this scent to an overpowering level, beguiling humans and "
"making them more suggestible at the cost of greatly increasing the range at "
"which others can smell you."
msgstr ""
"髪に咲いた花が、うっとりするような香りを放っています。もはや人間のように体臭を気にする必要はなく、他者からの反応がより好意的になります。現在香りは更に強まっており、匂いで感知される範囲が大幅に広がる代わりに、人間を惑わせて暗示に掛かりやすい状態にできます。"

#. ~ Message when transforming from mutation  "Enchanting Aroma (active)" to
#. "ARVORE_MIND_CONTROL_POLLEN"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/arvore_mutations.json
msgid "The scent filling the air fades away."
msgstr "周囲に充満していた香りが薄まりました。"

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/arvore_mutations.json
msgid "Leaves Return When Winter Ends"
msgstr "植生回復"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Leaves Return When Winter Ends"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/arvore_mutations.json
msgid ""
"When in wild areas, you can draw on the revitalizing power of the land to "
"heal yourself.  When in natural areas, your limbs will heal much faster."
msgstr "自然環境で大地の活性化の力を使って自分自身を癒します。自然環境にいると四肢の回復力が大幅に高まります。"

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/arvore_mutations.json
msgid "One with the Forest"
msgstr "森との合一"

#. ~ Description of mutation "One with the Forest"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/arvore_mutations.json
msgid ""
"You may transform into a tree, extending roots and spreading leaves out to "
"the sun.  You will heal faster, gain more benefit from sleep, and almost all"
" monsters will ignore you, but you will only be dimly aware of the outside "
"world and will be nearly unable to move."
msgstr ""
"樹木となって根を伸ばし、太陽に向かって葉を広げます。回復速度と睡眠による回復力が高まり、大部分のモンスターから感知されなくなりますが、外の世界をぼんやりとしか認識できなくなり、ほとんど動くこともできません。"

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/arvore_mutations.json
msgid "Ancient Tree"
msgstr "大樹"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Ancient Tree"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/arvore_mutations.json
msgid ""
"You are a tree.  You will heal much more quickly and resting is more "
"beneficial.  You are unable to see, hear, or move, but have a dim awareness "
"of nearby movement."
msgstr ""
"樹木そのものです。回復速度と睡眠による回復力が大幅に高まっています。見ることも聞くことも動くこともできませんが、周囲の動きをぼんやりと認識しています。"

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/arvore_mutations.json
msgid "Solar Empowerment"
msgstr "陽光の救い"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Solar Empowerment"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/arvore_mutations.json
msgid ""
"Like a tree, you are fueled by the sun.  When standing in the sunlight, you "
"will absorb its energy as nutrients, heal slightly faster, your mana "
"regenerates much quicker, and you gain a bonus to your maximum mana."
msgstr ""
"樹木のように、太陽光からエネルギーを吸収します。日光が当たっていると光エネルギーを栄養素として吸収し、体力の回復速度がわずかに高まります。マナの回復速度は大幅に高まり、更に最大マナにボーナスを得ます。"

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/arvore_mutations.json
msgid "Solar Ascendancy"
msgstr "陽光の慈愛"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Solar Ascendancy"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/arvore_mutations.json
msgid ""
"Like a tree, you are fueled by the sun.  When standing in the sunlight, you "
"will absorb its energy as nutrients, heal slightly faster, your mana "
"regenerates much quicker, you gain a bonus to your maximum mana, and you "
"gain a +2 bonus to all stats."
msgstr ""
"樹木のように、太陽光からエネルギーを吸収します。日光が当たっていると光エネルギーを栄養素として吸収し、体力の回復速度がわずかに高まります。マナの回復速度は大幅に高まり、更に最大マナにボーナスを得ます。全ての能力値に+2のボーナスを得ます。"

#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_LEVELER_ARVORE_NURTURING_THE_GREEN"
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC
#. "EOC_LEVELER_ARVORE_NURTURING_THE_GREEN_AOE"
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_LEVELER_ARVORE_SUMMON_WOOD_WALL"
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_LEVELER_ARVORE_COMMUNE_WITH_NATURE"
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_LEVELER_ARVORE_SUMMON_BRIARS"
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_LEVELER_ARVORE_FOREST_TELEPORT"
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_LEVELER_ARVORE_CAUSE_DECAY"
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC
#. "EOC_LEVELER_ARVORE_SUMMON_PRESERVATION_CONTAINER"
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_LEVELER_ARVORE_SUMMON_WOOD_SPIRIT"
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_LEVELER_ARVORE_TERRAIN_BASH_SPELL"
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_LEVELER_ARVORE_FOREST_TRANSLOCATION"
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_LEVELER_ARVORE_TURN_INTO_TREE"
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_LEVELER_ARVORE_VERDANT_INFUSION"
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_LEVELER_ARVORE_ROOTS_SPELL"
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_LEVELER_ARVORE_CLIMBING_VINE_SPELL"
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_LEVELER_ARVORE_LIVING_TENT_SPELL"
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_LEVELER_ARVORE_ANTI_PLANT_SPELL"
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC
#. "EOC_LEVELER_ARVORE_DAMAGE_ZOMBIES_HEAL_LIVING"
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_LEVELER_ARVORE_TREE_TRANSFORM"
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_LEVELER_ARVORE_TREE_SINGING_SPELL"
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC
#. "EOC_LEVELER_ARVORE_CULTIVATE_GOBLIN_FRUIT"
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC
#. "EOC_LEVELER_ARVORE_WIND_BLOWS_WILLOW_BENDS"
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_LEVELER_ARVORE_MAKE_GOSSAMER"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/arvore_spell_learning_eocs.json
msgid ""
"Your time spent under the shadows of the trees has increased your facility "
"with your fae magicks."
msgstr "木陰で長い時間を過ごしたことで、精霊の力が使えるようになりました。"

#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_HOMULLUS_NO_TRACE_ON"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/homullus_eocs.json
msgid "Your body stops producing scent."
msgstr "体臭が消えました。"

#. ~ Player message in false effect in EoC "EOC_HOMULLUS_NO_TRACE_ON"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/homullus_eocs.json
msgid "Your body begins producing scent."
msgstr "再び体臭を発し始めました。"

#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_HOMULLUS_BACKSTAGE_ON"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/homullus_eocs.json
msgid "You seem to fade into the background."
msgstr "世界の背景に溶け込みました。"

#. ~ Player message in false effect in EoC "EOC_HOMULLUS_BACKSTAGE_ON"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/homullus_eocs.json
msgid "You become more noticeable."
msgstr "存在感が戻ってきました。"

#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC
#. "EOC_HOMULLUS_DREAMWALKER_GAIN_DREAMDROSS"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/homullus_eocs.json
msgid ""
"As you awaken from the remnants of another's dreams, you find scraps of "
"dreamdross next to you."
msgstr "他者の夢の名残から目覚めて現実世界に戻ると、夢鉱屑が落ちていました。"

#. ~ Player message in false effect in EoC "EOC_HOMULLUS_GOBLIN_FRUIT"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/homullus_eocs.json
msgid ""
"You must be in the remnants of civilization to call forth a goblin fruit."
msgstr "ゴブリンフルーツを生み出すには文明の名残がある場所にいる必要があります。"

#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_HOMULLUS_DOLL_FORM_ON"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/homullus_eocs.json
msgid ""
"Your limbs stiffen and your skin takes on an even more waxen appearance."
msgstr "四肢が動きにくくなり、肌は蝋のような質感に変化しました。"

#. ~ Player message in false effect in EoC "EOC_HOMULLUS_DOLL_FORM_ON"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/homullus_eocs.json
msgid "A small semblance of life returns to you."
msgstr "小さな命の輝きが戻ってきました。"

#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC
#. "EOC_HOMULLUS_DOLL_FORM_MOVEMENT_BREAK_CHECKER"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/homullus_eocs.json
msgid ""
"As you take another step, you notice hostile eyes turn toward you.  They "
"don't see you as just a doll now."
msgstr "更に一歩踏み出すと、敵対的な視線を感じました。どうやら単なる人形だとは思われていないようです。"

#. ~ Player message in false effect in EoC
#. "EOC_HOMULLUS_ALL_ROADS_TRANSLOCATE_CHECK"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/homullus_eocs.json
msgid "You must be standing on a road to cast this spell."
msgstr "この呪文を詠唱するには道路上にいる必要があります。"

#. ~ Player message in false effect in EoC
#. "EOC_HOMULLUS_ALL_ROADS_ATTUNEMENT_CHECK"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/homullus_eocs.json
msgid ""
"You must be within one of the remaining bastions of civilization to cast "
"this spell."
msgstr "この呪文を詠唱するには、文明の名残がある地点にいる必要があります。"

#. ~ Spell name
#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/homullus_mutation_spells.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/homullus_mutations.json
msgid "One of Us"
msgstr "ﾜﾝ･ｵﾌﾞ･ｱｽ"

#. ~ Description of spell "One of Us"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/homullus_mutation_spells.json
msgid ""
"Insinuate yourself into a feral human's mind, tricking them into thinking "
"you are an ally."
msgstr "狂人の精神を操作して、詠唱者が味方であると思いこませます。"

#. ~ Spell name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/homullus_mutation_spells.json
msgid "Calling the Lost and the Damned"
msgstr "ｺｰﾘﾝｸﾞ･ｻﾞ･ﾛｽﾄ･ｱﾝﾄﾞ･ｻﾞ･ﾀﾞﾑﾄﾞ"

#. ~ Description of spell "Calling the Lost and the Damned"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/homullus_mutation_spells.json
msgid "Feral humans come to your aid."
msgstr "友好的な狂人を召喚します。"

#. ~ Spell name
#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/homullus_mutation_spells.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/homullus_mutations.json
msgid "Everything Will Be Fine"
msgstr "ｴﾌﾞﾘｼﾝｸﾞ･ｳｨﾙ･ﾋﾞｰ･ﾌｧｲﾝ"

#. ~ Description of spell "Everything Will Be Fine"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/homullus_mutation_spells.json
msgid ""
"Sometimes, it is best to focus on the positive.  This spell increases the "
"Homullus's mood when cast."
msgstr "ポジティブなことだけ考えている方がいいときもあります。ホムルスはこの呪文を詠唱して自らの意欲を高めます。"

#. ~ Spell name
#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/homullus_mutation_spells.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/homullus_mutations.json
msgid "A Face in the Crowd"
msgstr "ｱ･ﾌｪｲｽ･ｲﾝ･ｻﾞ･ｸﾗｳﾄﾞ"

#. ~ Description of spell "A Face in the Crowd"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/homullus_mutation_spells.json
msgid ""
"Though the teeming masses of humanity are gone, the Homullus can evoke their"
" anonymizing essence with magick, rendering them invisible to any humans "
"affected by the spell."
msgstr ""
"人類がほとんどいなくなった状況でも、ホムルスは魔法によって本質的な匿名性を呼び起こし、呪文の影響を受けた者がこちらを認識できないようにすることができます。"

#. ~ Spell name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/homullus_mutation_spells.json
msgid "A Face in the Crowd Self"
msgstr "ｱ･ﾌｪｲｽ･ｲﾝ･ｻﾞ･ｸﾗｳﾄﾞ自己効果"

#. ~ Description of spell "A Face in the Crowd Self"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/homullus_mutation_spells.json
msgid ""
"Puts an effect on you so anyone affected by A Face in the Crowd knows to "
"ignore you.  It's a bug if you have this directly."
msgstr "自分自身に効果を付与し、ア・フェイス・イン・ザ・クラウドの効果範囲内の者から認識されなくなります。通常は表示されません。"

#. ~ Spell name
#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/homullus_mutation_spells.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/homullus_mutations.json
msgid "The Average Joe"
msgstr "ｼﾞ･ｱﾍﾞﾚｰｼﾞ･ｼﾞｮｰ"

#. ~ Description of spell "The Average Joe"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/homullus_mutation_spells.json
msgid ""
"Weave a cloak of glamour around a target, making it more difficult for "
"enemies to spot them.  This is not invisibility, and getting to close to a "
"hostile target will allow them to see through the magick."
msgstr "標的を魔法のベールで包み、敵により発見されにくい状態にします。不可視になるわけではないため、標的が敵に近付きすぎると看破されます。"

#. ~ Spell name
#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/homullus_mutation_spells.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/homullus_mutations.json
msgid "Dynamo"
msgstr "ﾀﾞｲﾅﾓ"

#. ~ Description of spell "Dynamo"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/homullus_mutation_spells.json
msgid ""
"Fueled by the power charging your leylines, touch a target to restore some "
"of the power in a vehicle or power grid."
msgstr "レイラインに溜まった力を動力源に変えます。車両または電気配線に触れると、対象の電力が回復します。"

#. ~ Spell name
#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/homullus_mutation_spells.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/homullus_mutations.json
msgid "The Scholar's Regard"
msgstr "ｻﾞ･ｽｶﾗｰｽﾞ･ﾘｶﾞｰﾄﾞ"

#. ~ Description of spell "The Scholar's Regard"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/homullus_mutation_spells.json
msgid ""
"Unlike plants or animals, humans study subjects unrelated to survival.  This"
" spell focuses the Homullus's mind, allowing easier learning."
msgstr "植物や動物とは異なり、人間は生存に直接関係のないことも学びます。学習が容易になるように精神を集中させます。"

#. ~ Spell name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/homullus_mutation_spells.json
msgid "Discover Goblin Fruit"
msgstr "ﾃﾞｨｽｶﾊﾞｰ･ｺﾞﾌﾞﾘﾝ･ﾌﾙｰﾂ"

#. ~ Description of spell "Discover Goblin Fruit"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/homullus_mutation_spells.json
msgid ""
"With the aid of a bit of fae magick, you may find a goblin fruit abandoned "
"among the ruins.  Goblin fruit have a variety of effects, never predictable "
"but always at least somewhat beneficial.  This spell may only be cast in the"
" remnants of civilization."
msgstr ""
"精霊の魔法を掛けることで、文明の遺構に残されたゴブリンフルーツを見つけます。ゴブリンフルーツには様々な効果があり、予測は不可能ですが、少なくともある程度の有益な効果は期待できます。この呪文は文明の名残がある場所でのみ詠唱できます。"

#. ~ Spell name
#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/homullus_mutation_spells.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/homullus_mutations.json
msgid "All Roads Lead to Rome"
msgstr "ｵｰﾙ･ﾛｰｽﾞ･ﾘｰﾄﾞ･ﾄｩ･ﾛｰﾏ"

#. ~ Description of spell "All Roads Lead to Rome"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/homullus_mutation_spells.json
msgid ""
"Humanity crisscrossed the Earth with roads, first small tracks, then earthen"
" projects, and finally mighty asphalt webs upon which billions of people "
"traveled every day.  The Homullus can stand on the remnants of that web and "
"return to any remaining locus of civilization that they have attuned to."
msgstr ""
"最初は細い筋でしたが、やがて土を固め、遂にはアスファルトの広大な網を大地に広げ、何十億もの人類が地球を縦横無尽に移動してきました。ホムルスはその網の目の上に立ち、あらかじめ指定した文明の名残がある地点に転移できます。"

#. ~ Spell name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/homullus_mutation_spells.json
msgid "All Roads Lead to Rome Attunement"
msgstr "ｵｰﾙ･ﾛｰｽﾞ･ﾘｰﾄﾞ･ﾄｩ･ﾛｰﾏ(位置登録)"

#. ~ Description of spell "All Roads Lead to Rome Attunement"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/homullus_mutation_spells.json
msgid ""
"Attune to a location for later traveling.  You must attune at one of the "
"remaining bastions of civilization or concentrations of humanity."
msgstr "転移して戻ってくるときのために空間を整えます。文明が残っている場所、あるいは生き残った人類が集まっている場所のみ指定できます。"

#. ~ Spell name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/homullus_mutation_spells.json
msgid "All Roads Lead to Rome Attunement Real"
msgstr "ｵｰﾙ･ﾛｰｽﾞ･ﾘｰﾄﾞ･ﾄｩ･ﾛｰﾏ(位置登録)効果"

#. ~ Description of spell "All Roads Lead to Rome Attunement Real"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/homullus_mutation_spells.json
msgid ""
"The actual All Roads Lead to Rome attunement spell.  It's a bug if you have "
"it."
msgstr "オール・ローズ・リード・トゥ・ローマの位置登録の効果を実行する呪文です。通常は表示されません。"

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/homullus_mutations.json
msgid "Mannequin Skin"
msgstr "マネキンの皮膚"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Mannequin Skin"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/homullus_mutations.json
msgid ""
"Your skin has turned pearlescent white, similar to antique dolls.  This has "
"no gameplay effects."
msgstr "肌がアンティークドールのような真珠色です。特に何の効果もありません。"

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/homullus_mutations.json
msgid "Porcelain Skin"
msgstr "磁器の皮膚"

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/homullus_mutations.json
msgid "Latex Skin"
msgstr "ラテックスの皮膚"

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/homullus_mutations.json
msgid "Homullus Eyes"
msgstr "ホムルスの目"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Homullus Eyes"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/homullus_mutations.json
msgid ""
"Upon gaining this ability the Homullus's eyes begin change to look like "
"doll's eyes, always staring at the world.  Glare no longer impacts them."
msgstr "ホムルスの両目はまるで人形の瞳のようです。常に世界を見つめており、日光の眩しさの影響を受けません。"

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/homullus_mutations.json
msgid "Trust Me"
msgstr "信頼獲得"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Trust Me"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/homullus_mutations.json
msgid ""
" 'Men were deceivers ever,' as the quotation runs.  To be human is to be a "
"liar.  You are much more successful at lying to people now."
msgstr "「男共は永遠の嘘つき」という名台詞がありましたね。人間とは嘘をつくものです。人に嘘をつくのがずっと上手くなりました。"

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/homullus_mutations.json
msgid "Dreamwalker"
msgstr "夢歩き"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Dreamwalker"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/homullus_mutations.json
msgid ""
"From the dreams of mortals, you can spin remnants of fantasy into material "
"substance.  When you sleep near mortals, you have a chance to awaken with "
"some dreamdross nearby."
msgstr "定命者の夢から幻想の残骸を集めて物質化することができます。人間の近くで眠ることで、起床時に夢鉱屑を得られる可能性があります。"

#. ~ Description of mutation "One of Us"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/homullus_mutations.json
msgid ""
"With this ability, the Homullus can reach out to a feral's fractured mind "
"and twist it, convincing them to function as an ally."
msgstr "狂人の壊れた心に手を差し伸べ、操作して味方に付ける、ホムルスの能力です。"

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/homullus_mutations.json
msgid "The Lost and the Damned"
msgstr "亡者と罪人"

#. ~ Description of mutation "The Lost and the Damned"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/homullus_mutations.json
msgid ""
"The world crawls with the hungry dead and those who may as well be dead "
"while they still live.  This allows the Homullus to call one of the latter "
"to their side."
msgstr ""
"世界には飢えた死者と、生きてはいるものの死んだも同然の者たちがひしめき合っています。ホムルスは後者の1人を仲間として召喚することができます。"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Everything Will Be Fine"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/homullus_mutations.json
msgid ""
"A habit of lying is hard to break, even when, or especially when, talking to"
" oneself.  This trait grants the Homullus a spell that allows them to smooth"
" out any negative moods they experience."
msgstr "嘘が習慣になると、たとえ独り言だろうが、自分に対しての呼びかけだろうが、嘘が混じるものです。辛い気分を和らげるホムルスの能力です。"

#. ~ Description of mutation "A Face in the Crowd"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/homullus_mutations.json
msgid ""
"Upon gaining this ability the Homullus gains the ability to render "
"themselves invisible to humans."
msgstr "他者がこちらを視認できない状態になるホムルスの能力です。"

#. ~ Description of mutation "The Average Joe"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/homullus_mutations.json
msgid ""
"Upon gaining this ability the Homullus gains the ability to render one of "
"their allies inconspicuous."
msgstr "仲間の一人を視認されにくい状態にするホムルスの能力です。"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Dynamo"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/homullus_mutations.json
msgid ""
"Upon gaining this ability the Homullus gains the ability to recharge "
"vehicles or power grids."
msgstr "車両や電気配線に充電するホムルスの能力です。"

#. ~ Description of mutation "The Scholar's Regard"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/homullus_mutations.json
msgid ""
"Upon gaining this ability the Homullus gains the ability to focus their mind"
" to increase their learning ability."
msgstr "精神を集中させて学習力を高めるホムルスの能力です。"

#. ~ Description of mutation "All Roads Lead to Rome"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/homullus_mutations.json
msgid ""
"Upon gaining this ability the Homullus gains the ability to travel along a "
"road to any bastion of civilization they have attuned to."
msgstr "あらかじめ指定した文明の名残がある地点に転移するホムルスの能力です。"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Cultivate Goblin Fruit"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/homullus_mutations.json
msgid ""
"Upon gaining this ability the Homullus gains the ability to find a goblin "
"fruit when in the remnants of civilization."
msgstr "文明の残骸の中からゴブリンフルーツを探し出すホムルスの能力です。"

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/homullus_mutations.json
msgid "No Trace Yet I Wish"
msgstr "残り香隠し"

#. ~ Description of mutation "No Trace Yet I Wish"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/homullus_mutations.json
msgid ""
"The Homullus gains the ability to stop emitting scent at will.  They can use"
" this to control when scent-tracking creatures will be able to find them."
msgstr "体臭を自由に消す能力を獲得します。有効化すると、嗅覚をもつ敵がこちらの居場所を感知できなくなります。"

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/homullus_mutations.json
msgid "No Trace Yet I Wish (on)"
msgstr "残り香隠し(起動)"

#. ~ Description of mutation "No Trace Yet I Wish (on)"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/homullus_mutations.json
msgid "You don't currently produce scent."
msgstr "現在、体臭を全く発していません。"

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/homullus_mutations.json
msgid "Backstage"
msgstr "舞台の裏方"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Backstage"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/homullus_mutations.json
msgid ""
"At will, you can recede from the foreground of people's perceptions.  They "
"will still notice you if you make yourself known.  Conversation with actual "
"humans will be harder while this trait is active."
msgstr ""
"他者の認識の外へ自由に隠れることができます。気付かれるような行動を積極的に取れば、当然気付かれてしまいます。この特質を有効化している間は、他者との会話が困難になります。"

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/homullus_mutations.json
msgid "Backstage (on)"
msgstr "舞台の裏方(起動)"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Backstage (on)"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/homullus_mutations.json
msgid "You have faded into the background."
msgstr "世界の背景に溶け込んで消えています。"

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/homullus_mutations.json
msgid "Cybernetic Integration"
msgstr "生体部品取り込み"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Cybernetic Integration"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/homullus_mutations.json
msgid ""
"Your flesh and bones can instinctively shift to allow manually installing "
"cybernetics.  You no longer need external aid to install CBMs."
msgstr "肉や骨が本能的に変形し、生体部品を肉体と一体化させます。CBMの移植のために特殊な道具や装置を用意する必要がなくなります。"

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/homullus_mutations.json
msgid "Cybernetic Adaptation"
msgstr "生体部品適応"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Cybernetic Adaptation"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/homullus_mutations.json
msgid ""
"Your leylines have begun adapting to electronic interference.  Halves the "
"mana penalty caused by stored bionic power."
msgstr "体内のレイラインが電子的干渉に適応し始めています。CBM電力の蓄電によって引き起こされるマナへのペナルティが半減します。"

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/homullus_mutations.json
msgid "Complete Cybernetic Adaptation"
msgstr "生体部品完全適応"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Complete Cybernetic Adaptation"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/homullus_mutations.json
msgid ""
"Your leylines have fully adapted to electronic interference.  You no longer "
"suffer any mana penalty for stored bionic power."
msgstr "体内のレイラインが電子的干渉に完全に適応しています。CBM電力の蓄電によって引き起こされるマナへのペナルティが無効化されます。"

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/homullus_mutations.json
msgid "Internalized Charge"
msgstr "体内充電池"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Internalized Charge"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/homullus_mutations.json
msgid ""
"You are capable of storing power directly in your flesh.  You gain 50 kJ of "
"bionic power storage per Homullus trait you have."
msgstr "肉体に電力を直接蓄えられます。ホムルスの特質1つにつき50kJのCBM電力を獲得します。"

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/homullus_mutations.json
msgid "Reinforced Armor"
msgstr "堅牢防具"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Reinforced Armor"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/homullus_mutations.json
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Humans are flimsy creatures compared to even natural animals, yet by "
"crafting armor they obtain durability that unthinking creatures will never "
"reach.  You draw on this legacy, increasing the strength of armor you wear "
"by 20%"
msgstr ""
"人間は自然界の動物と比べると脆弱ですが、鎧をまとうことによって、知性のない生物が決して持ちえない耐久力を獲得しました。この力を受け継ぎ、着用アイテムの防御力を20%増加させます。"

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/homullus_mutations.json
msgid "Fortified Armor"
msgstr "鉄壁防具"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Fortified Armor"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/homullus_mutations.json
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"You embody the tales of ancient knights, increasing the strength of armor "
"you wear by 40%."
msgstr "着用アイテムの防御力を40%増加させ、古の騎士物語を再現します。"

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/homullus_mutations.json
msgid "Equipment Hardening"
msgstr "物質強化"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Equipment Hardening"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/homullus_mutations.json
msgid ""
"You conceptually harden your tools and armor, reducing the chance that they "
"are damaged."
msgstr "道具や防具を概念的に強化し、損傷する可能性を軽減します。"

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/homullus_mutations.json
msgid "Extreme Equipment Hardening"
msgstr "物質極限強化"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Extreme Equipment Hardening"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/homullus_mutations.json
msgid ""
"You conceptually harden your tools and armor, immensely reducing the chance "
"that they are damaged."
msgstr "道具や防具を概念的に強化し、損傷する可能性を大幅に軽減します。"

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/homullus_mutations.json
msgid "Echoes of the Streets"
msgstr "人々の残響"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Echoes of the Streets"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/homullus_mutations.json
msgid ""
"Though much of humanity has died, their echoes remain in the places they "
"once called home.  The Homullus can draw on those echoes to restore their "
"bionic power."
msgstr "人類はほとんど死に絶えましたが、その名残はかつて故郷と呼ばれた場所に残っています。ホムルスはその残響を利用してCBM電力を回復できます。"

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/homullus_mutations.json
msgid "The Pulse of the Invisible"
msgstr "見えざる文明の鼓動"

#. ~ Description of mutation "The Pulse of the Invisible"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/homullus_mutations.json
msgid ""
"Though much of humanity has died, their echoes remain in the places they "
"once called home.  The Homullus can draw on those echoes to restore their "
"bionic power and mana."
msgstr ""
"人類はほとんど死に絶えましたが、その名残はかつて故郷と呼ばれた場所に残っています。ホムルスはその残響を利用してCBM電力とマナを回復できます。"

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/homullus_mutations.json
msgid "City Strider"
msgstr "街歩き"

#. ~ Description of mutation "City Strider"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/homullus_mutations.json
msgid ""
"You are at home in the artificial environments constructed by humanity.  You"
" move slightly faster within."
msgstr "人類が構築した人口環境では足取りも軽くなります。人工的な地形では移動速度が少し上昇します。"

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/homullus_mutations.json
msgid "Endurance Hunter"
msgstr "粘り強い狩人"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Endurance Hunter"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/homullus_mutations.json
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Early humans chased prey for miles before it dropped dead from exhaustion, "
"and the Homullus is heir to that legacy.  You have 33% more stamina."
msgstr "原初の人類は獲物が疲れて倒れるまで何マイルも追いかける忍耐力を持っていました。ホムルスはその力の継承者です。スタミナが33%増加します。"

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/homullus_mutations.json
msgid "Take the Line"
msgstr "団結の力"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Take the Line"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/homullus_mutations.json
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"By standing together, humanity was able to overcome all threats, and it was "
"only when they turned on each other that the Cataclysm grew out of control."
"  The Homullus regains Stamina 5% faster per ally within 30 meters (10% "
"faster per ally if they have the Homullus trait)."
msgstr ""
"人類は団結することであらゆる脅威を克服してきました。人類同士の不信こそが、大変動拡大の要因です。半径30m以内に仲間がいると、自分のスタミナ回復速度が1人につき5%(ホムルスの特質をもっている場合は、1人につき10%)向上します。"

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/homullus_mutations.json
msgid "The Top of the Food Chain"
msgstr "食物連鎖の頂点"

#. ~ Description of mutation "The Top of the Food Chain"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/homullus_mutations.json
msgid ""
"Humanity are omnivores in the most literal sense.  You can eat anything not "
"human without any moral qualms."
msgstr "人類は文字通り雑食動物です。人間でさえなければ、どんな肉を食べても意欲が低下しません。"

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/homullus_mutations.json
msgid "At Home in any Clime"
msgstr "住めば都"

#. ~ Description of mutation "At Home in any Clime"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/homullus_mutations.json
msgid ""
"Before the Cataclysm there were cities all across the world.  From above the"
" Arctic Circle to directly on the equator, humanity built their dwellings.  "
"You are more comfortable with temperature extremes."
msgstr ""
"大変動が起きる前は、世界中に都市がありました。北極圏から赤道直下まで、あらゆる場所に人類は住居を築きました。極端な温度環境でも比較的快適に過ごせます。"

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/homullus_mutations.json
msgid "The Tool-Maker"
msgstr "道具製作者"

#. ~ Description of mutation "The Tool-Maker"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/homullus_mutations.json
msgid ""
"Though they had no claws or fangs or armored skin, humanity mastered the "
"world through their tools.  When near civilization, your crafting speed is "
"increased."
msgstr "人類には爪も牙も装甲もありませんでしたが、道具を作ることで世界を征服しました。文明的な場所の近くにいると、製作速度が向上します。"

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/homullus_mutations.json
msgid "The Innovator"
msgstr "革新者"

#. ~ Description of mutation "The Innovator"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/homullus_mutations.json
msgid ""
"Though they had no claws or fangs or armored skin, humanity mastered the "
"world through their tools.  When near civilization, your crafting speed and "
"ability are increased."
msgstr ""
"人類には爪も牙も装甲もありませんでしたが、道具を作ることで世界を征服しました。文明的な場所の近くにいると、製作速度とスキルレベルが向上します。"

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/homullus_mutations.json
msgid "The Builder of Cities"
msgstr "都市の建設者"

#. ~ Description of mutation "The Builder of Cities"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/homullus_mutations.json
msgid ""
"Though they had no claws or fangs or armored skin, humanity mastered the "
"world through their tools.  When near civilization, your crafting speed and "
"ability are greatly increased."
msgstr ""
"人類には爪も牙も装甲もありませんでしたが、道具を作ることで世界を征服しました。文明的な場所の近くにいると、製作速度とスキルレベルが大幅に向上します。"

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/homullus_mutations.json
msgid "Essence of the Makers"
msgstr "製作の真髄"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Essence of the Makers"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/homullus_mutations.json
msgid ""
"With their tools, humanity built weapons, grew food, made homes, and tamed "
"the wilderness.  The Homullus has internalized that essence into themselves,"
" allowing them to use their bare hands to accomplish many tasks that would "
"otherwise require tools."
msgstr ""
"人類は道具を使って武器を作り、食物を育て、家を建て、野生動物を飼い慣らしました。ホムルスはその力の真髄をその身の内に取り込んでおり、本来なら道具が必要な様々な仕事をその手だけで完了できます。"

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/homullus_mutations.json
msgid "Net Spider's Touch"
msgstr "ネットスパイダーの手技"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Net Spider's Touch"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/homullus_mutations.json
msgid ""
"While some other animals use simple tools, complex machinery is humanity's "
"legacy alone.  The Homullus can log into a computer or hack electronics with"
" but a touch."
msgstr ""
"動物の中には単純な道具を使うものもいますが、複雑な機械は人間にしか作れません。ホムルスは触れるだけでコンピュータや電子機器をハッキングできます。"

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/homullus_mutations.json
msgid "Mimicry of Biology"
msgstr "変異の真似事"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Mimicry of Biology"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/homullus_mutations.json
msgid ""
"As a spirit of humanity, you lack the natural biology required for mutagens "
"to function.  However, your powers have grown far enough to allow you to use"
" even the most abstract of human tools, allowing you to consume mutagens to "
"change your body.  Unlike humans, however, there are thresholds you will "
"never be able to reach."
msgstr ""
"人間性から生まれた精霊であるためか、変異原が適切に作用するために必要な何かがこの肉体には欠けています。しかし、経験を積んで人間の作り出した非常に抽象的な道具すら使いこなせるようになった結果、変異原を摂取して変異することは可能になりました。人間ではないため、閾値を超えることはできません。"

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/homullus_mutations.json
msgid "Homullus Biology"
msgstr "ホムルスの生態"

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/homullus_mutations.json
msgid "Running to Marathon"
msgstr "長距離走者"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Running to Marathon"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/homullus_mutations.json
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Early humans chased prey for miles before it dropped dead from exhaustion, "
"and the Homullus is heir to that legacy.  You have 33% more stamina and you "
"can run for much longer before tiring."
msgstr ""
"原初の人類は獲物が疲れて倒れるまで何マイルも追いかける忍耐力を持っていました。ホムルスはその力の継承者です。スタミナが33%増加し、長い距離を走っても疲れにくくなります。"

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/homullus_mutations.json
msgid "Mien of the Mannequin"
msgstr "マネキンの挙動"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Mien of the Mannequin"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/homullus_mutations.json
msgid ""
"You may transform yourself into a doll in truth, ignoring the needs of the "
"flesh and making most monsters less likely to attack you.  However, your "
"stiff limbs will inhibit your movement."
msgstr ""
"自分の肉体を人形に近付けることで生物として認識されにくくなり、大半のモンスターから攻撃される可能性が軽減します。ただし、四肢が硬くなるため動作が妨げられます。"

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/homullus_mutations.json
msgid "Mannequin Form"
msgstr "マネキン形態"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Mannequin Form"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/homullus_mutations.json
msgid ""
"You are a doll in truth.  You do not need to eat or drink, and monsters will"
" mostly ignore you, but you do not heal at all and crafting, as well as "
"movement over any ground not almost-perfectly flat, is very difficult due to"
" your stiff limbs."
msgstr ""
"完璧な人形になっています。飲食の欲求がなくなり、モンスターからもほぼ無視されますが、体力が全く回復しません。四肢が硬いため、製作や少しでも凹凸がある地形の移動が非常に困難になります。"

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/homullus_mutations.json
msgid "Mannequin Form Anger Relations"
msgstr "マネキン形態モンスター鎮静効果"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Mannequin Form Anger Relations"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/homullus_mutations.json
msgid ""
"Anger relations are here in a separate mutation so that they're removed on "
"attacking a target or moving too quickly."
msgstr "変異の影響でモンスターの態度が変化しています。攻撃したり、急に接近したりするとこの効果は削除されます。"

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/homullus_mutations.json
msgid "Mannequin Form Anger Relations Attacker"
msgstr "マネキン形態モンスター鎮静不可"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Mannequin Form Anger Relations Attacker"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/homullus_mutations.json
msgid ""
"This blocks you from gaining the anger relations mutation so you can't just "
"turn Mien of the Mannequin on and off between attacks."
msgstr "変異によってモンスターの態度を変化させることができません。戦闘中はマネキン化の変異を切り替えられません。"

#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_LEVELER_HOMULLUS_CHARM_FERALS"
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_LEVELER_HOMULLUS_SUMMON_FERALS"
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_LEVELER_HOMULLUS_SELF_DECEPTION"
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC
#. "EOC_LEVELER_HOMULLUS_INVISIBLE_TO_HUMANS"
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC
#. "EOC_LEVELER_HOMULLUS_REDUCED_VISIBILITY_ALLY"
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_LEVELER_HOMULLUS_RESTORE_POWER"
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_LEVELER_HOMULLUS_ADD_LEARNING_FOCUS"
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_LEVELER_HOMULLUS_ROAD_TRANSLOCATION"
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC
#. "EOC_LEVELER_HOMULLUS_CULTIVATE_GOBLIN_FRUIT"
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_LEVELER_HOMULLUS_MAKE_GOSSAMER"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/homullus_spell_learning_eocs.json
msgid ""
"Your time spent surrounded by the remnants of civilization has increased "
"your facility with your fae magicks."
msgstr "文明の残骸の中で長い時間を過ごしたことで、精霊の力が使えるようになりました。"

#. ~ Player message in false effect in EoC
#. "EOC_IERDE_DETECT_NEARBY_MONSTERS_EARTH_ON"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/ierde_eocs.json
msgid ""
"You must be in contact with the living earth or underground to activate The "
"Soil Knows Those Who Tread Upon It"
msgstr "地に耳ありを有効化するには、生きた大地の地形か地下にいる必要があります。"

#. ~ Player message in false effect in EoC "EOC_IERDE_GOBLIN_FRUIT"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/ierde_eocs.json
msgid "You must be on living earth or stone to call forth a goblin fruit."
msgstr "ゴブリンフルーツを生み出すには土や石の地形にいる必要があります。"

#. ~ Player message in false effect in EoC "EOC_IERDE_IRON_ARMOR_SPELL"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/ierde_eocs.json
msgid "You must be on living earth or stone to infuse yourself with iron."
msgstr "鉄分を取り込むには、生きた土や石の地形にいる必要があります。"

#. ~ value of variable 'message_success' in effect in EoC
#. "EOC_IERDE_SMASHING_PUNCH_activated"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/ierde_eocs.json
msgid "You gather yourself for a moment and strike."
msgstr "一瞬だけ精神統一し、改めて攻撃を繰り出しました。"

#. ~ value of variable 'message_success' in effect in EoC
#. "EOC_IERDE_NO_SLEEP_MEDITATE_activate"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/ierde_eocs.json
msgid "You settle down, feeling the ground beneath you, and begin your vigil"
msgstr "精神統一し、足元の大地を感じ、肉体を休ませました。"

#. ~ Player message in false effect in EoC
#. "EOC_IERDE_NO_SLEEP_MEDITATE_activate"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/ierde_eocs.json
msgid "You must be underground to begin your vigil!"
msgstr "肉体を休ませるには地下にいる必要があります！"

#. ~ Player message in false effect in EoC "EOC_IERDE_NO_SLEEP_MEDITATE"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/ierde_eocs.json
msgid "You're feeling refreshed and have no need to begin a vigil."
msgstr "気分が既にすっきりしているため、肉体を休ませる必要はありません。"

#. ~ Verb in activity "ACT_IERDE_NO_SLEEP_MEDITATE"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/ierde_eocs.json
msgid "watching"
msgstr "休養"

#. ~ Player message in false effect in EoC "EOC_IERDE_NO_SLEEP_MEDITATE_TURN"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/ierde_eocs.json
msgid "You are fully refreshed, and can end your vigil now."
msgstr "気分が完全にすっきりしたため、今すぐ休養を終了できます。"

#. ~ Player message in false effect in EoC "EOC_IERDE_EARTHEN_SHIELD_SPELL"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/ierde_eocs.json
msgid "You must be on living earth or stone to create the earthen shield."
msgstr "土の盾を作り出すには、生きた土や石の地形にいる必要があります。"

#. ~ Player message in false effect in EoC
#. "EOC_IERDE_SINK_INTO_EARTH_activate"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/ierde_eocs.json
msgid "You must be on living earth or stone to sink into it."
msgstr "土や石の上にいなければ身を沈められません。"

#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_IERDE_SLEEP_IN_EARTH_2" in nested
#. EOCs in effect in EoC "EOC_IERDE_SLEEP_IN_EARTH"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/ierde_eocs.json
msgid "The earth parts beneath you and you sink down into the stone."
msgstr "足元の大地が裂け、肉体が石の中に沈みました。"

#. ~ EOC option name in effect in EoC "EOC_RESHAPE_THE_EARTH_SELECTOR"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/ierde_eocs.json
msgid "Create or Destroy Wall"
msgstr "壁の生成と破壊"

#. ~ EOC option name in effect in EoC "EOC_RESHAPE_THE_EARTH_SELECTOR"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/ierde_eocs.json
msgid "Create Pit"
msgstr "穴の生成"

#. ~ EOC option name in effect in EoC "EOC_RESHAPE_THE_EARTH_SELECTOR"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/ierde_eocs.json
msgid "Earthen Stairs Up"
msgstr "上層への土階段の生成"

#. ~ EOC option name in effect in EoC "EOC_RESHAPE_THE_EARTH_SELECTOR"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/ierde_eocs.json
msgid "Earthen Stairs Down"
msgstr "下層への土階段の生成"

#. ~ EOC option name in effect in EoC "EOC_RESHAPE_THE_EARTH_SELECTOR"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/ierde_eocs.json
msgid "Smooth Stone"
msgstr "石の平滑化"

#. ~ EOC option name in effect in EoC "EOC_RESHAPE_THE_EARTH_SELECTOR"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/ierde_eocs.json
msgid "Churn Earth for Planting"
msgstr "畝の生成"

#. ~ EOC option name in effect in EoC "EOC_RESHAPE_THE_EARTH_SELECTOR"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/ierde_eocs.json
msgid "Turn Earth to Stone"
msgstr "土を岩に変える"

#. ~ EOC option name in effect in EoC "EOC_RESHAPE_THE_EARTH_SELECTOR"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/ierde_eocs.json
msgid "Turn Stone to Earth"
msgstr "岩を土にかえる"

#. ~ EOC option description in effect in EoC "EOC_RESHAPE_THE_EARTH_SELECTOR"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/ierde_eocs.json
msgid "Turn a dirt or stone floor into a wall or vice versa."
msgstr "土や石でできた床を壁に、または壁を床に変えます。"

#. ~ EOC option description in effect in EoC "EOC_RESHAPE_THE_EARTH_SELECTOR"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/ierde_eocs.json
msgid "Create a pit."
msgstr "穴を生成します。"

#. ~ EOC option description in effect in EoC "EOC_RESHAPE_THE_EARTH_SELECTOR"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/ierde_eocs.json
msgid "Reshape the dirt or stone into a set of stairs going up."
msgstr "石や土を使って上層に通じる階段を作ります。"

#. ~ EOC option description in effect in EoC "EOC_RESHAPE_THE_EARTH_SELECTOR"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/ierde_eocs.json
msgid "Reshape the dirt or stone into a set of stairs going down."
msgstr "石や土を使って下層に通じる階段を作ります。"

#. ~ EOC option description in effect in EoC "EOC_RESHAPE_THE_EARTH_SELECTOR"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/ierde_eocs.json
msgid "Polish and smooth a stone wall into a mirror-like finish."
msgstr "石の壁を磨き、鏡面のように滑らかにします。"

#. ~ EOC option description in effect in EoC "EOC_RESHAPE_THE_EARTH_SELECTOR"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/ierde_eocs.json
msgid "Create furrows in the earth suitable for planting crops"
msgstr "作物の植え付けに適した畝を地面に生成します。"

#. ~ EOC option description in effect in EoC "EOC_RESHAPE_THE_EARTH_SELECTOR"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/ierde_eocs.json
msgid "Turn dirt and earth into solid rock."
msgstr "土や地面を固い岩に変えます。"

#. ~ EOC option description in effect in EoC "EOC_RESHAPE_THE_EARTH_SELECTOR"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/ierde_eocs.json
msgid "Turn solid rock into loose soil or dirt."
msgstr "硬い岩を土や地面に変えます。"

#. ~ Player message in false effect in EoC
#. "EOC_IERDE_TUNNEL_TRANSLOCATE_CHECK"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/ierde_eocs.json
msgid ""
"You must be standing deep underground and on the living earth to "
"translocate."
msgstr "転移するには、地下深くのむき出しの大地の上にいる必要があります。"

#. ~ Player message in false effect in EoC "EOC_IERDE_TUNNEL_ATTUNEMENT_CHECK"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/ierde_eocs.json
msgid ""
"You must be deep underground on and on the living earth  to cast this spell."
msgstr "この呪文を詠唱するには、地下深くのむき出しの大地の上にいる必要があります。"

#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_IERDE_STONE_FORM_ON"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/ierde_eocs.json
msgid ""
"Your body stiffens as your flesh turns to stone and your joints to earth."
msgstr "肉は石に、関節は土に変化し、肉体が硬直しました。"

#. ~ Player message in false effect in EoC "EOC_IERDE_STONE_FORM_PER_TURN"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/ierde_eocs.json
msgid "You do not have enough mana to maintain your earthen body!"
msgstr "マナが不足しており、土の肉体を維持できません！"

#. ~ Spell name
#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/ierde_mutation_spells.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/ierde_mutations.json
msgid "Earthquake Stomp"
msgstr "ｱｰｽｸｴｲｸ･ｽﾄﾝﾌﾟ"

#. ~ Description of spell "Earthquake Stomp"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/ierde_mutation_spells.json
msgid ""
"Stomp on the ground and cause a minor local earthquake, damaging buildings "
"and knocking anyone nearby off their feet."
msgstr "大地を踏んで小規模の地震を局所的に発生させ、設置物に損傷を与えて周囲の者を転倒させます。"

#. ~ Sound description of spell "Earthquake Stomp"
#. ~ Sound description of spell "Earthen Grasp"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/ierde_mutation_spells.json
msgid "the ground shakes!"
msgstr "大地が揺れ動きました！"

#. ~ Spell name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/ierde_mutation_spells.json
msgid "Invulnerable Iron Armor"
msgstr "ｲﾝｳﾞｧﾙﾅﾗﾌﾞﾙ･ｱｲｱﾝ･ｱｰﾏｰ"

#. ~ Description of spell "Invulnerable Iron Armor"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/ierde_mutation_spells.json
msgid ""
"While on living earth or stone, the Ierde may infuse their body with the "
"essence of iron, slowing their movement and attacks but rendering them much "
"safer from harm."
msgstr ""
"生きた大地や岩石の地形にいる間、エルデは鉄のエッセンスを体内に取り込むことができます。移動や攻撃の速度は遅くなりますが、防御力が大幅に向上します。"

#. ~ Spell name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/ierde_mutation_spells.json
msgid "Invulnerable Iron Armor Real"
msgstr "ｲﾝｳﾞｧﾙﾅﾗﾌﾞﾙ･ｱｲｱﾝ･ｱｰﾏｰ効果"

#. ~ Description of spell "Invulnerable Iron Armor Real"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/ierde_mutation_spells.json
msgid ""
"The actual spell that summons the iron armor.  It's a bug if you have it."
msgstr "不滅の鉄皮を生成する呪文です。通常は表示されません。"

#. ~ Spell name
#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/ierde_mutation_spells.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/ierde_mutations.json
msgid "Mountain-Toppling Punch"
msgstr "ﾏｳﾝﾃﾝ･ﾄｯﾌﾟﾘﾝｸﾞ･ﾊﾟﾝﾁ"

#. ~ Description of spell "Mountain-Toppling Punch"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/ierde_mutation_spells.json
msgid ""
"With the force of a landslide behind it, punch a single target and knock "
"them backwards."
msgstr "山崩れの力を込めた拳を振るって単一の標的を吹き飛ばします。"

#. ~ Spell name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/ierde_mutation_spells.json
msgid "Mountain-Toppling Punch Knockback"
msgstr "ﾏｳﾝﾃﾝ･ﾄｯﾌﾟﾘﾝｸﾞ･ﾊﾟﾝﾁ吹き飛ばし"

#. ~ Description of spell "Mountain-Toppling Punch Knockback"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/ierde_mutation_spells.json
msgid ""
"The knockback part of Mountain-Toppling Punch.  It's a bug if you have it."
msgstr "マウンテン・トップリング・パンチの吹き飛ばし効果です。通常は表示されません。"

#. ~ Spell name
#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/ierde_mutation_spells.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/ierde_mutations.json
msgid "Knowing Every Furrow"
msgstr "ﾉｳｲﾝｸﾞ･ｴﾌﾞﾘｰ･ﾌｧﾛｰ"

#. ~ Description of spell "Knowing Every Furrow"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/ierde_mutation_spells.json
msgid ""
"Commune with the earth, whispering to it to reveal its secrets to you.  This"
" spell will reveal natural features within a large radius around the Ierde."
"  The spell must be cast while standing on the living earth."
msgstr ""
"大地と交信し、秘密を明かしてもらいます。詠唱者の周囲の広範囲の自然の地形を明らかにします。この呪文を詠唱するには、むき出しの大地の上にいる必要があります。"

#. ~ Spell name
#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/ierde_mutation_spells.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/ierde_mutations.json
msgid "Reshape the Living Earth"
msgstr "ﾘｼｪｲﾌﾟ･ｻﾞ･ﾘﾋﾞﾝｸﾞ･ｱｰｽ"

#. ~ Description of spell "Reshape the Living Earth"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/ierde_mutation_spells.json
msgid ""
"You can mold earth like clay, turning it to stone and back, or raising it "
"and lowering it into pits or ramps or walls."
msgstr "土を粘土のように変形させたり、岩に戻したり、隆起、陥没させたりすることで、穴や傾斜路、壁を生成します。"

#. ~ Spell name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/ierde_mutation_spells.json
msgid "Reshape the Living Earth (Walls)"
msgstr "ﾘｼｪｲﾌﾟ･ｻﾞ･ﾘﾋﾞﾝｸﾞ･ｱｰｽ壁生成"

#. ~ Description of spell "Reshape the Living Earth (Walls)"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/ierde_mutation_spells.json
msgid ""
"The create walls part of the Reshape the Living Earth spell.  It's a bug if "
"you have it directly."
msgstr "リシェイプ・ザ・リビング・アースで壁を生成する呪文です。通常は表示されません。"

#. ~ Spell name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/ierde_mutation_spells.json
msgid "Reshape the Living Earth (Pits)"
msgstr "ﾘｼｪｲﾌﾟ･ｻﾞ･ﾘﾋﾞﾝｸﾞ･ｱｰｽ穴生成"

#. ~ Description of spell "Reshape the Living Earth (Pits)"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/ierde_mutation_spells.json
msgid ""
"The create pits part of the Reshape the Living Earth spell.  It's a bug if "
"you have it directly."
msgstr "リシェイプ・ザ・リビング・アースで穴を生成する呪文です。通常は表示されません。"

#. ~ Spell name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/ierde_mutation_spells.json
msgid "Reshape the Living Earth (Raise Earth)"
msgstr "ﾘｼｪｲﾌﾟ･ｻﾞ･ﾘﾋﾞﾝｸﾞ･ｱｰｽ隆起"

#. ~ Description of spell "Reshape the Living Earth (Raise Earth)"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/ierde_mutation_spells.json
msgid ""
"The raise earth part of the Reshape the Living Earth spell.  It's a bug if "
"you have it directly."
msgstr "リシェイプ・ザ・リビング・アースで地形を隆起させる呪文です。通常は表示されません。"

#. ~ Spell name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/ierde_mutation_spells.json
msgid "Reshape the Living Earth (Lower Earth)"
msgstr "ﾘｼｪｲﾌﾟ･ｻﾞ･ﾘﾋﾞﾝｸﾞ･ｱｰｽ陥没"

#. ~ Description of spell "Reshape the Living Earth (Lower Earth)"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/ierde_mutation_spells.json
msgid ""
"The lower earth part of the Reshape the Living Earth spell.  It's a bug if "
"you have it directly."
msgstr "リシェイプ・ザ・リビング・アースで地形を陥没させる呪文です。通常は表示されません。"

#. ~ Spell name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/ierde_mutation_spells.json
msgid "Reshape the Living Earth (Smooth Stone)"
msgstr "ﾘｼｪｲﾌﾟ･ｻﾞ･ﾘﾋﾞﾝｸﾞ･ｱｰｽ滑らかな岩生成"

#. ~ Description of spell "Reshape the Living Earth (Smooth Stone)"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/ierde_mutation_spells.json
msgid ""
"The smoothing stone part of the Reshape the Living Earth spell.  It's a bug "
"if you have it directly."
msgstr "リシェイプ・ザ・リビング・アースで滑らかな岩を生成する呪文です。通常は表示されません。"

#. ~ Spell name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/ierde_mutation_spells.json
msgid "Reshape the Living Earth (Churn Earth)"
msgstr "ﾘｼｪｲﾌﾟ･ｻﾞ･ﾘﾋﾞﾝｸﾞ･ｱｰｽ畝生成"

#. ~ Description of spell "Reshape the Living Earth (Churn Earth)"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/ierde_mutation_spells.json
msgid ""
"The churning earth part of the Reshape the Living Earth spell.  It's a bug "
"if you have it directly."
msgstr "リシェイプ・ザ・リビング・アースで畝を生成する呪文です。通常は表示されません。"

#. ~ Spell name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/ierde_mutation_spells.json
msgid "Reshape the Living Earth (Earth to Stone)"
msgstr "ﾘｼｪｲﾌﾟ･ｻﾞ･ﾘﾋﾞﾝｸﾞ･ｱｰｽ岩変化"

#. ~ Description of spell "Reshape the Living Earth (Earth to Stone)"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/ierde_mutation_spells.json
msgid ""
"The turning earth to stone part of the Reshape the Living Earth spell.  It's"
" a bug if you have it directly."
msgstr "リシェイプ・ザ・リビング・アースで土の地形を岩に変える呪文です。通常は表示されません。"

#. ~ Spell name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/ierde_mutation_spells.json
msgid "Reshape the Living Earth (Stone to Earth)"
msgstr "ﾘｼｪｲﾌﾟ･ｻﾞ･ﾘﾋﾞﾝｸﾞ･ｱｰｽ土変化"

#. ~ Description of spell "Reshape the Living Earth (Stone to Earth)"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/ierde_mutation_spells.json
msgid ""
"The turning stone to earth part of the Reshape the Living Earth spell.  It's"
" a bug if you have it directly."
msgstr "リシェイプ・ザ・リビング・アースで岩の地形を土に変える呪文です。通常は表示されません。"

#. ~ Spell name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/ierde_mutation_spells.json
msgid "Earthquake Stomp Bash Terrain"
msgstr "ｱｰｽｸｴｲｸ･ｽﾄﾝﾌﾟ地形破壊"

#. ~ Spell name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/ierde_mutation_spells.json
msgid "Earthquake Stomp Rubble"
msgstr "ｱｰｽｸｴｲｸ･ｽﾄﾝﾌﾟ瓦礫生成"

#. ~ Spell name
#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/ierde_mutation_spells.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/ierde_mutations.json
msgid "Rigidity of Stone"
msgstr "ﾘｼﾞﾃﾞｨﾃｨ･ｵﾌﾞ･ｽﾄｰﾝ"

#. ~ Description of spell "Rigidity of Stone"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/ierde_mutation_spells.json
msgid ""
"Infuse your enemies with the rigidity of stone, slowing their movements."
msgstr "敵を石のように固めて鈍化させます。"

#. ~ Description of spell "Skin of the Mountains"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/ierde_mutation_spells.json
msgid ""
"Infuse the resilience of the earth into one of your allies.  Their skin will"
" repel some of the physical damage they take, and they will be more "
"resistant to losing blood, but they will be slightly slower due to the "
"magicks."
msgstr ""
"仲間の一人に大地の回復力を分け与えます。この力を受けた者は皮膚が物理的なダメージの一部を無効化し、失血に対する耐性が高まりますが、速度がわずかに低下します。"

#. ~ Description of spell "Impenetrable Earthen Shield"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/ierde_mutation_spells.json
msgid ""
"While standing on the living earth or stone, infuse your skin with the "
"hardness of bedrock.  You will take no damage at all while the spell is in "
"effect, though repeated blows can wear through the shield until it breaks."
msgstr ""
"生きた土や石の上にいる状態で、肌を岩盤のように硬化させます。効果中はまったくダメージを受けませんが、攻撃を繰り返し受けるとやがて効果が消失します。"

#. ~ Spell name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/ierde_mutation_spells.json
msgid "Lithic Gaol"
msgstr "ﾘｼｯｸ･ｼﾞｪｲﾙ"

#. ~ Description of spell "Lithic Gaol"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/ierde_mutation_spells.json
msgid ""
"Summon up a series of spikes around a a single target, imprisoning them in a"
" cage of stone.  The target must be on earth or stone for the spell to take "
"effect."
msgstr "単一の標的の周囲に並んだ棘を召喚して石の檻を作り出し、閉じ込めます。この呪文が機能するには、標的が地面や石の上にいる必要があります。"

#. ~ Spell name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/ierde_mutation_spells.json
msgid "Lithic Gaol Local Bash"
msgstr "ﾘｼｯｸ･ｼﾞｪｲﾙ地形破壊"

#. ~ Description of spell "Lithic Gaol Local Bash"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/ierde_mutation_spells.json
msgid ""
"Damages ground before the stone fangs come out, to represent the fangs "
"destroying furniture.  It's a bug if you have it."
msgstr "岩石の牙の出現位置にある設置物に損傷を与えて破壊します。通常は表示されません。"

#. ~ Spell name
#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/ierde_mutation_spells.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/ierde_mutations.json
msgid "Calling the Children of the Stones"
msgstr "ｺｰﾙ･ｻﾞ･ﾁﾙﾄﾞﾚﾝ･ｵﾌﾞ･ｻﾞ･ｽﾄｰﾝｽﾞ"

#. ~ Description of spell "Calling the Children of the Stones"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/ierde_mutation_spells.json
msgid "A lesser earth elemental is summoned to support you."
msgstr "あまり強くない友好的な大地の精を召喚します。"

#. ~ Spell name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/ierde_mutation_spells.json
msgid "Unsleeping Earth Vigil Spell"
msgstr "大地の不寝番効果"

#. ~ Description of spell "Unsleeping Earth Vigil Spell"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/ierde_mutation_spells.json
msgid ""
"The spell cast by the Unsleeping Earth Vigil mutation.  It's a bug if you "
"have it directly."
msgstr "大地の不寝番の効果を付与する呪文です。通常は表示されません。"

#. ~ Spell name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/ierde_mutation_spells.json
msgid "Avalanche Blow Spell"
msgstr "雪崩の猛威効果"

#. ~ Description of spell "Avalanche Blow Spell"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/ierde_mutation_spells.json
msgid ""
"The spell cast by the Avalanche Blow mutation.  It's a bug if you have it "
"directly."
msgstr "雪崩の猛威の効果を付与する呪文です。通常は表示されません。"

#. ~ Spell name
#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/ierde_mutation_spells.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/ierde_mutations.json
msgid "Earthen Grasp"
msgstr "ｱｰｽﾝ･ｸﾞﾗｽﾌﾟ"

#. ~ Description of spell "Earthen Grasp"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/ierde_mutation_spells.json
msgid "Open the ground beneath your enemies' feet, dumping them into pits."
msgstr "標的の足元に地割れを発生させて落とします。"

#. ~ Spell name
#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/ierde_mutation_spells.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/ierde_mutations.json
msgid "Traveling the Veins of the Earth"
msgstr "ﾄﾗﾍﾞﾘﾝｸﾞ･ｻﾞ･ｳﾞｪｲﾝｽﾞ･ｵﾌﾞ･ｼﾞ･ｱｰｽ"

#. ~ Description of spell "Traveling the Veins of the Earth"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/ierde_mutation_spells.json
msgid ""
"The earth is crisscrossed with fissures, with layers of rock and veins of "
"metal, and deeper, with flows of molten rock.  The Ierde can flow along "
"those paths, traveling deep within the earth to any point they have "
"previously been to."
msgstr ""
"大地を縦横無尽に走る地脈には岩石層や金属鉱脈があり、更に地中深くには溶けた岩石が流れています。エルデはこれらの脈を伝い、以前に行ったことがある地中の地点まで移動できます。"

#. ~ Spell name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/ierde_mutation_spells.json
msgid "Traveling the Veins of the Earth Attunement"
msgstr "ﾄﾗﾍﾞﾘﾝｸﾞ･ｻﾞ･ｳﾞｪｲﾝｽﾞ･ｵﾌﾞ･ｼﾞ･ｱｰｽ(位置登録)"

#. ~ Description of spell "Traveling the Veins of the Earth Attunement"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/ierde_mutation_spells.json
msgid ""
"Attune to a location for later traveling.  You must attune deep within the "
"earth on the living rock."
msgstr "転移して戻ってくるときのために空間を整えます。地中深くのむき出しの大地の上で詠唱する必要があります。"

#. ~ Spell name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/ierde_mutation_spells.json
msgid "Traveling the Veins of the Earth Attunement Real"
msgstr "ﾄﾗﾍﾞﾘﾝｸﾞ･ｻﾞ･ｳﾞｪｲﾝｽﾞ･ｵﾌﾞ･ｼﾞ･ｱｰｽ(位置登録)効果"

#. ~ Description of spell "Traveling the Veins of the Earth Attunement Real"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/ierde_mutation_spells.json
msgid ""
"The actual Traveling the Veins of the Earth attunement spell.  It's a bug if"
" you have it."
msgstr "トラベリング・ザ・ヴェインズ・オブ・ジ・アースの位置登録の効果を実行する呪文です。通常は表示されません。"

#. ~ Description of spell "Cultivate Goblin Fruit"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/ierde_mutation_spells.json
msgid ""
"You may spin a bit of fae magic into the earth, bringing forth a goblin "
"fruit.  Goblin fruit have a variety of effects, never predictable but always"
" at least somewhat beneficial.  This spell may only be cast on earth or "
"stone."
msgstr ""
"大地に精霊の魔法を掛けることで、ゴブリンフルーツを生み出します。ゴブリンフルーツには様々な効果があり、予測は不可能ですが、少なくともある程度の有益な効果は期待できます。この呪文は屋外の自然環境下でのみ詠唱できます。"

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/ierde_mutations.json
msgid "Clay of the Earth"
msgstr "粘土色の皮膚"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Clay of the Earth"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/ierde_mutations.json
msgid ""
"Your skin has turned the color of manganese stained soil.  Your skin is now "
"a purplish black.  This has no gameplay effects."
msgstr "皮膚がマンガン混じりの土の色に変わりました。紫がかった黒色の皮膚です。特に何の効果もありません。"

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/ierde_mutations.json
msgid "Pebbled Skin"
msgstr "砂利の皮膚"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Pebbled Skin"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/ierde_mutations.json
msgid ""
"Your skin has toughened and formed pebble-like growths in some places, "
"acting as natural armor.  Somewhat reduces wet effects."
msgstr "皮膚が硬くなり、小石のような瘤がまばらに生え始めています。天然の鎧として機能し、水濡れの影響を多少軽減します。"

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/ierde_mutations.json
msgid "Stone Skin"
msgstr "石の皮膚"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Stone Skin"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/ierde_mutations.json
msgid ""
"Your skin has developed into strong granite-like covering that retains some "
"flexibility and has grown to cover most of your body, acting as natural "
"armor.  While difficult to penetrate, it also limits your flexibility.  "
"Greatly reduces wet effects."
msgstr ""
"皮膚がある程度の柔軟性をもったまま、花崗岩のような物質に覆われています。天然の鎧として機能し、貫通攻撃への耐性が高くなりますが、身体の柔軟性は低下します。水濡れの影響を大幅に軽減します。"

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/ierde_mutations.json
msgid "Ierde Eyes"
msgstr "エルデの目"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Ierde Eyes"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/ierde_mutations.json
msgid ""
"Upon gaining this ability the Ierde's eyes begin reflecting their mood: a "
"pale white streaked with rose when happy; pale green or grey when calm, and "
"pure obsidian black when angry.  Glare no longer impacts them and they are "
"not bothered by light levels when sleeping."
msgstr ""
"幸せなときはバラの花の模様が入った淡い白、落ち着いているときは淡い緑灰色、怒っているときは純粋な黒曜石の色と、気分に合わせて様々な色に変化する目をもっています。日光の眩しさの影響を受けず、明るい場所でも問題なく眠りに就けます。"

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/ierde_mutations.json
msgid "Ierde Ears"
msgstr "エルデの耳"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Ierde Ears"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/ierde_mutations.json
msgid ""
"The Ierde's ears are longer and pointed, like the peak of a high mountain.  "
"They can hear slightly better and are unphased by loud sounds."
msgstr "エルデの耳は高い山の頂のように長く尖っています。聴覚が少し発達し、大きな音に動じなくなります。"

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/ierde_mutations.json
msgid "Fists of Stone"
msgstr "石の拳"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Fists of Stone"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/ierde_mutations.json
msgid ""
"The Ierde's stony skin makes their fists hit like hammers.  Though their "
"attacks are slower, the Ierde does more bashing damage with punches and can "
"use their hands to replace some simple tools."
msgstr ""
"石のように硬い皮膚のお陰で、拳をハンマーのように振るうことができます。素手格闘での攻撃速度が遅くなりますが、威力は上昇します。単純な作りの道具であれば、手で代用できます。"

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/ierde_mutations.json
msgid "Stone-Hardened Panoply"
msgstr "石造りの鎧"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Stone-Hardened Panoply"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/ierde_mutations.json
msgid ""
"Just as their body is now one with the stone, the Ierde can infuse the "
"strength of the earth into their equipment, rendering it more resilient.  "
"While on natural earth or stone or underground, the Ierde's equipment is "
"twice as difficult to damage."
msgstr ""
"肉体が石と一体化するのと同様に、着用している防具に大地の力を注いで鍛えることができます。むき出しの土や石の上、または地下にいる間、エルデの着用アイテムの防御力が2倍になります。"

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/ierde_mutations.json
msgid "Unsleeping Earth Vigil"
msgstr "大地の不寝番"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Unsleeping Earth Vigil"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/ierde_mutations.json
msgid ""
"Upon gaining this ability the Ierde gains the ability to, while underground,"
" rest and recover energy as though sleeping.  Activate to to begin the "
"vigil."
msgstr "地下にいるときに限り、睡眠を取っているかのように肉体を休ませ、体力を回復させることができます。変異メニューから効果を起動できます。"

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/ierde_mutations.json
msgid "The Soil Knows Those Who Tread Upon It"
msgstr "地に耳あり"

#. ~ Description of mutation "The Soil Knows Those Who Tread Upon It"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/ierde_mutations.json
msgid ""
"Upon gaining this ability the Ierde gains the ability to sense the movements"
" of nearby creatures, as long as they maintains contact with natural earth "
"or stone, or are underground."
msgstr "自然の土や石と接触しているか地下にいる状態で、周囲のモンスターの動きを感知するエルデの能力です。"

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/ierde_mutations.json
msgid "Avalanche Blow"
msgstr "雪崩の猛威"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Avalanche Blow"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/ierde_mutations.json
msgid ""
"With a brief moment to stabilize themselves, the Ierde strikes a wall, door,"
" or other terrain feature with the force of a falling boulder, doing many "
"times their normal damage."
msgstr "一瞬で体勢を安定させ、雪崩のごとき力で壁や扉などの地形に体当たりし、通常の何倍もの損傷を与えるエルデの能力です。"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Earthquake Stomp"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/ierde_mutations.json
msgid ""
"Upon gaining this ability the Ierde gains the ability to stomp on the ground"
" and cause a minor local earthquake."
msgstr "大地を踏み鳴らし、局所的に弱い地震を引き起こすエルデの能力です。"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Mountain-Toppling Punch"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/ierde_mutations.json
msgid ""
"Upon gaining this ability the Ierde gains the ability to strike an enemy "
"with a blow that does extra damage and knocks them backwards."
msgstr "敵に追加のダメージを与え、後方に吹き飛ばすエルデの能力です。"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Knowing Every Furrow"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/ierde_mutations.json
msgid ""
"Upon gaining this ability the Ierde gains the ability to learn the terrain "
"layout in a large area around themselves."
msgstr "周囲の広範囲の地形を明らかにするアルボレの能力です。"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Earthen Grasp"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/ierde_mutations.json
msgid ""
"Upon gaining this ability the Ierde gains the ability to create large pits "
"on diggable ground, dumping their enemies into them."
msgstr "掘削可能な地面に大きな穴を作り出し、敵をその中に投げ込むエルデの能力です。"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Rigidity of Stone"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/ierde_mutations.json
msgid ""
"Upon gaining this ability the Ierde may infuse the rigidity of stone into "
"their enemies, slowing their movements."
msgstr "敵を石のように固めて鈍化させるエルデの能力です。"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Reshape the Living Earth"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/ierde_mutations.json
msgid ""
"Upon gaining this ability the Ierde may reshape the earth, raising or "
"lowering earth or stone or turning the one into the other."
msgstr "土や石を隆起、陥没させたり、相互に変化させたりして地形を変えるエルデの能力です。"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Calling the Children of the Stones"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/ierde_mutations.json
msgid ""
"Allows the Ierde to summon a minor earth elemental to support them in the "
"world for a short time."
msgstr "短時間だけ活動できる友好的な大地の精を召喚するエルデの能力です。"

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/ierde_mutations.json
msgid "Invulnerable Iron Skin"
msgstr "不滅の鉄皮"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Invulnerable Iron Skin"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/ierde_mutations.json
msgid ""
"Stone endures but armor is made of metal.  While standing on natural earth "
"or stone, the Ierde can infuse their skin with metal, slowing their movement"
" and encumbering them but rendering them much harder to damage."
msgstr ""
"岩よりも硬い金属の鎧を身につけます。自然の土や石の地形にいる間、皮膚に金属の精髄を取り込むエルデの能力です。移動速度が遅くなり動作制限も発生しますが、ダメージを受けにくくなります。"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Impenetrable Earthen Shield"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/ierde_mutations.json
msgid ""
"While standing on natural earth or stone, the Ierde can summon up an earthen"
" shield to protect themselves.  They will be invulnerable until the shield "
"breaks."
msgstr "自然の土や岩の上にいる状態で、自分自身を守る土の盾を召喚します。盾が壊れるまではダメージを一切受けません。"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Skin of the Mountains"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/ierde_mutations.json
msgid ""
"When gaining this ability, the Ierde gains the ability to infuse the "
"resilience of the earth into one of their allies."
msgstr "仲間の一人に大地の回復力を分け与えるエルデの能力です。"

#. ~ Mutation name
#. ~ The name is a reference to Chapter 63 of Bleak House by Charles Dickens
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/ierde_mutations.json
msgid "An Iron Taste and an Iron Smell"
msgstr "鉄の味、鉄の匂い"

#. ~ Description of mutation "An Iron Taste and an Iron Smell"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/ierde_mutations.json
msgid ""
"The Ierde has taken the essence of iron into themselves.  They no longer "
"smell anything like a human, smelling only like a faint whiff of iron if "
"they have any scent at all, and can produce all their iron their body needs "
"themselves."
msgstr ""
"鉄のエッセンスを肉体に取り込みました。もはや人間の体臭は消え、わずかに鉄の匂いがするだけです。人体に必要な鉄分は全て体内で生成できるため、飲食物に含まれる鉄分を摂取する必要が無くなります。"

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/ierde_mutations.json
msgid "Tireless Strength of the Earth"
msgstr "大地の根性"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Tireless Strength of the Earth"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/ierde_mutations.json
msgid ""
"The Ierde can draw on the boundless strength of the earth, increasing their "
"stamina."
msgstr "大地に秘められた無限の力を引き出すことで、スタミナが上昇します。"

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/ierde_mutations.json
msgid "Unceasing Strength of the Earth"
msgstr "大地の不屈"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Unceasing Strength of the Earth"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/ierde_mutations.json
msgid ""
"The Ierde can draw even deeper on the boundless strength of the earth, "
"greatly increasing their stamina."
msgstr "大地に秘められた無限の力を更に引き出すことで、スタミナがかなり上昇します。"

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/ierde_mutations.json
msgid "Inexhaustible Strength of the Earth"
msgstr "大地の剛毅"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Inexhaustible Strength of the Earth"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/ierde_mutations.json
msgid ""
"The Ierde can draw from boundless strength of the very depths of the earth, "
"enormously increasing their stamina."
msgstr "大地に秘められた無限の力を極限まで引き出すことで、スタミナが大幅に上昇します。"

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/ierde_mutations.json
msgid "Stone Does Not Grow Weary"
msgstr "盤石"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Stone Does Not Grow Weary"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/ierde_mutations.json
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"When underground or on natural earth, the Ierde recovers Stamina 50% faster."
msgstr "地下、もしくは人工物ではない地面の地形にいる場合、スタミナ回復速度が50%上昇します。"

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/ierde_mutations.json
msgid "The Stone Endures"
msgstr "金剛石"

#. ~ Description of mutation "The Stone Endures"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/ierde_mutations.json
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"When underground or on natural earth, the Ierde recovers Stamina 50% faster "
"and heals 33% faster."
msgstr "地下、もしくは人工物ではない地面の地形にいる場合、スタミナ回復速度が50%、体力回復速度が33%上昇します。"

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/ierde_mutations.json
msgid "Stone Does Not Cry Out"
msgstr "鉄石心"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Stone Does Not Cry Out"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/ierde_mutations.json
msgid ""
"Like the stone, the Ierde suffers little from blows.  All pain is halved."
msgstr "攻撃をものともしないエルデはまるで岩石のようです。全ての苦痛が半減されます。"

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/ierde_mutations.json
msgid "In the Earthmother's Embrace"
msgstr "母なる大地の抱擁"

#. ~ Description of mutation "In the Earthmother's Embrace"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/ierde_mutations.json
msgid ""
"Upon gaining this ability the Ierde gains the ability to sink into the "
"living earth, where they will heal faster, they will not need to eat or "
"drink, and sleep will be more restful for them."
msgstr "大地に沈み込んで安らぎを得るエルデの能力です。効果中は回復速度が上昇し、飲食の必要が無くなり、より安らかに眠れます。"

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/ierde_mutations.json
msgid "Sleeping in the Earth"
msgstr "大地の揺籃"

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/ierde_mutations.json
msgid "Blood of the Earth"
msgstr "大地の血流"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Blood of the Earth"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/ierde_mutations.json
msgid ""
"The Ierde's blood has turned black and grown thick and tar-like.  They will "
"bleed much more slowly."
msgstr "エルデの血は濃いタールのような黒色です。出血速度が低下します。"

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/ierde_mutations.json
msgid "Black Blood of the Earth"
msgstr "大地の黒血"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Black Blood of the Earth"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/ierde_mutations.json
msgid ""
"The Ierde's blood has turned into a black sludge that barely flows.  They no"
" longer bleed at all."
msgstr "体内に黒く粘つくヘドロのような血が溜まっています。出血しなくなります。"

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/ierde_mutations.json
msgid "The Mountain Does Not Move"
msgstr "不動如山"

#. ~ Description of mutation "The Mountain Does Not Move"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/ierde_mutations.json
msgid ""
"Though the earth shivers and shakes, the mountain stands tall.  The Ierde is"
" immune to knockback."
msgstr "大地がどれほど震えても、山は変わらずそびえています。吹き飛ばしの影響を受けません。"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Cultivate Goblin Fruit"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/ierde_mutations.json
msgid ""
"Upon gaining this ability the Ierde gains the ability to grow a goblin fruit"
" from a earth or stone."
msgstr "土や石からゴブリンフルーツを生み出すエルデの能力です。"

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/ierde_mutations.json
msgid "Vigor of the Soil"
msgstr "土の剛力"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Vigor of the Soil"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/ierde_mutations.json
msgid "Like the bountiful soil, the Ierde is filled with power.  +3 Strength."
msgstr "豊かな土壌のように、活力に満ちています。筋力に+3のボーナスを得ます。"

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/ierde_mutations.json
msgid "Vigor of the Stone"
msgstr "岩の剛力"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Vigor of the Stone"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/ierde_mutations.json
msgid "Like the stone, the Ierde can withstand any punishment.  +5 Strength."
msgstr "どれほど辛い困難にも岩のように耐えられます。筋力に+5のボーナスを得ます。"

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/ierde_mutations.json
msgid "Vigor of the Mountain"
msgstr "山の剛力"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Vigor of the Mountain"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/ierde_mutations.json
msgid "Like the mountain, the Ierde is unmoved by calamity.  +7 Strength."
msgstr "どんな災難にも、山のようにじっと動じません。筋力に+7のボーナスを得ます。"

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/ierde_mutations.json
msgid "Vigor of the Bedrock"
msgstr "岩盤の剛力"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Vigor of the Bedrock"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/ierde_mutations.json
msgid ""
"Like the bedrock, the Ierde's might can support the entire world.  +9 "
"Strength."
msgstr "岩盤のように世界を支える力を持っています。筋力に+9のボーナスを得ます。"

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/ierde_mutations.json
msgid "The Hills Overlook the Valleys"
msgstr "一望千里"

#. ~ Description of mutation "The Hills Overlook the Valleys"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/ierde_mutations.json
msgid ""
"Like an observer on a mountaintop, the Ierde sees more than most.  +3 "
"Perception."
msgstr "山頂に立ってじっと観察するように、エルデは普通より多くの物事を感じられます。知覚に+3のボーナスを得ます。"

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/ierde_mutations.json
msgid "The Mountain Is Unflinching"
msgstr "山の毅然"

#. ~ Description of mutation "The Mountain Is Unflinching"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/ierde_mutations.json
msgid ""
"While on living earth or stone or underground, the Ierde is as impassive as "
"the mountains and feels no pain at all."
msgstr "生きた土や石の上、あるいは地下にいる状態で、エルデはまるで山のように苦痛を全く感じません。"

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/ierde_mutations.json
msgid "The Stone Does Not Rot"
msgstr "堅固な免疫"

#. ~ Description of mutation "The Stone Does Not Rot"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/ierde_mutations.json
msgid ""
"The stones do not rot as the trees or humans do, and neither is the Ierde "
"affected by the frailties of the flesh.  They are immune to disease and "
"cannot suffer from parasites."
msgstr "堅固な石は樹木や人間のように腐ることはなく、エルデもまた堅固な肉体をもっています。病気に対して免疫があり、寄生虫の影響を受けません。"

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/ierde_mutations.json
msgid "Mind of Iron"
msgstr "鉄の心"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Mind of Iron"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/ierde_mutations.json
msgid ""
"The Ierde's mind has the resilience of iron, and they cannot be affected by "
"delusions, hallucinations, or other mental problems."
msgstr "エルデの精神は鉄のように強靭です。妄想、幻覚、その他の精神的な悪影響を受けません。"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Traveling the Veins of the Earth"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/ierde_mutations.json
msgid ""
"Upon gaining this ability the Ierde gains the ability to travel through "
"stone to another underground location they have previously been to."
msgstr "地脈を伝ってあらかじめ指定した地下の特定地点に転移するエルデの能力です。"

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/ierde_mutations.json
msgid "Form of the Solid Earth"
msgstr "大地への変身"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Form of the Solid Earth"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/ierde_mutations.json
msgid ""
"The Ierde may transform into rock and earth.  They become incredibly "
"resilient and nearly immune to some forms of damage, but will be much, much "
"slower."
msgstr "エルデは岩や土に変化することができます。回復力が爆発的に増大し、大抵の攻撃では傷つかなくなりますが、速度は大幅に低下します。"

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/ierde_mutations.json
msgid "Earthen Form"
msgstr "大地形態"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Earthen Form"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/ierde_mutations.json
msgid ""
"You are a mass of stone and earth.  You are incredibly resilient, but you "
"are extremely slow."
msgstr "岩と土の塊です。回復力が爆発的に増大しますが、速度は非常に遅くなります。"

#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_LEVELER_IERDE_STOMP_GROUND_SMASH"
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_LEVELER_IERDE_CREATE_PITS"
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_LEVELER_IERDE_KNOCKBACK_PUNCH"
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_LEVELER_IERDE_IRON_ARMOR"
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_LEVELER_IERDE_REVEAL_EARTH_MAP"
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_LEVELER_IERDE_RESHAPE_THE_EARTH"
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_LEVELER_IERDE_SLOW_ENEMIES"
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC
#. "EOC_LEVELER_IERDE_ENTRAP_TARGET_IN_STONE"
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_LEVELER_IERDE_EARTHEN_SHIELD"
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_LEVELER_IERDE_BUFF_ARMOR_ALLIES"
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_LEVELER_IERDE_SUMMON_EARTH_SPIRIT"
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_LEVELER_IERDE_TUNNEL_TRANSLOCATE"
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC
#. "EOC_LEVELER_IERDE_CULTIVATE_GOBLIN_FRUIT"
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_LEVELER_IERDE_MAKE_GOSSAMER"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/ierde_spell_learning_eocs.json
msgid ""
"Your time spent surrounded by the living earth has increased your facility "
"with your fae magicks."
msgstr "生きた大地に囲まれて長い時間を過ごしたことで、精霊の力が使えるようになりました。"

#. ~ Player message in false effect in EoC
#. "EOC_PARACLESIAN_FAE_SIGHT_PROCESSING"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/paraclesian_eocs.json
msgid "You do not have enough mana to fuel your fae sight!"
msgstr "マナが不足しており、精霊の視力を活用できません！"

#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC
#. "EOC_COMPLETED_ROLL_REMAINDER_GOSSAMER_RECIPE"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/paraclesian_eocs.json
msgid "These are all the ways you can weave gossamer into garb now."
msgstr "薄衣を織って衣服を作る方法を全て習得し終えました。"

#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC
#. "EOC_SUCCESSFUL_ROLL_REMAINDER_GOSSAMER_RECIPE"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/paraclesian_eocs.json
msgid "You learn a recipe for gossamer raiment."
msgstr "薄衣を使った衣服のレシピを習得しました。"

#. ~ Player message in false effect in EoC "EOC_PARACLESIAN_GOSSAMER_RECIPES"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/paraclesian_eocs.json
msgid "You need more time to devise a recipe for gossamer."
msgstr "薄衣のレシピを考案するにはもう少し時間が必要です。"

#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_PARACLESIAN_TURN_COTTON_TO_GOSSAMER"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/paraclesian_eocs.json
msgid ""
"The moonlight permeates the cotton and it begins to shimmer like an opal in "
"the sunlight."
msgstr "月の光が生地に浸透し、太陽の光を浴びるオパールのように輝き始めました。"

#. ~ Player message in false effect in EoC
#. "EOC_PARACLESIAN_TURN_COTTON_TO_GOSSAMER"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/paraclesian_eocs.json
msgid "You must be outdoors under the moonlight to turn cotton into gossamer."
msgstr "生地を薄衣に変えるには、屋外で月光を浴びせる必要があります。"

#. ~ Message in nested effect in else statement in effect in EoC
#. "EOC_WANTS_TO_TALK"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/paraclesian_eocs.json
msgid "You cannot lead this person to talk to you anymore."
msgstr "この人物にこれ以上話しかけさせることはできません。"

#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_ARVORE_FAE_BAN_CUT_TREE"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/paraclesian_fae_bans.json
msgid ""
"You feel a stabbing pain as the tree falls.  One of your own, murdered by "
"your hand."
msgstr "樹木が倒れると、刺すような痛みを感じました。自分自身の一部を、自ら殺したのです。"

#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_ARVORE_FAE_BAN_LIGHT_FIRE"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/paraclesian_fae_bans.json
msgid ""
"Your heart races as you spark the fire.  A fire, outdoors, in the view of "
"the trees and the grasses.  Visions of charred wood, of blackened trunks and"
" broken branches, fill your mind."
msgstr "火を起こすと心臓が高鳴りました。炎、野外、辺りに生えた木々や草花。焼けた木、黒ずんだ幹、折れた枝。そのようなビジョンが心を満たしました。"

#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_ARVORE_FAE_BAN_SLEPT_IN_CITY"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/paraclesian_fae_bans.json
msgid ""
"You awaken with a groggy head, blinking bleary eyes.  Sleeping near the "
"remnants of civilization away from the bounty of nature, your sleep was not "
"as restful as it should have been."
msgstr "起床しましたが、頭がボーっとしており、瞼が重く感じます。自然の恵みから離れ、文明の残骸の近くでは、睡眠を取ってもあまり安らげません。"

#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC
#. "EOC_IERDE_FAE_BAN_DIDNT_SLEEP_UNDERGROUND"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/paraclesian_fae_bans.json
msgid ""
"You awaken in pain, your muscles stiff, your body groaning in protest.  Away"
" from the depths of the living earth, your sleep was not as restful as it "
"should have been."
msgstr ""
"痛みを感じて目覚めました。筋肉がこわばり、身体のあちこちが軋んでいます。生きた大地から遠く離れた場所では、睡眠を取ってもあまり安らげません。"

#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC
#. "EOC_IERDE_FAE_BAN_USED_TOOLS_ON_THE_EARTH"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/paraclesian_fae_bans.json
msgid ""
"You feel a stabbing pain as your tools dig into the living earth.  Tools "
"made of material torn from the earth by humans.  You should not be using "
"them."
msgstr "生きた大地に道具をねじ込ませると、刺すような痛みを感じました。人類が地球から引き剥がした素材で作った道具は、使わない方がよさそうです。"

#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_HOMULLUS_FAE_BAN_KILL_HUMAN"
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_HOMULLUS_FAE_BAN_KILL_HUMAN_MONSTER"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/paraclesian_fae_bans.json
msgid ""
"You feel a stab of pain as the human collapses in a puddle of their own "
"blood.  A human, slain by your hand, in defiance of your nature."
msgstr "人間が倒れてその場に血だまりを作ると、刺すような痛みを感じました。自らの手で人間を殺すのは、根本的な気質に反した行動です。"

#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_SALAMANDER_FAE_BAN_GET_WET"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/paraclesian_fae_bans.json
msgid ""
"Accursed water!  The touch of it burns you like acid, reminding you of your "
"nature.  Your flames must not be dowsed."
msgstr "忌々しい水！少し触れただけで酸のように肉体が溶け、自らの気質を思い出しました。炎を消すような行動は慎みましょう。"

#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_SYLPH_FAE_BAN_DIDNT_SLEEP_OUTSIDE"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/paraclesian_fae_bans.json
msgid ""
"You gasp as you awaken, the still air barely moving into your lungs.  You "
"long for the blowing winds."
msgstr "息苦しさで目覚め、淀んだ空気をかろうじて吸い込みました。自由に動き回る風を恋しく感じます。"

#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC
#. "EOC_SYLPH_FAE_BAN_TOO_LONG_UNDERGROUND_APPLY_PENALTY"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/paraclesian_fae_bans.json
msgid ""
"The walls seem like they're closing in on you.  You were born to fly free, "
"to dance on the winds, not to cower underground like a worm.  You have to "
"get out to the open sky."
msgstr ""
"壁が迫ってきているような気がします。自由に飛び回り、風に乗って踊るために生まれてきた筈が、今は虫のように地下で縮こまっています。広い空が見たくて仕方ありません。"

#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_UNDINE_FAE_BAN_SLEEP_ON_LAND"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/paraclesian_fae_bans.json
msgid ""
"You gasp as you awaken, thin air barely filling your lungs as you struggle "
"to breath.  You long for the soothing embrace of the waters."
msgstr "息苦しさに目覚め、やっとのことで薄い空気を肺に取り込みました。心地よい水の抱擁を恋しく感じます。"

#. ~ Spell name
#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/paraclesian_mutation_spells.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/paraclesian_mutations.json
msgid "Cloud of Steam"
msgstr "ｸﾗｳﾄﾞ･ｵﾌﾞ･ｽﾁｰﾑ"

#. ~ Description of spell "Cloud of Steam"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/paraclesian_mutation_spells.json
msgid "You bring forth a cloud of boiling water."
msgstr "水を沸騰させて雲を生み出します。"

#. ~ Spell name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/paraclesian_mutation_spells.json
msgid "Cultivate Goblin Fruit Real"
msgstr "ｶﾙﾃｨﾍﾞｲﾄ･ｺﾞﾌﾞﾘﾝ･ﾌﾙｰﾂ効果"

#. ~ Description of spell "Cultivate Goblin Fruit Real"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/paraclesian_mutation_spells.json
msgid ""
"The actual spell that calls forth a goblin fruit.  It's a bug if you have "
"it."
msgstr "ゴブリンフルーツを生成する呪文です。通常は表示されません。"

#. ~ Spell name
#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/paraclesian_mutation_spells.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/paraclesian_mutations.json
msgid "The Wind Blows, the Willow Bends"
msgstr "ｻﾞ･ｳｨﾝﾄﾞ･ﾌﾞﾛｳｽﾞ･ｻﾞ･ｳｨﾛｳ･ﾍﾞﾝｽﾞ"

#. ~ Description of spell "The Wind Blows, the Willow Bends"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/paraclesian_mutation_spells.json
msgid ""
"Like the flitting wind or the flexible willow, the spell allows you to avoid"
" attacks much more easily."
msgstr "この呪文を詠唱すると、まるで風に揺れる柳のように、攻撃を簡単に回避できるようになります。"

#. ~ Spell name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/paraclesian_mutation_spells.json
msgid "Weave Gossamer"
msgstr "ｳｨｰｳﾞ･ｺﾞｯｻﾏｰ"

#. ~ Description of spell "Weave Gossamer"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/paraclesian_mutation_spells.json
msgid "Under the light of the moon, you can weave cotton into gossamer."
msgstr "月明かりを綿に織り込んで薄衣を作ります。"

#. ~ Spell name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/paraclesian_mutation_spells.json
msgid "Wish to Converse"
msgstr "ｳｨｯｼｭ･ﾄｩ･ｺﾝﾊﾞｰｽ"

#. ~ Description of spell "Wish to Converse"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/paraclesian_mutation_spells.json
msgid ""
"When this spell is cast, the target will somehow begin to care about you "
"very much and can't not help but talk to."
msgstr "この呪文を詠唱すると、標的はどういう訳かこちらのことが非常に気になり、話しかけずにはいられなくなります。"

#. ~ Name of effect type id "effect_wants_to_talk"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/paraclesian_mutation_spells.json
msgid "Seeming to want to talk to you"
msgstr "会話したい"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Seeming to want to talk to you"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/paraclesian_mutation_spells.json
msgid "This person wants to talk with you."
msgstr "話したがっています。"

#. ~ Spell name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/paraclesian_mutation_spells.json
msgid "Paraclesian Translocation"
msgstr "元素の精転移"

#. ~ Description of spell "Paraclesian Translocation"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/paraclesian_mutation_spells.json
msgid ""
"The actual spell that transports you when Paraclesians use translocation "
"spells.  It's a bug if you have it."
msgstr "元素の精の転移呪文の効果を実行する呪文です。通常は表示されません。"

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/paraclesian_mutations.json
msgid "Born of the Earth"
msgstr "大地の血脈"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Born of the Earth"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/paraclesian_mutations.json
msgid "A spirit of earth and stone."
msgstr "土と石の精霊です。"

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/paraclesian_mutations.json
msgid "Root and Branch"
msgstr "繁茂"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Root and Branch"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/paraclesian_mutations.json
msgid "A spirit of leaf and bark."
msgstr "葉と樹皮の精霊です。"

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/paraclesian_mutations.json
msgid "Touched by Fire"
msgstr "燃える心"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Touched by Fire"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/paraclesian_mutations.json
msgid "A spirit of fire."
msgstr "炎の精霊です。"

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/paraclesian_mutations.json
msgid "Rain and Wave"
msgstr "雨と波"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Rain and Wave"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/paraclesian_mutations.json
msgid "You are born of the deep waters."
msgstr "深い水底から生まれました。"

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/paraclesian_mutations.json
msgid "Child of Dolls"
msgstr "人形の子"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Child of Dolls"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/paraclesian_mutations.json
msgid "A spirit of the image of humans given life."
msgstr "命を与えられた人形の精霊です。"

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/paraclesian_mutations.json
msgid "Born of the Air"
msgstr "大気の嫡流"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Born of the Air"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/paraclesian_mutations.json
msgid "A spirit of air and wind."
msgstr "大気と風の精霊です。"

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/paraclesian_mutations.json
msgid "Fae Prowess"
msgstr "精霊の技量"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Fae Prowess"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/paraclesian_mutations.json
msgid ""
"You have gained a portion of the might of your fae ancestors.  +1 Strength "
"and Dexterity."
msgstr "古き精霊の力の一部を手に入れました。筋力と器用にそれぞれ+1のボーナスを得ます。"

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/paraclesian_mutations.json
msgid "Fae Puissance"
msgstr "精霊の強勢"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Fae Puissance"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/paraclesian_mutations.json
msgid ""
"You have gained the might of your fae ancestors.  +2 Strength and Dexterity."
msgstr "古き精霊の力を手に入れました。筋力と器用にそれぞれ+2のボーナスを得ます。"

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/paraclesian_mutations.json
msgid "Fae Discernment"
msgstr "精霊の才知"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Fae Discernment"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/paraclesian_mutations.json
msgid ""
"You have gained a portion of the wits of your fae ancestors.  +1 "
"Intelligence and Perception."
msgstr "古き精霊の知恵の一部を手に入れました。知性と感覚にそれぞれ+1のボーナスを得ます。"

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/paraclesian_mutations.json
msgid "Fae Acumen"
msgstr "精霊の明敏"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Fae Acumen"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/paraclesian_mutations.json
msgid ""
"You have gained the wits of your fae ancestors.  +2 Intelligence and "
"Perception."
msgstr "古き精霊の知恵を手に入れました。知性と感覚にそれぞれ+2のボーナスを得ます。"

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/paraclesian_mutations.json
msgid "Fae Sight"
msgstr "精霊の注視"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Fae Sight"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/paraclesian_mutations.json
msgid ""
"You can sense other nearby creatures from the Bright Lands.  Activate to "
"enable your fae senses.  It has a small chance to cost some of your mana "
"each turn it is in use."
msgstr "晴れの国の領域越しに周囲の様子を探ることができます。有効化することで機能します。使用する度に低確率でマナを消費します。"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Wyrd Sight"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/paraclesian_mutations.json
msgid ""
"You can sense other nearby creatures from the Bright Lands.  Activate to "
"enable your fae senses."
msgstr "晴れの国の領域越しに周囲の様子を探ることができます。有効化することで機能します。"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Cloud of Steam"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/paraclesian_mutations.json
msgid ""
"Upon gaining this ability the Sylph gains the ability to create a cloud of "
"damaging steam."
msgstr "有害な蒸気の雲を生み出すシルフの能力です。"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Cloud of Steam"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/paraclesian_mutations.json
msgid ""
"Upon gaining this ability the Undine gains the ability to create a cloud of "
"damaging steam."
msgstr "有害な蒸気の雲を生み出すウンディーネの能力です。"

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/paraclesian_mutations.json
msgid "Create Light"
msgstr "光の生成"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Create Light"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/paraclesian_mutations.json
msgid "Upon gaining this ability the Sylph gains the ability to create light."
msgstr "光を生み出すシルフの能力です。"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Create Light"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/paraclesian_mutations.json
msgid ""
"Upon gaining this ability the Salamander gains the ability to create light."
msgstr "光を生み出すサラマンダーの能力です。"

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/paraclesian_mutations.json
msgid "Born of the Elements"
msgstr "元素の血脈"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Born of the Elements"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/paraclesian_mutations.json
msgid ""
"Your connection to this world is deep and rewards you with additional mana."
msgstr "世界との深い繋がりをもっており、追加でマナを獲得します。"

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/paraclesian_mutations.json
msgid "Change with the Seasons"
msgstr "季節の移ろい"

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/paraclesian_mutations.json
msgid "Walking Ley Line"
msgstr "生きたレイライン"

#. ~ Description of mutation "The Wind Blows, the Willow Bends"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/paraclesian_mutations.json
msgid ""
"Upon gaining this ability, you gain the ability to enhance your dodge "
"capabilities."
msgstr "回避力を高めるシルフの能力です。"

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/paraclesian_mutations.json
msgid "Gossamer Artisan"
msgstr "薄衣服職人"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Gossamer Artisan"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/paraclesian_mutations.json
msgid ""
"Like your fae ancestors, you can turn gossamer into clothing and armor.  "
"Activate this trait to learn a gossamer recipe (once per week)."
msgstr "古の精霊のように薄衣で衣服や防具を作る方法を学びます。この特質を有効化すると、薄衣を使った製作レシピを習得できます(1週間に1回)。"

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/paraclesian_mutations.json
msgid "Gossamerwright"
msgstr "薄衣織り"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Gossamerwright"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/paraclesian_mutations.json
msgid ""
"Your manipulation of gossamer has advanced to the point where you can make "
"it yourself out of mundane cotton and moonlight."
msgstr "薄衣の扱いに長けており、ありふれた綿に月光を浴びせて薄布を作れるようになりました。"

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/paraclesian_mutations.json
msgid "Desire for Conversation"
msgstr "会話喚起"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Desire for Conversation"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/paraclesian_mutations.json
msgid ""
"The Dollkin casts this spell to force a conversation with anyone, once.  If "
"they've heard the Dollkin out and decided they wish not to speak again it "
"will not work."
msgstr ""
"人形族は、呪文を唱えることで一度だけどんな人間も会話したい気分にさせることができます。一度会話してその後の会話を拒否しようと決めた者に対しては通用しません。"

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/paraclesian_mutations.json
msgid "FINAL DISCUSSION"
msgstr "最後の会話"

#. ~ Description of mutation "FINAL DISCUSSION"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/paraclesian_mutations.json
msgid "This person won't speak with them again if this goes poorly."
msgstr "この人物とは今後二度と会話してもらえない可能性があります。"

#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_SALAMANDER_GOBLIN_FRUIT"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/salamander_eocs.json
msgid "You full a goblin fruit from the flames."
msgstr "炎の中からゴブリンフルーツを取り出しました。"

#. ~ Player message in false effect in EoC "EOC_SALAMANDER_GOBLIN_FRUIT"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/salamander_eocs.json
msgid ""
"You must have a nearby source of flames or heat to call forth a goblin "
"fruit."
msgstr "ゴブリンフルーツを生み出すには、周囲に炎か熱源が必要です。"

#. ~ Player message in false effect in EoC "EOC_SALAMANDER_FIRE_FLY"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/salamander_eocs.json
msgid "You must be standing in flames to cast Burning Ascension."
msgstr "バーニング・アセンションを詠唱するには炎の中にいる必要があります。"

#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_SALAMANDER_WATER_TO_BOOZE"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/salamander_eocs.json
msgid ""
"From the fiery depths of your spirit, knowledge of how to turn various other"
" water into strong alcohol fills your mind."
msgstr "自己の内に燃える炎の奥底から、様々な水を度数の高いアルコールに変える方法が浮かび上がりました。"

#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_SALAMANDER_WATER_TO_FUEL"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/salamander_eocs.json
msgid ""
"From the fiery depths of your spirit, knowledge of how to turn various other"
" water into lamp oil fills your mind."
msgstr "自己の内に燃える炎の奥底から、様々な水をランプオイルに変える方法が浮かび上がりました。"

#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_SALAMANDER_REBORN_IN_FLAMES"
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC
#. "EOC_SALAMANDER_REBORN_IN_FLAMES_COOLDOWN" in nested EOCs in false effect
#. in EoC "EOC_SALAMANDER_REBORN_IN_FLAMES"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/salamander_eocs.json
msgid ""
"As your body takes its final wound, your fae spirit drinks in the heat of "
"the flames and your flesh is renewed."
msgstr "肉体が致命傷を受けると精霊の魂は炎の熱を飲み込み、新たな肉体が生まれました。"

#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_SALAMANDER_GRANT_COOKING_HEAT"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/salamander_eocs.json
msgid "Your hands grow warm."
msgstr "両手が温まりました。"

#. ~ Player message in false effect in EoC "EOC_SALAMANDER_GRANT_COOKING_HEAT"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/salamander_eocs.json
msgid "The heat from your hands fades away."
msgstr "手が徐々に冷えてきました。"

#. ~ Player message in false effect in EoC "EOC_SALAMANDER_HEALTH_FOR_MANA"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/salamander_eocs.json
msgid "You have no need to restore your mana now!"
msgstr "今すぐマナを回復する必要はありません！"

#. ~ Player message in false effect in EoC "EOC_SALAMANDER_SMOKE_FORM_ASCEND"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/salamander_eocs.json
msgid "You must be in warm air to ascend!"
msgstr "上昇するには暖気の中にいる必要があります。"

#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC
#. "EOC_SALAMANDER_SMOKE_FORM_ASCEND_OUTSIDE_CHECK"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/salamander_eocs.json
msgid "You soar upward on the rising smoke."
msgstr "立ち昇る煙に乗って空高く舞い上がりました。"

#. ~ Player message in false effect in EoC
#. "EOC_SALAMANDER_SMOKE_FORM_ASCEND_OUTSIDE_CHECK"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/salamander_eocs.json
msgid "The ceiling above blocks your attempt to rise!"
msgstr "天井に妨げられていて上昇できません！"

#. ~ Player message in false effect in EoC "EOC_SALAMANDER_BERSERK_STANCE_ON"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/salamander_eocs.json
msgid "You are already under the effects of Wildfire Soul!"
msgstr "既に燃え盛る魂の効果を受けています！"

#. ~ Spell name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/salamander_mutation_spells.json
msgid "Salamander AoE Explosion"
msgstr "サラマンダー範囲爆発"

#. ~ Description of spell "Salamander AoE Explosion"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/salamander_mutation_spells.json
msgid ""
"This is the AoE used by some other Salamander spells.  It's a bug if you "
"have it directly."
msgstr "その他のサラマンダーの呪文で使用される範囲効果です。通常は表示されません。"

#. ~ Spell name
#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/salamander_mutation_spells.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/salamander_mutations.json
msgid "Enkindle"
msgstr "ｴﾝｷﾝﾄﾞﾙ"

#. ~ Description of spell "Enkindle"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/salamander_mutation_spells.json
msgid ""
"Born from fire, it is easy for a Salamander to bring forth that fire and set"
" something alight."
msgstr "火から生まれたサラマンダーは、火を生み出して簡単に着火することができます。"

#. ~ Spell name
#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/salamander_mutation_spells.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/salamander_mutations.json
msgid "Blazing Blow"
msgstr "ﾌﾞﾚｲｼﾞﾝｸﾞ･ﾌﾞﾛｳ"

#. ~ Description of spell "Blazing Blow"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/salamander_mutation_spells.json
msgid ""
"Wreathe your fist in flames and punch a single target, causing fire damage "
"and knocking them backward."
msgstr "拳を炎で包み込んで単一の標的を殴り、火炎ダメージを与えて後方に吹き飛ばします。"

#. ~ Spell name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/salamander_mutation_spells.json
msgid "Blazing Blow Push"
msgstr "ﾌﾞﾚｲｼﾞﾝｸﾞ･ﾌﾞﾛｳ押出"

#. ~ Description of spell "Blazing Blow Push"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/salamander_mutation_spells.json
msgid ""
"This is the push effect of the Blazing Blow spell.  It's a bug if you have "
"it directly."
msgstr "ブレイジング・ブロウの押し出し効果です。通常は表示されません。"

#. ~ Spell name
#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/salamander_mutation_spells.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/salamander_mutations.json
msgid "A Hundred Tongues of Flame"
msgstr "ｱ･ﾊﾝﾄﾞﾚｯﾄﾞ･ﾀﾝｸﾞｽ･ｵﾌﾞ･ﾌﾚｲﾑ"

#. ~ Description of spell "A Hundred Tongues of Flame"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/salamander_mutation_spells.json
msgid "Summon a flaming whip to scourge your enemies."
msgstr "炎の鞭を召喚して敵を攻撃します。"

#. ~ Spell name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/salamander_mutation_spells.json
msgid "In a Cloud of Smoke"
msgstr "ｲﾝ･ｱ･ｸﾗｳﾄﾞ･ｵﾌﾞ･ｽﾓｰｸ"

#. ~ Description of spell "In a Cloud of Smoke"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/salamander_mutation_spells.json
msgid ""
"Like fire leaping over a firebreak, you can vanish and reappear somewhere "
"nearby, leaving a thick cloud of smoke in your former location."
msgstr "防火帯を越えて延焼する炎のように、その場から消失して付近のどこかに再び現れ、元いた地点には厚い煙が残ります。"

#. ~ Spell name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/salamander_mutation_spells.json
msgid "In a Cloud of Smoke Immunity"
msgstr "ｲﾝ･ｱ･ｸﾗｳﾄﾞ･ｵﾌﾞ･ｽﾓｰｸ煙耐性"

#. ~ Description of spell "In a Cloud of Smoke Immunity"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/salamander_mutation_spells.json
msgid ""
"Makes the Salamander immune to smoke so they won't inhale tons of smoke when"
" teleporting.  It's a bug if you have it directly."
msgstr "瞬間移動時に大量の煙を吸い込まないように、サラマンダーに煙への耐性を付与します。通常は表示されません。"

#. ~ Spell name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/salamander_mutation_spells.json
msgid "In a Cloud of Smoke Emit"
msgstr "ｲﾝ･ｱ･ｸﾗｳﾄﾞ･ｵﾌﾞ･ｽﾓｰｸ煙発生"

#. ~ Description of spell "In a Cloud of Smoke Emit"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/salamander_mutation_spells.json
msgid ""
"Releases the smoke from casting In a Puff of Smoke.  It's a bug if you have "
"it directly."
msgstr "イン・ア・クラウド・オブ・スモークの詠唱時に煙を発生させます。通常は表示されません。"

#. ~ Spell name
#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/salamander_mutation_spells.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/salamander_mutations.json
msgid "Burning Away Your Impurities"
msgstr "ﾊﾞｰﾆﾝｸﾞ･ｱｳｪｲ･ﾕｱ･ｲﾝﾋﾟｭﾘﾃｨｽﾞ"

#. ~ Description of spell "Burning Away Your Impurities"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/salamander_mutation_spells.json
msgid ""
"As fire burns dead wood, you can burn away poison or sickness in your "
"target.  However, just as fire is dangerous to touch, it damages the target "
"as well."
msgstr "標的の毒や病気を、火が枯れ木を燃やすように焼き尽くします。火は肉体をも害すため、標的はダメージを受けます。"

#. ~ Spell name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/salamander_mutation_spells.json
msgid "The Fire in the Marrow"
msgstr "ｻﾞ･ﾌｧｲｱ･ｲﾝ･ｻﾞ･ﾏﾛｰ"

#. ~ Description of spell "The Fire in the Marrow"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/salamander_mutation_spells.json
msgid ""
"Kindle a flame within the target, slowly burning them from the inside.  This"
" spell does damage only slowly, but there is little defense against being "
"burned from the inside out."
msgstr ""
"標的の体内に炎を生み出し、内側からゆっくりと炎上させます。少しずつしかダメージを与えられませんが、体内から燃やすため標的の防御力はほとんど意味を成しません。"

#. ~ Spell name
#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/salamander_mutation_spells.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/salamander_mutations.json
msgid "Fanning the Spark"
msgstr "ﾌｧﾆﾝｸﾞ･ｻﾞ･ｽﾊﾟｰｸ"

#. ~ Description of spell "Fanning the Spark"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/salamander_mutation_spells.json
msgid "You can infuse yourself or an ally with the blazing speed of fire."
msgstr "自分自身または仲間に燃え盛る加速の力を与えます。"

#. ~ Spell name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/salamander_mutation_spells.json
msgid "Stoking the Inner Furnace"
msgstr "ｽﾄｰｷﾝｸﾞ･ｼﾞ･ｲﾝﾅｰ･ﾌｧｰﾈｽ"

#. ~ Description of spell "Stoking the Inner Furnace"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/salamander_mutation_spells.json
msgid "Like a bonfire, you can throw off large quantities of heat."
msgstr "焚き火のように大量の熱を放出します。"

#. ~ Spell name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/salamander_mutation_spells.json
msgid "Calling the Children of the Inferno"
msgstr "ｺｰﾘﾝｸﾞ･ｻﾞ･ﾁﾙﾄﾞﾚﾝ･ｵﾌﾞ･ｼﾞ･ｲﾝﾌｪﾙﾉ"

#. ~ Description of spell "Calling the Children of the Inferno"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/salamander_mutation_spells.json
msgid "A lesser fire spirit is summoned to support you."
msgstr "あまり強くない友好的な火の精を召喚します。"

#. ~ Spell name
#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/salamander_mutation_spells.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/salamander_mutations.json
msgid "Flame of the Firebird"
msgstr "ﾌﾚｲﾑ･ｵﾌﾞ･ｻﾞ･ﾌｧｲｱﾊﾞｰﾄﾞ"

#. ~ Description of spell "Flame of the Firebird"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/salamander_mutation_spells.json
msgid ""
"Summon a delicate bird made of pure flame.  The bird will last only a few "
"moments, but if it sees an enemy it will eagerly dive upon them and erupt "
"into a fireball."
msgstr "純粋な炎で作られた優美な鳥を召喚します。鳥はほんの数秒しか生きられませんが、敵を見つけると勢いよく襲い掛かり爆発に巻き込みます。"

#. ~ Spell name
#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/salamander_mutation_spells.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/salamander_mutations.json
msgid "Breath of the Firedragon"
msgstr "ﾌﾞﾚｽ･ｵﾌﾞ･ｻﾞ･ﾌｧｲｱﾄﾞﾗｺﾞﾝ"

#. ~ Description of spell "Breath of the Firedragon"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/salamander_mutation_spells.json
msgid ""
"Like the legendary dragon, you can spray fire in a cone in front of you."
msgstr "伝説のドラゴンのように、前方に円錐形に火を噴きます。"

#. ~ Spell name
#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/salamander_mutation_spells.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/salamander_mutations.json
msgid "Fiery Charge"
msgstr "ﾌｧｲｱﾘｰ･ﾁｬｰｼﾞ"

#. ~ Description of spell "Fiery Charge"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/salamander_mutation_spells.json
msgid ""
"Hurl yourself forward in a burst of speed, causing an explosion at your "
"arrive point."
msgstr "猛スピードで前方に突っ込み、到達地点に爆発を引き起こします。"

#. ~ Spell name
#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/salamander_mutation_spells.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/salamander_mutations.json
msgid "Sigil of Detonation"
msgstr "ｼｼﾞﾙ･ｵﾌﾞ･ﾃﾞﾄﾈｰｼｮﾝ"

#. ~ Description of spell "Sigil of Detonation"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/salamander_mutation_spells.json
msgid ""
"Place a magical rune on a the ground that will explode when stepped on."
msgstr "踏むと爆発する魔法の印章を設置します。"

#. ~ Spell name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/salamander_mutation_spells.json
msgid "Salamander Trap Explosion"
msgstr "サラマンダー罠爆発"

#. ~ Description of spell "Salamander Trap Explosion"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/salamander_mutation_spells.json
msgid ""
"This is the AoE used by Sigil of Detonation.  It's a bug if you have it "
"directly."
msgstr "シジル・オブ・デトネーションの呪文で使用される範囲効果です。通常は表示されません。"

#. ~ Description of spell "Cultivate Goblin Fruit"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/salamander_mutation_spells.json
msgid ""
"You may spin a bit of fae magick into the flames, bringing forth a goblin "
"fruit.  Goblin fruit have a variety of effects, never predictable but always"
" at least somewhat beneficial.  This spell may only be cast outdoors in "
"natural surroundings."
msgstr ""
"炎に精霊の魔法を掛けることで、ゴブリンフルーツを生み出します。ゴブリンフルーツには様々な効果があり、予測は不可能ですが、少なくともある程度の有益な効果は期待できます。この呪文は屋外の自然環境下でのみ詠唱できます。"

#. ~ Spell name
#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/salamander_mutation_spells.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/salamander_mutations.json
msgid "Burning Ascension"
msgstr "ﾊﾞｰﾆﾝｸﾞ･ｱｾﾝｼｮﾝ"

#. ~ Description of spell "Burning Ascension"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/salamander_mutation_spells.json
msgid ""
"Like the rising heat of fire, you can ascend into the air and walk with the "
"smoke for a short time before falling safely back to the earth."
msgstr "上昇気流のように空中に昇って煙と共に短時間浮遊し、その後安全に地上に戻ります。"

#. ~ Spell name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/salamander_mutation_spells.json
msgid "Burning Ascension Real"
msgstr "ﾊﾞｰﾆﾝｸﾞ･ｱｾﾝｼｮﾝ効果"

#. ~ Description of spell "Burning Ascension Real"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/salamander_mutation_spells.json
msgid ""
"The actual spell that causes the burning ascension.  It's a bug if you have "
"it."
msgstr "バーニング・アセンションの効果を実行する呪文です。通常は表示されません。"

#. ~ Spell name
#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/salamander_mutation_spells.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/salamander_mutations.json
msgid "Anointed with Incandescence"
msgstr "ｱﾉｲﾝﾃｯﾄﾞ･ｳｨｽﾞ･ｲﾝｶﾝﾃﾞｾﾝｽ"

#. ~ Description of spell "Anointed with Incandescence"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/salamander_mutation_spells.json
msgid ""
"You draw on your own fiery nature and infuse a portion of it into an ally, "
"rendering them immune to warm temperatures and fire."
msgstr "自分自身の炎の力の一部を仲間に注ぎ、高温や火の影響を受けない状態にします。"

#. ~ Spell name
#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/salamander_mutation_spells.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/salamander_mutations.json
msgid "The Phoenix's Last Cry"
msgstr "ｻﾞ･ﾌｪﾆｯｸｽｽﾞ･ﾗｽﾄ･ｸﾗｲ"

#. ~ Description of spell "The Phoenix's Last Cry"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/salamander_mutation_spells.json
msgid ""
"Like the rebirth of the legendary phoenix, you explode into flames, causing "
"fire to engulf the entire nearby area.  You will heal faster for six hours "
"after casting this spell."
msgstr "伝説の不死鳥の蘇りのように、爆発して炎に包まれ、周囲一帯を焼き尽くします。この呪文を詠唱してから6時間は回復速度が上昇します。"

#. ~ Spell name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/salamander_mutation_spells.json
msgid "The Phoenix's Last Cry Healing Effect"
msgstr "ｻﾞ･ﾌｪﾆｯｸｽｽﾞ･ﾗｽﾄ･ｸﾗｲ回復効果"

#. ~ Description of spell "The Phoenix's Last Cry Healing Effect"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/salamander_mutation_spells.json
msgid ""
"The healing effect of The Phoenix's Last Cry.  It's a bug if you have it "
"directly."
msgstr "コーズ・ロットの回復呪文です。通常は表示されません。"

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/salamander_mutations.json
msgid "Salamander Skin"
msgstr "サラマンダーの皮膚"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Salamander Skin"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/salamander_mutations.json
msgid ""
"Your skin has turned the color of an autumnal bonfire.  Your skin is now an "
"orange red with dark freckles.  This has no gameplay effects."
msgstr "皮膚が秋の焚き火の色に変わりました。赤に近いオレンジ色の皮膚で、濃いそばかすがあります。特に何の効果もありません。"

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/salamander_mutations.json
msgid "Burning Coals Skin"
msgstr "燃える石炭の皮膚"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Burning Coals Skin"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/salamander_mutations.json
msgid ""
"Your skin has magickal flames flaring out of it on occasion.  You can "
"operate in warmer climates than normal humans but begin to take damage from "
"getting wet."
msgstr "肌から時折魔法の炎が燃え上がります。通常の人間よりも高温環境に耐性がありますが、水に濡れるとダメージを受けます。"

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/salamander_mutations.json
msgid "Flame Skin"
msgstr "火炎の皮膚"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Enkindle"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/salamander_mutations.json
msgid ""
"Upon gaining this ability the Salamander gains the ability to set something "
"nearby on fire."
msgstr "付近のものに着火するサラマンダーの能力です。"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Fiery Charge"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/salamander_mutations.json
msgid ""
"Upon gaining this ability the Salamander gains the ability to rush forward "
"and cause an explosion at the place they land."
msgstr "前方に突進して到達地点で爆発を引き起こすサラマンダーの能力です。"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Sigil of Detonation"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/salamander_mutations.json
msgid ""
"Upon gaining this ability the Salamander gains the ability to lay a fiery "
"trap which will burst into searing flames when stepped on."
msgstr "炎を噴出して踏んだ者を焼き尽くす罠を仕掛けるサラマンダーの能力です。"

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/salamander_mutations.json
msgid "In a Puff of Smoke"
msgstr "煙滅"

#. ~ Description of mutation "In a Puff of Smoke"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/salamander_mutations.json
msgid ""
"Upon gaining this ability the Salamander gains the ability to vanish in a "
"burst of smoke and reappear somewhere nearby."
msgstr "煙の爆発を引き起こして消え、付近のどこかに出現するサラマンダーの能力です。"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Blazing Blow"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/salamander_mutations.json
msgid ""
"Upon gaining this ability the Salamander gains the ability to punch a target"
" with a fiery fist, causing damage and hurling them back."
msgstr "燃える拳で標的を殴り、ダメージを与えて吹き飛ばすサラマンダーの能力です。"

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/salamander_mutations.json
msgid "Summon Fire Spirit"
msgstr "ｻﾓﾝ･ﾌｧｲｱ･ｽﾋﾟﾘｯﾄ"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Summon Fire Spirit"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/salamander_mutations.json
msgid ""
"Upon gaining this ability the Salamander gains the ability to summon a fire "
"spirit."
msgstr "火炎の精を召喚するサラマンダーの能力です。"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Breath of the Firedragon"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/salamander_mutations.json
msgid ""
"Upon gaining this ability the Salamander gains the ability to breathe a cone"
" of flames."
msgstr "円錐形に炎を吐くサラマンダーの能力です。"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Flame of the Firebird"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/salamander_mutations.json
msgid ""
"Upon gaining this ability the Salamander gains the ability to summon a bird "
"made of roaring flames to their aid."
msgstr "燃え盛る炎でできた鳥を召喚して敵と戦わせるサラマンダーの能力です。"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Fanning the Spark"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/salamander_mutations.json
msgid ""
"Upon gaining this ability the Salamander gains the ability to increase their"
" own or an ally's speed."
msgstr "自分自身または仲間の速度を上昇させるサラマンダーの能力です。"

#. ~ Description of mutation "A Hundred Tongues of Flame"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/salamander_mutations.json
msgid ""
"Upon gaining this ability the Salamander gains the ability to summon a "
"flaming whip to aid them in battle."
msgstr "戦闘の助けになる炎の鞭を召喚するサラマンダーの能力です。"

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/salamander_mutations.json
msgid "Stoking the Inner Fire"
msgstr "内なる炎の燃焼"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Stoking the Inner Fire"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/salamander_mutations.json
msgid ""
"Upon gaining this ability the Salamander gains the ability to emit large "
"quantities of heat."
msgstr "大量の熱を放出するサラマンダーの能力です。"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Burning Away Your Impurities"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/salamander_mutations.json
msgid ""
"Upon gaining this ability the Salamander gains the ability to cure "
"deleterious conditions at the cost of damage."
msgstr "体力を消費して状態異常を治療するサラマンダーの能力です。"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Cultivate Goblin Fruit"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/salamander_mutations.json
msgid ""
"Upon gaining this ability the Salamander gains the ability to pluck a goblin"
" fruit from the flames."
msgstr "炎からゴブリンフルーツを生み出すサラマンダーの能力です。"

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/salamander_mutations.json
msgid "Burning Water"
msgstr "燃える水"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Burning Water"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/salamander_mutations.json
msgid ""
"Upon gaining this ability the Salamander learns how to convert water into "
"very strong alcohol."
msgstr "水を度数の高いアルコールに変換するサラマンダーの能力です。"

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/salamander_mutations.json
msgid "Fire From Water"
msgstr "水中の火"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Fire From Water"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/salamander_mutations.json
msgid ""
"Upon gaining this ability the Salamander learn how to convert water directly"
" into fuel.  This is an intensely draining activity."
msgstr "水を燃料に変換するサラマンダーの能力です。実行すると肉体が著しく消耗します。"

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/salamander_mutations.json
msgid "Salamander Eyes"
msgstr "サラマンダーの目"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Salamander Eyes"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/salamander_mutations.json
msgid ""
"Upon gaining this ability the Salamander's eyes begin reflecting their mood,"
" with warm yellows and deep reds when happy and blazing oranges, blues, and "
"whites when angry.  Glare no longer impacts them and they can always see "
"exactly what temperature it is."
msgstr ""
"サラマンダーの瞳は気分によって変化し、幸せなときは暖かい黄色や深い赤色、怒っているときは燃えるようなオレンジ色や青色、白色になります。日光の眩しさの影響を受けず、いつでも正確に気温を感知できます。"

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/salamander_mutations.json
msgid "Heat Sight"
msgstr "熱源視"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Heat Sight"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/salamander_mutations.json
msgid ""
"With their new eyes, the Salamander can see heat and pick out others in "
"darkness."
msgstr "熱を感知し、暗闇に紛れている者も発見できます。"

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/salamander_mutations.json
msgid "Reading the Heartfires"
msgstr "心熱感知"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Reading the Heartfires"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/salamander_mutations.json
msgid ""
"The Salamander's ability to see heat has sharpened greatly, and they can "
"pick out subtle change in a person's skin caused by blood flow.  This makes "
"persuasion and lying easier."
msgstr "熱源視の能力が非常に鋭くなり、血流によって引き起こされる皮膚温度の微妙な変化も感知できるようになりました。説得や嘘が成功しやすくなります。"

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/salamander_mutations.json
msgid "Salamander Ears"
msgstr "サラマンダーの耳"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Salamander Ears"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/salamander_mutations.json
msgid ""
"The Salamander's ears narrow to a point, like tongues of leaping flame.  "
"While distinctive, this has no gameplay effects."
msgstr "舞い踊る炎のように先細った耳が生えています。目立ちますが、特に何の効果もありません。"

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/salamander_mutations.json
msgid "Heat Quickens the Blood"
msgstr "烈火"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Heat Quickens the Blood"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/salamander_mutations.json
msgid ""
"The Salamander gains strength from heat and becomes faster in hot weather.  "
"However, cold weather produces a corresponding slowing effect."
msgstr "サラマンダーは熱によって力を得るため、暑い気候ではより素早く動けます。しかし、寒い気候では逆に速度が低下します。"

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/salamander_mutations.json
msgid "Heat Fuels the Flames"
msgstr "熱血"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Heat Fuels the Flames"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/salamander_mutations.json
msgid ""
"The Salamander gains strength from heat and becomes faster and heals much "
"quicker in hot weather.  However, cold weather produces a corresponding "
"slowing effect."
msgstr "サラマンダーは熱によって力を得るため、暑い気候では回復速度が上昇します。しかし、寒い気候では逆に回復速度が低下します。"

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/salamander_mutations.json
msgid "Incandescent Artisan's Alacrity"
msgstr "熱情の工匠"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Incandescent Artisan's Alacrity"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/salamander_mutations.json
msgid ""
"As fae spirits of fire, Salamanders also partake of the heat of the forge "
"and the glow of white-hot iron.  Your crafting speed will increase while "
"standing in fire or hot air."
msgstr "炎の精霊であるサラマンダーは鍛冶場の熱と鉄の輝きを好みます。炎や熱風がある地形にいると製作速度が上昇します。"

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/salamander_mutations.json
msgid "Searing Footsteps"
msgstr "焼けつく足跡"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Searing Footsteps"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/salamander_mutations.json
msgid ""
"The Salamander can enhance their inner fire to the point where they leave "
"fiery footprints everywhere they travel.  Activate this trait to leave a "
"trail of fire in your wake at the cost of mana for every footstep."
msgstr "内なる炎を強化し、移動した経路に焼けつく足跡を残します。この特質を有効化すると、一歩毎にマナを消費し、移動経路に火を発生させます。"

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/salamander_mutations.json
msgid "Within the Firelight"
msgstr "ともし火"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Within the Firelight"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/salamander_mutations.json
msgid ""
"As a distant fire reveals that which is nearby, the Salamander can see what "
"surrounds their kin.  The Salamander may see through the eyes of any "
"creatures they summon."
msgstr "遠くの火が周囲を照らすように、サラマンダーは同族の周囲にあるものを感知します。召喚したモンスターの視界を共有することができます。"

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/salamander_mutations.json
msgid "Adding Wood to the Campfire"
msgstr "焚き付け"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Adding Wood to the Campfire"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/salamander_mutations.json
msgid ""
"Fires require fuel, and so does the Salamander.  This trait allows them to "
"eat twice as much at once."
msgstr "火には燃料が不可欠であり、それはサラマンダーも変わりません。通常の2倍の量の食べ物を摂取できます。"

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/salamander_mutations.json
msgid "Fueling the Hungry Oven"
msgstr "無限の炉"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Fueling the Hungry Oven"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/salamander_mutations.json
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Like a coal furnace, the Salamander devours food to keep functioning.  They "
"may eat three times as much at once and eat food 50% faster."
msgstr ""
"サラマンダーは力を維持するため、まるで石炭炉のように食べ物を貪ります。通常の3倍の量の食べ物を摂取することができ、摂取速度も50%上昇します。"

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/salamander_mutations.json
msgid "Burning New Wood"
msgstr "犠牲の炎"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Burning New Wood"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/salamander_mutations.json
msgid ""
"In times of extreme need, the Salamander can can fuel their powers with "
"their own body.  Activate this to restore mana at the cost of health."
msgstr "いざというとき、サラマンダーは自らの肉体を燃料に変えることもできます。有効化すると、体力を消費してマナを回復します。"

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/salamander_mutations.json
msgid "The Campfire Stands Watch"
msgstr "焚火の番"

#. ~ Description of mutation "The Campfire Stands Watch"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/salamander_mutations.json
msgid ""
"The Salamander needs less sleep than a human.  However, they will also need "
"to eat slightly more."
msgstr "サラマンダーは睡眠時間が一般的な人間より短くなりますが、その代わりに食べ物を少し多めに摂取する必要があります。"

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/salamander_mutations.json
msgid "The Bonfire Blazes Until the Revelers Have Gone"
msgstr "篝火の番"

#. ~ Description of mutation "The Bonfire Blazes Until the Revelers Have Gone"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/salamander_mutations.json
msgid ""
"The Salamander needs much less sleep than a human.  However, they will also "
"need to eat significantly more."
msgstr "サラマンダーは睡眠時間が一般的な人間より遥かに短くなりますが、その代わりに食べ物をかなり多く摂取する必要があります。"

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/salamander_mutations.json
msgid "The Watchfire Burns Throughout the Night"
msgstr "炬火の番"

#. ~ Description of mutation "The Watchfire Burns Throughout the Night"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/salamander_mutations.json
msgid ""
"Like a blazing signal fire, a Salamander never stops shining.  They never "
"need to sleep if they do not want to, and when they do, they need much less "
"sleep than normal.  However, they require twice as much food as a human."
msgstr ""
"サラマンダーは燃え盛る篝火のように輝き続けます。寝たくなければ寝る必要もなく、たとえ眠ったとしても、必要な睡眠時間は通常より遥かに短くなります。その代わり、通常の人間の2倍の量の食べ物を摂取する必要があります。"

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/salamander_mutations.json
msgid "The Inner Fire Cannot Be Quenched"
msgstr "内なる種火"

#. ~ Description of mutation "The Inner Fire Cannot Be Quenched"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/salamander_mutations.json
msgid ""
"Accursed water.  Its touch dampens your flames, and you will no longer have "
"anything to do with it.  You do not need to drink."
msgstr "水は忌まわしいものです。水に触れると炎が弱まるため、飲み物を摂取する必要がなくなります。"

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/salamander_mutations.json
msgid "Breathing in Cinders"
msgstr "灰中の息遣い"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Breathing in Cinders"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/salamander_mutations.json
msgid ""
"Smoke is the breath of fire and a Salamander is born of flames.  You suffer "
"no negative effects from smoke inhalation."
msgstr "煙は炎の息吹であり、サラマンダーは炎から生まれます。煙を吸入しても悪影響を受けません。"

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/salamander_mutations.json
msgid "Strength of the Crackling Fire"
msgstr "火の粉の力"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Strength of the Crackling Fire"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/salamander_mutations.json
msgid ""
"Like a fire fueled with fresh wood, you have increased strength.  +1 "
"Strength."
msgstr "新鮮な木にも燃え移る火のように、肉体が強くなります。筋力+1"

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/salamander_mutations.json
msgid "Strength of the Blazing Bonfire"
msgstr "大火の力"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Strength of the Blazing Bonfire"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/salamander_mutations.json
msgid ""
"Like the bonfire that will burn through the night, you have greatly "
"increased strength.  +3 Strength."
msgstr "夜通し燃え続ける篝火のように、肉体が大幅に強くなります。筋力+3"

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/salamander_mutations.json
msgid "Fiery Speed"
msgstr "猛火の勢い"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Fiery Speed"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/salamander_mutations.json
msgid ""
"Like a fire sparks kindling in flame, you have increased speed.  +2 "
"Dexterity."
msgstr "火の粉が一瞬で引火し燃え上がるように素早くなります。器用+2"

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/salamander_mutations.json
msgid "Blazing Speed"
msgstr "劫火の勢い"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Blazing Speed"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/salamander_mutations.json
msgid ""
"Like a forest fire moving faster than a running horse, you have greatly "
"increased speed.  +5 Dexterity."
msgstr "走るウマよりも速く燃え広がる森林火災のように、大幅に素早くなります。器用+5"

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/salamander_mutations.json
msgid "Outracing the Prairie Fire"
msgstr "燎原の火"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Outracing the Prairie Fire"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/salamander_mutations.json
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The Salamander can move even faster than a racing prairie fire.  -10% move "
"and attack speed."
msgstr "燃え広がる草原よりも速く移動できます。移動コストと攻撃コストが10%軽減されます。"

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/salamander_mutations.json
msgid "Sparking Thoughts"
msgstr "閃く頭脳"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Sparking Thoughts"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/salamander_mutations.json
msgid "Your thoughts are as fast as a forest fire.  +2 Intelligence."
msgstr "森林火災に負けないほど速い思考速度を得ています。知性+2"

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/salamander_mutations.json
msgid "Effortlessly-Rising Smoke"
msgstr "すり抜ける煙"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Effortlessly-Rising Smoke"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/salamander_mutations.json
msgid ""
"Like smoke rising to the sky, the Salamander cannot be kept down.  This "
"trait may be activated to immediately clear the Stunned, Dazed, or Downed "
"effects."
msgstr "空に立ち上る煙のように、サラマンダーは捉えどころがありません。この特質を有効化すると朦朧、放心、転倒の影響をすぐに解除できます。"

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/salamander_mutations.json
msgid "Stove's Caress"
msgstr "加熱の掌"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Stove's Caress"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/salamander_mutations.json
msgid ""
"Instead of simply causing a burst of heat, the Salamander can emit heat from"
" their hands at will, allowing them to use it to cook."
msgstr "サラマンダーは単に熱を爆発させるだけでなく、手から放出する熱を自在に調節し、調理をすることもできます。"

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/salamander_mutations.json
msgid "Inured to Flame"
msgstr "快適な火中"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Inured to Flame"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/salamander_mutations.json
msgid ""
"A creature born and bred of fire, the Salamander is utterly immune to heat "
"and flame of any kind.  However, they will take additional damage from cold."
msgstr "火の中で生まれ育つサラマンダーは、あらゆる熱や炎に対し完全耐性を持っています。ただし、冷気を浴びるとダメージを受けます。"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Burning Ascension"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/salamander_mutations.json
msgid ""
"Upon gaining this ability the Salamander gains the ability to hurl "
"themselves skyward while standing in a fire."
msgstr "火の中にいる状態で空に飛び上がるサラマンダーの能力です。"

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/salamander_mutations.json
msgid "Mana Bonfire"
msgstr "マナの篝火"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Mana Bonfire"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/salamander_mutations.json
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The Salamander is a font of mana, like a well-fueled bonfire.  25% extra "
"mana."
msgstr "薪がくべられた火のように、マナが十分に溜まっています。マナの量が25%増加します。"

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/salamander_mutations.json
msgid "Crackling Mana Bonfire"
msgstr "マナの劫火"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Crackling Mana Bonfire"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/salamander_mutations.json
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The Salamander's mana surges within them, ready to burst out at the slightly"
" opportunity.  25% extra mana and -15% spell casting speed."
msgstr "サラマンダーのマナは体内で急増し、勢いよく燃え上がるのを待っています。マナの量が25%増加し、呪文詠唱時間が15%軽減されます。"

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/salamander_mutations.json
msgid "On Wings of Flame"
msgstr "炎の翼"

#. ~ Description of mutation "On Wings of Flame"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/salamander_mutations.json
msgid ""
"With an act of will, you can extend wings of flame from your back.  These "
"aetherial wings are not hindered by clothing or armor, but also do not have "
"enough substance to allow you to fly.  However, they can break a fall or be "
"used in combat."
msgstr ""
"念じるだけで背中から炎の翼が広がります。霊的な翼であるため衣服や防具によって妨げられることはありませんが、飛行が可能なほどの質量もありません。落下ダメージを無効化し、戦闘で武器としても使えます。"

#. ~ Message when transforming from mutation  "On Wings of Flame" to
#. "SALAMANDER_SUMMON_WINGS_ON"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/salamander_mutations.json
msgid "Flaming wings extend from your back!"
msgstr "背中から炎の翼が広がりました！"

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/salamander_mutations.json
msgid "On Wings of Flame (active)"
msgstr "炎の翼(起動)"

#. ~ Description of mutation "On Wings of Flame (active)"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/salamander_mutations.json
msgid ""
"You are extending wings of aetherial flame from your back.  You can attack "
"enemies with them and will not take damage from falls."
msgstr "背中から霊的な炎の翼が生えています。敵の攻撃に使うことができ、落下ダメージを無効化します。"

#. ~ Message when player with mutation "On Wings of Flame (active)" attacks
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/salamander_mutations.json
#, c-format
msgid "You buffet %s with your fiery wings!"
msgstr "燃える翼で%sを打ちのめしました！"

#. ~ Message when NPC with mutation "On Wings of Flame (active)" attacks
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/salamander_mutations.json
#, c-format
msgid "%1$s buffets %2$s with their fiery wings!"
msgstr "%1$sは燃える翼で%2$sを打ちのめしました！"

#. ~ Message when transforming from mutation  "On Wings of Flame (active)" to
#. "SALAMANDER_SUMMON_WINGS"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/salamander_mutations.json
msgid "The wings on your back gutter and die."
msgstr "背中の翼が萎み、消えました。"

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/salamander_mutations.json
msgid "In Flames, Reborn Like the Phoenix"
msgstr "不死鳥の再誕"

#. ~ Description of mutation "In Flames, Reborn Like the Phoenix"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/salamander_mutations.json
msgid ""
"Like the bird of legend, the Salamander can recreate themselves from the "
"heat and smoke of a fire.  If their body takes fatal damage while standing "
"in a fire, their fae spirit will use those flames to renew themselves.  This"
" can generally occur no more often than once every 14 days, though there is "
"a small chance it can occur more often."
msgstr ""
"サラマンダーは伝説の不死鳥のように熱い炎と煙に包まれて肉体を再生することができます。火の中にいる状態で致命的なダメージを受けると、魂が炎を取り込んで肉体を再生します。通常は14日に1回しか再生は成功しませんが、ごく稀にそれ以上の頻度で再生が成功することもあります。"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Anointed with Incandescence"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/salamander_mutations.json
msgid ""
"Upon gaining this ability the Salamander gains the ability to make an ally "
"immune to heat and flame."
msgstr "熱と炎への耐性を仲間に与えるサラマンダーの能力です。"

#. ~ Description of mutation "The Phoenix's Last Cry"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/salamander_mutations.json
msgid ""
"Upon gaining this ability the Salamander gains the ability create a massive "
"explosion of flames around themselves and draw on its energy to increase "
"their healing rate."
msgstr "周囲に大規模な炎の爆発を引き起こし、そのエネルギーを利用して回復力を高めるサラマンダーの能力です。"

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/salamander_mutations.json
msgid "Form of Billowing Smoke"
msgstr "煙形態"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Form of Billowing Smoke"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/salamander_mutations.json
msgid ""
"The Salamander may transform into smoke.  They will have only a dim "
"awareness of their surroundings, but can freely move including through the "
"air and will be nearly immune to attack.  They will be unable to attack "
"anyone else themselves, however."
msgstr ""
"サラマンダーは煙に変化することができます。周囲の状況はぼんやりとしか認識できませんが、空中も含めて自由に移動でき、大抵の攻撃は無効化されます。ただし、こちらから敵を攻撃することもできません。"

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/salamander_mutations.json
msgid "Form of Billowing Smoke Appearance"
msgstr "煙形態表示"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Form of Billowing Smoke Appearance"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/salamander_mutations.json
msgid ""
"This mutation carries the sprite override info for Form of Billowing Smoke."
"  You shouldn't be able to see it in game."
msgstr "煙化の変異によって表示されるグラフィックが変わります。この変異は通常は表示されません。"

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/salamander_mutations.json
msgid "Smoke Form Ascension"
msgstr "煙形態上昇"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Smoke Form Ascension"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/salamander_mutations.json
msgid "While in hot air or a fire, you may ascend upwards"
msgstr "熱気や火の中にいる状態で上層に昇れます。"

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/salamander_mutations.json
msgid "In No Other Fire Shall I Burn"
msgstr "焼けずの炎"

#. ~ Description of mutation "In No Other Fire Shall I Burn"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/salamander_mutations.json
msgid "The Salamander is completely immune to radiation."
msgstr "サラマンダーは放射線に完全耐性を持っています。"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Wildfire Soul"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/salamander_mutations.json
msgid ""
"As a banked fire can suddenly spring up with a gust of wind, the Salamander "
"can surge into raging activity.  Activating this trait will make the "
"Salamander immune to pain and add +3 Strength and Dexterity for as long as "
"it is active.  However, when it ends, all the previously put-off pain and "
"more returns."
msgstr ""
"弱まった火が突風と共に突然燃え上がるように、サラマンダーも猛烈な勢いで活動を再開することができます。この特質を有効化している限り痛みに鈍くなり、筋力と器用が+3上昇しますが、効果が終わると受けた苦痛は再び感じるようになります。"

#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_LEVELER_SALAMANDER_MAKE_FIRE"
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_LEVELER_SALAMANDER_DASH_BOOM"
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_LEVELER_SALAMANDER_EXPLOSION_TRAP"
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_LEVELER_SALAMANDER_SMOKE_TELEPORT"
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_LEVELER_SALAMANDER_FLAME_PUNCH"
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC
#. "EOC_LEVELER_SALAMANDER_SUMMON_FIRE_SPIRIT"
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_LEVELER_SALAMANDER_FLAME_BREATH"
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_LEVELER_SALAMANDER_SUMMON_FIREBIRD"
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_LEVELER_SALAMANDER_INCREASE_SPEED"
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_LEVELER_SALAMANDER_SUMMON_WHIP"
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_LEVELER_SALAMANDER_EMIT_HEAT"
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_LEVELER_SALAMANDER_CURE_CONDITIONS"
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_LEVELER_SALAMANDER_FIRE_DOT"
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_LEVELER_SALAMANDER_CREATE_LIGHT"
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC
#. "EOC_LEVELER_SALAMANDER_FLY_IN_FIRE_SPELL"
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC
#. "EOC_LEVELER_SALAMANDER_FLAME_IMMUNITY_ALLY"
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC
#. "EOC_LEVELER_SALAMANDER_EXPOSION_AND_HEAL"
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC
#. "EOC_LEVELER_SALAMANDER_CULTIVATE_GOBLIN_FRUIT"
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_LEVELER_SALAMANDER_MAKE_GOSSAMER"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/salamander_spell_learning_eocs.json
msgid ""
"Your time spent among the heat and flames has increased your facility with "
"your fae magicks."
msgstr "熱と炎の中で長い時間を過ごしたことで、精霊の力が使えるようになりました。"

#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_SYLPH_LIGHTNING_MELEE_ATTACKS_ON"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/sylph_eocs.json
msgid "Lightning sparks from you hands."
msgstr "両手から稲妻が迸りました。"

#. ~ Player message in false effect in EoC
#. "EOC_SYLPH_LIGHTNING_MELEE_ATTACKS_PER_TURN"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/sylph_eocs.json
msgid "You do not have enough mana to maintain your fulgurating strikes!"
msgstr "マナが不足しており、雷の奔流を維持できません！"

#. ~ Player message in false effect in EoC "EOC_SYLPH_REVEAL_OVERMAP"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/sylph_eocs.json
msgid "You must be outdoors to cast Like a Bird on the Wing."
msgstr "ライク・ア・バード・オン・ザ・ウィングは屋外で詠唱する必要があります。"

#. ~ EOC option name in effect in EoC "EOC_SYLPH_JUMP_HIGH_ON"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/sylph_eocs.json
msgid "Leap two stories up"
msgstr "2階層上に跳躍する"

#. ~ EOC option name in effect in EoC "EOC_SYLPH_JUMP_HIGH_ON"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/sylph_eocs.json
msgid "Leap four stories up"
msgstr "4階層上に跳躍する"

#. ~ EOC option name in effect in EoC "EOC_SYLPH_JUMP_HIGH_ON"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/sylph_eocs.json
msgid "Leap six stories up"
msgstr "6階層上に跳躍する"

#. ~ EOC option description in effect in EoC "EOC_SYLPH_JUMP_HIGH_ON"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/sylph_eocs.json
msgid "Leap straight up two stories."
msgstr "2階層上に跳躍します。"

#. ~ EOC option description in effect in EoC "EOC_SYLPH_JUMP_HIGH_ON"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/sylph_eocs.json
msgid "Leap straight up four stories."
msgstr "4階層上に跳躍します。"

#. ~ EOC option description in effect in EoC "EOC_SYLPH_JUMP_HIGH_ON"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/sylph_eocs.json
msgid "Leap straight up six stories."
msgstr "6階層上に跳躍します。"

#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_SYLPH_JUMP_HIGH_SELECTOR_TWO"
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_SYLPH_JUMP_HIGH_SELECTOR_FOUR"
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_SYLPH_JUMP_HIGH_SELECTOR_SIX"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/sylph_eocs.json
msgid "With a burst of wind, you leap into the air."
msgstr "突風に乗って空中に飛び上がりました。"

#. ~ Player message in false effect in EoC "EOC_SYLPH_JUMP_HIGH_SELECTOR_TWO"
#. ~ Player message in false effect in EoC "EOC_SYLPH_JUMP_HIGH_SELECTOR_FOUR"
#. ~ Player message in false effect in EoC "EOC_SYLPH_JUMP_HIGH_SELECTOR_SIX"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/sylph_eocs.json
msgid "You cannot jump with a ceiling above you!"
msgstr "天井が邪魔で飛び上がれません！"

#. ~ Player message in false effect in EoC "EOC_SYLPH_FLY_AT_WILL"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/sylph_eocs.json
msgid "You do not have enough mana to fly!"
msgstr "マナが不足しているため飛べません！"

#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_SYLPH_CLOUD_FORM_ON"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/sylph_eocs.json
msgid "Your body falls apart into billowing clouds."
msgstr "肉体が波打ち、雲に溶け込みました。"

#. ~ Player message in false effect in EoC "EOC_SYLPH_CLOUD_FORM_PER_TURN"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/sylph_eocs.json
msgid "You do not have enough mana to maintain your cloud body!"
msgstr "マナが不足しており、雲化を維持できません！"

#. ~ Player message in false effect in EoC "EOC_SYLPH_MASSIVE_LIGHTNING_BOLT"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/sylph_eocs.json
msgid "You must be outdoors to cast Fist of Heaven's Fury."
msgstr "フィスト・オブ・ヘヴンズ・フューリーは屋外で詠唱する必要があります。"

#. ~ Player message in false effect in EoC "EOC_SYLPH_WIND_TRANSLOCATE_CHECK"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/sylph_eocs.json
msgid ""
"You must be outdoors and in a strong wind or high above the earth to "
"translocate."
msgstr "転移するには、強風が吹いている屋外か、地上の高い位置にいる必要があります。"

#. ~ Player message in false effect in EoC "EOC_SYLPH_WIND_ATTUNEMENT_CHECK"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/sylph_eocs.json
msgid "You must be outdoors and high above the earth to cast this spell."
msgstr "この呪文を唱えるには、屋外の高層にいる必要があります。"

#. ~ Player message in false effect in EoC "EOC_SYLPH_GOBLIN_FRUIT"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/sylph_eocs.json
msgid ""
"You must have a strong enough wind or be above ground level to call forth a "
"goblin fruit."
msgstr "ゴブリンフルーツを生み出すには、十分に強い風が吹いている屋外にいる必要があります。"

#. ~ Spell name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/sylph_mutation_spells.json
msgid "Zap"
msgstr "ｻﾞｯﾌﾟ"

#. ~ Description of spell "Zap"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/sylph_mutation_spells.json
msgid "Electricity emits from your extremities."
msgstr "指先から電撃を放ちます。"

#. ~ Message of spell "Zap"
#. ~ Message of spell "Electrical Field"
#. ~ Message of spell "Lightning Field"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/sylph_mutation_spells.json
msgid "tsszappp!"
msgstr "ビビビッ！"

#. ~ Description of spell "Lightning Bolt"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/sylph_mutation_spells.json
msgid ""
"The goto ability for many Sylphs, this does just what you expect: you shoot "
"lightning from your fingertips.  However, this lightning is more directed "
"than most lightning, and travels in a line through most non-solid targets."
msgstr ""
"名前に違わぬ効果をもたらす、多くのシルフに備わっている頼れる能力です。指先から発生する雷は自然の雷よりも指向性が高く、装甲が厚くない標的であれば一直線に通り抜けます。"

#. ~ Spell name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/sylph_mutation_spells.json
msgid "Crash of lightning"
msgstr "電撃の爆発"

#. ~ Description of spell "Crash of lightning"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/sylph_mutation_spells.json
msgid ""
"The crash of lightning strikes your foes with a blast of electricity and a "
"physical force that knocks them prone."
msgstr "電撃と物理的な衝撃で敵を攻撃し、転倒させます。"

#. ~ Spell name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/sylph_mutation_spells.json
msgid "crash"
msgstr "雷撃"

#. ~ Description of spell "crash"
#. ~ Description of spell "Clap of Thunder"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/sylph_mutation_spells.json
msgid "A thunder clap at a distance."
msgstr "遠距離に雷撃を放ちます。"

#. ~ Spell name
#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/sylph_mutation_spells.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/sylph_mutations.json
msgid "Clap of Thunder"
msgstr "ｸﾗｯﾌﾟ･ｵﾌﾞ･ｻﾝﾀﾞｰ"

#. ~ Spell name
#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/sylph_mutation_spells.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/sylph_mutations.json
msgid "Electrical Field"
msgstr "ｴﾚｸﾄﾘｶﾙ･ﾌｨｰﾙﾄﾞ"

#. ~ Description of spell "Electrical Field"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/sylph_mutation_spells.json
msgid "Summons a field of electricity."
msgstr "周囲に電撃が広がります。"

#. ~ Sound description of spell "Electrical Field"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/sylph_mutation_spells.json
msgid "zzzpptttt!"
msgstr "ビビビビビッ！"

#. ~ Spell name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/sylph_mutation_spells.json
msgid "Lightning Field"
msgstr "ﾗｲﾄﾆﾝｸﾞ･ﾌｨｰﾙﾄﾞ"

#. ~ Description of spell "Lightning Field"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/sylph_mutation_spells.json
msgid "Summons a field of lightning."
msgstr "周囲に激しい電撃が広がります。"

#. ~ Sound description of spell "Lightning Field"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/sylph_mutation_spells.json
msgid "cracklezzbit!"
msgstr "バリバリバリッ！"

#. ~ Spell name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/sylph_mutation_spells.json
msgid "Fulgurating Strikes Lightning Fields"
msgstr "雷の奔流範囲電撃"

#. ~ Description of spell "Fulgurating Strikes Lightning Fields"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/sylph_mutation_spells.json
msgid "The lightning fields generated by fulgurating strikes"
msgstr "雷の奔流によって範囲内に電撃が発生します。"

#. ~ Spell name
#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/sylph_mutation_spells.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/sylph_mutations.json
msgid "Like a Bird on the Wing"
msgstr "ﾗｲｸ･ｱ･ﾊﾞｰﾄﾞ･ｵﾝ･ｻﾞ･ｳｨﾝｸﾞ"

#. ~ Description of spell "Like a Bird on the Wing"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/sylph_mutation_spells.json
msgid ""
"Concentrating for a moment, you can hurl your senses into the air, seeing "
"the landscape spread out before you.  This spell only works outdoors."
msgstr "意識を集中させて感覚を上空に浮かべ、周囲の地形を確認できます。この呪文は屋外でのみ機能します。"

#. ~ Spell name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/sylph_mutation_spells.json
msgid "Like a Bird on the Wing Real Spell"
msgstr "ﾗｲｸ･ｱ･ﾊﾞｰﾄﾞ･ｵﾝ･ｻﾞ･ｳｨﾝｸﾞ効果"

#. ~ Description of spell "Like a Bird on the Wing Real Spell"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/sylph_mutation_spells.json
msgid ""
"This is the spell that actually fires when you cast Like a Bird on the Wing."
"  It's a bug if you have it."
msgstr "ライク・ア・バード・オン・ザ・ウィング詠唱時に実際に効果を発揮する呪文です。通常は操作キャラクターには表示されません。"

#. ~ Spell name
#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/sylph_mutation_spells.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/sylph_mutations.json
msgid "Stormwind Stride"
msgstr "ｽﾄｰﾑｳｨﾝﾄﾞ･ｽﾄﾗｲﾄﾞ"

#. ~ Description of spell "Stormwind Stride"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/sylph_mutation_spells.json
msgid "Charge forward like a sudden gust of wind."
msgstr "突風のように素早く移動します。"

#. ~ Description of spell "Favonian Murmuration"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/sylph_mutation_spells.json
msgid ""
"With a burst of fae magick, you infuse the speed of the west wind into one "
"of your allies, allowing them to move much more quickly for a time."
msgstr "精霊の魔法を増大して仲間の一人に西風の力を吹き込み、しばらくの間より速く動ける状態にします。"

#. ~ Description of spell "Cultivate Goblin Fruit"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/sylph_mutation_spells.json
msgid ""
"You may spin a bit of fae magic into the winds, bringing forth a goblin "
"fruit.  Goblin fruit have a variety of effects, never predictable but always"
" at least somewhat beneficial.  This spell may only be cast outdoors in "
"natural surroundings."
msgstr ""
"風に精霊の魔法を掛けることで、ゴブリンフルーツを生み出します。ゴブリンフルーツには様々な効果があり、予測は不可能ですが、少なくともある程度の有益な効果は期待できます。この呪文は屋外の自然環境下でのみ詠唱できます。"

#. ~ Spell name
#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/sylph_mutation_spells.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/sylph_mutations.json
msgid "Call the Children of the Winds"
msgstr "ｺｰﾙ･ｻﾞ･ﾁﾙﾄﾞﾚﾝ･ｵﾌﾞ･ｻﾞ･ｳｨﾝｽﾞ"

#. ~ Description of spell "Call the Children of the Winds"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/sylph_mutation_spells.json
msgid "A lesser air elemental is summoned to support you."
msgstr "あまり強くない友好的な大気の精を召喚します。"

#. ~ Spell name
#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/sylph_mutation_spells.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/sylph_mutations.json
msgid "Ominous Wind"
msgstr "ｵﾐﾅｽ･ｳｨﾝﾄﾞ"

#. ~ Description of spell "Ominous Wind"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/sylph_mutation_spells.json
msgid ""
"A whistling wind gusts past your shoulder in the direction you've pointed.  "
"It creates a fearful effect in your foes."
msgstr "不気味な風が標的めがけて吹き荒れ、恐ろしい影響を与えます。"

#. ~ Spell name
#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/sylph_mutation_spells.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/sylph_mutations.json
msgid "Pushing Wind"
msgstr "ﾌﾟｯｼﾝｸﾞ･ｳｨﾝﾄﾞ"

#. ~ Description of spell "Pushing Wind"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/sylph_mutation_spells.json
msgid "Shove something away with a burst of elemental air."
msgstr "空気の元素を破裂させて標的を吹き飛ばします。"

#. ~ Spell name
#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/sylph_mutation_spells.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/sylph_mutations.json
msgid "Purifying the Air"
msgstr "ﾋﾟｭﾘﾌｧｲﾝｸﾞ･ｼﾞ･ｴｱ"

#. ~ Description of spell "Purifying the Air"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/sylph_mutation_spells.json
msgid ""
"Reassert the purity of the air around yourself, removing contaminants such "
"as smoke or pollen."
msgstr "煙や花粉などの汚染物質を除去して周囲の空気を清浄にします。"

#. ~ Message of spell "Purifying the Air"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/sylph_mutation_spells.json
msgid "The air begins to smell sweet."
msgstr "周囲の空気から甘い香りが漂い始めました。"

#. ~ Description of spell "Hindering Winds"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/sylph_mutation_spells.json
msgid ""
"Surround a target with a blanket of buffeting winds, slowing them and "
"hindering their freedom of movement."
msgstr "標的を激しい風で包み込み、移動速度を低下させて自由に動けなくします。"

#. ~ Spell name
#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/sylph_mutation_spells.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/sylph_mutations.json
msgid "Fist of Heaven's Fury"
msgstr "ﾌｨｽﾄ･ｵﾌﾞ･ﾍｳﾞﾝｽﾞ･ﾌｭｰﾘｰ"

#. ~ Description of spell "Fist of Heaven's Fury"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/sylph_mutation_spells.json
msgid ""
"Call down a thundering lightning bolt to blast your enemies with the fury of"
" the heavens."
msgstr "轟く稲妻を呼び起こし、天の怒りで敵を吹き飛ばします。"

#. ~ Message of spell "Fist of Heaven's Fury"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/sylph_mutation_spells.json
msgid "Lightning crashes down from the heavens!"
msgstr "天から稲妻が放たれました！"

#. ~ Spell name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/sylph_mutation_spells.json
msgid "Fist of Heaven's Fury Real"
msgstr "ﾌｨｽﾄ･ｵﾌﾞ･ﾍｳﾞﾝｽﾞ･ﾌｭｰﾘｰ効果"

#. ~ Description of spell "Fist of Heaven's Fury Real"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/sylph_mutation_spells.json
msgid ""
"The actual spell that casts Fist of Heaven's Fury.  It's a bug if you have "
"it directly."
msgstr "フィスト・オブ・ヘヴンズ・フューリーの効果を実行する呪文です。通常は表示されません。"

#. ~ Spell name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/sylph_mutation_spells.json
msgid "Fist of Heaven's Fury Ter Transform 1"
msgstr "ﾌｨｽﾄ･ｵﾌﾞ･ﾍｳﾞﾝｽﾞ･ﾌｭｰﾘｰ地形変化1"

#. ~ Description of spell "Fist of Heaven's Fury Ter Transform 1"
#. ~ Description of spell "Fist of Heaven's Fury Ter Transform 2"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/sylph_mutation_spells.json
msgid ""
"The actual spell that casts the Fist of Heaven's Fury crater.  It's a bug if"
" you have it directly."
msgstr "フィスト・オブ・ヘヴンズ・フューリーのクレーターを生成する呪文です。通常は表示されません。"

#. ~ Spell name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/sylph_mutation_spells.json
msgid "Fist of Heaven's Fury Ter Transform 2"
msgstr "ﾌｨｽﾄ･ｵﾌﾞ･ﾍｳﾞﾝｽﾞ･ﾌｭｰﾘｰ地形変化2"

#. ~ Spell name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/sylph_mutation_spells.json
msgid "Fist of Heaven's Fury Monster Push"
msgstr "ﾌｨｽﾄ･ｵﾌﾞ･ﾍｳﾞﾝｽﾞ･ﾌｭｰﾘｰ押出"

#. ~ Description of spell "Fist of Heaven's Fury Monster Push"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/sylph_mutation_spells.json
msgid ""
"The actual spell that casts the Fist of Heaven's Fury fire.  It's a bug if "
"you have it."
msgstr "フィスト・オブ・ヘヴンズ・フューリーの効果を実行する呪文です。通常は表示されません。"

#. ~ Description of spell "Fist of Heaven's Fury Monster Push"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/sylph_mutation_spells.json
msgid ""
"The actual spell that casts the Fist of Heaven's Fury shove.  It's a bug if "
"you have it."
msgstr "フィスト・オブ・ヘヴンズ・フューリーの押し出し効果を実行する呪文です。通常は表示されません。"

#. ~ Spell name
#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/sylph_mutation_spells.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/sylph_mutations.json
msgid "Going Wither the Wind May Lead"
msgstr "ｺﾞｰｲﾝｸﾞ･ｳｨｻﾞｰ･ｻﾞ･ｳｨﾝﾄﾞ･ﾒｲ･ﾘｰﾄﾞ"

#. ~ Description of spell "Going Wither the Wind May Lead"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/sylph_mutation_spells.json
msgid ""
"The wind blows where it will, through fences and open windows, across fields"
" and over rivers  The Sylph can blow with it, traveling high above the earth"
" and alighting on a location they have previously been."
msgstr ""
"風は柵や開け放たれた窓を通り抜け、野を越え川を越え、好きな場所を吹き抜けます。シルフは風に乗って空高くを飛び、以前に行ったことがある場所に移動できます。"

#. ~ Spell name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/sylph_mutation_spells.json
msgid "Going Wither the Wind May Lead Attunement"
msgstr "ｺﾞｰｲﾝｸﾞ･ｳｨｻﾞｰ･ｻﾞ･ｳｨﾝﾄﾞ･ﾒｲ･ﾘｰﾄﾞ(位置登録)"

#. ~ Description of spell "Going Wither the Wind May Lead Attunement"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/sylph_mutation_spells.json
msgid ""
"Attune to a location for later traveling.  You must attune high above the "
"earth and outdoors."
msgstr "転移して戻ってくるときのために空間を整えます。高層の屋外で詠唱する必要があります。"

#. ~ Spell name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/sylph_mutation_spells.json
msgid "Going Wither the Wind May Lead Attunement Real"
msgstr "ｺﾞｰｲﾝｸﾞ･ｳｨｻﾞｰ･ｻﾞ･ｳｨﾝﾄﾞ･ﾒｲ･ﾘｰﾄﾞ(位置登録)効果"

#. ~ Description of spell "Going Wither the Wind May Lead Attunement Real"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/sylph_mutation_spells.json
msgid ""
"The actual Going Wither the Wind May Lead attunement spell.  It's a bug if "
"you have it."
msgstr "ゴーウィング・ウィザー・ザ・ウィンド・メイ・リードの位置登録の効果を実行する呪文です。通常は表示されません。"

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/sylph_mutations.json
msgid "Sylph Skin"
msgstr "シルフの皮膚"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Sylph Skin"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/sylph_mutations.json
msgid ""
"Your skin has turned the rolling grey of the clouds.  Your skin is now an "
"ever-shifting color of clouds shifting from stormy to rainy to barely there."
"  This has no gameplay effects."
msgstr "皮膚が雲のような暗い色に変わりました。雷雲から雨雲、そして曇り空の色へと、皮膚の色が刻々と変化しています。特に何の効果もありません。"

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/sylph_mutations.json
msgid "Cloud Skin"
msgstr "雲の皮膚"

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/sylph_mutations.json
msgid "Storm Skin"
msgstr "嵐の皮膚"

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/sylph_mutations.json
msgid "Breathe Without Air"
msgstr "無酸素呼吸"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Breathe Without Air"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/sylph_mutations.json
msgid ""
"Upon gaining this ability the Sylph gains the ability to breathe without "
"oxygen.  This will prevent damage from a lack of oxygen."
msgstr "酸素なしで呼吸するシルフの能力です。酸素不足によるダメージを防ぐことができます。"

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/sylph_mutations.json
msgid "Sylph Eyes"
msgstr "シルフの目"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Sylph Eyes"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/sylph_mutations.json
msgid ""
"Upon gaining this ability the Sylph's eyes begin reflecting their mood with "
"lightning and storms when angry and clear skies when happy.  Glare no longer"
" impacts them."
msgstr ""
"喜んでいるときは青空、怒っているときは稲妻や雷雲の色と、気分に合わせて様々な空模様の色に変化する目をもっています。日光の眩しさの影響を受けません。"

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/sylph_mutations.json
msgid "Sylph Ears"
msgstr "シルフの耳"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Sylph Ears"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/sylph_mutations.json
msgid ""
"The Sylph's ears are longer and pointed, like a wisp of cloud trailing "
"across the sky.  They can hear better and no matter how loud the thunder, "
"their ears will not ring from it."
msgstr "空を横切る雲の切れ端のように長く尖ったシルフの耳です。聴覚が発達しますが、雷のような大音量を聞いても耳鳴りが起きません。"

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/sylph_mutations.json
msgid "Voice of Thunder"
msgstr "轟く雷声"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Voice of Thunder"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/sylph_mutations.json
msgid ""
"The Sylph can make their voice boom like a peal of thunder, shouting so "
"loudly that they can be heard from hundreds of yards away."
msgstr "数百ヤード離れた地点にも届くほどの、雷鳴のような大声を出すことができます。"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Clap of Thunder"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/sylph_mutations.json
msgid ""
"Upon gaining this ability the Sylph gains the ability to create a loud clap "
"of thunder noise at a distance."
msgstr "遠距離に雷撃を発生させるシルフの能力です。"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Ominous Wind"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/sylph_mutations.json
msgid ""
"Upon gaining this ability the Sylph gains the ability to summon and ominous "
"wind that damages sapient creatures morale."
msgstr "不気味な風を召喚して知性あるモンスターの精神にダメージを与えるシルフの能力です。"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Stormwind Stride"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/sylph_mutations.json
msgid ""
"Upon gaining this ability the Sylph gains the ability to rush forward in a "
"burst of wind."
msgstr "突風の力を借りて素早く移動するシルフの能力です。"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Favonian Murmuration"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/sylph_mutations.json
msgid ""
"Upon gaining this ability the Sylph gains the ability increase the speed of "
"one of their allies."
msgstr "仲間ひとりの速度を上昇させるシルフの能力です。"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Like a Bird on the Wing"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/sylph_mutations.json
msgid ""
"Upon gaining this ability the Sylph gains the ability to see surrounding "
"terrain as though standing on high."
msgstr "空から見下ろしているかのように周囲の地形を把握するシルフの能力です。"

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/sylph_mutations.json
msgid "Slow Fall"
msgstr "低速落下"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Slow Fall"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/sylph_mutations.json
msgid ""
"Upon gaining this ability the Sylph ceases to fall at speeds that would "
"damage themselves, no matter how high the fall is."
msgstr "どれほど高い場所から落ちても決して落下ダメージを受けないシルフの能力です。"

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/sylph_mutations.json
msgid "Carried on the Breeze"
msgstr "そよ風乗り"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Carried on the Breeze"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/sylph_mutations.json
msgid ""
"Upon gaining this ability the Sylph can direct their falls, moving "
"horizontally in a gust of wind if they step off a ledge and landing safely "
"on the ground."
msgstr "高所から落下したときにそよ風に乗って安全に地面に着地するシルフの能力です。"

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/sylph_mutations.json
msgid "Updraft Leap"
msgstr "大跳躍"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Updraft Leap"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/sylph_mutations.json
msgid ""
"Upon gaining this ability the Sylph can leap straight into the air, riding "
"the wind currents for a few seconds before descending to the earth."
msgstr "上方に真っすぐ飛び上がり、数秒間風の流れに乗って漂い地上に安全に着地するシルフの能力です。"

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/sylph_mutations.json
msgid "Resist Cold"
msgstr "低温耐性"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Resist Cold"
#. ~ Description of mutation "Born of a Gale"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/sylph_mutations.json
msgid "The Sylph gains a resistance to cold and cold based damage."
msgstr "冷気や冷気攻撃への耐性を獲得します。"

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/sylph_mutations.json
msgid "Born of a Gale"
msgstr "疾風の血脈"

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/sylph_mutations.json
msgid "Dancing On Winter Winds"
msgstr "北風の舞踏"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Dancing On Winter Winds"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/sylph_mutations.json
msgid ""
"The sylph is nearly immune to mundane cold and heavily resistant to cold-"
"based damage."
msgstr "日常的な低温への耐性が高まり、冷気によるダメージを受けにくくなります。"

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/sylph_mutations.json
msgid "Wind-Carried Weapons"
msgstr "追い風"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Wind-Carried Weapons"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/sylph_mutations.json
msgid ""
"The winds surge around the Sylph as they attack, guiding their projectiles "
"to the target.  The range of the Sylph's weapons is increased."
msgstr "シルフが遠距離武器で攻撃する際、周囲に風が集まって発射体を押すことで、射程距離が増加します。"

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/sylph_mutations.json
msgid "Winds Guide Me"
msgstr "風の助け"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Winds Guide Me"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/sylph_mutations.json
#, no-c-format
msgid "When outdoors, the Sylph moves 10% faster."
msgstr "屋外での移動コストが10%軽減されます。"

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/sylph_mutations.json
msgid "Outrunning the Gale"
msgstr "疾風の導き"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Outrunning the Gale"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/sylph_mutations.json
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"When outdoors, the Sylph moves 10% faster and has +10% increased speed."
msgstr "屋外での移動コストが10%軽減され、速度が10%上昇します。"

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/sylph_mutations.json
msgid "Gusting Evasion"
msgstr "風の身かわし"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Gusting Evasion"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/sylph_mutations.json
msgid ""
"The Sylph slips away from attacks as easily as the wind finds its way "
"through cracks in a wall.  They gain +1 bonus dodge attempt per turn (+2 if "
"they have the Sylph trait)."
msgstr ""
"シルフは、まるで風が壁の亀裂を通り抜けるように攻撃を避けることができます。1ターンの回避試行数が+1(シルフの特質を得ている場合は+2)増加します。"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Cultivate Goblin Fruit"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/sylph_mutations.json
msgid ""
"Upon gaining this ability the Sylph gains the ability to grow a goblin fruit"
" when outdoors and the wind is blowing strongly."
msgstr "屋外で強く吹く風からゴブリンフルーツを生み出すシルフの能力です。"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Pushing Wind"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/sylph_mutations.json
msgid "The Sylph learns how to use the wind to push their opponents."
msgstr "風を使って敵を吹き飛ばすシルフの力を習得します。"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Hindering Winds"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/sylph_mutations.json
msgid ""
"The Sylph learns how to surround a single target with buffeting winds, "
"slowing their movements and knocking them off-balance."
msgstr "激しい風で単一の標的を囲み、移動速度を低下させバランスを崩させるシルフの力を習得します。"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Purifying the Air"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/sylph_mutations.json
msgid ""
"The Sylph can remove contaminants from the air such as smoke or pollen and "
"leave only pure air behind."
msgstr "煙や花粉などの汚染物質を除去して空気を清浄にするシルフの能力です。"

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/sylph_mutations.json
msgid "Electrical Emissions"
msgstr "電撃放出"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Electrical Emissions"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/sylph_mutations.json
msgid ""
"Sylphs often develop electrical emissions that can culminate in lightning "
"bolts."
msgstr "シルフには電撃を放出する力があり、鍛え上げれば雷を発生させることもできます。"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Electrical Field"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/sylph_mutations.json
msgid ""
"Upon gaining this ability the Sylph gains the ability to summon electrical "
"fields."
msgstr "周囲に電撃を放出するシルフの能力です。"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Fist of Heaven's Fury"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/sylph_mutations.json
msgid ""
"Upon gaining this ability the Sylph gains the ability to call down the "
"thunderstorm's judgement on a location while outdoors."
msgstr "屋外にいる状態でその場に雷雨を呼び起こすシルフの能力です。"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Call the Children of the Winds"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/sylph_mutations.json
msgid ""
"Upon gaining this ability the Sylph gains the ability to summon an air "
"sprite."
msgstr "大気の精を召喚するシルフの能力です。"

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/sylph_mutations.json
msgid "Fulgurating Strikes"
msgstr "雷の奔流"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Fulgurating Strikes"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/sylph_mutations.json
msgid ""
"At will, the Sylph may cause their attacks to carry a charge, whose power "
"grows with their mastery of lightning.  Each attack costs mana while this "
"trait is active."
msgstr ""
"シルフは自らの攻撃に雷をまとわせることができ、その威力は雷を操る技量に応じて増大します。この特性を有効化している間は、攻撃する度にマナを消費します。"

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/sylph_mutations.json
msgid "Fulgurating Strikes Active"
msgstr "雷の奔流(起動)"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Fulgurating Strikes Active"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/sylph_mutations.json
msgid ""
"The actual trait that grants you fulgurating strikes.  It's a bug if you "
"have it."
msgstr "攻撃に電撃ダメージを付与する呪文です。通常は表示されません。"

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/sylph_mutations.json
msgid "Spring Breeze Stride"
msgstr "春風の歩み"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Spring Breeze Stride"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/sylph_mutations.json
msgid "The Sylph's moves like the wind.  +2 Dexterity."
msgstr "シルフの動作はまるで風のようです。器用+2"

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/sylph_mutations.json
msgid "Storm-Runner's Speed"
msgstr "暴風の加勢"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Storm-Runner's Speed"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/sylph_mutations.json
msgid "The Sylph's moves like a sudden burst of wind.  +5 Dexterity."
msgstr "シルフの動作はまるで突然の暴風のようです。器用+5"

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/sylph_mutations.json
msgid "Ice-Clear Thoughts"
msgstr "澄んだ思考"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Ice-Clear Thoughts"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/sylph_mutations.json
msgid ""
"The Sylph's mind has the clarity of pure frozen water.  +2 Intelligence."
msgstr "シルフの精神は凍った純粋のように澄み渡っています。知性+2"

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/sylph_mutations.json
msgid "Lightning Mind"
msgstr "雷光の閃き"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Lightning Mind"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/sylph_mutations.json
msgid ""
"The Sylph's thoughts move as quickly as a bolt of lightning.  +4 "
"Intelligence."
msgstr "シルフの頭脳は稲妻のように素早く回転します。知性+4"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Eagle's Sight"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/sylph_mutations.json
msgid ""
"Like a bird soaring on the wind, the Sylph's keen eyes take in their "
"surroundings.  +3 Perception."
msgstr "風に乗って舞う鳥のように、鋭い感覚を張り巡らせます。感覚+3"

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/sylph_mutations.json
msgid "Zephyr Chant"
msgstr "軟風の歌"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Zephyr Chant"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/sylph_mutations.json
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Like the blowing winds, the Sylph's mana races from of their body at their "
"command.  -20% spell casting speed when outdoors."
msgstr "シルフのマナは風のように体内から湧き出します。屋外での呪文詠唱時間が20%軽減されます。"

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/sylph_mutations.json
msgid "Whistling Zephyr Chant"
msgstr "軟風の絶唱"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Whistling Zephyr Chant"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/sylph_mutations.json
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The wind finds it way through any crack, and so does the Sylph's mana come "
"to their call regardless of what movements they make.  -20% spell casting "
"speed when outdoors and the Sylph no longer needs to gesture to use their "
"magick."
msgstr ""
"風がどれほど狭い亀裂も通り抜けるように、シルフのマナはどんな呼び掛けにも答えます。屋外での呪文詠唱時間が20%軽減され、手と腕の状態に関係なく呪文を詠唱できるようになります。"

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/sylph_mutations.json
msgid "Surmounting the Clouds"
msgstr "雲踏み"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Surmounting the Clouds"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/sylph_mutations.json
msgid ""
"Born of the winds, the Sylph can walk on them as easily as the ground.  "
"While this trait is active, the Sylph will not fall and may walk on the air "
"as they like.  It requires 3 mana per turn to fuel their steps."
msgstr ""
"風から生まれたシルフはまるで地面のように空中を歩くことができます。この特質を有効化している間、シルフは落下することなく、自由に空中を移動できます。1ターンごとにマナを3消費します。"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Going Wither the Wind May Lead"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/sylph_mutations.json
msgid ""
"Upon gaining this ability the Sylph gains the ability to travel along the "
"blowing winds to another location they have previously been to."
msgstr "吹く風に乗ってあらかじめ指定した地下の特定地点に転移するシルフの能力です。"

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/sylph_mutations.json
msgid "Body of Cloud"
msgstr "肉体の雲化"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Body of Cloud"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/sylph_mutations.json
msgid ""
"The Sylph may transform into misty cloud.  They will be insubstantial and "
"unable to interact with the environment, but also able to move incredibly "
"quickly and attacks will simply pass through them.  Each second in the cloud"
" form will cost 10 mana."
msgstr ""
"シルフは自らの肉体を雲に変えることができます。雲は実体がなく、周囲に影響を与えられませんが、信じられないほど素早く移動でき、攻撃を受けることもありません。雲化中は1秒につき10マナを消費します。"

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/sylph_mutations.json
msgid "Body of Cloud Appearance"
msgstr "雲化表示"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Body of Cloud Appearance"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/sylph_mutations.json
msgid ""
"This mutation carries the sprite override info for Body of Cloud.  You "
"shouldn't be able to see it in game."
msgstr "肉体の雲化の変異によって表示されるグラフィックが変わります。この変異は通常は表示されません。"

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/sylph_mutations.json
msgid "As Free as the Wind"
msgstr "風の自在"

#. ~ Description of mutation "As Free as the Wind"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/sylph_mutations.json
msgid ""
"Like the wind, the Sylph goes where they will with no one to stop them.  "
"They are immune to anything that would restrict their movement, such as "
"grabs, terrain costs, or slippery terrain."
msgstr ""
"シルフは風のように何者にも邪魔されずどこまでも進みます。拘束、地形移動コスト、滑りやすい地形などの移動を制限するあらゆる要素の影響を受けません。"

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/sylph_mutations.json
msgid "Winds Always At My Back"
msgstr "追い風"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Winds Always At My Back"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/sylph_mutations.json
msgid ""
"The winds surround the Sylph and carry them along regardless of their "
"physical condition.  They suffer no penalties to dexterity or speed due to "
"pain."
msgstr "風がシルフを取り囲み、動きを支えてくれます。苦痛によって器用や速度が低下しません。"

#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_LEVELER_SYLPH_CLAP_OF_THUNDER"
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_LEVELER_SYLPH_OMINOUS_WIND"
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_LEVELER_SYLPH_PUSHING_WIND"
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_LEVELER_SYLPH_CLEAR_THE_AIR"
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_LEVELER_SYLPH_ELECTRICAL_EMISSIONS"
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_LEVELER_SYLPH_CHARGE_DASH"
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_LEVELER_SYLPH_INCREASE_ALLY_SPEED"
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_LEVELER_SYLPH_REVEAL_OVERMAP"
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_LEVELER_SYLPH_SUMMON_AIR_SPRITE"
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_LEVELER_SYLPH_CLOUD_OF_STEAM"
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_LEVELER_SYLPH_CREATE_LIGHT"
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_LEVELER_SYLPH_CALL_LIGHTNING"
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_LEVELER_SYLPH_CRASH_OF_LIGHTNING"
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC
#. "EOC_LEVELER_SYLPH_MASSIVE_LIGHTNING_BLAST"
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_LEVELER_SYLPH_WIND_TRANSLOCATE"
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC
#. "EOC_LEVELER_SLYPH_WIND_BLOWS_WILLOW_BENDS"
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC
#. "EOC_LEVELER_SYLPH_CULTIVATE_GOBLIN_FRUIT"
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_LEVELER_SYLPH_MAKE_GOSSAMER"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/sylph_spell_learning_eocs.json
msgid ""
"Your time spent among the blowing winds has increased your facility with "
"your fae magicks."
msgstr "吹きすさぶ風の中で長い時間を過ごしたことで、精霊の力が使えるようになりました。"

#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC
#. "EOC_COMPLETED_ROLL_REMAINDER_ELEMENTAL_RECIPE"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/undine_eocs.json
msgid "These are all the ways you can alter these elements now."
msgstr "元素を操作する方法を全て習得し終えました。"

#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC
#. "EOC_SUCCESFUL_ROLL_REMAINDER_ELEMENTAL_RECIPE"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/undine_eocs.json
msgid "You learn how to alter an element."
msgstr "元素を操作する方法を習得しました。"

#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC
#. "EOC_UNDINE_LEARN_SALTWATER_TO_FRESHWATER"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/undine_eocs.json
msgid ""
"Drawn from some atavistic well, knowledge of how to turn fresh water into "
"salt water, and vice versa, fills your mind."
msgstr "祖先から自己の奥底へ脈々と流れる水が満ち、淡水を塩水に、塩水を淡水に変える方法が浮かび上がりました。"

#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_UNDINE_LEARN_FOUL_WATER"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/undine_eocs.json
msgid ""
"Drawn from some atavistic well, knowledge of how to turn foul water into "
"clean, pure water, and vice versa, fills your mind."
msgstr "祖先から自己の奥底へ脈々と流れる水が満ち、汚れた水を綺麗な水に、綺麗な水を汚れた水に変える方法が浮かび上がりました。"

#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_UNDINE_LEARN_LIQUID_TO_WATER"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/undine_eocs.json
msgid ""
"Drawn from some atavistic well, knowledge of how to turn various other "
"liquids directly into water fills your mind."
msgstr "祖先から自己の奥底へ脈々と流れる水が満ち、様々な液体を水に変える方法が浮かび上がりました。"

#. ~ Player message in false effect in EoC "EOC_UNDINE_GOBLIN_FRUIT"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/undine_eocs.json
msgid ""
"You must be standing in water or near a large body of water to call forth a "
"goblin fruit."
msgstr "ゴブリンフルーツを生み出すには、水中か水域の付近にいる必要があります。"

#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_UNDINE_WATER_FORM_ON"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/undine_eocs.json
msgid "Your body falls apart in a rush of water."
msgstr "肉体が激しい水流に溶け込みました。"

#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_UNDINE_WATER_FORM_OFF"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/undine_eocs.json
msgid "Your body reconstitutes itself from the waters."
msgstr "肉体が固体に戻りました。"

#. ~ Spell name
#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/undine_mutation_spells.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/undine_mutations.json
msgid "Create Fog"
msgstr "ｸﾘｴｲﾄ･ﾌｫｸﾞ"

#. ~ Description of spell "Create Fog"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/undine_mutation_spells.json
msgid "Summons a field of fog."
msgstr "周囲に霧を生み出します。"

#. ~ Sound description of spell "Create Fog"
#. ~ Sound description of spell "Acidic Mist"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/undine_mutation_spells.json
msgid "sussurus!"
msgstr "シュワーッ！"

#. ~ Message of spell "Create Fog"
#. ~ Sound description of spell "Fog Bank"
#. ~ Message of spell "Fog Bank"
#. ~ Message of spell "Acidic Mist"
#. ~ Sound description of spell "Deadly Mist"
#. ~ Message of spell "Deadly Mist"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/undine_mutation_spells.json
msgid "whoosh!"
msgstr "シュー！"

#. ~ Spell name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/undine_mutation_spells.json
msgid "Fog Bank"
msgstr "ﾌｫｸﾞ･ﾊﾞﾝｸ"

#. ~ Description of spell "Fog Bank"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/undine_mutation_spells.json
msgid "Summons a bank of fog."
msgstr "周囲に深い霧を生み出します。"

#. ~ Spell name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/undine_mutation_spells.json
msgid "Grant buoyancy"
msgstr "ｸﾞﾗﾝﾄ･ﾎﾞｲｴﾝｼｰ"

#. ~ Description of spell "Grant buoyancy"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/undine_mutation_spells.json
msgid "You become more buoyant."
msgstr "自身の浮力が強くなります。"

#. ~ Spell name
#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/undine_mutation_spells.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/undine_mutations.json
msgid "Acidic Mist"
msgstr "ｱｼﾃﾞｨｯｸ･ﾐｽﾄ"

#. ~ Description of spell "Acidic Mist"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/undine_mutation_spells.json
msgid "Summons an acidic mist."
msgstr "酸の霧を生み出します。"

#. ~ Spell name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/undine_mutation_spells.json
msgid "Deadly Mist"
msgstr "ﾃﾞｯﾄﾞﾘｰ･ﾐｽﾄ"

#. ~ Description of spell "Deadly Mist"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/undine_mutation_spells.json
msgid "Summons a deadly mist."
msgstr "致命的な酸の霧を生み出します。"

#. ~ Spell name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/undine_mutation_spells.json
msgid "Water Pocket"
msgstr "ｳｫｰﾀｰ･ﾎﾟｹｯﾄ"

#. ~ Description of spell "Water Pocket"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/undine_mutation_spells.json
msgid ""
"This spell summons a pocket made of churning water that contains an air "
"bubble inside and prevents any items in it from being damaged by water."
msgstr "内部に気泡が入った、揺らぐ水の袋を呼び出します。この袋に入れたアイテムが水で損傷することはありません。"

#. ~ Description of spell "Caustic Cloak"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/undine_mutation_spells.json
msgid ""
"Weave a cloak of fae magicks around a target, surrounding them with a thin "
"shell of acidic mist.  This protects them somewhat from acid damage and will"
" sometimes damage an attacker as well."
msgstr "標的の周囲を精霊の魔法で包み、薄い酸性の霧をまとわせます。効果を受けた者は酸ダメージが多少軽減され、攻撃に対して時々酸で反撃します。"

#. ~ Spell name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/undine_mutation_spells.json
msgid "Caustic Cloak Thorns Spell"
msgstr "ｺｰｽﾃｨｯｸ･ｸﾛｰｸ反撃"

#. ~ Description of spell "Caustic Cloak Thorns Spell"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/undine_mutation_spells.json
msgid ""
"The thorns effect from Caustic Cloak.  It's a bug if you have it directly."
msgstr "コースティック・クロークの反撃効果です。通常は表示されません。"

#. ~ Description of spell "Cultivate Goblin Fruit"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/undine_mutation_spells.json
msgid ""
"You may spin a bit of fae magic into the waters, bringing forth a goblin "
"fruit.  Goblin fruit have a variety of effects, never predictable but always"
" at least somewhat beneficial.  This spell may only be cast when standing or"
" water or a near a large body of water."
msgstr ""
"水中に精霊の魔法を流し込むことで、ゴブリンフルーツを生み出します。ゴブリンフルーツには様々な効果があり、予測は不可能ですが、少なくともある程度の有益な効果は期待できます。この呪文は水中または広い水域の付近でのみ詠唱できます。"

#. ~ Spell name
#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/undine_mutation_spells.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/undine_mutations.json
msgid "Crushing Pressure"
msgstr "ｸﾗｯｼﾝｸﾞ･ﾌﾟﾚｯｼｬｰ"

#. ~ Description of spell "Crushing Pressure"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/undine_mutation_spells.json
msgid ""
"You may bring the force of the ocean's depths onto your enemy, crushing them"
" and slowing them briefly."
msgstr "深海の圧力を借りて敵を押し潰し、一時的に速度を低下させます。"

#. ~ Spell name
#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/undine_mutation_spells.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/undine_mutations.json
msgid "Whirlpool Catches the Shoal"
msgstr "ﾜｰﾙﾌﾟｰﾙ･ｷｬｯﾁｽﾞ･ｻﾞ･ｼｮｰﾙ"

#. ~ Description of spell "Whirlpool Catches the Shoal"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/undine_mutation_spells.json
msgid ""
"Create a whirling field of magickal waters, dragging everything within it "
"toward a central point and slowing them with the force of the current."
msgstr "魔法の水が渦巻く地形を作り出し、範囲内にいる者全てを中心点に引き寄せ、速度を低下させます。"

#. ~ Spell name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/undine_mutation_spells.json
msgid "Whirlpool Catches the Shoal 01"
msgstr "ﾜｰﾙﾌﾟｰﾙ･ｷｬｯﾁｽﾞ･ｻﾞ･ｼｮｰﾙ01"

#. ~ Description of spell "Whirlpool Catches the Shoal 01"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/undine_mutation_spells.json
msgid "Version 1 of the Whirlpool Catches the Shoal drag, with 2 pulls in."
msgstr "ワールプール・キャッチズ・ザ・ショールの対象を2引き寄せる効果です。"

#. ~ Spell name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/undine_mutation_spells.json
msgid "Whirlpool Catches the Shoal 02"
