msgstr "課題の品を持ってきたのですか？"

#. ~ Mission name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/boann_quests.json
msgid "Kill two March lords in my name"
msgstr "2体の辺境伯を殺す"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Kill two March lords in my name"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/boann_quests.json
msgid "Kill some of my opponents and I'll reward you handsomely."
msgstr "わたくしに仇なす者たちを倒したならば、十分な報酬を与えましょう。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Kill two March lords in my name"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/boann_quests.json
msgid ""
"They are fearsome opponents but lack long-range attacks.  You can find them "
"in the border patrol offices."
msgstr "彼奴らは恐ろしい敵ですが、遠くからこちらを狙うのは不得手です。国境警備隊の詰所にいることでしょう。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Kill two March lords in my name"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/boann_quests.json
msgid "Have you did as I requested?"
msgstr "任務をこなしてくれましたか？"

#. ~ Mission name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/boann_quests.json
msgid "Kill this suspicious dog for me"
msgstr "奇妙なイヌを殺す"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Kill this suspicious dog for me"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/boann_quests.json
msgid "Kill a dangerous monster in my honor and I shall reward you."
msgstr "危険な怪物を殺してわたくしへの忠誠を示せば、報酬を与えましょう。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Kill this suspicious dog for me"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/boann_quests.json
msgid "I will now grant you the knowledge to see beyond all walls."
msgstr "あらゆる壁の先を見通す知識をあなたに与えましょう。"

#. ~ Mission name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/boann_quests.json
msgid "Kill five Mi-Go guards for me"
msgstr "5体のミ＝ゴ・ガードを殺す"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Kill five Mi-Go guards for me"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/boann_quests.json
msgid "Kill a great beast in my honor and I'll grant you a reward."
msgstr "強大な獣を倒してわたくしへの忠誠を示せば、報酬を与えましょう。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Kill five Mi-Go guards for me"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/boann_quests.json
msgid "Have you killed the guards?"
msgstr "ガード共を倒したのですか？"

#. ~ Mission name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/boann_quests.json
msgid "Kill an armored centipede for me"
