#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Kill an armored centipede for me"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/boann_quests.json
msgid "Have you slain the centipede?"
msgstr "ムカデを打ち倒したのですか？"

#. ~ Mission name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/boann_quests.json
msgid "Kill the remains of a dreamforged automaton"
msgstr "暴走夢鉱人形たちを殺す"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Kill the remains of a dreamforged automaton"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/boann_quests.json
msgid "Kill a great foe in my honor and I'll reward you."
msgstr "強大な敵を倒してわたくしへの忠誠を示せば、報酬を与えましょう。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Kill the remains of a dreamforged automaton"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/boann_quests.json
msgid ""
"The reports mentioned that it relies on electricity to attack.  Find a way "
"to shield yourself against that, and it'll be much easier to kill.  The "
"reports also mentioned how damaged the automaton's exposed insides are, so I"
" wouldn't attempt to use weapons that only damage the insides if I were you."
msgstr ""
"偵察隊によれば、電撃を用いた攻撃を仕掛けてくるそうです。電撃を防ぐすべがあれば、ずっと楽に倒せるでしょうね。それから、自動人形は壊れかけており、内部機構がひどく傷ついているとの報告もありました。もしわたくしがあなたならば、装甲を貫き内側を傷つけられる武器を使うでしょうね。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Kill the remains of a dreamforged automaton"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/boann_quests.json
msgid "Have you slain the automaton as I requested?"
msgstr "自動人形を打ち倒したのですか？"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Kill the remains of a dreamforged automaton"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/boann_quests.json
msgid "I'm pleased to grant you a frostrimed estoc."
msgstr "氷霜のエストックをあなたに与えられることを、嬉しく思いますよ。"

#. ~ Mission name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/boann_quests.json
msgid "Bring me a chunk of a triffid heart"
msgstr "トリフィドの心臓塊を持ち帰る"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Bring me a chunk of a triffid heart"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/boann_quests.json
msgid ""
"Kill a great beast in my honor and I'll reward you as a new member of my "
"knights."
msgstr "大いなる獣を殺してわたくしへの忠誠を示せば、あなたを我が騎士団の新たな一員と認め、褒美を与えましょう。"

#. ~ Mission name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/boann_quests.json
msgid "Kill a titan stag beetle for me"
msgstr "超巨大クワガタを殺す"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Kill a titan stag beetle for me"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/boann_quests.json
msgid "Have you slain the titanic beetle?"
msgstr "巨大なクワガタムを打ち倒したのですか？"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Kill a titan stag beetle for me"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/boann_quests.json
msgid ""
"I give you Väinämöinen's Kantele.  Take care of it, for it is very precious."
msgstr "ワイナミョイネンのカンテレを与えましょう。とても貴重な楽器です。くれぐれも大切に扱うのですよ。"

#. ~ Mission name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/boann_quests.json
msgid "Bring me a piece of the darkest shadow"
msgstr "黒影の小片を持ち帰る"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Bring me a piece of the darkest shadow"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/boann_quests.json
msgid ""
"There's a shadow that haunts the night.  Bring me proof that you killed it "
"and I'll grant you the right to bear my banner."
msgstr "夜を彷徨う影を倒し、それを示すものを持ち帰ったならば、我が軍旗を掲げる権利を与えましょう。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Bring me a piece of the darkest shadow"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/boann_quests.json
msgid "Have you slain the shadow?"
msgstr "影を打ち倒したのですか？"

#. ~ Mission name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/boann_quests.json
msgid "Kill a star-crowned hound in my name"
msgstr "星冠の猟犬を殺す"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Kill a star-crowned hound in my name"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/boann_quests.json
msgid "Have you slain the hound from beyond reality?"
msgstr "世界の狭間に棲む猟犬を打ち倒したのですか？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/draco_dune.json
msgid "Have you seen anything that could help me?"
msgstr "何か役立ちそうな情報はないか？"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/draco_dune.json
msgid ""
"The last fifteen years or so before the Cataclysm were weirder than the "
"years before that don't you remember?  Well anyway before the end of things,"
" I used to travel across New England as a wandering musician earning my keep"
" as I could.  There were good times and there were hard times; and once when"
" things were at their hardest I was starving and cold and playing my guitar "
"on the shore of the lake.  A swan boat glides up to the shore quiet as a "
"mouse, a tall elegantly dressed man stepped out of the boat and asked me to "
"come play for them at the 'bonum collis'.  Being more hungry than I was "
"scared, I went with him."
msgstr ""
"大変動以前の15年間は、更にそれ以前の数年間より妙なことが多かったと思わないか？まあともかく、その頃私は放浪のミュージシャンとして、ニューイングランド中を旅しながら、日銭を稼いで暮らしていた。いい時期もあれば悪い時期もあったさ。一番苦しかった頃、私は飢えと寒さに耐えながら、湖のほとりでギターを弾いていたんだ。すると、スワンボートがネズミのように静かに岸に近付いてきて、背の高い上品な身なりの男が降り立った。そいつは私に「ボナム・コルリス」という所で演奏しないかと話を持ち掛けてきたんだ。不気味ではあったが、それより腹が減って仕方なかった。私は彼について行ったよ。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/draco_dune.json
msgid ""
"So I get the boat and it moves smooth as silk across the lake, no sound or "
"vibration but the waves against the hull.  I never see anyone or anything "
"guiding the boat or making it move.  Anyway we arrived at an island in the "
"lake and as we approached I can hear laughter and music.  Once we landed, "
"they had me sign a contract which I'd figured would just be an NDA not to "
"talk about the rich peoples party island.  Turns out I signed a contract to "
"play music every night for three months for the price of room and board."
msgstr ""
"私が乗り込むと、ボートは湖上を絹のように滑らかに動きだした。音も震動もなく、船体に波が当たる音だけが響いている。ボートを何かで引っ張っているようにも、ボート自体に動力が付いてるようにも見えないんだ。そんなこんなで、私は湖に浮かぶ島に着いた。島に近付くと笑い声と音楽が聞こえてくる。上陸してすぐ、契約書にサインをするよう言われた。私はてっきり、金持ちがパーティーに使ってる島のことをバラすなっていう、秘密保持契約だと思ってた。ところがどっこい、部屋代と食事代付きで三か月間毎晩演奏しろって契約だったんだ。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/draco_dune.json
msgid "You've got to be kidding."
msgstr "冗談だろう。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/draco_dune.json
msgid "I can't believe this story.  Goodbye."
msgstr "そんな話は信じられない。さようなら。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/draco_dune.json
msgid ""
"Long story short, I played for them every night like the contract said, it "
"was a good bit better than starving to death.  I saw and heard some of the "
"craziest things while I was there and other humans came and made deals and "
"went.  They told me that this particular 'sith' had strict rules about how "
"to treat people and that I was quite lucky to be here.  It didn't feel like "
"they considered themselves 'people'.  Anyway when my contract was up they "
"said they'd quite enjoyed my time with them and gave me some gifts to help "
"me get along once I'd left their island.  When society broke down I thought "
"about heading there to see if they were still there.  I chickened out when I"
" realized how far it was compared to my evacuation point.  Course, here I am"
" among the unwanted masses, maybe you'll find them there if you decide to go"
" look."
msgstr ""
"そこからも色々あったが、ともかく私は契約通り毎晩島の住人のために演奏した。餓死するよりはマシだからね。島にいる間はおかしなものばかり見たし、島の外からも誰かしらやってきては取り引きをして、そして去って行った。そいつらが教えてくれたんだが、この島の「支配者」は他人の言動に色々うるさいたちで、私がここにいられるのはかなり幸運なことだったそうだ。その来訪者も、どうも自分たちを「人間」だとは思ってないような口ぶりだった。やがて契約の期間が終わり、楽しい演奏だったと褒められ、島の外でもやっていけるようにと、贈り物まで貰った。時は流れて世界は滅び、私は今もあの島に何か残っていないか、行ってみたいと思った。しかし、避難場所へ向かうのと比べたら、とてつもなく時間がかかる。私は怖気づいた。そんなこんなで今は爪はじき者たちの仲間入りをしている訳だが、どうだろう、君が見に行けばいいんじゃないか。何か見つかるかもしれないぞ。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/draco_dune.json
msgid "Maybe I'll check it out."
msgstr "機会があれば、調べてみよう。"

#. ~ Mission name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/draco_dune.json
msgid "Go check out this island"
msgstr "島を調査する"

#. ~ Description of mission "Go check out this island"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/draco_dune.json
msgid ""
"This is where the island I agreed to a strange deal is.  I wonder if they're"
" still there."
msgstr "奇妙な契約が行われた島に行ってみましょう。まだ何か残っているかもしれません。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/mr_lapin.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/rubik.json
msgid "What can you tell me about Xedra?"
msgstr "XEDRAについて教えて？"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/mr_lapin.json
msgid ""
"Are you talking about the Zebra agencies?  I probably don't know any more "
"than you do.  When things started getting weird about a decade ago, all "
"these new departments starting springing up out of Homeland Security.  Their"
" badges were just barcodes that if you scanned with your phone would put you"
" in contact with your local law enforcement, who'd vouch for them."
msgstr ""
"ゼドラって、ゼブラのことかな？そんなに色々知ってるわけじゃないけどね。10年くらい前からおかしな事件が増えてきて、国土安全保障省で新しい部署が次々作られたんだ。ゼブラのバッジはバーコードになっていて、携帯電話でそれを読み取ると、後ろ盾になってくれる地元警察を呼べるんだってさ。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/mr_lapin.json
msgid ""
"I just keep finding references to them, I wondered if anyone else was as "
"well."
msgstr "ちょっと気になったから聞いてみただけだ。"

#. ~ Name suffix of an NPC
#. ~ spider victims could be hosts could be transforming.
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/npc_classes.json
msgid "spider victim"
msgstr "クモの餌"

#. ~ Name of an NPC class
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/npc_classes.json
msgid "Spider Victim"
msgstr "クモの餌"

#. ~ Job description of "Spider Victim" NPC class
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/npc_classes.json
msgid "I've been captured by these spider things.  Please rescue me!"
msgstr "クモみたいな化け物に捕まっちまった。頼む、助けてくれ！"

#. ~ Name suffix of an NPC
#. ~ someone with dreaming powers
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/npc_classes.json
msgid "rescued dreamer"
msgstr "救出された夢想家"

#. ~ Name of an NPC class
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/npc_classes.json
msgid "Captured Dreamer"
msgstr "囚われの夢想家"

#. ~ Job description of "Captured Dreamer" NPC class
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/npc_classes.json
msgid ""
"I dreamt of another world and something came and snatched me away from my "
"home."
msgstr "別世界の夢を見ていたと思ったら、家にやってきた何者かに連れ去られたんだ。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/npc_vampiresacrifice_chat.json
msgid "Can you tell me how much do you like me?"
msgstr "私のことをどう思っている？"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/npc_vampiresacrifice_chat.json
msgid "You're a good friend.  I had better friends but I also had way worse."
msgstr "それなりにいい友達だ。もっと仲のいい友達も、全然そうでもない友達もいたけれど。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/npc_vampiresacrifice_chat.json
msgid "Thanks for telling me. Can we talk about something else?"
msgstr "教えてくれてありがとう。他のことについて話そう。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/npc_vampiresacrifice_chat.json
msgid "Thanks for telling me. See you later."
msgstr "教えてくれてありがとう。また後で話そう。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/npc_vampiresacrifice_chat.json
msgid ""
"I would love it if you could find my favorite book.  Could you help me find "
"it?  It's an anthology of stories titled 'Apocalypse Now'.  I know it's "
"weird to want to read a book about apocalypses during one, but it gives me "
"hope we'll come out the other side of this one too."
msgstr ""
"お気に入りの本を探しているんだ。手伝ってもらえないか？『アポカリプス・ナウ』ってタイトルの短編集だ。黙示録の世界で黙示録についての本を読みたいなんて変な話だけれど、あの本を読めば、この世界を生き抜く希望が湧いてくるような気がするんだ。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/npc_vampiresacrifice_chat.json
