#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/npc_vampiresacrifice_chat.json
msgid ""
"You're the best person in the world for me.  I wouldn't ever hesitate to "
"trust you with my life.  I feel that no matter what happens, it'll be fine "
