msgid "Ierde"
msgstr "エルデ"

#. ~ Description of profession "Ierde" for male
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/player/professions.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"With the dimensional spillage that preceded the Cataclysm you are the spirit of a place that slowly gained sentience, a genius loci.  As the world reshapes itself you have decided to wander from your birthplace and determine where you will end up.\n"
"\n"
"As a spirit of the earth, your powers are strengthened by contact with the soil and the rock and weakened by separation from the living earth."
msgstr ""
"大変動の先触れとなった次元流入現象によって徐々に知性が芽生えた、この世界の地霊です。世界が刻々と姿を変える中、生まれ故郷を離れ、行く当てを探す旅に出ました。\n"
"\n"
"大地の精霊の力は土や岩に触れることで強化され、大地から離れることで弱まります。"

