msgstr "このメモは後で処分。トニー、マーテル、ピカレリの仇を取るためにも、ミラーレンズ領域の情報が必要。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "border_patrol_files"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/snippets/xedra.json
msgid ""
"Date: 07/13/2008\n"
"Location: Old Cain Springs, Kentucky\n"
"Incident: Faerie Incursion\n"
"Description: Our department has received reports of strange occurrences in the area, including sightings of small, barkskinned creatures that match the description of faeries from folklore.  Witnesses have reported missing objects, strange noises, and unexplained lights in the vicinity.\n"
"Response: Our team has been dispatched to the area to investigate.  We are working closely with local law enforcement and other relevant agencies to determine the nature of the incursion and to neutralize any potential threats.  We advise residents to stay indoors and report any suspicious activity to the authorities.\n"
"Status: The situation is ongoing.  We have set up a temporary command center in the area and are conducting a thorough investigation.  Our team is equipped with specialized equipment to detect and track interdimensional activity.  We will provide further updates as the situation develops.\n"
"Recommendation: Based on our findings, we recommend that the area be designated as a potential hotspot for interdimensional activity.  We suggest that ongoing surveillance and monitoring be put in place to ensure the safety of local residents and to prevent any further incursions.  We also recommend that education programs be put in place to help residents understand the nature of these creatures and how to avoid potential conflicts."
msgstr ""
"日付: 2008年07月13日\n"
"場所: ケンタッキー州オールド・カイン・スプリングス\n"
"発生事象: 妖精界からの侵入\n"
"説明: 当部署は、当該地域で奇妙な現象が起きているという報告を受けている。民間伝承のフェアリーの説明に一致する、樹皮のような皮膚をもつ小生物の目撃情報などがあり、更に、当該地域付近で物体の消失、奇妙な音、原因不明の光などが目撃されている。\n"
"対応: 当チームが調査のために当該地域に派遣された。当チームは地元の法執行機関およびその他の関連機関と緊密に連携し、侵入者の性質を特定し、潜在的な脅威を無力化すべく行動している。当該地域住民には、屋内に留まり、不審な動きがあれば警察当局に報告するよう伝達している。\n"
"状況: 対応継続中。現地に臨時司令部を設置し、異次元の活動を検知・追跡する専門機器を揃え、徹底的な調査を行っている。進展があり次第、最新の状況を報告する。\n"
"提案: 調査結果に基づき、当該地域を異次元活動の潜在的ホットスポットに指定することを提案する。地域住民の安全を確保し、さらなる侵入を防ぐためには、継続的な監視とモニタリングが必要である。また、地域住民に異次元生命体の性質を理解させ、潜在的な衝突を回避するために、教育プログラムを実施することを提案する。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "border_patrol_files"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/snippets/xedra.json
msgid ""
"Date: 07/25/2008\n"
"Location: Old Cain Springs, Kentucky\n"
"Incident: Abduction of Locals\n"
"Description: Our team has received reports of several local residents who have gone missing under mysterious circumstances.  Witnesses have reported seeing small, floating lights in the area around the time of the disappearances, leading us to believe that fae-class cryptids may be involved.\n"
"Response: Our team has launched a full investigation into the matter, working in close coordination with local law enforcement.  We have engaged significant animal based tracking resources, and are gathering intelligence from witnesses and other sources to build a comprehensive picture of the situation.\n"
"Status: The situation is ongoing.  At this time, we have not been able to locate the missing individuals or definitively establish the involvement of fae-class cryptids.  However, we are actively pursuing all leads and are dedicating significant resources to this investigation.\n"
"Recommendation: Based on our findings to date, we recommend that the area be designated as a high-risk zone for fae cryptid activity.  We urge all residents to exercise caution and report any suspicious activity to the authorities.  Additionally, we recommend that public awareness campaigns be initiated to educate the public about the potential dangers of fae cryptids and how to avoid potential conflicts.  Our team will continue to provide updates as the investigation progresses."
msgstr ""
"日付: 2008年07月25日\n"
"場所: ケンタッキー州オールド・カイン・スプリングス\n"
"発生事象: 当該地域住民の誘拐\n"
"説明: 当チームは、複数の当該地域住民が不可解な状況で行方不明になっているとの報告を受けている。行方不明者が発生した時間帯に、現場付近で小型の浮遊光が目撃されたという証言がある。妖魔クラスの未確認生物が関与している可能性が考えられる。\n"
"対応: 当チームは地元警察と緊密に連携しながら、当該事象に関する詳しい調査を開始した。動物による追跡リソースを活用し、目撃者やその他の情報源から情報を収集し、状況の全体像の把握に努めている。\n"
"状況: 対応継続中。現時点では、行方不明者の所在を突き止めることができておらず、妖魔クラスの未確認生物の関与を断定するには至っていない。この捜査に重要リソースを投入し、あらゆる手掛かりを積極的に追求している。\n"
"提案: 以上の調査結果に基づき、当該地域を、妖魔クラス未確認生物の活動に対するハイリスクゾーンに指定することを推奨する。当該地域住民には、注意深く行動し、不審な動きがあれば警察当局に報告するよう要請している。妖魔クラス未確認生物の潜在的危険性及び衝突を回避するため、啓蒙活動を開始することを推奨する。捜査に進展があり次第、最新の状況を報告する。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "border_patrol_files"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/snippets/xedra.json
msgid ""
"Date: 04/29/2016\n"
"Location: Norton, Massachusetts wetlands\n"
"Incident: Strange lights and sounds in bogs at night\n"
"Description: Sam 'Goatman' Simmons, has reported numerous strange lights and sounds emanating from the bogs on the northern edge of Norton, MA on the way to Rehobeth.  He'd been drinking and walking his goat late one night and as he neared the edge of the wetlands he heard strange music and multicolored lights.  He suspected one of his neighbors who's property adjoined the bog of throwing a party but after walking around the edges he couldn't figure out how to get through the various streams and ponds to get to it.  Finally at some point, he remembered stories his grandparents had told about people going missing in the bogs and decided to go home and call the police.  The police passed it on to the Border Patrol who investigated for dimensional spillage.  While they were unable to find any cryptids or artifacts at the bogs, they measured a weakness in reality that suggests that the stories might have basis in fact.  Border Patrol left emergency contact information with the local police in the event of any future incursions."
msgstr ""
"日付: 2016年04月29日\n"
"場所: マサチューセッツ州ノートン 湿地帯\n"
"発生事象: 夜間に湿地帯で奇妙な光と音との遭遇報告\n"
"説明: サム・\"ゴートマン\"・シモンズが、マサチューセッツ州ノートン北からレホベス方面へ向かう最中、湿地帯で奇妙な光と音に遭遇したことを報告した。事象発生当時は深夜で、彼は酒を飲みながらヤギの散歩をしていたが、湿地帯に近付いた際に、奇妙な音楽が聞こえ、色とりどりの光が見えたと証言している。彼は最初、単に湿地帯付近の住人がパーティーを開いているのだと思ったが、周辺を歩き回ってみても、多数の小川や池に阻まれ、音と光の発生源には近寄ることができなかった。その後彼は、湿地帯で発生した行方不明者の話を祖父母から聞いていたことを思い出し、帰宅して警察に通報した。警察からこの一件に関する報告を受けた国境警備隊が現場に向かい、次元の流入の有無を調査した。警備隊は現場で未確認生物やアーティファクトを確認できなかったが、目撃者の証言が事実である可能性を示唆する現実世界との接続の弱まりが観測された。国境警備隊は今後の侵入に備え、地元警察に緊急連絡先を通達した。"

#. ~ Spell name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/spells/XAEA.json
msgid "Artifact Earthquake"
msgstr "地震(アーティファクト)"

#. ~ Message of spell "Artifact Earthquake"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/spells/XAEA.json
msgid ""
"The earth around you rumble, and in an instant everything happen to be "
"upside down."
msgstr "周囲から地響きが起こり、一瞬にして何もかもがひっくり返るほどの衝撃が広がりました。"

#. ~ Spell name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/spells/XAEA.json
msgid "Artifact Quake Earthquake"
msgstr "地震の揺れ(アーティファクト)"

#. ~ Spell name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/spells/XAEA.json
msgid "Artifact Quake Transform"
msgstr "地震による変化(アーティファクト)"

#. ~ Message of spell "Artifact Teleport"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/spells/XAEA.json
msgid ""
"It's not like you teleport somewhere else, rather the whole world has been "
"shifted, and you are left in the same place."
msgstr "自分の肉体が移動しているわけではありません。むしろ世界全体が移動し、肉体が取り残されているのです。"

#. ~ Spell name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/spells/XAEA.json
msgid "Artifact Kill"
msgstr "殺害(アーティファクト)"

#. ~ Description of spell "Artifact Kill"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/spells/XAEA.json
#, c-format
msgid "Deal damage equal to 1000% of monster's HP."
msgstr "モンスターのHPの1000%に相当するダメージを与えます。"

#. ~ Message of spell "Artifact Kill"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/spells/XAEA.json
msgid "Something living nearby just exploded with fountain of gore."
msgstr "周囲のモンスターが破裂し、血が噴水のように飛び散りました。"

#. ~ Message of spell "Artifact Heal"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/spells/XAEA.json
msgid "Your flesh quickly rots and regenerates like in timelapse."
msgstr "肉体が一瞬で腐り、逆再生したかのように元通りになりました。"

#. ~ Description of spell "Artifact Pain"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/spells/XAEA.json
msgid "Decrease some pain."
msgstr "苦痛が一定量減少します。"

#. ~ Message of spell "Artifact Pain"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/spells/XAEA.json
msgid "All your feelings numb for a second, and all pain is gone now."
msgstr "一瞬あらゆる感情が麻痺し、痛みが消え去りました。"

#. ~ Spell name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/spells/XAEA.json
msgid "Artifact Stamina"
msgstr "スタミナ(アーティファクト)"

#. ~ Description of spell "Artifact Stamina"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/spells/XAEA.json
msgid "Restore some stamina."
msgstr "スタミナが一定量回復します。"

#. ~ Message of spell "Artifact Stamina"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/spells/XAEA.json
msgid ""
"The energy stream into your muscle, and you feel you can run a marathon "
"right now."
msgstr "筋肉にエネルギーが流れ込み、今からマラソンに出場できそうなほど元気になりました。"

#. ~ Spell name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/spells/XAEA.json
msgid "Artifact Mana"
msgstr "マナ(アーティファクト)"

#. ~ Description of spell "Artifact Mana"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/spells/XAEA.json
msgid "Restore some mana."
msgstr "マナが一定量回復します。"

#. ~ Message of spell "Artifact Mana"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/spells/XAEA.json
msgid ""
"You feel your body become energized, and you are ready to change the world."
msgstr "体内に力が溢れ、世界を変える準備が整いました。"

#. ~ Message of spell "Artifact Map"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/spells/XAEA.json
msgid "You feel like you know this place."
msgstr "この場所を以前から知っているような気がしてきました。"

#. ~ Spell name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/spells/XAEA.json
msgid "Artifact Strength Boost"
msgstr "筋力上昇(アーティファクト)"

#. ~ Description of spell "Artifact Strength Boost"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/spells/XAEA.json
msgid "Grant you powerful damage boost for 2 minutes."
msgstr "筋力が2分間大幅に上昇します。"

#. ~ Name of effect type id "xe_str"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/spells/XAEA.json
msgid "Enormous power"
msgstr "圧倒的な力"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Enormous power"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/spells/XAEA.json
msgid "Your muscles scream with force."
msgstr "筋肉に力が漲っています。"

#. ~ Apply message of effect type "Enormous power"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/spells/XAEA.json
msgid "Unleash the power."
msgstr "筋肉に力が漲りました。"

#. ~ Remove message of effect type "Enormous power"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/spells/XAEA.json
msgid "The power fades away."
msgstr "漲っていた力が消え去りました。"

#. ~ Spell name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/spells/XAEA.json
msgid "Artifact Intelligence Boost"
msgstr "知性上昇(アーティファクト)"

#. ~ Description of spell "Artifact Intelligence Boost"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/spells/XAEA.json
msgid "Grant you huge int bonus for 1-2 hours."
msgstr "知性が1～2時間大幅に上昇します。"

#. ~ Name of effect type id "xe_int"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/spells/XAEA.json
msgid "The Knowledge"
msgstr "知恵"

#. ~ Description of effect type "The Knowledge"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/spells/XAEA.json
msgid ""
"You know for sure - right now you are the smartest human on this side of the"
" planet."
msgstr "地球上で最も賢くなったことを理解しました。"

#. ~ Apply message of effect type "The Knowledge"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/spells/XAEA.json
msgid "With some effort you can outsmart reality."
msgstr "現実すら凌駕する知恵を手にしました。"

#. ~ Remove message of effect type "The Knowledge"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/spells/XAEA.json
msgid "You feel yourself much less smarter than before."
msgstr "以前よりずっと頭が悪くなったように感じます。"

#. ~ Spell name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/spells/XAEA.json
msgid "Artifact Electric Sight"
msgstr "ロボット透視(アーティファクト)"

#. ~ Description of spell "Artifact Electric Sight"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/spells/XAEA.json
msgid "Gives you an ability to see electric creatures for a whole week."
msgstr "電気の力で動くモンスターを透視する能力が1週間備わります。"

#. ~ Name of effect type id "xe_sight_elec"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/spells/XAEA.json
msgid "Sparks"
msgstr "火花"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Sparks"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/spells/XAEA.json
msgid "You feel sparks dancing in your eyes."
msgstr "両目から火花が飛び散ったように感じました。"

#. ~ Apply message of effect type "Sparks"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/spells/XAEA.json
msgid "Tiny electrical joints jump in your cornea."
msgstr "角膜の中に小さな火花が宿りました。"

#. ~ Remove message of effect type "Sparks"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/spells/XAEA.json
msgid "The sparks in your eyes are finally gone."
msgstr "目の中の火花が消え去りました。"

#. ~ Spell name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/spells/XAEA.json
msgid "Artifact Incorporeal"
msgstr "霊体(アーティファクト)"

#. ~ Description of spell "Artifact Incorporeal"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/spells/XAEA.json
msgid "Gives incorporeal effect for 0,5-1 hour."
msgstr "肉体が30分～1時間消失します。"

#. ~ Spell name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/spells/XAEA.json
msgid "Artifact Line"
msgstr "線状破壊(アーティファクト)"

#. ~ Description of spell "Artifact Line"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/spells/XAEA.json
msgid "Create a line of pure destruction."
msgstr "一直線上に純粋な破壊を引き起こします。"

#. ~ Message of spell "Artifact Line"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/spells/XAEA.json
msgid "Silently, a part of the world nearby just disappears."
msgstr "音もなく、付近の世界の一部が破壊されました。"

#. ~ Spell name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/spells/XAEA.json
msgid "Artifact Line Bash"
msgstr "線状地形破壊(アーティファクト)"

#. ~ Spell name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/spells/XAEA.json
msgid "Artifact Hologram Summon"
msgstr "ホログラム召喚(アーティファクト)"

#. ~ Description of spell "Artifact Hologram Summon"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/spells/XAEA.json
msgid "Summon a lot of holograms around you, for 0,5 - 1 h."
msgstr "周囲に大量のホログラムを30分～1時間召喚します。"

#. ~ Message of spell "Artifact Hologram Summon"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/spells/XAEA.json
msgid "It is you.  And this is you.  And that is you.  You are everywhere."
msgstr "これはあなた。それもあなた。そして、あれもあなたです。あなたはどこにでもいます。"

#. ~ Spell name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/spells/XAEA.json
msgid "Artifact Electric Emitter"
msgstr "電撃放出(アーティファクト)"

#. ~ Description of spell "Artifact Electric Emitter"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/spells/XAEA.json
msgid "Emit giant electric clout for 5 - 15 m."
msgstr "巨大な電撃の雲を5～15分間発生させます。"

#. ~ Name of effect type id "xaea_electric_emit"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/spells/XAEA.json
msgid "Shocker"
msgstr "電撃放出"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Shocker"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/spells/XAEA.json
msgid "Your body emit enough energy to power some small city."
msgstr "小さな都市を稼働させるのに十分な量のエネルギーを肉体から放出しています。"

#. ~ Apply message of effect type "Shocker"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/spells/XAEA.json
msgid "Shocking clouds fly everywhere!"
msgstr "周囲に電撃が広がりました！"

#. ~ Remove message of effect type "Shocker"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/spells/XAEA.json
msgid "Electric clouds are gone."
msgstr "電撃は消え去りました。"

#. ~ Spell name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/spells/XAEA.json
msgid "Artifact Add Moves"
msgstr "行動コスト無消費(アーティファクト)"

#. ~ Description of spell "Artifact Add Moves"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/spells/XAEA.json
msgid "Gives 15 - 45 seconds of free actions."
msgstr "行動コストを消費せずに15～45秒間自由に行動できます。"

#. ~ Message of spell "Artifact Add Moves"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/spells/XAEA.json
msgid "The world around you silently stops."
msgstr "周囲の世界が静止しました。"

#. ~ Spell name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/spells/XAEA.json
msgid "Artifact Super Senses"
msgstr "超感覚(アーティファクト)"

#. ~ Description of spell "Artifact Super Senses"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/spells/XAEA.json
msgid "You can feel any monster in range for a 0,5 - 2 h."
msgstr "範囲内のモンスターを知覚する能力が30分～2時間備わります。"

#. ~ Name of effect type id "xe_motion_vision"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/spells/XAEA.json
msgid "Extra Senses"
msgstr "超感覚"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Extra Senses"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/spells/XAEA.json
msgid "Somehow you can feel any motion around with your spine."
msgstr "脊椎で周囲の動きをなんとなく感じ取れます。"

#. ~ Apply message of effect type "Extra Senses"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/spells/XAEA.json
msgid "You feel unusual sensation in your spine."
msgstr "脊椎に超常的な感覚が備わりました。"

#. ~ Remove message of effect type "Extra Senses"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/spells/XAEA.json
msgid "The sensation in your spine gone."
msgstr "脊椎に備わっていた超感覚が消え去りました。"

#. ~ Message of spell "Night Sight"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/spells/classless_spells.json
msgid ""
"Your eyes glow lavender for a moment.  Now your sight can pierce the darkest"
" shadows."
msgstr "瞳が一瞬ラベンダー色に光り、暗黒を見通す力を得ました。"

#. ~ Spell name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/spells/classless_spells.json
msgid "Weight of Dread"
msgstr "ｳｪｲﾄ･ｵﾌﾞ･ﾄﾞﾚｯﾄﾞ"

#. ~ Description of spell "Weight of Dread"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/spells/classless_spells.json
msgid ""
"Everything around you faces an existential crisis and moves slower as a "
"result.  Including things that you wouldn't expect to suffer from "
"existential crises, like the undead.  The air around the targets' "
"extremities chills dramatically.  Higher levels allow a bigger AoE, and "
"longer effect."
msgstr ""
"ゾンビなどの恐怖を感じないモンスターも含め、周囲の全てが実存的恐怖に直面し、四肢にまとわりつく空気が急激に冷え、動きが鈍くなります。レベルが上昇するほど範囲が広くなり、効果時間も長くなります。"

#. ~ Spell name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/spells/classless_spells.json
msgid "Blur"
msgstr "ﾌﾞﾗｰ"

#. ~ Description of spell "Blur"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/spells/classless_spells.json
msgid ""
"The edges of your form seem to blur and distort, increasing the amount of "
"attacks you might dodge in a given turn."
msgstr "魔法のオーラが身体をぼやけさせ、1ターンで回避できる攻撃回数を増加させます。"

#. ~ Spell name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/spells/classless_spells.json
msgid "Damage Transfer"
msgstr "ﾀﾞﾒｰｼﾞ･ﾄﾗﾝｽﾌｧｰ"

#. ~ Description of spell "Damage Transfer"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/spells/classless_spells.json
msgid ""
"Allows you to move some damage from your body to someone else.  Usually "
"people don't like it, but who cares now?"
msgstr "詠唱者の肉体へのダメージを他の誰かの肉体に肩代わりさせます。こんなことをされて喜ぶ人はいませんが、今更気にすることがあるでしょうか？"

#. ~ Spell name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/spells/classless_spells.json
msgid "Damage Transfer Heal"
msgstr "ﾀﾞﾒｰｼﾞ･ﾄﾗﾝｽﾌｧｰ回復"

#. ~ Description of spell "Damage Transfer Heal"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/spells/classless_spells.json
msgid ""
"A spell that will heal you for a bit.  You can see it only in debug mode."
msgstr "HPを少し回復します。デバッグモード以外では表示されません。"

#. ~ Spell name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/spells/classless_spells.json
msgid "Pyroportation"
msgstr "ﾊﾟｲﾛﾎﾟｰﾃｰｼｮﾝ"

#. ~ Description of spell "Pyroportation"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/spells/classless_spells.json
msgid ""
"Transports you from one place to another, creating a huge fire explosion in "
"the end."
msgstr "別の地点へ転移し、元いた地点に大爆発を引き起こします。"

#. ~ Spell name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/spells/classless_spells.json
msgid "Pyroportation Explosion"
msgstr "ﾊﾟｲﾛﾎﾟｰﾃｰｼｮﾝ(爆発)"

#. ~ Description of spell "Pyroportation Explosion"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/spells/classless_spells.json
msgid "Makes a pretty big fire explosion around you."
msgstr "詠唱者を中心とした広範囲に炎と爆発を発生させます。"

#. ~ Spell name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/spells/classless_spells.json
msgid "Call Daffodil"
msgstr "ｺｰﾙ･ﾀﾞﾌｧﾃﾞｨﾙ"

#. ~ Description of spell "Call Daffodil"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/spells/classless_spells.json
msgid ""
"A few daffodil warriors appear near you.  They will fight for you, but they "
"will fade away after a day."
msgstr "数体の水仙の戦士が周囲に現れます。共に戦ってくれますが、1日経つと消えてしまいます。"

#. ~ Description of spell "Call Daffodil"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/spells/classless_spells.json
msgid "Hidden spell that spawns the daffodil"
msgstr "水仙の戦士を生成するための、通常は表示されない呪文です。"

#. ~ Spell name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/spells/dreamer_spells.json
msgid "Return Critters"
msgstr "ﾘﾀｰﾝ･ｸﾘｯﾀｰｽﾞ"

#. ~ Description of spell "Return Critters"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/spells/dreamer_spells.json
msgid "Summons your critters back to you, if they got lost."
msgstr "迷子になった生物を呼び寄せます。"

#. ~ Spell name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/spells/dreamer_spells.json
msgid "Dream Blade"
msgstr "ﾄﾞﾘｰﾑ･ﾌﾞﾚｰﾄﾞ"

#. ~ Description of spell "Dream Blade"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/spells/dreamer_spells.json
msgid ""
"This ephemeral blade allows you to defend yourself with dreams brought out "
"of your mind!"
msgstr "自分自身の心の中から引き出した夢を儚げな剣に変え、身を守ります！"

#. ~ Spell name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/spells/dreamer_spells.json
msgid "Dream Dagger"
msgstr "ﾄﾞﾘｰﾑ･ﾀﾞｶﾞｰ"

#. ~ Description of spell "Dream Dagger"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/spells/dreamer_spells.json
msgid ""
"This ephemeral dagger is powered with your own inner reality connections, "
"and is deadlier the larger your mana pool."
msgstr "詠唱者の内なる現実との繋がりを糧におぼろげな短剣を生み出します。マナの最大容量が多いほど、短剣の威力も上昇します。"

#. ~ Spell name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/spells/dreamer_spells.json
msgid "Dream Armor"
msgstr "ﾄﾞﾘｰﾑ･ｱｰﾏｰ"

#. ~ Description of spell "Dream Armor"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/spells/dreamer_spells.json
msgid ""
"Armor that sits lightly on your body with little in the way of encumbrance "
"and rests on top of whatever you are wearing."
msgstr "軽く、動作制限もほとんどない鎧をまといます。"

#. ~ Spell name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/spells/dreamer_spells.json
msgid "Bring Forth Dreamdross"
msgstr "ﾌﾞﾘﾝｸﾞ･ﾌｫｰｽ･ﾄﾞﾘｰﾑﾄﾞﾛｽ"

#. ~ Spell name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/spells/dreamer_spells.json
msgid "Banish Interdimensional Horrors"
msgstr "ﾊﾞﾆｯｼｭ･ｲﾝﾀｰﾃﾞｨﾒﾝｼｮﾅﾙ･ﾎﾗｰｽﾞ"

#. ~ Description of spell "Banish Interdimensional Horrors"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/spells/dreamer_spells.json
msgid ""
"Attempts to banish things clearly inimical to local physics back to their "
"home dimension."
msgstr "明らかに現実世界の物理法則から外れた存在を、元いた次元に追放しようとします。"

#. ~ Spell name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/spells/dreamer_spells.json
msgid "Banish Darkness Made Flesh"
msgstr "ﾊﾞﾆｯｼｭ･ﾀﾞｰｸﾈｽ･ﾒｲﾄﾞ･ﾌﾚｯｼｭ"

#. ~ Description of spell "Banish Darkness Made Flesh"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/spells/dreamer_spells.json
msgid "Attempts to banish monsters crafted from the darkest of nights."
msgstr "夜の暗がりから生み出されるモンスターを、元いた世界に追放しようとします。"

#. ~ Spell name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/spells/dreamer_spells.json
msgid "Twin"
msgstr "ﾂｲﾝ"

#. ~ Description of spell "Twin"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/spells/dreamer_spells.json
msgid "Make a fake copy of yourself to disrupt your enemies."
msgstr "詠唱者の写し身を作り出し、敵をかく乱します。"

#. ~ Spell name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/spells/dreamer_spells.json
msgid "Twin Flood"
msgstr "ﾂｲﾝ･ﾌﾗｯﾄﾞ"

#. ~ Description of spell "Twin Flood"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/spells/dreamer_spells.json
msgid "Fill the reality with your own copies."
msgstr "詠唱者の写し身で周囲を埋め尽くします。"

#. ~ Description of spell "Unfold"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/spells/dreamer_spells.json
msgid "All walls are obliterated before your eyes."
msgstr "視線を遮る全ての壁が透明になります。"

#. ~ Spell name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/spells/dreamer_spells.json
msgid "Spatial Awareness"
msgstr "ｽﾍﾟｰｼｬﾙ･ｱｳｪｱﾈｽ"

#. ~ Description of spell "Spatial Awareness"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/spells/dreamer_spells.json
msgid "Feel them.  See them.  Connect to them."
msgstr "彼らを感じ、彼らを見、彼らとつながりました。"

#. ~ Spell name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/spells/dreamer_spells.json
msgid "Summon Shifter"
msgstr "ｻﾓﾝ･ｼﾌﾀｰ"

#. ~ Description of spell "Summon Shifter"
#. ~ Description of spell "Summon Duplicator"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/spells/dreamer_spells.json
msgid "Summon a portal creature to help in a dangerous situation."
msgstr "ポータルの向こう側からモンスターを呼び出し、加勢してもらいます。"

#. ~ Spell name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/spells/dreamer_spells.json
msgid "Summon Light"
msgstr "ｻﾓﾝ･ﾗｲﾄ"

#. ~ Description of spell "Summon Light"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/spells/dreamer_spells.json
msgid ""
"Summon a disturbed sapient entity of another reality with a hatred for "
"living creatures.  It won't attack you.  At least for now."
msgstr "全ての生物を憎悪する知性体を別の次元から召喚します。詠唱者を攻撃しようとする様子は、今のところありません。"

#. ~ Spell name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/spells/dreamer_spells.json
msgid "Hammering"
msgstr "ﾊﾝﾏﾘﾝｸﾞ"

#. ~ Description of spell "Hammering"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/spells/dreamer_spells.json
msgid ""
"Using your energy you construct an oddly shaped hammer.  You can use it to "
"smash your enemies, or breach different obstacles."
msgstr "エネルギー体から奇妙な形状のハンマーを作り出します。このハンマーを使えば障害物や敵を打ち壊せます。"

#. ~ Spell name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/spells/dreamer_spells.json
msgid "Smash A Target"
msgstr "夢鉱ハンマー標的攻撃"

#. ~ Sound description of spell "Smash A Target"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/spells/dreamer_spells.json
msgid "a smash"
msgstr "ガンッ。"

#. ~ Spell name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/spells/dreamer_spells.json
msgid "Constructed Hammer Bash"
msgstr "夢鉱ハンマー破壊"

#. ~ Spell name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/spells/dreamer_spells.json
msgid "Constructed Hammer Self destruct"
msgstr "夢鉱ハンマー自己破壊"

#. ~ Description of spell "Constructed Hammer Self destruct"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/spells/dreamer_spells.json
msgid "Removes constructed hammer.  You can't see it except in debug mode."
msgstr "ハンマーを消去します。デバッグモード以外では表示されません。"

#. ~ Spell name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/spells/dreamer_spells.json
msgid "Summon Duplicator"
msgstr "ｻﾓﾝ･ﾃﾞｭﾌﾟﾘｹｰﾀｰ"

#. ~ Spell name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/spells/dreamer_spells.json
msgid "Toss a Coin"
msgstr "ﾄｽ･ｱ･ｺｲﾝ"

#. ~ Description of spell "Toss a Coin"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/spells/dreamer_spells.json
msgid "Toss a coin.  On which side are you?"
msgstr "コインを投げます。裏か、表か？"

#. ~ Spell name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/spells/dreamer_spells.json
msgid "Summon Angel"
msgstr "ｻﾓﾝ･ｴﾝｼﾞｪﾙ"

#. ~ Description of spell "Summon Angel"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/spells/dreamer_spells.json
msgid ""
"Summon a creature that looks pretty similar to how angels are described in "
"the Bible - a giant flying mess of wings, eyes and rings."
msgstr "聖書に描かれている天使によく似たモンスター、すなわち翼と目をもつリング状の巨大な飛行物体を召喚します。"

#. ~ Spell name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/spells/dreamer_spells.json
msgid "Construct a Winch"
msgstr "ｺﾝｽﾄﾗｸﾄ･ｱ･ｳｲﾝﾁ"

#. ~ Description of spell "Construct a Winch"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/spells/dreamer_spells.json
msgid ""
"Create a small token.  When used, it'll pull you back to the place you "
"created it."
msgstr "小さな石を作り出します。この石を使用すると、作り出した地点に一瞬で転移します。"

#. ~ Spell name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/spells/dreamer_spells.json
msgid "Spawn a Winch"
msgstr "ウインチ生成"

#. ~ Description of spell "Spawn a Winch"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/spells/dreamer_spells.json
msgid "Spawns a winch item.  You can see it only in debug mode."
msgstr "引き寄せ効果を持つアイテムを生成します。デバッグモード以外では表示されません。"

#. ~ Spell name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/spells/dreamer_spells.json
msgid "Pull From Beyond"
msgstr "ﾌﾟﾙ･ﾌﾛﾑ･ﾋﾞﾖﾝﾄﾞ"

#. ~ Description of spell "Pull From Beyond"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/spells/dreamer_spells.json
msgid ""
"Using your abilities, you compress the gap between your hands with pure "
"energy, attempting to construct…  something."
msgstr "その身に宿った力を使い、純粋なエネルギーを一点に集め...何かを造り出します。"

#. ~ Description of spell "Ethereal Wings"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/spells/dreamer_spells.json
msgid ""
"Two ethereal wings sprout out of your back indefinitely until toggled off.  "
"They work as phantasmal pair of wings that can somehow lift your weight even"
" without conscious effort."
msgstr ""
"背中から一対のエーテルの羽が生え、無効化しない限り消えることはありません。この幻想的な翼は、特に意識しなくても肉体を浮遊させる力をもっています。"

#. ~ Spell name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/spells/dreamer_spells.json
msgid "Karma Arms"
msgstr "ｶﾙﾏ･ｱｰﾑｽﾞ"

#. ~ Description of spell "Karma Arms"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/spells/dreamer_spells.json
msgid ""
"Four transparent arms emit out of your body indefinitely until toggled off."
"  They work as a desirable additional pair of arms, and who knows what power"
" they contain?"
msgstr ""
"4本の透明な腕が肉体から生え、特質を無効化するまで消えることはありません。追加の攻撃手段として活用できますが、一体どんな力を発揮するのでしょうか？"

#. ~ Spell name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/spells/dreamer_spells.json
msgid "Stalker's Oculars"
msgstr "ｽﾄｰｶｰｽﾞ･ｵｷｭﾗｽ"

#. ~ Description of spell "Stalker's Oculars"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/spells/dreamer_spells.json
msgid ""
"Your own eyes are replaced with the eyeballs of an unknown creature, "
"indefinitely, until you toggle them off.  Compounded from billions of red "
"crosses inside void-dark sclera, they can see much more clearly than any "
"natural creature."
msgstr ""
"特質を有効化すると、両目が未知のモンスターの眼球に変化します。虚ろで暗い強膜に覆われた瞳には、何十億もの赤色の十字が敷き詰められており、どんな野生動物よりも遥かに多くのものを見ることができます。"

#. ~ Description of spell "Devil's Tail"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/spells/dreamer_spells.json
msgid ""
"A stretchy tail appears from the base of your spine, instinctively aiding "
"you in battle or moving to defend you, indefinitely, until toggled off."
msgstr "特質を有効化すると、背骨の根本からしなやかな尻尾が生え、攻撃や防御のために本能的に動きます。"

#. ~ Spell name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/spells/dreamer_spells.json
msgid "Lucid Dreams"
msgstr "ﾙｼｰﾄﾞ･ﾄﾞﾘｰﾑｽ"

#. ~ Description of spell "Lucid Dreams"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/spells/dreamer_spells.json
msgid ""
"The line between reality and your dreams shrinks enormously.  In this dream "
"you are barely affected by reality, with most changes to your body reverting"
" when you wake up.  While it may end your dream, not even death can touch "
"you."
msgstr ""
"現実と夢との境界が限りなく曖昧になります。この夢の中では現実世界の影響をほとんど受けず、目覚めたときには、肉体への影響の大部分が消えています。死ねば夢はそこで終わりますが、現実世界の存在が死ぬことはありません。"

#. ~ Spell name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/spells/dreamsmithing.json
msgid "Call Oneiric Hammer"
msgstr "ｺｰﾙ･ｵﾈｲﾘｯｸ･ﾊﾝﾏｰ"

#. ~ Description of spell "Call Oneiric Hammer"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/spells/dreamsmithing.json
msgid ""
"Creates a crystal blacksmith's hammer with which to build a new reality.  "
"You need all your magic force to hold it, and you unable to do any magic "
"while using it."
msgstr "新たな現実を造るための鍛冶用ハンマーを生成します。このハンマーを持つには全魔力を注ぐ必要があるため、使用中は他の魔法は使えません。"

#. ~ Spell name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/spells/eater_spells.json
msgid "Eat dreamdross"
msgstr "ｲｰﾄ･ﾄﾞﾘｰﾑﾄﾞﾛｽ"

#. ~ Description of spell "Eat dreamdross"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/spells/eater_spells.json
msgid "You consume dreamdross to regain mana.  Pretty tasty."
msgstr "夢鉱を消費してマナを回復させます。中々の美味しさです。"

#. ~ Spell name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/spells/eater_spells.json
msgid "Eat dreamdross mood effect T1"
msgstr "ｲｰﾄ･ﾄﾞﾘｰﾑﾄﾞﾛｽ(T1)"

#. ~ Description of spell "Eat dreamdross mood effect T1"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/spells/eater_spells.json
msgid "Boost your mood from consuming dreamdross.  Tier 1 effect."
msgstr "夢鉱を消費して意欲を高めます。ティア1の効果が発生します。"

#. ~ Spell name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/spells/eater_spells.json
msgid "Eat more dreamdross"
msgstr "ｲｰﾄ･ﾓｱ･ﾄﾞﾘｰﾑﾄﾞﾛｽ"

#. ~ Description of spell "Eat more dreamdross"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/spells/eater_spells.json
msgid ""
"You can consume more dreamdross to regain mana in one sitting.  Delicious."
msgstr "夢鉱を多量に消費して、マナを大きく回復させます。とても美味しいです。"

#. ~ Spell name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/spells/eater_spells.json
msgid "Eat dreamdross mood effect T2"
msgstr "ｲｰﾄ･ﾄﾞﾘｰﾑﾄﾞﾛｽ(T2)"

#. ~ Description of spell "Eat dreamdross mood effect T2"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/spells/eater_spells.json
msgid "Boost your mood from consuming dreamdross.  Tier 2 effect."
msgstr "夢鉱を消費して意欲を高めます。ティア2の効果が発生します。"

#. ~ Spell name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/spells/eater_spells.json
msgid "Eat dreamdross ingots"
msgstr "ｲｰﾄ･ﾄﾞﾘｰﾑﾄﾞﾛｽ･ｲﾝｺﾞｯﾄ"

#. ~ Description of spell "Eat dreamdross ingots"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/spells/eater_spells.json
msgid ""
"You can't really process so much dreamdross at once, and additionally to "
"restoring your mana pool, it directly improves your body, making your "
"stronger and healthier.  It is probably the most delicious thing in your "
"life."
msgstr ""
"一度に大量の夢鉱をマナに変換することはできません。摂取した場合マナは回復せず、肉体が直接的に強化され、より強く健康的になります。今まで食べてきた食事の中で最も美味しいと感じます。"

#. ~ Spell name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/spells/eater_spells.json
msgid "Eat dreamdross mood effect T3"
msgstr "ｲｰﾄ･ﾄﾞﾘｰﾑﾄﾞﾛｽ(T3)"

#. ~ Description of spell "Eat dreamdross mood effect T3"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/spells/eater_spells.json
msgid "Boost your mood from consuming dreamdross.  Tier 3 effect."
msgstr "夢鉱を消費して意欲を高めます。ティア3の効果が発生します。"

#. ~ Spell name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/spells/eater_spells.json
msgid "Eat dreamdross ingots mana"
msgstr "ｲｰﾄ･ﾄﾞﾘｰﾑﾄﾞﾛｽ･ｲﾝｺﾞｯﾄ(マナ)"

#. ~ Description of spell "Eat dreamdross ingots mana"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/spells/eater_spells.json
msgid "Restore some mana when you consume a whole dreamdross ingot."
msgstr "夢鉱鋳塊を消費してマナを回復します。"

#. ~ Spell name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/spells/eater_spells.json
msgid "Blood Boil"
msgstr "ﾌﾞﾗｯﾄﾞ･ﾎﾞｲﾙ"

#. ~ Description of spell "Blood Boil"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/spells/eater_spells.json
msgid ""
"With a shouted ancient word, the target's blood temperature begins to "
"increase dangerously."
msgstr "古代の呪文を叫び、標的の血液温度を急上昇させます。"

#. ~ Description of spell "Trade dreams for health"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/spells/eater_spells.json
msgid "Absorbs some dross and heals damage to yourself."
msgstr "夢鉱を消費して詠唱者のHPを回復します。"

#. ~ Spell name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/spells/eater_spells.json
msgid "Recover fatigue for dreams"
msgstr "ﾘｶﾊﾞｰ･ﾌｧﾃｨｰｸﾞ･ﾌｫｰ･ﾄﾞﾘｰﾑｽ"

#. ~ Description of spell "Recover fatigue for dreams"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/spells/eater_spells.json
msgid "Absorbs some dross and heals fatigue to yourself."
msgstr "夢鉱を消費して詠唱者の倦怠を回復します。"

#. ~ Message of spell "Recover fatigue for dreams"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/spells/eater_spells.json
msgid "You feel refreshed."
msgstr "倦怠感が解消されました。"

#. ~ Spell name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/spells/eater_spells.json
msgid "Spring-heeled Leap"
msgstr "ｽﾌﾟﾘﾝｸﾞﾋｰﾙﾄﾞ･ﾘｰﾌﾟ"

#. ~ Description of spell "Spring-heeled Leap"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/spells/eater_spells.json
msgid "Force pushes your feet off the ground and launches you several meters."
msgstr "強い力で足を押し上げ、数メートル跳躍します。"

#. ~ Description of spell "Blind Rage"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/spells/eater_spells.json
msgid "Perfect hatred."
msgstr "強烈な憎悪の力で攻撃します。"

#. ~ Description of spell "Circulatory"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/spells/eater_spells.json
msgid "Don't stop."
msgstr "止まっている暇はありません。"

#. ~ Spell name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/spells/eater_spells.json
msgid "Dark Vision"
msgstr "ﾀﾞｰｸ･ﾋﾞｼﾞｮﾝ"

#. ~ Description of spell "Dark Vision"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/spells/eater_spells.json
msgid "Enhance your eyes to see at night as clearly as in daylight."
msgstr "目を強化し、夜間でも昼と同じ視界を確保します。"

#. ~ Description of spell "Dodge"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/spells/eater_spells.json
msgid "Shun their attacks."
msgstr "攻撃を回避します。"

#. ~ Description of spell "Endurance"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/spells/eater_spells.json
msgid "Take the blows.  Don't let the world kill you."
msgstr "この世界に殺されないように、防御力を高めます。"

#. ~ Spell name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/spells/eater_spells.json
msgid "Hide"
msgstr "ﾊｲﾄﾞ"

#. ~ Description of spell "Hide"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/spells/eater_spells.json
msgid "Don't let them spot you."
msgstr "敵に見つからないように身を潜めます。"

#. ~ Spell name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/spells/eater_spells.json
msgid "Open Mind"
msgstr "ｵｰﾌﾟﾝ･ﾏｲﾝﾄﾞ"

#. ~ Description of spell "Physical Instrument"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/spells/eater_spells.json
msgid "Your body is a tool of destruction.  Use it effectively."
msgstr "肉体は破壊のための道具です。効果的に使いましょう。"

#. ~ Description of spell "Pierce"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/spells/eater_spells.json
msgid "Throw a long ethereal spear out of your hand."
msgstr "手から霊的な長槍を投射します。"

#. ~ Description of spell "Rush"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/spells/eater_spells.json
msgid "Run.  Run as fast as you can.  Don't stop."
msgstr "できる限り速く走り続けましょう。止まってはいけません。"

#. ~ Description of spell "Weakening"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/spells/eater_spells.json
msgid "Make enemies around you more vulnerable."
msgstr "周囲の敵を弱体化させます。"

#. ~ Description of spell "Unbreakable"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/spells/eater_spells.json
msgid "Nothing can move you from your path."
msgstr "誰もこの肉体の通り道を遮ることはできません。"

#. ~ Description of spell "Point Blank"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/spells/eater_spells.json
msgid ""
"A straight hit with your arm.  Using additional energy you could probably "
"break a wall with such a powerful strike."
msgstr "エネルギーを込めて腕をまっすぐ突き出すことで、壁すら破壊するパンチを繰り出します。"

#. ~ Spell name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/spells/eater_spells.json
msgid "Point Blank Bash"
msgstr "ﾎﾟｲﾝﾄ･ﾌﾞﾗﾝｸ地形破壊"

#. ~ Description of spell "Point Blank Bash"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/spells/eater_spells.json
msgid "Additional terrain damage."
msgstr "地形を破壊する追加効果です。"

#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC
#. "EOC_ITEM_HEDGE_WITCHLIGHT_DISMISS_ACTUAL"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/spells/hedge_magic_eocs.json
msgid "The witchlight vanishes without a sound."
msgstr "ウィッチライトは音もなく消えました。"

#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_HEDGE_MAKE_PLANTS_GROW_2" in nested
#. EOCs in effect in EoC "EOC_HEDGE_MAKE_PLANTS_GROW"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/spells/hedge_magic_eocs.json
msgid ""
"As you finish the words of the charm, the magic takes hold.  (E)xamine a "
"nearby crop to fertilize it."
msgstr "まじないの言葉を唱えると、魔法の肥料が出来上がりました。隣接している作物の地形を調べる(E)ことで肥料を与えます。"

#. ~ Player message in false effect in EoC "EOC_HEDGE_MAKE_PLANTS_GROW_2" in
#. nested EOCs in effect in EoC "EOC_HEDGE_MAKE_PLANTS_GROW"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/spells/hedge_magic_eocs.json
msgid ""
"You must complete the charm within one hour of noon for it to be effective."
msgstr "まじないが効果を発揮するには、正午から1時間以内に実行する必要があります。"

#. ~ Player message in false effect in EoC "EOC_HEDGE_MAKE_PLANTS_GROW"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/spells/hedge_magic_eocs.json
msgid "You must be standing on soil for the charm to be effective."
msgstr "大地の上に立っていなければまじないが効果を発揮しません。"

#. ~ Player message in false effect in EoC "EOC_HEDGE_STUNNING_SPELL"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/spells/hedge_magic_eocs.json
msgid "You must be outside to use the charm."
msgstr "まじないが効果を発揮するには屋外にいる必要があります。"

#. ~ Player message in false effect in EoC "EOC_HEDGE_HIDE_IN_FOREST"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/spells/hedge_magic_eocs.json
msgid "Without being in a forest, the charm has no effect."
msgstr "森林にいなければお守りが効果を発揮しません。"

#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_HEDGE_TURN_INTO_BEAR_WEAR_ITEM"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/spells/hedge_magic_eocs.json
msgid ""
"As you put the mantle on, your skin writhes, your limbs twist, and thick fur"
" sprouts from your body as you fall onto all fours."
msgstr "毛皮をかぶると皮膚がよじれ、四肢が歪み、その場に這いつくばり、全身から厚い毛が生えました。"

#. ~ Player message in nested effect in then statement in effect in EoC
#. "EOC_HEDGE_TURN_INTO_BEAR_SIDE_EFFECTS"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/spells/hedge_magic_eocs.json
msgid ""
"It would be so easy to walk off into the forest and forget you had ever been"
" human."
msgstr "森に踏み入れば、自分がかつて人間であったことなど簡単に忘れてしまいそうです。"

#. ~ Player message in nested effect in then statement in effect in EoC
#. "EOC_HEDGE_TURN_INTO_BEAR_SIDE_EFFECTS_CURE_FAST"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/spells/hedge_magic_eocs.json
msgid ""
"You remember your childhood.  The sound of your mother's voice.  You are not"
" a wild beast!"
msgstr "幼少期の記憶を思い浮かべました。母の声が聞こえます。獣の姿は仮初のものです！"

#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_HEDGE_TURN_INTO_BEAR_REMOVE_ITEM"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/spells/hedge_magic_eocs.json
msgid ""
"Your nonexistence arms somehow remove the mantle and return to your old "
"shape."
msgstr "存在しない筈の腕でどうにか毛皮を脱ぎ、元の姿に戻りました。"

#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_HEDGE_WALK_ON_WATER"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/spells/hedge_magic_eocs.json
msgid ""
"You drop the bark on the water and recite the words of the charm, and as you"
" take your first step, the water feels firm under your feet."
msgstr "樹皮を水面に落とし、まじないの言葉を唱えながら一歩踏み出すと、水が足をしっかりと支えました。"

#. ~ Player message in false effect in EoC "EOC_HEDGE_WALK_ON_WATER"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/spells/hedge_magic_eocs.json
msgid "You must be standing on water or the charm will have no effect."
msgstr "水のある地形にいなければまじないが効果を発揮しません。"

#. ~ Player message in false effect in EoC
#. "EOC_HEDGE_WALK_ON_WATER_CONTINUANCE_2" in nested EOCs in effect in EoC
#. "EOC_HEDGE_WALK_ON_WATER_CONTINUANCE"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/spells/hedge_magic_eocs.json
msgid "As you step on solid ground again, the charm fades."
msgstr "再び地面に足をつけると、魔法の力が薄れました。"

#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_HEDGE_BLESS_STEEL_WEAPON_EFFECT" in
#. nested EOCs on true condition in effect in EoC
#. "EOC_HEDGE_BLESS_STEEL_WEAPON"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/spells/hedge_magic_eocs.json
msgid ""
"You pass the weapon through the candleflame after rubbing the mixture of "
"salt and herbs on it while slowly reciting the words of the charm, and when "
"you have finished you feel a sense of surety while holding it"
msgstr ""
"まじないの言葉をゆっくりと唱えながら、武器に塩と薬草の混合物を塗りつけ、ろうそくの炎で炙りました。儀式が終わると、武器の中に確かな力が籠っているのを感じます。"

#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC
#. "EOC_HEDGE_BLESS_STEEL_WEAPON_ATTACKS_CHECK_DAMAGE" in nested EOCs on true
#. condition in effect in EoC "EOC_HEDGE_BLESSED_WEAPON_LOSE_CHARM"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/spells/hedge_magic_eocs.json
msgid "You no longer feel a sense of purity from your weapon"
msgstr "武器に込められた力が消えました。"

#. ~ Spell name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/spells/hedge_magic_spells.json
msgid "To Keep Off the Rain and the Damp"
msgstr "水濡れ除けのまじない"

#. ~ Description of spell "To Keep Off the Rain and the Damp"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/spells/hedge_magic_spells.json
msgid ""
"Keep yourself from getting wet in the rain.  The charm will not keep you dry"
" if you step into a water source."
msgstr "雨から身を守りましょう。このまじないを使えば、水源などに浸かっても身体が濡れることはありません。"

#. ~ Message of spell "To Keep Off the Rain and the Damp"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/spells/hedge_magic_spells.json
msgid ""
"You crush the leaves and wrap them in the cloth, touching it to you "
"forehead, the crown of your head, both shoulders, and the backs of both "
"wrists as you recite the words of the charm."
msgstr "葉をちぎって布に包み、額、頭頂部、両肩、両手首の外側に当てながら、まじないの言葉を唱えました。"

#. ~ Spell name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/spells/hedge_magic_spells.json
msgid "To Bring Light to Dark Places"
msgstr "闇照らしのまじない"

#. ~ Description of spell "To Bring Light to Dark Places"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/spells/hedge_magic_spells.json
msgid ""
"Summon up a bobbing ball of light, just bright enough to read by.  You may "
"activate the witchlight to dismiss it."
msgstr "読書するのに十分なほど明るく輝く、ゆらめく光球を召喚します。アイテムのウィッチライトを使用すると光を消します。"

#. ~ Message of spell "To Bring Light to Dark Places"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/spells/hedge_magic_spells.json
msgid ""
"Takin a bit of oil on your fingertips, you trace a pattern in the air while "
"reciting the words of the charm, and a glowing ball of light forms in the "
"air."
msgstr "指先に少量の油を付け、まじないの言葉を唱えながら空中に模様を描くと、空中に浮かぶ光の玉が現れました。"

#. ~ Spell name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/spells/hedge_magic_spells.json
msgid "To Bring Health to the Soil and Life to the Crops"
msgstr "作物肥やしのまじない"

#. ~ Description of spell "To Bring Health to the Soil and Life to the Crops"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/spells/hedge_magic_spells.json
msgid ""
"While standing on soil or turned earth, perform a ritual to increase the "
"bounty of the crops.  The casting of this charm must end within one hour of "
"noon."
msgstr "土が露出した大地の上に立ち、作物の実りをよくする儀式を行います。このまじないは正午から1時間以内に完了する必要があります。"

#. ~ Message of spell "To Bring Health to the Soil and Life to the Crops"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/spells/hedge_magic_spells.json
msgid ""
"You dance slowly over the living earth, letting the seeds fall at the "
"appropriate time, and as the sun climbs to its zenith you recite the last "
"words of the charm."
msgstr "露出した大地の上でゆっくりと舞いながら適切な間隔で種を落とし、太陽が天頂に昇ったのを見計らってまじないの最後の言葉を唱えました。"

#. ~ Description of spell "To Kindle the Flames"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/spells/hedge_magic_spells.json
msgid "Call forth the remnants of a fire from some ash to light a new flame."
msgstr "灰の中から残り火を呼び起こし、新たな炎を灯します。"

#. ~ Message of spell "To Kindle the Flames"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/spells/hedge_magic_spells.json
msgid ""
"You sprinkle the wood ash over the kindling as you recite the words of the "
"charm."
msgstr "まじないの言葉を唱えながら、焚き付けに木灰を振りかけました。"

#. ~ Spell name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/spells/hedge_magic_spells.json
msgid "To Spot the Goodly Folk"
msgstr "異人探しのまじない"

#. ~ Description of spell "To Spot the Goodly Folk"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/spells/hedge_magic_spells.json
msgid ""
"Using wild herbs and hawthorn berries, create an amulet that will tell you "
"if any of the Fair Folk are nearby."
msgstr "野草やサンザシの実を使って、こことは異なる世界に棲む者が近くにいることを知らせるお守りを作ります。"

#. ~ Message of spell "To Spot the Goodly Folk"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/spells/hedge_magic_spells.json
msgid ""
"You laboriously sew the square of leather into a pouch and place the herbs "
"and hawthorn berries inside.  Chanting softly, you seal the bag and attach "
"the string to it so it can be worn around your neck."
msgstr ""
"四角い革を丁寧に縫って袋を作り、その中に野草とサンザシの実を詰めます。そして、まじないの言葉を呟きながら袋を密封して、首に掛けられるように紐を付けました。"

#. ~ Spell name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/spells/hedge_magic_spells.json
msgid "To Perceive the Mazzikin"
msgstr "魔物悟りのまじない"

#. ~ Description of spell "To Perceive the Mazzikin"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/spells/hedge_magic_spells.json
msgid ""
"Using blood and ashes and certain herbs, create a paste that when rubbed on "
"the eyes, will allow you to perceive otherworldly beings even in darkness or"
" through walls.  It will inhibit your mundane sight, however."
msgstr ""
"血や灰、ある種の薬草などを使ってペーストを作り、両目に擦りつけることで、暗闇や壁越しでも異界の存在を感知できるようになります。ただし、通常の視界は妨げられます。"

#. ~ Message of spell "To Perceive the Mazzikin"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/spells/hedge_magic_spells.json
msgid ""
"You grind the bones to powder and mix in the blood and herbs while "
"rhythmically chanting the words of the charm, and when you're done you have "
"a dark, foul-smelling paste as the reward of your labors."
msgstr ""
"骨を粉々に砕き、まじないの言葉をリズミカルに唱えながら血と薬草を混ぜ込みました。しばらく儀式を続け、やがて悪臭を放つ黒いペーストが出来上がりました。"

#. ~ Spell name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/spells/hedge_magic_spells.json
msgid "Maze the Little Folk"
msgstr "小さき妖を迷わしむまじない"

#. ~ Description of spell "Maze the Little Folk"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/spells/hedge_magic_spells.json
msgid ""
"A spell to create a snare for catching one of the little folk, a changeling."
"  Has no effect on the elder spirits of wood and water, fire and earth, nor "
"plant or man."
msgstr "妖精の一種であるチェンジリングを捕まえる罠を作り出すまじないです。木、水、火、土、植物、人を司る古の精霊には効果がありません。"

#. ~ Message of spell "Maze the Little Folk"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/spells/hedge_magic_spells.json
msgid ""
"You skein a complicated cat's cradle with splinters of wood guiding the way "
"in to blackberries at each of the focus points in your design."
msgstr "複雑な形状の紐細工に木片を括り付け、仕掛けの要となる位置にブラックベリーを置きました。"

#. ~ Spell name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/spells/hedge_magic_spells.json
msgid "To Befuddle As the Thunderstrike"
msgstr "雷落としのまじない"

#. ~ Description of spell "To Befuddle As the Thunderstrike"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/spells/hedge_magic_spells.json
msgid ""
"While outdoors, recite a quick charm to produce a flash of light like unto a"
" thunderbolt, bedazzling anyone around you."
msgstr "屋外で簡単なまじないの言葉を唱えると、雷のような閃光が発生して周囲の者を驚かせます。"

#. ~ Message of spell "To Befuddle As the Thunderstrike"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/spells/hedge_magic_spells.json
msgid ""
"You call out the words of the charm to the sky and there is a burst of "
"light."
msgstr "空に向かってまじないの言葉を唱えると、閃光が迸りました。"

#. ~ Spell name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/spells/hedge_magic_spells.json
msgid "To Befuddle As the Thunderstrike Real"
msgstr "雷落としのまじない効果"

#. ~ Description of spell "To Befuddle As the Thunderstrike Real"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/spells/hedge_magic_spells.json
msgid "The actual spell that causes the effect.  It's a bug if you have it."
msgstr "効果を実行する呪文です。通常は表示されません。"

#. ~ Spell name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/spells/hedge_magic_spells.json
msgid "To Purge the Most Virulent Grippe"
msgstr "悪疫封じのまじない"

#. ~ Description of spell "To Purge the Most Virulent Grippe"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/spells/hedge_magic_spells.json
msgid ""
"By adding particular herbs and a bit of iron to your tea while you recite "
"the words of the charm over it, you can brew a tea that will prove a "
"sovereign remedy to a cold or a flu."
msgstr "ある種の薬草と少量の鉄分を加えた茶にまじないの言葉を唱えることで、風邪やインフルエンザの特効薬となる飲み物を作り出します。"

#. ~ Message of spell "To Purge the Most Virulent Grippe"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/spells/hedge_magic_spells.json
msgid ""
"You brew the tea, adding in a bit of scrap iron and herbs to mix in, while "
"you recite a chant as you stir, and eventually the tea is ready."
msgstr "茶に少量の鉄片と薬草を混ぜ、まじないの言葉を唱えながらかき混ぜると、飲み薬が出来上がりました。"

#. ~ Spell name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/spells/hedge_magic_spells.json
msgid "To Ward Off the Evil Eye"
msgstr "邪眼除けのまじない"

#. ~ Description of spell "To Ward Off the Evil Eye"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/spells/hedge_magic_spells.json
msgid ""
"With a bit of salt and some muttered words, deflect the gaze of the evil "
"eye."
msgstr "少量の塩とまじないの言葉によって邪悪な視線を防ぎます。"

#. ~ Message of spell "To Ward Off the Evil Eye"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/spells/hedge_magic_spells.json
msgid ""
"You toss a bit of salt over your left shoulder with your right hand and spit"
" three times into the folds of your clothing as you say, \"Keneinahora\"."
msgstr "「ケネイナホラ」と唱えながら右手で左肩に少量の塩を撒き、服の皺に唾を3回吹きかけました。"

#. ~ Spell name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/spells/hedge_magic_spells.json
msgid "To Thrice-Bar the Portal"
msgstr "戸口塞ぎのまじない"

#. ~ Description of spell "To Thrice-Bar the Portal"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/spells/hedge_magic_spells.json
msgid ""
"With some string and the words of the charm, lock a door firmly, even one "
"that doesn't have a locking mechanism."
msgstr "紐とまじないの言葉を使い、錠前が付いていない扉もしっかりと施錠します。"

#. ~ Message of spell "To Thrice-Bar the Portal"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/spells/hedge_magic_spells.json
msgid ""
"You wind the cord several times around your fingers, muttering the words of "
"the charm, and as the pattern ends you hear a soft thud."
msgstr "まじないの言葉を呟きながら決められた手順で紐を指に何度か巻き付けると、どこからかドスンと鈍い音がしました。"

#. ~ Spell name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/spells/hedge_magic_spells.json
msgid "To See Beyond the Barriers"
msgstr "壁見透かしのまじない"

#. ~ Description of spell "To See Beyond the Barriers"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/spells/hedge_magic_spells.json
msgid "Gain a brief vision of what lies beyond a wall or a doorway."
msgstr "壁や扉の向こうにあるものを手早く把握します。"

#. ~ Message of spell "To See Beyond the Barriers"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/spells/hedge_magic_spells.json
msgid ""
"You close your eyes and place the shards of glass over them and press, just "
"slightly.  As the pain blooms and the blood trickles, you see beyond."
msgstr "閉じた瞼の上にガラス片を軽く押し付けると、痛みと共に血が滴り落ち、障壁の先の光景が浮かび上がってきました。"

#. ~ Spell name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/spells/hedge_magic_spells.json
msgid "To See Beyond the Barriers Real"
msgstr "壁見透かしのまじない効果"

#. ~ Description of spell "To See Beyond the Barriers Real"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/spells/hedge_magic_spells.json
msgid ""
"The actual spell that causes the effect for To See Beyond the Barriers.  "
"It's a bug if you have it."
msgstr "壁見透かしのまじないの効果を実行する呪文です。通常は表示されません。"

#. ~ Spell name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/spells/hedge_magic_spells.json
msgid "To Sooth the Pains and Injuries of the Flesh"
msgstr "傷癒しのまじない"

#. ~ Description of spell "To Sooth the Pains and Injuries of the Flesh"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/spells/hedge_magic_spells.json
msgid ""
"Mix a paste of herbs, water, and willow bark and rub it on the target's "
"wounds.  The charm increases the speed at which wounds heal, as long as the "
"target does not engage in any strenuous activity."
msgstr "薬草、水、ヤナギの樹皮を混ぜたペーストを傷口に塗り込むことで、激しい運動をしない限りは治癒速度が上昇します。"

#. ~ Message of spell "To Sooth the Pains and Injuries of the Flesh"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/spells/hedge_magic_spells.json
msgid ""
"You grind the herbs and willowbark together with the water, making a thick, "
"woody-smelling paste, and rub it on the target."
msgstr "薬草とヤナギの樹皮と水をすり潰して木の香りがする濃厚なペーストを作り出し、傷に塗り込みました。"

#. ~ Spell name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/spells/hedge_magic_spells.json
msgid "To Halt the Scarlet Flow"
msgstr "血止めのまじない"

#. ~ Description of spell "To Halt the Scarlet Flow"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/spells/hedge_magic_spells.json
msgid ""
"With some whispered words and a mixture of iron, salt, and herbs, increase "
"your ability to stop the flow of blood.  Best recited right before bandaging"
" a wound."
msgstr "鉄、塩、薬草の混合物とまじないの言葉を使い、止血の力を高めます。傷に包帯を巻く直前に唱えるのが最適です。"

#. ~ Message of spell "To Halt the Scarlet Flow"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/spells/hedge_magic_spells.json
msgid ""
"You face toward the east and recite the words of the charm as you rub the "
"iron and salt and herbs on your hands."
msgstr "東を向き、まじないの言葉を唱えながら鉄と塩と薬草の混合物を両手に塗りました。"

#. ~ Description of spell "To Vanish Amidst the Leaves"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/spells/hedge_magic_spells.json
msgid ""
"While standing in a forest, conceal your presence.  For a brief time after "
"using the charm, anything looking at you will only see another bit of "
"foliage.  Movement or taking any hostile action will cancel the charm."
msgstr ""
"森の中で立ち止まり、姿を隠します。まじないが効果を発揮すると、敵に視認されても、舞い散る木の葉だと認識されて見つかりません。移動したり、攻撃を仕掛けたりすると、効果は消えてしまいます。"

#. ~ Message of spell "To Vanish Amidst the Leaves"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/spells/hedge_magic_spells.json
msgid ""
"You wrap the beans in the leaf and, with a slight grimace, recite the words "
"of the charm before you put them in your mouth and hold them there."
msgstr "葉で包んだ豆を口に含んだまま、しかめ面でまじないの言葉を唱えました。"

#. ~ Spell name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/spells/hedge_magic_spells.json
msgid "To Sail on the River of Dreams"
msgstr "夢渡りのまじない"

#. ~ Description of spell "To Sail on the River of Dreams"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/spells/hedge_magic_spells.json
msgid ""
"With lavender and thyme, weave a barrier around your sleeping space to keep "
"bad dreams away.  You must perform the charm directly before trying to "
"sleep; moving will breach the barrier and allow the nightmares to find a way"
" in again."
msgstr ""
"ラベンダーとタイムを使って寝床に魔法の障壁を張り、悪い夢を遠ざけます。このまじないは寝る直前に実行する必要があります。唱えた後移動すると障壁が消えてしまい、悪夢は遠ざけられません。"

#. ~ Message of spell "To Sail on the River of Dreams"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/spells/hedge_magic_spells.json
msgid ""
"You place the herbs under your pillow and, while chanting the words of the "
"charm, paint some thyme oil on the four corners of your sleeping space."
msgstr "薬草を枕の下に置き、まじないの言葉を唱えながら寝床の四隅にタイムの精油を塗りました。"

#. ~ Spell name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/spells/hedge_magic_spells.json
msgid "To Walk the Forests with the Brown One"
msgstr "熊潜りのまじない"

#. ~ Description of spell "To Walk the Forests with the Brown One"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/spells/hedge_magic_spells.json
msgid ""
"Over the freshly-slain and butchered corpse of a bear, recite a paean to its"
" spirit while using its fur and sinew and skull to create a garment.  "
"Putting the garment on will take the spirit of the bear into yourself, "
"allowing you to assume its form until the garment is removed."
msgstr ""
"殺されて解体されたばかりのクマの死骸の上で、クマの魂への賛歌を唱えながらクマの毛皮と腱と頭蓋骨を使って衣服を作ります。この衣服を着用するとクマの魂が自らの内に取り込まれ、衣服を脱ぐまでクマの姿に変身することができます。"

#. ~ Message of spell "To Walk the Forests with the Brown One"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/spells/hedge_magic_spells.json
msgid ""
"As you recite the words of the charm, you sew the bits of fur together into "
"a rough mantle with the bear skull at the top."
msgstr "まじないの言葉を唱えながら毛皮の切れ端を縫い合わせ、クマの頭蓋骨が付いた野性的なマントを作りました。"

#. ~ Spell name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/spells/hedge_magic_spells.json
msgid "To Walk Across the Flowing Waters"
msgstr "水面歩きのまじない"

#. ~ Description of spell "To Walk Across the Flowing Waters"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/spells/hedge_magic_spells.json
msgid ""
"While standing with your feet in the water, recite this charm to have the "
"water bear you up.  You must keep moving at a steady pace, without running "
"or stopping for more than a few moments, or the charm will fade."
msgstr ""
"足を水に浸した状態でまじないの言葉を唱えると、水が足を支えてくれます。走ったり止まったりすることなく一定のペースで動き続けることでまじないの効果が維持されます。"

#. ~ Spell name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/spells/hedge_magic_spells.json
msgid "To Bless the Sacred Weapon"
msgstr "魔払いの武器のまじない"

#. ~ Description of spell "To Bless the Sacred Weapon"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/spells/hedge_magic_spells.json
msgid ""
"Ensorcell an iron or steel weapon that you are holding so it does additional"
" damage to unholy creatures when used in melee combat.  If the weapon is too"
" damaged, the charm will cease to function."
msgstr ""
"鉄または鋼製のアイテムに特別な力を込めることで、異界のモンスターに近接攻撃を加えた際に追加ダメージを与えます。武器が損傷しすぎると神聖な力は消えてしまいます。"

#. ~ Spell name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/spells/hedge_magic_spells.json
msgid "Blessed Weapon Nether Damage"
msgstr "祝福ダメージ"

#. ~ Description of spell "Blessed Weapon Nether Damage"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/spells/hedge_magic_spells.json
msgid ""
"This is the extra damage a blessed weapon does to Nether creatures.  It's a "
"bug if you have it directly."
msgstr "祝福された武器が異界モンスターに与える追加ダメージです。通常は表示されません。"

#. ~ Spell name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/spells/integrated_armor_spells.json
msgid "Coal Skin Burnback"
msgstr "燃える石炭の皮膚燃焼攻撃"

#. ~ Description of spell "Coal Skin Burnback"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/spells/integrated_armor_spells.json
msgid "The burnback effect from the burning coals skin."
msgstr "燃える石炭の皮膚の変異に伴う燃焼攻撃の効果です。"

#. ~ Description of enchantment "Salamander"
#. ~ Description of enchantment "Salamonstrous"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/spells/integrated_armor_spells.json
msgid ""
"Your Fire Elemental abilities grant you good resistance to temperature "
"conditions and heat damage.  Also your body emits streams of heat into "
"anyone who attack you."
msgstr "ファイアエレメンタルの能力によって、温度と熱ダメージに対する優れた耐性が付与されます。更に、攻撃を受けると熱を放出して反撃します。"

#. ~ Message in effect "integrated_coal_skin_burnback"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/spells/integrated_armor_spells.json
msgid "Flames and heat flash out from where you've been hit."
msgstr "攻撃を受けた箇所から炎と熱が噴き出しました。"

#. ~ Spell name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/spells/integrated_armor_spells.json
msgid "Flame Skin Burnback"
msgstr "燃え盛る皮膚燃焼攻撃"

#. ~ Description of spell "Flame Skin Burnback"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/spells/integrated_armor_spells.json
msgid "The burnback effect from the flaming skin."
msgstr "燃え盛る皮膚の変異に伴う燃焼攻撃の効果です。"

#. ~ Name of a enchantment
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/spells/integrated_armor_spells.json
msgid "Salamonstrous"
msgstr "サラマンダーの炎"

#. ~ Description of enchantment "cloud skin"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/spells/integrated_armor_spells.json
msgid ""
"Your cloud skin grant you good resistance to temperature conditions.  Also "
"your hands emit a small amount of electricity, increasing your damage in "
"melee."
msgstr "雲の皮膚の変異によって、温度に対する優れた耐性が付与されます。更に、手から弱い電撃を放出し、近接攻撃による与ダメージが増加します。"

#. ~ Description of enchantment "storm skin"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/spells/integrated_armor_spells.json
msgid ""
"Your storm skin grant you good resistance to temperature conditions.  Also "
"your hands emit a moderate amount of electricity, increasing your damage in "
"melee."
msgstr "嵐の皮膚の変異によって、温度に対する優れた耐性が付与されます。更に、手から電撃を放出し、近接攻撃による与ダメージが増加します。"

#. ~ Spell name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/spells/inventor_spells.json
msgid "Firmament-Driver"
msgstr "ﾌｧｰﾏﾒﾝﾄﾄﾞﾗｲﾊﾞｰ"

#. ~ Description of spell "Firmament-Driver"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/spells/inventor_spells.json
msgid ""
"Push the target.  It's not really effective, but sometimes comes in handy."
msgstr "標的を押し出します。あまり効果的ではありませんが、便利に使えることもあります。"

#. ~ Spell name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/spells/inventor_spells.json
msgid "Firmament-driver Damage"
msgstr "ﾌｧｰﾏﾒﾝﾄﾄﾞﾗｲﾊﾞｰ攻撃"

#. ~ Description of spell "Firmament-driver Damage"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/spells/inventor_spells.json
msgid "Deal some damage to the pushed enemy."
msgstr "押し出した敵にダメージを与えます。"

#. ~ Spell name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/spells/inventor_spells.json
msgid "Electric Brandish"
msgstr "ｴﾚｸﾄﾘｯｸ･ﾌﾞﾗﾝﾃﾞｨｯｼｭ"

#. ~ Description of spell "Electric Brandish"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/spells/inventor_spells.json
msgid "A small whip attack that uses energized cables as a conductor."
msgstr "通電したケーブルを小さな鞭にして攻撃します。"

#. ~ Spell name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/spells/item_spells.json
msgid "Throw The Hammer"
msgstr "ハンマー投擲"

#. ~ Description of spell "Throw The Hammer"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/spells/item_spells.json
msgid "You throw the hammer."
msgstr "ハンマーを投げます。"

#. ~ Spell name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/spells/item_spells.json
msgid "Väinämöinen's Kantele Song"
msgstr "ワイナミョイネンのカンテレ音楽"

#. ~ Description of spell "Väinämöinen's Kantele Song"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/spells/item_spells.json
msgid ""
"You play and sing songs written by or about a Finnish wizard/deity.  It "
"summons forest mammals to your presence."
msgstr "フィンランドの魔法使いや神々についての曲や神話上の存在が自ら書き残した曲を演奏して、野生動物たちを召喚します。"

#. ~ Spell name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/spells/item_spells.json
msgid "Nine more seconds"
msgstr "九秒の猶予"

#. ~ Description of spell "Nine more seconds"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/spells/item_spells.json
msgid ""
"Nine seconds of time stop for what I assume is a mythological reference."
msgstr "何らかの神話的な謂れがあると思われる、時を9秒間止める力です。"

#. ~ Message of spell "Nine more seconds"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/spells/item_spells.json
msgid "Time suddenly stops for everything but you."
msgstr "自分自身以外の全ての時間が停止しました。"

#. ~ Spell name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/spells/item_spells.json
msgid "Milk and Hazelnuts"
msgstr "乳と知恵の実"

#. ~ Description of spell "Milk and Hazelnuts"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/spells/item_spells.json
msgid "Spawns milk.  The extra effect spawns the hazelnuts."
msgstr "牛乳を生成します。追加効果としてヘーゼルナッツを生成します。"

#. ~ Spell name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/spells/item_spells.json
msgid "Here's the Hazelnuts"
msgstr "ヘーゼルナッツ生成"

#. ~ Description of spell "Here's the Hazelnuts"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/spells/item_spells.json
msgid "This extra effect spawns the hazelnuts."
msgstr "ヘーゼルナッツを生成する追加効果です。"

#. ~ Spell name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/spells/item_spells.json
msgid "Blackout rage drank"
msgstr "BORG酒"

#. ~ Description of spell "Blackout rage drank"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/spells/item_spells.json
msgid "This spell transforms you into a drunken master."
msgstr "詠唱者を成龍酔拳の使い手に変身させます。"

#. ~ Spell name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/spells/item_spells.json
msgid "Biotic Blast"
msgstr "生体爆発"

#. ~ Description of spell "Biotic Blast"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/spells/item_spells.json
msgid "Explode the enemy.  Literally."
msgstr "敵を文字通り爆発させます。"

#. ~ Spell name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/spells/item_spells.json
msgid "Ion Shot"
msgstr "イオン砲"

#. ~ Description of spell "Ion Shot"
#. ~ Description of spell "Secondary Ion Shot"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/spells/item_spells.json
msgid "A small ion charge."
msgstr "小規模のイオン爆発を引き起こします。"

#. ~ Spell name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/spells/item_spells.json
msgid "Secondary Ion Shot"
msgstr "イオン砲2"

#. ~ Spell name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/spells/item_spells.json
msgid "Instant Ignition"
msgstr "小爆発"

#. ~ Description of spell "Instant Ignition"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/spells/item_spells.json
msgid "Explode a small area."
msgstr "小規模な爆発を引き起こします。"

#. ~ Spell name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/spells/item_spells.json
msgid "Jump Boots Leap"
msgstr "跳躍強化"

#. ~ Description of spell "Jump Boots Leap"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/spells/item_spells.json
msgid "Makes you jump."
msgstr "飛び上がります。"

#. ~ Spell name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/spells/item_spells.json
msgid "Overture Electric Attack"
msgstr "オーバーチュアの電撃"

#. ~ Description of spell "Overture Electric Attack"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/spells/item_spells.json
msgid "You cast an electric spell at the monster."
msgstr "モンスターに対して電撃の呪文を詠唱します。"

#. ~ Spell name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/spells/item_spells.json
msgid "Blood of Saints"
msgstr "聖者の血"

#. ~ Spell name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/spells/item_spells.json
msgid "Extend Life"
msgstr "延命ポーション"

#. ~ Description of spell "Future Sight"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/spells/item_spells.json
msgid "Summons an aura that grants precognitive abilities."
msgstr "予知能力のオーラを纏います。"

#. ~ Description of spell "Terrible Strength"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/spells/item_spells.json
msgid "You gain a terrible strength."
msgstr "恐るべき筋力を得ました。"

#. ~ Spell name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/spells/item_spells.json
msgid "Hare Leap"
msgstr "ヘアズ・リープ"

#. ~ Spell name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/spells/item_spells.json
msgid "Create the dream-drainer"
msgstr "夢喰い蚊召喚"

#. ~ Description of spell "Create the dream-drainer"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/spells/item_spells.json
msgid ""
"This spell is used by the catalyst to summon the dream-drainer.  It's not "
"intended to be known by the player."
msgstr "触媒の使用によって発動し、夢喰い蚊を召喚します。操作キャラクターが習得する呪文ではありません。"

#. ~ Spell name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/spells/item_spells.json
msgid "Create the dream-drainer real"
msgstr "夢喰い蚊召喚効果"

#. ~ Description of spell "Create the dream-drainer real"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/spells/item_spells.json
msgid "Transform a mosquito into a dream-draining nightmare."
msgstr "蚊が夢喰い蚊に変化します。"

#. ~ Spell name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/spells/shapeshifter.json
msgid "Shapeshifter reduce pain spell"
msgstr "肉体変化苦痛軽減"

#. ~ Description of spell "Shapeshifter reduce pain spell"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/spells/shapeshifter.json
msgid ""
"This reduces pain for shapeshifters as their wounds regenerate.  You should "
"never see it."
msgstr "肉体変化能力者の傷が再生する際に苦痛を軽減します。通常は表示されません。"

#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_DREAMER_ARTIFACT_SPAWN"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/spells/spell_eocs.json
msgid ""
"You pull your power into this world, and something outside of it places an "
"object in your hand."
msgstr "内なる力を世界に放出すると、どこからか力を宿したアイテムが出現しました。"

#. ~ Player message in nested effect in switch statement in effect in EoC
#. "EOC_DREAMER_ARTIFACT_FAIL_MESSAGE"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/spells/spell_eocs.json
msgid ""
"Your impatience is apparently a defining feature.  You're going to need a "
"lot more time connecting with the universe to make this happen."
msgstr "せっかちな性格が災いしたようです。宇宙と繋がり夢を現実にするには、更に時間を掛ける必要があります。"

#. ~ Player message in nested effect in switch statement in effect in EoC
#. "EOC_DREAMER_ARTIFACT_FAIL_MESSAGE"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/spells/spell_eocs.json
msgid ""
"You try to connect the item with another dimension, but everything goes "
"wrong from the very beginning.  You feel you need much more patience to "
"finish this."
msgstr "アイテムを別の次元に接続しようとしましたが、まったく上手くいきません。やり遂げるには更なる忍耐が必要だと感じます。"

#. ~ Player message in nested effect in switch statement in effect in EoC
#. "EOC_DREAMER_ARTIFACT_FAIL_MESSAGE"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/spells/spell_eocs.json
msgid ""
"You try to connect the item with another dimension, but something interrupts"
" you in the middle of your attempt.  You need just a bit more time to make "
"this work."
msgstr "アイテムを別の次元に接続しようとしましたが、途中で何かに妨げられました。もう少し時間を掛ければ成功しそうです。"

#. ~ Player message in nested effect in switch statement in effect in EoC
#. "EOC_DREAMER_ARTIFACT_FAIL_MESSAGE"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/spells/spell_eocs.json
msgid ""
"You try to connect the item with another dimension, but in the end it fails."
"  It was close though, so you think you need to try it again tomorrow."
msgstr "アイテムを別の次元に接続しようとしましたが、あと少しのところで失敗しました。明日にでももう一度挑戦してみましょう。"

#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_ETHEREAL_WINGS_INITIATE"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/spells/spell_eocs.json
msgid "<color_white>Ethereal</color> wings grow from your back."
msgstr "背中に<color_white>エーテル</color>の羽が生えました。"

#. ~ Player message in false effect in EoC "EOC_ETHEREAL_WINGS_INITIATE"
#. ~ Player message in false effect in EoC "EOC_ETHEREAL_WINGS_CONTINUE"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/spells/spell_eocs.json
msgid "The wings behind you fade out of existence."
msgstr "背中に生えていた羽が消失しました。"

#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_ETHEREAL_WINGS_CONTINUE"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/spells/spell_eocs.json
msgid ""
"The wings behind you grow slightly more transparent, but they quickly revert"
" back to normal."
msgstr "背中の羽が少し透けてきましたが、すぐ元に戻りました。"

#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_KARMA_ARMS_INITIATE"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/spells/spell_eocs.json
msgid ""
"Ethereal, transparent arms appear behind your shoulders and "
"<color_cyan>glow</color>."
msgstr "幻想的な透明の腕が肩の後ろから伸び、<color_cyan>発光</color>しています。"

#. ~ Player message in false effect in EoC "EOC_KARMA_ARMS_INITIATE"
#. ~ Player message in false effect in EoC "EOC_KARMA_ARMS_CONTINUE"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/spells/spell_eocs.json
msgid "The cyan arms grow dim and finally disappear."
msgstr "青緑色の腕は少しずつ薄くなり、やがて消えました。"

#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_KARMA_ARMS_CONTINUE"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/spells/spell_eocs.json
msgid ""
"The floating arms behind you slightly flicker, but they soon resume their "
"steady glow."
msgstr "背後に浮かぶ腕がわずかにちらつき、すぐに輝きを取り戻しました。"

#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_DEVIL_TAIL_INITIATE"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/spells/spell_eocs.json
msgid "You feel like your spine stretched enormously."
msgstr "背筋が急に伸びたような気がします。"

#. ~ Player message in false effect in EoC "EOC_DEVIL_TAIL_INITIATE"
#. ~ Player message in false effect in EoC "EOC_DEVIL_TAIL_CONTINUE"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/spells/spell_eocs.json
msgid "Your devil tail fades away."
msgstr "悪魔の尻尾が消えました。"

#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_DEVIL_TAIL_CONTINUE"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/spells/spell_eocs.json
msgid "Your devilish tail stretches and twists playfully."
msgstr "悪魔の尻尾は好き勝手に伸びたり捻じれたりしています。"

#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_STALKER_EYES_INITIATE"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/spells/spell_eocs.json
msgid ""
"Your vision grows dark for a moment, but a second later a whole new world is"
" revealed under your eyes."
msgstr "視界が一瞬暗くなり、次の瞬間には全く新しい世界が目の前に現れました。"

#. ~ Player message in false effect in EoC "EOC_STALKER_EYES_INITIATE"
#. ~ Player message in false effect in EoC "EOC_STALKER_EYES_CONTINUE"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/spells/spell_eocs.json
msgid "The great new world visible to your eyes disappears."
msgstr "目の前の素晴らしい新世界が消え失せました。"

#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_STALKER_EYES_CONTINUE"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/spells/spell_eocs.json
msgid "Your sight darkens for a second, but it quickly turns back."
msgstr "視界が一瞬暗くなりましたが、すぐ元に戻りました。"

#. ~ Spell name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/spells/vampire_spells.json
msgid "Scent of Blood"
msgstr "ｾﾝﾄ･ｵﾌﾞ･ﾌﾞﾗｯﾄﾞ"

#. ~ Description of spell "Scent of Blood"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/spells/vampire_spells.json
msgid ""
"You can smell even the faintest traces of living human, or nearly-human, "
"blood."
msgstr "生きている人間、またはそれに近い生物の匂いのほんの僅かな痕跡を嗅ぎ取れます。"

#. ~ Description of spell "Blood-Fueled Magic"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/spells/vampire_spells.json
msgid ""
"You consume some of the blood in your veins, turning it into magical power."
msgstr "奪った血の一部を魔法の力に変換します。"

#. ~ Description of spell "Sanguine Restoration"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/spells/vampire_spells.json
msgid "Heal your wounds with the power of stolen blood."
msgstr "奪い取った血を消費して傷を癒します。"

#. ~ Description of spell "Predator's Mien"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/spells/vampire_spells.json
msgid ""
"With a bit of stolen blood and a savage expression, you can send your "
"enemies fleeing.  This power only works on enemies capable of feeling fear."
msgstr "奪い取った一滴の血と恐ろしい表情によって、敵を追い払います。この力は恐怖の感情をもたない敵には効果を発揮しません。"

#. ~ Description of spell "Hypnotic Gaze"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/spells/vampire_spells.json
msgid ""
"Stare into the eyes of your victim and wills them to pause.  This power does"
" not work on unliving targets."
msgstr "標的の瞳をじっと見つめ、その場で静止するように暗示を掛けます。この力はゾンビには効果を発揮しません。"

#. ~ Description of spell "Cowing the Beast"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/spells/vampire_spells.json
msgid ""
"Exert command over a predatory wild animal like a wolf or a rat, making it "
"your ally for a time."
msgstr "オオカミやネズミのような肉食性の野生動物を支配し、一時的に友好化します。"

#. ~ Spell name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/spells/vampire_spells.json
msgid "Cowing the Beast Real"
msgstr "ｶｳｲﾝｸﾞ･ｻﾞ･ﾋﾞｰｽﾄ効果"

#. ~ Description of spell "Cowing the Beast Real"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/spells/vampire_spells.json
msgid ""
"The actual power that lets you command a beast.  If you see this, it's a "
"bug."
msgstr "動物を支配する効果を実行する呪文です。通常は表示されません。"

#. ~ Description of spell "Earthen Slumber"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/spells/vampire_spells.json
msgid ""
"You can sleep within the earth itself, avoiding the hateful light of the "
"sun.  This power must be used on diggable soil."
msgstr "憎むべき太陽光を避け、大地の中で眠ることができます。この力は穴を掘れる地形の上でしか使えません。"

#. ~ Description of spell "Torpor"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/spells/vampire_spells.json
msgid ""
"Enter a deathlike slumber and recover from your wounds and fatigue.  "
"Preferably while somewhere nobody could attack you while you sleep."
msgstr "死に近い鈍麻状態に入り、傷と疲労を回復します。誰からも攻撃されない安全な場所で詠唱した方がよさそうです。"

#. ~ Message of spell "Torpor"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/spells/vampire_spells.json
msgid "You enter torpor."
msgstr "鈍麻状態に入りました。"

#. ~ Description of spell "Dominating Gaze"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/spells/vampire_spells.json
msgid "Take control of a mind.  Only works on targets that have weak minds."
msgstr "精神を支配します。弱い精神をもつ者にしか効果がありません。"

#. ~ Message of spell "Dominating Gaze"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/spells/vampire_spells.json
msgid "You look for a mind to control."
msgstr "標的の精神を凝視しました。"

#. ~ Spell name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/spells/vampire_spells.json
msgid "Dominating Gaze real"
msgstr "ﾄﾞﾐﾈｰﾃｨﾝｸﾞ･ｹﾞｲｽﾞ効果"

#. ~ Description of spell "Dominating Gaze real"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/spells/vampire_spells.json
msgid ""
"The actual power that lets you take over a mind.  If you see this, it's a "
"bug."
msgstr "精神を支配する効果を実行する呪文です。通常は表示されません。"

#. ~ Spell name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/spells/vampire_spells.json
msgid "(Mist Form) Pass Through Barrier"
msgstr "(霧形態)障壁通過"

#. ~ Description of spell "(Mist Form) Pass Through Barrier"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/spells/vampire_spells.json
msgid "Seep through a door or a window."
msgstr "ドアや窓を通り抜けます。"

#. ~ Spell name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/spells/vampire_spells.json
msgid "(Mist Form) Pass Through Barrier Real"
msgstr "(霧形態)障壁通過効果"

#. ~ Description of spell "(Mist Form) Pass Through Barrier Real"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/spells/vampire_spells.json
msgid ""
"The actual spell that lets you seep through a barrier.  It's a bug if you "
"have it."
msgstr "障壁通過の効果を実行する呪文です。通常は表示されません。"

#. ~ Message after transforming to "t_tree_birch, t_tree_elm,
#. t_tree_cottonwood, t_tree_basswood, t_tree_alder, t_tree_pine,
#. t_tree_maple, t_tree_willow, t_tree_hickory, t_tree_walnut,
#. t_tree_butternut, t_tree_chestnut, t_tree_hazelnut, t_tree_beech,
#. t_tree_blackjack, t_tree_apple, t_tree_cherry, t_tree_juniper, t_tree_pear,
#. t_tree_plum, t_tree_elderberry, t_tree_mulberry, t_tree_sassafras"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/ter_transforms/arvore_ter_transforms.json
msgid ""
"The young tree creaks as its limbs begin growing, first slowly and then with"
" increasing speed.  Roots churn through the soil and leaves stretch toward "
"the sun, and in moments, before you is a tree that could have stood for a "
"human lifetime."
msgstr ""
"最初はゆっくりと、徐々に速度を上げて若木が軋みながら成長し、根が土を掘り、葉が太陽に向かって伸びていきます。一瞬のうちに、人間の一生分程の時を経たような立派な樹木が目の前に現れました。"

#. ~ Message after transforming to "t_grass_long"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/ter_transforms/arvore_ter_transforms.json
msgid ""
"Fresh green grass grows longer and longer until it stands as tall as your "
"knees."
msgstr "青々とした草はどんどん伸びて、膝の高さにまで成長しました。"

#. ~ Message after transforming to "t_grass_tall"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/ter_transforms/arvore_ter_transforms.json
msgid ""
"The tall grass grows and grows until a child could easily hide themselves "
"within it."
msgstr "背の高い草が更に伸び、子供であればすっぽり隠れてしまうほどの丈に成長しました。"

#. ~ Message after transforming to "f_plant_harvest"
#. ~ Message after transforming to "f_dirtmound_shallow_harvest"
#. ~ Message after transforming to "f_dirtmound_pile_harvest"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/ter_transforms/arvore_ter_transforms.json
msgid ""
"The plant grows in moments, leaves unfurling, roots churning the soil, and "
"flowers opening toward the sun.  Before you even lower your hands, it's ripe"
" and ready for the harvest."
msgstr "植物がぐんぐん伸び、葉が広がり、根が土を掘り、花が太陽に向かって大きく開いていきます。次の瞬間にはもう成熟し、収穫できる状態になりました。"

#. ~ Message after transforming to "t_triffid_bark_wall"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/ter_transforms/arvore_ter_transforms.json
msgid ""
"The bark surges upward as the roots below grow into a heavy, solid wall "
"covered in bark."
msgstr "樹皮が上方に盛り上がり、根は地面にしっかりと食い込み、重厚で堅固な壁ができあがりました。"

#. ~ Message after transforming to "t_triffid_wood_wall"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/ter_transforms/arvore_ter_transforms.json
msgid ""
"The wooden wall shudders as as the bark peels off in sheets, eventually "
"becoming a solid expanse of bare wood."
msgstr "堅固な壁全体が震えると樹皮が捲れて剥がれ落ち、剥き出しの木質の壁が現れました。"

#. ~ Message after transforming to "t_triffid_bark_wall"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/ter_transforms/arvore_ter_transforms.json
msgid ""
"The bare wooden wall shudders as bark sprouts and spreads over it, covering "
"the entire surface in moments."
msgstr "剥き出しの木質の壁が震えると、地面から樹皮が現れ、壁全体を覆いました。"

#. ~ Message after transforming to "t_barkfloor_no_roof"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/ter_transforms/arvore_ter_transforms.json
msgid ""
"The ground churns as bark-covered roots erupt from it and form into a solid "
"bark-covered floor."
msgstr "地面が盛り上がって無数の根が顔を出し、樹皮で覆われた堅固な床ができあがりました。"

#. ~ Message after transforming to "t_barkfloor"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/ter_transforms/arvore_ter_transforms.json
msgid ""
"The ground churns as bark-covered roots quest upward, forming an "
"intertwining roof."
msgstr "地面がかき混ぜられ、樹皮で覆われた根が上方に伸びて絡み合い、屋根を形成しました。"

#. ~ Message after transforming to "t_barkfloor_no_roof"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/ter_transforms/arvore_ter_transforms.json
msgid ""
"The wooden wall spasms and recedes into the ground, leaving only a bark-"
"covered floor in its place."
msgstr "木の壁が震えて地面に潜り、樹皮で覆われた床だけが残りました。"

#. ~ Message after transforming to "t_triffid_leaves"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/ter_transforms/arvore_ter_transforms.json
msgid ""
"The bark floor shudders as thin branches sprout from it, leaves already "
"growing and unfurling, and soon a thicket of dense leaves covers the area."
msgstr "樹皮の床から細い枝が芽吹き、震える無数の葉があっという間に広がって全体を覆いました。"

#. ~ Message after transforming to "t_triffid_leaves"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/ter_transforms/arvore_ter_transforms.json
msgid ""
"The ground shudders as thin branches sprout from it, leaves already growing "
"and unfurling, and soon a thicket of dense leaves covers the area."
msgstr "震える地面から細い枝が芽生え、そこからすぐさま葉が広がり、密集した茂みが全体を覆いました。"

#. ~ Message after transforming to "t_bramble_door_c"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/ter_transforms/arvore_ter_transforms.json
msgid ""
"The wall trembles and splits apart into a tangle of gnarled roots, waving in"
" the air like monstrous tentacles.  They weave together into a sturdy door "
"before ceasing their motion."
msgstr ""
"壁が震えると節くれだった複数の根が絡みつき、巨大な触手のように大きく揺れて裂けました。植物が成長を終えると、そこには頑丈な扉ができあがっています。"

#. ~ Message after transforming to "t_triffid_bark_wall"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/ter_transforms/arvore_ter_transforms.json
msgid ""
"The roots surge into motion, growing together thicker and more tangled until"
" a bark-covered wall of solid wood is all that remains."
msgstr "根が勢いよく動き回り、太く絡み合って成長し、樹皮で覆われた木の壁になりました。"

#. ~ Message after transforming to "t_dirt_barren"
#. ~ Message after transforming to "f_null"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/ter_transforms/arvore_ter_transforms.json
msgid "The fungus withers and dies!"
msgstr "真菌が萎れ、朽ちました！"

#. ~ Message after transforming to "f_arvore_translocator_ground"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/ter_transforms/arvore_ter_transforms.json
msgid "You meditate within the depths of the forest."
msgstr "森の奥深くで気持ちを落ち着けました。"

#. ~ Message after transforming to "t_arvore_climbing_vine"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/ter_transforms/arvore_ter_transforms.json
msgid "A vine bursts out of the ground and grows in moments!"
msgstr "蔓が地面から飛び出し、あっという間に長く伸びました！"

#. ~ Message after transforming to "t_tree_birch, t_tree_elm,
#. t_tree_cottonwood, t_tree_basswood, t_tree_alder, t_tree_pine,
#. t_tree_maple, t_tree_willow, t_tree_hickory, t_tree_walnut,
#. t_tree_butternut, t_tree_chestnut, t_tree_hazelnut, t_tree_beech,
#. t_tree_blackjack, t_tree_apple, t_tree_cherry, t_tree_juniper, t_tree_pear,
#. t_tree_plum, t_tree_elderberry, t_tree_mulberry, t_tree_sassafras"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/ter_transforms/arvore_ter_transforms.json
msgid ""
"The target's limbs begin stretching and spreading toward the sky as their "
"body elongates, and in moments, a tree that could have stood for a hundred "
"years stands in their place."
msgstr "標的の胴と四肢が空に向かって伸び、広がり、次の瞬間その位置には、百年前からそこにあったような樹木がそびえていました。"

#. ~ Message after transforming to "t_arvore_living_tent"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/ter_transforms/arvore_ter_transforms.json
msgid "Vines and brambles rapidly grow from the ground into a small shelter."
msgstr "地面から急に伸びてきた蔓や茨が、小さなシェルターを形作りました。"

#. ~ Message after transforming to "f_homullus_translocator_location"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/ter_transforms/homullus_ter_transforms.json
msgid "You close your eyes and listen to the sounds of civilization."
msgstr "目を閉じて、文明の音に耳を傾けました。"

#. ~ Message after transforming to "t_pit"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/ter_transforms/ierde_ter_transform.json
msgid "The ground opens up!"
msgstr "大地にぽっかりと穴が開きました！"

#. ~ Message after transforming to "t_rock"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/ter_transforms/ierde_ter_transform.json
msgid "The stone rises up into a stone wall."
msgstr "岩が持ち上がり壁が現れました。"

#. ~ Message after transforming to "t_rock_floor"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/ter_transforms/ierde_ter_transform.json
msgid "The stone wall sinks away."
msgstr "石の壁が地面に沈み込みました。"

#. ~ Message after transforming to "t_soil"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/ter_transforms/ierde_ter_transform.json
msgid "The ground rises into a wall of solid earth."
msgstr "地面が隆起し、硬い土の壁が現れました。"

#. ~ Message after transforming to "t_dirt"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/ter_transforms/ierde_ter_transform.json
msgid "The solid earth sinks away."
msgstr "硬い土の壁が地面に沈み込みました。"

#. ~ Message after transforming to "t_hole"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/ter_transforms/ierde_ter_transform.json
msgid "The pit deepens!"
msgstr "穴が深く広がりました！"

#. ~ Message after transforming to "t_earthen_stairs_up"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/ter_transforms/ierde_ter_transform.json
msgid "The ground rises up into a set of earthen stairs."
msgstr "地面が隆起し、土の階段が現れました。"

#. ~ Message after transforming to "t_earthen_stairs_up"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/ter_transforms/ierde_ter_transform.json
msgid "The dirt rises up into a set of earthen stairs."
msgstr "土が隆起し、土階段が現れました。"

#. ~ Message after transforming to "t_earthen_stairs_down"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/ter_transforms/ierde_ter_transform.json
msgid "The ground sinks down into a set of earthen stairs."
msgstr "地面が沈下し、土の階段が現れました。"

#. ~ Message after transforming to "t_earthen_stairs_down"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/ter_transforms/ierde_ter_transform.json
msgid "The dirt sinks down into a set of earthen stairs."
msgstr "土が沈下し、階段が現れました。"

#. ~ Message after transforming to "t_rock_smooth"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/ter_transforms/ierde_ter_transform.json
msgid "All imperfections in the stone are smoothed away."
msgstr "岩の凹凸が消え、表面が滑らかになりました。"

#. ~ Message after transforming to "f_rubble_rock"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/ter_transforms/ierde_ter_transform.json
msgid "The pile of dirt hardens into a large pile of stones."
msgstr "土の塊が圧縮され、大きな岩の塊になりました。"

#. ~ Message after transforming to "f_dirtmound_shallow"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/ter_transforms/ierde_ter_transform.json
msgid "The loose rock falls apart into a pile of dirt."
msgstr "岩の塊が緩んでバラバラになり、土の塊に変わりました。"

#. ~ Message after transforming to "f_ierde_lithic_gaol_fang"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/ter_transforms/ierde_ter_transform.json
msgid "Fangs of rock erupt around the target!"
msgstr "岩石の牙が大地を突き破り、標的を取り囲みました！"

#. ~ Message after transforming to "f_ierde_translocator_location"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/ter_transforms/ierde_ter_transform.json
msgid ""
"You place both hands on the living earth and feel the rhythms of the rock."
msgstr "むき出しの大地に両手を当て、岩の脈動を感じました。"

#. ~ Message after transforming to "t_pit_shallow"
#. ~ Message after transforming to "t_pit"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/ter_transforms/sylph_ter_transforms.json
msgid "The lightning blasts a crater where it strikes!"
msgstr "落雷が地面に穴を開けました！"

#. ~ Message after transforming to "f_sylph_translocator_location"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/ter_transforms/sylph_ter_transforms.json
msgid ""
"High above the earth, you close your eyes and feel the wind on your face."
msgstr "空高くで目を閉じ、風を感じました。"

