#. ~ Female memorial apply log of effect type "Zombie bite, Zombie contagion"
#. ~ Female memorial apply log of effect type "Zombie wound, Zombie contagion"
#: data/mods/classic_zombies/contagion/effect.json
msgctxt "memorial_female"
msgid "Died of the zombie plague."
