"need!"
msgstr "そんな生物は存在しないって？まあまあ、いいじゃないですか。愛すべきヤギたちが傍にいればそれで十分です。"

#. ~ Profession name for male
#: data/mods/innawood/professions.json
msgctxt "profession_male"
msgid "Lost Tribal"
msgstr "迷子の部族"

#. ~ Description of profession "Lost Tribal" for male
#: data/mods/innawood/professions.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You were out gathering for the tribe when the sky broke and the gods called "
"to you, then you collapsed.  When you woke up, you were in an unfamiliar "
"place with new memories crowding your thoughts."
msgstr ""
"部族の集いへ行く途中、突然空が割れて神々の呼び声が聞こえ、意識を失いました、目が覚めると見知らぬ土地に来ており、身に覚えのない記憶が思考を満たしていました。"

#. ~ Profession name for female
#: data/mods/innawood/professions.json
msgctxt "profession_female"
msgid "Lost Tribal"
msgstr "迷子の部族"

#. ~ Description of profession "Lost Tribal" for female
#: data/mods/innawood/professions.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
