"to you, then you collapsed.  When you woke up, you were in an unfamiliar "
"place with new memories crowding your thoughts."
msgstr ""
"部族の集いへ行く途中、突然空が割れて神々の呼び声が聞こえ、意識を失いました、目が覚めると見知らぬ土地に来ており、身に覚えのない記憶が思考を満たしていました。"

#. ~ Profession name for male
#: data/mods/innawood/professions.json
msgctxt "profession_male"
msgid "Shaman"
msgstr "シャーマン"

#. ~ Description of profession "Shaman" for male
#: data/mods/innawood/professions.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You've trained in the medical arts, refining natural remedies into real "
"cures for disease.  Your tribe would have lived long and healthy lives, were"
" they still here."
msgstr "医術を修め、病気を治す自然療法の技を磨き上げてきました。同じ部族の人間が今も生き残っていれば、健康で長生きできたかもしれません。"

