"You can't climb here - there is no terrain above you that would support your"
" weight."
msgstr "ここからは登れません - 身体を支える地形が必要です。"

#: src/game.cpp:11959
msgid "You can't go down here!"
msgstr "ここではこれ以上は下がれません！"

