#: src/iexamine.cpp:6694
#, c-format
msgid "Failed to find milling recipe for %s. Cannot be placed into the mill."
msgstr "%sの製粉レシピが見つかりません。このアイテムは製粉機内に置けません。"

#: src/iexamine.cpp:6701
msgid "Load mill with what kind of product?"
msgstr "製粉機に入れるアイテムを選択"

#: src/iexamine.cpp:6724
msgid "You don't have any products that can be milled."
msgstr "製粉できるアイテムがありません。"

#: src/iexamine.cpp:6746
#, c-format
msgid "Insert how many %s into the mill?"
msgstr "製粉機に入れる%sの数を選択"

#: src/iexamine.cpp:6759
msgid "You don't have that many."
msgstr "そんなにたくさん持っていません。"

#: src/iexamine.cpp:6762
msgid "You can't place that many."
msgstr "多すぎて入りません。"

#: src/iexamine.cpp:6783
#, c-format
msgid "You carefully place %1$d %2$s in the mill."
msgstr "製粉機の中に%2$s(%1$d)を注意深く置きました。"

#: src/iexamine.cpp:6803
msgid "The water mill needs to be over shallow flowing water to work."
msgstr "粉挽き水車を稼働するには浅い流水上に設置する必要があります。"

#: src/iexamine.cpp:6809
msgid "The wind mill needs to be outside in the wind to work."
msgstr "粉挽き風車を稼働するには風が吹いている屋外に設置する必要があります。"

#: src/iexamine.cpp:6858
msgid "What to do with the mill?"
msgstr "製粉機操作"

#: src/iexamine.cpp:6861
msgid "Inspect mill"
msgstr "製粉機の中を調べる"

#: src/iexamine.cpp:6865
msgid "Remove brake and start milling… insert some products for milling first"
msgstr "稼働して製粉を始める...製粉するアイテムが入っていない"

#: src/iexamine.cpp:6866
msgid "Remove brake and start milling"
msgstr "稼働して製粉を始める"

#: src/iexamine.cpp:6867
#, c-format
msgid "Remove brake and start milling, milling will take about %s."
msgstr "石臼を稼働して製粉を開始します。完成まで約%sかかります。"

#: src/iexamine.cpp:6871
msgid "Insert products for milling… mill is full"
msgstr "製粉するアイテムを入れる...満杯"

#: src/iexamine.cpp:6872
#, c-format
msgid "Insert products for milling… remaining capacity is %s %s"
msgstr "製粉するアイテムを入れる...残り容量%s%s"

#: src/iexamine.cpp:6874
msgid "Fill the mill with starchy products such as wheat, barley or oats."
msgstr "小麦や大麦、燕麦などのでんぷん質を含むアイテムを投入して下さい。"

#: src/iexamine.cpp:6877
msgid "Remove products from mill"
msgstr "製粉機からアイテムを取り出す"

#: src/iexamine.cpp:6882
msgid "Apply brake to mill"
msgstr "ブレーキ装置を起動する"

#: src/iexamine.cpp:6883
msgid "Applying the brake will stop milling process."
msgstr "ブレーキ装置を起動すると製粉が停止します。"

#: src/iexamine.cpp:6892
msgid "There's a mill here.  It is turning and milling."
msgstr "製粉機があります。石臼が回転して製粉を行っています。"

#: src/iexamine.cpp:6894
#, c-format
msgid "It should take about %s to finish milling."
msgstr "あと%sほどで製粉が完了します。"

#: src/iexamine.cpp:6898
msgid "There's a mill here."
msgstr "製粉機があります。"

#: src/iexamine.cpp:6900 src/iexamine.cpp:7120
msgid "You inspect its contents and find: "
msgstr "ラックの内容物: "

#: src/iexamine.cpp:6902 src/iexamine.cpp:7122
msgid "…that it is empty."
msgstr "...何も入っていません。"

#: src/iexamine.cpp:6906
msgid "You see some grains that are not yet milled to fine flour."
msgstr "完全に粉砕されていないアイテムが残っています。"

#: src/iexamine.cpp:6919
msgid "It is already milling."
msgstr "既に製粉を行っています。"

#: src/iexamine.cpp:6935
#, c-format
msgid "You remove %s from the mill."
msgstr "製粉機から%sを取り出しました。"

#: src/iexamine.cpp:6949 src/iexamine.cpp:6968
msgid "You stop the milling process."
msgstr "製粉を中断しました。"

#: src/iexamine.cpp:7039
msgid "What to do with the smoking rack:"
msgstr "燻製ラック操作:"

#: src/iexamine.cpp:7042
msgid "Inspect smoking rack"
msgstr "燻製ラックの中を調べる"

#: src/iexamine.cpp:7046
msgid "Light up and smoke food… insert some food for smoking first"
msgstr "点火して燻製を始める...燻製する食料が入っていない"

#: src/iexamine.cpp:7048
#, c-format
msgid "Light up and smoke food… need extra %d charges of charcoal"
msgstr "点火して燻製を始める...炭が%d足りない"

#: src/iexamine.cpp:7050
msgid "Light up and smoke food"
msgstr "点火して燻製を始める"

#: src/iexamine.cpp:7051
msgid ""
"Light up the smoking rack and start smoking.  Smoking will take about 6 "
"hours."
msgstr "燻製ラックを点火して燻製を開始します。完成まで約6時間かかります。"

